      "encoded_ascii": "agile",
      "encoded_base64": "YWdpbGU=",
      "byte_length": 5
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0df5de082139",
      "text": "evil",
      "encoded_ascii": "evil",
      "encoded_base64": "ZXZpbA==",
      "byte_length": 4
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2a6867e7d86f",
      "text": "第 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^', ",
      "encoded_base64": "XicsIA==",
      "byte_length": 4
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ce2476891968",
      "text": " 個字，在手冊第 ",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^!V^#)^*A^\"d^$+^4r^', ",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4hVl4jKV4qQV4iZF4kK140cl4nLCA=",
      "byte_length": 23
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0a2e6dea6b9d",
      "text": "頁，第 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^5&^*A^', ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjUmXipBXicsIA==",
      "byte_length": 10
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_37107052ff9e",
      "text": "行，以字母 '",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(;^*A^!B^#)^/s '",
      "encoded_base64": "Xig7XipBXiFCXiMpXi9zICc=",
      "byte_length": 17
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a9b18be22107",
      "text": "e",
      "encoded_ascii": "e",
      "encoded_base64": "ZQ==",
      "byte_length": 1
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a270321197ac",
      "text": "' 開頭。那個字是什麼？",
      "encoded_ascii": "' ^)F^)t^!\"^)!^!V^#)^,X^!=^.T^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "JyBeKUZeKXReISJeKSFeIVZeIyleLFheIT1eLlReLlY=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d7ee65a40980",
      "text": "你回答的是 '",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^\"\\^-B^&Z^,X '",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiJcXi1CXiZaXixYICc=",
      "byte_length": 17
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_807d7488e4c1",
      "text": "'。這是你的最終答案嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "'^!\"^(s^,X^*F^&Z^$q^-H^-B^4|^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "J14hIl4oc14sWF4qRl4mWl4kcV4tSF4tQl40fF4rWF4uVg==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_00701ffa276d",
      "text": "休想用虛假的謊言來考驗我的耐心！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!G^,1^&H^-g^1i^&Z^3*^1Y^!O^-R^.P^$%^&Z^-S^#k^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFHXiwxXiZIXi1nXjFpXiZaXjMqXjFZXiFPXi1SXi5QXiQlXiZaXi1TXiNrXipX",
      "byte_length": 48
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8a7442b91aca",
      "text": "你們那愚笨拙劣的回答若不是因為你們大限將至，倒還算得上滑稽！現在……",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^)!^/a^5#^4z^+2^&Z^\"\\^-B^'x^!)^,X^\"]^%{^*F^*{^\"z^)O^#7^'n^*A^!X^.7^-C^#e^!'^%u^26^*W^&?^\"d^*o^*o",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XikhXi9hXjUjXjR6XisyXiZaXiJcXi1CXid4XiEpXixYXiJdXiV7XipGXip7XiJ6XilPXiM3XiduXipBXiFYXi43Xi1DXiNlXiEnXiV1XjI2XipXXiY/XiJkXipvXipv",
      "byte_length": 102
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6dc122d3de76",
      "text": "你的心智不夠敏捷。你的死期已然降臨！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^&Z^#k^$i^!)^+d^//^/.^!\"^*F^&Z^%L^$u^#J^&\"^)N^1U^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiZaXiNrXiRpXiEpXitkXi8vXi8uXiEiXipGXiZaXiVMXiR1XiNKXiYiXilOXjFVXipX",
      "byte_length": 54
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9f84cd1c86e7",
      "text": "  抱歉打擾了。再見。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^,@^,h^$-^$K^*D^!\"^!l^-m^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLEBeLGheJC1eJEteKkReISJeIWxeLW1eISI=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_df24e3b933d7",
      "text": "走開！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.&^)F^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi4mXilGXipX",
      "byte_length": 9
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2565274494b6",
      "text": "  你在這裡做什麼？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^\"d^(s^-j^*~^!=^.T^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeImReKHNeLWpeKn5eIT1eLlReLlY=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_99af22622b2d",
      "text": "  你們的戰士都在哪裡？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^*{^&Z^$(^+a^)$^\"d^+I^-j^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeKnteJlpeJCheK2FeKSReImReK0leLWpeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2654a7dd4868",
      "text": "你們是誰？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^,X^-y^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XixYXi15Xi5W",
      "byte_length": 15
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_257b88fce061",
      "text": "救命！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,Q^\"N^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XixRXiJOXipX",
      "byte_length": 9
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f78098a9889a",
      "text": " 在沙子裡踢到了某個堅硬的物體。",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^\"d^%]^#(^-j^2J^!u^*D^%$^!V^\"l^25^&Z^&4^**^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4iZF4lXV4jKF4tal4ySl4hdV4qRF4lJF4hVl4ibF4yNV4mWl4mNF4qKl4hIg==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7a83b172a0a9",
      "text": " 的赤腳幾乎要在一個半埋的箱子上踢斷",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^&Z^2H^00^#T^!0^(C^\"d^!%^!V^\"-^1r^&Z^'/^#(^!'^2J^,T",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4mWl4ySF4wMF4jVF4hMF4oQ14iZF4hJV4hVl4iLV4xcl4mWl4nL14jKF4hJ14ySl4sVA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_904ed639b0e3",
      "text": " 了。",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4qRF4hIg==",
      "byte_length": 7
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_65ec9a528469",
      "text": "你們要將它挖出來嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^(C^#7^+o^2!^!q^!O^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XihDXiM3XitvXjIhXiFxXiFPXitYXi5W",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_78f9039e4b1c",
      "text": "不！噢，求求你，不要！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^*W^+]^*A^,n^,n^*F^*A^!)^(C^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXipXXitdXipBXixuXixuXipGXipBXiEpXihDXipX",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_08c721e393cc",
      "text": "救命啊——！殺人啦！著火啦！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,Q^\"N^+Q^*n^*n^*W^%M^!<^+R^*W^-a^%x^+R^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XixRXiJOXitRXipuXipuXipXXiVNXiE8XitSXipXXi1hXiV4XitSXipX",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e6647c422537",
      "text": " 獲得了 ",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^&:^#e^*D ",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4mOl4jZV4qRCA=",
      "byte_length": 11
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_714509b9289a",
      "text": " 點經驗值！",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^*;^'D^.P^!Z^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4qO14nRF4uUF4hWl4qVw==",
      "byte_length": 16
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fa2f7f55a212",
      "text": "現在不需要。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&?^\"d^!)^)e^(C^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiY/XiJkXiEpXillXihDXiEi",
      "byte_length": 18
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c5c37edb7638",
      "text": "沒什麼",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%\\^!=^.T",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVcXiE9Xi5U",
      "byte_length": 9
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_dfa0f2c0e81e",
      "text": "。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 4
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_60d158b51f9a",
      "text": "  既然如此！準備受死吧！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^,U^&\"^#$^%I^*W^,x^+\"^\";^%L^*I^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLFVeJiJeIyReJUleKldeLHheKyJeIjteJUxeKkleKlcg",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_458686129592",
      "text": "算了。我這就走。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-C^*D^!\"^$%^(s^*J^.&^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi1DXipEXiEiXiQlXihzXipKXi4mXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2b7c60a54a01",
      "text": "你需要什麼？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^)e^(C^!=^.T^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXillXihDXiE9Xi5UXi5W",
      "byte_length": 18
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_53e0586c07d0",
      "text": "  帶我去見你們的長官，否則受死！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^#N^$%^\"6^-m^*F^*{^&Z^)C^#-^*A^\"H^!x^\";^%L^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeI05eJCVeIjZeLW1eKkZeKnteJlpeKUNeIy1eKkFeIkheIXheIjteJUxeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 47
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_edeb2def03f3",
      "text": "  德拉吉那邊有傳來什麼消息嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^#j^$6^\"D^)!^.8^$s^+$^!O^!=^.T^%k^#w^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeI2peJDZeIkReKSFeLjheJHNeKyReIU9eIT1eLlReJWteI3deK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6ce059f1a460",
      "text": "  這裡有可以歇息的地方嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^(s^-j^$s^\"A^!B^%E^#w^&Z^\"e^$]^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKHNeLWpeJHNeIkFeIUJeJUVeI3deJlpeImVeJF1eK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_77f051c7e29d",
      "text": "  我們可以在哪裡買賣貨物？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^*{^\"A^!B^\"d^+I^-j^.!^.$^.w^&4^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeKnteIkFeIUJeImReK0leLWpeLiFeLiReLndeJjReLlY=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fe5f20e18295",
      "text": "  威脅衛兵。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^#&^1T^(=^+,^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIyZeMVReKD1eKyxeISI=",
      "byte_length": 17
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cd41532fb9d5",
      "text": "  離開商隊。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^)`^)F^1'^)U^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKWBeKUZeMSdeKVVeISI=",
      "byte_length": 17
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_34b071a90e41",
      "text": "  自報家門身分。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^'l^+`^+s^)D^(c^!s^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJ2xeK2BeK3NeKUReKGNeIXNeISI=",
      "byte_length": 23
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8ac494ac7441",
      "text": "站住！報上你們的身分！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^->^*z^*W^+`^!'^*F^*{^&Z^(c^!s^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi0+Xip6XipXXitgXiEnXipGXip7XiZaXihjXiFzXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_76994686ec5d",
      "text": "  裝作無辜。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^(A^!M^%}^66^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKEFeIU1eJX1eNjZeISI=",
      "byte_length": 17
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f5d27d61a3f4",
      "text": "又是你們！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+;^,X^*F^*{^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "Xis7XixYXipGXip7XipX",
      "byte_length": 15
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d97da8034de6",
      "text": "你們的規矩學好點了嗎，還是依然拒絕表明身分？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^&Z^6'^5k^+n^+i^*;^*D^+X^*A^.7^,X^!Q^&\"^5Q^-I^-i^$c^(c^!s^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiZaXjYnXjVrXituXitpXio7XipEXitYXipBXi43XixYXiFRXiYiXjVRXi1JXi1pXiRjXihjXiFzXi5W",
      "byte_length": 66
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7b36a737ab46",
      "text": "  乞求寬恕。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^4+^,n^3l^3q^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeNCteLG5eM2xeM3FeISI=",
      "byte_length": 17
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9c607f18e752",
      "text": "這裡是一支貿易商隊。我們歡迎你們進入營地警戒線內——但任何私鬥或偷竊行徑都將 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^-j^,X^!%^$L^6/^,W^1'^)U^!\"^$%^*{^%F^(k^*F^*{^(w^!f^&'^\"e^(S^$&^'I^!g^*n^*n^!I^!C^!L^&~^*,^$'^/O^5n^(;^#c^)$^#7 ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXi1qXixYXiElXiRMXjYvXixXXjEnXilVXiEiXiQlXip7XiVGXihrXipGXip7Xih3XiFmXiYnXiJlXihTXiQmXidJXiFnXipuXipuXiFJXiFDXiFMXiZ+XiosXiQnXi9PXjVuXig7XiNjXikkXiM3IA==",
      "byte_length": 115
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c4fd95eadfa3",
      "text": "受到最嚴厲的處置。現在，你們來這裡有何貴幹？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\";^!u^$q^1*^+:^&Z^(,^'Q^!\"^&?^\"d^*A^*F^*{^!O^(s^-j^$s^!L^2F^,!^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XiI7XiF1XiRxXjEqXis6XiZaXigsXidRXiEiXiY/XiJkXipBXipGXip7XiFPXihzXi1qXiRzXiFMXjJGXiwhXi5W",
      "byte_length": 66
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0f370e1f0ff9",
      "text": "  我想在荒漠中尋求一處庇護所。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^,1^\"d^1W^,}^!,^#9^,n^!%^(,^,\"^(T^$)^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeLDFeImReMVdeLH1eISxeIzleLG5eISVeKCxeLCJeKFReJCleISI=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_110ec267e54b",
      "text": "  我希望能買賣交易貨物。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^+{^,]^'b^.!^.$^0P^,W^.w^&4^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeK3teLF1eJ2JeLiFeLiReMFBeLFdeLndeJjReISI=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9a8a4c2d9352",
      "text": "  我是來受雇賣命當傭兵的。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^,X^!O^\";^6C^.$^\"N^&N^5,^+,^&Z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeLFheIU9eIjteNkNeLiReIk5eJk5eNSxeKyxeJlpeISI=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9fd0509b4fc3",
      "text": "  我在哪裡能找到大篷車主？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^\"d^+I^-j^'b^$/^!u^\"z^'1^5%^!-^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeImReK0leLWpeJ2JeJC9eIXVeInpeJzFeNSVeIS1eLlY=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_26520d1a0e84",
      "text": "我見多了像你這種滿嘴吹噓的下流胚子，根本不值得我大動干戈！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^-m^\"x^*D^!`^*F^(s^'$^,{^+[^+A^/W^&Z^!(^%j^5{^#(^*A^%)^$x^!)^!Z^#e^$%^\"z^\"%^#R^*M^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXi1tXiJ4XipEXiFgXipGXihzXickXix7XitbXitBXi9XXiZaXiEoXiVqXjV7XiMoXipBXiUpXiR4XiEpXiFaXiNlXiQlXiJ6XiIlXiNSXipNXipX",
      "byte_length": 87
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_047a0270f031",
      "text": "你們那些虛張聲勢的威脅真令人厭煩！這支商隊是方圓百里內唯一能買到補給的地方。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^)!^!8^-g^,(^-W^\"&^&Z^#&^1T^-2^*w^!<^+9^-!^*W^(s^$L^1'^)U^,X^$]^\"a^&Y^)(^!g^+O^!%^'b^.!^!u^6&^'A^&Z^\"e^$]^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XikhXiE4Xi1nXiwoXi1XXiImXiZaXiMmXjFUXi0yXip3XiE8Xis5Xi0hXipXXihzXiRMXjEnXilVXixYXiRdXiJhXiZZXikoXiFnXitPXiElXidiXi4hXiF1XjYmXidBXiZaXiJlXiRdXiEi",
      "byte_length": 114
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_152ecd5527d7",
      "text": "你們這副搖尾乞憐的奴才相或許能討好奴隸主，但我覺得丟人現眼。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^(s^52^3J^5J^4+^1}^&Z^##^$,^&a^$'^-s^'b^-o^+i^##^)Z^!-^*A^!I^$%^(G^#e^*q^!<^&?^&d^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XihzXjUyXjNKXjVKXjQrXjF9XiZaXiMjXiQsXiZhXiQnXi1zXidiXi1vXitpXiMjXilaXiEtXipBXiFJXiQlXihHXiNlXipxXiE8XiY/XiZkXiEi",
      "byte_length": 90
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7e481a1f0c0b",
      "text": "現在，表明你們的身分！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&?^\"d^*A^-i^$c^*F^*{^&Z^(c^!s^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiY/XiJkXipBXi1pXiRjXipGXip7XiZaXihjXiFzXipX",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4eb3a9003244",
      "text": "現在立刻表明身分，否則就給我滾！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&?^\"d^0'^.Y^-i^$c^(c^!s^*A^\"H^!x^*J^'A^$%^,z^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiY/XiJkXjAnXi5ZXi1pXiRjXihjXiFzXipBXiJIXiF4XipKXidBXiQlXix6XipX",
      "byte_length": 48
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e32572d50426",
      "text": "願粗沙永遠灌滿你的靴子！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.H^0(^%]^%W^({^0o^,{^*F^&Z^)k^#(^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi5IXjAoXiVdXiVXXih7XjBvXix7XipGXiZaXilrXiMoXipX",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cb2511e4d27a",
      "text": "你們可以在商隊東北角的訪客營圈內歇息。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^\"A^!B^\"d^1'^)U^,`^+6^(H^&Z^4d^+q^&'^\"_^!g^%E^#w^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiJBXiFCXiJkXjEnXilVXixgXis2XihIXiZaXjRkXitxXiYnXiJfXiFnXiVFXiN3XiEi",
      "byte_length": 57
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_60fa5897ba40",
      "text": "去見大篷車主吧。她會告訴你們可以在哪裡進行交易營生。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"6^-m^\"z^'1^5%^!-^*I^!\"^+h^$r^+B^-t^*F^*{^\"A^!B^\"d^+I^-j^(w^(;^0P^,W^&'^&F^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiI2Xi1tXiJ6XicxXjUlXiEtXipJXiEiXitoXiRyXitCXi10XipGXip7XiJBXiFCXiJkXitJXi1qXih3Xig7XjBQXixXXiYnXiZGXiEi",
      "byte_length": 78
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_56f56c7b89ab",
      "text": "大篷車主或許會感興趣。自從我們扎營以來，掠奪者就一直騷擾我們。你們該去跟她談談。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"z^'1^5%^!-^$'^-s^$r^#{^-]^.*^!\"^'l^#f^$%^*{^,=^&'^!B^!O^*A^1<^1,^'V^*J^!%^&`^0y^$K^$%^*{^!\"^*F^*{^(M^\"6^.+^+h^0;^0;^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJ6XicxXjUlXiEtXiQnXi1zXiRyXiN7Xi1dXi4qXiEiXidsXiNmXiQlXip7Xiw9XiYnXiFCXiFPXipBXjE8XjEsXidWXipKXiElXiZgXjB5XiRLXiQlXip7XiEiXipGXip7XihNXiI2Xi4rXitoXjA7XjA7XiEi",
      "byte_length": 120
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e66f0985f111",
      "text": "商隊中央那輛最大的大篷車屬於大篷車主德莉莎娜。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^1'^)U^!,^5@^)!^65^$q^\"z^&Z^\"z^'1^5%^#C^$^^\"z^'1^5%^!-^#j^'{^/E^/*^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XjEnXilVXiEsXjVAXikhXjY1XiRxXiJ6XiZaXiJ6XicxXjUlXiNDXiReXiJ6XicxXjUlXiEtXiNqXid7Xi9FXi8qXiEi",
      "byte_length": 69
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b76fe901ddbe",
      "text": "你們不妨去造訪拉麗莎的大篷車。她是一位女先知，她的占卜 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^!)^5D^\"6^(v^4d^$6^0z^/E^&Z^\"z^'1^5%^!\"^+h^,X^!%^!J^#\"^!b^&h^*A^+h^&Z^54^53 ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiEpXjVEXiI2Xih2XjRkXiQ2XjB6Xi9FXiZaXiJ6XicxXjUlXiEiXitoXixYXiElXiFKXiMiXiFiXiZoXipBXitoXiZaXjU0XjUzIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9bbd04084542",
      "text": "能賜予你們深邃的智慧與洞悉未來的啟示。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'b^.#^!4^*F^*{^2*^6;^&Z^$i^4;^'p^%h^2h^,_^!O^&Z^57^&s^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XidiXi4jXiE0XipGXip7XjIqXjY7XiZaXiRpXjQ7XidwXiVoXjJoXixfXiFPXiZaXjU3XiZzXiEi",
      "byte_length": 57
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e735f3bef3fc",
      "text": "再會，願你的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!l^$r^*A^.H^*F^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFsXiRyXipBXi5IXipGXiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 19
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3abd1dd42c78",
      "text": "靴履不染黃沙。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)k^5L^!)^%%^*7^%]^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XilrXjVMXiEpXiUlXio3XiVdXiEi",
      "byte_length": 21
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6c044f976946",
      "text": "頭頂常有綠蔭庇護。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)t^)p^#O^$s^3V^5~^,\"^(T^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xil0XilwXiNPXiRzXjNWXjV+XiwiXihUXiEi",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1a0c899c00e8",
      "text": "水囊永遠不會枯竭。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%V^5=^%W^({^!)^$r^5Z^29^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVWXjU9XiVXXih7XiEpXiRyXjVaXjI5XiEi",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7c8df6ea6383",
      "text": "衛兵們拔出兵刃，嚴陣以待。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(=^+,^*{^/c^!q^+,^!r^*A^1*^)P^!B^,*^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xig9XissXip7Xi9jXiFxXissXiFyXipBXjEqXilQXiFCXiwqXiEi",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0aca58c83259",
      "text": " 現在，滾開！否則我宰了你們！",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^&?^\"d^*A^,z^)F^*W^\"H^!x^$%^1w^*D^*F^*{^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4mP14iZF4qQV4sel4pRl4qV14iSF4heF4kJV4xd14qRF4qRl4qe14qVw==",
      "byte_length": 43
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d0625e374e12",
      "text": "啊， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+Q^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitRXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 7
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_91050c3f73ee",
      "text": "，是你們啊。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*A^,X^*F^*{^+Q^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipBXixYXipGXip7XitRXiEi",
      "byte_length": 18
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_95edd09234e6",
      "text": "歡迎回來。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%F^(k^\"\\^!O^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVGXihrXiJcXiFPXiEi",
      "byte_length": 15
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_baf772d464f6",
      "text": "你們討伐 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^-o^5) ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7Xi1vXjUpIA==",
      "byte_length": 13
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ab9097cac82d",
      "text": "瑪格拉",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-*^%*^$6",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi0qXiUqXiQ2",
      "byte_length": 9
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_390f00c9c04e",
      "text": "雙足飛龍",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)_^(^^)z^*>",
      "encoded_base64": "XilfXiheXil6Xio+",
      "byte_length": 12
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d2c53b7647e0",
      "text": " 掠奪者的任務進展如何？",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^1<^1,^'V^&Z^!C^+4^(w^+x^#$^!L^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4xPF4xLF4nVl4mWl4hQ14rNF4od14reF4jJF4hTF4uVg==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_26e0dbb68b02",
      "text": "  能再次見到友善的面孔真是太好了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^'b^!l^%D^-m^!u^\"8^1(^&Z^)j^5G^-2^,X^+f^+i^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJ2JeIWxeJUReLW1eIXVeIjheMSheJlpeKWpeNUdeLTJeLFheK2ZeK2leKkReISI=",
      "byte_length": 50
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_17eb22a69fa5",
      "text": "  巴卡扎再也不會給你們惹任何麻煩了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^#K^\"0^,=^!l^!1^!)^$r^'A^*F^*{^3s^!C^!L^*6^-!^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeI0teIjBeLD1eIWxeITFeISleJHJeJ0FeKkZeKnteM3NeIUNeIUxeKjZeLSFeKkReISI=",
      "byte_length": 53
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5c9e89a8a868",
      "text": "  我在巨蟲之腹那邊進展不太順利。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^\"d^#H^(8^!/^3%^)!^.8^(w^+x^!)^+f^.D^!t^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeImReI0heKDheIS9eMyVeKSFeLjheKHdeK3heISleK2ZeLkReIXReISI=",
      "byte_length": 47
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ef542f334ac4",
      "text": "  雙足飛龍掠奪者已經全被消滅了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^)_^(^^)z^*>^1<^1,^'V^#J^'D^!h^(@^%k^%t^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKV9eKF5eKXpeKj5eMTxeMSxeJ1ZeI0peJ0ReIWheKEBeJWteJXReKkReISI=",
      "byte_length": 47
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bb8979bb078e",
      "text": "  那些雙足飛龍依然造成了些麻煩。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^)!^!8^)_^(^^)z^*>^!Q^&\"^(v^$$^*D^!8^*6^-!^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKSFeITheKV9eKF5eKXpeKj5eIVFeJiJeKHZeJCReKkReITheKjZeLSFeISI=",
      "byte_length": 47
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_63f2f6012185",
      "text": "是啊，這片沙漠裡很難孕育出友善的事物。真高興看到你們依然活著。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,X^+Q^*A^(s^&1^%]^,}^-j^*K^)a^5H^5z^!q^\"8^1(^&Z^*r^&4^!\"^-2^*+^-]^*Q^!u^*F^*{^!Q^&\"^%i^-a^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XixYXitRXipBXihzXiYxXiVdXix9Xi1qXipLXilhXjVIXjV6XiFxXiI4XjEoXiZaXipyXiY0XiEiXi0yXiorXi1dXipRXiF1XipGXip7XiFRXiYiXiVpXi1hXiEi",
      "byte_length": 93
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a7d452fb2adf",
      "text": "自從那支大軍覆滅之後，我就再沒聽說任何消息了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'l^#f^)!^$L^\"z^..^(D^%t^!/^#b^*A^$%^*J^!l^%\\^-X^-x^!C^!L^%k^#w^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XidsXiNmXikhXiRMXiJ6Xi4uXihEXiV0XiEvXiNiXipBXiQlXipKXiFsXiVcXi1YXi14XiFDXiFMXiVrXiN3XipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 69
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9845cdd4038f",
      "text": "聖堂武士集結了一支規模遠超所有人想像的大軍。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'Z^42^%J^+a^)]^'@^*D^!%^$L^6'^%:^({^(\\^$)^$s^!<^,1^!`^&Z^\"z^..^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XidaXjQyXiVKXithXildXidAXipEXiElXiRMXjYnXiU6Xih7XihcXiQpXiRzXiE8XiwxXiFgXiZaXiJ6Xi4uXiEi",
      "byte_length": 66
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5b038cdbe774",
      "text": "提奎茲爾將首當其衝承受攻擊，但所有的村落恐怕都注定 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$A^5B^/D^&/^#7^)~^&N^!j^-h^$0^\";^$O^$F^*A^!I^$)^$s^&Z^$z^-`^#t^0^^)$^%e^#. ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRBXjVCXi9EXiYvXiM3Xil+XiZOXiFqXi1oXiQwXiI7XiRPXiRGXipBXiFJXiQpXiRzXiZaXiR6Xi1gXiN0XjBeXikkXiVlXiMuIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a8af43534d24",
      "text": "像狂風中的黃沙般被席捲抹殺。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!`^&8^)y^!,^&Z^*7^%]^'r^(@^0X^0c^4=^%M^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFgXiY4Xil5XiEsXiZaXio3XiVdXidyXihAXjBYXjBjXjQ9XiVNXiEi",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_141204cb6774",
      "text": "德拉吉的聖堂武士為了維持自身權柄，行事手段正變得越來越偏激極端。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#j^$6^\"D^&Z^'Z^42^%J^+a^%{^*D^'F^$7^'l^(c^1E^%#^*A^(;^*r^$+^.l^%H^(U^#e^(]^!O^(]^![^1H^1D^5o^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNqXiQ2XiJEXiZaXidaXjQyXiVKXithXiV7XipEXidGXiQ3XidsXihjXjFFXiUjXipBXig7XipyXiQrXi5sXiVIXihVXiNlXihdXiFPXihdXiFbXjFIXjFEXjVvXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 97
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_093a9b989367",
      "text": "沙漠裡的村落絕不可能在這種動盪劫難中倖存。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%]^,}^-j^&Z^$z^-`^-I^!)^\"A^'b^\"d^(s^'$^\"%^0\"^1l^)a^!,^5+^#*^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVdXix9Xi1qXiZaXiR6Xi1gXi1JXiEpXiJBXidiXiJkXihzXickXiIlXjAiXjFsXilhXiEsXjUrXiMqXiEi",
      "byte_length": 63
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b2dae2b146e4",
      "text": "無數流言沸沸揚揚，謠傳德拉吉的巫王與聖堂武士正為了統治權 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%}^$V^%j^1Y^5\\^5\\^2k^2k^*A^6,^+$^#j^$6^\"D^&Z^14^-)^'p^'Z^42^%J^+a^%H^%{^*D^'B^%_^1E ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiV9XiRWXiVqXjFZXjVcXjVcXjJrXjJrXipBXjYsXiskXiNqXiQ2XiJEXiZaXjE0Xi0pXidwXidaXjQyXiVKXithXiVIXiV7XipEXidCXiVfXjFFIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2a55cda6486c",
      "text": "爭吵不休。他們唯一達成共識的，就是徹底毀滅荒漠中的村落。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^1I^/T^!)^!G^!\"^!@^*{^+O^!%^(z^$$^3d^(R^&Z^*A^*J^,X^18^/^^%N^%t^1W^,}^!,^&Z^$z^-`^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XjFJXi9UXiEpXiFHXiEiXiFAXip7XitPXiElXih6XiQkXjNkXihSXiZaXipBXipKXixYXjE4Xi9eXiVOXiV0XjFXXix9XiEsXiZaXiR6Xi1gXiEi",
      "byte_length": 84
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_81fa40f258e8",
      "text": "德拉吉的聖堂武士懷疑提奎茲爾正在策劃起義叛亂， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#j^$6^\"D^&Z^'Z^42^%J^+a^,9^0p^$A^5B^/D^&/^%H^\"d^5p^4s^.(^2<^.Z^!3^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNqXiQ2XiJEXiZaXidaXjQyXiVKXithXiw5XjBwXiRBXjVCXi9EXiYvXiVIXiJkXjVwXjRzXi4oXjI8Xi5aXiEzXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_661b62ca522a",
      "text": "目前正大肆集結重兵，企圖徹底撲滅這股威脅。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&^^!z^%H^\"z^2>^)]^'@^))^+,^*A^4-^\"b^18^/^^4B^%t^(s^'_^#&^1T^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZeXiF6XiVIXiJ6XjI+XildXidAXikpXissXipBXjQtXiJiXjE4Xi9eXjRCXiV0XihzXidfXiMmXjFUXiEi",
      "byte_length": 63
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1d7b5556822a",
      "text": "從各方消息來看，德拉吉的聖堂武士恐慌絕望，深怕巫王會收回賜予他們的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#f^+>^$]^%k^#w^!O^*Q^*A^#j^$6^\"D^&Z^'Z^42^%J^+a^#t^#}^-I^,]^*A^2*^0^^14^-)^$r^$M^\"\\^.#^!4^!@^*{^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNmXis+XiRdXiVrXiN3XiFPXipRXipBXiNqXiQ2XiJEXiZaXidaXjQyXiVKXithXiN0XiN9Xi1JXixdXipBXjIqXjBeXjE0Xi0pXiRyXiRNXiJcXi4jXiE0XiFAXip7XiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 100
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fbc01013a0bd",
      "text": "神術權能。他們定會採取鋌而走險的極端手段來阻止大權旁落。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&w^(<^1E^'b^!\"^!@^*{^#.^$r^5R^\":^6>^'W^.&^*m^&Z^1D^5o^$+^.l^!O^)L^%G^\"z^1E^.h^-`^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZ3Xig8XjFFXidiXiEiXiFAXip7XiMuXiRyXjVSXiI6XjY+XidXXi4mXiptXiZaXjFEXjVvXiQrXi5sXiFPXilMXiVHXiJ6XjFFXi5oXi1gXiEi",
      "byte_length": 84
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b647c4533569",
      "text": "傳言說有一群奴隸從競技場逃脫了。我對聖堂武士沒半點好感，但這意味著 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+$^1Y^-x^$s^!%^'R^##^)Z^#f^-?^,>^\"n^(p^'c^*D^!\"^$%^#:^'Z^42^%J^+a^%\\^\"-^*;^+i^#{^*A^!I^(s^#z^1n^-a ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiskXjFZXi14XiRzXiElXidSXiMjXilaXiNmXi0/Xiw+XiJuXihwXidjXipEXiEiXiQlXiM6XidaXjQyXiVKXithXiVcXiItXio7XitpXiN7XipBXiFJXihzXiN6XjFuXi1hIA==",
      "byte_length": 100
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2a10fcce87cd",
      "text": "將有更多駐軍在德拉吉城外盤查騷擾平民，而我們商隊又得多付好幾筆過路賄賂。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#7^$s^$o^\"x^1f^..^\"d^#j^$6^\"D^+_^\"w^1M^%&^0y^$K^0Y^%T^*A^'W^$%^*{^1'^)U^+;^#e^\"x^*u^+i^#T^-A^(x^(a^61^60^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiM3XiRzXiRvXiJ4XjFmXi4uXiJkXiNqXiQ2XiJEXitfXiJ3XjFNXiUmXjB5XiRLXjBZXiVUXipBXidXXiQlXip7XjEnXilVXis7XiNlXiJ4Xip1XitpXiNUXi1BXih4XihhXjYxXjYwXiEi",
      "byte_length": 108
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_345b1d3f08b5",
      "text": "一名途經此地前往提奎茲爾的旅人說，德拉吉的聖堂武士們已經亂作一團。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!%^\"F^3.^'D^%I^\"e^!z^,)^$A^5B^/D^&/^&Z^2m^!<^-x^*A^#j^$6^\"D^&Z^'Z^42^%J^+a^*{^#J^'D^!3^!M^!%^0V^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiElXiJGXjMuXidEXiVJXiJlXiF6XiwpXiRBXjVCXi9EXiYvXiZaXjJtXiE8Xi14XipBXiNqXiQ2XiJEXiZaXidaXjQyXiVKXithXip7XiNKXidEXiEzXiFNXiElXjBWXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 100
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e2de4bfe76d1",
      "text": "據說跟巫王特克圖克特雷拋棄了他們有關。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^5T^-x^.+^14^-)^&5^!d^\"b^!d^&5^)c^,A^,a^*D^!@^*{^$s^.>^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XjVUXi14Xi4rXjE0Xi0pXiY1XiFkXiJiXiFkXiY1XiljXixBXixhXipEXiFAXip7XiRzXi4+XiEi",
      "byte_length": 57
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_62980d7cfbda",
      "text": "我聽說有個來自德拉吉的聖堂武士在我們西南方扎下了營地——我真不知道 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^-X^-x^$s^!V^!O^'l^#j^$6^\"D^&Z^'Z^42^%J^+a^\"d^$%^*{^-l^\"/^$]^,=^!(^*D^&'^\"e^*n^*n^$%^-2^!)^&h^(y ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXi1YXi14XiRzXiFWXiFPXidsXiNqXiQ2XiJEXiZaXidaXjQyXiVKXithXiJkXiQlXip7Xi1sXiIvXiRdXiw9XiEoXipEXiYnXiJlXipuXipuXiQlXi0yXiEpXiZoXih5IA==",
      "byte_length": 100
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c7673a980a09",
      "text": "那個蠢蛋到底妄想在那裡找到什麼！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^!V^.u^6\"^!u^/^^+j^,1^\"d^)!^-j^$/^!u^!=^.T^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXiFWXi51XjYiXiF1Xi9eXitqXiwxXiJkXikhXi1qXiQvXiF1XiE9Xi5UXipX",
      "byte_length": 48
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_aa7349a451c2",
      "text": "以我父親的寶劍起誓，你們的膽識連巨龍的尾巴都敢抓！這真是天大的好消息！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!B^$%^5d^(F^&Z^#4^!|^.(^-w^*A^*F^*{^&Z^-[^(R^.0^#H^*>^&Z^5J^#K^)$^/m^$2^*W^(s^-2^,X^+e^\"z^&Z^+i^%k^#w^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFCXiQlXjVkXihGXiZaXiM0XiF8Xi4oXi13XipBXipGXip7XiZaXi1bXihSXi4wXiNIXio+XiZaXjVKXiNLXikkXi9tXiQyXipXXihzXi0yXixYXitlXiJ6XiZaXitpXiVrXiN3XipX",
      "byte_length": 105
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f5d5b78d001f",
      "text": "巴卡扎是個徹頭徹尾的惡魔。真慶幸他的陰影再也不會玷污這片黃沙了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#K^\"0^,=^,X^!V^18^)t^18^5J^&Z^#y^*0^!\"^-2^5P^15^!@^&Z^6B^#a^!l^!1^!)^$r^1K^0h^(s^&1^*7^%]^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNLXiIwXiw9XixYXiFWXjE4Xil0XjE4XjVKXiZaXiN5XiowXiEiXi0yXjVQXjE1XiFAXiZaXjZCXiNhXiFsXiExXiEpXiRyXjFLXjBoXihzXiYxXio3XiVdXipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 96
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0b8fbbc4a146",
      "text": "那真是個糟糕的壞消息，朋友。當你們接下任務時，我們本來抱著很大的期望，但如果對我們的襲擊 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^-2^,X^!V^-E^4\\^&Z^\"v^%k^#w^*A^,[^\"8^!\"^&N^*F^*{^$?^!(^!C^+4^$f^*A^$%^*{^$x^!O^,@^-a^*K^\"z^&Z^$u^,]^*A^!I^#$^%!^#:^$%^*{^&Z^08^$F ",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXi0yXixYXiFWXi1FXjRcXiZaXiJ2XiVrXiN3XipBXixbXiI4XiEiXiZOXipGXip7XiQ/XiEoXiFDXis0XiRmXipBXiQlXip7XiR4XiFPXixAXi1hXipLXiJ6XiZaXiR1XixdXipBXiFJXiMkXiUhXiM6XiQlXip7XiZaXjA4XiRGIA==",
      "byte_length": 133
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_57b6ed929c33",
      "text": "不及早停止，商隊的護衛力量恐怕很快就會削弱到難以自保了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^\"7^,V^+!^%G^*A^1'^)U^&Z^(T^(=^!~^)*^#t^0^^*K^*L^*J^$r^!y^#\\^!u^)a^!B^'l^!T^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXiI3XixWXishXiVHXipBXjEnXilVXiZaXihUXig9XiF+XikqXiN0XjBeXipLXipMXipKXiRyXiF5XiNcXiF1XilhXiFCXidsXiFUXipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 84
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a40d0bad09af",
      "text": "這消息就像甘霖般令人欣喜！整支商隊都對你們感激不盡，今晚我一定要舉起酒杯 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^%k^#w^*J^!`^/:^6D^'r^*w^!<^2'^+V^*W^$T^$L^1'^)U^)$^#:^*F^*{^#{^1H^!)^-1^*A^*E^,Y^$%^!%^#.^(C^01^.(^6=^5Y ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXiVrXiN3XipKXiFgXi86XjZEXidyXip3XiE8XjInXitWXipXXiRUXiRMXjEnXilVXikkXiM6XipGXip7XiN7XjFIXiEpXi0xXipBXipFXixZXiQlXiElXiMuXihDXjAxXi4oXjY9XjVZIA==",
      "byte_length": 109
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3d832f585852",
      "text": "為你們的安康乾杯。那些雙足飛龍簡直是籠罩在我們所有人頭上的瘟疫！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%{^*F^*{^&Z^+p^5N^*X^5Y^!\"^)!^!8^)_^(^^)z^*>^3y^&`^,X^'3^'P^\"d^$%^*{^$)^$s^!<^)t^!'^&Z^&T^&P^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiV7XipGXip7XiZaXitwXjVOXipYXjVZXiEiXikhXiE4XilfXiheXil6Xio+XjN5XiZgXixYXiczXidQXiJkXiQlXip7XiQpXiRzXiE8Xil0XiEnXiZaXiZUXiZQXipX",
      "byte_length": 96
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_086cfd499b39",
      "text": "願沙塵暴把那些該死的孽畜和龍騎士統統埋葬！要不是因為那些雙足飛龍， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.H^%]^\"p^$m^$1^)!^!8^(M^%L^&Z^5I^5f^\"O^*>^0K^+a^'B^'B^1r^-b^*W^(C^!)^,X^\"]^%{^)!^!8^)_^(^^)z^*>^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi5IXiVdXiJwXiRtXiQxXikhXiE4XihNXiVMXiZaXjVJXjVmXiJPXio+XjBLXithXidCXidCXjFyXi1iXipXXihDXiEpXixYXiJdXiV7XikhXiE4XilfXiheXil6Xio+XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 100
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0d846e14700d",
      "text": "強盜其實很容易對付；但每當牠們從天而降俯衝撲下時，營地警戒線根本起不到什麼防禦作用。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#]^0!^!j^#3^*K^+t^,W^#:^*u^*C^!I^%P^&N^-#^*{^#f^+e^'W^)N^5*^-h^4B^!(^$f^*A^&'^\"e^(S^$&^'I^%)^$x^.(^!)^!u^!=^.T^)K^&{^!M^&H^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNdXjAhXiFqXiMzXipLXit0XixXXiM6Xip1XipDXiFJXiVQXiZOXi0jXip7XiNmXitlXidXXilOXjUqXi1oXjRCXiEoXiRmXipBXiYnXiJlXihTXiQmXidJXiUpXiR4Xi4oXiEpXiF1XiE9Xi5UXilLXiZ7XiFNXiZIXiEi",
      "byte_length": 126
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3beaac966e40",
      "text": "你們答應前去剷除 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^-B^0`^!z^\"6^2Y^)Q ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7Xi1CXjBgXiF6XiI2XjJZXilRIA==",
      "byte_length": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_30faab94f07c",
      "text": " 掠奪者的消息已經傳遍了整支商隊。你們真是英勇的靈魂，祝你們好運。",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^1<^1,^'V^&Z^%k^#w^#J^'D^+$^69^*D^$T^$L^1'^)U^!\"^*F^*{^-2^,X^'y^\"$^&Z^)g^*.^*A^&v^*F^*{^+i^.4^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4xPF4xLF4nVl4mWl4la14jd14jSl4nRF4rJF42OV4qRF4kVF4kTF4xJ14pVV4hIl4qRl4qe14tMl4sWF4neV4iJF4mWl4pZ14qLl4qQV4mdl4qRl4qe14raV4uNF4hIg==",
      "byte_length": 97
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e05b1d9530a7",
      "text": "  你們能給予的任何好運我都十分需要。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^*{^'b^'A^!4^&Z^!C^!L^+i^.4^$%^)$^*Y^!s^)e^(C^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeKnteJ2JeJ0FeITReJlpeIUNeIUxeK2leLjReJCVeKSReKlleIXNeKWVeKENeISI=",
      "byte_length": 53
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d2dd469a887d",
      "text": "  我從來就不喜歡那些瑪格拉。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^#f^!O^*J^!)^+V^%F^)!^!8^-*^%*^$6^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeI2ZeIU9eKkpeISleK1ZeJUZeKSFeITheLSpeJSpeJDZeISI=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_78b50413dac2",
      "text": "  那些瑪格拉巨怪絕不會再困擾你們太久了！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^)!^!8^-*^%*^$6^#H^#s^-I^!)^$r^!l^\"^^$K^*F^*{^+f^!.^*D^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKSFeITheLSpeJSpeJDZeI0heI3NeLUleISleJHJeIWxeIl5eJEteKkZeKnteK2ZeIS5eKkReKlc=",
      "byte_length": 59
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2f6b6c837d16",
      "text": "  聽起來那些雙足飛龍是極其致命的凶獸。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^-X^.(^!O^)!^!8^)_^(^^)z^*>^,X^1D^!j^'o^\"N^&Z^3e^&<^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLVheLiheIU9eKSFeITheKV9eKF5eKXpeKj5eLFheMUReIWpeJ29eIk5eJlpeM2VeJjxeISI=",
      "byte_length": 56
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d74ab67a885b",
      "text": "  不管牠們是不是飛龍，牠們絕不可能再來騷擾你們了！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^!)^-D^-#^*{^,X^!)^,X^)z^*>^*A^-#^*{^-I^!)^\"A^'b^!l^!O^0y^$K^*F^*{^*D^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeISleLUReLSNeKnteLFheISleLFheKXpeKj5eKkFeLSNeKnteLUleISleIkFeJ2JeIWxeIU9eMHleJEteKkZeKnteKkReKlc=",
      "byte_length": 74
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d0dff9861f02",
      "text": " 能在你們面前支撐太久。",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^'b^\"d^*F^*{^)j^!z^$L^,L^+f^!.^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4nYl4iZF4qRl4qe14pal4hel4kTF4sTF4rZl4hLl4hIg==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fe3c76b2eea5",
      "text": "在我看來你們實力相當強悍！我懷疑 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"d^$%^*Q^!O^*F^*{^#3^!~^&a^&N^#]^,-^*W^$%^,9^0p ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJkXiQlXipRXiFPXipGXip7XiMzXiF+XiZhXiZOXiNdXiwtXipXXiQlXiw5XjBwIA==",
      "byte_length": 49
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c6b03a40d011",
      "text": "盤踞在巨蟲之腹的瑪格拉",
      "encoded_ascii": "^1M^1_^\"d^#H^(8^!/^3%^&Z^-*^%*^$6",
      "encoded_base64": "XjFNXjFfXiJkXiNIXig4XiEvXjMlXiZaXi0qXiUqXiQ2",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_51391ad6587e",
      "text": "強盜與他們的雙足飛龍",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#]^0!^'p^!@^*{^&Z^)_^(^^)z^*>",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNdXjAhXidwXiFAXip7XiZaXilfXiheXil6Xio+",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6498fa24e37c",
      "text": "骯髒下賤的畜生！只有牠們才會願意住在巨蟲腐爛的骸骨裡！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^0L^0M^!(^2G^&Z^5f^&F^*W^\"?^$s^-#^*{^$,^$r^.H^#z^*z^\"d^#H^(8^0/^&-^&Z^*'^*$^-j^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XjBMXjBNXiEoXjJHXiZaXjVmXiZGXipXXiI/XiRzXi0jXip7XiQsXiRyXi5IXiN6Xip6XiJkXiNIXig4XjAvXiYtXiZaXionXiokXi1qXipX",
      "byte_length": 81
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d147ee101e41",
      "text": "我可一點都不想跟牠們正面交鋒！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^\"A^!%^*;^)$^!)^,1^.+^-#^*{^%H^)j^0P^6?^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiJBXiElXio7XikkXiEpXiwxXi4rXi0jXip7XiVIXilqXjBQXjY/XipX",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0bd181098735",
      "text": "  你能跟我說說巨蟲之腹的事嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^'b^.+^$%^-x^-x^#H^(8^!/^3%^&Z^*r^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeJ2JeLiteJCVeLXheLXheI0heKDheIS9eMyVeJlpeKnJeK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_286ec081b6f9",
      "text": "  你對那些瑪格拉巨怪了解多少？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^#:^)!^!8^-*^%*^$6^#H^#s^*D^(I^\"x^#<^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeIzpeKSFeITheLSpeJSpeJDZeI0heI3NeKkReKEleInheIzxeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_88eb0c15078b",
      "text": "  巴卡扎是何許人也？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^#K^\"0^,=^,X^!L^-s^!<^!1^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeI0teIjBeLD1eLFheIUxeLXNeITxeITFeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7c904619ee8b",
      "text": "  你還聽說過哪些其他傳聞？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^.7^-X^-x^(x^+I^!8^!j^!@^+$^4^^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeLjdeLVheLXheKHheK0leITheIWpeIUBeKyReNF5eLlY=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a81ffdb15966",
      "text": "  你知道那些瑪格拉巨怪是打哪裡來的嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^&h^(y^)!^!8^-*^%*^$6^#H^#s^,X^$-^+I^-j^!O^&Z^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeJmheKHleKSFeITheLSpeJSpeJDZeI0heI3NeLFheJC1eK0leLWpeIU9eJlpeK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 56
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6bd4e35c6799",
      "text": "  你對那些強盜了解多少？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^#:^)!^!8^#]^0!^*D^(I^\"x^#<^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeIzpeKSFeITheI11eMCFeKkReKEleInheIzxeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_542045a5c79e",
      "text": "  關於那些雙足飛龍，你能告訴我些什麼？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^.>^$^^)!^!8^)_^(^^)z^*>^*A^*F^'b^+B^-t^$%^!8^!=^.T^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLj5eJF5eKSFeITheKV9eKF5eKXpeKj5eKkFeKkZeJ2JeK0JeLXReJCVeITheIT1eLlReLlY=",
      "byte_length": 56
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3858e2dcd85a",
      "text": "  你一定知道些內情。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^!%^#.^&h^(y^!8^!g^,0^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeISVeIy5eJmheKHleITheIWdeLDBeISI=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_43a1ca1c5818",
      "text": "  你剛才提到的那座城堡是怎麼回事？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^+0^$,^$A^!u^&Z^)!^/_^+_^\"m^,X^,,^.T^\"\\^*r^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeKzBeJCxeJEFeIXVeJlpeKSFeL19eK19eIm1eLFheLCxeLlReIlxeKnJeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 50
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9da6e7034ddb",
      "text": "  強盜們是從哪裡弄來雙足飛龍的？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^#]^0!^*{^,X^#f^+I^-j^/`^!O^)_^(^^)z^*>^&Z^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeI11eMCFeKnteLFheI2ZeK0leLWpeL2BeIU9eKV9eKF5eKXpeKj5eJlpeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 47
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2853984ad315",
      "text": "大篷車主肯定告訴過你們更多內情。我只知道 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"z^'1^5%^!-^-Z^#.^+B^-t^(x^*F^*{^$o^\"x^!g^,0^!\"^$%^\"?^&h^(y ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJ6XicxXjUlXiEtXi1aXiMuXitCXi10Xih4XipGXip7XiRvXiJ4XiFnXiwwXiEiXiQlXiI/XiZoXih5IA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_78145ff47583",
      "text": "他們惹出的麻煩大到連城邦軍隊都在四處搜捕他們。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^*{^3s^!q^&Z^*6^-!^\"z^!u^.0^+_^1a^..^)U^)$^\"d^\"[^(,^/h^4?^!@^*{^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXip7XjNzXiFxXiZaXio2Xi0hXiJ6XiF1Xi4wXitfXjFhXi4uXilVXikkXiJkXiJbXigsXi9oXjQ/XiFAXip7XiEi",
      "byte_length": 69
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_595028b64e2b",
      "text": "我知道的不多。大篷車主對巴卡扎和瑪格拉的了解比我清楚得多。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^&h^(y^&Z^!)^\"x^!\"^\"z^'1^5%^!-^#:^#K^\"0^,=^\"O^-*^%*^$6^&Z^*D^(I^,m^$%^,u^,c^#e^\"x^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiZoXih5XiZaXiEpXiJ4XiEiXiJ6XicxXjUlXiEtXiM6XiNLXiIwXiw9XiJPXi0qXiUqXiQ2XiZaXipEXihJXixtXiQlXix1XixjXiNlXiJ4XiEi",
      "byte_length": 87
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ea84d2d05e71",
      "text": "只要知道那些強盜從城堡俯衝而下、肆意劫掠他們想要的一切就夠了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"?^(C^&h^(y^)!^!8^#]^0!^#f^+_^\"m^5*^-h^'W^!(^!!^2>^#z^1l^1<^!@^*{^,1^(C^&Z^!%^+.^*J^+d^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiI/XihDXiZoXih5XikhXiE4XiNdXjAhXiNmXitfXiJtXjUqXi1oXidXXiEoXiEhXjI+XiN6XjFsXjE8XiFAXip7XiwxXihDXiZaXiElXisuXipKXitkXipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 94
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7debbe09d43e",
      "text": "要不是靠著那些雙足飛龍，他們哪敢這麼囂張！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(C^!)^,X^.C^-a^)!^!8^)_^(^^)z^*>^*A^!@^*{^+I^/m^(s^.T^5;^,(^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XihDXiEpXixYXi5DXi1hXikhXiE4XilfXiheXil6Xio+XipBXiFAXip7XitJXi9tXihzXi5UXjU7XiwoXipX",
      "byte_length": 63
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7f6e8adba7ec",
      "text": "城堡？那只是一個旅人隨口提起的。她當時正前往塞德利特——就在 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+_^\"m^.V^)!^\"?^,X^!%^!V^2m^!<^)X^\"<^$A^.(^&Z^!\"^+h^&N^$f^%H^!z^,)^/(^#j^!t^&5^*n^*n^*J^\"d ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitfXiJtXi5WXikhXiI/XixYXiElXiFWXjJtXiE8XilYXiI8XiRBXi4oXiZaXiEiXitoXiZOXiRmXiVIXiF6XiwpXi8oXiNqXiF0XiY1XipuXipuXipKXiJkIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_25b4488c14f1",
      "text": "此地以西——中途看見雙足飛龍從一座山間要塞騰空而起。我猜那群飛龍 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%I^\"e^!B^-l^*n^*n^!,^3.^*Q^-m^)_^(^^)z^*>^#f^!%^/_^11^)G^(C^/(^.O^'(^'W^.(^!\"^$%^-'^)!^'R^)z^*> ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVJXiJlXiFCXi1sXipuXipuXiEsXjMuXipRXi1tXilfXiheXil6Xio+XiNmXiElXi9fXjExXilHXihDXi8oXi5PXicoXidXXi4oXiEiXiQlXi0nXikhXidSXil6Xio+IA==",
      "byte_length": 97
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_193cfd973707",
      "text": "肯定就是襲擊我們的這批，但我不敢斷定。我敢說大篷車主知道的一定比我多。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-Z^#.^*J^,X^08^$F^$%^*{^&Z^(s^2i^*A^!I^$%^!)^/m^,T^#.^!\"^$%^/m^-x^\"z^'1^5%^!-^&h^(y^&Z^!%^#.^,m^$%^\"x^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi1aXiMuXipKXixYXjA4XiRGXiQlXip7XiZaXihzXjJpXipBXiFJXiQlXiEpXi9tXixUXiMuXiEiXiQlXi9tXi14XiJ6XicxXjUlXiEtXiZoXih5XiZaXiElXiMuXixtXiQlXiJ4XiEi",
      "byte_length": 105
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1df527c5f50c",
      "text": "我能告訴你的不多，只知道雙足飛龍極其罕見， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^'b^+B^-t^*F^&Z^!)^\"x^*A^\"?^&h^(y^)_^(^^)z^*>^1D^!j^5w^-m^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXidiXitCXi10XipGXiZaXiEpXiJ4XipBXiI/XiZoXih5XilfXiheXil6Xio+XjFEXiFqXjV3Xi1tXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cce4a0ae3b3b",
      "text": "真叫人想不透一夥尋常的強盜究竟是怎麼控制住牠們的。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-2^+<^!<^,1^!)^(q^!%^5?^#9^#O^&Z^#]^0!^-<^28^,X^,,^.T^$@^!v^*z^-#^*{^&Z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi0yXis8XiE8XiwxXiEpXihxXiElXjU/XiM5XiNPXiZaXiNdXjAhXi08XjI4XixYXiwsXi5UXiRAXiF2Xip6Xi0jXip7XiZaXiEi",
      "byte_length": 75
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_15ea20117591",
      "text": "他是個滅絕者！各種傳聞如群蠅附屍般糾纏著他的名字。我們抓獲的一名瑪格拉說巴卡扎 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^,X^!V^%t^-I^'V^*W^+>^'$^+$^4^^#$^'R^6#^.?^#?^'r^3U^'N^-a^!@^&Z^\"F^#)^!\"^$%^*{^$2^&:^&Z^!%^\"F^-*^%*^$6^-x^#K^\"0^,= ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXixYXiFWXiV0Xi1JXidWXipXXis+XickXiskXjReXiMkXidSXjYjXi4/XiM/XidyXjNVXidOXi1hXiFAXiZaXiJGXiMpXiEiXiQlXip7XiQyXiY6XiZaXiElXiJGXi0qXiUqXiQ2Xi14XiNLXiIwXiw9IA==",
      "byte_length": 118
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b872413bba3b",
      "text": "妄圖自封為德拉吉之王——而且他確實擁有這股實力。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+j^\"b^'l^#5^%{^#j^$6^\"D^!/^-)^*n^*n^'W^!*^!@^-6^#3^,M^$s^(s^'_^#3^!~^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XitqXiJiXidsXiM1XiV7XiNqXiQ2XiJEXiEvXi0pXipuXipuXidXXiEqXiFAXi02XiMzXixNXiRzXihzXidfXiMzXiF+XiEi",
      "byte_length": 72
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_598a5b1bb9da",
      "text": "沒什麼值得大書特書的……不過我岳父的表親曾說過，在巨蟲之腹深處 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%\\^!=^.T^!Z^#e^\"z^$p^&5^$p^&Z^*o^*o^!)^(x^$%^5M^5d^&Z^-i^(F^.j^-x^(x^*A^\"d^#H^(8^!/^3%^2*^(, ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVcXiE9Xi5UXiFaXiNlXiJ6XiRwXiY1XiRwXiZaXipvXipvXiEpXih4XiQlXjVNXjVkXiZaXi1pXihGXi5qXi14Xih4XipBXiJkXiNIXig4XiEvXjMlXjIqXigsIA==",
      "byte_length": 94
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_376cac4c40bf",
      "text": "蘊藏著古老的賜命魔法——源自眾神尚未遺棄亞薩斯的遠古歲月。可如今從巨蟲之腹傳出的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^6!^-f^-a^\"=^'U^&Z^.#^\"N^*0^%b^*n^*n^%q^'l^&e^&w^+v^,_^0v^,a^!9^-e^$[^&Z^({^\"=^,j^/p^!\"^\"A^#$^*E^#f^#H^(8^!/^3%^+$^!q^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjYhXi1mXi1hXiI9XidVXiZaXi4jXiJOXiowXiViXipuXipuXiVxXidsXiZlXiZ3Xit2XixfXjB2XixhXiE5Xi1lXiRbXiZaXih7XiI9XixqXi9wXiEiXiJBXiMkXipFXiNmXiNIXig4XiEvXjMlXiskXiFxXiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 121
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f225e6bb54f3",
      "text": "唯有死亡。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+O^$s^%L^!:^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XitPXiRzXiVMXiE6XiEi",
      "byte_length": 15
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_65c04adddd13",
      "text": "成群結隊的部族在荒漠中搜尋唾手可得的獵物。突襲商隊的那批盤踞在西方一頭巨蟲的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$$^'R^'@^)U^&Z^)#^5V^\"d^1W^,}^!,^/h^#9^+P^$+^\"A^#e^&Z^&;^&4^!\"^'*^08^1'^)U^&Z^)!^2i^1M^1_^\"d^-l^$]^!%^)t^#H^(8^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQkXidSXidAXilVXiZaXikjXjVWXiJkXjFXXix9XiEsXi9oXiM5XitQXiQrXiJBXiNlXiZaXiY7XiY0XiEiXicqXjA4XjEnXilVXiZaXikhXjJpXjFNXjFfXiJkXi1sXiRdXiElXil0XiNIXig4XiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 115
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2f28a904554d",
      "text": "枯骨中，自從被巴卡扎誘騙蠱惑後，行事手段變得更加凶殘激進。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^5Z^*$^!,^*A^'l^#f^(@^#K^\"0^,=^1Z^.{^6$^#x^#b^*A^(;^*r^$+^.l^(U^#e^$o^\"\"^3e^,l^1H^(w^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XjVaXiokXiEsXipBXidsXiNmXihAXiNLXiIwXiw9XjFaXi57XjYkXiN4XiNiXipBXig7XipyXiQrXi5sXihVXiNlXiRvXiIiXjNlXixsXjFIXih3XiEi",
      "byte_length": 87
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_799a2d6b5689",
      "text": "歡迎光臨！我是賈克，這輛氣派大篷車的主人。請問你們對 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%F^(k^!c^1U^*W^$%^,X^/J^!d^*A^(s^65^%U^.n^\"z^'1^5%^&Z^!-^!<^!\"^*S^*Z^*F^*{^#: ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVGXihrXiFjXjFVXipXXiQlXixYXi9KXiFkXipBXihzXjY1XiVVXi5uXiJ6XicxXjUlXiZaXiEtXiE8XiEiXipTXipaXipGXip7XiM6IA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d994360a4c03",
      "text": "精良的兵刃武器感興趣嗎？我這裡只賣最頂級的貨色。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'7^1V^&Z^+,^!r^%J^\"V^#{^-]^.*^+X^.V^$%^(s^-j^\"?^.$^$q^)p^'<^&Z^.w^'s^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xic3XjFWXiZaXissXiFyXiVKXiJWXiN7Xi1dXi4qXitYXi5WXiQlXihzXi1qXiI/Xi4kXiRxXilwXic8XiZaXi53XidzXiEi",
      "byte_length": 72
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b7875532e1e8",
      "text": "  讓我看看你有些什麼好貨。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^-}^$%^*Q^*Q^*F^$s^!8^!=^.T^+i^.w^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLX1eJCVeKlFeKlFeKkZeJHNeITheIT1eLlReK2leLndeISI=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_af5379b15344",
      "text": "  沙漠裡最近有吹來什麼傳聞流言嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^%]^,}^-j^$q^(l^$s^+A^!O^!=^.T^+$^4^^%j^1Y^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJV1eLH1eLWpeJHFeKGxeJHNeK0FeIU9eIT1eLlReKyReNF5eJWpeMVleK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 50
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ee0f8b5f9bb9",
      "text": "期待下次再與你們做生意。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$u^,*^!(^%D^!l^'p^*F^*{^*~^&F^#z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiR1XiwqXiEoXiVEXiFsXidwXipGXip7Xip+XiZGXiN6XiEi",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_33df93cd6762",
      "text": "願這些兵器助你們戰無不勝。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.H^(s^!8^+,^\"V^\"#^*F^*{^$(^%}^!)^+5^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi5IXihzXiE4XissXiJWXiIjXipGXip7XiQoXiV9XiEpXis1XiEi",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2efe655c5fa1",
      "text": "願熾烈驕陽庇蔭你的額頭。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.H^20^%|^6F^.@^,\"^5~^*F^&Z^)v^)t^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi5IXjIwXiV8XjZGXi5AXiwiXjV+XipGXiZaXil2Xil0XiEi",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bc7622e2b0bb",
      "text": "請隨意挑選，看中什麼想買的儘管告訴我。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*S^)X^#z^,H^.6^*A^*Q^!,^!=^.T^,1^.!^&Z^+(^-D^+B^-t^$%^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipTXilYXiN6XixIXi42XipBXipRXiEsXiE9Xi5UXiwxXi4hXiZaXisoXi1EXitCXi10XiQlXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bdfc86cac7be",
      "text": "希望你們找到了稱心如意的物件。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+{^,]^*F^*{^$/^!u^*D^0&^#k^#$^#z^&Z^&4^.W^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xit7XixdXipGXip7XiQvXiF1XipEXjAmXiNrXiMkXiN6XiZaXiY0Xi5XXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4b7623f95248",
      "text": "有些從南方漂泊而來的旅人私下低語，提到了 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$s^!8^#f^\"/^$]^,|^5]^'W^!O^&Z^2m^!<^&~^!(^!K^0:^*A^$A^!u^*D ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRzXiE4XiNmXiIvXiRdXix8XjVdXidXXiFPXiZaXjJtXiE8XiZ+XiEoXiFLXjA6XipBXiRBXiF1XipEIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fa73c51f8e99",
      "text": "一則古老預言。全是些晦澀陰森的末日凶兆與胡言亂語。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!%^!x^\"=^'U^.E^1Y^!\"^!h^,X^!8^.i^.o^6B^4H^&Z^$w^$a^3e^5/^'p^3}^1Y^!3^0:^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiElXiF4XiI9XidVXi5FXjFZXiEiXiFoXixYXiE4Xi5pXi5vXjZCXjRIXiZaXiR3XiRhXjNlXjUvXidwXjN9XjFZXiEzXjA6XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3ec69392fd34",
      "text": "要我說啊，那些傢伙八成是被太陽曬昏了頭。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(C^$%^-x^+Q^*A^)!^!8^+#^*y^50^$$^,X^(@^+f^.@^,Z^$d^*D^)t^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XihDXiQlXi14XitRXipBXikhXiE4XisjXip5XjUwXiQkXixYXihAXitmXi5AXixaXiRkXipEXil0XiEi",
      "byte_length": 60
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9352094e51e4",
      "text": "一名來自提奎茲爾的戰士剛光顧了我的篷車，差點把我的庫存全買光。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!%^\"F^!O^'l^$A^5B^/D^&/^&Z^$(^+a^+0^!c^4n^*D^$%^&Z^'1^5%^*A^48^*;^$1^$%^&Z^,#^#*^!h^.!^!c^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiElXiJGXiFPXidsXiRBXjVCXi9EXiYvXiZaXiQoXithXiswXiFjXjRuXipEXiQlXiZaXicxXjUlXipBXjQ4Xio7XiQxXiQlXiZaXiwjXiMqXiFoXi4hXiFjXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 94
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f520293d2c9f",
      "text": "他嘴裡滔滔不絕地談論著德拉吉大軍，以及一支注定要 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^+[^-j^2t^2t^!)^-I^\"e^0;^1\\^-a^#j^$6^\"D^\"z^..^*A^!B^\"7^!%^$L^%e^#.^(C ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXitbXi1qXjJ0XjJ0XiEpXi1JXiJlXjA7XjFcXi1hXiNqXiQ2XiJEXiJ6Xi4uXipBXiFCXiI3XiElXiRMXiVlXiMuXihDIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6fa7149540dc",
      "text": "引領沙漠子民走向勝利的冒險者隊伍。在我聽來，那簡直 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#Z^)s^%]^,}^#(^%T^.&^+?^+5^!t^&Z^/P^*m^'V^)U^!F^!\"^\"d^$%^-X^!O^*A^)!^3y^&` ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNaXilzXiVdXix9XiMoXiVUXi4mXis/Xis1XiF0XiZaXi9QXiptXidWXilVXiFGXiEiXiJkXiQlXi1YXiFPXipBXikhXjN5XiZgIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_60839bb10141",
      "text": "就像是瘋子的囈語。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*J^!`^,X^-/^#(^&Z^5<^0:^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipKXiFgXixYXi0vXiMoXiZaXjU8XjA6XiEi",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d21b1389a06b",
      "text": "但誰又說得準呢？至少德拉吉發動大軍那部分千真萬確。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!I^-y^+;^-x^#e^,x^+C^.V^'n^#<^#j^$6^\"D^&W^\"%^\"z^..^)!^)#^!s^+7^-2^-_^-6^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFJXi15Xis7Xi14XiNlXix4XitDXi5WXiduXiM8XiNqXiQ2XiJEXiZXXiIlXiJ6Xi4uXikhXikjXiFzXis3Xi0yXi1fXi02XiEi",
      "byte_length": 75
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d5d7ee2e7a60",
      "text": "德拉吉的聖堂武士正強行把所有能抓到的奴隸統統徵召入伍；而且 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#j^$6^\"D^&Z^'Z^42^%J^+a^%H^#]^(;^$1^$)^$s^'b^$2^!u^&Z^##^)Z^'B^'B^5O^\"@^!f^!F^*C^'W^!* ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNqXiQ2XiJEXiZaXidaXjQyXiVKXithXiVIXiNdXig7XiQxXiQpXiRzXidiXiQyXiF1XiZaXiMjXilaXidCXidCXjVPXiJAXiFmXiFGXipDXidXXiEqIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_35788c1693ab",
      "text": "至於那位巫王特克圖克特雷——關於他的流言更是滿天飛， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'n^$^^)!^!J^14^-)^&5^!d^\"b^!d^&5^)c^*n^*n^.>^$^^!@^&Z^%j^1Y^$o^,X^,{^+e^)z^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiduXiReXikhXiFKXjE0Xi0pXiY1XiFkXiJiXiFkXiY1XiljXipuXipuXi4+XiReXiFAXiZaXiVqXjFZXiRvXixYXix7XitlXil6XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cba85396f636",
      "text": "足以讓最愛嚼舌根的人都說個沒完沒了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(^^!B^-}^$q^,2^5:^'q^%)^&Z^!<^)$^-x^!V^%\\^#,^%\\^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiheXiFCXi19XiRxXiwyXjU6XidxXiUpXiZaXiE8XikkXi14XiFWXiVcXiMsXiVcXipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c34cede176c0",
      "text": "有人說他已經駕崩了；也有人說他沉睡不醒，神魂正在遨遊 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$s^!<^-x^!@^#J^'D^6E^0W^*D^*C^!1^$s^!<^-x^!@^%Z^-3^!)^.9^*A^&w^*.^%H^\"d^6:^.3 ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRzXiE8Xi14XiFAXiNKXidEXjZFXjBXXipEXipDXiExXiRzXiE8Xi14XiFAXiVaXi0zXiEpXi45XipBXiZ3XiouXiVIXiJkXjY6Xi4zIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cb493760bc70",
      "text": "異度異界；還有人言之鑿鑿，說他已經化身成了一頭真龍。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&M^#V^&M^.p^*C^.7^$s^!<^1Y^!/^6@^6@^*A^-x^!@^#J^'D^\")^(c^$$^*D^!%^)t^-2^*>^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZNXiNWXiZNXi5wXipDXi43XiRzXiE8XjFZXiEvXjZAXjZAXipBXi14XiFAXiNKXidEXiIpXihjXiQkXipEXiElXil0Xi0yXio+XiEi",
      "byte_length": 78
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4cf617f26dd4",
      "text": "那些奴隸村落正在全民皆兵武裝自己，企圖擊退 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^!8^##^)Z^$z^-`^%H^\"d^!h^%T^5j^+,^%J^(A^'l^#I^*A^4-^\"b^$F^*V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXiE4XiMjXilaXiR6Xi1gXiVIXiJkXiFoXiVUXjVqXissXiVKXihBXidsXiNJXipBXjQtXiJiXiRGXipWIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_08610ea3703f",
      "text": "正在德拉吉集結的大軍。這對軍火生意固然是大好利多，但我 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%H^\"d^#j^$6^\"D^)]^'@^&Z^\"z^..^!\"^(s^#:^..^%x^&F^#z^3>^&\"^,X^\"z^+i^!t^\"x^*A^!I^$% ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVIXiJkXiNqXiQ2XiJEXildXidAXiZaXiJ6Xi4uXiEiXihzXiM6Xi4uXiV4XiZGXiN6XjM+XiYiXixYXiJ6XitpXiF0XiJ4XipBXiFJXiQlIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c40d035407b6",
      "text": "太清楚聖堂武士的心狠手辣了。那些村民注定會被碾得粉碎。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+f^,u^,c^'Z^42^%J^+a^&Z^#k^4T^$+^67^*D^!\"^)!^!8^$z^%T^%e^#.^$r^(@^0$^#e^'5^&o^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XitmXix1XixjXidaXjQyXiVKXithXiZaXiNrXjRUXiQrXjY3XipEXiEiXikhXiE4XiR6XiVUXiVlXiMuXiRyXihAXjAkXiNlXic1XiZvXiEi",
      "byte_length": 81
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f6ec38846981",
      "text": "一名被浩蕩軍隊逼得背井離鄉的難民告訴我， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!%^\"F^(@^5^^1X^..^)U^.1^#e^.r^!7^)`^6<^&Z^)a^%T^+B^-t^$%^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiElXiJGXihAXjVeXjFYXi4uXilVXi4xXiNlXi5yXiE3XilgXjY8XiZaXilhXiVUXitCXi10XiQlXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_72aedeb3ab5b",
      "text": "德拉吉大軍正朝著提奎茲爾撲去。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#j^$6^\"D^\"z^..^%H^,^^-a^$A^5B^/D^&/^4B^\"6^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNqXiQ2XiJEXiJ6Xi4uXiVIXixeXi1hXiRBXjVCXi9EXiYvXjRCXiI2XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f0670eaee81a",
      "text": "他說軍隊數量極其龐大，行軍揚起的滾滾沙塵甚至遮蔽了太陽。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^-x^..^)U^$V^)*^1D^!j^6H^\"z^*A^(;^..^2k^.(^&Z^,z^,z^%]^\"p^/|^'n^(~^('^*D^+f^.@^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXi14Xi4uXilVXiRWXikqXjFEXiFqXjZIXiJ6XipBXig7Xi4uXjJrXi4oXiZaXix6Xix6XiVdXiJwXi98XiduXih+XignXipEXitmXi5AXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d2399a4b3f80",
      "text": "要是那些村民稍有理智，早就該四散逃命了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(C^,X^)!^!8^$z^%T^-:^$s^&A^$i^*A^,V^*J^(M^\"[^$S^(p^\"N^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XihDXixYXikhXiE4XiR6XiVUXi06XiRzXiZBXiRpXipBXixWXipKXihNXiJbXiRTXihwXiJOXipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 60
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_92f13f51dbe3",
      "text": "沒什麼特別的，四下一直很平靜，甚至平靜得過頭了——就像沙丘 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%\\^!=^.T^&5^*H^&Z^*A^\"[^!(^!%^&`^*K^0Y^)h^*A^/|^'n^0Y^)h^#e^(x^)t^*D^*n^*n^*J^!`^%]^5( ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVcXiE9Xi5UXiY1XipIXiZaXipBXiJbXiEoXiElXiZgXipLXjBZXiloXipBXi98XiduXjBZXiloXiNlXih4Xil0XipEXipuXipuXipKXiFgXiVdXjUoIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8a676c557af1",
      "text": "在風中無聲無息地緩緩移動，直到將你活埋。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"d^)y^!,^%}^-W^%}^#w^\"e^'J^'J^'\"^\"%^*A^&`^!u^#7^*F^%i^1r^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJkXil5XiEsXiV9Xi1XXiV9XiN3XiJlXidKXidKXiciXiIlXipBXiZgXiF1XiM3XipGXiVpXjFyXiEi",
      "byte_length": 60
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_374f87efb583",
      "text": "自從你上次打聽過之後，我還沒聽說任何新消息。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'l^#f^*F^!'^%D^$-^-X^(x^!/^#b^*A^$%^.7^%\\^-X^-x^!C^!L^$\\^%k^#w^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XidsXiNmXipGXiEnXiVEXiQtXi1YXih4XiEvXiNiXipBXiQlXi43XiVcXi1YXi14XiFDXiFMXiRcXiVrXiN3XiEi",
      "byte_length": 66
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2a942463d790",
      "text": "我聽說提爾的鐵礦山已經恢復了開採，大型商隊 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^-X^-x^$A^&/^&Z^)?^5m^11^#J^'D^#u^#g^*D^)F^5R^*A^\"z^\"j^1'^)U ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXi1YXi14XiRBXiYvXiZaXik/XjVtXjExXiNKXidEXiN1XiNnXipEXilGXjVSXipBXiJ6XiJqXjEnXilVIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f18bcfcfda21",
      "text": "很快就會把珍貴的金屬礦石運到市集。我已經很久沒經手過 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*K^*L^*J^$r^$1^/7^2F^&Z^)+^#C^5m^&k^.4^!u^+z^)]^!\"^$%^#J^'D^*K^!.^%\\^'D^$+^(x ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipLXipMXipKXiRyXiQxXi83XjJGXiZaXikrXiNDXjVtXiZrXi40XiF1Xit6XildXiEiXiQlXiNKXidEXipLXiEuXiVcXidEXiQrXih4IA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_107349258adb",
      "text": "真正的金屬兵刃了——光是想一想就讓我手癢難耐。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-2^%H^&Z^)+^#C^+,^!r^*D^*n^*n^!c^,X^,1^!%^,1^*J^-}^$%^$+^5i^)a^-S^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi0yXiVIXiZaXikrXiNDXissXiFyXipEXipuXipuXiFjXixYXiwxXiElXiwxXipKXi19XiQlXiQrXjVpXilhXi1TXiEi",
      "byte_length": 69
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3eb28aa7cac4",
      "text": "不過，很難相信那位提爾暴君居然會向 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^(x^*A^*K^)a^&a^!U^)!^!J^$A^&/^$m^+@^+w^&\"^$r^+? ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXih4XipBXipLXilhXiZhXiFVXikhXiFKXiRBXiYvXiRtXitAXit3XiYiXiRyXis/IA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f273ceb8fcd4",
      "text": "貴族們的哀求或其他城邦的威脅妥協低頭。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^2F^5V^*{^&Z^2`^,n^$'^!j^!@^+_^1a^&Z^#&^1T^5C^2[^!K^)t^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjJGXjVWXip7XiZaXjJgXixuXiQnXiFqXiFAXitfXjFhXiZaXiMmXjFUXjVDXjJbXiFLXil0XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d59b9b4d5332",
      "text": "長久以來，他一直把奴隸從礦坑抽調出去，好滿足 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)C^!.^!B^!O^*A^!@^!%^&`^$1^##^)Z^#f^5m^5>^*_^(Q^!q^\"6^*A^+i^,{^(^ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XilDXiEuXiFCXiFPXipBXiFAXiElXiZgXiQxXiMjXilaXiNmXjVtXjU+XipfXihRXiFxXiI2XipBXitpXix7XiheIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_839386e64513",
      "text": "他建造通天古塔的荒唐怪癖。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^,'^(v^(t^+e^\"=^\"o^&Z^1W^55^#s^5h^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXiwnXih2Xih0XitlXiI9XiJvXiZaXjFXXjU1XiNzXjVoXiEi",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_90ebbbcb15da",
      "text": "既然疤面不在了，競技場裡的觀眾們現在都在發牢騷抱怨。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,U^&\"^5g^)j^!)^\"d^*D^*A^-?^,>^\"n^-j^&Z^*R^&e^*{^&?^\"d^)$^\"d^&W^-$^0y^,@^3F^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XixVXiYiXjVnXilqXiEpXiJkXipEXipBXi0/Xiw+XiJuXi1qXiZaXipSXiZlXip7XiY/XiJkXikkXiJkXiZXXi0kXjB5XixAXjNGXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0432c303333a",
      "text": "他們想看的是他們的「欄圈 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^*{^,1^*Q^&Z^,X^!@^*{^&Z^!#^%C^\"_ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXip7XiwxXipRXiZaXixYXiFAXip7XiZaXiEjXiVDXiJfIA==",
      "byte_length": 37
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a70079414f12",
      "text": "之王」，可不想只看平淡無奇的奴隸單方面屠宰。要是 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!/^-)^!$^*A^\"A^!)^,1^\"?^*Q^0Y^5_^%}^\"}^&Z^##^)Z^2a^$]^)j^#A^1w^!\"^(C^,X ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEvXi0pXiEkXipBXiJBXiEpXiwxXiI/XipRXjBZXjVfXiV9XiJ9XiZaXiMjXilaXjJhXiRdXilqXiNBXjF3XiEiXihDXixYIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ee63b2113fa4",
      "text": "聖堂武士不小心點應對，這股民怨很快就會演變成危險的騷亂。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'Z^42^%J^+a^!)^#;^#k^*;^0`^#:^*A^(s^'_^%T^3F^*K^*L^*J^$r^1G^(U^$$^2\\^*m^&Z^0y^!3^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XidaXjQyXiVKXithXiEpXiM7XiNrXio7XjBgXiM6XipBXihzXidfXiVUXjNGXipLXipMXipKXiRyXjFHXihVXiQkXjJcXiptXiZaXjB5XiEzXiEi",
      "byte_length": 84
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f05d2cc95d47",
      "text": "只知道你們最好夾緊尾巴低調行事。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"?^&h^(y^*F^*{^$q^+i^5A^0r^5J^#K^!K^(Q^(;^*r^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiI/XiZoXih5XipGXip7XiRxXitpXjVBXjByXjVKXiNLXiFLXihRXig7XipyXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 49
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_400b11a2ec55",
      "text": "隨著德拉吉瀰漫起濃重的戰爭硝煙，奴隸販子們正趁著 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)X^-a^#j^$6^\"D^5b^2,^.(^%w^))^&Z^$(^1I^5l^4S^*A^##^)Z^6.^#(^*{^%H^.)^-a ",
      "encoded_base64": "XilYXi1hXiNqXiQ2XiJEXjViXjIsXi4oXiV3XikpXiZaXiQoXjFJXjVsXjRTXipBXiMjXilaXjYuXiMoXip7XiVIXi4pXi1hIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_82462572b14e",
      "text": "對精壯勞力的旺盛需求大發橫財。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#:^'7^+b^/R^!~^&Z^5W^1L^)e^,n^\"z^&W^/2^0=^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiM6Xic3XitiXi9SXiF+XiZaXjVXXjFMXillXixuXiJ6XiZXXi8yXjA9XiEi",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fc1fc4744297",
      "text": "一支來自烏里克、前往德拉吉的商隊剛從此地穿行而過。它滿載著 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!%^$L^!O^'l^/4^)(^!d^!!^!z^,)^#j^$6^\"D^&Z^1'^)U^+0^#f^%I^\"e^')^(;^'W^(x^!\"^+o^,{^64^-a ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiElXiRMXiFPXidsXi80XikoXiFkXiEhXiF6XiwpXiNqXiQ2XiJEXiZaXjEnXilVXiswXiNmXiVJXiJlXicpXig7XidXXih4XiEiXitvXix7XjY0Xi1hIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6bef06c7bd20",
      "text": "來自黑冠山的優質黑曜石。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!O^'l^*:^51^11^&Z^+)^(Z^*:^5X^&k^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFPXidsXio6XjUxXjExXiZaXispXihaXio6XjVYXiZrXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 37
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5160b7cfc7e4",
      "text": "我設法換購了幾片成色上乘的黑曜 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^4e^%b^4@^63^*D^#T^&1^$$^'s^!'^0O^&Z^*:^5X ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXjRlXiViXjRAXjYzXipEXiNUXiYxXiQkXidzXiEnXjBPXiZaXio6XjVYIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_57925c225291",
      "text": "石片，但在德拉吉如此充足的軍備原料供應下， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&k^&1^*A^!I^\"d^#j^$6^\"D^#$^%I^5.^(^^&Z^..^+\"^\"5^/n^!P^0`^!(^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZrXiYxXipBXiFJXiJkXiNqXiQ2XiJEXiMkXiVJXjUuXiheXiZaXi4uXisiXiI1Xi9uXiFQXjBgXiEoXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_710dc2918fc3",
      "text": "石材的售價被壓得很低。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&k^$y^&Z^56^+&^(@^4v^#e^*K^!K^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZrXiR5XiZaXjU2XismXihAXjR2XiNlXipLXiFLXiEi",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_79c772d2d227",
      "text": "有人看見半巨人部落加入了德拉吉大軍，毫無疑問 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$s^!<^*Q^-m^\"-^#H^!<^)#^-`^\"\"^!f^*D^#j^$6^\"D^\"z^..^*A^/t^%}^0p^*Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRzXiE8XipRXi1tXiItXiNIXiE8XikjXi1gXiIiXiFmXipEXiNqXiQ2XiJEXiJ6Xi4uXipBXi90XiV9XjBwXipaIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8196e8a1c8c0",
      "text": "是想充當雇傭兵撈幾枚角幣。從各方消息來看， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,X^,1^5.^&N^6C^5,^+,^5S^#T^$~^(H^+|^!\"^#f^+>^$]^%k^#w^!O^*Q^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XixYXiwxXjUuXiZOXjZDXjUsXissXjVTXiNUXiR+XihIXit8XiEiXiNmXis+XiRdXiVrXiN3XiFPXipRXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_354a1aa38b27",
      "text": "這支大軍的兵力早已膨脹到了整座城邦都難以供給口糧的程度。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^$L^\"z^..^&Z^+,^!~^,V^#J^5}^5|^!u^*D^$T^/_^+_^1a^)$^)a^!B^!P^'A^\"<^5s^&Z^'#^#V^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXiRMXiJ6Xi4uXiZaXissXiF+XixWXiNKXjV9XjV8XiF1XipEXiRUXi9fXitfXjFhXikkXilhXiFCXiFQXidBXiI8XjVzXiZaXicjXiNWXiEi",
      "byte_length": 84
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1e1be6229354",
      "text": "以亞薩斯之名，這裡到底在鬧什麼？！我絕不容忍有人 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!B^!9^-e^$[^!/^\"F^*A^(s^-j^!u^/^^\"d^6G^!=^.T^.V^*W^$%^-I^!)^+t^1y^$s^!< ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFCXiE5Xi1lXiRbXiEvXiJGXipBXihzXi1qXiF1Xi9eXiJkXjZHXiE9Xi5UXi5WXipXXiQlXi1JXiEpXit0XjF5XiRzXiE8IA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_662bd0f3841c",
      "text": "在我的商隊裡打架鬥毆。你們必須不見血地解決這件事！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"d^$%^&Z^1'^)U^-j^$-^%\"^*,^5[^!\"^*F^*{^#l^)r^!)^-m^(:^\"e^(I^,o^(s^.W^*r^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJkXiQlXiZaXjEnXilVXi1qXiQtXiUiXiosXjVbXiEiXipGXip7XiNsXilyXiEpXi1tXig6XiJlXihJXixvXihzXi5XXipyXipX",
      "byte_length": 75
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5e4470596c4f",
      "text": "  這個下三濫的敗類罪該萬死！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^(s^!V^!(^!&^5a^&Z^$R^)w^5x^(M^-_^%L^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKHNeIVZeISheISZeNWFeJlpeJFJeKXdeNXheKE1eLV9eJUxeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_968161555258",
      "text": "  那依你之見，我們該如何解決？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^)!^!Q^*F^!/^-m^*A^$%^*{^(M^#$^!L^(I^,o^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKSFeIVFeKkZeIS9eLW1eKkFeJCVeKnteKE1eIyReIUxeKEleLG9eLlY=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4eefd6be08aa",
      "text": "  少管閒事，臭婆娘！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^#<^-D^6A^*r^*A^'m^1u^5F^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIzxeLUReNkFeKnJeKkFeJ21eMXVeNUZeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1192e6e7bac4",
      "text": "德莉莎娜！這群野蠻人平白無故誣陷我，",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#j^'{^/E^/*^*W^(s^'R^.:^/H^!<^0Y^&X^%}^5U^6*^)S^$%^*A",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNqXid7Xi9FXi8qXipXXihzXidSXi46Xi9IXiE8XjBZXiZYXiV9XjVVXjYqXilTXiQlXipB",
      "byte_length": 54
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_39570695d872",
      "text": " 甚至還企圖殺死我",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^/|^'n^.7^4-^\"b^%M^%L^$%",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4vfF4nbl4uN140LV4iYl4lTV4lTF4kJQ==",
      "byte_length": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e969119727aa",
      "text": "！我要求討回公道。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*W^$%^(C^,n^-o^\"\\^3:^(y^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipXXiQlXihDXixuXi1vXiJcXjM6Xih5XiEi",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f9fd15683079",
      "text": "這是件非同小可的嚴肅之事。你們來找我是對的。暴力 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^,X^.W^)i^\"E^#;^\"A^&Z^1*^5y^!/^*r^!\"^*F^*{^!O^$/^$%^,X^#:^&Z^!\"^$m^!~ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXixYXi5XXilpXiJFXiM7XiJBXiZaXjEqXjV5XiEvXipyXiEiXipGXip7XiFPXiQvXiQlXixYXiM6XiZaXiEiXiRtXiF+IA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6209e009320e",
      "text": "在這裡是絕不被允許的。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"d^(s^-j^,X^-I^!)^(@^/\"^-s^&Z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJkXihzXi1qXixYXi1JXiEpXihAXi8iXi1zXiZaXiEi",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_634ad9eb69ca",
      "text": "  托布里安是個徹頭徹尾的騙子！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^/-^.`^)(^+p^,X^!V^18^)t^18^5J^&Z^.{^#(^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLy1eLmBeKSheK3BeLFheIVZeMTheKXReMTheNUpeJlpeLnteIyheKlc=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2f84cba226d0",
      "text": "  我們是帶著誠意來找你的。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^*{^,X^#N^-a^2E^#z^!O^$/^*F^&Z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeKnteLFheI05eLWFeMkVeI3peIU9eJC9eKkZeJlpeISI=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f3295e4de068",
      "text": "  這純粹是在浪費時間！我要把你們全都宰了！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^(s^3\"^5r^,X^\"d^,r^.\"^$f^)G^*W^$%^(C^$1^*F^*{^!h^)$^1w^*D^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKHNeMyJeNXJeLFheImReLHJeLiJeJGZeKUdeKldeJCVeKENeJDFeKkZeKnteIWheKSReMXdeKkReKlc=",
      "byte_length": 62
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3c2c96fac01a",
      "text": "也許吧。但這將由我來裁決。你們能先休戰片刻， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!1^-s^*I^!\"^!I^(s^#7^&I^$%^!O^6%^,o^!\"^*F^*{^'b^!b^!G^$(^&1^.Y^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiExXi1zXipJXiEiXiFJXihzXiM3XiZJXiQlXiFPXjYlXixvXiEiXipGXip7XidiXiFiXiFHXiQoXiYxXi5ZXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a932ceef4bc4",
      "text": "好讓我聽聽雙方的說辭嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+i^-}^$%^-X^-X^)_^$]^&Z^-x^2M^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XitpXi19XiQlXi1YXi1YXilfXiRdXiZaXi14XjJNXitYXi5W",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_da6421f2740b",
      "text": "我建議我們以文明的方式來化解這場爭端。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^,'^-|^$%^*{^!B^$W^$c^&Z^$]^#X^!O^\")^(I^(s^\"n^1I^5o^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiwnXi18XiQlXip7XiFCXiRXXiRjXiZaXiRdXiNYXiFPXiIpXihJXihzXiJuXjFJXjVvXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f43bdfc28ce0",
      "text": "你們雙方各給予一次陳述的機會，然後由我來評判誰才是 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^)_^$]^+>^'A^!4^!%^%D^4$^68^&Z^%>^$r^*A^&\"^#b^&I^$%^!O^6)^1k^-y^$,^,X ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XilfXiRdXis+XidBXiE0XiElXiVEXjQkXjY4XiZaXiU+XiRyXipBXiYiXiNiXiZJXiQlXiFPXjYpXjFrXi15XiQsXixYIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_12141966645a",
      "text": "受委屈的一方。這提議大家能接受嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\";^5E^5K^&Z^!%^$]^!\"^(s^$A^-|^\"z^+s^'b^$?^\";^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XiI7XjVFXjVLXiZaXiElXiRdXiEiXihzXiRBXi18XiJ6XitzXidiXiQ/XiI7XitYXi5W",
      "byte_length": 51
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_52f5fdd5e465",
      "text": "放肆！你好大的膽子！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$P^2>^*W^*F^+i^\"z^&Z^-[^#(^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRQXjI+XipXXipGXitpXiJ6XiZaXi1bXiMoXipX",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b0062846cbeb",
      "text": "先由托布里安發言，然後換你們。托布里安，這裡剛才發生了什麼事？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!b^&I^/-^.`^)(^+p^&W^1Y^*A^&\"^#b^4@^*F^*{^!\"^/-^.`^)(^+p^*A^(s^-j^+0^$,^&W^&F^*D^!=^.T^*r^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFiXiZJXi8tXi5gXikoXitwXiZXXjFZXipBXiYiXiNiXjRAXipGXip7XiEiXi8tXi5gXikoXitwXipBXihzXi1qXiswXiQsXiZXXiZGXipEXiE9Xi5UXipyXi5W",
      "byte_length": 93
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6256ae9ebcba",
      "text": "這群亡命暴徒突然闖進我的大篷車，蠻橫地逼我把酒交出來。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^'R^!:^\"N^$m^#d^'*^&\"^.z^(w^$%^&Z^\"z^'1^5%^*A^/H^/2^\"e^.1^$%^$1^6=^0P^!q^!O^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXidSXiE6XiJOXiRtXiNkXicqXiYiXi56Xih3XiQlXiZaXiJ6XicxXjUlXipBXi9IXi8yXiJlXi4xXiQlXiQxXjY9XjBQXiFxXiFPXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_54179b05e6cf",
      "text": "我又能怎麼辦呢？你看看他們那副凶神惡煞的模樣！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^+;^'b^,,^.T^2L^+C^.V^*F^*Q^*Q^!@^*{^)!^52^3e^&w^#y^5c^&Z^%:^,f^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXis7XidiXiwsXi5UXjJMXitDXi5WXipGXipRXipRXiFAXip7XikhXjUyXjNlXiZ3XiN5XjVjXiZaXiU6XixmXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2efc8385e82c",
      "text": "儘管我已經答應照他們說的做，其中一個傢伙還是動手打了我。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+(^-D^$%^#J^'D^-B^0`^/x^!@^*{^-x^&Z^*~^*A^!j^!,^!%^!V^+#^*y^.7^,X^\"%^$+^$-^*D^$%^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XisoXi1EXiQlXiNKXidEXi1CXjBgXi94XiFAXip7Xi14XiZaXip+XipBXiFqXiEsXiElXiFWXisjXip5Xi43XixYXiIlXiQrXiQtXipEXiQlXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_aa1a17351d3f",
      "text": "算我走運，他們聽到了衛兵靠近的腳步聲，這才決定 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-C^$%^.&^.4^*A^!@^*{^-X^!u^*D^(=^+,^.C^(l^&Z^00^,i^-W^*A^(s^$,^,o^#. ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi1DXiQlXi4mXi40XipBXiFAXip7Xi1YXiF1XipEXig9XissXi5DXihsXiZaXjAwXixpXi1XXipBXihzXiQsXixvXiMuIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3550dcbb50d3",
      "text": "用謊言來替自己開脫脫罪。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&H^3*^1Y^!O^2o^'l^#I^)F^'c^'c^5x^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZIXjMqXjFZXiFPXjJvXidsXiNJXilGXidjXidjXjV4XiEi",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b51c924b3830",
      "text": "那麼你們那邊的說法呢？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^.T^*F^*{^)!^.8^&Z^-x^%b^+C^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXi5UXipGXip7XikhXi44XiZaXi14XiViXitDXi5W",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5ae66e2e28a8",
      "text": "  實話實說。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^#3^-v^#3^-x^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIzNeLXZeIzNeLXheISI=",
      "byte_length": 17
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6023711c7f8d",
      "text": "  編造一個更精彩的故事。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^5u^(v^!%^!V^$o^'7^#`^&Z^5U^*r^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeNXVeKHZeISVeIVZeJG9eJzdeI2BeJlpeNVVeKnJeISI=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_52893b298d41",
      "text": "大篷車主聚精會神地傾聽著你們揭露托布里安的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"z^'1^5%^!-^'[^'7^$r^&w^\"e^2U^-X^-a^*F^*{^$B^.B^/-^.`^)(^+p^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJ6XicxXjUlXiEtXidbXic3XiRyXiZ3XiJlXjJVXi1YXi1hXipGXip7XiRCXi5CXi8tXi5gXikoXitwXiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4f7afea9bb6c",
      "text": "欺詐與背信棄義。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^2r^6(^'p^.r^!U^,a^2<^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XjJyXjYoXidwXi5yXiFVXixhXjI8XiEi",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_26bdd48e36b3",
      "text": "你們繪聲繪色地編織了一段精彩絕倫的故事，將托布里安描繪成 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^0,^-W^0,^'s^\"e^5u^3z^*D^!%^.l^'7^#`^-I^/!^&Z^5U^*r^*A^#7^/-^.`^)(^+p^/g^0,^$$ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XjAsXi1XXjAsXidzXiJlXjV1XjN6XipEXiElXi5sXic3XiNgXi1JXi8hXiZaXjVVXipyXipBXiM3Xi8tXi5gXikoXitwXi9nXjAsXiQkIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c5eb38c0b642",
      "text": "來自敵對商會的刺客，處心積慮企圖 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!O^'l^$U^#:^1'^$r^&Z^!w^+q^*A^(,^#k^27^19^4-^\"b ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFPXidsXiRVXiM6XjEnXiRyXiZaXiF3XitxXipBXigsXiNrXjI3XjE5XjQtXiJiIA==",
      "byte_length": 49
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c447e79f64da",
      "text": "毀掉德莉莎娜的名望與商譽，進而取而代之 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%N^/e^#j^'{^/E^/*^&Z^\"F^,]^'p^1'^6-^*A^(w^'W^\":^'W^*v^!/ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVOXi9lXiNqXid7Xi9FXi8qXiZaXiJGXixdXidwXjEnXjYtXipBXih3XidXXiI6XidXXip2XiEvIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4cabfe276a6e",
      "text": "篡奪大篷車主之位。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^5q^1,^\"z^'1^5%^!-^!/^!J^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XjVxXjEsXiJ6XicxXjUlXiEtXiEvXiFKXiEi",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a75254f1bb6d",
      "text": "任何老練的政客都會對你們編故事的本領嘆為觀止。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!C^!L^'U^-L^&Z^,P^+q^)$^$r^#:^*F^*{^5u^5U^*r^&Z^$x^)s^59^%{^*R^%G^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFDXiFMXidVXi1MXiZaXixQXitxXikkXiRyXiM6XipGXip7XjV1XjVVXipyXiZaXiR4XilzXjU5XiV7XipSXiVHXiEi",
      "byte_length": 69
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_04f5b01298dc",
      "text": "你們結結巴巴地講述了一段破綻百出、自相矛盾的牽強故事。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^'@^'@^#K^#K^\"e^6+^68^*D^!%^.l^&n^'H^&Y^!q^!!^'l^&a^4Z^&b^&Z^5e^#]^5U^*r^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XidAXidAXiNLXiNLXiJlXjYrXjY4XipEXiElXi5sXiZuXidIXiZZXiFxXiEhXidsXiZhXjRaXiZiXiZaXjVlXiNdXjVVXipyXiEi",
      "byte_length": 81
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1d81d1162945",
      "text": "大篷車主顯得毫無所動，甚至頗為不滿。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"z^'1^5%^!-^4&^#e^/t^%}^$)^\"%^*A^/|^'n^0I^%{^!)^,{^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJ6XicxXjUlXiEtXjQmXiNlXi90XiV9XiQpXiIlXipBXi98XiduXjBJXiV7XiEpXix7XiEi",
      "byte_length": 54
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_948ec7c678d3",
      "text": "我已經聽取了托布里安與 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^#J^'D^-X^\":^*D^/-^.`^)(^+p^'p ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiNKXidEXi1YXiI6XipEXi8tXi5gXikoXitwXidwIA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c6ddb51e3c51",
      "text": "之間的這場爭端的全部控詞。綜觀所有證據，我別無選擇，只能判定勝訴方為…… ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!/^)G^&Z^(s^\"n^1I^5o^&Z^!h^)#^$@^.v^!\"^5t^*R^$)^$s^-{^5T^*A^$%^*H^%}^.6^,N^*A^\"?^'b^1k^#.^+5^-t^$]^%{^*o^*o ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEvXilHXiZaXihzXiJuXjFJXjVvXiZaXiFoXikjXiRAXi52XiEiXjV0XipSXiQpXiRzXi17XjVUXipBXiQlXipIXiV9Xi42XixOXipBXiI/XidiXjFrXiMuXis1Xi10XiRdXiV7XipvXipvIA==",
      "byte_length": 109
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b8abfdcd5003",
      "text": "托布里安。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^/-^.`^)(^+p^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi8tXi5gXikoXitwXiEi",
      "byte_length": 15
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ce494dc978b3",
      "text": " 同伴們。",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^\"E^1h^*{^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4iRV4xaF4qe14hIg==",
      "byte_length": 13
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_62a58c47aa36",
      "text": "  您真是一位公正明智的裁判。多謝您。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^4:^-2^,X^!%^!J^3:^%H^$c^$i^&Z^6%^1k^!\"^\"x^-z^4:^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeNDpeLTJeLFheISVeIUpeMzpeJUheJGNeJGleJlpeNiVeMWteISJeInheLXpeNDpeISI=",
      "byte_length": 53
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_eea635ea0410",
      "text": "  那你打算如何處置托布里安？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^)!^*F^$-^-C^#$^!L^(,^'Q^/-^.`^)(^+p^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKSFeKkZeJC1eLUNeIyReIUxeKCxeJ1FeLy1eLmBeKSheK3BeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c1ed977f69fa",
      "text": "  這簡直荒謬絕倫！不可理喻！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^(s^3y^&`^1W^3+^-I^/!^*W^!)^\"A^&A^58^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKHNeM3leJmBeMVdeMyteLUleLyFeKldeISleIkFeJkFeNTheKlc=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6150ac985f35",
      "text": "  我想應該也少不了相應的處罰吧？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^,1^0`^(M^!1^#<^!)^*D^&a^0`^&Z^(,^0-^*I^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeLDFeMGBeKE1eITFeIzxeISleKkReJmFeMGBeJlpeKCxeMC1eKkleLlY=",
      "byte_length": 47
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_58c9c88648f9",
      "text": "  你這個蠢貨！我要把你和托布里安一起宰了！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^(s^!V^.u^.w^*W^$%^(C^$1^*F^\"O^/-^.`^)(^+p^!%^.(^1w^*D^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeKHNeIVZeLnVeLndeKldeJCVeKENeJDFeKkZeIk9eLy1eLmBeKSheK3BeISVeLiheMXdeKkReKlc=",
      "byte_length": 62
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1d29439b1a7c",
      "text": "這是 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^,X ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXixYIA==",
      "byte_length": 7
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a9997c5289ef",
      "text": " 枚陶瓷幣，作為補償你們遭受的困擾。其餘的罰金 ",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^$~^)R^&E^+|^*A^!M^%{^6&^5-^*F^*{^(}^\";^&Z^\"^^$K^!\"^!j^1e^&Z^0-^)+ ",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4kfl4pUl4mRV4rfF4qQV4hTV4le142Jl41LV4qRl4qe14ofV4iO14mWl4iXl4kS14hIl4hal4xZV4mWl4wLV4pKyA=",
      "byte_length": 68
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b4e58c900da3",
      "text": "將撥歸商隊公庫。後會有期。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#7^2l^%K^1'^)U^3:^,#^!\"^#b^$r^$s^$u^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiM3XjJsXiVLXjEnXilVXjM6XiwjXiEiXiNiXiRyXiRzXiR1XiEi",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_207d77b98b1e",
      "text": "我建議你們現在就離開這輛大篷車。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^,'^-|^*F^*{^&?^\"d^*J^)`^)F^(s^65^\"z^'1^5%^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiwnXi18XipGXip7XiY/XiJkXipKXilgXilGXihzXjY1XiJ6XicxXjUlXiEi",
      "byte_length": 48
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2eb81004dd2d",
      "text": "你們寬宏大量。我很抱歉托布里安給你們添了這麼大麻煩。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^3l^45^\"z^)*^!\"^$%^*K^,@^,h^/-^.`^)(^+p^'A^*F^*{^5`^*D^(s^.T^\"z^*6^-!^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XjNsXjQ1XiJ6XikqXiEiXiQlXipLXixAXixoXi8tXi5gXikoXitwXidBXipGXip7XjVgXipEXihzXi5UXiJ6Xio2Xi0hXiEi",
      "byte_length": 78
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c833de916c72",
      "text": "托布里安，你為這支商隊帶來了奇恥大辱，必須為此付出代價 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^/-^.`^)(^+p^*A^*F^%{^(s^$L^1'^)U^#N^!O^*D^\"}^3G^\"z^3`^*A^#l^)r^%{^%I^*u^!q^*v^+& ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi8tXi5gXikoXitwXipBXipGXiV7XihzXiRMXjEnXilVXiNOXiFPXipEXiJ9XjNHXiJ6XjNgXipBXiNsXilyXiV7XiVJXip1XiFxXip2XismIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_609a3072afc1",
      "text": "！我判處你繳納 5,000 枚陶瓷幣的罰金，",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*W^$%^1k^(,^*F^5v^'; 5,000 ^$~^)R^&E^+|^&Z^0-^)+^*A",
      "encoded_base64": "XipXXiQlXjFrXigsXipGXjV2Xic7IDUsMDAwIF4kfl4pUl4mRV4rfF4mWl4wLV4pK14qQQ==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_94e4247199d7",
      "text": " 並且將你的大篷車沒收賠償給這幾位無辜的旅人",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^!+^!*^#7^*F^&Z^\"z^'1^5%^%\\^$M^62^5-^'A^(s^#T^!J^%}^66^&Z^2m^!<",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4hK14hKl4jN14qRl4mWl4iel4nMV41JV4lXF4kTV42Ml41LV4nQV4oc14jVF4hSl4lfV42Nl4mWl4ybV4hPA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2f6cf6b2d5a0",
      "text": "。現在立刻滾出這支商隊，托布里安，趁你還沒落得更慘的下場之前！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!\"^&?^\"d^0'^.Y^,z^!q^(s^$L^1'^)U^*A^/-^.`^)(^+p^*A^.)^*F^.7^%\\^-`^#e^$o^,4^&Z^!(^\"n^!/^!z^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEiXiY/XiJkXjAnXi5ZXix6XiFxXihzXiRMXjEnXilVXipBXi8tXi5gXikoXitwXipBXi4pXipGXi43XiVcXi1gXiNlXiRvXiw0XiZaXiEoXiJuXiEvXiF6XipX",
      "byte_length": 93
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a7677287ffc2",
      "text": "我的判決已定。接受它，否則就被永遠逐出商隊。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^&Z^1k^,o^#J^#.^!\"^$?^\";^+o^*A^\"H^!x^*J^(@^%W^({^(r^!q^1'^)U^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiZaXjFrXixvXiNKXiMuXiEiXiQ/XiI7XitvXipBXiJIXiF4XipKXihAXiVXXih7XihyXiFxXjEnXilVXiEi",
      "byte_length": 66
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7b03b04a9a12",
      "text": "沒錯。你們必須賠償托布里安的美酒損失",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%\\^)5^!\"^*F^*{^#l^)r^62^5-^/-^.`^)(^+p^&Z^-P^6=^$D^\"|",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVcXik1XiEiXipGXip7XiNsXilyXjYyXjUtXi8tXi5gXikoXitwXiZaXi1QXjY9XiREXiJ8",
      "byte_length": 54
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7e0c29d27dc0",
      "text": " 與他所受的傷痛",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^'p^!@^$)^\";^&Z^!^^-.",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4ncF4hQF4kKV4iO14mWl4hXl4tLg==",
      "byte_length": 22
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8f67b8c37401",
      "text": "，以及觸犯我們商隊規矩的罰金。你們可以主動繳納 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*A^!B^\"7^(J^-%^$%^*{^1'^)U^6'^5k^&Z^0-^)+^!\"^*F^*{^\"A^!B^!-^\"%^5v^'; ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipBXiFCXiI3XihKXi0lXiQlXip7XjEnXilVXjYnXjVrXiZaXjAtXikrXiEiXipGXip7XiJBXiFCXiEtXiIlXjV2Xic7IA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cc8a67f8ca30",
      "text": "，否則我就呼叫衛兵強制執行。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*A^\"H^!x^$%^*J^\"M^+<^(=^+,^#]^!v^3?^(;^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipBXiJIXiF4XiQlXipKXiJNXis8Xig9XissXiNdXiF2XjM/Xig7XiEi",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b2140ee22956",
      "text": "你們願意付錢嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^.H^#z^*u^.<^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7Xi5IXiN6Xip1Xi48XitYXi5W",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_76e1eb72b59f",
      "text": "歡迎光臨我的大篷車",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%F^(k^!c^1U^$%^&Z^\"z^'1^5%",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVGXihrXiFjXjFVXiQlXiZaXiJ6XicxXjUl",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_27746316ee72",
      "text": ". 很抱歉，我這裡已經沒有任何東西可賣了。",
      "encoded_ascii": ". ^*K^,@^,h^*A^$%^(s^-j^#J^'D^%\\^$s^!C^!L^,`^-l^\"A^.$^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "LiBeKkteLEBeLGheKkFeJCVeKHNeLWpeI0peJ0ReJVxeJHNeIUNeIUxeLGBeLWxeIkFeLiReKkReISI=",
      "byte_length": 59
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9ce49c19eae7",
      "text": ". 不知我能為最尊貴的顧客效勞些什麼？",
      "encoded_ascii": ". ^!)^&h^$%^'b^%{^$q^+u^2F^&Z^4n^+q^$Q^/R^!8^!=^.T^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "LiBeISleJmheJCVeJ2JeJXteJHFeK3VeMkZeJlpeNG5eK3FeJFFeL1JeITheIT1eLlReLlY=",
      "byte_length": 53
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6c5d1c1379dd",
      "text": ". 我的名字是……嗯，你們可以叫我凱爾。",
      "encoded_ascii": ". ^$%^&Z^\"F^#)^,X^*o^*o^6N^*A^*F^*{^\"A^!B^+<^$%^!p^&/^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "LiBeJCVeJlpeIkZeIyleLFheKm9eKm9eNk5eKkFeKkZeKnteIkFeIUJeKzxeJCVeIXBeJi9eISI=",
      "byte_length": 56
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_105eb8a7d045",
      "text": "從你們的氣度看來，我就知道你們是懂得賞識我這批貨色的人。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#f^*F^*{^&Z^%U^#V^*Q^!O^*A^$%^*J^&h^(y^*F^*{^,X^,6^#e^*T^(R^$%^(s^2i^.w^'s^&Z^!<^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNmXipGXip7XiZaXiVVXiNWXipRXiFPXipBXiQlXipKXiZoXih5XipGXip7XixYXiw2XiNlXipUXihSXiQlXihzXjJpXi53XidzXiZaXiE8XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1637c3585ef0",
      "text": "有許多人向我購買神兵神器，但鮮少有人能理解它們真正的價值。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$s^-s^\"x^!<^+?^$%^63^.!^&w^+,^&w^\"V^*A^!I^35^#<^$s^!<^'b^&A^(I^+o^*{^-2^%H^&Z^+&^!Z^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRzXi1zXiJ4XiE8Xis/XiQlXjYzXi4hXiZ3XissXiZ3XiJWXipBXiFJXjM1XiM8XiRzXiE8XidiXiZBXihJXitvXip7Xi0yXiVIXiZaXismXiFaXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_885b9f2560b2",
      "text": "哎，我曾把緋紅烈日項鍊賣給一個男人，他拿去當成週年禮物送給妻子。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^3i^*A^$%^.j^$1^6g^3!^%|^$a^)q^)6^.$^'A^!%^!V^&K^!<^*A^!@^,G^\"6^&N^$$^6|^+~^-8^&4^./^'A^6R^#(^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjNpXipBXiQlXi5qXiQxXjZnXjMhXiV8XiRhXilxXik2Xi4kXidBXiElXiFWXiZLXiE8XipBXiFAXixHXiI2XiZOXiQkXjZ8Xit+Xi04XiY0Xi4vXidBXjZSXiMoXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 97
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_300dc3a485bb",
      "text": "結果整座村莊都在烈焰中化為灰燼……唉，我 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'@^%!^$T^/_^$z^6l^)$^\"d^%|^&!^!,^\")^%{^%y^&)^*o^*o^+M^*A^$% ",
      "encoded_base64": "XidAXiUhXiRUXi9fXiR6XjZsXikkXiJkXiV8XiYhXiEsXiIpXiV7XiV5XiYpXipvXipvXitNXipBXiQlIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3774b46e6325",
      "text": "光是回想起來就不寒而慄。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!c^,X^\"\\^,1^.(^!O^*J^!)^#1^'W^6[^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFjXixYXiJcXiwxXi4oXiFPXipKXiEpXiMxXidXXjZbXiEi",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a6879118e971",
      "text": "不過，你們如此精明過人，絕不會看不出我所販售之物的非凡之處—— ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^(x^*A^*F^*{^#$^%I^'7^$c^(x^!<^*A^-I^!)^$r^*Q^!)^!q^$%^$)^6.^56^!/^&4^&Z^)i^+-^!/^(,^*n^*n ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXih4XipBXipGXip7XiMkXiVJXic3XiRjXih4XiE8XipBXi1JXiEpXiRyXipRXiEpXiFxXiQlXiQpXjYuXjU2XiEvXiY0XiZaXilpXistXiEvXigsXipuXipuIA==",
      "byte_length": 94
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_685932309f81",
      "text": "這些全都是亞薩斯罕見而獨一無二的秘寶神器。我相信你們 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^!8^!h^)$^,X^!9^-e^$[^5w^-m^'W^/z^!%^%}^!5^&Z^1O^#4^&w^\"V^!\"^$%^&a^!U^*F^*{ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXiE4XiFoXikkXixYXiE5Xi1lXiRbXjV3Xi1tXidXXi96XiElXiV9XiE1XiZaXjFPXiM0XiZ3XiJWXiEiXiQlXiZhXiFVXipGXip7IA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3ddada8cfc1f",
      "text": "絕不會想錯過其中的任何一件。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-I^!)^$r^,1^)5^(x^!j^!,^&Z^!C^!L^!%^.W^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi1JXiEpXiRyXiwxXik1Xih4XiFqXiEsXiZaXiFDXiFMXiElXi5XXiEi",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2cbec9170929",
      "text": "  讓我看看你的貨物。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^-}^$%^*Q^*Q^*F^&Z^.w^&4^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLX1eJCVeKlFeKlFeKkZeJlpeLndeJjReISI=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0c594e3fc2c4",
      "text": "  我有些東西，你或許會有興趣收購。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^$s^!8^,`^-l^*A^*F^$'^-s^$r^$s^-]^.*^$M^63^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeJHNeITheLGBeLWxeKkFeKkZeJCdeLXNeJHJeJHNeLV1eLipeJE1eNjNeISI=",
      "byte_length": 50
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5ff6c4e237c3",
      "text": "  我只是隨便看看。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^\"?^,X^)X^!R^*Q^*Q^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeIj9eLFheKVheIVJeKlFeKlFeISI=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_830d67988513",
      "text": "  跟我說說這些秘寶神器的來歷。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^.+^$%^-x^-x^(s^!8^1O^#4^&w^\"V^&Z^!O^6^^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLiteJCVeLXheLXheKHNeITheMU9eIzReJndeIlZeJlpeIU9eNl5eISI=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b53396e6da0f",
      "text": "  我現在只想先聊聊。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^&?^\"d^\"?^,1^!b^-U^-U^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeJj9eImReIj9eLDFeIWJeLVVeLVVeISI=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2f0a4b414395",
      "text": " 我當然很樂意與你們多聊聊，但我可是個大忙人。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^$%^&N^&\"^*K^%8^#z^'p^*F^*{^\"x^-U^-U^*A^!I^$%^\"A^,X^!V^\"z^,+^!<^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4kJV4mTl4mIl4qS14lOF4jel4ncF4qRl4qe14ieF4tVV4tVV4qQV4hSV4kJV4iQV4sWF4hVl4iel4sK14hPF4hIiA=",
      "byte_length": 68
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4d38f4c62137",
      "text": "請看，你們可以好好端詳我的珍寶。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*S^*Q^*A^*F^*{^\"A^!B^+i^+i^5o^6v^$%^&Z^/7^#4^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipTXipRXipBXipGXip7XiJBXiFCXitpXitpXjVvXjZ2XiQlXiZaXi83XiM0XiEi",
      "byte_length": 48
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e8b0704d41b1",
      "text": "感謝惠顧。我相信這件戰利品一定會讓你們稱心如意。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#{^-z^6Z^4n^!\"^$%^&a^!U^(s^.W^$(^!t^\"R^!%^#.^$r^-}^*F^*{^0&^#k^#$^#z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiN7Xi16XjZaXjRuXiEiXiQlXiZhXiFVXihzXi5XXiQoXiF0XiJSXiElXiMuXiRyXi19XipGXip7XjAmXiNrXiMkXiN6XiEi",
      "byte_length": 72
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_aab9e51ad92f",
      "text": "正如你們所見，我的貨物皆為上品。或許在你們深思熟慮之後， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%H^#$^*F^*{^$)^-m^*A^$%^&Z^.w^&4^5j^%{^!'^\"R^!\"^$'^-s^\"d^*F^*{^2*^#q^-\"^19^!/^#b^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVIXiMkXipGXip7XiQpXi1tXipBXiQlXiZaXi53XiY0XjVqXiV7XiEnXiJSXiEiXiQnXi1zXiJkXipGXip7XjIqXiNxXi0iXjE5XiEvXiNiXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_766e6b87adc3",
      "text": "會想要買下幾樣東西。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$r^,1^(C^.!^!(^#T^,f^,`^-l^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRyXiwxXihDXi4hXiEoXiNUXixmXixgXi1sXiEi",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_66fa2f3c9bda",
      "text": "沒錯，我向來都在尋覓新貨色。你們手上有什麼好東西？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%\\^)5^*A^$%^+?^!O^)$^\"d^#9^6t^$\\^.w^'s^!\"^*F^*{^$+^!'^$s^!=^.T^+i^,`^-l^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVcXik1XipBXiQlXis/XiFPXikkXiJkXiM5XjZ0XiRcXi53XidzXiEiXipGXip7XiQrXiEnXiRzXiE9Xi5UXitpXixgXi1sXi5W",
      "byte_length": 75
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5eb490117312",
      "text": "儘管看吧，但你們在亞薩斯的任何地方，都絕不可能找到比這裡更精選的神兵秘寶與 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+(^-D^*Q^*I^*A^!I^*F^*{^\"d^!9^-e^$[^&Z^!C^!L^\"e^$]^*A^)$^-I^!)^\"A^'b^$/^!u^,m^(s^-j^$o^'7^.6^&Z^&w^+,^1O^#4^'p ",
      "encoded_base64": "XisoXi1EXipRXipJXipBXiFJXipGXip7XiJkXiE5Xi1lXiRbXiZaXiFDXiFMXiJlXiRdXipBXikkXi1JXiEpXiJBXidiXiQvXiF1XixtXihzXi1qXiRvXic3Xi42XiZaXiZ3XissXjFPXiM0XidwIA==",
      "byte_length": 112
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f8777a9af7d0",
      "text": "護身符了。我跋涉千里、歷經無數艱難險阻， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(T^(c^'+^*D^!\"^$%^6y^3O^+7^)(^!!^6^^'D^%}^$V^6j^)a^*m^)L^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihUXihjXicrXipEXiEiXiQlXjZ5XjNPXis3XikoXiEhXjZeXidEXiV9XiRWXjZqXilhXiptXilMXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ab06b99b1a70",
      "text": "才將它們帶到你們眼前。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$,^#7^+o^*{^#N^!u^*F^*{^&d^!z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQsXiM3XitvXip7XiNOXiF1XipGXip7XiZkXiF6XiEi",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a85fc01b1775",
      "text": "與朋友談天總是人生一大樂事。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'p^,[^\"8^0;^+e^-M^,X^!<^&F^!%^\"z^%8^*r^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XidwXixbXiI4XjA7XitlXi1NXixYXiE8XiZGXiElXiJ6XiU4XipyXiEi",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_adcb834fecd8",
      "text": "我向來都說，及時行樂重於買賣生意。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^+?^!O^)$^-x^*A^\"7^$f^(;^%8^))^$^^.!^.$^&F^#z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXis/XiFPXikkXi14XipBXiI3XiRmXig7XiU4XikpXiReXi4hXi4kXiZGXiN6XiEi",
      "byte_length": 51
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a5e4e9ad781c",
      "text": "  「凱爾」不是你的真名，對吧？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^!#^!p^&/^!$^!)^,X^*F^&Z^-2^\"F^*A^#:^*I^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeISNeIXBeJi9eISReISleLFheKkZeJlpeLTJeIkZeKkFeIzpeKkleLlY=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1f9d3b847be5",
      "text": "  你剛才說你叫什麼名字來著？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^+0^$,^-x^*F^+<^!=^.T^\"F^#)^!O^-a^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeKzBeJCxeLXheKkZeKzxeIT1eLlReIkZeIyleIU9eLWFeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cd5699e78da6",
      "text": "  是誰在追捕你？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^,X^-y^\"d^(o^4?^*F^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLFheLXleImReKG9eND9eKkZeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 23
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_da81adcaac31",
      "text": "  我們正在組建的同盟正需要英雄。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^*{^%H^\"d^2;^,'^&Z^\"E^-0^%H^)e^(C^'y^)\\^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeKnteJUheImReMjteLCdeJlpeIkVeLTBeJUheKWVeKENeJ3leKVxeISI=",
      "byte_length": 47
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_14ba69c4fa31",
      "text": "  你還有興趣再來一場冒險嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^.7^$s^-]^.*^!l^!O^!%^\"n^/P^*m^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeLjdeJHNeLV1eLipeIWxeIU9eISVeIm5eL1BeKm1eK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_65800c9cc7f3",
      "text": "  你看起來不太像個法師。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^*Q^.(^!O^!)^+f^!`^!V^%b^#M^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeKlFeLiheIU9eISleK2ZeIWBeIVZeJWJeI01eISI=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_09934dc88f11",
      "text": "  你是從哪裡弄到這些秘寶神器的？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^,X^#f^+I^-j^/`^!u^(s^!8^1O^#4^&w^\"V^&Z^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeLFheI2ZeK0leLWpeL2BeIXVeKHNeITheMU9eIzReJndeIlZeJlpeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 47
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ca1a90f75cf3",
      "text": "  那條「緋紅烈日項鍊」究竟是什麼來頭？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^)!^%.^!#^6g^3!^%|^$a^)q^)6^!$^-<^28^,X^!=^.T^!O^)t^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKSFeJS5eISNeNmdeMyFeJXxeJGFeKXFeKTZeISReLTxeMjheLFheIT1eLlReIU9eKXReLlY=",
      "byte_length": 56
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f2c6f772c15c",
      "text": "  廢話少說，我們談正事吧。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^#W^-v^#<^-x^*A^$%^*{^0;^%H^*r^*I^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeI1deLXZeIzxeLXheKkFeJCVeKnteMDteJUheKnJeKkleISI=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_62cad9f305b6",
      "text": "  再會了，凱爾。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^!l^$r^*D^*A^!p^&/^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIWxeJHJeKkReKkFeIXBeJi9eISI=",
      "byte_length": 23
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6a3c7f920809",
      "text": " 請別再談論我了。我這人天性謙遜，實在不好意思。",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^*S^*H^!l^0;^1\\^$%^*D^!\"^$%^(s^!<^+e^#r^6x^6}^*A^#3^\"d^!)^+i^#z^#q^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4qU14qSF4hbF4wO14xXF4kJV4qRF4hIl4kJV4oc14hPF4rZV4jcl42eF42fV4qQV4jM14iZF4hKV4raV4jel4jcV4hIg==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f3b065df7a95",
      "text": "我相信像閣下這樣 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^&a^!U^!`^6~^!(^(s^,f ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiZhXiFVXiFgXjZ+XiEoXihzXixmIA==",
      "byte_length": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5d85e69b1a76",
      "text": "充滿智慧之人，定能輕易看出這些珍寶的真正價值， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^5.^,{^$i^4;^!/^!<^*A^#.^'b^(g^,W^*Q^!q^(s^!8^/7^#4^&Z^-2^%H^+&^!Z^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjUuXix7XiRpXjQ7XiEvXiE8XipBXiMuXidiXihnXixXXipRXiFxXihzXiE4Xi83XiM0XiZaXi0yXiVIXismXiFaXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c71ffc0c70a7",
      "text": "不過若有需要，我這點微薄的見識隨時聽憑差遣。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^(x^'x^$s^)e^(C^*A^$%^(s^*;^#i^6o^&Z^-m^(R^)X^$f^-X^,5^48^4k^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXih4Xid4XiRzXillXihDXipBXiQlXihzXio7XiNpXjZvXiZaXi1tXihSXilYXiRmXi1YXiw1XjQ4XjRrXiEi",
      "byte_length": 66
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d5e710a85427",
      "text": "你想打聽哪一件？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^,1^$-^-X^+I^!%^.W^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiwxXiQtXi1YXitJXiElXi5XXi5W",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_88cd89b991af",
      "text": "  寇特爾之斗篷",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^6T^&5^&/^!/^$X^'1",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeNlReJjVeJi9eIS9eJFheJzE=",
      "byte_length": 20
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_61b9141aee9d",
      "text": "  夢境之眼",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^\"y^\"q^!/^&d",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeInleInFeIS9eJmQ=",
      "byte_length": 14
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b34a6a723802",
      "text": "  碎魂斧",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^&o^*.^$Z",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJm9eKi5eJFo=",
      "byte_length": 11
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_410de3ba24a1",
      "text": "  大黃寶石",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^\"z^*7^#4^&k",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeInpeKjdeIzReJms=",
      "byte_length": 14
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2098dbf18041",
      "text": "  毒蛇之戒",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^%Q^(/^!/^$&",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJVFeKC9eIS9eJCY=",
      "byte_length": 14
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e95033fde33d",
      "text": "  德古拉之淚",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^#j^\"=^$6^!/^%m",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeI2peIj1eJDZeIS9eJW0=",
      "byte_length": 17
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f7a3f9844ec6",
      "text": "  尋獵者戰弓",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^#9^&;^'V^$(^#Y",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIzleJjteJ1ZeJCheI1k=",
      "byte_length": 17
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0bfd1b76c829",
      "text": "  劇毒護符",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^1#^%Q^(T^'+",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeMSNeJVFeKFReJys=",
      "byte_length": 14
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3a6f3a9d6e93",
      "text": "  達帕蒂亞頭盔",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^(z^#L^(%^!9^)t^&]",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKHpeI0xeKCVeITleKXReJl0=",
      "byte_length": 20
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0ed3544f6640",
      "text": "祝你享用新買的寶物！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&v^*F^!;^&H^$\\^.!^&Z^#4^&4^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZ2XipGXiE7XiZIXiRcXi4hXiZaXiM0XiY0XipX",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bbcbb984e013",
      "text": "祝你有美好的一天。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&v^*F^$s^-P^+i^&Z^!%^+e^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZ2XipGXiRzXi1QXitpXiZaXiElXitlXiEi",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_38ae22002be7",
      "text": "「寇特爾之斗篷」曾屬於烏里克的一位大法師，他是位技術無與倫比的幻術師。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!#^6T^&5^&/^!/^$X^'1^!$^.j^#C^$^^/4^)(^!d^&Z^!%^!J^\"z^%b^#M^*A^!@^,X^!J^,>^(<^%}^'p^/!^,m^&Z^#S^(<^#M^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEjXjZUXiY1XiYvXiEvXiRYXicxXiEkXi5qXiNDXiReXi80XikoXiFkXiZaXiElXiFKXiJ6XiViXiNNXipBXiFAXixYXiFKXiw+Xig8XiV9XidwXi8hXixtXiZaXiNTXig8XiNNXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 106
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_093f5c2471bc",
      "text": "據說寇特爾即使穿過巨龍的巢穴， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^5T^-x^6T^&5^&/^\"1^!N^')^(x^#H^*>^&Z^#G^'&^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjVUXi14XjZUXiY1XiYvXiIxXiFOXicpXih4XiNIXio+XiZaXiNHXicmXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b692aa14f5f6",
      "text": "也完全不會被察覺。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!1^#,^!h^!)^$r^(@^#2^(G^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiExXiMsXiFoXiEpXiRyXihAXiMyXihHXiEi",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bca9d910d871",
      "text": "「夢境之眼」是個極度奇特的物件。鳴響山脈中一位苦行先知 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!#^\"y^\"q^!/^&d^!$^,X^!V^1D^#V^\"}^&5^&Z^&4^.W^!\"^.|^)o^11^6i^!,^!%^!J^.t^(;^!b^&h ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEjXiJ5XiJxXiEvXiZkXiEkXixYXiFWXjFEXiNWXiJ9XiY1XiZaXiY0Xi5XXiEiXi58XilvXjExXjZpXiEsXiElXiFKXi50Xig7XiFiXiZoIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0b4cf1f4e911",
      "text": "將它視為超越一切的最珍貴財產，我費了極大代價才讓他割愛。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#7^+o^(E^%{^(\\^(]^!%^+.^&Z^$q^/7^2F^0=^&G^*A^$%^.\"^*D^1D^\"z^*v^+&^$,^-}^!@^+1^,2^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiM3XitvXihFXiV7XihcXihdXiElXisuXiZaXiRxXi83XjJGXjA9XiZHXipBXiQlXi4iXipEXjFEXiJ6Xip2XismXiQsXi19XiFAXisxXiwyXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c7cd59e86d8a",
      "text": "這顆寶珠抵禦了我所有的探測， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^)u^#4^&>^$5^&{^*D^$%^$)^$s^&Z^$>^%p^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXil1XiM0XiY+XiQ1XiZ7XipEXiQlXiQpXiRzXiZaXiQ+XiVwXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 43
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9555991f4726",
      "text": "阻止我窺探其漆黑深邃的奧秘。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)L^%G^$%^6f^$>^!j^6d^*:^2*^6;^&Z^6Q^1O^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XilMXiVHXiQlXjZmXiQ+XiFqXjZkXio6XjIqXjY7XiZaXjZRXjFPXiEi",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_32167f327412",
      "text": "難道你們沒聽說過傳奇角鬥士貝維爾凡嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)a^(y^*F^*{^%\\^-X^-x^(x^+$^\"}^(H^*,^+a^/I^'F^&/^+-^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XilhXih5XipGXip7XiVcXi1YXi14Xih4XiskXiJ9XihIXiosXithXi9JXidGXiYvXistXitYXi5W",
      "byte_length": 57
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f377acf82e03",
      "text": "那麼你們一定知道， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^.T^*F^*{^!%^#.^&h^(y^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXi5UXipGXip7XiElXiMuXiZoXih5XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 28
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f57754dcc119",
      "text": "貝維爾凡是德拉吉角鬥場有史以來最偉大的角鬥士。他所選用的武器 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^/I^'F^&/^+-^,X^#j^$6^\"D^(H^*,^\"n^$s^1m^!B^!O^$q^*}^\"z^&Z^(H^*,^+a^!\"^!@^$)^.6^&H^&Z^%J^\"V ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi9JXidGXiYvXistXixYXiNqXiQ2XiJEXihIXiosXiJuXiRzXjFtXiFCXiFPXiRxXip9XiJ6XiZaXihIXiosXithXiEiXiFAXiQpXi42XiZIXiZaXiVKXiJWIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bfd5ad42389f",
      "text": "正是巨斧「碎魂斧」——也就是你們眼前的這一把。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%H^,X^#H^$Z^!#^&o^*.^$Z^!$^*n^*n^!1^*J^,X^*F^*{^&d^!z^&Z^(s^!%^$1^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVIXixYXiNIXiRaXiEjXiZvXiouXiRaXiEkXipuXipuXiExXipKXixYXipGXip7XiZkXiF6XiZaXihzXiElXiQxXiEi",
      "byte_length": 69
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9866cfd0abd1",
      "text": "這顆黃寶石？老實說——而且我只因為你們顯然是精明且值得信賴的人才透露—— ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^)u^*7^#4^&k^.V^'U^#3^-x^*n^*n^'W^!*^$%^\"?^\"]^%{^*F^*{^4&^&\"^,X^'7^$c^!*^!Z^#e^!U^0t^&Z^!<^$,^(q^.B^*n^*n ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXil1Xio3XiM0XiZrXi5WXidVXiMzXi14XipuXipuXidXXiEqXiQlXiI/XiJdXiV7XipGXip7XjQmXiYiXixYXic3XiRjXiEqXiFaXiNlXiFVXjB0XiZaXiE8XiQsXihxXi5CXipuXipuIA==",
      "byte_length": 109
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_021db3346bb4",
      "text": "這是我從商隊另一側的那座方尖石碑上撬下來的。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^,X^$%^#f^1'^)U^\">^!%^!\\^&Z^)!^/_^$]^#=^&k^&p^!'^6]^!(^!O^&Z^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXixYXiQlXiNmXjEnXilVXiI+XiElXiFcXiZaXikhXi9fXiRdXiM9XiZrXiZwXiEnXjZdXiEoXiFPXiZaXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_89a193449926",
      "text": "就我目前看來， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*J^$%^&^^!z^*Q^!O^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipKXiQlXiZeXiF6XipRXiFPXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 22
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_401ba71b373f",
      "text": "它只不過是一顆普通的寶石而已。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+o^\"?^!)^(x^,X^!%^)u^$g^(t^&Z^#4^&k^'W^#J^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XitvXiI/XiEpXih4XixYXiElXil1XiRnXih0XiZaXiM0XiZrXidXXiNKXiEi",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_83fae0c71bd5",
      "text": "傳說中的古代德魯伊德古拉，曾為這個世界的荒蕪蒼涼而痛哭。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+$^-x^!,^&Z^\"=^*v^#j^/K^!E^#j^\"=^$6^*A^.j^%{^(s^!V^*p^.p^&Z^1W^4b^6n^,s^'W^-.^/U^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiskXi14XiEsXiZaXiI9Xip2XiNqXi9LXiFFXiNqXiI9XiQ2XipBXi5qXiV7XihzXiFWXipwXi5wXiZaXjFXXjRiXjZuXixzXidXXi0uXi9VXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_18e6fcb7350c",
      "text": "他渴望復甦大地的意志如此強烈，以至於其生命能量結晶化為 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^,w^,]^#g^6e^\"z^\"e^&Z^#z^#m^#$^%I^#]^%|^*A^!B^'n^$^^!j^&F^\"N^'b^)*^'@^$h^\")^%{ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXix3XixdXiNnXjZlXiJ6XiJlXiZaXiN6XiNtXiMkXiVJXiNdXiV8XipBXiFCXiduXiReXiFqXiZGXiJOXidiXikqXidAXiRoXiIpXiV7IA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_65d8f73a5e9f",
      "text": "像這樣的寶石，滴落在沙塵之中。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!`^(s^,f^&Z^#4^&k^*A^2u^-`^\"d^%]^\"p^!/^!,^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFgXihzXixmXiZaXiM0XiZrXipBXjJ1Xi1gXiJkXiVdXiJwXiEvXiEsXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ff3cd3fdba00",
      "text": "預言說，德古拉自知力量尚不足以挽救世界，因此將力量 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.E^1Y^-x^*A^#j^\"=^$6^'l^&h^!~^)*^+v^!)^(^^!B^0b^,Q^*p^.p^*A^\"]^%I^#7^!~^)* ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi5FXjFZXi14XipBXiNqXiI9XiQ2XidsXiZoXiF+XikqXit2XiEpXiheXiFCXjBiXixRXipwXi5wXipBXiJdXiVJXiM3XiF+XikqIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d482c90f1550",
      "text": "封存在水晶中，等待巫王們自己痛哭流涕的那一天。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#5^#*^\"d^%V^$h^!,^*A^'-^,*^14^-)^*{^'l^#I^-.^/U^%j^6a^&Z^)!^!%^+e^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiM1XiMqXiJkXiVWXiRoXiEsXipBXictXiwqXjE0Xi0pXip7XidsXiNJXi0uXi9VXiVqXjZhXiZaXikhXiElXitlXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0dcb22c68ff3",
      "text": "到了那一天，甘泉必將湧流於荒漠之中。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!u^*D^)!^!%^+e^*A^/:^%a^#l^#7^0m^%j^$^^1W^,}^!/^!,^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiF1XipEXikhXiElXitlXipBXi86XiVhXiNsXiM3XjBtXiVqXiReXjFXXix9XiEvXiEsXiEi",
      "byte_length": 54
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6b3f3ee7484b",
      "text": "如果你們仔細端詳這枚戒指，會看到寶石深處封印著一縷蜿蜒的蛇影—— ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#$^%!^*F^*{^6I^'?^5o^6v^(s^$~^$&^$8^*A^$r^*Q^!u^#4^&k^2*^(,^#5^1%^-a^!%^6h^6q^6p^&Z^(/^#a^*n^*n ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiMkXiUhXipGXip7XjZJXic/XjVvXjZ2XihzXiR+XiQmXiQ4XipBXiRyXipRXiF1XiM0XiZrXjIqXigsXiM1XjElXi1hXiElXjZoXjZxXjZwXiZaXigvXiNhXipuXipuIA==",
      "byte_length": 97
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8708ab263ada",
      "text": "這正是其名稱的由來。有人聲稱， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^%H^,X^!j^\"F^0&^&Z^&I^!O^!\"^$s^!<^-W^0&^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXiVIXixYXiFqXiJGXjAmXiZaXiZJXiFPXiEiXiRzXiE8Xi1XXjAmXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9a863a9b8853",
      "text": "「毒蛇之戒」中蘊含著巨龍的力量。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!#^%Q^(/^!/^$&^!$^!,^6!^\"I^-a^#H^*>^&Z^!~^)*^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEjXiVRXigvXiEvXiQmXiEkXiEsXjYhXiJJXi1hXiNIXio+XiZaXiF+XikqXiEi",
      "byte_length": 48
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1f4e1c0397e8",
      "text": "啊，沒錯。新月森林古爾格的偉大尤達加獵手阿佩尼蒙， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+Q^*A^%\\^)5^!\"^$\\^/p^4H^/1^\"=^&/^%*^&Z^*}^\"z^6V^(z^\"\"^&;^$+^)M^.}^#>^-c^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitRXipBXiVcXik1XiEiXiRcXi9wXjRIXi8xXiI9XiYvXiUqXiZaXip9XiJ6XjZWXih6XiIiXiY7XiQrXilNXi59XiM+Xi1jXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d7228085414f",
      "text": "曾攜帶這把名為「尋獵者」的戰弓參加對抗尼本奈的戰爭。阿佩尼蒙是 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.j^0e^#N^(s^$1^\"F^%{^!#^#9^&;^'V^!$^&Z^$(^#Y^6K^\"\"^#:^$4^#>^$x^\"~^&Z^$(^1I^!\"^)M^.}^#>^-c^,X ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi5qXjBlXiNOXihzXiQxXiJGXiV7XiEjXiM5XiY7XidWXiEkXiZaXiQoXiNZXjZLXiIiXiM6XiQ0XiM+XiR4XiJ+XiZaXiQoXjFJXiEiXilNXi59XiM+Xi1jXixYIA==",
      "byte_length": 94
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b6c44f291f3b",
      "text": "巫女王菈拉莉-普依最寵愛的勇士，因為他作為獵手戰士身手卓絕， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^14^#\"^-)^6m^$6^'{-^$g^!Q^$q^6U^,2^&Z^\"$^+a^*A^\"]^%{^!@^!M^%{^&;^$+^$(^+a^(c^$+^/#^-I^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjE0XiMiXi0pXjZtXiQ2Xid7LV4kZ14hUV4kcV42VV4sMl4mWl4iJF4rYV4qQV4iXV4le14hQF4hTV4le14mO14kK14kKF4rYV4oY14kK14vI14tSV4qQSA=",
      "byte_length": 89
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_efdcf92420e5",
      "text": "僅憑精準的一箭便能射倒一名巨人。據說「尋獵者」 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!_^,5^'7^,x^&Z^!%^'.^!R^'b^#6^!X^!%^\"F^#H^!<^!\"^5T^-x^!#^#9^&;^'V^!$ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFfXiw1Xic3Xix4XiZaXiElXicuXiFSXidiXiM2XiFYXiElXiJGXiNIXiE8XiEiXjVUXi14XiEjXiM5XiY7XidWXiEkIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bcecdd9021d2",
      "text": "正是菈拉莉-普依賜予他的禮物。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%H^,X^6m^$6^'{-^$g^!Q^.#^!4^!@^&Z^-8^&4^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVIXixYXjZtXiQ2Xid7LV4kZ14hUV4uI14hNF4hQF4mWl4tOF4mNF4hIg==",
      "byte_length": 43
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3e0ad2af9790",
      "text": "「劇毒護符」是黑水吟遊詩人贈予我的，他是一位用毒大師。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!#^1#^%Q^(T^'+^!$^,X^*:^%V^6L^.3^6u^!<^([^!4^$%^&Z^*A^!@^,X^!%^!J^&H^%Q^\"z^#M^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEjXjEjXiVRXihUXicrXiEkXixYXio6XiVWXjZMXi4zXjZ1XiE8XihbXiE0XiQlXiZaXipBXiFAXixYXiElXiFKXiZIXiVRXiJ6XiNNXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b43b33fadd9e",
      "text": "在我和他同行的旅途中，我曾親眼見過這位吟遊詩人 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"d^$%^\"O^!@^\"E^(;^&Z^2m^3.^!,^*A^$%^.j^(F^&d^-m^(x^(s^!J^6L^.3^6u^!< ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJkXiQlXiJPXiFAXiJFXig7XiZaXjJtXjMuXiEsXipBXiQlXi5qXihGXiZkXi1tXih4XihzXiFKXjZMXi4zXjZ1XiE8IA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_96de474e5bf1",
      "text": "為了一句誇口而一口飲下毒酒。除了之後大家都不大願意 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%{^*D^!%^2]^6w^\"<^'W^!%^\"<^){^!(^%Q^6=^!\"^)Q^*D^!/^#b^\"z^+s^)$^!)^\"z^.H^#z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiV7XipEXiElXjJdXjZ3XiI8XidXXiElXiI8Xil7XiEoXiVRXjY9XiEiXilRXipEXiEvXiNiXiJ6XitzXikkXiEpXiJ6Xi5IXiN6IA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_213c4e541a0c",
      "text": "再找他喝酒之外，他完全沒有受到任何不良影響。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!l^$/^!@^6M^6=^!/^\"w^*A^!@^#,^!h^%\\^$s^\";^!u^!C^!L^!)^1V^#a^)o^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFsXiQvXiFAXjZNXjY9XiEvXiJ3XipBXiFAXiMsXiFoXiVcXiRzXiI7XiF1XiFDXiFMXiEpXjFWXiNhXilvXiEi",
      "byte_length": 66
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ecfa1bcc1da8",
      "text": "在諸神遺棄亞薩斯之前的遠古時代，群山披著鬱鬱蔥蔥的林木， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"d^1]^&w^0v^,a^!9^-e^$[^!/^!z^&Z^({^\"=^$f^*v^*A^'R^11^6\\^-a^4o^4o^4a^4a^&Z^/1^$v^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJkXjFdXiZ3XjB2XixhXiE5Xi1lXiRbXiEvXiF6XiZaXih7XiI9XiRmXip2XipBXidSXjExXjZcXi1hXjRvXjRvXjRhXjRhXiZaXi8xXiR2XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4dc97c167730",
      "text": "綠草如茵覆蓋原野，無比崇高的英雄們奮起對抗這片土地上的邪惡。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^3V^*f^#$^6k^(D^-d^\"5^.:^*A^%}^,m^13^*+^&Z^'y^)\\^*{^+g^.(^#:^$4^(s^&1^\"c^\"e^!'^&Z^)\"^#y^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjNWXipmXiMkXjZrXihEXi1kXiI1Xi46XipBXiV9XixtXjEzXiorXiZaXid5XilcXip7XitnXi4oXiM6XiQ0XihzXiYxXiJjXiJlXiEnXiZaXikiXiN5XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5b1eb825d4cf",
      "text": "達帕蒂亞就是這樣一位英雄。在我不辭辛勞取得 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(z^#L^(%^!9^*J^,X^(s^,f^!%^!J^'y^)\\^!\"^\"d^$%^!)^2M^6z^/R^\":^#e ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xih6XiNMXiglXiE5XipKXixYXihzXixmXiElXiFKXid5XilcXiEiXiJkXiQlXiEpXjJNXjZ6Xi9SXiI6XiNlIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_be23ca9a29dd",
      "text": "「達帕蒂亞頭盔」的陵墓中，雕刻的牆壁至今仍頌揚著這位英雄的事蹟。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!#^(z^#L^(%^!9^)t^&]^!$^&Z^7!^6P^!,^*A^)^^.Y^&Z^&0^*\\^'n^*E^!?^7\"^2k^-a^(s^!J^'y^)\\^&Z^*r^0B^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEjXih6XiNMXiglXiE5Xil0XiZdXiEkXiZaXjchXjZQXiEsXipBXileXi5ZXiZaXiYwXipcXiduXipFXiE/XjciXjJrXi1hXihzXiFKXid5XilcXiZaXipyXjBCXiEi",
      "byte_length": 96
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a1745ff794ab",
      "text": "我對外自稱凱爾。我在到處收集這些寶物時結下了太多仇敵； ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^#:^\"w^'l^0&^!p^&/^!\"^$%^\"d^!u^(,^$M^)]^(s^!8^#4^&4^$f^'@^!(^*D^+f^\"x^1g^$U^*C ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiM6XiJ3XidsXjAmXiFwXiYvXiEiXiQlXiJkXiF1XigsXiRNXildXihzXiE4XiM0XiY0XiRmXidAXiEoXipEXitmXiJ4XjFnXiRVXipDIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_30b3812e6246",
      "text": "如果我的真實姓名洩露出去，我恐怕連今天都活不過去。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#$^%!^$%^&Z^-2^#3^6S^\"F^6_^.B^!q^\"6^*A^$%^#t^0^^.0^*E^+e^)$^%i^!)^(x^\"6^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiMkXiUhXiQlXiZaXi0yXiMzXjZTXiJGXjZfXi5CXiFxXiI2XipBXiQlXiN0XjBeXi4wXipFXitlXikkXiVpXiEpXih4XiI2XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_da65bf0ebf2e",
      "text": "我現在甚至連法術都不敢再施展了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^&?^\"d^/|^'n^.0^%b^(<^)$^!)^/m^!l^$_^+x^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiY/XiJkXi98XiduXi4wXiViXig8XikkXiEpXi9tXiFsXiRfXit4XipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 48
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_69fadedb6d28",
      "text": "這身偽裝挺高明的，不是嗎？這不過是我那些秘寶神器 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^(c^6J^(A^,I^*+^$c^&Z^*A^!)^,X^+X^.V^(s^!)^(x^,X^$%^)!^!8^1O^#4^&w^\"V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXihjXjZKXihBXixJXiorXiRjXiZaXipBXiEpXixYXitYXi5WXihzXiEpXih4XixYXiQlXikhXiE4XjFPXiM0XiZ3XiJWIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2770cbb91f62",
      "text": "所能發揮的一點小把戲罷了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$)^'b^&W^2\"^&Z^!%^*;^#;^$1^,;^1Q^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQpXidiXiZXXjIiXiZaXiElXio7XiM7XiQxXiw7XjFRXipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_91afd7da779c",
      "text": "我戴著「寇特爾之戒」。若非我自己實在迫切需要， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^1:^-a^!#^6T^&5^&/^!/^$&^!$^!\"^'x^)i^$%^'l^#I^#3^\"d^1`^+.^)e^(C^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXjE6Xi1hXiEjXjZUXiY1XiYvXiEvXiQmXiEkXiEiXid4XilpXiQlXidsXiNJXiMzXiJkXjFgXisuXillXihDXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2fb5ec2498eb",
      "text": "我本來也願意把它賣給你們，但萬一我的施法能力 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^$x^!O^!1^.H^#z^$1^+o^.$^'A^*F^*{^*A^!I^-_^!%^$%^&Z^$_^%b^'b^!~ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiR4XiFPXiExXi5IXiN6XiQxXitvXi4kXidBXipGXip7XipBXiFJXi1fXiElXiQlXiZaXiRfXiViXidiXiF+IA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a3c3b509e008",
      "text": "傳到了不該聽的人耳中……那可就不堪設想了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+$^!u^*D^!)^(M^-X^&Z^!<^'Y^!,^*o^*o^)!^\"A^*J^!)^6O^4e^,1^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiskXiF1XipEXiEpXihNXi1YXiZaXiE8XidZXiEsXipvXipvXikhXiJBXipKXiEpXjZPXjRlXiwxXipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 63
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6f5d3cdbd141",
      "text": "仇敵的名單長到唸不完：巫王們、數不清的聖堂武士、 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^1g^$U^&Z^\"F^2a^)C^!u^.]^!)^#,^*B^14^-)^*{^!!^$V^!)^,u^&Z^'Z^42^%J^+a^!! ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjFnXiRVXiZaXiJGXjJhXilDXiF1Xi5dXiEpXiMsXipCXjE0Xi0pXip7XiEhXiRWXiEpXix1XiZaXidaXjQyXiVKXithXiEhIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_57f327ff1c94",
      "text": "一夥特別兇殘的淤泥海巨人……我還可以繼續數下去，但 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!%^5?^&5^*H^*G^,l^&Z^6c^%d^6`^#H^!<^*o^*o^$%^.7^\"A^!B^-O^'M^$V^!(^\"6^*A^!I ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiElXjU/XiY1XipIXipHXixsXiZaXjZjXiVkXjZgXiNIXiE8XipvXipvXiQlXi43XiJBXiFCXi1PXidNXiRWXiEoXiI2XipBXiFJIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a772faf81db1",
      "text": "像你們這樣的冒險者一定明白，成天掛念著敵人 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!`^*F^*{^(s^,f^&Z^/P^*m^'V^!%^#.^$c^&X^*A^$$^+e^$=^1z^-a^$U^!< ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFgXipGXip7XihzXixmXiZaXi9QXiptXidWXiElXiMuXiRjXiZYXipBXiQkXitlXiQ9XjF6Xi1hXiRVXiE8IA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cf34885c523b",
      "text": "根本毫無意義。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%)^$x^/t^%}^#z^2<^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiUpXiR4Xi90XiV9XiN6XjI8XiEi",
      "byte_length": 21
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_61945a30702a",
      "text": "我身為冒險法師的生涯已經劃下句點，但我仍竭盡所能協助我的同道—— ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^(c^%{^/P^*m^%b^#M^&Z^&F^6b^#J^'D^4s^!(^2]^*;^*A^!I^$%^!?^29^-1^$)^'b^2[^\"#^$%^&Z^\"E^(y^*n^*n ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXihjXiV7Xi9QXiptXiViXiNNXiZaXiZGXjZiXiNKXidEXjRzXiEoXjJdXio7XipBXiFJXiQlXiE/XjI5Xi0xXiQpXidiXjJbXiIjXiQlXiZaXiJFXih5XipuXipuIA==",
      "byte_length": 97
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f5ba4b96d2d7",
      "text": "以低到讓你們以為我是在賣沙子的價格， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!B^!K^!u^-}^*F^*{^!B^%{^$%^,X^\"d^.$^%]^#(^&Z^+&^%*^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFCXiFLXiF1Xi19XipGXip7XiFCXiV7XiQlXixYXiJkXi4kXiVdXiMoXiZaXismXiUqXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_691e8c36d58c",
      "text": "廉售我行遍天下收集的珍寶。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^6X^56^$%^(;^69^+e^!(^$M^)]^&Z^/7^#4^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XjZYXjU2XiQlXig7XjY5XitlXiEoXiRNXildXiZaXi83XiM0XiEi",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_984f7314b839",
      "text": "在被迫收起法師長袍之前，我曾踏遍亞薩斯無數無人涉足的秘徑。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"d^(@^1`^$M^.(^%b^#M^)C^6r^!/^!z^*A^$%^.j^.,^69^!9^-e^$[^%}^$V^%}^!<^3O^(^^&Z^1O^#c^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJkXihAXjFgXiRNXi4oXiViXiNNXilDXjZyXiEvXiF6XipBXiQlXi5qXi4sXjY5XiE5Xi1lXiRbXiV9XiRWXiV9XiE8XjNPXiheXiZaXjFPXiNjXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3a7913fc18c1",
      "text": "我的魔法能力幫助我識破了那些看似平凡的器物， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^&Z^*0^%b^'b^!~^+}^\"#^$%^(R^&n^*D^)!^!8^*Q^!H^0Y^+-^&Z^\"V^&4^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiZaXiowXiViXidiXiF+Xit9XiIjXiQlXihSXiZuXipEXikhXiE4XipRXiFIXjBZXistXiZaXiJWXiY0XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_84871a37ad31",
      "text": "辨認出它們真正的神妙之處。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^6{^(O^!q^+o^*{^-2^%H^&Z^&w^43^!/^(,^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XjZ7XihPXiFxXitvXip7Xi0yXiVIXiZaXiZ3XjQzXiEvXigsXiEi",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c56f2f96ee9b",
      "text": "至於它們的來歷：有些來自巫王們的深宮秘庫—— ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'n^$^^+o^*{^&Z^!O^6^^*B^$s^!8^!O^'l^14^-)^*{^&Z^2*^/\\^1O^,#^*n^*n ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiduXiReXitvXip7XiZaXiFPXjZeXipCXiRzXiE4XiFPXidsXjE0Xi0pXip7XiZaXjIqXi9cXjFPXiwjXipuXipuIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_672ce28a71ca",
      "text": "有些來自鳴響山脈另一側蠻荒邊境的神秘廢墟—— ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$s^!8^!O^'l^.|^)o^11^6i^\">^!%^!\\^/H^1W^.8^\"q^&Z^&w^1O^#W^\"t^*n^*n ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRzXiE4XiFPXidsXi58XilvXjExXjZpXiI+XiElXiFcXi9IXjFXXi44XiJxXiZaXiZ3XjFPXiNXXiJ0XipuXipuIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d85cf1b26716",
      "text": "還有些來自淤泥海酷熱的心臟地帶。朋友啊，這些寶藏是從 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.7^$s^!8^!O^'l^6c^%d^6`^1b^&$^&Z^#k^3Y^\"e^#N^!\"^,[^\"8^+Q^*A^(s^!8^#4^-f^,X^#f ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi43XiRzXiE4XiFPXidsXjZjXiVkXjZgXjFiXiYkXiZaXiNrXjNZXiJlXiNOXiEiXixbXiI4XitRXipBXihzXiE4XiM0Xi1mXixYXiNmIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7e73bf5307c6",
      "text": "亞薩斯最遙遠的角落帶回來的，你們在其他任何地方 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!9^-e^$[^$q^4j^({^&Z^(H^-`^#N^\"\\^!O^&Z^*A^*F^*{^\"d^!j^!@^!C^!L^\"e^$] ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiE5Xi1lXiRbXiRxXjRqXih7XiZaXihIXi1gXiNOXiJcXiFPXiZaXipBXipGXip7XiJkXiFqXiFAXiFDXiFMXiJlXiRdIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0b08036d2005",
      "text": "都絕不可能見到類似的珍品。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)$^-I^!)^\"A^'b^-m^!u^)w^!H^&Z^/7^\"R^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XikkXi1JXiEpXiJBXidiXi1tXiF1Xil3XiFIXiZaXi83XiJSXiEi",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8e611a859715",
      "text": "比起我能賣給你們的寶物，緋紅烈日項鍊不過是個小玩意兒， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,m^.(^$%^'b^.$^'A^*F^*{^&Z^#4^&4^*A^6g^3!^%|^$a^)q^)6^!)^(x^,X^!V^#;^4U^#z^++^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XixtXi4oXiQlXidiXi4kXidBXipGXip7XiZaXiM0XiY0XipBXjZnXjMhXiV8XiRhXilxXik2XiEpXih4XixYXiFWXiM7XjRVXiN6XisrXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1782e96e3958",
      "text": "但它依然是一件強大的墜飾，在做工繁複的精銅上鑲嵌著烈火紅寶石—— ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!I^+o^!Q^&\"^,X^!%^.W^#]^\"z^&Z^\"r^)|^*A^\"d^*~^+y^-N^6s^&Z^'7^0x^!'^)A^6W^-a^%|^%x^3!^#4^&k^*n^*n ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFJXitvXiFRXiYiXixYXiElXi5XXiNdXiJ6XiZaXiJyXil8XipBXiJkXip+Xit5Xi1OXjZzXiZaXic3XjB4XiEnXilBXjZXXi1hXiV8XiV4XjMhXiM0XiZrXipuXipuIA==",
      "byte_length": 97
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_899b10746c0a",
      "text": "傳說女術士露薩蒂曾將一頭火焰龍獸封印在項鍊之中。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+$^-x^#\"^(<^+a^.B^-e^(%^.j^#7^!%^)t^%x^&!^*>^&<^#5^1%^\"d^)q^)6^!/^!,^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiskXi14XiMiXig8XithXi5CXi1lXiglXi5qXiM3XiElXil0XiV4XiYhXio+XiY8XiM1XjElXiJkXilxXik2XiEvXiEsXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a74fecf6da51",
      "text": "我真後悔把它賣給了一個不識貨的傢伙。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^-2^#b^6Y^$1^+o^.$^'A^*D^!%^!V^!)^(R^.w^&Z^+#^*y^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXi0yXiNiXjZZXiQxXitvXi4kXidBXipEXiElXiFWXiEpXihSXi53XiZaXisjXip5XiEi",
      "byte_length": 54
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_424b7a177d58",
      "text": "那是自然。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^,X^'l^&\"^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXixYXidsXiYiXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 16
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d664de1eaeca",
      "text": "不，求求你們別傷害我！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^*A^,n^,n^*F^*{^*H^!^^#/^$%^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXipBXixuXixuXipGXip7XipIXiFeXiMvXiQlXipX",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4ace48bce064",
      "text": "問候各位追尋者。我是拉麗莎夫人——而你們是……",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*Z^*|^+>^!J^(o^#9^'V^!\"^$%^,X^$6^0z^/E^\"{^!<^*n^*n^'W^*F^*{^,X^*o^*o",
      "encoded_base64": "XipaXip8Xis+XiFKXihvXiM5XidWXiEiXiQlXixYXiQ2XjB6Xi9FXiJ7XiE8XipuXipuXidXXipGXip7XixYXipvXipv",
      "byte_length": 69
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_951180da09cb",
      "text": "沒錯，幻象浮現了。你是 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%\\^)5^*A^#S^4g^4M^&?^*D^!\"^*F^,X ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVcXik1XipBXiNTXjRnXjRNXiY/XipEXiEiXipGXixYIA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_207a2cf70552",
      "text": "，而你的同伴們…… ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*A^'W^*F^&Z^\"E^1h^*{^*o^*o ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipBXidXXipGXiZaXiJFXjFoXip7XipvXipvIA==",
      "byte_length": 28
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1a6f44a67db6",
      "text": "皆為堂堂正正的冒險者。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^5j^%{^42^42^%H^%H^&Z^/P^*m^'V^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XjVqXiV7XjQyXjQyXiVIXiVIXiZaXi9QXiptXidWXiEi",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_09c7faaa43a5",
      "text": "幸會，歡迎你們， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^15^$r^*A^%F^(k^*F^*{^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjE1XiRyXipBXiVGXihrXipGXip7XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_74a11094ed0d",
      "text": "我，拉麗莎夫人，正如以往一樣在此為你們勇敢的追求指引方向。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*A^$6^0z^/E^\"{^!<^*A^%H^#$^!B^,)^!%^,f^\"d^%I^%{^*F^*{^\"$^/m^&Z^(o^,n^$8^#Z^$]^+?^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXipBXiQ2XjB6Xi9FXiJ7XiE8XipBXiVIXiMkXiFCXiwpXiElXixmXiJkXiVJXiV7XipGXip7XiIkXi9tXiZaXihvXixuXiQ4XiNaXiRdXis/XiEi",
      "byte_length": 87
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bfc9b80ed8ee",
      "text": "  妳願意為我占卜命運嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^7(^.H^#z^%{^$%^54^53^\"N^.4^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeNyheLkheI3peJXteJCVeNTReNTNeIk5eLjReK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_59331e2e67b8",
      "text": "  妳能把剛才給我的預言再重複一遍嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^7(^'b^$1^+0^$,^'A^$%^&Z^.E^1Y^!l^))^6s^!%^69^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeNyheJ2JeJDFeKzBeJCxeJ0FeJCVeJlpeLkVeMVleIWxeKSleNnNeISVeNjleK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 53
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_61b9cf7688da",
      "text": "  妳怎麼會知道我們的名字？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^7(^,,^.T^$r^&h^(y^$%^*{^&Z^\"F^#)^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeNyheLCxeLlReJHJeJmheKHleJCVeKnteJlpeIkZeIyleLlY=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_aaaeef34af76",
      "text": "  守門的衛兵叫我來的。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^#+^)D^&Z^(=^+,^+<^$%^!O^&Z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIyteKUReJlpeKD1eKyxeKzxeJCVeIU9eJlpeISI=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1b869c774be5",
      "text": "  令弟叫我來的。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*w^16^+<^$%^!O^&Z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKndeMTZeKzxeJCVeIU9eJlpeISI=",
      "byte_length": 23
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_71f6c36d6da3",
      "text": "  令弟自己似乎也知道不少事。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*w^16^'l^#I^!H^!0^!1^&h^(y^!)^#<^*r^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKndeMTZeJ2xeI0leIUheITBeITFeJmheKHleISleIzxeKnJeISI=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9af7ca66131d",
      "text": "  妳和另一位先知鬧過矛盾？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^7(^\"O^\">^!%^!J^!b^&h^6G^(x^4Z^&b^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeNyheIk9eIj5eISVeIUpeIWJeJmheNkdeKHheNFpeJmJeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_720da0f3df7b",
      "text": "我洞悉萬物。我是個擁有超越常人靈視之力的先知， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^%h^2h^-_^&4^!\"^$%^,X^!V^,M^$s^(\\^(]^#O^!<^)g^(E^!/^!~^&Z^!b^&h^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiVoXjJoXi1fXiY0XiEiXiQlXixYXiFWXixNXiRzXihcXihdXiNPXiE8XilnXihFXiEvXiF+XiZaXiFiXiZoXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_127301cfdc7e",
      "text": "能感應遠古過去與未來，正如你們看見眼前當下一般 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'b^#{^0`^({^\"=^(x^\"6^'p^,_^!O^*A^%H^#$^*F^*{^*Q^-m^&d^!z^&N^!(^!%^'r ",
      "encoded_base64": "XidiXiN7XjBgXih7XiI9Xih4XiI2XidwXixfXiFPXipBXiVIXiMkXipGXip7XipRXi1tXiZkXiF6XiZOXiEoXiElXidyIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a109eba533a5",
      "text": "清晰分明。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,u^71^!s^$c^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xix1XjcxXiFzXiRjXiEi",
      "byte_length": 15
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a8aca373ecde",
      "text": "是的，我知道。我弟弟也略通些許靈視。這正是他被選為 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,X^&Z^*A^$%^&h^(y^!\"^$%^16^16^!1^&L^(t^!8^-s^)g^(E^!\"^(s^%H^,X^!@^(@^.6^%{ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XixYXiZaXipBXiQlXiZoXih5XiEiXiQlXjE2XjE2XiExXiZMXih0XiE4Xi1zXilnXihFXiEiXihzXiVIXixYXiFAXihAXi42XiV7IA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b8d6daaea907",
      "text": "守門衛兵的原因。他經常把那些靈光氣場格外強烈的人 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#+^)D^(=^+,^&Z^\"5^\"]^!\"^!@^'D^#O^$1^)!^!8^)g^!c^%U^\"n^%*^\"w^#]^%|^&Z^!< ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiMrXilEXig9XissXiZaXiI1XiJdXiEiXiFAXidEXiNPXiQxXikhXiE4XilnXiFjXiVVXiJuXiUqXiJ3XiNdXiV8XiZaXiE8IA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_61085ebb044a",
      "text": "送到我這裡來接受進一步指引。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^./^!u^$%^(s^-j^!O^$?^\";^(w^!%^,i^$8^#Z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi4vXiF1XiQlXihzXi1qXiFPXiQ/XiI7Xih3XiElXixpXiQ4XiNaXiEi",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_307cb2d9aeb3",
      "text": "沒錯，在我們姊弟兩人合力之下，這一帶的大事小情幾乎逃不過我們的眼睛。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%\\^)5^*A^\"d^$%^*{^7)^16^!i^!<^\"C^!~^!/^!(^*A^(s^!%^#N^&Z^\"z^*r^#;^,0^#T^!0^(p^!)^(x^$%^*{^&Z^&d^&f^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVcXik1XipBXiJkXiQlXip7XjcpXjE2XiFpXiE8XiJDXiF+XiEvXiEoXipBXihzXiElXiNOXiZaXiJ6XipyXiM7XiwwXiNUXiEwXihwXiEpXih4XiQlXip7XiZaXiZkXiZmXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 103
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_355bb27cfba7",
      "text": "我弟弟自然是從他接待的往來旅客口中收集消息， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^16^16^'l^&\"^,X^#f^!@^$?^,*^&Z^,)^!O^2m^+q^\"<^!,^$M^)]^%k^#w^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXjE2XjE2XidsXiYiXixYXiNmXiFAXiQ/XiwqXiZaXiwpXiFPXjJtXitxXiI8XiEsXiRNXildXiVrXiN3XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ef0cf7fb7f9b",
      "text": "而我則是從神秘未知的靈視源頭中汲取預兆。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'W^$%^!x^,X^#f^&w^1O^,_^&h^&Z^)g^(E^%q^)t^!,^%Y^\":^.E^5/^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XidXXiQlXiF4XixYXiNmXiZ3XjFPXixfXiZoXiZaXilnXihFXiVxXil0XiEsXiVZXiI6Xi5FXjUvXiEi",
      "byte_length": 60
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e6a6dd71e871",
      "text": "沒什麼好細說的。我那當守衛的弟弟和我出生於德拉吉…… ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%\\^!=^.T^+i^'?^-x^&Z^!\"^$%^)!^&N^#+^(=^&Z^16^16^\"O^$%^!q^&F^$^^#j^$6^\"D^*o^*o ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVcXiE9Xi5UXitpXic/Xi14XiZaXiEiXiQlXikhXiZOXiMrXig9XiZaXjE2XjE2XiJPXiQlXiFxXiZGXiReXiNqXiQ2XiJEXipvXipvIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0e702060c859",
      "text": "曾是一名聖堂武士的奴隸。我們憑藉我的預知能力成功脫逃， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.j^,X^!%^\"F^'Z^42^%J^+a^&Z^##^)Z^!\"^$%^*{^,5^04^$%^&Z^.E^&h^'b^!~^$$^\"!^'c^(p^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi5qXixYXiElXiJGXidaXjQyXiVKXithXiZaXiMjXilaXiEiXiQlXip7Xiw1XjA0XiQlXiZaXi5FXiZoXidiXiF+XiQkXiIhXidjXihwXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8433683459a1",
      "text": "並在提奎茲爾村生活，直到後來加入了這支商隊。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!+^\"d^$A^5B^/D^&/^$z^&F^%i^*A^&`^!u^#b^!O^\"\"^!f^*D^(s^$L^1'^)U^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiErXiJkXiRBXjVCXi9EXiYvXiR6XiZGXiVpXipBXiZgXiF1XiNiXiFPXiIiXiFmXipEXihzXiRMXjEnXilVXiEi",
      "byte_length": 66
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d636fa61517c",
      "text": "提奎茲爾村就在這裡的西南方。我們之所以離開，是因為同一個村子裡 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$A^5B^/D^&/^$z^*J^\"d^(s^-j^&Z^-l^\"/^$]^!\"^$%^*{^!/^$)^!B^)`^)F^*A^,X^\"]^%{^\"E^!%^!V^$z^#(^-j ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRBXjVCXi9EXiYvXiR6XipKXiJkXihzXi1qXiZaXi1sXiIvXiRdXiEiXiQlXip7XiEvXiQpXiFCXilgXilGXipBXixYXiJdXiV7XiJFXiElXiFWXiR6XiMoXi1qIA==",
      "byte_length": 94
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7604222c1ad8",
      "text": "容不下兩位先知，否則只會惹出麻煩。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+t^!)^!(^!i^!J^!b^&h^*A^\"H^!x^\"?^$r^3s^!q^*6^-!^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xit0XiEpXiEoXiFpXiFKXiFiXiZoXipBXiJIXiF4XiI/XiRyXjNzXiFxXio2Xi0hXiEi",
      "byte_length": 51
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_78e0b8e66213",
      "text": "何止是麻煩！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!L^%G^,X^*6^-!^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFMXiVHXixYXio2Xi0hXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 19
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ab7d6ff60fea",
      "text": "不過，如今既然你們已經實現了他的預言，我明白是我看走眼了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^(x^*A^#$^*E^,U^&\"^*F^*{^#J^'D^#3^&?^*D^!@^&Z^.E^1Y^*A^$%^$c^&X^,X^$%^*Q^.&^&d^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXih4XipBXiMkXipFXixVXiYiXipGXip7XiNKXidEXiMzXiY/XipEXiFAXiZaXi5FXjFZXipBXiQlXiRjXiZYXixYXiQlXipRXi4mXiZkXipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_129e747b47dd",
      "text": "或許有朝一日我會重返提奎茲爾村，向他賠罪和解。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$'^-s^$s^,^^!%^$a^$%^$r^))^7J^$A^5B^/D^&/^$z^*A^+?^!@^62^5x^\"O^(I^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQnXi1zXiRzXixeXiElXiRhXiQlXiRyXikpXjdKXiRBXjVCXi9EXiYvXiR6XipBXis/XiFAXjYyXjV4XiJPXihJXiEi",
      "byte_length": 69
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5fcb747776e5",
      "text": "那個江湖騙子滿嘴除了毀滅與救贖之外 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^!V^73^78^.{^#(^,{^+[^)Q^*D^%N^%t^'p^,Q^3-^!/^\"w ",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXiFWXjczXjc4Xi57XiMoXix7XitbXilRXipEXiVOXiV0XidwXixRXjMtXiEvXiJ3IA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bdc012a3eb23",
      "text": "什麼都不會說。哈！我曾告訴大家那種胡言亂語根本是無稽之談， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!=^.T^)$^!)^$r^-x^!\"^+F^*W^$%^.j^+B^-t^\"z^+s^)!^'$^3}^1Y^!3^0:^%)^$x^,X^%}^26^!/^0;^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiE9Xi5UXikkXiEpXiRyXi14XiEiXitGXipXXiQlXi5qXitCXi10XiJ6XitzXikhXickXjN9XjFZXiEzXjA6XiUpXiR4XixYXiV9XjI2XiEvXjA7XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fd2b9d2997eb",
      "text": "只會自招大禍。我可從沒見過那種荒唐的幻象。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"?^$r^'l^,D^\"z^7B^!\"^$%^\"A^#f^%\\^-m^(x^)!^'$^1W^55^&Z^#S^4g^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiI/XiRyXidsXixEXiJ6XjdCXiEiXiQlXiJBXiNmXiVcXi1tXih4XikhXickXjFXXjU1XiZaXiNTXjRnXiEi",
      "byte_length": 63
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4c76ebc695f7",
      "text": "只要區區35枚陶瓷幣，我就能為你們揭示命運——那些對你們隱匿的神秘天機。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"?^(C^\"+^\"+35^$~^)R^&E^+|^*A^$%^*J^'b^%{^*F^*{^$B^&s^\"N^.4^*n^*n^)!^!8^#:^*F^*{^)Y^7%^&Z^&w^1O^+e^%>^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiI/XihDXiIrXiIrMzVeJH5eKVJeJkVeK3xeKkFeJCVeKkpeJ2JeJXteKkZeKnteJEJeJnNeIk5eLjReKm5eKm5eKSFeITheIzpeKkZeKnteKVleNyVeJlpeJndeMU9eK2VeJT5eISIg",
      "byte_length": 105
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_210e379ed11a",
      "text": "你們願意支付嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^.H^#z^$L^*u^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7Xi5IXiN6XiRMXip1XitYXi5W",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2951859fa216",
      "text": "拉麗莎夫人閉上雙眼。她的臉部肌肉逐漸鬆弛， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$6^0z^/E^\"{^!<^.=^!'^)_^&d^!\"^+h^&Z^-\\^)#^7F^'^^(r^2v^.R^7,^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQ2XjB6Xi9FXiJ7XiE8Xi49XiEnXilfXiZkXiEiXitoXiZaXi1cXikjXjdGXideXihyXjJ2Xi5SXjcsXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e71f4aef965d",
      "text": "整個人陷入了一種恍惚出神的通靈狀態。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$T^!V^!<^)S^!f^*D^!%^'$^7-^7.^!q^&w^&Z^(t^)g^&7^#|^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRUXiFWXiE8XilTXiFmXipEXiElXickXjctXjcuXiFxXiZ3XiZaXih0XilnXiY3XiN8XiEi",
      "byte_length": 54
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c8934571a3df",
      "text": "請記住，無論禍福，你們都必須坦然擁抱自己的宿命。再會了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*S^(K^*z^*A^%}^1\\^7B^&z^*A^*F^*{^)$^#l^)r^7&^&\"^,M^,@^'l^#I^&Z^7+^\"N^!\"^!l^$r^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipTXihLXip6XipBXiV9XjFcXjdCXiZ6XipBXipGXip7XikkXiNsXilyXjcmXiYiXixNXixAXidsXiNJXiZaXjcrXiJOXiEiXiFsXiRyXipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 84
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8cbd50e59237",
      "text": "別把我當傻子耍。無所不知的我一眼就看出你們付不起占卜的費用。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*H^$1^$%^&N^7$^#(^7E^!\"^%}^$)^!)^&h^&Z^$%^!%^&d^*J^*Q^!q^*F^*{^*u^!)^.(^54^53^&Z^.\"^&H^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipIXiQxXiQlXiZOXjckXiMoXjdFXiEiXiV9XiQpXiEpXiZoXiZaXiQlXiElXiZkXipKXipRXiFxXipGXip7Xip1XiEpXi4oXjU0XjUzXiZaXi4iXiZIXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_86eaed11ad84",
      "text": "等你們湊夠了錢再來吧。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'-^*F^*{^77^+d^*D^.<^!l^!O^*I^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XictXipGXip7Xjc3XitkXipEXi48XiFsXiFPXipJXiEi",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_610adea9d645",
      "text": "拉麗莎夫人不動聲色地將你們給的硬幣收起，隨即開始 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$6^0z^/E^\"{^!<^!)^\"%^-W^'s^\"e^#7^*F^*{^'A^&Z^25^+|^$M^.(^*A^)X^\"1^)F^+k ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQ2XjB6Xi9FXiJ7XiE8XiEpXiIlXi1XXidzXiJlXiM3XipGXip7XidBXiZaXjI1Xit8XiRNXi4oXipBXilYXiIxXilGXitrIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e97b4192041f",
      "text": "吟誦起神秘的咒語。她雙目翻白，緩緩張開了雙臂。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^6L^7H^.(^&w^1O^&Z^\"P^0:^!\"^+h^)_^&^^-Q^&X^*A^'J^'J^,(^)F^*D^)_^'k^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XjZMXjdIXi4oXiZ3XjFPXiZaXiJQXjA6XiEiXitoXilfXiZeXi1RXiZYXipBXidKXidKXiwoXilGXipEXilfXidrXiEi",
      "byte_length": 69
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_590297af4a50",
      "text": "我看到……我看到了無辜者的鮮血四濺！純樸的商賈 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*Q^!u^*o^*o^$%^*Q^!u^*D^%}^66^'V^&Z^35^(:^\"[^7<^*W^3\"^72^&Z^1'^/J ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXipRXiF1XipvXipvXiQlXipRXiF1XipEXiV9XjY2XidWXiZaXjM1Xig6XiJbXjc8XipXXjMiXjcyXiZaXjEnXi9KIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ffd816545b05",
      "text": "遭逢強盜圍攻，生計被洗劫一空，但是，瞧啊！英勇的英雄們 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(}^7K^#]^0!^\"`^$O^*A^&F^-n^(@^0j^1l^!%^'(^*A^!I^,X^*A^-4^+Q^*W^'y^\"$^&Z^'y^)\\^*{ ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xih9XjdLXiNdXjAhXiJgXiRPXipBXiZGXi1uXihAXjBqXjFsXiElXicoXipBXiFJXixYXipBXi00XitRXipXXid5XiIkXiZaXid5XilcXip7IA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b502cd655341",
      "text": "挺身相助，並獲得了應得的獎賞。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,I^(c^&a^\"#^*A^!+^&:^#e^*D^0`^#e^&Z^7?^*T^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XixJXihjXiZhXiIjXipBXiErXiY6XiNlXipEXjBgXiNlXiZaXjc/XipUXiEi",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_726de912929d",
      "text": "啊……你們將踏上一場崇高的使命，橫越酷熱的沙漠！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+Q^*o^*o^*F^*{^#7^.,^!'^!%^\"n^13^*+^&Z^!N^\"N^*A^/2^(]^1b^&$^&Z^%]^,}^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XitRXipvXipvXipGXip7XiM3Xi4sXiEnXiElXiJuXjEzXiorXiZaXiFOXiJOXipBXi8yXihdXjFiXiYkXiZaXiVdXix9XipX",
      "byte_length": 72
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ec064d5f9a37",
      "text": "瑪格拉巨怪！你們將與牠們奮戰……並徹底戰勝那肆虐我們的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-*^%*^$6^#H^#s^*W^*F^*{^#7^'p^-#^*{^+g^$(^*o^*o^!+^18^/^^$(^+5^)!^2>^3)^$%^*{^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi0qXiUqXiQ2XiNIXiNzXipXXipGXip7XiM3XidwXi0jXip7XitnXiQoXipvXipvXiErXjE4Xi9eXiQoXis1XikhXjI+XjMpXiQlXip7XiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ceea79e9e9fc",
      "text": "邪惡孽物。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)\"^#y^5I^&4^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XikiXiN5XjVJXiY0XiEi",
      "byte_length": 15
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_548cdab9345c",
      "text": "哎呀！雙翼！你們四周籠罩著恐怖的羽翼——就像 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^3i^3h^*W^)_^'T^*W^*F^*{^\"[^\"L^'3^'P^-a^#t^#p^&Z^'S^'T^*n^*n^*J^!` ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjNpXjNoXipXXilfXidUXipXXipGXip7XiJbXiJMXiczXidQXi1hXiN0XiNwXiZaXidTXidUXipuXipuXipKXiFgIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9a1c0cecf6bb",
      "text": "襲擊我們的那些雙足飛龍巨獸。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^08^$F^$%^*{^&Z^)!^!8^)_^(^^)z^*>^#H^&<^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XjA4XiRGXiQlXip7XiZaXikhXiE4XilfXiheXil6Xio+XiNIXiY8XiEi",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7b7964739469",
      "text": "那雙翼如影隨形地追逐著你們，毫無喘息之機！但心地善良之人 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^)_^'T^#$^#a^)X^#_^\"e^(o^(r^-a^*F^*{^*A^/t^%}^+U^#w^!/^%>^*W^!I^#k^\"e^1(^1V^!/^!< ",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXilfXidUXiMkXiNhXilYXiNfXiJlXihvXihyXi1hXipGXip7XipBXi90XiV9XitVXiN3XiEvXiU+XipXXiFJXiNrXiJlXjEoXjFWXiEvXiE8IA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_895a1e5a90c2",
      "text": "終將蒙受命運的眷顧。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-H^#7^-c^\";^\"N^.4^&Z^7A^4n^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi1IXiM3Xi1jXiI7XiJOXi40XiZaXjdBXjRuXiEi",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7ee7b232dcb0",
      "text": "我看到了一層面紗……沒錯，面紗後正是你們的面孔。一支龐大的軍隊 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*Q^!u^*D^!%^#B^)j^-G^*o^*o^%\\^)5^*A^)j^-G^#b^%H^,X^*F^*{^&Z^)j^5G^!\"^!%^$L^6H^\"z^&Z^..^)U ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXipRXiF1XipEXiElXiNCXilqXi1HXipvXipvXiVcXik1XipBXilqXi1HXiNiXiVIXixYXipGXip7XiZaXilqXjVHXiEiXiElXiRMXjZIXiJ6XiZaXi4uXilVIA==",
      "byte_length": 94
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ff8cdd4abfcd",
      "text": "正開拔奔赴沙場，無數——無數生靈死於非命。戰爭的狼煙塵土 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%H^)F^/c^2b^.'^%]^\"n^*A^%}^$V^*n^*n^%}^$V^&F^)g^%L^$^^)i^\"N^!\"^$(^1I^&Z^21^4S^\"p^\"c ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVIXilGXi9jXjJiXi4nXiVdXiJuXipBXiV9XiRWXipuXipuXiV9XiRWXiZGXilnXiVMXiReXilpXiJOXiEiXiQoXjFJXiZaXjIxXjRTXiJwXiJjIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_caf856f81547",
      "text": "遮天蔽日，而你們……不，我再也看不清了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(~^+e^('^$a^*A^'W^*F^*{^*o^*o^!)^*A^$%^!l^!1^*Q^!)^,u^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xih+XitlXignXiRhXipBXidXXipGXip7XipvXipvXiEpXipBXiQlXiFsXiExXipRXiEpXix1XipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 60
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b800e77d710e",
      "text": "我看到了水——四處汪洋漫溢，卻污濁而惡臭難聞—— ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*Q^!u^*D^%V^*n^*n^\"[^(,^4K^75^2,^79^*A^1&^0h^7;^'W^#y^'m^)a^4^^*n^*n ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXipRXiF1XipEXiVWXipuXipuXiJbXigsXjRLXjc1XjIsXjc5XipBXjEmXjBoXjc7XidXXiN5XidtXilhXjReXipuXipuIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_95bcd21239d9",
      "text": "深水之下潛藏著無人能逃脫的邪惡。無辜者求饒的哀號呼救 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^2*^%V^!/^!(^7:^-f^-a^%}^!<^'b^(p^'c^&Z^)\"^#y^!\"^%}^66^'V^,n^.M^&Z^2`^(-^\"M^,Q ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjIqXiVWXiEvXiEoXjc6Xi1mXi1hXiV9XiE8XidiXihwXidjXiZaXikiXiN5XiEiXiV9XjY2XidWXixuXi5NXiZaXjJgXigtXiJNXixRIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d68e63d2d7a3",
      "text": "撕扯著我的耳膜，但你們的聲音並未混雜在其中。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^/k^.e^-a^$%^&Z^'Y^'j^*A^!I^*F^*{^&Z^-W^34^!+^,_^%n^0G^\"d^!j^!,^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi9rXi5lXi1hXiQlXiZaXidZXidqXipBXiFJXipGXip7XiZaXi1XXjM0XiErXixfXiVuXjBHXiJkXiFqXiEsXiEi",
      "byte_length": 66
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a9ca122eca90",
      "text": "你們的靈光閃耀著領袖的披風威儀， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^&Z^)g^!c^)E^7D^-a^)s^7G^&Z^6\\^)y^#&^+'^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiZaXilnXiFjXilFXjdEXi1hXilzXjdHXiZaXjZcXil5XiMmXisnXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 49
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f7686fdd5102",
      "text": "偉大的成就如影隨形地伴隨著你們。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*}^\"z^&Z^$$^*J^#$^#a^)X^#_^\"e^1h^)X^-a^*F^*{^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xip9XiJ6XiZaXiQkXipKXiMkXiNhXilYXiNfXiJlXjFoXilYXi1hXipGXip7XiEi",
      "byte_length": 48
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3abdfd248171",
      "text": "很抱歉。這一次我無法從你們的靈光中讀出任何預兆。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*K^,@^,h^!\"^(s^!%^%D^$%^%}^%b^#f^*F^*{^&Z^)g^!c^!,^7I^!q^!C^!L^.E^5/^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipLXixAXixoXiEiXihzXiElXiVEXiQlXiV9XiViXiNmXipGXip7XiZaXilnXiFjXiEsXjdJXiFxXiFDXiFMXi5FXjUvXiEi",
      "byte_length": 72
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_76faa5d2e390",
      "text": "她將錢退還到了你們手中。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+h^#7^.<^*V^.7^!u^*D^*F^*{^$+^!,^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XitoXiM3Xi48XipWXi43XiF1XipEXipGXip7XiQrXiEsXiEi",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_05bd082ab25f",
      "text": "一場驟起的風暴正困擾著你們的心靈。我看到了你們的痛苦。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!%^\"n^7M^.(^&Z^)y^$m^%H^\"^^$K^-a^*F^*{^&Z^#k^)g^!\"^$%^*Q^!u^*D^*F^*{^&Z^-.^.t^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiElXiJuXjdNXi4oXiZaXil5XiRtXiVIXiJeXiRLXi1hXipGXip7XiZaXiNrXilnXiEiXiQlXipRXiF1XipEXipGXip7XiZaXi0uXi50XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_02bab7e00d0e",
      "text": "你們試圖在結交的同伴身上尋求信任。切莫畏懼！將你們的信任 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^-u^\"b^\"d^'@^0P^&Z^\"E^1h^(c^!'^#9^,n^!U^!C^!\"^+.^/F^7@^$#^*W^#7^*F^*{^&Z^!U^!C ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7Xi11XiJiXiJkXidAXjBQXiZaXiJFXjFoXihjXiEnXiM5XixuXiFVXiFDXiEiXisuXi9GXjdAXiQjXipXXiM3XipGXip7XiZaXiFVXiFDIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9392ae1514bd",
      "text": "交付給信仰所歸之處。作為回報，真理必將 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^0P^*u^'A^!U^4,^$)^%K^!/^(,^!\"^!M^%{^\"\\^+`^*A^-2^&A^#l^#7 ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjBQXip1XidBXiFVXjQsXiQpXiVLXiEvXigsXiEiXiFNXiV7XiJcXitgXipBXi0yXiZBXiNsXiM3IA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_24dfad9d9d21",
      "text": "為你們帶來足以擔當那份信任的摯友。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%{^*F^*{^#N^!O^(^^!B^*N^&N^)!^*x^!U^!C^&Z^2#^\"8^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiV7XipGXip7XiNOXiFPXiheXiFCXipOXiZOXikhXip4XiFVXiFDXiZaXjIjXiI4XiEi",
      "byte_length": 51
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b0c0bb47db94",
      "text": "啊，你們正在尋找一片綠洲——殘酷無情的烈日炙烤著你們 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+Q^*A^*F^*{^%H^\"d^#9^$/^!%^&1^3V^76^*n^*n^,l^1b^%}^,0^&Z^%|^$a^7=^/w^-a^*F^*{ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitRXipBXipGXip7XiVIXiJkXiM5XiQvXiElXiYxXjNWXjc2XipuXipuXixsXjFiXiV9XiwwXiZaXiV8XiRhXjc9Xi93Xi1hXipGXip7IA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_138984d71099",
      "text": "毫無防護的頭頂。水源既是奧秘，亦是唯一的解方。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^/t^%}^)K^(T^&Z^)t^)p^!\"^%V^%q^,U^,X^6Q^1O^*A^7#^,X^+O^!%^&Z^(I^$]^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi90XiV9XilLXihUXiZaXil0XilwXiEiXiVWXiVxXixVXixYXjZRXjFPXipBXjcjXixYXitPXiElXiZaXihJXiRdXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_948fd8e897b3",
      "text": "萬物終將在它所化現的力量面前俯首稱臣。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-_^&4^-H^#7^\"d^+o^$)^\")^&?^&Z^!~^)*^)j^!z^5*^)~^0&^.s^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi1fXiY0Xi1IXiM3XiJkXitvXiQpXiIpXiY/XiZaXiF+XikqXilqXiF6XjUqXil+XjAmXi5zXiEi",
      "byte_length": 57
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_572d54a7a8f1",
      "text": "我預見到你們的未來充斥著血戰。你們必須做好準備！愚蠢之人 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^.E^-m^!u^*F^*{^&Z^,_^!O^5.^,S^-a^(:^$(^!\"^*F^*{^#l^)r^*~^+i^,x^+\"^*W^/a^.u^!/^!< ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXi5FXi1tXiF1XipGXip7XiZaXixfXiFPXjUuXixTXi1hXig6XiQoXiEiXipGXip7XiNsXilyXip+XitpXix4XisiXipXXi9hXi51XiEvXiE8IA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_abc54cf44557",
      "text": "盲目衝入險境；英雄迎面尋求挑戰；而懦夫 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&_^&^^-h^!f^*m^\"q^*C^'y^)\\^(k^)j^#9^,n^,H^$(^*C^'W^,7^\"{ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZfXiZeXi1oXiFmXiptXiJxXipDXid5XilcXihrXilqXiM5XixuXixIXiQoXipDXidXXiw3XiJ7IA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b7263e174715",
      "text": "則會被危險的利爪撕碎。你們必須勇敢直面自己的命運。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!x^$r^(@^2\\^*m^&Z^!t^&.^/k^&o^!\"^*F^*{^#l^)r^\"$^/m^&`^)j^'l^#I^&Z^\"N^.4^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiF4XiRyXihAXjJcXiptXiZaXiF0XiYuXi9rXiZvXiEiXipGXip7XiNsXilyXiIkXi9tXiZgXilqXidsXiNJXiZaXiJOXi40XiEi",
      "byte_length": 75
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c067b692d9c0",
      "text": "食腐猛禽在天際盤旋，沙蟲在荒丘下盲目鑽營。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^0J^0/^*P^7C^\"d^+e^30^1M^$`^*A^%]^(8^\"d^1W^5(^!(^&_^&^^7L^&'^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjBKXjAvXipQXjdDXiJkXitlXjMwXjFNXiRgXipBXiVdXig4XiJkXjFXXjUoXiEoXiZfXiZeXjdMXiYnXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b54fee2c064f",
      "text": "嫉妒與貪婪是生者在奔赴死亡途中所執迷的幻影。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^7*^7'^'p^1^^1-^,X^&F^'V^\"d^2b^.'^%L^!:^3.^!,^$)^3?^(n^&Z^#S^#a^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjcqXjcnXidwXjFeXjEtXixYXiZGXidWXiJkXjJiXi4nXiVMXiE6XjMuXiEsXiQpXjM/XihuXiZaXiNTXiNhXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e93556dc16d2",
      "text": "亡者對此毫不在意； ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!:^'V^#:^%I^/t^!)^\"d^#z^*C ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiE6XidWXiM6XiVJXi90XiEpXiJkXiN6XipDIA==",
      "byte_length": 28
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fab98bca2b25",
      "text": "他們慷慨地交出自己不再擁有的一切。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^*{^70^7/^\"e^0P^!q^'l^#I^!)^!l^,M^$s^&Z^!%^+.^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXip7XjcwXjcvXiJlXjBQXiFxXidsXiNJXiEpXiFsXixNXiRzXiZaXiElXisuXiEi",
      "byte_length": 51
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0140d134b8c6",
      "text": "你們的靈光沾染了奴隸制殘酷的烙印。當心！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^&Z^)g^!c^74^%%^*D^##^)Z^!v^,l^1b^&Z^7>^1%^!\"^&N^#k^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiZaXilnXiFjXjc0XiUlXipEXiMjXilaXiF2XixsXjFiXiZaXjc+XjElXiEiXiZOXiNrXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_578efd44956e",
      "text": "對自由的渴望既是奴隸唯一的救贖，卻也是 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#:^'l^&I^&Z^,w^,]^,U^,X^##^)Z^+O^!%^&Z^,Q^3-^*A^1&^!1^,X ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiM6XidsXiZJXiZaXix3XixdXixVXixYXiMjXilaXitPXiElXiZaXixRXjMtXipBXjEmXiExXixYIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9ac5fa78cf10",
      "text": "奴隸主最得心應手的恩賜，世間最殘酷的武器。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^##^)Z^!-^$q^#e^#k^0`^$+^&Z^#v^.#^*A^*p^)G^$q^,l^1b^&Z^%J^\"V^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiMjXilaXiEtXiRxXiNlXiNrXjBgXiQrXiZaXiN2Xi4jXipBXipwXilHXiRxXixsXjFiXiZaXiVKXiJWXiEi",
      "byte_length": 63
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e2785dbefaa3",
      "text": "我看你們與托布里安起了糾紛。既然雙方都在 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*Q^*F^*{^'p^/-^.`^)(^+p^.(^*D^3U^7d^!\"^,U^&\"^)_^$]^)$^\"d ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXipRXipGXip7XidwXi8tXi5gXikoXitwXi4oXipEXjNVXjdkXiEiXixVXiYiXilfXiRdXikkXiJkIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cd1cab633c2b",
      "text": "我面前，我會秉公審理這項指控。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^)j^!z^*A^$%^$r^7b^3:^7V^&A^(s^)q^$8^$@^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXilqXiF6XipBXiQlXiRyXjdiXjM6XjdWXiZBXihzXilxXiQ4XiRAXiEi",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_77b7ebbb14b8",
      "text": "瑪格拉巨怪",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-*^%*^$6^#H^#s",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi0qXiUqXiQ2XiNIXiNz",
      "byte_length": 15
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_da63a3065d4f",
      "text": "雙足飛龍騎兵",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)_^(^^)z^*>^0K^+,",
      "encoded_base64": "XilfXiheXil6Xio+XjBLXiss",
      "byte_length": 18
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5f072e9ed5a1",
      "text": "恭賀你們成功擊潰了 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^1{^7l^*F^*{^$$^\"!^$F^2-^*D ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjF7XjdsXipGXip7XiQkXiIhXiRGXjItXipEIA==",
      "byte_length": 28
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f5d6f6ebeada",
      "text": "！這個喜訊已經傳遍了整支商隊，我們由衷感激。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*W^(s^!V^+V^09^#J^'D^+$^69^*D^$T^$L^1'^)U^*A^$%^*{^&I^7i^#{^1H^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipXXihzXiFWXitWXjA5XiNKXidEXiskXjY5XipEXiRUXiRMXjEnXilVXipBXiQlXip7XiZJXjdpXiN7XjFIXiEi",
      "byte_length": 66
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e88851b2fb22",
      "text": "正如我所承諾的，這是給你們的獎賞。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%H^#$^$%^$)^$0^7k^&Z^*A^(s^,X^'A^*F^*{^&Z^7?^*T^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVIXiMkXiQlXiQpXiQwXjdrXiZaXipBXihzXixYXidBXipGXip7XiZaXjc/XipUXiEi",
      "byte_length": 51
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c7331a8eb3e8",
      "text": "你們好。我沒想到這麼快又見到你們了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^+i^!\"^$%^%\\^,1^!u^(s^.T^*L^+;^-m^!u^*F^*{^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XitpXiEiXiQlXiVcXiwxXiF1XihzXi5UXipMXis7Xi1tXiF1XipGXip7XipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_23a92da1518f",
      "text": "請自便，你們可以在訪客營地好好歇息。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*S^'l^!R^*A^*F^*{^\"A^!B^\"d^4d^+q^&'^\"e^+i^+i^%E^#w^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipTXidsXiFSXipBXipGXip7XiJBXiFCXiJkXjRkXitxXiYnXiJlXitpXitpXiVFXiN3XiEi",
      "byte_length": 54
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e8592b995737",
      "text": "問候各位！我是大篷車主德莉莎娜。如果各位有興致， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*Z^*|^+>^!J^*W^$%^,X^\"z^'1^5%^!-^#j^'{^/E^/*^!\"^#$^%!^+>^!J^$s^-]^'o^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipaXip8Xis+XiFKXipXXiQlXixYXiJ6XicxXjUlXiEtXiNqXid7Xi9FXi8qXiEiXiMkXiUhXis+XiFKXiRzXi1dXidvXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ed0a92f69242",
      "text": "我們這裡有包羅萬象的貨物可供挑選。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^(s^-j^$s^\"'^/?^-_^4g^&Z^.w^&4^\"A^!P^,H^.6^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7XihzXi1qXiRzXiInXi8/Xi1fXjRnXiZaXi53XiY0XiJBXiFQXixIXi42XiEi",
      "byte_length": 51
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3b3ce36025a6",
      "text": "當然，只要你們樂意。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&N^&\"^*A^\"?^(C^*F^*{^%8^#z^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZOXiYiXipBXiI/XihDXipGXip7XiU4XiN6XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 31
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_585f1ba0818d",
      "text": "  跟我說說車隊裡的商人們吧。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^.+^$%^-x^-x^5%^)U^-j^&Z^1'^!<^*{^*I^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLiteJCVeLXheLXheNSVeKVVeLWpeJlpeMSdeITxeKnteKkleISI=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d3faec534f24",
      "text": "  你們商隊目前的營運狀況如何？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^*{^1'^)U^&^^!z^&Z^&'^.4^&7^,q^#$^!L^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeKnteMSdeKVVeJl5eIXpeJlpeJideLjReJjdeLHFeIyReIUxeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_96af04004852",
      "text": "  跟我說說你們這支商隊的情況。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^.+^$%^-x^-x^*F^*{^(s^$L^1'^)U^&Z^,0^,q^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLiteJCVeLXheLXheKkZeKnteKHNeJExeMSdeKVVeJlpeLDBeLHFeISI=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3b22e251236c",
      "text": "我的榮幸， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^&Z^,e^15^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiZaXixlXjE1XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 16
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0b687462d1c9",
      "text": "你們是冒險者，對吧？在訪客營地那裡， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^,X^/P^*m^'V^*A^#:^*I^.V^\"d^4d^+q^&'^\"e^)!^-j^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XixYXi9QXiptXidWXipBXiM6XipJXi5WXiJkXjRkXitxXiYnXiJlXikhXi1qXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b475da95254b",
      "text": "你們會遇見許多和你們志同道合的人。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^$r^.2^-m^-s^\"x^\"O^*F^*{^#m^\"E^(y^\"C^&Z^!<^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiRyXi4yXi1tXi1zXiJ4XiJPXipGXip7XiNtXiJFXih5XiJDXiZaXiE8XiEi",
      "byte_length": 51
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_eb89b0b97aa7",
      "text": "祝你們 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&v^*F^*{ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZ2XipGXip7IA==",
      "byte_length": 10
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2d2408476175",
      "text": "討伐 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-o^5) ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi1vXjUpIA==",
      "byte_length": 7
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_29431cba5726",
      "text": " 的任務旗開得勝。",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^&Z^!C^+4^1B^)F^#e^+5^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4mWl4hQ14rNF4xQl4pRl4jZV4rNV4hIg==",
      "byte_length": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_942e16608517",
      "text": "旅途順利。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^2m^3.^.D^!t^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XjJtXjMuXi5EXiF0XiEi",
      "byte_length": 15
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_abb30d568b62",
      "text": "若你們要採購貨物，我推薦你們去看看 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'x^*F^*{^(C^5R^63^.w^&4^*A^$%^,J^7h^*F^*{^\"6^*Q^*Q ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xid4XipGXip7XihDXjVSXjYzXi53XiY0XipBXiQlXixKXjdoXipGXip7XiI2XipRXipRIA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_43c119157eae",
      "text": "拉麗莎、凱爾",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$6^0z^/E^!!^!p^&/",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQ2XjB6Xi9FXiEhXiFwXiYv",
      "byte_length": 18
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_631eb5315d9b",
      "text": "、托布里安",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!!^/-^.`^)(^+p",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEhXi8tXi5gXikoXitw",
      "byte_length": 15
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0cd1dcad3495",
      "text": "與賈克的大車。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'p^/J^!d^&Z^\"z^5%^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XidwXi9KXiFkXiZaXiJ6XjUlXiEi",
      "byte_length": 21
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4075fcf807e2",
      "text": "  托布里安是做什麼生意的？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^/-^.`^)(^+p^,X^*~^!=^.T^&F^#z^&Z^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLy1eLmBeKSheK3BeLFheKn5eIT1eLlReJkZeI3peJlpeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ed5ee42373fe",
      "text": "  我在哪裡可以找到托布里安？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^\"d^+I^-j^\"A^!B^$/^!u^/-^.`^)(^+p^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeImReK0leLWpeIkFeIUJeJC9eIXVeLy1eLmBeKSheK3BeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d81224e51767",
      "text": "  拉麗莎是做什麼生意的？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$6^0z^/E^,X^*~^!=^.T^&F^#z^&Z^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJDZeMHpeL0VeLFheKn5eIT1eLlReJkZeI3peJlpeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_96823529a494",
      "text": "  我在哪裡可以找到拉麗莎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^\"d^+I^-j^\"A^!B^$/^!u^$6^0z^/E^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeImReK0leLWpeIkFeIUJeJC9eIXVeJDZeMHpeL0VeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_aa9c94a9319f",
      "text": "  凱爾是做什麼生意的？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^!p^&/^,X^*~^!=^.T^&F^#z^&Z^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIXBeJi9eLFheKn5eIT1eLlReJkZeI3peJlpeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e6efedf1376d",
      "text": "  我在哪裡可以找到凱爾？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^\"d^+I^-j^\"A^!B^$/^!u^!p^&/^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeImReK0leLWpeIkFeIUJeJC9eIXVeIXBeJi9eLlY=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_89f6e5db6e1b",
      "text": "  賈克是做什麼生意的？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^/J^!d^,X^*~^!=^.T^&F^#z^&Z^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeL0peIWReLFheKn5eIT1eLlReJkZeI3peJlpeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_219fa0bb12c8",
      "text": "  我在哪裡可以找到賈克？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^\"d^+I^-j^\"A^!B^$/^!u^/J^!d^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeImReK0leLWpeIkFeIUJeJC9eIXVeL0peIWReLlY=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6da1557d7f5d",
      "text": "毫無疑問，我們以前賺得比現在多得多， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^/t^%}^0p^*Z^*A^$%^*{^!B^!z^7m^#e^,m^&?^\"d^\"x^#e^\"x^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi90XiV9XjBwXipaXipBXiQlXip7XiFCXiF6XjdtXiNlXixtXiY/XiJkXiJ4XiNlXiJ4XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3e45bf891104",
      "text": "但掠奪者逼得我們只能躲入荒漠深處，只有像你們這樣的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!I^1<^1,^'V^.1^#e^$%^*{^\"?^'b^0C^!f^1W^,}^2*^(,^*A^\"?^$s^!`^*F^*{^(s^,f^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFJXjE8XjEsXidWXi4xXiNlXiQlXip7XiI/XidiXjBDXiFmXjFXXix9XjIqXigsXipBXiI/XiRzXiFgXipGXip7XihzXixmXiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4288816ceae3",
      "text": "旅人才能找到我們。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^2m^!<^$,^'b^$/^!u^$%^*{^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XjJtXiE8XiQsXidiXiQvXiF1XiQlXip7XiEi",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e57dba3e6bba",
      "text": "自從你們出手相助之後，我們的生意好轉了許多， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'l^#f^*F^*{^!q^$+^&a^\"#^!/^#b^*A^$%^*{^&Z^&F^#z^+i^(i^*D^-s^\"x^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XidsXiNmXipGXip7XiFxXiQrXiZhXiIjXiEvXiNiXipBXiQlXip7XiZaXiZGXiN6XitpXihpXipEXi1zXiJ4XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2f238776cc3d",
      "text": "我們徹底擺脫了所有襲擊的威脅。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^18^/^^1@^'c^*D^$)^$s^08^$F^&Z^#&^1T^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7XjE4Xi9eXjFAXidjXipEXiQpXiRzXjA4XiRGXiZaXiMmXjFUXiEi",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_96e3249aefd1",
      "text": "阻止了瑪格拉巨怪前來劫掠。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)L^%G^*D^-*^%*^$6^#H^#s^!z^!O^1l^1<^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XilMXiVHXipEXi0qXiUqXiQ2XiNIXiNzXiF6XiFPXjFsXjE8XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 40
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1e95d8035093",
      "text": "剷除了那些雙足飛龍騎兵。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^2Y^)Q^*D^)!^!8^)_^(^^)z^*>^0K^+,^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjJZXilRXipEXikhXiE4XilfXiheXil6Xio+XjBLXissXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 37
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_af33ad618d55",
      "text": "如果你們能像當初承諾的那樣剷除強盜， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#$^%!^*F^*{^'b^!`^&N^1\"^$0^7k^&Z^)!^,f^2Y^)Q^#]^0!^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiMkXiUhXipGXip7XidiXiFgXiZOXjEiXiQwXjdrXiZaXikhXixmXjJZXilRXiNdXjAhXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ed48eb7ac49b",
      "text": "我們的處境一定會比現在好得多。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^&Z^(,^\"q^!%^#.^$r^,m^&?^\"d^+i^#e^\"x^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7XiZaXigsXiJxXiElXiMuXiRyXixtXiY/XiJkXitpXiNlXiJ4XiEi",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7d9bef1af404",
      "text": "但如今，我們依然飽受永無休止的劫掠之苦。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!I^#$^*E^*A^$%^*{^!Q^&\"^7r^\";^%W^%}^!G^%G^&Z^1l^1<^!/^.t^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFJXiMkXipFXipBXiQlXip7XiFRXiYiXjdyXiI7XiVXXiV9XiFHXiVHXiZaXjFsXjE8XiEvXi50XiEi",
      "byte_length": 60
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5a887c047cb0",
      "text": "我們過去常和城裡人做生意，在城牆外扎營設市； ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^(x^\"6^#O^\"O^+_^-j^!<^*~^&F^#z^*A^\"d^+_^&0^\"w^,=^&'^4e^+z^*C ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7Xih4XiI2XiNPXiJPXitfXi1qXiE8Xip+XiZGXiN6XipBXiJkXitfXiYwXiJ3Xiw9XiYnXjRlXit6XipDIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7a89f1094da5",
      "text": "但現在我們只跟尋常旅客打交道。我們只是在等待時機， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!I^&?^\"d^$%^*{^\"?^.+^#9^#O^2m^+q^$-^0P^(y^!\"^$%^*{^\"?^,X^\"d^'-^,*^$f^%>^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFJXiY/XiJkXiQlXip7XiI/Xi4rXiM5XiNPXjJtXitxXiQtXjBQXih5XiEiXiQlXip7XiI/XixYXiJkXictXiwqXiRmXiU+XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_53e6294de43e",
      "text": "靜觀這鍋大亂鬥何時煮沸。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)h^*R^(s^)7^\"z^!3^*,^!L^$f^7`^5\\^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiloXipSXihzXik3XiJ6XiEzXiosXiFMXiRmXjdgXjVcXiEi",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cd892ab34d7f",
      "text": "  妳說的「大亂鬥」是指什麼？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^7(^-x^&Z^!#^\"z^!3^*,^!$^,X^$8^!=^.T^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeNyheLXheJlpeISNeInpeITNeKixeISReLFheJDheIT1eLlReLlY=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_849ce05a4ef7",
      "text": "  你們過去和城裡做的是什麼買賣？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^*{^(x^\"6^\"O^+_^-j^*~^&Z^,X^!=^.T^.!^.$^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeKnteKHheIjZeIk9eK19eLWpeKn5eJlpeLFheIT1eLlReLiFeLiReLlY=",
      "byte_length": 47
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_58c83e238ef4",
      "text": "  你們為何要在此靜待時機？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^*{^%{^!L^(C^\"d^%I^)h^,*^$f^%>^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeKnteJXteIUxeKENeImReJUleKWheLCpeJGZeJT5eLlY=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0c43e07423d8",
      "text": "  妳有聽到關於德拉吉的任何消息嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^7(^$s^-X^!u^.>^$^^#j^$6^\"D^&Z^!C^!L^%k^#w^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeNyheJHNeLVheIXVeLj5eJF5eI2peJDZeIkReJlpeIUNeIUxeJWteI3deK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 50
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5c57d69c8366",
      "text": "隨著你們輝煌地挫敗了德拉吉，各處村落勢必 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)X^-a^*F^*{^2K^2.^\"e^7]^$R^*D^#j^$6^\"D^*A^+>^(,^$z^-`^\"&^#l ",
      "encoded_base64": "XilYXi1hXipGXip7XjJLXjIuXiJlXjddXiRSXipEXiNqXiQ2XiJEXipBXis+XigsXiR6Xi1gXiImXiNsIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_079a3cc4bd46",
      "text": "迎來繁榮貿易的絕佳良機。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(k^!O^-N^,e^6/^,W^&Z^-I^7P^1V^%>^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XihrXiFPXi1OXixlXjYvXixXXiZaXi1JXjdQXjFWXiU+XiEi",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_00702f5c092e",
      "text": "德拉吉與各個奴隸村莊之間的衝突越激烈， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#j^$6^\"D^'p^+>^!V^##^)Z^$z^6l^!/^)G^&Z^-h^'*^(]^1H^%|^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNqXiQ2XiJEXidwXis+XiFWXiMjXilaXiR6XjZsXiEvXilHXiZaXi1oXicqXihdXjFIXiV8XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e3e77252142a",
      "text": "對我們的生意就越有利。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#:^$%^*{^&Z^&F^#z^*J^(]^$s^!t^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiM6XiQlXip7XiZaXiZGXiN6XipKXihdXiRzXiF0XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bf9e3be46e71",
      "text": "只不過我們現在正遭受強盜圍困。我真不知道 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"?^!)^(x^$%^*{^&?^\"d^%H^(}^\";^#]^0!^\"`^\"^^!\"^$%^-2^!)^&h^(y ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiI/XiEpXih4XiQlXip7XiY/XiJkXiVIXih9XiI7XiNdXjAhXiJgXiJeXiEiXiQlXi0yXiEpXiZoXih5IA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_92fd50033961",
      "text": "我們還能在這裡苦撐多久。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^.7^'b^\"d^(s^-j^.t^,L^\"x^!.^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7Xi43XidiXiJkXihzXi1qXi50XixMXiJ4XiEuXiEi",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6424a3735a68",
      "text": "雙方都亟需不惜一切代價填滿物資儲備， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)_^$]^)$^7O^)e^!)^7X^!%^+.^*v^+&^7U^,{^&4^(X^+*^+\"^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XilfXiRdXikkXjdPXillXiEpXjdYXiElXisuXip2XismXjdVXix7XiY0XihYXisqXisiXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_86b88f60bfc7",
      "text": "以供養並武裝他們不斷擴充的軍隊。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!B^!P^.I^!+^%J^(A^!@^*{^!)^,T^$J^5.^&Z^..^)U^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFCXiFQXi5JXiErXiVKXihBXiFAXip7XiEpXixUXiRKXjUuXiZaXi4uXilVXiEi",
      "byte_length": 48
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8bd81fe7c4d6",
      "text": "  是誰在襲擊你們的商隊？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^,X^-y^\"d^08^$F^*F^*{^&Z^1'^)U^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLFheLXleImReMDheJEZeKkZeKnteJlpeMSdeKVVeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7a279da22166",
      "text": "  這些強盜是從哪裡來的？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^(s^!8^#]^0!^,X^#f^+I^-j^!O^&Z^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKHNeITheI11eMCFeLFheI2ZeK0leLWpeIU9eJlpeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3b586f17231f",
      "text": "  跟我說說瑪格拉巨怪的事。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^.+^$%^-x^-x^-*^%*^$6^#H^#s^&Z^*r^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLiteJCVeLXheLXheLSpeJSpeJDZeI0heI3NeJlpeKnJeISI=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f95a8748ff57",
      "text": "  跟我說說雙足飛龍騎兵的事。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^.+^$%^-x^-x^)_^(^^)z^*>^0K^+,^&Z^*r^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLiteJCVeLXheLXheKV9eKF5eKXpeKj5eMEteKyxeJlpeKnJeISI=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a98f09f54d0d",
      "text": "  你們為何不換去別的城邦？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^*{^%{^!L^!)^4@^\"6^*H^&Z^+_^1a^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeKnteJXteIUxeISleNEBeIjZeKkheJlpeK19eMWFeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_12a4681b91b5",
      "text": "我們的主要營生是將德拉吉盛產的穀物和麻料 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^&Z^!-^(C^&'^&F^,X^#7^#j^$6^\"D^1L^&G^&Z^'%^&4^\"O^*6^/n ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7XiZaXiEtXihDXiYnXiZGXixYXiM3XiNqXiQ2XiJEXjFMXiZHXiZaXiclXiY0XiJPXio2Xi9uIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4ecdb60fecea",
      "text": "運送到拉姆和烏里克。此外，我們作為本地工匠與商賈的中介 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.4^./^!u^$6^#%^\"O^/4^)(^!d^!\"^%I^\"w^*A^$%^*{^!M^%{^$x^\"e^+y^7S^'p^1'^/J^&Z^!,^!> ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi40Xi4vXiF1XiQ2XiMlXiJPXi80XikoXiFkXiEiXiVJXiJ3XipBXiQlXip7XiFNXiV7XiR4XiJlXit5XjdTXidwXjEnXi9KXiZaXiEsXiE+IA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fed221e31afa",
      "text": "也能賺取豐厚的即時差價利潤。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!1^'b^7m^\":^4!^\"4^&Z^\"1^$f^48^+&^!t^7_^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiExXidiXjdtXiI6XjQhXiI0XiZaXiIxXiRmXjQ4XismXiF0XjdfXiEi",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b7aea30b231d",
      "text": "戰爭正是大發橫財的良機。現在物資的售價 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$(^1I^%H^,X^\"z^&W^/2^0=^&Z^1V^%>^!\"^&?^\"d^&4^(X^&Z^56^+& ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQoXjFJXiVIXixYXiJ6XiZXXi8yXjA9XiZaXjFWXiU+XiEiXiY/XiJkXiY0XihYXiZaXjU2XismIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_be10150c26e8",
      "text": "已經暴漲到平時的兩倍之多",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#J^'D^$m^7^^!u^0Y^$f^&Z^!i^!W^!/^\"x",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNKXidEXiRtXjdeXiF1XjBZXiRmXiZaXiFpXiFXXiEvXiJ4",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9f02e0a9589a",
      "text": "城內動亂四起的傳聞，讓我們覺得在此按兵不動等待 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+_^!g^\"%^!3^\"[^.(^&Z^+$^4^^*A^-}^$%^*{^(G^#e^\"d^%I^$9^+,^!)^\"%^'-^,* ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitfXiFnXiIlXiEzXiJbXi4oXiZaXiskXjReXipBXi19XiQlXip7XihHXiNlXiJkXiVJXiQ5XissXiEpXiIlXictXiwqIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_301c97271b54",
      "text": "十分值得",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*Y^!s^!Z^#e",
      "encoded_base64": "XipZXiFzXiFaXiNl",
      "byte_length": 12
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_42b3f624fb0c",
      "text": "所有的奴隸村莊都群情激憤，而城邦的衛隊 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$)^$s^&Z^##^)Z^$z^6l^)$^'R^,0^1H^7Y^*A^'W^+_^1a^&Z^(=^)U ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQpXiRzXiZaXiMjXilaXiR6XjZsXikkXidSXiwwXjFIXjdZXipBXidXXitfXjFhXiZaXig9XilVIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_15c2f0ff6993",
      "text": "願意為補給物資掏出任何高價",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.H^#z^%{^6&^'A^&4^(X^/f^!q^!C^!L^*+^+&",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi5IXiN6XiV7XjYmXidBXiY0XihYXi9mXiFxXiFDXiFMXiorXism",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c651f23fd498",
      "text": "如今德拉吉的軍隊已經龜縮回城牆之內，亟需物資 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#$^*E^#j^$6^\"D^&Z^..^)U^#J^'D^7s^3X^\"\\^+_^&0^!/^!g^*A^7O^)e^&4^(X ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiMkXipFXiNqXiQ2XiJEXiZaXi4uXilVXiNKXidEXjdzXjNYXiJcXitfXiYwXiEvXiFnXipBXjdPXillXiY0XihYIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_224ad8ecb34e",
      "text": "來填補原本靠劫掠才能獲得的缺口",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!O^7U^6&^\"5^$x^.C^1l^1<^$,^'b^&:^#e^&Z^7e^\"<",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFPXjdVXjYmXiI1XiR4Xi5DXjFsXjE8XiQsXidiXiY6XiNlXiZaXjdlXiI8",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_825cb5b2b159",
      "text": "。物價肯定還會進一步飆漲。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!\"^&4^+&^-Z^#.^.7^$r^(w^!%^,i^7q^7^^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEiXiY0XismXi1aXiMuXi43XiRyXih3XiElXixpXjdxXjdeXiEi",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e365f3eacc60",
      "text": "不久前有位聖堂武士路過這裡——他說他寧可去投奔 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^!.^!z^$s^!J^'Z^42^%J^+a^(a^(x^(s^-j^*n^*n^!@^-x^!@^3k^\"A^\"6^$3^2b ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXiEuXiF6XiRzXiFKXidaXjQyXiVKXithXihhXih4XihzXi1qXipuXipuXiFAXi14XiFAXjNrXiJBXiI2XiQzXjJiIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a4ba8d159d1b",
      "text": "另一位巫王碰碰運氣，因為特克圖克特雷已經 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\">^!%^!J^14^-)^-5^-5^.4^%U^*A^\"]^%{^&5^!d^\"b^!d^&5^)c^#J^'D ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiI+XiElXiFKXjE0Xi0pXi01Xi01Xi40XiVVXipBXiJdXiV7XiY1XiFkXiJiXiFkXiY1XiljXiNKXidEIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d50a473dbc8d",
      "text": "遺棄了他的聖堂武士們。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^0v^,a^*D^!@^&Z^'Z^42^%J^+a^*{^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XjB2XixhXipEXiFAXiZaXidaXjQyXiVKXithXip7XiEi",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2aab9109d169",
      "text": "聖堂武士正在煽動德拉吉居民投入戰爭，藉著奴隸村莊叛亂的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'Z^42^%J^+a^%H^\"d^7a^\"%^#j^$6^\"D^+w^%T^$3^!f^$(^1I^*A^04^-a^##^)Z^$z^6l^.Z^!3^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XidaXjQyXiVKXithXiVIXiJkXjdhXiIlXiNqXiQ2XiJEXit3XiVUXiQzXiFmXiQoXjFJXipBXjA0Xi1hXiMjXilaXiR6XjZsXi5aXiEzXiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5f41b9ccfb41",
      "text": "陰影作為藉口搶奪物資。他們宣稱要徹底肅清荒漠…… ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^6B^#a^!M^%{^04^\"<^1?^1,^&4^(X^!\"^!@^*{^2d^0&^(C^18^/^^5y^,u^1W^,}^*o^*o ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjZCXiNhXiFNXiV7XjA0XiI8XjE/XjEsXiY0XihYXiEiXiFAXip7XjJkXjAmXihDXjE4Xi9eXjV5Xix1XjFXXix9XipvXipvIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_056f2ccace31",
      "text": "至少他們嘴上是這麼說的。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'n^#<^!@^*{^+[^!'^,X^(s^.T^-x^&Z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiduXiM8XiFAXip7XitbXiEnXixYXihzXi5UXi14XiZaXiEi",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b54ea33c454d",
      "text": "我剛派了一名管事押送一整大車的補給物資前往德拉吉。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^+0^.n^*D^!%^\"F^-D^*r^7Z^./^!%^$T^\"z^5%^&Z^6&^'A^&4^(X^!z^,)^#j^$6^\"D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiswXi5uXipEXiElXiJGXi1EXipyXjdaXi4vXiElXiRUXiJ6XjUlXiZaXjYmXidBXiY0XihYXiF6XiwpXiNqXiQ2XiJEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8e57af2007ed",
      "text": "如今大批戰士軍團集結在城牆內， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#$^*E^\"z^2i^$(^+a^..^0V^)]^'@^\"d^+_^&0^!g^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiMkXipFXiJ6XjJpXiQoXithXi4uXjBWXildXidAXiJkXitfXiYwXiFnXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3ebac4b3ea86",
      "text": "他這批貨肯定能賣出天價。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^(s^2i^.w^-Z^#.^'b^.$^!q^+e^+&^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXihzXjJpXi53Xi1aXiMuXidiXi4kXiFxXitlXismXiEi",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9ffc577213fd",
      "text": "德拉吉那邊目前音訊全無。究竟他們是在舔舐傷口， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#j^$6^\"D^)!^.8^&^^!z^34^09^!h^%}^!\"^-<^28^!@^*{^,X^\"d^7g^7f^!^^\"<^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNqXiQ2XiJEXikhXi44XiZeXiF6XjM0XjA5XiFoXiV9XiEiXi08XjI4XiFAXip7XixYXiJkXjdnXjdmXiFeXiI8XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3a5048064f30",
      "text": "還是在密謀策劃什麼大動作，誰也說不準。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.7^,X^\"d^#0^3~^5p^4s^!=^.T^\"z^\"%^!M^*A^-y^!1^-x^!)^,x^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi43XixYXiJkXiMwXjN+XjVwXjRzXiE9Xi5UXiJ6XiIlXiFNXipBXi15XiExXi14XiEpXix4XiEi",
      "byte_length": 57
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a8a38f0d583c",
      "text": "有兩夥掠奪者不斷襲擊我們。一夥是頑固糾纏不休、 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$s^!i^5?^1<^1,^'V^!)^,T^08^$F^$%^*{^!\"^!%^5?^,X^4%^3>^3U^'N^!)^!G^!! ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRzXiFpXjU/XjE8XjEsXidWXiEpXixUXjA4XiRGXiQlXip7XiEiXiElXjU/XixYXjQlXjM+XjNVXidOXiEpXiFHXiEhIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f74bfacade7a",
      "text": "兇殘致命的瑪格拉巨怪；另一夥則是騎乘著雙足飛龍的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*G^,l^'o^\"N^&Z^-*^%*^$6^#H^#s^*C^\">^!%^5?^!x^,X^0K^0O^-a^)_^(^^)z^*>^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipHXixsXidvXiJOXiZaXi0qXiUqXiQ2XiNIXiNzXipDXiI+XiElXjU/XiF4XixYXjBLXjBPXi1hXilfXiheXil6Xio+XiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_61e0f5e8aebc",
      "text": "狂暴強盜！他們令人膽戰心驚。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&8^$m^#]^0!^*W^!@^*{^*w^!<^-[^$(^#k^.Q^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiY4XiRtXiNdXjAhXipXXiFAXip7Xip3XiE8Xi1bXiQoXiNrXi5RXiEi",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c12b5af0a6de",
      "text": "我也不清楚他們究竟是何方神聖——大概是尋常盜匪 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^!1^!)^,u^,c^!@^*{^-<^28^,X^!L^$]^&w^'Z^*n^*n^\"z^,d^,X^#9^#O^0!^3g ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiExXiEpXix1XixjXiFAXip7Xi08XjI4XixYXiFMXiRdXiZ3XidaXipuXipuXiJ6XixkXixYXiM5XiNPXjAhXjNnIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2b60662eee81",
      "text": "不知透過什麼門路弄到了雙足飛龍。商隊若想生存下去， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^&h^(q^(x^!=^.T^)D^(a^/`^!u^*D^)_^(^^)z^*>^!\"^1'^)U^'x^,1^&F^#*^!(^\"6^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXiZoXihxXih4XiE9Xi5UXilEXihhXi9gXiF1XipEXilfXiheXil6Xio+XiEiXjEnXilVXid4XiwxXiZGXiMqXiEoXiI2XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2c220ecbbee9",
      "text": "就必須徹底遏止這些劫掠！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*J^#l^)r^18^/^^7n^%G^(s^!8^1l^1<^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XipKXiNsXilyXjE4Xi9eXjduXiVHXihzXiE4XjFsXjE8XipX",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c0f7f83dfe1a",
      "text": "一支部族的瑪格拉巨怪正在禍害我們。他們的組織紀律 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!%^$L^)#^5V^&Z^-*^%*^$6^#H^#s^%H^\"d^7B^#/^$%^*{^!\"^!@^*{^&Z^2;^3z^2:^7W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiElXiRMXikjXjVWXiZaXi0qXiUqXiQ2XiNIXiNzXiVIXiJkXjdCXiMvXiQlXip7XiEiXiFAXip7XiZaXjI7XjN6XjI6XjdXIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d60206c15114",
      "text": "遠比尋常的同類流竄劫掠者嚴密得多。他們的首領 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^({^,m^#9^#O^&Z^\"E^)w^%j^7c^1l^1<^'V^1*^#0^#e^\"x^!\"^!@^*{^&Z^)~^)s ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xih7XixtXiM5XiNPXiZaXiJFXil3XiVqXjdjXjFsXjE8XidWXjEqXiMwXiNlXiJ4XiEiXiFAXip7XiZaXil+XilzIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1b5c9c863133",
      "text": "要麼卓爾不群，要麼根本就不是瑪格拉巨怪。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(C^.T^/#^&/^!)^'R^*A^(C^.T^%)^$x^*J^!)^,X^-*^%*^$6^#H^#s^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XihDXi5UXi8jXiYvXiEpXidSXipBXihDXi5UXiUpXiR4XipKXiEpXixYXi0qXiUqXiQ2XiNIXiNzXiEi",
      "byte_length": 60
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a2c7299a12e5",
      "text": "野蠻的畜生！他們總是九到十人結成小股突襲——一擊即退。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.:^/H^&Z^5f^&F^*W^!@^*{^-M^,X^7N^!u^*Y^!<^'@^$$^#;^'_^'*^08^*n^*n^!%^$F^\"1^*V^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi46Xi9IXiZaXjVmXiZGXipXXiFAXip7Xi1NXixYXjdOXiF1XipZXiE8XidAXiQkXiM7XidfXicqXjA4XipuXipuXiElXiRGXiIxXipWXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_15851863f681",
      "text": "他們雖然搶不走多少大件物資，卻嚴重啃食著我們的利潤。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^*{^.A^&\"^1?^!)^.&^\"x^#<^\"z^.W^&4^(X^*A^1&^1*^))^7T^0J^-a^$%^*{^&Z^!t^7_^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXip7Xi5BXiYiXjE/XiEpXi4mXiJ4XiM8XiJ6Xi5XXiY0XihYXipBXjEmXjEqXikpXjdUXjBKXi1hXiQlXip7XiZaXiF0XjdfXiEi",
      "byte_length": 78
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_eeeb4fae8163",
      "text": "那些雙足飛龍騎兵簡直是一場浩劫！當他們從高空呼嘯俯衝而下時， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^!8^)_^(^^)z^*>^0K^+,^3y^&`^,X^!%^\"n^5^^1l^*W^&N^!@^*{^#f^*+^'(^\"M^0U^5*^-h^'W^!(^$f^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXiE4XilfXiheXil6Xio+XjBLXissXjN5XiZgXixYXiElXiJuXjVeXjFsXipXXiZOXiFAXip7XiNmXiorXicoXiJNXjBVXjUqXi1oXidXXiEoXiRmXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_156334a470ff",
      "text": "商隊根本無從防禦。連德拉吉都曾遭受他們的襲擊， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^1'^)U^%)^$x^%}^#f^)K^&{^!\"^.0^#j^$6^\"D^)$^.j^(}^\";^!@^*{^&Z^08^$F^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjEnXilVXiUpXiR4XiV9XiNmXilLXiZ7XiEiXi4wXiNqXiQ2XiJEXikkXi5qXih9XiI7XiFAXip7XiZaXjA4XiRGXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4f8fa0947f98",
      "text": "並派遣軍隊前去圍剿這夥強盜。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!+^.n^4k^..^)U^!z^\"6^\"`^7R^(s^5?^#]^0!^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiErXi5uXjRrXi4uXilVXiF6XiI2XiJgXjdSXihzXjU/XiNdXjAhXiEi",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cbf70f605aad",
      "text": "這兩夥強盜",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^!i^5?^#]^0!",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXiFpXjU/XiNdXjAh",
      "byte_length": 15
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e38785115140",
      "text": "他們",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^*{",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXip7",
      "byte_length": 6
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ee1ccc1cef47",
      "text": " 都來自南方，通常趁著日落昏暗難以察覺時出擊， ",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^)$^!O^'l^\"/^$]^*A^(t^#O^.)^-a^$a^-`^$d^$k^)a^!B^#2^(G^$f^!q^$F^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4pJF4hT14nbF4iL14kXV4qQV4odF4jT14uKV4tYV4kYV4tYF4kZF4ka14pYV4hQl4jMl4oR14kZl4hcV4kRl4qQSA=",
      "byte_length": 68
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_02f5de210dfa",
      "text": "但誰也說不準他們的真正老巢在哪裡。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!I^-y^!1^-x^!)^,x^!@^*{^&Z^-2^%H^'U^#G^\"d^+I^-j^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFJXi15XiExXi14XiEpXix4XiFAXip7XiZaXi0yXiVIXidVXiNHXiJkXitJXi1qXiEi",
      "byte_length": 51
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c47e2054c5eb",
      "text": "德拉吉備戰所帶來的商機實在太巨大了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#j^$6^\"D^+\"^$(^$)^#N^!O^&Z^1'^%>^#3^\"d^+f^#H^\"z^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNqXiQ2XiJEXisiXiQoXiQpXiNOXiFPXiZaXjEnXiU+XiMzXiJkXitmXiNIXiJ6XipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_42c57af2f3f1",
      "text": "只要物價飆升，我們就能把所有的損失連本帶利賺回來。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"?^(C^&4^+&^7q^\",^*A^$%^*{^*J^'b^$1^$)^$s^&Z^$D^\"|^.0^$x^#N^!t^7m^\"\\^!O^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiI/XihDXiY0XismXjdxXiIsXipBXiQlXip7XipKXidiXiQxXiQpXiRzXiZaXiREXiJ8Xi4wXiR4XiNOXiF0XjdtXiJcXiFPXiEi",
      "byte_length": 75
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5008c9ccbc90",
      "text": "請稍等片刻！你們有興趣為我效勞嗎？只要你們肯動用 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*S^-:^'-^&1^.Y^*W^*F^*{^$s^-]^.*^%{^$%^$Q^/R^+X^.V^\"?^(C^*F^*{^-Z^\"%^&H ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipTXi06XictXiYxXi5ZXipXXipGXip7XiRzXi1dXi4qXiV7XiQlXiRRXi9SXitYXi5WXiI/XihDXipGXip7Xi1aXiIlXiZIIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_28aa08a03b02",
      "text": "刀劍出點力，我會付給你們極其優厚的酬勞。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^7Q^!|^!q^*;^!~^*A^$%^$r^*u^'A^*F^*{^1D^!j^+)^\"4^&Z^7o^/R^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XjdRXiF8XiFxXio7XiF+XipBXiQlXiRyXip1XidBXipGXip7XjFEXiFqXispXiI0XiZaXjdvXi9SXiEi",
      "byte_length": 60
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4f4fcc541f0c",
      "text": "你們對哪一項任務感興趣？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^#:^+I^!%^)q^!C^+4^#{^-]^.*^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiM6XitJXiElXilxXiFDXis0XiN7Xi1dXi4qXi5W",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8e55fefed24a",
      "text": "  對付雙足飛龍騎兵。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^#:^*u^)_^(^^)z^*>^0K^+,^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIzpeKnVeKV9eKF5eKXpeKj5eMEteKyxeISI=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c6b2ac6980b6",
      "text": "  對付瑪格拉掠奪者。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^#:^*u^-*^%*^$6^1<^1,^'V^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIzpeKnVeLSpeJSpeJDZeMTxeMSxeJ1ZeISI=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_004b545b7d39",
      "text": "  抱歉，看來我終究幫不上忙。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^,@^,h^*A^*Q^!O^$%^-H^-<^+}^!)^!'^,+^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLEBeLGheKkFeKlFeIU9eJCVeLUheLTxeK31eISleISdeLCteISI=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_72dd336012de",
      "text": "托布里安是一位出色的釀酒大師。在亞薩斯的任何地方， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^/-^.`^)(^+p^,X^!%^!J^!q^'s^&Z^7p^6=^\"z^#M^!\"^\"d^!9^-e^$[^&Z^!C^!L^\"e^$]^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi8tXi5gXikoXitwXixYXiElXiFKXiFxXidzXiZaXjdwXjY9XiJ6XiNNXiEiXiJkXiE5Xi1lXiRbXiZaXiFDXiFMXiJlXiRdXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ff06f416a15d",
      "text": "你都找不到更好的佳釀了。如果運氣好的話，他手頭上的存貨 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^)$^$/^!)^!u^$o^+i^&Z^7P^7p^*D^!\"^#$^%!^.4^%U^+i^&Z^-v^*A^!@^$+^)t^!'^&Z^#*^.w ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXikkXiQvXiEpXiF1XiRvXitpXiZaXjdQXjdwXipEXiEiXiMkXiUhXi40XiVVXitpXiZaXi12XipBXiFAXiQrXil0XiEnXiZaXiMqXi53IA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3ea42a83e600",
      "text": "足夠讓你們買個痛快。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(^^+d^-}^*F^*{^.!^!V^-.^*L^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiheXitkXi19XipGXip7Xi4hXiFWXi0uXipMXiEi",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_32e2caaeaa6c",
      "text": "拉麗莎是一位先知。她對未來的預見如同你們對過去的回憶一樣 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$6^0z^/E^,X^!%^!J^!b^&h^!\"^+h^#:^,_^!O^&Z^.E^-m^#$^\"E^*F^*{^#:^(x^\"6^&Z^\"\\^$\"^!%^,f ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQ2XjB6Xi9FXixYXiElXiFKXiFiXiZoXiEiXitoXiM6XixfXiFPXiZaXi5FXi1tXiMkXiJFXipGXip7XiM6Xih4XiI2XiZaXiJcXiQiXiElXixmIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4ccf39447a39",
      "text": "清晰分明。當初正是她告誡我們要避開 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,u^71^!s^$c^!\"^&N^1\"^%H^,X^+h^+B^7j^$%^*{^(C^0F^)F ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xix1XjcxXiFzXiRjXiEiXiZOXjEiXiVIXixYXitoXitCXjdqXiQlXip7XihDXjBGXilGIA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_70e2cc232361",
      "text": "主要城邦的。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!-^(C^+_^1a^&Z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEtXihDXitfXjFhXiZaXiEi",
      "byte_length": 18
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_358e3902f3ee",
      "text": "凱爾販售從亞薩斯各地收集而來的獨特珍寶，但他這個人嘴很緊。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!p^&/^6.^56^#f^!9^-e^$[^+>^\"e^$M^)]^'W^!O^&Z^/z^&5^/7^#4^*A^!I^!@^(s^!V^!<^+[^*K^0r^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFwXiYvXjYuXjU2XiNmXiE5Xi1lXiRbXis+XiJlXiRNXildXidXXiFPXiZaXi96XiY1Xi83XiM0XipBXiFJXiFAXihzXiFWXiE8XitbXipLXjByXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9f731d104b10",
      "text": "我敢說他心裡藏著不少秘密。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^/m^-x^!@^#k^-j^-f^-a^!)^#<^1O^#0^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXi9tXi14XiFAXiNrXi1qXi1mXi1hXiEpXiM8XjFPXiMwXiEi",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0e363d52c94e",
      "text": "賈克專門販售各類兵器，他在這片接近德拉吉的荒原上，擁有最齊全的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^/J^!d^#8^)D^6.^56^+>^)w^+,^\"V^*A^!@^\"d^(s^&1^$?^(l^#j^$6^\"D^&Z^1W^\"5^!'^*A^,M^$s^$q^36^!h^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi9KXiFkXiM4XilEXjYuXjU2Xis+Xil3XissXiJWXipBXiFAXiJkXihzXiYxXiQ/XihsXiNqXiQ2XiJEXiZaXjFXXiI1XiEnXipBXixNXiRzXiRxXjM2XiFoXiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 94
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4761c01378a9",
      "text": "黑曜石與骨製武器庫存。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*:^5X^&k^'p^*$^(B^%J^\"V^,#^#*^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xio6XjVYXiZrXidwXiokXihCXiVKXiJWXiwjXiMqXiEi",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_87ed63da2938",
      "text": "托布里安的大篷車就在東北邊。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^/-^.`^)(^+p^&Z^\"z^'1^5%^*J^\"d^,`^+6^.8^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi8tXi5gXikoXitwXiZaXiJ6XicxXjUlXipKXiJkXixgXis2Xi44XiEi",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1638e7df2444",
      "text": "拉麗莎的大篷車緊挨著商隊的西側圍欄，就在 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$6^0z^/E^&Z^\"z^'1^5%^0r^7\\^-a^1'^)U^&Z^-l^!\\^\"`^%C^*A^*J^\"d ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQ2XjB6Xi9FXiZaXiJ6XicxXjUlXjByXjdcXi1hXjEnXilVXiZaXi1sXiFcXiJgXiVDXipBXipKXiJkIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_029cbf3fd608",
      "text": "凱爾的大篷車正北邊。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!p^&/^&Z^\"z^'1^5%^%H^+6^.8^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFwXiYvXiZaXiJ6XicxXjUlXiVIXis2Xi44XiEi",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3b7c09242bba",
      "text": "凱爾的大車是西南邊的第二輛大篷車。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!p^&/^&Z^\"z^5%^,X^-l^\"/^.8^&Z^',^!5^65^\"z^'1^5%^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFwXiYvXiZaXiJ6XjUlXixYXi1sXiIvXi44XiZaXicsXiE1XjY1XiJ6XicxXjUlXiEi",
      "byte_length": 51
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_229e70bdeb75",
      "text": "你會在我的大車北邊找到賈克的大篷車。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^$r^\"d^$%^&Z^\"z^5%^+6^.8^$/^!u^/J^!d^&Z^\"z^'1^5%^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiRyXiJkXiQlXiZaXiJ6XjUlXis2Xi44XiQvXiF1Xi9KXiFkXiZaXiJ6XicxXjUlXiEi",
      "byte_length": 54
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2108057ebf0b",
      "text": "依然在侵擾我這支平靜的商隊。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!Q^&\"^\"d^.X^$K^$%^(s^$L^0Y^)h^&Z^1'^)U^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFRXiYiXiJkXi5YXiRLXiQlXihzXiRMXjBZXiloXiZaXjEnXilVXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 43
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_487c435b0fea",
      "text": "雙足飛龍騎兵 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)_^(^^)z^*>^0K^+, ",
      "encoded_base64": "XilfXiheXil6Xio+XjBLXissIA==",
      "byte_length": 19
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4b9359759f6c",
      "text": "瑪格拉掠奪者 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-*^%*^$6^1<^1,^'V ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi0qXiUqXiQ2XjE8XjEsXidWIA==",
      "byte_length": 19
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ae6a4b26e6dd",
      "text": "我手下最優秀的斥候回報，那些雙足飛龍來自遠在西南方的一個村莊。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^$+^!(^$q^+)^-9^&Z^,S^*|^\"\\^+`^*A^)!^!8^)_^(^^)z^*>^!O^'l^({^\"d^-l^\"/^$]^&Z^!%^!V^$z^6l^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiQrXiEoXiRxXispXi05XiZaXixTXip8XiJcXitgXipBXikhXiE4XilfXiheXil6Xio+XiFPXidsXih7XiJkXi1sXiIvXiRdXiZaXiElXiFWXiR6XjZsXiEi",
      "byte_length": 93
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6d628915bf26",
      "text": "恐怕我對瑪格拉巨怪知之甚少，不過有一條傳聞說， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#t^0^^$%^#:^-*^%*^$6^#H^#s^&h^!/^/|^#<^*A^!)^(x^$s^!%^%.^+$^4^^-x^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiN0XjBeXiQlXiM6Xi0qXiUqXiQ2XiNIXiNzXiZoXiEvXi98XiM8XipBXiEpXih4XiRzXiElXiUuXiskXjReXi14XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_94977153724a",
      "text": "他們盤踞在東南方的一座白骨之城裡。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^*{^1M^1_^\"d^,`^\"/^$]^&Z^!%^/_^&X^*$^!/^+_^-j^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXip7XjFNXjFfXiJkXixgXiIvXiRdXiZaXiElXi9fXiZYXiokXiEvXitfXi1qXiEi",
      "byte_length": 51
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5f3980876e6f",
      "text": "噢，真是個大好消息！整支商隊都會對你們感激不盡。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+]^*A^-2^,X^!V^\"z^+i^%k^#w^*W^$T^$L^1'^)U^)$^$r^#:^*F^*{^#{^1H^!)^-1^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XitdXipBXi0yXixYXiFWXiJ6XitpXiVrXiN3XipXXiRUXiRMXjEnXilVXikkXiRyXiM6XipGXip7XiN7XjFIXiEpXi0xXiEi",
      "byte_length": 72
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a5d3c8fc9dee",
      "text": "噢，我本來還抱著希望呢。要是襲擊不停下來， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+]^*A^$%^$x^!O^.7^,@^-a^+{^,]^+C^!\"^(C^,X^08^$F^!)^+!^!(^!O^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitdXipBXiQlXiR4XiFPXi43XixAXi1hXit7XixdXitDXiEiXihDXixYXjA4XiRGXiEpXishXiEoXiFPXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c1a7aad46230",
      "text": "我們將不得不收拾家當遠走他鄉。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^#7^!)^#e^!)^$M^7[^+s^&N^({^.&^!@^6<^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7XiM3XiEpXiNlXiEpXiRNXjdbXitzXiZOXih7Xi4mXiFAXjY8XiEi",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_625b5351aa06",
      "text": "只要你們能徹底制止 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"?^(C^*F^*{^'b^18^/^^!v^%G ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiI/XihDXipGXip7XidiXjE4Xi9eXiF2XiVHIA==",
      "byte_length": 28
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3c1f29f721a8",
      "text": " 對商隊的襲擊，酬勞便是一千枚陶瓷幣。你們同意嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^#:^1'^)U^&Z^08^$F^*A^7o^/R^!R^,X^!%^+7^$~^)R^&E^+|^!\"^*F^*{^\"E^#z^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4jOl4xJ14pVV4mWl4wOF4kRl4qQV43b14vUl4hUl4sWF4hJV4rN14kfl4pUl4mRV4rfF4hIl4qRl4qe14iRV4jel4rWF4uVg==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bc58641a31b9",
      "text": "當你走近大篷車時，無意中聽見兩名男子正在激烈爭吵。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&N^*F^.&^(l^\"z^'1^5%^$f^*A^%}^#z^!,^-X^-m^!i^\"F^&K^#(^%H^\"d^1H^%|^1I^/T^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZOXipGXi4mXihsXiJ6XicxXjUlXiRmXipBXiV9XiN6XiEsXi1YXi1tXiFpXiJGXiZLXiMoXiVIXiJkXjFIXiV8XjFJXi9UXiEi",
      "byte_length": 75
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e13910b9218c",
      "text": "……但城邦軍隊願意為他們支付 2,000 枚陶瓷幣！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*o^*o^!I^+_^1a^..^)U^.H^#z^%{^!@^*{^$L^*u 2,000 ^$~^)R^&E^+|^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XipvXipvXiFJXitfXjFhXi4uXilVXi5IXiN6XiV7XiFAXip7XiRMXip1IDIsMDAwIF4kfl4pUl4mRV4rfF4qVw==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5508b936984d",
      "text": "第二個聲音同樣語氣強硬，插話反駁道。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^',^!5^!V^-W^34^\"E^,f^0:^%U^#]^25^*A^4{^-v^\"9^5'^(y^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XicsXiE1XiFWXi1XXjM0XiJFXixmXjA6XiVVXiNdXjI1XipBXjR7Xi12XiI5XjUnXih5XiEi",
      "byte_length": 54
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d834206f4374",
      "text": "你難道沒看到他們的樣子嗎？那幫傢伙可不是好惹的！我們要是能活著走出這檔事就算走運了！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^)a^(y^%\\^*Q^!u^!@^*{^&Z^,f^#(^+X^.V^)!^+}^+#^*y^\"A^!)^,X^+i^3s^&Z^*W^$%^*{^(C^,X^'b^%i^-a^.&^!q^(s^4}^*r^*J^-C^.&^.4^*D^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXilhXih5XiVcXipRXiF1XiFAXip7XiZaXixmXiMoXitYXi5WXikhXit9XisjXip5XiJBXiEpXixYXitpXjNzXiZaXipXXiQlXip7XihDXixYXidiXiVpXi1hXi4mXiFxXihzXjR9XipyXipKXi1DXi4mXi40XipEXipX",
      "byte_length": 126
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_077253a20b89",
      "text": "別再哭哭啼啼了！我的計劃萬無一失！城邦軍隊能得到他們的「志願兵」，而我們則發大財拍拍屁股走人。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*H^!l^/U^/U^40^40^*D^*W^$%^&Z^-n^4s^-_^%}^!%^\"|^*W^+_^1a^..^)U^'b^#e^!u^!@^*{^&Z^!#^#m^.H^+,^!$^*A^'W^$%^*{^!x^&W^\"z^0=^4y^4y^4w^'_^.&^!<^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipIXiFsXi9VXi9VXjQwXjQwXipEXipXXiQlXiZaXi1uXjRzXi1fXiV9XiElXiJ8XipXXitfXjFhXi4uXilVXidiXiNlXiF1XiFAXip7XiZaXiEjXiNtXi5IXissXiEkXipBXidXXiQlXip7XiF4XiZXXiJ6XjA9XjR5XjR5XjR3XidfXi4mXiE8XiEi",
      "byte_length": 141
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_92319a011ce9",
      "text": "已經叫你滾開了！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#J^'D^+<^*F^,z^)F^*D^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNKXidEXis8XipGXix6XilGXipEXipX",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8bd58d00fa66",
      "text": "你想要離開商隊嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^,1^(C^)`^)F^1'^)U^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiwxXihDXilgXilGXjEnXilVXitYXi5W",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_73f050fe66a1",
      "text": "把你的話留給大篷車主吧。她會秉公審理。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$1^*F^&Z^-v^-+^'A^\"z^'1^5%^!-^*I^!\"^+h^$r^7b^3:^7V^&A^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQxXipGXiZaXi12Xi0rXidBXiJ6XicxXjUlXiEtXipJXiEiXitoXiRyXjdiXjM6XjdWXiZBXiEi",
      "byte_length": 57
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8c45f0c05f49",
      "text": "我們之間沒什麼好談的了。告辭。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^!/^)G^%\\^!=^.T^+i^0;^&Z^*D^!\"^+B^2M^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7XiEvXilHXiVcXiE9Xi5UXitpXjA7XiZaXipEXiEiXitCXjJNXiEi",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_483c86c3e866",
      "text": "日安！我是托布里安，舉世無雙的釀酒大師。來吧，請品嘗一下 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$a^+p^*W^$%^,X^/-^.`^)(^+p^*A^01^*p^%}^)_^&Z^7p^6=^\"z^#M^!\"^!O^*I^*A^*S^\"R^1o^!%^!( ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRhXitwXipXXiQlXixYXi8tXi5gXikoXitwXipBXjAxXipwXiV9XilfXiZaXjdwXjY9XiJ6XiNNXiEiXiFPXipJXipBXipTXiJSXjFvXiElXiEoIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f7ad2e7a16fc",
      "text": "我的美酒。你們絕不會想錯過它細緻芬芳的醇香與 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^&Z^-P^6=^!\"^*F^*{^-I^!)^$r^,1^)5^(x^+o^'?^8$^/C^4`^&Z^8-^*!^'p ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiZaXi1QXjY9XiEiXipGXip7Xi1JXiEpXiRyXiwxXik1Xih4XitvXic/XjgkXi9DXjRgXiZaXjgtXiohXidwIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_26b8b04a4ccf",
      "text": "濃郁飽滿的口感。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%w^8+^7r^,{^&Z^\"<^#{^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiV3XjgrXjdyXix7XiZaXiI8XiN7XiEi",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2ab2514f05d1",
      "text": "你們現在想品嘗一下我的酒嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^&?^\"d^,1^\"R^1o^!%^!(^$%^&Z^6=^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiY/XiJkXiwxXiJSXjFvXiElXiEoXiQlXiZaXjY9XitYXi5W",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6fc74d437847",
      "text": "  我很樂意品嘗一下你的美酒。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^*K^%8^#z^\"R^1o^!%^!(^*F^&Z^-P^6=^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeKkteJTheI3peIlJeMW9eISVeISheKkZeJlpeLVBeNj1eISI=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_945fec965d06",
      "text": "  先告訴我剛才和你在說話的人是誰。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^!b^+B^-t^$%^+0^$,^\"O^*F^\"d^-x^-v^&Z^!<^,X^-y^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIWJeK0JeLXReJCVeKzBeJCxeIk9eKkZeImReLXheLXZeJlpeITxeLFheLXleISI=",
      "byte_length": 50
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_47da1193127f",
      "text": "  邊聊邊喝，酒才更顯甘醇。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^.8^-U^.8^6M^*A^6=^$,^$o^4&^/:^8-^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLjheLVVeLjheNk1eKkFeNj1eJCxeJG9eNCZeLzpeOC1eISI=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5b7aee4c33f6",
      "text": "  不，我才不喝你的酒。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^!)^*A^$%^$,^!)^6M^*F^&Z^6=^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeISleKkFeJCVeJCxeISleNk1eKkZeJlpeNj1eISI=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_999ce69f964f",
      "text": "啊，能結識像閣下這樣 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+Q^*A^'b^'@^(R^!`^6~^!(^(s^,f ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitRXipBXidiXidAXihSXiFgXjZ+XiEoXihzXixmIA==",
      "byte_length": 31
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ed3e2131803f",
      "text": "卓爾不凡的貴人，真是不勝榮幸。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^/#^&/^!)^+-^&Z^2F^!<^*A^-2^,X^!)^+5^,e^15^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi8jXiYvXiEpXistXiZaXjJGXiE8XipBXi0yXixYXiEpXis1XixlXjE1XiEi",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_22562ea7ce56",
      "text": "噢，你指的一定是塞雷夫。他也是個酒商同行。我們剛才在 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+]^*A^*F^$8^&Z^!%^#.^,X^/(^)c^\"{^!\"^!@^!1^,X^!V^6=^1'^\"E^(;^!\"^$%^*{^+0^$,^\"d ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitdXipBXipGXiQ4XiZaXiElXiMuXixYXi8oXiljXiJ7XiEiXiFAXiExXixYXiFWXjY9XjEnXiJFXig7XiEiXiQlXip7XiswXiQsXiJkIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0dfe2cf62fe3",
      "text": "商討他剛賣給我的這批美酒的價錢。或許你們 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^1'^-o^!@^+0^.$^'A^$%^&Z^(s^2i^-P^6=^&Z^+&^.<^!\"^$'^-s^*F^*{ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjEnXi1vXiFAXiswXi4kXidBXiQlXiZaXihzXjJpXi1QXjY9XiZaXismXi48XiEiXiQnXi1zXipGXip7IA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6aa018638ce8",
      "text": "想來品嘗一下？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,1^!O^\"R^1o^!%^!(^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XiwxXiFPXiJSXjFvXiElXiEoXi5W",
      "byte_length": 21
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_164d07da7955",
      "text": "說得太好了。來，讓我為你們斟上一杯， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-x^#e^+f^+i^*D^!\"^!O^*A^-}^$%^%{^*F^*{^7w^!'^!%^5Y^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi14XiNlXitmXitpXipEXiEiXiFPXipBXi19XiQlXiV7XipGXip7Xjd3XiEnXiElXjVZXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_090ea3a6b9d2",
      "text": "一邊暢飲一邊閒聊。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!%^.8^7x^){^!%^.8^6A^-U^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiElXi44Xjd4Xil7XiElXi44XjZBXi1VXiEi",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_df9e32374c65",
      "text": "托布里安遞給你們一只裝滿酒的高腳杯。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^/-^.`^)(^+p^8*^'A^*F^*{^!%^\"?^(A^,{^6=^&Z^*+^00^5Y^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi8tXi5gXikoXitwXjgqXidBXipGXip7XiElXiI/XihBXix7XjY9XiZaXiorXjAwXjVZXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_52b58852269f",
      "text": "  剛才和你說話的那個人是誰？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^+0^$,^\"O^*F^-x^-v^&Z^)!^!V^!<^,X^-y^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKzBeJCxeIk9eKkZeLXheLXZeJlpeKSFeIVZeITxeLFheLXleLlY=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_36987b1f09e4",
      "text": "  塞雷夫剛才好像提到了城邦的軍隊。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^/(^)c^\"{^+0^$,^+i^!`^$A^!u^*D^+_^1a^&Z^..^)U^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLyheKWNeInteKzBeJCxeK2leIWBeJEFeIXVeKkReK19eMWFeJlpeLi5eKVVeISI=",
      "byte_length": 50
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ed69896e0b63",
      "text": "  你似乎非常急著要我喝下這杯酒。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^!H^!0^)i^#O^3p^-a^(C^$%^6M^!(^(s^5Y^6=^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeIUheITBeKWleI09eM3BeLWFeKENeJCVeNk1eISheKHNeNVleNj1eISI=",
      "byte_length": 47
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c03b4860c059",
      "text": "  最近這陣子酒類買賣好做嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$q^(l^(s^)P^#(^6=^)w^.!^.$^+i^*~^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJHFeKGxeKHNeKVBeIyheNj1eKXdeLiFeLiReK2leKn5eK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bcad21e040a6",
      "text": "  跟我說說你提供的這款酒吧。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^.+^$%^-x^-x^*F^$A^!P^&Z^(s^7{^6=^*I^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLiteJCVeLXheLXheKkZeJEFeIVBeJlpeKHNeN3teNj1eKkleISI=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c37a5a743a04",
      "text": "  你一直以來都是個酒商嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^!%^&`^!B^!O^)$^,X^!V^6=^1'^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeISVeJmBeIUJeIU9eKSReLFheIVZeNj1eMSdeK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_634cdbe6d036",
      "text": "  奴隸販子全該被丟進淤泥海裡淹死！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^##^)Z^6.^#(^!h^(M^(@^*q^(w^6c^%d^6`^-j^0l^%L^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIyNeKVpeNi5eIyheIWheKE1eKEBeKnFeKHdeNmNeJWReNmBeLWpeMGxeJUxeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 50
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8f8fb3fc8b1a",
      "text": "  你跟著這支商隊多久了？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^.+^-a^(s^$L^1'^)U^\"x^!.^*D^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeLiteLWFeKHNeJExeMSdeKVVeInheIS5eKkReLlY=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_43aa20e1fd10",
      "text": "  你為什麼這麼急著想讓我喝下去？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^%{^!=^.T^(s^.T^3p^-a^,1^-}^$%^6M^!(^\"6^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeJXteIT1eLlReKHNeLlReM3BeLWFeLDFeLX1eJCVeNk1eISheIjZeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 47
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_da1038f657df",
      "text": "  你想下毒害我！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^,1^!(^%Q^#/^$%^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeLDFeISheJVFeIy9eJCVeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 23
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_63b3b244f1fa",
      "text": "  廢話少說了，托布里安。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^#W^-v^#<^-x^*D^*A^/-^.`^)(^+p^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeI1deLXZeIzxeLXheKkReKkFeLy1eLmBeKSheK3BeISI=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b24720082c7f",
      "text": "求求你們了，我今天試了太多種酒，舌頭都發麻了， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,n^,n^*F^*{^*D^*A^$%^*E^+e^-u^*D^+f^\"x^'$^6=^*A^'q^)t^)$^&W^*6^*D^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XixuXixuXipGXip7XipEXipBXiQlXipFXitlXi11XipEXitmXiJ4XickXjY9XipBXidxXil0XikkXiZXXio2XipEXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c9d791a12866",
      "text": "根本分不清好壞，喝起來全都一個味！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%)^$x^!s^!)^,u^+i^\"v^*A^6M^.(^!O^!h^)$^!%^!V^1n^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiUpXiR4XiFzXiEpXix1XitpXiJ2XipBXjZNXi4oXiFPXiFoXikkXiElXiFWXjFuXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cb1f32b38067",
      "text": "要是你們肯幫我嘗上一口，那可真是幫了我天大的忙。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(C^,X^*F^*{^-Z^+}^$%^1o^!'^!%^\"<^*A^)!^\"A^-2^,X^+}^*D^$%^+e^\"z^&Z^,+^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihDXixYXipGXip7Xi1aXit9XiQlXjFvXiEnXiElXiI8XipBXikhXiJBXi0yXixYXit9XipEXiQlXitlXiJ6XiZaXiwrXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_233bfb390640",
      "text": "你們願意試試看嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^.H^#z^-u^-u^*Q^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7Xi5IXiN6Xi11Xi11XipRXitYXi5W",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e692e3550fce",
      "text": "這酒的味道相當醇厚，但殘留在舌尖的餘味卻帶著一股可疑的苦澀。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^6=^&Z^1n^(y^&a^&N^8-^\"4^*A^!I^,l^-+^\"d^'q^#=^&Z^1e^1n^1&^#N^-a^!%^'_^\"A^0p^&Z^.t^.o^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXjY9XiZaXjFuXih5XiZhXiZOXjgtXiI0XipBXiFJXixsXi0rXiJkXidxXiM9XiZaXjFlXjFuXjEmXiNOXi1hXiElXidfXiJBXjBwXiZaXi50Xi5vXiEi",
      "byte_length": 90
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a5af1267bf00",
      "text": "  真是人間美味！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^-2^,X^!<^)G^-P^1n^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLTJeLFheITxeKUdeLVBeMW5eKlc=",
      "byte_length": 23
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_006dd2a8d364",
      "text": "  這酒馬馬虎虎，稱不上極品。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^(s^6=^*\"^*\"^8&^8&^*A^0&^!)^!'^1D^\"R^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKHNeNj1eKiJeKiJeOCZeOCZeKkFeMCZeISleISdeMUReIlJeISI=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_693d7a52aedd",
      "text": "  喝起來簡直跟下水道的餿水沒兩樣！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^6M^.(^!O^3y^&`^.+^!(^%V^(y^&Z^8/^%V^%\\^!i^,f^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeNk1eLiheIU9eM3leJmBeLiteISheJVZeKHleJlpeOC9eJVZeJVxeIWleLGZeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 50
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1cca95ae7348",
      "text": "著急？哎呀，我哪裡著急了。我只是覺得像你們這樣的旅客 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-a^3p^.V^3i^3h^*A^$%^+I^-j^-a^3p^*D^!\"^$%^\"?^,X^(G^#e^!`^*F^*{^(s^,f^&Z^2m^+q ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi1hXjNwXi5WXjNpXjNoXipBXiQlXitJXi1qXi1hXjNwXipEXiEiXiQlXiI/XixYXihHXiNlXiFgXipGXip7XihzXixmXiZaXjJtXitxIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cf40dbcebb57",
      "text": "如果能品嘗到我的好酒，自然能把這美酒的聲譽傳揚開來。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#$^%!^'b^\"R^1o^!u^$%^&Z^+i^6=^*A^'l^&\"^'b^$1^(s^-P^6=^&Z^-W^6-^+$^2k^)F^!O^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiMkXiUhXidiXiJSXjFvXiF1XiQlXiZaXitpXjY9XipBXidsXiYiXidiXiQxXihzXi1QXjY9XiZaXi1XXjYtXiskXjJrXilGXiFPXiEi",
      "byte_length": 78
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ede884700882",
      "text": "你確定不喝？只要你喜歡，我可以免費奉送你兩整瓶。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^-6^#.^!)^6M^.V^\"?^(C^*F^+V^%F^*A^$%^\"A^!B^!e^.\"^1+^./^*F^!i^$T^&D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXi02XiMuXiEpXjZNXi5WXiI/XihDXipGXitWXiVGXipBXiQlXiJBXiFCXiFlXi4iXjErXi4vXipGXiFpXiRUXiZEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 72
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6f95a50a0c36",
      "text": "這個嘛，呃，你知道的，這好酒的滋味自己會說話，哪裡需要我多費唇舌。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^!V^+Y^*A^3<^*A^*F^&h^(y^&Z^*A^(s^+i^6=^&Z^7|^1n^'l^#I^$r^-x^-v^*A^+I^-j^)e^(C^$%^\"x^.\"^+L^'q^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXiFWXitZXipBXjM8XipBXipGXiZoXih5XiZaXipBXihzXitpXjY9XiZaXjd8XjFuXidsXiNJXiRyXi14Xi12XipBXitJXi1qXillXihDXiQlXiJ4Xi4iXitMXidxXiEi",
      "byte_length": 99
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e33173cbbc95",
      "text": "沒錯，你看，他也賣酒給城邦衛隊，剛才正試圖逼我 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%\\^)5^*A^*F^*Q^*A^!@^!1^.$^6=^'A^+_^1a^(=^)U^*A^+0^$,^%H^-u^\"b^.1^$% ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVcXik1XipBXipGXipRXipBXiFAXiExXi4kXjY9XidBXitfXjFhXig9XilVXipBXiswXiQsXiVIXi11XiJiXi4xXiQlIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4dfaede4107f",
      "text": "用同樣的高價收購。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&H^\"E^,f^&Z^*+^+&^$M^63^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZIXiJFXixmXiZaXiorXismXiRNXjYzXiEi",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a0098319ba27",
      "text": "我的生意好得很，德拉吉城裡駐紮了那麼多大軍，對酒的需求 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^&Z^&F^#z^+i^#e^*K^*A^#j^$6^\"D^+_^-j^1f^8\"^*D^)!^.T^\"x^\"z^..^*A^#:^6=^&Z^)e^,n ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiZaXiZGXiN6XitpXiNlXipLXipBXiNqXiQ2XiJEXitfXi1qXjFmXjgiXipEXikhXi5UXiJ4XiJ6Xi4uXipBXiM6XjY9XiZaXillXixuIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f85df5aac25f",
      "text": "急劇暴漲。事實上，我剛賣了一大批給一夥在 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^3p^1#^$m^7^^!\"^*r^#3^!'^*A^$%^+0^.$^*D^!%^\"z^2i^'A^!%^5?^\"d ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjNwXjEjXiRtXjdeXiEiXipyXiMzXiEnXipBXiQlXiswXi4kXipEXiElXiJ6XjJpXidBXiElXjU/XiJkIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_96c203b815a2",
      "text": "這裡西邊圍剿蘇蘭蜥蜴人的士兵。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^-j^-l^.8^\"`^7R^4c^/G^(2^(3^!<^&Z^+a^+,^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXi1qXi1sXi44XiJgXjdSXjRjXi9HXigyXigzXiE8XiZaXithXissXiEi",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f7b8a0d342d5",
      "text": "我端給你們的這款酒，可比賣給當兵的大老粗那些貨色好太多了， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^5o^'A^*F^*{^&Z^(s^7{^6=^*A^\"A^,m^.$^'A^&N^+,^&Z^\"z^'U^0(^)!^!8^.w^'s^+i^+f^\"x^*D^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXjVvXidBXipGXip7XiZaXihzXjd7XjY9XipBXiJBXixtXi4kXidBXiZOXissXiZaXiJ6XidVXjAoXikhXiE4Xi53XidzXitpXitmXiJ4XipEXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e213442920c2",
      "text": "只要你們親口嘗上一口就能見分曉。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"?^(C^*F^*{^(F^\"<^1o^!'^!%^\"<^*J^'b^-m^!s^7y^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiI/XihDXipGXip7XihGXiI8XjFvXiEnXiElXiI8XipKXidiXi1tXiFzXjd5XiEi",
      "byte_length": 48
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_924b42ff9cb7",
      "text": "釀酒的葡萄產自提爾上方鳴響山脈的向陽山坡。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^7p^6=^&Z^(#^'~^&G^'l^$A^&/^!'^$]^.|^)o^11^6i^&Z^+?^.@^11^7u^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjdwXjY9XiZaXigjXid+XiZHXidsXiRBXiYvXiEnXiRdXi58XilvXjExXjZpXiZaXis/Xi5AXjExXjd1XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c6a4034a615e",
      "text": "是用貨真價實的木桶陳釀，不像劣質酒那樣用陶甕， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,X^&H^.w^-2^+&^#3^&Z^$v^7z^4$^7p^*A^!)^!`^+2^(Z^6=^)!^,f^&H^)R^7~^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XixYXiZIXi53Xi0yXismXiMzXiZaXiR2Xjd6XjQkXjdwXipBXiEpXiFgXisyXihaXjY9XikhXixmXiZIXilSXjd+XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_94c3548fafd0",
      "text": "這酒帶著一縷淡淡的煙燻風味，你們喝了肯定會 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^6=^#N^-a^!%^6h^5_^5_^&Z^4S^7}^)y^1n^*A^*F^*{^6M^*D^-Z^#.^$r ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXjY9XiNOXi1hXiElXjZoXjVfXjVfXiZaXjRTXjd9Xil5XjFuXipBXipGXip7XjZNXipEXi1aXiMuXiRyIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9fd87d788398",
      "text": "讚不絕口。快試試看吧！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^8'^!)^-I^\"<^!\"^*L^-u^-u^*Q^*I^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XjgnXiEpXi1JXiI8XiEiXipMXi11Xi11XipRXipJXipX",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_386b8fc968a2",
      "text": "不，並非一直如此。我年輕時曾做過奴隸販子…… ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^*A^!+^)i^!%^&`^#$^%I^!\"^$%^+~^(g^$f^.j^*~^(x^##^)Z^6.^#(^*o^*o ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXipBXiErXilpXiElXiZgXiMkXiVJXiEiXiQlXit+XihnXiRmXi5qXip+Xih4XiMjXilaXjYuXiMoXipvXipvIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5a3ce2fb30ef",
      "text": "呃，那都是很久以前的事了，再說這年頭誰沒經手過奴隸買賣呢？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^3<^*A^)!^)$^,X^*K^!.^!B^!z^&Z^*r^*D^*A^!l^-x^(s^+~^)t^-y^%\\^'D^$+^(x^##^)Z^.!^.$^+C^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjM8XipBXikhXikkXixYXipLXiEuXiFCXiF6XiZaXipyXipEXipBXiFsXi14XihzXit+Xil0Xi15XiVcXidEXiQrXih4XiMjXilaXi4hXi4kXitDXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_754d86fbddad",
      "text": "我現在可更喜歡賣酒。賣酒有許多附帶的好處， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^&?^\"d^\"A^$o^+V^%F^.$^6=^!\"^.$^6=^$s^-s^\"x^.?^#N^&Z^+i^(,^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiY/XiJkXiJBXiRvXitWXiVGXi4kXjY9XiEiXi4kXjY9XiRzXi1zXiJ4Xi4/XiNOXiZaXitpXigsXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_688139998de0",
      "text": "比如你們手中端著的這杯美酒。快嘗嘗吧。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,m^#$^*F^*{^$+^!,^5o^-a^&Z^(s^5Y^-P^6=^!\"^*L^1o^1o^*I^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XixtXiMkXipGXip7XiQrXiEsXjVvXi1hXiZaXihzXjVZXi1QXjY9XiEiXipMXjFvXjFvXipJXiEi",
      "byte_length": 57
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_85b3ec57fe03",
      "text": "我跟著德莉莎娜的商隊走過兩趟遠門，一次去烏里克，一次去拉姆。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^.+^-a^#j^'{^/E^/*^&Z^1'^)U^.&^(x^!i^8)^({^)D^*A^!%^%D^\"6^/4^)(^!d^*A^!%^%D^\"6^$6^#%^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXi4rXi1hXiNqXid7Xi9FXi8qXiZaXjEnXilVXi4mXih4XiFpXjgpXih7XilEXipBXiElXiVEXiI2Xi80XikoXiFkXipBXiElXiVEXiI2XiQ2XiMlXiEi",
      "byte_length": 90
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2102a63a9691",
      "text": "我完全同意！那真是一門傷天害理的勾當——這正是我洗手不幹的原因。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^#,^!h^\"E^#z^*W^)!^-2^,X^!%^)D^!^^+e^#/^&A^&Z^7t^&N^*n^*n^(s^%H^,X^$%^0j^$+^!)^,!^&Z^\"5^\"]^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiMsXiFoXiJFXiN6XipXXikhXi0yXixYXiElXilEXiFeXitlXiMvXiZBXiZaXjd0XiZOXipuXipuXihzXiVIXixYXiQlXjBqXiQrXiEpXiwhXiZaXiI1XiJdXiEi",
      "byte_length": 96
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_43dbe659319e",
      "text": "那麼，為所有奴隸販子的末日乾一杯吧！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^.T^*A^%{^$)^$s^##^)Z^6.^#(^&Z^$w^$a^*X^!%^5Y^*I^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXi5UXipBXiV7XiQpXiRzXiMjXilaXjYuXiMoXiZaXiR3XiRhXipYXiElXjVZXipJXipX",
      "byte_length": 54
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bffa9903fd5b",
      "text": "當然，但是…… ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&N^&\"^*A^!I^,X^*o^*o ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZOXiYiXipBXiFJXixYXipvXipvIA==",
      "byte_length": 22
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2331c3653b10",
      "text": "嗯……感謝你們賞光品嘗。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^6N^*o^*o^#{^-z^*F^*{^*T^!c^\"R^1o^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjZOXipvXipvXiN7Xi16XipGXip7XipUXiFjXiJSXjFvXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 37
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b78f0d6b7893",
      "text": "這是答應送給你們的美酒。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^,X^-B^0`^./^'A^*F^*{^&Z^-P^6=^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXixYXi1CXjBgXi4vXidBXipGXip7XiZaXi1QXjY9XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 37
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4a4b804a76d4",
      "text": "請恕我失陪，我還有很多事要忙。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*S^3q^$%^\"|^8.^*A^$%^.7^$s^*K^\"x^*r^(C^,+^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipTXjNxXiQlXiJ8XjguXipBXiQlXi43XiRzXipLXiJ4XipyXihDXiwrXiEi",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_322edf07aab2",
      "text": "喝下那杯酒後，一股辛辣刺鼻的怪味久久停留在舌尖。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^6M^!(^)!^5Y^6=^#b^*A^!%^'_^6z^67^!w^4q^&Z^#s^1n^!.^!.^+!^-+^\"d^'q^#=^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjZNXiEoXikhXjVZXjY9XiNiXipBXiElXidfXjZ6XjY3XiF3XjRxXiZaXiNzXjFuXiEuXiEuXishXi0rXiJkXidxXiM9XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cdb357a8159f",
      "text": "突然間，你的喉嚨猛烈痙攣收縮，劇烈的絞痛直刺胃部。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'*^&\"^)G^*A^*F^&Z^/V^/Y^*P^%|^8!^7v^$M^3X^*A^1#^%|^&Z^8#^-.^&`^!w^3|^)#^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XicqXiYiXilHXipBXipGXiZaXi9WXi9ZXipQXiV8XjghXjd2XiRNXjNYXipBXjEjXiV8XiZaXjgjXi0uXiZgXiF3XjN8XikjXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1d8d0008c72e",
      "text": "隨後你眼前一黑，便什麼也記不得了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)X^#b^*F^&d^!z^!%^*:^*A^!R^!=^.T^!1^(K^!)^#e^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XilYXiNiXipGXiZkXiF6XiElXio6XipBXiFSXiE9Xi5UXiExXihLXiEpXiNlXipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 51
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0f5c6f1c3863",
      "text": "不，我發誓絕無此事！如果酒裡有毒，那肯定是別人下的！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^*A^$%^&W^-w^-I^%}^%I^*r^*W^#$^%!^6=^-j^$s^%Q^*A^)!^-Z^#.^,X^*H^!<^!(^&Z^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXipBXiQlXiZXXi13Xi1JXiV9XiVJXipyXipXXiMkXiUhXjY9Xi1qXiRzXiVRXipBXikhXi1aXiMuXixYXipIXiE8XiEoXiZaXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ec3620d0a1f4",
      "text": "我對此一無所知，求求你們相信我！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^#:^%I^!%^%}^$)^&h^*A^,n^,n^*F^*{^&a^!U^$%^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiM6XiVJXiElXiV9XiQpXiZoXipBXixuXixuXipGXip7XiZhXiFVXiQlXipX",
      "byte_length": 48
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4883ce0c306d",
      "text": "你要喝下這杯酒嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^(C^6M^!(^(s^5Y^6=^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXihDXjZNXiEoXihzXjVZXjY9XitYXi5W",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c4d6514550d5",
      "text": "改天再說吧。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$N^+e^!l^-x^*I^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiROXitlXiFsXi14XipJXiEi",
      "byte_length": 18
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b3d8b722018b",
      "text": "錯過這樣的美酒可是你們自己的損失。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)5^(x^(s^,f^&Z^-P^6=^\"A^,X^*F^*{^'l^#I^&Z^$D^\"|^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xik1Xih4XihzXixmXiZaXi1QXjY9XiJBXixYXipGXip7XidsXiNJXiZaXiREXiJ8XiEi",
      "byte_length": 51
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9d80fb5331b9",
      "text": "唉，隨便吧。反正是你們自己不識貨。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+M^*A^)X^!R^*I^!\"^\"9^%H^,X^*F^*{^'l^#I^!)^(R^.w^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XitNXipBXilYXiFSXipJXiEiXiI5XiVIXixYXipGXip7XidsXiNJXiEpXihSXi53XiEi",
      "byte_length": 51
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b8d715df1291",
      "text": "噢！是你們！剛才發生的事我真是萬分抱歉。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+]^*W^,X^*F^*{^*W^+0^$,^&W^&F^&Z^*r^$%^-2^,X^-_^!s^,@^,h^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitdXipXXixYXipGXip7XipXXiswXiQsXiZXXiZGXiZaXipyXiQlXi0yXixYXi1fXiFzXixAXixoXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_dc9aa4ebf968",
      "text": "車裡這些全是你們的隨身物品。我只是代為保管，以免 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^5%^-j^(s^!8^!h^,X^*F^*{^&Z^)X^(c^&4^\"R^!\"^$%^\"?^,X^*v^%{^!T^-D^*A^!B^!e ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjUlXi1qXihzXiE4XiFoXixYXipGXip7XiZaXilYXihjXiY0XiJSXiEiXiQlXiI/XixYXip2XiV7XiFUXi1EXipBXiFCXiFlIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c236a82f82e3",
      "text": "你們從塞雷夫那條卑鄙的蠕蟲手裡逃脫後無物可用。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^#f^/(^)c^\"{^)!^%.^\".^8,^&Z^07^(8^$+^-j^(p^'c^#b^%}^&4^\"A^&H^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiNmXi8oXiljXiJ7XikhXiUuXiIuXjgsXiZaXjA3Xig4XiQrXi1qXihwXidjXiNiXiV9XiY0XiJBXiZIXiEi",
      "byte_length": 69
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6a8a090f73e5",
      "text": "  閉嘴，受死吧！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^.=^+[^*A^\";^%L^*I^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLj1eK1teKkFeIjteJUxeKkleKlc=",
      "byte_length": 23
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_66ed0de3bc8c",
      "text": "  騙子！我聽見你和那個奴隸販子說的話了！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^.{^#(^*W^$%^-X^-m^*F^\"O^)!^!V^##^)Z^6.^#(^-x^&Z^-v^*D^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLnteIyheKldeJCVeLVheLW1eKkZeIk9eKSFeIVZeIyNeKVpeNi5eIyheLXheJlpeLXZeKkReKlc=",
      "byte_length": 59
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cdfd3b54ab81",
      "text": "  塞雷夫現在人在哪裡？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^/(^)c^\"{^&?^\"d^!<^\"d^+I^-j^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLyheKWNeInteJj9eImReITxeImReK0leLWpeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5eecfbcbe952",
      "text": "  把你們出賣我們換來的錢交出來。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$1^*F^*{^!q^.$^$%^*{^4@^!O^&Z^.<^0P^!q^!O^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJDFeKkZeKnteIXFeLiReJCVeKnteNEBeIU9eJlpeLjxeMFBeIXFeIU9eISI=",
      "byte_length": 47
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d8096add966f",
      "text": "  你在說謊！把錢交出來！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^\"d^-x^3*^*W^$1^.<^0P^!q^!O^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeImReLXheMypeKldeJDFeLjxeMFBeIXFeIU9eKlc=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2d7d08c3957f",
      "text": "  我要讓大篷車主來審理這件事！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^(C^-}^\"z^'1^5%^!-^!O^7V^&A^(s^.W^*r^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeKENeLX1eInpeJzFeNSVeIS1eIU9eN1ZeJkFeKHNeLldeKnJeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4e65efaeb8a5",
      "text": "  別再讓我們碰到你。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*H^!l^-}^$%^*{^-5^!u^*F^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkheIWxeLX1eJCVeKnteLTVeIXVeKkZeISI=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b0d7da9f521c",
      "text": "我也是逼不得已的！全是塞雷夫幹的！他拿刀架在我脖子上逼我做，說我不配合就殺了我！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^!1^,X^.1^!)^#e^#J^&Z^*W^!h^,X^/(^)c^\"{^,!^&Z^*W^!@^,G^7Q^%\"^\"d^$%^8%^#(^!'^.1^$%^*~^*A^-x^$%^!)^)&^\"C^*J^%M^*D^$%^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiExXixYXi4xXiEpXiNlXiNKXiZaXipXXiFoXixYXi8oXiljXiJ7XiwhXiZaXipXXiFAXixHXjdRXiUiXiJkXiQlXjglXiMoXiEnXi4xXiQlXip+XipBXi14XiQlXiEpXikmXiJDXipKXiVNXipEXiQlXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 121
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2283d63e52c6",
      "text": "求求你們，饒了我吧！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,n^,n^*F^*{^*A^.M^*D^$%^*I^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XixuXixuXipGXip7XipBXi5NXipEXiQlXipJXipX",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2fa9c6f6a6f7",
      "text": "他躲在荒漠裡。我本該把你們送到商隊正南方 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^0C^\"d^1W^,}^-j^!\"^$%^$x^(M^$1^*F^*{^./^!u^1'^)U^%H^\"/^$] ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXjBDXiJkXjFXXix9Xi1qXiEiXiQlXiR4XihNXiQxXipGXip7Xi4vXiF1XjEnXilVXiVIXiIvXiRdIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_45c71684bc30",
      "text": "親手交給他的。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(F^$+^0P^'A^!@^&Z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XihGXiQrXjBQXidBXiFAXiZaXiEi",
      "byte_length": 21
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b19a998199de",
      "text": "好，好吧。我們這就去她的大篷車。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+i^*A^+i^*I^!\"^$%^*{^(s^*J^\"6^+h^&Z^\"z^'1^5%^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XitpXipBXitpXipJXiEiXiQlXip7XihzXipKXiI2XitoXiZaXiJ6XicxXjUlXiEi",
      "byte_length": 48
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_89847f475aa3",
      "text": "錢？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.<^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi48Xi5W",
      "byte_length": 6
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c5caab8f9cb7",
      "text": "所有的錢全被塞雷夫拿走了——我連一枚陶瓷幣都沒分到！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$)^$s^&Z^.<^!h^(@^/(^)c^\"{^,G^.&^*D^*n^*n^$%^.0^!%^$~^)R^&E^+|^)$^%\\^!s^!u^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQpXiRzXiZaXi48XiFoXihAXi8oXiljXiJ7XixHXi4mXipEXipuXipuXiQlXi4wXiElXiR+XilSXiZFXit8XikkXiVcXiFzXiF1XipX",
      "byte_length": 78
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a08e85fb8243",
      "text": "給，馬上給！我剛才是豬油蒙了心，這些錢 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'A^*A^*\"^!'^'A^*W^$%^+0^$,^,X^8(^%^^-c^*D^#k^*A^(s^!8^.< ",
      "encoded_base64": "XidBXipBXioiXiEnXidBXipXXiQlXiswXiQsXixYXjgoXiVeXi1jXipEXiNrXipBXihzXiE4Xi48IA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d4e027b9d976",
      "text": "理所當然該歸你們！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&A^$)^&N^&\"^(M^%K^*F^*{^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZBXiQpXiZOXiYiXihNXiVLXipGXip7XipX",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8aaf8dc767b9",
      "text": "托布里安在腰帶上一陣摸索，終於掏出了那筆錢。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^/-^.`^)(^+p^\"d^'f^#N^!'^!%^)P^/j^'>^*A^-H^$^^/f^!q^*D^)!^-A^.<^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi8tXi5gXikoXitwXiJkXidmXiNOXiEnXiElXilQXi9qXic+XipBXi1IXiReXi9mXiFxXipEXikhXi1BXi48XiEi",
      "byte_length": 66
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e0cdc80ef1f2",
      "text": "多麼低劣的生物。連小孩都能殺得死牠們。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"x^.T^!K^+2^&Z^&F^&4^!\"^.0^#;^+m^)$^'b^%M^#e^%L^-#^*{^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJ4Xi5UXiFLXisyXiZaXiZGXiY0XiEiXi4wXiM7XittXikkXidiXiVNXiNlXiVMXi0jXip7XiEi",
      "byte_length": 57
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_89a07c70a4e1",
      "text": "多可悲的生物！牠的訓獸師打起來都比牠強！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"x^\"A^,.^&Z^&F^&4^*W^-#^&Z^-p^&<^#M^$-^.(^!O^)$^,m^-#^#]^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJ4XiJBXiwuXiZaXiZGXiY0XipXXi0jXiZaXi1wXiY8XiNNXiQtXi4oXiFPXikkXixtXi0jXiNdXipX",
      "byte_length": 60
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8a164a04a9de",
      "text": "難怪這怪物會死！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)a^#s^(s^#s^&4^$r^%L^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XilhXiNzXihzXiNzXiY0XiRyXiVMXipX",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3f6204ebf8a0",
      "text": "牠本來就病懨懨的了。牠幾乎",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-#^$x^!O^*J^&R^,8^,8^&Z^*D^!\"^-#^#T^!0",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi0jXiR4XiFPXipKXiZSXiw4Xiw4XiZaXipEXiEiXi0jXiNUXiEw",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3313a3ecfe47",
      "text": "站都站不穩，虛弱成那樣。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^->^)$^->^!)^-;^*A^-g^#\\^$$^)!^,f^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi0+XikkXi0+XiEpXi07XipBXi1nXiNcXiQkXikhXixmXiEi",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_16485d782e54",
      "text": "喔，這一擊真漂亮！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+T^*A^(s^!%^$F^-2^,|^*t^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XitUXipBXihzXiElXiRGXi0yXix8Xip0XipX",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d5bdff6d3a31",
      "text": "這些角鬥士挺強悍的，不是嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^!8^(H^*,^+a^,I^#]^,-^&Z^*A^!)^,X^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXiE4XihIXiosXithXixJXiNdXiwtXiZaXipBXiEpXixYXitYXi5W",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e0562dc6f0de",
      "text": "也許他們終究算得上是合格的角鬥士。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!1^-s^!@^*{^-H^-<^-C^#e^!'^,X^\"C^%*^&Z^(H^*,^+a^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiExXi1zXiFAXip7Xi1IXi08Xi1DXiNlXiEnXixYXiJDXiUqXiZaXihIXiosXithXiEi",
      "byte_length": 51
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_37ad1c85678b",
      "text": "這下讓",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^!(^-}",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXiEoXi19",
      "byte_length": 9
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e9d4c5f4433e",
      "text": "成了獸欄之王！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$$^*D^&<^%C^!/^-)^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQkXipEXiY8XiVDXiEvXi0pXipX",
      "byte_length": 21
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4f46e7b0d6db",
      "text": "這正好證明了……他們看起來雖強，骨子裡——",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^%H^+i^-{^$c^*D^*o^*o^!@^*{^*Q^.(^!O^.A^#]^*A^*$^#(^-j^*n^*n",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXiVIXitpXi17XiRjXipEXipvXipvXiFAXip7XipRXi4oXiFPXi5BXiNdXipBXiokXiMoXi1qXipuXipu",
      "byte_length": 63
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5dd7f9669db9",
      "text": "根本什麼都不是！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%)^$x^!=^.T^)$^!)^,X^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiUpXiR4XiE9Xi5UXikkXiEpXixYXipX",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c7e060f913e0",
      "text": "我們又抓來一群裝成角鬥士的小孩！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^+;^$2^!O^!%^'R^(A^$$^(H^*,^+a^&Z^#;^+m^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7Xis7XiQyXiFPXiElXidSXihBXiQkXihIXiosXithXiZaXiM7XittXipX",
      "byte_length": 48
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e656ca92572c",
      "text": "我明明跟庫爾扎克說過，別再靠看牙齒",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^$c^$c^.+^,#^&/^,=^!d^-x^(x^*A^*H^!l^.C^*Q^&3^.U",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiRjXiRjXi4rXiwjXiYvXiw9XiFkXi14Xih4XipBXipIXiFsXi5DXipRXiYzXi5V",
      "byte_length": 51
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_445eb3cd1f8c",
      "text": "來挑奴隸了！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!O^,H^##^)Z^*D^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFPXixIXiMjXilaXipEXipX",
      "byte_length": 18
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5d63084cb06b",
      "text": "少一張要餵的嘴也好。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#<^!%^,(^(C^.L^&Z^+[^!1^+i^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiM8XiElXiwoXihDXi5MXiZaXitbXiExXitpXiEi",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_359cb8b6f384",
      "text": "噢！那一下一定很痛！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+]^*W^)!^!%^!(^!%^#.^*K^-.^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XitdXipXXikhXiElXiEoXiElXiMuXipLXi0uXipX",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2a42971e3f25",
      "text": "這傷得花點時間才能痊癒！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^!^^#e^'w^*;^$f^)G^$,^'b^--^&V^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXiFeXiNlXid3Xio7XiRmXilHXiQsXidiXi0tXiZWXipX",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f3e331f59bf6",
      "text": "正中臉部！好痛！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%H^!,^-\\^)#^*W^+i^-.^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVIXiEsXi1cXikjXipXXitpXi0uXipX",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6b49f4481d23",
      "text": "要是",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(C^,X",
      "encoded_base64": "XihDXixY",
      "byte_length": 6
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7141034dced4",
      "text": "他",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFA",
      "byte_length": 3
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_148e0379dc90",
      "text": "她",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+h",
      "encoded_base64": "Xito",
      "byte_length": 3
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_be6f4386bea3",
      "text": "明天還站得起來，我才驚訝呢！嘿嘿嘿……",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$c^+e^.7^->^#e^.(^!O^*A^$%^$,^.Q^-r^+C^*W^+\\^+\\^+\\^*o^*o",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRjXitlXi43Xi0+XiNlXi4oXiFPXipBXiQlXiQsXi5RXi1yXitDXipXXitcXitcXitcXipvXipv",
      "byte_length": 57
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f9ca858fa331",
      "text": "角鬥士逃跑了！守衛！拉響警報！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(H^*,^+a^(p^(_^*D^*W^#+^(=^*W^$6^)o^(S^+`^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XihIXiosXithXihwXihfXipEXipXXiMrXig9XipXXiQ2XilvXihTXitgXipX",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_84adedf8bcbd",
      "text": "這條走廊通往下方的奴隸欄。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^%.^.&^,$^(t^,)^!(^$]^&Z^##^)Z^%C^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXiUuXi4mXiwkXih0XiwpXiEoXiRdXiZaXiMjXilaXiVDXiEi",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5b0bc5fe8193",
      "text": "你要繼續嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^(C^-O^'M^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXihDXi1PXidNXitYXi5W",
      "byte_length": 18
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_776eadea81dd",
      "text": "取消警報！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\":^%k^(S^+`^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiI6XiVrXihTXitgXipX",
      "byte_length": 15
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c7709673cd3e",
      "text": "重重一擊，",
      "encoded_ascii": "^))^))^!%^$F^*A",
      "encoded_base64": "XikpXikpXiElXiRGXipB",
      "byte_length": 15
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2f9f9f67c4c3",
      "text": "她",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+h",
      "encoded_base64": "Xito",
      "byte_length": 3
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4c93cabb36b3",
      "text": "把牠的羽毛都打飛了！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$1^-#^&Z^'S^%R^)$^$-^)z^*D^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQxXi0jXiZaXidTXiVSXikkXiQtXil6XipEXipX",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8599db0792ad",
      "text": "各位旅伴，向你們致敬！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+>^!J^2m^1h^*A^+?^*F^*{^'o^*O^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "Xis+XiFKXjJtXjFoXipBXis/XipGXip7XidvXipPXipX",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_126476626bca",
      "text": "快過來一起圍爐烤火、聊聊天吧。這座訪客 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*L^(x^!O^!%^.(^\"`^&,^/w^%x^!!^-U^-U^+e^*I^!\"^(s^/_^4d^+q ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipMXih4XiFPXiElXi4oXiJgXiYsXi93XiV4XiEhXi1VXi1VXitlXipJXiEiXihzXi9fXjRkXitxIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b2bdaeffe22f",
      "text": "營地既能讓疲憊的身體好好歇息，也是振奮精神的好地方。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&'^\"e^,U^'b^-}^88^84^&Z^(c^**^+i^+i^%E^#w^*A^!1^,X^85^+g^'7^&w^&Z^+i^\"e^$]^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiYnXiJlXixVXidiXi19Xjg4Xjg0XiZaXihjXioqXitpXitpXiVFXiN3XipBXiExXixYXjg1XitnXic3XiZ3XiZaXitpXiJlXiRdXiEi",
      "byte_length": 78
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e2dc740b1c26",
      "text": "歡迎！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%F^(k^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVGXihrXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 10
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f0919e305718",
      "text": "我的名字是卡圖拉。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^&Z^\"F^#)^,X^\"0^\"b^$6^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiZaXiJGXiMpXixYXiIwXiJiXiQ2XiEi",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_435b2659cfa0",
      "text": "你們是剛到這裡的新面孔，對吧？嗯，或許我能為你們幫點忙。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^,X^+0^!u^(s^-j^&Z^$\\^)j^5G^*A^#:^*I^.V^6N^*A^$'^-s^$%^'b^%{^*F^*{^+}^*;^,+^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XixYXiswXiF1XihzXi1qXiZaXiRcXilqXjVHXipBXiM6XipJXi5WXjZOXipBXiQnXi1zXiQlXidiXiV7XipGXip7Xit9Xio7XiwrXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b285e0bf4fea",
      "text": "我是這裡的常客，該認識的人我全認識。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^,X^(s^-j^&Z^#O^+q^*A^(M^(O^(R^&Z^!<^$%^!h^(O^(R^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXixYXihzXi1qXiZaXiNPXitxXipBXihNXihPXihSXiZaXiE8XiQlXiFoXihPXihSXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_988ed5125740",
      "text": "你們叫什麼名字？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^+<^!=^.T^\"F^#)^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7Xis8XiE9Xi5UXiJGXiMpXi5W",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4faa0e359a02",
      "text": "你們在這裡找到所需的物資了嗎？荒漠裡的補給物資 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^\"d^(s^-j^$/^!u^$)^)e^&Z^&4^(X^*D^+X^.V^1W^,}^-j^&Z^6&^'A^&4^(X ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiJkXihzXi1qXiQvXiF1XiQpXillXiZaXiY0XihYXipEXitYXi5WXjFXXix9Xi1qXiZaXjYmXidBXiY0XihYIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_68d52e6d66fc",
      "text": "向來十分短缺。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+?^!O^*Y^!s^&i^7e^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xis/XiFPXipZXiFzXiZpXjdlXiEi",
      "byte_length": 21
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d0e7492af8e9",
      "text": "  我不是提爾人。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^!)^,X^$A^&/^!<^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeISleLFheJEFeJi9eITxeISI=",
      "byte_length": 23
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_479c0dd9e419",
      "text": "  妳來自哪裡？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^7(^!O^'l^+I^-j^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeNyheIU9eJ2xeK0leLWpeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 20
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_93706fadb58e",
      "text": "  跟我說說這支商隊的情況吧。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^.+^$%^-x^-x^(s^$L^1'^)U^&Z^,0^,q^*I^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLiteJCVeLXheLXheKHNeJExeMSdeKVVeJlpeLDBeLHFeKkleISI=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_593a263fd4be",
      "text": "好了，很高興能和你們聊天。祝你們好運！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+i^*D^*A^*K^*+^-]^'b^\"O^*F^*{^-U^+e^!\"^&v^*F^*{^+i^.4^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XitpXipEXipBXipLXiorXi1dXidiXiJPXipGXip7Xi1VXitlXiEiXiZ2XipGXip7XitpXi40XipX",
      "byte_length": 57
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a4a7514d4451",
      "text": "。這個名字真特別。你們來自提爾嗎？我曾有個叔叔 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!\"^(s^!V^\"F^#)^-2^&5^*H^!\"^*F^*{^!O^'l^$A^&/^+X^.V^$%^.j^$s^!V^81^81 ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEiXihzXiFWXiJGXiMpXi0yXiY1XipIXiEiXipGXip7XiFPXidsXiRBXiYvXitYXi5WXiQlXi5qXiRzXiFWXjgxXjgxIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_75ece7af9bca",
      "text": "在當地的礦場裡做苦工——最後也死在了礦坑裡。他生前總是 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"d^&N^\"e^&Z^5m^\"n^-j^*~^.t^+y^*n^*n^$q^#b^!1^%L^\"d^*D^5m^5>^-j^!\"^!@^&F^!z^-M^,X ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJkXiZOXiJlXiZaXjVtXiJuXi1qXip+Xi50Xit5XipuXipuXiRxXiNiXiExXiVMXiJkXipEXjVtXjU+Xi1qXiEiXiFAXiZGXiF6Xi1NXixYIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d27ad1a93b9c",
      "text": "絮絮叨叨說那裡的一切有多麼古怪離奇——當然，我絕沒有 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^8<^8<^82^82^-x^)!^-j^&Z^!%^+.^$s^\"x^.T^\"=^#s^)`^\"}^*n^*n^&N^&\"^*A^$%^-I^%\\^$s ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xjg8Xjg8XjgyXjgyXi14XikhXi1qXiZaXiElXisuXiRzXiJ4Xi5UXiI9XiNzXilgXiJ9XipuXipuXiZOXiYiXipBXiQlXi1JXiVcXiRzIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_40ef719a5795",
      "text": "冒犯的意思。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^/P^-%^&Z^#z^#q^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi9QXi0lXiZaXiN6XiNxXiEi",
      "byte_length": 18
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_444ab4a416c0",
      "text": "不是嗎？那你們是古爾格人？我知道你們絕不是這附近的人……不過這 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^,X^+X^.V^)!^*F^*{^,X^\"=^&/^%*^!<^.V^$%^&h^(y^*F^*{^-I^!)^,X^(s^.?^(l^&Z^!<^*o^*o^!)^(x^(s ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXixYXitYXi5WXikhXipGXip7XixYXiI9XiYvXiUqXiE8Xi5WXiQlXiZoXih5XipGXip7Xi1JXiEpXixYXihzXi4/XihsXiZaXiE8XipvXipvXiEpXih4XihzIA==",
      "byte_length": 94
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_346377caa44e",
      "text": "並不打緊。如果各位不想透露自己的來歷， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!+^!)^$-^0r^!\"^#$^%!^+>^!J^!)^,1^(q^.B^'l^#I^&Z^!O^6^^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiErXiEpXiQtXjByXiEiXiMkXiUhXis+XiFKXiEpXiwxXihxXi5CXidsXiNJXiZaXiFPXjZeXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1bd768a7e4cf",
      "text": "我完全能夠理解。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^#,^!h^'b^+d^&A^(I^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiMsXiFoXidiXitkXiZBXihJXiEi",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3ac2dc93fac3",
      "text": "我現在住在提奎茲爾村，但我出生在尼本奈——至少 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^&?^\"d^*z^\"d^$A^5B^/D^&/^$z^*A^!I^$%^!q^&F^\"d^#>^$x^\"~^*n^*n^'n^#< ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiY/XiJkXip6XiJkXiRBXjVCXi9EXiYvXiR6XipBXiFJXiQlXiFxXiZGXiJkXiM+XiR4XiJ+XipuXipuXiduXiM8IA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0c39588f1919",
      "text": "我父親是這麼對我說的。你們曾去過那裡嗎？大家都說 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^5d^(F^,X^(s^.T^#:^$%^-x^&Z^!\"^*F^*{^.j^\"6^(x^)!^-j^+X^.V^\"z^+s^)$^-x ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXjVkXihGXixYXihzXi5UXiM6XiQlXi14XiZaXiEiXipGXip7Xi5qXiI2Xih4XikhXi1qXitYXi5WXiJ6XitzXikkXi14IA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d6e70536c5e4",
      "text": "那裡美得令人屏息——遍布著清泉噴池與雕欄玉砌的巍峨建築。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^-j^-P^#e^*w^!<^#@^#w^*n^*n^69^.`^-a^,u^%a^\"W^%X^'p^)^^%C^&=^89^&Z^47^46^,'^8;^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXi1qXi1QXiNlXip3XiE8XiNAXiN3XipuXipuXjY5Xi5gXi1hXix1XiVhXiJXXiVYXidwXileXiVDXiY9Xjg5XiZaXjQ3XjQ2XiwnXjg7XiEi",
      "byte_length": 84
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0e5c72575807",
      "text": "我正在為提奎茲爾村採購補給物資。我們的先知預言了 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^%H^\"d^%{^$A^5B^/D^&/^$z^5R^63^6&^'A^&4^(X^!\"^$%^*{^&Z^!b^&h^.E^1Y^*D ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiVIXiJkXiV7XiRBXjVCXi9EXiYvXiR6XjVSXjYzXjYmXidBXiY0XihYXiEiXiQlXip7XiZaXiFiXiZoXi5FXjFZXipEIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_81585d570d4b",
      "text": "即將降臨的浩劫厄運，所以長老們希望未雨綢繆做好萬全準備。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"1^#7^)N^1U^&Z^5^^1l^80^.4^*A^$)^!B^)C^'U^*{^+{^,]^,_^8B^'E^8=^*~^+i^-_^!h^,x^+\"^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiIxXiM3XilOXjFVXiZaXjVeXjFsXjgwXi40XipBXiQpXiFCXilDXidVXip7Xit7XixdXixfXjhCXidFXjg9Xip+XitpXi1fXiFoXix4XisiXiEi",
      "byte_length": 84
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4cbf31149a36",
      "text": "看緊你們的錢袋。這是跟任何商隊打交道的金科玉律—— ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*Q^0r^*F^*{^&Z^.<^(?^!\"^(s^,X^.+^!C^!L^1'^)U^$-^0P^(y^&Z^)+^'!^&=^7W^*n^*n ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipRXjByXipGXip7XiZaXi48Xig/XiEiXihzXixYXi4rXiFDXiFMXjEnXilVXiQtXjBQXih5XiZaXikrXichXiY9XjdXXipuXipuIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b585af7cf771",
      "text": "不過你們一定要去逛逛凱爾的大篷車。他賣的貨色真是妙不可言。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^(x^*F^*{^!%^#.^(C^\"6^8A^8A^!p^&/^&Z^\"z^'1^5%^!\"^!@^.$^&Z^.w^'s^-2^,X^43^!)^\"A^1Y^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXih4XipGXip7XiElXiMuXihDXiI2XjhBXjhBXiFwXiYvXiZaXiJ6XicxXjUlXiEiXiFAXi4kXiZaXi53XidzXi0yXixYXjQzXiEpXiJBXjFZXiEi",
      "byte_length": 87
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_20979ce7c084",
      "text": "  凱爾是誰？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^!p^&/^,X^-y^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIXBeJi9eLFheLXleLlY=",
      "byte_length": 17
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_361887323e4f",
      "text": "  跟我說說拉麗莎的事。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^.+^$%^-x^-x^$6^0z^/E^&Z^*r^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLiteJCVeLXheLXheJDZeMHpeL0VeJlpeKnJeISI=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_617c815ac0da",
      "text": "  那個守門衛兵看起來疑心病真重。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^)!^!V^#+^)D^(=^+,^*Q^.(^!O^0p^#k^&R^-2^))^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKSFeIVZeIyteKUReKD1eKyxeKlFeLiheIU9eMHBeI2teJlJeLTJeKSleISI=",
      "byte_length": 47
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_57ccb79c50bf",
      "text": "自從強盜襲擊以來，衛兵們變得過度謹慎小心——何況 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'l^#f^#]^0!^08^$F^!B^!O^*A^(=^+,^*{^(U^#e^(x^#V^8@^83^#;^#k^*n^*n^!L^,q ",
      "encoded_base64": "XidsXiNmXiNdXjAhXjA4XiRGXiFCXiFPXipBXig9XissXip7XihVXiNlXih4XiNWXjhAXjgzXiM7XiNrXipuXipuXiFMXixxIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_78df838c098b",
      "text": "守門衛兵正是拉麗莎的弟弟。他能為她打聽到的消息越多， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#+^)D^(=^+,^%H^,X^$6^0z^/E^&Z^16^16^!\"^!@^'b^%{^+h^$-^-X^!u^&Z^%k^#w^(]^\"x^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiMrXilEXig9XissXiVIXixYXiQ2XjB6Xi9FXiZaXjE2XjE2XiEiXiFAXidiXiV7XitoXiQtXi1YXiF1XiZaXiVrXiN3XihdXiJ4XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a273dbcfdf55",
      "text": "她就越能為你們提供精準的指引。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+h^*J^(]^'b^%{^*F^*{^$A^!P^'7^,x^&Z^$8^#Z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XitoXipKXihdXidiXiV7XipGXip7XiRBXiFQXic3Xix4XiZaXiQ4XiNaXiEi",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_55ca17e53159",
      "text": "他是個魔法師，或者至少曾經是。但你們可千萬別宣揚出去。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^,X^!V^*0^%b^#M^*A^$'^'V^'n^#<^.j^'D^,X^!\"^!I^*F^*{^\"A^+7^-_^*H^2d^2k^!q^\"6^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXixYXiFWXiowXiViXiNNXipBXiQnXidWXiduXiM8Xi5qXidEXixYXiEiXiFJXipGXip7XiJBXis3Xi1fXipIXjJkXjJrXiFxXiI2XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3175c1661d49",
      "text": "這可是個秘密。不過話說回來，他手上的寶物真是不可思議。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^\"A^,X^!V^1O^#0^!\"^!)^(x^-v^-x^\"\\^!O^*A^!@^$+^!'^&Z^#4^&4^-2^,X^!)^\"A^#q^-|^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXiJBXixYXiFWXjFPXiMwXiEiXiEpXih4Xi12Xi14XiJcXiFPXipBXiFAXiQrXiEnXiZaXiM0XiY0Xi0yXixYXiEpXiJBXiNxXi18XiEi",
      "byte_length": 81
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7f5ba2949fd9",
      "text": "噢，只要有空我一定會去拜訪拉麗莎。在預卜未來這方面， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+]^*A^\"?^(C^$s^'(^$%^!%^#.^$r^\"6^,E^4d^$6^0z^/E^!\"^\"d^.E^53^,_^!O^(s^$]^)j^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitdXipBXiI/XihDXiRzXicoXiQlXiElXiMuXiRyXiI2XixFXjRkXiQ2XjB6Xi9FXiEiXiJkXi5FXjUzXixfXiFPXihzXiRdXilqXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a460b38ed8aa",
      "text": "她的心靈預知能力無人能及。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+h^&Z^#k^)g^.E^&h^'b^!~^%}^!<^'b^\"7^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitoXiZaXiNrXilnXi5FXiZoXidiXiF+XiV9XiE8XidiXiI3XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 40
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b48626486d0f",
      "text": "千真萬確，她是名副其實的先知。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+7^-2^-_^-6^*A^+h^,X^\"F^52^!j^#3^&Z^!b^&h^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xis3Xi0yXi1fXi02XipBXitoXixYXiJGXjUyXiFqXiMzXiZaXiFiXiZoXiEi",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0bdc4e50b66a",
      "text": "強盜就是強盜，他們就像黃沙一樣，是荒漠不可分割的一部分。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#]^0!^*J^,X^#]^0!^*A^!@^*{^*J^!`^*7^%]^!%^,f^*A^,X^1W^,}^!)^\"A^!s^+1^&Z^!%^)#^!s^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNdXjAhXipKXixYXiNdXjAhXipBXiFAXip7XipKXiFgXio3XiVdXiElXixmXipBXixYXjFXXix9XiEpXiJBXiFzXisxXiZaXiElXikjXiFzXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e486e5aeda13",
      "text": "他們襲擊商隊，就像襲擊這片大地上任何比他們弱小的生靈一樣 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^*{^08^$F^1'^)U^*A^*J^!`^08^$F^(s^&1^\"z^\"e^!'^!C^!L^,m^!@^*{^#\\^#;^&Z^&F^)g^!%^,f ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXip7XjA4XiRGXjEnXilVXipBXipKXiFgXjA4XiRGXihzXiYxXiJ6XiJlXiEnXiFDXiFMXixtXiFAXip7XiNcXiM7XiZaXiZGXilnXiElXixmIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_02dc6f7875bc",
      "text": "習以為常。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^3{^!B^%{^#O^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XjN7XiFCXiV7XiNPXiEi",
      "byte_length": 15
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0f44adae5771",
      "text": "  提奎茲爾村在什麼地方？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$A^5B^/D^&/^$z^\"d^!=^.T^\"e^$]^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJEFeNUJeL0ReJi9eJHpeImReIT1eLlReImVeJF1eLlY=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bd3e53ce84ca",
      "text": "  跟我說說尼本奈吧。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^.+^$%^-x^-x^#>^$x^\"~^*I^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLiteJCVeLXheLXheIz5eJHheIn5eKkleISI=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_94a695866388",
      "text": "  令尊是哪位？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*w^+u^,X^+I^!J^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKndeK3VeLFheK0leIUpeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 20
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6239afafc57e",
      "text": "提奎茲爾村就在這裡的西南方。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$A^5B^/D^&/^$z^*J^\"d^(s^-j^&Z^-l^\"/^$]^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRBXjVCXi9EXiYvXiR6XipKXiJkXihzXi1qXiZaXi1sXiIvXiRdXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 43
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_42a7f33fe197",
      "text": "我所知道的一切全是我父親告訴我的。往南走至少要走上整整三個月的路程。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^$)^&h^(y^&Z^!%^+.^!h^,X^$%^5d^(F^+B^-t^$%^&Z^!\"^,)^\"/^.&^'n^#<^(C^.&^!'^$T^$T^!&^!V^/p^&Z^(a^'#^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiQpXiZoXih5XiZaXiElXisuXiFoXixYXiQlXjVkXihGXitCXi10XiQlXiZaXiEiXiwpXiIvXi4mXiduXiM8XihDXi4mXiEnXiRUXiRUXiEmXiFWXi9wXiZaXihhXicjXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 103
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6e165b3ecd8b",
      "text": "我父親當年孤身一人抱著襁褓中的我，冒死橫越了淤泥海， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^5d^(F^&N^+~^2c^(c^!%^!<^,@^-a^8?^8>^!,^&Z^$%^*A^/P^%L^/2^(]^*D^6c^%d^6`^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXjVkXihGXiZOXit+XjJjXihjXiElXiE8XixAXi1hXjg/Xjg+XiEsXiZaXiQlXipBXi9QXiVMXi8yXihdXipEXjZjXiVkXjZgXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_58b11fd408fc",
      "text": "才逃脫了追擊的大軍。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$,^(p^'c^*D^(o^$F^&Z^\"z^..^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQsXihwXidjXipEXihvXiRGXiZaXiJ6Xi4uXiEi",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_889323937bf4",
      "text": "他是提奎茲爾村的領袖，一位堂堂正正的偉男子。能從聖堂武士的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^,X^$A^5B^/D^&/^$z^&Z^)s^7G^*A^!%^!J^42^42^%H^%H^&Z^*}^&K^#(^!\"^'b^#f^'Z^42^%J^+a^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXixYXiRBXjVCXi9EXiYvXiR6XiZaXilzXjdHXipBXiElXiFKXjQyXjQyXiVIXiVIXiZaXip9XiZLXiMoXiEiXidiXiNmXidaXjQyXiVKXithXiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a705de5dacb3",
      "text": "盛怒下死裡逃生的人本就少之又少，能從一介奴隸脫穎而出成為一村之主的， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^1L^#o^!(^%L^-j^(p^&F^&Z^!<^$x^*J^#<^!/^+;^#<^*A^'b^#f^!%^!>^##^)Z^'c^8:^'W^!q^$$^%{^!%^$z^!/^!-^&Z^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjFMXiNvXiEoXiVMXi1qXihwXiZGXiZaXiE8XiR4XipKXiM8XiEvXis7XiM8XipBXidiXiNmXiElXiE+XiMjXilaXidjXjg6XidXXiFxXiQkXiV7XiElXiR6XiEvXiEtXiZaXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 103
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0af731a4805a",
      "text": "更是鳳毛麟角。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$o^,X^8C^%R^8D^(H^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRvXixYXjhDXiVSXjhEXihIXiEi",
      "byte_length": 21
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_56da864dbdc3",
      "text": "哎，我平常其實不太理會他的那些神神叨叨，但聽著確實挺叫人 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^3i^*A^$%^0Y^#O^!j^#3^!)^+f^&A^$r^!@^&Z^)!^!8^&w^&w^82^82^*A^!I^-X^-a^-6^#3^,I^+<^!< ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjNpXipBXiQlXjBZXiNPXiFqXiMzXiEpXitmXiZBXiRyXiFAXiZaXikhXiE4XiZ3XiZ3XjgyXjgyXipBXiFJXi1YXi1hXi02XiMzXixJXis8XiE8IA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_73354a5ccb6f",
      "text": "熱血澎湃的。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&$^(:^87^86^&Z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiYkXig6Xjg3Xjg2XiZaXiEi",
      "byte_length": 18
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ac563feb9454",
      "text": "那是自然。拉麗莎——你們去拜訪過她了嗎？她真是太神準了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^,X^'l^&\"^!\"^$6^0z^/E^*n^*n^*F^*{^\"6^,E^4d^(x^+h^*D^+X^.V^+h^-2^,X^+f^&w^,x^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXixYXidsXiYiXiEiXiQ2XjB6Xi9FXipuXipuXipGXip7XiI2XixFXjRkXih4XitoXipEXitYXi5WXitoXi0yXixYXitmXiZ3Xix4XipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_df544251e568",
      "text": "我剛從她的大車那裡回來。她說我將會在此遇見背負著 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^+0^#f^+h^&Z^\"z^5%^)!^-j^\"\\^!O^!\"^+h^-x^$%^#7^$r^\"d^%I^.2^-m^.r^(W^-a ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiswXiNmXitoXiZaXiJ6XjUlXikhXi1qXiJcXiFPXiEiXitoXi14XiQlXiM3XiRyXiJkXiVJXi4yXi1tXi5yXihXXi1hIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_921831ca2650",
      "text": "偉大宿命的天命之子。我真是一刻都等不及了！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*}^\"z^7+^\"N^&Z^+e^\"N^!/^#(^!\"^$%^-2^,X^!%^.Y^)$^'-^!)^\"7^*D^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "Xip9XiJ6XjcrXiJOXiZaXitlXiJOXiEvXiMoXiEiXiQlXi0yXixYXiElXi5ZXikkXictXiEpXiI3XipEXipX",
      "byte_length": 63
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_70f840e10deb",
      "text": "噢，能見到半身人同胞真是讓人鬆了一口氣。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+]^*A^'b^-m^!u^\"-^(c^!<^\"E^'`^-2^,X^-}^!<^.R^*D^!%^\"<^%U^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XitdXipBXidiXi1tXiF1XiItXihjXiE8XiJFXidgXi0yXixYXi19XiE8Xi5SXipEXiElXiI8XiVVXiEi",
      "byte_length": 60
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f98ce678c764",
      "text": "很抱歉，我現在沒時間奉陪閒聊。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*K^,@^,h^*A^$%^&?^\"d^%\\^$f^)G^1+^8.^6A^-U^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipLXixAXixoXipBXiQlXiY/XiJkXiVcXiRmXilHXjErXjguXjZBXi1VXiEi",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_eef15b44ab3e",
      "text": "  你不跟我說清楚，我就不走！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^!)^.+^$%^-x^,u^,c^*A^$%^*J^!)^.&^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeISleLiteJCVeLXheLHVeLGNeKkFeJCVeKkpeISleLiZeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_30765b2762cf",
      "text": "  我向你保證，我們絕無惡意。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^+?^*F^!T^-{^*A^$%^*{^-I^%}^#y^#z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeKz9eKkZeIVReLXteKkFeJCVeKnteLUleJX1eI3leI3peISI=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7cbe7719b871",
      "text": "  開口說話，否則就讓你嘗嘗皮肉之苦！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^)F^\"<^-x^-v^*A^\"H^!x^*J^-}^*F^1o^1o^&[^'^^!/^.t^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKUZeIjxeLXheLXZeKkFeIkheIXheKkpeLX1eKkZeMW9eMW9eJlteJ15eIS9eLnReKlc=",
      "byte_length": 53
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e32a4eebc2e8",
      "text": "  反正你長得這麼醜，我本來也不想跟你說話！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^\"9^%H^*F^)C^#e^(s^.T^2O^*A^$%^$x^!O^!1^!)^,1^.+^*F^-x^-v^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIjleJUheKkZeKUNeI2VeKHNeLlReMk9eKkFeJCVeJHheIU9eITFeISleLDFeLiteKkZeLXheLXZeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 62
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ab2c065c2e90",
      "text": "我從沒聽說過你這號人物。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^#f^%\\^-X^-x^(x^*F^(s^(-^!<^&4^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiNmXiVcXi1YXi14Xih4XipGXihzXigtXiE8XiY0XiEi",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8698ca5e1ecb",
      "text": "你想留多久就留多久，請便吧。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^,1^-+^\"x^!.^*J^-+^\"x^!.^*A^*S^!R^*I^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiwxXi0rXiJ4XiEuXipKXi0rXiJ4XiEuXipBXipTXiFSXipJXiEi",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_11306e38cbf5",
      "text": "難道整個亞薩斯就沒有一絲榮譽可言了嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)a^(y^$T^!V^!9^-e^$[^*J^%\\^$s^!%^'C^,e^6-^\"A^1Y^*D^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XilhXih5XiRUXiFWXiE5Xi1lXiRbXipKXiVcXiRzXiElXidDXixlXjYtXiJBXjFZXipEXitYXi5W",
      "byte_length": 57
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_49cf17dfe350",
      "text": "就連當奴隸都比碰上這檔事強！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*J^.0^&N^##^)Z^)$^,m^-5^!'^(s^4}^*r^#]^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XipKXi4wXiZOXiMjXilaXikkXixtXi01XiEnXihzXjR9XipyXiNdXipX",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_09180b677e57",
      "text": "看來指望懂禮貌，對一個",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*Q^!O^$8^,]^,6^-8^-~^*A^#:^!%^!V",
      "encoded_base64": "XipRXiFPXiQ4XixdXiw2Xi04Xi1+XipBXiM6XiElXiFW",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_49d8aceac04a",
      "text": " 人類來說要求太高了。",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^!<^)w^!O^-x^(C^,n^+f^*+^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4hPF4pd14hT14teF4oQ14sbl4rZl4qK14qRF4hIg==",
      "byte_length": 31
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_00ed10c37b66",
      "text": " 矮人來說要求太高了。",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^&j^!<^!O^-x^(C^,n^+f^*+^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4mal4hPF4hT14teF4oQ14sbl4rZl4qK14qRF4hIg==",
      "byte_length": 31
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1b79b57f8c55",
      "text": "精靈來說要求太高了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'7^)g^!O^-x^(C^,n^+f^*+^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xic3XilnXiFPXi14XihDXixuXitmXiorXipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d6e1548bc785",
      "text": " 半精靈來說要求太高了。",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^\"-^'7^)g^!O^-x^(C^,n^+f^*+^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4iLV4nN14pZ14hT14teF4oQ14sbl4rZl4qK14qRF4hIg==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_912da5ce7699",
      "text": " 半巨人來說要求太高了。",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^\"-^#H^!<^!O^-x^(C^,n^+f^*+^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4iLV4jSF4hPF4hT14teF4oQ14sbl4rZl4qK14qRF4hIg==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fe7f8e4895c5",
      "text": " 穆爾人來說要求太高了。",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^8K^&/^!<^!O^-x^(C^,n^+f^*+^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "IF44S14mL14hPF4hT14teF4oQ14sbl4rZl4qK14qRF4hIg==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ce58e9d6be2b",
      "text": " 螳螂人來說要求太高了。",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^8O^8N^!<^!O^-x^(C^,n^+f^*+^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "IF44T144Tl4hPF4hT14teF4oQ14sbl4rZl4qK14qRF4hIg==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e7cf56057ccf",
      "text": "半身人猶豫了一下，暗自權衡著你語氣中的誠意。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"-^(c^!<^2y^3,^*D^!%^!(^*A^$k^'l^1E^8P^-a^*F^0:^%U^!,^&Z^2E^#z^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiItXihjXiE8XjJ5XjMsXipEXiElXiEoXipBXiRrXidsXjFFXjhQXi1hXipGXjA6XiVVXiEsXiZaXjJFXiN6XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ce30def69a2e",
      "text": "你的魅力",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^&Z^*/^!~",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiZaXiovXiF+",
      "byte_length": 12
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bd6103e3aee3",
      "text": " 足以化解這名半身人內心的恐懼。",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^(^^!B^\")^(I^(s^\"F^\"-^(c^!<^!g^#k^&Z^#t^$#^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4oXl4hQl4iKV4oSV4oc14iRl4iLV4oY14hPF4hZ14ja14mWl4jdF4kI14hIg==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9318cb799b21",
      "text": "請原諒我的無禮。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*S^\"5^0<^$%^&Z^%}^-8^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipTXiI1XjA8XiQlXiZaXiV9Xi04XiEi",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_580eb681a99e",
      "text": "，卻未能在這名半身人身上奏效。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*A^1&^,_^'b^\"d^(s^\"F^\"-^(c^!<^(c^!'^8F^$Q^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipBXjEmXixfXidiXiJkXihzXiJGXiItXihjXiE8XihjXiEnXjhGXiRRXiEi",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_63d624384d4c",
      "text": " 難得能遇見不想加害於我的人。",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^)a^#e^'b^.2^-m^!)^,1^\"\"^#/^$^^$%^&Z^!<^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4pYV4jZV4nYl4uMl4tbV4hKV4sMV4iIl4jL14kXl4kJV4mWl4hPF4hIg==",
      "byte_length": 43
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a9ef72d4aab0",
      "text": "  你在旅途中都見到了些什麼？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^\"d^2m^3.^!,^)$^-m^!u^*D^!8^!=^.T^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeImReMm1eMy5eISxeKSReLW1eIXVeKkReITheIT1eLlReLlY=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_39c65e9e294f",
      "text": "  為什麼大家都要加害於你？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^%{^!=^.T^\"z^+s^)$^(C^\"\"^#/^$^^*F^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJXteIT1eLlReInpeK3NeKSReKENeIiJeIy9eJF5eKkZeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fbb555b082fd",
      "text": "我的名字是瑪赫拉德。我本來在前往德拉吉的路上，卻被 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^&Z^\"F^#)^,X^-*^5$^$6^#j^!\"^$%^$x^!O^\"d^!z^,)^#j^$6^\"D^&Z^(a^!'^*A^1&^(@ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiZaXiJGXiMpXixYXi0qXjUkXiQ2XiNqXiEiXiQlXiR4XiFPXiJkXiF6XiwpXiNqXiQ2XiJEXiZaXihhXiEnXipBXjEmXihAIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0ae5f7847101",
      "text": "奴隸販子俘虜了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^##^)Z^6.^#(^39^3[^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiMjXilaXjYuXiMoXjM5XjNbXipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_76677c98bf9c",
      "text": "  你當初為什麼要去德拉吉？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^&N^1\"^%{^!=^.T^(C^\"6^#j^$6^\"D^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeJk5eMSJeJXteIT1eLlReKENeIjZeI2peJDZeIkReLlY=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_05ad7827e109",
      "text": "  這個荒蕪術士是何許人也？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^(s^!V^1W^4b^(<^+a^,X^!L^-s^!<^!1^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKHNeIVZeMVdeNGJeKDxeK2FeLFheIUxeLXNeITxeITFeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1e94477bc212",
      "text": "  你的家鄉在哪裡？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^&Z^+s^6<^\"d^+I^-j^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeJlpeK3NeNjxeImReK0leLWpeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_36a2bb11ba1e",
      "text": "  跟我說說那些奴隸販子的事。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^.+^$%^-x^-x^)!^!8^##^)Z^6.^#(^&Z^*r^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLiteJCVeLXheLXheKSFeITheIyNeKVpeNi5eIyheJlpeKnJeISI=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1033cba1c8ff",
      "text": "  我們也是逃亡的奴隸。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^*{^!1^,X^(p^!:^&Z^##^)Z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeKnteITFeLFheKHBeITpeJlpeIyNeKVpeISI=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e1235848e442",
      "text": "我見識了太多令人痛心的邪惡與野蠻暴行。我唯一的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^-m^(R^*D^+f^\"x^*w^!<^-.^#k^&Z^)\"^#y^'p^.:^/H^$m^(;^!\"^$%^+O^!%^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXi1tXihSXipEXitmXiJ4Xip3XiE8Xi0uXiNrXiZaXikiXiN5XidwXi46Xi9IXiRtXig7XiEiXiQlXitPXiElXiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ceb0399558f8",
      "text": "心願就是回到我的部族，在那裡我們與鄰族 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#k^.H^*J^,X^\"\\^!u^$%^&Z^)#^5V^*A^\"d^)!^-j^$%^*{^'p^)%^5V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNrXi5IXipKXixYXiJcXiF1XiQlXiZaXikjXjVWXipBXiJkXikhXi1qXiQlXip7XidwXiklXjVWIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_caace4aad6c3",
      "text": "和平共處。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"O^0Y^3d^(,^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJPXjBZXjNkXigsXiEi",
      "byte_length": 15
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b0d43b2d7377",
      "text": "我說不上來，除非是因為我是個半身人。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^-x^!)^!'^!O^*A^)Q^)i^,X^\"]^%{^$%^,X^!V^\"-^(c^!<^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXi14XiEpXiEnXiFPXipBXilRXilpXixYXiJdXiV7XiQlXixYXiFWXiItXihjXiE8XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_94910619a59b",
      "text": "我們似乎是唯一不以錢袋的沉重與否 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^!H^!0^,X^+O^!%^!)^!B^.<^(?^&Z^%Z^))^'p^\"H ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7XiFIXiEwXixYXitPXiElXiEpXiFCXi48Xig/XiZaXiVaXikpXidwXiJIIA==",
      "byte_length": 49
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_25a1ba096253",
      "text": "來衡量自身幸福的種族。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!O^8P^)*^'l^(c^15^&z^&Z^'$^5V^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFPXjhQXikqXidsXihjXjE1XiZ6XiZaXickXjVWXiEi",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_635217ec71ad",
      "text": "我現在必須啟程趕路了。在顛沛流離的旅途中能遇見 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^&?^\"d^#l^)r^57^'#^0u^(a^*D^!\"^\"d^8R^8I^%j^)`^&Z^2m^3.^!,^'b^.2^-m ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiY/XiJkXiNsXilyXjU3XicjXjB1XihhXipEXiEiXiJkXjhSXjhJXiVqXilgXiZaXjJtXjMuXiEsXidiXi4yXi1tIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_93ebb67bed0d",
      "text": "至少一個心懷善良的人，著實令我欣慰。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'n^#<^!%^!V^#k^,9^1(^1V^&Z^!<^*A^-a^#3^*w^$%^2'^4<^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiduXiM8XiElXiFWXiNrXiw5XjEoXjFWXiZaXiE8XipBXi1hXiMzXip3XiQlXjInXjQ8XiEi",
      "byte_length": 54
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3b5ea8011637",
      "text": "一名荒蕪術士榨乾了我們故土的生命力，導致我的部族深陷饑荒。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!%^\"F^1W^4b^(<^+a^8G^*X^*D^$%^*{^5U^\"c^&Z^&F^\"N^!~^*A^10^'o^$%^&Z^)#^5V^2*^)S^8S^1W^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiElXiJGXjFXXjRiXig8XithXjhHXipYXipEXiQlXip7XjVVXiJjXiZaXiZGXiJOXiF+XipBXjEwXidvXiQlXiZaXikjXjVWXjIqXilTXjhTXjFXXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8fb352b37cb9",
      "text": "我本希望能到德拉吉換取糧食。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^$x^+{^,]^'b^!u^#j^$6^\"D^4@^\":^5s^0J^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiR4Xit7XixdXidiXiF1XiNqXiQ2XiJEXjRAXiI6XjVzXjBKXiEi",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d2a6b7af309f",
      "text": "老實說，我也不太清楚。他出現在我們領地的時間，剛好只夠 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'U^#3^-x^*A^$%^!1^!)^+f^,u^,c^!\"^!@^!q^&?^\"d^$%^*{^)s^\"e^&Z^$f^)G^*A^+0^+i^\"?^+d ",
      "encoded_base64": "XidVXiMzXi14XipBXiQlXiExXiEpXitmXix1XixjXiEiXiFAXiFxXiY/XiJkXiQlXip7XilzXiJlXiZaXiRmXilHXipBXiswXitpXiI/XitkIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bba612edda24",
      "text": "把那裡徹底摧毀殆盡。他的名字叫威米亞斯。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$1^)!^-j^18^/^^$E^%N^8H^-1^!\"^!@^&Z^\"F^#)^+<^#&^'4^!9^$[^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQxXikhXi1qXjE4Xi9eXiRFXiVOXjhIXi0xXiEiXiFAXiZaXiJGXiMpXis8XiMmXic0XiE5XiRbXiEi",
      "byte_length": 60
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_482e0bc5ed08",
      "text": "在西方，穿過蓋德隆村更遠的地方。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"d^-l^$]^*A^')^(x^-d^#j^)T^$z^$o^({^&Z^\"e^$]^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJkXi1sXiRdXipBXicpXih4Xi1kXiNqXilUXiR6XiRvXih7XiZaXiJlXiRdXiEi",
      "byte_length": 48
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e772dde33ab3",
      "text": "我實在不想再提起他們。被關在他們的囚籠裡時， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^#3^\"d^!)^,1^!l^$A^.(^!@^*{^!\"^(@^.>^\"d^!@^*{^&Z^\"Z^'3^-j^$f^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiMzXiJkXiEpXiwxXiFsXiRBXi4oXiFAXip7XiEiXihAXi4+XiJkXiFAXip7XiZaXiJaXiczXi1qXiRmXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bfedc4c33afc",
      "text": "我差點就丟了性命。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^48^*;^*J^*q^*D^#r^\"N^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXjQ4Xio7XipKXipxXipEXiNyXiJOXiEi",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e021756f3926",
      "text": "這種慘事實在太司空見慣了。你們或許最好低調避避風頭 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^'$^,4^*r^#3^\"d^+f^+=^'(^-m^$!^*D^!\"^*F^*{^$'^-s^$q^+i^!K^(Q^0F^0F^)y^)t ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXickXiw0XipyXiMzXiJkXitmXis9XicoXi1tXiQhXipEXiEiXipGXip7XiQnXi1zXiRxXitpXiFLXihRXjBGXjBGXil5Xil0IA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_73f41699adcf",
      "text": "一陣子。那群奴隸販子剛才正在商隊西南邊一帶 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!%^)P^#(^!\"^)!^'R^##^)Z^6.^#(^+0^$,^%H^\"d^1'^)U^-l^\"/^.8^!%^#N ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiElXilQXiMoXiEiXikhXidSXiMjXilaXjYuXiMoXiswXiQsXiVIXiJkXjEnXilVXi1sXiIvXi44XiElXiNOIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cddac373df9a",
      "text": "四處大肆搜捕。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"[^(,^\"z^2>^/h^4?^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJbXigsXiJ6XjI+Xi9oXjQ/XiEi",
      "byte_length": 21
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f92129778f4b",
      "text": "我很忙。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*K^,+^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXipLXiwrXiEi",
      "byte_length": 12
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0081b6f93306",
      "text": "抱歉，在啟程展開我的旅途之前， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,@^,h^*A^\"d^57^'#^+x^)F^$%^&Z^2m^3.^!/^!z^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XixAXixoXipBXiJkXjU3XicjXit4XilGXiQlXiZaXjJtXjMuXiEvXiF6XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c320535f3eb2",
      "text": "我得好好歇息一會兒。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^#e^+i^+i^%E^#w^!%^$r^++^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiNlXitpXitpXiVFXiN3XiElXiRyXisrXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 31
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1a47b6813a23",
      "text": "你們好啊！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^+i^+Q^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XitpXitRXipX",
      "byte_length": 15
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_74e348617214",
      "text": "我的名字叫梅蒂克特。要一起圍著營火烤烤火嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^&Z^\"F^#)^+<^%-^(%^!d^&5^!\"^(C^!%^.(^\"`^-a^&'^%x^/w^/w^%x^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiZaXiJGXiMpXis8XiUtXiglXiFkXiY1XiEiXihDXiElXi4oXiJgXi1hXiYnXiV4Xi93Xi93XiV4XitYXi5W",
      "byte_length": 66
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7be0cfe68049",
      "text": "你還真夠熱情的，不是嗎？好吧，希望你不介意 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^.7^-2^+d^&$^,0^&Z^*A^!)^,X^+X^.V^+i^*I^*A^+{^,]^*F^!)^!>^#z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXi43Xi0yXitkXiYkXiwwXiZaXipBXiEpXixYXitYXi5WXitpXipJXipBXit7XixdXipGXiEpXiE+XiN6IA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a9bd81f539cd",
      "text": "我一個人坐著。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^!%^!V^!<^8E^-a^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiElXiFWXiE8XjhFXi1hXiEi",
      "byte_length": 21
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0a433e40583c",
      "text": "我正在為我的好運氣慶祝呢！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^%H^\"d^%{^$%^&Z^+i^.4^%U^5P^&v^+C^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiVIXiJkXiV7XiQlXiZaXitpXi40XiVVXjVQXiZ2XitDXipX",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fa4a3e1e6595",
      "text": "  你在慶祝什麼？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^\"d^5P^&v^!=^.T^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeImReNVBeJnZeIT1eLlReLlY=",
      "byte_length": 23
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2f790d1009fe",
      "text": "  你為什麼要去提爾？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^%{^!=^.T^(C^\"6^$A^&/^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeJXteIT1eLlReKENeIjZeJEFeJi9eLlY=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c7951e5f47ab",
      "text": "  你是怎麼弄到這筆錢的？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^,X^,,^.T^/`^!u^(s^-A^.<^&Z^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeLFheLCxeLlReL2BeIXVeKHNeLUFeLjxeJlpeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2058d87dd7bf",
      "text": "  那個聖堂武士在哪裡？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^)!^!V^'Z^42^%J^+a^\"d^+I^-j^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKSFeIVZeJ1peNDJeJUpeK2FeImReK0leLWpeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_125e38bff9e8",
      "text": "  我碰見過那個聖堂武士了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^-5^-m^(x^)!^!V^'Z^42^%J^+a^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeLTVeLW1eKHheKSFeIVZeJ1peNDJeJUpeK2FeKkReISI=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_34534b74bc19",
      "text": "你的名字聽起來好耳熟， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^&Z^\"F^#)^-X^.(^!O^+i^'Y^-\"^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiZaXiJGXiMpXi1YXi4oXiFPXitpXidZXi0iXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_00d514e181cb",
      "text": "……你就是那個從德拉吉殺出重圍的角鬥士嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*o^*o^*F^*J^,X^)!^!V^#f^#j^$6^\"D^%M^!q^))^\"`^&Z^(H^*,^+a^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XipvXipvXipGXipKXixYXikhXiFWXiNmXiNqXiQ2XiJEXiVNXiFxXikpXiJgXiZaXihIXiosXithXitYXi5W",
      "byte_length": 63
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_db9244df4703",
      "text": "  沒錯，正是在下。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^%\\^)5^*A^%H^,X^\"d^!(^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJVxeKTVeKkFeJUheLFheImReISheISI=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a4843bbbd0df",
      "text": "  你認錯人了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^(O^)5^!<^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeKE9eKTVeITxeKkReISI=",
      "byte_length": 20
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c449981f4518",
      "text": "  少管閒事！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^#<^-D^6A^*r^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIzxeLUReNkFeKnJeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 17
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cf568e3ba2a4",
      "text": "我剛狠狠痛宰了一個蠢蛋聖堂武士一筆。不得不說，能給聖堂武士下套 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^+0^4T^4T^-.^1w^*D^!%^!V^.u^6\"^'Z^42^%J^+a^!%^-A^!\"^!)^#e^!)^-x^*A^'b^'A^'Z^42^%J^+a^!(^#! ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiswXjRUXjRUXi0uXjF3XipEXiElXiFWXi51XjYiXidaXjQyXiVKXithXiElXi1BXiEiXiEpXiNlXiEpXi14XipBXidiXidBXidaXjQyXiVKXithXiEoXiMhIA==",
      "byte_length": 94
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_28a4074d52cd",
      "text": "真是大快人心，而現在我手頭上有了足夠的錢",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-2^,X^\"z^*L^!<^#k^*A^'W^&?^\"d^$%^$+^)t^!'^$s^*D^(^^+d^&Z^.<",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi0yXixYXiJ6XipMXiE8XiNrXipBXidXXiY/XiJkXiQlXiQrXil0XiEnXiRzXipEXiheXitkXiZaXi48",
      "byte_length": 60
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_72fed6e3843c",
      "text": "一大筆可觀的橫財剛落入我的錢袋，足夠讓我",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!%^\"z^-A^\"A^*R^&Z^/2^0=^+0^-`^!f^$%^&Z^.<^(?^*A^(^^+d^-}^$%",
      "encoded_base64": "XiElXiJ6Xi1BXiJBXipSXiZaXi8yXjA9XiswXi1gXiFmXiQlXiZaXi48Xig/XipBXiheXitkXi19XiQl",
      "byte_length": 60
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f77dc4d8579f",
      "text": " 動身前往提爾。",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^\"%^(c^!z^,)^$A^&/^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4iJV4oY14hel4sKV4kQV4mL14hIg==",
      "byte_length": 22
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_525cc3d38b70",
      "text": "那裡才是真正能挖礦淘金的寶地。只要手腳勤快， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^-j^$,^,X^-2^%H^'b^2!^5m^8J^)+^&Z^#4^\"e^!\"^\"?^(C^$+^00^2Z^*L^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXi1qXiQsXixYXi0yXiVIXidiXjIhXjVtXjhKXikrXiZaXiM0XiJlXiEiXiI/XihDXiQrXjAwXjJaXipMXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b06a3e82179b",
      "text": "偷偷溜進鐵礦坑順手牽羊鑿走礦脈，就能過上十分滋潤的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^/O^/O^%r^(w^)?^5m^5>^.D^$+^5e^8M^6@^.&^5m^6i^*A^*J^'b^(x^!'^*Y^!s^7|^7_^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi9PXi9PXiVyXih3Xik/XjVtXjU+Xi5EXiQrXjVlXjhNXjZAXi4mXjVtXjZpXipBXipKXidiXih4XiEnXipZXiFzXjd8XjdfXiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_52e182019479",
      "text": "富裕日子。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^3C^8Q^$a^#(^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XjNDXjhRXiRhXiMoXiEi",
      "byte_length": 15
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c491f18ff5f5",
      "text": "我讓那個聖堂武士深信不疑，以為他能在這裡西南邊的一處 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^-}^)!^!V^'Z^42^%J^+a^2*^!U^!)^0p^*A^!B^%{^!@^'b^\"d^(s^-j^-l^\"/^.8^&Z^!%^(, ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXi19XikhXiFWXidaXjQyXiVKXithXjIqXiFVXiEpXjBwXipBXiFCXiV7XiFAXidiXiJkXihzXi1qXi1sXiIvXi44XiZaXiElXigsIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7b7f4c603197",
      "text": "礦物溫泉裡挖出銅礦。當然啦，那裡除了熱騰騰的滾水之外， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^5m^&4^%s^%a^-j^2!^!q^0x^5m^!\"^&N^&\"^+R^*A^)!^-j^)Q^*D^&$^.O^.O^&Z^,z^%V^!/^\"w^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjVtXiY0XiVzXiVhXi1qXjIhXiFxXjB4XjVtXiEiXiZOXiYiXitSXipBXikhXi1qXilRXipEXiYkXi5PXi5PXiZaXix6XiVWXiEvXiJ3XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8f6b71df5f8e",
      "text": "什麼也沒有。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!=^.T^!1^%\\^$s^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiE9Xi5UXiExXiVcXiRzXiEi",
      "byte_length": 18
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_12e1a8340ab2",
      "text": "這麼說吧，在荒漠深處有個聖堂武士， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^.T^-x^*I^*A^\"d^1W^,}^2*^(,^$s^!V^'Z^42^%J^+a^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXi5UXi14XipJXipBXiJkXjFXXix9XjIqXigsXiRzXiFWXidaXjQyXiVKXithXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f309189ed14e",
      "text": "對採礦這檔事根本一竅不通。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#:^5R^5m^(s^4}^*r^%)^$x^!%^8L^!)^(t^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiM6XjVSXjVtXihzXjR9XipyXiUpXiR4XiElXjhMXiEpXih0XiEi",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4a3657ed60d1",
      "text": "就我所知，他現在說不定已經灰溜溜滾回德拉吉了；但我 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*J^$%^$)^&h^*A^!@^&?^\"d^-x^!)^#.^#J^'D^%y^%r^%r^,z^\"\\^#j^$6^\"D^*D^*C^!I^$% ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipKXiQlXiQpXiZoXipBXiFAXiY/XiJkXi14XiEpXiMuXiNKXidEXiV5XiVyXiVyXix6XiJcXiNqXiQ2XiJEXipEXipDXiFJXiQlIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d383df3345ea",
      "text": "跟他告別時，他還在西南邊的溫泉那裡白忙活呢。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.+^!@^+B^*H^$f^*A^!@^.7^\"d^-l^\"/^.8^&Z^%s^%a^)!^-j^&X^,+^%i^+C^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi4rXiFAXitCXipIXiRmXipBXiFAXi43XiJkXi1sXiIvXi44XiZaXiVzXiVhXikhXi1qXiZYXiwrXiVpXitDXiEi",
      "byte_length": 66
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4a155291b617",
      "text": "那你們肯定見識到他有多蠢了。要是所有的聖堂武士都這麼無能， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^*F^*{^-Z^#.^-m^(R^!u^!@^$s^\"x^.u^*D^!\"^(C^,X^$)^$s^&Z^'Z^42^%J^+a^)$^(s^.T^%}^'b^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXipGXip7Xi1aXiMuXi1tXihSXiF1XiFAXiRzXiJ4Xi51XipEXiEiXihDXixYXiQpXiRzXiZaXidaXjQyXiVKXithXikkXihzXi5UXiV9XidiXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_05f4f624763a",
      "text": "我們這些冒險者的日子肯定會過得輕鬆得多，而且荷包滿滿！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^(s^!8^/P^*m^'V^&Z^$a^#(^-Z^#.^$r^(x^#e^(g^.R^#e^\"x^*A^'W^!*^*g^\"'^,{^,{^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7XihzXiE4Xi9QXiptXidWXiZaXiRhXiMoXi1aXiMuXiRyXih4XiNlXihnXi5SXiNlXiJ4XipBXidXXiEqXipnXiInXix7Xix7XipX",
      "byte_length": 81
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ec6bc7f30fc0",
      "text": "祝你們旅途順利。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&v^*F^*{^2m^3.^.D^!t^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZ2XipGXip7XjJtXjMuXi5EXiF0XiEi",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f520df962731",
      "text": "我只是想跟人熱絡熱絡而已。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^\"?^,X^,1^.+^!<^&$^-J^&$^-J^'W^#J^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiI/XixYXiwxXi4rXiE8XiYkXi1KXiYkXi1KXidXXiNKXiEi",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_488d0a532165",
      "text": "我在角鬥場看過你們的比賽。那一戰交鋒 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^\"d^(H^*,^\"n^*Q^(x^*F^*{^&Z^,m^*U^!\"^)!^!%^$(^0P^6? ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiJkXihIXiosXiJuXipRXih4XipGXip7XiZaXixtXipVXiEiXikhXiElXiQoXjBQXjY/IA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_742a874ef4e9",
      "text": "沙丘收割者，真是精彩絕倫。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%]^5(^$M^+1^'V^*A^-2^,X^'7^#`^-I^/!^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVdXjUoXiRNXisxXidWXipBXi0yXixYXic3XiNgXi1JXi8hXiEi",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_755263becc79",
      "text": "尖叫甲蟲，真是精彩絕倫。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#=^+<^&J^(8^*A^-2^,X^'7^#`^-I^/!^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiM9Xis8XiZKXig4XipBXi0yXixYXic3XiNgXi1JXi8hXiEi",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_102eba20b386",
      "text": "山脈追蹤者，真是精彩絕倫。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^11^6i^(o^(b^'V^*A^-2^,X^'7^#`^-I^/!^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XjExXjZpXihvXihiXidWXipBXi0yXixYXic3XiNgXi1JXi8hXiEi",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ed89cbd7e6aa",
      "text": "疤面與他的爪牙，真是精彩絕倫。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^5g^)j^'p^!@^&Z^&.^&3^*A^-2^,X^'7^#`^-I^/!^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XjVnXilqXidwXiFAXiZaXiYuXiYzXipBXi0yXixYXic3XiNgXi1JXi8hXiEi",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c46993bd247d",
      "text": "那麼多怪物，真是精彩絕倫。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^.T^\"x^#s^&4^*A^-2^,X^'7^#`^-I^/!^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXi5UXiJ4XiNzXiY0XipBXi0yXixYXic3XiNgXi1JXi8hXiEi",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ec7a87389c7a",
      "text": "哈，你們可給那些聖堂武士留下了無比深刻的印象，他們到現在還氣得 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+F^*A^*F^*{^\"A^'A^)!^!8^'Z^42^%J^+a^-+^!(^*D^%}^,m^2*^.Y^&Z^1%^4g^*A^!@^*{^!u^&?^\"d^.7^%U^#e ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitGXipBXipGXip7XiJBXidBXikhXiE4XidaXjQyXiVKXithXi0rXiEoXipEXiV9XixtXjIqXi5ZXiZaXjElXjRnXipBXiFAXip7XiF1XiY/XiJkXi43XiVVXiNlIA==",
      "byte_length": 94
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8fcbe5ce8d68",
      "text": "暴跳如雷、咬牙切齒呢！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$m^0@^#$^)c^!!^\"Q^&3^+.^.U^+C^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRtXjBAXiMkXiljXiEhXiJRXiYzXisuXi5VXitDXipX",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b43f025aeda6",
      "text": "噢，好吧。我剛才還以為自己能有幸與大人物為伍呢。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+]^*A^+i^*I^!\"^$%^+0^$,^.7^!B^%{^'l^#I^'b^$s^15^'p^\"z^!<^&4^%{^!F^+C^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XitdXipBXitpXipJXiEiXiQlXiswXiQsXi43XiFCXiV7XidsXiNJXidiXiRzXjE1XidwXiJ6XiE8XiY0XiV7XiFGXitDXiEi",
      "byte_length": 72
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_567acdab0cc0",
      "text": "行吧。那我就自個兒坐在這裡，跟自己熱絡去。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(;^*I^!\"^)!^$%^*J^'l^!V^++^8E^\"d^(s^-j^*A^.+^'l^#I^&$^-J^\"6^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xig7XipJXiEiXikhXiQlXipKXidsXiFWXisrXjhFXiJkXihzXi1qXipBXi4rXidsXiNJXiYkXi1KXiI2XiEi",
      "byte_length": 63
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fc727a0e7201",
      "text": "我很想跟你們多聊聊，但我與 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*K^,1^.+^*F^*{^\"x^-U^-U^*A^!I^$%^'p ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXipLXiwxXi4rXipGXip7XiJ4Xi1VXi1VXipBXiFJXiQlXidwIA==",
      "byte_length": 40
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_57489b007ce5",
      "text": " 還有漫長的前路要走。我們",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^.7^$s^2,^)C^&Z^!z^(a^(C^.&^!\"^$%^*{",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4uN14kc14yLF4pQ14mWl4hel4oYV4oQ14uJl4hIl4kJV4qew==",
      "byte_length": 37
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ff56edce7aaf",
      "text": " 還有很多事要做。",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^.7^$s^*K^\"x^*r^(C^*~^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4uN14kc14qS14ieF4qcl4oQ14qfl4hIg==",
      "byte_length": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8fe6e60186bb",
      "text": "你們好。我是 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^+i^!\"^$%^,X ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XitpXiEiXiQlXixYIA==",
      "byte_length": 19
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_26bfa42ce7bc",
      "text": " 和我都是從北方逃難來的難民。我們的村莊被大火燒毀了， ",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^\"O^$%^)$^,X^#f^+6^$]^(p^)a^!O^&Z^)a^%T^!\"^$%^*{^&Z^$z^6l^(@^\"z^%x^&&^%N^*D^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4iT14kJV4pJF4sWF4jZl4rNl4kXV4ocF4pYV4hT14mWl4pYV4lVF4hIl4kJV4qe14mWl4kel42bF4oQF4iel4leF4mJl4lTl4qRF4qQSA=",
      "byte_length": 80
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9f1b69f1ba4a",
      "text": "我們失去了一切！求求你們，能施捨我們一點買食物的錢嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^\"|^\"6^*D^!%^+.^*W^,n^,n^*F^*{^*A^'b^$_^8[^$%^*{^!%^*;^.!^0J^&4^&Z^.<^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7XiJ8XiI2XipEXiElXisuXipXXixuXixuXipGXip7XipBXidiXiRfXjhbXiQlXip7XiElXio7Xi4hXjBKXiY0XiZaXi48XitYXi5W",
      "byte_length": 81
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e18b721cb011",
      "text": "你要給她多少枚陶瓷幣？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^(C^'A^+h^\"x^#<^$~^)R^&E^+|^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXihDXidBXitoXiJ4XiM8XiR+XilSXiZFXit8Xi5W",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f0f87adea52b",
      "text": "  一分不給",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^!%^!s^!)^'A",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeISVeIXNeISleJ0E=",
      "byte_length": 14
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e2aa11aaa4a4",
      "text": "當她意識到你們的錢袋和她一樣空空如也時，臉上不禁 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&N^+h^#z^(R^!u^*F^*{^&Z^.<^(?^\"O^+h^!%^,f^'(^'(^#$^!1^$f^*A^-\\^!'^!)^&y ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZOXitoXiN6XihSXiF1XipGXip7XiZaXi48Xig/XiJPXitoXiElXixmXicoXicoXiMkXiExXiRmXipBXi1cXiEnXiEpXiZ5IA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0befdd8e82b3",
      "text": "浮現出深深的失望之色。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^4M^&?^!q^2*^2*^&Z^\"|^,]^!/^'s^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XjRNXiY/XiFxXjIqXjIqXiZaXiJ8XixdXiEvXidzXiEi",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e98217b70ba9",
      "text": "她轉過頭去，對無家可歸者所遭受的冷酷對待 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+h^(i^(x^)t^\"6^*A^#:^%}^+s^\"A^%K^'V^$)^(}^\";^&Z^!n^1b^#:^,* ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitoXihpXih4Xil0XiI2XipBXiM6XiV9XitzXiJBXiVLXidWXiQpXih9XiI7XiZaXiFuXjFiXiM6XiwqIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fb18094c9122",
      "text": "似乎早已習以為常、感到麻木了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!H^!0^,V^#J^3{^!B^%{^#O^!!^#{^!u^*6^$v^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFIXiEwXixWXiNKXjN7XiFCXiV7XiNPXiEhXiN7XiF1Xio2XiR2XipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1d71fc23896c",
      "text": "噢，太感謝你們了！我們已經整整兩天沒吃過東西了！謝謝你們！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+]^*A^+f^#{^-z^*F^*{^*D^*W^$%^*{^#J^'D^$T^$T^!i^+e^%\\^2^^(x^,`^-l^*D^*W^-z^-z^*F^*{^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XitdXipBXitmXiN7Xi16XipGXip7XipEXipXXiQlXip7XiNKXidEXiRUXiRUXiFpXitlXiVcXjJeXih4XixgXi1sXipEXipXXi16Xi16XipGXip7XipX",
      "byte_length": 87
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3c7db3340def",
      "text": "感謝你們借給 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#{^-z^*F^*{^!Y^'A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiN7Xi16XipGXip7XiFZXidBIA==",
      "byte_length": 19
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_35e581941bb2",
      "text": " 這筆錢。要不是有它，我們肯定早就餓死了。",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^(s^-A^.<^!\"^(C^!)^,X^$s^+o^*A^$%^*{^-Z^#.^,V^*J^2R^%L^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4oc14tQV4uPF4hIl4oQ14hKV4sWF4kc14rb14qQV4kJV4qe14tWl4jLl4sVl4qSl4yUl4lTF4qRF4hIg==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_60d7940eb218",
      "text": "  你認為村莊為什麼會被燒毀？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^(O^%{^$z^6l^%{^!=^.T^$r^(@^&&^%N^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeKE9eJXteJHpeNmxeJXteIT1eLlReJHJeKEBeJiZeJU5eLlY=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8e7fdd823e00",
      "text": "  你們打算前往哪裡？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^*{^$-^-C^!z^,)^+I^-j^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeKnteJC1eLUNeIXpeLCleK0leLWpeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_599c7219633f",
      "text": "。我是德拉吉聖堂武士巴林特的女兒。因為我私自放走了一些奴隸，他便將我逐入 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!\"^$%^,X^#j^$6^\"D^'Z^42^%J^+a^#K^/1^&5^&Z^#\"^++^!\"^\"]^%{^$%^&~^'l^$P^.&^*D^!%^!8^##^)Z^*A^!@^!R^#7^$%^(r^!f ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEiXiQlXixYXiNqXiQ2XiJEXidaXjQyXiVKXithXiNLXi8xXiY1XiZaXiMiXisrXiEiXiJdXiV7XiQlXiZ+XidsXiRQXi4mXipEXiElXiE4XiMjXilaXipBXiFAXiFSXiM3XiQlXihyXiFmIA==",
      "byte_length": 109
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0fbc8996201f",
      "text": "荒漠任由自生自滅。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^1W^,}^!C^&I^'l^&F^'l^%t^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XjFXXix9XiFDXiZJXidsXiZGXidsXiV0XiEi",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7aca813cf95d",
      "text": "  你心裡一定對此滿懷怨恨吧。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^#k^-j^!%^#.^#:^%I^,{^,9^3F^2g^*I^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeI2teLWpeISVeIy5eIzpeJUleLHteLDleM0ZeMmdeKkleISI=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_38682fbfd2fd",
      "text": "  跟我說說你父親的事。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^.+^$%^-x^-x^*F^5d^(F^&Z^*r^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLiteJCVeLXheLXheKkZeNWReKEZeJlpeKnJeISI=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_033e69dbcc69",
      "text": "  你能告訴我其他聖堂武士的情況嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^'b^+B^-t^$%^!j^!@^'Z^42^%J^+a^&Z^,0^,q^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeJ2JeK0JeLXReJCVeIWpeIUBeJ1peNDJeJUpeK2FeJlpeLDBeLHFeK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 50
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_950a43540ddd",
      "text": "  這跟奴隸部族又有什麼關係？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^(s^.+^##^)Z^)#^5V^+;^$s^!=^.T^.>^38^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKHNeLiteIyNeKVpeKSNeNVZeKzteJHNeIT1eLlReLj5eMzheLlY=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_33b518259dac",
      "text": "  關於特克圖克特雷，你知道些什麼？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^.>^$^^&5^!d^\"b^!d^&5^)c^*A^*F^&h^(y^!8^!=^.T^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLj5eJF5eJjVeIWReImJeIWReJjVeKWNeKkFeKkZeJmheKHleITheIT1eLlReLlY=",
      "byte_length": 50
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_854e9453d635",
      "text": " 說那些當兵的只不過是想搶奪糧食，但聖堂武士卻早已下令 ",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^-x^)!^!8^&N^+,^&Z^\"?^!)^(x^,X^,1^1?^1,^5s^0J^*A^!I^'Z^42^%J^+a^1&^,V^#J^!(^*w ",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4teF4pIV4hOF4mTl4rLF4mWl4iP14hKV4oeF4sWF4sMV4xP14xLF41c14wSl4qQV4hSV4nWl40Ml4lSl4rYV4xJl4sVl4jSl4hKF4qdyA=",
      "byte_length": 80
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_814ddc7b1f46",
      "text": "要徹底剿滅德拉吉周邊目之所及的所有奴隸部族。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(C^18^/^^7R^%t^#j^$6^\"D^\"L^.8^&^^!/^$)^\"7^&Z^$)^$s^##^)Z^)#^5V^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XihDXjE4Xi9eXjdSXiV0XiNqXiQ2XiJEXiJMXi44XiZeXiEvXiQpXiI3XiZaXiQpXiRzXiMjXilaXikjXjVWXiEi",
      "byte_length": 66
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b2d625c76eef",
      "text": "只要我親眼看著 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"?^(C^$%^(F^&d^*Q^-a ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiI/XihDXiQlXihGXiZkXipRXi1hIA==",
      "byte_length": 22
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b2a002cfa087",
      "text": " 在另一個村莊安頓妥當，我就會潛回德拉吉。在我哥哥的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^\"d^\">^!%^!V^$z^6l^+p^.F^5C^&N^*A^$%^*J^$r^7:^\"\\^#j^$6^\"D^!\"^\"d^$%^\"S^\"S^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4iZF4iPl4hJV4hVl4kel42bF4rcF4uRl41Q14mTl4qQV4kJV4qSl4kcl43Ol4iXF4jal4kNl4iRF4hIl4iZF4kJV4iU14iU14mWiA=",
      "byte_length": 77
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_51cbf15eeaa9",
      "text": "暗中相助下，我或許能在聖堂武士之間挑起內鬨。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$k^!,^&a^\"#^!(^*A^$%^$'^-s^'b^\"d^'Z^42^%J^+a^!/^)G^,H^.(^!g^8d^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRrXiEsXiZhXiIjXiEoXipBXiQlXiQnXi1zXidiXiJkXidaXjQyXiVKXithXiEvXilHXixIXi4oXiFnXjhkXiEi",
      "byte_length": 66
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8f6686ae5ed8",
      "text": "巴林特是掌管德拉吉整座城邦糧倉的聖堂武士。他囤積了 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#K^/1^&5^,X^$;^-D^#j^$6^\"D^$T^/_^+_^1a^5s^8T^&Z^'Z^42^%J^+a^!\"^!@^8V^27^*D ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNLXi8xXiY1XixYXiQ7Xi1EXiNqXiQ2XiJEXiRUXi9fXitfXjFhXjVzXjhUXiZaXidaXjQyXiVKXithXiEiXiFAXjhWXjI3XipEIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_99ea40e18ffa",
      "text": "海量的過剩糧食，並以此作為槓桿為自己攫取大權。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^6`^)*^&Z^(x^8U^5s^0J^*A^!+^!B^%I^!M^%{^8^^%,^%{^'l^#I^8]^\":^\"z^1E^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjZgXikqXiZaXih4XjhVXjVzXjBKXipBXiErXiFCXiVJXiFNXiV7XjheXiUsXiV7XidsXiNJXjhdXiI6XiJ6XjFFXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_64918828910b",
      "text": "與此同時，底層的平民百姓卻無端白白餓死。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'p^%I^\"E^$f^*A^/^^#B^&Z^0Y^%T^&Y^6S^1&^%}^5o^&X^&X^2R^%L^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XidwXiVJXiJFXiRmXipBXi9eXiNCXiZaXjBZXiVUXiZZXjZTXjEmXiV9XjVvXiZYXiZYXjJSXiVMXiEi",
      "byte_length": 60
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0c808dd33579",
      "text": "兩年前我還在德拉吉時，特克圖克特雷就已經對直接掌管 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!i^+~^!z^$%^.7^\"d^#j^$6^\"D^$f^*A^&5^!d^\"b^!d^&5^)c^*J^#J^'D^#:^&`^$?^$;^-D ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFpXit+XiF6XiQlXi43XiJkXiNqXiQ2XiJEXiRmXipBXiY1XiFkXiJiXiFkXiY1XiljXipKXiNKXidEXiM6XiZgXiQ/XiQ7Xi1EIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_22c8263d3253",
      "text": "聖堂武士失去了興致，導致德拉吉的統治中樞出現了權力真空。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'Z^42^%J^+a^\"|^\"6^*D^-]^'o^*A^10^'o^#j^$6^\"D^&Z^'B^%_^!,^8_^!q^&?^*D^1E^!~^-2^'(^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XidaXjQyXiVKXithXiJ8XiI2XipEXi1dXidvXipBXjEwXidvXiNqXiQ2XiJEXiZaXidCXiVfXiEsXjhfXiFxXiY/XipEXjFFXiF+Xi0yXicoXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5bbe9cdf7a0c",
      "text": "聖堂武士們隨即為了爭奪那份權力大打出手。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'Z^42^%J^+a^*{^)X^\"1^%{^*D^1I^1,^)!^*x^1E^!~^\"z^$-^!q^$+^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XidaXjQyXiVKXithXip7XilYXiIxXiV7XipEXjFJXjEsXikhXip4XjFFXiF+XiJ6XiQtXiFxXiQrXiEi",
      "byte_length": 60
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_114261769186",
      "text": " 這正是他們對奴隸部族發動這場戰爭的根本原因。",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^(s^%H^,X^!@^*{^#:^##^)Z^)#^5V^&W^\"%^(s^\"n^$(^1I^&Z^%)^$x^\"5^\"]^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4oc14lSF4sWF4hQF4qe14jOl4jI14pWl4pI141Vl4mV14iJV4oc14ibl4kKF4xSV4mWl4lKV4keF4iNV4iXV4hIg==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f9ef2d114966",
      "text": "巫王特克圖克特雷在不久前徹底隱退避世了。沒有人再見過他， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^14^-)^&5^!d^\"b^!d^&5^)c^\"d^!)^!.^!z^18^/^^)Y^*V^0F^*p^*D^!\"^%\\^$s^!<^!l^-m^(x^!@^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjE0Xi0pXiY1XiFkXiJiXiFkXiY1XiljXiJkXiEpXiEuXiF6XjE4Xi9eXilZXipWXjBGXipwXipEXiEiXiVcXiRzXiE8XiFsXi1tXih4XiFAXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_28a0b1a02bb9",
      "text": "也沒人知道究竟發生了什麼。聖堂武士們不再爭奪統治權，反而 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!1^%\\^!<^&h^(y^-<^28^&W^&F^*D^!=^.T^!\"^'Z^42^%J^+a^*{^!)^!l^1I^1,^'B^%_^1E^*A^\"9^'W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiExXiVcXiE8XiZoXih5Xi08XjI4XiZXXiZGXipEXiE9Xi5UXiEiXidaXjQyXiVKXithXip7XiEpXiFsXjFJXjEsXidCXiVfXjFFXipBXiI5XidXIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d2017139569b",
      "text": "陷入了極度恐慌——他們深恐自己 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)S^!f^*D^1D^#V^#t^#}^*n^*n^!@^*{^2*^#t^'l^#I ",
      "encoded_base64": "XilTXiFmXipEXjFEXiNWXiN0XiN9XipuXipuXiFAXip7XjIqXiN0XidsXiNJIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_766ed649b7d1",
      "text": "會徹底失去施展神術的力量源泉。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$r^18^/^^\"|^\"6^$_^+x^&w^(<^&Z^!~^)*^%q^%a^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRyXjE4Xi9eXiJ8XiI2XiRfXit4XiZ3Xig8XiZaXiF+XikqXiVxXiVhXiEi",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b35d2b3bbadb",
      "text": "徹底粉碎奴隸部族能夠鞏固聖堂武士的權勢。這不僅能剷除 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^18^/^^'5^&o^##^)Z^)#^5V^'b^+d^3b^3>^'Z^42^%J^+a^&Z^1E^\"&^!\"^(s^!)^!_^'b^2Y^)Q ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjE4Xi9eXic1XiZvXiMjXilaXikjXjVWXidiXitkXjNiXjM+XidaXjQyXiVKXithXiZaXjFFXiImXiEiXihzXiEpXiFfXidiXjJZXilRIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d81718e2b659",
      "text": "潛在叛亂的威脅，還能先發制人阻遏其他城邦的覬覦與 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^7:^\"d^.Z^!3^&Z^#&^1T^*A^.7^'b^!b^&W^!v^!<^)L^7n^!j^!@^+_^1a^&Z^8b^8a^'p ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xjc6XiJkXi5aXiEzXiZaXiMmXjFUXipBXi43XidiXiFiXiZXXiF2XiE8XilMXjduXiFqXiFAXitfXjFhXiZaXjhiXjhhXidwIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e9867e306d69",
      "text": "進攻。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(w^$O^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xih3XiRPXiEi",
      "byte_length": 9
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f37fc9e99700",
      "text": "我曾立誓總有一天要重返德拉吉，為受壓迫者帶去自由； ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^.j^0'^-w^-M^$s^!%^+e^(C^))^7J^#j^$6^\"D^*A^%{^\";^4v^1`^'V^#N^\"6^'l^&I^*C ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXi5qXjAnXi13Xi1NXiRzXiElXitlXihDXikpXjdKXiNqXiQ2XiJEXipBXiV7XiI7XjR2XjFgXidWXiNOXiI2XidsXiZJXipDIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d65551ed6500",
      "text": "但聖堂武士女兒的身分，在奴隸部族中很難贏得 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!I^'Z^42^%J^+a^#\"^++^&Z^(c^!s^*A^\"d^##^)Z^)#^5V^!,^*K^)a^.%^#e ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFJXidaXjQyXiVKXithXiMiXisrXiZaXihjXiFzXipBXiJkXiMjXilaXikjXjVWXiEsXipLXilhXi4lXiNlIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d5ec16ff3568",
      "text": "絲毫信任。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'C^/t^!U^!C^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XidDXi90XiFVXiFDXiEi",
      "byte_length": 15
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ec048273db44",
      "text": "  提奎茲爾村現在情況如何？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$A^5B^/D^&/^$z^&?^\"d^,0^,q^#$^!L^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJEFeNUJeL0ReJi9eJHpeJj9eImReLDBeLHFeIyReIUxeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5da45558c335",
      "text": "  是誰放火燒毀了你們的村莊？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^,X^-y^$P^%x^&&^%N^*D^*F^*{^&Z^$z^6l^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLFheLXleJFBeJXheJiZeJU5eKkReKkZeKnteJlpeJHpeNmxeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_97e3895ee916",
      "text": "  你們來自哪個村莊？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^*{^!O^'l^+I^!V^$z^6l^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeKnteIU9eJ2xeK0leIVZeJHpeNmxeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1da4c551d41f",
      "text": "能結識閣下真是三生有幸， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'b^'@^(R^6~^!(^-2^,X^!&^&F^$s^15^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XidiXidAXihSXjZ+XiEoXi0yXixYXiEmXiZGXiRzXjE1XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 37
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6ee1ac5091f2",
      "text": "。我在提奎茲爾村聽說過你們的威名。你們為奴隸村莊 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!\"^$%^\"d^$A^5B^/D^&/^$z^-X^-x^(x^*F^*{^&Z^#&^\"F^!\"^*F^*{^%{^##^)Z^$z^6l ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEiXiQlXiJkXiRBXjVCXi9EXiYvXiR6Xi1YXi14Xih4XipGXip7XiZaXiMmXiJGXiEiXipGXip7XiV7XiMjXilaXiR6XjZsIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f134435daa00",
      "text": "所做的一切，宛如甘霖般珍貴無比。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$)^*~^&Z^!%^+.^*A^1v^#$^/:^6D^'r^/7^2F^%}^,m^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQpXip+XiZaXiElXisuXipBXjF2XiMkXi86XjZEXidyXi83XjJGXiV9XixtXiEi",
      "byte_length": 48
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_77e83a697d24",
      "text": "。你們的慷慨就如同傳說中的英雄一般！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!\"^*F^*{^&Z^70^7/^*J^#$^\"E^+$^-x^!,^&Z^'y^)\\^!%^'r^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEiXipGXip7XiZaXjcwXjcvXipKXiMkXiJFXiskXi14XiEsXiZaXid5XilcXiElXidyXipX",
      "byte_length": 54
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c25ed93a64d4",
      "text": "村民們心中充滿了 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$z^%T^*{^#k^!,^5.^,{^*D ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiR6XiVUXip7XiNrXiEsXjUuXix7XipEIA==",
      "byte_length": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4559417f00ed",
      "text": "疑慮與不安。他們終日生活在對德拉吉大軍的恐懼之中， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^0p^19^'p^!)^+p^!\"^!@^*{^-H^$a^&F^%i^\"d^#:^#j^$6^\"D^\"z^..^&Z^#t^$#^!/^!,^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjBwXjE5XidwXiEpXitwXiEiXiFAXip7Xi1IXiRhXiZGXiVpXiJkXiM6XiNqXiQ2XiJEXiJ6Xi4uXiZaXiN0XiQjXiEvXiEsXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_106c3050d9bf",
      "text": "而如今德拉吉的全副武裝力量正向他們大舉壓境。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'W^#$^*E^#j^$6^\"D^&Z^!h^52^%J^(A^!~^)*^%H^+?^!@^*{^\"z^01^4v^\"q^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XidXXiMkXipFXiNqXiQ2XiJEXiZaXiFoXjUyXiVKXihBXiF+XikqXiVIXis/XiFAXip7XiJ6XjAxXjR2XiJxXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a2cff95280f5",
      "text": "對某些人來說，這份壓力實在難以承受。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#:^%$^!8^!<^!O^-x^*A^(s^*x^4v^!~^#3^\"d^)a^!B^$0^\";^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiM6XiUkXiE4XiE8XiFPXi14XipBXihzXip4XjR2XiF+XiMzXiJkXilhXiFCXiQwXiI7XiEi",
      "byte_length": 54
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cc729883b3d7",
      "text": "對那場偉大戰役與你們輝煌勝利的熱烈談論。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#:^)!^\"n^*}^\"z^$(^17^'p^*F^*{^2K^2.^+5^!t^&Z^&$^%|^0;^1\\^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiM6XikhXiJuXip9XiJ6XiQoXjE3XidwXipGXip7XjJLXjIuXis1XiF0XiZaXiYkXiV8XjA7XjFcXiEi",
      "byte_length": 60
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_34123596d27d",
      "text": "希望。你們為他們提供了一個徹底掙脫德拉吉 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+{^,]^!\"^*F^*{^%{^!@^*{^$A^!P^*D^!%^!V^18^/^^.g^'c^#j^$6^\"D ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xit7XixdXiEiXipGXip7XiV7XiFAXip7XiRBXiFQXipEXiElXiFWXjE4Xi9eXi5nXidjXiNqXiQ2XiJEIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_13f50ae5da61",
      "text": "殘酷暴政枷鎖的契機。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,l^1b^$m^,P^2p^)8^&Z^8W^%>^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XixsXjFiXiRtXixQXjJwXik4XiZaXjhXXiU+XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 31
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a1b727090ce4",
      "text": "他們迫不及待想親眼見證這一切的實現。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^*{^1`^!)^\"7^,*^,1^(F^&d^-m^-{^(s^!%^+.^&Z^#3^&?^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXip7XjFgXiEpXiI3XiwqXiwxXihGXiZkXi1tXi17XihzXiElXisuXiZaXiMzXiY/XiEi",
      "byte_length": 54
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_793057621e8f",
      "text": "德拉吉的軍隊趁著黑夜突襲。我原本在熟睡中，直到 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#j^$6^\"D^&Z^..^)U^.)^-a^*:^+c^'*^08^!\"^$%^\"5^$x^\"d^-\"^-3^!,^*A^&`^!u ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNqXiQ2XiJEXiZaXi4uXilVXi4pXi1hXio6XitjXicqXjA4XiEiXiQlXiI1XiR4XiJkXi0iXi0zXiEsXipBXiZgXiF1IA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c6fe070b4783",
      "text": " 冒死將我從燃燒的帳篷中拉了出來。",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^/P^%L^#7^$%^#f^&%^&&^&Z^8Y^'1^!,^$6^*D^!q^!O^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4vUF4lTF4jN14kJV4jZl4mJV4mJl4mWl44WV4nMV4hLF4kNl4qRF4hcV4hT14hIg==",
      "byte_length": 49
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b1d7ec86192a",
      "text": "  你們的村莊為什麼會被燒毀？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^*{^&Z^$z^6l^%{^!=^.T^$r^(@^&&^%N^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeKnteJlpeJHpeNmxeJXteIT1eLlReJHJeKEBeJiZeJU5eLlY=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a31dc60f05ba",
      "text": "  當兵的經常這樣強搶糧食嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^&N^+,^&Z^'D^#O^(s^,f^#]^1?^5s^0J^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJk5eKyxeJlpeJ0ReI09eKHNeLGZeI11eMT9eNXNeMEpeK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fb355b849006",
      "text": "  還有其他人生還嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^.7^$s^!j^!@^!<^&F^.7^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLjdeJHNeIWpeIUBeITxeJkZeLjdeK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8fc8ef59cdd3",
      "text": "那裡根本沒有名字——甚至算不上是個村莊。我們一群人 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^-j^%)^$x^%\\^$s^\"F^#)^*n^*n^/|^'n^-C^!)^!'^,X^!V^$z^6l^!\"^$%^*{^!%^'R^!< ",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXi1qXiUpXiR4XiVcXiRzXiJGXiMpXipuXipuXi98XiduXi1DXiEpXiEnXixYXiFWXiR6XjZsXiEiXiQlXip7XiElXidSXiE8IA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_02769b884a5d",
      "text": "三個季度前聚集在那裡搭起了帳篷。當士兵殺過來時， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!&^!V^8X^#V^!z^'[^)]^\"d^)!^-j^8\\^.(^*D^8Y^'1^!\"^&N^+a^+,^%M^(x^!O^$f^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEmXiFWXjhYXiNWXiF6XidbXildXiJkXikhXi1qXjhcXi4oXipEXjhZXicxXiEiXiZOXithXissXiVNXih4XiFPXiRmXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e8aab0301a12",
      "text": "我們才剛剛在商量著要搭建永久性的居所。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^$,^+0^+0^\"d^1'^)*^-a^(C^8\\^,'^%W^!.^#r^&Z^+w^$)^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7XiQsXiswXiswXiJkXjEnXikqXi1hXihDXjhcXiwnXiVXXiEuXiNyXiZaXit3XiQpXiEi",
      "byte_length": 57
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1dceec2f3848",
      "text": "我不知道。當兵的揚言說 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^!)^&h^(y^!\"^&N^+,^&Z^2k^1Y^-x ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiEpXiZoXih5XiEiXiZOXissXiZaXjJrXjFZXi14IA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d17dd0eaf38c",
      "text": "所有的村莊都要化為灰燼，奴隸們必須懂得不得忤逆的道理 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$)^$s^&Z^$z^6l^)$^(C^\")^%{^%y^&)^*A^##^)Z^*{^#l^)r^,6^#e^!)^#e^8Z^8c^&Z^(y^&A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQpXiRzXiZaXiR6XjZsXikkXihDXiIpXiV7XiV5XiYpXipBXiMjXilaXip7XiNsXilyXiw2XiNlXiEpXiNlXjhaXjhjXiZaXih5XiZBIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_96392e9dcd77",
      "text": "說什麼要搜捕逃亡的奴隸",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-x^!=^.T^(C^/h^4?^(p^!:^&Z^##^)Z",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi14XiE9Xi5UXihDXi9oXjQ/XihwXiE6XiZaXiMjXila",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a2c53398b0aa",
      "text": "提到了搜捕逃奴之類的話",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$A^!u^*D^/h^4?^(p^##^!/^)w^&Z^-v",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRBXiF1XipEXi9oXjQ/XihwXiMjXiEvXil3XiZaXi12",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_52913334581d",
      "text": "。但我看那根本就只是他們強搶我們糧食的藉口。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!\"^!I^$%^*Q^)!^%)^$x^*J^\"?^,X^!@^*{^#]^1?^$%^*{^5s^0J^&Z^04^\"<^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEiXiFJXiQlXipRXikhXiUpXiR4XipKXiI/XixYXiFAXip7XiNdXjE/XiQlXip7XjVzXjBKXiZaXjA0XiI8XiEi",
      "byte_length": 66
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_52d3d7851400",
      "text": "不然你以為他們在遠離德拉吉的荒野行軍時， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^&\"^*F^!B^%{^!@^*{^\"d^({^)`^#j^$6^\"D^&Z^1W^.:^(;^..^$f^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXiYiXipGXiFCXiV7XiFAXip7XiJkXih7XilgXiNqXiQ2XiJEXiZaXjFXXi46Xig7Xi4uXiRmXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fbc541241cdb",
      "text": "還能靠什麼來維持糧草補給？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.7^'b^.C^!=^.T^!O^'F^$7^5s^*f^6&^'A^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi43XidiXi5DXiE9Xi5UXiFPXidGXiQ3XjVzXipmXjYmXidBXi5W",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3af3a0cbab28",
      "text": "沒有，就只有我和 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%\\^$s^*A^*J^\"?^$s^$%^\"O ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVcXiRzXipBXipKXiI/XiRzXiQlXiJPIA==",
      "byte_length": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1efb69281c33",
      "text": "是的，談論我失去的家園對我來說實在太痛苦了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,X^&Z^*A^0;^1\\^$%^\"|^\"6^&Z^+s^41^#:^$%^!O^-x^#3^\"d^+f^-.^.t^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XixYXiZaXipBXjA7XjFcXiQlXiJ8XiI2XiZaXitzXjQxXiM6XiQlXiFPXi14XiMzXiJkXitmXi0uXi50XipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 66
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c11ecf01020f",
      "text": "伊拉凱茲",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!E^$6^!p^/D",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFFXiQ2XiFwXi9E",
      "byte_length": 12
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8891290b8e5c",
      "text": "凱琪亞",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!p^8`^!9",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFwXjhgXiE5",
      "byte_length": 9
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8d097afe32ef",
      "text": "再次感謝你們施捨的錢。告辭了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!l^%D^#{^-z^*F^*{^$_^8[^&Z^.<^!\"^+B^2M^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFsXiVEXiN7Xi16XipGXip7XiRfXjhbXiZaXi48XiEiXitCXjJNXipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9aa9592d5d7b",
      "text": "歡迎各位旅伴！要不要一起來喝碗熱騰騰的燉肉？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%F^(k^+>^!J^2m^1h^*W^(C^!)^(C^!%^.(^!O^6M^&q^&$^.O^.O^&Z^8j^'^^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVGXihrXis+XiFKXjJtXjFoXipXXihDXiEpXihDXiElXi4oXiFPXjZNXiZxXiYkXi5PXi5PXiZaXjhqXideXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7c93fe882111",
      "text": "這可是剛打來的新鮮鮮肉。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^\"A^,X^+0^$-^!O^&Z^$\\^35^35^'^^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXiJBXixYXiswXiQtXiFPXiZaXiRcXjM1XjM1XideXiEi",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_368ffc93650f",
      "text": "太好了。既然狩獵結束了，能有人一起共進晚餐真是再好不過了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+f^+i^*D^!\"^,U^&\"^8l^&;^'@^$|^*D^*A^'b^$s^!<^!%^.(^3d^(w^,Y^.K^-2^,X^!l^+i^!)^(x^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XitmXitpXipEXiEiXixVXiYiXjhsXiY7XidAXiR8XipEXipBXidiXiRzXiE8XiElXi4oXjNkXih3XixZXi5LXi0yXixYXiFsXitpXiEpXih4XipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 87
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_da4e5842fd54",
      "text": "那正好，全留給我自己享用。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^%H^+i^*A^!h^-+^'A^$%^'l^#I^!;^&H^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXiVIXitpXipBXiFoXi0rXidBXiQlXidsXiNJXiE7XiZIXiEi",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ea330e0ac6b7",
      "text": "  你是從哪裡弄來新鮮鮮肉的？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^,X^#f^+I^-j^/`^!O^$\\^35^35^'^^&Z^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeLFheI2ZeK0leLWpeL2BeIU9eJFxeMzVeMzVeJ15eJlpeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1f5766e79da2",
      "text": "很高興能認識各位， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*K^*+^-]^'b^(O^(R^+>^!J^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipLXiorXi1dXidiXihPXihSXis+XiFKXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 28
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5e71765831e8",
      "text": "我碰巧遇上了一頭毫無防備的獵物，幸運地一箭命中了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^-5^3D^.2^!'^*D^!%^)t^/t^%}^)K^+\"^&Z^&;^&4^*A^15^.4^\"e^!%^'.^\"N^!,^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXi01XjNEXi4yXiEnXipEXiElXil0Xi90XiV9XilLXisiXiZaXiY7XiY0XipBXjE1Xi40XiJlXiElXicuXiJOXiEsXipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 75
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2837fa1b3ad8",
      "text": "我的名字是蒂齊奧。我對亞薩斯的這個區域以及這裡的風俗習慣人生地不熟。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^&Z^\"F^#)^,X^(%^36^6Q^!\"^$%^#:^!9^-e^$[^&Z^(s^!V^\"+^\"k^!B^\"7^(s^-j^&Z^)y^8e^3{^$!^!<^&F^\"e^!)^-\"^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiZaXiJGXiMpXixYXiglXjM2XjZRXiEiXiQlXiM6XiE5Xi1lXiRbXiZaXihzXiFWXiIrXiJrXiFCXiI3XihzXi1qXiZaXil5XjhlXjN7XiQhXiE8XiZGXiJlXiEpXi0iXiEi",
      "byte_length": 102
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_03a86b0d0eaf",
      "text": "無處是家，又處處為家。從我有記憶以來，我便一直在四處流浪漂泊。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%}^(,^,X^+s^*A^+;^(,^(,^%{^+s^!\"^#f^$%^$s^(K^$\"^!B^!O^*A^$%^!R^!%^&`^\"d^\"[^(,^%j^,r^,|^5]^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiV9XigsXixYXitzXipBXis7XigsXigsXiV7XitzXiEiXiNmXiQlXiRzXihLXiQiXiFCXiFPXipBXiQlXiFSXiElXiZgXiJkXiJbXigsXiVqXixyXix8XjVdXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 94
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_15bcab8ad861",
      "text": "對我而言，未來的去向向來都比我曾經走過何處 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#:^$%^'W^1Y^*A^,_^!O^&Z^\"6^+?^+?^!O^)$^,m^$%^.j^'D^.&^(x^!L^(, ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiM6XiQlXidXXjFZXipBXixfXiFPXiZaXiI2Xis/Xis/XiFPXikkXixtXiQlXi5qXidEXi4mXih4XiFMXigsIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a29801204670",
      "text": "更加重要。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$o^\"\"^))^(C^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRvXiIiXikpXihDXiEi",
      "byte_length": 15
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d6fcf8e717d4",
      "text": " 你們打算朝哪個方向走？",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^*F^*{^$-^-C^,^^+I^!V^$]^+?^.&^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4qRl4qe14kLV4tQ14sXl4rSV4hVl4kXV4rP14uJl4uVg==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_10306fcf4b9d",
      "text": "  北方。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^+6^$]^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKzZeJF1eISI=",
      "byte_length": 11
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5b22526b5881",
      "text": "  南方。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^\"/^$]^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIi9eJF1eISI=",
      "byte_length": 11
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1288491a5577",
      "text": "  東方。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^,`^$]^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLGBeJF1eISI=",
      "byte_length": 11
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0c33b151045a",
      "text": "  西方。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^-l^$]^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLWxeJF1eISI=",
      "byte_length": 11
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_dfc5e2590980",
      "text": "  我還沒拿定主意。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^.7^%\\^,G^#.^!-^#z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeLjdeJVxeLEdeIy5eIS1eI3peISI=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1b8a3ce2f757",
      "text": "  你打算朝哪個方向旅行？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^$-^-C^,^^+I^!V^$]^+?^2m^(;^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeJC1eLUNeLF5eK0leIVZeJF1eKz9eMm1eKDteLlY=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cf607841e150",
      "text": "  熔岩原裡有什麼？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^&#^#D^\"5^-j^$s^!=^.T^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJiNeI0ReIjVeLWpeJHNeIT1eLlReLlY=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b31bf708b7d2",
      "text": "  你曾親眼見過那些寶石嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^.j^(F^&d^-m^(x^)!^!8^#4^&k^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeLmpeKEZeJmReLW1eKHheKSFeITheIzReJmteK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c33020a35449",
      "text": "  關於城邦軍隊，你還聽到了些什麼？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^.>^$^^+_^1a^..^)U^*A^*F^.7^-X^!u^*D^!8^!=^.T^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLj5eJF5eK19eMWFeLi5eKVVeKkFeKkZeLjdeLVheIXVeKkReITheIT1eLlReLlY=",
      "byte_length": 50
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7a1db2fe4675",
      "text": "  火元素在那裡做什麼？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^%x^!a^'=^\"d^)!^-j^*~^!=^.T^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJXheIWFeJz1eImReKSFeLWpeKn5eIT1eLlReLlY=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_645cd48c01a2",
      "text": "  東邊有什麼？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^,`^.8^$s^!=^.T^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLGBeLjheJHNeIT1eLlReLlY=",
      "byte_length": 20
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e70bd9561a9e",
      "text": "  南邊有什麼？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^\"/^.8^$s^!=^.T^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIi9eLjheJHNeIT1eLlReLlY=",
      "byte_length": 20
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a7b830e54687",
      "text": "  西邊有什麼？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^-l^.8^$s^!=^.T^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLWxeLjheJHNeIT1eLlReLlY=",
      "byte_length": 20
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_72f47813c238",
      "text": "讓我給你們講一個我父親傳給我的傳奇故事吧。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-}^$%^'A^*F^*{^6+^!%^!V^$%^5d^(F^+$^'A^$%^&Z^+$^\"}^5U^*r^*I^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi19XiQlXidBXipGXip7XjYrXiElXiFWXiQlXjVkXihGXiskXidBXiQlXiZaXiskXiJ9XjVVXipyXipJXiEi",
      "byte_length": 63
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_dbcc279aa204",
      "text": "很多年以前，有一位名叫涅菲爾的游牧民。他正從德拉吉往北走， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*K^\"x^+~^!B^!z^*A^$s^!%^!J^\"F^+<^4O^8q^&/^&Z^8i^/5^%T^!\"^!@^%H^#f^#j^$6^\"D^,)^+6^.&^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipLXiJ4Xit+XiFCXiF6XipBXiRzXiElXiFKXiJGXis8XjRPXjhxXiYvXiZaXjhpXi81XiVUXiEiXiFAXiVIXiNmXiNqXiQ2XiJEXiwpXis2Xi4mXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d4dd07307f70",
      "text": "不料一場遮天蔽日的沙塵暴突然無預警地襲來。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^/n^!%^\"n^(~^+e^('^$a^&Z^%]^\"p^$m^'*^&\"^%}^.E^(S^\"e^08^!O^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXi9uXiElXiJuXih+XitlXignXiRhXiZaXiVdXiJwXiRtXicqXiYiXiV9Xi5FXihTXiJlXjA4XiFPXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ffe104589920",
      "text": "狂暴的狂風將他整個人掀飛吹倒， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&8^$m^&Z^&8^)y^#7^!@^$T^!V^!<^8h^)z^+A^!X^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiY4XiRtXiZaXiY4Xil5XiM3XiFAXiRUXiFWXiE8XjhoXil6XitBXiFYXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c5416082469c",
      "text": "亂石飛沙將他砸得昏迷不醒。當他醒來時，發現自己身處於 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!3^&k^)z^%]^#7^!@^0#^#e^$d^(n^!)^.9^!\"^&N^!@^.9^!O^$f^*A^&W^&?^'l^#I^(c^(,^$^ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEzXiZrXil6XiVdXiM3XiFAXjAjXiNlXiRkXihuXiEpXi45XiEiXiZOXiFAXi45XiFPXiRmXipBXiZXXiY/XidsXiNJXihjXigsXiReIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_549e15e64897",
      "text": "一座火山的北側山坡。在他下方，整齊排列著數百座 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!%^/_^%x^11^&Z^+6^!\\^11^7u^!\"^\"d^!@^!(^$]^*A^$T^36^$<^8f^-a^$V^&Y^/_ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiElXi9fXiV4XjExXiZaXis2XiFcXjExXjd1XiEiXiJkXiFAXiEoXiRdXipBXiRUXjM2XiQ8XjhmXi1hXiRWXiZZXi9fIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_336956d1a4df",
      "text": "熔岩穹丘，每一座穹丘裡都封存著一顆璀璨的寶石！當他重返 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&#^#D^''^5(^*A^%P^!%^/_^''^5(^-j^)$^#5^#*^-a^!%^)u^8m^8n^&Z^#4^&k^*W^&N^!@^))^7J ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiYjXiNEXicnXjUoXipBXiVQXiElXi9fXicnXjUoXi1qXikkXiM1XiMqXi1hXiElXil1XjhtXjhuXiZaXiM0XiZrXipXXiZOXiFAXikpXjdKIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_984de92eef22",
      "text": "文明世界後，他的暴富成為了流傳千古的傳奇。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$W^$c^*p^.p^#b^*A^!@^&Z^$m^3C^$$^%{^*D^%j^+$^+7^\"=^&Z^+$^\"}^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRXXiRjXipwXi5wXiNiXipBXiFAXiZaXiRtXjNDXiQkXiV7XipEXiVqXiskXis3XiI9XiZaXiskXiJ9XiEi",
      "byte_length": 63
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5f07c1aaa1e4",
      "text": "你們打算前往德拉吉？我可不建議你們這麼做",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^$-^-C^!z^,)^#j^$6^\"D^.V^$%^\"A^!)^,'^-|^*F^*{^(s^.T^*~",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiQtXi1DXiF6XiwpXiNqXiQ2XiJEXi5WXiQlXiJBXiEpXiwnXi18XipGXip7XihzXi5UXip+",
      "byte_length": 60
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0e0e7ee1cbd6",
      "text": "德拉吉就在南邊。不過我強烈建議你們千萬別靠近 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#j^$6^\"D^*J^\"d^\"/^.8^!\"^!)^(x^$%^#]^%|^,'^-|^*F^*{^+7^-_^*H^.C^(l ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNqXiQ2XiJEXipKXiJkXiIvXi44XiEiXiEpXih4XiQlXiNdXiV8XiwnXi18XipGXip7Xis3Xi1fXipIXi5DXihsIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b614bf698219",
      "text": "那個鬼地方。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^!V^*-^\"e^$]^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXiFWXiotXiJlXiRdXiEi",
      "byte_length": 18
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ac426470132c",
      "text": "尤其是以你們這副逃奴的模樣。城邦的軍隊正在 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^6V^!j^,X^!B^*F^*{^(s^52^(p^##^&Z^%:^,f^!\"^+_^1a^&Z^..^)U^%H^\"d ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjZWXiFqXixYXiFCXipGXip7XihzXjUyXihwXiMjXiZaXiU6XixmXiEiXitfXjFhXiZaXi4uXilVXiVIXiJkIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_42f2f0353970",
      "text": "大肆搜捕「叛亂」的奴隸。要不了多久， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"z^2>^/h^4?^!#^.Z^!3^!$^&Z^##^)Z^!\"^(C^!)^*D^\"x^!.^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJ6XjI+Xi9oXjQ/XiEjXi5aXiEzXiEkXiZaXiMjXilaXiEiXihDXiEpXipEXiJ4XiEuXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e46472ad22bf",
      "text": "他們就會大軍開拔出征了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^*{^*J^$r^\"z^..^)F^/c^!q^.c^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXip7XipKXiRyXiJ6Xi4uXilGXi9jXiFxXi5jXipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_097e3670a9ce",
      "text": "他們為了逃奴正氣急敗壞，而且在動手殺戮時， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^*{^%{^*D^(p^##^%H^%U^3p^$R^\"v^*A^'W^!*^\"d^\"%^$+^%M^,:^$f^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXip7XiV7XipEXihwXiMjXiVIXiVVXjNwXiRSXiJ2XipBXidXXiEqXiJkXiIlXiQrXiVNXiw6XiRmXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1e8564784430",
      "text": "可絲毫不會講究殺的是不是無辜之人。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"A^'C^/t^!)^$r^6+^-<^%M^&Z^,X^!)^,X^%}^66^!/^!<^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJBXidDXi90XiEpXiRyXjYrXi08XiVNXiZaXixYXiEpXixYXiV9XjY2XiEvXiE8XiEi",
      "byte_length": 51
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_59d8cdb588bd",
      "text": "往那條路走沒什麼特別的，只有一具巨大的化石巨龍骨架。我嗎？我可 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,)^)!^%.^(a^.&^%\\^!=^.T^&5^*H^&Z^*A^\"?^$s^!%^!k^#H^\"z^&Z^\")^&k^#H^*>^*$^%\"^!\"^$%^+X^.V^$%^\"A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiwpXikhXiUuXihhXi4mXiVcXiE9Xi5UXiY1XipIXiZaXipBXiI/XiRzXiElXiFrXiNIXiJ6XiZaXiIpXiZrXiNIXio+XiokXiUiXiEiXiQlXitYXi5WXiQlXiJBIA==",
      "byte_length": 94
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0d6ccfdf933a",
      "text": "從來沒有勇氣踏進那個地方。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#f^!O^%\\^$s^\"$^%U^.,^(w^)!^!V^\"e^$]^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNmXiFPXiVcXiRzXiIkXiVVXi4sXih3XikhXiFWXiJlXiRdXiEi",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c7a07e336e94",
      "text": "那裡沒什麼東西，",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^-j^%\\^!=^.T^,`^-l^*A",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXi1qXiVcXiE9Xi5UXixgXi1sXipB",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4acc658f8387",
      "text": " 除了一望無際的熔岩原。",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^)Q^*D^!%^,]^%}^30^&Z^&#^#D^\"5^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4pUV4qRF4hJV4sXV4lfV4zMF4mWl4mI14jRF4iNV4hIg==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7c72c130ec26",
      "text": "不過曾有一位旅人聲稱，他在試圖穿過熔岩原時， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^(x^.j^$s^!%^!J^2m^!<^-W^0&^*A^!@^\"d^-u^\"b^')^(x^&#^#D^\"5^$f^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXih4Xi5qXiRzXiElXiFKXjJtXiE8Xi1XXjAmXipBXiFAXiJkXi11XiJiXicpXih4XiYjXiNEXiI1XiRmXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b45439d06065",
      "text": "差點被狂暴的火元素奪去性命。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^48^*;^(@^&8^$m^&Z^%x^!a^'=^1,^\"6^#r^\"N^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XjQ4Xio7XihAXiY4XiRtXiZaXiV4XiFhXic9XjEsXiI2XiNyXiJOXiEi",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_446c9dc8c588",
      "text": "你們正前往塞德利特村嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^%H^!z^,)^/(^#j^!t^&5^$z^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiVIXiF6XiwpXi8oXiNqXiF0XiY1XiR6XitYXi5W",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_632f988a0d11",
      "text": "正西方是蓋德隆村，而西南方則是塞德利特村。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%H^-l^$]^,X^-d^#j^)T^$z^*A^'W^-l^\"/^$]^!x^,X^/(^#j^!t^&5^$z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVIXi1sXiRdXixYXi1kXiNqXilUXiR6XipBXidXXi1sXiIvXiRdXiF4XixYXi8oXiNqXiF0XiY1XiR6XiEi",
      "byte_length": 63
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_623745dc269c",
      "text": " 我幾年前曾去過塞德利特村—— ",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^$%^#T^+~^!z^.j^\"6^(x^/(^#j^!t^&5^$z^*n^*n ",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4kJV4jVF4rfl4hel4ual4iNl4oeF4vKF4jal4hdF4mNV4kel4qbl4qbiA=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_160d34cfd35b",
      "text": "一直很好奇那座俯瞰村莊的巍峨古堡裡究竟藏著什麼，",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!%^&`^*K^+i^\"}^)!^/_^5*^8p^$z^6l^&Z^47^46^\"=^\"m^-j^-<^28^-f^-a^!=^.T^*A",
      "encoded_base64": "XiElXiZgXipLXitpXiJ9XikhXi9fXjUqXjhwXiR6XjZsXiZaXjQ3XjQ2XiI9XiJtXi1qXi08XjI4Xi1mXi1hXiE9Xi5UXipB",
      "byte_length": 72
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d895937c894b",
      "text": "但我卻始終找不到進去的入口。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!I^$%^1&^+k^-H^$/^!)^!u^(w^\"6^&Z^!f^\"<^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFJXiQlXjEmXitrXi1IXiQvXiEpXiF1Xih3XiI2XiZaXiFmXiI8XiEi",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5d5b64603521",
      "text": "那座城堡散發著令人作嘔的邪惡氣息。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^/_^+_^\"m^$S^&W^-a^*w^!<^!M^0T^&Z^)\"^#y^%U^#w^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXi9fXitfXiJtXiRTXiZXXi1hXip3XiE8XiFNXjBUXiZaXikiXiN5XiVVXiN3XiEi",
      "byte_length": 51
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f0100d1f2947",
      "text": "沒有，我承認我沒見過。但我見過不少人為了尋找那些寶石而冒險深入， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%\\^$s^*A^$%^$0^(O^$%^%\\^-m^(x^!\"^!I^$%^-m^(x^!)^#<^!<^%{^*D^#9^$/^)!^!8^#4^&k^'W^/P^*m^2*^!f^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVcXiRzXipBXiQlXiQwXihPXiQlXiVcXi1tXih4XiEiXiFJXiQlXi1tXih4XiEpXiM8XiE8XiV7XipEXiM5XiQvXikhXiE4XiM0XiZrXidXXi9QXiptXjIqXiFmXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 97
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6251937b2fdb",
      "text": "卻再也沒有回來。是死了嗎？還是他們真的發了橫財， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^1&^!l^!1^%\\^$s^\"\\^!O^!\"^,X^%L^*D^+X^.V^.7^,X^!@^*{^-2^&Z^&W^*D^/2^0=^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjEmXiFsXiExXiVcXiRzXiJcXiFPXiEiXixYXiVMXipEXitYXi5WXi43XixYXiFAXip7Xi0yXiZaXiZXXipEXi8yXjA9XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0f9486bcecd1",
      "text": "隱退去安享晚年了呢？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)Y^*V^\"6^+p^!;^,Y^+~^*D^+C^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XilZXipWXiI2XitwXiE7XixZXit+XipEXitDXi5W",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e97a360ab985",
      "text": "我正打算往西南方前往鳴響山脈。我這輩子看夠了黃沙， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^%H^$-^-C^,)^-l^\"/^$]^!z^,)^.|^)o^11^6i^!\"^$%^(s^8t^#(^*Q^+d^*D^*7^%]^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiVIXiQtXi1DXiwpXi1sXiIvXiRdXiF6XiwpXi58XilvXjExXjZpXiEiXiQlXihzXjh0XiMoXipRXitkXipEXio3XiVdXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_61d0360700d2",
      "text": "而且我聽說過關於滿是寶藏的地下古城的傳說。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'W^!*^$%^-X^-x^(x^.>^$^^,{^,X^#4^-f^&Z^\"e^!(^\"=^+_^&Z^+$^-x^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XidXXiEqXiQlXi1YXi14Xih4Xi4+XiReXix7XixYXiM0Xi1mXiZaXiJlXiEoXiI9XitfXiZaXiskXi14XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_37fd70c0d629",
      "text": "我希望能儘快穿過這片荒野，抵達西側的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^+{^,]^'b^+(^*L^')^(x^(s^&1^1W^.:^*A^$5^(z^-l^!\\^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXit7XixdXidiXisoXipMXicpXih4XihzXiYxXjFXXi46XipBXiQ1Xih6Xi1sXiFcXiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e0b6992c0289",
      "text": "熔岩原。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&#^#D^\"5^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiYjXiNEXiI1XiEi",
      "byte_length": 12
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3eac175bb78b",
      "text": "我最近聽說，有一支巡邏隊正在這裡西邊追捕強盜。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^$q^(l^-X^-x^*A^$s^!%^$L^8g^8u^)U^%H^\"d^(s^-j^-l^.8^(o^4?^#]^0!^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiRxXihsXi1YXi14XipBXiRzXiElXiRMXjhnXjh1XilVXiVIXiJkXihzXi1qXi1sXi44XihvXjQ/XiNdXjAhXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_382c5712c3cf",
      "text": "那些雙足飛龍騎兵實際上甚至襲擊過德拉吉好幾次。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^!8^)_^(^^)z^*>^0K^+,^#3^30^!'^/|^'n^08^$F^(x^#j^$6^\"D^+i^#T^%D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXiE4XilfXiheXil6Xio+XjBLXissXiMzXjMwXiEnXi98XiduXjA4XiRGXih4XiNqXiQ2XiJEXitpXiNUXiVEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 69
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_dea1bbdfd1aa",
      "text": "軍隊的調動每天都在加劇。大戰肯定迫在眉睫了—— ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^..^)U^&Z^(Q^\"%^%P^+e^)$^\"d^\"\"^1#^!\"^\"z^$(^-Z^#.^1`^\"d^3S^8o^*D^*n^*n ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi4uXilVXiZaXihRXiIlXiVQXitlXikkXiJkXiIiXjEjXiEiXiJ6XiQoXi1aXiMuXjFgXiJkXjNTXjhvXipEXipuXipuIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1c62d76e283b",
      "text": "一場空前的大戰。我聽說克拉西斯將軍親自統率大軍。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!%^\"n^'(^!z^&Z^\"z^$(^!\"^$%^-X^-x^!d^$6^-l^$[^#7^..^(F^'l^'B^22^\"z^..^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiElXiJuXicoXiF6XiZaXiJ6XiQoXiEiXiQlXi1YXi14XiFkXiQ2Xi1sXiRbXiM3Xi4uXihGXidsXidCXjIyXiJ6Xi4uXiEi",
      "byte_length": 72
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1942e21ed7c7",
      "text": "只聽說提奎茲爾村注定在劫難逃。他們絕不可能抵擋得住 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"?^-X^-x^$A^5B^/D^&/^$z^%e^#.^\"d^1l^)a^(p^!\"^!@^*{^-I^!)^\"A^'b^$5^$G^#e^*z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiI/Xi1YXi14XiRBXjVCXi9EXiYvXiR6XiVlXiMuXiJkXjFsXilhXihwXiEiXiFAXip7Xi1JXiEpXiJBXidiXiQ1XiRHXiNlXip6IA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d1bae0fca9f3",
      "text": "德拉吉大軍的鐵蹄。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#j^$6^\"D^\"z^..^&Z^)?^8s^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNqXiQ2XiJEXiJ6Xi4uXiZaXik/XjhzXiEi",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e4d6de6e938d",
      "text": "一點動靜都沒有。我看在很長一段時間內，我們都不會再聽到他們的任何消息了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!%^*;^\"%^)h^)$^%\\^$s^!\"^$%^*Q^\"d^*K^)C^!%^.l^$f^)G^!g^*A^$%^*{^)$^!)^$r^!l^-X^!u^!@^*{^&Z^!C^!L^%k^#w^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiElXio7XiIlXiloXikkXiVcXiRzXiEiXiQlXipRXiJkXipLXilDXiElXi5sXiRmXilHXiFnXipBXiQlXip7XikkXiEpXiRyXiFsXi1YXiF1XiFAXip7XiZaXiFDXiFMXiVrXiN3XipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 108
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1eeb31352a7f",
      "text": "有些事情還是不知道為妙，那座古堡就是其中之一。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$s^!8^*r^,0^.7^,X^!)^&h^(y^%{^43^*A^)!^/_^\"=^\"m^*J^,X^!j^!,^!/^!%^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRzXiE4XipyXiwwXi43XixYXiEpXiZoXih5XiV7XjQzXipBXikhXi9fXiI9XiJtXipKXixYXiFqXiEsXiEvXiElXiEi",
      "byte_length": 69
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_429ae0d71348",
      "text": "我想牠們是被滾燙的熔岩吸引過去的。不過我聽說， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^,1^-#^*{^,X^(@^,z^8k^&Z^&#^#D^\"J^#Z^(x^\"6^&Z^!\"^!)^(x^$%^-X^-x^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiwxXi0jXip7XixYXihAXix6XjhrXiZaXiYjXiNEXiJKXiNaXih4XiI2XiZaXiEiXiEpXih4XiQlXi1YXi14XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7ee419957b2a",
      "text": "那處地方附近有一道通往元素界的位面裂隙。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^(,^\"e^$]^.?^(l^$s^!%^(y^(t^,)^!a^'=^.p^&Z^!J^)j^8r^8v^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXigsXiJlXiRdXi4/XihsXiRzXiElXih5Xih0XiwpXiFhXic9Xi5wXiZaXiFKXilqXjhyXjh2XiEi",
      "byte_length": 60
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a1c5ff014cac",
      "text": "事實上，我也該啟程動身了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*r^#3^!'^*A^$%^!1^(M^57^'#^\"%^(c^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipyXiMzXiEnXipBXiQlXiExXihNXjU3XicjXiIlXihjXipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1dd1ea8e0f7a",
      "text": "打擾死人安息是會要你命的！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$-^$K^%L^!<^+p^#w^,X^$r^(C^*F^\"N^&Z^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQtXiRLXiVMXiE8XitwXiN3XixYXiRyXihDXipGXiJOXiZaXipX",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1dc8d13ba4c3",
      "text": "  如果我打擾了你，我很抱歉。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^#$^%!^$%^$-^$K^*D^*F^*A^$%^*K^,@^,h^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIyReJSFeJCVeJC1eJEteKkReKkZeKkFeJCVeKkteLEBeLGheISI=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_18a4c725eb73",
      "text": "  最後送命的人只會是你！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$q^#b^./^\"N^&Z^!<^\"?^$r^,X^*F^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJHFeI2JeLi9eIk5eJlpeITxeIj9eJHJeLFheKkZeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_51d8d555e689",
      "text": "  那我就把你的脊椎骨抽出來！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^)!^$%^*J^$1^*F^&Z^9'^8}^*$^*_^!q^!O^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKSFeJCVeKkpeJDFeKkZeJlpeOSdeOH1eKiReKl9eIXFeIU9eKlc=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4b8ceae7baaf",
      "text": "  我相信我們能成為朋友。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^&a^!U^$%^*{^'b^$$^%{^,[^\"8^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeJmFeIVVeJCVeKnteJ2JeJCReJXteLFteIjheISI=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_452e68cbe7ce",
      "text": "哼！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+K^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XitLXipX",
      "byte_length": 6
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fdcb55bcaf1b",
      "text": "省省你那毫無骨氣的哀求吧。那毫無用處。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^9%^9%^*F^)!^/t^%}^*$^%U^&Z^2`^,n^*I^!\"^)!^/t^%}^&H^(,^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XjklXjklXipGXikhXi90XiV9XiokXiVVXiZaXjJgXixuXipJXiEiXikhXi90XiV9XiZIXigsXiEi",
      "byte_length": 57
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b12675b537d0",
      "text": "別指望了！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*H^$8^,]^*D^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XipIXiQ4XixdXipEXipX",
      "byte_length": 15
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f1aa2b7d7c82",
      "text": "你根本沒給我多少選擇！看來我不得不跟你聊聊了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^%)^$x^%\\^'A^$%^\"x^#<^.6^,N^*W^*Q^!O^$%^!)^#e^!)^.+^*F^-U^-U^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiUpXiR4XiVcXidBXiQlXiJ4XiM8Xi42XixOXipXXipRXiFPXiQlXiEpXiNlXiEpXi4rXipGXi1VXi1VXipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 69
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5a369ede6732",
      "text": "快滾吧，落得耳根清淨！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*L^,z^*I^*A^-`^#e^'Y^%)^,u^0k^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XipMXix6XipJXipBXi1gXiNlXidZXiUpXix1XjBrXipX",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2c83ebf63a61",
      "text": "  你的部族發生了什麼事？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^&Z^)#^5V^&W^&F^*D^!=^.T^*r^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeJlpeKSNeNVZeJldeJkZeKkReIT1eLlReKnJeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1a1366b2c99a",
      "text": "  你們部族的誓願是什麼？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^*{^)#^5V^&Z^-w^.H^,X^!=^.T^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeKnteKSNeNVZeJlpeLXdeLkheLFheIT1eLlReLlY=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_80be91f0b7da",
      "text": "  你為何如此憤怒？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^%{^!L^#$^%I^7Y^#o^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeJXteIUxeIyReJUleN1leI29eLlY=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e6956d76f7b3",
      "text": "！你就是那個在各個村莊四處惹事生非的傢伙！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*W^*F^*J^,X^)!^!V^\"d^+>^!V^$z^6l^\"[^(,^3s^*r^&F^)i^&Z^+#^*y^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipXXipGXipKXixYXikhXiFWXiJkXis+XiFWXiR6XjZsXiJbXigsXjNzXipyXiZGXilpXiZaXisjXip5XipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_73fcbaa7771d",
      "text": "這絕不會有好下場。我們只會全被殺死！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^-I^!)^$r^$s^+i^!(^\"n^!\"^$%^*{^\"?^$r^!h^(@^%M^%L^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXi1JXiEpXiRyXiRzXitpXiEoXiJuXiEiXiQlXip7XiI/XiRyXiFoXihAXiVNXiVMXipX",
      "byte_length": 54
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_01520d49223f",
      "text": "  這不是我的錯！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^(s^!)^,X^$%^&Z^)5^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKHNeISleLFheJCVeJlpeKTVeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 23
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c6582d05eee6",
      "text": "  你唯一的機會就是奮起反抗。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^+O^!%^&Z^%>^$r^*J^,X^+g^.(^\"9^$4^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeK09eISVeJlpeJT5eJHJeKkpeLFheK2deLiheIjleJDReISI=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1fb3842bb4b9",
      "text": "  你說起話來像個懦夫！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^-x^.(^-v^!O^!`^!V^,7^\"{^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeLXheLiheLXZeIU9eIWBeIVZeLDdeInteKlc=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8d3e27f32edd",
      "text": "  你簡直不可理喻！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^3y^&`^!)^\"A^&A^58^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeM3leJmBeISleIkFeJkFeNTheKlc=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2cc181196f1f",
      "text": "我是赫蘇圖",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^,X^5$^4c^\"b",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXixYXjUkXjRjXiJi",
      "byte_length": 15
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2744b3b5a2c3",
      "text": "。你們又是誰？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!\"^*F^*{^+;^,X^-y^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEiXipGXip7Xis7XixYXi15Xi5W",
      "byte_length": 21
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1de8f18c2775",
      "text": " ，屬於魯克德拉奇部族。魯克德拉奇曾賦予我們生命誓願。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^*A^#C^$^^/K^!d^#j^$6^\"}^)#^5V^!\"^/K^!d^#j^$6^\"}^.j^(Y^!4^$%^*{^&F^\"N^-w^.H^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4qQV4jQ14kXl4vS14hZF4jal4kNl4ifV4pI141Vl4hIl4vS14hZF4jal4kNl4ifV4ual4oWV4hNF4kJV4qe14mRl4iTl4td14uSF4hIiA=",
      "byte_length": 80
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_eabae713c692",
      "text": "他的死對我們是個沉重的打擊",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^&Z^%L^#:^$%^*{^,X^!V^%Z^))^&Z^$-^$F",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXiZaXiVMXiM6XiQlXip7XixYXiFWXiVaXikpXiZaXiQtXiRG",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4e5e4b3c9600",
      "text": "魯克德拉奇構想出一種從此處以西的熔岩流中 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^/K^!d^#j^$6^\"}^8~^,1^!q^!%^'$^#f^%I^(,^!B^-l^&Z^&#^#D^%j^!, ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi9LXiFkXiNqXiQ2XiJ9Xjh+XiwxXiFxXiElXickXiNmXiVJXigsXiFCXi1sXiZaXiYjXiNEXiVqXiEsIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_00645ce00841",
      "text": "提煉黑曜石的方法。假以時日，我們本能建立一座 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$A^9\"^*:^5X^&k^&Z^$]^%b^!\"^1i^!B^$f^$a^*A^$%^*{^$x^'b^,'^0'^!%^/_ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRBXjkiXio6XjVYXiZrXiZaXiRdXiViXiEiXjFpXiFCXiRmXiRhXipBXiQlXip7XiR4XidiXiwnXjAnXiElXi9fIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d0bc5383b0fc",
      "text": "足以匹敵烏里克的武器工廠。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(^^!B^8w^$U^/4^)(^!d^&Z^%J^\"V^+y^8z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiheXiFCXjh3XiRVXi80XikoXiFkXiZaXiVKXiJWXit5Xjh6XiEi",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_eeb22f8e305f",
      "text": "  你們製造的武器品質精良嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^*{^(B^(v^&Z^%J^\"V^\"R^(Z^'7^1V^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeKnteKEJeKHZeJlpeJUpeIlZeIlJeKFpeJzdeMVZeK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8edfcdb1e8e4",
      "text": "  你們願意向提奎茲爾供應武器嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^*{^.H^#z^+?^$A^5B^/D^&/^!P^0`^%J^\"V^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeKnteLkheI3peKz9eJEFeNUJeL0ReJi9eIVBeMGBeJUpeIlZeK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 47
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e42d0806bcd6",
      "text": "城邦軍隊屠滅了我的部族。我們向來安分守己，從不與 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+_^1a^..^)U^#A^%t^*D^$%^&Z^)#^5V^!\"^$%^*{^+?^!O^+p^!s^#+^#I^*A^#f^!)^'p ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitfXjFhXi4uXilVXiNBXiV0XipEXiQlXiZaXikjXjVWXiEiXiQlXip7Xis/XiFPXitwXiFzXiMrXiNJXipBXiNmXiEpXidwIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7153ad4410b0",
      "text": "官兵起衝突。但現在他們見人就殺！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#-^+,^.(^-h^'*^!\"^!I^&?^\"d^!@^*{^-m^!<^*J^%M^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiMtXissXi4oXi1oXicqXiEiXiFJXiY/XiJkXiFAXip7Xi1tXiE8XipKXiVNXipX",
      "byte_length": 48
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_91b95f6f9f47",
      "text": "  關於那些軍隊，你了解多少？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^.>^$^^)!^!8^..^)U^*A^*F^*D^(I^\"x^#<^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLj5eJF5eKSFeITheLi5eKVVeKkFeKkZeKkReKEleInheIzxeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f6fdcd4a4b2a",
      "text": "  你是怎麼活下來的？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^,X^,,^.T^%i^!(^!O^&Z^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeLFheLCxeLlReJWleISheIU9eJlpeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7561633e7e06",
      "text": "要不是因為你們，奴隸部族本該依然對 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(C^!)^,X^\"]^%{^*F^*{^*A^##^)Z^)#^5V^$x^(M^!Q^&\"^#: ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihDXiEpXixYXiJdXiV7XipGXip7XipBXiMjXilaXikjXjVWXiR4XihNXiFRXiYiXiM6IA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bcaa83911b83",
      "text": "德拉吉的所作所為漠不關心。我們以前的日子好過多了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#j^$6^\"D^&Z^$)^!M^$)^%{^,}^!)^.>^#k^!\"^$%^*{^!B^!z^&Z^$a^#(^+i^(x^\"x^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNqXiQ2XiJEXiZaXiQpXiFNXiQpXiV7Xix9XiEpXi4+XiNrXiEiXiQlXip7XiFCXiF6XiZaXiRhXiMoXitpXih4XiJ4XipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 75
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b1e9a0a3c073",
      "text": "可是……",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"A^,X^*o^*o",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJBXixYXipvXipv",
      "byte_length": 12
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c694d51e28bc",
      "text": "或許你是對的。無論如何，聖堂武士都想把奴隸 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$'^-s^*F^,X^#:^&Z^!\"^%}^1\\^#$^!L^*A^'Z^42^%J^+a^)$^,1^$1^##^)Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQnXi1zXipGXixYXiM6XiZaXiEiXiV9XjFcXiMkXiFMXipBXidaXjQyXiVKXithXikkXiwxXiQxXiMjXilaIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4a9474200ab3",
      "text": "部族徹底消滅。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)#^5V^18^/^^%k^%t^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XikjXjVWXjE4Xi9eXiVrXiV0XiEi",
      "byte_length": 21
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d7b0d86761b7",
      "text": "總比送命強！奴隸部族根本不可能抵擋得住 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-M^,m^./^\"N^#]^*W^##^)Z^)#^5V^%)^$x^!)^\"A^'b^$5^$G^#e^*z ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi1NXixtXi4vXiJOXiNdXipXXiMjXilaXikjXjVWXiUpXiR4XiEpXiJBXidiXiQ1XiRHXiNlXip6IA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b0ccc3a95f7b",
      "text": "德拉吉。他們寡不敵眾、實力懸殊。唯一能 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#j^$6^\"D^!\"^!@^*{^8x^!)^$U^&e^!!^#3^!~^0a^9!^!\"^+O^!%^'b ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNqXiQ2XiJEXiEiXiFAXip7Xjh4XiEpXiRVXiZlXiEhXiMzXiF+XjBhXjkhXiEiXitPXiElXidiIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_21921d56375a",
      "text": "活下來的辦法，就是在風暴來臨前逃命。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%i^!(^!O^&Z^2L^%b^*A^*J^,X^\"d^)y^$m^!O^1U^!z^(p^\"N^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVpXiEoXiFPXiZaXjJMXiViXipBXipKXixYXiJkXil5XiRtXiFPXjFVXiF6XihwXiJOXiEi",
      "byte_length": 54
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1f45a40655e0",
      "text": "那就別跟我廢話！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^*J^*H^.+^$%^#W^-v^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXipKXipIXi4rXiQlXiNXXi12XipX",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_85bb68013b32",
      "text": "拿去吧，這把劍送給你們，好讓你們親自評斷。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,G^\"6^*I^*A^(s^$1^!|^./^'A^*F^*{^*A^+i^-}^*F^*{^(F^'l^6)^,T^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XixHXiI2XipJXipBXihzXiQxXiF8Xi4vXidBXipGXip7XipBXitpXi19XipGXip7XihGXidsXjYpXixUXiEi",
      "byte_length": 63
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_36b5a20c06e0",
      "text": "好，我會照辦。我將繼承魯克德拉奇的誓願，並融入 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+i^*A^$%^$r^/x^2L^!\"^$%^#7^-O^$0^/K^!d^#j^$6^\"}^&Z^-w^.H^*A^!+^(7^!f ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitpXipBXiQlXiRyXi94XjJMXiEiXiQlXiM3Xi1PXiQwXi9LXiFkXiNqXiQ2XiJ9XiZaXi13Xi5IXipBXiErXig3XiFmIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1ab166503a12",
      "text": "你們的志向。我將建立一個全新的部族！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^&Z^#m^+?^!\"^$%^#7^,'^0'^!%^!V^!h^$\\^&Z^)#^5V^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiZaXiNtXis/XiEiXiQlXiM3XiwnXjAnXiElXiFWXiFoXiRcXiZaXikjXjVWXipX",
      "byte_length": 54
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5a08ce846d02",
      "text": "感謝你們讓我重新找回生命的目標！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#{^-z^*F^*{^-}^$%^))^$\\^$/^\"\\^&F^\"N^&Z^&^^%9^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiN7Xi16XipGXip7Xi19XiQlXikpXiRcXiQvXiJcXiZGXiJOXiZaXiZeXiU5XipX",
      "byte_length": 48
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4a4584d85a75",
      "text": "軍隊正強行徵召蓋德隆的前角鬥士 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^..^)U^%H^#]^(;^5O^\"@^-d^#j^)T^&Z^!z^(H^*,^+a ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi4uXilVXiVIXiNdXig7XjVPXiJAXi1kXiNqXilUXiZaXiF6XihIXiosXithIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f100d13782b2",
      "text": "入伍，使他們本就龐大的軍隊更加 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!f^!F^*A^!N^!@^*{^$x^*J^6H^\"z^&Z^..^)U^$o^\"\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFmXiFGXipBXiFOXiFAXip7XiR4XipKXjZIXiJ6XiZaXi4uXilVXiRvXiIiIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_782078ca7f7c",
      "text": "兵強馬壯。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+,^#]^*\"^+b^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XissXiNdXioiXitiXiEi",
      "byte_length": 15
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a3765c49711e",
      "text": "我來這裡的路上看見了大規模的軍隊集結。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^!O^(s^-j^&Z^(a^!'^*Q^-m^*D^\"z^6'^%:^&Z^..^)U^)]^'@^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiFPXihzXi1qXiZaXihhXiEnXipRXi1tXipEXiJ6XjYnXiU6XiZaXi4uXilVXildXidAXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4f0b76b29191",
      "text": "我想他們正朝著提奎茲爾進軍。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^,1^!@^*{^%H^,^^-a^$A^5B^/D^&/^(w^..^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiwxXiFAXip7XiVIXixeXi1hXiRBXjVCXi9EXiYvXih3Xi4uXiEi",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_db1158179d82",
      "text": "他們屠滅了我的部族，讓我失去了生命的誓願 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^*{^#A^%t^*D^$%^&Z^)#^5V^*A^-}^$%^\"|^\"6^*D^&F^\"N^&Z^-w^.H ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXip7XiNBXiV0XipEXiQlXiZaXikjXjVWXipBXi19XiQlXiJ8XiI2XipEXiZGXiJOXiZaXi13Xi5IIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9203a41d03b0",
      "text": "！這就是我所知道的全部。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*W^(s^*J^,X^$%^$)^&h^(y^&Z^!h^)#^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipXXihzXipKXixYXiQlXiQpXiZoXih5XiZaXiFoXikjXiEi",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9be9c0536f0a",
      "text": "這座村莊位在 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^/_^$z^6l^!J^\"d ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXi9fXiR6XjZsXiFKXiJkIA==",
      "byte_length": 19
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_aa9ebf4dd1d6",
      "text": "我被當成死人扔在我們的水井底部。要不是有一位牧師 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^(@^&N^$$^%L^!<^8{^\"d^$%^*{^&Z^%V^!7^/^^)#^!\"^(C^!)^,X^$s^!%^!J^/5^#M ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXihAXiZOXiQkXiVMXiE8Xjh7XiJkXiQlXip7XiZaXiVWXiE3Xi9eXikjXiEiXihDXiEpXixYXiRzXiElXiFKXi81XiNNIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_26b95314b3a2",
      "text": "停下來喝水，我現在肯定還躺在那裡。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+!^!(^!O^6M^%V^*A^$%^&?^\"d^-Z^#.^.7^.-^\"d^)!^-j^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XishXiEoXiFPXjZNXiVWXipBXiQlXiY/XiJkXi1aXiMuXi43Xi4tXiJkXikhXi1qXiEi",
      "byte_length": 51
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ba467a82940c",
      "text": "不久前有一些來自塞德里爾特的難民經過這裡， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^!.^!z^$s^!%^!8^!O^'l^/(^#j^)(^&/^&5^&Z^)a^%T^'D^(x^(s^-j^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXiEuXiF6XiRzXiElXiE4XiFPXidsXi8oXiNqXikoXiYvXiY1XiZaXilhXiVUXidEXih4XihzXi1qXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a94562b46c89",
      "text": "但他們抱怨的是強盜，而不是官兵。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!I^!@^*{^,@^3F^&Z^,X^#]^0!^*A^'W^!)^,X^#-^+,^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFJXiFAXip7XixAXjNGXiZaXixYXiNdXjAhXipBXidXXiEpXixYXiMtXissXiEi",
      "byte_length": 48
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_11a4b506fab1",
      "text": "噢，是 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+]^*A^,X ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitdXipBXixYIA==",
      "byte_length": 10
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e63b98acf417",
      "text": "！能得見尊容真是我的榮幸！你們是自諸神離開阿塔斯以來， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*W^'b^#e^-m^+u^+t^-2^,X^$%^&Z^,e^15^*W^*F^*{^,X^'l^1]^&w^)`^)F^)M^\"o^$[^!B^!O^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipXXidiXiNlXi1tXit1Xit0Xi0yXixYXiQlXiZaXixlXjE1XipXXipGXip7XixYXidsXjFdXiZ3XilgXilGXilNXiJvXiRbXiFCXiFPXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cd60cd3774d9",
      "text": "這片土地上所見過最偉大的英雄！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^&1^\"c^\"e^!'^$)^-m^(x^$q^*}^\"z^&Z^'y^)\\^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXiYxXiJjXiJlXiEnXiQpXi1tXih4XiRxXip9XiJ6XiZaXid5XilcXipX",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c76619447be9",
      "text": "  你過獎了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^(x^7?^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeKHheNz9eKkReISI=",
      "byte_length": 17
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6b110910b4f8",
      "text": "  大戰期間你在哪裡？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^\"z^$(^$u^)G^*F^\"d^+I^-j^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeInpeJCheJHVeKUdeKkZeImReK0leLWpeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a5e47c188971",
      "text": "噢，但這是千真萬確的！你們戰勝德拉吉大軍的勝利， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+]^*A^!I^(s^,X^+7^-2^-_^-6^&Z^*W^*F^*{^$(^+5^#j^$6^\"D^\"z^..^&Z^+5^!t^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitdXipBXiFJXihzXixYXis3Xi0yXi1fXi02XiZaXipXXipGXip7XiQoXis1XiNqXiQ2XiJEXiJ6Xi4uXiZaXis1XiF0XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2bdbac43995b",
      "text": "對奴隸村落意味著一切。就算沙漠降下甘霖， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#:^##^)Z^$z^-`^#z^1n^-a^!%^+.^!\"^*J^-C^%]^,}^)N^!(^/:^6D^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiM6XiMjXilaXiR6Xi1gXiN6XjFuXi1hXiElXisuXiEiXipKXi1DXiVdXix9XilOXiEoXi86XjZEXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2468749e8d03",
      "text": "我們也不會比現在更加感激涕零了！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^!1^!)^$r^,m^&?^\"d^$o^\"\"^#{^1H^6a^9*^*D^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7XiExXiEpXiRyXixtXiY/XiJkXiRvXiIiXiN7XjFIXjZhXjkqXipEXipX",
      "byte_length": 48
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f9c716c6f003",
      "text": "我的名字是阿爾赫娜。既然戰爭結束了，我正準備前往塞德里爾特 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^&Z^\"F^#)^,X^)M^&/^5$^/*^!\"^,U^&\"^$(^1I^'@^$|^*D^*A^$%^%H^,x^+\"^!z^,)^/(^#j^)(^&/^&5 ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiZaXiJGXiMpXixYXilNXiYvXjUkXi8qXiEiXixVXiYiXiQoXjFJXidAXiR8XipEXipBXiQlXiVIXix4XisiXiF6XiwpXi8oXiNqXikoXiYvXiY1IA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_02cac01273bd",
      "text": "與我的家人團聚。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'p^$%^&Z^+s^!<^0V^'[^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XidwXiQlXiZaXitzXiE8XjBWXidbXiEi",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c554f0efe06c",
      "text": " 我也必須由衷感謝你們將塞德里爾特從雙足飛龍掠奪者的手中解救出來。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^$%^!1^#l^)r^&I^7i^#{^-z^*F^*{^#7^/(^#j^)(^&/^&5^#f^)_^(^^)z^*>^1<^1,^'V^&Z^$+^!,^(I^,Q^!q^!O^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4kJV4hMV4jbF4pcl4mSV43aV4je14tel4qRl4qe14jN14vKF4jal4pKF4mL14mNV4jZl4pX14oXl4pel4qPl4xPF4xLF4nVl4mWl4kK14hLF4oSV4sUV4hcV4hT14hIiA=",
      "byte_length": 98
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0cb7714ed70d",
      "text": "此恩永誌難忘。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%I^#v^%W^(N^)a^0]^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVJXiN2XiVXXihOXilhXjBdXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 22
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d8f358443919",
      "text": "我當時就在提奎茲爾！我親眼看見你們率領戰士衝入戰場，接著 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^&N^$f^*J^\"d^$A^5B^/D^&/^*W^$%^(F^&d^*Q^-m^*F^*{^22^)s^$(^+a^-h^!f^$(^\"n^*A^$?^-a ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiZOXiRmXipKXiJkXiRBXjVCXi9EXiYvXipXXiQlXihGXiZkXipRXi1tXipGXip7XjIyXilzXiQoXithXi1oXiFmXiQoXiJuXipBXiQ/Xi1hIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e9cdbc89a3c8",
      "text": "沙塵暴就襲來了。我當時嚇得不敢戰鬥，一直躲在 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%]^\"p^$m^*J^08^!O^*D^!\"^$%^&N^$f^\"X^#e^!)^/m^$(^*,^*A^!%^&`^0C^\"d ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVdXiJwXiRtXipKXjA4XiFPXipEXiEiXiQlXiZOXiRmXiJYXiNlXiEpXi9tXiQoXiosXipBXiElXiZgXjBDXiJkIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cb6ec4670844",
      "text": "茅屋裡直到一切結束。你們真是無比英勇！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^9(^8y^-j^&`^!u^!%^+.^'@^$|^!\"^*F^*{^-2^,X^%}^,m^'y^\"$^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjkoXjh5Xi1qXiZgXiF1XiElXisuXidAXiR8XiEiXipGXip7Xi0yXixYXiV9XixtXid5XiIkXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c2f35420e186",
      "text": "我們永遠不會忘記你， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^%W^({^!)^$r^0]^(K^*F^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7XiVXXih7XiEpXiRyXjBdXihLXipGXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 31
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4b6cf881fb7c",
      "text": "！願你未來所有的冒險都凱旋而歸！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*W^.H^*F^,_^!O^$)^$s^&Z^/P^*m^)$^!p^$`^'W^%K^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XipXXi5IXipGXixfXiFPXiQpXiRzXiZaXi9QXiptXikkXiFwXiRgXidXXiVLXipX",
      "byte_length": 48
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bc33ff1f0ad0",
      "text": "你好，凡人同胞。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^+i^*A^+-^!<^\"E^'`^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXitpXipBXistXiE8XiJFXidgXiEi",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9fd50d9259e4",
      "text": "你們擊敗德拉吉的勝利，給了我自從我 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^$F^$R^#j^$6^\"D^&Z^+5^!t^*A^'A^*D^$%^'l^#f^$% ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiRGXiRSXiNqXiQ2XiJEXiZaXis1XiF0XipBXidBXipEXiQlXidsXiNmXiQlIA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fba756decf44",
      "text": "成為牧師以來從未感受過的希望。我為此向你們致謝！我會治癒 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$$^%{^/5^#M^!B^!O^#f^,_^#{^\";^(x^&Z^+{^,]^!\"^$%^%{^%I^+?^*F^*{^'o^-z^*W^$%^$r^%_^&V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQkXiV7Xi81XiNNXiFCXiFPXiNmXixfXiN7XiI7Xih4XiZaXit7XixdXiEiXiQlXiV7XiVJXis/XipGXip7XidvXi16XipXXiQlXiRyXiVfXiZWIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cb7beead5365",
      "text": "這個村莊的傷痛，這一點你們大可放心。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^!V^$z^6l^&Z^!^^-.^*A^(s^!%^*;^*F^*{^\"z^\"A^$P^#k^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXiFWXiR6XjZsXiZaXiFeXi0uXipBXihzXiElXio7XipGXip7XiJ6XiJBXiRQXiNrXiEi",
      "byte_length": 54
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_eb930d8f24a9",
      "text": "  我受傷了。你能幫幫我嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^\";^!^^*D^!\"^*F^'b^+}^+}^$%^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeIjteIV5eKkReISJeKkZeJ2JeK31eK31eJCVeK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_860a70603a81",
      "text": "  你崇拜的是哪一個領域？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^13^,E^&Z^,X^+I^!%^!V^)s^\"k^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeMTNeLEVeJlpeLFheK0leISVeIVZeKXNeImteLlY=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3bb5a9945b5d",
      "text": "  這樣的生活方式太可怕了！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^(s^,f^&Z^&F^%i^$]^#X^+f^\"A^0^^*D^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKHNeLGZeJlpeJkZeJWleJF1eI1heK2ZeIkFeMF5eKkReKlc=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b84ca59371b2",
      "text": "  可是他們摧毀了你的村莊！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^\"A^,X^!@^*{^$E^%N^*D^*F^&Z^$z^6l^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIkFeLFheIUBeKnteJEVeJU5eKkReKkZeJlpeJHpeNmxeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_857f6098b2d1",
      "text": "  難道你不在乎村民的死活嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^)a^(y^*F^!)^\"d^!0^$z^%T^&Z^%L^%i^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKWFeKHleKkZeISleImReITBeJHpeJVReJlpeJUxeJWleK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_67d6fe92c3b2",
      "text": "  能說服你們的首領與我結盟嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^'b^-x^,\\^*F^*{^&Z^)~^)s^'p^$%^'@^-0^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJ2JeLXheLFxeKkZeKnteJlpeKX5eKXNeJ3BeJCVeJ0BeLTBeK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_390c8b641213",
      "text": "  你們的首領已經同意結盟了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^*{^&Z^)~^)s^#J^'D^\"E^#z^'@^-0^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeKnteJlpeKX5eKXNeI0peJ0ReIkVeI3peJ0BeLTBeKkReISI=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a685cc2756d8",
      "text": " 我現在必須回去專心祈禱了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^$%^&?^\"d^#l^)r^\"\\^\"6^#8^#k^&u^&|^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4kJV4mP14iZF4jbF4pcl4iXF4iNl4jOF4ja14mdV4mfF4qRF4hIiA=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_dd984ea2ba28",
      "text": "我是村裡的牧師，梅赫塔。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^,X^$z^-j^&Z^/5^#M^*A^%-^5$^\"o^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXixYXiR6Xi1qXiZaXi81XiNNXipBXiUtXjUkXiJvXiEi",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d833942dcc2a",
      "text": "風之元素領域是我所選擇的奉獻對象。它是唯一 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)y^!/^!a^'=^)s^\"k^,X^$%^$)^.6^,N^&Z^1+^-(^#:^4g^!\"^+o^,X^+O^!% ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xil5XiEvXiFhXic9XilzXiJrXixYXiQlXiQpXi42XixOXiZaXjErXi0oXiM6XjRnXiEiXitvXixYXitPXiElIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b4f40c271fd5",
      "text": "未受凡塵腐朽所玷污的領域。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,_^\";^+-^\"p^0/^3K^$)^1K^0h^&Z^)s^\"k^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XixfXiI7XistXiJwXjAvXjNLXiQpXjFLXjBoXiZaXilzXiJrXiEi",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2370ec7aba43",
      "text": "強盜與我們在阿塔斯上必須承受的其他災難相比，並沒有什麼不同。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#]^0!^'p^$%^*{^\"d^)M^\"o^$[^!'^#l^)r^$0^\";^&Z^!j^!@^3P^)a^&a^,m^*A^!+^%\\^$s^!=^.T^!)^\"E^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNdXjAhXidwXiQlXip7XiJkXilNXiJvXiRbXiEnXiNsXilyXiQwXiI7XiZaXiFqXiFAXjNQXilhXiZhXixtXipBXiErXiVcXiRzXiE9Xi5UXiEpXiJFXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_94209f80db16",
      "text": "在此生中，我們必須竭力應對加諸在身的一切。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"d^%I^&F^!,^*A^$%^*{^#l^)r^29^!~^0`^#:^\"\"^1]^\"d^(c^&Z^!%^+.^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJkXiVJXiZGXiEsXipBXiQlXip7XiNsXilyXjI5XiF+XjBgXiM6XiIiXjFdXiJkXihjXiZaXiElXisuXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_77f711898cb0",
      "text": "我們生來就是為了受苦。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^&F^!O^*J^,X^%{^*D^\";^.t^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7XiZGXiFPXipKXixYXiV7XipEXiI7Xi50XiEi",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b20c5f2f2e12",
      "text": "就算不是強盜，也會是瘟疫、烈火， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*J^-C^!)^,X^#]^0!^*A^!1^$r^,X^&T^&P^!!^%|^%x^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipKXi1DXiEpXixYXiNdXjAhXipBXiExXiRyXixYXiZUXiZQXiEhXiV8XiV4XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 49
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f6cd35413a9d",
      "text": "或是痲瘋。何必為了所有凡人共通的命運去怪罪強盜？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$'^,X^9$^-/^!\"^!L^#l^%{^*D^$)^$s^+-^!<^3d^(t^&Z^\"N^.4^\"6^#s^5x^#]^0!^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQnXixYXjkkXi0vXiEiXiFMXiNsXiV7XipEXiQpXiRzXistXiE8XjNkXih0XiZaXiJOXi40XiI2XiNzXjV4XiNdXjAhXi5W",
      "byte_length": 72
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_527dd81e4423",
      "text": "那不是我能做的決定，我也為此感到慶幸。若有成千上萬人 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^!)^,X^$%^'b^*~^&Z^,o^#.^*A^$%^!1^%{^%I^#{^!u^5P^15^!\"^'x^$s^$$^+7^!'^-_^!< ",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXiEpXixYXiQlXidiXip+XiZaXixvXiMuXipBXiQlXiExXiV7XiVJXiN7XiF1XjVQXjE1XiEiXid4XiRzXiQkXis3XiEnXi1fXiE8IA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_39b967f41869",
      "text": "注定要被德拉吉屠戮，我寧願自己不是那個將他們送去 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%e^#.^(C^(@^#j^$6^\"D^#A^,:^*A^$%^3k^.H^'l^#I^!)^,X^)!^!V^#7^!@^*{^./^\"6 ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVlXiMuXihDXihAXiNqXiQ2XiJEXiNBXiw6XipBXiQlXjNrXi5IXidsXiNJXiEpXixYXikhXiFWXiM3XiFAXip7Xi4vXiI2IA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9eea73ec1aee",
      "text": "送死的人。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^./^%L^&Z^!<^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi4vXiVMXiZaXiE8XiEi",
      "byte_length": 15
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_90e2b8b718db",
      "text": "我很抱歉，但我 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*K^,@^,h^*A^!I^$% ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXipLXixAXixoXipBXiFJXiQlIA==",
      "byte_length": 22
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_26db08289b3e",
      "text": "只剩下這枚治療之果了。不過你們可以拿去， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"?^8U^!(^(s^$~^%_^&U^!/^%!^*D^!\"^!)^(x^*F^*{^\"A^!B^,G^\"6^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiI/XjhVXiEoXihzXiR+XiVfXiZVXiEvXiUhXipEXiEiXiEpXih4XipGXip7XiJBXiFCXixHXiI2XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c32edcf2d90b",
      "text": "並請收下我的謝意。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!+^*S^$M^!(^$%^&Z^-z^#z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiErXipTXiRNXiEoXiQlXiZaXi16XiN6XiEi",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_88bca5863bf8",
      "text": "我無能為力。村莊遭受的連番襲擊 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^%}^'b^%{^!~^!\"^$z^6l^(}^\";^&Z^.0^2{^08^$F ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiV9XidiXiV7XiF+XiEiXiR6XjZsXih9XiI7XiZaXi4wXjJ7XjA4XiRGIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_88a0f7e5f093",
      "text": "已經耗盡了我的治療神力。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#J^'D^'X^-1^*D^$%^&Z^%_^&U^&w^!~^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNKXidEXidYXi0xXipEXiQlXiZaXiVfXiZVXiZ3XiF+XiEi",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e52f747d4f79",
      "text": "這與其他任何死法一樣並無分別，但這確實是個高尚的義舉， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^'p^!j^!@^!C^!L^%L^%b^!%^,f^!+^%}^!s^*H^*A^!I^(s^-6^#3^,X^!V^*+^+v^&Z^2<^01^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXidwXiFqXiFAXiFDXiFMXiVMXiViXiElXixmXiErXiV9XiFzXipIXipBXiFJXihzXi02XiMzXixYXiFWXiorXit2XiZaXjI8XjAxXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2cd68dd99340",
      "text": "這一點我承認……我為你們的努力獻上祝福",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^!%^*;^$%^$0^(O^*o^*o^$%^%{^*F^*{^&Z^1$^!~^-(^!'^&v^&z",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXiElXio7XiQlXiQwXihPXipvXipvXiQlXiV7XipGXip7XiZaXjEkXiF+Xi0oXiEnXiZ2XiZ6",
      "byte_length": 57
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8539609b31e9",
      "text": "，並贈予這枚治療之果，以備你們不時之需。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*A^!+^([^!4^(s^$~^%_^&U^!/^%!^*A^!B^+\"^*F^*{^!)^$f^!/^)e^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipBXiErXihbXiE0XihzXiR+XiVfXiZVXiEvXiUhXipBXiFCXisiXipGXip7XiEpXiRmXiEvXillXiEi",
      "byte_length": 60
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e17ef953066e",
      "text": "我們早晚都會死",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^,V^,Y^)$^$r^%L",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7XixWXixZXikkXiRyXiVM",
      "byte_length": 21
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_281a1b03387f",
      "text": "，不是死在德拉吉手裡，就是死於其他因由。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*A^!)^,X^%L^\"d^#j^$6^\"D^$+^-j^*A^*J^,X^%L^$^^!j^!@^\"]^&I^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipBXiEpXixYXiVMXiJkXiNqXiQ2XiJEXiQrXi1qXipBXipKXixYXiVMXiReXiFqXiFAXiJdXiZJXiEi",
      "byte_length": 60
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c281224b0463",
      "text": " 就算強盜沒來，也會有更糟糕的災禍降臨。",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^*J^-C^#]^0!^%\\^!O^*A^!1^$r^$s^$o^-E^4\\^&Z^3P^7B^)N^1U^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4qSl4tQ14jXV4wIV4lXF4hT14qQV4hMV4kcl4kc14kb14tRV40XF4mWl4zUF43Ql4pTl4xVV4hIg==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1b790857e622",
      "text": " 在阿塔斯上的所有生靈生來都是受苦的。",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^\"d^)M^\"o^$[^!'^&Z^$)^$s^&F^)g^&F^!O^)$^,X^\";^.t^&Z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4iZF4pTV4ib14kW14hJ14mWl4kKV4kc14mRl4pZ14mRl4hT14pJF4sWF4iO14udF4mWl4hIg==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0deed19f9adc",
      "text": "你們怎麼磨蹭了這麼久——噢，算了！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^,,^.T^-7^9)^*D^(s^.T^!.^*n^*n^+]^*A^-C^*D^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiwsXi5UXi03XjkpXipEXihzXi5UXiEuXipuXipuXitdXipBXi1DXipEXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a1bb73721602",
      "text": "洞穴入口就在這些岩石正後方。你們只需要 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%h^'&^!f^\"<^*J^\"d^(s^!8^#D^&k^%H^#b^$]^!\"^*F^*{^\"?^)e^(C ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVoXicmXiFmXiI8XipKXiJkXihzXiE4XiNEXiZrXiVIXiNiXiRdXiEiXipGXip7XiI/XillXihDIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7676b399dab3",
      "text": "仔細瞧瞧就行了。現在，也許我終於能把手頭的工作完成了……不過還是祝你們 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^6I^'?^-4^-4^*J^(;^*D^!\"^&?^\"d^*A^!1^-s^$%^-H^$^^'b^$1^$+^)t^&Z^+y^!M^#,^$$^*D^*o^*o^!)^(x^.7^,X^&v^*F^*{ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjZJXic/Xi00Xi00XipKXig7XipEXiEiXiY/XiJkXipBXiExXi1zXiQlXi1IXiReXidiXiQxXiQrXil0XiZaXit5XiFNXiMsXiQkXipEXipvXipvXiEpXih4Xi43XixYXiZ2XipGXip7IA==",
      "byte_length": 106
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2f063928ecb4",
      "text": "對付強盜時好運。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#:^*u^#]^0!^$f^+i^.4^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiM6Xip1XiNdXjAhXiRmXitpXi40XiEi",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fdb0772d2785",
      "text": "你們要進入洞穴嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^(C^(w^!f^%h^'&^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XihDXih3XiFmXiVoXicmXitYXi5W",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d9b932d32a4c",
      "text": " 發現了一條通往山脈內部的幽暗狹窄通道。",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^&W^&?^*D^!%^%.^(t^,)^11^6i^!g^)#^&Z^2f^$k^9#^9&^(t^(y^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4mV14mP14qRF4hJV4lLl4odF4sKV4xMV42aV4hZ14pI14mWl4yZl4ka145I145Jl4odF4oeV4hIg==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_caff889d5977",
      "text": " 發現了一堆引人注目的岩石。",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^&W^&?^*D^!%^*[^#Z^!<^%e^&^^&Z^#D^&k^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4mV14mP14qRF4hJV4qW14jWl4hPF4lZV4mXl4mWl4jRF4ma14hIg==",
      "byte_length": 40
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9318d33227d9",
      "text": "井壁上鑿有可供攀爬的著手之處。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!7^*\\^!'^6@^$s^\"A^!P^8|^/y^&Z^-a^$+^!/^(,^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiE3XipcXiEnXjZAXiRzXiJBXiFQXjh8Xi95XiZaXi1hXiQrXiEvXigsXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_424315b11434",
      "text": "你們要爬下去嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^(C^/y^!(^\"6^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XihDXi95XiEoXiI2XitYXi5W",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_98801901cda5",
      "text": "等你們回來如果想找我說話，我就在我的茅屋裡。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'-^*F^*{^\"\\^!O^#$^%!^,1^$/^$%^-x^-v^*A^$%^*J^\"d^$%^&Z^9(^8y^-j^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XictXipGXip7XiJcXiFPXiMkXiUhXiwxXiQvXiQlXi14Xi12XipBXiQlXipKXiJkXiQlXiZaXjkoXjh5Xi1qXiEi",
      "byte_length": 66
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_763fa75870ef",
      "text": "一名傳令兵告訴了我你們進行的那場偉大戰役。阿塔斯從未見過 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!%^\"F^+$^*w^+,^+B^-t^*D^$%^*F^*{^(w^(;^&Z^)!^\"n^*}^\"z^$(^17^!\"^)M^\"o^$[^#f^,_^-m^(x ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiElXiJGXiskXip3XissXitCXi10XipEXiQlXipGXip7Xih3Xig7XiZaXikhXiJuXip9XiJ6XiQoXjE3XiEiXilNXiJvXiRbXiNmXixfXi1tXih4IA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1a4e94702ab9",
      "text": "如此英勇的英雄！我們欠你們一份永遠無法回報的浩大恩情。我 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#$^%I^'y^\"$^&Z^'y^)\\^*W^$%^*{^,g^*F^*{^!%^*x^%W^({^%}^%b^\"\\^+`^&Z^5^^\"z^#v^,0^!\"^$% ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiMkXiVJXid5XiIkXiZaXid5XilcXipXXiQlXip7XixnXipGXip7XiElXip4XiVXXih7XiV9XiViXiJcXitgXiZaXjVeXiJ6XiN2XiwwXiEiXiQlIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d913f551d90b",
      "text": "正計劃為你們舉辦一場慶功盛會，只要 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%H^-n^4s^%{^*F^*{^01^2L^!%^\"n^5P^\"!^1L^$r^*A^\"?^(C ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVIXi1uXjRzXiV7XipGXip7XjAxXjJMXiElXiJuXjVQXiIhXjFMXiRyXipBXiI/XihDIA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_48869d86ff4f",
      "text": "烏斯庫耶與 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^/4^$[^,#^0.^'p ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi80XiRbXiwjXjAuXidwIA==",
      "byte_length": 16
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_27456cf8685b",
      "text": "戰士們一返回村莊就立刻舉行。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$(^+a^*{^!%^7J^\"\\^$z^6l^*J^0'^.Y^01^(;^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQoXithXip7XiElXjdKXiJcXiR6XjZsXipKXjAnXi5ZXjAxXig7XiEi",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8a8962a33c12",
      "text": "很高興再次見到你， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*K^*+^-]^!l^%D^-m^!u^*F^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipLXiorXi1dXiFsXiVEXi1tXiF1XipGXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 28
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_da1b80e0304e",
      "text": "感謝你們為我們所做的一切！要不是 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#{^-z^*F^*{^%{^$%^*{^$)^*~^&Z^!%^+.^*W^(C^!)^,X ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiN7Xi16XipGXip7XiV7XiQlXip7XiQpXip+XiZaXiElXisuXipXXihDXiEpXixYIA==",
      "byte_length": 49
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_332865e40353",
      "text": "因為你們的慷慨與勇氣，我們早就喪命了！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"]^%{^*F^*{^&Z^70^7/^'p^\"$^%U^*A^$%^*{^,V^*J^1)^\"N^*D^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJdXiV7XipGXip7XiZaXjcwXjcvXidwXiIkXiVVXipBXiQlXip7XixWXipKXjEpXiJOXipEXipX",
      "byte_length": 57
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8010b6684aeb",
      "text": " 這只手鐲與魔法之果是我唯一能給予你們的禮物，但請 ",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^(s^\"?^$+^98^'p^*0^%b^!/^%!^,X^$%^+O^!%^'b^'A^!4^*F^*{^&Z^-8^&4^*A^!I^*S ",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4oc14iP14kK145OF4ncF4qMF4lYl4hL14lIV4sWF4kJV4rT14hJV4nYl4nQV4hNF4qRl4qe14mWl4tOF4mNF4qQV4hSV4qUyA=",
      "byte_length": 74
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cb940422de6b",
      "text": "收下它們，代表我由衷的感激之情。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$M^!(^+o^*{^*A^*v^-i^$%^&I^7i^&Z^#{^1H^!/^,0^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRNXiEoXitvXip7XipBXip2Xi1pXiQlXiZJXjdpXiZaXiN7XjFIXiEvXiwwXiEi",
      "byte_length": 48
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e5b8a8a17fda",
      "text": "  那座古堡裡可不只有強盜！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^)!^/_^\"=^\"m^-j^\"A^!)^\"?^$s^#]^0!^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKSFeL19eIj1eIm1eLWpeIkFeISleIj9eJHNeI11eMCFeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5ad14332374f",
      "text": "  你們願意加入我們對抗德拉吉的同盟嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^*{^.H^#z^\"\"^!f^$%^*{^#:^$4^#j^$6^\"D^&Z^\"E^-0^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeKnteLkheI3peIiJeIWZeJCVeKnteIzpeJDReI2peJDZeIkReJlpeIkVeLTBeK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 56
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f2ecbcf2b8ee",
      "text": "  德拉吉的暴政會將你們的村莊徹底碾碎！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^#j^$6^\"D^&Z^$m^,P^$r^#7^*F^*{^&Z^$z^6l^18^/^^0$^&o^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeI2peJDZeIkReJlpeJG1eLFBeJHJeIzdeKkZeKnteJlpeJHpeNmxeMTheL15eMCReJm9eKlc=",
      "byte_length": 56
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5ae3d16acd9d",
      "text": "  德拉吉要的是毀滅，而不是抓奴隸。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^#j^$6^\"D^(C^&Z^,X^%N^%t^*A^'W^!)^,X^$2^##^)Z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeI2peJDZeIkReKENeJlpeLFheJU5eJXReKkFeJ1deISleLFheJDJeIyNeKVpeISI=",
      "byte_length": 50
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_44ddbfd65e4e",
      "text": "  我會去尋找其他盟友來協助我。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^$r^\"6^#9^$/^!j^!@^-0^\"8^!O^2[^\"#^$%^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeJHJeIjZeIzleJC9eIWpeIUBeLTBeIjheIU9eMlteIiNeJCVeISI=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f639b89eb1df",
      "text": "  我希望能有個地方可以歇息。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^+{^,]^'b^$s^!V^\"e^$]^\"A^!B^%E^#w^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeK3teLF1eJ2JeJHNeIVZeImVeJF1eIkFeIUJeJUVeI3deISI=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cce00e7b30da",
      "text": "  我手頭有一些穀物可以贈予你們。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^$+^)t^$s^!%^!8^'%^&4^\"A^!B^([^!4^*F^*{^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeJCteKXReJHNeISVeITheJyVeJjReIkFeIUJeKFteITReKkZeKnteISI=",
      "byte_length": 47
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9a12d8e74ee5",
      "text": "  你們村莊現在打算怎麼辦？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^*{^$z^6l^&?^\"d^$-^-C^,,^.T^2L^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeKnteJHpeNmxeJj9eImReJC1eLUNeLCxeLlReMkxeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2e262444270a",
      "text": "你真是一位偉大的英雄！極少有人能像你一樣歷經浩劫而生還。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^-2^,X^!%^!J^*}^\"z^&Z^'y^)\\^*W^1D^#<^$s^!<^'b^!`^*F^!%^,f^6^^'D^5^^1l^'W^&F^.7^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXi0yXixYXiElXiFKXip9XiJ6XiZaXid5XilcXipXXjFEXiM8XiRzXiE8XidiXiFgXipGXiElXixmXjZeXidEXjVeXjFsXidXXiZGXi43XiEi",
      "byte_length": 84
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a528ed28b996",
      "text": "烏斯庫耶已經率領他們前往提奎茲爾了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^/4^$[^,#^0.^#J^'D^22^)s^!@^*{^!z^,)^$A^5B^/D^&/^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi80XiRbXiwjXjAuXiNKXidEXjIyXilzXiFAXip7XiF6XiwpXiRBXjVCXi9EXiYvXipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 54
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e71b0571ebfb",
      "text": "就在我們說話的此時，他們正朝著提奎茲爾行軍，加入你們的大軍。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*J^\"d^$%^*{^-x^-v^&Z^%I^$f^*A^!@^*{^%H^,^^-a^$A^5B^/D^&/^(;^..^*A^\"\"^!f^*F^*{^&Z^\"z^..^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipKXiJkXiQlXip7Xi14Xi12XiZaXiVJXiRmXipBXiFAXip7XiVIXixeXi1hXiRBXjVCXi9EXiYvXig7Xi4uXipBXiIiXiFmXipGXip7XiZaXiJ6Xi4uXiEi",
      "byte_length": 90
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ad30afd4b48f",
      "text": "他們這幾天隨時都會回來。他們一回到村裡，我便會立刻派他們前往 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^*{^(s^#T^+e^)X^$f^)$^$r^\"\\^!O^!\"^!@^*{^!%^\"\\^!u^$z^-j^*A^$%^!R^$r^0'^.Y^.n^!@^*{^!z^,) ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXip7XihzXiNUXitlXilYXiRmXikkXiRyXiJcXiFPXiEiXiFAXip7XiElXiJcXiF1XiR6Xi1qXipBXiQlXiFSXiRyXjAnXi5ZXi5uXiFAXip7XiF6XiwpIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_158b944e521d",
      "text": "提奎茲爾支援。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$A^5B^/D^&/^$L^$C^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRBXjVCXi9EXiYvXiRMXiRDXiEi",
      "byte_length": 21
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a5eaf60206cd",
      "text": "一旦我們的戰士從戰場歸來",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!%^1C^$%^*{^&Z^$(^+a^#f^$(^\"n^%K^!O",
      "encoded_base64": "XiElXjFDXiQlXip7XiZaXiQoXithXiNmXiQoXiJuXiVLXiFP",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e44c1ee93943",
      "text": "既然強盜都死了",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,U^&\"^#]^0!^)$^%L^*D",
      "encoded_base64": "XixVXiYiXiNdXjAhXikkXiVMXipE",
      "byte_length": 21
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_70a33ee01748",
      "text": "，我們就能著手重建主城牆與家園。用不了 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*A^$%^*{^*J^'b^-a^$+^))^,'^!-^+_^&0^'p^+s^41^!\"^&H^!)^*D ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipBXiQlXip7XipKXidiXi1hXiQrXikpXiwnXiEtXitfXiYwXidwXitzXjQxXiEiXiZIXiEpXipEIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3976d67c50f8",
      "text": "多久，塞德里爾特便能恢復往日的面貌。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"x^!.^*A^/(^#j^)(^&/^&5^!R^'b^#u^#g^,)^$a^&Z^)j^-~^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJ4XiEuXipBXi8oXiNqXikoXiYvXiY1XiFSXidiXiN1XiNnXiwpXiRhXiZaXilqXi1+XiEi",
      "byte_length": 54
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c0ead5108ef2",
      "text": "看看你們四周。這個村莊根本沒有打仗的條件。我們需要 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*Q^*Q^*F^*{^\"[^\"L^!\"^(s^!V^$z^6l^%)^$x^%\\^$s^$-^0|^&Z^%.^.W^!\"^$%^*{^)e^(C ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipRXipRXipGXip7XiJbXiJMXiEiXihzXiFWXiR6XjZsXiUpXiR4XiVcXiRzXiQtXjB8XiZaXiUuXi5XXiEiXiQlXip7XillXihDIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_08437b6333d4",
      "text": "留著戰士在村裡捕捉新的牲畜群，並重建家園。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-+^-a^$(^+a^\"d^$z^-j^4?^4>^$\\^&Z^1J^5f^'R^*A^!+^))^,'^+s^41^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi0rXi1hXiQoXithXiJkXiR6Xi1qXjQ/XjQ+XiRcXiZaXjFKXjVmXidSXipBXiErXikpXiwnXitzXjQxXiEi",
      "byte_length": 63
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_32fcd74ec530",
      "text": "祝你們在對抗德拉吉的戰爭中旗開得勝。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&v^*F^*{^\"d^#:^$4^#j^$6^\"D^&Z^$(^1I^!,^1B^)F^#e^+5^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZ2XipGXip7XiJkXiM6XiQ0XiNqXiQ2XiJEXiZaXiQoXjFJXiEsXjFCXilGXiNlXis1XiEi",
      "byte_length": 54
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_162e4fb6f7e6",
      "text": "如果我們把戰士派走，村莊就會徹底失去防護。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#$^%!^$%^*{^$1^$(^+a^.n^.&^*A^$z^6l^*J^$r^18^/^^\"|^\"6^)K^(T^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiMkXiUhXiQlXip7XiQxXiQoXithXi5uXi4mXipBXiR6XjZsXipKXiRyXjE4Xi9eXiJ8XiI2XilLXihUXiEi",
      "byte_length": 63
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3212d171a730",
      "text": "呼嘯之風德魯伊的",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"M^0U^!/^)y^#j^/K^!E^&Z",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJNXjBVXiEvXil5XiNqXi9LXiFFXiZa",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fff880ba1ebb",
      "text": " 威嚴聲音在",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^#&^1*^-W^34^\"d",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4jJl4xKl4tV14zNF4iZA==",
      "byte_length": 16
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cdb3b18cdf27",
      "text": " 微風中緩緩迴盪。",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^#i^)y^!,^'J^'J^0D^0\"^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4jaV4peV4hLF4nSl4nSl4wRF4wIl4hIg==",
      "byte_length": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1c19c23d7244",
      "text": "只要村民與自然和諧共存，我 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"?^(C^$z^%T^'p^'l^&\"^\"O^4f^3d^#*^*A^$% ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiI/XihDXiR6XiVUXidwXidsXiYiXiJPXjRmXjNkXiMqXipBXiQlIA==",
      "byte_length": 40
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_65f787f1076c",
      "text": "就會守護他們。我應允賜予庇護。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*J^$r^#+^(T^!@^*{^!\"^$%^0`^/\"^.#^!4^,\"^(T^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipKXiRyXiMrXihUXiFAXip7XiEiXiQlXjBgXi8iXi4jXiE0XiwiXihUXiEi",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2370b8f95205",
      "text": "既然如此，我們欣然同意加入你們的同盟！我們會盡快 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,U^&\"^#$^%I^*A^$%^*{^2'^&\"^\"E^#z^\"\"^!f^*F^*{^&Z^\"E^-0^*W^$%^*{^$r^-1^*L ",
      "encoded_base64": "XixVXiYiXiMkXiVJXipBXiQlXip7XjInXiYiXiJFXiN6XiIiXiFmXipGXip7XiZaXiJFXi0wXipXXiQlXip7XiRyXi0xXipMIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9afb71ca3358",
      "text": "將我們的戰士派往你們那裡支援。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#7^$%^*{^&Z^$(^+a^.n^,)^*F^*{^)!^-j^$L^$C^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiM3XiQlXip7XiZaXiQoXithXi5uXiwpXipGXip7XikhXi1qXiRMXiRDXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0179380788b0",
      "text": " 你們只需環顧四周便能明白，比起德拉吉，這裡有更多 ",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^*F^*{^\"?^)e^&B^4n^\"[^\"L^!R^'b^$c^&X^*A^,m^.(^#j^$6^\"D^*A^(s^-j^$s^$o^\"x ",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4qRl4qe14iP14pZV4mQl40bl4iW14iTF4hUl4nYl4kY14mWF4qQV4sbV4uKF4jal4kNl4iRF4qQV4oc14tal4kc14kb14ieCA=",
      "byte_length": 74
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2125263d93b7",
      "text": "值得擔憂的生死存亡之危。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!Z^#e^*N^91^&Z^&F^%L^#*^!:^!/^2\\^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFaXiNlXipOXjkxXiZaXiZGXiVMXiMqXiE6XiEvXjJcXiEi",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ff91032097f6",
      "text": "你們不知道你們對我的要求有多麼沉重",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^!)^&h^(y^*F^*{^#:^$%^&Z^(C^,n^$s^\"x^.T^%Z^))",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiEpXiZoXih5XipGXip7XiM6XiQlXiZaXihDXixuXiRzXiJ4Xi5UXiVaXikp",
      "byte_length": 51
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c36b3d09ee5c",
      "text": "，但你說的話確實不無道理。我會派遣一些 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*A^!I^*F^-x^&Z^-v^-6^#3^!)^%}^(y^&A^!\"^$%^$r^.n^4k^!%^!8 ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipBXiFJXipGXi14XiZaXi12Xi02XiMzXiEpXiV9Xih5XiZBXiEiXiQlXiRyXi5uXjRrXiElXiE4IA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bbe4a38ee345",
      "text": "我的戰士前去協助你們的同盟。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^&Z^$(^+a^!z^\"6^2[^\"#^*F^*{^&Z^\"E^-0^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiZaXiQoXithXiF6XiI2XjJbXiIjXipGXip7XiZaXiJFXi0wXiEi",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_84fa58a9a81c",
      "text": "。這個村莊受的苦已經夠多了！如果非得如此，我們會逃往 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!\"^(s^!V^$z^6l^\";^&Z^.t^#J^'D^+d^\"x^*D^*W^#$^%!^)i^#e^#$^%I^*A^$%^*{^$r^(p^,) ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEiXihzXiFWXiR6XjZsXiI7XiZaXi50XiNKXidEXitkXiJ4XipEXipXXiMkXiUhXilpXiNlXiMkXiVJXipBXiQlXip7XiRyXihwXiwpIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_02eef6c58543",
      "text": "山脈深處避難，但與德拉吉開戰根本是瘋了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^11^6i^2*^(,^0F^)a^*A^!I^'p^#j^$6^\"D^)F^$(^%)^$x^,X^-/^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XjExXjZpXjIqXigsXjBGXilhXipBXiFJXidwXiNqXiQ2XiJEXilGXiQoXiUpXiR4XixYXi0vXipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 60
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3b32046ad6d1",
      "text": "這是我起碼能做到的事。你們想在這裡歇息多久都可以。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^,X^$%^.(^94^'b^*~^!u^&Z^*r^!\"^*F^*{^,1^\"d^(s^-j^%E^#w^\"x^!.^)$^\"A^!B^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXixYXiQlXi4oXjk0XidiXip+XiF1XiZaXipyXiEiXipGXip7XiwxXiJkXihzXi1qXiVFXiN3XiJ4XiEuXikkXiJBXiFCXiEi",
      "byte_length": 75
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b3f044d65663",
      "text": "你們還在這裡？我還以為你們早就跑去洗劫另一個 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^.7^\"d^(s^-j^.V^$%^.7^!B^%{^*F^*{^,V^*J^(_^\"6^0j^1l^\">^!%^!V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7Xi43XiJkXihzXi1qXi5WXiQlXi43XiFCXiV7XipGXip7XixWXipKXihfXiI2XjBqXjFsXiI+XiElXiFWIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c1a9a0bae562",
      "text": "村莊了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$z^6l^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiR6XjZsXipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 12
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9b64ecf78cf3",
      "text": "我是村長查雅。我要你們交代清楚你們來這裡的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^,X^$z^)C^%&^9:^!\"^$%^(C^*F^*{^0P^*v^,u^,c^*F^*{^!O^(s^-j^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXixYXiR6XilDXiUmXjk6XiEiXiQlXihDXipGXip7XjBQXip2Xix1XixjXipGXip7XiFPXihzXi1qXiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f9c4f8fb5d17",
      "text": "目的。你們是像那些強盜一樣的壓迫者嗎？還是更惡劣的傢伙？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&^^&Z^!\"^*F^*{^,X^!`^)!^!8^#]^0!^!%^,f^&Z^4v^1`^'V^+X^.V^.7^,X^$o^#y^+2^&Z^+#^*y^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZeXiZaXiEiXipGXip7XixYXiFgXikhXiE4XiNdXjAhXiElXixmXiZaXjR2XjFgXidWXitYXi5WXi43XixYXiRvXiN5XisyXiZaXisjXip5Xi5W",
      "byte_length": 84
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5b14f9c79da4",
      "text": "  我剛剛才殺了那些強盜！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^+0^+0^$,^%M^*D^)!^!8^#]^0!^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeKzBeKzBeJCxeJU1eKkReKSFeITheI11eMCFeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_331fae9c65c9",
      "text": "  我正在尋求盟友。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^%H^\"d^#9^,n^-0^\"8^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeJUheImReIzleLG5eLTBeIjheISI=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_208a9442ebfe",
      "text": "  我不過是個普通的冒險者。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^!)^(x^,X^!V^$g^(t^&Z^/P^*m^'V^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeISleKHheLFheIVZeJGdeKHReJlpeL1BeKm1eJ1ZeISI=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f0c119dba4db",
      "text": "  你竟敢侮辱我！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^28^/m^9+^3`^$%^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeMjheL21eOSteM2BeJCVeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 23
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b2bfbebd1ed4",
      "text": "  我很抱歉。我們應該試著成為朋友。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^*K^,@^,h^!\"^$%^*{^0`^(M^-u^-a^$$^%{^,[^\"8^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeKkteLEBeLGheISJeJCVeKnteMGBeKE1eLXVeLWFeJCReJXteLFteIjheISI=",
      "byte_length": 50
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e7d9ac4c4e5b",
      "text": "  我要如何證明我的意圖是和平的？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^(C^#$^!L^-{^$c^$%^&Z^#z^\"b^,X^\"O^0Y^&Z^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeKENeIyReIUxeLXteJGNeJCVeJlpeI3peImJeLFheIk9eMFleJlpeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 47
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_51a462ad3ae5",
      "text": "  我聽厭了你這張臭嘴！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^-X^+9^*D^*F^(s^,(^'m^+[^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeLVheKzleKkReKkZeKHNeLCheJ21eK1teKlc=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fc77d12f5b27",
      "text": "  我會替你們除掉那些強盜。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^$r^2o^*F^*{^)Q^/e^)!^!8^#]^0!^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeJHJeMm9eKkZeKnteKVFeL2VeKSFeITheI11eMCFeISI=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d5eab64e546d",
      "text": "  我聽夠了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^-X^+d^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeLVheK2ReKkReISI=",
      "byte_length": 17
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_092b8d24044c",
      "text": "  算了。你們自己的麻煩自己解決吧。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^-C^*D^!\"^*F^*{^'l^#I^&Z^*6^-!^'l^#I^(I^,o^*I^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLUNeKkReISJeKkZeKnteJ2xeI0leJlpeKjZeLSFeJ2xeI0leKEleLG9eKkleISI=",
      "byte_length": 50
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7f8a04669c88",
      "text": "  與我聯手吧。德拉吉才是真正的威脅。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^'p^$%^-V^$+^*I^!\"^#j^$6^\"D^$,^,X^-2^%H^&Z^#&^1T^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJ3BeJCVeLVZeJCteKkleISJeI2peJDZeIkReJCxeLFheLTJeJUheJlpeIyZeMVReISI=",
      "byte_length": 53
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_de1051cd6134",
      "text": "  那些強盜活該找上你們！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^)!^!8^#]^0!^%i^(M^$/^!'^*F^*{^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKSFeITheI11eMCFeJWleKE1eJC9eISdeKkZeKnteKlc=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4da529392c29",
      "text": "我的朋友全都死了。我不需要任何新朋友。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^&Z^,[^\"8^!h^)$^%L^*D^!\"^$%^!)^)e^(C^!C^!L^$\\^,[^\"8^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiZaXixbXiI4XiFoXikkXiVMXipEXiEiXiQlXiEpXillXihDXiFDXiFMXiRcXixbXiI4XiEi",
      "byte_length": 57
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fb4fc3948320",
      "text": "我不在乎你叫什麼名字。反正大概也是假的。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^!)^\"d^!0^*F^+<^!=^.T^\"F^#)^!\"^\"9^%H^\"z^,d^!1^,X^1i^&Z^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiEpXiJkXiEwXipGXis8XiE9Xi5UXiJGXiMpXiEiXiI5XiVIXiJ6XixkXiExXixYXjFpXiZaXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_94a541b5cd4d",
      "text": "我想知道你們為何會來到這裡。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^,1^&h^(y^*F^*{^%{^!L^$r^!O^!u^(s^-j^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiwxXiZoXih5XipGXip7XiV7XiFMXiRyXiFPXiF1XihzXi1qXiEi",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6bc0699cfc22",
      "text": "你們只殺了少數幾個。要不了多久，會有更多強盜捲土重來。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^\"?^%M^*D^#<^$V^#T^!V^!\"^(C^!)^*D^\"x^!.^*A^$r^$s^$o^\"x^#]^0!^0c^\"c^))^!O^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiI/XiVNXipEXiM8XiRWXiNUXiFWXiEiXihDXiEpXipEXiJ4XiEuXipBXiRyXiRzXiRvXiJ4XiNdXjAhXjBjXiJjXikpXiFPXiEi",
      "byte_length": 81
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d94588c8929d",
      "text": "我絕不會跟你們這種烏合之眾結盟。你們分明是打算引走 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^-I^!)^$r^.+^*F^*{^(s^'$^/4^\"C^!/^&e^'@^-0^!\"^*F^*{^!s^$c^,X^$-^-C^#Z^.& ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXi1JXiEpXiRyXi4rXipGXip7XihzXickXi80XiJDXiEvXiZlXidAXi0wXiEiXipGXip7XiFzXiRjXixYXiQtXi1DXiNaXi4mIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2a92b93afaea",
      "text": "我們的戰士，好讓你們折返回來霸佔整個村莊。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^&Z^$(^+a^*A^+i^-}^*F^*{^,?^7J^\"\\^!O^33^0R^$T^!V^$z^6l^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7XiZaXiQoXithXipBXitpXi19XipGXip7Xiw/XjdKXiJcXiFPXjMzXjBSXiRUXiFWXiR6XjZsXiEi",
      "byte_length": 63
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_56cb42383000",
      "text": "這正是我所擔心的！像你們這樣的冒險者，還有那些強盜，只會 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^%H^,X^$%^$)^*N^#k^&Z^*W^!`^*F^*{^(s^,f^&Z^/P^*m^'V^*A^.7^$s^)!^!8^#]^0!^*A^\"?^$r ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXiVIXixYXiQlXiQpXipOXiNrXiZaXipXXiFgXipGXip7XihzXixmXiZaXi9QXiptXidWXipBXi43XiRzXikhXiE4XiNdXjAhXipBXiI/XiRyIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d932289acc09",
      "text": "對愛好和平的村落敲骨吸髓。哼，你們在這裡根本撈不到什麼好處！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#:^,2^+i^\"O^0Y^&Z^$z^-`^1A^*$^\"J^*)^!\"^+K^*A^*F^*{^\"d^(s^-j^%)^$x^5S^!)^!u^!=^.T^+i^(,^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiM6XiwyXitpXiJPXjBZXiZaXiR6Xi1gXjFBXiokXiJKXiopXiEiXitLXipBXipGXip7XiJkXihzXi1qXiUpXiR4XjVTXiEpXiF1XiE9Xi5UXitpXigsXipX",
      "byte_length": 90
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f2eebb97a10c",
      "text": "這是我的村莊！我想怎麼說就怎麼說。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^,X^$%^&Z^$z^6l^*W^$%^,1^,,^.T^-x^*J^,,^.T^-x^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXixYXiQlXiZaXiR6XjZsXipXXiQlXiwxXiwsXi5UXi14XipKXiwsXi5UXi14XiEi",
      "byte_length": 51
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_94ad290f129a",
      "text": "你們看起來跟那些不斷襲擊我們村莊、燒殺擄掠的強盜 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^*Q^.(^!O^.+^)!^!8^!)^,T^08^$F^$%^*{^$z^6l^!!^&&^%M^92^1<^&Z^#]^0! ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XipRXi4oXiFPXi4rXikhXiE4XiEpXixUXjA4XiRGXiQlXip7XiR6XjZsXiEhXiYmXiVNXjkyXjE8XiZaXiNdXjAhIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e945df0f8efd",
      "text": "沒什麼兩樣。先證明你們比他們高尚，我或許還會考慮 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%\\^!=^.T^!i^,f^!\"^!b^-{^$c^*F^*{^,m^!@^*{^*+^+v^*A^$%^$'^-s^.7^$r^-R^19 ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVcXiE9Xi5UXiFpXixmXiEiXiFiXi17XiRjXipGXip7XixtXiFAXip7XiorXit2XipBXiQlXiQnXi1zXi43XiRyXi1SXjE5IA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_967c68b6cfac",
      "text": "跟你們談談。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.+^*F^*{^0;^0;^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi4rXipGXip7XjA7XjA7XiEi",
      "byte_length": 18
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ca81bef70039",
      "text": "你們隨時都可以滾出這裡！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^)X^$f^)$^\"A^!B^,z^!q^(s^-j^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XilYXiRmXikkXiJBXiFCXix6XiFxXihzXi1qXipX",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_66dd2cdd7e34",
      "text": "在強盜被剷除之前，我根本無力參與任何戰爭。我的戰士必須 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"d^#]^0!^(@^2Y^)Q^!/^!z^*A^$%^%)^$x^%}^!~^6K^'p^!C^!L^$(^1I^!\"^$%^&Z^$(^+a^#l^)r ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJkXiNdXjAhXihAXjJZXilRXiEvXiF6XipBXiQlXiUpXiR4XiV9XiF+XjZLXidwXiFDXiFMXiQoXjFJXiEiXiQlXiZaXiQoXithXiNsXilyIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_48c553c74672",
      "text": "留在這裡守衛村莊。先替我們除掉那些強盜，然後 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-+^\"d^(s^-j^#+^(=^$z^6l^!\"^!b^2o^$%^*{^)Q^/e^)!^!8^#]^0!^*A^&\"^#b ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi0rXiJkXihzXi1qXiMrXig9XiR6XjZsXiEiXiFiXjJvXiQlXip7XilRXi9lXikhXiE4XiNdXjAhXipBXiYiXiNiIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_420402540134",
      "text": "我們再來談同盟的事。記住，我可沒做任何保證。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^!l^!O^0;^\"E^-0^&Z^*r^!\"^(K^*z^*A^$%^\"A^%\\^*~^!C^!L^!T^-{^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7XiFsXiFPXjA7XiJFXi0wXiZaXipyXiEiXihLXip6XipBXiQlXiJBXiVcXip+XiFDXiFMXiFUXi17XiEi",
      "byte_length": 66
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_04cf7a82922e",
      "text": "我當然不反對你們去替我們除掉強盜，但是 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^&N^&\"^!)^\"9^#:^*F^*{^\"6^2o^$%^*{^)Q^/e^#]^0!^*A^!I^,X ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiZOXiYiXiEpXiI5XiM6XipGXip7XiI2XjJvXiQlXip7XilRXi9lXiNdXjAhXipBXiFJXixYIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_004ae5b8a54f",
      "text": "別指望能得到任何回報。除了粗茶淡飯的款待，我什麼也 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*H^$8^,]^'b^#e^!u^!C^!L^\"\\^+`^!\"^)Q^*D^0(^97^5_^9;^&Z^7{^,*^*A^$%^!=^.T^!1 ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipIXiQ4XixdXidiXiNlXiF1XiFDXiFMXiJcXitgXiEiXilRXipEXjAoXjk3XjVfXjk7XiZaXjd7XiwqXipBXiQlXiE9Xi5UXiExIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9ed08fa39607",
      "text": "給不了你們。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'A^!)^*D^*F^*{^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XidBXiEpXipEXipGXip7XiEi",
      "byte_length": 18
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_40a687228783",
      "text": "滾出我的村莊！你們這群禿鷹在這裡不受歡迎！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,z^!q^$%^&Z^$z^6l^*W^*F^*{^(s^'R^&}^*3^\"d^(s^-j^!)^\";^%F^(k^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "Xix6XiFxXiQlXiZaXiR6XjZsXipXXipGXip7XihzXidSXiZ9XiozXiJkXihzXi1qXiEpXiI7XiVGXihrXipX",
      "byte_length": 63
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d5ba0d27d88c",
      "text": "果不其然。你們憑什麼要在乎我們？我們沒有你們想要的任何東西， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%!^!)^!j^&\"^!\"^*F^*{^,5^!=^.T^(C^\"d^!0^$%^*{^.V^$%^*{^%\\^$s^*F^*{^,1^(C^&Z^!C^!L^,`^-l^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiUhXiEpXiFqXiYiXiEiXipGXip7Xiw1XiE9Xi5UXihDXiJkXiEwXiQlXip7Xi5WXiQlXip7XiVcXiRzXipGXip7XiwxXihDXiZaXiFDXiFMXixgXi1sXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8715cd242b8c",
      "text": "更沒有任何你們無法隨手搶走的事物。要是能遇見一個願意施予善意的人， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$o^%\\^$s^!C^!L^*F^*{^%}^%b^)X^$+^1?^.&^&Z^*r^&4^!\"^(C^,X^'b^.2^-m^!%^!V^.H^#z^$_^!4^1(^#z^&Z^!<^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRvXiVcXiRzXiFDXiFMXipGXip7XiV9XiViXilYXiQrXjE/Xi4mXiZaXipyXiY0XiEiXihDXixYXidiXi4yXi1tXiElXiFWXi5IXiN6XiRfXiE0XjEoXiN6XiZaXiE8XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 100
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1ca8fc9a19d2",
      "text": "沙漠恐怕早就天降甘霖了！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%]^,}^#t^0^^,V^*J^+e^)N^/:^6D^*D^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVdXix9XiN0XjBeXixWXipKXitlXilOXi86XjZEXipEXipX",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_dc735e8867b9",
      "text": "你們真讓我感到驚訝！我完全沒想到在阿塔斯上的任何角落 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^-2^-}^$%^#{^!u^.Q^-r^*W^$%^#,^!h^%\\^,1^!u^\"d^)M^\"o^$[^!'^&Z^!C^!L^(H^-` ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7Xi0yXi19XiQlXiN7XiF1Xi5RXi1yXipXXiQlXiMsXiFoXiVcXiwxXiF1XiJkXilNXiJvXiRbXiEnXiZaXiFDXiFMXihIXi1gIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a0994e96bef7",
      "text": "還能見到如此無私的英勇義舉。或許你們願意收下藏在我床底下的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.7^'b^-m^!u^#$^%I^%}^&~^&Z^'y^\"$^2<^01^!\"^$'^-s^*F^*{^.H^#z^$M^!(^-f^\"d^$%^#U^/^^!(^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi43XidiXi1tXiF1XiMkXiVJXiV9XiZ+XiZaXid5XiIkXjI8XjAxXiEiXiQnXi1zXipGXip7Xi5IXiN6XiRNXiEoXi1mXiJkXiQlXiNVXi9eXiEoXiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4345714767f7",
      "text": "寶箱，以彌補我先前的無禮與冒犯。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#4^'/^*A^!B^9/^6&^$%^!b^!z^&Z^%}^-8^'p^/P^-%^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiM0XicvXipBXiFCXjkvXjYmXiQlXiFiXiF6XiZaXiV9Xi04XidwXi9QXi0lXiEi",
      "byte_length": 48
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_31eb5e7cad61",
      "text": "  這些強盜是從哪裡來的？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^(s^!8^#]^0!^,X^#f^+I^-j^!O^&Z^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKHNeITheI11eMCFeLFheI2ZeK0leLWpeIU9eJlpeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_34b742e851b5",
      "text": "  關於那座古堡，你知道些什麼？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^.>^$^^)!^/_^\"=^\"m^*A^*F^&h^(y^!8^!=^.T^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLj5eJF5eKSFeL19eIj1eIm1eKkFeKkZeJmheKHleITheIT1eLlReLlY=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c3ab67317795",
      "text": "  我該如何前往那座古堡？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^(M^#$^!L^!z^,)^)!^/_^\"=^\"m^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeKE1eIyReIUxeIXpeLCleKSFeL19eIj1eIm1eLlY=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_04c9590b49c7",
      "text": "  克里科爾是誰？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^!d^)(^'!^&/^,X^-y^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIWReKSheJyFeJi9eLFheLXleLlY=",
      "byte_length": 23
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_68007f93f69b",
      "text": "  你們村裡有戰士嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^*{^$z^-j^$s^$(^+a^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeKnteJHpeLWpeJHNeJCheK2FeK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6e9a78cab1b3",
      "text": "  戰士們何時會回來？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$(^+a^*{^!L^$f^$r^\"\\^!O^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCheK2FeKnteIUxeJGZeJHJeIlxeIU9eLlY=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bc81415f1e1f",
      "text": "那些強盜是最近才盤踞在山頂古堡的。除了 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^!8^#]^0!^,X^$q^(l^$,^1M^1_^\"d^11^)p^\"=^\"m^&Z^!\"^)Q^*D ",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXiE4XiNdXjAhXixYXiRxXihsXiQsXjFNXjFfXiJkXjExXilwXiI9XiJtXiZaXiEiXilRXipEIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a8a30b831d13",
      "text": "那些雙足飛龍以外，他們就是群典型的亡命兇徒。既然我們已經沒有任何東西可偷，他們便以殺人為樂， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^!8^)_^(^^)z^*>^!B^\"w^*A^!@^*{^*J^,X^'R^2W^\"j^&Z^!:^\"N^*G^#d^!\"^,U^&\"^$%^*{^#J^'D^%\\^$s^!C^!L^,`^-l^\"A^/O^*A^!@^*{^!R^!B^%M^!<^%{^%8^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXiE4XilfXiheXil6Xio+XiFCXiJ3XipBXiFAXip7XipKXixYXidSXjJXXiJqXiZaXiE6XiJOXipHXiNkXiEiXixVXiYiXiQlXip7XiNKXidEXiVcXiRzXiFDXiFMXixgXi1sXiJBXi9PXipBXiFAXip7XiFSXiFCXiVNXiE8XiV7XiU4XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 139
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_34cd89c6794a",
      "text": "還屠殺我們的牲畜來練手試刀。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.7^#A^%M^$%^*{^&Z^1J^5f^!O^-L^$+^-u^7Q^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi43XiNBXiVNXiQlXip7XiZaXjFKXjVmXiFPXi1MXiQrXi11XjdRXiEi",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7af02817a096",
      "text": "那座古堡的歷史至少和德拉吉城邦一樣悠久，但沒人知道是誰建造的。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^/_^\"=^\"m^&Z^6^^1m^'n^#<^\"O^#j^$6^\"D^+_^1a^!%^,f^90^!.^*A^!I^%\\^!<^&h^(y^,X^-y^,'^(v^&Z^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXi9fXiI9XiJtXiZaXjZeXjFtXiduXiM8XiJPXiNqXiQ2XiJEXitfXjFhXiElXixmXjkwXiEuXipBXiFJXiVcXiE8XiZoXih5XixYXi15XiwnXih2XiZaXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 94
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a237aebe137d",
      "text": "在強盜到來之前，我們偶爾能看見城堡裡透出燈火，但是 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"d^#]^0!^!u^!O^!/^!z^*A^$%^*{^9,^&/^'b^*Q^-m^+_^\"m^-j^(q^!q^93^%x^*A^!I^,X ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJkXiNdXjAhXiF1XiFPXiEvXiF6XipBXiQlXip7XjksXiYvXidiXipRXi1tXitfXiJtXi1qXihxXiFxXjkzXiV4XipBXiFJXixYIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d26a55aea883",
      "text": "從來沒有人走下山來打擾過我們。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#f^!O^%\\^$s^!<^.&^!(^11^!O^$-^$K^(x^$%^*{^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNmXiFPXiVcXiRzXiE8Xi4mXiEoXjExXiFPXiQtXiRLXih4XiQlXip7XiEi",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_05f8beefa7c5",
      "text": "這個嘛，我只知道你們絕對爬不上那座山。強盜第一次襲擊 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^!V^+Y^*A^$%^\"?^&h^(y^*F^*{^-I^#:^/y^!)^!'^)!^/_^11^!\"^#]^0!^',^!%^%D^08^$F ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXiFWXitZXipBXiQlXiI/XiZoXih5XipGXip7Xi1JXiM6Xi95XiEpXiEnXikhXi9fXjExXiEiXiNdXjAhXicsXiElXiVEXjA4XiRGIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_467f0fd84336",
      "text": "我的村莊時，我們的戰士曾嘗試攀登。克里科爾是唯一可能 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^&Z^$z^6l^$f^*A^$%^*{^&Z^$(^+a^.j^1o^-u^8|^/;^!\"^!d^)(^'!^&/^,X^+O^!%^\"A^'b ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiZaXiR6XjZsXiRmXipBXiQlXip7XiZaXiQoXithXi5qXjFvXi11Xjh8Xi87XiEiXiFkXikoXichXiYvXixYXitPXiElXiJBXidiIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f4ceca4b1c7c",
      "text": "知曉路徑的人。要是連他都不知道，你們就只能學著長翅膀飛上去了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&h^7y^(a^#c^&Z^!<^!\"^(C^,X^.0^!@^)$^!)^&h^(y^*A^*F^*{^*J^\"?^'b^+n^-a^)C^95^96^)z^!'^\"6^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZoXjd5XihhXiNjXiZaXiE8XiEiXihDXixYXi4wXiFAXikkXiEpXiZoXih5XipBXipGXip7XipKXiI/XidiXituXi1hXilDXjk1Xjk2Xil6XiEnXiI2XipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 93
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_502987bb168e",
      "text": "克里科爾是個矮人。他住在村莊西南邊的小木屋裡。要是他 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!d^)(^'!^&/^,X^!V^&j^!<^!\"^!@^*z^\"d^$z^6l^-l^\"/^.8^&Z^#;^$v^8y^-j^!\"^(C^,X^!@ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFkXikoXichXiYvXixYXiFWXiZqXiE8XiEiXiFAXip6XiJkXiR6XjZsXi1sXiIvXi44XiZaXiM7XiR2Xjh5Xi1qXiEiXihDXixYXiFAIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_849b49b37b90",
      "text": "不在那兒，大概就是出門勘測山脈了。他對其他事情一概不感興趣。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^\"d^)!^++^*A^\"z^,d^*J^,X^!q^)D^9.^%p^11^6i^*D^!\"^!@^#:^!j^!@^*r^,0^!%^,d^!)^#{^-]^.*^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXiJkXikhXisrXipBXiJ6XixkXipKXixYXiFxXilEXjkuXiVwXjExXjZpXipEXiEiXiFAXiM6XiFqXiFAXipyXiwwXiElXixkXiEpXiN7Xi1dXi4qXiEi",
      "byte_length": 90
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cfd1e5fdadab",
      "text": "有戰士，但現在不在。他們出發去尋找新的康克甲蟲或厄德陸鳥群了， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$s^$(^+a^*A^!I^&?^\"d^!)^\"d^!\"^!@^*{^!q^&W^\"6^#9^$/^$\\^&Z^5N^!d^&J^(8^$'^80^#j^99^4p^'R^*D^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRzXiQoXithXipBXiFJXiY/XiJkXiEpXiJkXiEiXiFAXip7XiFxXiZXXiI2XiM5XiQvXiRcXiZaXjVOXiFkXiZKXig4XiQnXjgwXiNqXjk5XjRwXidSXipEXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 94
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a7e66c034fa4",
      "text": "因為沒有肉食我們就會餓死。有些戰士留了下來， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"]^%{^%\\^$s^'^^0J^$%^*{^*J^$r^2R^%L^!\"^$s^!8^$(^+a^-+^*D^!(^!O^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJdXiV7XiVcXiRzXideXjBKXiQlXip7XipKXiRyXjJSXiVMXiEiXiRzXiE4XiQoXithXi0rXipEXiEoXiFPXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_33426ee1e620",
      "text": "但很快就被強盜殺害了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!I^*K^*L^*J^(@^#]^0!^%M^#/^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFJXipLXipMXipKXihAXiNdXjAhXiVNXiMvXipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_95f11c6b2829",
      "text": "他們只要找到新的畜群，或者隨身乾糧耗盡，就會立刻返回村莊。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^*{^\"?^(C^$/^!u^$\\^&Z^5f^'R^*A^$'^'V^)X^(c^*X^5s^'X^-1^*A^*J^$r^0'^.Y^7J^\"\\^$z^6l^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXip7XiI/XihDXiQvXiF1XiRcXiZaXjVmXidSXipBXiQnXidWXilYXihjXipYXjVzXidYXi0xXipBXipKXiRyXjAnXi5ZXjdKXiJcXiR6XjZsXiEi",
      "byte_length": 87
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_395f52a281bd",
      "text": "我必須照料我的村民了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^#l^)r^/x^/n^$%^&Z^$z^%T^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiNsXilyXi94Xi9uXiQlXiZaXiR6XiVUXipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fffe5604bfa9",
      "text": "說不準強盜何時會再度襲來，我們必須做好準備。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-x^!)^,x^#]^0!^!L^$f^$r^!l^#V^08^!O^*A^$%^*{^#l^)r^*~^+i^,x^+\"^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi14XiEpXix4XiNdXjAhXiFMXiRmXiRyXiFsXiNWXjA4XiFPXipBXiQlXip7XiNsXilyXip+XitpXix4XisiXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_27a6385fc770",
      "text": "你們真的願意嗎？我的村民已經太久沒有好好飽餐一頓了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^-2^&Z^.H^#z^+X^.V^$%^&Z^$z^%T^#J^'D^+f^!.^%\\^$s^+i^+i^7r^.K^!%^.F^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7Xi0yXiZaXi5IXiN6XitYXi5WXiQlXiZaXiR6XiVUXiNKXidEXitmXiEuXiVcXiRzXitpXitpXjdyXi5LXiElXi5GXipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 78
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_215dfcf4a091",
      "text": "噢，太感謝你們了！這對我們來說意義無比重大。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+]^*A^+f^#{^-z^*F^*{^*D^*W^(s^#:^$%^*{^!O^-x^#z^2<^%}^,m^))^\"z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XitdXipBXitmXiN7Xi16XipGXip7XipEXipXXihzXiM6XiQlXip7XiFPXi14XiN6XjI8XiV9XixtXikpXiJ6XiEi",
      "byte_length": 66
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_79f269da8663",
      "text": "這些村民正在挨餓受凍，而你們顯然衣食無憂！接下來， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^!8^$z^%T^%H^\"d^7\\^2R^\";^9-^*A^'W^*F^*{^4&^&\"^(>^0J^%}^91^*W^$?^!(^!O^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXiE4XiR6XiVUXiVIXiJkXjdcXjJSXiI7XjktXipBXidXXipGXip7XjQmXiYiXig+XjBKXiV9XjkxXipXXiQ/XiEoXiFPXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_41559957a964",
      "text": "你們大概就要開始洗劫我們了吧。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^\"z^,d^*J^(C^)F^+k^0j^1l^$%^*{^*D^*I^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiJ6XixkXipKXihDXilGXitrXjBqXjFsXiQlXip7XipEXipJXiEi",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_074d262b4978",
      "text": "進入競技場的角鬥士，能活著出來的還不到一半。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(w^!f^-?^,>^\"n^&Z^(H^*,^+a^*A^'b^%i^-a^!q^!O^&Z^.7^!)^!u^!%^\"-^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xih3XiFmXi0/Xiw+XiJuXiZaXihIXiosXithXipBXidiXiVpXi1hXiFxXiFPXiZaXi43XiEpXiF1XiElXiItXiEi",
      "byte_length": 66
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_90a01f0c8186",
      "text": "廢話少說。給我進競技場！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#W^-v^#<^-x^!\"^'A^$%^(w^-?^,>^\"n^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNXXi12XiM8Xi14XiEiXidBXiQlXih3Xi0/Xiw+XiJuXipX",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7357d07e220c",
      "text": "要嘛回獸欄，要嘛去戰鬥。我們快沒耐性了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(C^+Y^\"\\^&<^%C^*A^(C^+Y^\"6^$(^*,^!\"^$%^*{^*L^%\\^-S^#r^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XihDXitZXiJcXiY8XiVDXipBXihDXitZXiI2XiQoXiosXiEiXiQlXip7XipMXiVcXi1TXiNyXipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 60
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0d0562169bef",
      "text": "回獸欄去。我沒時間再浪費在你身上了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"\\^&<^%C^\"6^!\"^$%^%\\^$f^)G^!l^,r^.\"^\"d^*F^(c^!'^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJcXiY8XiVDXiI2XiEiXiQlXiVcXiRmXilHXiFsXixyXi4iXiJkXipGXihjXiEnXipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 54
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0258c593719a",
      "text": "我受夠這些廢話了！快點動作！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^\";^+d^(s^!8^#W^-v^*D^*W^*L^*;^\"%^!M^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiI7XitkXihzXiE4XiNXXi12XipEXipXXipMXio7XiIlXiFNXipX",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_03052d6e2c46",
      "text": "哼，算你走運。我們走著瞧。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+K^*A^-C^*F^.&^.4^!\"^$%^*{^.&^-a^-4^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XitLXipBXi1DXipGXi4mXi40XiEiXiQlXip7Xi4mXi1hXi00XiEi",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5889a1777481",
      "text": "時間站在我這邊，年輕的角鬥士。離開獸欄",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$f^)G^->^\"d^$%^(s^.8^*A^+~^(g^&Z^(H^*,^+a^!\"^)`^)F^&<^%C",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRmXilHXi0+XiJkXiQlXihzXi44XipBXit+XihnXiZaXihIXiosXithXiEiXilgXilGXiY8XiVD",
      "byte_length": 57
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1bd3b7760084",
      "text": "只有一條路。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"?^$s^!%^%.^(a^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiI/XiRzXiElXiUuXihhXiEi",
      "byte_length": 18
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bf2cec76f2b0",
      "text": "你打得比我預期的還好。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^$-^#e^,m^$%^.E^$u^&Z^.7^+i^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiQtXiNlXixtXiQlXi5FXiR1XiZaXi43XitpXiEi",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ff05a436ac2d",
      "text": "角鬥士，你有什麼想說的嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(H^*,^+a^*A^*F^$s^!=^.T^,1^-x^&Z^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XihIXiosXithXipBXipGXiRzXiE9Xi5UXiwxXi14XiZaXitYXi5W",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_86983e1f7208",
      "text": "我們該把你送去金字塔做工。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^(M^$1^*F^./^\"6^)+^#)^\"o^*~^+y^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7XihNXiQxXipGXi4vXiI2XikrXiMpXiJvXip+Xit5XiEi",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ece5a7211b96",
      "text": "你的牙口不錯。我有個朋友會想買你。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^&Z^&3^\"<^!)^)5^!\"^$%^$s^!V^,[^\"8^$r^,1^.!^*F^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiZaXiYzXiI8XiEpXik1XiEiXiQlXiRzXiFWXixbXiI4XiRyXiwxXi4hXipGXiEi",
      "byte_length": 51
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4f97dc8c37c4",
      "text": "別指望我會手下留情——我們留你在這裡是為了戰鬥，",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*H^$8^,]^$%^$r^$+^!(^-+^,0^*n^*n^$%^*{^-+^*F^\"d^(s^-j^,X^%{^*D^$(^*,^*A",
      "encoded_base64": "XipIXiQ4XixdXiQlXiRyXiQrXiEoXi0rXiwwXipuXipuXiQlXip7Xi0rXipGXiJkXihzXi1qXixYXiV7XipEXiQoXiosXipB",
      "byte_length": 72
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3a2857774a6e",
      "text": "不是讓你躺著養肥的。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^,X^-}^*F^.-^-a^.I^-Y^&Z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXixYXi19XipGXi4tXi1hXi5JXi1ZXiZaXiEi",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1737147310b2",
      "text": "  你不能買賣我。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^!)^'b^.!^.$^$%^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeISleJ2JeLiFeLiReJCVeISI=",
      "byte_length": 23
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8b1ccb056696",
      "text": "  站在牆後說勇氣可容易得很！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^->^\"d^&0^#b^-x^\"$^%U^\"A^+t^,W^#e^*K^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLT5eImReJjBeI2JeLXheIiReJVVeIkFeK3ReLFdeI2VeKkteKlc=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e625af9cd62d",
      "text": "  我才不要去幫特克圖克特雷蓋沙堡。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^$,^!)^(C^\"6^+}^&5^!d^\"b^!d^&5^)c^-d^%]^\"m^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeJCxeISleKENeIjZeK31eJjVeIWReImJeIWReJjVeKWNeLWReJV1eIm1eISI=",
      "byte_length": 50
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_92e29ebf4d41",
      "text": "  別讓我死在這裡！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*H^-}^$%^%L^\"d^(s^-j^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkheLX1eJCVeJUxeImReKHNeLWpeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_60287a564c81",
      "text": "  反正每個人終究都會死。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^\"9^%H^%P^!V^!<^-H^-<^)$^$r^%L^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIjleJUheJVBeIVZeITxeLUheLTxeKSReJHJeJUxeISI=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7094919d7496",
      "text": "  如果你放我活命，我會好好報答你！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^#$^%!^*F^$P^$%^%i^\"N^*A^$%^$r^+i^+i^+`^-B^*F^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIyReJSFeKkZeJFBeJCVeJWleIk5eKkFeJCVeJHJeK2leK2leK2BeLUJeKkZeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 50
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_816ecd236162",
      "text": "  我已經準備好赴死——希望你也是。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^#J^'D^,x^+\"^+i^.'^%L^*n^*n^+{^,]^*F^!1^,X^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeI0peJ0ReLHheKyJeK2leLideJUxeKm5eKm5eK3teLF1eKkZeITFeLFheISI=",
      "byte_length": 50
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d16dff8c2345",
      "text": "  要死就死吧。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^(C^%L^*J^%L^*I^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKENeJUxeKkpeJUxeKkleISI=",
      "byte_length": 20
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3488c5b3098a",
      "text": "  我要當著特克圖克特雷的面唾棄他！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^(C^&N^-a^&5^!d^\"b^!d^&5^)c^&Z^)j^+P^,a^!@^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeKENeJk5eLWFeJjVeIWReImJeIWReJjVeKWNeJlpeKWpeK1BeLGFeIUBeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 50
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0358dc1270ce",
      "text": "  饒了我吧，求求你！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^.M^*D^$%^*I^*A^,n^,n^*F^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLk1eKkReJCVeKkleKkFeLG5eLG5eKkZeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_39ea7f280745",
      "text": "  你會死在我手上！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^$r^%L^\"d^$%^$+^!'^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeJHJeJUxeImReJCVeJCteISdeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4a6b0d3e9306",
      "text": "  沒幾個人打得過我。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^%\\^#T^!V^!<^$-^#e^(x^$%^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJVxeI1ReIVZeITxeJC1eI2VeKHheJCVeISI=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f41244878992",
      "text": "  快點繁殖你的怪物吧，你會需要的。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*L^*;^-N^,k^*F^&Z^#s^&4^*I^*A^*F^$r^)e^(C^&Z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkxeKjteLU5eLGteKkZeJlpeI3NeJjReKkleKkFeKkZeJHJeKWVeKENeJlpeISI=",
      "byte_length": 50
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_80e7d0f6a64d",
      "text": "  再這樣下去，你就得跟我打了！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^!l^(s^,f^!(^\"6^*A^*F^*J^#e^.+^$%^$-^*D^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIWxeKHNeLGZeISheIjZeKkFeKkZeKkpeI2VeLiteJCVeJC1eKkReKlc=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5ba9b371d890",
      "text": "你說的話跟我無關。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^-x^&Z^-v^.+^$%^%}^.>^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXi14XiZaXi12Xi4rXiQlXiV9Xi4+XiEi",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_30eb07b2d566",
      "text": "  真好笑。我會在你的葬禮上笑出來。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^-2^+i^-@^!\"^$%^$r^\"d^*F^&Z^-b^-8^!'^-@^!q^!O^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLTJeK2leLUBeISJeJCVeJHJeImReKkZeJlpeLWJeLTheISdeLUBeIXFeIU9eISI=",
      "byte_length": 50
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_339090d2f57f",
      "text": "  嘲笑你比跟你相處還容易。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^+Z^-@^*F^,m^.+^*F^&a^(,^.7^+t^,W^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeK1peLUBeKkZeLG1eLiteKkZeJmFeKCxeLjdeK3ReLFdeISI=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1c4cad0295b0",
      "text": "  我等不及要多砍幾隻你的怪物了！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^'-^!)^\"7^(C^\"x^&l^#T^)[^*F^&Z^#s^&4^*D^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeJy1eISleIjdeKENeInheJmxeI1ReKVteKkZeJlpeI3NeJjReKkReKlc=",
      "byte_length": 47
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_41b0a4fa3959",
      "text": "  等我把武器磨利了再回來找你。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^'-^$%^$1^%J^\"V^-7^!t^*D^!l^\"\\^!O^$/^*F^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJy1eJCVeJDFeJUpeIlZeLTdeIXReKkReIWxeIlxeIU9eJC9eKkZeISI=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2d63ed214f9a",
      "text": "  你有在餵那些怪物嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^$s^\"d^.L^)!^!8^#s^&4^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeJHNeImReLkxeKSFeITheI3NeJjReK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4e2869affda0",
      "text": "晚點再跟你多聊聊。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,Y^*;^!l^.+^*F^\"x^-U^-U^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XixZXio7XiFsXi4rXipGXiJ4Xi1VXi1VXiEi",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a1995f827a7c",
      "text": "你會這麼想也不奇怪。我買下你——是為了",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^$r^(s^.T^,1^!1^!)^\"}^#s^!\"^$%^.!^!(^*F^*n^*n^,X^%{^*D",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiRyXihzXi5UXiwxXiExXiEpXiJ9XiNzXiEiXiQlXi4hXiEoXipGXipuXipuXixYXiV7XipE",
      "byte_length": 57
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2d8493252634",
      "text": "競技場，沒別的。你這筆買賣還挺划算，我們可是打折買到你的。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-?^,>^\"n^*A^%\\^*H^&Z^!\"^*F^(s^-A^.!^.$^.7^,I^+/^-C^*A^$%^*{^\"A^,X^$-^,?^.!^!u^*F^&Z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi0/Xiw+XiJuXipBXiVcXipIXiZaXiEiXipGXihzXi1BXi4hXi4kXi43XixJXisvXi1DXipBXiQlXip7XiJBXixYXiQtXiw/Xi4hXiF1XipGXiZaXiEi",
      "byte_length": 87
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6b62ab694b24",
      "text": "我笑得出來，你可笑不出來。我很有錢，我有僕人滿足",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^-@^#e^!q^!O^*A^*F^\"A^-@^!)^!q^!O^!\"^$%^*K^$s^.<^*A^$%^$s^+%^!<^,{^(^",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXi1AXiNlXiFxXiFPXipBXipGXiJBXi1AXiEpXiFxXiFPXiEiXiQlXipLXiRzXi48XipBXiQlXiRzXislXiE8Xix7Xihe",
      "byte_length": 72
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3f0590d807c6",
      "text": "我的每一個心願——",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^&Z^%P^!%^!V^#k^.H^*n^*n",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiZaXiVQXiElXiFWXiNrXi5IXipuXipu",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c5d8d157e391",
      "text": "我擁有一切，而你一無所有。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^,M^$s^!%^+.^*A^'W^*F^!%^%}^$)^$s^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXixNXiRzXiElXisuXipBXidXXipGXiElXiV9XiQpXiRzXiEi",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8f1b6c1350de",
      "text": "聽你這麼說我真高興！熱血的奴隸可不好找。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-X^*F^(s^.T^-x^$%^-2^*+^-]^*W^&$^(:^&Z^##^)Z^\"A^!)^+i^$/^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi1YXipGXihzXi5UXi14XiQlXi0yXiorXi1dXipXXiYkXig6XiZaXiMjXilaXiJBXiEpXitpXiQvXiEi",
      "byte_length": 60
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e95ea9cd4581",
      "text": "別想得太遠——你還得先撐過",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*H^,1^#e^+f^({^*n^*n^*F^.7^#e^!b^,L^(x",
      "encoded_base64": "XipIXiwxXiNlXitmXih7XipuXipuXipGXi43XiNlXiFiXixMXih4",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b5cc7816578a",
      "text": "在獸欄的下一夜。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"d^&<^%C^&Z^!(^!%^+c^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJkXiY8XiVDXiZaXiEoXiElXitjXiEi",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a1a07de4c344",
      "text": "別被群眾的歡呼沖昏頭，以為自己很重要，",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*H^(@^'R^&e^&Z^%F^\"M^,p^$d^)t^*A^!B^%{^'l^#I^*K^))^(C^*A",
      "encoded_base64": "XipIXihAXidSXiZlXiZaXiVGXiJNXixwXiRkXil0XipBXiFCXiV7XidsXiNJXipLXikpXihDXipB",
      "byte_length": 57
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0d18902f6196",
      "text": "其實你不是。他們只是想看血，不管流的是",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!j^#3^*F^!)^,X^!\"^!@^*{^\"?^,X^,1^*Q^(:^*A^!)^-D^%j^&Z^,X",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFqXiMzXipGXiEpXixYXiEiXiFAXip7XiI/XixYXiwxXipRXig6XipBXiEpXi1EXiVqXiZaXixY",
      "byte_length": 57
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_75380daee67a",
      "text": "怪物的血還是你的血，他們都一樣開心。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#s^&4^&Z^(:^.7^,X^*F^&Z^(:^*A^!@^*{^)$^!%^,f^)F^#k^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNzXiY0XiZaXig6Xi43XixYXipGXiZaXig6XipBXiFAXip7XikkXiElXixmXilGXiNrXiEi",
      "byte_length": 54
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_55672df21592",
      "text": "這一回合你打得不錯。不過下一回合會更難。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^!%^\"\\^\"C^*F^$-^#e^!)^)5^!\"^!)^(x^!(^!%^\"\\^\"C^$r^$o^)a^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXiElXiJcXiJDXipGXiQtXiNlXiEpXik1XiEiXiEpXih4XiEoXiElXiJcXiJDXiRyXiRvXilhXiEi",
      "byte_length": 60
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b3c666bf3c29",
      "text": "哈哈——太棒了！懦弱的膽小鬼！一文不值的渣滓！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+F^+F^*n^*n^+f^%1^*D^*W^,7^#\\^&Z^-[^#;^*-^*W^!%^$W^!)^!Z^&Z^,v^,y^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XitGXitGXipuXipuXitmXiUxXipEXipXXiw3XiNcXiZaXi1bXiM7XiotXipXXiElXiRXXiEpXiFaXiZaXix2Xix5XipX",
      "byte_length": 69
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d022f69fa3fe",
      "text": "我保證讓你死得痛快！哈哈哈！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^!T^-{^-}^*F^%L^#e^-.^*L^*W^+F^+F^+F^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiFUXi17Xi19XipGXiVMXiNlXi0uXipMXipXXitGXitGXitGXipX",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_db6c02e50a7a",
      "text": "也許你不是筆好買賣。我還以為你會更有骨氣。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!1^-s^*F^!)^,X^-A^+i^.!^.$^!\"^$%^.7^!B^%{^*F^$r^$o^$s^*$^%U^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiExXi1zXipGXiEpXixYXi1BXitpXi4hXi4kXiEiXiQlXi43XiFCXiV7XipGXiRyXiRvXiRzXiokXiVVXiEi",
      "byte_length": 63
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_14d0f78d24d9",
      "text": "更有骨氣一點。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$o^$s^*$^%U^!%^*;^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRvXiRzXiokXiVVXiElXio7XiEi",
      "byte_length": 21
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d70a169c3fc6",
      "text": "你得再加把勁，才能撐得更久。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^#e^!l^\"\"^$1^+3^*A^$,^'b^,L^#e^$o^!.^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiNlXiFsXiIiXiQxXiszXipBXiQsXidiXixMXiNlXiRvXiEuXiEi",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9da154840cdd",
      "text": "別再廢話了！拿出戰士的樣子！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*H^!l^#W^-v^*D^*W^,G^!q^$(^+a^&Z^,f^#(^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XipIXiFsXiNXXi12XipEXipXXixHXiFxXiQoXithXiZaXixmXiMoXipX",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3d5f2656a5e1",
      "text": "偉大的特克圖克特雷已經統治了好幾代人了！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*}^\"z^&Z^&5^!d^\"b^!d^&5^)c^#J^'D^'B^%_^*D^+i^#T^*v^!<^*D^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "Xip9XiJ6XiZaXiY1XiFkXiJiXiFkXiY1XiljXiNKXidEXidCXiVfXipEXitpXiNUXip2XiE8XipEXipX",
      "byte_length": 60
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f5a8e5eb059f",
      "text": "他的統治永不終結！而你的死期，",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^&Z^'B^%_^%W^!)^-H^'@^*W^'W^*F^&Z^%L^$u^*A",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXiZaXidCXiVfXiVXXiEpXi1IXidAXipXXidXXipGXiZaXiVMXiR1XipB",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7b08efbc25ca",
      "text": "很快就要到了！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*K^*L^*J^(C^!u^*D^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XipLXipMXipKXihDXiF1XipEXipX",
      "byte_length": 21
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bfae733ced69",
      "text": "沒錯，但你會先我一步死。這點我可以保證。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%\\^)5^*A^!I^*F^$r^!b^$%^!%^,i^%L^!\"^(s^*;^$%^\"A^!B^!T^-{^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVcXik1XipBXiFJXipGXiRyXiFiXiQlXiElXixpXiVMXiEiXihzXio7XiQlXiJBXiFCXiFUXi17XiEi",
      "byte_length": 60
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a03954e8bd00",
      "text": "對一個角鬥士來說，這種人生哲學倒挺不錯的。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#:^!%^!V^(H^*,^+a^!O^-x^*A^(s^'$^!<^&F^+J^+n^!X^,I^!)^)5^&Z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiM6XiElXiFWXihIXiosXithXiFPXi14XipBXihzXickXiE8XiZGXitKXituXiFYXixJXiEpXik1XiZaXiEi",
      "byte_length": 63
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b94c0fa035f6",
      "text": "你需要學學什麼叫尊重！馴獸師！放出更多怪物！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^)e^(C^+n^+n^!=^.T^+<^+u^))^*W^.N^&<^#M^*W^$P^!q^$o^\"x^#s^&4^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXillXihDXituXituXiE9Xi5UXis8Xit1XikpXipXXi5OXiY8XiNNXipXXiRQXiFxXiRvXiJ4XiNzXiY0XipX",
      "byte_length": 66
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c3f946346d3c",
      "text": "在我殺了你之前，快滾回獸欄去！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"d^$%^%M^*D^*F^!/^!z^*A^*L^,z^\"\\^&<^%C^\"6^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJkXiQlXiVNXipEXipGXiEvXiF6XipBXipMXix6XiJcXiY8XiVDXiI2XipX",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_28db273cae0a",
      "text": "小心點，角鬥士。褻瀆神明的下場",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#;^#k^*;^*A^(H^*,^+a^!\"^-k^,~^&w^$c^&Z^!(^\"n",
      "encoded_base64": "XiM7XiNrXio7XipBXihIXiosXithXiEiXi1rXix+XiZ3XiRjXiZaXiEoXiJu",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b12c68062776",
      "text": "可比死在競技場裡還要淒慘得多！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"A^,m^%L^\"d^-?^,>^\"n^-j^.7^(C^,t^,4^#e^\"x^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJBXixtXiVMXiJkXi0/Xiw+XiJuXi1qXi43XihDXix0Xiw0XiNlXiJ4XipX",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c9776834e8f4",
      "text": "什麼？！放出大型怪物！教教這個凡人什麼叫尊重！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!=^.T^.V^*W^$P^!q^\"z^\"j^#s^&4^*W^,R^,R^(s^!V^+-^!<^!=^.T^+<^+u^))^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiE9Xi5UXi5WXipXXiRQXiFxXiJ6XiJqXiNzXiY0XipXXixSXixSXihzXiFWXistXiE8XiE9Xi5UXis8Xit1XikpXipX",
      "byte_length": 69
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_775707132e15",
      "text": "很好。我喜歡你這股氣魄。也許我們該把你",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*K^+i^!\"^$%^+V^%F^*F^(s^'_^%U^.S^!\"^!1^-s^$%^*{^(M^$1^*F",
      "encoded_base64": "XipLXitpXiEiXiQlXitWXiVGXipGXihzXidfXiVVXi5TXiEiXiExXi1zXiQlXip7XihNXiQxXipG",
      "byte_length": 57
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_58463821e41c",
      "text": "留在這裡，我想。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-+^\"d^(s^-j^*A^$%^,1^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi0rXiJkXihzXi1qXipBXiQlXiwxXiEi",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e3cbaf4f03bf",
      "text": "很好，那些怪物就是了。不過你該擔心的是怪物。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*K^+i^*A^)!^!8^#s^&4^*J^,X^*D^!\"^!)^(x^*F^(M^*N^#k^&Z^,X^#s^&4^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipLXitpXipBXikhXiE4XiNzXiY0XipKXixYXipEXiEiXiEpXih4XipGXihNXipOXiNrXiZaXixYXiNzXiY0XiEi",
      "byte_length": 66
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b80b92fd163f",
      "text": "這會是你最後的錯誤，角鬥士們。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^$r^,X^*F^$q^#b^&Z^)5^(P^*A^(H^*,^+a^*{^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXiRyXixYXipGXiRxXiNiXiZaXik1XihQXipBXihIXiosXithXip7XiEi",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b3a7e50672d8",
      "text": "完美的計畫，不是嗎？我剛好知道逃出去的路！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#,^-P^&Z^-n^-,^*A^!)^,X^+X^.V^$%^+0^+i^&h^(y^(p^!q^\"6^&Z^(a^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiMsXi1QXiZaXi1uXi0sXipBXiEpXixYXitYXi5WXiQlXiswXitpXiZoXih5XihwXiFxXiI2XiZaXihhXipX",
      "byte_length": 63
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0d2de3839cbd",
      "text": "歡迎啊，蟲餌。你到目前為止表現得挺不錯，但死亡",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%F^(k^+Q^*A^(8^.J^!\"^*F^!u^&^^!z^%{^%G^-i^&?^#e^,I^!)^)5^*A^!I^%L^!:",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVGXihrXitRXipBXig4Xi5KXiEiXipGXiF1XiZeXiF6XiV7XiVHXi1pXiY/XiNlXixJXiEpXik1XipBXiFJXiVMXiE6",
      "byte_length": 69
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_614738caf786",
      "text": "正等著你。國王需要血來獻給他的金字塔。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%H^'-^-a^*F^!\"^+^^-)^)e^(C^(:^!O^-(^'A^!@^&Z^)+^#)^\"o^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVIXictXi1hXipGXiEiXiteXi0pXillXihDXig6XiFPXi0oXidBXiFAXiZaXikrXiMpXiJvXiEi",
      "byte_length": 57
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c537ec786681",
      "text": "  我已經準備好赴死了……你呢？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^#J^'D^,x^+\"^+i^.'^%L^*D^*o^*o^*F^+C^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeI0peJ0ReLHheKyJeK2leLideJUxeKkReKm9eKm9eKkZeK0NeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_45188db49adf",
      "text": "  我們離開這裡吧！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^*{^)`^)F^(s^-j^*I^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeKnteKWBeKUZeKHNeLWpeKkleKlc=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c41ed423c255",
      "text": "  我們合作吧！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^*{^\"C^!M^*I^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeKnteIkNeIU1eKkleKlc=",
      "byte_length": 20
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_311dd8b1b408",
      "text": "  哼？你還在等什麼？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^+K^.V^*F^.7^\"d^'-^!=^.T^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeK0teLlZeKkZeLjdeImReJy1eIT1eLlReLlY=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_42e5da78af9b",
      "text": "  我要逃出去了。擋我的路就等死吧！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^(C^(p^!q^\"6^*D^!\"^$G^$%^&Z^(a^*J^'-^%L^*I^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeKENeKHBeIXFeIjZeKkReISJeJEdeJCVeJlpeKGFeKkpeJy1eJUxeKkleKlc=",
      "byte_length": 50
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2d4d439ed529",
      "text": "不用多說了。我已經下定決心。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^&H^\"x^-x^*D^!\"^$%^#J^'D^!(^#.^,o^#k^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXiZIXiJ4Xi14XipEXiEiXiQlXiNKXidEXiEoXiMuXixvXiNrXiEi",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d2de6cc29216",
      "text": "我們數到「一」就衝向西側出口。準備好了嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^$V^!u^!#^!%^!$^*J^-h^+?^-l^!\\^!q^\"<^!\"^,x^+\"^+i^*D^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7XiRWXiF1XiEjXiElXiEkXipKXi1oXis/Xi1sXiFcXiFxXiI8XiEiXix4XisiXitpXipEXitYXi5W",
      "byte_length": 63
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a5336bb2e24e",
      "text": "三……二……一……上！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!&^*o^*o^!5^*o^*o^!%^*o^*o^!'^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEmXipvXipvXiE1XipvXipvXiElXipvXipvXiEnXipX",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4c4319481295",
      "text": "拚死一戰！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,C^%L^!%^$(^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XixDXiVMXiElXiQoXipX",
      "byte_length": 15
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_02ffcc956e29",
      "text": "很好。我建議我們從西門衝出去。然後你往",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*K^+i^!\"^$%^,'^-|^$%^*{^#f^-l^)D^-h^!q^\"6^!\"^&\"^#b^*F^,)",
      "encoded_base64": "XipLXitpXiEiXiQlXiwnXi18XiQlXip7XiNmXi1sXilEXi1oXiFxXiI2XiEiXiYiXiNiXipGXiwp",
      "byte_length": 57
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3132f650643d",
      "text": "北邊找出路；我往南走。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+6^.8^$/^!q^(a^*C^$%^,)^\"/^.&^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xis2Xi44XiQvXiFxXihhXipDXiQlXiwpXiIvXi4mXiEi",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bb84fe7c5b2a",
      "text": "事到如今，我們要嘛互相殘殺，要嘛聯手。沒有其他選擇了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*r^!u^#$^*E^*A^$%^*{^(C^+Y^*s^&a^,l^%M^*A^(C^+Y^-V^$+^!\"^%\\^$s^!j^!@^.6^,N^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipyXiF1XiMkXipFXipBXiQlXip7XihDXitZXipzXiZhXixsXiVNXipBXihDXitZXi1WXiQrXiEiXiVcXiRzXiFqXiFAXi42XixOXipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 81
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ee3ee05b49d8",
      "text": "你想戰鬥，還是趁機逃走？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^,1^$(^*,^*A^.7^,X^.)^%>^(p^.&^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiwxXiQoXiosXipBXi43XixYXi4pXiU+XihwXi4mXi5W",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_69edc7826de4",
      "text": "  我們找機會逃走吧。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^*{^$/^%>^$r^(p^.&^*I^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeKnteJC9eJT5eJHJeKHBeLiZeKkleISI=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1f2c75ecf841",
      "text": "  我們打吧，臭泥巴臉！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^*{^$-^*I^*A^'m^%d^#K^-\\^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeKnteJC1eKkleKkFeJ21eJWReI0teLVxeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c8584a710fb7",
      "text": "你已經跟我作對了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^#J^'D^.+^$%^!M^#:^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiNKXidEXi4rXiQlXiFNXiM6XipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_579144ce2b56",
      "text": "你們這些沒骨氣的小狗，本來也當不成什麼有用的盟友。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^(s^!8^%\\^*$^%U^&Z^#;^-&^*A^$x^!O^!1^&N^!)^$$^!=^.T^$s^&H^&Z^-0^\"8^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XihzXiE4XiVcXiokXiVVXiZaXiM7Xi0mXipBXiR4XiFPXiExXiZOXiEpXiQkXiE9Xi5UXiRzXiZIXiZaXi0wXiI4XiEi",
      "byte_length": 75
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_eb141cdd2dd0",
      "text": "去西側出口！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"6^-l^!\\^!q^\"<^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiI2Xi1sXiFcXiFxXiI8XipX",
      "byte_length": 18
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7c4b1fcecd25",
      "text": "  我在西邊什麼都找不到。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^\"d^-l^.8^!=^.T^)$^$/^!)^!u^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeImReLWxeLjheIT1eLlReKSReJC9eISleIXVeISI=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e8870e4b6dcc",
      "text": "  我在西邊找到出路了！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^\"d^-l^.8^$/^!u^!q^(a^*D^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeImReLWxeLjheJC9eIXVeIXFeKGFeKkReKlc=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2c0a81c9b503",
      "text": "  戰況如何？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$(^,q^#$^!L^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCheLHFeIyReIUxeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 17
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2fb0c119a387",
      "text": "  你確定自己一個人也行嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^-6^#.^'l^#I^!%^!V^!<^!1^(;^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeLTZeIy5eJ2xeI0leISVeIVZeITxeITFeKDteK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c854a288e79b",
      "text": "  沒事，繼續戰鬥就好。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^%\\^*r^*A^-O^'M^$(^*,^*J^+i^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJVxeKnJeKkFeLU9eJ01eJCheKixeKkpeK2leISI=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_de14075b01b5",
      "text": "就是那扇看起來像怪物的大門。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*J^,X^)!^$*^*Q^.(^!O^!`^#s^&4^&Z^\"z^)D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipKXixYXikhXiQqXipRXi4oXiFPXiFgXiNzXiY0XiZaXiJ6XilEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6e1d08617afc",
      "text": "那就用它然後離開這裡吧！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^*J^&H^+o^&\"^#b^)`^)F^(s^-j^*I^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXipKXiZIXitvXiYiXiNiXilgXilGXihzXi1qXipJXipX",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_45392a6e0e13",
      "text": "我還活著。那就表示我在贏。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^.7^%i^-a^!\"^)!^*J^-i^&s^$%^\"d^.%^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXi43XiVpXi1hXiEiXikhXipKXi1pXiZzXiQlXiJkXi4lXiEi",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_20b75cab748a",
      "text": "你們這些黃口小兒自己小心點。如果我活不下來，",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^(s^!8^*7^\"<^#;^++^'l^#I^#;^#k^*;^!\"^#$^%!^$%^%i^!)^!(^!O^*A",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XihzXiE4Xio3XiI8XiM7XisrXidsXiNJXiM7XiNrXio7XiEiXiMkXiUhXiQlXiVpXiEpXiEoXiFPXipB",
      "byte_length": 66
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2cf79512df7f",
      "text": "那至少要死在戰場上！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^'n^#<^(C^%L^\"d^$(^\"n^!'^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXiduXiM8XihDXiVMXiJkXiQoXiJuXiEnXipX",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0b987ef77dc3",
      "text": "說得好。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-x^#e^+i^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi14XiNlXitpXiEi",
      "byte_length": 12
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fc07f0125674",
      "text": "歡迎！你們究竟是怎麼把那些強盜全都殺掉的？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%F^(k^*W^*F^*{^-<^28^,X^,,^.T^$1^)!^!8^#]^0!^!h^)$^%M^/e^&Z^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVGXihrXipXXipGXip7Xi08XjI4XixYXiwsXi5UXiQxXikhXiE4XiNdXjAhXiFoXikkXiVNXi9lXiZaXi5W",
      "byte_length": 63
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4dc160cfd2c4",
      "text": "向強大的戰士們致敬！我們收到了消息，你們令人驚嘆地重創了德拉吉大軍。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+?^#]^\"z^&Z^$(^+a^*{^'o^*O^*W^$%^*{^$M^!u^*D^%k^#w^*A^*F^*{^*w^!<^.Q^59^\"e^))^!{^*D^#j^$6^\"D^\"z^..^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xis/XiNdXiJ6XiZaXiQoXithXip7XidvXipPXipXXiQlXip7XiRNXiF1XipEXiVrXiN3XipBXipGXip7Xip3XiE8Xi5RXjU5XiJlXikpXiF7XipEXiNqXiQ2XiJEXiJ6Xi4uXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 103
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_37885fda75e1",
      "text": "那個巫王要是還想保住他的城邦，最好趕快從沉睡中清醒過來， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^!V^14^-)^(C^,X^.7^,1^!T^*z^!@^&Z^+_^1a^*A^$q^+i^0u^*L^#f^%Z^-3^!,^,u^.9^(x^!O^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXiFWXjE0Xi0pXihDXixYXi43XiwxXiFUXip6XiFAXiZaXitfXjFhXipBXiRxXitpXjB1XipMXiNmXiVaXi0zXiEsXix1Xi45Xih4XiFPXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ca2955a7535c",
      "text": "對吧？以你們的本事，就算去扯巨龍的尾巴都綽綽有餘！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#:^*I^.V^!B^*F^*{^&Z^$x^*r^*A^*J^-C^\"6^.e^#H^*>^&Z^5J^#K^)$^9I^9I^$s^1e^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiM6XipJXi5WXiFCXipGXip7XiZaXiR4XipyXipBXipKXi1DXiI2Xi5lXiNIXio+XiZaXjVKXiNLXikkXjlJXjlJXiRzXjFlXipX",
      "byte_length": 75
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c6ee3d3b91e0",
      "text": "恭賀你們戰勝德拉吉！你們的威名必將傳遍 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^1{^7l^*F^*{^$(^+5^#j^$6^\"D^*W^*F^*{^&Z^#&^\"F^#l^#7^+$^69 ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjF7XjdsXipGXip7XiQoXis1XiNqXiQ2XiJEXipXXipGXip7XiZaXiMmXiJGXiNsXiM3XiskXjY5IA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ca3382853004",
      "text": "整個平頂台地，正如我們對你們將我們拯救於水火之中的感激之情那般 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$T^!V^0Y^)p^\"B^\"e^*A^%H^#$^$%^*{^#:^*F^*{^#7^$%^*{^,F^,Q^$^^%V^%x^!/^!,^&Z^#{^1H^!/^,0^)!^'r ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRUXiFWXjBZXilwXiJCXiJlXipBXiVIXiMkXiQlXip7XiM6XipGXip7XiM3XiQlXip7XixGXixRXiReXiVWXiV4XiEvXiEsXiZaXiN7XjFIXiEvXiwwXikhXidyIA==",
      "byte_length": 94
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f6c7b83e782e",
      "text": "深厚浩瀚。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^2*^\"4^5^^9F^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XjIqXiI0XjVeXjlGXiEi",
      "byte_length": 15
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_463ace3b893a",
      "text": "在的，有什麼事嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"d^&Z^*A^$s^!=^.T^*r^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJkXiZaXipBXiRzXiE9Xi5UXipyXitYXi5W",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_16ec13dc44e5",
      "text": "  你研究的是哪一類的學識？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^9G^-<^&Z^,X^+I^!%^)w^&Z^+n^(R^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeOUdeLTxeJlpeLFheK0leISVeKXdeJlpeK25eKFJeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f50ace10f85d",
      "text": "  你曾聽說過恐懼之花嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^.j^-X^-x^(x^#t^$#^!/^'w^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeLmpeLVheLXheKHheI3ReJCNeIS9eJ3deK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_652fece81062",
      "text": "  這片區域有哪些奇特的植物？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^(s^&1^\"+^\"k^$s^+I^!8^\"}^&5^&Z^%3^&4^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKHNeJjFeIiteImteJHNeK0leITheIn1eJjVeJlpeJTNeJjReLlY=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e5af0bb56f71",
      "text": "  跟我說說你們的首領吧。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^.+^$%^-x^-x^*F^*{^&Z^)~^)s^*I^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLiteJCVeLXheLXheKkZeKnteJlpeKX5eKXNeKkleISI=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8c5ecf8a501c",
      "text": "你想從我這裡得到什麼？你明知道我身無長物，什麼也給不了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^,1^#f^$%^(s^-j^#e^!u^!=^.T^.V^*F^$c^&h^(y^$%^(c^%}^)C^&4^*A^!=^.T^!1^'A^!)^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiwxXiNmXiQlXihzXi1qXiNlXiF1XiE9Xi5UXi5WXipGXiRjXiZoXih5XiQlXihjXiV9XilDXiY0XipBXiE9Xi5UXiExXidBXiEpXipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 84
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5855f1ed5bca",
      "text": "  你們為什麼不去修繕村莊？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^*{^%{^!=^.T^!)^\"6^.~^9K^$z^6l^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeKnteJXteIT1eLlReISleIjZeLn5eOUteJHpeNmxeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c6ed647930e4",
      "text": "  這裡究竟發生了什麼事？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^(s^-j^-<^28^&W^&F^*D^!=^.T^*r^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKHNeLWpeLTxeMjheJldeJkZeKkReIT1eLlReKnJeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_10223a3a0122",
      "text": "  你們為什麼不反抗那些強盜？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^*{^%{^!=^.T^!)^\"9^$4^)!^!8^#]^0!^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeKnteJXteIT1eLlReISleIjleJDReKSFeITheI11eMCFeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bd3787542922",
      "text": "  我九死一生才活了下來，但他們都被剷除了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^7N^%L^!%^&F^$,^%i^*D^!(^!O^*A^!I^!@^*{^)$^(@^2Y^)Q^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeN05eJUxeISVeJkZeJCxeJWleKkReISheIU9eKkFeIUleIUBeKnteKSReKEBeMlleKVFeKkReISI=",
      "byte_length": 62
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0278e619d8c7",
      "text": "  那些強盜不過是一群軟骨頭。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^)!^!8^#]^0!^!)^(x^,X^!%^'R^.x^*$^)t^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKSFeITheI11eMCFeISleKHheLFheISVeJ1JeLnheKiReKXReISI=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b63e8fe6acf6",
      "text": "  你們的戰士一定會英勇奮戰的。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^*{^&Z^$(^+a^!%^#.^$r^'y^\"$^+g^$(^&Z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeKnteJlpeJCheK2FeISVeIy5eJHJeJ3leIiReK2deJCheJlpeISI=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ba5321f9d8c7",
      "text": "  沒有援助，我們無法贏得這場戰爭。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^%\\^$s^$C^\"#^*A^$%^*{^%}^%b^.%^#e^(s^\"n^$(^1I^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJVxeJHNeJENeIiNeKkFeJCVeKnteJX1eJWJeLiVeI2VeKHNeIm5eJCheMUleISI=",
      "byte_length": 50
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9cd12e465e2a",
      "text": "感謝你們將我們從強盜的殘酷屠殺中解救出來。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#{^-z^*F^*{^#7^$%^*{^#f^#]^0!^&Z^,l^1b^#A^%M^!,^(I^,Q^!q^!O^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiN7Xi16XipGXip7XiM3XiQlXip7XiNmXiNdXjAhXiZaXixsXjFiXiNBXiVNXiEsXihJXixRXiFxXiFPXiEi",
      "byte_length": 63
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c2a6b9151e2d",
      "text": "  能驅逐那些強盜是我的榮幸。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^'b^*#^(r^)!^!8^#]^0!^,X^$%^&Z^,e^15^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJ2JeKiNeKHJeKSFeITheI11eMCFeLFheJCVeJlpeLGVeMTVeISI=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bd968c77ebf1",
      "text": "  為了換取你們的自由，我所受的一切苦難都是值得的。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^%{^*D^4@^\":^*F^*{^&Z^'l^&I^*A^$%^$)^\";^&Z^!%^+.^.t^)a^)$^,X^!Z^#e^&Z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJXteKkReNEBeIjpeKkZeKnteJlpeJ2xeJkleKkFeJCVeJCleIjteJlpeISVeKy5eLnReKWFeKSReLFheIVpeI2VeJlpeISI=",
      "byte_length": 74
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0cd6ebb7f685",
      "text": "我是盧基安，這座村莊的博學者",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^,X^/<^/'^+p^*A^(s^/_^$z^6l^&Z^/$^+n^'V",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXixYXi88Xi8nXitwXipBXihzXi9fXiR6XjZsXiZaXi8kXituXidW",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_de0188e1370c",
      "text": "，但眼下強盜橫行，連勉強活命都成了奢望， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*A^!I^&d^!(^#]^0!^/2^(;^*A^.0^9>^#]^%i^\"N^)$^$$^*D^1t^,]^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipBXiFJXiZkXiEoXiNdXjAhXi8yXig7XipBXi4wXjk+XiNdXiVpXiJOXikkXiQkXipEXjF0XixdXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3c4dbde4b5cd",
      "text": "我們哪還有心思去探討那些學問",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^+I^.7^$s^#k^#q^\"6^$>^-o^)!^!8^+n^*Z",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7XitJXi43XiRzXiNrXiNxXiI2XiQ+Xi1vXikhXiE4XituXipa",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_957083a54814",
      "text": "我的名字是阿扎米。我是村裡的木匠。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^&Z^\"F^#)^,X^)M^,=^'4^!\"^$%^,X^$z^-j^&Z^$v^7S^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiZaXiJGXiMpXixYXilNXiw9Xic0XiEiXiQlXixYXiR6Xi1qXiZaXiR2XjdTXiEi",
      "byte_length": 51
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a85cb88996bc",
      "text": "我正在烤麵包！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^%H^\"d^/w^*5^\"'^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiVIXiJkXi93Xio1XiInXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 22
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_878cda830a94",
      "text": "多虧了你們的慷慨善心，我",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"x^9N^*D^*F^*{^&Z^70^7/^1(^#k^*A^$%",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJ4XjlOXipEXipGXip7XiZaXjcwXjcvXjEoXiNrXipBXiQl",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f8c5c9bb99b6",
      "text": "我們抓獲了一名從古堡逃竄下來的強盜，他身上帶著兩大袋穀物。我",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^$2^&:^*D^!%^\"F^#f^\"=^\"m^(p^7c^!(^!O^&Z^#]^0!^*A^!@^(c^!'^#N^-a^!i^\"z^(?^'%^&4^!\"^$%",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7XiQyXiY6XipEXiElXiJGXiNmXiI9XiJtXihwXjdjXiEoXiFPXiZaXiNdXjAhXipBXiFAXihjXiEnXiNOXi1hXiFpXiJ6Xig/XiclXiY0XiEiXiQl",
      "byte_length": 90
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b346162ed5c7",
      "text": "們今晚終於能飽餐一頓了！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*{^*E^,Y^-H^$^^'b^7r^.K^!%^.F^*D^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "Xip7XipFXixZXi1IXiReXidiXjdyXi5LXiElXi5GXipEXipX",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bcdbff1dc982",
      "text": "我正在研磨這些種子來製作麵粉。雖然口糧少得可憐， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^%H^\"d^9G^-7^(s^!8^'$^#(^!O^(B^!M^*5^'5^!\"^.A^&\"^\"<^5s^#<^#e^\"A^1}^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiVIXiJkXjlHXi03XihzXiE4XickXiMoXiFPXihCXiFNXio1Xic1XiEiXi5BXiYiXiI8XjVzXiM8XiNlXiJBXjF9XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b61eb13172bf",
      "text": "但我們已經沒有其他東西可以充飢了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!I^$%^*{^#J^'D^%\\^$s^!j^!@^,`^-l^\"A^!B^5.^1d^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFJXiQlXip7XiNKXidEXiVcXiRzXiFqXiFAXixgXi1sXiJBXiFCXjUuXjFkXipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 51
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_271641ae7859",
      "text": "新的屋頂。既然強盜已經被剷除，我就不必再擔心 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$\\^&Z^8y^)p^!\"^,U^&\"^#]^0!^#J^'D^(@^2Y^)Q^*A^$%^*J^!)^#l^!l^*N^#k ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRcXiZaXjh5XilwXiEiXixVXiYiXiNdXjAhXiNKXidEXihAXjJZXilRXipBXiQlXipKXiEpXiNsXiFsXipOXiNrIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_03d22649bcd4",
      "text": "屋頂會被他們一把火燒光了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^8y^)p^$r^(@^!@^*{^!%^$1^%x^&&^!c^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xjh5XilwXiRyXihAXiFAXip7XiElXiQxXiV4XiYmXiFjXipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1912c936b5af",
      "text": "儲藏棚，好讓我們採集來的種子和塊根不至於被老鼠啃光。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+*^-f^9D^*A^+i^-}^$%^*{^5R^)]^!O^&Z^'$^#(^\"O^/Z^%)^!)^'n^$^^(@^'U^*=^7T^!c^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XisqXi1mXjlEXipBXitpXi19XiQlXip7XjVSXildXiFPXiZaXickXiMoXiJPXi9aXiUpXiEpXiduXiReXihAXidVXio9XjdUXiFjXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1f526beb5db4",
      "text": "我真不知道自己何必費這個勁。強盜肯定會像上次那樣 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^-2^!)^&h^(y^'l^#I^!L^#l^.\"^(s^!V^+3^!\"^#]^0!^-Z^#.^$r^!`^!'^%D^)!^,f ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXi0yXiEpXiZoXih5XidsXiNJXiFMXiNsXi4iXihzXiFWXiszXiEiXiNdXjAhXi1aXiMuXiRyXiFgXiEnXiVEXikhXixmIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3949ae5aed5a",
      "text": "把它砸得稀巴爛。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$1^+o^0#^#e^3w^#K^&-^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQxXitvXjAjXiNlXjN3XiNLXiYtXiEi",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4e8a7ead3dc7",
      "text": "我的興趣在於草藥學。這正是我當初來到塞德里爾特的原因。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^&Z^-]^.*^\"d^$^^*f^()^+n^!\"^(s^%H^,X^$%^&N^1\"^!O^!u^/(^#j^)(^&/^&5^&Z^\"5^\"]^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiZaXi1dXi4qXiJkXiReXipmXigpXituXiEiXihzXiVIXixYXiQlXiZOXjEiXiFPXiF1Xi8oXiNqXikoXiYvXiY1XiZaXiI1XiJdXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_08af82534202",
      "text": "這片區域生長著許多獨一無二的奇特植物。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^&1^\"+^\"k^&F^)C^-a^-s^\"x^/z^!%^%}^!5^&Z^\"}^&5^%3^&4^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXiYxXiIrXiJrXiZGXilDXi1hXi1zXiJ4Xi96XiElXiV9XiE1XiZaXiJ9XiY1XiUzXiY0XiEi",
      "byte_length": 57
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7da0b697e28b",
      "text": "你要恐懼之花做什麼？那種東西除了帶來死亡以外毫無益處。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^(C^#t^$#^!/^'w^*~^!=^.T^.V^)!^'$^,`^-l^)Q^*D^#N^!O^%L^!:^!B^\"w^/t^%}^3R^(,^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXihDXiN0XiQjXiEvXid3Xip+XiE9Xi5UXi5WXikhXickXixgXi1sXilRXipEXiNOXiFPXiVMXiE6XiFCXiJ3Xi90XiV9XjNSXigsXiEi",
      "byte_length": 81
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bed00179fbfe",
      "text": "  我身負尋找它的任務。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^(c^(W^#9^$/^+o^&Z^!C^+4^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeKGNeKFdeIzleJC9eK29eJlpeIUNeKzReISI=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a5370741173a",
      "text": "  我為什麼要找它，根本不關你的事。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^%{^!=^.T^(C^$/^+o^*A^%)^$x^!)^.>^*F^&Z^*r^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeJXteIT1eLlReKENeJC9eK29eKkFeJSleJHheISleLj5eKkZeJlpeKnJeISI=",
      "byte_length": 50
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1a5cc77b3b4a",
      "text": "  我要如何才能找到一朵？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^(C^#$^!L^$,^'b^$/^!u^!%^9C^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeKENeIyReIUxeJCxeJ2JeJC9eIXVeISVeOUNeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_11e56165be4a",
      "text": "  我在哪裡能找到蛇樹？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^\"d^+I^-j^'b^$/^!u^(/^%;^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeImReK0leLWpeJ2JeJC9eIXVeKC9eJTteLlY=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_018041119982",
      "text": "  我要如何把狂暴獸引到蛇樹附近？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^(C^#$^!L^$1^&8^$m^&<^#Z^!u^(/^%;^.?^(l^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeKENeIyReIUxeJDFeJjheJG1eJjxeI1peIXVeKC9eJTteLj9eKGxeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 47
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bc079927d5d1",
      "text": "  你願意幫我取得這朵花嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^.H^#z^+}^$%^\":^#e^(s^9C^'w^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeLkheI3peK31eJCVeIjpeI2VeKHNeOUNeJ3deK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ad30d5022ff5",
      "text": "  你為什麼說恐懼之花是不祥之物？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^%{^!=^.T^-x^#t^$#^!/^'w^,X^!)^9H^!/^&4^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeJXteIT1eLlReLXheI3ReJCNeIS9eJ3deLFheISleOUheIS9eJjReLlY=",
      "byte_length": 47
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_dc5f0d2331df",
      "text": "  別在意恐懼之花的事了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*H^\"d^#z^#t^$#^!/^'w^&Z^*r^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkheImReI3peI3ReJCNeIS9eJ3deJlpeKnJeKkReISI=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6e0560e171e5",
      "text": "山坡上有許多具有藥用價值的植物， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^11^7u^!'^$s^-s^\"x^!k^$s^()^&H^+&^!Z^&Z^%3^&4^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjExXjd1XiEnXiRzXi1zXiJ4XiFrXiRzXigpXiZIXismXiFaXiZaXiUzXiY0XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 49
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e7263bee086a",
      "text": "其中真菌尤為繁盛。但千萬要當心那些菌類。我曾親眼見過一隻 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!j^!,^-2^9M^6V^%{^-N^1L^!\"^!I^+7^-_^(C^&N^#k^)!^!8^9M^)w^!\"^$%^.j^(F^&d^-m^(x^!%^)[ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFqXiEsXi0yXjlNXjZWXiV7Xi1OXjFMXiEiXiFJXis3Xi1fXihDXiZOXiNrXikhXiE4XjlNXil3XiEiXiQlXi5qXihGXiZkXi1tXih4XiElXilbIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_45cba4b3d879",
      "text": "厄德陸鳥幼雛在誤食了一種毒菌後，竟瘋狂攻擊牠的母親。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^80^#j^99^4p^9@^9Q^\"d^(P^0J^*D^!%^'$^%Q^9M^#b^*A^28^-/^&8^$O^$F^-#^&Z^/s^(F^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XjgwXiNqXjk5XjRwXjlAXjlRXiJkXihQXjBKXipEXiElXickXiVRXjlNXiNiXipBXjI4Xi0vXiY4XiRPXiRGXi0jXiZaXi9zXihGXiEi",
      "byte_length": 78
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4cd8f288f5e7",
      "text": "強盜的連番襲擊幾乎把查雅逼到了崩潰邊緣。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#]^0!^&Z^.0^2{^08^$F^#T^!0^$1^%&^9:^.1^!u^*D^0W^2-^.8^9J^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNdXjAhXiZaXi4wXjJ7XjA4XiRGXiNUXiEwXiQxXiUmXjk6Xi4xXiF1XipEXjBXXjItXi44XjlKXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_19fd44b82be4",
      "text": "真希望這沒有在她心頭留下太深的創傷。在一切發生之前，她曾是個 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-2^+{^,]^(s^%\\^$s^\"d^+h^#k^)t^-+^!(^+f^2*^&Z^!{^!^^!\"^\"d^!%^+.^&W^&F^!/^!z^*A^+h^.j^,X^!V ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi0yXit7XixdXihzXiVcXiRzXiJkXitoXiNrXil0Xi0rXiEoXitmXjIqXiZaXiF7XiFeXiEiXiJkXiElXisuXiZXXiZGXiEvXiF6XipBXitoXi5qXixYXiFWIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3593d77384f5",
      "text": "溫柔又極具耐心的女子。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%s^0f^+;^1D^!k^-S^#k^&Z^#\"^#(^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVzXjBmXis7XjFEXiFrXi1TXiNrXiZaXiMiXiMoXiEi",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_65e30dd14b6e",
      "text": "何必費心去修復任何東西？只要我們一攢下任何值錢的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!L^#l^.\"^#k^\"6^.~^#g^!C^!L^,`^-l^.V^\"?^(C^$%^*{^!%^9A^!(^!C^!L^!Z^.<^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFMXiNsXi4iXiNrXiI2Xi5+XiNnXiFDXiFMXixgXi1sXi5WXiI/XihDXiQlXip7XiElXjlBXiEoXiFDXiFMXiFaXi48XiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cc269c206311",
      "text": "家當，強盜就會再度殺回來洗劫一空。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+s^&N^*A^#]^0!^*J^$r^!l^#V^%M^\"\\^!O^0j^1l^!%^'(^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XitzXiZOXipBXiNdXjAhXipKXiRyXiFsXiNWXiVNXiJcXiFPXjBqXjFsXiElXicoXiEi",
      "byte_length": 51
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_84ef4951d10b",
      "text": "他們的實力太強大了，我們根本打不過。我們倒是想放棄這座村莊，但 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^*{^&Z^#3^!~^+f^#]^\"z^*D^*A^$%^*{^%)^$x^$-^!)^(x^!\"^$%^*{^!X^,X^,1^$P^,a^(s^/_^$z^6l^*A^!I ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXip7XiZaXiMzXiF+XitmXiNdXiJ6XipEXipBXiQlXip7XiUpXiR4XiQtXiEpXih4XiEiXiQlXip7XiFYXixYXiwxXiRQXixhXihzXi9fXiR6XjZsXipBXiFJIA==",
      "byte_length": 94
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6d99d77d8544",
      "text": "這茫茫廢土之上，我們根本無處可去。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^9L^9L^#W^\"c^!/^!'^*A^$%^*{^%)^$x^%}^(,^\"A^\"6^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXjlMXjlMXiNXXiJjXiEvXiEnXipBXiQlXip7XiUpXiR4XiV9XigsXiJBXiI2XiEi",
      "byte_length": 51
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f687d9d748ef",
      "text": "強盜洗劫了我們的村莊。他們摧毀了民房，搶走了 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#]^0!^0j^1l^*D^$%^*{^&Z^$z^6l^!\"^!@^*{^$E^%N^*D^%T^,<^*A^1?^.&^*D ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNdXjAhXjBqXjFsXipEXiQlXip7XiZaXiR6XjZsXiEiXiFAXip7XiRFXiVOXipEXiVUXiw8XipBXjE/Xi4mXipEIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0038a21deb64",
      "text": "我們的牲畜與財物，並殺害了所有 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^&Z^1J^5f^'p^0=^&4^*A^!+^%M^#/^*D^$)^$s ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7XiZaXjFKXjVmXidwXjA9XiY0XipBXiErXiVNXiMvXipEXiQpXiRzIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1bce6c1166c1",
      "text": "敢於反抗的人。他們留給我們的只有無盡的飢餓。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^/m^$^^\"9^$4^&Z^!<^!\"^!@^*{^-+^'A^$%^*{^&Z^\"?^$s^%}^-1^&Z^1d^2R^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi9tXiReXiI5XiQ0XiZaXiE8XiEiXiFAXip7Xi0rXidBXiQlXip7XiZaXiI/XiRzXiV9Xi0xXiZaXjFkXjJSXiEi",
      "byte_length": 66
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_70300a8e9588",
      "text": "如此偉大的英雄，必定無所不能！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#$^%I^*}^\"z^&Z^'y^)\\^*A^#l^#.^%}^$)^!)^'b^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiMkXiVJXip9XiJ6XiZaXid5XilcXipBXiNsXiMuXiV9XiQpXiEpXidiXipX",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8400d52a94b6",
      "text": "你們的勇氣真令人敬佩！我很高興我的孩子們能以你們這樣 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^&Z^\"$^%U^-2^*w^!<^*O^.}^*W^$%^*K^*+^-]^$%^&Z^+m^#(^*{^'b^!B^*F^*{^(s^,f ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiZaXiIkXiVVXi0yXip3XiE8XipPXi59XipXXiQlXipLXiorXi1dXiQlXiZaXittXiMoXip7XidiXiFCXipGXip7XihzXixmIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5c0e2acc6601",
      "text": "傑出的人物為榜樣。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^9<^!q^&Z^!<^&4^%{^2q^,f^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xjk8XiFxXiZaXiE8XiY0XiV7XjJxXixmXiEi",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a41002e6b064",
      "text": "你們是真正的英雄！世上沒有任何難事能阻擋你們！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^,X^-2^%H^&Z^'y^)\\^*W^*p^!'^%\\^$s^!C^!L^)a^*r^'b^)L^$G^*F^*{^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XixYXi0yXiVIXiZaXid5XilcXipXXipwXiEnXiVcXiRzXiFDXiFMXilhXipyXidiXilMXiRHXipGXip7XipX",
      "byte_length": 69
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_049c2eef1e3c",
      "text": "我很遺憾你們為了我們承受如此多的苦難，但我們打從心底由衷感激。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*K^0v^0_^*F^*{^%{^*D^$%^*{^$0^\";^#$^%I^\"x^&Z^.t^)a^*A^!I^$%^*{^$-^#f^#k^/^^&I^7i^#{^1H^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXipLXjB2XjBfXipGXip7XiV7XipEXiQlXip7XiQwXiI7XiMkXiVJXiJ4XiZaXi50XilhXipBXiFJXiQlXip7XiQtXiNmXiNrXi9eXiZJXjdpXiN7XjFIXiEi",
      "byte_length": 93
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_19145a6901ab",
      "text": " 我們的首領可以為你們提供歇息之所",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^$%^*{^&Z^)~^)s^\"A^!B^%{^*F^*{^$A^!P^%E^#w^!/^$)",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4kJV4qe14mWl4pfl4pc14iQV4hQl4le14qRl4qe14kQV4hUF4lRV4jd14hL14kKQ==",
      "byte_length": 49
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8c2b4dd2799e",
      "text": "，或者你們也可以去找牧師梅赫塔。他也許能為你們治癒傷口。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*A^$'^'V^*F^*{^!1^\"A^!B^\"6^$/^/5^#M^%-^5$^\"o^!\"^!@^!1^-s^'b^%{^*F^*{^%_^&V^!^^\"<^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipBXiQnXidWXipGXip7XiExXiJBXiFCXiI2XiQvXi81XiNNXiUtXjUkXiJvXiEiXiFAXiExXi1zXidiXiV7XipGXip7XiVfXiZWXiFeXiI8XiEi",
      "byte_length": 84
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d8708e6d8ee9",
      "text": "我實在不忍心看到我們的戰士為了一場與我們無關的戰爭去送死。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^#3^\"d^!)^1y^#k^*Q^!u^$%^*{^&Z^$(^+a^%{^*D^!%^\"n^'p^$%^*{^%}^.>^&Z^$(^1I^\"6^./^%L^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiMzXiJkXiEpXjF5XiNrXipRXiF1XiQlXip7XiZaXiQoXithXiV7XipEXiElXiJuXidwXiQlXip7XiV9Xi4+XiZaXiQoXjFJXiI2Xi4vXiVMXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_dbfbe5373185",
      "text": "以你們的英勇，肯定能憑一己之力打敗德拉吉的整支大軍！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!B^*F^*{^&Z^'y^\"$^*A^-Z^#.^'b^,5^!%^#I^!/^!~^$-^$R^#j^$6^\"D^&Z^$T^$L^\"z^..^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFCXipGXip7XiZaXid5XiIkXipBXi1aXiMuXidiXiw1XiElXiNJXiEvXiF+XiQtXiRSXiNqXiQ2XiJEXiZaXiRUXiRMXiJ6Xi4uXipX",
      "byte_length": 78
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e5b9c366236c",
      "text": "我相信他們會的。我只希望他們能活著回到自己的家園。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^&a^!U^!@^*{^$r^&Z^!\"^$%^\"?^+{^,]^!@^*{^'b^%i^-a^\"\\^!u^'l^#I^&Z^+s^41^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiZhXiFVXiFAXip7XiRyXiZaXiEiXiQlXiI/Xit7XixdXiFAXip7XidiXiVpXi1hXiJcXiF1XidsXiNJXiZaXitzXjQxXiEi",
      "byte_length": 75
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d8b67f0445ed",
      "text": "即便如此，這對塞德里爾特來說依然是個沉重的代價，我祈求你們千萬不要 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"1^!R^#$^%I^*A^(s^#:^/(^#j^)(^&/^&5^!O^-x^!Q^&\"^,X^!V^%Z^))^&Z^*v^+&^*A^$%^&u^,n^*F^*{^+7^-_^!)^(C ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiIxXiFSXiMkXiVJXipBXihzXiM6Xi8oXiNqXikoXiYvXiY1XiFPXi14XiFRXiYiXixYXiFWXiVaXikpXiZaXip2XismXipBXiQlXiZ1XixuXipGXip7Xis3Xi1fXiEpXihDIA==",
      "byte_length": 100
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8c71bae1c86f",
      "text": "辜負了我們的期望。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^66^(W^*D^$%^*{^&Z^$u^,]^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XjY2XihXXipEXiQlXip7XiZaXiR1XixdXiEi",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_98c372047fbb",
      "text": "是啊，我明白這一點。但我不敢肯定，就算加上我們的戰士，你們是否真能打贏德拉吉。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,X^+Q^*A^$%^$c^&X^(s^!%^*;^!\"^!I^$%^!)^/m^-Z^#.^*A^*J^-C^\"\"^!'^$%^*{^&Z^$(^+a^*A^*F^*{^,X^\"H^-2^'b^$-^.%^#j^$6^\"D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XixYXitRXipBXiQlXiRjXiZYXihzXiElXio7XiEiXiFJXiQlXiEpXi9tXi1aXiMuXipBXipKXi1DXiIiXiEnXiQlXip7XiZaXiQoXithXipBXipGXip7XixYXiJIXi0yXidiXiQtXi4lXiNqXiQ2XiJEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 117
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f254dbfa8542",
      "text": " 我必須回去幹活了。再次感謝你們。",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^$%^#l^)r^\"\\^\"6^,!^%i^*D^!\"^!l^%D^#{^-z^*F^*{^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4kJV4jbF4pcl4iXF4iNl4sIV4laV4qRF4hIl4hbF4lRF4je14tel4qRl4qe14hIg==",
      "byte_length": 49
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_57586e30d207",
      "text": " 我沒時間再多說了。告辭。",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^$%^%\\^$f^)G^!l^\"x^-x^*D^!\"^+B^2M^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4kJV4lXF4kZl4pR14hbF4ieF4teF4qRF4hIl4rQl4yTV4hIg==",
      "byte_length": 37
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_35836bd46bba",
      "text": "好吧，看來我只能相信你知道自己在做什麼了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+i^*I^*A^*Q^!O^$%^\"?^'b^&a^!U^*F^&h^(y^'l^#I^\"d^*~^!=^.T^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitpXipJXipBXipRXiFPXiQlXiI/XidiXiZhXiFVXipGXiZoXih5XidsXiNJXiJkXip+XiE9Xi5UXipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c06bd66ccd36",
      "text": "恐懼之花是一種具有魔力的魔法植物，只會在極為特殊的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#t^$#^!/^'w^,X^!%^'$^!k^$s^*0^!~^&Z^*0^%b^%3^&4^*A^\"?^$r^\"d^1D^%{^&5^9!^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiN0XiQjXiEvXid3XixYXiElXickXiFrXiRzXiowXiF+XiZaXiowXiViXiUzXiY0XipBXiI/XiRyXiJkXjFEXiV7XiY1XjkhXiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_381233bacca1",
      "text": "條件下才會誕生。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%.^.W^!(^$,^$r^9O^&F^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiUuXi5XXiEoXiQsXiRyXjlPXiZGXiEi",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d6d1abf441c4",
      "text": "好吧，我很遺憾。我……我幫不了你。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+i^*I^*A^$%^*K^0v^0_^!\"^$%^*o^*o^$%^+}^!)^*D^*F^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XitpXipJXipBXiQlXipLXjB2XjBfXiEiXiQlXipvXipvXiQlXit9XiEpXipEXipGXiEi",
      "byte_length": 51
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fd3c5763b89b",
      "text": "與其說是尋找這朵花，倒不如說是如何去培育它。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'p^!j^-x^,X^#9^$/^(s^9C^'w^*A^!X^!)^#$^-x^,X^#$^!L^\"6^9?^5z^+o^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XidwXiFqXi14XixYXiM5XiQvXihzXjlDXid3XipBXiFYXiEpXiMkXi14XixYXiMkXiFMXiI2Xjk/XjV6XitvXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_54cdaf8c19b4",
      "text": "催生恐懼之花的唯一途徑，就是在蛇樹的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^9=^&F^#t^$#^!/^'w^&Z^+O^!%^3.^#c^*A^*J^,X^\"d^(/^%;^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xjk9XiZGXiN0XiQjXiEvXid3XiZaXitPXiElXjMuXiNjXipBXipKXixYXiJkXigvXiU7XiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ca82eb1c3c25",
      "text": "樹蔭下親手斬殺一頭狂暴獸。你必須設法讓一頭狂暴獸追殺你。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%;^5~^!(^(F^$+^9B^%M^!%^)t^&8^$m^&<^!\"^*F^#l^)r^4e^%b^-}^!%^)t^&8^$m^&<^(o^%M^*F^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiU7XjV+XiEoXihGXiQrXjlCXiVNXiElXil0XiY4XiRtXiY8XiEiXipGXiNsXilyXjRlXiViXi19XiElXil0XiY4XiRtXiY8XihvXiVNXipGXiEi",
      "byte_length": 84
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e0ffbcf41c42",
      "text": "據我所知，唯一一棵蛇樹就生長在村莊的西北角。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^5T^$%^$)^&h^*A^+O^!%^!%^9E^(/^%;^*J^&F^)C^\"d^$z^6l^&Z^-l^+6^(H^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XjVUXiQlXiQpXiZoXipBXitPXiElXiElXjlFXigvXiU7XipKXiZGXilDXiJkXiR6XjZsXiZaXi1sXis2XihIXiEi",
      "byte_length": 66
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_caae14e0fa0a",
      "text": "正如其名，狂暴獸極易被激怒。牠們活著唯一的目的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%H^#$^!j^\"F^*A^&8^$m^&<^1D^,W^(@^1H^#o^!\"^-#^*{^%i^-a^+O^!%^&Z^&^^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVIXiMkXiFqXiJGXipBXiY4XiRtXiY8XjFEXixXXihAXjFIXiNvXiEiXi0jXip7XiVpXi1hXitPXiElXiZaXiZeXiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b0c8424dc31a",
      "text": "就是摧毀人類的一切造物。要引誘牠現身，只需要宣告 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*J^,X^$E^%N^!<^)w^&Z^!%^+.^(v^&4^!\"^(C^#Z^1Z^-#^&?^(c^*A^\"?^)e^(C^2d^+B ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipKXixYXiRFXiVOXiE8Xil3XiZaXiElXisuXih2XiY0XiEiXihDXiNaXjFaXi0jXiY/XihjXipBXiI/XillXihDXjJkXitCIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bbdbf796b742",
      "text": "你的存在即可。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^&Z^#*^\"d^\"1^\"A^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiZaXiMqXiJkXiIxXiJBXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 22
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e9803ec3cee0",
      "text": "要是你想這麼做，你可以拿著那支號角走到蛇樹旁用力吹響它， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(C^,X^*F^,1^(s^.T^*~^*A^*F^\"A^!B^,G^-a^)!^$L^(-^(H^.&^!u^(/^%;^.h^&H^!~^+A^)o^+o^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihDXixYXipGXiwxXihzXi5UXip+XipBXipGXiJBXiFCXixHXi1hXikhXiRMXigtXihIXi4mXiF1XigvXiU7Xi5oXiZIXiF+XitBXilvXitvXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e4bb58770bf6",
      "text": "如果你非要這麼做的話。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#$^%!^*F^)i^(C^(s^.T^*~^&Z^-v^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiMkXiUhXipGXilpXihDXihzXi5UXip+XiZaXi12XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_febd4cc1d8a3",
      "text": "不過，光是大力敲打蛇樹的樹幹，大概就足以引牠過來了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^(x^*A^!c^,X^\"z^!~^1A^$-^(/^%;^&Z^%;^,!^*A^\"z^,d^*J^(^^!B^#Z^-#^(x^!O^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXih4XipBXiFjXixYXiJ6XiF+XjFBXiQtXigvXiU7XiZaXiU7XiwhXipBXiJ6XixkXipKXiheXiFCXiNaXi0jXih4XiFPXipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 78
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b4cffa371892",
      "text": "我已經違背了自己的理智原則，給了你們足夠多的幫助。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^#J^'D^9P^.r^*D^'l^#I^&Z^&A^$i^\"5^!x^*A^'A^*D^*F^*{^(^^+d^\"x^&Z^+}^\"#^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiNKXidEXjlQXi5yXipEXidsXiNJXiZaXiZBXiRpXiI1XiF4XipBXidBXipEXipGXip7XiheXitkXiJ4XiZaXit9XiIjXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_91c020e3496c",
      "text": "或許烏斯庫耶願意陪你們一起去。他向來最熱衷於這種冒險蠻幹的事。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$'^-s^/4^$[^,#^0.^.H^#z^8.^*F^*{^!%^.(^\"6^!\"^!@^+?^!O^$q^&$^7i^$^^(s^'$^/P^*m^/H^,!^&Z^*r^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQnXi1zXi80XiRbXiwjXjAuXi5IXiN6XjguXipGXip7XiElXi4oXiI2XiEiXiFAXis/XiFPXiRxXiYkXjdpXiReXihzXickXi9QXiptXi9IXiwhXiZaXipyXiEi",
      "byte_length": 93
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_945d92b5cd70",
      "text": "恐懼之花是製造特定類型劇毒匕首的主要原料—— ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#t^$#^!/^'w^,X^(B^(v^&5^#.^)w^\"j^1#^%Q^\"(^)~^&Z^!-^(C^\"5^/n^*n^*n ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiN0XiQjXiEvXid3XixYXihCXih2XiY1XiMuXil3XiJqXjEjXiVRXiIoXil+XiZaXiEtXihDXiI1Xi9uXipuXipuIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d15f2d41f864",
      "text": "也就是能讓受害者身中劇毒的那種。我向來極度排斥任何 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!1^*J^,X^'b^-}^\";^#/^'V^(c^!,^1#^%Q^&Z^)!^'$^!\"^$%^+?^!O^1D^#V^$<^,S^!C^!L ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiExXipKXixYXidiXi19XiI7XiMvXidWXihjXiEsXjEjXiVRXiZaXikhXickXiEiXiQlXis/XiFPXjFEXiNWXiQ8XixTXiFDXiFMIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6d6a6d01ce7d",
      "text": "純粹為了帶來死亡而設計出來的事物。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^3\"^5r^%{^*D^#N^!O^%L^!:^'W^4e^-n^!q^!O^&Z^*r^&4^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XjMiXjVyXiV7XipEXiNOXiFPXiVMXiE6XidXXjRlXi1uXiFxXiFPXiZaXipyXiY0XiEi",
      "byte_length": 51
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1a24d0c8fb5a",
      "text": "你們最好趁早把它拋到腦後。恐懼之花 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^$q^+i^.)^,V^$1^+o^,A^!u^2@^#b^!\"^#t^$#^!/^'w ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiRxXitpXi4pXixWXiQxXitvXixBXiF1XjJAXiNiXiEiXiN0XiQjXiEvXid3IA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3c090612a38c",
      "text": "在這個世上根本百害而無一利。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"d^(s^!V^*p^!'^%)^$x^&Y^#/^'W^%}^!%^!t^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJkXihzXiFWXipwXiEnXiUpXiR4XiZZXiMvXidXXiV9XiElXiF0XiEi",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b35afdd2e564",
      "text": "樹木蜿蜒曲折的樹皮形成了一種圖案，看起來就像是一條條長蛇 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%;^$v^6q^6p^$n^,?^&Z^%;^&[^#_^$$^*D^!%^'$^\"b^4|^*A^*Q^.(^!O^*J^!`^,X^!%^%.^%.^)C^(/ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiU7XiR2XjZxXjZwXiRuXiw/XiZaXiU7XiZbXiNfXiQkXipEXiElXickXiJiXjR8XipBXipRXi4oXiFPXipKXiFgXixYXiElXiUuXiUuXilDXigvIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4e1b064fb52c",
      "text": "正順著樹幹向上蜿蜒攀爬。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%H^.D^-a^%;^,!^+?^!'^6q^6p^8|^/y^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVIXi5EXi1hXiU7XiwhXis/XiEnXjZxXjZwXjh8Xi95XiEi",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a2e70a1e75a9",
      "text": "沒有什麼比一場大獲全勝的狩獵更能讓人重獲生機了，對吧， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%\\^$s^!=^.T^,m^!%^\"n^\"z^&:^!h^+5^&Z^8l^&;^$o^'b^-}^!<^))^&:^&F^%>^*D^*A^#:^*I^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVcXiRzXiE9Xi5UXixtXiElXiJuXiJ6XiY6XiFoXis1XiZaXjhsXiY7XiRvXidiXi19XiE8XikpXiY6XiZGXiU+XipEXipBXiM6XipJXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8a6eddcf7b12",
      "text": "？雖然這是一場令人暢快的消遣，但我現在必須回到自己的職責 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.V^.A^&\"^(s^,X^!%^\"n^*w^!<^7x^*L^&Z^%k^4k^*A^!I^$%^&?^\"d^#l^)r^\"\\^!u^'l^#I^&Z^'\\^0> ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi5WXi5BXiYiXihzXixYXiElXiJuXip3XiE8Xjd4XipMXiZaXiVrXjRrXipBXiFJXiQlXiY/XiJkXiNsXilyXiJcXiF1XidsXiNJXiZaXidcXjA+IA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_38355951e413",
      "text": "上了。後會有期。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!'^*D^!\"^#b^$r^$s^$u^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEnXipEXiEiXiNiXiRyXiRzXiR1XiEi",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5afc8adca2d2",
      "text": "快逃！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*L^(p^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XipMXihwXipX",
      "byte_length": 9
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5caed0f1b8f7",
      "text": "雙足飛龍！雙足飛龍來了！快逃命啊！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)_^(^^)z^*>^*W^)_^(^^)z^*>^!O^*D^*W^*L^(p^\"N^+Q^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XilfXiheXil6Xio+XipXXilfXiheXil6Xio+XiFPXipEXipXXipMXihwXiJOXitRXipX",
      "byte_length": 51
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_47e2dfe3d505",
      "text": "你們正打算前往村長的住所嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^%H^$-^-C^!z^,)^$z^)C^&Z^*z^$)^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiVIXiQtXi1DXiF6XiwpXiR6XilDXiZaXip6XiQpXitYXi5W",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d4c15f1a9e78",
      "text": "多麼精彩的戰鬥！你真是一位出色的戰士， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"x^.T^'7^#`^&Z^$(^*,^*W^*F^-2^,X^!%^!J^!q^'s^&Z^$(^+a^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJ4Xi5UXic3XiNgXiZaXiQoXiosXipXXipGXi0yXixYXiElXiFKXiFxXidzXiZaXiQoXithXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7793039f6f2a",
      "text": " 我這一生都以為狂暴獸是不可戰勝的，但你們徹底 ",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^$%^(s^!%^&F^)$^!B^%{^&8^$m^&<^,X^!)^\"A^$(^+5^&Z^*A^!I^*F^*{^18^/^ ",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4kJV4oc14hJV4mRl4pJF4hQl4le14mOF4kbV4mPF4sWF4hKV4iQV4kKF4rNV4mWl4qQV4hSV4qRl4qe14xOF4vXiA=",
      "byte_length": 68
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5577b00999ef",
      "text": "證明了事實並非如此！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-{^$c^*D^*r^#3^!+^)i^#$^%I^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi17XiRjXipEXipyXiMzXiErXilpXiMkXiVJXipX",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cdeb9950fcea",
      "text": "米莉察",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'4^'{^#2",
      "encoded_base64": "Xic0Xid7XiMy",
      "byte_length": 9
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bd44491e3b80",
      "text": "阿卡爾",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)M^\"0^&/",
      "encoded_base64": "XilNXiIwXiYv",
      "byte_length": 9
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c52895cc91d0",
      "text": "查雅向我們轉述了你們戰勝德拉吉的偉大捷報。你們的英勇 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%&^9:^+?^$%^*{^(i^68^*D^*F^*{^$(^+5^#j^$6^\"D^&Z^*}^\"z^/.^+`^!\"^*F^*{^&Z^'y^\"$ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiUmXjk6Xis/XiQlXip7XihpXjY4XipEXipGXip7XiQoXis1XiNqXiQ2XiJEXiZaXip9XiJ6Xi8uXitgXiEiXipGXip7XiZaXid5XiIkIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_808d2bed9460",
      "text": "給了我無限希望！有像你們這樣的英雄在，特克圖克特雷自己 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'A^*D^$%^%}^)O^+{^,]^*W^$s^!`^*F^*{^(s^,f^&Z^'y^)\\^\"d^*A^&5^!d^\"b^!d^&5^)c^'l^#I ",
      "encoded_base64": "XidBXipEXiQlXiV9XilPXit7XixdXipXXiRzXiFgXipGXip7XihzXixmXiZaXid5XilcXiJkXipBXiY1XiFkXiJiXiFkXiY1XiljXidsXiNJIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8be94ad886e5",
      "text": "有朝一日也必將被迫改變他那套殘暴的統治手段！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$s^,^^!%^$a^!1^#l^#7^(@^1`^$N^(U^!@^)!^#!^,l^$m^&Z^'B^%_^$+^.l^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRzXixeXiElXiRhXiExXiNsXiM3XihAXjFgXiROXihVXiFAXikhXiMhXixsXiRtXiZaXidCXiVfXiQrXi5sXipX",
      "byte_length": 66
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_711c7423ef35",
      "text": "我們究竟該如何向你們致謝才好， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^-<^28^(M^#$^!L^+?^*F^*{^'o^-z^$,^+i^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7Xi08XjI4XihNXiMkXiFMXis/XipGXip7XidvXi16XiQsXitpXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bb58f2c9db3d",
      "text": "！你們給予了沙漠人民從未體驗過的自由。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*W^*F^*{^'A^!4^*D^%]^,}^!<^%T^#f^,_^**^.P^(x^&Z^'l^&I^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipXXipGXip7XidBXiE0XipEXiVdXix9XiE8XiVUXiNmXixfXioqXi5QXih4XiZaXidsXiZJXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5be8d0940036",
      "text": "我們生平第一次擁有了一個值得 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^&F^0Y^',^!%^%D^,M^$s^*D^!%^!V^!Z^#e ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7XiZGXjBZXicsXiElXiVEXixNXiRzXipEXiElXiFWXiFaXiNlIA==",
      "byte_length": 43
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_85c8b0c8f07d",
      "text": "翹首期盼的未來。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^9c^)~^$u^23^&Z^,_^!O^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XjljXil+XiR1XjIzXiZaXixfXiFPXiEi",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_313caa1fb601",
      "text": "我至今依然不敢相信你們竟然真的把強盜殺光了！你們是 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^'n^*E^!Q^&\"^!)^/m^&a^!U^*F^*{^28^&\"^-2^&Z^$1^#]^0!^%M^!c^*D^*W^*F^*{^,X ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiduXipFXiFRXiYiXiEpXi9tXiZhXiFVXipGXip7XjI4XiYiXi0yXiZaXiQxXiNdXjAhXiVNXiFjXipEXipXXipGXip7XixYIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b40dd1002d6b",
      "text": "真正的英雄，我由衷感謝你們。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-2^%H^&Z^'y^)\\^*A^$%^&I^7i^#{^-z^*F^*{^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi0yXiVIXiZaXid5XilcXipBXiQlXiZJXjdpXiN7Xi16XipGXip7XiEi",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_61cafdee1218",
      "text": "有什麼我能為你們效勞的嗎——只要能幫得上 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$s^!=^.T^$%^'b^%{^*F^*{^$Q^/R^&Z^+X^*n^*n^\"?^(C^'b^+}^#e^!' ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRzXiE9Xi5UXiQlXidiXiV7XipGXip7XiRRXi9SXiZaXitYXipuXipuXiI/XihDXidiXit9XiNlXiEnIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_55969ad7051e",
      "text": "終結了肆虐我們村莊的強盜的大英雄，我願竭盡所能。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-H^'@^*D^2>^3)^$%^*{^$z^6l^&Z^#]^0!^&Z^\"z^'y^)\\^*A^$%^.H^29^-1^$)^'b^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi1IXidAXipEXjI+XjMpXiQlXip7XiR6XjZsXiZaXiNdXjAhXiZaXiJ6Xid5XilcXipBXiQlXi5IXjI5Xi0xXiQpXidiXiEi",
      "byte_length": 72
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_51b69af99b1c",
      "text": "你們想要什麼？如果你們以為村裡還有什麼油水，那你們可就大錯特錯了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^,1^(C^!=^.T^.V^#$^%!^*F^*{^!B^%{^$z^-j^.7^$s^!=^.T^%^^%V^*A^)!^*F^*{^\"A^*J^\"z^)5^&5^)5^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiwxXihDXiE9Xi5UXi5WXiMkXiUhXipGXip7XiFCXiV7XiR6Xi1qXi43XiRzXiE9Xi5UXiVeXiVWXipBXikhXipGXip7XiJBXipKXiJ6Xik1XiY1Xik1XipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 100
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f0cbd10a213b",
      "text": "就連我們飼養的康克甲蟲和厄德陸鳥群也全 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*J^.0^$%^*{^9f^.I^&Z^5N^!d^&J^(8^\"O^80^#j^99^4p^'R^!1^!h ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipKXi4wXiQlXip7XjlmXi5JXiZaXjVOXiFkXiZKXig4XiJPXjgwXiNqXjk5XjRwXidSXiExXiFoIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_730774278fa8",
      "text": "都沒了。除了一地白骨，我們這裡什麼也沒剩下。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)$^%\\^*D^!\"^)Q^*D^!%^\"e^&X^*$^*A^$%^*{^(s^-j^!=^.T^!1^%\\^8U^!(^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XikkXiVcXipEXiEiXilRXipEXiElXiJlXiZYXiokXipBXiQlXip7XihzXi1qXiE9Xi5UXiExXiVcXjhVXiEoXiEi",
      "byte_length": 66
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d08372b5faa8",
      "text": "我現在沒空說話。尋找食物是一場永無止境的苦鬥， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^&?^\"d^%\\^'(^-x^-v^!\"^#9^$/^0J^&4^,X^!%^\"n^%W^%}^%G^\"q^&Z^.t^*,^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiY/XiJkXiVcXicoXi14Xi12XiEiXiM5XiQvXjBKXiY0XixYXiElXiJuXiVXXiV9XiVHXiJxXiZaXi50XiosXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1cdbb91a6b23",
      "text": "而我們正在節節敗退。我知道，我們早晚都會被活活餓死。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'W^$%^*{^%H^\"d^9b^9b^$R^*V^!\"^$%^&h^(y^*A^$%^*{^,V^,Y^)$^$r^(@^%i^%i^2R^%L^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XidXXiQlXip7XiVIXiJkXjliXjliXiRSXipWXiEiXiQlXiZoXih5XipBXiQlXip7XixWXixZXikkXiRyXihAXiVpXiVpXjJSXiVMXiEi",
      "byte_length": 78
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c09cf61c81a2",
      "text": "千萬別喝井裡的水。那水是有毒的。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+7^-_^*H^6M^!7^-j^&Z^%V^!\"^)!^%V^,X^$s^%Q^&Z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xis3Xi1fXipIXjZNXiE3Xi1qXiZaXiVWXiEiXikhXiVWXixYXiRzXiVRXiZaXiEi",
      "byte_length": 48
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_637934edbf65",
      "text": "  你們村莊遭遇了什麼？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^*{^$z^6l^(}^.2^*D^!=^.T^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeKnteJHpeNmxeKH1eLjJeKkReIT1eLlReLlY=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_664d5f0039d8",
      "text": "  強盜為何要襲擊你們的村莊？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^#]^0!^%{^!L^(C^08^$F^*F^*{^&Z^$z^6l^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeI11eMCFeJXteIUxeKENeMDheJEZeKkZeKnteJlpeJHpeNmxeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b2eb3549b9bc",
      "text": "  你們為什麼不再飼養牲畜了？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^*{^%{^!=^.T^!)^!l^9f^.I^1J^5f^*D^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeKnteJXteIT1eLlReISleIWxeOWZeLkleMUpeNWZeKkReLlY=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0ff1d9aa7b1f",
      "text": "  你們難道不能再去弄些牲畜來嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^*{^)a^(y^!)^'b^!l^\"6^/`^!8^1J^5f^!O^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeKnteKWFeKHleISleJ2JeIWxeIjZeL2BeITheMUpeNWZeIU9eK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 47
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b128c92c5033",
      "text": "  你們難道沒有莊稼或家畜嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^*{^)a^(y^%\\^$s^6l^9a^$'^+s^5f^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeKnteKWFeKHleJVxeJHNeNmxeOWFeJCdeK3NeNWZeK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_71bbf2600e98",
      "text": "  你們不能去打獵覓食嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^*{^!)^'b^\"6^$-^&;^6t^0J^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeKnteISleJ2JeIjZeJC1eJjteNnReMEpeK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e9f179213733",
      "text": "  你知道上山的路徑嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^&h^(y^!'^11^&Z^(a^#c^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeJmheKHleISdeMTFeJlpeKGFeI2NeK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_14107e4b5672",
      "text": "  水質出了什麼問題？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^%V^(Z^!q^*D^!=^.T^*Z^.G^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJVZeKFpeIXFeKkReIT1eLlReKlpeLkdeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a3690f954789",
      "text": "  村裡難道沒有任何能喝的水嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$z^-j^)a^(y^%\\^$s^!C^!L^'b^6M^&Z^%V^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJHpeLWpeKWFeKHleJVxeJHNeIUNeIUxeJ2JeNk1eJlpeJVZeK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8953ca3473ee",
      "text": "  我正在招募戰士對抗德拉吉。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^%H^\"d^,D^9S^$(^+a^#:^$4^#j^$6^\"D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeJUheImReLEReOVNeJCheK2FeIzpeJDReI2peJDZeIkReISI=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1e6f06afc7cf",
      "text": "  對抗德拉吉，你們唯一的活路就是奮起反抗。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^#:^$4^#j^$6^\"D^*A^*F^*{^+O^!%^&Z^%i^(a^*J^,X^+g^.(^\"9^$4^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIzpeJDReI2peJDZeIkReKkFeKkZeKnteK09eISVeJlpeJWleKGFeKkpeLFheK2deLiheIjleJDReISI=",
      "byte_length": 62
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ac1143ac8492",
      "text": "  我很感謝塞德里爾特承諾派出戰士支援。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^*K^#{^-z^/(^#j^)(^&/^&5^$0^7k^.n^!q^$(^+a^$L^$C^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeKkteI3teLXpeLyheI2peKSheJi9eJjVeJDBeN2teLm5eIXFeJCheK2FeJExeJENeISI=",
      "byte_length": 56
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c30c00328865",
      "text": "  你最近有聽到什麼傳言嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^$q^(l^$s^-X^!u^!=^.T^+$^1Y^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeJHFeKGxeJHNeLVheIXVeIT1eLlReKyReMVleK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4fd7c8b89566",
      "text": "我是 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^,X ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXixYIA==",
      "byte_length": 7
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_578b2c9d5999",
      "text": "自從阿塔斯淪為廢土以來，每天發生的事無非都是如此。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'l^#f^)M^\"o^$[^2)^%{^#W^\"c^!B^!O^*A^%P^+e^&W^&F^&Z^*r^%}^)i^)$^,X^#$^%I^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XidsXiNmXilNXiJvXiRbXjIpXiV7XiNXXiJjXiFCXiFPXipBXiVQXitlXiZXXiZGXiZaXipyXiV9XilpXikkXixYXiMkXiVJXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_131b667c4656",
      "text": "弱肉強食、強凌弱暴， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#\\^'^^#]^0J^!!^#]^9R^#\\^$m^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNcXideXiNdXjBKXiEhXiNdXjlSXiNcXiRtXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 31
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9aa55f0acd79",
      "text": "災難與毀滅無情降臨在愛好和平之人身上。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^3P^)a^'p^%N^%t^%}^,0^)N^1U^\"d^,2^+i^\"O^0Y^!/^!<^(c^!'^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XjNQXilhXidwXiVOXiV0XiV9XiwwXilOXjFVXiJkXiwyXitpXiJPXjBZXiEvXiE8XihjXiEnXiEi",
      "byte_length": 57
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_69819eef14b4",
      "text": "這座廣場以前從未如此空曠過。肥碩的康克甲蟲和厄德陸鳥曾擠滿了 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^/_^9V^\"n^!B^!z^#f^,_^#$^%I^'(^9\\^(x^!\"^-Y^9`^&Z^5N^!d^&J^(8^\"O^80^#j^99^4p^.j^9[^,{^*D ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXi9fXjlWXiJuXiFCXiF6XiNmXixfXiMkXiVJXicoXjlcXih4XiEiXi1ZXjlgXiZaXjVOXiFkXiZKXig4XiJPXjgwXiNqXjk5XjRwXi5qXjlbXix7XipEIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_258493f8b569",
      "text": "這裡，但現在全都一去不復返了。強盜將牠們屠戮殆盡！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^-j^*A^!I^&?^\"d^!h^)$^!%^\"6^!)^#g^7J^*D^!\"^#]^0!^#7^-#^*{^#A^,:^8H^-1^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXi1qXipBXiFJXiY/XiJkXiFoXikkXiElXiI2XiEpXiNnXjdKXipEXiEiXiNdXjAhXiM3Xi0jXip7XiNBXiw6XjhIXi0xXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cabef576ec85",
      "text": "他們甚至連肉都沒帶走——就只是任由屍體在地上腐爛生蛆。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^*{^/|^'n^.0^'^^)$^%\\^#N^.&^*n^*n^*J^\"?^,X^!C^&I^#?^**^\"d^\"e^!'^0/^&-^&F^2C^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXip7Xi98XiduXi4wXideXikkXiVcXiNOXi4mXipuXipuXipKXiI/XixYXiFDXiZJXiM/XioqXiJkXiJlXiEnXjAvXiYtXiZGXjJDXiEi",
      "byte_length": 81
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3ab22a3024c6",
      "text": "為何？烈日為何會灼傷你的皮膚？這就是沙漠的法則。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%{^!L^.V^%|^$a^%{^!L^$r^9^^!^^*F^&Z^&[^'i^.V^(s^*J^,X^%]^,}^&Z^%b^!x^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiV7XiFMXi5WXiV8XiRhXiV7XiFMXiRyXjleXiFeXipGXiZaXiZbXidpXi5WXihzXipKXixYXiVdXix9XiZaXiViXiF4XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_48e48fe04760",
      "text": "你瞧見這些石牆當初是帶著多麼虛妄的希望建立起來的吧。如今全都在 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^-4^-m^(s^!8^&k^&0^&N^1\"^,X^#N^-a^\"x^.T^-g^+j^&Z^+{^,]^,'^0'^.(^!O^&Z^*I^!\"^#$^*E^!h^)$^\"d ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXi00Xi1tXihzXiE4XiZrXiYwXiZOXjEiXixYXiNOXi1hXiJ4Xi5UXi1nXitqXiZaXit7XixdXiwnXjAnXi4oXiFPXiZaXipJXiEiXiMkXipFXiFoXikkXiJkIA==",
      "byte_length": 94
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e0e534a0c991",
      "text": "風沙中化作齏粉。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)y^%]^!,^\")^!M^9g^'5^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xil5XiVdXiEsXiIpXiFNXjlnXic1XiEi",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9abc613562ca",
      "text": "一開始，他們搶奪我們的財物，這對他們來說理由足夠充分了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!%^)F^+k^*A^!@^*{^1?^1,^$%^*{^&Z^0=^&4^*A^(s^#:^!@^*{^!O^-x^&A^&I^(^^+d^5.^!s^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiElXilGXitrXipBXiFAXip7XjE/XjEsXiQlXip7XiZaXjA9XiY0XipBXihzXiM6XiFAXip7XiFPXi14XiZBXiZJXiheXitkXjUuXiFzXipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b44de32e3924",
      "text": "但現在我們已經一無所有，他們卻依然不斷進攻！他們根本就是一群 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!I^&?^\"d^$%^*{^#J^'D^!%^%}^$)^$s^*A^!@^*{^1&^!Q^&\"^!)^,T^(w^$O^*W^!@^*{^%)^$x^*J^,X^!%^'R ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFJXiY/XiJkXiQlXip7XiNKXidEXiElXiV9XiQpXiRzXipBXiFAXip7XjEmXiFRXiYiXiEpXixUXih3XiRPXipXXiFAXip7XiUpXiR4XipKXixYXiElXidSIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b84b63678168",
      "text": "徹頭徹尾的惡徒！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^18^)t^18^5J^&Z^#y^#d^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XjE4Xil0XjE4XjVKXiZaXiN5XiNkXipX",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_25aebcf8a30c",
      "text": "強盜把它們殺得精光。連一點活口都沒留給我們！直接把我們殺了， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#]^0!^$1^+o^*{^%M^#e^'7^!c^!\"^.0^!%^*;^%i^\"<^)$^%\\^-+^'A^$%^*{^*W^&`^$?^$1^$%^*{^%M^*D^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNdXjAhXiQxXitvXip7XiVNXiNlXic3XiFjXiEiXi4wXiElXio7XiVpXiI8XikkXiVcXi0rXidBXiQlXip7XipXXiZgXiQ/XiQxXiQlXip7XiVNXipEXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2a489acdf1c4",
      "text": "倒還比留下我們在這裡活活餓死要仁慈得多。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!X^.7^,m^-+^!(^$%^*{^\"d^(s^-j^%i^%i^2R^%L^(C^37^3H^#e^\"x^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFYXi43XixtXi0rXiEoXiQlXip7XiJkXihzXi1qXiVpXiVpXjJSXiVMXihDXjM3XjNIXiNlXiJ4XiEi",
      "byte_length": 60
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2aa250a8fcea",
      "text": "我們起初太過害怕，不敢讓戰士離開村莊去尋找新的牲畜群，但 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^.(^1\"^+f^(x^#/^0^^*A^!)^/m^-}^$(^+a^)`^)F^$z^6l^\"6^#9^$/^$\\^&Z^1J^5f^'R^*A^!I ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7Xi4oXjEiXitmXih4XiMvXjBeXipBXiEpXi9tXi19XiQoXithXilgXilGXiR6XjZsXiI2XiM5XiQvXiRcXiZaXjFKXjVmXidSXipBXiFJIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_840472fa1b83",
      "text": "飢餓的威脅甚至比強盜還要可怕。我只希望他們 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^1d^2R^&Z^#&^1T^/|^'n^,m^#]^0!^.7^(C^\"A^0^^!\"^$%^\"?^+{^,]^!@^*{ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjFkXjJSXiZaXiMmXjFUXi98XiduXixtXiNdXjAhXi43XihDXiJBXjBeXiEiXiQlXiI/Xit7XixdXiFAXip7IA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_92c4d01bc151",
      "text": "能在強盜從古堡發動下一次襲擊之前平安歸來。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'b^\"d^#]^0!^#f^\"=^\"m^&W^\"%^!(^!%^%D^08^$F^!/^!z^0Y^+p^%K^!O^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XidiXiJkXiNdXjAhXiNmXiI9XiJtXiZXXiIlXiEoXiElXiVEXjA4XiRGXiEvXiF6XjBZXitwXiVLXiFPXiEi",
      "byte_length": 63
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c72fff289863",
      "text": "強盜燒光了我們的莊稼。除了我們在山坡上採集的種子和塊根， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#]^0!^&&^!c^*D^$%^*{^&Z^6l^9a^!\"^)Q^*D^$%^*{^\"d^11^7u^!'^5R^)]^&Z^'$^#(^\"O^/Z^%)^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNdXjAhXiYmXiFjXipEXiQlXip7XiZaXjZsXjlhXiEiXilRXipEXiQlXip7XiJkXjExXjd1XiEnXjVSXildXiZaXickXiMoXiJPXi9aXiUpXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f98a1757e3fe",
      "text": "已經沒有任何食物可吃了。這些微薄的口糧——根本不足以 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#J^'D^%\\^$s^!C^!L^0J^&4^\"A^2^^*D^!\"^(s^!8^#i^6o^&Z^\"<^5s^*n^*n^%)^$x^!)^(^^!B ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNKXidEXiVcXiRzXiFDXiFMXjBKXiY0XiJBXjJeXipEXiEiXihzXiE4XiNpXjZvXiZaXiI8XjVzXipuXipuXiUpXiR4XiEpXiheXiFCIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_78048abc07e7",
      "text": "支撐我們捱過太長的時間。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$L^,L^$%^*{^9Z^(x^+f^)C^&Z^$f^)G^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRMXixMXiQlXip7XjlaXih4XitmXilDXiZaXiRmXilHXiEi",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_45ea5d609d52",
      "text": "你們來這裡的路上看見了多少獵物？我告訴你，這片地界早就沒活物了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^!O^(s^-j^&Z^(a^!'^*Q^-m^*D^\"x^#<^&;^&4^.V^$%^+B^-t^*F^*A^(s^&1^\"e^.p^,V^*J^%\\^%i^&4^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiFPXihzXi1qXiZaXihhXiEnXipRXi1tXipEXiJ4XiM8XiY7XiY0Xi5WXiQlXitCXi10XipGXipBXihzXiYxXiJlXi5wXixWXipKXiVcXiVpXiY0XipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 97
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9fd3c939a2bd",
      "text": "根本沒有上山的路。當年在山頂築城的那位老兄，八成 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%)^$x^%\\^$s^!'^11^&Z^(a^!\"^&N^+~^\"d^11^)p^8;^+_^&Z^)!^!J^'U^1!^*A^50^$$ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiUpXiR4XiVcXiRzXiEnXjExXiZaXihhXiEiXiZOXit+XiJkXjExXilwXjg7XitfXiZaXikhXiFKXidVXjEhXipBXjUwXiQkIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c681fdb80382",
      "text": "是隻長了翅膀的大鳥！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,X^)[^)C^*D^95^96^&Z^\"z^4p^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XixYXilbXilDXipEXjk1Xjk2XiZaXiJ6XjRwXipX",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d9f4c961d7df",
      "text": "你們為什麼要去那裡？強盜肯定會殺了你們的。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^%{^!=^.T^(C^\"6^)!^-j^.V^#]^0!^-Z^#.^$r^%M^*D^*F^*{^&Z^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiV7XiE9Xi5UXihDXiI2XikhXi1qXi5WXiNdXjAhXi1aXiMuXiRyXiVNXipEXipGXip7XiZaXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_58c8d1ad8d16",
      "text": "他們在城堡上嚴密監視著山坡上的一舉一動—— ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^*{^\"d^+_^\"m^!'^1*^#0^2|^(E^-a^11^7u^!'^&Z^!%^01^!%^\"%^*n^*n ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXip7XiJkXitfXiJtXiEnXjEqXiMwXjJ8XihFXi1hXjExXjd1XiEnXiZaXiElXjAxXiElXiIlXipuXipuIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_35766ce90413",
      "text": "除非你們也像強盜那樣擁有一頭雙足飛龍，否則你們根本上不去。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)Q^)i^*F^*{^!1^!`^#]^0!^)!^,f^,M^$s^!%^)t^)_^(^^)z^*>^*A^\"H^!x^*F^*{^%)^$x^!'^!)^\"6^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XilRXilpXipGXip7XiExXiFgXiNdXjAhXikhXixmXixNXiRzXiElXil0XilfXiheXil6Xio+XipBXiJIXiF4XipGXip7XiUpXiR4XiEnXiEpXiI2XiEi",
      "byte_length": 87
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ee7b53a1a163",
      "text": "只要一越過附近的山坡，山勢就會變得如同山頂的城堡石牆一樣 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"?^(C^!%^(]^(x^.?^(l^&Z^11^7u^*A^11^\"&^*J^$r^(U^#e^#$^\"E^11^)p^&Z^+_^\"m^&k^&0^!%^,f ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiI/XihDXiElXihdXih4Xi4/XihsXiZaXjExXjd1XipBXjExXiImXipKXiRyXihVXiNlXiMkXiJFXjExXilwXiZaXitfXiJtXiZrXiYwXiElXixmIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6d19e668a326",
      "text": "陡峭險峻。你們能爬上去的機率， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^9d^9T^*m^9U^!\"^*F^*{^'b^/y^!'^\"6^&Z^%>^22^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjlkXjlUXiptXjlVXiEiXipGXip7XidiXi95XiEnXiI2XiZaXiU+XjIyXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e85bf0bc08af",
      "text": "就跟期盼得到巫王的憐憫一樣微乎其微。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*J^.+^$u^23^#e^!u^14^-)^&Z^1}^1~^!%^,f^#i^!0^!j^#i^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipKXi4rXiR1XjIzXiNlXiF1XjE0Xi0pXiZaXjF9XjF+XiElXixmXiNpXiEwXiFqXiNpXiEi",
      "byte_length": 54
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5265ef2b4c0b",
      "text": "我只知道那裡到處都是雙足飛龍和強盜！這就足夠讓我 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^\"?^&h^(y^)!^-j^!u^(,^)$^,X^)_^(^^)z^*>^\"O^#]^0!^*W^(s^*J^(^^+d^-}^$% ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiI/XiZoXih5XikhXi1qXiF1XigsXikkXixYXilfXiheXil6Xio+XiJPXiNdXjAhXipXXihzXipKXiheXitkXi19XiQlIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_964e64a2aadc",
      "text": "敬而遠之，不想再去探聽更多了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*O^'W^({^!/^*A^!)^,1^!l^\"6^$>^-X^$o^\"x^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipPXidXXih7XiEvXipBXiEpXiwxXiFsXiI2XiQ+Xi1YXiRvXiJ4XipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b1178f767330",
      "text": "過去曾有一個傳說，說那座城堡是 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(x^\"6^.j^$s^!%^!V^+$^-x^*A^-x^)!^/_^+_^\"m^,X ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xih4XiI2Xi5qXiRzXiElXiFWXiskXi14XipBXi14XikhXi9fXitfXiJtXixYIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f9cbf4fd045f",
      "text": "風的居所。這座山確實終年狂風肆虐，但我懷疑 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)y^&Z^+w^$)^!\"^(s^/_^11^-6^#3^-H^+~^&8^)y^2>^3)^*A^!I^$%^,9^0p ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xil5XiZaXit3XiQpXiEiXihzXi9fXjExXi02XiMzXi1IXit+XiY4Xil5XjI+XjMpXipBXiFJXiQlXiw5XjBwIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9d370f122d03",
      "text": "傳說背後恐怕也不過如此。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+$^-x^.r^#b^#t^0^^!1^!)^(x^#$^%I^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiskXi14Xi5yXiNiXiN0XjBeXiExXiEpXih4XiMkXiVJXiEi",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7c8fdf849b04",
      "text": "就在強盜來到之後不久，我們聽到了關於城堡 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*J^\"d^#]^0!^!O^!u^!/^#b^!)^!.^*A^$%^*{^-X^!u^*D^.>^$^^+_^\"m ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipKXiJkXiNdXjAhXiFPXiF1XiEvXiNiXiEpXiEuXipBXiQlXip7Xi1YXiF1XipEXi4+XiReXitfXiJtIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7403943d2c0f",
      "text": "遭到詛咒的傳聞。不過在那之前，山風是唯一 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(}^!u^(L^\"P^&Z^+$^4^^!\"^!)^(x^\"d^)!^!/^!z^*A^11^)y^,X^+O^!% ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xih9XiF1XihMXiJQXiZaXiskXjReXiEiXiEpXih4XiJkXikhXiEvXiF6XipBXjExXil5XixYXitPXiElIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_968a8ffa2a9d",
      "text": "從山上下來的東西。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#f^11^!'^!(^!O^&Z^,`^-l^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNmXjExXiEnXiEoXiFPXiZaXixgXi1sXiEi",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7289295c3817",
      "text": "你們該擔心的不是城堡本身，而是盤踞在裡面的東西。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^(M^*N^#k^&Z^!)^,X^+_^\"m^$x^(c^*A^'W^,X^1M^1_^\"d^-j^)j^&Z^,`^-l^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XihNXipOXiNrXiZaXiEpXixYXitfXiJtXiR4XihjXipBXidXXixYXjFNXjFfXiJkXi1qXilqXiZaXixgXi1sXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b1933958cdc5",
      "text": "雙足飛龍和強盜！願詛咒降臨在他們所有人頭上！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)_^(^^)z^*>^\"O^#]^0!^*W^.H^(L^\"P^)N^1U^\"d^!@^*{^$)^$s^!<^)t^!'^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XilfXiheXil6Xio+XiJPXiNdXjAhXipXXi5IXihMXiJQXilOXjFVXiJkXiFAXip7XiQpXiRzXiE8Xil0XiEnXipX",
      "byte_length": 66
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0a1c3c2b3c1a",
      "text": "強盜把一具腐爛的獸屍扔進了水井裡，而且兩次襲擊之間相隔太短， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#]^0!^$1^!%^!k^0/^&-^&Z^&<^#?^8{^(w^*D^%V^!7^-j^*A^'W^!*^!i^%D^08^$F^!/^)G^&a^9e^+f^&i^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNdXjAhXiQxXiElXiFrXjAvXiYtXiZaXiY8XiM/Xjh7Xih3XipEXiVWXiE3Xi1qXipBXidXXiEqXiFpXiVEXjA4XiRGXiEvXilHXiZhXjllXitmXiZpXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_493b661093d1",
      "text": "根本沒有足夠的時間讓我們去開鑿一口新井，甚至連清理 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%)^$x^%\\^$s^(^^+d^&Z^$f^)G^-}^$%^*{^\"6^)F^6@^!%^\"<^$\\^!7^*A^/|^'n^.0^,u^&A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiUpXiR4XiVcXiRzXiheXitkXiZaXiRmXilHXi19XiQlXip7XiI2XilGXjZAXiElXiI8XiRcXiE3XipBXi98XiduXi4wXix1XiZBIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_87db0ebfe3c1",
      "text": "現有水井的污物都辦不到。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&?^$s^%V^!7^&Z^0h^&4^)$^2L^!)^!u^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiY/XiRzXiVWXiE3XiZaXjBoXiY0XikkXjJMXiEpXiF1XiEi",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1a10736e873d",
      "text": "山上有幾條溪流流淌下來，但走過去路途十分遙遠， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^11^!'^$s^#T^%.^4P^%j^%j^9]^!(^!O^*A^!I^.&^(x^\"6^(a^3.^*Y^!s^4j^({^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjExXiEnXiRzXiNUXiUuXjRQXiVqXiVqXjldXiEoXiFPXipBXiFJXi4mXih4XiI2XihhXjMuXipZXiFzXjRqXih7XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_feaaf0095bf0",
      "text": "而且大半時候你們都必須一路擊退荒野猛獸才能取到水。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'W^!*^\"z^\"-^$f^*|^*F^*{^)$^#l^)r^!%^(a^$F^*V^1W^.:^*P^&<^$,^'b^\":^!u^%V^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XidXXiEqXiJ6XiItXiRmXip8XipGXip7XikkXiNsXilyXiElXihhXiRGXipWXjFXXi46XipQXiY8XiQsXidiXiI6XiF1XiVWXiEi",
      "byte_length": 75
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_24ff7de37d5b",
      "text": "我又不是戰士！只有瘋子",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^+;^!)^,X^$(^+a^*W^\"?^$s^-/^#(",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXis7XiEpXixYXiQoXithXipXXiI/XiRzXi0vXiMo",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6ca910426e14",
      "text": "才會想著要去跟德拉吉開戰！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$,^$r^,1^-a^(C^\"6^.+^#j^$6^\"D^)F^$(^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQsXiRyXiwxXi1hXihDXiI2Xi4rXiNqXiQ2XiJEXilGXiQoXipX",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5f438c7ebe74",
      "text": "那去跟我們的首領查雅談吧。我在這項決策上沒有任何發言權。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^\"6^.+^$%^*{^&Z^)~^)s^%&^9:^0;^*I^!\"^$%^\"d^(s^)q^,o^5p^!'^%\\^$s^!C^!L^&W^1Y^1E^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXiI2Xi4rXiQlXip7XiZaXil+XilzXiUmXjk6XjA7XipJXiEiXiQlXiJkXihzXilxXixvXjVwXiEnXiVcXiRzXiFDXiFMXiZXXjFZXjFFXiEi",
      "byte_length": 84
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_284e4374bcc9",
      "text": "如果你們把我們的戰士帶走，塞德里爾特會變成什麼樣？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#$^%!^*F^*{^$1^$%^*{^&Z^$(^+a^#N^.&^*A^/(^#j^)(^&/^&5^$r^(U^$$^!=^.T^,f^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiMkXiUhXipGXip7XiQxXiQlXip7XiZaXiQoXithXiNOXi4mXipBXi8oXiNqXikoXiYvXiY1XiRyXihVXiQkXiE9Xi5UXixmXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_29e078ed2656",
      "text": "強盜已經摧毀了我們的村莊，你們竟然還想讓我們去打仗！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#]^0!^#J^'D^$E^%N^*D^$%^*{^&Z^$z^6l^*A^*F^*{^28^&\"^.7^,1^-}^$%^*{^\"6^$-^0|^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNdXjAhXiNKXidEXiRFXiVOXipEXiQlXip7XiZaXiR6XjZsXipBXipGXip7XjI4XiYiXi43XiwxXi19XiQlXip7XiI2XiQtXjB8XipX",
      "byte_length": 78
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2ee709d27634",
      "text": "我們現在連活命都成問題！強盜動不動就任意殺害我們， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^&?^\"d^.0^%i^\"N^)$^$$^*Z^.G^*W^#]^0!^\"%^!)^\"%^*J^!C^#z^%M^#/^$%^*{^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7XiY/XiJkXi4wXiVpXiJOXikkXiQkXipaXi5HXipXXiNdXjAhXiIlXiEpXiIlXipKXiFDXiN6XiVNXiMvXiQlXip7XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6c2d6fde468a",
      "text": "我哪有心思去管什麼德拉吉。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^+I^$s^#k^#q^\"6^-D^!=^.T^#j^$6^\"D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXitJXiRzXiNrXiNxXiI2Xi1EXiE9Xi5UXiNqXiQ2XiJEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_90c86eb89587",
      "text": "這個村莊本就名存實亡了。我懷疑德拉吉根本懶得理會我們。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^!V^$z^6l^$x^*J^\"F^#*^#3^!:^*D^!\"^$%^,9^0p^#j^$6^\"D^%)^$x^9Y^#e^&A^$r^$%^*{^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXiFWXiR6XjZsXiR4XipKXiJGXiMqXiMzXiE6XipEXiEiXiQlXiw5XjBwXiNqXiQ2XiJEXiUpXiR4XjlZXiNlXiZBXiRyXiQlXip7XiEi",
      "byte_length": 81
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f82ba0846abf",
      "text": "等德拉吉打到我們的城牆下時我們自會戰鬥。主動去招惹 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'-^#j^$6^\"D^$-^!u^$%^*{^&Z^+_^&0^!(^$f^$%^*{^'l^$r^$(^*,^!\"^!-^\"%^\"6^,D^3s ",
      "encoded_base64": "XictXiNqXiQ2XiJEXiQtXiF1XiQlXip7XiZaXitfXiYwXiEoXiRmXiQlXip7XidsXiRyXiQoXiosXiEiXiEtXiIlXiI2XixEXjNzIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e0c886777660",
      "text": "那種禍事根本毫無意義。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^'$^7B^*r^%)^$x^/t^%}^#z^2<^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXickXjdCXipyXiUpXiR4Xi90XiV9XiN6XjI8XiEi",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2c79f93c6aee",
      "text": "無論結局如何，我都希望戰火能盡快平息。死神徘徊在我身旁的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%}^1\\^'@^._^#$^!L^*A^$%^)$^+{^,]^$(^%x^'b^-1^*L^0Y^#w^!\"^%L^&w^9X^9W^\"d^$%^(c^.h^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiV9XjFcXidAXi5fXiMkXiFMXipBXiQlXikkXit7XixdXiQoXiV4XidiXi0xXipMXjBZXiN3XiEiXiVMXiZ3XjlYXjlXXiJkXiQlXihjXi5oXiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7f78d8e30077",
      "text": "日子，我已經過得太久了！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$a^#(^*A^$%^#J^'D^(x^#e^+f^!.^*D^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRhXiMoXipBXiQlXiNKXidEXih4XiNlXitmXiEuXipEXipX",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a9c7617afd35",
      "text": "我不敢說我喜歡這主意，但我祝你們好運，進展順利。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^!)^/m^-x^$%^+V^%F^(s^!-^#z^*A^!I^$%^&v^*F^*{^+i^.4^*A^(w^+x^.D^!t^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiEpXi9tXi14XiQlXitWXiVGXihzXiEtXiN6XipBXiFJXiQlXiZ2XipGXip7XitpXi40XipBXih3Xit4Xi5EXiF0XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_df8058d96a07",
      "text": "或許阿塔斯正需要像你們這樣的英雄——一位不只是想要 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$'^-s^)M^\"o^$[^%H^)e^(C^!`^*F^*{^(s^,f^&Z^'y^)\\^*n^*n^!%^!J^!)^\"?^,X^,1^(C ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQnXi1zXilNXiJvXiRbXiVIXillXihDXiFgXipGXip7XihzXixmXiZaXid5XilcXipuXipuXiElXiFKXiEpXiI/XixYXiwxXihDIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_142a1921872a",
      "text": "填飽自己的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^7U^7r^'l^#I^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjdVXjdyXidsXiNJXiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 16
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7e845519e9ab",
      "text": "荷包之人。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*g^\"'^!/^!<^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipnXiInXiEvXiE8XiEi",
      "byte_length": 15
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d23e10b4040f",
      "text": "在強盜來到之前，我們經常前往村莊以北的惡地 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"d^#]^0!^!O^!u^!/^!z^*A^$%^*{^'D^#O^!z^,)^$z^6l^!B^+6^&Z^#y^\"e ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJkXiNdXjAhXiFPXiF1XiEvXiF6XipBXiQlXip7XidEXiNPXiF6XiwpXiR6XjZsXiFCXis2XiZaXiN5XiJlIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5a3c9c5d4ff3",
      "text": "打獵。我們偶爾會碰上被割去舌頭的瑪格拉巨怪。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$-^&;^!\"^$%^*{^9,^&/^$r^-5^!'^(@^+1^\"6^'q^)t^&Z^-*^%*^$6^#H^#s^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQtXiY7XiEiXiQlXip7XjksXiYvXiRyXi01XiEnXihAXisxXiI2XidxXil0XiZaXi0qXiUqXiQ2XiNIXiNzXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a8e6c5f2cb76",
      "text": "那大概是有個殘虐的奴隸販子在荒原那頭四處流竄作惡吧。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^\"z^,d^,X^$s^!V^,l^3)^&Z^##^)Z^6.^#(^\"d^1W^\"5^)!^)t^\"[^(,^%j^7c^!M^#y^*I^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXiJ6XixkXixYXiRzXiFWXixsXjMpXiZaXiMjXilaXjYuXiMoXiJkXjFXXiI1XikhXil0XiJbXigsXiVqXjdjXiFNXiN5XipJXiEi",
      "byte_length": 78
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f1d3a3902a13",
      "text": "我聽說那些蘇蘭蜥蜴人又在四處遊蕩覓食了。這群 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^-X^-x^)!^!8^4c^/G^(2^(3^!<^+;^\"d^\"[^(,^.3^1X^6t^0J^*D^!\"^(s^'R ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXi1YXi14XikhXiE4XjRjXi9HXigyXigzXiE8Xis7XiJkXiJbXigsXi4zXjFYXjZ0XjBKXipEXiEiXihzXidSIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0e0aa68e8e7a",
      "text": "卑劣生物的部族就居住在此處東北方，他們隔三岔五就 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\".^+2^&F^&4^&Z^)#^5V^*J^+w^*z^\"d^%I^(,^,`^+6^$]^*A^!@^*{^9e^!&^3m^!6^*J ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiIuXisyXiZGXiY0XiZaXikjXjVWXipKXit3Xip6XiJkXiVJXigsXixgXis2XiRdXipBXiFAXip7XjllXiEmXjNtXiE2XipKIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_07162bc9ea8d",
      "text": "跑出來到處惹是生非。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(_^!q^!O^!u^(,^3s^,X^&F^)i^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XihfXiFxXiFPXiF1XigsXjNzXixYXiZGXilpXiEi",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0bee7b4e83d1",
      "text": "有人看見城邦的官兵出沒在此處東邊——正在搜捕一夥 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$s^!<^*Q^-m^+_^1a^&Z^#-^+,^!q^%\\^\"d^%I^(,^,`^.8^*n^*n^%H^\"d^/h^4?^!%^5? ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRzXiE8XipRXi1tXitfXjFhXiZaXiMtXissXiFxXiVcXiJkXiVJXigsXixgXi44XipuXipuXiVIXiJkXi9oXjQ/XiElXjU/IA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_16afccffe401",
      "text": "逃跑的奴隸。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(p^(_^&Z^##^)Z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XihwXihfXiZaXiMjXilaXiEi",
      "byte_length": 18
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_14b226f9605d",
      "text": "有人說一支商隊即將途經這片區域……要是有新鮮食物， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$s^!<^-x^!%^$L^1'^)U^\"1^#7^3.^'D^(s^&1^\"+^\"k^*o^*o^(C^,X^$s^$\\^35^0J^&4^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRzXiE8Xi14XiElXiRMXjEnXilVXiIxXiM3XjMuXidEXihzXiYxXiIrXiJrXipvXipvXihDXixYXiRzXiRcXjM1XjBKXiY0XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4d5ac2773987",
      "text": "我真是不惜拿任何東西去跟他們交換！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^-2^,X^!)^7X^,G^!C^!L^,`^-l^\"6^.+^!@^*{^0P^4@^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXi0yXixYXiEpXjdYXixHXiFDXiFMXixgXi1sXiI2Xi4rXiFAXip7XjBQXjRAXipX",
      "byte_length": 51
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2342c94bda4a",
      "text": " 我該回去幹活了",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^$%^(M^\"\\^\"6^,!^%i^*D",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4kJV4oTV4iXF4iNl4sIV4laV4qRA==",
      "byte_length": 22
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2e31da188088",
      "text": " 很抱歉我不能跟你們多聊了，手頭還有好多事情要做",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^*K^,@^,h^$%^!)^'b^.+^*F^*{^\"x^-U^*D^*A^$+^)t^.7^$s^+i^\"x^*r^,0^(C^*~",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4qS14sQF4saF4kJV4hKV4nYl4uK14qRl4qe14ieF4tVV4qRF4qQV4kK14pdF4uN14kc14raV4ieF4qcl4sMF4oQ14qfg==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d3d9f15a8f16",
      "text": " 能與各位交談是我的榮幸，但我必須回去工作了",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^'b^'p^+>^!J^0P^0;^,X^$%^&Z^,e^15^*A^!I^$%^#l^)r^\"\\^\"6^+y^!M^*D",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4nYl4ncF4rPl4hSl4wUF4wO14sWF4kJV4mWl4sZV4xNV4qQV4hSV4kJV4jbF4pcl4iXF4iNl4reV4hTV4qRA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5110e8bda381",
      "text": " 我還有太多瑣事要忙，沒法整天站在這裡聊天",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^$%^.7^$s^+f^\"x^9_^*r^(C^,+^*A^%\\^%b^$T^+e^->^\"d^(s^-j^-U^+e",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4kJV4uN14kc14rZl4ieF45X14qcl4oQ14sK14qQV4lXF4lYl4kVF4rZV4tPl4iZF4oc14tal4tVV4rZQ==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7ba9435c3353",
      "text": "你好啊，各位戰士同袍！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^+i^+Q^*A^+>^!J^$(^+a^\"E^6r^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXitpXitRXipBXis+XiFKXiQoXithXiJFXjZyXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_77e397b741dd",
      "text": "你們之前對付那些雙足飛龍和 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^!/^!z^#:^*u^)!^!8^)_^(^^)z^*>^\"O ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiEvXiF6XiM6Xip1XikhXiE4XilfXiheXil6Xio+XiJPIA==",
      "byte_length": 40
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_349a60deb538",
      "text": "龍騎兵的戰鬥可真精彩，雖然我自己也不是沒跟他們交手過幾次！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*>^0K^+,^&Z^$(^*,^\"A^-2^'7^#`^*A^.A^&\"^$%^'l^#I^!1^!)^,X^%\\^.+^!@^*{^0P^$+^(x^#T^%D^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "Xio+XjBLXissXiZaXiQoXiosXiJBXi0yXic3XiNgXipBXi5BXiYiXiQlXidsXiNJXiExXiEpXixYXiVcXi4rXiFAXip7XjBQXiQrXih4XiNUXiVEXipX",
      "byte_length": 87
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_654f8f31723b",
      "text": "感謝你們替我們除掉了強盜。你們是優秀的戰士。我 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#{^-z^*F^*{^2o^$%^*{^)Q^/e^*D^#]^0!^!\"^*F^*{^,X^+)^-9^&Z^$(^+a^!\"^$% ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiN7Xi16XipGXip7XjJvXiQlXip7XilRXi9lXipEXiNdXjAhXiEiXipGXip7XixYXispXi05XiZaXiQoXithXiEiXiQlIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a7ec81a30418",
      "text": "只遺憾自己當初沒能為村子出更多力！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"?^0v^0_^'l^#I^&N^1\"^%\\^'b^%{^$z^#(^!q^$o^\"x^!~^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiI/XjB2XjBfXidsXiNJXiZOXjEiXiVcXidiXiV7XiR6XiMoXiFxXiRvXiJ4XiF+XipX",
      "byte_length": 51
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3014b8ca3c2e",
      "text": "我真羨慕你們能自由自在地面對挑戰，例如這次主動去突襲 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^-2^9r^3I^*F^*{^'b^'l^&I^'l^\"d^\"e^)j^#:^,H^$(^*A^9h^#$^(s^%D^!-^\"%^\"6^'*^08 ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXi0yXjlyXjNJXipGXip7XidiXidsXiZJXidsXiJkXiJlXilqXiM6XixIXiQoXipBXjloXiMkXihzXiVEXiEtXiIlXiI2XicqXjA4IA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5e383c0fcaf5",
      "text": "強盜巢穴，但我對塞德里爾特的職責十分明確。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#]^0!^#G^'&^*A^!I^$%^#:^/(^#j^)(^&/^&5^&Z^'\\^0>^*Y^!s^$c^-6^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNdXjAhXiNHXicmXipBXiFJXiQlXiM6Xi8oXiNqXikoXiYvXiY1XiZaXidcXjA+XipZXiFzXiRjXi02XiEi",
      "byte_length": 63
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f2eaebb9d892",
      "text": "  保衛塞德里爾特是一項艱鉅的任務。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^!T^(=^/(^#j^)(^&/^&5^,X^!%^)q^6j^9w^&Z^!C^+4^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIVReKD1eLyheI2peKSheJi9eJjVeLFheISVeKXFeNmpeOXdeJlpeIUNeKzReISI=",
      "byte_length": 50
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ee82d63dcf1d",
      "text": "  你看起來幹得不怎麼樣。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^*Q^.(^!O^,!^#e^!)^,,^.T^,f^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeKlFeLiheIU9eLCFeI2VeISleLCxeLlReLGZeISI=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5950a0cd7da3",
      "text": "  村子現在狀況如何？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$z^#(^&?^\"d^&7^,q^#$^!L^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJHpeIyheJj9eImReJjdeLHFeIyReIUxeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3c9fdca40d19",
      "text": "  你身手厲害嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^(c^$+^+:^#/^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeKGNeJCteKzpeIy9eK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 23
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_93f9abec93f5",
      "text": "  幫我一起剷除強盜。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^+}^$%^!%^.(^2Y^)Q^#]^0!^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeK31eJCVeISVeLiheMlleKVFeI11eMCFeISI=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cc822cb77338",
      "text": "  你願意幫我一起對抗狂暴獸嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^.H^#z^+}^$%^!%^.(^#:^$4^&8^$m^&<^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeLkheI3peK31eJCVeISVeLiheIzpeJDReJjheJG1eJjxeK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b42ff3d880e2",
      "text": "  如果我殺了強盜，就不會再有襲擊了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^#$^%!^$%^%M^*D^#]^0!^*A^*J^!)^$r^!l^$s^08^$F^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIyReJSFeJCVeJU1eKkReI11eMCFeKkFeKkpeISleJHJeIWxeJHNeMDheJEZeKkReISI=",
      "byte_length": 53
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f780be996b47",
      "text": "  盧基安是誰？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^/<^/'^+p^,X^-y^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLzxeLydeK3BeLFheLXleLlY=",
      "byte_length": 20
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ab878f150440",
      "text": "  德拉吉正在襲擊各個村莊！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^#j^$6^\"D^%H^\"d^08^$F^+>^!V^$z^6l^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeI2peJDZeIkReJUheImReMDheJEZeKz5eIVZeJHpeNmxeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8939ce5b9f68",
      "text": "我是村莊的副首領烏斯庫耶，負責統領戰士與 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^,X^$z^6l^&Z^52^)~^)s^/4^$[^,#^0.^*A^(W^0>^'B^)s^$(^+a^'p ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXixYXiR6XjZsXiZaXjUyXil+XilzXi80XiRbXiwjXjAuXipBXihXXjA+XidCXilzXiQoXithXidwIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_04d58edd69b7",
      "text": "塞德里爾特的防務。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^/(^#j^)(^&/^&5^&Z^)K^+4^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi8oXiNqXikoXiYvXiY1XiZaXilLXis0XiEi",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a278d219d7d6",
      "text": "就讓我們瞧瞧你們能拿那些強盜怎麼樣吧！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*J^-}^$%^*{^-4^-4^*F^*{^'b^,G^)!^!8^#]^0!^,,^.T^,f^*I^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipKXi19XiQlXip7Xi00Xi00XipGXip7XidiXixHXikhXiE4XiNdXjAhXiwsXi5UXixmXipJXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1aab57838f10",
      "text": "保衛塞德里爾特可不只是在城牆邊打上幾場小規模衝突 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!T^(=^/(^#j^)(^&/^&5^\"A^!)^\"?^,X^\"d^+_^&0^.8^$-^!'^#T^\"n^#;^6'^%:^-h^'* ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFUXig9Xi8oXiNqXikoXiYvXiY1XiJBXiEpXiI/XixYXiJkXitfXiYwXi44XiQtXiEnXiNUXiJuXiM7XjYnXiU6Xi1oXicqIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1dc6e371c405",
      "text": "那麼簡單。這倒是提醒了我，我還有其他要務。別了！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^.T^3y^2a^!\"^(s^!X^,X^$A^.9^*D^$%^*A^$%^.7^$s^!j^!@^(C^+4^!\"^*H^*D^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXi5UXjN5XjJhXiEiXihzXiFYXixYXiRBXi45XipEXiQlXipBXiQlXi43XiRzXiFqXiFAXihDXis0XiEiXipIXipEXipX",
      "byte_length": 72
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8843f3bfe58c",
      "text": "沒錯，但我足以勝任！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%\\^)5^*A^!I^$%^(^^!B^+5^!C^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVcXik1XipBXiFJXiQlXiheXiFCXis1XiFDXipX",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d9ddc895d24c",
      "text": "那幫強盜不過是些半桶水，我手頭還有幾手絕活等著教訓他們呢。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^+}^#]^0!^!)^(x^,X^!8^\"-^7z^%V^*A^$%^$+^)t^.7^$s^#T^$+^-I^%i^'-^-a^,R^-p^!@^*{^+C^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXit9XiNdXjAhXiEpXih4XixYXiE4XiItXjd6XiVWXipBXiQlXiQrXil0Xi43XiRzXiNUXiQrXi1JXiVpXictXi1hXixSXi1wXiFAXip7XitDXiEi",
      "byte_length": 87
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fa407bd92159",
      "text": "在與強盜交戰的所有經驗中，我發現只有一件事是值得掌握的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"d^'p^#]^0!^0P^$(^&Z^$)^$s^'D^.P^!,^*A^$%^&W^&?^\"?^$s^!%^.W^*r^,X^!Z^#e^$;^1>^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJkXidwXiNdXjAhXjBQXiQoXiZaXiQpXiRzXidEXi5QXiEsXipBXiQlXiZXXiY/XiI/XiRzXiElXi5XXipyXixYXiFaXiNlXiQ7XjE+XiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c55ec2fe0d33",
      "text": "關鍵——沒了雙足飛龍，他們什麼都不是。要是奪走他們的飛龍， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.>^9x^*n^*n^%\\^*D^)_^(^^)z^*>^*A^!@^*{^!=^.T^)$^!)^,X^!\"^(C^,X^1,^.&^!@^*{^&Z^)z^*>^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi4+Xjl4XipuXipuXiVcXipEXilfXiheXil6Xio+XipBXiFAXip7XiE9Xi5UXikkXiEpXixYXiEiXihDXixYXjEsXi4mXiFAXip7XiZaXil6Xio+XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0b50517c247a",
      "text": "就連小孩子都能打敗他們。但只要騎上飛龍，他們就致命無比！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*J^.0^#;^+m^#(^)$^'b^$-^$R^!@^*{^!\"^!I^\"?^(C^0K^!'^)z^*>^*A^!@^*{^*J^'o^\"N^%}^,m^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XipKXi4wXiM7XittXiMoXikkXidiXiQtXiRSXiFAXip7XiEiXiFJXiI/XihDXjBLXiEnXil6Xio+XipBXiFAXip7XipKXidvXiJOXiV9XixtXipX",
      "byte_length": 84
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_be9744a75a3d",
      "text": "我想，大概就是預料中的那副慘況吧。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^,1^*A^\"z^,d^*J^,X^.E^/n^!,^&Z^)!^52^,4^,q^*I^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiwxXipBXiJ6XixkXipKXixYXi5FXi9uXiEsXiZaXikhXjUyXiw0XixxXipJXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6e9318e3173f",
      "text": "至少村民們因你們擊敗了強盜而大受鼓舞。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'n^#<^$z^%T^*{^\"]^*F^*{^$F^$R^*D^#]^0!^'W^\"z^\";^*<^9s^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiduXiM8XiR6XiVUXip7XiJdXipGXip7XiRGXiRSXipEXiNdXjAhXidXXiJ6XiI7Xio8XjlzXiEi",
      "byte_length": 57
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_06a1abcda834",
      "text": "不過，我們還需要好長一段時間才能從強盜造成的破壞中 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^(x^*A^$%^*{^.7^)e^(C^+i^)C^!%^.l^$f^)G^$,^'b^#f^#]^0!^(v^$$^&Z^&n^\"v^!, ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXih4XipBXiQlXip7Xi43XillXihDXitpXilDXiElXi5sXiRmXilHXiQsXidiXiNmXiNdXjAhXih2XiQkXiZaXiZuXiJ2XiEsIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_85b80324e0e8",
      "text": "徹底復原。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^18^/^^#g^\"5^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XjE4Xi9eXiNnXiI1XiEi",
      "byte_length": 15
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a0ee12e1bf98",
      "text": "塞德里爾特乃至許多地方最好的戰士。這也是為什麼我會留在這裡， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^/(^#j^)(^&/^&5^/M^'n^-s^\"x^\"e^$]^$q^+i^&Z^$(^+a^!\"^(s^!1^,X^%{^!=^.T^$%^$r^-+^\"d^(s^-j^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi8oXiNqXikoXiYvXiY1Xi9NXiduXi1zXiJ4XiJlXiRdXiRxXitpXiZaXiQoXithXiEiXihzXiExXixYXiV7XiE9Xi5UXiQlXiRyXi0rXiJkXihzXi1qXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3731ec49d6cc",
      "text": "而不是跟他們在一起。村莊需要我的劍術與臂膀來守護。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'W^!)^,X^.+^!@^*{^\"d^!%^.(^!\"^$z^6l^)e^(C^$%^&Z^!|^(<^'p^'k^96^!O^#+^(T^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XidXXiEpXixYXi4rXiFAXip7XiJkXiElXi4oXiEiXiR6XjZsXillXihDXiQlXiZaXiF8Xig8XidwXidrXjk2XiFPXiMrXihUXiEi",
      "byte_length": 75
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5813b4ae707d",
      "text": "要是我真能去就好了！但必須有人留在這裡保衛塞德里爾特，以防 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(C^,X^$%^-2^'b^\"6^*J^+i^*D^*W^!I^#l^)r^$s^!<^-+^\"d^(s^-j^!T^(=^/(^#j^)(^&/^&5^*A^!B^)K ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihDXixYXiQlXi0yXidiXiI2XipKXitpXipEXipXXiFJXiNsXilyXiRzXiE8Xi0rXiJkXihzXi1qXiFUXig9Xi8oXiNqXikoXiYvXiY1XipBXiFCXilLIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ec10b667ed64",
      "text": "遭到另一波襲擊。不過，我祝你們好運。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(}^!u^\">^!%^%c^08^$F^!\"^!)^(x^*A^$%^&v^*F^*{^+i^.4^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xih9XiF1XiI+XiElXiVjXjA4XiRGXiEiXiEpXih4XipBXiQlXiZ2XipGXip7XitpXi40XiEi",
      "byte_length": 54
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9717d3e263f1",
      "text": " 不過，要是有幸能與你們一同打獵，我會感到無比榮幸。你們 ",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^!)^(x^*A^(C^,X^$s^15^'b^'p^*F^*{^!%^\"E^$-^&;^*A^$%^$r^#{^!u^%}^,m^,e^15^!\"^*F^*{ ",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4hKV4oeF4qQV4oQ14sWF4kc14xNV4nYl4ncF4qRl4qe14hJV4iRV4kLV4mO14qQV4kJV4kcl4je14hdV4lfV4sbV4sZV4xNV4hIl4qRl4qeyA=",
      "byte_length": 83
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_52d7d0bc3206",
      "text": "有興趣嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$s^-]^.*^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRzXi1dXi4qXitYXi5W",
      "byte_length": 15
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bad6c0896bd1",
      "text": "太棒了！盧基安說他在村莊西南側發現了獵物的蹤跡。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+f^%1^*D^*W^/<^/'^+p^-x^!@^\"d^$z^6l^-l^\"/^!\\^&W^&?^*D^&;^&4^&Z^(b^(`^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitmXiUxXipEXipXXi88Xi8nXitwXi14XiFAXiJkXiR6XjZsXi1sXiIvXiFcXiZXXiY/XipEXiY7XiY0XiZaXihiXihgXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a24cb467f509",
      "text": "我們應該去那裡看看。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^0`^(M^\"6^)!^-j^*Q^*Q^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7XjBgXihNXiI2XikhXi1qXipRXipRXiEi",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_026c726730b5",
      "text": "好吧，既然如此，你們盡快阻止強盜也是件好事。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+i^*I^*A^,U^&\"^#$^%I^*A^*F^*{^-1^*L^)L^%G^#]^0!^!1^,X^.W^+i^*r^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XitpXipJXipBXixVXiYiXiMkXiVJXipBXipGXip7Xi0xXipMXilMXiVHXiNdXjAhXiExXixYXi5XXitpXipyXiEi",
      "byte_length": 66
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7cf995fa7e11",
      "text": "盧基安是我們的博學者。他專精於植物和諸如此類的研究。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^/<^/'^+p^,X^$%^*{^&Z^/$^+n^'V^!\"^!@^#8^'7^$^^%3^&4^\"O^1]^#$^%I^)w^&Z^9G^-<^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi88Xi8nXitwXixYXiQlXip7XiZaXi8kXituXidWXiEiXiFAXiM4Xic3XiReXiUzXiY0XiJPXjFdXiMkXiVJXil3XiZaXjlHXi08XiEi",
      "byte_length": 78
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bd86e943d248",
      "text": "這可是個我無法拒絕的挑戰！事實上，就算你們想攔我，也別想阻止我去把握 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^\"A^,X^!V^$%^%}^%b^5Q^-I^&Z^,H^$(^*W^*r^#3^!'^*A^*J^-C^*F^*{^,1^9n^$%^*A^!1^*H^,1^)L^%G^$%^\"6^$1^1> ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXiJBXixYXiFWXiQlXiV9XiViXjVRXi1JXiZaXixIXiQoXipXXipyXiMzXiEnXipBXipKXi1DXipGXip7XiwxXjluXiQlXipBXiExXipIXiwxXilMXiVHXiQlXiI2XiQxXjE+IA==",
      "byte_length": 103
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c8567f945438",
      "text": "如此令人熱血沸騰的機會！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#$^%I^*w^!<^&$^(:^5\\^.O^&Z^%>^$r^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiMkXiVJXip3XiE8XiYkXig6XjVcXi5PXiZaXiU+XiRyXipX",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_58e197975a98",
      "text": "打一場自尋死路的戰鬥毫無榮耀可言。要是戰士們白白送死， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$-^!%^\"n^'l^#9^%L^(a^&Z^$(^*,^/t^%}^,e^7D^\"A^1Y^!\"^(C^,X^$(^+a^*{^&X^&X^./^%L^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQtXiElXiJuXidsXiM5XiVMXihhXiZaXiQoXiosXi90XiV9XixlXjdEXiJBXjFZXiEiXihDXixYXiQoXithXip7XiZYXiZYXi4vXiVMXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_123bfc88efc2",
      "text": "村民們只會承受更慘烈的災難。組成一支精幹的小隊，反而更有希望 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$z^%T^*{^\"?^$r^$0^\";^$o^,4^%|^&Z^3P^)a^!\"^2;^$$^!%^$L^'7^,!^&Z^#;^)U^*A^\"9^'W^$o^$s^+{^,] ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiR6XiVUXip7XiI/XiRyXiQwXiI7XiRvXiw0XiV8XiZaXjNQXilhXiEiXjI7XiQkXiElXiRMXic3XiwhXiZaXiM7XilVXipBXiI5XidXXiRvXiRzXit7XixdIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_eb28d04e2e31",
      "text": "對抗他們。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#:^$4^!@^*{^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiM6XiQ0XiFAXip7XiEi",
      "byte_length": 15
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ff17a0410958",
      "text": "我活著就是為了能親眼看到德拉吉被擊潰的那一天！我打算親自率領戰士們 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^%i^-a^*J^,X^%{^*D^'b^(F^&d^*Q^!u^#j^$6^\"D^(@^$F^2-^&Z^)!^!%^+e^*W^$%^$-^-C^(F^'l^22^)s^$(^+a^*{ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiVpXi1hXipKXixYXiV7XipEXidiXihGXiZkXipRXiF1XiNqXiQ2XiJEXihAXiRGXjItXiZaXikhXiElXitlXipXXiQlXiQtXi1DXihGXidsXjIyXilzXiQoXithXip7IA==",
      "byte_length": 100
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c7dc62537a70",
      "text": "奔赴沙場。我們即將斬獲的榮耀，必將使我們的威名傳遍 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^2b^.'^%]^\"n^!\"^$%^*{^\"1^#7^9B^&:^&Z^,e^7D^*A^#l^#7^!N^$%^*{^&Z^#&^\"F^+$^69 ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjJiXi4nXiVdXiJuXiEiXiQlXip7XiIxXiM3XjlCXiY6XiZaXixlXjdEXipBXiNsXiM3XiFOXiQlXip7XiZaXiMmXiJGXiskXjY5IA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_86ac6ec02256",
      "text": "整個阿塔斯。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$T^!V^)M^\"o^$[^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRUXiFWXilNXiJvXiRbXiEi",
      "byte_length": 18
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9cbdc59ade11",
      "text": "你們為何要主動挑起對抗德拉吉的戰爭？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^%{^!L^(C^!-^\"%^,H^.(^#:^$4^#j^$6^\"D^&Z^$(^1I^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiV7XiFMXihDXiEtXiIlXixIXi4oXiM6XiQ0XiNqXiQ2XiJEXiZaXiQoXjFJXi5W",
      "byte_length": 54
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_dc597f479bab",
      "text": "早該有人站出來反抗德拉吉了！這支聯軍 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,V^(M^$s^!<^->^!q^!O^\"9^$4^#j^$6^\"D^*D^*W^(s^$L^-V^.. ",
      "encoded_base64": "XixWXihNXiRzXiE8Xi0+XiFxXiFPXiI5XiQ0XiNqXiQ2XiJEXipEXipXXihzXiRMXi1WXi4uIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fc6dc90e9d6b",
      "text": "本就該在很久以前組建。只要村長同意與你們 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$x^*J^(M^\"d^*K^!.^!B^!z^2;^,'^!\"^\"?^(C^$z^)C^\"E^#z^'p^*F^*{ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiR4XipKXihNXiJkXipLXiEuXiFCXiF6XjI7XiwnXiEiXiI/XihDXiR6XilDXiJFXiN6XidwXipGXip7IA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fc3971bcc226",
      "text": "結盟，我必將親自率領我們的戰士奔赴沙場！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'@^-0^*A^$%^#l^#7^(F^'l^22^)s^$%^*{^&Z^$(^+a^2b^.'^%]^\"n^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XidAXi0wXipBXiQlXiNsXiM3XihGXidsXjIyXilzXiQlXip7XiZaXiQoXithXjJiXi4nXiVdXiJuXipX",
      "byte_length": 60
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c3422fa480c9",
      "text": "好了，我們該別再閒扯，開始尋找那頭怪物了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+i^*D^*A^$%^*{^(M^*H^!l^6A^.e^*A^)F^+k^#9^$/^)!^)t^#s^&4^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XitpXipEXipBXiQlXip7XihNXipIXiFsXjZBXi5lXipBXilGXitrXiM5XiQvXikhXil0XiNzXiY0XipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 63
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8f0e9facc834",
      "text": "失陪了。我必須去負責 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"|^8.^*D^!\"^$%^#l^)r^\"6^(W^0> ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJ8XjguXipEXiEiXiQlXiNsXilyXiI2XihXXjA+IA==",
      "byte_length": 31
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b23d08ceae97",
      "text": "抵禦下一次襲擊的準備工作。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$5^&{^!(^!%^%D^08^$F^&Z^,x^+\"^+y^!M^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQ1XiZ7XiEoXiElXiVEXjA4XiRGXiZaXix4XisiXit5XiFNXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 40
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7eadcf03c7aa",
      "text": "對抗德拉吉戰事的準備工作。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#:^$4^#j^$6^\"D^$(^*r^&Z^,x^+\"^+y^!M^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiM6XiQ0XiNqXiQ2XiJEXiQoXipyXiZaXix4XisiXit5XiFNXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 40
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5732397f6983",
      "text": "重建村莊的準備工程。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^))^,'^$z^6l^&Z^,x^+\"^+y^'#^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XikpXiwnXiR6XjZsXiZaXix4XisiXit5XicjXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 31
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6f949a21e151",
      "text": "嘿！這邊。洞穴在這邊。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+\\^*W^(s^.8^!\"^%h^'&^\"d^(s^.8^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XitcXipXXihzXi44XiEiXiVoXicmXiJkXihzXi44XiEi",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0f3c48499206",
      "text": "快點！你們就像平常一樣在浪費時間。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*L^*;^*W^*F^*{^*J^!`^0Y^#O^!%^,f^\"d^,r^.\"^$f^)G^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipMXio7XipXXipGXip7XipKXiFgXjBZXiNPXiElXixmXiJkXixyXi4iXiRmXilHXiEi",
      "byte_length": 51
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_917744389d94",
      "text": "你們是要我帶你們去洞穴入口嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^,X^(C^$%^#N^*F^*{^\"6^%h^'&^!f^\"<^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XixYXihDXiQlXiNOXipGXip7XiI2XiVoXicmXiFmXiI8XitYXi5W",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_35ac8e53e817",
      "text": "那就跟緊我。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^*J^.+^0r^$%^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXipKXi4rXjByXiQlXiEi",
      "byte_length": 18
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ee3fe6d81f77",
      "text": "  跟我說說關於那座洞穴的事。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^.+^$%^-x^-x^.>^$^^)!^/_^%h^'&^&Z^*r^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLiteJCVeLXheLXheLj5eJF5eKSFeL19eJWheJyZeJlpeKnJeISI=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c448800b160f",
      "text": "你們這次又想幹嘛？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^(s^%D^+;^,1^,!^+Y^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XihzXiVEXis7XiwxXiwhXitZXi5W",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cde49ad88a1f",
      "text": "又怎麼了？我這不是正在帶你們去洞穴入口嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+;^,,^.T^*D^.V^$%^(s^!)^,X^%H^\"d^#N^*F^*{^\"6^%h^'&^!f^\"<^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "Xis7XiwsXi5UXipEXi5WXiQlXihzXiEpXixYXiVIXiJkXiNOXipGXip7XiI2XiVoXicmXiFmXiI8XitYXi5W",
      "byte_length": 63
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4702bc38215d",
      "text": "  我想跟你談談。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^,1^.+^*F^0;^0;^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeLDFeLiteKkZeMDteMDteISI=",
      "byte_length": 23
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4c195bec51f8",
      "text": "  我想我終究用不著你的幫忙了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^,1^$%^-H^-<^&H^!)^-a^*F^&Z^+}^,+^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeLDFeJCVeLUheLTxeJkheISleLWFeKkZeJlpeK31eLCteKkReISI=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8cb6fc5dc470",
      "text": "什麼事？別打擾我！我沒時間應付打擾，也沒空理會陌生人！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!=^.T^*r^.V^*H^$-^$K^$%^*W^$%^%\\^$f^)G^0`^*u^$-^$K^*A^!1^%\\^'(^&A^$r^9z^&F^!<^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiE9Xi5UXipyXi5WXipIXiQtXiRLXiQlXipXXiQlXiVcXiRmXilHXjBgXip1XiQtXiRLXipBXiExXiVcXicoXiZBXiRyXjl6XiZGXiE8XipX",
      "byte_length": 81
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ec388ca1bd5a",
      "text": "你們幹嘛不去煩 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^,!^+Y^!)^\"6^-! ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiwhXitZXiEpXiI2Xi0hIA==",
      "byte_length": 22
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_89ef3c196d38",
      "text": "身材相當的人",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(c^$y^&a^&N^&Z^!<",
      "encoded_base64": "XihjXiR5XiZhXiZOXiZaXiE8",
      "byte_length": 18
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_340a364a0f32",
      "text": "別人",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*H^!<",
      "encoded_base64": "XipIXiE8",
      "byte_length": 6
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2a6c20256052",
      "text": "。我手頭還有事要做。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!\"^$%^$+^)t^.7^$s^*r^(C^*~^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEiXiQlXiQrXil0Xi43XiRzXipyXihDXip+XiEi",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9cff1a88661a",
      "text": "  你能幫我們對付強盜嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^'b^+}^$%^*{^#:^*u^#]^0!^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeJ2JeK31eJCVeKnteIzpeKnVeI11eMCFeK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_664463521333",
      "text": "  查雅說你能幫上我的忙。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^%&^9:^-x^*F^'b^+}^!'^$%^&Z^,+^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJSZeOTpeLXheKkZeJ2JeK31eISdeJCVeJlpeLCteISI=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a32e6d2e41c6",
      "text": "  拜託，我不會耽誤你太多時間的。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^,E^-q^*A^$%^!)^$r^-T^(P^*F^+f^\"x^$f^)G^&Z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLEVeLXFeKkFeJCVeISleJHJeLVReKFBeKkZeK2ZeInheJGZeKUdeJlpeISI=",
      "byte_length": 47
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9fbec9cded9b",
      "text": "  不，她不能，你這隻雜種康克！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^!)^*A^+h^!)^'b^*A^*F^(s^)[^0G^'$^5N^!d^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeISleKkFeK2heISleJ2JeKkFeKkZeKHNeKVteMEdeJyReNU5eIWReKlc=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_584f72d6d4e0",
      "text": "  好好回答，不然我把你打成碎渣！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^+i^+i^\"\\^-B^*A^!)^&\"^$%^$1^*F^$-^$$^&o^,v^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeK2leK2leIlxeLUJeKkFeISleJiJeJCVeJDFeKkZeJC1eJCReJm9eLHZeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 47
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_88506acd8be6",
      "text": "好，我走就是了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+i^*A^$%^.&^*J^,X^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XitpXipBXiQlXi4mXipKXixYXipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_be1b9cba9243",
      "text": "而我是克里科爾。現在，你們能讓我清靜一下了嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'W^$%^,X^!d^)(^'!^&/^!\"^&?^\"d^*A^*F^*{^'b^-}^$%^,u^)h^!%^!(^*D^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XidXXiQlXixYXiFkXikoXichXiYvXiEiXiY/XiJkXipBXipGXip7XidiXi19XiQlXix1XiloXiElXiEoXipEXitYXi5W",
      "byte_length": 69
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7bbaada8caa0",
      "text": "正合我意……反正也是浪費時間。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%H^\"C^$%^#z^*o^*o^\"9^%H^!1^,X^,r^.\"^$f^)G^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVIXiJDXiQlXiN6XipvXipvXiI5XiVIXiExXixYXixyXi4iXiRmXilHXiEi",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1acf39c5aee5",
      "text": "我就該猜到的。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*J^(M^-'^!u^&Z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXipKXihNXi0nXiF1XiZaXiEi",
      "byte_length": 21
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1aa3370cb3e9",
      "text": "我忙著繪製地圖呢，哪有閒工夫去管什麼強盜。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^,+^-a^0,^(B^\"e^\"b^+C^*A^+I^$s^6A^+y^\"{^\"6^-D^!=^.T^#]^0!^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiwrXi1hXjAsXihCXiJlXiJiXitDXipBXitJXiRzXjZBXit5XiJ7XiI2Xi1EXiE9Xi5UXiNdXjAhXiEi",
      "byte_length": 63
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_73227c5975ea",
      "text": "我沒時間陪你們胡鬧！現在，滾一邊去！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^%\\^$f^)G^8.^*F^*{^3}^6G^*W^&?^\"d^*A^,z^!%^.8^\"6^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiVcXiRmXilHXjguXipGXip7XjN9XjZHXipXXiY/XiJkXipBXix6XiElXi44XiI2XipX",
      "byte_length": 54
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_613d2c62ce9d",
      "text": "查雅對我一直很仁慈，准許我在繪製地圖期間寄宿在 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%&^9:^#:^$%^!%^&`^*K^37^3H^*A^/Q^-s^$%^\"d^0,^(B^\"e^\"b^$u^)G^9k^7+^\"d ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiUmXjk6XiM6XiQlXiElXiZgXipLXjM3XjNIXipBXi9RXi1zXiQlXiJkXjAsXihCXiJlXiJiXiR1XilHXjlrXjcrXiJkIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0e1bfbf6821c",
      "text": "她的村莊裡，但我實在太忙了，可沒空隨便聽憑一個 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+h^&Z^$z^6l^-j^*A^!I^$%^#3^\"d^+f^,+^*D^*A^\"A^%\\^'(^)X^!R^-X^,5^!%^!V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitoXiZaXiR6XjZsXi1qXipBXiFJXiQlXiMzXiJkXitmXiwrXipEXipBXiJBXiVcXicoXilYXiFSXi1YXiw1XiElXiFWIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0810b857388e",
      "text": "毛頭新手的使喚而到處亂跑。難道她不能幫你們嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%R^)t^$\\^$+^&Z^!N^\"U^'W^!u^(,^!3^(_^!\"^)a^(y^+h^!)^'b^+}^*F^*{^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVSXil0XiRcXiQrXiZaXiFOXiJVXidXXiF1XigsXiEzXihfXiEiXilhXih5XitoXiEpXidiXit9XipGXip7XitYXi5W",
      "byte_length": 69
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_70290ecb2714",
      "text": "好吧。看在查雅的面子上，我可以跟你們聊聊，但我可沒 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+i^*I^!\"^*Q^\"d^%&^9:^&Z^)j^#(^!'^*A^$%^\"A^!B^.+^*F^*{^-U^-U^*A^!I^$%^\"A^%\\ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitpXipJXiEiXipRXiJkXiUmXjk6XiZaXilqXiMoXiEnXipBXiQlXiJBXiFCXi4rXipGXip7Xi1VXi1VXipBXiFJXiQlXiJBXiVcIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_51b658180b46",
      "text": "答應會提供任何幫助。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-B^0`^$r^$A^!P^!C^!L^+}^\"#^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi1CXjBgXiRyXiRBXiFQXiFDXiFMXit9XiIjXiEi",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_aee01e47dc91",
      "text": "你們只有一分鐘。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^\"?^$s^!%^!s^9y^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiI/XiRzXiElXiFzXjl5XiEi",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_095dc18e58fb",
      "text": "你們到底想要什麼？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^!u^/^^,1^(C^!=^.T^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiF1Xi9eXiwxXihDXiE9Xi5UXi5W",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_de547164f53b",
      "text": "很好。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*K^+i^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipLXitpXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 10
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e10dd1b791a2",
      "text": "別再來煩我了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*H^!l^!O^-!^$%^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipIXiFsXiFPXi0hXiQlXipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 21
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a17c32b2323d",
      "text": "我已經在你們身上浪費太多時間了！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^#J^'D^\"d^*F^*{^(c^!'^,r^.\"^+f^\"x^$f^)G^*D^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiNKXidEXiJkXipGXip7XihjXiEnXixyXi4iXitmXiJ4XiRmXilHXipEXipX",
      "byte_length": 48
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_77bd1df17906",
      "text": "  查雅說你知道登上城堡的路徑。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^%&^9:^-x^*F^&h^(y^/;^!'^+_^\"m^&Z^(a^#c^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJSZeOTpeLXheKkZeJmheKHleLzteISdeK19eIm1eJlpeKGFeI2NeISI=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_81524537160c",
      "text": "  洞穴入口在哪裡？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^%h^'&^!f^\"<^\"d^+I^-j^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJWheJyZeIWZeIjxeImReK0leLWpeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8d14410219f2",
      "text": "  你知道我能不能攀爬上那座城堡嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^&h^(y^$%^'b^!)^'b^8|^/y^!'^)!^/_^+_^\"m^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeJmheKHleJCVeJ2JeISleJ2JeOHxeL3leISdeKSFeL19eK19eIm1eK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 50
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a88e018bb87b",
      "text": "  你能帶我去看洞穴入口嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^'b^#N^$%^\"6^*Q^%h^'&^!f^\"<^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeJ2JeI05eJCVeIjZeKlFeJWheJyZeIWZeIjxeK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c4732ddc1c85",
      "text": "  我需要關於強盜的情報。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^)e^(C^.>^$^^#]^0!^&Z^,0^+`^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeKWVeKENeLj5eJF5eI11eMCFeJlpeLDBeK2BeISI=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0bba8e21eb52",
      "text": "很抱歉打擾你了。再見。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*K^,@^,h^$-^$K^*F^*D^!\"^!l^-m^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipLXixAXixoXiQtXiRLXipGXipEXiEiXiFsXi1tXiEi",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fa540047b53d",
      "text": "感謝你的幫助。再見。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#{^-z^*F^&Z^+}^\"#^!\"^!l^-m^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiN7Xi16XipGXiZaXit9XiIjXiEiXiFsXi1tXiEi",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fd8baa1cb500",
      "text": "我當然知道。我早就把附近的洞穴全都勘測繪製完成了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^&N^&\"^&h^(y^!\"^$%^,V^*J^$1^.?^(l^&Z^%h^'&^!h^)$^9.^%p^0,^(B^#,^$$^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiZOXiYiXiZoXih5XiEiXiQlXixWXipKXiQxXi4/XihsXiZaXiVoXicmXiFoXikkXjkuXiVwXjAsXihCXiMsXiQkXipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 75
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_547463024dc2",
      "text": "不可能，根本沒有路能爬上那座山，除非你有一半 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^\"A^'b^*A^%)^$x^%\\^$s^(a^'b^/y^!'^)!^/_^11^*A^)Q^)i^*F^$s^!%^\"- ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXiJBXidiXipBXiUpXiR4XiVcXiRzXihhXidiXi95XiEnXikhXi9fXjExXipBXilRXilpXipGXiRzXiElXiItIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9dbfacc40f0a",
      "text": "懸崖松鼠的血統。唯一的路徑是穿透 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^0a^9l^9o^*=^&Z^(:^'B^!\"^+O^!%^&Z^(a^#c^,X^')^(q ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjBhXjlsXjlvXio9XiZaXig6XidCXiEiXitPXiElXiZaXihhXiNjXixYXicpXihxIA==",
      "byte_length": 49
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ce77d6697333",
      "text": "山體深處。這附近有一處洞穴直接通往城堡入口。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^11^**^2*^(,^!\"^(s^.?^(l^$s^!%^(,^%h^'&^&`^$?^(t^,)^+_^\"m^!f^\"<^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XjExXioqXjIqXigsXiEiXihzXi4/XihsXiRzXiElXigsXiVoXicmXiZgXiQ/Xih0XiwpXitfXiJtXiFmXiI8XiEi",
      "byte_length": 66
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9f1f430c22a4",
      "text": "洞穴入口位於村莊北側的懸崖峭壁上。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%h^'&^!f^\"<^!J^$^^$z^6l^+6^!\\^&Z^0a^9l^9T^*\\^!'^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVoXicmXiFmXiI8XiFKXiReXiR6XjZsXis2XiFcXiZaXjBhXjlsXjlUXipcXiEnXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_94a5522caf41",
      "text": "它就隱藏在一處凸起的岩石後面——你們絕對不會錯過的。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+o^*J^)Y^-f^\"d^!%^(,^9i^.(^&Z^#D^&k^#b^)j^*n^*n^*F^*{^-I^#:^!)^$r^)5^(x^&Z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XitvXipKXilZXi1mXiJkXiElXigsXjlpXi4oXiZaXiNEXiZrXiNiXilqXipuXipuXipGXip7Xi1JXiM6XiEpXiRyXik1Xih4XiZaXiEi",
      "byte_length": 78
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1adbec1e9e47",
      "text": "我就帶你們去看洞口，只要你們別再來煩我。跟我來， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*J^#N^*F^*{^\"6^*Q^%h^\"<^*A^\"?^(C^*F^*{^*H^!l^!O^-!^$%^!\"^.+^$%^!O^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXipKXiNOXipGXip7XiI2XipRXiVoXiI8XipBXiI/XihDXipGXip7XipIXiFsXiFPXi0hXiQlXiEiXi4rXiQlXiFPXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_559d320d7eed",
      "text": "而且動作快點！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'W^!*^\"%^!M^*L^*;^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XidXXiEqXiIlXiFNXipMXio7XipX",
      "byte_length": 21
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_eaa4b96e80af",
      "text": "你們需要的不是嚮導，而是個保姆！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^)e^(C^&Z^!)^,X^9j^10^*A^'W^,X^!V^!T^#%^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XillXihDXiZaXiEpXixYXjlqXjEwXipBXidXXixYXiFWXiFUXiMlXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 49
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f15c48b9c06b",
      "text": "我手頭有夠多事情要做，沒空牽著你們的手亦步亦趨。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^$+^)t^$s^+d^\"x^*r^,0^(C^*~^*A^%\\^'(^5e^-a^*F^*{^&Z^$+^7#^,i^7#^9v^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiQrXil0XiRzXitkXiJ4XipyXiwwXihDXip+XipBXiVcXicoXjVlXi1hXipGXip7XiZaXiQrXjcjXixpXjcjXjl2XiEi",
      "byte_length": 72
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_da58e8986ff4",
      "text": "他們草菅人命。他們讓我勘測這片山脈的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^*{^*f^9t^!<^\"N^!\"^!@^*{^-}^$%^9.^%p^(s^&1^11^6i^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXip7XipmXjl0XiE8XiJOXiEiXiFAXip7Xi19XiQlXjkuXiVwXihzXiYxXjExXjZpXiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4e32f25da3cb",
      "text": "工作困難重重。他們醜陋可憎。但何需我對你們說這些",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+y^!M^\"^^)a^))^))^!\"^!@^*{^2O^2P^\"A^9m^!\"^!I^!L^)e^$%^#:^*F^*{^-x^(s^!8",
      "encoded_base64": "Xit5XiFNXiJeXilhXikpXikpXiEiXiFAXip7XjJPXjJQXiJBXjltXiEiXiFJXiFMXillXiQlXiM6XipGXip7Xi14XihzXiE4",
      "byte_length": 72
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_dba7dace95ba",
      "text": "。查雅對那些強盜的了解比我多得多。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!\"^%&^9:^#:^)!^!8^#]^0!^&Z^*D^(I^,m^$%^\"x^#e^\"x^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEiXiUmXjk6XiM6XikhXiE4XiNdXjAhXiZaXipEXihJXixtXiQlXiJ4XiNlXiJ4XiEi",
      "byte_length": 51
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_516e4a43a773",
      "text": "，而且你們的時間所剩無幾了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*A^'W^!*^*F^*{^&Z^$f^)G^$)^8U^%}^#T^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipBXidXXiEqXipGXip7XiZaXiRmXilHXiQpXjhVXiV9XiNUXipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ed1b0234e800",
      "text": "要是我把所知道的都告訴你們，你們保證不再來糾纏我嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(C^,X^$%^$1^$)^&h^(y^&Z^)$^+B^-t^*F^*{^*A^*F^*{^!T^-{^!)^!l^!O^3U^'N^$%^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XihDXixYXiQlXiQxXiQpXiZoXih5XiZaXikkXitCXi10XipGXip7XipBXipGXip7XiFUXi17XiEpXiFsXiFPXjNVXidOXiQlXitYXi5W",
      "byte_length": 78
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0121af7c2819",
      "text": "好吧。你們到底想知道些什麼？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+i^*I^!\"^*F^*{^!u^/^^,1^&h^(y^!8^!=^.T^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XitpXipJXiEiXipGXip7XiF1Xi9eXiwxXiZoXih5XiE4XiE9Xi5UXi5W",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a7392b7f9c80",
      "text": "那我就跟你們沒什麼好說的了。再見。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^$%^*J^.+^*F^*{^%\\^!=^.T^+i^-x^&Z^*D^!\"^!l^-m^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXiQlXipKXi4rXipGXip7XiVcXiE9Xi5UXitpXi14XiZaXipEXiEiXiFsXi1tXiEi",
      "byte_length": 51
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f644bf45c388",
      "text": "那座洞穴跟其他洞穴沒什麼兩樣，只不過剛好通往 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^/_^%h^'&^.+^!j^!@^%h^'&^%\\^!=^.T^!i^,f^*A^\"?^!)^(x^+0^+i^(t^,) ",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXi9fXiVoXicmXi4rXiFqXiFAXiVoXicmXiVcXiE9Xi5UXiFpXixmXipBXiI/XiEpXih4XiswXitpXih0XiwpIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8b85c6aa77db",
      "text": "那座城堡。你們還需要知道些什麼？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^/_^+_^\"m^!\"^*F^*{^.7^)e^(C^&h^(y^!8^!=^.T^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXi9fXitfXiJtXiEiXipGXip7Xi43XillXihDXiZoXih5XiE4XiE9Xi5UXi5W",
      "byte_length": 48
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e30091aabe21",
      "text": "我們直接動身吧。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^&`^$?^\"%^(c^*I^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7XiZgXiQ/XiIlXihjXipJXiEi",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_289ef9bc5c15",
      "text": "我保證絕不會讓它變成習慣的。再會",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^!T^-{^-I^!)^$r^-}^+o^(U^$$^3{^$!^&Z^!\"^!l^$r",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiFUXi17Xi1JXiEpXiRyXi19XitvXihVXiQkXjN7XiQhXiZaXiEiXiFsXiRy",
      "byte_length": 48
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2da832f1fd63",
      "text": "我忙著繪製這些山脈的地圖——要是旁人別總是跑來 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^,+^-a^0,^(B^(s^!8^11^6i^&Z^\"e^\"b^*n^*n^(C^,X^.h^!<^*H^-M^,X^(_^!O ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiwrXi1hXjAsXihCXihzXiE4XjExXjZpXiZaXiJlXiJiXipuXipuXihDXixYXi5oXiE8XipIXi1NXixYXihfXiFPIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_50cdd9cadb93",
      "text": "煩我，我早就把它們畫完了！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-!^$%^*A^$%^,V^*J^$1^+o^*{^-,^#,^*D^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi0hXiQlXipBXiQlXixWXipKXiQxXitvXip7Xi0sXiMsXipEXipX",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9503356508be",
      "text": "  你在勘測繪製些什麼？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^\"d^9.^%p^0,^(B^!8^!=^.T^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeImReOS5eJXBeMCxeKEJeITheIT1eLlReLlY=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ffa70332a1a6",
      "text": "  我能看看嗎？地圖正是我所需要的。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^'b^*Q^*Q^+X^.V^\"e^\"b^%H^,X^$%^$)^)e^(C^&Z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeJ2JeKlFeKlFeK1heLlZeImVeImJeJUheLFheJCVeJCleKWVeKENeJlpeISI=",
      "byte_length": 50
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_69436e744f5e",
      "text": "  你熟悉山區周圍的路徑嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^-\"^2h^11^\"+^\"L^\"`^&Z^(a^#c^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeLSJeMmheMTFeIiteIkxeImBeJlpeKGFeI2NeK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2b138cc2d937",
      "text": "  我該如何找到城堡入口？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^(M^#$^!L^$/^!u^+_^\"m^!f^\"<^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeKE1eIyReIUxeJC9eIXVeK19eIm1eIWZeIjxeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_acc4d8f8a132",
      "text": "  你願意跟我一起去城堡嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^.H^#z^.+^$%^!%^.(^\"6^+_^\"m^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeLkheI3peLiteJCVeISVeLiheIjZeK19eIm1eK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2aa6eb32dd78",
      "text": "  至少告訴我該怎麼走才不會迷路？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^'n^#<^+B^-t^$%^(M^,,^.T^.&^$,^!)^$r^(n^(a^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJ25eIzxeK0JeLXReJCVeKE1eLCxeLlReLiZeJCxeISleJHJeKG5eKGFeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 47
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fe18a41005d0",
      "text": "  為什麼那座城堡聞起來那麼臭？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^%{^!=^.T^)!^/_^+_^\"m^4^^.(^!O^)!^.T^'m^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJXteIT1eLlReKSFeL19eK19eIm1eNF5eLiheIU9eKSFeLlReJ21eLlY=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3509d6914ff7",
      "text": "  洞穴裡預期會遇到些什麼？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^%h^'&^-j^.E^$u^$r^.2^!u^!8^!=^.T^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJWheJyZeLWpeLkVeJHVeJHJeLjJeIXVeITheIT1eLlReLlY=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d2b6b8d37809",
      "text": "  有什麼東西住在洞穴裡嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$s^!=^.T^,`^-l^*z^\"d^%h^'&^-j^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJHNeIT1eLlReLGBeLWxeKnpeImReJWheJyZeLWpeK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_96ee29640443",
      "text": "  多謝了。你可真是一座知識的活泉啊。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^\"x^-z^*D^!\"^*F^\"A^-2^,X^!%^/_^&h^(R^&Z^%i^%a^+Q^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeInheLXpeKkReISJeKkZeIkFeLTJeLFheISVeL19eJmheKFJeJlpeJWleJWFeK1FeISI=",
      "byte_length": 53
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_49758550189e",
      "text": "我正在勘測山脈！這我早就告訴過你們了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^%H^\"d^9.^%p^11^6i^*W^(s^$%^,V^*J^+B^-t^(x^*F^*{^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiVIXiJkXjkuXiVwXjExXjZpXipXXihzXiQlXixWXipKXitCXi10Xih4XipGXip7XipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f4e3ff7297f3",
      "text": "我可沒時間跟你們閒磕牙。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^\"A^%\\^$f^)G^.+^*F^*{^6A^9q^&3^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiJBXiVcXiRmXilHXi4rXipGXip7XjZBXjlxXiYzXiEi",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8b50d38329d1",
      "text": "你們該做的是去找別人打擾。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^(M^*~^&Z^,X^\"6^$/^*H^!<^$-^$K^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XihNXip+XiZaXixYXiI2XiQvXipIXiE8XiQtXiRLXiEi",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_34958349e0b5",
      "text": "我當然熟悉山區周圍的路！我剛才不是才告訴過你們，我正在 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^&N^&\"^-\"^2h^11^\"+^\"L^\"`^&Z^(a^*W^$%^+0^$,^!)^,X^$,^+B^-t^(x^*F^*{^*A^$%^%H^\"d ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiZOXiYiXi0iXjJoXjExXiIrXiJMXiJgXiZaXihhXipXXiQlXiswXiQsXiEpXixYXiQsXitCXi10Xih4XipGXip7XipBXiQlXiVIXiJkIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_dd3a50139fec",
      "text": "勘測繪製它們嗎，不是嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^9.^%p^0,^(B^+o^*{^+X^*A^!)^,X^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XjkuXiVwXjAsXihCXitvXip7XitYXipBXiEpXixYXitYXi5W",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8ea4a2dbe6b7",
      "text": "依我看這是個好主意。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!Q^$%^*Q^(s^,X^!V^+i^!-^#z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFRXiQlXipRXihzXixYXiFWXitpXiEtXiN6XiEi",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_77b52346ed80",
      "text": "順著你的鼻子走。從那座城堡傳來的惡臭，濃烈到足以把 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.D^-a^*F^&Z^4q^#(^.&^!\"^#f^)!^/_^+_^\"m^+$^!O^&Z^#y^'m^*A^%w^%|^!u^(^^!B^$1 ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi5EXi1hXipGXiZaXjRxXiMoXi4mXiEiXiNmXikhXi9fXitfXiJtXiskXiFPXiZaXiN5XidtXipBXiV3XiV8XiF1XiheXiFCXiQxIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4fb56dc10a6e",
      "text": "麥基洛特巨蜥都薰得調頭折返！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^/L^/'^%g^&5^#H^(2^)$^9u^#e^(Q^)t^,?^7J^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi9MXi8nXiVnXiY1XiNIXigyXikkXjl1XiNlXihRXil0Xiw/XjdKXipX",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9fd3dd8d3c39",
      "text": "我早就把那些洞穴勘測完了。我根本沒有任何理由 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^,V^*J^$1^)!^!8^%h^'&^9.^%p^#,^*D^!\"^$%^%)^$x^%\\^$s^!C^!L^&A^&I ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXixWXipKXiQxXikhXiE4XiVoXicmXjkuXiVwXiMsXipEXiEiXiQlXiUpXiR4XiVcXiRzXiFDXiFMXiZBXiZJIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c2785331ae83",
      "text": "再回去走上一趟。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!l^\"\\^\"6^.&^!'^!%^8)^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFsXiJcXiI2Xi4mXiEnXiElXjgpXiEi",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3e86d7954a53",
      "text": "一般原則上，你們最好往北邊方向前進。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!%^'r^\"5^!x^!'^*A^*F^*{^$q^+i^,)^+6^.8^$]^+?^!z^(w^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiElXidyXiI1XiF4XiEnXipBXipGXip7XiRxXitpXiwpXis2Xi44XiRdXis/XiF6Xih3XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2f651d750760",
      "text": "途中有幾個棘手的地方，但你們的身手或許足以 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^3.^!,^$s^#T^!V^9p^$+^&Z^\"e^$]^*A^!I^*F^*{^&Z^(c^$+^$'^-s^(^^!B ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjMuXiEsXiRzXiNUXiFWXjlwXiQrXiZaXiJlXiRdXipBXiFJXipGXip7XiZaXihjXiQrXiQnXi1zXiheXiFCIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3a842f01dff9",
      "text": "應付得來。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^0`^*u^#e^!O^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XjBgXip1XiNlXiFPXiEi",
      "byte_length": 15
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e7726287da5c",
      "text": "到處都是雙足飛龍是原因之一，但還有一種氣味比那更糟糕。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!u^(,^)$^,X^)_^(^^)z^*>^,X^\"5^\"]^!/^!%^*A^!I^.7^$s^!%^'$^%U^1n^,m^)!^$o^-E^4\\^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiF1XigsXikkXixYXilfXiheXil6Xio+XixYXiI1XiJdXiEvXiElXipBXiFJXi43XiRzXiElXickXiVVXjFuXixtXikhXiRvXi1FXjRcXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6fa2b2d65492",
      "text": "我不知道那到底是什麼，也沒打算去深究——那味道讓我想起 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^!)^&h^(y^)!^!u^/^^,X^!=^.T^*A^!1^%\\^$-^-C^\"6^2*^-<^*n^*n^)!^1n^(y^-}^$%^,1^.( ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiEpXiZoXih5XikhXiF1Xi9eXixYXiE9Xi5UXipBXiExXiVcXiQtXi1DXiI2XjIqXi08XipuXipuXikhXjFuXih5Xi19XiQlXiwxXi4oIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_296b313f86aa",
      "text": "徹底腐爛發臭的肉庫。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^18^/^^0/^&-^&W^'m^&Z^'^^,#^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XjE4Xi9eXjAvXiYtXiZXXidtXiZaXideXiwjXiEi",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1f3e3db80c75",
      "text": "我根本一點都不在乎裡面住著什麼。你們何不自己親自 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^%)^$x^!%^*;^)$^!)^\"d^!0^-j^)j^*z^-a^!=^.T^!\"^*F^*{^!L^!)^'l^#I^(F^'l ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiUpXiR4XiElXio7XikkXiEpXiJkXiEwXi1qXilqXip6Xi1hXiE9Xi5UXiEiXipGXip7XiFMXiEpXidsXiNJXihGXidsIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f5be42315f14",
      "text": "去看看？最好看久一點別回來。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"6^*Q^*Q^.V^$q^+i^*Q^!.^!%^*;^*H^\"\\^!O^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiI2XipRXipRXi5WXiRxXitpXipRXiEuXiElXio7XipIXiJcXiFPXiEi",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_75f70c93d119",
      "text": "洞穴裡住著很多東西，其中有些相當危險。我 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%h^'&^-j^*z^-a^*K^\"x^,`^-l^*A^!j^!,^$s^!8^&a^&N^2\\^*m^!\"^$% ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVoXicmXi1qXip6Xi1hXipLXiJ4XixgXi1sXipBXiFqXiEsXiRzXiE4XiZhXiZOXjJcXiptXiEiXiQlIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0fd2ff889112",
      "text": "不去招惹牠們，牠們也不會來招惹我——你們真該好好 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^\"6^,D^3s^-#^*{^*A^-#^*{^!1^!)^$r^!O^,D^3s^$%^*n^*n^*F^*{^-2^(M^+i^+i ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXiI2XixEXjNzXi0jXip7XipBXi0jXip7XiExXiEpXiRyXiFPXixEXjNzXiQlXipuXipuXipGXip7Xi0yXihNXitpXitpIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7b59a9292961",
      "text": "學學這個教訓。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+n^+n^(s^!V^,R^-p^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XituXituXihzXiFWXixSXi1wXiEi",
      "byte_length": 21
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_559187599e0c",
      "text": "感謝你們救了我們！能擊退那些雙足飛龍騎士，你們真是了不起的戰士。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#{^-z^*F^*{^,Q^*D^$%^*{^*W^'b^$F^*V^)!^!8^)_^(^^)z^*>^0K^+a^*A^*F^*{^-2^,X^*D^!)^.(^&Z^$(^+a^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiN7Xi16XipGXip7XixRXipEXiQlXip7XipXXidiXiRGXipWXikhXiE4XilfXiheXil6Xio+XjBLXithXipBXipGXip7Xi0yXixYXipEXiEpXi4oXiZaXiQoXithXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 97
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4c9500d28ebb",
      "text": "我們的首領一定會想見見你們。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^&Z^)~^)s^!%^#.^$r^,1^-m^-m^*F^*{^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7XiZaXil+XilzXiElXiMuXiRyXiwxXi1tXi1tXipGXip7XiEi",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7b6c90ef021b",
      "text": "  你們的首領是誰？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^*{^&Z^)~^)s^,X^-y^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeKnteJlpeKX5eKXNeLFheLXleLlY=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bcddcf8a2436",
      "text": "  這是什麼村莊？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^(s^,X^!=^.T^$z^6l^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKHNeLFheIT1eLlReJHpeNmxeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 23
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cf801277395d",
      "text": "  雙足飛龍為何要襲擊你們的村莊？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^)_^(^^)z^*>^%{^!L^(C^08^$F^*F^*{^&Z^$z^6l^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKV9eKF5eKXpeKj5eJXteIUxeKENeMDheJEZeKkZeKnteJlpeJHpeNmxeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 47
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_78356a94a77f",
      "text": "  這些雙足飛龍是從哪裡來的？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^(s^!8^)_^(^^)z^*>^,X^#f^+I^-j^!O^&Z^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKHNeITheKV9eKF5eKXpeKj5eLFheI2ZeK0leLWpeIU9eJlpeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_96157d0404d3",
      "text": "  我要怎麼前往那座城堡？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^(C^,,^.T^!z^,)^)!^/_^+_^\"m^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeKENeLCxeLlReIXpeLCleKSFeL19eK19eIm1eLlY=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_10e4412b1fd5",
      "text": "她在村莊北邊的大屋裡。如果需要的話， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+h^\"d^$z^6l^+6^.8^&Z^\"z^8y^-j^!\"^#$^%!^)e^(C^&Z^-v^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitoXiJkXiR6XjZsXis2Xi44XiZaXiJ6Xjh5Xi1qXiEiXiMkXiUhXillXihDXiZaXi12XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ef9b05eae056",
      "text": "我可以為你們帶路？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^\"A^!B^%{^*F^*{^#N^(a^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiJBXiFCXiV7XipGXip7XiNOXihhXi5W",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1ae34da9e97b",
      "text": "我知道她一定會想親自向你們道謝。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^&h^(y^+h^!%^#.^$r^,1^(F^'l^+?^*F^*{^(y^-z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiZoXih5XitoXiElXiMuXiRyXiwxXihGXidsXis/XipGXip7Xih5Xi16XiEi",
      "byte_length": 48
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_aad21fb4e04f",
      "text": "她名叫查雅。在逃出生天來到這裡之前，她曾是德拉吉角鬥場的角鬥士。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+h^\"F^+<^%&^9:^!\"^\"d^(p^!q^&F^+e^!O^!u^(s^-j^!/^!z^*A^+h^.j^,X^#j^$6^\"D^(H^*,^\"n^&Z^(H^*,^+a^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitoXiJGXis8XiUmXjk6XiEiXiJkXihwXiFxXiZGXitlXiFPXiF1XihzXi1qXiEvXiF6XipBXitoXi5qXixYXiNqXiQ2XiJEXihIXiosXiJuXiZaXihIXiosXithXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 97
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4f894f38433f",
      "text": "我們立刻推選她為首領，因為她既聰慧精明， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^0'^.Y^,J^.6^+h^%{^)~^)s^*A^\"]^%{^+h^,U^2=^4;^'7^$c^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7XjAnXi5ZXixKXi42XitoXiV7Xil+XilzXipBXiJdXiV7XitoXixVXjI9XjQ7Xic3XiRjXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6e5d821e362c",
      "text": "又老練沉著。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+;^'U^-L^%Z^-a^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xis7XidVXi1MXiVaXi1hXiEi",
      "byte_length": 18
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6fa7c45a78cb",
      "text": "這裡就是塞德里爾特，或者該說是它的殘存廢墟。那些雙足飛龍騎士的接連洗劫， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^-j^*J^,X^/(^#j^)(^&/^&5^*A^$'^'V^(M^-x^,X^+o^&Z^,l^#*^#W^\"t^!\"^)!^!8^)_^(^^)z^*>^0K^+a^&Z^$?^.0^0j^1l^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXi1qXipKXixYXi8oXiNqXikoXiYvXiY1XipBXiQnXidWXihNXi14XixYXitvXiZaXixsXiMqXiNXXiJ0XiEiXikhXiE4XilfXiheXil6Xio+XjBLXithXiZaXiQ/Xi4wXjBqXjFsXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 109
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_415608a600e9",
      "text": "幾乎徹底摧毀了我們的村莊。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#T^!0^18^/^^$E^%N^*D^$%^*{^&Z^$z^6l^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNUXiEwXjE4Xi9eXiRFXiVOXipEXiQlXip7XiZaXiR6XjZsXiEi",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_98925251d66a",
      "text": "騎著飛龍的強盜來搶奪我們的糧食，以及任何他們能 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^0K^-a^)z^*>^&Z^#]^0!^!O^1?^1,^$%^*{^&Z^5s^0J^*A^!B^\"7^!C^!L^!@^*{^'b ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjBLXi1hXil6Xio+XiZaXiNdXjAhXiFPXjE/XjEsXiQlXip7XiZaXjVzXjBKXipBXiFCXiI3XiFDXiFMXiFAXip7XidiIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_66adeda0b335",
      "text": "找到的物資。但他們早就搶光了我們的一切。我不知道 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$/^!u^&Z^&4^(X^!\"^!I^!@^*{^,V^*J^1?^!c^*D^$%^*{^&Z^!%^+.^!\"^$%^!)^&h^(y ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQvXiF1XiZaXiY0XihYXiEiXiFJXiFAXip7XixWXipKXjE/XiFjXipEXiQlXip7XiZaXiElXisuXiEiXiQlXiEpXiZoXih5IA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1291eddb6669",
      "text": "他們為何還一直回來，除非他們純粹以此殺戮為樂。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^*{^%{^!L^.7^!%^&`^\"\\^!O^*A^)Q^)i^!@^*{^3\"^5r^!B^%I^%M^,:^%{^%8^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXip7XiV7XiFMXi43XiElXiZgXiJcXiFPXipBXilRXilpXiFAXip7XjMiXjVyXiFCXiVJXiVNXiw6XiV7XiU4XiEi",
      "byte_length": 69
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4a4f8ad0052f",
      "text": "他們來自山上的那座城堡。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^*{^!O^'l^11^!'^&Z^)!^/_^+_^\"m^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXip7XiFPXidsXjExXiEnXiZaXikhXi9fXitfXiJtXiEi",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bae69c3424b5",
      "text": "根本沒有路能上去那裡……除非你們會飛。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%)^$x^%\\^$s^(a^'b^!'^\"6^)!^-j^*o^*o^)Q^)i^*F^*{^$r^)z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiUpXiR4XiVcXiRzXihhXidiXiEnXiI2XikhXi1qXipvXipvXilRXilpXipGXip7XiRyXil6XiEi",
      "byte_length": 57
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_74a04c638e33",
      "text": "跟我來吧。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.+^$%^!O^*I^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi4rXiQlXiFPXipJXiEi",
      "byte_length": 15
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_613a844baee9",
      "text": "我必須回去照顧我的家人了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^#l^)r^\"\\^\"6^/x^4n^$%^&Z^+s^!<^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiNsXilyXiJcXiI2Xi94XjRuXiQlXiZaXitzXiE8XipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_eeea85761be9",
      "text": " 你們應該盡快去見查雅。",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^*F^*{^0`^(M^-1^*L^\"6^-m^%&^9:^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4qRl4qe14wYF4oTV4tMV4qTF4iNl4tbV4lJl45Ol4hIg==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6bf2ca722537",
      "text": "我們的首領一定會想見你們。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^&Z^)~^)s^!%^#.^$r^,1^-m^*F^*{^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7XiZaXil+XilzXiElXiMuXiRyXiwxXi1tXipGXip7XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 40
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_728fefa89b8a",
      "text": "你看見一名聖堂武士正在與一名精靈激烈爭吵。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*Q^-m^!%^\"F^'Z^42^%J^+a^%H^\"d^'p^!%^\"F^'7^)g^1H^%|^1I^/T^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXipRXi1tXiElXiJGXidaXjQyXiVKXithXiVIXiJkXidwXiElXiJGXic3XilnXjFIXiV8XjFJXi9UXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_348241922f55",
      "text": "我才不管你手下衛兵的抽成！我們早就談妥了價格，我絕不 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^$,^!)^-D^*F^$+^!(^(=^+,^&Z^*_^$$^*W^$%^*{^,V^*J^0;^5C^*D^+&^%*^*A^$%^-I^!) ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiQsXiEpXi1EXipGXiQrXiEoXig9XissXiZaXipfXiQkXipXXiQlXip7XixWXipKXjA7XjVDXipEXismXiUqXipBXiQlXi1JXiEpIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d0f569975a20",
      "text": "會再加價！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$r^!l^\"\"^+&^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRyXiFsXiIiXismXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 16
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c9e10e10c9b7",
      "text": "聽著，要嘛再給我一千錢，要嘛你一個奴隸都別想帶走——就是這麼 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-X^-a^*A^(C^+Y^!l^'A^$%^!%^+7^.<^*A^(C^+Y^*F^!%^!V^##^)Z^)$^*H^,1^#N^.&^*n^*n^*J^,X^(s^.T ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi1YXi1hXipBXihDXitZXiFsXidBXiQlXiElXis3Xi48XipBXihDXitZXipGXiElXiFWXiMjXilaXikkXipIXiwxXiNOXi4mXipuXipuXipKXixYXihzXi5UIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7bc5ba755ad1",
      "text": "簡單。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^3y^2a^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjN5XjJhXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 10
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b2ac7f82893f",
      "text": "你竟敢坐地起價！我可—— ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^28^/m^8E^\"e^.(^+&^*W^$%^\"A^*n^*n ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXjI4Xi9tXjhFXiJlXi4oXismXipXXiQlXiJBXipuXipuIA==",
      "byte_length": 37
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5ab7f3319fe8",
      "text": "就在這時，精靈和聖堂武士都注意到了你們的到來。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*J^\"d^(s^$f^*A^'7^)g^\"O^'Z^42^%J^+a^)$^%e^#z^!u^*D^*F^*{^&Z^!u^!O^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipKXiJkXihzXiRmXipBXic3XilnXiJPXidaXjQyXiVKXithXikkXiVlXiN6XiF1XipEXipGXip7XiZaXiF1XiFPXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_dd40ab75b9d8",
      "text": "跟我來！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.+^$%^!O^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi4rXiQlXiFPXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 13
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_57dcae56e97e",
      "text": "我們要離開這裡了。祝你們好運。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^(C^)`^)F^(s^-j^*D^!\"^&v^*F^*{^+i^.4^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7XihDXilgXilGXihzXi1qXipEXiEiXiZ2XipGXip7XitpXi40XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_696591edab7b",
      "text": "感謝你們的相助。現在，趁我還沒改變主意把你們和 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#{^-z^*F^*{^&Z^&a^\"#^!\"^&?^\"d^*A^.)^$%^.7^%\\^$N^(U^!-^#z^$1^*F^*{^\"O ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiN7Xi16XipGXip7XiZaXiZhXiIjXiEiXiY/XiJkXipBXi4pXiQlXi43XiVcXiROXihVXiEtXiN6XiQxXipGXip7XiJPIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c4ccf8f6490a",
      "text": "其餘奴隸關在一起前，快滾吧。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!j^1e^##^)Z^.>^\"d^!%^.(^!z^*A^*L^,z^*I^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFqXjFlXiMjXilaXi4+XiJkXiElXi4oXiF6XipBXipMXix6XipJXiEi",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d46854faed68",
      "text": "你看見一名聖堂武士正在與一名精靈爭吵。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*Q^-m^!%^\"F^'Z^42^%J^+a^%H^\"d^'p^!%^\"F^'7^)g^1I^/T^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXipRXi1tXiElXiJGXidaXjQyXiVKXithXiVIXiJkXidwXiElXiJGXic3XilnXjFJXi9UXiEi",
      "byte_length": 57
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4c1e4e064100",
      "text": "聖堂武士盯著你們，隨後轉向精靈首領。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'Z^42^%J^+a^:U^-a^*F^*{^*A^)X^#b^(i^+?^'7^)g^)~^)s^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XidaXjQyXiVKXithXjpVXi1hXipGXip7XipBXilYXiNiXihpXis/Xic3XilnXil+XilzXiEi",
      "byte_length": 54
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d53e737e6b0c",
      "text": "這些奴隸是從德拉吉的奴隸牢房逃出來的！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^!8^##^)Z^,X^#f^#j^$6^\"D^&Z^##^)Z^-$^,<^(p^!q^!O^&Z^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXiE4XiMjXilaXixYXiNmXiNqXiQ2XiJEXiZaXiMjXilaXi0kXiw8XihwXiFxXiFPXiZaXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_38a9ec4662f4",
      "text": "他們謀殺了負責管理奴隸圍欄的聖堂武士，我奉命深入這片該死的荒漠前來抓捕奴隸。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^*{^3~^%M^*D^(W^0>^-D^&A^##^)Z^\"`^%C^&Z^'Z^42^%J^+a^*A^$%^1+^\"N^2*^!f^(s^&1^(M^%L^&Z^1W^,}^!z^!O^$2^4?^##^)Z^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXip7XjN+XiVNXipEXihXXjA+Xi1EXiZBXiMjXilaXiJgXiVDXiZaXidaXjQyXiVKXithXipBXiQlXjErXiJOXjIqXiFmXihzXiYxXihNXiVMXiZaXjFXXix9XiF6XiFPXiQyXjQ/XiMjXilaXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 115
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0e69ed419021",
      "text": "我、我願意付你一萬陶幣買下 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^!!^$%^.H^#z^*u^*F^!%^-_^)R^+|^.!^!( ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiEhXiQlXi5IXiN6Xip1XipGXiElXi1fXilSXit8Xi4hXiEoIA==",
      "byte_length": 40
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_28582461e4c1",
      "text": "他們！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^*{^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXip7XipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 10
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_195dffa306b0",
      "text": "他們必須被帶回去受罰。我相信佩圖克爾一定會非常樂意 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^*{^#l^)r^(@^#N^\"\\^\"6^\";^0-^!\"^$%^&a^!U^.}^\"b^!d^&/^!%^#.^$r^)i^#O^%8^#z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXip7XiNsXilyXihAXiNOXiJcXiI2XiI7XjAtXiEiXiQlXiZhXiFVXi59XiJiXiFkXiYvXiElXiMuXiRyXilpXiNPXiU4XiN6IA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2d2a5c82860c",
      "text": "親自折磨他們！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(F^'l^,?^-7^!@^*{^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihGXidsXiw/Xi03XiFAXip7XipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 22
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a37969671054",
      "text": "  加入我們，一起反抗德拉吉！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^\"\"^!f^$%^*{^*A^!%^.(^\"9^$4^#j^$6^\"D^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIiJeIWZeJCVeKnteKkFeISVeLiheIjleJDReI2peJDZeIkReKlc=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_94786b4aca9e",
      "text": "  我想受雇加入你們。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^,1^\";^6C^\"\"^!f^*F^*{^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeLDFeIjteNkNeIiJeIWZeKkZeKnteISI=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f69e7fb960dd",
      "text": "  我想買下一些奴隸。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^,1^.!^!(^!%^!8^##^)Z^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeLDFeLiFeISheISVeITheIyNeKVpeISIg",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5c04de97b775",
      "text": "  不行！殺了聖堂武士，站在反抗德拉吉這一邊！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^!)^(;^*W^%M^*D^'Z^42^%J^+a^*A^->^\"d^\"9^$4^#j^$6^\"D^(s^!%^.8^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeISleKDteKldeJU1eKkReJ1peNDJeJUpeK2FeKkFeLT5eImReIjleJDReI2peJDZeIkReKHNeISVeLjheKlc=",
      "byte_length": 65
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_17fa5e520a9b",
      "text": "  不行！與我們結盟對抗德拉吉！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^!)^(;^*W^'p^$%^*{^'@^-0^#:^$4^#j^$6^\"D^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeISleKDteKldeJ3BeJCVeKnteJ0BeLTBeIzpeJDReI2peJDZeIkReKlc=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_05fdf09e5032",
      "text": "  你搞錯了。我從沒去過德拉吉。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^:R^)5^*D^!\"^$%^#f^%\\^\"6^(x^#j^$6^\"D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeOlJeKTVeKkReISJeJCVeI2ZeJVxeIjZeKHheI2peJDZeIkReISI=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_716815bd20d7",
      "text": "  你死期到了，聖堂武士！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^%L^$u^!u^*D^*A^'Z^42^%J^+a^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeJUxeJHVeIXVeKkReKkFeJ1peNDJeJUpeK2FeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e2abbe8c3afd",
      "text": "是嗎？哼，我的大部分收入都來自城邦，所以我寧願城邦 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,X^+X^.V^+K^*A^$%^&Z^\"z^)#^!s^$M^!f^)$^!O^'l^+_^1a^*A^$)^!B^$%^3k^.H^+_^1a ",
      "encoded_base64": "XixYXitYXi5WXitLXipBXiQlXiZaXiJ6XikjXiFzXiRNXiFmXikkXiFPXidsXitfXjFhXipBXiQpXiFCXiQlXjNrXi5IXitfXjFhIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8b41cd7db683",
      "text": "一直向我收購奴隸。我幹嘛要改變現狀？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!%^&`^+?^$%^$M^63^##^)Z^!\"^$%^,!^+Y^(C^$N^(U^&?^&7^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiElXiZgXis/XiQlXiRNXjYzXiMjXilaXiEiXiQlXiwhXitZXihDXiROXihVXiY/XiY3Xi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7546035c1522",
      "text": "嗯。好吧，我永遠不嫌多一個捕奴獵手，而你看起來正好合適。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^6N^!\"^+i^*I^*A^$%^%W^({^!)^:4^\"x^!%^!V^4?^##^&;^$+^*A^'W^*F^*Q^.(^!O^%H^+i^\"C^(|^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjZOXiEiXitpXipJXipBXiQlXiVXXih7XiEpXjo0XiJ4XiElXiFWXjQ/XiMjXiY7XiQrXipBXidXXipGXipRXi4oXiFPXiVIXitpXiJDXih8XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7bf63c46ba86",
      "text": "等我和她談完這筆生意，我們再來聊聊。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'-^$%^\"O^+h^0;^#,^(s^-A^&F^#z^*A^$%^*{^!l^!O^-U^-U^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XictXiQlXiJPXitoXjA7XiMsXihzXi1BXiZGXiN6XipBXiQlXip7XiFsXiFPXi1VXi1VXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_86243db10a13",
      "text": "真的嗎？嗯，我現在正和另一位買家洽談，不過要是你的出價能高過 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-2^&Z^+X^.V^6N^*A^$%^&?^\"d^%H^\"O^\">^!%^!J^.!^+s^:T^0;^*A^!)^(x^(C^,X^*F^&Z^!q^+&^'b^*+^(x ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi0yXiZaXitYXi5WXjZOXipBXiQlXiY/XiJkXiVIXiJPXiI+XiElXiFKXi4hXitzXjpUXjA7XipBXiEpXih4XihDXixYXipGXiZaXiFxXismXidiXiorXih4IA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a8d8dee7822f",
      "text": "德拉吉開的條件，那些奴隸就歸你了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#j^$6^\"D^)F^&Z^%.^.W^*A^)!^!8^##^)Z^*J^%K^*F^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNqXiQ2XiJEXilGXiZaXiUuXi5XXipBXikhXiE4XiMjXilaXipKXiVLXipGXipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_73eee40877c4",
      "text": "什麼？！你竟然還考慮把奴隸賣給這些混—— ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!=^.T^.V^*W^*F^28^&\"^.7^-R^19^$1^##^)Z^.$^'A^(s^!8^%n^*n^*n ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiE9Xi5UXi5WXipXXipGXjI4XiYiXi43Xi1SXjE5XiQxXiMjXilaXi4kXidBXihzXiE4XiVuXipuXipuIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f45f4091edbd",
      "text": "那名聖堂武士一直無視你們的存在，此時終於看向你們。看到你們的模樣， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^\"F^'Z^42^%J^+a^!%^&`^%}^(E^*F^*{^&Z^#*^\"d^*A^%I^$f^-H^$^^*Q^+?^*F^*{^!\"^*Q^!u^*F^*{^&Z^%:^,f^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXiJGXidaXjQyXiVKXithXiElXiZgXiV9XihFXipGXip7XiZaXiMqXiJkXipBXiVJXiRmXi1IXiReXipRXis/XipGXip7XiEiXipRXiF1XipGXip7XiZaXiU6XixmXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 100
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b0725a4bbba0",
      "text": "她的雙眼驟然睜大。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+h^&Z^)_^&d^7M^&\"^.q^\"z^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitoXiZaXilfXiZkXjdNXiYiXi5xXiJ6XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 28
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e52bbe4e86d7",
      "text": "衛兵！把這些陌生人押進奴隸牢房！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(=^+,^*W^$1^(s^!8^9z^&F^!<^7Z^(w^##^)Z^-$^,<^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "Xig9XissXipXXiQxXihzXiE4Xjl6XiZGXiE8XjdaXih3XiMjXilaXi0kXiw8XipX",
      "byte_length": 48
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e9b1b77690fc",
      "text": "你們同意束手就擒嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^\"E^#z^$|^$+^*J^:S^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiJFXiN6XiR8XiQrXipKXjpTXitYXi5W",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1e843039672b",
      "text": "有何不可？她確實該死，而且我敢肯定她身上帶了不少錢。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$s^!L^!)^\"A^.V^+h^-6^#3^(M^%L^*A^'W^!*^$%^/m^-Z^#.^+h^(c^!'^#N^*D^!)^#<^.<^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRzXiFMXiEpXiJBXi5WXitoXi02XiMzXihNXiVMXipBXidXXiEqXiQlXi9tXi1aXiMuXitoXihjXiEnXiNOXipEXiEpXiM8Xi48XiEi",
      "byte_length": 78
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_150da6b62fbf",
      "text": "恭喜！隊伍獲得了 2,000 點經驗值！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^1{^+V^*W^)U^!F^&:^#e^*D 2,000 ^*;^'D^.P^!Z^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjF7XitWXipXXilVXiFGXiY6XiNlXipEIDIsMDAwIF4qO14nRF4uUF4hWl4qVyA=",
      "byte_length": 47
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_05f29e37f36b",
      "text": "聖堂武士臉色發白。她轉向精靈首領。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'Z^42^%J^+a^-\\^'s^&W^&X^!\"^+h^(i^+?^'7^)g^)~^)s^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XidaXjQyXiVKXithXi1cXidzXiZXXiZYXiEiXitoXihpXis/Xic3XilnXil+XilzXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_289e50451b3a",
      "text": "你、你不是認真的吧！你知道德拉吉會怎麼對付你嗎？快告訴我你是在 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^!!^*F^!)^,X^(O^-2^&Z^*I^*W^*F^&h^(y^#j^$6^\"D^$r^,,^.T^#:^*u^*F^+X^.V^*L^+B^-t^$%^*F^,X^\"d ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiEhXipGXiEpXixYXihPXi0yXiZaXipJXipXXipGXiZoXih5XiNqXiQ2XiJEXiRyXiwsXi5UXiM6Xip1XipGXitYXi5WXipMXitCXi10XiQlXipGXixYXiJkIA==",
      "byte_length": 94
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_49183f639117",
      "text": "開玩笑！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)F^4U^-@^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XilGXjRVXi1AXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 13
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_74f6c272aa37",
      "text": "我可不是會開玩笑的人，聖堂武士。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^\"A^!)^,X^$r^)F^4U^-@^&Z^!<^*A^'Z^42^%J^+a^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiJBXiEpXixYXiRyXilGXjRVXi1AXiZaXiE8XipBXidaXjQyXiVKXithXiEi",
      "byte_length": 48
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d5e2b73b7da8",
      "text": "聖堂武士狠狠瞪著你們和那名精靈，隨後一邊吹響哨子，一邊向你們衝了 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'Z^42^%J^+a^4T^4T^:V^-a^*F^*{^\"O^)!^\"F^'7^)g^*A^)X^#b^!%^.8^+A^)o^:Q^#(^*A^!%^.8^+?^*F^*{^-h^*D ",
      "encoded_base64": "XidaXjQyXiVKXithXjRUXjRUXjpWXi1hXipGXip7XiJPXikhXiJGXic3XilnXipBXilYXiNiXiElXi44XitBXilvXjpRXiMoXipBXiElXi44Xis/XipGXip7Xi1oXipEIA==",
      "byte_length": 97
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e0b7abd2f318",
      "text": "過來。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(x^!O^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xih4XiFPXiEi",
      "byte_length": 9
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b8f2df1f9183",
      "text": "哦？我看未必。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+H^.V^$%^*Q^,_^#l^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XitIXi5WXiQlXipRXixfXiNsXiEi",
      "byte_length": 21
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e962b051888c",
      "text": "聖堂武士吹響了哨子。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'Z^42^%J^+a^+A^)o^*D^:Q^#(^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XidaXjQyXiVKXithXitBXilvXipEXjpRXiMoXiEi",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_200a25429eef",
      "text": "戰爭比抓奴隸重要得多。所以，我可以放手殺了你們。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$(^1I^,m^$2^##^)Z^))^(C^#e^\"x^!\"^$)^!B^*A^$%^\"A^!B^$P^$+^%M^*D^*F^*{^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQoXjFJXixtXiQyXiMjXilaXikpXihDXiNlXiJ4XiEiXiQpXiFCXipBXiQlXiJBXiFCXiRQXiQrXiVNXipEXipGXip7XiEi",
      "byte_length": 72
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d16838278915",
      "text": "這下有意思了——我和我的弟兄們正好能找點樂子！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^!(^$s^#z^#q^*D^*n^*n^$%^\"O^$%^&Z^16^1!^*{^%H^+i^'b^$/^*;^%8^#(^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXiEoXiRzXiN6XiNxXipEXipuXipuXiQlXiJPXiQlXiZaXjE2XjEhXip7XiVIXitpXidiXiQvXio7XiU4XiMoXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_083351c56b52",
      "text": "你們是真正的戰士！你們贏得了我的敬重。我把一件禮物送給你們，這是我 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^,X^-2^%H^&Z^$(^+a^*W^*F^*{^.%^#e^*D^$%^&Z^*O^))^!\"^$%^$1^!%^.W^-8^&4^./^'A^*F^*{^*A^(s^,X^$% ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XixYXi0yXiVIXiZaXiQoXithXipXXipGXip7Xi4lXiNlXipEXiQlXiZaXipPXikpXiEiXiQlXiQxXiElXi5XXi04XiY0Xi4vXidBXipGXip7XipBXihzXixYXiQlIA==",
      "byte_length": 100
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_832dcbad006a",
      "text": "從以前認識的一位螳螂人那裡得來的。拿去吧。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#f^!B^!z^(O^(R^&Z^!%^!J^8O^8N^!<^)!^-j^#e^!O^&Z^!\"^,G^\"6^*I^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNmXiFCXiF6XihPXihSXiZaXiElXiFKXjhPXjhOXiE8XikhXi1qXiNlXiFPXiZaXiEiXixHXiI2XipJXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ecbe13325006",
      "text": "你們身上拿不下了，我就先把它留在這裡給你們。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^(c^!'^,G^!)^!(^*D^*A^$%^*J^!b^$1^+o^-+^\"d^(s^-j^'A^*F^*{^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XihjXiEnXixHXiEpXiEoXipEXipBXiQlXipKXiFiXiQxXitvXi0rXiJkXihzXi1qXidBXipGXip7XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e1cb2c995827",
      "text": "好了，既然這事解決了，你們剛才提到要反抗城邦—— ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+i^*D^*A^,U^&\"^(s^*r^(I^,o^*D^*A^*F^*{^+0^$,^$A^!u^(C^\"9^$4^+_^1a^*n^*n ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitpXipEXipBXixVXiYiXihzXipyXihJXixvXipEXipBXipGXip7XiswXiQsXiRBXiF1XihDXiI5XiQ0XitfXjFhXipuXipuIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d7e3c48518f9",
      "text": "再跟我多說說吧，朋友們。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!l^.+^$%^\"x^-x^-x^*I^*A^,[^\"8^*{^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFsXi4rXiQlXiJ4Xi14Xi14XipJXipBXixbXiI4Xip7XiEi",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e16f72c506ef",
      "text": "  加入對抗德拉吉的反抗同盟！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^\"\"^!f^#:^$4^#j^$6^\"D^&Z^\"9^$4^\"E^-0^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIiJeIWZeIzpeJDReI2peJDZeIkReJlpeIjleJDReIkVeLTBeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4975ee54b59b",
      "text": "  抱歉，我並沒有加入任何同盟。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^,@^,h^*A^$%^!+^%\\^$s^\"\"^!f^!C^!L^\"E^-0^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLEBeLGheKkFeJCVeISteJVxeJHNeIiJeIWZeIUNeIUxeIkVeLTBeISIg",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9f7ae6fdeadd",
      "text": "  你必須先釋放這些奴隸。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^#l^)r^!b^0w^$P^(s^!8^##^)Z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeI2xeKXJeIWJeMHdeJFBeKHNeITheIyNeKVpeISI=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8b6c21632b08",
      "text": "我該走了。回頭見。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^(M^.&^*D^!\"^\"\\^)t^-m^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXihNXi4mXipEXiEiXiJcXil0Xi1tXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 28
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fcf8cb921ae7",
      "text": "  前往特奎策爾。大家都在那裡。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^!z^,)^&5^5B^5p^&/^!\"^\"z^+s^)$^\"d^)!^-j^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIXpeLCleJjVeNUJeNXBeJi9eISJeInpeK3NeKSReImReKSFeLWpeISI=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_118ec1e8c1b0",
      "text": "  特奎策爾。但請加入我，一同尋找更多盟友。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^&5^5B^5p^&/^!\"^!I^*S^\"\"^!f^$%^*A^!%^\"E^#9^$/^$o^\"x^-0^\"8^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJjVeNUJeNXBeJi9eISJeIUleKlNeIiJeIWZeJCVeKkFeISVeIkVeIzleJC9eJG9eInheLTBeIjheISI=",
      "byte_length": 62
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1d8717d1b06f",
      "text": "不想說？好吧，至少你們讓我痛快打了一場——我都快忘了痛擊 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^,1^-x^.V^+i^*I^*A^'n^#<^*F^*{^-}^$%^-.^*L^$-^*D^!%^\"n^*n^*n^$%^)$^*L^0]^*D^-.^$F ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXiwxXi14Xi5WXitpXipJXipBXiduXiM8XipGXip7Xi19XiQlXi0uXipMXiQtXipEXiElXiJuXipuXipuXiQlXikkXipMXjBdXipEXi0uXiRGIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_36ff769d3293",
      "text": "德拉吉士兵是多麼痛快了。那麼我們也該動身了，因為一旦這個聖堂武士沒 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#j^$6^\"D^+a^+,^,X^\"x^.T^-.^*L^*D^!\"^)!^.T^$%^*{^!1^(M^\"%^(c^*D^*A^\"]^%{^!%^1C^(s^!V^'Z^42^%J^+a^%\\ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNqXiQ2XiJEXithXissXixYXiJ4Xi5UXi0uXipMXipEXiEiXikhXi5UXiQlXip7XiExXihNXiIlXihjXipEXipBXiJdXiV7XiElXjFDXihzXiFWXidaXjQyXiVKXithXiVcIA==",
      "byte_length": 100
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_eabb6300306c",
      "text": "回德拉吉覆命，我可不想在軍隊找上門時還待在這裡。祝你們旅途 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"\\^#j^$6^\"D^(D^\"N^*A^$%^\"A^!)^,1^\"d^..^)U^$/^!'^)D^$f^.7^,*^\"d^(s^-j^!\"^&v^*F^*{^2m^3. ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJcXiNqXiQ2XiJEXihEXiJOXipBXiQlXiJBXiEpXiwxXiJkXi4uXilVXiQvXiEnXilEXiRmXi43XiwqXiJkXihzXi1qXiEiXiZ2XipGXip7XjJtXjMuIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ca1a6733553b",
      "text": "順利。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.D^!t^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi5EXiF0XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 10
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bf6dc67f7049",
      "text": "好，我願意響應你們的大業。衛兵，釋放這些奴隸！對了，我該去哪裡 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+i^*A^$%^.H^#z^)o^0`^*F^*{^&Z^\"z^%5^!\"^(=^+,^*A^0w^$P^(s^!8^##^)Z^*W^#:^*D^*A^$%^(M^\"6^+I^-j ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitpXipBXiQlXi5IXiN6XilvXjBgXipGXip7XiZaXiJ6XiU1XiEiXig9XissXipBXjB3XiRQXihzXiE4XiMjXilaXipXXiM6XipEXipBXiQlXihNXiI2XitJXi1qIA==",
      "byte_length": 94
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c6138f31b2c7",
      "text": "與我們的盟友會合？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'p^$%^*{^&Z^-0^\"8^$r^\"C^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XidwXiQlXip7XiZaXi0wXiI4XiRyXiJDXi5W",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e0d96bd7c814",
      "text": "恭喜！隊伍獲得了 3,000 點經驗值！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^1{^+V^*W^)U^!F^&:^#e^*D 3,000 ^*;^'D^.P^!Z^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjF7XitWXipXXilVXiFGXiY6XiNlXipEIDMsMDAwIF4qO14nRF4uUF4hWl4qVyA=",
      "byte_length": 47
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7270193945a0",
      "text": "沒問題！衛兵，釋放這些奴隸！那麼，朋友，我接下來該怎麼 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%\\^*Z^.G^*W^(=^+,^*A^0w^$P^(s^!8^##^)Z^*W^)!^.T^*A^,[^\"8^*A^$%^$?^!(^!O^(M^,,^.T ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVcXipaXi5HXipXXig9XissXipBXjB3XiRQXihzXiE4XiMjXilaXipXXikhXi5UXipBXixbXiI4XipBXiQlXiQ/XiEoXiFPXihNXiwsXi5UIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7d2e9a77ab14",
      "text": "做？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*~^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "Xip+Xi5W",
      "byte_length": 6
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e2966ebb3f3a",
      "text": "很好。我這就動身。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*K^+i^!\"^$%^(s^*J^\"%^(c^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipLXitpXiEiXiQlXihzXipKXiIlXihjXiEi",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f9c613f95745",
      "text": "不，你們村莊需要有人留守統籌備戰。我們將會 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^*A^*F^*{^$z^6l^)e^(C^$s^!<^-+^#+^'B^:W^+\"^$(^!\"^$%^*{^#7^$r ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXipBXipGXip7XiR6XjZsXillXihDXiRzXiE8Xi0rXiMrXidCXjpXXisiXiQoXiEiXiQlXip7XiM3XiRyIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bbb20820e04a",
      "text": "前往特奎策爾。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!z^,)^&5^5B^5p^&/^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiF6XiwpXiY1XjVCXjVwXiYvXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 22
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_20ee6308e829",
      "text": "別了，戰士們。感謝你們帶來一場痛快的戰鬥。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*H^*D^*A^$(^+a^*{^!\"^#{^-z^*F^*{^#N^!O^!%^\"n^-.^*L^&Z^$(^*,^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipIXipEXipBXiQoXithXip7XiEiXiN7Xi16XipGXip7XiNOXiFPXiElXiJuXi0uXipMXiZaXiQoXiosXiEi",
      "byte_length": 63
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f3b0c46a5f79",
      "text": "有什麼我能效勞的嗎，朋友？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$s^!=^.T^$%^'b^$Q^/R^&Z^+X^*A^,[^\"8^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRzXiE9Xi5UXiQlXidiXiRRXi9SXiZaXitYXipBXixbXiI4Xi5W",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e994644a886c",
      "text": "  在這裡等我。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^\"d^(s^-j^'-^$%^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeImReKHNeLWpeJy1eJCVeISI=",
      "byte_length": 20
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_47b24592af92",
      "text": "  我們在特奎策爾會合。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^*{^\"d^&5^5B^5p^&/^$r^\"C^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeKnteImReJjVeNUJeNXBeJi9eJHJeIkNeISI=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_de3fdc4ee7ad",
      "text": "很好。等我們再次相見時，我們將並肩投入一場浩大的戰爭！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*K^+i^!\"^'-^$%^*{^!l^%D^&a^-m^$f^*A^$%^*{^#7^!+^:#^$3^!f^!%^\"n^5^^\"z^&Z^$(^1I^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipLXitpXiEiXictXiQlXip7XiFsXiVEXiZhXi1tXiRmXipBXiQlXip7XiM3XiErXjojXiQzXiFmXiElXiJuXjVeXiJ6XiZaXiQoXjFJXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5a108c412331",
      "text": "不，我認為特奎策爾需要有人防範敵人的先鋒部隊深入 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^*A^$%^(O^%{^&5^5B^5p^&/^)e^(C^$s^!<^)K^'0^$U^!<^&Z^!b^6?^)#^)U^2*^!f ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXipBXiQlXihPXiV7XiY1XjVCXjVwXiYvXillXihDXiRzXiE8XilLXicwXiRVXiE8XiZaXiFiXjY/XikjXilVXjIqXiFmIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_35f16ccd5f58",
      "text": "荒原。我們將動身前往那座村莊，為即將到來的戰爭做好準備！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^1W^\"5^!\"^$%^*{^#7^\"%^(c^!z^,)^)!^/_^$z^6l^*A^%{^\"1^#7^!u^!O^&Z^$(^1I^*~^+i^,x^+\"^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjFXXiI1XiEiXiQlXip7XiM3XiIlXihjXiF6XiwpXikhXi9fXiR6XjZsXipBXiV7XiIxXiM3XiF1XiFPXiZaXiQoXjFJXip+XitpXix4XisiXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f0c72e727c33",
      "text": "好了，弟兄們！我們準備拔營離開這裡！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+i^*D^*A^16^1!^*{^*W^$%^*{^,x^+\"^/c^&'^)`^)F^(s^-j^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitpXipEXipBXjE2XjEhXip7XipXXiQlXip7Xix4XisiXi9jXiYnXilgXilGXihzXi1qXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_dc2c0a77dac5",
      "text": "釋放那些奴隸！在我們接下來要去的地方，留著他們毫無用處！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^0w^$P^)!^!8^##^)Z^*W^\"d^$%^*{^$?^!(^!O^(C^\"6^&Z^\"e^$]^*A^-+^-a^!@^*{^/t^%}^&H^(,^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjB3XiRQXikhXiE4XiMjXilaXipXXiJkXiQlXip7XiQ/XiEoXiFPXihDXiI2XiZaXiJlXiRdXipBXi0rXi1hXiFAXip7Xi90XiV9XiZIXigsXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_739b08cb8408",
      "text": "我們準備前往特奎策爾村與德拉吉作戰！任何不想 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^,x^+\"^!z^,)^&5^5B^5p^&/^$z^'p^#j^$6^\"D^!M^$(^*W^!C^!L^!)^,1 ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7Xix4XisiXiF6XiwpXiY1XjVCXjVwXiYvXiR6XidwXiNqXiQ2XiJEXiFNXiQoXipXXiFDXiFMXiEpXiwxIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_dbb0a7d0ef35",
      "text": "賣命的人，最好現在就給我滾蛋！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.$^\"N^&Z^!<^*A^$q^+i^&?^\"d^*J^'A^$%^,z^6\"^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi4kXiJOXiZaXiE8XipBXiRxXitpXiY/XiJkXipKXidBXiQlXix6XjYiXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0dda2e4b9a52",
      "text": "一旦那個聖堂武士沒能返回德拉吉，他們派來搜捕的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!%^1C^)!^!V^'Z^42^%J^+a^%\\^'b^7J^\"\\^#j^$6^\"D^*A^!@^*{^.n^!O^/h^4?^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiElXjFDXikhXiFWXidaXjQyXiVKXithXiVcXidiXjdKXiJcXiNqXiQ2XiJEXipBXiFAXip7Xi5uXiFPXi9oXjQ/XiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9504edee29ff",
      "text": "可絕不只十幾名士兵，所以我們得立刻撤離！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"A^-I^!)^\"?^*Y^#T^\"F^+a^+,^*A^$)^!B^$%^*{^#e^0'^.Y^:7^)`^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJBXi1JXiEpXiI/XipZXiNUXiJGXithXissXipBXiQpXiFCXiQlXip7XiNlXjAnXi5ZXjo3XilgXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_54134f6f586e",
      "text": "整隊行軍！大家出發！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$T^)U^(;^..^*W^\"z^+s^!q^&W^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRUXilVXig7Xi4uXipXXiJ6XitzXiFxXiZXXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 31
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1241b33e8e7c",
      "text": "精靈捕奴團離開了這個區域。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'7^)g^4?^##^0V^)`^)F^*D^(s^!V^\"+^\"k^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xic3XilnXjQ/XiMjXjBWXilgXilGXipEXihzXiFWXiIrXiJrXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 40
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d5b1ade25ae1",
      "text": "橋面上的面孔痛苦地扭曲著。那永無止境的尖叫聲 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%<^)j^!'^&Z^)j^5G^-.^.t^\"e^1;^$n^-a^!\"^)!^%W^%}^%G^\"q^&Z^#=^+<^-W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiU8XilqXiEnXiZaXilqXjVHXi0uXi50XiJlXjE7XiRuXi1hXiEiXikhXiVXXiV9XiVHXiJxXiZaXiM9Xis8Xi1XIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_11e8a577d495",
      "text": "實在稱不上是什麼愉快的交談話題。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#3^\"d^0&^!)^!'^,X^!=^.T^1|^*L^&Z^0P^0;^-v^.G^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiMzXiJkXjAmXiEpXiEnXixYXiE9Xi5UXjF8XipMXiZaXjBQXjA7Xi12Xi5HXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 49
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cb6a616c2931",
      "text": "殭屍向你們狂奔而來！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^3N^#?^+?^*F^*{^&8^2b^'W^!O^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjNOXiM/Xis/XipGXip7XiY4XjJiXidXXiFPXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 31
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_10633b724c78",
      "text": "你必須靠近蒸汽槽，才能把粉末倒進去使用。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^#l^)r^.C^(l^(&^:\\^%6^*A^$,^'b^$1^'5^$w^!X^(w^\"6^!N^&H^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiNsXilyXi5DXihsXigmXjpcXiU2XipBXiQsXidiXiQxXic1XiR3XiFYXih3XiI2XiFOXiZIXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_650096a0d1b8",
      "text": "粉末尚未在槽中完全溶解。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'5^$w^+v^,_^\"d^%6^!,^#,^!h^:]^(I^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xic1XiR3Xit2XixfXiJkXiU2XiEsXiMsXiFoXjpdXihJXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 37
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b64f60718bfc",
      "text": "什麼動靜都沒有發生。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!=^.T^\"%^)h^)$^%\\^$s^&W^&F^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiE9Xi5UXiIlXiloXikkXiVcXiRzXiZXXiZGXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 31
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bb3759fb0884",
      "text": "門上的眼睛亮起微光，彷彿準備發動攻擊，但你們配戴的項鍊上的眼睛 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)D^!'^&Z^&d^&f^*t^.(^#i^!c^*A^.a^.b^,x^+\"^&W^\"%^$O^$F^*A^!I^*F^*{^)&^1:^&Z^)q^)6^!'^&Z^&d^&f ",
      "encoded_base64": "XilEXiEnXiZaXiZkXiZmXip0Xi4oXiNpXiFjXipBXi5hXi5iXix4XisiXiZXXiIlXiRPXiRGXipBXiFJXipGXip7XikmXjE6XiZaXilxXik2XiEnXiZaXiZkXiZmIA==",
      "byte_length": 94
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a37ea4529ab3",
      "text": "綻放出更耀眼的光芒。門上的眼睛隨即閉合，大門敞開了！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'H^$P^!q^$o^7D^&d^&Z^!c^'u^!\"^)D^!'^&Z^&d^&f^)X^\"1^.=^\"C^*A^\"z^)D^*d^)F^*D^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XidIXiRQXiFxXiRvXjdEXiZkXiZaXiFjXid1XiEiXilEXiEnXiZaXiZkXiZmXilYXiIxXi49XiJDXipBXiJ6XilEXipkXilGXipEXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0e3f22cb4dfc",
      "text": "門上的眼睛發出刺眼的強光，強烈的光芒炫花了你們的雙眼，並 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)D^!'^&Z^&d^&f^&W^!q^!w^&d^&Z^#]^!c^*A^#]^%|^&Z^!c^'u^:^^'w^*D^*F^*{^&Z^)_^&d^*A^!+ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XilEXiEnXiZaXiZkXiZmXiZXXiFxXiF3XiZkXiZaXiNdXiFjXipBXiNdXiV8XiZaXiFjXid1XjpeXid3XipEXipGXip7XiZaXilfXiZkXipBXiErIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a734e390ff93",
      "text": "震懾了你們的心智！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^32^:Y^*D^*F^*{^&Z^#k^$i^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XjMyXjpZXipEXipGXip7XiZaXiNrXiRpXipX",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_595a67856285",
      "text": "你想要離開這個區域嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^,1^(C^)`^)F^(s^!V^\"+^\"k^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiwxXihDXilgXilGXihzXiFWXiIrXiJrXitYXi5W",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e933c2167794",
      "text": "烈焰散發的滾滾熱浪將你們逼退離開拱門。顯然，唯一穿過 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%|^&!^$S^&W^&Z^,z^,z^&$^,r^#7^*F^*{^.1^*V^)`^)F^*a^)D^!\"^4&^&\"^*A^+O^!%^')^(x ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiV8XiYhXiRTXiZXXiZaXix6Xix6XiYkXixyXiM3XipGXip7Xi4xXipWXilgXilGXiphXilEXiEiXjQmXiYiXipBXitPXiElXicpXih4IA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5ba16e22fbff",
      "text": "這片火焰的方法，就是試著直接跳過去。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^&1^%x^&!^&Z^$]^%b^*A^*J^,X^-u^-a^&`^$?^0@^(x^\"6^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXiYxXiV4XiYhXiZaXiRdXiViXipBXipKXixYXi11Xi1hXiZgXiQ/XjBAXih4XiI2XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3b69a165fc65",
      "text": "要試試看嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(C^-u^-u^*Q^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XihDXi11Xi11XipRXitYXi5W",
      "byte_length": 18
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4d93b50c9f9c",
      "text": " 縱身躍入烈焰之中…… ",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^4]^(c^:b^!f^%|^&!^!/^!,^*o^*o ",
      "encoded_base64": "IF40XV4oY146Yl4hZl4lfF4mIV4hL14hLF4qb14qbyA=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_de5346436e14",
      "text": "並跌落在火堆中，受到了 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!+^:a^-`^\"d^%x^*[^!,^*A^\";^!u^*D ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiErXjphXi1gXiJkXiV4XipbXiEsXipBXiI7XiF1XipEIA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_757bc82e381c",
      "text": " 點傷害！",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^*;^!^^#/^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4qO14hXl4jL14qVw==",
      "byte_length": 13
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d02befb71a3a",
      "text": "戈伯尼克斯向你們打手勢，示意你們離開火源前面。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*M^:X^#>^!d^$[^+?^*F^*{^$-^$+^\"&^*A^&s^#z^*F^*{^)`^)F^%x^%q^!z^)j^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipNXjpYXiM+XiFkXiRbXis/XipGXip7XiQtXiQrXiImXipBXiZzXiN6XipGXip7XilgXilGXiV4XiVxXiF6XilqXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d6b63a297f8b",
      "text": "戈伯尼克斯朝烈焰走了過去！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*M^:X^#>^!d^$[^,^^%|^&!^.&^*D^(x^\"6^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipNXjpYXiM+XiFkXiRbXixeXiV8XiYhXi4mXipEXih4XiI2XipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 40
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_853c66e8da61",
      "text": "戈伯尼克斯仍在等待你們讓開道路。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*M^:X^#>^!d^$[^!?^\"d^'-^,*^*F^*{^-}^)F^(y^(a^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipNXjpYXiM+XiFkXiRbXiE/XiJkXictXiwqXipGXip7Xi19XilGXih5XihhXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 49
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_972b6e770b60",
      "text": "戈伯尼克斯直接踏入了烈焰之中！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*M^:X^#>^!d^$[^&`^$?^.,^!f^*D^%|^&!^!/^!,^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipNXjpYXiM+XiFkXiRbXiZgXiQ/Xi4sXiFmXipEXiV8XiYhXiEvXiEsXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6d83f40f4f73",
      "text": "渾身燒得焦黑的戈伯尼克斯，正穩穩站在重壓踏板上！顯然， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^2+^(c^&&^#e^%~^*:^&Z^*M^:X^#>^!d^$[^*A^%H^-;^-;^->^\"d^))^4v^.,^$}^!'^*W^4&^&\"^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjIrXihjXiYmXiNlXiV+Xio6XiZaXipNXjpYXiM+XiFkXiRbXipBXiVIXi07Xi07Xi0+XiJkXikpXjR2Xi4sXiR9XiEnXipXXjQmXiYiXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4f50df066caa",
      "text": "烈焰並沒有讓他的狀況惡化太多。只不過他的氣味已經 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%|^&!^!+^%\\^$s^-}^!@^&Z^&7^,q^#y^\")^+f^\"x^!\"^\"?^!)^(x^!@^&Z^%U^1n^#J^'D ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiV8XiYhXiErXiVcXiRzXi19XiFAXiZaXiY3XixxXiN5XiIpXitmXiJ4XiEiXiI/XiEpXih4XiFAXiZaXiVVXjFuXiNKXidEIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9730ef598249",
      "text": "從腐爛的屍體變成了烤熟的屍體，但這實在稱不上有什麼改善。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#f^0/^&-^&Z^#?^**^(U^$$^*D^/w^-\"^&Z^#?^**^*A^!I^(s^#3^\"d^0&^!)^!'^$s^!=^.T^$N^1(^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNmXjAvXiYtXiZaXiM/XioqXihVXiQkXipEXi93Xi0iXiZaXiM/XioqXipBXiFJXihzXiMzXiJkXjAmXiEpXiEnXiRzXiE9Xi5UXiROXjEoXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_af0a9f1514fa",
      "text": "他回到了你們身邊。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^\"\\^!u^*D^*F^*{^(c^.8^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXiJcXiF1XipEXipGXip7XihjXi44XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 28
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e98f970d84d9",
      "text": "你們把沉重的骨頭穿過火焰，扔到了重壓踏板上。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^$1^%Z^))^&Z^*$^)t^')^(x^%x^&!^*A^8{^!u^*D^))^4v^.,^$}^!'^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiQxXiVaXikpXiZaXiokXil0XicpXih4XiV4XiYhXipBXjh7XiF1XipEXikpXjR2Xi4sXiR9XiEnXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_00c76de65f7e",
      "text": "踏板稍微移動了一下，但顯然只靠一根骨頭還不夠沉重。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.,^$}^-:^#i^'\"^\"%^*D^!%^!(^*A^!I^4&^&\"^\"?^.C^!%^%)^*$^)t^.7^!)^+d^%Z^))^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi4sXiR9Xi06XiNpXiciXiIlXipEXiElXiEoXipBXiFJXjQmXiYiXiI/Xi5DXiElXiUpXiokXil0Xi43XiEpXitkXiVaXikpXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5ee4f13611a7",
      "text": "踏板又下陷了一點，但其他什麼都沒發生。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.,^$}^+;^!(^)S^*D^!%^*;^*A^!I^!j^!@^!=^.T^)$^%\\^&W^&F^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi4sXiR9Xis7XiEoXilTXipEXiElXio7XipBXiFJXiFqXiFAXiE9Xi5UXikkXiVcXiZXXiZGXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4a8f3ff3d4bd",
      "text": "踏板幾乎與地面齊平了！也許再來一根就能成功。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.,^$}^#T^!0^'p^\"e^)j^36^0Y^*D^*W^!1^-s^!l^!O^!%^%)^*J^'b^$$^\"!^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi4sXiR9XiNUXiEwXidwXiJlXilqXjM2XjBZXipEXipXXiExXi1zXiFsXiFPXiElXiUpXipKXidiXiQkXiIhXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_29295a872e4f",
      "text": "踏板完全沉入地面，火焰隨之熄滅！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.,^$}^#,^!h^%Z^!f^\"e^)j^*A^%x^&!^)X^!/^:_^%t^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi4sXiR9XiMsXiFoXiVaXiFmXiJlXilqXipBXiV4XiYhXilYXiEvXjpfXiV0XipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 49
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_31b7559846d2",
      "text": "恭喜！隊伍獲得了 1,000 點經驗值！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^1{^+V^*W^)U^!F^&:^#e^*D 1,000 ^*;^'D^.P^!Z^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjF7XitWXipXXilVXiFGXiY6XiNlXipEIDEsMDAwIF4qO14nRF4uUF4hWl4qVyA=",
      "byte_length": 47
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_990ead6c0193",
      "text": "啊啊啊啊啊！不——！求求你！好痛痛痛痛！不——！啊啊啊啊啊！讓、讓它 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+Q^+Q^+Q^+Q^+Q^*W^!)^*n^*n^*W^,n^,n^*F^*W^+i^-.^-.^-.^-.^*W^!)^*n^*n^*W^+Q^+Q^+Q^+Q^+Q^*W^-}^!!^-}^+o ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitRXitRXitRXitRXitRXipXXiEpXipuXipuXipXXixuXixuXipGXipXXitpXi0uXi0uXi0uXi0uXipXXiEpXipuXipuXipXXitRXitRXitRXitRXitRXipXXi19XiEhXi19XitvIA==",
      "byte_length": 103
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f3d36e7006d1",
      "text": "停下啊啊啊！！！啊啊啊啊啊啊！！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+!^!(^+Q^+Q^+Q^*W^*W^*W^+Q^+Q^+Q^+Q^+Q^+Q^*W^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XishXiEoXitRXitRXitRXipXXipXXipXXitRXitRXitRXitRXitRXitRXipXXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 49
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ea5ce60ed760",
      "text": "如果你們就是這樣對待朋友的，那我不奉陪了！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#$^%!^*F^*{^*J^,X^(s^,f^#:^,*^,[^\"8^&Z^*A^)!^$%^!)^1+^8.^*D^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiMkXiUhXipGXip7XipKXixYXihzXixmXiM6XiwqXixbXiI4XiZaXipBXikhXiQlXiEpXjErXjguXipEXipX",
      "byte_length": 63
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b08b5551c255",
      "text": "該死的軟泥怪！你破壞了我的偽裝！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(M^%L^&Z^.x^%d^#s^*W^*F^&n^\"v^*D^$%^&Z^6J^(A^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihNXiVMXiZaXi54XiVkXiNzXipXXipGXiZuXiJ2XipEXiQlXiZaXjZKXihBXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 49
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0c6e6284353c",
      "text": "下賤的殭屍！你毀了我的偽裝！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!(^2G^&Z^3N^#?^*W^*F^%N^*D^$%^&Z^6J^(A^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEoXjJHXiZaXjNOXiM/XipXXipGXiVOXipEXiQlXiZaXjZKXihBXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 43
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a01e0677caa3",
      "text": "愚蠢的衛兵！你們壞了我的騙局！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^/a^.u^&Z^(=^+,^*W^*F^*{^\"v^*D^$%^&Z^.{^._^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi9hXi51XiZaXig9XissXipXXipGXip7XiJ2XipEXiQlXiZaXi57Xi5fXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bf13b966ddc1",
      "text": "愚蠢的幽魂！你毀掉了我的偽裝！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^/a^.u^&Z^2f^*.^*W^*F^%N^/e^*D^$%^&Z^6J^(A^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi9hXi51XiZaXjJmXiouXipXXipGXiVOXi9lXipEXiQlXiZaXjZKXihBXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3dc7e93eadc7",
      "text": "達戈拉爾轉身面對你們。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(z^*M^$6^&/^(i^(c^)j^#:^*F^*{^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXihpXihjXilqXiM6XipGXip7XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_59f8218001ce",
      "text": "很好！你們竟然看穿了我的偽裝！你們一定是巴爾卡札的同黨！我可沒空 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*K^+i^*W^*F^*{^28^&\"^*Q^')^*D^$%^&Z^6J^(A^*W^*F^*{^!%^#.^,X^#K^&/^\"0^.k^&Z^\"E^:e^*W^$%^\"A^%\\^'( ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipLXitpXipXXipGXip7XjI4XiYiXipRXicpXipEXiQlXiZaXjZKXihBXipXXipGXip7XiElXiMuXixYXiNLXiYvXiIwXi5rXiZaXiJFXjplXipXXiQlXiJBXiVcXicoIA==",
      "byte_length": 97
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2af99b192164",
      "text": "再陪你們玩下去了！我在我的內室等你們！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!l^8.^*F^*{^4U^!(^\"6^*D^*W^$%^\"d^$%^&Z^!g^+r^'-^*F^*{^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFsXjguXipGXip7XjRVXiEoXiI2XipEXipXXiQlXiJkXiQlXiZaXiFnXityXictXipGXip7XipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_10bc4f1523a9",
      "text": "達戈拉爾傳送離開了！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(z^*M^$6^&/^+$^./^)`^)F^*D^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXiskXi4vXilgXilGXipEXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 31
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_12cccd17b324",
      "text": "凱爾達也跟著消失了！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!p^&/^(z^!1^.+^-a^%k^\"|^*D^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFwXiYvXih6XiExXi4rXi1hXiVrXiJ8XipEXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 31
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1e99e1148bcc",
      "text": "蠢貨！你們真以為能打敗我嗎？你們千里迢迢來到這裡， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.u^.w^*W^*F^*{^-2^!B^%{^'b^$-^$R^$%^+X^.V^*F^*{^+7^)(^:c^:c^!O^!u^(s^-j^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi51Xi53XipXXipGXip7Xi0yXiFCXiV7XidiXiQtXiRSXiQlXitYXi5WXipGXip7Xis3XikoXjpjXjpjXiFPXiF1XihzXi1qXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d0864205903b",
      "text": "不過是為了死在我手裡！無數比你們更強大的人都曾挑戰我並化為齏粉，難道你們以為 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^(x^,X^%{^*D^%L^\"d^$%^$+^-j^*W^%}^$V^,m^*F^*{^$o^#]^\"z^&Z^!<^)$^.j^,H^$(^$%^!+^\")^%{^9g^'5^*A^)a^(y^*F^*{^!B^%{ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXih4XixYXiV7XipEXiVMXiJkXiQlXiQrXi1qXipXXiV9XiRWXixtXipGXip7XiRvXiNdXiJ6XiZaXiE8XikkXi5qXixIXiQoXiQlXiErXiIpXiV7XjlnXic1XipBXilhXih5XipGXip7XiFCXiV7IA==",
      "byte_length": 115
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_dcc6ee031d83",
      "text": "自己有何不同？你們正好能為我的「收藏品」增添新成員！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'l^#I^$s^!L^!)^\"E^.V^*F^*{^%H^+i^'b^%{^$%^&Z^!#^$M^-f^\"R^!$^\"s^5`^$\\^$$^+G^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XidsXiNJXiRzXiFMXiEpXiJFXi5WXipGXip7XiVIXitpXidiXiV7XiQlXiZaXiEjXiRNXi1mXiJSXiEkXiJzXjVgXiRcXiQkXitHXipX",
      "byte_length": 78
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_209a9c6c722b",
      "text": "哼！原來你們找了幫手！好吧，我們會好好收拾他們的！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+K^*W^\"5^!O^*F^*{^$/^*D^+}^$+^*W^+i^*I^*A^$%^*{^$r^+i^+i^$M^7[^!@^*{^&Z^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitLXipXXiI1XiFPXipGXip7XiQvXipEXit9XiQrXipXXitpXipJXipBXiQlXip7XiRyXitpXitpXiRNXjdbXiFAXip7XiZaXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_816f0b38e7e5",
      "text": "現在輪到你們了！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&?^\"d^(h^!u^*F^*{^*D^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiY/XiJkXihoXiF1XipGXip7XipEXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4da1e21c0e3a",
      "text": "你們殺了我的弟弟戈伯尼克斯！我絕不可能原諒這種 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^%M^*D^$%^&Z^16^16^*M^:X^#>^!d^$[^*W^$%^-I^!)^\"A^'b^\"5^0<^(s^'$ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiVNXipEXiQlXiZaXjE2XjE2XipNXjpYXiM+XiFkXiRbXipXXiQlXi1JXiEpXiJBXidiXiI1XjA8XihzXickIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cc02ec0eef04",
      "text": "罪行！當你們成為我收藏的一部分時，你們將體會何謂真正的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^5x^(;^*W^&N^*F^*{^$$^%{^$%^$M^-f^&Z^!%^)#^!s^$f^*A^*F^*{^#7^**^$r^!L^0s^-2^%H^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjV4Xig7XipXXiZOXipGXip7XiQkXiV7XiQlXiRNXi1mXiZaXiElXikjXiFzXiRmXipBXipGXip7XiM3XioqXiRyXiFMXjBzXi0yXiVIXiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_464b7954a281",
      "text": "痛苦！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-.^.t^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi0uXi50XipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 10
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5f429676c0a8",
      "text": "我看見我的弟弟沒跟你們在一起。我知道他一直在幫你們，所以 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*Q^-m^$%^&Z^16^16^%\\^.+^*F^*{^\"d^!%^.(^!\"^$%^&h^(y^!@^!%^&`^\"d^+}^*F^*{^*A^$)^!B ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXipRXi1tXiQlXiZaXjE2XjE2XiVcXi4rXipGXip7XiJkXiElXi4oXiEiXiQlXiZoXih5XiFAXiElXiZgXiJkXit9XipGXip7XipBXiQpXiFCIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f3a53be2e900",
      "text": "他一定是死在了我的某隻造物手中。雖然給予致命一擊的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^!%^#.^,X^%L^\"d^*D^$%^&Z^%$^)[^(v^&4^$+^!,^!\"^.A^&\"^'A^!4^'o^\"N^!%^$F^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXiElXiMuXixYXiVMXiJkXipEXiQlXiZaXiUkXilbXih2XiY0XiQrXiEsXiEiXi5BXiYiXidBXiE0XidvXiJOXiElXiRGXiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_20935b510c3b",
      "text": "不是你們，但我仍要把他的死算在你們頭上。要是你們當初沒有 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^,X^*F^*{^*A^!I^$%^!?^(C^$1^!@^&Z^%L^-C^\"d^*F^*{^)t^!'^!\"^(C^,X^*F^*{^&N^1\"^%\\^$s ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXixYXipGXip7XipBXiFJXiQlXiE/XihDXiQxXiFAXiZaXiVMXi1DXiJkXipGXip7Xil0XiEnXiEiXihDXixYXipGXip7XiZOXjEiXiVcXiRzIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cd06d7268103",
      "text": "插手介入，我弟弟現在肯定還活著！你們必須為此償命！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^4{^$+^!>^!f^*A^$%^16^16^&?^\"d^-Z^#.^.7^%i^-a^*W^*F^*{^#l^)r^%{^%I^5-^\"N^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjR7XiQrXiE+XiFmXipBXiQlXjE2XjE2XiY/XiJkXi1aXiMuXi43XiVpXi1hXipXXipGXip7XiNsXilyXiV7XiVJXjUtXiJOXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e38f0b48e9e6",
      "text": "你們！你們一定是巴爾卡札的密探！區區逃奴絕不可能 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^*W^*F^*{^!%^#.^,X^#K^&/^\"0^.k^&Z^#0^$>^*W^\"+^\"+^(p^##^-I^!)^\"A^'b ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XipXXipGXip7XiElXiMuXixYXiNLXiYvXiIwXi5rXiZaXiMwXiQ+XipXXiIrXiIrXihwXiMjXi1JXiEpXiJBXidiIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_df2ead2c66a5",
      "text": "突破得了 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'*^&n^#e^*D ",
      "encoded_base64": "XicqXiZuXiNlXipEIA==",
      "byte_length": 13
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6aaa75277d3e",
      "text": "凱爾達以及 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!p^&/^(z^!B^\"7 ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFwXiYvXih6XiFCXiI3IA==",
      "byte_length": 16
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a8af0b6b4f5f",
      "text": "我的殭屍和 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^&Z^3N^#?^\"O ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiZaXjNOXiM/XiJPIA==",
      "byte_length": 16
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8dd87b7d6dd9",
      "text": "我的軟泥怪！讓你們的主子知道，統治亞薩斯的人將會是我，而不是他！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^&Z^.x^%d^#s^*W^-}^*F^*{^&Z^!-^#(^&h^(y^*A^'B^%_^!9^-e^$[^&Z^!<^#7^$r^,X^$%^*A^'W^!)^,X^!@^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiZaXi54XiVkXiNzXipXXi19XipGXip7XiZaXiEtXiMoXiZoXih5XipBXidCXiVfXiE5Xi1lXiRbXiZaXiE8XiM3XiRyXixYXiQlXipBXidXXiEpXixYXiFAXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 97
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d049291b024a",
      "text": "現在，我將徹底終結你們的性命！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&?^\"d^*A^$%^#7^18^/^^-H^'@^*F^*{^&Z^#r^\"N^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiY/XiJkXipBXiQlXiM3XjE4Xi9eXi1IXidAXipGXip7XiZaXiNyXiJOXipX",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e7cd152002c8",
      "text": "戈伯尼克斯！你竟然在幫這些奴隸？為什麼？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*M^:X^#>^!d^$[^*W^*F^28^&\"^\"d^+}^(s^!8^##^)Z^.V^%{^!=^.T^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipNXjpYXiM+XiFkXiRbXipXXipGXjI4XiYiXiJkXit9XihzXiE4XiMjXilaXi5WXiV7XiE9Xi5UXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_88d053ce70d9",
      "text": "戈伯尼克斯張開雙臂，緩緩走向他的哥哥。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*M^:X^#>^!d^$[^,(^)F^)_^'k^*A^'J^'J^.&^+?^!@^&Z^\"S^\"S^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipNXjpYXiM+XiFkXiRbXiwoXilGXilfXidrXipBXidKXidKXi4mXis/XiFAXiZaXiJTXiJTXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8242c9b90488",
      "text": "不，戈伯尼克斯！別再過來了！我警告你！求你！別逼我…… ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^*A^*M^:X^#>^!d^$[^*W^*H^!l^(x^!O^*D^*W^$%^(S^+B^*F^*W^,n^*F^*W^*H^.1^$%^*o^*o ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXipBXipNXjpYXiM+XiFkXiRbXipXXipIXiFsXih4XiFPXipEXipXXiQlXihTXitCXipGXipXXixuXipGXipXXipIXi4xXiQlXipvXipvIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ff5cc37a9a72",
      "text": "戈伯尼克斯依然張開雙臂，繼續朝他的哥哥走近。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*M^:X^#>^!d^$[^!Q^&\"^,(^)F^)_^'k^*A^-O^'M^,^^!@^&Z^\"S^\"S^.&^(l^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipNXjpYXiM+XiFkXiRbXiFRXiYiXiwoXilGXilfXidrXipBXi1PXidNXixeXiFAXiZaXiJTXiJTXi4mXihsXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6cdef025e58c",
      "text": "我警告你，戈伯尼克斯，求你了！不要！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^(S^+B^*F^*A^*M^:X^#>^!d^$[^*A^,n^*F^*D^*W^!)^(C^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXihTXitCXipGXipBXipNXjpYXiM+XiFkXiRbXipBXixuXipGXipEXipXXiEpXihDXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_88dc78c7f72d",
      "text": "戈伯尼克斯伸出雙手摟住他的哥哥，正要將他擁入懷中。然而在戈伯尼克斯 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*M^:X^#>^!d^$[^/N^!q^)_^$+^:[^*z^!@^&Z^\"S^\"S^*A^%H^(C^#7^!@^,M^!f^,9^!,^!\"^&\"^'W^\"d^*M^:X^#>^!d^$[ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipNXjpYXiM+XiFkXiRbXi9OXiFxXilfXiQrXjpbXip6XiFAXiZaXiJTXiJTXipBXiVIXihDXiM3XiFAXixNXiFmXiw5XiEsXiEiXiYiXidXXiJkXipNXjpYXiM+XiFkXiRbIA==",
      "byte_length": 100
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c6afc2beb40f",
      "text": "真正觸及他之前，達戈拉爾的雙眼泛起光芒，戈伯尼克斯瞬間解體化為塵埃。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-2^%H^(J^\"7^!@^!/^!z^*A^(z^*M^$6^&/^&Z^)_^&d^0i^.(^!c^'u^*A^*M^:X^#>^!d^$[^1N^)G^(I^**^\")^%{^\"p^/&^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi0yXiVIXihKXiI3XiFAXiEvXiF6XipBXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXiZaXilfXiZkXjBpXi4oXiFjXid1XipBXipNXjpYXiM+XiFkXiRbXjFOXilHXihJXioqXiIpXiV7XiJwXi8mXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 103
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4f7b87c0738f",
      "text": "耐人尋味的是，戈伯尼克斯剛才的舉動完全不像要攻擊他的哥哥， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-S^!<^#9^1n^&Z^,X^*A^*M^:X^#>^!d^$[^+0^$,^&Z^01^\"%^#,^!h^!)^!`^(C^$O^$F^!@^&Z^\"S^\"S^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi1TXiE8XiM5XjFuXiZaXixYXipBXipNXjpYXiM+XiFkXiRbXiswXiQsXiZaXjAxXiIlXiMsXiFoXiEpXiFgXihDXiRPXiRGXiFAXiZaXiJTXiJTXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_50213fbcd477",
      "text": "倒更像是在乞求最後一次的擁抱。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!X^$o^!`^,X^\"d^4+^,n^$q^#b^!%^%D^&Z^,M^,@^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFYXiRvXiFgXixYXiJkXjQrXixuXiRxXiNiXiElXiVEXiZaXixNXixAXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e69a772c4ef2",
      "text": "達戈拉爾怒不可遏地看著你們，氣得渾身發抖。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(z^*M^$6^&/^#o^!)^\"A^7n^\"e^*Q^-a^*F^*{^*A^%U^#e^2+^(c^&W^:Z^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXiNvXiEpXiJBXjduXiJlXipRXi1hXipGXip7XipBXiVVXiNlXjIrXihjXiZXXjpaXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d195613eef60",
      "text": "你、你們！都是你們害的！要不是你們攪局，我根本不用親手 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^!!^*F^*{^*W^)$^,X^*F^*{^#/^&Z^*W^(C^!)^,X^*F^*{^*c^._^*A^$%^%)^$x^!)^&H^(F^$+ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiEhXipGXip7XipXXikkXixYXipGXip7XiMvXiZaXipXXihDXiEpXixYXipGXip7XipjXi5fXipBXiQlXiUpXiR4XiEpXiZIXihGXiQrIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9b3aa365344f",
      "text": "殺了他！是你們來到這裡害死了我弟弟！為此，你們將遭受永世的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%M^*D^!@^*W^,X^*F^*{^!O^!u^(s^-j^#/^%L^*D^$%^16^16^*W^%{^%I^*A^*F^*{^#7^(}^\";^%W^*p^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVNXipEXiFAXipXXixYXipGXip7XiFPXiF1XihzXi1qXiMvXiVMXipEXiQlXjE2XjE2XipXXiV7XiVJXipBXipGXip7XiM3Xih9XiI7XiVXXipwXiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bae60fb24679",
      "text": "折磨——我一定會讓你們求生不得、求死不能！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,?^-7^*n^*n^$%^!%^#.^$r^-}^*F^*{^,n^&F^!)^#e^!!^,n^%L^!)^'b^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xiw/Xi03XipuXipuXiQlXiElXiMuXiRyXi19XipGXip7XixuXiZGXiEpXiNlXiEhXixuXiVMXiEpXidiXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_386a00cf2ad4",
      "text": "一直沉默不語的凱爾達，終於忍不住開口了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!%^&`^%Z^:d^!)^0:^&Z^!p^&/^(z^*A^-H^$^^1y^!)^*z^)F^\"<^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiElXiZgXiVaXjpkXiEpXjA6XiZaXiFwXiYvXih6XipBXi1IXiReXjF5XiEpXip6XilGXiI8XipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 60
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5db0b491cddd",
      "text": "主人，冷靜點！那不過是一具腐爛的屍體！您的弟—— ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!-^!<^*A^!n^)h^*;^*W^)!^!)^(x^,X^!%^!k^0/^&-^&Z^#?^**^*W^4:^&Z^16^*n^*n ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEtXiE8XipBXiFuXiloXio7XipXXikhXiEpXih4XixYXiElXiFrXjAvXiYtXiZaXiM/XioqXipXXjQ6XiZaXjE2XipuXipuIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7c1208ab94c7",
      "text": "凱爾達甚至沒能把話說完。達戈拉爾只是冷冷瞥了他一眼， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!p^&/^(z^/|^'n^%\\^'b^$1^-v^-x^#,^!\"^(z^*M^$6^&/^\"?^,X^!n^!n^:`^*D^!@^!%^&d^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFwXiYvXih6Xi98XiduXiVcXidiXiQxXi12Xi14XiMsXiEiXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXiI/XixYXiFuXiFuXjpgXipEXiFAXiElXiZkXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_121fd647b69f",
      "text": "凱爾達也跟著解體化為了灰燼。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!p^&/^(z^!1^.+^-a^(I^**^\")^%{^*D^%y^&)^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFwXiYvXih6XiExXi4rXi1hXihJXioqXiIpXiV7XipEXiV5XiYpXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 43
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a6484f5fabf0",
      "text": "永遠不准那樣議論我弟弟！永遠不准！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%W^({^!)^/Q^)!^,f^-|^1\\^$%^16^16^*W^%W^({^!)^/Q^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVXXih7XiEpXi9RXikhXixmXi18XjFcXiQlXjE2XjE2XipXXiVXXih7XiEpXi9RXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b9cbcf5407f5",
      "text": "達戈拉爾從凱爾達的骨灰旁轉過身來，冷冷注視著你們。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(z^*M^$6^&/^#f^!p^&/^(z^&Z^*$^%y^.h^(i^(x^(c^!O^*A^!n^!n^%e^(E^-a^*F^*{^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXiNmXiFwXiYvXih6XiZaXiokXiV5Xi5oXihpXih4XihjXiFPXipBXiFuXiFuXiVlXihFXi1hXipGXip7XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d2592b27e978",
      "text": "你們！這群奴隸！你們將遭受與戈伯尼克斯和凱爾達相同的命運！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^*W^(s^'R^##^)Z^*W^*F^*{^#7^(}^\";^'p^*M^:X^#>^!d^$[^\"O^!p^&/^(z^&a^\"E^&Z^\"N^.4^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XipXXihzXidSXiMjXilaXipXXipGXip7XiM3Xih9XiI7XidwXipNXjpYXiM+XiFkXiRbXiJPXiFwXiYvXih6XiZhXiJFXiZaXiJOXi40XipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1c9b0760115a",
      "text": "不——！退後啊啊啊啊啊啊！啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^*n^*n^*W^*V^#b^+Q^+Q^+Q^+Q^+Q^+Q^*W^+Q^+Q^+Q^+Q^+Q^+Q^+Q^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXipuXipuXipXXipWXiNiXitRXitRXitRXitRXitRXitRXipXXitRXitRXitRXitRXitRXitRXitRXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_313629c9b480",
      "text": "幽影撲向了達戈拉爾！當它們觸及他時，他的身軀開始異變…… ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^2f^#a^4B^+?^*D^(z^*M^$6^&/^*W^&N^+o^*{^(J^\"7^!@^$f^*A^!@^&Z^(c^(d^)F^+k^&M^(U^*o^*o ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjJmXiNhXjRCXis/XipEXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXipXXiZOXitvXip7XihKXiI3XiFAXiRmXipBXiFAXiZaXihjXihkXilGXitrXiZNXihVXipvXipvIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2992cf79694a",
      "text": "他隨身攜帶的物品紛紛掉落，在一道刺目的閃光中，他徹底被轉化了！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^)X^(c^0e^#N^&Z^&4^\"R^7d^7d^/e^-`^*A^\"d^!%^(y^!w^&^^&Z^)E^!c^!,^*A^!@^18^/^^(@^(i^\")^*D^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXilYXihjXjBlXiNOXiZaXiY0XiJSXjdkXjdkXi9lXi1gXipBXiJkXiElXih5XiF3XiZeXiZaXilFXiFjXiEsXipBXiFAXjE4Xi9eXihAXihpXiIpXipEXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 94
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_457cfebbc48c",
      "text": "達戈拉爾！你的判決已經下達。好好品嚐你的痛苦吧，因為在這永恆的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(z^*M^$6^&/^*W^*F^&Z^1k^,o^#J^'D^!(^(z^!\"^+i^+i^\"R^1q^*F^&Z^-.^.t^*I^*A^\"]^%{^\"d^(s^%W^:6^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXipXXipGXiZaXjFrXixvXiNKXidEXiEoXih6XiEiXitpXitpXiJSXjFxXipGXiZaXi0uXi50XipJXipBXiJdXiV7XiJkXihzXiVXXjo2XiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 94
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b472e7e6b8ef",
      "text": "餘生之中，這將是你所能感受到的唯一知覺。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^1e^&F^!/^!,^*A^(s^#7^,X^*F^$)^'b^#{^\";^!u^&Z^+O^!%^&h^(G^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjFlXiZGXiEvXiEsXipBXihzXiM3XixYXipGXiQpXidiXiN7XiI7XiF1XiZaXitPXiElXiZoXihHXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9d0618792e2e",
      "text": "異鄉人，你們摧毀了達戈拉爾。我們原本對達戈拉爾的審判並非 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&M^6<^!<^*A^*F^*{^$E^%N^*D^(z^*M^$6^&/^!\"^$%^*{^\"5^$x^#:^(z^*M^$6^&/^&Z^7V^1k^!+^)i ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZNXjY8XiE8XipBXipGXip7XiRFXiVOXipEXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXiEiXiQlXip7XiI1XiR4XiM6Xih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXiZaXjdWXjFrXiErXilpIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_402fb50ca587",
      "text": "讓他如此輕易地解脫，但遺憾的是，如今已別無選擇。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-}^!@^#$^%I^(g^,W^\"e^(I^'c^*A^!I^0v^0_^&Z^,X^*A^#$^*E^#J^*H^%}^.6^,N^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi19XiFAXiMkXiVJXihnXixXXiJlXihJXidjXipBXiFJXjB2XjBfXiZaXixYXipBXiMkXipFXiNKXipIXiV9Xi42XixOXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cd1eb613aa80",
      "text": "我們不會向你們尋求復仇；那是達戈拉爾的行徑，而我們並不想 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^!)^$r^+?^*F^*{^#9^,n^#g^1g^*C^)!^,X^(z^*M^$6^&/^&Z^(;^#c^*A^'W^$%^*{^!+^!)^,1 ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7XiEpXiRyXis/XipGXip7XiM5XixuXiNnXjFnXipDXikhXixYXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXiZaXig7XiNjXipBXidXXiQlXip7XiErXiEpXiwxIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_833e719d4a98",
      "text": "像他那樣殘酷行事。我們就此離去了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!`^!@^)!^,f^,l^1b^(;^*r^!\"^$%^*{^*J^%I^)`^\"6^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFgXiFAXikhXixmXixsXjFiXig7XipyXiEiXiQlXip7XipKXiVJXilgXiI2XipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9617d5c83704",
      "text": "恭喜！隊伍獲得了 12,000 點經驗值！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^1{^+V^*W^)U^!F^&:^#e^*D 12,000 ^*;^'D^.P^!Z^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjF7XitWXipXXilVXiFGXiY6XiNlXipEIDEyLDAwMCBeKjteJ0ReLlBeIVpeKlcg",
      "byte_length": 48
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_06c2e9c6435f",
      "text": "好啊！你們竟然擊敗了我的替身，還看破了我的偽裝！你們肯定是巴爾卡札的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+i^+Q^*W^*F^*{^28^&\"^$F^$R^*D^$%^&Z^2o^(c^*A^.7^*Q^&n^*D^$%^&Z^6J^(A^*W^*F^*{^-Z^#.^,X^#K^&/^\"0^.k^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitpXitRXipXXipGXip7XjI4XiYiXiRGXiRSXipEXiQlXiZaXjJvXihjXipBXi43XipRXiZuXipEXiQlXiZaXjZKXihBXipXXipGXip7Xi1aXiMuXixYXiNLXiYvXiIwXi5rXiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 103
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5cf84121a9e1",
      "text": "走狗——只有在他的協助下，你們才能走到這一步。不過現在， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.&^-&^*n^*n^\"?^$s^\"d^!@^&Z^2[^\"#^!(^*A^*F^*{^$,^'b^.&^!u^(s^!%^,i^!\"^!)^(x^&?^\"d^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi4mXi0mXipuXipuXiI/XiRzXiJkXiFAXiZaXjJbXiIjXiEoXipBXipGXip7XiQsXidiXi4mXiF1XihzXiElXixpXiEiXiEpXih4XiY/XiJkXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_986d31ab5197",
      "text": "你們的任務到此為止了——你們死期已至！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^&Z^!C^+4^!u^%I^%{^%G^*D^*n^*n^*F^*{^%L^$u^#J^'n^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiZaXiFDXis0XiF1XiVJXiV7XiVHXipEXipuXipuXipGXip7XiVMXiR1XiNKXiduXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b1b27cca9608",
      "text": "現在，納命來吧！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&?^\"d^*A^';^\"N^!O^*I^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiY/XiJkXipBXic7XiJOXiFPXipJXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b60a03865da8",
      "text": "特克圖克特雷的裝置外觀類似一架風琴。許多風管 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&5^!d^\"b^!d^&5^)c^&Z^(A^'Q^\"w^*R^)w^!H^!%^%\"^)y^:k^!\"^-s^\"x^)y^-D ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiY1XiFkXiJiXiFkXiY1XiljXiZaXihBXidRXiJ3XipSXil3XiFIXiElXiUiXil5XjprXiEiXi1zXiJ4Xil5Xi1EIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3e99dc806656",
      "text": "從頂部探出，控制面板上佈滿了各式各樣的按鈕與 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#f^)p^)#^$>^!q^*A^$@^!v^)j^$}^!'^:f^,{^*D^+>^#X^+>^,f^&Z^$9^).^'p ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNmXilwXikjXiQ+XiFxXipBXiRAXiF2XilqXiR9XiEnXjpmXix7XipEXis+XiNYXis+XixmXiZaXiQ5XikuXidwIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0a3d1073dd5e",
      "text": "琴鍵。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^:k^9x^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjprXjl4XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 10
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_dec3d3d8fa6c",
      "text": "無論你如何嘗試，站在目前的角度都無法操作這架風琴。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%}^1\\^*F^#$^!L^1o^-u^*A^->^\"d^&^^!z^&Z^(H^#V^)$^%}^%b^$H^!M^(s^%\"^)y^:k^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiV9XjFcXipGXiMkXiFMXjFvXi11XipBXi0+XiJkXiZeXiF6XiZaXihIXiNWXikkXiV9XiViXiRIXiFNXihzXiUiXil5XjprXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_20fb0288bd07",
      "text": "要彈奏風琴嗎？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(C^#^^8F^)y^:k^+X^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihDXiNeXjhGXil5XjprXitYXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 22
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1973cbfd5fde",
      "text": "一陣排山倒海的尖叫與哀嚎猛烈衝擊著你的耳朵，折磨著你的心智。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!%^)P^$<^11^!X^6`^&Z^#=^+<^'p^2`^\"Y^*P^%|^-h^$F^-a^*F^&Z^'Y^9C^*A^,?^-7^-a^*F^&Z^#k^$i^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiElXilQXiQ8XjExXiFYXjZgXiZaXiM9Xis8XidwXjJgXiJZXipQXiV8Xi1oXiRGXi1hXipGXiZaXidZXjlDXipBXiw/Xi03Xi1hXipGXiZaXiNrXiRpXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_82e325043dd4",
      "text": "聽著這刺耳的噪音讓你劇烈頭痛，但除此以外幾乎什麼都 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-X^-a^(s^!w^'Y^&Z^:h^34^-}^*F^1#^%|^)t^-.^*A^!I^)Q^%I^!B^\"w^#T^!0^!=^.T^)$ ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi1YXi1hXihzXiF3XidZXiZaXjpoXjM0Xi19XipGXjEjXiV8Xil0Xi0uXipBXiFJXilRXiVJXiFCXiJ3XiNUXiEwXiE9Xi5UXikkIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_40c13a123930",
      "text": "沒發生。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%\\^&W^&F^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVcXiZXXiZGXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 13
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0a136bc66033",
      "text": "有了上次彈奏風琴的慘痛經驗，你現在心神太過震撼，如果不 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$s^*D^!'^%D^#^^8F^)y^:k^&Z^,4^-.^'D^.P^*A^*F^&?^\"d^#k^&w^+f^(x^32^:i^*A^#$^%!^!) ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRzXipEXiEnXiVEXiNeXjhGXil5XjprXiZaXiw0Xi0uXidEXi5QXipBXipGXiY/XiJkXiNrXiZ3XitmXih4XjMyXjppXipBXiMkXiUhXiEpIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c8c1db309f29",
      "text": "稍作休息，根本無法再次嘗試。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-:^!M^!G^#w^*A^%)^$x^%}^%b^!l^%D^1o^-u^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi06XiFNXiFHXiN3XipBXiUpXiR4XiV9XiViXiFsXiVEXjFvXi11XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 43
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3229735e720c",
      "text": "一道耀眼奪目的光束重重擊中了達戈拉爾！他發出淒厲慘叫， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!%^(y^7D^&d^1,^&^^&Z^!c^$|^))^))^$F^!,^*D^(z^*M^$6^&/^*W^!@^&W^!q^,t^+:^,4^+<^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiElXih5XjdEXiZkXjEsXiZeXiZaXiFjXiR8XikpXikpXiRGXiEsXipEXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXipXXiFAXiZXXiFxXix0Xis6Xiw0Xis8XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_21ce5811a4e3",
      "text": "隨後在地上溶解成一灘塵埃。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)X^#b^\"d^\"e^!'^:]^(I^$$^!%^:j^\"p^/&^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XilYXiNiXiJkXiJlXiEnXjpdXihJXiQkXiElXjpqXiJwXi8mXiEi",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6b76b73c8ea1",
      "text": "不！千萬別彈那個！你根本不知道自己在做什麼！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^*W^+7^-_^*H^#^^)!^!V^*W^*F^%)^$x^!)^&h^(y^'l^#I^\"d^*~^!=^.T^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXipXXis3Xi1fXipIXiNeXikhXiFWXipXXipGXiUpXiR4XiEpXiZoXih5XidsXiNJXiJkXip+XiE9Xi5UXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7bf6a10448cd",
      "text": "在一道耀眼的光芒中， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"d^!%^(y^7D^&d^&Z^!c^'u^!,^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJkXiElXih5XjdEXiZkXiZaXiFjXid1XiEsXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 31
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0058e236ce08",
      "text": "凱爾達 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!p^&/^(z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFwXiYvXih6IA==",
      "byte_length": 10
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cb8bd2f66fab",
      "text": "與 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'p ",
      "encoded_base64": "XidwIA==",
      "byte_length": 4
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_02f0a79561f8",
      "text": "軟泥怪 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.x^%d^#s ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi54XiVkXiNzIA==",
      "byte_length": 10
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0473bd221242",
      "text": "被摧毀了！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(@^$E^%N^*D^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihAXiRFXiVOXipEXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 16
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f5c72e2ddd8c",
      "text": "你聽到了陣陣呻吟與哀號，彷彿是從牆壁深處傳出來的一般。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^-X^!u^*D^)P^)P^:g^6L^'p^2`^(-^*A^.a^.b^,X^#f^&0^*\\^2*^(,^+$^!q^!O^&Z^!%^'r^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXi1YXiF1XipEXilQXilQXjpnXjZMXidwXjJgXigtXipBXi5hXi5iXixYXiNmXiYwXipcXjIqXigsXiskXiFxXiFPXiZaXiElXidyXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bfdc3f0612b4",
      "text": "幽影轉身看向你們。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^2f^#a^(i^(c^*Q^+?^*F^*{^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjJmXiNhXihpXihjXipRXis/XipGXip7XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 28
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_97e55ebadb2f",
      "text": "異鄉人，這是我們的使命。你們召喚了我們，如今我們終於能從這場 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&M^6<^!<^*A^(s^,X^$%^*{^&Z^!N^\"N^!\"^*F^*{^\"@^\"U^*D^$%^*{^*A^#$^*E^$%^*{^-H^$^^'b^#f^(s^\"n ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZNXjY8XiE8XipBXihzXixYXiQlXip7XiZaXiFOXiJOXiEiXipGXip7XiJAXiJVXipEXiQlXip7XipBXiMkXipFXiQlXip7Xi1IXiReXidiXiNmXihzXiJuIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f1146bf261ca",
      "text": "惡夢中解脫。請不要插手干涉。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#y^\"y^!,^(I^'c^!\"^*S^!)^(C^4{^$+^#R^3O^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiN5XiJ5XiEsXihJXidjXiEiXipTXiEpXihDXjR7XiQrXiNSXjNPXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 43
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d08c26e8c3a5",
      "text": "說完，幽影轉向了達戈拉爾。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-x^#,^*A^2f^#a^(i^+?^*D^(z^*M^$6^&/^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi14XiMsXipBXjJmXiNhXihpXis/XipEXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 40
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5604b6834727",
      "text": "達戈拉爾！你生前的殘虐冷酷，決定了你死後的宿命。你的靈魂將會 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(z^*M^$6^&/^*W^*F^&F^!z^&Z^,l^3)^!n^1b^*A^,o^#.^*D^*F^%L^#b^&Z^7+^\"N^!\"^*F^&Z^)g^*.^#7^$r ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXipXXipGXiZGXiF6XiZaXixsXjMpXiFuXjFiXipBXixvXiMuXipEXipGXiVMXiNiXiZaXjcrXiJOXiEiXipGXiZaXilnXiouXiM3XiRyIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6a25ebe9dc5d",
      "text": "被囚禁在你自己親手製造的造物之中，在無盡的永恆裡承受痛苦—— ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(@^\"Z^&y^\"d^*F^'l^#I^(F^$+^(B^(v^&Z^(v^&4^!/^!,^*A^\"d^%}^-1^&Z^%W^:6^-j^$0^\";^-.^.t^*n^*n ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihAXiJaXiZ5XiJkXipGXidsXiNJXihGXiQrXihCXih2XiZaXih2XiY0XiEvXiEsXipBXiJkXiV9Xi0xXiZaXiVXXjo2Xi1qXiQwXiI7Xi0uXi50XipuXipuIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bb4cdbde5489",
      "text": "難以忍受的劇痛。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)a^!B^1y^\";^&Z^1#^-.^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XilhXiFCXjF5XiI7XiZaXjEjXi0uXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bc3c518ca092",
      "text": "不！退後！你們必須退後！別靠近我！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^*W^*V^#b^*W^*F^*{^#l^)r^*V^#b^*W^*H^.C^(l^$%^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXipXXipWXiNiXipXXipGXip7XiNsXilyXipWXiNiXipXXipIXi5DXihsXiQlXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0ac4180d62ff",
      "text": "不要插手干涉！這是我們的使命！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^(C^4{^$+^#R^3O^*W^(s^,X^$%^*{^&Z^!N^\"N^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXihDXjR7XiQrXiNSXjNPXipXXihzXixYXiQlXip7XiZaXiFOXiJOXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f07c7873682a",
      "text": "你輕易殺死了那名被綁的囚犯。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^(g^,W^%M^%L^*D^)!^\"F^(@^-K^&Z^\"Z^-%^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXihnXixXXiVNXiVMXipEXikhXiJGXihAXi1LXiZaXiJaXi0lXiEi",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_04c7fe218a8a",
      "text": "我……我覺得好多了。謝謝你！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*o^*o^$%^(G^#e^+i^\"x^*D^!\"^-z^-z^*F^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXipvXipvXiQlXihHXiNlXitpXiJ4XipEXiEiXi16Xi16XipGXipX",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9998fa918d5e",
      "text": "唔……",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+N^*o^*o",
      "encoded_base64": "XitOXipvXipv",
      "byte_length": 9
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6eb6aaf0ebe3",
      "text": "那人在水碰到嘴唇前就死了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^!<^\"d^%V^-5^!u^+[^+L^!z^*J^%L^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXiE8XiJkXiVWXi01XiF1XitbXitMXiF6XipKXiVMXipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8060ec3a3a3e",
      "text": "哇，我正需要這個！謝了！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+E^*A^$%^%H^)e^(C^(s^!V^*W^-z^*D^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XitFXipBXiQlXiVIXillXihDXihzXiFWXipXXi16XipEXipX",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3448cdd99d2b",
      "text": "我要離開這裡了！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^(C^)`^)F^(s^-j^*D^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXihDXilgXilGXihzXi1qXipEXipX",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a76c31da6bb2",
      "text": "你的攻擊被一道魔法護盾擋下了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^&Z^$O^$F^(@^!%^(y^*0^%b^(T^&b^$G^!(^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiZaXiRPXiRGXihAXiElXih5XiowXiViXihUXiZiXiRHXiEoXipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cb1e52bee89c",
      "text": "我來幫你鬆綁！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^!O^+}^*F^.R^-K^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiFPXit9XipGXi5SXi1LXipX",
      "byte_length": 21
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_73f8c7b857f5",
      "text": "你不值得我放你自由。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^!)^!Z^#e^$%^$P^*F^'l^&I^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiEpXiFaXiNlXiQlXiRQXipGXidsXiZJXiEi",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1a75ae02051c",
      "text": "再次感謝你。有什麼我能幫你的嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!l^%D^#{^-z^*F^!\"^$s^!=^.T^$%^'b^+}^*F^&Z^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFsXiVEXiN7Xi16XipGXiEiXiRzXiE9Xi5UXiQlXidiXit9XipGXiZaXitYXi5W",
      "byte_length": 48
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c3574f461a97",
      "text": "  別麻煩了，好好活下去就好！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*H^*6^-!^*D^*A^+i^+i^%i^!(^\"6^*J^+i^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkheKjZeLSFeKkReKkFeK2leK2leJWleISheIjZeKkpeK2leKlc=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4cab743290bb",
      "text": "  寶石在哪裡？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^#4^&k^\"d^+I^-j^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIzReJmteImReK0leLWpeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 20
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1588756197b4",
      "text": "  你能幫我什麼忙？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^'b^+}^$%^!=^.T^,+^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeJ2JeK31eJCVeIT1eLlReLCteLlY=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fd063c0d0fa5",
      "text": "我來放你自由！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^!O^$P^*F^'l^&I^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiFPXiRQXipGXidsXiZJXipX",
      "byte_length": 21
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_787fa552b886",
      "text": "唔……",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+N^*o^*o",
      "encoded_base64": "XitOXipvXipv",
      "byte_length": 9
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_36152a25a216",
      "text": "  我該幫你鬆綁嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^(M^+}^*F^.R^-K^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeKE1eK31eKkZeLlJeLUteK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2f78be46da3d",
      "text": "  你是賽蒙嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^,X^*U^-c^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeLFheKlVeLWNeK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 20
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_343f7d6f0323",
      "text": "  哪裡可以找到水？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^+I^-j^\"A^!B^$/^!u^%V^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeK0leLWpeIkFeIUJeJC9eIXVeJVZeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_720deb00d7fc",
      "text": "  告訴我寶石在哪！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^+B^-t^$%^#4^&k^\"d^+I^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeK0JeLXReJCVeIzReJmteImReK0leKlc=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bc6cd44b2f4b",
      "text": "唔……救命……水……給我一點就好……",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+N^*o^*o^,Q^\"N^*o^*o^%V^*o^*o^'A^$%^!%^*;^*J^+i^*o^*o",
      "encoded_base64": "XitOXipvXipvXixRXiJOXipvXipvXiVWXipvXipvXidBXiQlXiElXio7XipKXitpXipvXipv",
      "byte_length": 54
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1f06e954e0c7",
      "text": "請幫幫我！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*S^+}^+}^$%^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XipTXit9Xit9XiQlXipX",
      "byte_length": 15
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_90cc9da0ff37",
      "text": "我……我……你是誰？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*o^*o^$%^*o^*o^*F^,X^-y^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXipvXipvXiQlXipvXipvXipGXixYXi15Xi5W",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c5198e7621b6",
      "text": "唔……我好渴……幫幫我！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+N^*o^*o^$%^+i^,w^*o^*o^+}^+}^$%^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XitOXipvXipvXiQlXitpXix3XipvXipvXit9Xit9XiQlXipX",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2cab1a4a6262",
      "text": "我會盡力的！祝你好運！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^$r^-1^!~^&Z^*W^&v^*F^+i^.4^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiRyXi0xXiF+XiZaXipXXiZ2XipGXitpXi40XipX",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_63daea527dbb",
      "text": "嘿嘿，我就知道你救我是有原因的。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+\\^+\\^*A^$%^*J^&h^(y^*F^,Q^$%^,X^$s^\"5^\"]^&Z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XitcXitcXipBXiQlXipKXiZoXih5XipGXixRXiQlXixYXiRzXiI1XiJdXiZaXiEi",
      "byte_length": 48
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_79dd405c39ed",
      "text": "你想知道寶石在哪嗎？它就在其中一個裝穀物的罐子裡，",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^,1^&h^(y^#4^&k^\"d^+I^+X^.V^+o^*J^\"d^!j^!,^!%^!V^(A^'%^&4^&Z^'O^#(^-j^*A",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiwxXiZoXih5XiM0XiZrXiJkXitJXitYXi5WXitvXipKXiJkXiFqXiEsXiElXiFWXihBXiclXiY0XiZaXidPXiMoXi1qXipB",
      "byte_length": 75
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ef41d88ff175",
      "text": "不是在廚房、儲藏室，就是在噴泉附近。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^,X^\"d^,%^,<^!!^+*^-f^+r^*A^*J^,X^\"d^\"W^%a^.?^(l^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXixYXiJkXiwlXiw8XiEhXisqXi1mXityXipBXipKXixYXiJkXiJXXiVhXi4/XihsXiEi",
      "byte_length": 54
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7e3892640d03",
      "text": "太好了！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+f^+i^*D^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XitmXitpXipEXipX",
      "byte_length": 12
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bd5344e2c673",
      "text": "誰？什麼？對，我是賽蒙。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-y^.V^!=^.T^.V^#:^*A^$%^,X^*U^-c^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi15Xi5WXiE9Xi5UXi5WXiM6XipBXiQlXixYXipVXi1jXiEi",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9d8d8a7b1609",
      "text": "唔，我好渴，拜託——給我一點水——我什麼",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+N^*A^$%^+i^,w^*A^,E^-q^*n^*n^'A^$%^!%^*;^%V^*n^*n^$%^!=^.T",
      "encoded_base64": "XitOXipBXiQlXitpXix3XipBXixFXi1xXipuXipuXidBXiQlXiElXio7XiVWXipuXipuXiQlXiE9Xi5U",
      "byte_length": 60
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_aa558ac3d35e",
      "text": "都願意告訴你！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)$^.H^#z^+B^-t^*F^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XikkXi5IXiN6XitCXi10XipGXipX",
      "byte_length": 21
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_99f6e0ab52c5",
      "text": "你割斷了綁住他的繩索。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^+1^,T^*D^-K^*z^!@^&Z^'L^'>^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXisxXixUXipEXi1LXip6XiFAXiZaXidMXic+XiEi",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_dbcd80dab7fb",
      "text": "他的身體無力地倒在地上。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^&Z^(c^**^%}^!~^\"e^!X^\"d^\"e^!'^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXiZaXihjXioqXiV9XiF+XiJlXiFYXiJkXiJlXiEnXiEi",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5ea630f57d1e",
      "text": "等一下，我馬上跟你說話。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'-^!%^!(^*A^$%^*\"^!'^.+^*F^-x^-v^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XictXiElXiEoXipBXiQlXioiXiEnXi4rXipGXi14Xi12XiEi",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a2ea0ac41542",
      "text": "讓我來對付他們。面紗聯盟萬歲！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-}^$%^!O^#:^*u^!@^*{^!\"^)j^-G^-V^-0^-_^,j^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi19XiQlXiFPXiM6Xip1XiFAXip7XiEiXilqXi1HXi1WXi0wXi1fXixqXipX",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e11d49315248",
      "text": "  快逃！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*L^(p^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkxeKHBeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 11
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bb2809f48359",
      "text": "  繼續跟著我。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^-O^'M^.+^-a^$%^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLU9eJ01eLiteLWFeJCVeISI=",
      "byte_length": 20
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d1379411e412",
      "text": "跟我說說面紗聯盟的事吧。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.+^$%^-x^-x^)j^-G^-V^-0^&Z^*r^*I^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi4rXiQlXi14Xi14XilqXi1HXi1WXi0wXiZaXipyXipJXiEi",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_93c0ce752e3c",
      "text": "我猜你遲早會想逃走。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^-'^*F^.5^,V^$r^,1^(p^.&^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXi0nXipGXi41XixWXiRyXiwxXihwXi4mXiEi",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bc9b6d06826a",
      "text": "我要再次感謝你救了我。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^(C^!l^%D^#{^-z^*F^,Q^*D^$%^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXihDXiFsXiVEXiN7Xi16XipGXixRXipEXiQlXiEi",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9f54fb15ab7f",
      "text": "我發誓，我不會告訴任何人你是聯盟的一員！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^&W^-w^*A^$%^!)^$r^+B^-t^!C^!L^!<^*F^,X^-V^-0^&Z^!%^+G^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiZXXi13XipBXiQlXiEpXiRyXitCXi10XiFDXiFMXiE8XipGXixYXi1WXi0wXiZaXiElXitHXipX",
      "byte_length": 60
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_654d18f0a651",
      "text": "這裡沒什麼特別的。我一直保持警覺，",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^-j^%\\^!=^.T^&5^*H^&Z^!\"^$%^!%^&`^!T^$7^(S^(G^*A",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXi1qXiVcXiE9Xi5UXiY1XipIXiZaXiEiXiQlXiElXiZgXiFUXiQ3XihTXihHXipB",
      "byte_length": 51
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_87a1a170259e",
      "text": "就這樣而已。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*J^(s^,f^'W^#J^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipKXihzXixmXidXXiNKXiEi",
      "byte_length": 18
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_91d0f4dd24d3",
      "text": "  不客氣。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^!)^+q^%U^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeISleK3FeJVVeISI=",
      "byte_length": 14
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ddb9f0ea8580",
      "text": "  拯救亞薩斯的人民不是我的工作。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^,F^,Q^!9^-e^$[^&Z^!<^%T^!)^,X^$%^&Z^+y^!M^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLEZeLFFeITleLWVeJFteJlpeITxeJVReISleLFheJCVeJlpeK3leIU1eISI=",
      "byte_length": 47
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bd65c9fe9ab6",
      "text": "  幹得好，同志。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^,!^#e^+i^*A^\"E^#m^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLCFeI2VeK2leKkFeIkVeI21eISI=",
      "byte_length": 23
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_339b92e3e903",
      "text": "  你現在也是聯盟的一員了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^&?^\"d^!1^,X^-V^-0^&Z^!%^+G^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeJj9eImReITFeLFheLVZeLTBeJlpeISVeK0deKkReISI=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_45e41288144b",
      "text": "  好，你想跟我一起走嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^+i^*A^*F^,1^.+^$%^!%^.(^.&^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeK2leKkFeKkZeLDFeLiteJCVeISVeLiheLiZeK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_012b3f85e4ba",
      "text": "  不，我還挺喜歡待在這裡的。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^!)^*A^$%^.7^,I^+V^%F^,*^\"d^(s^-j^&Z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeISleKkFeJCVeLjdeLEleK1ZeJUZeLCpeImReKHNeLWpeJlpeISI=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d34540e9117c",
      "text": "  今天真熱，不是嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*E^+e^-2^&$^*A^!)^,X^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkVeK2VeLTJeJiReKkFeISleLFheK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0d8bb1749ae3",
      "text": "  你知道面紗聯盟的事嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^&h^(y^)j^-G^-V^-0^&Z^*r^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeJmheKHleKWpeLUdeLVZeLTBeJlpeKnJeK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7947f34e7322",
      "text": "  我不是面紗聯盟的人！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^!)^,X^)j^-G^-V^-0^&Z^!<^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeISleLFheKWpeLUdeLVZeLTBeJlpeITxeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7e317d27af06",
      "text": "  好啦——我是聯盟的人，別再說了！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^+i^+R^*n^*n^$%^,X^-V^-0^&Z^!<^*A^*H^!l^-x^*D^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeK2leK1JeKm5eKm5eJCVeLFheLVZeLTBeJlpeITxeKkFeKkheIWxeLXheKkReKlc=",
      "byte_length": 50
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_14f19aab668f",
      "text": "  對了，賽蒙……那顆寶石在哪？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^#:^*D^*A^*U^-c^*o^*o^)!^)u^#4^&k^\"d^+I^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIzpeKkReKkFeKlVeLWNeKm9eKm9eKSFeKXVeIzReJmteImReK0leLlY=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_830a9e1ab0b7",
      "text": "  同志，該是你幫我戰鬥的時候了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^\"E^#m^*A^(M^,X^*F^+}^$%^$(^*,^&Z^$f^*|^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIkVeI21eKkFeKE1eLFheKkZeK31eJCVeJCheKixeJlpeJGZeKnxeKkReISI=",
      "byte_length": 47
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8ab5d895ba78",
      "text": "  想在競技場幫我一把嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^,1^\"d^-?^,>^\"n^+}^$%^!%^$1^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLDFeImReLT9eLD5eIm5eK31eJCVeISVeJDFeK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_61e60017b61e",
      "text": "  難道村落不能對抗軍隊嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^)a^(y^$z^-`^!)^'b^#:^$4^..^)U^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKWFeKHleJHpeLWBeISleJ2JeIzpeJDReLi5eKVVeK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_436f304939fa",
      "text": "  為什麼那些村落不聯合起來？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^%{^!=^.T^)!^!8^$z^-`^!)^-V^\"C^.(^!O^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJXteIT1eLlReKSFeITheJHpeLWBeISleLVZeIkNeLiheIU9eLlY=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_903a591a21bb",
      "text": "夠了，我先走了。我們獸欄見。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+d^*D^*A^$%^!b^.&^*D^!\"^$%^*{^&<^%C^-m^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XitkXipEXipBXiQlXiFiXi4mXipEXiEiXiQlXip7XiY8XiVDXi1tXiEi",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ec019930812f",
      "text": "我哪兒都沒去。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^+I^++^)$^%\\^\"6^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXitJXisrXikkXiVcXiI2XiEi",
      "byte_length": 21
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8398474e2791",
      "text": "「再見」是什麼意思？你需要我幫忙嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!#^!l^-m^!$^,X^!=^.T^#z^#q^.V^*F^)e^(C^$%^+}^,+^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEjXiFsXi1tXiEkXixYXiE9Xi5UXiN6XiNxXi5WXipGXillXihDXiQlXit9XiwrXitYXi5W",
      "byte_length": 54
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a38a44c29c43",
      "text": "這麼有禮貌真是難得。不愧是",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^.T^$s^-8^-~^-2^,X^)a^#e^!\"^!)^,3^,X",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXi5UXiRzXi04Xi1+Xi0yXixYXilhXiNlXiEiXiEpXiwzXixY",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e5ab537c0ce1",
      "text": "面紗聯盟的一員。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)j^-G^-V^-0^&Z^!%^+G^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XilqXi1HXi1WXi0wXiZaXiElXitHXiEi",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3ee7c9808e9f",
      "text": "有個任務正配得上面紗聯盟！把分散的村落",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$s^!V^!C^+4^%H^)&^#e^!'^)j^-G^-V^-0^*W^$1^!s^$S^&Z^$z^-`",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRzXiFWXiFDXis0XiVIXikmXiNlXiEnXilqXi1HXi1WXi0wXipXXiQxXiFzXiRTXiZaXiR6Xi1g",
      "byte_length": 57
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e7088f494a64",
      "text": "聯合成一支戰鬥力量！如果真能做到，我們將",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-V^\"C^$$^!%^$L^$(^*,^!~^)*^*W^#$^%!^-2^'b^*~^!u^*A^$%^*{^#7",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi1WXiJDXiQkXiElXiRMXiQoXiosXiF+XikqXipXXiMkXiUhXi0yXidiXip+XiF1XipBXiQlXip7XiM3",
      "byte_length": 60
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5b07820bcd5d",
      "text": "被後世銘記數百年！你說得對，這值得一試。他們會說",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(@^#b^*p^.;^(K^$V^&Y^+~^*W^*F^-x^#e^#:^*A^(s^!Z^#e^!%^-u^!\"^!@^*{^$r^-x",
      "encoded_base64": "XihAXiNiXipwXi47XihLXiRWXiZZXit+XipXXipGXi14XiNlXiM6XipBXihzXiFaXiNlXiElXi11XiEiXiFAXip7XiRyXi14",
      "byte_length": 72
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d1350a4397a8",
      "text": "我瘋了，但偉大的人都是這樣被說的。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^-/^*D^*A^!I^*}^\"z^&Z^!<^)$^,X^(s^,f^(@^-x^&Z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXi0vXipEXipBXiFJXip9XiJ6XiZaXiE8XikkXixYXihzXixmXihAXi14XiZaXiEi",
      "byte_length": 51
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_45f5d6879abe",
      "text": "你得先逃出",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^#e^!b^(p^!q",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiNlXiFiXihwXiFx",
      "byte_length": 15
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_63de5f01219f",
      "text": "獸欄。等你成功了，我會趁亂離開這裡。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&<^%C^!\"^'-^*F^$$^\"!^*D^*A^$%^$r^.)^!3^)`^)F^(s^-j^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiY8XiVDXiEiXictXipGXiQkXiIhXipEXipBXiQlXiRyXi4pXiEzXilgXilGXihzXi1qXiEi",
      "byte_length": 54
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f7d704d02f7e",
      "text": "接著，你就能展開你的任務了。眼下，祝你戰鬥順利。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$?^-a^*A^*F^*J^'b^+x^)F^*F^&Z^!C^+4^*D^!\"^&d^!(^*A^&v^*F^$(^*,^.D^!t^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQ/Xi1hXipBXipGXipKXidiXit4XilGXipGXiZaXiFDXis0XipEXiEiXiZkXiEoXipBXiZ2XipGXiQoXiosXi5EXiF0XiEi",
      "byte_length": 72
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_27ab24169e6e",
      "text": "光憑一個村落，不管戰士再怎麼優秀，",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!c^,5^!%^!V^$z^-`^*A^!)^-D^$(^+a^!l^,,^.T^+)^-9^*A",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFjXiw1XiElXiFWXiR6Xi1gXipBXiEpXi1EXiQoXithXiFsXiwsXi5UXispXi05XipB",
      "byte_length": 51
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_218dc8046c4b",
      "text": "也無法對抗一支軍隊。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!1^%}^%b^#:^$4^!%^$L^..^)U^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiExXiV9XiViXiM6XiQ0XiElXiRMXi4uXilVXiEi",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ca2f26b794d5",
      "text": "不，我不這麼認為。在德拉吉的生活，就算是當角鬥士，也比",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^*A^$%^!)^(s^.T^(O^%{^!\"^\"d^#j^$6^\"D^&Z^&F^%i^*A^*J^-C^,X^&N^(H^*,^+a^*A^!1^,m",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXipBXiQlXiEpXihzXi5UXihPXiV7XiEiXiJkXiNqXiQ2XiJEXiZaXiZGXiVpXipBXipKXi1DXixYXiZOXihIXiosXithXipBXiExXixt",
      "byte_length": 81
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_63076bd63c44",
      "text": "在沙漠裡討生活安全得多。再說，總得有人阻止德拉吉的軍隊",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"d^%]^,}^-j^-o^&F^%i^+p^!h^#e^\"x^!\"^!l^-x^*A^-M^#e^$s^!<^)L^%G^#j^$6^\"D^&Z^..^)U",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJkXiVdXix9Xi1qXi1vXiZGXiVpXitwXiFoXiNlXiJ4XiEiXiFsXi14XipBXi1NXiNlXiRzXiE8XilMXiVHXiNqXiQ2XiJEXiZaXi4uXilV",
      "byte_length": 81
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c82e7dc1cc80",
      "text": "出兵屠殺那些村落。如果不阻止他們，",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!q^+,^#A^%M^)!^!8^$z^-`^!\"^#$^%!^!)^)L^%G^!@^*{^*A",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFxXissXiNBXiVNXikhXiE4XiR6Xi1gXiEiXiMkXiUhXiEpXilMXiVHXiFAXip7XipB",
      "byte_length": 51
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d677b7addde4",
      "text": "那些村落永遠不會有活路。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^!8^$z^-`^%W^({^!)^$r^$s^%i^(a^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXiE4XiR6Xi1gXiVXXih7XiEpXiRyXiRzXiVpXihhXiEi",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6f9a85726992",
      "text": "你說得對。既然我要成為聯盟的一份子，我就該幫助",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^-x^#e^#:^!\"^,U^&\"^$%^(C^$$^%{^-V^-0^&Z^!%^*x^#(^*A^$%^*J^(M^+}^\"#",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXi14XiNlXiM6XiEiXixVXiYiXiQlXihDXiQkXiV7Xi1WXi0wXiZaXiElXip4XiMoXipBXiQlXipKXihNXit9XiIj",
      "byte_length": 69
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c0e19c0435b4",
      "text": "我的同胞。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^&Z^\"E^'`^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiZaXiJFXidgXiEi",
      "byte_length": 15
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_63d3587f878b",
      "text": "不逃走？！那你要怎麼把亞薩斯的人民從",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^(p^.&^.V^*W^)!^*F^(C^,,^.T^$1^!9^-e^$[^&Z^!<^%T^#f",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXihwXi4mXi5WXipXXikhXipGXihDXiwsXi5UXiQxXiE5Xi1lXiRbXiZaXiE8XiVUXiNm",
      "byte_length": 54
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9eb35eec0b8c",
      "text": "龍王的暴政下解放出來？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*>^-)^&Z^$m^,P^!(^(I^$P^!q^!O^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "Xio+Xi0pXiZaXiRtXixQXiEoXihJXiRQXiFxXiFPXi5W",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_db458d1462ef",
      "text": "大家都知道面紗聯盟正試圖推翻",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"z^+s^)$^&h^(y^)j^-G^-V^-0^%H^-u^\"b^,J^-Q",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJ6XitzXikkXiZoXih5XilqXi1HXi1WXi0wXiVIXi11XiJiXixKXi1R",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_974ef44985af",
      "text": "龍王，拯救亞薩斯。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*>^-)^*A^,F^,Q^!9^-e^$[^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xio+Xi0pXipBXixGXixRXiE5Xi1lXiRbXiEi",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e564abee8bfe",
      "text": "謝謝你，大人！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-z^-z^*F^*A^\"z^!<^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi16Xi16XipGXipBXiJ6XiE8XipX",
      "byte_length": 21
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5ae10d8f4daa",
      "text": "你是說我？在競技場裡？我覺得我幫不上什麼忙……我",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^,X^-x^$%^.V^\"d^-?^,>^\"n^-j^.V^$%^(G^#e^$%^+}^!)^!'^!=^.T^,+^*o^*o^$%",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXixYXi14XiQlXi5WXiJkXi0/Xiw+XiJuXi1qXi5WXiQlXihHXiNlXiQlXit9XiEpXiEnXiE9Xi5UXiwrXipvXipvXiQl",
      "byte_length": 72
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_04e0dc5a63e2",
      "text": "比較像是個斥候，不是戰士。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,m^(f^!`^,X^!V^,S^*|^*A^!)^,X^$(^+a^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XixtXihmXiFgXixYXiFWXixTXip8XipBXiEpXixYXiQoXithXiEi",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b4753886d871",
      "text": "好啊，回頭見！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+i^+Q^*A^\"\\^)t^-m^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XitpXitRXipBXiJcXil0Xi1tXipX",
      "byte_length": 21
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5bceb3479c88",
      "text": "太好了——這樣吧，我在這裡守著出口。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+f^+i^*D^*n^*n^(s^,f^*I^*A^$%^\"d^(s^-j^#+^-a^!q^\"<^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XitmXitpXipEXipuXipuXihzXixmXipJXipBXiQlXiJkXihzXi1qXiMrXi1hXiFxXiI8XiEi",
      "byte_length": 54
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_080a133c1f01",
      "text": "唉，今天真夠糟的——我一直站在這裡看著那隻",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+M^*A^*E^+e^-2^+d^-E^&Z^*n^*n^$%^!%^&`^->^\"d^(s^-j^*Q^-a^)!^)[",
      "encoded_base64": "XitNXipBXipFXitlXi0yXitkXi1FXiZaXipuXipuXiQlXiElXiZgXi0+XiJkXihzXi1qXipRXi1hXikhXilb",
      "byte_length": 63
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8e98b9f26855",
      "text": "蜥蜴被曬乾。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(2^(3^(@^,Z^*X^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XigyXigzXihAXixaXipYXiEi",
      "byte_length": 18
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5f46597246d2",
      "text": "是啊，沒錯。你居然能在這種高溫下戰鬥，真令我意外。這肯定",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,X^+Q^*A^%\\^)5^!\"^*F^+w^&\"^'b^\"d^(s^'$^*+^%s^!(^$(^*,^*A^-2^*w^$%^#z^\"w^!\"^(s^-Z^#.",
      "encoded_base64": "XixYXitRXipBXiVcXik1XiEiXipGXit3XiYiXidiXiJkXihzXickXiorXiVzXiEoXiQoXiosXipBXi0yXip3XiQlXiN6XiJ3XiEiXihzXi1aXiMu",
      "byte_length": 84
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_52ae08e58d5a",
      "text": "熱得要命！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&$^#e^(C^\"N^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiYkXiNlXihDXiJOXipX",
      "byte_length": 15
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e1432de6d141",
      "text": "待在外面曬太陽也總比回獸欄好。我有種感覺，",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,*^\"d^\"w^)j^,Z^+f^.@^!1^-M^,m^\"\\^&<^%C^+i^!\"^$%^$s^'$^#{^(G^*A",
      "encoded_base64": "XiwqXiJkXiJ3XilqXixaXitmXi5AXiExXi1NXixtXiJcXiY8XiVDXitpXiEiXiQlXiRzXickXiN7XihHXipB",
      "byte_length": 63
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c80babc39914",
      "text": "我大概回不了我的牢房了——你懂我的意思吧……",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^\"z^,d^\"\\^!)^*D^$%^&Z^-$^,<^*D^*n^*n^*F^,6^$%^&Z^#z^#q^*I^*o^*o",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiJ6XixkXiJcXiEpXipEXiQlXiZaXi0kXiw8XipEXipuXipuXipGXiw2XiQlXiZaXiN6XiNxXipJXipvXipv",
      "byte_length": 66
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_88f9f3c231da",
      "text": "你出來之前這裡本來還涼快一點。有陣微風吹過，",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^!q^!O^!/^!z^(s^-j^$x^!O^.7^,s^*L^!%^*;^!\"^$s^)P^#i^)y^+A^(x^*A",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiFxXiFPXiEvXiF6XihzXi1qXiR4XiFPXi43XixzXipMXiElXio7XiEiXiRzXilQXiNpXil5XitBXih4XipB",
      "byte_length": 66
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1fd359398a30",
      "text": "大概半小時前就停了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"z^,d^\"-^#;^$f^!z^*J^+!^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJ6XixkXiItXiM7XiRmXiF6XipKXishXipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_34ff4376af86",
      "text": "沒什麼。這才是問題所在！我就是因為在打聽",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%\\^!=^.T^!\"^(s^$,^,X^*Z^.G^$)^\"d^*W^$%^*J^,X^\"]^%{^\"d^$-^-X",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVcXiE9Xi5UXiEiXihzXiQsXixYXipaXi5HXiQpXiJkXipXXiQlXipKXixYXiJdXiV7XiJkXiQtXi1Y",
      "byte_length": 60
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ee892e99a612",
      "text": "聯盟的事才被抓的。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-V^-0^&Z^*r^$,^(@^$2^&Z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi1WXi0wXiZaXipyXiQsXihAXiQyXiZaXiEi",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c2341d857fb1",
      "text": "隨便告訴我一個聯絡人的名字就好，隨便誰都行……",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)X^!R^+B^-t^$%^!%^!V^-V^-J^!<^&Z^\"F^#)^*J^+i^*A^)X^!R^-y^)$^(;^*o^*o",
      "encoded_base64": "XilYXiFSXitCXi10XiQlXiElXiFWXi1WXi1KXiE8XiZaXiJGXiMpXipKXitpXipBXilYXiFSXi15XikkXig7XipvXipv",
      "byte_length": 69
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_57ef7c3565d5",
      "text": "好吧——隨便你！也不能怪誰愛問東問西……",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+i^*I^*n^*n^)X^!R^*F^*W^!1^!)^'b^#s^-y^,2^*Z^,`^*Z^-l^*o^*o",
      "encoded_base64": "XitpXipJXipuXipuXilYXiFSXipGXipXXiExXiEpXidiXiNzXi15XiwyXipaXixgXipaXi1sXipvXipv",
      "byte_length": 60
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_152779c6751d",
      "text": "不用喊那麼大聲！我只需要被告知一次就夠了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^&H^+S^)!^.T^\"z^-W^*W^$%^\"?^)e^(C^(@^+B^&h^!%^%D^*J^+d^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXiZIXitTXikhXi5UXiJ6Xi1XXipXXiQlXiI/XillXihDXihAXitCXiZoXiElXiVEXipKXitkXipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 63
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_624fa0b956bd",
      "text": "要不是我很清楚，我還真會相信你！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(C^!)^,X^$%^*K^,u^,c^*A^$%^.7^-2^$r^&a^!U^*F^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XihDXiEpXixYXiQlXipLXix1XixjXipBXiQlXi43Xi0yXiRyXiZhXiFVXipGXipX",
      "byte_length": 48
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cd648796c244",
      "text": "我就知道！我就知道！我發誓我絕不會跟任何人透露一個字！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*J^&h^(y^*W^$%^*J^&h^(y^*W^$%^&W^-w^$%^-I^!)^$r^.+^!C^!L^!<^(q^.B^!%^!V^#)^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXipKXiZoXih5XipXXiQlXipKXiZoXih5XipXXiQlXiZXXi13XiQlXi1JXiEpXiRyXi4rXiFDXiFMXiE8XihxXi5CXiElXiFWXiMpXipX",
      "byte_length": 81
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d9a43c61bda1",
      "text": "我可以加入聯盟嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^\"A^!B^\"\"^!f^-V^-0^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiJBXiFCXiIiXiFmXi1WXi0wXitYXi5W",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ec65fe680455",
      "text": "你一定是真的來自面紗聯盟！我還以為那只是個",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^!%^#.^,X^-2^&Z^!O^'l^)j^-G^-V^-0^*W^$%^.7^!B^%{^)!^\"?^,X^!V",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiElXiMuXixYXi0yXiZaXiFPXidsXilqXi1HXi1WXi0wXipXXiQlXi43XiFCXiV7XikhXiI/XixYXiFW",
      "byte_length": 63
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_eb5fd1bed164",
      "text": "傳說！告訴我該做什麼——我什麼都願意做！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+$^-x^*W^+B^-t^$%^(M^*~^!=^.T^*n^*n^$%^!=^.T^)$^.H^#z^*~^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiskXi14XipXXitCXi10XiQlXihNXip+XiE9Xi5UXipuXipuXiQlXiE9Xi5UXikkXi5IXiN6Xip+XipX",
      "byte_length": 60
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d92835122e42",
      "text": "  在拘留欄見我。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^\"d^,B^-+^%C^-m^$%^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeImReLEJeLSteJUNeLW1eJCVeISI=",
      "byte_length": 23
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_80755756d3e3",
      "text": "幫我戰鬥。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+}^$%^$(^*,^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xit9XiQlXiQoXiosXiEi",
      "byte_length": 15
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_82ad360119c1",
      "text": "喔，那個啊……我把它藏在獸欄裡了，就在一個裝穀物的",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+T^*A^)!^!V^+Q^*o^*o^$%^$1^+o^-f^\"d^&<^%C^-j^*D^*A^*J^\"d^!%^!V^(A^'%^&4^&Z",
      "encoded_base64": "XitUXipBXikhXiFWXitRXipvXipvXiQlXiQxXitvXi1mXiJkXiY8XiVDXi1qXipEXipBXipKXiJkXiElXiFWXihBXiclXiY0XiZa",
      "byte_length": 75
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9ccf0deaf0cc",
      "text": "罐子裡。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'O^#(^-j^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XidPXiMoXi1qXiEi",
      "byte_length": 12
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5fb0997b2102",
      "text": "好，那就到時候見了！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+i^*A^)!^*J^!u^$f^*|^-m^*D^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XitpXipBXikhXipKXiF1XiRmXip8Xi1tXipEXipX",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d8906a042780",
      "text": "我不知道，沒什麼特別的。我還很虛弱。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^!)^&h^(y^*A^%\\^!=^.T^&5^*H^&Z^!\"^$%^.7^*K^-g^#\\^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiEpXiZoXih5XipBXiVcXiE9Xi5UXiY1XipIXiZaXiEiXiQlXi43XipLXi1nXiNcXiEi",
      "byte_length": 54
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c3c78a13cba1",
      "text": "我會的……但我還很虛弱。不如我們約在拘留欄見面？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^$r^&Z^*o^*o^!I^$%^.7^*K^-g^#\\^!\"^!)^#$^$%^*{^-F^\"d^,B^-+^%C^-m^)j^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiRyXiZaXipvXipvXiFJXiQlXi43XipLXi1nXiNcXiEiXiEpXiMkXiQlXip7Xi1GXiJkXixCXi0rXiVDXi1tXilqXi5W",
      "byte_length": 72
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f43f715a2e7b",
      "text": "他正期待著午餐。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^%H^$u^,*^-a^+8^.K^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXiVIXiR1XiwqXi1hXis4Xi5LXiEi",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_92898aec1762",
      "text": "屍體上什麼都沒有。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#?^**^!'^!=^.T^)$^%\\^$s^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiM/XioqXiEnXiE9Xi5UXikkXiVcXiRzXiEi",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_32aa1bbb61ca",
      "text": "我在這裡沒什麼好告訴你們的。繼續前進！等到了適當的地方， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^\"d^(s^-j^%\\^!=^.T^+i^+B^-t^*F^*{^&Z^!\"^-O^'M^!z^(w^*W^'-^!u^*D^(|^&N^&Z^\"e^$]^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiJkXihzXi1qXiVcXiE9Xi5UXitpXitCXi10XipGXip7XiZaXiEiXi1PXidNXiF6Xih3XipXXictXiF1XipEXih8XiZOXiZaXiJlXiRdXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_00c32f433842",
      "text": "我自會把能說的全告訴你們！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^'l^$r^$1^'b^-x^&Z^!h^+B^-t^*F^*{^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXidsXiRyXiQxXidiXi14XiZaXiFoXitCXi10XipGXip7XipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 40
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d3a1b349c274",
      "text": "  再說一次，我這是在哪裡？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^!l^-x^!%^%D^*A^$%^(s^,X^\"d^+I^-j^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIWxeLXheISVeJUReKkFeJCVeKHNeLFheImReK0leLWpeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7f106b65170c",
      "text": "  別再跟著我了！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*H^!l^.+^-a^$%^*D^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkheIWxeLiteLWFeJCVeKkReKlcg",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bb4383c75ca1",
      "text": "  我不是在開玩笑！快滾！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^!)^,X^\"d^)F^4U^-@^*W^*L^,z^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeISleLFheImReKUZeNFVeLUBeKldeKkxeLHpeKlcg",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_392c33523282",
      "text": "  那些人體實驗是怎麼回事？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^)!^!8^!<^**^#3^.P^,X^,,^.T^\"\\^*r^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKSFeITheITxeKipeIzNeLlBeLFheLCxeLlReIlxeKnJeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2878da5761ce",
      "text": "  你當初為何沒逃跑？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^&N^1\"^%{^!L^%\\^(p^(_^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeJk5eMSJeJXteIUxeJVxeKHBeKF9eLlY=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7714fc8d2d64",
      "text": "我們繼續前進吧。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^-O^'M^!z^(w^*I^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7Xi1PXidNXiF6Xih3XipJXiEi",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_45d2ac3d8d61",
      "text": "你在開玩笑吧！我真佩服你的膽量。沒有水門主管的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^\"d^)F^4U^-@^*I^*W^$%^-2^.}^,\\^*F^&Z^-[^)*^!\"^%\\^$s^%V^)D^!-^-D^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiJkXilGXjRVXi1AXipJXipXXiQlXi0yXi59XixcXipGXiZaXi1bXikqXiEiXiVcXiRzXiVWXilEXiEtXi1EXiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c4bae5eab86b",
      "text": "協助，誰也別想在這裡走得遠！走著瞧吧！我有太多事情可以告訴你們了！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^2[^\"#^*A^-y^!1^*H^,1^\"d^(s^-j^.&^#e^({^*W^.&^-a^-4^*I^*W^$%^$s^+f^\"x^*r^,0^\"A^!B^+B^-t^*F^*{^*D^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjJbXiIjXipBXi15XiExXipIXiwxXiJkXihzXi1qXi4mXiNlXih7XipXXi4mXi1hXi00XipJXipXXiQlXiRzXitmXiJ4XipyXiwwXiJBXiFCXitCXi10XipGXip7XipEXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 100
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6d2b6dc08af4",
      "text": "真讓人耳目一新！身處達戈拉爾的罪惡老巢居然還能開玩笑！但我話太多了！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-2^-}^!<^'Y^&^^!%^$\\^*W^(c^(,^(z^*M^$6^&/^&Z^5x^#y^'U^#G^+w^&\"^.7^'b^)F^4U^-@^*W^!I^$%^-v^+f^\"x^*D^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi0yXi19XiE8XidZXiZeXiElXiRcXipXXihjXigsXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXiZaXjV4XiN5XidVXiNHXit3XiYiXi43XidiXilGXjRVXi1AXipXXiFJXiQlXi12XitmXiJ4XipEXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 103
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_da36781d33f3",
      "text": "沒錯！沒時間可以浪費了！讓我們找到達戈拉爾並消滅他！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%\\^)5^*W^%\\^$f^)G^\"A^!B^,r^.\"^*D^*W^-}^$%^*{^$/^!u^(z^*M^$6^&/^!+^%k^%t^!@^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVcXik1XipXXiVcXiRmXilHXiJBXiFCXixyXi4iXipEXipXXi19XiQlXip7XiQvXiF1Xih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXiErXiVrXiV0XiFAXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b7beb3c3cde0",
      "text": "我是水門主管！我掌控水流並餵養軟泥怪！每當達戈拉爾需要 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^,X^%V^)D^!-^-D^*W^$%^$;^$@^%V^%j^!+^.L^.I^.x^%d^#s^*W^%P^&N^(z^*M^$6^&/^)e^(C ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXixYXiVWXilEXiEtXi1EXipXXiQlXiQ7XiRAXiVWXiVqXiErXi5MXi5JXi54XiVkXiNzXipXXiVQXiZOXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXillXihDIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f93f07eee3fc",
      "text": "從下水道抓來更多實驗品時，他都得求助於我！我已經當牛做馬太久了！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#f^!(^%V^(y^$2^!O^$o^\"x^#3^.P^\"R^$f^*A^!@^)$^#e^,n^\"#^$^^$%^*W^$%^#J^'D^&N^:q^*~^*\"^+f^!.^*D^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNmXiEoXiVWXih5XiQyXiFPXiRvXiJ4XiMzXi5QXiJSXiRmXipBXiFAXikkXiNlXixuXiIjXiReXiQlXipXXiQlXiNKXidEXiZOXjpxXip+XioiXitmXiEuXipEXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 97
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6b3fea2688de",
      "text": "然後冒著承受達戈拉爾怒火的風險？你在說笑吧！只有像你們這樣的英雄才能擊敗他！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&\"^#b^/P^-a^$0^\";^(z^*M^$6^&/^#o^%x^&Z^)y^*m^.V^*F^\"d^-x^-@^*I^*W^\"?^$s^!`^*F^*{^(s^,f^&Z^'y^)\\^$,^'b^$F^$R^!@^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiYiXiNiXi9QXi1hXiQwXiI7Xih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXiNvXiV4XiZaXil5XiptXi5WXipGXiJkXi14Xi1AXipJXipXXiI/XiRzXiFgXipGXip7XihzXixmXiZaXid5XilcXiQsXidiXiRGXiRSXiFAXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 115
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b0671ef92ec9",
      "text": "我很狡黠——我一直在忍耐等待，而你們終於來了！現在我要反了！莫奧可不是傻子！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*K^::^:A^*n^*n^$%^!%^&`^\"d^1y^-S^'-^,*^*A^'W^*F^*{^-H^$^^!O^*D^*W^&?^\"d^$%^(C^\"9^*D^*W^/F^6Q^\"A^!)^,X^7$^#(^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXipLXjo6XjpBXipuXipuXiQlXiElXiZgXiJkXjF5Xi1TXictXiwqXipBXidXXipGXip7Xi1IXiReXiFPXipEXipXXiY/XiJkXiQlXihDXiI5XipEXipXXi9GXjZRXiJBXiEpXixYXjckXiMoXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 115
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_aac3999bda33",
      "text": "抱歉！惹你們不高興絕非我的本意。我這就讓開！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,@^,h^*W^3s^*F^*{^!)^*+^-]^-I^)i^$%^&Z^$x^#z^!\"^$%^(s^*J^-}^)F^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XixAXixoXipXXjNzXipGXip7XiEpXiorXi1dXi1JXilpXiQlXiZaXiR4XiN6XiEiXiQlXihzXipKXi19XilGXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3d6241de5917",
      "text": "太棒了！救星來拯救我脫離奴役苦海了！我會幫你們 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+f^%1^*D^*W^,Q^$e^!O^,F^,Q^$%^'c^)`^##^17^.t^6`^*D^*W^$%^$r^+}^*F^*{ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitmXiUxXipEXipXXixRXiRlXiFPXixGXixRXiQlXidjXilgXiMjXjE3Xi50XjZgXipEXipXXiQlXiRyXit9XipGXip7IA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2f3937a469cf",
      "text": "殺了他。為你們指路！沒錯！沒錯！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%M^*D^!@^!\"^%{^*F^*{^$8^(a^*W^%\\^)5^*W^%\\^)5^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVNXipEXiFAXiEiXiV7XipGXip7XiQ4XihhXipXXiVcXik1XipXXiVcXik1XipX",
      "byte_length": 48
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8182ca0026bb",
      "text": "  你要幫我殺了誰？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^(C^+}^$%^%M^*D^-y^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeKENeK31eJCVeJU1eKkReLXleLlY=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8872f738080c",
      "text": "  我這是在哪裡？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^(s^,X^\"d^+I^-j^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeKHNeLFheImReK0leLWpeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 23
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9673ee73ad40",
      "text": "  你說的刺殺是怎麼回事？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^-x^&Z^!w^%M^,X^,,^.T^\"\\^*r^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeLXheJlpeIXdeJU1eLFheLCxeLlReIlxeKnJeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9f25a615777c",
      "text": "  我可不是刺客。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^\"A^!)^,X^!w^+q^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeIkFeISleLFheIXdeK3FeISIg",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9775b14c4c2c",
      "text": "  你能幫上什麼忙？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^'b^+}^!'^!=^.T^,+^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeJ2JeK31eISdeIT1eLlReLCteLlY=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_41f8b2bdef3a",
      "text": "  很好。跟我來吧。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*K^+i^!\"^.+^$%^!O^*I^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkteK2leISJeLiteJCVeIU9eKkleISIg",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e6fe12cb3329",
      "text": "  我不需要你的幫助。走開。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^!)^)e^(C^*F^&Z^+}^\"#^!\"^.&^)F^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeISleKWVeKENeKkZeJlpeK31eIiNeISJeLiZeKUZeISIg",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d4d1ac7c368c",
      "text": "我該走了。回頭見。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^(M^.&^*D^!\"^\"\\^)t^-m^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXihNXi4mXipEXiEiXiJcXil0Xi1tXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 28
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_857dbeeb7a50",
      "text": "我是水門主管，被派駐在這裡把守。這裡無聊透頂。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^,X^%V^)D^!-^-D^*A^(@^.n^1f^\"d^(s^-j^$1^#+^!\"^(s^-j^%}^-U^(q^)p^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXixYXiVWXilEXiEtXi1EXipBXihAXi5uXjFmXiJkXihzXi1qXiQxXiMrXiEiXihzXi1qXiV9Xi1VXihxXilwXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_79f49abc08dd",
      "text": "我會幫你們進行刺殺！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^$r^+}^*F^*{^(w^(;^!w^%M^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiRyXit9XipGXip7Xih3Xig7XiF3XiVNXipX",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1970d825ebc5",
      "text": "你很狡黠，不願輕易吐露。你們是來找達戈拉爾的——我的主人！全世界都在嫉妒 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*K^::^:A^*A^!)^.H^(g^,W^\"G^.B^!\"^*F^*{^,X^!O^$/^(z^*M^$6^&/^&Z^*n^*n^$%^&Z^!-^!<^*W^!h^*p^.p^)$^\"d^7*^7' ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXipLXjo6XjpBXipBXiEpXi5IXihnXixXXiJHXi5CXiEiXipGXip7XixYXiFPXiQvXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXiZaXipuXipuXiQlXiZaXiEtXiE8XipXXiFoXipwXi5wXikkXiJkXjcqXjcnIA==",
      "byte_length": 109
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_50a27bad9f33",
      "text": "達戈拉爾。全世界都在痛恨達戈拉爾！這個名字足以讓你們的主子嚇得瑟瑟發抖。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(z^*M^$6^&/^!\"^!h^*p^.p^)$^\"d^-.^2g^(z^*M^$6^&/^*W^(s^!V^\"F^#)^(^^!B^-}^*F^*{^&Z^!-^#(^\"X^#e^:r^:r^&W^:Z^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXiEiXiFoXipwXi5wXikkXiJkXi0uXjJnXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXipXXihzXiFWXiJGXiMpXiheXiFCXi19XipGXip7XiZaXiEtXiMoXiJYXiNlXjpyXjpyXiZXXjpaXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 109
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a5ba4beb100e",
      "text": "別怕！我會幫你們殺了他。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*H^0^^*W^$%^$r^+}^*F^*{^%M^*D^!@^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipIXjBeXipXXiQlXiRyXit9XipGXip7XiVNXipEXiFAXiEi",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ed5309d27d6a",
      "text": "你們身在達戈拉爾塔樓下方的地道中。這裡是他進行實驗的地方—— ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^(c^\"d^(z^*M^$6^&/^\"o^0g^!(^$]^&Z^\"e^(y^!,^!\"^(s^-j^,X^!@^(w^(;^#3^.P^&Z^\"e^$]^*n^*n ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XihjXiJkXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXiJvXjBnXiEoXiRdXiZaXiJlXih5XiEsXiEiXihzXi1qXixYXiFAXih3Xig7XiMzXi5QXiZaXiJlXiRdXipuXipuIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f2e9666c9bf7",
      "text": "也是他警惕最鬆懈的地方！趁他不備，你們一定能將他擊潰！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!1^,X^!@^(S^:n^$q^.R^:o^&Z^\"e^$]^*W^.)^!@^!)^+\"^*A^*F^*{^!%^#.^'b^#7^!@^$F^2-^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiExXixYXiFAXihTXjpuXiRxXi5SXjpvXiZaXiJlXiRdXipXXi4pXiFAXiEpXisiXipBXipGXip7XiElXiMuXidiXiM3XiFAXiRGXjItXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7e773bb22b74",
      "text": "這裡就是達戈拉爾做實驗的地方……我隨時都能聽到實驗品發出的慘叫 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^-j^*J^,X^(z^*M^$6^&/^*~^#3^.P^&Z^\"e^$]^*o^*o^$%^)X^$f^)$^'b^-X^!u^#3^.P^\"R^&W^!q^&Z^,4^+< ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXi1qXipKXixYXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXip+XiMzXi5QXiZaXiJlXiRdXipvXipvXiQlXilYXiRmXikkXidiXi1YXiF1XiMzXi5QXiJSXiZXXiFxXiZaXiw0Xis8IA==",
      "byte_length": 94
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f8e9f067b118",
      "text": "聲。達戈拉爾根本不懂什麼叫仁慈……或者說他完全沒有任何善念。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-W^!\"^(z^*M^$6^&/^%)^$x^!)^,6^!=^.T^+<^37^3H^*o^*o^$'^'V^-x^!@^#,^!h^%\\^$s^!C^!L^1(^1z^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi1XXiEiXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXiUpXiR4XiEpXiw2XiE9Xi5UXis8XjM3XjNIXipvXipvXiQnXidWXi14XiFAXiMsXiFoXiVcXiRzXiFDXiFMXjEoXjF6XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3322cdc29fb8",
      "text": "我知道你們很謹慎，但別害怕！我會幫忙的！我可不是 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^&h^(y^*F^*{^*K^8@^83^*A^!I^*H^#/^0^^*W^$%^$r^+}^,+^&Z^*W^$%^\"A^!)^,X ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiZoXih5XipGXip7XipLXjhAXjgzXipBXiFJXipIXiMvXjBeXipXXiQlXiRyXit9XiwrXiZaXipXXiQlXiJBXiEpXixYIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1c30f8b0ed3f",
      "text": "他的爪牙！你們必將成為凱旋而歸的刺客！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^&Z^&.^&3^*W^*F^*{^#l^#7^$$^%{^!p^$`^'W^%K^&Z^!w^+q^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXiZaXiYuXiYzXipXXipGXip7XiNsXiM3XiQkXiV7XiFwXiRgXidXXiVLXiZaXiF3XitxXipX",
      "byte_length": 57
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_85b2baffbdd9",
      "text": "我跟著你們！但你們必須知道！你們需要項鍊。只有衛兵才能通過 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^.+^-a^*F^*{^*W^!I^*F^*{^#l^)r^&h^(y^*W^*F^*{^)e^(C^)q^)6^!\"^\"?^$s^(=^+,^$,^'b^(t^(x ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXi4rXi1hXipGXip7XipXXiFJXipGXip7XiNsXilyXiZoXih5XipXXipGXip7XillXihDXilxXik2XiEiXiI/XiRzXig9XissXiQsXidiXih0Xih4IA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ed6de575f4ec",
      "text": "雙眼之門。衛兵就在熔岩橋以東——他們身上有你們需要的項鍊！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)_^&d^!/^)D^!\"^(=^+,^*J^\"d^&#^#D^%<^!B^,`^*n^*n^!@^*{^(c^!'^$s^*F^*{^)e^(C^&Z^)q^)6^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XilfXiZkXiEvXilEXiEiXig9XissXipKXiJkXiYjXiNEXiU8XiFCXixgXipuXipuXiFAXip7XihjXiEnXiRzXipGXip7XillXihDXiZaXilxXik2XipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_aa7e7aaf2241",
      "text": "那扇門認得我——我不需要項鍊！我在這裡幹活已經很久了！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^$*^)D^(O^#e^$%^*n^*n^$%^!)^)e^(C^)q^)6^*W^$%^\"d^(s^-j^,!^%i^#J^'D^*K^!.^*D^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXiQqXilEXihPXiNlXiQlXipuXipuXiQlXiEpXillXihDXilxXik2XipXXiQlXiJkXihzXi1qXiwhXiVpXiNKXidEXipLXiEuXipEXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8e8fc2b60778",
      "text": "我在這裡當奴隸太久了。每個房間我都打掃照料過！這裡所有的秘密我都了如指 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^\"d^(s^-j^&N^##^)Z^+f^!.^*D^!\"^%P^!V^,<^)G^$%^)$^$-^:p^/x^/n^(x^*W^(s^-j^$)^$s^&Z^1O^#0^$%^)$^*D^#$^$8 ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiJkXihzXi1qXiZOXiMjXilaXitmXiEuXipEXiEiXiVQXiFWXiw8XilHXiQlXikkXiQtXjpwXi94Xi9uXih4XipXXihzXi1qXiQpXiRzXiZaXjFPXiMwXiQlXikkXipEXiMkXiQ4IA==",
      "byte_length": 106
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c971f415ee3f",
      "text": "掌。大意者必將面臨重重凶險！我就是你們的地圖。沒人比我更合適！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$;^!\"^\"z^#z^'V^#l^#7^)j^1U^))^))^3e^*m^*W^$%^*J^,X^*F^*{^&Z^\"e^\"b^!\"^%\\^!<^,m^$%^$o^\"C^(|^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQ7XiEiXiJ6XiN6XidWXiNsXiM3XilqXjFVXikpXikpXjNlXiptXipXXiQlXipKXixYXipGXip7XiZaXiJlXiJiXiEiXiVcXiE8XixtXiQlXiRvXiJDXih8XipX",
      "byte_length": 93
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_288a7f8f07dc",
      "text": "你們會改變主意的。單打獨鬥的刺客走不遠。粗心大意只會招致死亡！我會 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^$r^$N^(U^!-^#z^&Z^!\"^2a^$-^/z^*,^&Z^!w^+q^.&^!)^({^!\"^0(^#k^\"z^#z^\"?^$r^,D^'o^%L^!:^*W^$%^$r ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiRyXiROXihVXiEtXiN6XiZaXiEiXjJhXiQtXi96XiosXiZaXiF3XitxXi4mXiEpXih7XiEiXjAoXiNrXiJ6XiN6XiI/XiRyXixEXidvXiVMXiE6XipXXiQlXiRyIA==",
      "byte_length": 100
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_82079b6dd264",
      "text": "悄悄跟在後面。你們不會看見我。需要時我自會出手相助。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^3r^3r^.+^\"d^#b^)j^!\"^*F^*{^!)^$r^*Q^-m^$%^!\"^)e^(C^$f^$%^'l^$r^!q^$+^&a^\"#^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XjNyXjNyXi4rXiJkXiNiXilqXiEiXipGXip7XiEpXiRyXipRXi1tXiQlXiEiXillXihDXiRmXiQlXidsXiRyXiFxXiQrXiZhXiIjXiEi",
      "byte_length": 78
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c36de3ded86c",
      "text": "好吧。你們必須拿到項鍊。去熔岩橋以東就能找到衛兵和項鍊！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+i^*I^!\"^*F^*{^#l^)r^,G^!u^)q^)6^!\"^\"6^&#^#D^%<^!B^,`^*J^'b^$/^!u^(=^+,^\"O^)q^)6^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitpXipJXiEiXipGXip7XiNsXilyXixHXiF1XilxXik2XiEiXiI2XiYjXiNEXiU8XiFCXixgXipKXidiXiQvXiF1Xig9XissXiJPXilxXik2XipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d5f53eeda036",
      "text": "我會跟著你們！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^$r^.+^-a^*F^*{^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiRyXi4rXi1hXipGXip7XipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 22
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5113a12b8e71",
      "text": "別否認了。我主人身邊只有仇敵。你們來到這裡，肯定也是刺客—— ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*H^\"H^(O^*D^!\"^$%^!-^!<^(c^.8^\"?^$s^1g^$U^!\"^*F^*{^!O^!u^(s^-j^*A^-Z^#.^!1^,X^!w^+q^*n^*n ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipIXiJIXihPXipEXiEiXiQlXiEtXiE8XihjXi44XiI/XiRzXjFnXiRVXiEiXipGXip7XiFPXiF1XihzXi1qXipBXi1aXiMuXiExXixYXiF3XitxXipuXipuIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0abffc281595",
      "text": "另一個勢力的密探。我會協助刺殺！以我的見識加上你們的利刃！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\">^!%^!V^\"&^!~^&Z^#0^$>^!\"^$%^$r^2[^\"#^!w^%M^*W^!B^$%^&Z^-m^(R^\"\"^!'^*F^*{^&Z^!t^!r^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiI+XiElXiFWXiImXiF+XiZaXiMwXiQ+XiEiXiQlXiRyXjJbXiIjXiF3XiVNXipXXiFCXiQlXiZaXi1tXihSXiIiXiEnXipGXip7XiZaXiF0XiFyXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c5afaa0c9592",
      "text": "達戈拉爾必死無疑！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(z^*M^$6^&/^#l^%L^%}^0p^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "Xih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXiNsXiVMXiV9XjBwXipX",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1e343e2f45b7",
      "text": "等我們走到我有話可說的地方時，我會詳細說明，但 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'-^$%^*{^.&^!u^$%^$s^-v^\"A^-x^&Z^\"e^$]^$f^*A^$%^$r^6v^'?^-x^$c^*A^!I ",
      "encoded_base64": "XictXiQlXip7Xi4mXiF1XiQlXiRzXi12XiJBXi14XiZaXiJlXiRdXiRmXipBXiQlXiRyXjZ2Xic/Xi14XiRjXipBXiFJIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d880ffe216d6",
      "text": "在那之前，我們還是繼續前進吧。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"d^)!^!/^!z^*A^$%^*{^.7^,X^-O^'M^!z^(w^*I^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJkXikhXiEvXiF6XipBXiQlXip7Xi43XixYXi1PXidNXiF6Xih3XipJXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3b292a419f4e",
      "text": "  你能往後退一點嗎，傑克？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^'b^,)^#b^*V^!%^*;^+X^*A^9<^!d^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeJ2JeLCleI2JeKlZeISVeKjteK1heKkFeOTxeIWReLlY=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8cf40d71302e",
      "text": "  別再跟著我了，傑克。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*H^!l^.+^-a^$%^*D^*A^9<^!d^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkheIWxeLiteLWFeJCVeKkReKkFeOTxeIWReISI=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7ec2e9b3dd08",
      "text": "  跟我說說關於聖堂武士的事。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^.+^$%^-x^-x^.>^$^^'Z^42^%J^+a^&Z^*r^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLiteJCVeLXheLXheLj5eJF5eJ1peNDJeJUpeK2FeJlpeKnJeISI=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_21efe55776b9",
      "text": "在不透露任何姓名的情況下，我只能說光是在這座 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"d^!)^(q^.B^!C^!L^6S^\"F^&Z^,0^,q^!(^*A^$%^\"?^'b^-x^!c^,X^\"d^(s^/_ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJkXiEpXihxXi5CXiFDXiFMXjZTXiJGXiZaXiwwXixxXiEoXipBXiQlXiI/XidiXi14XiFjXixYXiJkXihzXi9fIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2b758d08add1",
      "text": "城裡，就有成百上千的人想讓達戈拉爾死。他製造的某些怪物曾經也有家人， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+_^-j^*A^*J^$s^$$^&Y^!'^+7^&Z^!<^,1^-}^(z^*M^$6^&/^%L^!\"^!@^(B^(v^&Z^%$^!8^#s^&4^.j^'D^!1^$s^+s^!<^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitfXi1qXipBXipKXiRzXiQkXiZZXiEnXis3XiZaXiE8XiwxXi19Xih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXiVMXiEiXiFAXihCXih2XiZaXiUkXiE4XiNzXiY0Xi5qXidEXiExXiRzXitzXiE8XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 103
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ca3c877a1cd6",
      "text": "他們都渴望復仇。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^*{^)$^,w^,]^#g^1g^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXip7XikkXix3XixdXiNnXjFnXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8dd0b0b6b608",
      "text": "你們身處達戈拉爾的地道之中！如果你連這都忘了，肯定是達戈拉爾在影響 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^(c^(,^(z^*M^$6^&/^&Z^\"e^(y^!/^!,^*W^#$^%!^*F^.0^(s^)$^0]^*D^*A^-Z^#.^,X^(z^*M^$6^&/^\"d^#a^)o ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XihjXigsXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXiZaXiJlXih5XiEvXiEsXipXXiMkXiUhXipGXi4wXihzXikkXjBdXipEXipBXi1aXiMuXixYXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXiJkXiNhXilvIA==",
      "byte_length": 100
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9df24a78c3e3",
      "text": "你的心智！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^&Z^#k^$i^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiZaXiNrXiRpXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 16
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7699308b0b82",
      "text": "不可能。你需要我的情報，而我需要你們的力量。讓我們一起殺了 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^\"A^'b^!\"^*F^)e^(C^$%^&Z^,0^+`^*A^'W^$%^)e^(C^*F^*{^&Z^!~^)*^!\"^-}^$%^*{^!%^.(^%M^*D ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXiJBXidiXiEiXipGXillXihDXiQlXiZaXiwwXitgXipBXidXXiQlXillXihDXipGXip7XiZaXiF+XikqXiEiXi19XiQlXip7XiElXi4oXiVNXipEIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ea6b828190d7",
      "text": "達戈拉爾，然後大家再各奔東西。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(z^*M^$6^&/^*A^&\"^#b^\"z^+s^!l^+>^2b^,`^-l^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXipBXiYiXiNiXiJ6XitzXiFsXis+XjJiXixgXi1sXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fb70292bfc68",
      "text": "沒錯。我們繼續走吧。等達戈拉爾一死， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%\\^)5^!\"^$%^*{^-O^'M^.&^*I^!\"^'-^(z^*M^$6^&/^!%^%L^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVcXik1XiEiXiQlXip7Xi1PXidNXi4mXipJXiEiXictXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXiElXiVMXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d838b78de11f",
      "text": "有的是時間慢慢聊！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$s^&Z^,X^$f^)G^#~^#~^-U^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRzXiZaXixYXiRmXilHXiN+XiN+Xi1VXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 28
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_de6e71bc2231",
      "text": "當然可以。抱歉靠你們太近了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&N^&\"^\"A^!B^!\"^,@^,h^.C^*F^*{^+f^(l^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZOXiYiXiJBXiFCXiEiXixAXixoXi5DXipGXip7XitmXihsXipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 43
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6dbba5db201e",
      "text": "囚犯注意到了跟在你們身後的人，嚇得往後退縮。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"Z^-%^%e^#z^!u^*D^.+^\"d^*F^*{^(c^#b^&Z^!<^*A^\"X^#e^,)^#b^*V^3X^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJaXi0lXiVlXiN6XiF1XipEXi4rXiJkXipGXip7XihjXiNiXiZaXiE8XipBXiJYXiNlXiwpXiNiXipWXjNYXiEi",
      "byte_length": 66
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a06737258a02",
      "text": "戈、戈伯尼克斯！什——不！離我遠點！不要啊！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*M^!!^*M^:X^#>^!d^$[^*W^!=^*n^*n^!)^*W^)`^$%^({^*;^*W^!)^(C^+Q^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipNXiEhXipNXjpYXiM+XiFkXiRbXipXXiE9XipuXipuXiEpXipXXilgXiQlXih7Xio7XipXXiEpXihDXitRXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b4ac72bf4c00",
      "text": "  我是衛兵。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^,X^(=^+,^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeLFheKD1eKyxeISI=",
      "byte_length": 17
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b889f68b4431",
      "text": "  我是來釋放你的。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^,X^!O^0w^$P^*F^&Z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeLFheIU9eMHdeJFBeKkZeJlpeISI=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f47242f65f66",
      "text": "我是傑克。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^,X^9<^!d^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXixYXjk8XiFkXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 16
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f22e9822465c",
      "text": "得了吧，你才不是。你看起來根本不像衛兵，而且你還會說話——達戈拉爾手下的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#e^*D^*I^*A^*F^$,^!)^,X^!\"^*F^*Q^.(^!O^%)^$x^!)^!`^(=^+,^*A^'W^!*^*F^.7^$r^-x^-v^*n^*n^(z^*M^$6^&/^$+^!(^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNlXipEXipJXipBXipGXiQsXiEpXixYXiEiXipGXipRXi4oXiFPXiUpXiR4XiEpXiFgXig9XissXipBXidXXiEqXipGXi43XiRyXi14Xi12XipuXipuXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXiQrXiEoXiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 109
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cf5e273c1309",
      "text": "衛兵可全都是啞巴。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(=^+,^\"A^!h^)$^,X^:m^#K^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xig9XissXiJBXiFoXikkXixYXjptXiNLXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 28
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a88f3615ff81",
      "text": "多謝了。我叫傑克。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"x^-z^*D^!\"^$%^+<^9<^!d^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJ4Xi16XipEXiEiXiQlXis8Xjk8XiFkXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 28
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ccedbedb4e10",
      "text": "我是傑克。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^,X^9<^!d^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXixYXjk8XiFkXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 16
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9054862984af",
      "text": "你不知道看到你們不是衛兵我有多安心——那群傢伙簡直是虐待狂！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^!)^&h^(y^*Q^!u^*F^*{^!)^,X^(=^+,^$%^$s^\"x^+p^#k^*n^*n^)!^'R^+#^*y^3y^&`^,X^3)^,*^&8^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiEpXiZoXih5XipRXiF1XipGXip7XiEpXixYXig9XissXiQlXiRzXiJ4XitwXiNrXipuXipuXikhXidSXisjXip5XjN5XiZgXixYXjMpXiwqXiY4XipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ea907dccd3f7",
      "text": "看見這道疤了嗎？昨天其中一個衛兵突然襲擊我——動手時連吭 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*Q^-m^(s^(y^5g^*D^+X^.V^:9^+e^!j^!,^!%^!V^(=^+,^'*^&\"^08^$F^$%^*n^*n^\"%^$+^$f^.0^:l ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipRXi1tXihzXih5XjVnXipEXitYXi5WXjo5XitlXiFqXiEsXiElXiFWXig9XissXicqXiYiXjA4XiRGXiQlXipuXipuXiIlXiQrXiRmXi4wXjpsIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f677fce14859",
      "text": "都沒吭一聲。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)$^%\\^:l^!%^-W^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XikkXiVcXjpsXiElXi1XXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 19
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_90c0cf6ec217",
      "text": "  衛兵為什麼要襲擊你？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^(=^+,^%{^!=^.T^(C^08^$F^*F^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKD1eKyxeJXteIT1eLlReKENeMDheJEZeKkZeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2784edd0d0f1",
      "text": "  衛兵不會說話嗎？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^(=^+,^!)^$r^-x^-v^+X^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKD1eKyxeISleJHJeLXheLXZeK1heLlYg",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c124935668a4",
      "text": "  你怎麼知道衛兵會流血？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^,,^.T^&h^(y^(=^+,^$r^%j^(:^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeLCxeLlReJmheKHleKD1eKyxeJHJeJWpeKDpeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_65763354d951",
      "text": "  你為什麼會被關在這裡？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^%{^!=^.T^$r^(@^.>^\"d^(s^-j^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeJXteIT1eLlReJHJeKEBeLj5eImReKHNeLWpeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b063b194b562",
      "text": "  你一開始到底是來這裡做什麼的？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^!%^)F^+k^!u^/^^,X^!O^(s^-j^*~^!=^.T^&Z^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeISVeKUZeK2teIXVeL15eLFheIU9eKHNeLWpeKn5eIT1eLlReJlpeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 47
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a52c50909750",
      "text": "  抱歉，但我要去殺了達戈拉爾。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^,@^,h^*A^!I^$%^(C^\"6^%M^*D^(z^*M^$6^&/^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLEBeLGheKkFeIUleJCVeKENeIjZeJU1eKkReKHpeKk1eJDZeJi9eISIg",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_814bb29fca5d",
      "text": "  跟我來吧。我正好需要幫手。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^.+^$%^!O^*I^!\"^$%^%H^+i^)e^(C^+}^$+^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLiteJCVeIU9eKkleISJeJCVeJUheK2leKWVeKENeK31eJCteISIg",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e555c810f540",
      "text": "我該走了。再見。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^(M^.&^*D^!\"^!l^-m^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXihNXi4mXipEXiEiXiFsXi1tXiEi",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_23abeb985a78",
      "text": "我拿鬆動的石頭砸了他。他顯然對此非常不高興。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^,G^.R^\"%^&Z^&k^)t^0#^*D^!@^!\"^!@^4&^&\"^#:^%I^)i^#O^!)^*+^-]^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXixHXi5SXiIlXiZaXiZrXil0XjAjXipEXiFAXiEiXiFAXjQmXiYiXiM6XiVJXilpXiNPXiEpXiorXi1dXiEi",
      "byte_length": 66
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a620ded5e7a8",
      "text": "我在這裡關了大約一個星期，連一聲衛兵的動靜都 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^\"d^(s^-j^.>^*D^\"z^-F^!%^!V^$e^$u^*A^.0^!%^-W^(=^+,^&Z^\"%^)h^)$ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiJkXihzXi1qXi4+XipEXiJ6Xi1GXiElXiFWXiRlXiR1XipBXi4wXiElXi1XXig9XissXiZaXiIlXiloXikkIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a3bf4212d60a",
      "text": "沒聽過。要不是我親眼見過他們流血，我敢發誓他們根本不是人類。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%\\^-X^(x^!\"^(C^!)^,X^$%^(F^&d^-m^(x^!@^*{^%j^(:^*A^$%^/m^&W^-w^!@^*{^%)^$x^!)^,X^!<^)w^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVcXi1YXih4XiEiXihDXiEpXixYXiQlXihGXiZkXi1tXih4XiFAXip7XiVqXig6XipBXiQlXi9tXiZXXi13XiFAXip7XiUpXiR4XiEpXixYXiE8Xil3XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2a3efa580153",
      "text": "我用石頭砸過其中一個，記得嗎？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^&H^&k^)t^0#^(x^!j^!,^!%^!V^*A^(K^#e^+X^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiZIXiZrXil0XjAjXih4XiFqXiEsXiElXiFWXipBXihLXiNlXitYXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ca7f622ac8f8",
      "text": "當我拿鬆動的石頭砸向衛兵時，他撲過來攻擊我。但他確實流血了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&N^$%^,G^.R^\"%^&Z^&k^)t^0#^+?^(=^+,^$f^*A^!@^4B^(x^!O^$O^$F^$%^!\"^!I^!@^-6^#3^%j^(:^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZOXiQlXixHXi5SXiIlXiZaXiZrXil0XjAjXis/Xig9XissXiRmXipBXiFAXjRCXih4XiFPXiRPXiRGXiQlXiEiXiFJXiFAXi02XiMzXiVqXig6XipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b745dde6ff34",
      "text": "我被抓到了，你以為呢？相信我，我可不是自願被關進 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^(@^$2^!u^*D^*A^*F^!B^%{^+C^.V^&a^!U^$%^*A^$%^\"A^!)^,X^'l^.H^(@^.>^(w ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXihAXiQyXiF1XipEXipBXipGXiFCXiV7XitDXi5WXiZhXiFVXiQlXipBXiQlXiJBXiEpXixYXidsXi5IXihAXi4+Xih3IA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_248e5dd7bb00",
      "text": "這裡的。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^-j^&Z^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXi1qXiZaXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 13
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b28b827442a0",
      "text": "一名聖堂武士派我來刺殺達戈拉爾。細節我就不多說了，總之 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!%^\"F^'Z^42^%J^+a^.n^$%^!O^!w^%M^(z^*M^$6^&/^!\"^'?^9b^$%^*J^!)^\"x^-x^*D^*A^-M^!/ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiElXiJGXidaXjQyXiVKXithXi5uXiQlXiFPXiF3XiVNXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXiEiXic/XjliXiQlXipKXiEpXiJ4Xi14XipEXipBXi1NXiEvIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d54e2057a56a",
      "text": "我失手了。不過，你們來得正是時候——既然外面的衛兵都已經被 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^\"|^$+^*D^!\"^!)^(x^*A^*F^*{^!O^#e^%H^,X^$f^*|^*n^*n^,U^&\"^\"w^)j^&Z^(=^+,^)$^#J^'D^(@ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiJ8XiQrXipEXiEiXiEpXih4XipBXipGXip7XiFPXiNlXiVIXixYXiRmXip8XipuXipuXixVXiYiXiJ3XilqXiZaXig9XissXikkXiNKXidEXihAIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ef5c9fd9809e",
      "text": "解決掉了，我就可以完成我的任務了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(I^,o^/e^*D^*A^$%^*J^\"A^!B^#,^$$^$%^&Z^!C^+4^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihJXixvXi9lXipEXipBXiQlXipKXiJBXiFCXiMsXiQkXiQlXiZaXiFDXis0XipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_71a4e56ff84d",
      "text": "我在這裡被關了大約一週，但我也不太確定——在這看不見雙日的地底下， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^\"d^(s^-j^(@^.>^*D^\"z^-F^!%^6|^*A^!I^$%^!1^!)^+f^-6^#.^*n^*n^\"d^(s^*Q^!)^-m^)_^$a^&Z^\"e^/^^!(^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiJkXihzXi1qXihAXi4+XipEXiJ6Xi1GXiElXjZ8XipBXiFJXiQlXiExXiEpXitmXi02XiMuXipuXipuXiJkXihzXipRXiEpXi1tXilfXiRhXiZaXiJlXi9eXiEoXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 100
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_65ce9aba8e3a",
      "text": "人很容易失去時間感。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!<^*K^+t^,W^\"|^\"6^$f^)G^#{^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiE8XipLXit0XixXXiJ8XiI2XiRmXilHXiN7XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 31
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f96325610583",
      "text": "我無所謂，但在拿到達戈拉爾死亡的證據之前，我沒法向聖堂武士覆命， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^%}^$)^0s^*A^!I^\"d^,G^!u^(z^*M^$6^&/^%L^!:^&Z^-{^5T^!/^!z^*A^$%^%\\^%b^+?^'Z^42^%J^+a^(D^\"N^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiV9XiQpXjBzXipBXiFJXiJkXixHXiF1Xih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXiVMXiE6XiZaXi17XjVUXiEvXiF6XipBXiQlXiVcXiViXis/XidaXjQyXiVKXithXihEXiJOXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 97
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_998ed25e280a",
      "text": "所以我還是跟著你們一起走吧。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$)^!B^$%^.7^,X^.+^-a^*F^*{^!%^.(^.&^*I^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQpXiFCXiQlXi43XixYXi4rXi1hXipGXip7XiElXi4oXi4mXipJXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 43
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_994bf5c5f407",
      "text": "太好了。讓我們徹底終結這場瘋狂吧。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+f^+i^*D^!\"^-}^$%^*{^18^/^^-H^'@^(s^\"n^-/^&8^*I^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitmXitpXipEXiEiXi19XiQlXip7XjE4Xi9eXi1IXidAXihzXiJuXi0vXiY4XipJXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4b6de5d386a9",
      "text": "等等。你們得幫我殺死達戈拉爾。如果沒有他死透的確鑿 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'-^'-^!\"^*F^*{^#e^+}^$%^%M^%L^(z^*M^$6^&/^!\"^#$^%!^%\\^$s^!@^%L^(q^&Z^-6^6@ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XictXictXiEiXipGXip7XiNlXit9XiQlXiVNXiVMXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXiEiXiMkXiUhXiVcXiRzXiFAXiVMXihxXiZaXi02XjZAIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_79de9ac8d161",
      "text": "證據，我沒法向聖堂武士交差。我別無選擇，既然你們也是朝那個方向去，那我也 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-{^5T^*A^$%^%\\^%b^+?^'Z^42^%J^+a^0P^48^!\"^$%^*H^%}^.6^,N^*A^,U^&\"^*F^*{^!1^,X^,^^)!^!V^$]^+?^\"6^*A^)!^$%^!1 ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi17XjVUXipBXiQlXiVcXiViXis/XidaXjQyXiVKXithXjBQXjQ4XiEiXiQlXipIXiV9Xi42XixOXipBXixVXiYiXipGXip7XiExXixYXixeXikhXiFWXiRdXis/XiI2XipBXikhXiQlXiExIA==",
      "byte_length": 109
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1610996959c1",
      "text": "不如加入你們。你們同意嗎？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^#$^\"\"^!f^*F^*{^!\"^*F^*{^\"E^#z^+X^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXiMkXiIiXiFmXipGXip7XiEiXipGXip7XiJFXiN6XitYXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 40
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_83bf58764dfd",
      "text": "好吧，反正我橫豎都是要跟著你們的。再說了， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+i^*I^*A^\"9^%H^$%^/2^:s^)$^,X^(C^.+^-a^*F^*{^&Z^!\"^!l^-x^*D^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitpXipJXipBXiI5XiVIXiQlXi8yXjpzXikkXixYXihDXi4rXi1hXipGXip7XiZaXiEiXiFsXi14XipEXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4c948dff9e84",
      "text": "我對這裡相當熟悉，幾乎能為你們解答這裡的一切。而且 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^#:^(s^-j^&a^&N^-\"^2h^*A^#T^!0^'b^%{^*F^*{^(I^-B^(s^-j^&Z^!%^+.^!\"^'W^!* ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiM6XihzXi1qXiZhXiZOXi0iXjJoXipBXiNUXiEwXidiXiV7XipGXip7XihJXi1CXihzXi1qXiZaXiElXisuXiEiXidXXiEqIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_402f4235a53f",
      "text": "我在戰鬥中身手也不賴。閒聊就到此為止吧；我們動身出發。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^\"d^$(^*,^!,^(c^$+^!1^!)^0t^!\"^6A^-U^*J^!u^%I^%{^%G^*I^*C^$%^*{^\"%^(c^!q^&W^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiJkXiQoXiosXiEsXihjXiQrXiExXiEpXjB0XiEiXjZBXi1VXipKXiF1XiVJXiV7XiVHXipJXipDXiQlXip7XiIlXihjXiFxXiZXXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5fd7cf2a11d0",
      "text": "裡面很不妙。非常不妙。我才不會跟你們進去。戈伯尼克斯就在裡面。可怕的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-j^)j^*K^!)^43^!\"^)i^#O^!)^43^!\"^$%^$,^!)^$r^.+^*F^*{^(w^\"6^!\"^*M^:X^#>^!d^$[^*J^\"d^-j^)j^!\"^\"A^0^^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi1qXilqXipLXiEpXjQzXiEiXilpXiNPXiEpXjQzXiEiXiQlXiQsXiEpXiRyXi4rXipGXip7Xih3XiI2XiEiXipNXjpYXiM+XiFkXiRbXipKXiJkXi1qXilqXiEiXiJBXjBeXiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 103
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ee3407c4583c",
      "text": "殭屍——他邪惡透頂！別進去。我絕不跟來。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^3N^#?^*n^*n^!@^)\"^#y^(q^)p^*W^*H^(w^\"6^!\"^$%^-I^!)^.+^!O^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjNOXiM/XipuXipuXiFAXikiXiN5XihxXilwXipXXipIXih3XiI2XiEiXiQlXi1JXiEpXi4rXiFPXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_232e8aef96e0",
      "text": "我才不要進去——我聽說過達戈拉爾豢養的那具殭屍。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^$,^!)^(C^(w^\"6^*n^*n^$%^-X^-x^(x^(z^*M^$6^&/^;\"^.I^&Z^)!^!k^3N^#?^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiQsXiEpXihDXih3XiI2XipuXipuXiQlXi1YXi14Xih4Xih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXjsiXi5JXiZaXikhXiFrXjNOXiM/XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5b4e31ba1e8f",
      "text": "那傢伙幾乎無人能擋！如果我是你們，我絕不會踏進去一步。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^+#^*y^#T^!0^%}^!<^'b^$G^*W^#$^%!^$%^,X^*F^*{^*A^$%^-I^!)^$r^.,^(w^\"6^!%^,i^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXisjXip5XiNUXiEwXiV9XiE8XidiXiRHXipXXiMkXiUhXiQlXixYXipGXip7XipBXiQlXi1JXiEpXiRyXi4sXih3XiI2XiElXixpXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7fba36a1bf4f",
      "text": "戈伯尼克斯指向西北方。當你伸手去開 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*M^:X^#>^!d^$[^$8^+?^-l^+6^$]^!\"^&N^*F^/N^$+^\"6^)F ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipNXjpYXiM+XiFkXiRbXiQ4Xis/Xi1sXis2XiRdXiEiXiZOXipGXi9OXiQrXiI2XilGIA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_791cc4b50519",
      "text": "門時，他連連搖頭。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)D^$f^*A^!@^.0^.0^3J^)t^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XilEXiRmXipBXiFAXi4wXi4wXjNKXil0XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 28
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e03429c8983d",
      "text": "門旁的一塊小金屬牌上寫著： ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)D^.h^&Z^!%^/Z^#;^)+^#C^&2^!'^/]^-a^*B ",
      "encoded_base64": "XilEXi5oXiZaXiElXi9aXiM7XikrXiNDXiYyXiEnXi9dXi1hXipCIA==",
      "byte_length": 40
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3fc35847592d",
      "text": "「戈伯尼克斯，我唯一鑄下的大錯。」 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!#^*M^:X^#>^!d^$[^*A^$%^+O^!%^:?^!(^&Z^\"z^)5^!\"^!$ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEjXipNXjpYXiM+XiFkXiRbXipBXiQlXitPXiElXjo/XiEoXiZaXiJ6Xik1XiEiXiEkIA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a61276186237",
      "text": "金屬牌下方有一個小按鈕。要按下去嗎？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)+^#C^&2^!(^$]^$s^!%^!V^#;^$9^).^!\"^(C^$9^!(^\"6^+X^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XikrXiNDXiYyXiEoXiRdXiRzXiElXiFWXiM7XiQ5XikuXiEiXihDXiQ5XiEoXiI2XitYXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_af996e0755a8",
      "text": "我留在這裡。你們最好立刻把那扇門關上，我們馬上離開。我絕不進去。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^-+^\"d^(s^-j^!\"^*F^*{^$q^+i^0'^.Y^$1^)!^$*^)D^.>^!'^*A^$%^*{^*\"^!'^)`^)F^!\"^$%^-I^!)^(w^\"6^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXi0rXiJkXihzXi1qXiEiXipGXip7XiRxXitpXjAnXi5ZXiQxXikhXiQqXilEXi4+XiEnXipBXiQlXip7XioiXiEnXilgXilGXiEiXiQlXi1JXiEpXih3XiI2XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 97
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f8e11a2c7410",
      "text": "隨你們便。如果你們一心想尋死，我可不奉陪。我會留在 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)X^*F^*{^!R^!\"^#$^%!^*F^*{^!%^#k^,1^#9^%L^*A^$%^\"A^!)^1+^8.^!\"^$%^$r^-+^\"d ",
      "encoded_base64": "XilYXipGXip7XiFSXiEiXiMkXiUhXipGXip7XiElXiNrXiwxXiM5XiVMXipBXiQlXiJBXiEpXjErXjguXiEiXiQlXiRyXi0rXiJkIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_557d42392645",
      "text": "這裡等，謝了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^-j^'-^*A^-z^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXi1qXictXipBXi16XipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 22
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c3d432dce9ce",
      "text": "戈伯尼克斯跟著你們，但每當你們看向他時，他依舊執著地指向西北方。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*M^:X^#>^!d^$[^.+^-a^*F^*{^*A^!I^%P^&N^*F^*{^*Q^+?^!@^$f^*A^!@^!Q^02^3?^-a^\"e^$8^+?^-l^+6^$]^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipNXjpYXiM+XiFkXiRbXi4rXi1hXipGXip7XipBXiFJXiVQXiZOXipGXip7XipRXis/XiFAXiRmXipBXiFAXiFRXjAyXjM/Xi1hXiJlXiQ4Xis/Xi1sXis2XiRdXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 97
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c42929990f79",
      "text": "當你們踏入房間時，身後的大門轟然關閉！角落裡的殭屍聽到動靜 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&N^*F^*{^.,^!f^,<^)G^$f^*A^(c^#b^&Z^\"z^)D^.y^&\"^.>^.=^*W^(H^-`^-j^&Z^3N^#?^-X^!u^\"%^)h ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZOXipGXip7Xi4sXiFmXiw8XilHXiRmXipBXihjXiNiXiZaXiJ6XilEXi55XiYiXi4+Xi49XipXXihIXi1gXi1qXiZaXjNOXiM/Xi1YXiF1XiIlXiloIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6ecdd10a729e",
      "text": "轉過身來，蹣跚地朝你們走來！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(i^(x^(c^!O^*A^;$^;#^\"e^,^^*F^*{^.&^!O^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihpXih4XihjXiFPXipBXjskXjsjXiJlXixeXipGXip7Xi4mXiFPXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 43
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e11afc50e941",
      "text": "你們要怎麼做？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^(C^,,^.T^*~^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XihDXiwsXi5UXip+Xi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 22
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_191540311f9b",
      "text": "  攻擊這具腐爛的屍體！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$O^$F^(s^!k^0/^&-^&Z^#?^**^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJE9eJEZeKHNeIWteMC9eJi1eJlpeIz9eKipeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fcc834fee645",
      "text": "殭屍停在你們面前，打量著你們。腐爛皮肉散發的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^3N^#?^+!^\"d^*F^*{^)j^!z^*A^$-^)*^-a^*F^*{^!\"^0/^&-^&[^'^^$S^&W^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjNOXiM/XishXiJkXipGXip7XilqXiF6XipBXiQtXikqXi1hXipGXip7XiEiXjAvXiYtXiZbXideXiRTXiZXXiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6ddbf92084fb",
      "text": "惡臭令人窒息難耐。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#y^'m^*w^!<^:~^#w^)a^-S^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiN5XidtXip3XiE8Xjp+XiN3XilhXi1TXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 28
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8724454dc8ae",
      "text": "片刻之後，它試圖開口說話，呼出的惡臭氣息撲面而來。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&1^.Y^!/^#b^*A^+o^-u^\"b^)F^\"<^-x^-v^*A^\"M^!q^&Z^#y^'m^%U^#w^4B^)j^'W^!O^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiYxXi5ZXiEvXiNiXipBXitvXi11XiJiXilGXiI8Xi14Xi12XipBXiJNXiFxXiZaXiN5XidtXiVVXiN3XjRCXilqXidXXiFPXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bcea5674c0ba",
      "text": "戈……嘎……戈——伯……尼……戈——伯——尼克斯。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*M^*o^*o^:v^*o^*o^*M^*n^*n^:X^*o^*o^#>^*o^*o^*M^*n^*n^:X^*n^*n^#>^!d^$[^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipNXipvXipvXjp2XipvXipvXipNXipuXipuXjpYXipvXipvXiM+XipvXipvXipNXipuXipuXjpYXipuXipuXiM+XiFkXiRbXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9647193b5b84",
      "text": "  呃，嗨。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^3<^*A^9}^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeMzxeKkFeOX1eISIg",
      "byte_length": 15
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bf5bff068d43",
      "text": "  你的名字是戈伯尼克斯？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^&Z^\"F^#)^,X^*M^:X^#>^!d^$[^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeJlpeIkZeIyleLFheKk1eOlheIz5eIWReJFteLlY=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e0046e609d87",
      "text": "  你生前是誰？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^&F^!z^,X^-y^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeJkZeIXpeLFheLXleLlYg",
      "byte_length": 21
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_45b16aec570d",
      "text": "  你看得懂這卷羊皮紙嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^*Q^#e^,6^(s^\"3^8M^&[^0+^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeKlFeI2VeLDZeKHNeIjNeOE1eJlteMCteK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ca0ec4e36da7",
      "text": "  達戈拉爾是你的哥哥？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^(z^*M^$6^&/^,X^*F^&Z^\"S^\"S^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKHpeKk1eJDZeJi9eLFheKkZeJlpeIlNeIlNeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e4592c966c52",
      "text": "  你正在失去記憶？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^%H^\"d^\"|^\"6^(K^$\"^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeJUheImReInxeIjZeKEteJCJeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_363d3bc65752",
      "text": "  高興？你很高興嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*+^-]^.V^*F^*K^*+^-]^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKiteLV1eLlZeKkZeKkteKiteLV1eK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_499ed233e8ba",
      "text": "  幫你？你想要我的幫助？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^+}^*F^.V^*F^,1^(C^$%^&Z^+}^\"#^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeK31eKkZeLlZeKkZeLDFeKENeJCVeJlpeK31eIiNeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fb3cad616a3b",
      "text": "  你想要跟我一起走嗎？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^,1^(C^.+^$%^!%^.(^.&^+X^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeLDFeKENeLiteJCVeISVeLiheLiZeK1heLlYg",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_47437288fd59",
      "text": "  你想要去找達戈拉爾？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^,1^(C^\"6^$/^(z^*M^$6^&/^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeLDFeKENeIjZeJC9eKHpeKk1eJDZeJi9eLlY=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1507791adfcc",
      "text": "  好吧。我們去找達戈拉爾。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^+i^*I^!\"^$%^*{^\"6^$/^(z^*M^$6^&/^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeK2leKkleISJeJCVeKnteIjZeJC9eKHpeKk1eJDZeJi9eISIg",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_90d61b5127aa",
      "text": "  休想！我哪裡都不會帶你去！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^!G^,1^*W^$%^+I^-j^)$^!)^$r^#N^*F^\"6^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIUdeLDFeKldeJCVeK0leLWpeKSReISleJHJeI05eKkZeIjZeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_644d2fe8220a",
      "text": "  你想要我離開嗎？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^,1^(C^$%^)`^)F^+X^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeLDFeKENeJCVeKWBeKUZeK1heLlYg",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_76d1791a4081",
      "text": "  下賤的行屍！退後！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^!(^2G^&Z^(;^#?^*W^*V^#b^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeISheMkdeJlpeKDteIz9eKldeKlZeI2JeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b7e083d57e18",
      "text": "  再退後！滾開，否則休怪我不客氣！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^!l^*V^#b^*W^,z^)F^*A^\"H^!x^!G^#s^$%^!)^+q^%U^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIWxeKlZeI2JeKldeLHpeKUZeKkFeIkheIXheIUdeI3NeJCVeISleK3FeJVVeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 50
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_44bff004cedd",
      "text": "  既然如此！受死吧！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^,U^&\"^#$^%I^*W^\";^%L^*I^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLFVeJiJeIyReJUleKldeIjteJUxeKkleKlc=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9077613cefa7",
      "text": "我該走了。失陪。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^(M^.&^*D^!\"^\"|^8.^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXihNXi4mXipEXiEiXiJ8XjguXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_91882666fdd2",
      "text": "咳——嗨……嗨。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^:t^*n^*n^9}^*o^*o^9}^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xjp0XipuXipuXjl9XipvXipvXjl9XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_36a2f779ea9f",
      "text": "在努力嘗試溝通的過程中，殭屍掉了一顆牙齒。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"d^1$^!~^1o^-u^:|^(t^&Z^(x^'#^!,^*A^3N^#?^/e^*D^!%^)u^&3^.U^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJkXjEkXiF+XjFvXi11Xjp8Xih0XiZaXih4XicjXiEsXipBXjNOXiM/Xi9lXipEXiElXil1XiYzXi5VXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_be0616e74a31",
      "text": "殭屍熱切地點著頭，雖然動作幅度不大，但已經是他所能使出的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^3N^#?^&$^+.^\"e^*;^-a^)t^*A^.A^&\"^\"%^!M^#P^#V^!)^\"z^*A^!I^#J^'D^,X^!@^$)^'b^!N^!q^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjNOXiM/XiYkXisuXiJlXio7Xi1hXil0XipBXi5BXiYiXiIlXiFNXiNQXiNWXiEpXiJ6XipBXiFJXiNKXidEXixYXiFAXiQpXidiXiFOXiFxXiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6975212e7ee9",
      "text": "最大極限了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$q^\"z^1D^)O^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRxXiJ6XjFEXilPXipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 19
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_429b18bc3d5d",
      "text": "殭屍顯得有些困惑，隨後緩緩揮動手臂指向整個房間，這讓你們又一次 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^3N^#?^4&^#e^$s^!8^\"^^#x^*A^)X^#b^'J^'J^2\"^\"%^$+^'k^$8^+?^$T^!V^,<^)G^*A^(s^-}^*F^*{^+;^!%^%D ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjNOXiM/XjQmXiNlXiRzXiE4XiJeXiN4XipBXilYXiNiXidKXidKXjIiXiIlXiQrXidrXiQ4Xis/XiRUXiFWXiw8XilHXipBXihzXi19XipGXip7Xis7XiElXiVEIA==",
      "byte_length": 94
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ccdd3181e365",
      "text": "深深領略了一番腐肉散發的刺鼻惡臭。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^2*^2*^)s^&L^*D^!%^2{^0/^'^^$S^&W^&Z^!w^4q^#y^'m^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjIqXjIqXilzXiZMXipEXiElXjJ7XjAvXideXiRTXiZXXiZaXiF3XjRxXiN5XidtXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1e4cc2202a1f",
      "text": "咳姆……哈……霍姆。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^:t^#%^*o^*o^+F^*o^*o^;%^#%^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xjp0XiMlXipvXipvXitGXipvXipvXjslXiMlXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 31
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0e80e1c84fc4",
      "text": "啊嘎……嘎……啊嘎……伊——斯……拉啊—— ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+Q^:v^*o^*o^:v^*o^*o^+Q^:v^*o^*o^!E^*n^*n^$[^*o^*o^$6^+Q^*n^*n ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitRXjp2XipvXipvXjp2XipvXipvXitRXjp2XipvXipvXiFFXipuXipuXiRbXipvXipvXiQ2XitRXipuXipuIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_72607757fdf8",
      "text": "突然間，殭屍停止了說話的嘗試，將手伸入蹣跚破爛的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'*^&\"^)G^*A^3N^#?^+!^%G^*D^-x^-v^&Z^1o^-u^*A^#7^$+^/N^!f^;$^;#^&n^&-^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XicqXiYiXilHXipBXjNOXiM/XishXiVHXipEXi14Xi12XiZaXjFvXi11XipBXiM3XiQrXi9OXiFmXjskXjsjXiZuXiYtXiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a64c35121bcc",
      "text": "衣物中。他掏出了一張卷軸遞給你們，連同他掉落的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(>^&4^!,^!\"^!@^/f^!q^*D^!%^,(^\"3^(e^8*^'A^*F^*{^*A^.0^\"E^!@^/e^-`^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xig+XiY0XiEsXiEiXiFAXi9mXiFxXipEXiElXiwoXiIzXihlXjgqXidBXipGXip7XipBXi4wXiJFXiFAXi9lXi1gXiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9354adfb79e5",
      "text": "一截斷指。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!%^:y^,T^$8^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiElXjp5XixUXiQ4XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 16
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a462d39992b4",
      "text": "戈伯尼克斯點了點頭。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*M^:X^#>^!d^$[^*;^*D^*;^)t^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipNXjpYXiM+XiFkXiRbXio7XipEXio7Xil0XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 31
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_34eee2ba2534",
      "text": "吼啊啊啊啊……吼啊啊啊…… ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^2_^+Q^+Q^+Q^+Q^*o^*o^2_^+Q^+Q^+Q^*o^*o ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjJfXitRXitRXitRXitRXipvXipvXjJfXitRXitRXitRXipvXipvIA==",
      "byte_length": 40
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b660576fe6bc",
      "text": "它往後退了一步，便不再後退。惡臭雖然稍有減弱，但 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+o^,)^#b^*V^*D^!%^,i^*A^!R^!)^!l^#b^*V^!\"^#y^'m^.A^&\"^-:^$s^%o^#\\^*A^!I ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitvXiwpXiNiXipWXipEXiElXixpXipBXiFSXiEpXiFsXiNiXipWXiEiXiN5XidtXi5BXiYiXi06XiRzXiVvXiNcXipBXiFJIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a1a7e5070e35",
      "text": "依然令人作嘔。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!Q^&\"^*w^!<^!M^0T^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFRXiYiXip3XiE8XiFNXjBUXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 22
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b5c96c50a4b2",
      "text": "殭屍紋絲不動。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^3N^#?^':^'C^!)^\"%^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjNOXiM/Xic6XidDXiEpXiIlXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 22
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c1f1ec213dca",
      "text": "戈伯尼克斯緩緩點頭。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*M^:X^#>^!d^$[^'J^'J^*;^)t^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipNXjpYXiM+XiFkXiRbXidKXidKXio7Xil0XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 31
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_eb41d055f028",
      "text": "法……法革……法革汀……記……記憶……記不得了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%b^*o^*o^%b^;&^*o^*o^%b^;&^:{^*o^*o^(K^*o^*o^(K^$\"^*o^*o^(K^!)^#e^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiViXipvXipvXiViXjsmXipvXipvXiViXjsmXjp7XipvXipvXihLXipvXipvXihLXiQiXipvXipvXihLXiEpXiNlXipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d6c4ef729128",
      "text": "戈伯尼克斯再次點頭，頭骨上又掉落了一塊碎骨。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*M^:X^#>^!d^$[^!l^%D^*;^)t^*A^)t^*$^!'^+;^/e^-`^*D^!%^/Z^&o^*$^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipNXjpYXiM+XiFkXiRbXiFsXiVEXio7Xil0XipBXil0XiokXiEnXis7Xi9lXi1gXipEXiElXi9aXiZvXiokXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_868af3e0ad53",
      "text": "幫……幫……幫幫我…… ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+}^*o^*o^+}^*o^*o^+}^+}^$%^*o^*o ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xit9XipvXipvXit9XipvXipvXit9Xit9XiQlXipvXipvIA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_089163a88c3b",
      "text": "戈伯尼克斯認真地搖了搖頭，甩得細小的腐肉碎屑向四處 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*M^:X^#>^!d^$[^(O^-2^\"e^3J^*D^3J^)t^*A^2z^#e^'?^#;^&Z^0/^'^^&o^:x^+?^\"[^(, ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipNXjpYXiM+XiFkXiRbXihPXi0yXiJlXjNKXipEXjNKXil0XipBXjJ6XiNlXic/XiM7XiZaXjAvXideXiZvXjp4Xis/XiJbXigsIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_47b8de9d8c3f",
      "text": "飛濺。由於劇烈的甩動，你甚至聽到了骨頭折斷的喀嚓聲。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)z^7<^!\"^&I^$^^1#^%|^&Z^2z^\"%^*A^*F^/|^'n^-X^!u^*D^*$^)t^,?^,T^&Z^:u^:w^-W^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xil6Xjc8XiEiXiZJXiReXjEjXiV8XiZaXjJ6XiIlXipBXipGXi98XiduXi1YXiF1XipEXiokXil0Xiw/XixUXiZaXjp1Xjp3Xi1XXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3c1824e17925",
      "text": "戈伯尼克斯先指了指你們，又指了指自己，最後指向了房門。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*M^:X^#>^!d^$[^!b^$8^*D^$8^*F^*{^*A^+;^$8^*D^$8^'l^#I^*A^$q^#b^$8^+?^*D^,<^)D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipNXjpYXiM+XiFkXiRbXiFiXiQ4XipEXiQ4XipGXip7XipBXis7XiQ4XipEXiQ4XidsXiNJXipBXiRxXiNiXiQ4Xis/XipEXiw8XilEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_aea50bf9ab54",
      "text": "啊啊啊戈……啊戈拉啊啊啊…… ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+Q^+Q^+Q^*M^*o^*o^+Q^*M^$6^+Q^+Q^+Q^*o^*o ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitRXitRXitRXipNXipvXipvXitRXipNXiQ2XitRXitRXitRXipvXipvIA==",
      "byte_length": 43
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_dce678f6e1ca",
      "text": "嘎……伊……伊思……哦哦……",
      "encoded_ascii": "^:v^*o^*o^!E^*o^*o^!E^#q^*o^*o^+H^+H^*o^*o",
      "encoded_base64": "Xjp2XipvXipvXiFFXipvXipvXiFFXiNxXipvXipvXitIXitIXipvXipv",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_eba3a27c232c",
      "text": "死……死……死！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%L^*o^*o^%L^*o^*o^%L^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVMXipvXipvXiVMXipvXipvXiVMXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_13b13f6ae6e3",
      "text": "戈伯尼克斯朝房門打手勢，門便應聲而開。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*M^:X^#>^!d^$[^,^^,<^)D^$-^$+^\"&^*A^)D^!R^0`^-W^'W^)F^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipNXjpYXiM+XiFkXiRbXixeXiw8XilEXiQtXiQrXiImXipBXilEXiFSXjBgXi1XXidXXilGXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_60e2695ee73f",
      "text": "戈伯尼克斯轉身跟著你們。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*M^:X^#>^!d^$[^(i^(c^.+^-a^*F^*{^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipNXjpYXiM+XiFkXiRbXihpXihjXi4rXi1hXipGXip7XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 37
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_99a04e4da396",
      "text": "恭喜！隊伍獲得了 1,000 點經驗值！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^1{^+V^*W^)U^!F^&:^#e^*D 1,000 ^*;^'D^.P^!Z^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjF7XitWXipXXilVXiFGXiY6XiNlXipEIDEsMDAwIF4qO14nRF4uUF4hWl4qVyA=",
      "byte_length": 47
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6f6714148fd7",
      "text": "戈伯尼克斯點點頭。他朝門打了個手勢，門隨之敞開。接著他轉身蹣跚走回 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*M^:X^#>^!d^$[^*;^*;^)t^!\"^!@^,^^)D^$-^*D^!V^$+^\"&^*A^)D^)X^!/^*d^)F^!\"^$?^-a^!@^(i^(c^;$^;#^.&^\"\\ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipNXjpYXiM+XiFkXiRbXio7Xio7Xil0XiEiXiFAXixeXilEXiQtXipEXiFWXiQrXiImXipBXilEXilYXiEvXipkXilGXiEiXiQ/Xi1hXiFAXihpXihjXjskXjsjXi4mXiJcIA==",
      "byte_length": 100
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_987165b6f08b",
      "text": "屬於他的角落。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#C^$^^!@^&Z^(H^-`^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNDXiReXiFAXiZaXihIXi1gXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 22
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4134a21e8f2e",
      "text": "戈伯尼克斯指向北",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*M^:X^#>^!d^$[^$8^+?^+6",
      "encoded_base64": "XipNXjpYXiM+XiFkXiRbXiQ4Xis/Xis2",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e77399e20b55",
      "text": "戈伯尼克斯刻意不理睬你們。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*M^:X^#>^!d^$[^.Y^#z^!)^&A^:}^*F^*{^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipNXjpYXiM+XiFkXiRbXi5ZXiN6XiEpXiZBXjp9XipGXip7XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 40
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_07e5837e8a96",
      "text": "  受死吧，下賤的腐屍！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^\";^%L^*I^*A^!(^2G^&Z^0/^#?^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIjteJUxeKkleKkFeISheMkdeJlpeMC9eIz9eKlcg",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_44f53c48284e",
      "text": "  對不起。我會帶你去找達戈拉爾。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^#:^!)^.(^!\"^$%^$r^#N^*F^\"6^$/^(z^*M^$6^&/^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIzpeISleLiheISJeJCVeJHJeI05eKkZeIjZeJC9eKHpeKk1eJDZeJi9eISIg",
      "byte_length": 48
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5c641ea70ee2",
      "text": "我該走了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^(M^.&^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXihNXi4mXipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 16
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1a1789d00cbb",
      "text": "戈伯尼克斯帶著探詢的眼神看著你們。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*M^:X^#>^!d^$[^#N^-a^$>^;!^&Z^&d^&w^*Q^-a^*F^*{^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipNXjpYXiM+XiFkXiRbXiNOXi1hXiQ+XjshXiZaXiZkXiZ3XipRXi1hXipGXip7XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9dc7a75debcc",
      "text": "  你能稍微離遠一點嗎？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^'b^-:^#i^)`^({^!%^*;^+X^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeJ2JeLTpeI2leKWBeKHteISVeKjteK1heLlYg",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_21f9b3afe5d4",
      "text": "沒事了。我們走吧。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%\\^*r^*D^!\"^$%^*{^.&^*I^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVcXipyXipEXiEiXiQlXip7Xi4mXipJXiEi",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1708acb98fb8",
      "text": "戈伯尼克斯點了點頭。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*M^:X^#>^!d^$[^*;^*D^*;^)t^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipNXjpYXiM+XiFkXiRbXio7XipEXio7Xil0XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 31
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bca5be63e1da",
      "text": "戈伯尼克斯挪開腳步離你們遠了一點。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*M^:X^#>^!d^$[^:z^)F^00^,i^)`^*F^*{^({^*D^!%^*;^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipNXjpYXiM+XiFkXiRbXjp6XilGXjAwXixpXilgXipGXip7Xih7XipEXiElXio7XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3f7c7cc6f82f",
      "text": "你們幹了什麼？！你們竟然殺了戈伯尼克斯！你、你們怎麼下得了手！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^,!^*D^!=^.T^.V^*W^*F^*{^28^&\"^%M^*D^*M^:X^#>^!d^$[^*W^*F^!!^*F^*{^,,^.T^!(^#e^*D^$+^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiwhXipEXiE9Xi5UXi5WXipXXipGXip7XjI4XiYiXiVNXipEXipNXjpYXiM+XiFkXiRbXipXXipGXiEhXipGXip7XiwsXi5UXiEoXiNlXipEXiQrXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 94
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_da11d34f6c37",
      "text": "莫奧 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^/F^6Q ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi9GXjZRIA==",
      "byte_length": 7
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8a42b3913ef5",
      "text": "傑克 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^9<^!d ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xjk8XiFkIA==",
      "byte_length": 7
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6f575210d591",
      "text": "看起來不太對勁。事實上，他的樣貌每過一刻都變得越來越不像 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*Q^.(^!O^!)^+f^#:^+3^!\"^*r^#3^!'^*A^!@^&Z^,f^-~^%P^(x^!%^.Y^)$^(U^#e^(]^!O^(]^!)^!` ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipRXi4oXiFPXiEpXitmXiM6XiszXiEiXipyXiMzXiEnXipBXiFAXiZaXixmXi1+XiVQXih4XiElXi5ZXikkXihVXiNlXihdXiFPXihdXiEpXiFgIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a206f9ba8dad",
      "text": "他原本的模樣，反而開始逐漸顯露出…… ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^\"5^$x^&Z^%:^,f^*A^\"9^'W^)F^+k^(r^2v^4&^.B^!q^*o^*o ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXiI1XiR4XiZaXiU6XixmXipBXiI5XidXXilGXitrXihyXjJ2XjQmXi5CXiFxXipvXipvIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cfd03fac9c60",
      "text": "你們殺了我的弟弟！我絕不可能原諒這種罪行！你們休想活著離開 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^%M^*D^$%^&Z^16^16^*W^$%^-I^!)^\"A^'b^\"5^0<^(s^'$^5x^(;^*W^*F^*{^!G^,1^%i^-a^)`^)F ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiVNXipEXiQlXiZaXjE2XjE2XipXXiQlXi1JXiEpXiJBXidiXiI1XjA8XihzXickXjV4Xig7XipXXipGXip7XiFHXiwxXiVpXi1hXilgXilGIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8aa4e5bbe7e2",
      "text": "這裡！等我好好處置完你們，你們將會明白何謂真正的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^-j^*W^'-^$%^+i^+i^(,^'Q^#,^*F^*{^*A^*F^*{^#7^$r^$c^&X^!L^0s^-2^%H^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXi1qXipXXictXiQlXitpXitpXigsXidRXiMsXipGXip7XipBXipGXip7XiM3XiRyXiRjXiZYXiFMXjBzXi0yXiVIXiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_19220196c564",
      "text": "折磨！來找我吧，蠢貨們！我在我的密室等候你們！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,?^-7^*W^!O^$/^$%^*I^*A^.u^.w^*{^*W^$%^\"d^$%^&Z^#0^+r^'-^*|^*F^*{^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "Xiw/Xi03XipXXiFPXiQvXiQlXipJXipBXi51Xi53Xip7XipXXiQlXiJkXiQlXiZaXiMwXityXictXip8XipGXip7XipX",
      "byte_length": 69
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5a134c8638bc",
      "text": "你們回來了！你們沒被殺死！太好了！戈伯尼克斯怕你們！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^\"\\^!O^*D^*W^*F^*{^%\\^(@^%M^%L^*W^+f^+i^*D^*W^*M^:X^#>^!d^$[^0^^*F^*{^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiJcXiFPXipEXipXXipGXip7XiVcXihAXiVNXiVMXipXXitmXitpXipEXipXXipNXjpYXiM+XiFkXiRbXjBeXipGXip7XipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_dbcee0fa255c",
      "text": "沒錯！戈—— ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%\\^)5^*W^*M^*n^*n ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVcXik1XipXXipNXipuXipuIA==",
      "byte_length": 19
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7c7e403f5df9",
      "text": "太不可思議了！你們先是擊敗達戈拉爾的衛兵釋放了我，現在又面對了 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+f^!)^\"A^#q^-|^*D^*W^*F^*{^!b^,X^$F^$R^(z^*M^$6^&/^&Z^(=^+,^0w^$P^*D^$%^*A^&?^\"d^+;^)j^#:^*D ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitmXiEpXiJBXiNxXi18XipEXipXXipGXip7XiFiXixYXiRGXiRSXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXiZaXig9XissXjB3XiRQXipEXiQlXipBXiY/XiJkXis7XilqXiM6XipEIA==",
      "byte_length": 94
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6d1019464168",
      "text": "戈伯尼克斯還活著回—— ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*M^:X^#>^!d^$[^.7^%i^-a^\"\\^*n^*n ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipNXjpYXiM+XiFkXiRbXi43XiVpXi1hXiJcXipuXipuIA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7306e524a764",
      "text": "就在這個時候， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*J^\"d^(s^!V^$f^*|^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipKXiJkXihzXiFWXiRmXip8XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 22
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c721a69833d7",
      "text": "注意到了跟在你們身後的是誰。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%e^#z^!u^*D^.+^\"d^*F^*{^(c^#b^&Z^,X^-y^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVlXiN6XiF1XipEXi4rXiJkXipGXip7XihjXiNiXiZaXixYXi15XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 43
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7fb092da9742",
      "text": "戈、戈伯尼克斯！不！退後！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*M^!!^*M^:X^#>^!d^$[^*W^!)^*W^*V^#b^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipNXiEhXipNXjpYXiM+XiFkXiRbXipXXiEpXipXXipWXiNiXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 40
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5903546e19a6",
      "text": "戈伯尼克斯！可——不！離我遠點！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*M^:X^#>^!d^$[^*W^\"A^*n^*n^!)^*W^)`^$%^({^*;^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipNXjpYXiM+XiFkXiRbXipXXiJBXipuXipuXiEpXipXXilgXiQlXih7Xio7XipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 49
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e2f2b52b7f67",
      "text": "當戈伯尼克斯接近 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&N^*M^:X^#>^!d^$[^$?^(l ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZOXipNXjpYXiM+XiFkXiRbXiQ/XihsIA==",
      "byte_length": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4a6b2f5050c2",
      "text": "莫奧時， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^/F^6Q^$f^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi9GXjZRXiRmXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 13
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_df3b400f6fe8",
      "text": "傑克時， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^9<^!d^$f^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xjk8XiFkXiRmXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 13
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5c2c09ab5d05",
      "text": "驟然閃起一道耀眼的強光！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^7M^&\"^)E^.(^!%^(y^7D^&d^&Z^#]^!c^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjdNXiYiXilFXi4oXiElXih5XjdEXiZkXiZaXiNdXiFjXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 37
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ee1a59399517",
      "text": "戈伯尼克斯……我……不，我做不到……對不起。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*M^:X^#>^!d^$[^*o^*o^$%^*o^*o^!)^*A^$%^*~^!)^!u^*o^*o^#:^!)^.(^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipNXjpYXiM+XiFkXiRbXipvXipvXiQlXipvXipvXiEpXipBXiQlXip+XiEpXiF1XipvXipvXiM6XiEpXi4oXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6e6a52913638",
      "text": "真實身分暴露後，達戈拉爾傳送離開了！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-2^#3^(c^!s^$m^.B^#b^*A^(z^*M^$6^&/^+$^./^)`^)F^*D^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi0yXiMzXihjXiFzXiRtXi5CXiNiXipBXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXiskXi4vXilgXilGXipEXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_999c8493702f",
      "text": "戈伯尼克斯看著你們，再次指向了西北方。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*M^:X^#>^!d^$[^*Q^-a^*F^*{^*A^!l^%D^$8^+?^*D^-l^+6^$]^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipNXjpYXiM+XiFkXiRbXipRXi1hXipGXip7XipBXiFsXiVEXiQ4Xis/XipEXi1sXis2XiRdXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_40d72f805d1d",
      "text": "你展開發霉的卷軸開始閱讀： ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^+x^)F^&W^0H^&Z^\"3^(e^)F^+k^:&^7I^*B ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXit4XilGXiZXXjBIXiZaXiIzXihlXilGXitrXjomXjdJXipCIA==",
      "byte_length": 40
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_12d3473a5561",
      "text": "我的兄弟，請原諒我對你所做的一切。我知道你 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^&Z^1!^16^*A^*S^\"5^0<^$%^#:^*F^$)^*~^&Z^!%^+.^!\"^$%^&h^(y^*F ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiZaXjEhXjE2XipBXipTXiI1XjA8XiQlXiM6XipGXiQpXip+XiZaXiElXisuXiEiXiQlXiZoXih5XipGIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f3b445cc6d5c",
      "text": "或許無法看懂這張卷軸，但我由衷希望你終能 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$'^-s^%}^%b^*Q^,6^(s^,(^\"3^(e^*A^!I^$%^&I^7i^+{^,]^*F^-H^'b ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQnXi1zXiV9XiViXipRXiw2XihzXiwoXiIzXihlXipBXiFJXiQlXiZJXjdpXit7XixdXipGXi1IXidiIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4fad39f3c4a2",
      "text": "理解我為何要對你做出這等殘忍之事。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&A^(I^$%^%{^!L^(C^#:^*F^*~^!q^(s^'-^,l^1y^!/^*r^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZBXihJXiQlXiV7XiFMXihDXiM6XipGXip+XiFxXihzXictXixsXjF5XiEvXipyXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d06e4e372e5e",
      "text": "我下不了手將你埋葬，更無法原諒自己親手殺害了 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^!(^!)^*D^$+^#7^*F^1r^-b^*A^$o^%}^%b^\"5^0<^'l^#I^(F^$+^%M^#/^*D ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiEoXiEpXipEXiQrXiM3XipGXjFyXi1iXipBXiRvXiV9XiViXiI1XjA8XidsXiNJXihGXiQrXiVNXiMvXipEIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_47e3cb920d0e",
      "text": "你。我曾無比渴望聽你親口對我說一句原諒，但如今我卻發現自己 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^!\"^$%^.j^%}^,m^,w^,]^-X^*F^(F^\"<^#:^$%^-x^!%^2]^\"5^0<^*A^!I^#$^*E^$%^1&^&W^&?^'l^#I ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiEiXiQlXi5qXiV9XixtXix3XixdXi1YXipGXihGXiI8XiM6XiQlXi14XiElXjJdXiI1XjA8XipBXiFJXiMkXipFXiQlXjEmXiZXXiY/XidsXiNJIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_eb59d68913c4",
      "text": "根本沒有勇氣面對你。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%)^$x^%\\^$s^\"$^%U^)j^#:^*F^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiUpXiR4XiVcXiRzXiIkXiVVXilqXiM6XipGXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 31
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c316baed93b3",
      "text": "我多麼希望你能明白這一切，但我害怕你如今已成了失去心智的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^\"x^.T^+{^,]^*F^'b^$c^&X^(s^!%^+.^*A^!I^$%^#/^0^^*F^#$^*E^#J^$$^*D^\"|^\"6^#k^$i^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiJ4Xi5UXit7XixdXipGXidiXiRjXiZYXihzXiElXisuXipBXiFJXiQlXiMvXjBeXipGXiMkXipFXiNKXiQkXipEXiJ8XiI2XiNrXiRpXiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cbe03e0472ad",
      "text": "怪物，只剩下飢渴與本能支配著殘軀。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#s^&4^*A^\"?^8U^!(^1d^,w^'p^$x^'b^$L^)&^-a^,l^(d^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNzXiY0XipBXiI/XjhVXiEoXjFkXix3XidwXiR4XidiXiRMXikmXi1hXixsXihkXiEi",
      "byte_length": 51
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8726c54151bd",
      "text": "我的僕從會照料你的起居，而我會看看自己是否能在有朝一日鼓起 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^&Z^+%^#f^$r^/x^/n^*F^&Z^.(^+w^*A^'W^$%^$r^*Q^*Q^'l^#I^,X^\"H^'b^\"d^$s^,^^!%^$a^*<^.( ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiZaXislXiNmXiRyXi94Xi9uXipGXiZaXi4oXit3XipBXidXXiQlXiRyXipRXipRXidsXiNJXixYXiJIXidiXiJkXiRzXixeXiElXiRhXio8Xi4oIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7276ccf605d8",
      "text": "勇氣，來親自面對你。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"$^%U^*A^!O^(F^'l^)j^#:^*F^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiIkXiVVXipBXiFPXihGXidsXilqXiM6XipGXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 31
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fbcc58ef26ce",
      "text": "你的兄弟，達戈拉爾。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^&Z^1!^16^*A^(z^*M^$6^&/^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiZaXjEhXjE2XipBXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 31
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_995718331a7d",
      "text": "等、等等我！我跟著你們！幫忙一起殺死他！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'-^!!^'-^'-^$%^*W^$%^.+^-a^*F^*{^*W^+}^,+^!%^.(^%M^%L^!@^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XictXiEhXictXictXiQlXipXXiQlXi4rXi1hXipGXip7XipXXit9XiwrXiElXi4oXiVNXiVMXiFAXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f7776dd6cbb7",
      "text": "等等我！記住，我必須拿到達戈拉爾死亡的確鑿證據！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'-^'-^$%^*W^(K^*z^*A^$%^#l^)r^,G^!u^(z^*M^$6^&/^%L^!:^&Z^-6^6@^-{^5T^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XictXictXiQlXipXXihLXip6XipBXiQlXiNsXilyXixHXiF1Xih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXiVMXiE6XiZaXi02XjZAXi17XjVUXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_94cbae84a72a",
      "text": "訪客！多麼令人興奮啊！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^4d^+q^*W^\"x^.T^*w^!<^-]^+g^+Q^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjRkXitxXipXXiJ4Xi5UXip3XiE8Xi1dXitnXitRXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_29e66d657ad9",
      "text": "  所以你就是凱爾達？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$)^!B^*F^*J^,X^!p^&/^(z^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCleIUJeKkZeKkpeLFheIXBeJi9eKHpeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5d34f73d2738",
      "text": "  你嚇不倒我！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^\"X^!)^!X^$%^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeIlheISleIVheJCVeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 20
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0340e1c6628e",
      "text": "  話說回來，髮型不錯喔。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^-v^-x^\"\\^!O^*A^;=^\"j^!)^)5^+T^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLXZeLXheIlxeIU9eKkFeOz1eImpeISleKTVeK1ReISIg",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c93045510b7b",
      "text": "  你瘋了！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^-/^*D^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeLS9eKkReKlc=",
      "byte_length": 14
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_335e13a3fce1",
      "text": "  你說什麼？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^-x^!=^.T^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeLXheIT1eLlReLlY=",
      "byte_length": 17
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_75ab700cb969",
      "text": "  咦？剛才說了什麼？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^;*^.V^+0^$,^-x^*D^!=^.T^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeOypeLlZeKzBeJCxeLXheKkReIT1eLlReLlY=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_591aec1b2d26",
      "text": "  什麼？我聽不見你的聲音！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^!=^.T^.V^$%^-X^!)^-m^*F^&Z^-W^34^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIT1eLlReLlZeJCVeLVheISleLW1eKkZeJlpeLVdeMzReKlc=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0c3cdd0eb7d9",
      "text": "  那是哪門子的正事？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^)!^,X^+I^)D^#(^&Z^%H^*r^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKSFeLFheK0leKUReIyheJlpeJUheKnJeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_235353a6d435",
      "text": "  噢，給我閉嘴！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^+]^*A^'A^$%^.=^+[^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeK11eKkFeJ0FeJCVeLj1eK1teKlc=",
      "byte_length": 23
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0d936c7fda64",
      "text": "  夠了！受死吧！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^+d^*D^*W^\";^%L^*I^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeK2ReKkReKldeIjteJUxeKkleKlc=",
      "byte_length": 23
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_94e861317e3c",
      "text": "  我是來殺達戈拉爾的。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^,X^!O^%M^(z^*M^$6^&/^&Z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeLFheIU9eJU1eKHpeKk1eJDZeJi9eJlpeISI=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c42ea581808f",
      "text": "  只要你死了我就不用聽你廢話了！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^\"?^(C^*F^%L^*D^$%^*J^!)^&H^-X^*F^#W^-v^*D^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIj9eKENeKkZeJUxeKkReJCVeKkpeISleJkheLVheKkZeI1deLXZeKkReKlc=",
      "byte_length": 47
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d5f69cda0c51",
      "text": "  我可不想死。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^\"A^!)^,1^%L^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeIkFeISleLDFeJUxeISI=",
      "byte_length": 20
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9979ae49b9f6",
      "text": "  你在那本書裡寫了些什麼？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^\"d^)!^$x^$p^-j^/]^*D^!8^!=^.T^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeImReKSFeJHheJHBeLWpeL11eKkReITheIT1eLlReLlY=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b9a7633d5b92",
      "text": "我該走了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^(M^.&^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXihNXi4mXipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 15
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_913793d8a22b",
      "text": "我是凱爾達，達戈拉爾的個人助理。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^,X^!p^&/^(z^*A^(z^*M^$6^&/^&Z^!V^!<^\"#^&A^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXixYXiFwXiYvXih6XipBXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXiZaXiFWXiE8XiIjXiZBXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 49
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_08cc489ac16c",
      "text": "噢，那可真謝謝你。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+]^*A^)!^\"A^-2^-z^-z^*F^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitdXipBXikhXiJBXi0yXi16Xi16XipGXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 28
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d97b024dea31",
      "text": "為什麼大家只要一聽到別人說了或做了什麼非比尋常的事， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%{^!=^.T^\"z^+s^\"?^(C^!%^-X^!u^*H^!<^-x^*D^$'^*~^*D^!=^.T^)i^,m^#9^#O^&Z^*r^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiV7XiE9Xi5UXiJ6XitzXiI/XihDXiElXi1YXiF1XipIXiE8Xi14XipEXiQnXip+XipEXiE9Xi5UXilpXixtXiM5XiNPXiZaXipyXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4e71c6fc1f67",
      "text": "就急著給人扣上「瘋狂」的帽子呢？我一直都在問自己這個問題， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*J^3p^-a^'A^!<^$.^!'^!#^-/^&8^!$^&Z^;,^#(^+C^.V^$%^!%^&`^)$^\"d^*Z^'l^#I^(s^!V^*Z^.G^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipKXjNwXi1hXidBXiE8XiQuXiEnXiEjXi0vXiY4XiEkXiZaXjssXiMoXitDXi5WXiQlXiElXiZgXikkXiJkXipaXidsXiNJXihzXiFWXipaXi5HXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1de5d998d6a0",
      "text": "而我總是得到同一個答案： ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'W^$%^-M^,X^#e^!u^\"E^!%^!V^-B^4|^*B ",
      "encoded_base64": "XidXXiQlXi1NXixYXiNlXiF1XiJFXiElXiFWXi1CXjR8XipCIA==",
      "byte_length": 37
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5cbf15207358",
      "text": "因為那是事實！只要你跟別人不一樣，你就是個瘋子！我完全樂在其中！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"]^%{^)!^,X^*r^#3^*W^\"?^(C^*F^.+^*H^!<^!)^!%^,f^*A^*F^*J^,X^!V^-/^#(^*W^$%^#,^!h^%8^\"d^!j^!,^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJdXiV7XikhXixYXipyXiMzXipXXiI/XihDXipGXi4rXipIXiE8XiEpXiElXixmXipBXipGXipKXixYXiFWXi0vXiMoXipXXiQlXiMsXiFoXiU4XiJkXiFqXiEsXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 97
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3ed8551ec877",
      "text": "我住在這——這裡是我的家！我才應該問你們同一個問題！不過 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*z^\"d^(s^*n^*n^(s^-j^,X^$%^&Z^+s^*W^$%^$,^0`^(M^*Z^*F^*{^\"E^!%^!V^*Z^.G^*W^!)^(x ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip6XiJkXihzXipuXipuXihzXi1qXixYXiQlXiZaXitzXipXXiQlXiQsXjBgXihNXipaXipGXip7XiJFXiElXiFWXipaXi5HXipXXiEpXih4IA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7a70b12cc993",
      "text": "反正在你們馬上就要死了，我又何必多此一舉呢！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"9^%H^\"d^*F^*{^*\"^!'^*J^(C^%L^*D^*A^$%^+;^!L^#l^\"x^%I^!%^01^+C^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiI5XiVIXiJkXipGXip7XioiXiEnXipKXihDXiVMXipEXipBXiQlXis7XiFMXiNsXiJ4XiVJXiElXjAxXitDXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2d931f8f8da4",
      "text": "天哪！真暴力！好吧，反正我也懶得再逗你們高興了。祝你們死得愉快！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+e^+I^*W^-2^$m^!~^*W^+i^*I^*A^\"9^%H^$%^!1^9Y^#e^!l^;;^*F^*{^*+^-]^*D^!\"^&v^*F^*{^%L^#e^1|^*L^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitlXitJXipXXi0yXiRtXiF+XipXXitpXipJXipBXiI5XiVIXiQlXiExXjlZXiNlXiFsXjs7XipGXip7XiorXi1dXipEXiEiXiZ2XipGXip7XiVMXiNlXjF8XipMXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 97
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_244721824822",
      "text": "瞧！我閉嘴了！現在感覺好多了吧？我就猜你會這麼想。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-4^*W^$%^.=^+[^*D^*W^&?^\"d^#{^(G^+i^\"x^*D^*I^.V^$%^*J^-'^*F^$r^(s^.T^,1^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi00XipXXiQlXi49XitbXipEXipXXiY/XiJkXiN7XihHXitpXiJ4XipEXipJXi5WXiQlXipKXi0nXipGXiRyXihzXi5UXiwxXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_899a2d62a074",
      "text": "你們這種四肢發達的莽漢，總是覺得必須用恐嚇與暴力 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^(s^'$^\"[^;5^&W^(z^&Z^;8^4Q^*A^-M^,X^(G^#e^#l^)r^&H^#t^\"X^'p^$m^!~ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XihzXickXiJbXjs1XiZXXih6XiZaXjs4XjRRXipBXi1NXixYXihHXiNlXiNsXilyXiZIXiN0XiJYXidwXiRtXiF+IA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6f188c093f5d",
      "text": "來彌補自己貧乏低劣的智力 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!O^9/^6&^'l^#I^;:^;'^!K^+2^&Z^$i^!~ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFPXjkvXjYmXidsXiNJXjs6XjsnXiFLXisyXiZaXiRpXiF+IA==",
      "byte_length": 37
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9e7786e72246",
      "text": "來掩飾自己呆頭呆腦、空有肌肉的外表 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!O^9~^)|^'l^#I^;)^)t^;)^2@^!!^'(^$s^7F^'^^&Z^\"w^-i ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFPXjl+Xil8XidsXiNJXjspXil0XjspXjJAXiEhXicoXiRzXjdGXideXiZaXiJ3Xi1pIA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_67c0cdc9df0e",
      "text": "。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 4
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f31fd2cd8cc3",
      "text": "你們這種書呆子，總是覺得必須用尖酸刻薄的嘲弄與空洞的威脅 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^(s^'$^$p^;)^#(^*A^-M^,X^(G^#e^#l^)r^&H^#=^)'^.Y^6o^&Z^+Z^/`^'p^'(^%h^&Z^#&^1T ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XihzXickXiRwXjspXiMoXipBXi1NXixYXihHXiNlXiNsXilyXiZIXiM9XiknXi5ZXjZvXiZaXitaXi9gXidwXicoXiVoXiZaXiMmXjFUIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fbe4a8f97aa3",
      "text": "來彌補自己羸弱不堪的肌肉力量。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!O^9/^6&^'l^#I^;4^#\\^!)^6O^&Z^7F^'^^!~^)*^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFPXjkvXjYmXidsXiNJXjs0XiNcXiEpXjZPXiZaXjdGXideXiF+XikqXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6c1a858f6dbb",
      "text": "你這個呆頭呆腦的下等蠢材！你既不夠聰明，連羞辱我會引火燒身都不知道； ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^(s^!V^;)^)t^;)^2@^&Z^!(^'-^.u^$y^*W^*F^,U^!)^+d^2=^$c^*A^.0^;3^3`^$%^$r^#Z^%x^&&^(c^)$^!)^&h^(y^*C ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXihzXiFWXjspXil0XjspXjJAXiZaXiEoXictXi51XiR5XipXXipGXixVXiEpXitkXjI9XiRjXipBXi4wXjszXjNgXiQlXiRyXiNaXiV4XiYmXihjXikkXiEpXiZoXih5XipDIA==",
      "byte_length": 103
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c7d1cd53d4e1",
      "text": "也不夠強壯，若我真的跟你動手，你根本不堪一擊。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!1^!)^+d^#]^+b^*A^'x^$%^-2^&Z^.+^*F^\"%^$+^*A^*F^%)^$x^!)^6O^!%^$F^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiExXiEpXitkXiNdXitiXipBXid4XiQlXi0yXiZaXi4rXipGXiIlXiQrXipBXipGXiUpXiR4XiEpXjZPXiElXiRGXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1a481bedf6e3",
      "text": "這簡直是個天大的笑話。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^3y^&`^,X^!V^+e^\"z^&Z^-@^-v^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXjN5XiZgXixYXiFWXitlXiJ6XiZaXi1AXi12XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ba183d001ce0",
      "text": "你真是個天大的笑話！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^-2^,X^!V^+e^\"z^&Z^-@^-v^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXi0yXixYXiFWXitlXiJ6XiZaXi1AXi12XipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 31
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_86d70a0dc0b2",
      "text": "很好！本來就不該怕我！為什麼人們總喜歡說這句話？我實在搞不懂 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*K^+i^*W^$x^!O^*J^!)^(M^0^^$%^*W^%{^!=^.T^!<^*{^-M^+V^%F^-x^(s^2]^-v^.V^$%^#3^\"d^:R^!)^,6 ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipLXitpXipXXiR4XiFPXipKXiEpXihNXjBeXiQlXipXXiV7XiE9Xi5UXiE8Xip7Xi1NXitWXiVGXi14XihzXjJdXi12Xi5WXiQlXiMzXiJkXjpSXiEpXiw2IA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0426f3ef4654",
      "text": "有什麼意義。也——但我扯遠了。我們剛才說到哪了？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$s^!=^.T^#z^2<^!\"^!1^*n^*n^!I^$%^.e^({^*D^!\"^$%^*{^+0^$,^-x^!u^+I^*D^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRzXiE9Xi5UXiN6XjI8XiEiXiExXipuXipuXiFJXiQlXi5lXih7XipEXiEiXiQlXip7XiswXiQsXi14XiF1XitJXipEXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0ac820731f3e",
      "text": "真的嗎？嗯，我想他對此一定有話要說，你覺得呢？我挺享受 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-2^&Z^+X^.V^6N^*A^$%^,1^!@^#:^%I^!%^#.^$s^-v^(C^-x^*A^*F^(G^#e^+C^.V^$%^,I^!;^\"; ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi0yXiZaXitYXi5WXjZOXipBXiQlXiwxXiFAXiM6XiVJXiElXiMuXiRzXi12XihDXi14XipBXipGXihHXiNlXitDXi5WXiQlXixJXiE7XiI7IA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b2a9376a3322",
      "text": "這次談話的，但現在也差不多到了殺你們的時候了，所以我就先向你們 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^%D^0;^-v^&Z^*A^!I^&?^\"d^!1^48^!)^\"x^!u^*D^%M^*F^*{^&Z^$f^*|^*D^*A^$)^!B^$%^*J^!b^+?^*F^*{ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXiVEXjA7Xi12XiZaXipBXiFJXiY/XiJkXiExXjQ4XiEpXiJ4XiF1XipEXiVNXipGXip7XiZaXiRmXip8XipEXipBXiQpXiFCXiQlXipKXiFiXis/XipGXip7IA==",
      "byte_length": 94
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_10615faa72f9",
      "text": "道別了——祝你們死得愉快！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(y^*H^*D^*n^*n^&v^*F^*{^%L^#e^1|^*L^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "Xih5XipIXipEXipuXipuXiZ2XipGXip7XiVMXiNlXjF8XipMXipX",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_405ba0659a46",
      "text": "這本書？噢，沒什麼。我只是得確保達戈拉爾掌握所有 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^$x^$p^.V^+]^*A^%\\^!=^.T^!\"^$%^\"?^,X^#e^-6^!T^(z^*M^$6^&/^$;^1>^$)^$s ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXiR4XiRwXi5WXitdXipBXiVcXiE9Xi5UXiEiXiQlXiI/XixYXiNlXi02XiFUXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXiQ7XjE+XiQpXiRzIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_eb9fba4031c4",
      "text": "踏入這裡的人的名字。不過我也不知道自己幹嘛費這個心。他可 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.,^!f^(s^-j^&Z^!<^&Z^\"F^#)^!\"^!)^(x^$%^!1^!)^&h^(y^'l^#I^,!^+Y^.\"^(s^!V^#k^!\"^!@^\"A ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi4sXiFmXihzXi1qXiZaXiE8XiZaXiJGXiMpXiEiXiEpXih4XiQlXiExXiEpXiZoXih5XidsXiNJXiwhXitZXi4iXihzXiFWXiNrXiEiXiFAXiJBIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f4791bef7b9e",
      "text": "從來沒看過這本書哪怕一眼！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#f^!O^%\\^*Q^(x^(s^$x^$p^+I^0^^!%^&d^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNmXiFPXiVcXipRXih4XihzXiR4XiRwXitJXjBeXiElXiZkXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 40
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_01ee03e1808c",
      "text": "真的嗎？那可就太掃興了……但我知道你肯定只是在 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-2^&Z^+X^.V^)!^\"A^*J^+f^:p^-]^*D^*o^*o^!I^$%^&h^(y^*F^-Z^#.^\"?^,X^\"d ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi0yXiZaXitYXi5WXikhXiJBXipKXitmXjpwXi1dXipEXipvXipvXiFJXiQlXiZoXih5XipGXi1aXiMuXiI/XixYXiJkIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_526aa3495fd6",
      "text": "開玩笑，對吧。每個人都渴望死亡！要不是想死，你們 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)F^4U^-@^*A^#:^*I^!\"^%P^!V^!<^)$^,w^,]^%L^!:^*W^(C^!)^,X^,1^%L^*A^*F^*{ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XilGXjRVXi1AXipBXiM6XipJXiEiXiVQXiFWXiE8XikkXix3XixdXiVMXiE6XipXXihDXiEpXixYXiwxXiVMXipBXipGXip7IA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_adc89f1d9f3f",
      "text": "才不會跑到這裡來呢！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$,^!)^$r^(_^!u^(s^-j^!O^+C^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQsXiEpXiRyXihfXiF1XihzXi1qXiFPXitDXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 31
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c24718b1caa6",
      "text": "哈！你聽得見我說話！抓到你了！好啦，既然我知道你聽得見， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+F^*W^*F^-X^#e^-m^$%^-x^-v^*W^$2^!u^*F^*D^*W^+i^+R^*A^,U^&\"^$%^&h^(y^*F^-X^#e^-m^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitGXipXXipGXi1YXiNlXi1tXiQlXi14Xi12XipXXiQyXiF1XipGXipEXipXXitpXitSXipBXixVXiYiXiQlXiZoXih5XipGXi1YXiNlXi1tXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_efffa21a6e8a",
      "text": "那你就必須老老實實聽完我所有機智幽默的反駁！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^*F^*J^#l^)r^'U^'U^#3^#3^-X^#,^$%^$)^$s^%>^$i^2f^:d^&Z^\"9^5'^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXipGXipKXiNsXilyXidVXidVXiMzXiMzXi1YXiMsXiQlXiQpXiRzXiU+XiRpXjJmXjpkXiZaXiI5XjUnXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3313ff5f8227",
      "text": "噢，你是聾子嗎？重聽？唔……讓我換個方式問好了…… ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+]^*A^*F^,X^']^#(^+X^.V^))^-X^.V^+N^*o^*o^-}^$%^4@^!V^$]^#X^*Z^+i^*D^*o^*o ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitdXipBXipGXixYXiddXiMoXitYXi5WXikpXi1YXi5WXitOXipvXipvXi19XiQlXjRAXiFWXiRdXiNYXipaXitpXipEXipvXipvIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8aef4956b252",
      "text": "你想怎麼個死法？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^,1^,,^.T^!V^%L^%b^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiwxXiwsXi5UXiFWXiVMXiViXi5W",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_24646900d90f",
      "text": "這樣聽得清楚了嗎？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^,f^-X^#e^,u^,c^*D^+X^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXixmXi1YXiNlXix1XixjXipEXitYXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 28
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_db9b709ec221",
      "text": "唔……這可真遺憾。看來你是沒法聽到我對你那愚蠢問題所做的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+N^*o^*o^(s^\"A^-2^0v^0_^!\"^*Q^!O^*F^,X^%\\^%b^-X^!u^$%^#:^*F^)!^/a^.u^*Z^.G^$)^*~^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitOXipvXipvXihzXiJBXi0yXjB2XjBfXiEiXipRXiFPXipGXixYXiVcXiViXi1YXiF1XiQlXiM6XipGXikhXi9hXi51XipaXi5HXiQpXip+XiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b7a5495f032f",
      "text": "絕妙犀利反駁了……無所謂，我想我們就直接切入正題吧。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-I^43^;1^!t^\"9^5'^*D^*o^*o^%}^$)^0s^*A^$%^,1^$%^*{^*J^&`^$?^+.^!f^%H^.G^*I^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi1JXjQzXjsxXiF0XiI5XjUnXipEXipvXipvXiV9XiQpXjBzXipBXiQlXiwxXiQlXip7XipKXiZgXiQ/XisuXiFmXiVIXi5HXipJXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c301906ea922",
      "text": "噢，少裝蒜了。我知道你聽得見，別在那假裝聽不到！說實話， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+]^*A^#<^(A^;9^*D^!\"^$%^&h^(y^*F^-X^#e^-m^*A^*H^\"d^)!^1i^(A^-X^!)^!u^*W^-x^#3^-v^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitdXipBXiM8XihBXjs5XipEXiEiXiQlXiZoXih5XipGXi1YXiNlXi1tXipBXipIXiJkXikhXjFpXihBXi1YXiEpXiF1XipXXi14XiMzXi12XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a19ea09c1977",
      "text": "你的配合度挺高的，但我現在不得不殺了你。好好享受吧！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^&Z^)&^\"C^#V^,I^*+^&Z^*A^!I^$%^&?^\"d^!)^#e^!)^%M^*D^*F^!\"^+i^+i^!;^\";^*I^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiZaXikmXiJDXiNWXixJXiorXiZaXipBXiFJXiQlXiY/XiJkXiEpXiNlXiEpXiVNXipEXipGXiEiXitpXitpXiE7XiI7XipJXipX",
      "byte_length": 78
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0bae4dc9a16f",
      "text": "唔。這可沒有我想像中那麼刺激！沒關係。讓我來熱熱場子！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+N^!\"^(s^\"A^%\\^$s^$%^,1^!`^!,^)!^.T^!w^1H^*W^%\\^.>^38^!\"^-}^$%^!O^&$^&$^\"n^#(^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitOXiEiXihzXiJBXiVcXiRzXiQlXiwxXiFgXiEsXikhXi5UXiF3XjFIXipXXiVcXi4+XjM4XiEiXi19XiQlXiFPXiYkXiYkXiJuXiMoXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9c5b4ece52cc",
      "text": "你的名字是 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^&Z^\"F^#)^,X ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiZaXiJGXiMpXixYIA==",
      "byte_length": 16
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_027c19902072",
      "text": "，對吧？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*A^#:^*I^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipBXiM6XipJXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 13
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5e6be9fc023a",
      "text": "等一下！等一下！我得把它記在這本書裡，好讓達戈拉爾 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'-^!%^!(^*W^'-^!%^!(^*W^$%^#e^$1^+o^(K^\"d^(s^$x^$p^-j^*A^+i^-}^(z^*M^$6^&/ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XictXiElXiEoXipXXictXiElXiEoXipXXiQlXiNlXiQxXitvXihLXiJkXihzXiR4XiRwXi1qXipBXitpXi19Xih6XipNXiQ2XiYvIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6609a4de0e63",
      "text": "知道我有在恪盡職守！稍等片刻……",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&h^(y^$%^$s^\"d^49^-1^'\\^#+^*W^-:^'-^&1^.Y^*o^*o",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZoXih5XiQlXiRzXiJkXjQ5Xi0xXidcXiMrXipXXi06XictXiYxXi5ZXipvXipv",
      "byte_length": 48
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1f59cc69484f",
      "text": "不肯說？好吧，無所謂。我就隨便寫個 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^-Z^-x^.V^+i^*I^*A^%}^$)^0s^!\"^$%^*J^)X^!R^/]^!V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXi1aXi14Xi5WXitpXipJXipBXiV9XiQpXjBzXiEiXiQlXipKXilYXiFSXi9dXiFWIA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_69b2a3b3ed7e",
      "text": " 好了！反正也沒人會去查核！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^+i^*D^*W^\"9^%H^!1^%\\^!<^$r^\"6^%&^:\"^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4raV4qRF4qV14iOV4lSF4hMV4lXF4hPF4kcl4iNl4lJl46Il4qVyA=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3394e996b8e9",
      "text": "凱爾達拿出一本書並瘋狂地在上面亂塗亂畫，記下各色各樣 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!p^&/^(z^,G^!q^!%^$x^$p^!+^-/^&8^\"e^\"d^!'^)j^!3^;+^!3^-,^*A^(K^!(^+>^'s^+>^,f ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFwXiYvXih6XixHXiFxXiElXiR4XiRwXiErXi0vXiY4XiJlXiJkXiEnXilqXiEzXjsrXiEzXi0sXipBXihLXiEoXis+XidzXis+XixmIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b99d2acec9d4",
      "text": "的訊息…… ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&Z^09^#w^*o^*o ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZaXjA5XiN3XipvXipvIA==",
      "byte_length": 16
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9059ef6965e9",
      "text": "再給我一秒——太棒了！既然這事搞定了，我們就可以繼續了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!l^'A^$%^!%^;2^*n^*n^+f^%1^*D^*W^,U^&\"^(s^*r^:R^#.^*D^*A^$%^*{^*J^\"A^!B^-O^'M^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFsXidBXiQlXiElXjsyXipuXipuXitmXiUxXipEXipXXixVXiYiXihzXipyXjpSXiMuXipEXipBXiQlXip7XipKXiJBXiFCXi1PXidNXipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_377a3855eff9",
      "text": "那麼，你想怎麼個死法？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^.T^*A^*F^,1^,,^.T^!V^%L^%b^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXi5UXipBXipGXiwxXiwsXi5UXiFWXiVMXiViXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6898dcc0613d",
      "text": "這麼快就想走？門都沒有。你就是那種喜歡直截了當、 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^.T^*L^*J^,1^.&^.V^)D^)$^%\\^$s^!\"^*F^*J^,X^)!^'$^+V^%F^&`^:y^*D^&N^!! ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXi5UXipMXipKXiwxXi4mXi5WXilEXikkXiVcXiRzXiEiXipGXipKXixYXikhXickXitWXiVGXiZgXjp5XipEXiZOXiEhIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_57aab293d95c",
      "text": "「直接開打吧」的人，對吧？好吧，我奉陪到底。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!#^&`^$?^)F^$-^*I^!$^&Z^!<^*A^#:^*I^.V^+i^*I^*A^$%^1+^8.^!u^/^^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEjXiZgXiQ/XilGXiQtXipJXiEkXiZaXiE8XipBXiM6XipJXi5WXitpXipJXipBXiQlXjErXjguXiF1Xi9eXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9408d2c4c230",
      "text": "當凱爾達倒下時，他開始發狂般地在書上潦草塗寫。就在嚥下 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&N^!p^&/^(z^!X^!(^$f^*A^!@^)F^+k^&W^&8^'r^\"e^\"d^$p^!'^;/^*f^;+^/]^!\"^*J^\"d^:1^!( ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZOXiFwXiYvXih6XiFYXiEoXiRmXipBXiFAXilGXitrXiZXXiY4XidyXiJlXiJkXiRwXiEnXjsvXipmXjsrXi9dXiEiXipKXiJkXjoxXiEoIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bf793829b2a5",
      "text": "最後一口氣的同時，他寫完了最後一筆。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$q^#b^!%^\"<^%U^&Z^\"E^$f^*A^!@^/]^#,^*D^$q^#b^!%^-A^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRxXiNiXiElXiI8XiVVXiZaXiJFXiRmXipBXiFAXi9dXiMsXipEXiRxXiNiXiElXi1BXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_29de2162cc5d",
      "text": "大部分頁面上滿是無窮無盡的名字，雜亂無章地潦草胡寫， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"z^)#^!s^5&^)j^!'^,{^,X^%}^-=^%}^-1^&Z^\"F^#)^*A^0G^!3^%}^3x^\"e^;/^*f^3}^/]^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJ6XikjXiFzXjUmXilqXiEnXix7XixYXiV9Xi09XiV9Xi0xXiZaXiJGXiMpXipBXjBHXiEzXiV9XjN4XiJlXjsvXipmXjN9Xi9dXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_975e1722808a",
      "text": "完全看不出任何規律或順序。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#,^!h^*Q^!)^!q^!C^!L^6'^7W^$'^.D^;-^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiMsXiFoXipRXiEpXiFxXiFDXiFMXjYnXjdXXiQnXi5EXjstXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 40
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_231fa7fd366b",
      "text": "唯有這本日誌最後的幾條記錄吸引了你的目光。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+O^$s^(s^$x^$a^(N^$q^#b^&Z^#T^%.^(K^;<^\"J^#Z^*D^*F^&Z^&^^!c^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitPXiRzXihzXiR4XiRhXihOXiRxXiNiXiZaXiNUXiUuXihLXjs8XiJKXiNaXipEXipGXiZaXiZeXiFjXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3f7c1cec788c",
      "text": "你注意到你們的名字已經被劃掉了。在那之後， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^%e^#z^!u^*F^*{^&Z^\"F^#)^#J^'D^(@^4s^/e^*D^!\"^\"d^)!^!/^#b^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiVlXiN6XiF1XipGXip7XiZaXiJGXiMpXiNKXidEXihAXjRzXi9lXipEXiEiXiJkXikhXiEvXiNiXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ddc37ebc2c8a",
      "text": "只剩下最後一個名字，或者說，只寫了一半的名字。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"?^8U^!(^$q^#b^!%^!V^\"F^#)^*A^$'^'V^-x^*A^\"?^/]^*D^!%^\"-^&Z^\"F^#)^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiI/XjhVXiEoXiRxXiNiXiElXiFWXiJGXiMpXipBXiQnXidWXi14XipBXiI/Xi9dXipEXiElXiItXiZaXiJGXiMpXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_46563a0a15cc",
      "text": "凱爾……",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!p^&/^*o^*o",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFwXiYvXipvXipv",
      "byte_length": 12
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a0547c9da631",
      "text": "哎呀呀！又回來啦？好吧，無所謂，我這次一定得確保 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^3i^3h^3h^*W^+;^\"\\^!O^+R^.V^+i^*I^*A^%}^$)^0s^*A^$%^(s^%D^!%^#.^#e^-6^!T ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjNpXjNoXjNoXipXXis7XiJcXiFPXitSXi5WXitpXipJXipBXiV9XiQpXjBzXipBXiQlXihzXiVEXiElXiMuXiNlXi02XiFUIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_96481d5c55ee",
      "text": "你們徹底死透——我們總不能讓我在書裡記下的名字 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^18^/^^%L^(q^*n^*n^$%^*{^-M^!)^'b^-}^$%^\"d^$p^-j^(K^!(^&Z^\"F^#) ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XjE4Xi9eXiVMXihxXipuXipuXiQlXip7Xi1NXiEpXidiXi19XiQlXiJkXiRwXi1qXihLXiEoXiZaXiJGXiMpIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_91ba4e8a7629",
      "text": "全都是活人吧？那可不行！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!h^)$^,X^%i^!<^*I^.V^)!^\"A^!)^(;^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFoXikkXixYXiVpXiE8XipJXi5WXikhXiJBXiEpXig7XipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 37
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2bd370bff524",
      "text": "  你為何不在那本書裡寫上自己的名字？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^%{^!L^!)^\"d^)!^$x^$p^-j^/]^!'^'l^#I^&Z^\"F^#)^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeJXteIUxeISleImReKSFeJHheJHBeLWpeL11eISdeJ2xeI0leJlpeIkZeIyleLlY=",
      "byte_length": 53
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_414bc8574a8e",
      "text": "  你把所有樂趣都破壞殆盡了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^$1^$)^$s^%8^.*^)$^&n^\"v^8H^-1^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeJDFeJCleJHNeJTheLipeKSReJm5eInZeOEheLTFeKkReISI=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_43056dda43fa",
      "text": "  沒錯！我剛好也正想這麼說！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^%\\^)5^*W^$%^+0^+i^!1^%H^,1^(s^.T^-x^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJVxeKTVeKldeJCVeKzBeK2leITFeJUheLDFeKHNeLlReLXheKlc=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d8906c748a8d",
      "text": "  等妳死了我根本就不用這麼做！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^'-^7(^%L^*D^$%^%)^$x^*J^!)^&H^(s^.T^*~^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJy1eNyheJUxeKkReJCVeJSleJHheKkpeISleJkheKHNeLlReKn5eKlc=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_53647ad45f5a",
      "text": "  算了。我一點都笑不出來。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^-C^*D^!\"^$%^!%^*;^)$^-@^!)^!q^!O^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLUNeKkReISJeJCVeISVeKjteKSReLUBeISleIXFeIU9eISIg",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b1ba318ce9cf",
      "text": "  話說回來，你到底為什麼想殺我？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^-v^-x^\"\\^!O^*A^*F^!u^/^^%{^!=^.T^,1^%M^$%^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLXZeLXheIlxeIU9eKkFeKkZeIXVeL15eJXteIT1eLlReLDFeJU1eJCVeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 47
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b992f32ff410",
      "text": "  那一頁根本是空白的！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^)!^!%^5&^%)^$x^,X^'(^&X^&Z^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKSFeISVeNSZeJSleJHheLFheJyheJlheJlpeKlcg",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9bd5416fdbab",
      "text": "  噢。上面還真的這麼寫！我搞錯了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^+]^!\"^!'^)j^.7^-2^&Z^(s^.T^/]^*W^$%^:R^)5^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeK11eISJeISdeKWpeLjdeLTJeJlpeKHNeLlReL11eKldeJCVeOlJeKTVeKkReISIg",
      "byte_length": 51
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8e611d1552e9",
      "text": "  該受死的是你，還是我？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^(M^\";^%L^&Z^,X^*F^*A^.7^,X^$%^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKE1eIjteJUxeJlpeLFheKkZeKkFeLjdeLFheJCVeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5f4f95ebcd61",
      "text": "  好吧。有種就來殺我啊。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^+i^*I^!\"^$s^'$^*J^!O^%M^$%^+Q^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeK2leKkleISJeJHNeJyReKkpeIU9eJU1eJCVeK1FeISI=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a499c4822ab0",
      "text": "  沒錯。我現在可以帶著微笑宰了你了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^%\\^)5^!\"^$%^&?^\"d^\"A^!B^#N^-a^#i^-@^1w^*D^*F^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJVxeKTVeISJeJCVeJj9eImReIkFeIUJeI05eLWFeI2leLUBeMXdeKkReKkZeKkReISI=",
      "byte_length": 53
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ba85832703d0",
      "text": "  不。等你死了我會更高興！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^!)^!\"^'-^*F^%L^*D^$%^$r^$o^*+^-]^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeISleISJeJy1eKkZeJUxeKkReJCVeJHJeJG9eKiteLV1eKlc=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_de3ebd9dbfcc",
      "text": "  受死吧，你這個瘋子聖堂武士！去死吧！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^\";^%L^*I^*A^*F^(s^!V^-/^#(^'Z^42^%J^+a^*W^\"6^%L^*I^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIjteJUxeKkleKkFeKkZeKHNeIVZeLS9eIyheJ1peNDJeJUpeK2FeKldeIjZeJUxeKkleKlc=",
      "byte_length": 56
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c307cedf58e2",
      "text": "我要離開這裡了。你徹底瘋了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^(C^)`^)F^(s^-j^*D^!\"^*F^18^/^^-/^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXihDXilgXilGXihzXi1qXipEXiEiXipGXjE4Xi9eXi0vXipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e23b7318dedb",
      "text": "不對，而且答對了！答對了，我確實瘋了；不對，你們休想離開這裡。你們 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^#:^*A^'W^!*^-B^#:^*D^*W^-B^#:^*D^*A^$%^-6^#3^-/^*D^*C^!)^#:^*A^*F^*{^!G^,1^)`^)F^(s^-j^!\"^*F^*{ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXiM6XipBXidXXiEqXi1CXiM6XipEXipXXi1CXiM6XipEXipBXiQlXi02XiMzXi0vXipEXipDXiEpXiM6XipBXipGXip7XiFHXiwxXilgXilGXihzXi1qXiEiXipGXip7IA==",
      "byte_length": 100
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c0e9e4b42837",
      "text": "死期到了！好好享受吧！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%L^$u^!u^*D^*W^+i^+i^!;^\";^*I^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVMXiR1XiF1XipEXipXXitpXitpXiE7XiI7XipJXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bc99710cf207",
      "text": "我幹嘛要那麼做？等等，讓我猜猜……你肯定想說，這樣 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^,!^+Y^(C^)!^.T^*~^.V^'-^'-^*A^-}^$%^-'^-'^*o^*o^*F^-Z^#.^,1^-x^*A^(s^,f ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiwhXitZXihDXikhXi5UXip+Xi5WXictXictXipBXi19XiQlXi0nXi0nXipvXipvXipGXi1aXiMuXiwxXi14XipBXihzXixmIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ee5942dfa5ad",
      "text": "等你們殺了我之後，就省得你們親自動手寫了，對吧？哈！這笑話 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'-^*F^*{^%M^*D^$%^!/^#b^*A^*J^9%^#e^*F^*{^(F^'l^\"%^$+^/]^*D^*A^#:^*I^.V^+F^*W^(s^-@^-v ",
      "encoded_base64": "XictXipGXip7XiVNXipEXiQlXiEvXiNiXipBXipKXjklXiNlXipGXip7XihGXidsXiIlXiQrXi9dXipEXipBXiM6XipJXi5WXitGXipXXihzXi1AXi12IA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1bda7664e9e6",
      "text": "真夠水準，我不得不稱讚你一句。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-2^+d^%V^,x^*A^$%^!)^#e^!)^0&^8'^*F^!%^2]^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi0yXitkXiVWXix4XipBXiQlXiEpXiNlXiEpXjAmXjgnXipGXiElXjJdXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9e2c8f0c3fb9",
      "text": "噢，真抱歉。我可不想搶了你這句精彩的台詞。來，我給你個 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+]^*A^-2^,@^,h^!\"^$%^\"A^!)^,1^1?^*D^*F^(s^2]^'7^#`^&Z^\"B^.v^!\"^!O^*A^$%^'A^*F^!V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitdXipBXi0yXixAXixoXiEiXiQlXiJBXiEpXiwxXjE/XipEXipGXihzXjJdXic3XiNgXiZaXiJCXi52XiEiXiFPXipBXiQlXidBXipGXiFWIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4a68e9f9fff0",
      "text": "機會重新說一遍，好嗎？這樣你滿意了吧？咳咳。「我為什麼 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%>^$r^))^$\\^-x^!%^69^*A^+i^+X^.V^(s^,f^*F^,{^#z^*D^*I^.V^:t^:t^!\"^!#^$%^%{^!=^.T ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiU+XiRyXikpXiRcXi14XiElXjY5XipBXitpXitYXi5WXihzXixmXipGXix7XiN6XipEXipJXi5WXjp0Xjp0XiEiXiEjXiQlXiV7XiE9Xi5UIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_dd49bd7459e3",
      "text": "要把我自己的名字寫進書裡？」",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(C^$1^$%^'l^#I^&Z^\"F^#)^/]^(w^$p^-j^.V^!$",
      "encoded_base64": "XihDXiQxXiQlXidsXiNJXiZaXiJGXiMpXi9dXih3XiRwXi1qXi5WXiEk",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9afe607e7d8f",
      "text": "噢，你這一下真把我將死了！噢，我居然傻傻跳進圈套了！沒錯，我 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+]^*A^*F^(s^!%^!(^-2^$1^$%^#7^%L^*D^*W^+]^*A^$%^+w^&\"^7$^7$^0@^(w^\"_^#!^*D^*W^%\\^)5^*A^$% ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitdXipBXipGXihzXiElXiEoXi0yXiQxXiQlXiM3XiVMXipEXipXXitdXipBXiQlXit3XiYiXjckXjckXjBAXih3XiJfXiMhXipEXipXXiVcXik1XipBXiQlIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_54f13e224efa",
      "text": "乾脆現在就把自己的名字寫上去好了，我真是無地自容。沒錯，我——",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*X^2?^&?^\"d^*J^$1^'l^#I^&Z^\"F^#)^/]^!'^\"6^+i^*D^*A^$%^-2^,X^%}^\"e^'l^+t^!\"^%\\^)5^*A^$%^*n^*n",
      "encoded_base64": "XipYXjI/XiY/XiJkXipKXiQxXidsXiNJXiZaXiJGXiMpXi9dXiEnXiI2XitpXipEXipBXiQlXi0yXixYXiV9XiJlXidsXit0XiEiXiVcXik1XipBXiQlXipuXipu",
      "byte_length": 93
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b51929a2bcd2",
      "text": "鬧劇演夠了。你現在高興了吧？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^6G^1#^1G^+d^*D^!\"^*F^&?^\"d^*+^-]^*D^*I^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjZHXjEjXjFHXitkXipEXiEiXipGXiY/XiJkXiorXi1dXipEXipJXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 43
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_30c3f2975f61",
      "text": "好啦，真是不好意思——下次你記得別把意圖表現得那麼明顯。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+i^+R^*A^-2^,X^!)^+i^#z^#q^*n^*n^!(^%D^*F^(K^#e^*H^$1^#z^\"b^-i^&?^#e^)!^.T^$c^4&^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitpXitSXipBXi0yXixYXiEpXitpXiN6XiNxXipuXipuXiEoXiVEXipGXihLXiNlXipIXiQxXiN6XiJiXi1pXiY/XiNlXikhXi5UXiRjXjQmXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_65a35e8316c7",
      "text": "遺憾的是，我不會再給你們下一次機會了，因為我現在就得 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^0v^0_^&Z^,X^*A^$%^!)^$r^!l^'A^*F^*{^!(^!%^%D^%>^$r^*D^*A^\"]^%{^$%^&?^\"d^*J^#e ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjB2XjBfXiZaXixYXipBXiQlXiEpXiRyXiFsXidBXipGXip7XiEoXiElXiVEXiU+XiRyXipEXipBXiJdXiV7XiQlXiY/XiJkXipKXiNlIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3b32431600ab",
      "text": "殺了你們。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%M^*D^*F^*{^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVNXipEXipGXip7XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 16
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e408e70d9ebe",
      "text": "瞧，現在你不用費嘴皮子了！我替你免去了羞辱我這項 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-4^*A^&?^\"d^*F^!)^&H^.\"^+[^&[^#(^*D^*W^$%^2o^*F^!e^\"6^*D^;3^3`^$%^(s^)q ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi00XipBXiY/XiJkXipGXiEpXiZIXi4iXitbXiZbXiMoXipEXipXXiQlXjJvXipGXiFlXiI2XipEXjszXjNgXiQlXihzXilxIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7ee5ba5eb6fe",
      "text": "艱鉅使命！你不感到如釋重負嗎？我替你省去了開口說話的枯燥乏味！現在 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^6j^9w^!N^\"N^*W^*F^!)^#{^!u^#$^0w^))^(W^+X^.V^$%^2o^*F^9%^\"6^*D^)F^\"<^-x^-v^&Z^5Z^;0^;'^1n^*W^&?^\"d ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjZqXjl3XiFOXiJOXipXXipGXiEpXiN7XiF1XiMkXjB3XikpXihXXitYXi5WXiQlXjJvXipGXjklXiI2XipEXilGXiI8Xi14Xi12XiZaXjVaXjswXjsnXjFuXipXXiY/XiJkIA==",
      "byte_length": 100
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e0590215c05f",
      "text": "我還得替你解脫這乏味透頂的人生！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^.7^#e^2o^*F^(I^'c^(s^;'^1n^(q^)p^&Z^!<^&F^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXi43XiNlXjJvXipGXihJXidjXihzXjsnXjFuXihxXilwXiZaXiE8XiZGXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 49
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_eb34e35e9b15",
      "text": "我瘋了，記得嗎？我酷愛殺戮！這是我本性的一部分！瞧，這上面寫得 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^-/^*D^*A^(K^#e^+X^.V^$%^1b^,2^%M^,:^*W^(s^,X^$%^$x^#r^&Z^!%^)#^!s^*W^-4^*A^(s^!'^)j^/]^#e ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXi0vXipEXipBXihLXiNlXitYXi5WXiQlXjFiXiwyXiVNXiw6XipXXihzXixYXiQlXiR4XiNyXiZaXiElXikjXiFzXipXXi00XipBXihzXiEnXilqXi9dXiNlIA==",
      "byte_length": 94
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_47d60f9859ed",
      "text": "清清楚楚，看見沒？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,u^,u^,c^,c^*A^*Q^-m^%\\^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xix1Xix1XixjXixjXipBXipRXi1tXiVcXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 28
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8868f74fc47f",
      "text": "凱爾達拿出他的書並翻到空白的一頁，煞有介事地指著那裡。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!p^&/^(z^,G^!q^!@^&Z^$p^!+^-Q^!u^'(^&X^&Z^!%^5&^*A^5c^$s^!>^*r^\"e^$8^-a^)!^-j^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFwXiYvXih6XixHXiFxXiFAXiZaXiRwXiErXi1RXiF1XicoXiZYXiZaXiElXjUmXipBXjVjXiRzXiE+XipyXiJlXiQ4Xi1hXikhXi1qXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_eae992df7623",
      "text": "看見了沒？就在這——「凱爾達必須想方設法大開殺戒。」看到了吧？你可不能反駁 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*Q^-m^*D^%\\^.V^*J^\"d^(s^*n^*n^!#^!p^&/^(z^#l^)r^,1^$]^4e^%b^\"z^)F^%M^$&^!\"^!$^*Q^!u^*D^*I^.V^*F^\"A^!)^'b^\"9^5' ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipRXi1tXipEXiVcXi5WXipKXiJkXihzXipuXipuXiEjXiFwXiYvXih6XiNsXilyXiwxXiRdXjRlXiViXiJ6XilGXiVNXiQmXiEiXiEkXipRXiF1XipEXipJXi5WXipGXiJBXiEpXidiXiI5XjUnIA==",
      "byte_length": 112
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_667141339b85",
      "text": "白紙黑字寫著的話，朋友。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&X^0+^*:^#)^/]^-a^&Z^-v^*A^,[^\"8^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZYXjArXio6XiMpXi9dXi1hXiZaXi12XipBXixbXiI4XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 37
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_096cd54cf278",
      "text": "當然是空白的！我瘋了，記得嗎？我當然知道那一頁根本沒寫 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&N^&\"^,X^'(^&X^&Z^*W^$%^-/^*D^*A^(K^#e^+X^.V^$%^&N^&\"^&h^(y^)!^!%^5&^%)^$x^%\\^/] ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZOXiYiXixYXicoXiZYXiZaXipXXiQlXi0vXipEXipBXihLXiNlXitYXi5WXiQlXiZOXiYiXiZoXih5XikhXiElXjUmXiUpXiR4XiVcXi9dIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1c1a0b5808bb",
      "text": "字……還是其實我有寫？好啦，這不重要。該是你們受死的時候了。好好享受吧！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#)^*o^*o^.7^,X^!j^#3^$%^$s^/]^.V^+i^+R^*A^(s^!)^))^(C^!\"^(M^,X^*F^*{^\";^%L^&Z^$f^*|^*D^!\"^+i^+i^!;^\";^*I^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiMpXipvXipvXi43XixYXiFqXiMzXiQlXiRzXi9dXi5WXitpXitSXipBXihzXiEpXikpXihDXiEiXihNXixYXipGXip7XiI7XiVMXiZaXiRmXip8XipEXiEiXitpXitpXiE7XiI7XipJXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 109
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_aee2a4086638",
      "text": "錯！那一頁根本沒寫字！它是空白的！還是真有字？唔……好吧，無所謂 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)5^*W^)!^!%^5&^%)^$x^%\\^/]^#)^*W^+o^,X^'(^&X^&Z^*W^.7^,X^-2^$s^#)^.V^+N^*o^*o^+i^*I^*A^%}^$)^0s ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xik1XipXXikhXiElXjUmXiUpXiR4XiVcXi9dXiMpXipXXitvXixYXicoXiZYXiZaXipXXi43XixYXi0yXiRzXiMpXi5WXitOXipvXipvXitpXipJXipBXiV9XiQpXjBzIA==",
      "byte_length": 97
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a60f3f4adc81",
      "text": "啦，納命來吧！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+R^*A^';^\"N^!O^*I^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitSXipBXic7XiJOXiFPXipJXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 22
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_24e5c231b58d",
      "text": "說得好！我喜歡這句！不過，恐怕將要受死的人是你們， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-x^#e^+i^*W^$%^+V^%F^(s^2]^*W^!)^(x^*A^#t^0^^#7^(C^\";^%L^&Z^!<^,X^*F^*{^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi14XiNlXitpXipXXiQlXitWXiVGXihzXjJdXipXXiEpXih4XipBXiN0XjBeXiM3XihDXiI7XiVMXiZaXiE8XixYXipGXip7XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d5a0fe32af86",
      "text": "而不是我！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'W^!)^,X^$%^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XidXXiEpXixYXiQlXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 16
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f7fce6cbba2d",
      "text": "我量你們也不會傻傻站在那讓我殺，所以我安排了一些 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^)*^*F^*{^!1^!)^$r^7$^7$^->^\"d^)!^-}^$%^%M^*A^$)^!B^$%^+p^$<^*D^!%^!8 ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXikqXipGXip7XiExXiEpXiRyXjckXjckXi0+XiJkXikhXi19XiQlXiVNXipBXiQpXiFCXiQlXitwXiQ8XipEXiElXiE4IA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1336cc562eed",
      "text": "「朋友」來除掉你們。好好享受吧！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!#^,[^\"8^!$^!O^)Q^/e^*F^*{^!\"^+i^+i^!;^\";^*I^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEjXixbXiI4XiEkXiFPXilRXi9lXipGXip7XiEiXitpXitpXiE7XiI7XipJXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 49
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_67b918c0af0e",
      "text": "天哪！脾氣真暴躁！好吧，無所謂。我會給你們準備足夠的靶子發洩 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+e^+I^*W^;7^%U^-2^$m^4\"^*W^+i^*I^*A^%}^$)^0s^!\"^$%^$r^'A^*F^*{^,x^+\"^(^^+d^&Z^)l^#(^&W^6_ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitlXitJXipXXjs3XiVVXi0yXiRtXjQiXipXXitpXipJXipBXiV9XiQpXjBzXiEiXiQlXiRyXidBXipGXip7Xix4XisiXiheXitkXiZaXilsXiMoXiZXXjZfIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cd5de1098d63",
      "text": "你們的怒火……好好享受吧！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^&Z^#o^%x^*o^*o^+i^+i^!;^\";^*I^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiZaXiNvXiV4XipvXipvXitpXitpXiE7XiI7XipJXipX",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1f445cd5b26f",
      "text": "去死吧，奴隸們！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"6^%L^*I^*A^##^)Z^*{^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiI2XiVMXipJXipBXiMjXilaXip7XipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a67899175ce4",
      "text": "什麼？還在這？我還以為你們早就死透了。你們明知道我是不得不 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!=^.T^.V^.7^\"d^(s^.V^$%^.7^!B^%{^*F^*{^,V^*J^%L^(q^*D^!\"^*F^*{^$c^&h^(y^$%^,X^!)^#e^!) ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiE9Xi5UXi5WXi43XiJkXihzXi5WXiQlXi43XiFCXiV7XipGXip7XixWXipKXiVMXihxXipEXiEiXipGXip7XiRjXiZoXih5XiQlXixYXiEpXiNlXiEpIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_57df0ad87a0e",
      "text": "殺了你們的。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%M^*D^*F^*{^&Z^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVNXipEXipGXip7XiZaXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 19
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cd9cb05ea062",
      "text": " 我的主人就在隔壁房間，他可不會高興…… ",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^$%^&Z^!-^!<^*J^\"d^9e^*\\^,<^)G^*A^!@^\"A^!)^$r^*+^-]^*o^*o ",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4kJV4mWl4hLV4hPF4qSl4iZF45ZV4qXF4sPF4pR14qQV4hQF4iQV4hKV4kcl4qK14tXV4qb14qbyA=",
      "byte_length": 59
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_dea722212b36",
      "text": " 我的主人就在這裡！要是讓你們活著，那可就太難看了！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^$%^&Z^!-^!<^*J^\"d^(s^-j^*W^(C^,X^-}^*F^*{^%i^-a^*A^)!^\"A^*J^+f^)a^*Q^*D^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4kJV4mWl4hLV4hPF4qSl4iZF4oc14tal4qV14oQ14sWF4tfV4qRl4qe14laV4tYV4qQV4pIV4iQV4qSl4rZl4pYV4qUV4qRF4qVyA=",
      "byte_length": 77
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_05226e8b6def",
      "text": "所以別再發表機智的俏皮話了——乖乖去死吧！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$)^!B^*H^!l^&W^-i^%>^$i^&Z^!S^&[^-v^*D^*n^*n^0{^0{^\"6^%L^*I^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQpXiFCXipIXiFsXiZXXi1pXiU+XiRpXiZaXiFTXiZbXi12XipEXipuXipuXjB7XjB7XiI2XiVMXipJXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a2c47e81e45f",
      "text": "  真的嗎？不用聽你講俏皮話了？太棒了！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^-2^&Z^+X^.V^!)^&H^-X^*F^6+^!S^&[^-v^*D^.V^+f^%1^*D^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLTJeJlpeK1heLlZeISleJkheLVheKkZeNiteIVNeJlteLXZeKkReLlZeK2ZeJTFeKkReKlcg",
      "byte_length": 57
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d612de43ba6b",
      "text": "  終於踩到你的痛處了，是吧？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^-H^$^^0A^!u^*F^&Z^-.^(,^*D^*A^,X^*I^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLUheJF5eMEFeIXVeKkZeJlpeLS5eKCxeKkReKkFeLFheKkleLlY=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a99528bfb7d0",
      "text": "夠了！我受夠你們了。你們對我來說已經毫無樂趣可言——所以我必須殺了你們…… ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+d^*D^*W^$%^\";^+d^*F^*{^*D^!\"^*F^*{^#:^$%^!O^-x^#J^'D^/t^%}^%8^.*^\"A^1Y^*n^*n^$)^!B^$%^#l^)r^%M^*D^*F^*{^*o^*o ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitkXipEXipXXiQlXiI7XitkXipGXip7XipEXiEiXipGXip7XiM6XiQlXiFPXi14XiNKXidEXi90XiV9XiU4Xi4qXiJBXjFZXipuXipuXiQpXiFCXiQlXiNsXilyXiVNXipEXipGXip7XipvXipvIA==",
      "byte_length": 112
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_33448b1c1d64",
      "text": "立刻！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^0'^.Y^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjAnXi5ZXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 10
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_89580f890151",
      "text": "胡說！你才沒踩到我的痛處！當我的飯碗被區區一個逃奴 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^3}^-x^*W^*F^$,^%\\^0A^!u^$%^&Z^-.^(,^*W^&N^$%^&Z^9;^&q^(@^\"+^\"+^!%^!V^(p^## ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjN9Xi14XipXXipGXiQsXiVcXjBBXiF1XiQlXiZaXi0uXigsXipXXiZOXiQlXiZaXjk7XiZxXihAXiIrXiIrXiElXiFWXihwXiMjIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_84a97c8c9ad2",
      "text": "威脅時，我可高興了！真的！我愛死這種感覺了！沒錯，我真—— ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#&^1T^$f^*A^$%^\"A^*+^-]^*D^*W^-2^&Z^*W^$%^,2^%L^(s^'$^#{^(G^*D^*W^%\\^)5^*A^$%^-2^*n^*n ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiMmXjFUXiRmXipBXiQlXiJBXiorXi1dXipEXipXXi0yXiZaXipXXiQlXiwyXiVMXihzXickXiN7XihHXipEXipXXiVcXik1XipBXiQlXi0yXipuXipuIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d1b55ee9b866",
      "text": "休想。你們休想從我這討到任何便宜，而且你們還會樂意接受！就算這樣， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!G^,1^!\"^*F^*{^!G^,1^#f^$%^(s^-o^!u^!C^!L^!R^/[^*A^'W^!*^*F^*{^.7^$r^%8^#z^$?^\";^*W^*J^-C^(s^,f^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFHXiwxXiEiXipGXip7XiFHXiwxXiNmXiQlXihzXi1vXiF1XiFDXiFMXiFSXi9bXipBXidXXiEqXipGXip7Xi43XiRyXiU4XiN6XiQ/XiI7XipXXipKXi1DXihzXixmXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 100
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_96bf0c447f4d",
      "text": "我也不會給你們時間去樂意接受！沒錯，我就要—— ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^!1^!)^$r^'A^*F^*{^$f^)G^\"6^%8^#z^$?^\";^*W^%\\^)5^*A^$%^*J^(C^*n^*n ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiExXiEpXiRyXidBXipGXip7XiRmXilHXiI2XiU4XiN6XiQ/XiI7XipXXiVcXik1XipBXiQlXipKXihDXipuXipuIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_576f113760a9",
      "text": "門上的那些面孔，全都是以前熱衷於窺探達戈拉爾隱私的僕從。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)D^!'^&Z^)!^!8^)j^5G^*A^!h^)$^,X^!B^!z^&$^7i^$^^6f^$>^(z^*M^$6^&/^)Y^&~^&Z^+%^#f^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XilEXiEnXiZaXikhXiE4XilqXjVHXipBXiFoXikkXixYXiFCXiF6XiYkXjdpXiReXjZmXiQ+Xih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXilZXiZ+XiZaXislXiNmXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3926b92d2545",
      "text": "現在他們可以盡情窺探個夠了——只不過是替達戈拉爾的敵人刺探。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&?^\"d^!@^*{^\"A^!B^-1^,0^6f^$>^!V^+d^*D^*n^*n^\"?^!)^(x^,X^2o^(z^*M^$6^&/^&Z^$U^!<^!w^$>^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiY/XiJkXiFAXip7XiJBXiFCXi0xXiwwXjZmXiQ+XiFWXitkXipEXipuXipuXiI/XiEpXih4XixYXjJvXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXiZaXiRVXiE8XiF3XiQ+XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_63ffb107babf",
      "text": "達戈拉爾將這個人的靈魂織進了這幅掛毯中，讓他在無盡的永恆裡 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(z^*M^$6^&/^#7^(s^!V^!<^&Z^)g^*.^3z^(w^*D^(s^#P^$=^%S^!,^*A^-}^!@^\"d^%}^-1^&Z^%W^:6^-j ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXiM3XihzXiFWXiE8XiZaXilnXiouXjN6Xih3XipEXihzXiNQXiQ9XiVTXiEsXipBXi19XiFAXiJkXiV9Xi0xXiZaXiVXXjo2Xi1qIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9ea84230caf8",
      "text": "不斷重複經歷他最恐懼的噩夢。達戈拉爾確實殘酷至極。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^,T^))^6s^'D^6^^!@^$q^#t^$#^&Z^/X^\"y^!\"^(z^*M^$6^&/^-6^#3^,l^1b^'n^1D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXixUXikpXjZzXidEXjZeXiFAXiRxXiN0XiQjXiZaXi9YXiJ5XiEiXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXi02XiMzXixsXjFiXiduXjFEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4e0d3a8bd9e9",
      "text": "雕像裡的那些人，都是意志堅定、寧死不屈的硬骨頭。既然達戈拉爾 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)^^!`^-j^&Z^)!^!8^!<^*A^)$^,X^#z^#m^\"l^#.^!!^3k^%L^!)^5K^&Z^25^*$^)t^!\"^,U^&\"^(z^*M^$6^&/ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XileXiFgXi1qXiZaXikhXiE4XiE8XipBXikkXixYXiN6XiNtXiJsXiMuXiEhXjNrXiVMXiEpXjVLXiZaXjI1XiokXil0XiEiXixVXiYiXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ea643c4cd2ae",
      "text": "無法將他們改造成奴隸，便乾脆將他們活活塑造成了這些「藝術品」。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%}^%b^#7^!@^*{^$N^(v^$$^##^)Z^*A^!R^*X^2?^#7^!@^*{^%i^%i^1s^(v^$$^*D^(s^!8^!#^3Z^(<^\"R^!$^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiV9XiViXiM3XiFAXip7XiROXih2XiQkXiMjXilaXipBXiFSXipYXjI/XiM3XiFAXip7XiVpXiVpXjFzXih2XiQkXipEXihzXiE4XiEjXjNaXig8XiJSXiEkXiEi",
      "byte_length": 93
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e20dc805e8b0",
      "text": "這裡就是達戈拉爾將奇異粉末與鍋爐蒸汽混合，藉此進行 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^-j^*J^,X^(z^*M^$6^&/^#7^\"}^&M^'5^$w^'p^)7^&,^(&^:\\^%n^\"C^*A^04^%I^(w^(; ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXi1qXipKXixYXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXiM3XiJ9XiZNXic1XiR3XidwXik3XiYsXigmXjpcXiVuXiJDXipBXjA0XiVJXih3Xig7IA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_81801f0ae037",
      "text": "劇烈異變實驗的地方。由於過程極度危險，他大多使用殭屍來執行 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^1#^%|^&M^(U^#3^.P^&Z^\"e^$]^!\"^&I^$^^(x^'#^1D^#V^2\\^*m^*A^!@^\"z^\"x^!N^&H^3N^#?^!O^3?^(; ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjEjXiV8XiZNXihVXiMzXi5QXiZaXiJlXiRdXiEiXiZJXiReXih4XicjXjFEXiNWXjJcXiptXipBXiFAXiJ6XiJ4XiFOXiZIXjNOXiM/XiFPXjM/Xig7IA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c4a5c2491f21",
      "text": "絕大多數的實驗。我建議你們別去碰它——其效果頂多只能說是隨機混亂。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-I^\"z^\"x^$V^&Z^#3^.P^!\"^$%^,'^-|^*F^*{^*H^\"6^-5^+o^*n^*n^!j^$Q^%!^)p^\"x^\"?^'b^-x^,X^)X^%>^%n^!3^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi1JXiJ6XiJ4XiRWXiZaXiMzXi5QXiEiXiQlXiwnXi18XipGXip7XipIXiI2Xi01XitvXipuXipuXiFqXiRRXiUhXilwXiJ4XiI/XidiXi14XixYXilYXiU+XiVuXiEzXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 100
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5924682b6d73",
      "text": "達戈拉爾在這裡嘗試將烈火與生命力量結合進行實驗。他在活人身上 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(z^*M^$6^&/^\"d^(s^-j^1o^-u^#7^%|^%x^'p^&F^\"N^!~^)*^'@^\"C^(w^(;^#3^.P^!\"^!@^\"d^%i^!<^(c^!' ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXiJkXihzXi1qXjFvXi11XiM3XiV8XiV4XidwXiZGXiJOXiF+XikqXidAXiJDXih3Xig7XiMzXi5QXiEiXiFAXiJkXiVpXiE8XihjXiEnIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_354656c29655",
      "text": "塗滿藥劑並畫上符文，然後將他們置入模具之中。劇烈的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^;+^,{^()^!}^!+^-,^!'^'+^$W^*A^&\"^#b^#7^!@^*{^'Q^!f^%:^!k^!/^!,^!\"^1#^%|^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjsrXix7XigpXiF9XiErXi0sXiEnXicrXiRXXipBXiYiXiNiXiM3XiFAXip7XidRXiFmXiU6XiFrXiEvXiEsXiEiXjEjXiV8XiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f6f1aac4256e",
      "text": "異變隨即發生。而受害者通常都會當場斃命。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&M^(U^)X^\"1^&W^&F^!\"^'W^\";^#/^'V^(t^#O^)$^$r^&N^\"n^;.^\"N^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZNXihVXilYXiIxXiZXXiZGXiEiXidXXiI7XiMvXidWXih0XiNPXikkXiRyXiZOXiJuXjsuXiJOXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cef75f745159",
      "text": "有一種方法可以將軟泥怪活化為達戈拉爾軟泥怪。我曾親眼見過達戈拉爾 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$s^!%^'$^$]^%b^\"A^!B^#7^.x^%d^#s^%i^\")^%{^(z^*M^$6^&/^.x^%d^#s^!\"^$%^.j^(F^&d^-m^(x^(z^*M^$6^&/ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRzXiElXickXiRdXiViXiJBXiFCXiM3Xi54XiVkXiNzXiVpXiIpXiV7Xih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXi54XiVkXiNzXiEiXiQlXi5qXihGXiZkXi1tXih4Xih6XipNXiQ2XiYvIA==",
      "byte_length": 97
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_73185e4227ab",
      "text": "這麼做過。把罐子放在圓環上，然後研讀那本書。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^.T^*~^(x^!\"^$1^'O^#(^$P^\"d^\"a^&B^!'^*A^&\"^#b^9G^7I^)!^$x^$p^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXi5UXip+Xih4XiEiXiQxXidPXiMoXiRQXiJkXiJhXiZCXiEnXipBXiYiXiNiXjlHXjdJXikhXiR4XiRwXiEi",
      "byte_length": 66
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_dee264b81991",
      "text": "特克圖克特雷裝置極其危險！那是從德拉吉王宮 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&5^!d^\"b^!d^&5^)c^(A^'Q^1D^!j^2\\^*m^*W^)!^,X^#f^#j^$6^\"D^-)^/\\ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiY1XiFkXiJiXiFkXiY1XiljXihBXidRXjFEXiFqXjJcXiptXipXXikhXixYXiNmXiNqXiQ2XiJEXi0pXi9cIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b966f3ccc2b3",
      "text": "偷出來的。如果我是你們，我絕不會碰它——誰知道它會引發什麼後果！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^/O^!q^!O^&Z^!\"^#$^%!^$%^,X^*F^*{^*A^$%^-I^!)^$r^-5^+o^*n^*n^-y^&h^(y^+o^$r^#Z^&W^!=^.T^#b^%!^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi9PXiFxXiFPXiZaXiEiXiMkXiUhXiQlXixYXipGXip7XipBXiQlXi1JXiEpXiRyXi01XitvXipuXipuXi15XiZoXih5XitvXiRyXiNaXiZXXiE9Xi5UXiNiXiUhXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 97
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b7f6a012719d",
      "text": "回到特克圖克特雷裝置那裡！如果我們能把達戈拉爾引誘到那個房間，我們 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"\\^!u^&5^!d^\"b^!d^&5^)c^(A^'Q^)!^-j^*W^#$^%!^$%^*{^'b^$1^(z^*M^$6^&/^#Z^1Z^!u^)!^!V^,<^)G^*A^$%^*{ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJcXiF1XiY1XiFkXiJiXiFkXiY1XiljXihBXidRXikhXi1qXipXXiMkXiUhXiQlXip7XidiXiQxXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXiNaXjFaXiF1XikhXiFWXiw8XilHXipBXiQlXip7IA==",
      "byte_length": 100
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c1c9ec3a000b",
      "text": "就能用那個裝置來對付他！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*J^'b^&H^)!^!V^(A^'Q^!O^#:^*u^!@^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XipKXidiXiZIXikhXiFWXihBXidRXiFPXiM6Xip1XiFAXipX",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_62f4df90d46b",
      "text": "達戈拉爾的「貴客」在參觀這些設施時，會把大衣留在這裡。但與 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(z^*M^$6^&/^&Z^!#^2F^+q^!$^\"d^6K^*R^(s^!8^4e^$_^$f^*A^$r^$1^\"z^(>^-+^\"d^(s^-j^!\"^!I^'p ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXiZaXiEjXjJGXitxXiEkXiJkXjZLXipSXihzXiE4XjRlXiRfXiRmXipBXiRyXiQxXiJ6Xig+Xi0rXiJkXihzXi1qXiEiXiFJXidwIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cc2dc89a3c6a",
      "text": "大衣數量所暗示的相反，達戈拉爾此刻根本沒有任何客人。那些 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"z^(>^$V^)*^$)^$k^&s^&Z^&a^\"9^*A^(z^*M^$6^&/^%I^.Y^%)^$x^%\\^$s^!C^!L^+q^!<^!\"^)!^!8 ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJ6Xig+XiRWXikqXiQpXiRrXiZzXiZaXiZhXiI5XipBXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXiVJXi5ZXiUpXiR4XiVcXiRzXiFDXiFMXitxXiE8XiEiXikhXiE4IA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7ee4b7929a51",
      "text": "大衣的主人全都變成了實驗品。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"z^(>^&Z^!-^!<^!h^)$^(U^$$^*D^#3^.P^\"R^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJ6Xig+XiZaXiEtXiE8XiFoXikkXihVXiQkXipEXiMzXi5QXiJSXiEi",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_45e1e370ea36",
      "text": "達戈拉爾從這口井裡抽水，供實驗用的蒸汽管道運作。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(z^*M^$6^&/^#f^(s^\"<^!7^-j^*_^%V^*A^!P^#3^.P^&H^&Z^(&^:\\^-D^(y^.4^!M^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXiNmXihzXiI8XiE3Xi1qXipfXiVWXipBXiFQXiMzXi5QXiZIXiZaXigmXjpcXi1EXih5Xi40XiFNXiEi",
      "byte_length": 72
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ebc71eada3ae",
      "text": "這裡就是為達戈拉爾的實驗燒煮沸水的地方。他利用這些 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^-j^*J^,X^%{^(z^*M^$6^&/^&Z^#3^.P^&&^7`^5\\^%V^&Z^\"e^$]^!\"^!@^!t^&H^(s^!8 ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXi1qXipKXixYXiV7Xih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXiZaXiMzXi5QXiYmXjdgXjVcXiVWXiZaXiJlXiRdXiEiXiFAXiF0XiZIXihzXiE4IA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_82619f80087b",
      "text": "高溫蒸汽製造活體怪物，或是將活生生的人類摧殘殆盡。他的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*+^%s^(&^:\\^(B^(v^%i^**^#s^&4^*A^$'^,X^#7^%i^&F^&F^&Z^!<^)w^$E^,l^8H^-1^!\"^!@^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiorXiVzXigmXjpcXihCXih2XiVpXioqXiNzXiY0XipBXiQnXixYXiM3XiVpXiZGXiZGXiZaXiE8Xil3XiRFXixsXjhIXi0xXiEiXiFAXiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f73036fa87e4",
      "text": "實驗手段確實駭人聽聞。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#3^.P^$+^.l^-6^#3^4(^!<^-X^4^^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiMzXi5QXiQrXi5sXi02XiMzXjQoXiE8Xi1YXjReXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f1eaee9de1db",
      "text": "糟糕！這可不是我想再次遇到的人！小心 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-E^4\\^*W^(s^\"A^!)^,X^$%^,1^!l^%D^.2^!u^&Z^!<^*W^#;^#k ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi1FXjRcXipXXihzXiJBXiEpXixYXiQlXiwxXiFsXiVEXi4yXiF1XiZaXiE8XipXXiM7XiNrIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f8f7d7762a1c",
      "text": "那個聖堂武士，他是達戈拉爾的助理！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^!V^'Z^42^%J^+a^*A^!@^,X^(z^*M^$6^&/^&Z^\"#^&A^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXiFWXidaXjQyXiVKXithXipBXiFAXixYXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXiZaXiIjXiZBXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_147df34ff519",
      "text": "這座拱門後方就是達戈拉爾的密室，但我不知道該怎麼穿過去——我 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^/_^*a^)D^#b^$]^*J^,X^(z^*M^$6^&/^&Z^#0^+r^*A^!I^$%^!)^&h^(y^(M^,,^.T^')^(x^\"6^*n^*n^$% ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXi9fXiphXilEXiNiXiRdXipKXixYXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXiZaXiMwXityXipBXiFJXiQlXiEpXiZoXih5XihNXiwsXi5UXicpXih4XiI2XipuXipuXiQlIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_eb6c62275dd7",
      "text": "除了達戈拉爾以外，從沒見過任何人能熄滅那些火焰。不過，對面有一塊 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)Q^*D^(z^*M^$6^&/^!B^\"w^*A^#f^%\\^-m^(x^!C^!L^!<^'b^:_^%t^)!^!8^%x^&!^!\"^!)^(x^*A^#:^)j^$s^!%^/Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XilRXipEXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXiFCXiJ3XipBXiNmXiVcXi1tXih4XiFDXiFMXiE8XidiXjpfXiV0XikhXiE4XiV4XiYhXiEiXiEpXih4XipBXiM6XilqXiRzXiElXi9aIA==",
      "byte_length": 97
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a3d3ce9ea0d4",
      "text": "重壓踏板。找些沉重的東西扔上去！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^))^4v^.,^$}^!\"^$/^!8^%Z^))^&Z^,`^-l^8{^!'^\"6^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XikpXjR2Xi4sXiR9XiEiXiQvXiE4XiVaXikpXiZaXixgXi1sXjh7XiEnXiI2XipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 49
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cf016556c455",
      "text": "看見了吧？我早跟你們說過別亂碰它！瞧瞧你們搞出了什麼怪物！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*Q^-m^*D^*I^.V^$%^,V^.+^*F^*{^-x^(x^*H^!3^-5^+o^*W^-4^-4^*F^*{^:R^!q^*D^!=^.T^#s^&4^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipRXi1tXipEXipJXi5WXiQlXixWXi4rXipGXip7Xi14Xih4XipIXiEzXi01XitvXipXXi00Xi00XipGXip7XjpSXiFxXipEXiE9Xi5UXiNzXiY0XipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ece207692de0",
      "text": "一旦把粉末倒入這個大桶中混合，就必須等待一段時間讓它完全溶解。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!%^1C^$1^'5^$w^!X^!f^(s^!V^\"z^7z^!,^%n^\"C^*A^*J^#l^)r^'-^,*^!%^.l^$f^)G^-}^+o^#,^!h^:]^(I^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiElXjFDXiQxXic1XiR3XiFYXiFmXihzXiFWXiJ6Xjd6XiEsXiVuXiJDXipBXipKXiNsXilyXictXiwqXiElXi5sXiRmXilHXi19XitvXiMsXiFoXjpdXihJXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 94
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d01358ee9e71",
      "text": "這需要花點時間，而我們還有比瞎搗鼓這玩意更重要的正事要辦。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^)e^(C^'w^*;^$f^)G^*A^'W^$%^*{^.7^$s^,m^2}^:H^*<^(s^4U^#z^$o^))^(C^&Z^%H^*r^(C^2L^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXillXihDXid3Xio7XiRmXilHXipBXidXXiQlXip7Xi43XiRzXixtXjJ9XjpIXio8XihzXjRVXiN6XiRvXikpXihDXiZaXiVIXipyXihDXjJMXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5e754e396a77",
      "text": "走吧。繼續往裡加只不過是白白浪費粉末而已。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.&^*I^!\"^-O^'M^,)^-j^\"\"^\"?^!)^(x^,X^&X^&X^,r^.\"^'5^$w^'W^#J^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi4mXipJXiEiXi1PXidNXiwpXi1qXiIiXiI/XiEpXih4XixYXiZYXiZYXixyXi4iXic1XiR3XidXXiNKXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3bb9edaf4b03",
      "text": "你們可別太相信這些東西說的話——他們的心智早已被達戈拉爾 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^\"A^*H^+f^&a^!U^(s^!8^,`^-l^-x^&Z^-v^*n^*n^!@^*{^&Z^#k^$i^,V^#J^(@^(z^*M^$6^&/ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiJBXipIXitmXiZhXiFVXihzXiE4XixgXi1sXi14XiZaXi12XipuXipuXiFAXip7XiZaXiNrXiRpXixWXiNKXihAXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_aebf4d9535ad",
      "text": "和彼此扭曲折磨得不成人形了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"O^:E^%I^1;^$n^,?^-7^#e^!)^$$^!<^#_^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJPXjpFXiVJXjE7XiRuXiw/Xi03XiNlXiEpXiQkXiE8XiNfXipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 43
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4a1047bdfb05",
      "text": "維持鍋爐運轉所需的燃料都是從這個房間提取的。達戈拉爾 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'F^$7^)7^&,^.4^(i^$)^)e^&Z^&%^/n^)$^,X^#f^(s^!V^,<^)G^$A^\":^&Z^!\"^(z^*M^$6^&/ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XidGXiQ3Xik3XiYsXi40XihpXiQpXillXiZaXiYlXi9uXikkXixYXiNmXihzXiFWXiw8XilHXiRBXiI6XiZaXiEiXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5405f827759e",
      "text": "使用了一種極其罕見的手法來獲取油脂。他完善了一套 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!N^&H^*D^!%^'$^1D^!j^5w^-m^&Z^$+^%b^!O^&:^\":^%^^;6^!\"^!@^#,^1(^*D^!%^#! ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFOXiZIXipEXiElXickXjFEXiFqXjV3Xi1tXiZaXiQrXiViXiFPXiY6XiI6XiVeXjs2XiEiXiFAXiMsXjEoXipEXiElXiMhIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_de3c7cc6fbb8",
      "text": "直接從活生生生靈身上榨取油脂的工藝。成本呢？一文不花！當他 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&`^$?^#f^%i^&F^&F^&F^)g^(c^!'^8G^\":^%^^;6^&Z^+y^3Z^!\"^$$^$x^+C^.V^!%^$W^!)^'w^*W^&N^!@ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZgXiQ/XiNmXiVpXiZGXiZGXiZGXilnXihjXiEnXjhHXiI6XiVeXjs2XiZaXit5XjNaXiEiXiQkXiR4XitDXi5WXiElXiRXXiEpXid3XipXXiZOXiFAIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c89c00f887b0",
      "text": "對他的「貴客」感到厭倦時，那些人通常都會被送進這個房間。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#:^!@^&Z^!#^2F^+q^!$^#{^!u^+9^;(^$f^*A^)!^!8^!<^(t^#O^)$^$r^(@^./^(w^(s^!V^,<^)G^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiM6XiFAXiZaXiEjXjJGXitxXiEkXiN7XiF1Xis5XjsoXiRmXipBXikhXiE4XiE8Xih0XiNPXikkXiRyXihAXi4vXih3XihzXiFWXiw8XilHXiEi",
      "byte_length": 84
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f66af8aab542",
      "text": "這就是記憶之橋。達戈拉爾是用那些企圖欺騙他的貴族 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^*J^,X^(K^$\"^!/^%<^!\"^(z^*M^$6^&/^,X^&H^)!^!8^4-^\"b^2r^.{^!@^&Z^2F^5V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXipKXixYXihLXiQiXiEvXiU8XiEiXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXixYXiZIXikhXiE4XjQtXiJiXjJyXi57XiFAXiZaXjJGXjVWIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5e862eafa910",
      "text": "建造了這座橋。如今他們在此受烈火炙烤，反省自己的愚蠢。達戈拉爾在 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,'^(v^*D^(s^/_^%<^!\"^#$^*E^!@^*{^\"d^%I^\";^%|^%x^7=^/w^*A^\"9^9%^'l^#I^&Z^/a^.u^!\"^(z^*M^$6^&/^\"d ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiwnXih2XipEXihzXi9fXiU8XiEiXiMkXipFXiFAXip7XiJkXiVJXiI7XiV8XiV4Xjc9Xi93XipBXiI5XjklXidsXiNJXiZaXi9hXi51XiEiXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXiJkIA==",
      "byte_length": 97
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0eb374d26b06",
      "text": "刑罰藝術上的造詣真是令人驚嘆。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^9|^0-^3Z^(<^!'^&Z^(v^;G^-2^,X^*w^!<^.Q^59^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xjl8XjAtXjNaXig8XiEnXiZaXih2XjtHXi0yXixYXip3XiE8Xi5RXjU5XiEi",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_35eb25f64789",
      "text": "既然你們拿到了衛兵的項鍊，就可以毫髮無傷地穿過 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,U^&\"^*F^*{^,G^!u^*D^(=^+,^&Z^)q^)6^*A^*J^\"A^!B^/t^;=^%}^!^^\"e^')^(x ",
      "encoded_base64": "XixVXiYiXipGXip7XixHXiF1XipEXig9XissXiZaXilxXik2XipBXipKXiJBXiFCXi90Xjs9XiV9XiFeXiJlXicpXih4IA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_53e560b70e33",
      "text": "雙眼之門了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)_^&d^!/^)D^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XilfXiZkXiEvXilEXipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 19
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_93236fb6197b",
      "text": "去拿到衛兵的項鍊。它們能讓你們安全通過記憶之橋旁的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"6^,G^!u^(=^+,^&Z^)q^)6^!\"^+o^*{^'b^-}^*F^*{^+p^!h^(t^(x^(K^$\"^!/^%<^.h^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiI2XixHXiF1Xig9XissXiZaXilxXik2XiEiXitvXip7XidiXi19XipGXip7XitwXiFoXih0Xih4XihLXiQiXiEvXiU8Xi5oXiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d16f57a798bd",
      "text": "雙眼之門。每個人都必須佩戴一條才能安然無恙。那扇門認得我—— ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)_^&d^!/^)D^!\"^%P^!V^!<^)$^#l^)r^.}^1:^!%^%.^$,^'b^+p^&\"^%}^;A^!\"^)!^$*^)D^(O^#e^$%^*n^*n ",
      "encoded_base64": "XilfXiZkXiEvXilEXiEiXiVQXiFWXiE8XikkXiNsXilyXi59XjE6XiElXiUuXiQsXidiXitwXiYiXiV9XjtBXiEiXikhXiQqXilEXihPXiNlXiQlXipuXipuIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_916caa331b66",
      "text": "所以我根本不需要項鍊。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$)^!B^$%^%)^$x^!)^)e^(C^)q^)6^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQpXiFCXiQlXiUpXiR4XiEpXillXihDXilxXik2XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_335ab9bc44e7",
      "text": "這就是雙眼之門，是達戈拉爾用那些窺探他隱私的人造出來的。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^*J^,X^)_^&d^!/^)D^*A^,X^(z^*M^$6^&/^&H^)!^!8^6f^$>^!@^)Y^&~^&Z^!<^(v^!q^!O^&Z^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXipKXixYXilfXiZkXiEvXilEXipBXixYXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXiZIXikhXiE4XjZmXiQ+XiFAXilZXiZ+XiZaXiE8Xih2XiFxXiFPXiZaXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d5188dca554b",
      "text": "現在他們可以盡情看、盡情窺探了，但這也是他們唯一能做的事了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&?^\"d^!@^*{^\"A^!B^-1^,0^*Q^!!^-1^,0^6f^$>^*D^*A^!I^(s^!1^,X^!@^*{^+O^!%^'b^*~^&Z^*r^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiY/XiJkXiFAXip7XiJBXiFCXi0xXiwwXipRXiEhXi0xXiwwXjZmXiQ+XipEXipBXiFJXihzXiExXixYXiFAXip7XitPXiElXidiXip+XiZaXipyXipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a559a518d5e0",
      "text": "你們從衛兵身上奪來的項鍊，能讓你們毫髮無傷地穿過 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^#f^(=^+,^(c^!'^1,^!O^&Z^)q^)6^*A^'b^-}^*F^*{^/t^;=^%}^!^^\"e^')^(x ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiNmXig9XissXihjXiEnXjEsXiFPXiZaXilxXik2XipBXidiXi19XipGXip7Xi90Xjs9XiV9XiFeXiJlXicpXih4IA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9c6f25c64dad",
      "text": "雙眼之門。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)_^&d^!/^)D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XilfXiZkXiEvXilEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 16
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_37f908993bea",
      "text": "如果不佩戴犬首項鍊，你們在這裡將面臨致命的危險。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#$^%!^!)^.}^1:^&6^)~^)q^)6^*A^*F^*{^\"d^(s^-j^#7^)j^1U^'o^\"N^&Z^2\\^*m^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiMkXiUhXiEpXi59XjE6XiY2Xil+XilxXik2XipBXipGXip7XiJkXihzXi1qXiM3XilqXjFVXidvXiJOXiZaXjJcXiptXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_596ba92320f5",
      "text": "衛兵就在東邊！你們一定要拿到那些項鍊！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(=^+,^*J^\"d^,`^.8^*W^*F^*{^!%^#.^(C^,G^!u^)!^!8^)q^)6^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xig9XissXipKXiJkXixgXi44XipXXipGXip7XiElXiMuXihDXixHXiF1XikhXiE4XilxXik2XipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_da0492f94e65",
      "text": "這些是達戈拉爾的宿敵，他們的意志堅定不屈，無法被擊垮。達戈拉爾把他們抓 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^!8^,X^(z^*M^$6^&/^&Z^7+^$U^*A^!@^*{^&Z^#z^#m^\"l^#.^!)^5K^*A^%}^%b^(@^$F^.^^!\"^(z^*M^$6^&/^$1^!@^*{^$2 ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXiE4XixYXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXiZaXjcrXiRVXipBXiFAXip7XiZaXiN6XiNtXiJsXiMuXiEpXjVLXipBXiV9XiViXihAXiRGXi5eXiEiXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXiQxXiFAXip7XiQyIA==",
      "byte_length": 106
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6d369f8e9411",
      "text": "了起來，並將他們活活熔鑄成了這些雕塑。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*D^.(^!O^*A^!+^#7^!@^*{^%i^%i^&#^:?^$$^*D^(s^!8^)^^1s^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipEXi4oXiFPXipBXiErXiM3XiFAXip7XiVpXiVpXiYjXjo/XiQkXipEXihzXiE4XileXjFzXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_dbee2a65b62f",
      "text": "這是一幅噩夢掛毯。達戈拉爾將受害者的靈魂織進了這幅 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^,X^!%^#P^/X^\"y^$=^%S^!\"^(z^*M^$6^&/^#7^\";^#/^'V^&Z^)g^*.^3z^(w^*D^(s^#P ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXixYXiElXiNQXi9YXiJ5XiQ9XiVTXiEiXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXiM3XiI7XiMvXidWXiZaXilnXiouXjN6Xih3XipEXihzXiNQIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6e55960aebcc",
      "text": "掛毯中，把受害者永世困在噩夢裡。你們可以看到下場如何。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$=^%S^!,^*A^$1^\";^#/^'V^%W^*p^\"^^\"d^/X^\"y^-j^!\"^*F^*{^\"A^!B^*Q^!u^!(^\"n^#$^!L^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQ9XiVTXiEsXipBXiQxXiI7XiMvXidWXiVXXipwXiJeXiJkXi9YXiJ5Xi1qXiEiXipGXip7XiJBXiFCXipRXiF1XiEoXiJuXiMkXiFMXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_de64405c17ce",
      "text": "達戈拉爾的「貴客」留下了大衣，但沒一個人回來過！許多人都被拿去當燃料了！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(z^*M^$6^&/^&Z^!#^2F^+q^!$^-+^!(^*D^\"z^(>^*A^!I^%\\^!%^!V^!<^\"\\^!O^(x^*W^-s^\"x^!<^)$^(@^,G^\"6^&N^&%^/n^*D^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXiZaXiEjXjJGXitxXiEkXi0rXiEoXipEXiJ6Xig+XipBXiFJXiVcXiElXiFWXiE8XiJcXiFPXih4XipXXi1zXiJ4XiE8XikkXihAXixHXiI2XiZOXiYlXi9uXipEXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 109
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_77e850405927",
      "text": "這裡什麼都沒有——值錢的東西早被衛兵偷光了！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^-j^!=^.T^)$^%\\^$s^*n^*n^!Z^.<^&Z^,`^-l^,V^(@^(=^+,^/O^!c^*D^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXi1qXiE9Xi5UXikkXiVcXiRzXipuXipuXiFaXi48XiZaXixgXi1sXixWXihAXig9XissXi9PXiFjXipEXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d0061a187b78",
      "text": "達戈拉爾博學多聞。他從地底深處汲取地下水來進行他的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(z^*M^$6^&/^/$^+n^\"x^4^^!\"^!@^#f^\"e^/^^2*^(,^%Y^\":^\"e^!(^%V^!O^(w^(;^!@^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXi8kXituXiJ4XjReXiEiXiFAXiNmXiJlXi9eXjIqXigsXiVZXiI6XiJlXiEoXiVWXiFPXih3Xig7XiFAXiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cc056f7d4057",
      "text": "實驗！水順著管道流進隔壁房間。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#3^.P^*W^%V^.D^-a^-D^(y^%j^(w^9e^*\\^,<^)G^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiMzXi5QXipXXiVWXi5EXi1hXi1EXih5XiVqXih3XjllXipcXiw8XilHXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f8cf613d01b9",
      "text": "這裡就是燒煮沸水的地方。達戈拉爾做實驗需要高溫熱水，但我 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^-j^*J^,X^&&^7`^5\\^%V^&Z^\"e^$]^!\"^(z^*M^$6^&/^*~^#3^.P^)e^(C^*+^%s^&$^%V^*A^!I^$% ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXi1qXipKXixYXiYmXjdgXjVcXiVWXiZaXiJlXiRdXiEiXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXip+XiMzXi5QXillXihDXiorXiVzXiYkXiVWXipBXiFJXiQlIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_44cb87811af7",
      "text": "不知道原因。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^&h^(y^\"5^\"]^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXiZoXih5XiI1XiJdXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 19
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_16353a9bdc96",
      "text": "流水之廳。達戈拉爾把蒸汽與魔法粉末混合！他使用殭屍 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%j^%V^!/^0\\^!\"^(z^*M^$6^&/^$1^(&^:\\^'p^*0^%b^'5^$w^%n^\"C^*W^!@^!N^&H^3N^#? ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVqXiVWXiEvXjBcXiEiXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXiQxXigmXjpcXidwXiowXiViXic1XiR3XiVuXiJDXipXXiFAXiFOXiZIXjNOXiM/IA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7cafc32d76b2",
      "text": "來操作，這樣就不會平白折損能用來做實驗的活人！效果是隨機的！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!O^$H^!M^*A^(s^,f^*J^!)^$r^0Y^&X^,?^$D^'b^&H^!O^*~^#3^.P^&Z^%i^!<^*W^$Q^%!^,X^)X^%>^&Z^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFPXiRIXiFNXipBXihzXixmXipKXiEpXiRyXjBZXiZYXiw/XiREXidiXiZIXiFPXip+XiMzXi5QXiZaXiVpXiE8XipXXiRRXiUhXixYXilYXiU+XiZaXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f3ae7d6f2b78",
      "text": "千萬別胡亂擺弄它！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+7^-_^*H^3}^!3^1@^/`^+o^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xis3Xi1fXipIXjN9XiEzXjFAXi9gXitvXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 28
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4d43d57e376c",
      "text": "這裡就是達戈拉爾製造軟泥怪的地方！他先使用提爾軟泥怪，然後研讀 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^-j^*J^,X^(z^*M^$6^&/^(B^(v^.x^%d^#s^&Z^\"e^$]^*W^!@^!b^!N^&H^$A^&/^.x^%d^#s^*A^&\"^#b^9G^7I ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXi1qXipKXixYXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXihCXih2Xi54XiVkXiNzXiZaXiJlXiRdXipXXiFAXiFiXiFOXiZIXiRBXiYvXi54XiVkXiNzXipBXiYiXiNiXjlHXjdJIA==",
      "byte_length": 94
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9505192e8276",
      "text": "他的秘典！軟泥怪就會變得凶暴邪惡！別亂動這東西，因為只有達戈拉爾 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^&Z^1O^2W^*W^.x^%d^#s^*J^$r^(U^#e^3e^$m^)\"^#y^*W^*H^!3^\"%^(s^,`^-l^*A^\"]^%{^\"?^$s^(z^*M^$6^&/ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXiZaXjFPXjJXXipXXi54XiVkXiNzXipKXiRyXihVXiNlXjNlXiRtXikiXiN5XipXXipIXiEzXiIlXihzXixgXi1sXipBXiJdXiV7XiI/XiRzXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvIA==",
      "byte_length": 97
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e4728783f455",
      "text": "懂得正確製造它們的方法！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,6^#e^%H^-6^(B^(v^+o^*{^&Z^$]^%b^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xiw2XiNlXiVIXi02XihCXih2XitvXip7XiZaXiRdXiViXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 37
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f567aef554f8",
      "text": "這裡是烈火之廳！活人被放入那些模具中。他先在人體上塗抹 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^-j^,X^%|^%x^!/^0\\^*W^%i^!<^(@^$P^!f^)!^!8^%:^!k^!,^!\"^!@^!b^\"d^!<^**^!'^;+^4= ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXi1qXixYXiV8XiV4XiEvXjBcXipXXiVpXiE8XihAXiRQXiFmXikhXiE4XiU6XiFrXiEsXiEiXiFAXiFiXiJkXiE8XioqXiEnXjsrXjQ9IA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7cf72c81b79d",
      "text": "魔法藥劑並畫上符號，然後注入烈火精華。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*0^%b^()^!}^!+^-,^!'^'+^(-^*A^&\"^#b^%e^!f^%|^%x^'7^3'^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiowXiViXigpXiF9XiErXi0sXiEnXicrXigtXipBXiYiXiNiXiVlXiFmXiV8XiV4Xic3XjMnXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8ba6736ae36b",
      "text": "那台裝置非常危險！只有達戈拉爾才敢使用它，但連他自己都可能 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^\"B^(A^'Q^)i^#O^2\\^*m^*W^\"?^$s^(z^*M^$6^&/^$,^/m^!N^&H^+o^*A^!I^.0^!@^'l^#I^)$^\"A^'b ",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXiJCXihBXidRXilpXiNPXjJcXiptXipXXiI/XiRzXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXiQsXi9tXiFOXiZIXitvXipBXiFJXi4wXiFAXidsXiNJXikkXiJBXidiIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c66991684371",
      "text": "被它毀滅！千萬別碰！太危險了！什麼意想不到的事都有可能發生！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(@^+o^%N^%t^*W^+7^-_^*H^-5^*W^+f^2\\^*m^*D^*W^!=^.T^#z^,1^!)^!u^&Z^*r^)$^$s^\"A^'b^&W^&F^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihAXitvXiVOXiV0XipXXis3Xi1fXipIXi01XipXXitmXjJcXiptXipEXipXXiE9Xi5UXiN6XiwxXiEpXiF1XiZaXipyXikkXiRzXiJBXidiXiZXXiZGXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_471e99ef2868",
      "text": "這裡就是達戈拉爾關押囚犯的地方。他喜歡在把囚犯改造成 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^-j^*J^,X^(z^*M^$6^&/^.>^7Z^\"Z^-%^&Z^\"e^$]^!\"^!@^+V^%F^\"d^$1^\"Z^-%^$N^(v^$$ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXi1qXipKXixYXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXi4+XjdaXiJaXi0lXiZaXiJlXiRdXiEiXiFAXitWXiVGXiJkXiQxXiJaXi0lXiROXih2XiQkIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_252d683a33a1",
      "text": "活體雕塑和其他「怪物」之前，盡情折磨他們。他是個精通邪惡技藝的大師！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%i^**^)^^1s^\"O^!j^!@^!#^#s^&4^!$^!/^!z^*A^-1^,0^,?^-7^!@^*{^!\"^!@^,X^!V^'7^(t^)\"^#y^,>^3Z^&Z^\"z^#M^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVpXioqXileXjFzXiJPXiFqXiFAXiEjXiNzXiY0XiEkXiEvXiF6XipBXi0xXiwwXiw/Xi03XiFAXip7XiEiXiFAXixYXiFWXic3Xih0XikiXiN5Xiw+XjNaXiZaXiJ6XiNNXipX",
      "byte_length": 102
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_20c145bd8bb0",
      "text": "我們快走吧！正面交鋒你們是不可能打贏達戈拉爾的——把他引誘到隔壁 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^*L^.&^*I^*W^%H^)j^0P^6?^*F^*{^,X^!)^\"A^'b^$-^.%^(z^*M^$6^&/^&Z^*n^*n^$1^!@^#Z^1Z^!u^9e^*\\ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7XipMXi4mXipJXipXXiVIXilqXjBQXjY/XipGXip7XixYXiEpXiJBXidiXiQtXi4lXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXiZaXipuXipuXiQxXiFAXiNaXjFaXiF1XjllXipcIA==",
      "byte_length": 97
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cdc29a2f73b0",
      "text": "房間，然後啟動特克圖克特雷裝置。那件裝置的強大力量必能制伏他。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,<^)G^*A^&\"^#b^57^\"%^&5^!d^\"b^!d^&5^)c^(A^'Q^!\"^)!^.W^(A^'Q^&Z^#]^\"z^!~^)*^#l^'b^!v^3c^!@^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xiw8XilHXipBXiYiXiNiXjU3XiIlXiY1XiFkXiJiXiFkXiY1XiljXihBXidRXiEiXikhXi5XXihBXidRXiZaXiNdXiJ6XiF+XikqXiNsXidiXiF2XjNjXiFAXiEi",
      "byte_length": 93
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9a3d561a866d",
      "text": "啊！凱爾達！達戈拉爾的二把手！千萬別相信他！他徹底瘋了！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+Q^*W^!p^&/^(z^*W^(z^*M^$6^&/^&Z^!5^$1^$+^*W^+7^-_^*H^&a^!U^!@^*W^!@^18^/^^-/^*D^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitRXipXXiFwXiYvXih6XipXXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXiZaXiE1XiQxXiQrXipXXis3Xi1fXipIXiZhXiFVXiFAXipXXiFAXjE4Xi9eXi0vXipEXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9ab0bbb18ab0",
      "text": "啊！怎麼又是他！快把這傢伙解決掉！他就是個瘋子！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+Q^*W^,,^.T^+;^,X^!@^*W^*L^$1^(s^+#^*y^(I^,o^/e^*W^!@^*J^,X^!V^-/^#(^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitRXipXXiwsXi5UXis7XixYXiFAXipXXipMXiQxXihzXisjXip5XihJXixvXi9lXipXXiFAXipKXixYXiFWXi0vXiMoXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_16839ad08a39",
      "text": "達戈拉爾就在這裡——在烈火後面。我從沒敢進去過。他是唯一 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(z^*M^$6^&/^*J^\"d^(s^-j^*n^*n^\"d^%|^%x^#b^)j^!\"^$%^#f^%\\^/m^(w^\"6^(x^!\"^!@^,X^+O^!% ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXipKXiJkXihzXi1qXipuXipuXiJkXiV8XiV4XiNiXilqXiEiXiQlXiNmXiVcXi9tXih3XiI2Xih4XiEiXiFAXixYXitPXiElIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_057318a1e1c8",
      "text": "能穿過去的人——換作其他人，火焰會把一切燒成灰燼！你們必須想辦法穿 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'b^')^(x^\"6^&Z^!<^*n^*n^4@^!M^!j^!@^!<^*A^%x^&!^$r^$1^!%^+.^&&^$$^%y^&)^*W^*F^*{^#l^)r^,1^2L^%b^') ",
      "encoded_base64": "XidiXicpXih4XiI2XiZaXiE8XipuXipuXjRAXiFNXiFqXiFAXiE8XipBXiV4XiYhXiRyXiQxXiElXisuXiYmXiQkXiV5XiYpXipXXipGXip7XiNsXilyXiwxXjJMXiViXicpIA==",
      "byte_length": 100
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d405b2506170",
      "text": "過去！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(x^\"6^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xih4XiI2XipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 10
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8daedbf594b8",
      "text": "效果全都是隨機的！別亂動它！達戈拉爾就在前面等著——你們應該全神貫注 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$Q^%!^!h^)$^,X^)X^%>^&Z^*W^*H^!3^\"%^+o^*W^(z^*M^$6^&/^*J^\"d^!z^)j^'-^-a^*n^*n^*F^*{^0`^(M^!h^&w^;J^%e ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRRXiUhXiFoXikkXixYXilYXiU+XiZaXipXXipIXiEzXiIlXitvXipXXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXipKXiJkXiF6XilqXictXi1hXipuXipuXipGXip7XjBgXihNXiFoXiZ3XjtKXiVlIA==",
      "byte_length": 103
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0f96e5ff7d39",
      "text": "對付他——而不是在這胡搞！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#:^*u^!@^*n^*n^'W^!)^,X^\"d^(s^3}^:R^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiM6Xip1XiFAXipuXipuXidXXiEpXixYXiJkXihzXjN9XjpSXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 40
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_65f4b4edf9b9",
      "text": "現在大桶需要時間冷卻！大桶必須靜置一段時間才能再次使用，但這 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&?^\"d^\"z^7z^)e^(C^$f^)G^!n^1&^*W^\"z^7z^#l^)r^)h^'Q^!%^.l^$f^)G^$,^'b^!l^%D^!N^&H^*A^!I^(s ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiY/XiJkXiJ6Xjd6XillXihDXiRmXilHXiFuXjEmXipXXiJ6Xjd6XiNsXilyXiloXidRXiElXi5sXiRmXilHXiQsXidiXiFsXiVEXiFOXiZIXipBXiFJXihzIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_312f5647273f",
      "text": "需要時間！我們趕緊上路吧！達戈拉爾就在前面！現在加入更多粉末 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)e^(C^$f^)G^*W^$%^*{^0u^0r^!'^(a^*I^*W^(z^*M^$6^&/^*J^\"d^!z^)j^*W^&?^\"d^\"\"^!f^$o^\"x^'5^$w ",
      "encoded_base64": "XillXihDXiRmXilHXipXXiQlXip7XjB1XjByXiEnXihhXipJXipXXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXipKXiJkXiF6XilqXipXXiY/XiJkXiIiXiFmXiRvXiJ4Xic1XiR3IA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_266916e1e6cb",
      "text": "只會平白浪費！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"?^$r^0Y^&X^,r^.\"^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiI/XiRyXjBZXiZYXixyXi4iXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 22
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b3e4e078ccdb",
      "text": "他們都瘋了！承受著巨大的痛苦！他們根本不知道自己在說什麼！聽他們胡言亂語 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^*{^)$^-/^*D^*W^$0^\";^-a^#H^\"z^&Z^-.^.t^*W^!@^*{^%)^$x^!)^&h^(y^'l^#I^\"d^-x^!=^.T^*W^-X^!@^*{^3}^1Y^!3^0: ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXip7XikkXi0vXipEXipXXiQwXiI7Xi1hXiNIXiJ6XiZaXi0uXi50XipXXiFAXip7XiUpXiR4XiEpXiZoXih5XidsXiNJXiJkXi14XiE9Xi5UXipXXi1YXiFAXip7XjN9XjFZXiEzXjA6IA==",
      "byte_length": 109
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1b39366fef7b",
      "text": "是個天大的錯誤！達戈拉爾用無盡的劇痛與謊言扭曲了他們的心智！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,X^!V^+e^\"z^&Z^)5^(P^*W^(z^*M^$6^&/^&H^%}^-1^&Z^1#^-.^'p^3*^1Y^1;^$n^*D^!@^*{^&Z^#k^$i^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XixYXiFWXitlXiJ6XiZaXik1XihQXipXXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXiZIXiV9Xi0xXiZaXjEjXi0uXidwXjMqXjFZXjE7XiRuXipEXiFAXip7XiZaXiNrXiRpXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4c66b78165a4",
      "text": "門正在關閉！別慌！唯一離開的辦法就是殺了達戈拉爾，但我知道你們 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)D^%H^\"d^.>^.=^*W^*H^#}^*W^+O^!%^)`^)F^&Z^2L^%b^*J^,X^%M^*D^(z^*M^$6^&/^*A^!I^$%^&h^(y^*F^*{ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XilEXiVIXiJkXi4+Xi49XipXXipIXiN9XipXXitPXiElXilgXilGXiZaXjJMXiViXipKXixYXiVNXipEXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXipBXiFJXiQlXiZoXih5XipGXip7IA==",
      "byte_length": 94
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_acf6eeba06b2",
      "text": "一定能成功！現在別無退路了！除非達戈拉爾死透，否則你們休想離開！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!%^#.^'b^$$^\"!^*W^&?^\"d^*H^%}^*V^(a^*D^*W^)Q^)i^(z^*M^$6^&/^%L^(q^*A^\"H^!x^*F^*{^!G^,1^)`^)F^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiElXiMuXidiXiQkXiIhXipXXiY/XiJkXipIXiV9XipWXihhXipEXipXXilRXilpXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXiVMXihxXipBXiJIXiF4XipGXip7XiFHXiwxXilgXilGXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 97
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_de93879b12e4",
      "text": "維持鍋爐高溫所需的燃料就在這個房間裡。達戈拉爾從活生生的生靈身上 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'F^$7^)7^&,^*+^%s^$)^)e^&Z^&%^/n^*J^\"d^(s^!V^,<^)G^-j^!\"^(z^*M^$6^&/^#f^%i^&F^&F^&Z^&F^)g^(c^!' ",
      "encoded_base64": "XidGXiQ3Xik3XiYsXiorXiVzXiQpXillXiZaXiYlXi9uXipKXiJkXihzXiFWXiw8XilHXi1qXiEiXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXiNmXiVpXiZGXiZGXiZaXiZGXilnXihjXiEnIA==",
      "byte_length": 97
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cead2499f613",
      "text": "榨取油脂來當作鍋爐燃料。鐵籠裡關著的那些動物，就是 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^8G^\":^%^^;6^!O^&N^!M^)7^&,^&%^/n^!\"^)?^'3^-j^.>^-a^&Z^)!^!8^\"%^&4^*A^*J^,X ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjhHXiI6XiVeXjs2XiFPXiZOXiFNXik3XiYsXiYlXi9uXiEiXik/XiczXi1qXi4+Xi1hXiZaXikhXiE4XiIlXiY0XipBXipKXixYIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c797beb0c1be",
      "text": "下一批等待被「轉化」的祭品。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!(^!%^2i^'-^,*^(@^!#^(i^\")^!$^&Z^&x^\"R^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEoXiElXjJpXictXiwqXihAXiEjXihpXiIpXiEkXiZaXiZ4XiJSXiEi",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8e9263ad97bb",
      "text": "衛兵默默轉過身來看向你們。他們拔出了武器。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(=^+,^:d^:d^(i^(x^(c^!O^*Q^+?^*F^*{^!\"^!@^*{^/c^!q^*D^%J^\"V^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xig9XissXjpkXjpkXihpXih4XihjXiFPXipRXis/XipGXip7XiEiXiFAXip7Xi9jXiFxXipEXiVKXiJWXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2fdfe88cb081",
      "text": "  去死吧，人渣！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^\"6^%L^*I^*A^!<^,v^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIjZeJUxeKkleKkFeITxeLHZeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 23
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3bd19e13fbd7",
      "text": "  我迷路了。你能幫幫我嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^(n^(a^*D^!\"^*F^'b^+}^+}^$%^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeKG5eKGFeKkReISJeKkZeJ2JeK31eK31eJCVeK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_786bfdc1b039",
      "text": "  出口在哪裡？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^!q^\"<^\"d^+I^-j^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIXFeIjxeImReK0leLWpeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 20
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7a7b6ed0f996",
      "text": "  別管我。我這就離開。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*H^-D^$%^!\"^$%^(s^*J^)`^)F^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkheLUReJCVeISJeJCVeKHNeKkpeKWBeKUZeISI=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_185997a13dc7",
      "text": "衛兵張開嘴巴彷彿想回答，卻沒有發出任何聲音。他們默默地全都朝 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(=^+,^,(^)F^+[^#K^.a^.b^,1^\"\\^-B^*A^1&^%\\^$s^&W^!q^!C^!L^-W^34^!\"^!@^*{^:d^:d^\"e^!h^)$^,^ ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xig9XissXiwoXilGXitbXiNLXi5hXi5iXiwxXiJcXi1CXipBXjEmXiVcXiRzXiZXXiFxXiFDXiFMXi1XXjM0XiEiXiFAXip7XjpkXjpkXiJlXiFoXikkXixeIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_30322e8eba37",
      "text": "你們逼近過來。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^.1^(l^(x^!O^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7Xi4xXihsXih4XiFPXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 22
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d109855f91ce",
      "text": "你佩戴的項鍊泛起詭異的微光！囚犯的生命力 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^.}^1:^&Z^)q^)6^0i^.(^;H^&M^&Z^#i^!c^*W^\"Z^-%^&Z^&F^\"N^!~ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXi59XjE6XiZaXilxXik2XjBpXi4oXjtIXiZNXiZaXiNpXiFjXipXXiJaXi0lXiZaXiZGXiJOXiF+IA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e58a10228a75",
      "text": "正在被飛速吸乾。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%H^\"d^(@^)z^(u^\"J^*X^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVIXiJkXihAXil6Xih1XiJKXipYXiEi",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ebddd211da5f",
      "text": "滾開！快滾開！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,z^)F^*W^*L^,z^)F^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xix6XilGXipXXipMXix6XilGXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 22
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_186d0e011a96",
      "text": "求求你們！別傷害我！你們到底想要什麼？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,n^,n^*F^*{^*W^*H^!^^#/^$%^*W^*F^*{^!u^/^^,1^(C^!=^.T^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XixuXixuXipGXip7XipXXipIXiFeXiMvXiQlXipXXipGXip7XiF1Xi9eXiwxXihDXiE9Xi5UXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_45147fd1dbd1",
      "text": "  有什麼我能為你做的嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$s^!=^.T^$%^'b^%{^*F^*~^&Z^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJHNeIT1eLlReJCVeJ2JeJXteKkZeKn5eJlpeK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7ed4b7709c37",
      "text": "  你很痛苦嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^*K^-.^.t^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeKkteLS5eLnReK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 20
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c87206078f9d",
      "text": "  達戈拉爾打算拿你怎麼樣？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^(z^*M^$6^&/^$-^-C^,G^*F^,,^.T^,f^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKHpeKk1eJDZeJi9eJC1eLUNeLEdeKkZeLCxeLlReLGZeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f751e58238c8",
      "text": "啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！嘎啊啊啊啊啊！噫噫噫噫噫！呀啊啊啊啊啊……",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+Q^+Q^+Q^+Q^+Q^+Q^+Q^*W^:v^+Q^+Q^+Q^+Q^+Q^*W^;@^;@^;@^;@^;@^*W^3h^+Q^+Q^+Q^+Q^+Q^*o^*o",
      "encoded_base64": "XitRXitRXitRXitRXitRXitRXitRXipXXjp2XitRXitRXitRXitRXitRXipXXjtAXjtAXjtAXjtAXjtAXipXXjNoXitRXitRXitRXitRXitRXipvXipv",
      "byte_length": 87
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0c6a83a8685c",
      "text": "是的，但你們根本幫不了我。請讓我獨自承受這份痛苦吧。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,X^&Z^*A^!I^*F^*{^%)^$x^+}^!)^*D^$%^!\"^*S^-}^$%^/z^'l^$0^\";^(s^*x^-.^.t^*I^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XixYXiZaXipBXiFJXipGXip7XiUpXiR4Xit9XiEpXipEXiQlXiEiXipTXi19XiQlXi96XidsXiQwXiI7XihzXip4Xi0uXi50XipJXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6066d9e8bda5",
      "text": "達戈拉爾抓到我在暗中窺探他。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(z^*M^$6^&/^$2^!u^$%^\"d^$k^!,^6f^$>^!@^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXiQyXiF1XiQlXiJkXiRrXiEsXjZmXiQ+XiFAXiEi",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_557ecaea816b",
      "text": "我曾是這裡的僕從。我實在看不慣他那樣虐待囚犯，便當面勸阻了 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^.j^,X^(s^-j^&Z^+%^#f^!\"^$%^#3^\"d^*Q^!)^$!^!@^)!^,f^3)^,*^\"Z^-%^*A^!R^&N^)j^;?^)L^*D ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXi5qXixYXihzXi1qXiZaXislXiNmXiEiXiQlXiMzXiJkXipRXiEpXiQhXiFAXikhXixmXjMpXiwqXiJaXi0lXipBXiFSXiZOXilqXjs/XilMXipEIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fd8277bf9701",
      "text": "他——結果他就把我也變成了囚犯。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^*n^*n^'@^%!^!@^*J^$1^$%^!1^(U^$$^*D^\"Z^-%^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXipuXipuXidAXiUhXiFAXipKXiQxXiQlXiExXihVXiQkXipEXiJaXi0lXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 49
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_208724b1e539",
      "text": "我被城邦的軍隊一路追捕，誤打誤撞逃進了這個區域。結果被抓起來 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^(@^+_^1a^&Z^..^)U^!%^(a^(o^4?^*A^(P^$-^(P^/l^(p^(w^*D^(s^!V^\"+^\"k^!\"^'@^%!^(@^$2^.(^!O ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXihAXitfXjFhXiZaXi4uXilVXiElXihhXihvXjQ/XipBXihQXiQtXihQXi9sXihwXih3XipEXihzXiFWXiIrXiJrXiEiXidAXiUhXihAXiQyXi4oXiFPIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9ee94502fc28",
      "text": "關進了這裡。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.>^(w^*D^(s^-j^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi4+Xih3XipEXihzXi1qXiEi",
      "byte_length": 18
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f5fccc07aa97",
      "text": "我在他的塔樓裡行竊時被他抓了個正著。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^\"d^!@^&Z^\"o^0g^-j^(;^5n^$f^(@^!@^$2^*D^!V^%H^-a^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiJkXiFAXiZaXiJvXjBnXi1qXig7XjVuXiRmXihAXiFAXiQyXipEXiFWXiVIXi1hXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8cc764f932e9",
      "text": "當達戈拉爾在德拉吉時，我試圖扒竊他的口袋。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&N^(z^*M^$6^&/^\"d^#j^$6^\"D^$f^*A^$%^-u^\"b^;C^5n^!@^&Z^\"<^(?^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZOXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXiJkXiNqXiQ2XiJEXiRmXipBXiQlXi11XiJiXjtDXjVuXiFAXiZaXiI8Xig/XiEi",
      "byte_length": 63
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_37a2335e4416",
      "text": "啊啊啊啊啊！啊啊啊啊！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+Q^+Q^+Q^+Q^+Q^*W^+Q^+Q^+Q^+Q^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitRXitRXitRXitRXitRXipXXitRXitRXitRXitRXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c8accb77663d",
      "text": "啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！啊啊啊啊！呀啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+Q^+Q^+Q^+Q^+Q^+Q^+Q^+Q^*W^+Q^+Q^+Q^+Q^*W^3h^+Q^+Q^+Q^+Q^+Q^+Q^+Q^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitRXitRXitRXitRXitRXitRXitRXitRXipXXitRXitRXitRXitRXipXXjNoXitRXitRXitRXitRXitRXitRXitRXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bd7acba86bb8",
      "text": "殺了達戈拉爾！徹底終結這場噩夢吧！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%M^*D^(z^*M^$6^&/^*W^18^/^^-H^'@^(s^\"n^/X^\"y^*I^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVNXipEXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXipXXjE4Xi9eXi1IXidAXihzXiJuXi9YXiJ5XipJXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f90f002f2524",
      "text": "啊啊啊啊啊！呀啊啊啊！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+Q^+Q^+Q^+Q^+Q^*W^3h^+Q^+Q^+Q^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitRXitRXitRXitRXitRXipXXjNoXitRXitRXitRXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d4c96d1abe2b",
      "text": "當然是殺了我。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&N^&\"^,X^%M^*D^$%^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZOXiYiXixYXiVNXipEXiQlXiEi",
      "byte_length": 21
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e9033978b818",
      "text": "當你望向大門時，門上的雙眼紛紛聚焦在你的身上。門上長著幾十隻眼睛， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&N^*F^,]^+?^\"z^)D^$f^*A^)D^!'^&Z^)_^&d^7d^7d^'[^%~^\"d^*F^&Z^(c^!'^!\"^)D^!'^)C^-a^#T^*Y^)[^&d^&f^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZOXipGXixdXis/XiJ6XilEXiRmXipBXilEXiEnXiZaXilfXiZkXjdkXjdkXidbXiV+XiJkXipGXiZaXihjXiEnXiEiXilEXiEnXilDXi1hXiNUXipZXilbXiZkXiZmXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 100
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6964d87d9a2e",
      "text": "五顏六色、大小不一，雜亂無章地眨動著。「被注視的感覺」在此刻有了 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!6^;K^;>^'s^!!^\"z^#;^!)^!%^*A^0G^!3^%}^3x^\"e^;F^\"%^-a^!\"^!#^(@^%e^(E^&Z^#{^(G^!$^\"d^%I^.Y^$s^*D ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiE2XjtLXjs+XidzXiEhXiJ6XiM7XiEpXiElXipBXjBHXiEzXiV9XjN4XiJlXjtGXiIlXi1hXiEiXiEjXihAXiVlXihFXiZaXiN7XihHXiEkXiJkXiVJXi5ZXiRzXipEIA==",
      "byte_length": 97
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e895eaf13da1",
      "text": "全新的恐怖詮釋。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!h^$\\^&Z^#t^#p^;I^0w^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFoXiRcXiZaXiN0XiNwXjtJXjB3XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cce6e8befae2",
      "text": "這幅掛毯看起來像是用類似絲綢的材質織成的。其上浮現的畫面 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^#P^$=^%S^*Q^.(^!O^!`^,X^&H^)w^!H^'C^'E^&Z^$y^(Z^3z^$$^&Z^!\"^!j^!'^4M^&?^&Z^-,^)j ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXiNQXiQ9XiVTXipRXi4oXiFPXiFgXixYXiZIXil3XiFIXidDXidFXiZaXiR5XihaXjN6XiQkXiZaXiEiXiFqXiEnXjRNXiY/XiZaXi0sXilqIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0d7cbdc6428c",
      "text": "令人心神不寧，且透著一股令人毛骨悚然的熟悉感…… ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*w^!<^#k^&w^!)^3k^*A^!*^(q^-a^!%^'_^*w^!<^%R^*$^;B^&\"^&Z^-\"^2h^#{^*o^*o ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xip3XiE8XiNrXiZ3XiEpXjNrXipBXiEqXihxXi1hXiElXidfXip3XiE8XiVSXiokXjtCXiYiXiZaXi0iXjJoXiN7XipvXipvIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6730e33be35e",
      "text": "掛在這裡的大衣看起來已經有些年頭了。上面積滿了厚厚的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$=^\"d^(s^-j^&Z^\"z^(>^*Q^.(^!O^#J^'D^$s^!8^+~^)t^*D^!\"^!'^)j^27^,{^*D^\"4^\"4^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQ9XiJkXihzXi1qXiZaXiJ6Xig+XipRXi4oXiFPXiNKXidEXiRzXiE4Xit+Xil0XipEXiEiXiEnXilqXjI3Xix7XipEXiI0XiI0XiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f32fc97ae676",
      "text": "灰塵。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%y^\"p^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiV5XiJwXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 10
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3cd9ed917c82",
      "text": "這台裝置由某種未知動力驅動，正不斷震顫隆隆作響。你可以看見它正從水池中 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^\"B^(A^'Q^&I^%$^'$^,_^&h^\"%^!~^*#^\"%^*A^%H^!)^,T^32^)x^)T^)T^!M^)o^!\"^*F^\"A^!B^*Q^-m^+o^%H^#f^%V^%X^!, ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXiJCXihBXidRXiZJXiUkXickXixfXiZoXiIlXiF+XiojXiIlXipBXiVIXiEpXixUXjMyXil4XilUXilUXiFNXilvXiEiXipGXiJBXiFCXipRXi1tXitvXiVIXiNmXiVWXiVYXiEsIA==",
      "byte_length": 106
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0473212ed57f",
      "text": "抽取池水。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*_^\":^%X^%V^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipfXiI6XiVYXiVWXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 16
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0e647100bbcf",
      "text": "這台裝置精巧複雜的運作機制遠超你的理解。它的正面泛起斑斕五彩的光芒， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^\"B^(A^'Q^'7^3D^6s^0G^&Z^.4^!M^%>^!v^({^(\\^*F^&Z^&A^(I^!\"^+o^&Z^%H^)j^0i^.(^;D^;E^!6^#`^&Z^!c^'u^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXiJCXihBXidRXic3XjNEXjZzXjBHXiZaXi40XiFNXiU+XiF2Xih7XihcXipGXiZaXiZBXihJXiEiXitvXiZaXiVIXilqXjBpXi4oXjtEXjtFXiE2XiNgXiZaXiFjXid1XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 103
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_98b8fc825efe",
      "text": "摸起來滾燙灼人。它在一陣轟鳴與震顫中……運轉著？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^/j^.(^!O^,z^8k^9^^!<^!\"^+o^\"d^!%^)P^.y^.|^'p^32^)x^!,^*o^*o^.4^(i^-a^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi9qXi4oXiFPXix6XjhrXjleXiE8XiEiXitvXiJkXiElXilQXi55Xi58XidwXjMyXil4XiEsXipvXipvXi40XihpXi1hXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1bc33126aa71",
      "text": "大桶裡盛滿了熱水，沸騰翻滾冒出縷縷白色的霧氣， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"z^7z^-j^1L^,{^*D^&$^%V^*A^5\\^.O^-Q^,z^/P^!q^6h^6h^&X^'s^&Z^)f^%U^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJ6Xjd6Xi1qXjFMXix7XipEXiYkXiVWXipBXjVcXi5PXi1RXix6Xi9QXiFxXjZoXjZoXiZYXidzXiZaXilmXiVVXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b65952646440",
      "text": "盤旋飄浮在水槽的頂部。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^1M^$`^;L^4M^\"d^%V^%6^&Z^)p^)#^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjFNXiRgXjtMXjRNXiJkXiVWXiU2XiZaXilwXikjXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c92a21ef7b65",
      "text": "那些模具和鑄模看起來就像是為了容納人體而量身打造的，但究竟是誰 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^!8^%:^!k^\"O^:?^%:^*Q^.(^!O^*J^!`^,X^%{^*D^+t^';^!<^**^'W^)*^(c^$-^(v^&Z^*A^!I^-<^28^,X^-y ",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXiE4XiU6XiFrXiJPXjo/XiU6XipRXi4oXiFPXipKXiFgXixYXiV7XipEXit0Xic7XiE8XioqXidXXikqXihjXiQtXih2XiZaXipBXiFJXi08XjI4XixYXi15IA==",
      "byte_length": 94
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bc8df45af708",
      "text": "會做出如此殘酷駭人之舉？這簡直令你難以置信。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$r^*~^!q^#$^%I^,l^1b^4(^!<^!/^01^.V^(s^3y^&`^*w^*F^)a^!B^'Q^!U^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRyXip+XiFxXiMkXiVJXixsXjFiXjQoXiE8XiEvXjAxXi5WXihzXjN5XiZgXip3XipGXilhXiFCXidRXiFVXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bb51fc1dfcff",
      "text": "雙眼之門在你們身後重重關閉了！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)_^&d^!/^)D^\"d^*F^*{^(c^#b^))^))^.>^.=^*D^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XilfXiZkXiEvXilEXiJkXipGXip7XihjXiNiXikpXikpXi4+Xi49XipEXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_785e822cf61b",
      "text": "這本書裡寫滿了奧術符號與古文字。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^$x^$p^-j^/]^,{^*D^6Q^(<^'+^(-^'p^\"=^$W^#)^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXiR4XiRwXi1qXi9dXix7XipEXjZRXig8XicrXigtXidwXiI9XiRXXiMpXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 49
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_41e2aa5843f6",
      "text": " 仔細審視著上面的文字， ",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^6I^'?^7V^(E^-a^!'^)j^&Z^$W^#)^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "IF42SV4nP143Vl4oRV4tYV4hJ14pal4mWl4kV14jKV4qQSA=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_225460a30f14",
      "text": "並憑藉著 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!+^,5^04^-a ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiErXiw1XjA0Xi1hIA==",
      "byte_length": 13
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_edf2ffaf536a",
      "text": "魔法造詣，成功解讀出了頁面上的文字！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*0^%b^(v^;G^*A^$$^\"!^(I^7I^!q^*D^5&^)j^!'^&Z^$W^#)^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiowXiViXih2XjtHXipBXiQkXiIhXihJXjdJXiFxXipEXjUmXilqXiEnXiZaXiRXXiMpXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1c417a63b4f6",
      "text": "必須將軟泥怪受試物置於法陣之中。在符文能量的束縛下， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#l^)r^#7^.x^%d^#s^\";^-u^&4^'Q^$^^%b^)P^!/^!,^!\"^\"d^'+^$W^'b^)*^&Z^$|^3W^!(^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNsXilyXiM3Xi54XiVkXiNzXiI7Xi11XiY0XidRXiReXiViXilQXiEvXiEsXiEiXiJkXicrXiRXXidiXikqXiZaXiR8XjNXXiEoXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5021763bd599",
      "text": "它會保持溫馴。接著必須朗讀以下段落， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+o^$r^!T^$7^%s^.N^!\"^$?^-a^#l^)r^$t^7I^!B^!(^.l^-`^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitvXiRyXiFUXiQ3XiVzXi5OXiEiXiQ/Xi1hXiNsXilyXiR0XjdJXiFCXiEoXi5sXi1gXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f3da8e7a3281",
      "text": "軟泥怪便會開始轉化。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.x^%d^#s^!R^$r^)F^+k^(i^\")^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi54XiVkXiNzXiFSXiRyXilGXitrXihpXiIpXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 31
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_137a619cc0a8",
      "text": "要朗讀這本書嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(C^$t^7I^(s^$x^$p^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XihDXiR0XjdJXihzXiR4XiRwXitYXi5W",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_503237cebaf2",
      "text": "但由於未受過任何魔法訓練，根本無法理解上面的文字。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!I^&I^$^^,_^\";^(x^!C^!L^*0^%b^-p^-L^*A^%)^$x^%}^%b^&A^(I^!'^)j^&Z^$W^#)^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFJXiZJXiReXixfXiI7Xih4XiFDXiFMXiowXiViXi1wXi1MXipBXiUpXiR4XiV9XiViXiZBXihJXiEnXilqXiZaXiRXXiMpXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7449a03ad038",
      "text": "無論如何都要朗讀這本書嗎？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%}^1\\^#$^!L^)$^(C^$t^7I^(s^$x^$p^+X^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiV9XjFcXiMkXiFMXikkXihDXiR0XjdJXihzXiR4XiRwXitYXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 40
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d5ddec4d6c87",
      "text": " 朗讀了書中的段落！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^$t^7I^*D^$p^!,^&Z^.l^-`^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4kdF43SV4qRF4kcF4hLF4mWl4ubF4tYF4qVyA=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bbfaefcc53b3",
      "text": " 感到自己的生命力彷彿正被硬生生抽離體外——注入了 ",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^#{^!u^'l^#I^&Z^&F^\"N^!~^.a^.b^%H^(@^25^&F^&F^*_^)`^**^\"w^*n^*n^%e^!f^*D ",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4je14hdV4nbF4jSV4mWl4mRl4iTl4hfl4uYV4uYl4lSF4oQF4yNV4mRl4mRl4qX14pYF4qKl4id14qbl4qbl4lZV4hZl4qRCA=",
      "byte_length": 74
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_02eb101f533b",
      "text": "軟泥怪之中！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.x^%d^#s^!/^!,^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi54XiVkXiNzXiEvXiEsXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 19
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_70092310e024",
      "text": "什麼事情也沒有發生。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!=^.T^*r^,0^!1^%\\^$s^&W^&F^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiE9Xi5UXipyXiwwXiExXiVcXiRzXiZXXiZGXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 31
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7393aa521bd7",
      "text": "你辨認不出籠子裡究竟是什麼野獸，但牠顯然暴怒無比。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^6{^(O^!)^!q^'3^#(^-j^-<^28^,X^!=^.T^.:^&<^*A^!I^-#^4&^&\"^$m^#o^%}^,m^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXjZ7XihPXiEpXiFxXiczXiMoXi1qXi08XjI4XixYXiE9Xi5UXi46XiY8XipBXiFJXi0jXjQmXiYiXiRtXiNvXiV9XixtXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3fde610a9911",
      "text": "靠籠子太近很可能對你的小命大為不利！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.C^'3^#(^+f^(l^*K^\"A^'b^#:^*F^&Z^#;^\"N^\"z^%{^!)^!t^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi5DXiczXiMoXitmXihsXipLXiJBXidiXiM6XipGXiZaXiM7XiJOXiJ6XiV7XiEpXiF0XipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_28dd567a9dfa",
      "text": "籠中的野獸猛撲過來，擊中了 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'3^!,^&Z^.:^&<^*P^4B^(x^!O^*A^$F^!,^*D ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiczXiEsXiZaXi46XiY8XipQXjRCXih4XiFPXipBXiRGXiEsXipEIA==",
      "byte_length": 40
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_41962e14b2d1",
      "text": " ，造成了 ",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^*A^(v^$$^*D ",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4qQV4odl4kJF4qRCA=",
      "byte_length": 14
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7fa02c0b4b5c",
      "text": " 點",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^*;",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4qOw==",
      "byte_length": 4
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b624fc6a4fde",
      "text": " 傷害！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^!^^#/^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4hXl4jL14qVyA=",
      "byte_length": 11
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d1b39655351a",
      "text": "噴泉邊緣有一塊小銘牌： ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"W^%a^.8^9J^$s^!%^/Z^#;^.;^&2^*B ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJXXiVhXi44XjlKXiRzXiElXi9aXiM7Xi47XiYyXipCIA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_161e2ac8a3f9",
      "text": "「奧特爾，我最信任的僕從。他生前不太愛洗澡。」 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!#^6Q^&5^&/^*A^$%^$q^!U^!C^&Z^+%^#f^!\"^!@^&F^!z^!)^+f^,2^0j^;T^!\"^!$ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEjXjZRXiY1XiYvXipBXiQlXiRxXiFVXiFDXiZaXislXiNmXiEiXiFAXiZGXiF6XiEpXitmXiwyXjBqXjtUXiEiXiEkIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_505a90c3a869",
      "text": "當你試圖與雕像說話時，一陣淒厲尖叫與痛苦哀號交織的聲浪猛烈衝擊著你的雙耳。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&N^*F^-u^\"b^'p^)^^!`^-x^-v^$f^*A^!%^)P^,t^+:^#=^+<^'p^-.^.t^2`^(-^0P^3z^&Z^-W^,r^*P^%|^-h^$F^-a^*F^&Z^)_^'Y^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZOXipGXi11XiJiXidwXileXiFgXi14Xi12XiRmXipBXiElXilQXix0Xis6XiM9Xis8XidwXi0uXi50XjJgXigtXjBQXjN6XiZaXi1XXixyXipQXiV8Xi1oXiRGXi1hXipGXiZaXilfXidZXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 112
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_85eb24ae326d",
      "text": "過了好一會兒，你才在雕像上找到一個能條理清晰地 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(x^*D^+i^!%^$r^++^*A^*F^$,^\"d^)^^!`^!'^$/^!u^!%^!V^'b^%.^&A^,u^71^\"e ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xih4XipEXitpXiElXiRyXisrXipBXipGXiQsXiJkXileXiFgXiEnXiQvXiF1XiElXiFWXidiXiUuXiZBXix1XjcxXiJlIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_52a70d5274f5",
      "text": "開口說話的部位。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)F^\"<^-x^-v^&Z^)#^!J^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XilGXiI8Xi14Xi12XiZaXikjXiFKXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a4a8b8e3c317",
      "text": "你們為什麼會在這裡？！快在達戈拉爾發現你們之前離開！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^%{^!=^.T^$r^\"d^(s^-j^.V^*W^*L^\"d^(z^*M^$6^&/^&W^&?^*F^*{^!/^!z^)`^)F^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiV7XiE9Xi5UXiRyXiJkXihzXi1qXi5WXipXXipMXiJkXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXiZXXiY/XipGXip7XiEvXiF6XilgXilGXipX",
      "byte_length": 78
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cfc58cdf8634",
      "text": "  你遭遇了什麼事？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^(}^.2^*D^!=^.T^*r^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeKH1eLjJeKkReIT1eLlReKnJeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c4f17051ed13",
      "text": "  你為什麼會變成這個……怪物的一部分？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^%{^!=^.T^$r^(U^$$^(s^!V^*o^*o^#s^&4^&Z^!%^)#^!s^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeJXteIT1eLlReJHJeKFVeJCReKHNeIVZeKm9eKm9eI3NeJjReJlpeISVeKSNeIXNeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 56
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9026970c4794",
      "text": "  達戈拉爾經常來這裡嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^(z^*M^$6^&/^'D^#O^!O^(s^-j^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKHpeKk1eJDZeJi9eJ0ReI09eIU9eKHNeLWpeK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1203fcf1c421",
      "text": "你怎麼問得出這種話？你自己不會看嗎！我已經成了這個 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^,,^.T^*Z^#e^!q^(s^'$^-v^.V^*F^'l^#I^!)^$r^*Q^+X^*W^$%^#J^'D^$$^*D^(s^!V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiwsXi5UXipaXiNlXiFxXihzXickXi12Xi5WXipGXidsXiNJXiEpXiRyXipRXitYXipXXiQlXiNKXidEXiQkXipEXihzXiFWIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3b61c4df0125",
      "text": "怪物的一部分！我們被困在這裡的人，直到時間的盡頭都將萬劫不復！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#s^&4^&Z^!%^)#^!s^*W^$%^*{^(@^\"^^\"d^(s^-j^&Z^!<^*A^&`^!u^$f^)G^&Z^-1^)t^)$^#7^-_^1l^!)^#g^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNzXiY0XiZaXiElXikjXiFzXipXXiQlXip7XihAXiJeXiJkXihzXi1qXiZaXiE8XipBXiZgXiF1XiRmXilHXiZaXi0xXil0XikkXiM3Xi1fXjFsXiEpXiNnXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 94
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_de0491e7670a",
      "text": "達戈拉爾……他把我熔鑄進了這座雕像！我想死，卻死不了！我們 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(z^*M^$6^&/^*o^*o^!@^$1^$%^&#^:?^(w^*D^(s^/_^)^^!`^*W^$%^,1^%L^*A^1&^%L^!)^*D^*W^$%^*{ ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXipvXipvXiFAXiQxXiQlXiYjXjo/Xih3XipEXihzXi9fXileXiFgXipXXiQlXiwxXiVMXipBXjEmXiVMXiEpXipEXipXXiQlXip7IA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6530886af77b",
      "text": "彼此分擔著對方的痛苦，這根本不是任何人所能承受的！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^:E^%I^!s^*N^-a^#:^$]^&Z^-.^.t^*A^(s^%)^$x^!)^,X^!C^!L^!<^$)^'b^$0^\";^&Z^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjpFXiVJXiFzXipOXi1hXiM6XiRdXiZaXi0uXi50XipBXihzXiUpXiR4XiEpXixYXiFDXiFMXiE8XiQpXidiXiQwXiI7XiZaXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b1dc1f2bdca1",
      "text": "我已經死了！這就是死後的世界，這裡只有無盡的痛苦與哀傷！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^#J^'D^%L^*D^*W^(s^*J^,X^%L^#b^&Z^*p^.p^*A^(s^-j^\"?^$s^%}^-1^&Z^-.^.t^'p^2`^!^^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiNKXidEXiVMXipEXipXXihzXipKXixYXiVMXiNiXiZaXipwXi5wXipBXihzXi1qXiI/XiRzXiV9Xi0xXiZaXi0uXi50XidwXjJgXiFeXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3bc54a705f24",
      "text": "我曾是效忠特克圖克特雷的聖堂武士。我對達戈拉爾起了疑心，跟蹤過 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^.j^,X^$Q^.d^&5^!d^\"b^!d^&5^)c^&Z^'Z^42^%J^+a^!\"^$%^#:^(z^*M^$6^&/^.(^*D^0p^#k^*A^.+^(b^(x ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXi5qXixYXiRRXi5kXiY1XiFkXiJiXiFkXiY1XiljXiZaXidaXjQyXiVKXithXiEiXiQlXiM6Xih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXi4oXipEXjBwXiNrXipBXi4rXihiXih4IA==",
      "byte_length": 94
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ba1541888748",
      "text": "他一次……就那麼一次！這就是我好奇心招致的懲罰！就是這個！我當初為什麼 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^!%^%D^*o^*o^*J^)!^.T^!%^%D^*W^(s^*J^,X^$%^+i^\"}^#k^,D^'o^&Z^/b^0-^*W^*J^,X^(s^!V^*W^$%^&N^1\"^%{^!=^.T ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXiElXiVEXipvXipvXipKXikhXi5UXiElXiVEXipXXihzXipKXixYXiQlXitpXiJ9XiNrXixEXidvXiZaXi9iXjAtXipXXipKXixYXihzXiFWXipXXiQlXiZOXjEiXiV7XiE9Xi5UIA==",
      "byte_length": 106
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bd22e4759bc2",
      "text": "要那麼愚蠢？！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(C^)!^.T^/a^.u^.V^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihDXikhXi5UXi9hXi51Xi5WXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 22
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_18319ac3e726",
      "text": "我……我已經不知道自己是誰了！我們當中有個孩子，另一個是聖堂武士， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*o^*o^$%^#J^'D^!)^&h^(y^'l^#I^,X^-y^*D^*W^$%^*{^&N^!,^$s^!V^+m^#(^*A^\">^!%^!V^,X^'Z^42^%J^+a^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXipvXipvXiQlXiNKXidEXiEpXiZoXih5XidsXiNJXixYXi15XipEXipXXiQlXip7XiZOXiEsXiRzXiFWXittXiMoXipBXiI+XiElXiFWXixYXidaXjQyXiVKXithXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 100
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_37c41d2ffa1e",
      "text": "還有一個是……我想不起來了！好痛啊！好痛！到處都是哭喊聲！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.7^$s^!%^!V^,X^*o^*o^$%^,1^!)^.(^!O^*D^*W^+i^-.^+Q^*W^+i^-.^*W^!u^(,^)$^,X^/U^+S^-W^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi43XiRzXiElXiFWXixYXipvXipvXiQlXiwxXiEpXi4oXiFPXipEXipXXitpXi0uXitRXipXXitpXi0uXipXXiF1XigsXikkXixYXi9VXitTXi1XXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ebdbc120bb3f",
      "text": "我是個罪人！我生前從不尊重他人，現在這就是給我的懲罰！那些不遵從 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^,X^!V^5x^!<^*W^$%^&F^!z^#f^!)^+u^))^!@^!<^*A^&?^\"d^(s^*J^,X^'A^$%^&Z^/b^0-^*W^)!^!8^!)^4#^#f ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXixYXiFWXjV4XiE8XipXXiQlXiZGXiF6XiNmXiEpXit1XikpXiFAXiE8XipBXiY/XiJkXihzXipKXixYXidBXiQlXiZaXi9iXjAtXipXXikhXiE4XiEpXjQjXiNmIA==",
      "byte_length": 97
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2a09eb890a34",
      "text": "規矩的人是得不到救贖的！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^6'^5k^&Z^!<^,X^#e^!)^!u^,Q^3-^&Z^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjYnXjVrXiZaXiE8XixYXiNlXiEpXiF1XixRXjMtXiZaXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 37
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2577a79c8ef5",
      "text": "他何必常來？他的折磨已經無法再加劇了！當你連靈魂都不復存在時， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^!L^#l^#O^!O^.V^!@^&Z^,?^-7^#J^'D^%}^%b^!l^\"\"^1#^*D^*W^&N^*F^.0^)g^*.^)$^!)^#g^#*^\"d^$f^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXiFMXiNsXiNPXiFPXi5WXiFAXiZaXiw/Xi03XiNKXidEXiV9XiViXiFsXiIiXjEjXipEXipXXiZOXipGXi4wXilnXiouXikkXiEpXiNnXiMqXiJkXiRmXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 94
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_259c928fa209",
      "text": "靈魂根本無從得到救贖！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)g^*.^%)^$x^%}^#f^#e^!u^,Q^3-^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XilnXiouXiUpXiR4XiV9XiNmXiNlXiF1XixRXjMtXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_91a0a1fb89df",
      "text": "那些記憶！全都是關於各個地方、人物……愛恨糾葛……我已經 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^!8^(K^$\"^*W^!h^)$^,X^.>^$^^+>^!V^\"e^$]^!!^!<^&4^*o^*o^,2^2g^3U^(\"^*o^*o^$%^#J^'D ",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXiE4XihLXiQiXipXXiFoXikkXixYXi4+XiReXis+XiFWXiJlXiRdXiEhXiE8XiY0XipvXipvXiwyXjJnXjNVXigiXipvXipvXiQlXiNKXidEIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6b291ffa666a",
      "text": "想不起任何清晰的事情了！只剩下破碎的情感！實在太痛苦了！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,1^!)^.(^!C^!L^,u^71^&Z^*r^,0^*D^*W^\"?^8U^!(^&n^&o^&Z^,0^#{^*W^#3^\"d^+f^-.^.t^*D^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiwxXiEpXi4oXiFDXiFMXix1XjcxXiZaXipyXiwwXipEXipXXiI/XjhVXiEoXiZuXiZvXiZaXiwwXiN7XipXXiMzXiJkXitmXi0uXi50XipEXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7ccbb2545dcf",
      "text": "你現在還問這個？你難道看不見他嗎——他就站在你正前方！他的雙眼！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^&?^\"d^.7^*Z^(s^!V^.V^*F^)a^(y^*Q^!)^-m^!@^+X^*n^*n^!@^*J^->^\"d^*F^%H^!z^$]^*W^!@^&Z^)_^&d^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiY/XiJkXi43XipaXihzXiFWXi5WXipGXilhXih5XipRXiEpXi1tXiFAXitYXipuXipuXiFAXipKXi0+XiJkXipGXiVIXiF6XiRdXipXXiFAXiZaXilfXiZkXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 97
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_95bc2d28d78e",
      "text": "正燃燒著扭曲的仇恨！他在這裡！不！滾開！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%H^&%^&&^-a^1;^$n^&Z^1g^2g^*W^!@^\"d^(s^-j^*W^!)^*W^,z^)F^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVIXiYlXiYmXi1hXjE7XiRuXiZaXjFnXjJnXipXXiFAXiJkXihzXi1qXipXXiEpXipXXix6XilGXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_35427634fc1a",
      "text": "他就在附近——他無所不在！這裡的一切都充滿了猜忌！他能化身為 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^*J^\"d^.?^(l^*n^*n^!@^%}^$)^!)^\"d^*W^(s^-j^&Z^!%^+.^)$^5.^,{^*D^-'^;P^*W^!@^'b^\")^(c^%{ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXipKXiJkXi4/XihsXipuXipuXiFAXiV9XiQpXiEpXiJkXipXXihzXi1qXiZaXiElXisuXikkXjUuXix7XipEXi0nXjtQXipXXiFAXidiXiIpXihjXiV7IA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3cf023d85935",
      "text": "任何東西！他現在可能就在這裡，而你根本察覺不到！他熱衷於保守自己的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!C^!L^,`^-l^*W^!@^&?^\"d^\"A^'b^*J^\"d^(s^-j^*A^'W^*F^%)^$x^#2^(G^!)^!u^*W^!@^&$^7i^$^^!T^#+^'l^#I^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFDXiFMXixgXi1sXipXXiFAXiY/XiJkXiJBXidiXipKXiJkXihzXi1qXipBXidXXipGXiUpXiR4XiMyXihHXiEpXiF1XipXXiFAXiYkXjdpXiReXiFUXiMrXidsXiNJXiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 100
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4e5b1e77b3d2",
      "text": "秘密！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^1O^#0^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjFPXiMwXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 10
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d2c1f86cc121",
      "text": "萬劫不復！萬劫不復！直到時間的盡頭！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-_^1l^!)^#g^*W^-_^1l^!)^#g^*W^&`^!u^$f^)G^&Z^-1^)t^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi1fXjFsXiEpXiNnXipXXi1fXjFsXiEpXiNnXipXXiZgXiF1XiRmXilHXiZaXi0xXil0XipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1250a2e1f16c",
      "text": "快滾！在你們也淪落到與我們一同承受這永恆劇痛之前快滾！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*L^,z^*W^\"d^*F^*{^!1^2)^-`^!u^'p^$%^*{^!%^\"E^$0^\";^(s^%W^:6^1#^-.^!/^!z^*L^,z^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipMXix6XipXXiJkXipGXip7XiExXjIpXi1gXiF1XidwXiQlXip7XiElXiJFXiQwXiI7XihzXiVXXjo2XjEjXi0uXiEvXiF6XipMXix6XipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_63143ad6cda3",
      "text": "當心！你們周圍全都是他的造物！這整座地方都散發著他邪惡的惡臭！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&N^#k^*W^*F^*{^\"L^\"`^!h^)$^,X^!@^&Z^(v^&4^*W^(s^$T^/_^\"e^$]^)$^$S^&W^-a^!@^)\"^#y^&Z^#y^'m^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZOXiNrXipXXipGXip7XiJMXiJgXiFoXikkXixYXiFAXiZaXih2XiY0XipXXihzXiRUXi9fXiJlXiRdXikkXiRTXiZXXi1hXiFAXikiXiN5XiZaXiN5XidtXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 94
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_eb6978472944",
      "text": "你距離太遠，無法看清 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^2I^)`^+f^({^*A^%}^%b^*Q^,u ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXjJJXilgXitmXih7XipBXiV9XiViXipRXix1IA==",
      "byte_length": 31
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_032e32a7da59",
      "text": "洞穴內部。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%h^'&^!g^)#^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVoXicmXiFnXikjXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 16
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c8da40837efe",
      "text": "鐵柵內部。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)?^%(^!g^)#^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xik/XiUoXiFnXikjXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 16
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6cff444780b1",
      "text": " 探身摸進黑暗的洞穴，用 ",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^$>^(c^/j^(w^*:^$k^&Z^%h^'&^*A^&H ",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4kPl4oY14val4od14qOl4ka14mWl4laF4nJl4qQV4mSCA=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_19c7dbcd66e7",
      "text": " 探身摸進敞開的鐵柵，用 ",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^$>^(c^/j^(w^*d^)F^&Z^)?^%(^*A^&H ",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4kPl4oY14val4od14qZF4pRl4mWl4pP14lKF4qQV4mSCA=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1a3cad0051ee",
      "text": "手摸索， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$+^/j^'>^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQrXi9qXic+XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 13
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4e724494d83e",
      "text": "經過一番搜尋後，什麼也沒發現。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'D^(x^!%^2{^/h^#9^#b^*A^!=^.T^!1^%\\^&W^&?^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XidEXih4XiElXjJ7Xi9oXiM5XiNiXipBXiE9Xi5UXiExXiVcXiZXXiY/XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fd2290142925",
      "text": "感覺到有滑膩的東西爬上了 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#{^(G^!u^$s^%u^:=^&Z^,`^-l^/y^!'^*D ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiN7XihHXiF1XiRzXiV1Xjo9XiZaXixgXi1sXi95XiEnXipEIA==",
      "byte_length": 37
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4de50dfc9249",
      "text": "手臂！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$+^'k^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQrXidrXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 10
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d2f8592adfa8",
      "text": "但當 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!I^&N ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFJXiZOIA==",
      "byte_length": 7
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_afef56688a44",
      "text": "被某種東西咬了一口時，便迅速縮了回來。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(@^%$^'$^,`^-l^\"Q^*D^!%^\"<^$f^*A^!R^(j^(u^3X^*D^\"\\^!O^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihAXiUkXickXixgXi1sXiJRXipEXiElXiI8XiRmXipBXiFSXihqXih1XjNYXipEXiJcXiFPXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6cf11ca6a94f",
      "text": "摸到了某樣光滑的物體。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^/j^!u^*D^%$^,f^!c^%u^&Z^&4^**^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi9qXiF1XipEXiUkXixmXiFjXiV1XiZaXiY0XioqXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5d1d58df9634",
      "text": "摸到了一些錢幣。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^/j^!u^*D^!%^!8^.<^+|^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi9qXiF1XipEXiElXiE4Xi48Xit8XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3b37faf9bb1b",
      "text": "摸到了某樣尖銳的物體。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^/j^!u^*D^%$^,f^#=^;W^&Z^&4^**^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi9qXiF1XipEXiUkXixmXiM9XjtXXiZaXiY0XioqXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3c0e57d8fb9b",
      "text": "感覺到有滑膩的東西爬上了 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#{^(G^!u^$s^%u^:=^&Z^,`^-l^/y^!'^*D ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiN7XihHXiF1XiRzXiV1Xjo9XiZaXixgXi1sXi95XiEnXipEIA==",
      "byte_length": 37
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3cfad6ccd2b9",
      "text": "你們會為自己的狂妄付出代價！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^$r^%{^'l^#I^&Z^&8^+j^*u^!q^*v^+&^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiRyXiV7XidsXiNJXiZaXiY4XitqXip1XiFxXip2XismXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 43
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d4bc5ef44229",
      "text": "要是我能回到德拉吉，你們一定會付出代價！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(C^,X^$%^'b^\"\\^!u^#j^$6^\"D^*A^*F^*{^!%^#.^$r^*u^!q^*v^+&^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihDXixYXiQlXidiXiJcXiF1XiNqXiQ2XiJEXipBXipGXip7XiElXiMuXiRyXip1XiFxXip2XismXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_76cd0609a023",
      "text": "一名身穿德拉吉信使制服的男子面容扭曲。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!%^\"F^(c^')^#j^$6^\"D^!U^!N^!v^,\\^&Z^&K^#(^)j^+t^1;^$n^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiElXiJGXihjXicpXiNqXiQ2XiJEXiFVXiFOXiF2XixcXiZaXiZLXiMoXilqXit0XjE7XiRuXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4c078ec9fe18",
      "text": "他從緊身短上衣中掏出一顆圓球，朝著你們猛擲過來。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^#f^0r^(c^&i^!'^(>^!,^/f^!q^!%^)u^\"a^&@^*A^,^^-a^*F^*{^*P^$I^(x^!O^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXiNmXjByXihjXiZpXiEnXig+XiEsXi9mXiFxXiElXil1XiJhXiZAXipBXixeXi1hXipGXip7XipQXiRJXih4XiFPXiEi",
      "byte_length": 72
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_70a7da2eaa9f",
      "text": "滾開，誰也別想攔我！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,z^)F^*A^-y^!1^*H^,1^9n^$%^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "Xix6XilGXipBXi15XiExXipIXiwxXjluXiQlXipX",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ee80da813d9b",
      "text": "這就是膽敢阻礙卡爾金密探之人的下場！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^*J^,X^-[^/m^)L^:M^\"0^&/^)+^#0^$>^!/^!<^&Z^!(^\"n^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXipKXixYXi1bXi9tXilMXjpNXiIwXiYvXikrXiMwXiQ+XiEvXiE8XiZaXiEoXiJuXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a98d68c1c49b",
      "text": "順祝安好，",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.D^&v^+p^+i^*A",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi5EXiZ2XitwXitpXipB",
      "byte_length": 15
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fda4ee7c50bc",
      "text": "聖堂武士佩圖克爾",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'Z^42^%J^+a^.}^\"b^!d^&/",
      "encoded_base64": "XidaXjQyXiVKXithXi59XiJiXiFkXiYv",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6df082f4076a",
      "text": "卡爾金伯爵",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"0^&/^)+^:X^;U",
      "encoded_base64": "XiIwXiYvXikrXjpYXjtV",
      "byte_length": 15
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c0183b378a2b",
      "text": "   最近，又有一批奴隸 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "   ^$q^(l^*A^+;^$s^!%^2i^##^)Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICAgXiRxXihsXipBXis7XiRzXiElXjJpXiMjXilaIA==",
      "byte_length": 31
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e8a490bc4d7b",
      "text": "從角鬥士牢籠逃脫了。請密切 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#f^(H^*,^+a^-$^'3^(p^'c^*D^!\"^*S^#0^+. ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNmXihIXiosXithXi0kXiczXihwXidjXipEXiEiXipTXiMwXisuIA==",
      "byte_length": 40
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d651e97470b2",
      "text": "留意他們的行蹤。他們正朝你那邊逃去。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-+^#z^!@^*{^&Z^(;^(b^!\"^!@^*{^%H^,^^*F^)!^.8^(p^\"6^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi0rXiN6XiFAXip7XiZaXig7XihiXiEiXiFAXip7XiVIXixeXipGXikhXi44XihwXiI2XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_12a859138d80",
      "text": "絕不能讓他們在我們追上之前 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-I^!)^'b^-}^!@^*{^\"d^$%^*{^(o^!'^!/^!z ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi1JXiEpXidiXi19XiFAXip7XiJkXiQlXip7XihvXiEnXiEvXiF6IA==",
      "byte_length": 40
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c497be2d3a46",
      "text": "找到任何一個奴隸村落， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$/^!u^!C^!L^!%^!V^##^)Z^$z^-`^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQvXiF1XiFDXiFMXiElXiFWXiMjXilaXiR6Xi1gXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b399a3e16c92",
      "text": "否則我們就再也抓不回他們了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"H^!x^$%^*{^*J^!l^!1^$2^!)^\"\\^!@^*{^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJIXiF4XiQlXip7XipKXiFsXiExXiQyXiEpXiJcXiFAXip7XipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ee6359b8b056",
      "text": "若見到或聽聞他們的下落，請立即通報。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'x^-m^!u^$'^-X^4^^!@^*{^&Z^!(^-`^*A^*S^0'^\"1^(t^+`^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xid4Xi1tXiF1XiQnXi1YXjReXiFAXip7XiZaXiEoXi1gXipBXipTXjAnXiIxXih0XitgXiEi",
      "byte_length": 54
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0d543ab628f4",
      "text": "那些奴隸村落乃是阿塔斯之患！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^!8^##^)Z^$z^-`^/M^,X^)M^\"o^$[^!/^;Q^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXiE4XiMjXilaXiR6Xi1gXi9NXixYXilNXiJvXiRbXiEvXjtRXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 43
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a717e4b3e5f3",
      "text": "必須將它們徹底摧毀。它們長期以來 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#l^)r^#7^+o^*{^18^/^^$E^%N^!\"^+o^*{^)C^$u^!B^!O ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNsXilyXiM3XitvXip7XjE4Xi9eXiRFXiVOXiEiXitvXip7XilDXiR1XiFCXiFPIA==",
      "byte_length": 49
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_23cc5650111e",
      "text": "一直是逃奴的庇護所，如今甚至 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!%^&`^,X^(p^##^&Z^,\"^(T^$)^*A^#$^*E^/|^'n ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiElXiZgXixYXihwXiMjXiZaXiwiXihUXiQpXipBXiMkXipFXi98XiduIA==",
      "byte_length": 43
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8b1b69372f2a",
      "text": "妄想聚集足夠的人手來威脅德拉吉的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+j^,1^'[^)]^(^^+d^&Z^!<^$+^!O^#&^1T^#j^$6^\"D^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitqXiwxXidbXildXiheXitkXiZaXiE8XiQrXiFPXiMmXjFUXiNqXiQ2XiJEXiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 49
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_843f61c81b66",
      "text": "軍隊。簡直可笑，他們難道還能威脅到 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^..^)U^!\"^3y^&`^\"A^-@^*A^!@^*{^)a^(y^.7^'b^#&^1T^!u ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi4uXilVXiEiXjN5XiZgXiJBXi1AXipBXiFAXip7XilhXih5Xi43XidiXiMmXjFUXiF1IA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b3c323783a1d",
      "text": "特克圖克特雷的萬鈞神威不成！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&5^!d^\"b^!d^&5^)c^&Z^-_^;V^&w^#&^!)^$$^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiY1XiFkXiJiXiFkXiY1XiljXiZaXi1fXjtWXiZ3XiMmXiEpXiQkXipX",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_72d00d7e1647",
      "text": "若你有所需求，派人傳信，我便會 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'x^*F^$s^$)^)e^,n^*A^.n^!<^+$^!U^*A^$%^!R^$r ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xid4XipGXiRzXiQpXillXixuXipBXi5uXiE8XiskXiFVXipBXiQlXiFSXiRyIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_29bfa6b35ba1",
      "text": "派兵前去支援你。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.n^+,^!z^\"6^$L^$C^*F^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi5uXissXiF6XiI2XiRMXiRDXipGXiEi",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f6ff67a8dd5e",
      "text": "   欣聞特克圖克特雷陛下 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "   ^2'^4^^&5^!d^\"b^!d^&5^)c^:@^!( ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICAgXjInXjReXiY1XiFkXiJiXiFkXiY1XiljXjpAXiEoIA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f0e02179fa83",
      "text": "已有處置奴隸村落的計策。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#J^$s^(,^'Q^##^)Z^$z^-`^&Z^-n^5p^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNKXiRzXigsXidRXiMjXilaXiR6Xi1gXiZaXi1uXjVwXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 37
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_319604c03596",
      "text": "在這片邊陲之地，我們早就深知必須在 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"d^(s^&1^.8^;X^!/^\"e^*A^$%^*{^,V^*J^2*^&h^#l^)r^\"d ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJkXihzXiYxXi44XjtYXiEvXiJlXipBXiQlXip7XixWXipKXjIqXiZoXiNsXilyXiJkIA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d366c7ef0135",
      "text": "這幫跳梁小丑壯大為禍患之前， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^+}^0@^;S^#;^;O^+b^\"z^%{^7B^;Q^!/^!z^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXit9XjBAXjtTXiM7XjtPXitiXiJ6XiV7XjdCXjtRXiEvXiF6XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 43
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_980f1b5c1e65",
      "text": "將其一舉剿滅。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#7^!j^!%^01^7R^%t^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiM3XiFqXiElXjAxXjdSXiV0XiEi",
      "byte_length": 21
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0ae6d3ab73a8",
      "text": "   部隊支援正經由北部商道 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "   ^)#^)U^$L^$C^%H^'D^&I^+6^)#^1'^(y ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICAgXikjXilVXiRMXiRDXiVIXidEXiZJXis2XikjXjEnXih5IA==",
      "byte_length": 37
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e23caede7569",
      "text": "火速趕往。願至高無上、全能的特克圖克特雷 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%x^(u^0u^,)^!\"^.H^'n^*+^%}^!'^!!^!h^'b^&Z^&5^!d^\"b^!d^&5^)c ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiV4Xih1XjB1XiwpXiEiXi5IXiduXiorXiV9XiEnXiEhXiFoXidiXiZaXiY1XiFkXiJiXiFkXiY1XiljIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8a3a6a628d4b",
      "text": "之所有敵手盡數覆滅！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!/^$)^$s^$U^$+^-1^$V^(D^%t^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEvXiQpXiRzXiRVXiQrXi0xXiRWXihEXiV0XipX",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4c2498eb0a15",
      "text": "雖然我軍的慘重損失令人扼腕， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.A^&\"^$%^..^&Z^,4^))^$D^\"|^*w^!<^;R^'e^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi5BXiYiXiQlXi4uXiZaXiw0XikpXiREXiJ8Xip3XiE8XjtSXidlXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 43
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_63923e56a969",
      "text": "但這絕非德拉吉的末日。如今特克圖克特雷陛下 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!I^(s^-I^)i^#j^$6^\"D^&Z^$w^$a^!\"^#$^*E^&5^!d^\"b^!d^&5^)c^:@^!( ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFJXihzXi1JXilpXiNqXiQ2XiJEXiZaXiR3XiRhXiEiXiMkXipFXiY1XiFkXiJiXiFkXiY1XiljXjpAXiEoIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b3dcb503940e",
      "text": "已再度現世，世間萬物終將臣服於 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#J^!l^#V^&?^*p^*A^*p^)G^-_^&4^-H^#7^.s^,\\^$^ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNKXiFsXiNWXiY/XipwXipBXipwXilHXi1fXiY0Xi1IXiM3Xi5zXixcXiReIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_94eefded4f6e",
      "text": "他的腳下。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^&Z^00^!(^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXiZaXjAwXiEoXiEi",
      "byte_length": 15
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f40767ea2af9",
      "text": "陛下已完成了他的羽化轉變，很快便會 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^:@^!(^#J^#,^$$^*D^!@^&Z^'S^\")^(i^(U^*A^*K^*L^!R^$r ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjpAXiEoXiNKXiMsXiQkXipEXiFAXiZaXidTXiIpXihpXihVXipBXipLXipMXiFSXiRyIA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_abbe6dc47e67",
      "text": "需要奴隸村落所能為他提供的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)e^(C^##^)Z^$z^-`^$)^'b^%{^!@^$A^!P^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XillXihDXiMjXilaXiR6Xi1gXiQpXidiXiV7XiFAXiRBXiFQXiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 40
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_29d99dc7c3c3",
      "text": "滋養。無須擔憂，陛下依然銘記著他的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^7|^.I^!\"^%}^)r^*N^91^*A^:@^!(^!Q^&\"^.;^(K^-a^!@^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xjd8Xi5JXiEiXiV9XilyXipOXjkxXipBXjpAXiEoXiFRXiYiXi47XihLXi1hXiFAXiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a64932cbcd0c",
      "text": "盟友們。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-0^\"8^*{^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi0wXiI4Xip7XiEi",
      "byte_length": 12
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_02d9d093734d",
      "text": "你們殺了我們的祭品！你們必須為此償命！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^%M^*D^$%^*{^&Z^&x^\"R^*W^*F^*{^#l^)r^%{^%I^5-^\"N^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiVNXipEXiQlXip7XiZaXiZ4XiJSXipXXipGXip7XiNsXilyXiV7XiVJXjUtXiJOXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ce6da78e0f20",
      "text": "鼓手對你們視而不見，一心專注於擊鼓的職責。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*<^$+^#:^*F^*{^(E^'W^!)^-m^*A^!%^#k^#8^%e^$^^$F^*<^&Z^'\\^0>^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xio8XiQrXiM6XipGXip7XihFXidXXiEpXi1tXipBXiElXiNrXiM4XiVlXiReXiRGXio8XiZaXidcXjA+XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_91c83e45ee48",
      "text": "滾開！我們正在召喚達卡倫，絕不能被打擾！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,z^)F^*W^$%^*{^%H^\"d^\"@^\"U^(z^\"0^/!^*A^-I^!)^'b^(@^$-^$K^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "Xix6XilGXipXXiQlXip7XiVIXiJkXiJAXiJVXih6XiIwXi8hXipBXi1JXiEpXidiXihAXiQtXiRLXipX",
      "byte_length": 60
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d11b40365261",
      "text": "  你們為什麼要召喚達卡倫？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^*{^%{^!=^.T^(C^\"@^\"U^(z^\"0^/!^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeKnteJXteIT1eLlReKENeIkBeIlVeKHpeIjBeLyFeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c825316bdffe",
      "text": "  我們是不會離開的。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^*{^,X^!)^$r^)`^)F^&Z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeKnteLFheISleJHJeKWBeKUZeJlpeISI=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9bb52227d710",
      "text": "好吧。再見。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+i^*I^!\"^!l^-m^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XitpXipJXiEiXiFsXi1tXiEi",
      "byte_length": 18
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a894b1fbf3e8",
      "text": "  什麼祭品？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^!=^.T^&x^\"R^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIT1eLlReJnheIlJeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 17
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2936dade817a",
      "text": "  你們為什麼要崇拜他？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^*{^%{^!=^.T^(C^13^,E^!@^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeKnteJXteIT1eLlReKENeMTNeLEVeIUBeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4a3956dd5738",
      "text": "  你們為什麼要召喚他？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^*{^%{^!=^.T^(C^\"@^\"U^!@^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeKnteJXteIT1eLlReKENeIkBeIlVeIUBeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f02ceaca143a",
      "text": "  他對我構不成威脅！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^!@^#:^$%^8~^!)^$$^#&^1T^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIUBeIzpeJCVeOH5eISleJCReIyZeMVReKlc=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a8dab8e59fc4",
      "text": "我們召喚他，是為了讓他享用我們精心準備的祭品。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^\"@^\"U^!@^*A^,X^%{^*D^-}^!@^!;^&H^$%^*{^'7^#k^,x^+\"^&Z^&x^\"R^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7XiJAXiJVXiFAXipBXixYXiV7XipEXi19XiFAXiE7XiZIXiQlXip7Xic3XiNrXix4XisiXiZaXiZ4XiJSXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_92dbb6eb3492",
      "text": "很好。等達卡倫現身時，他自會親自收拾你們。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*K^+i^!\"^'-^(z^\"0^/!^&?^(c^$f^*A^!@^'l^$r^(F^'l^$M^7[^*F^*{^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipLXitpXiEiXictXih6XiIwXi8hXiY/XihjXiRmXipBXiFAXidsXiRyXihGXidsXiRNXjdbXipGXip7XiEi",
      "byte_length": 63
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5f0f36d807d0",
      "text": "那不關你們的事！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^!)^.>^*F^*{^&Z^*r^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXiEpXi4+XipGXip7XiZaXipyXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8f0ab094b6a0",
      "text": "等到他將你們硬生生拖入淤泥深處時，你們就會明白， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'-^!u^!@^#7^*F^*{^25^&F^&F^.f^!f^6c^%d^2*^(,^$f^*A^*F^*{^*J^$r^$c^&X^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XictXiF1XiFAXiM3XipGXip7XjI1XiZGXiZGXi5mXiFmXjZjXiVkXjIqXigsXiRmXipBXipGXip7XipKXiRyXiRjXiZYXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_94e4a8b28b3b",
      "text": "小看他是多麼致命的錯誤！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#;^*Q^!@^,X^\"x^.T^'o^\"N^&Z^)5^(P^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiM7XipRXiFAXixYXiJ4Xi5UXidvXiJOXiZaXik1XihQXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 37
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8c5a2ac28423",
      "text": "他來了！他馬上就要奪走祭品了！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^!O^*D^*W^!@^*\"^!'^*J^(C^1,^.&^&x^\"R^*D^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXiFPXipEXipXXiFAXioiXiEnXipKXihDXjEsXi4mXiZ4XiJSXipEXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_02d250a8a831",
      "text": "求求你們，我們已經把一切都給你們了！我們真的什麼都拿不出來了！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,n^,n^*F^*{^*A^$%^*{^#J^'D^$1^!%^+.^)$^'A^*F^*{^*D^*W^$%^*{^-2^&Z^!=^.T^)$^,G^!)^!q^!O^*D^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XixuXixuXipGXip7XipBXiQlXip7XiNKXidEXiQxXiElXisuXikkXidBXipGXip7XipEXipXXiQlXip7Xi0yXiZaXiE9Xi5UXikkXixHXiEpXiFxXiFPXipEXipX",
      "byte_length": 93
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a719b3ddcf8f",
      "text": "求求你們饒我們一命。只要你們不殺我們， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,n^,n^*F^*{^.M^$%^*{^!%^\"N^!\"^\"?^(C^*F^*{^!)^%M^$%^*{^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XixuXixuXipGXip7Xi5NXiQlXip7XiElXiJOXiEiXiI/XihDXipGXip7XiEpXiVNXiQlXip7XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5ef6038d14f0",
      "text": "我們願意交出身上所有的一切。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^.H^#z^0P^!q^(c^!'^$)^$s^&Z^!%^+.^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7Xi5IXiN6XjBQXiFxXihjXiEnXiQpXiRzXiZaXiElXisuXiEi",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5494d21f6d7e",
      "text": "  把所有東西都交出來，我就不殺你們。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$1^$)^$s^,`^-l^)$^0P^!q^!O^*A^$%^*J^!)^%M^*F^*{^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJDFeJCleJHNeLGBeLWxeKSReMFBeIXFeIU9eKkFeJCVeKkpeISleJU1eKkZeKnteISI=",
      "byte_length": 53
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9accde5c50ce",
      "text": "  抱歉，免談。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^,@^,h^*A^!e^0;^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLEBeLGheKkFeIWVeMDteISI=",
      "byte_length": 20
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c4eea3cb5fbb",
      "text": "我這就走——趁我還沒改變主意。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^(s^*J^.&^*n^*n^.)^$%^.7^%\\^$N^(U^!-^#z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXihzXipKXi4mXipuXipuXi4pXiQlXi43XiVcXiROXihVXiEtXiN6XiEi",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_95509634c2df",
      "text": "全都在這裡了。多謝各位手下留情！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!h^)$^\"d^(s^-j^*D^!\"^\"x^-z^+>^!J^$+^!(^-+^,0^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFoXikkXiJkXihzXi1qXipEXiEiXiJ4Xi16Xis+XiFKXiQrXiEoXi0rXiwwXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 49
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_552f8d94605f",
      "text": "求求你們別殺我們！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,n^,n^*F^*{^*H^%M^$%^*{^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XixuXixuXipGXip7XipIXiVNXiQlXip7XipX",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_728d5c933e2f",
      "text": "謝謝你們！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-z^-z^*F^*{^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi16Xi16XipGXip7XipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 16
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a3520350baa7",
      "text": "你毀了一切！就算失去了爪牙，我仍會",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^%N^*D^!%^+.^*W^*J^-C^\"|^\"6^*D^&.^&3^*A^$%^!?^$r",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiVOXipEXiElXisuXipXXipKXi1DXiJ8XiI2XipEXiYuXiYzXipBXiQlXiE/XiRy",
      "byte_length": 51
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4158370fbec9",
      "text": "擊敗你！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$F^$R^*F^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRGXiRSXipGXipX",
      "byte_length": 12
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6a76f9fca6da",
      "text": "你們永遠不可能擊敗我和我的爪牙！休想！我是不死之身！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^%W^({^!)^\"A^'b^$F^$R^$%^\"O^$%^&Z^&.^&3^*W^!G^,1^*W^$%^,X^!)^%L^!/^(c^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiVXXih7XiEpXiJBXidiXiRGXiRSXiQlXiJPXiQlXiZaXiYuXiYzXipXXiFHXiwxXipXXiQlXixYXiEpXiVMXiEvXihjXipX",
      "byte_length": 78
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f1b642c95ba8",
      "text": "巴爾卡札看到瑪格拉時，雙眼驚訝地睜大。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#K^&/^\"0^.k^*Q^!u^-*^%*^$6^$f^*A^)_^&d^.Q^-r^\"e^.q^\"z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNLXiYvXiIwXi5rXipRXiF1Xi0qXiUqXiQ2XiRmXipBXilfXiZkXi5RXi1yXiJlXi5xXiJ6XiEi",
      "byte_length": 57
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3683672492e7",
      "text": "你！你不該離開法陣！去死吧！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*W^*F^!)^(M^)`^)F^%b^)P^*W^\"6^%L^*I^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXipXXipGXiEpXihNXilgXilGXiViXilQXipXXiI2XiVMXipJXipX",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0b3efba04c1a",
      "text": "你們！你們一定是達戈拉爾派來的！區區奴隸絕不可能",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^*W^*F^*{^!%^#.^,X^(z^*M^$6^&/^.n^!O^&Z^*W^\"+^\"+^##^)Z^-I^!)^\"A^'b",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XipXXipGXip7XiElXiMuXixYXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXi5uXiFPXiZaXipXXiIrXiIrXiMjXilaXi1JXiEpXiJBXidi",
      "byte_length": 72
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f6dd7fc54118",
      "text": "闖過我的巴布魔和弗洛魔！回去告訴你們的主人，統治亞薩斯的將是我，",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.z^(x^$%^&Z^#K^.`^*0^\"O^#[^%g^*0^*W^\"\\^\"6^+B^-t^*F^*{^&Z^!-^!<^*A^'B^%_^!9^-e^$[^&Z^#7^,X^$%^*A",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi56Xih4XiQlXiZaXiNLXi5gXiowXiJPXiNbXiVnXiowXipXXiJcXiI2XitCXi10XipGXip7XiZaXiEtXiE8XipBXidCXiVfXiE5Xi1lXiRbXiZaXiM3XixYXiQlXipB",
      "byte_length": 96
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_053cb03c1338",
      "text": "不是他！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^,X^!@^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXixYXiFAXipX",
      "byte_length": 12
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f43d29fc583b",
      "text": "達戈拉爾死了。是我殺的。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(z^*M^$6^&/^%L^*D^!\"^,X^$%^%M^&Z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXiVMXipEXiEiXixYXiQlXiVNXiZaXiEi",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_53f4bf688234",
      "text": "達戈拉爾？！你在說什麼？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(z^*M^$6^&/^.V^*W^*F^\"d^-x^!=^.T^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "Xih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXi5WXipXXipGXiJkXi14XiE9Xi5UXi5W",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c2a3e78eeb3c",
      "text": "我好像在哪裡聽過這套說詞……",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^+i^!`^\"d^+I^-j^-X^(x^(s^#!^-x^.v^*o^*o",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXitpXiFgXiJkXitJXi1qXi1YXih4XihzXiMhXi14Xi52XipvXipv",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_98a0e97a33b6",
      "text": "我才不會和你這種人渣為伍！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^$,^!)^$r^\"O^*F^(s^'$^!<^,v^%{^!F^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiQsXiEpXiRyXiJPXipGXihzXickXiE8Xix2XiV7XiFGXipX",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6ac1a1a5977b",
      "text": "沒錯，我是來加入你的。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%\\^)5^*A^$%^,X^!O^\"\"^!f^*F^&Z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVcXik1XipBXiQlXixYXiFPXiIiXiFmXipGXiZaXiEi",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0b5aab04a28e",
      "text": "加入你，我能得到什麼？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"\"^!f^*F^*A^$%^'b^#e^!u^!=^.T^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XiIiXiFmXipGXipBXiQlXidiXiNlXiF1XiE9Xi5UXi5W",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7a590f6fc5f2",
      "text": "我是來殺你的！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^,X^!O^%M^*F^&Z^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXixYXiFPXiVNXipGXiZaXipX",
      "byte_length": 21
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_860dc5308068",
      "text": "你非死不可！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^)i^%L^!)^\"A^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXilpXiVMXiEpXiJBXipX",
      "byte_length": 18
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_711bbffa5463",
      "text": "好吧，我加入你。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+i^*I^*A^$%^\"\"^!f^*F^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XitpXipJXipBXiQlXiIiXiFmXipGXiEi",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_efa307938dcb",
      "text": "當然聽過！你曾夢見這一刻——而你也知道結局！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&N^&\"^-X^(x^*W^*F^.j^\"y^-m^(s^!%^.Y^*n^*n^'W^*F^!1^&h^(y^'@^._^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZOXiYiXi1YXih4XipXXipGXi5qXiJ5Xi1tXihzXiElXi5ZXipuXipuXidXXipGXiExXiZoXih5XidAXi5fXipX",
      "byte_length": 66
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_05d07850ca1e",
      "text": "你們將加入我，一同征服亞薩斯！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^#7^\"\"^!f^$%^*A^!%^\"E^.c^,\\^!9^-e^$[^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiM3XiIiXiFmXiQlXipBXiElXiJFXi5jXixcXiE5Xi1lXiRbXipX",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6db170f60dea",
      "text": "別拿效忠來騙我！我知道達戈拉爾派你們來消滅",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*H^,G^$Q^.d^!O^.{^$%^*W^$%^&h^(y^(z^*M^$6^&/^.n^*F^*{^!O^%k^%t",
      "encoded_base64": "XipIXixHXiRRXi5kXiFPXi57XiQlXipXXiQlXiZoXih5Xih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXi5uXipGXip7XiFPXiVrXiV0",
      "byte_length": 63
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1c7130526384",
      "text": "我！不過，我願意提出另一個條件：達戈拉爾太軟弱了——投靠",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*W^!)^(x^*A^$%^.H^#z^$A^!q^\">^!%^!V^%.^.W^*B^(z^*M^$6^&/^+f^.x^#\\^*D^*n^*n^$3^.C",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXipXXiEpXih4XipBXiQlXi5IXiN6XiRBXiFxXiI+XiElXiFWXiUuXi5XXipCXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXitmXi54XiNcXipEXipuXipuXiQzXi5D",
      "byte_length": 84
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b2fb4c26eae5",
      "text": "我，和我一同征服亞薩斯！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*A^\"O^$%^!%^\"E^.c^,\\^!9^-e^$[^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXipBXiJPXiQlXiElXiJFXi5jXixcXiE5Xi1lXiRbXipX",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_edc386b58004",
      "text": "所以，你背叛主人了，是嗎？我早知道達戈拉爾遲早會垮台。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$)^!B^*A^*F^.r^.Z^!-^!<^*D^*A^,X^+X^.V^$%^,V^&h^(y^(z^*M^$6^&/^.5^,V^$r^.^^\"B^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQpXiFCXipBXipGXi5yXi5aXiEtXiE8XipEXipBXixYXitYXi5WXiQlXixWXiZoXih5Xih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXi41XixWXiRyXi5eXiJCXiEi",
      "byte_length": 81
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f4db8fe5933f",
      "text": "很好！我正需要你們這種人效力——加入我，一同征服亞薩斯！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*K^+i^*W^$%^%H^)e^(C^*F^*{^(s^'$^!<^$Q^!~^*n^*n^\"\"^!f^$%^*A^!%^\"E^.c^,\\^!9^-e^$[^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XipLXitpXipXXiQlXiVIXillXihDXipGXip7XihzXickXiE8XiRRXiF+XipuXipuXiIiXiFmXiQlXipBXiElXiJFXi5jXixcXiE5Xi1lXiRbXipX",
      "byte_length": 84
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a769cb966c58",
      "text": "當我召喚出無名者，整個世界都將向我臣服！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&N^$%^\"@^\"U^!q^%}^\"F^'V^*A^$T^!V^*p^.p^)$^#7^+?^$%^.s^,\\^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZOXiQlXiJAXiJVXiFxXiV9XiJGXidWXipBXiRUXiFWXipwXi5wXikkXiM3Xis/XiQlXi5zXixcXipX",
      "byte_length": 60
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3ce50322791c",
      "text": "整個亞薩斯都將聽我號令！反抗者只有死路一條！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$T^!V^!9^-e^$[^)$^#7^-X^$%^(-^*w^*W^\"9^$4^'V^\"?^$s^%L^(a^!%^%.^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRUXiFWXiE5Xi1lXiRbXikkXiM3Xi1YXiQlXigtXip3XipXXiI5XiQ0XidWXiI/XiRzXiVMXihhXiElXiUuXipX",
      "byte_length": 66
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_00e8f9c7143e",
      "text": "你們將站在我身旁——加入我的王朝吧！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^#7^->^\"d^$%^(c^.h^*n^*n^\"\"^!f^$%^&Z^-)^,^^*I^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiM3Xi0+XiJkXiQlXihjXi5oXipuXipuXiIiXiFmXiQlXiZaXi0pXixeXipJXipX",
      "byte_length": 54
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_28c66814d8e5",
      "text": "那就看著我召喚無名者吧！跟上！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^*J^*Q^-a^$%^\"@^\"U^%}^\"F^'V^*I^*W^.+^!'^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXipKXipRXi1hXiQlXiJAXiJVXiV9XiJGXidWXipJXipXXi4rXiEnXipX",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6df1a44b0d1b",
      "text": "加入我，否則就死！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"\"^!f^$%^*A^\"H^!x^*J^%L^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiIiXiFmXiQlXipBXiJIXiF4XipKXiVMXipX",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5b36d53268d9",
      "text": "巴爾卡札開始唸出晦澀難懂的咒文。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#K^&/^\"0^.k^)F^+k^.]^!q^.i^.o^)a^,6^&Z^\"P^$W^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNLXiYvXiIwXi5rXilGXitrXi5dXiFxXi5pXi5vXilhXiw2XiZaXiJQXiRXXiEi",
      "byte_length": 48
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3245f98c4505",
      "text": "地面開始轟鳴咆哮，彷彿活了過來！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"e^)j^)F^+k^.y^.|^.[^.\\^*A^.a^.b^%i^*D^(x^!O^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJlXilqXilGXitrXi55Xi58Xi5bXi5cXipBXi5hXi5iXiVpXipEXih4XiFPXipX",
      "byte_length": 48
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ec8ffc59c705",
      "text": "無名者就要來了！我會把所有人傳送到神殿！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%}^\"F^'V^*J^(C^!O^*D^*W^$%^$r^$1^$)^$s^!<^+$^./^!u^&w^.m^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiV9XiJGXidWXipKXihDXiFPXipEXipXXiQlXiRyXiQxXiQpXiRzXiE8XiskXi4vXiF1XiZ3Xi5tXipX",
      "byte_length": 60
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_126deb82ad1f",
      "text": "休想！你現在就得死！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!G^,1^*W^*F^&?^\"d^*J^#e^%L^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFHXiwxXipXXipGXiY/XiJkXipKXiNlXiVMXipX",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f5302d8a1558",
      "text": "走吧！向神殿前進！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.&^*I^*W^+?^&w^.m^!z^(w^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi4mXipJXipXXis/XiZ3Xi5tXiF6Xih3XipX",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c6b0856aca88",
      "text": "那本無名的書在你想帶走它時掙脫了！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^$x^%}^\"F^&Z^$p^\"d^*F^,1^#N^.&^+o^$f^.g^'c^*D^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXiR4XiV9XiJGXiZaXiRwXiJkXipGXiwxXiNOXi4mXitvXiRmXi5nXidjXipEXipX",
      "byte_length": 51
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c99829921086",
      "text": "一陣閃光中，它消失了！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!%^)P^)E^!c^!,^*A^+o^%k^\"|^*D^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiElXilQXilFXiFjXiEsXipBXitvXiVrXiJ8XipEXipX",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5de49821da59",
      "text": "你感到一股怪力拉扯著你——將你拖向鏡子。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^#{^!u^!%^'_^#s^!~^$6^.e^-a^*F^*n^*n^#7^*F^.f^+?^)>^#(^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiN7XiF1XiElXidfXiNzXiF+XiQ2Xi5lXi1hXipGXipuXipuXiM3XipGXi5mXis/Xik+XiMoXiEi",
      "byte_length": 60
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_66fe1d98738b",
      "text": "鏡面暗了下來，你感到一陣輕微的拉力。除此之外什麼也沒發生。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)>^)j^$k^*D^!(^!O^*A^*F^#{^!u^!%^)P^(g^#i^&Z^$6^!~^!\"^)Q^%I^!/^\"w^!=^.T^!1^%\\^&W^&F^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xik+XilqXiRrXipEXiEoXiFPXipBXipGXiN7XiF1XiElXilQXihnXiNpXiZaXiQ2XiF+XiEiXilRXiVJXiEvXiJ3XiE9Xi5UXiExXiVcXiZXXiZGXiEi",
      "byte_length": 87
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_207e71c3ada3",
      "text": "你被吸進鏡子裡了！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^(@^\"J^(w^)>^#(^-j^*D^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXihAXiJKXih3Xik+XiMoXi1qXipEXipX",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f2c1a466e105",
      "text": "消滅巴爾卡札，你獲得 6,000 點經驗值！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%k^%t^#K^&/^\"0^.k^*A^*F^&:^#e 6,000 ^*;^'D^.P^!Z^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVrXiV0XiNLXiYvXiIwXi5rXipBXipGXiY6XiNlIDYsMDAwIF4qO14nRF4uUF4hWl4qVw==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9fe8df7b5132",
      "text": "蠢貨！你們葬送的遠不只自己的性命！我是不死之身！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.u^.w^*W^*F^*{^-b^./^&Z^({^!)^\"?^'l^#I^&Z^#r^\"N^*W^$%^,X^!)^%L^!/^(c^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi51Xi53XipXXipGXip7Xi1iXi4vXiZaXih7XiEpXiI/XidsXiNJXiZaXiNyXiJOXipXXiQlXixYXiEpXiVMXiEvXihjXipX",
      "byte_length": 72
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b7ff66ca2db0",
      "text": "巴爾卡札唸出",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#K^&/^\"0^.k^.]^!q",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNLXiYvXiIwXi5rXi5dXiFx",
      "byte_length": 18
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5bc22bac2a3b",
      "text": "另",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\">",
      "encoded_base64": "XiI+",
      "byte_length": 3
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c987855bd1bd",
      "text": "一段咒文！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!%^.l^\"P^$W^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiElXi5sXiJQXiRXXipX",
      "byte_length": 15
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f04a0351c489",
      "text": "你將恐懼之花萃取液倒進碗裡。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^#7^#t^$#^!/^'w^'}^\":^%l^!X^(w^&q^-j^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiM3XiN0XiQjXiEvXid3Xid9XiI6XiVsXiFYXih3XiZxXi1qXiEi",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_de00f7efa524",
      "text": "你的匕首現在看起來有些不一樣……",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^&Z^\"(^)~^&?^\"d^*Q^.(^!O^$s^!8^!)^!%^,f^*o^*o",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiZaXiIoXil+XiY/XiJkXipRXi4oXiFPXiRzXiE4XiEpXiElXixmXipvXipv",
      "byte_length": 48
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4bb4ae12cbfc",
      "text": "你距離太遠，無法與農奴交談。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^2I^)`^+f^({^*A^%}^%b^'p^4i^##^0P^0;^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXjJJXilgXitmXih7XipBXiV9XiViXidwXjRpXiMjXjBQXjA7XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 43
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5585c1113219",
      "text": "我不能再跟你們說話了。我可不想招惹衛兵找麻煩。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^!)^'b^!l^.+^*F^*{^-x^-v^*D^!\"^$%^\"A^!)^,1^,D^3s^(=^+,^$/^*6^-!^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiEpXidiXiFsXi4rXipGXip7Xi14Xi12XipEXiEiXiQlXiJBXiEpXiwxXixEXjNzXig9XissXiQvXio2Xi0hXiEi",
      "byte_length": 69
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_153ce74f0dcb",
      "text": "別理我了。要是衛兵抓到我和你們說話，肯定會把我打個半死。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*H^&A^$%^*D^!\"^(C^,X^(=^+,^$2^!u^$%^\"O^*F^*{^-x^-v^*A^-Z^#.^$r^$1^$%^$-^!V^\"-^%L^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipIXiZBXiQlXipEXiEiXihDXixYXig9XissXiQyXiF1XiQlXiJPXipGXip7Xi14Xi12XipBXi1aXiMuXiRyXiQxXiQlXiQtXiFWXiItXiVMXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_563aee634bda",
      "text": "你們是誰？我們這裡向來沒有訪客——來者通常都是逃跑的奴隸，而且他們 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^,X^-y^.V^$%^*{^(s^-j^+?^!O^%\\^$s^4d^+q^*n^*n^!O^'V^(t^#O^)$^,X^(p^(_^&Z^##^)Z^*A^'W^!*^!@^*{ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XixYXi15Xi5WXiQlXip7XihzXi1qXis/XiFPXiVcXiRzXjRkXitxXipuXipuXiFPXidWXih0XiNPXikkXixYXihwXihfXiZaXiMjXilaXipBXidXXiEqXiFAXip7IA==",
      "byte_length": 100
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8b1a5a31ac94",
      "text": "最終全都死無葬身之地。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$q^-H^!h^)$^%L^%}^-b^(c^!/^\"e^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRxXi1IXiFoXikkXiVMXiV9Xi1iXihjXiEvXiJlXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0cebce8ddb61",
      "text": "  那個石造構造物是什麼？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^)!^!V^&k^(v^8~^(v^&4^,X^!=^.T^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKSFeIVZeJmteKHZeOH5eKHZeJjReLFheIT1eLlReLlY=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b500b6328ef7",
      "text": "  我能悄悄溜過衛兵身邊嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^'b^3r^3r^%r^(x^(=^+,^(c^.8^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeJ2JeM3JeM3JeJXJeKHheKD1eKyxeKGNeLjheK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_64ca28f886ee",
      "text": "  你為什麼不逃跑？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^%{^!=^.T^!)^(p^(_^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeJXteIT1eLlReISleKHBeKF9eLlY=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_546d28d4d1b1",
      "text": "  跟我說說外面的荒野吧。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^.+^$%^-x^-x^\"w^)j^&Z^1W^.:^*I^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLiteJCVeLXheLXheIndeKWpeJlpeMVdeLjpeKkleISI=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a3b2f7d75261",
      "text": "  大門有多少衛兵巡邏？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^\"z^)D^$s^\"x^#<^(=^+,^8g^8u^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeInpeKUReJHNeInheIzxeKD1eKyxeOGdeOHVeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_30a2edaec151",
      "text": "  德拉吉為什麼在集結軍隊？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^#j^$6^\"D^%{^!=^.T^\"d^)]^'@^..^)U^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeI2peJDZeIkReJXteIT1eLlReImReKV1eJ0BeLi5eKVVeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_de5cb4f990a4",
      "text": "  這裡有人能幫我嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^(s^-j^$s^!<^'b^+}^$%^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKHNeLWpeJHNeITxeJ2JeK31eJCVeK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_14534152f778",
      "text": "  老獨眼在哪裡？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^'U^/z^&d^\"d^+I^-j^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJ1VeL3peJmReImReK0leLWpeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 23
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_67cfd036a48a",
      "text": "我不知道。我聽說早在建城之前它就聳立在這裡了。有些 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^!)^&h^(y^!\"^$%^-X^-x^,V^\"d^,'^+_^!/^!z^+o^*J^4_^0'^\"d^(s^-j^*D^!\"^$s^!8 ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiEpXiZoXih5XiEiXiQlXi1YXi14XixWXiJkXiwnXitfXiEvXiF6XitvXipKXjRfXjAnXiJkXihzXi1qXipEXiEiXiRzXiE4IA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ab1ee67d969d",
      "text": "奴隸說上面原本鑲嵌著一顆巨大的寶石，但那是好幾年前的事了—— ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^##^)Z^-x^!'^)j^\"5^$x^)A^6W^-a^!%^)u^#H^\"z^&Z^#4^&k^*A^!I^)!^,X^+i^#T^+~^!z^&Z^*r^*D^*n^*n ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiMjXilaXi14XiEnXilqXiI1XiR4XilBXjZXXi1hXiElXil1XiNIXiJ6XiZaXiM0XiZrXipBXiFJXikhXixYXitpXiNUXit+XiF6XiZaXipyXipEXipuXipuIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_df64462e6eb1",
      "text": "早就被人偷走了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,V^*J^(@^!<^/O^.&^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XixWXipKXihAXiE8Xi9PXi4mXipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_dc35583b74c1",
      "text": "哪裡？當然是這裡啊。你們現在身處德拉吉城外的田野之中。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+I^-j^.V^&N^&\"^,X^(s^-j^+Q^!\"^*F^*{^&?^\"d^(c^(,^#j^$6^\"D^+_^\"w^&Z^;\\^.:^!/^!,^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitJXi1qXi5WXiZOXiYiXixYXihzXi1qXitRXiEiXipGXip7XiY/XiJkXihjXigsXiNqXiQ2XiJEXitfXiJ3XiZaXjtcXi46XiEvXiEsXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cb31f5177444",
      "text": "我在照料農作物。我這把老骨頭太老了，沒法在角鬥場拼殺，也太虛弱了，幫不上 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^\"d^/x^/n^4i^!M^&4^!\"^$%^(s^$1^'U^*$^)t^+f^'U^*D^*A^%\\^%b^\"d^(H^*,^\"n^;Z^%M^*A^!1^+f^-g^#\\^*D^*A^+}^!)^!' ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiJkXi94Xi9uXjRpXiFNXiY0XiEiXiQlXihzXiQxXidVXiokXil0XitmXidVXipEXipBXiVcXiViXiJkXihIXiosXiJuXjtaXiVNXipBXiExXitmXi1nXiNcXipEXipBXit9XiEpXiEnIA==",
      "byte_length": 109
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5f242134da2e",
      "text": "金字塔的建造工程，所以才留在這裡。所有老奴隸的宿命都是如此。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)+^#)^\"o^&Z^,'^(v^+y^'#^*A^$)^!B^$,^-+^\"d^(s^-j^!\"^$)^$s^'U^##^)Z^&Z^7+^\"N^)$^,X^#$^%I^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XikrXiMpXiJvXiZaXiwnXih2Xit5XicjXipBXiQpXiFCXiQsXi0rXiJkXihzXi1qXiEiXiQpXiRzXidVXiMjXilaXiZaXjcrXiJOXikkXixYXiMkXiVJXiEi",
      "byte_length": 90
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f716d492a5b1",
      "text": "絕不可能——就算你溜得過去，外面的怪物也會把你撕成碎片。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-I^!)^\"A^'b^*n^*n^*J^-C^*F^%r^#e^(x^\"6^*A^\"w^)j^&Z^#s^&4^!1^$r^$1^*F^/k^$$^&o^&1^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi1JXiEpXiJBXidiXipuXipuXipKXi1DXipGXiVyXiNlXih4XiI2XipBXiJ3XilqXiZaXiNzXiY0XiExXiRyXiQxXipGXi9rXiQkXiZvXiYxXiEi",
      "byte_length": 84
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_282ad0794382",
      "text": "我根本不想逃跑——我太老了。外面的世界對我來說什麼也沒有， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^%)^$x^!)^,1^(p^(_^*n^*n^$%^+f^'U^*D^!\"^\"w^)j^&Z^*p^.p^#:^$%^!O^-x^!=^.T^!1^%\\^$s^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiUpXiR4XiEpXiwxXihwXihfXipuXipuXiQlXitmXidVXipEXiEiXiJ3XilqXiZaXipwXi5wXiM6XiQlXiFPXi14XiE9Xi5UXiExXiVcXiRzXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f27654149d56",
      "text": "而且我也沒有體力一直逃亡了。我要留在這裡。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'W^!*^$%^!1^%\\^$s^**^!~^!%^&`^(p^!:^*D^!\"^$%^(C^-+^\"d^(s^-j^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XidXXiEqXiQlXiExXiVcXiRzXioqXiF+XiElXiZgXihwXiE6XipEXiEiXiQlXihDXi0rXiJkXihzXi1qXiEi",
      "byte_length": 63
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8a0ba6178dbd",
      "text": "離開這裡？唯一的解脫就是死亡。大門有衛兵巡邏，而且外面的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)`^)F^(s^-j^.V^+O^!%^&Z^(I^'c^*J^,X^%L^!:^!\"^\"z^)D^$s^(=^+,^8g^8u^*A^'W^!*^\"w^)j^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XilgXilGXihzXi1qXi5WXitPXiElXiZaXihJXidjXipKXixYXiVMXiE6XiEiXiJ6XilEXiRzXig9XissXjhnXjh1XipBXidXXiEqXiJ3XilqXiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e8e6613fe228",
      "text": "荒野上盤踞著凶殘的野獸。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^1W^.:^!'^1M^1_^-a^3e^,l^&Z^.:^&<^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjFXXi46XiEnXjFNXjFfXi1hXjNlXixsXiZaXi46XiY8XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 37
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_102ccd46a3ac",
      "text": "你只要知道千萬別踏進去就夠了！那裡盤踞著邪惡的生物——我親眼見過 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^\"?^(C^&h^(y^+7^-_^*H^.,^(w^\"6^*J^+d^*D^*W^)!^-j^1M^1_^-a^)\"^#y^&Z^&F^&4^*n^*n^$%^(F^&d^-m^(x ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiI/XihDXiZoXih5Xis3Xi1fXipIXi4sXih3XiI2XipKXitkXipEXipXXikhXi1qXjFNXjFfXi1hXikiXiN5XiZaXiZGXiY0XipuXipuXiQlXihGXiZkXi1tXih4IA==",
      "byte_length": 97
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f16daddf7a91",
      "text": "牠們逮到活人時的殘忍手段！相信我，那絕對比留在這裡 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-#^*{^;]^!u^%i^!<^$f^&Z^,l^1y^$+^.l^*W^&a^!U^$%^*A^)!^-I^#:^,m^-+^\"d^(s^-j ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi0jXip7XjtdXiF1XiVpXiE8XiRmXiZaXixsXjF5XiQrXi5sXipXXiZhXiFVXiQlXipBXikhXi1JXiM6XixtXi0rXiJkXihzXi1qIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6fce234811e7",
      "text": "應付衛兵還要可怕得多。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^0`^*u^(=^+,^.7^(C^\"A^0^^#e^\"x^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XjBgXip1Xig9XissXi43XihDXiJBXjBeXiNlXiJ4XiEi",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_95e72e0447d7",
      "text": "以前只有少數衛兵在大門巡邏，但最近 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!B^!z^\"?^$s^#<^$V^(=^+,^\"d^\"z^)D^8g^8u^*A^!I^$q^(l ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFCXiF6XiI/XiRzXiM8XiRWXig9XissXiJkXiJ6XilEXjhnXjh1XipBXiFJXiRxXihsIA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a908f806f14c",
      "text": "派駐到這裡的衛兵越來越多。不出幾天，他們就會 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.n^1f^!u^(s^-j^&Z^(=^+,^(]^!O^(]^\"x^!\"^!)^!q^#T^+e^*A^!@^*{^*J^$r ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi5uXjFmXiF1XihzXi1qXiZaXig9XissXihdXiFPXihdXiJ4XiEiXiEpXiFxXiNUXitlXipBXiFAXip7XipKXiRyIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7b44a48ab98d",
      "text": "在城市邊緣集結起整支大軍！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"d^+_^+z^.8^9J^)]^'@^.(^$T^$L^\"z^..^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJkXitfXit6Xi44XjlKXildXidAXi4oXiRUXiRMXiJ6Xi4uXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 40
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_347d62742472",
      "text": "我聽說他們正策劃一場大規模征伐，但我不知道目標是誰。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^-X^-x^!@^*{^%H^5p^4s^!%^\"n^\"z^6'^%:^.c^5)^*A^!I^$%^!)^&h^(y^&^^%9^,X^-y^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXi1YXi14XiFAXip7XiVIXjVwXjRzXiElXiJuXiJ6XjYnXiU6Xi5jXjUpXipBXiFJXiQlXiEpXiZoXih5XiZeXiU5XixYXi15XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b0cdc0b6e019",
      "text": "但不管目標是誰，都注定要化為齏粉——德拉吉的軍隊 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!I^!)^-D^&^^%9^,X^-y^*A^)$^%e^#.^(C^\")^%{^9g^'5^*n^*n^#j^$6^\"D^&Z^..^)U ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFJXiEpXi1EXiZeXiU5XixYXi15XipBXikkXiVlXiMuXihDXiIpXiV7XjlnXic1XipuXipuXiNqXiQ2XiJEXiZaXi4uXilVIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0d7b9a76218c",
      "text": "幾乎是所向披靡的！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#T^!0^,X^$)^+?^6\\^;^^&Z^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNUXiEwXixYXiQpXis/XjZcXjteXiZaXipX",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bd799450094a",
      "text": "老獨眼是這片田野中最有智慧的奴隸。但他也會對你說同樣的話—— ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'U^/z^&d^,X^(s^&1^;\\^.:^!,^$q^$s^$i^4;^&Z^##^)Z^!\"^!I^!@^!1^$r^#:^*F^-x^\"E^,f^&Z^-v^*n^*n ",
      "encoded_base64": "XidVXi96XiZkXixYXihzXiYxXjtcXi46XiEsXiRxXiRzXiRpXjQ7XiZaXiMjXilaXiEiXiFJXiFAXiExXiRyXiM6XipGXi14XiJFXixmXiZaXi12XipuXipuIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_436a415a77f1",
      "text": "從這裡唯一逃脫的途徑，只有死亡。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#f^(s^-j^+O^!%^(p^'c^&Z^3.^#c^*A^\"?^$s^%L^!:^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNmXihzXi1qXitPXiElXihwXidjXiZaXjMuXiNjXipBXiI/XiRzXiVMXiE6XiEi",
      "byte_length": 48
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3b74351f22ca",
      "text": "他平時總是待在田野正中央，好讓我們在需要時能找到他。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^0Y^$f^-M^,X^,*^\"d^;\\^.:^%H^!,^5@^*A^+i^-}^$%^*{^\"d^)e^(C^$f^'b^$/^!u^!@^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXjBZXiRmXi1NXixYXiwqXiJkXjtcXi46XiVIXiEsXjVAXipBXitpXi19XiQlXip7XiJkXillXihDXiRmXidiXiQvXiF1XiFAXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_518a92aefe34",
      "text": "我得回去幹活了。再見。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^#e^\"\\^\"6^,!^%i^*D^!\"^!l^-m^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiNlXiJcXiI2XiwhXiVpXipEXiEiXiFsXi1tXiEi",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f8864b7efb2a",
      "text": "地面上有一個通往黑暗深處的地洞。你們想要進去嗎？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"e^)j^!'^$s^!%^!V^(t^,)^*:^$k^2*^(,^&Z^\"e^%h^!\"^*F^*{^,1^(C^(w^\"6^+X^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJlXilqXiEnXiRzXiElXiFWXih0XiwpXio6XiRrXjIqXigsXiZaXiJlXiVoXiEiXipGXip7XiwxXihDXih3XiI2XitYXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_535a1c3df878",
      "text": "排水管道散發出一股刺鼻的惡臭，猛烈撲鼻而來。你們想要 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$<^%V^-D^(y^$S^&W^!q^!%^'_^!w^4q^&Z^#y^'m^*A^*P^%|^4B^4q^'W^!O^!\"^*F^*{^,1^(C ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQ8XiVWXi1EXih5XiRTXiZXXiFxXiElXidfXiF3XjRxXiZaXiN5XidtXipBXipQXiV8XjRCXjRxXidXXiFPXiEiXipGXip7XiwxXihDIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_525f4ff37561",
      "text": "進入下水道嗎？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(w^!f^!(^%V^(y^+X^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xih3XiFmXiEoXiVWXih5XitYXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 22
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d6d1b64e0a51",
      "text": "稍等一下！我有樣東西要給你們！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-:^'-^!%^!(^*W^$%^$s^,f^,`^-l^(C^'A^*F^*{^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi06XictXiElXiEoXipXXiQlXiRzXixmXixgXi1sXihDXidBXipGXip7XipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e70f7387e27c",
      "text": "農奴慘叫一聲，倒地身亡！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^4i^##^,4^+<^!%^-W^*A^!X^\"e^(c^!:^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjRpXiMjXiw0Xis8XiElXi1XXipBXiFYXiJlXihjXiE6XipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 37
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cd378cb90cc2",
      "text": "其他奴隸驚慌失措，四散奔逃！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!j^!@^##^)Z^.Q^#}^\"|^;[^*A^\"[^$S^2b^(p^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFqXiFAXiMjXilaXi5RXiN9XiJ8XjtbXipBXiJbXiRTXjJiXihwXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 43
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5cf9223b47f4",
      "text": "祝你們好運！你們讓一個老傢伙開懷大笑了——自從我離開 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&v^*F^*{^+i^.4^*W^*F^*{^-}^!%^!V^'U^+#^*y^)F^,9^\"z^-@^*D^*n^*n^'l^#f^$%^)`^)F ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZ2XipGXip7XitpXi40XipXXipGXip7Xi19XiElXiFWXidVXisjXip5XilGXiw5XiJ6Xi1AXipEXipuXipuXidsXiNmXiQlXilgXilGIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d3328097ed73",
      "text": "角鬥場後，就再也沒這麼暢快過了！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(H^*,^\"n^#b^*A^*J^!l^!1^%\\^(s^.T^7x^*L^(x^*D^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihIXiosXiJuXiNiXipBXipKXiFsXiExXiVcXihzXi5UXjd4XipMXih4XipEXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 49
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8af52ebc87e0",
      "text": "  你想跟我一起走嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^,1^.+^$%^!%^.(^.&^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeLDFeLiteJCVeISVeLiheLiZeK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_024359057d27",
      "text": "謝謝你。再見。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-z^-z^*F^!\"^!l^-m^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi16Xi16XipGXiEiXiFsXi1tXiEi",
      "byte_length": 21
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a2900b1ded32",
      "text": "哦，趁我還沒忘記，我本來存著這東西是打算用來逃跑的，但時機早就過了， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+H^*A^.)^$%^.7^%\\^0]^(K^*A^$%^$x^!O^#*^-a^(s^,`^-l^,X^$-^-C^&H^!O^(p^(_^&Z^*A^!I^$f^%>^,V^*J^(x^*D^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitIXipBXi4pXiQlXi43XiVcXjBdXihLXipBXiQlXiR4XiFPXiMqXi1hXihzXixgXi1sXixYXiQtXi1DXiZIXiFPXihwXihfXiZaXipBXiFJXiRmXiU+XixWXipKXih4XipEXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 103
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_57dba1538604",
      "text": "現在你們比我更需要它。拿去吧，收下這卷卷軸。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&?^\"d^*F^*{^,m^$%^$o^)e^(C^+o^!\"^,G^\"6^*I^*A^$M^!(^(s^\"3^\"3^(e^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiY/XiJkXipGXip7XixtXiQlXiRvXillXihDXitvXiEiXixHXiI2XipJXipBXiRNXiEoXihzXiIzXiIzXihlXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5ad6be8b0a87",
      "text": "現在快點離開這裡，免得招來更多巡查的衛兵！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&?^\"d^*L^*;^)`^)F^(s^-j^*A^!e^#e^,D^!O^$o^\"x^8g^%&^&Z^(=^+,^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiY/XiJkXipMXio7XilgXilGXihzXi1qXipBXiFlXiNlXixEXiFPXiRvXiJ4XjhnXiUmXiZaXig9XissXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_03ebaa2e4d53",
      "text": "我就不去了，那片荒漠我這輩子已經受夠了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*J^!)^\"6^*D^*A^)!^&1^1W^,}^$%^(s^8t^#(^#J^'D^\";^+d^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXipKXiEpXiI2XipEXipBXikhXiYxXjFXXix9XiQlXihzXjh0XiMoXiNKXidEXiI7XitkXipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c9dc46fcfa17",
      "text": "要是你們能活下來，就殺回來徹底摧毀這座該死的城市。要是我 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(C^,X^*F^*{^'b^%i^!(^!O^*A^*J^%M^\"\\^!O^18^/^^$E^%N^(s^/_^(M^%L^&Z^+_^+z^!\"^(C^,X^$% ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihDXixYXipGXip7XidiXiVpXiEoXiFPXipBXipKXiVNXiJcXiFPXjE4Xi9eXiRFXiVOXihzXi9fXihNXiVMXiZaXitfXit6XiEiXihDXixYXiQlIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3af334e0804d",
      "text": "還年輕，我就自己動手了，但現在我全指望你們了……我們大家都指望著你們。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.7^+~^(g^*A^$%^*J^'l^#I^\"%^$+^*D^*A^!I^&?^\"d^$%^!h^$8^,]^*F^*{^*D^*o^*o^$%^*{^\"z^+s^)$^$8^,]^-a^*F^*{^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi43Xit+XihnXipBXiQlXipKXidsXiNJXiIlXiQrXipEXipBXiFJXiY/XiJkXiQlXiFoXiQ4XixdXipGXip7XipEXipvXipvXiQlXip7XiJ6XitzXikkXiQ4XixdXi1hXipGXip7XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 106
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d6ffb0e921c3",
      "text": "你聽見遠處傳來衛兵的呼喝聲。從喧鬧的動靜來看， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^-X^-m^({^(,^+$^!O^(=^+,^&Z^\"M^6M^-W^!\"^#f^;Y^6G^&Z^\"%^)h^!O^*Q^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXi1YXi1tXih7XigsXiskXiFPXig9XissXiZaXiJNXjZNXi1XXiEiXiNmXjtZXjZHXiZaXiIlXiloXiFPXipRXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_65cb9c4a79d6",
      "text": "他們正朝著這個方向趕來。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^*{^%H^,^^-a^(s^!V^$]^+?^0u^!O^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXip7XiVIXixeXi1hXihzXiFWXiRdXis/XjB1XiFPXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 37
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_aa0c2447becd",
      "text": "離這裡遠點，奴隸們！我只警告你們一次！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)`^(s^-j^({^*;^*A^##^)Z^*{^*W^$%^\"?^(S^+B^*F^*{^!%^%D^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XilgXihzXi1qXih7Xio7XipBXiMjXilaXip7XipXXiQlXiI/XihTXitCXipGXip7XiElXiVEXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c239000a579a",
      "text": "我警告過你們了！你們就等著受罰吧！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^(S^+B^(x^*F^*{^*D^*W^*F^*{^*J^'-^-a^\";^0-^*I^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXihTXitCXih4XipGXip7XipEXipXXipGXip7XipKXictXi1hXiI7XjAtXipJXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4d5deaa23ae5",
      "text": "你們不是本地人——我一眼就能看出來。如果各位有興趣，我可以賣你們一些 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^!)^,X^$x^\"e^!<^*n^*n^$%^!%^&d^*J^'b^*Q^!q^!O^!\"^#$^%!^+>^!J^$s^-]^.*^*A^$%^\"A^!B^.$^*F^*{^!%^!8 ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiEpXixYXiR4XiJlXiE8XipuXipuXiQlXiElXiZkXipKXidiXipRXiFxXiFPXiEiXiMkXiUhXis+XiFKXiRzXi1dXi4qXipBXiQlXiJBXiFCXi4kXipGXip7XiElXiE4IA==",
      "byte_length": 103
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_62bf4c4e490a",
      "text": "水果——剛摘下來的新鮮貨！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%V^%!^*n^*n^+0^;g^!(^!O^&Z^$\\^35^.w^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVWXiUhXipuXipuXiswXjtnXiEoXiFPXiZaXiRcXjM1Xi53XipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 40
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_48756ba04d5c",
      "text": "  你為什麼不在田裡幹活？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^%{^!=^.T^!)^\"d^;\\^-j^,!^%i^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeJXteIT1eLlReISleImReO1xeLWpeLCFeJWleLlY=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c514fa784751",
      "text": "  什麼樣的水果？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^!=^.T^,f^&Z^%V^%!^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIT1eLlReLGZeJlpeJVZeJSFeLlYg",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2d67a3d16ac4",
      "text": "  這些作物難道不是供應給城裡的嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^(s^!8^!M^&4^)a^(y^!)^,X^!P^0`^'A^+_^-j^&Z^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKHNeITheIU1eJjReKWFeKHleISleLFheIVBeMGBeJ0FeK19eLWpeJlpeK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 50
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f09e68617ae4",
      "text": "  好吧，我買一些。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^+i^*I^*A^$%^.!^!%^!8^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeK2leKkleKkFeJCVeLiFeISVeITheISIg",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8e8080c3945b",
      "text": "我得走了。再見。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^#e^.&^*D^!\"^!l^-m^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiNlXi4mXipEXiEiXiFsXi1tXiEi",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_edc7fa245cc8",
      "text": "噓！你想讓衛兵聽見嗎？要是被他們發現我偷賣作物…… ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^/W^*W^*F^,1^-}^(=^+,^-X^-m^+X^.V^(C^,X^(@^!@^*{^&W^&?^$%^/O^.$^!M^&4^*o^*o ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi9XXipXXipGXiwxXi19Xig9XissXi1YXi1tXitYXi5WXihDXixYXihAXiFAXip7XiZXXiY/XiQlXi9PXi4kXiFNXiY0XipvXipvIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8075f9d25ce1",
      "text": "我連想都不敢想。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^.0^,1^)$^!)^/m^,1^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXi4wXiwxXikkXiEpXi9tXiwxXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_86ccc7e82bfb",
      "text": "絕對是最好的——直接採自德拉吉的農田。我這裡有梨子、葡萄、檸檬， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-I^#:^,X^$q^+i^&Z^*n^*n^&`^$?^5R^'l^#j^$6^\"D^&Z^4i^;\\^!\"^$%^(s^-j^$s^%/^#(^!!^(#^'~^!!^%A^%@^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi1JXiM6XixYXiRxXitpXiZaXipuXipuXiZgXiQ/XjVSXidsXiNqXiQ2XiJEXiZaXjRpXjtcXiEiXiQlXihzXi1qXiRzXiUvXiMoXiEhXigjXid+XiEhXiVBXiVAXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 97
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6c8927759414",
      "text": "甚至還有幾穗玉米。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^/|^'n^.7^$s^#T^;l^&=^'4^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi98XiduXi43XiRzXiNUXjtsXiY9Xic0XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 28
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1dfdb7504324",
      "text": "聽著，你們到底要不要買水果？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-X^-a^*A^*F^*{^!u^/^^(C^!)^(C^.!^%V^%!^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi1YXi1hXipBXipGXip7XiF1Xi9eXihDXiEpXihDXi4hXiVWXiUhXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 43
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_16a89c5b678f",
      "text": "行。那就別浪費我的時間。我可不想為了閒扯淡去冒受酷刑的風險。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(;^!\"^)!^*J^*H^,r^.\"^$%^&Z^$f^)G^!\"^$%^\"A^!)^,1^%{^*D^6A^.e^5_^\"6^/P^\";^1b^9|^&Z^)y^*m^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xig7XiEiXikhXipKXipIXixyXi4iXiQlXiZaXiRmXilHXiEiXiQlXiJBXiEpXiwxXiV7XipEXjZBXi5lXjVfXiI2Xi9QXiI7XjFiXjl8XiZaXil5XiptXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_69a8a84d54d3",
      "text": "很好。那就別問東問西。只要想想你們買下這些能讓城裡的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*K^+i^!\"^)!^*J^*H^*Z^,`^*Z^-l^!\"^\"?^(C^,1^,1^*F^*{^.!^!(^(s^!8^'b^-}^+_^-j^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipLXitpXiEiXikhXipKXipIXipaXixgXipaXi1sXiEiXiI/XihDXiwxXiwxXipGXip7Xi4hXiEoXihzXiE4XidiXi19XitfXi1qXiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8fe785a7679f",
      "text": "某些貴族少吃一口，心裡就踏實了吧。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%$^!8^2F^5V^#<^2^^!%^\"<^*A^#k^-j^*J^.,^#3^*D^*I^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiUkXiE4XjJGXjVWXiM8XjJeXiElXiI8XipBXiNrXi1qXipKXi4sXiMzXipEXipJXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7c96cc376281",
      "text": "站得那麼老遠你打算怎麼買東西？你得 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^->^#e^)!^.T^'U^({^*F^$-^-C^,,^.T^.!^,`^-l^.V^*F^#e ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi0+XiNlXikhXi5UXidVXih7XipGXiQtXi1DXiwsXi5UXi4hXixgXi1sXi5WXipGXiNlIA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_56097e350aed",
      "text": "走近一點才行。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.&^(l^!%^*;^$,^(;^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi4mXihsXiElXio7XiQsXig7XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 22
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_80686928f7c3",
      "text": "我們來談正事吧。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^!O^0;^%H^*r^*I^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7XiFPXjA7XiVIXipyXipJXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_97f9b8a099ce",
      "text": "每一件都是頂級上品！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%P^!%^.W^)$^,X^)p^'<^!'^\"R^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVQXiElXi5XXikkXixYXilwXic8XiEnXiJSXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 31
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_029ff36a59d4",
      "text": "需要水果隨時再來。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)e^(C^%V^%!^)X^$f^!l^!O^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XillXihDXiVWXiUhXilYXiRmXiFsXiFPXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 28
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_47f0273a6d19",
      "text": "農奴向你們招了招手。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^4i^##^+?^*F^*{^,D^*D^,D^$+^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XjRpXiMjXis/XipGXip7XixEXipEXixEXiQrXiEi",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c02d3e234c82",
      "text": "喂！快過來這邊——我有話跟你們說！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^;c^*W^*L^(x^!O^(s^.8^*n^*n^$%^$s^-v^.+^*F^*{^-x^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjtjXipXXipMXih4XiFPXihzXi44XipuXipuXiQlXiRzXi12Xi4rXipGXip7Xi14XipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5afde28f76f3",
      "text": "前面帶路！我就全指望你們帶我逃出去了！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!z^)j^#N^(a^*W^$%^*J^!h^$8^,]^*F^*{^#N^$%^(p^!q^\"6^*D^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiF6XilqXiNOXihhXipXXiQlXipKXiFoXiQ4XixdXipGXip7XiNOXiQlXihwXiFxXiI2XipEXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_82316a35b51d",
      "text": "你們是逃跑的奴隸，對吧？放心——我絕不會向衛兵告發。事實上， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^,X^(p^(_^&Z^##^)Z^*A^#:^*I^.V^$P^#k^*n^*n^$%^-I^!)^$r^+?^(=^+,^+B^&W^!\"^*r^#3^!'^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XixYXihwXihfXiZaXiMjXilaXipBXiM6XipJXi5WXiRQXiNrXipuXipuXiQlXi1JXiEpXiRyXis/Xig9XissXitCXiZXXiEiXipyXiMzXiEnXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5168eda2ddce",
      "text": "要是你們有興趣，我倒有個提議。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(C^,X^*F^*{^$s^-]^.*^*A^$%^!X^$s^!V^$A^-|^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihDXixYXipGXip7XiRzXi1dXi4qXipBXiQlXiFYXiRzXiFWXiRBXi18XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3de69de01c74",
      "text": "  什麼提議？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^!=^.T^$A^-|^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIT1eLlReJEFeLXxeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 17
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0ef9c8feb7c0",
      "text": "  算了，我沒興趣。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^-C^*D^*A^$%^%\\^-]^.*^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLUNeKkReKkFeJCVeJVxeLV1eLipeISI=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d4de6bf1c755",
      "text": "  那件東西到底是什麼？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^)!^.W^,`^-l^!u^/^^,X^!=^.T^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKSFeLldeLGBeLWxeIXVeL15eLFheIT1eLlReLlY=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0754af7fc34e",
      "text": "  如果我直接殺了你奪走寶石呢？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^#$^%!^$%^&`^$?^%M^*D^*F^1,^.&^#4^&k^+C^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIyReJSFeJCVeJmBeJD9eJU1eKkReKkZeMSxeLiZeIzReJmteK0NeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5e387fe1399a",
      "text": "  成交，一言為定。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$$^0P^*A^!%^1Y^%{^#.^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCReMFBeKkFeISVeMVleJXteIy5eISI=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_56ff2f1bea7b",
      "text": "  沒門。我不跟農奴做交易。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^%\\^)D^!\"^$%^!)^.+^4i^##^*~^0P^,W^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJVxeKUReISJeJCVeISleLiteNGleIyNeKn5eMFBeLFdeISI=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f95588b08ff1",
      "text": "我得走了。再會。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^#e^.&^*D^!\"^!l^$r^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiNlXi4mXipEXiEiXiFsXiRyXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_22a48b615550",
      "text": "你以為我會蠢到把寶石隨身攜帶嗎？你腦子在想什麼？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^!B^%{^$%^$r^.u^!u^$1^#4^&k^)X^(c^0e^#N^+X^.V^*F^2@^#(^\"d^,1^!=^.T^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiFCXiV7XiQlXiRyXi51XiF1XiQxXiM0XiZrXilYXihjXjBlXiNOXitYXi5WXipGXjJAXiMoXiJkXiwxXiE9Xi5UXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f48ccdca410d",
      "text": "它藏在一個隱秘的地方，只有我才知道在哪裡。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+o^-f^\"d^!%^!V^)Y^1O^&Z^\"e^$]^*A^\"?^$s^$%^$,^&h^(y^\"d^+I^-j^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitvXi1mXiJkXiElXiFWXilZXjFPXiZaXiJlXiRdXipBXiI/XiRzXiQlXiQsXiZoXih5XiJkXitJXi1qXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4aaed59aae01",
      "text": "再見。要是你們改變主意隨時回來找我。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!l^-m^!\"^(C^,X^*F^*{^$N^(U^!-^#z^)X^$f^\"\\^!O^$/^$%^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFsXi1tXiEiXihDXixYXipGXip7XiROXihVXiEtXiN6XilYXiRmXiJcXiFPXiQvXiQlXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a1e085e64526",
      "text": "行吧。既然你們不想要那件東西，那就隨便你們。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(;^*I^!\"^,U^&\"^*F^*{^!)^,1^(C^)!^.W^,`^-l^*A^)!^*J^)X^!R^*F^*{^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xig7XipJXiEiXixVXiYiXipGXip7XiEpXiwxXihDXikhXi5XXixgXi1sXipBXikhXipKXilYXiFSXipGXip7XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8306fa1117ac",
      "text": "我有一件東西，只要你們能帶我逃離這裡，我就把它送給你們——我唯一的條件， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^$s^!%^.W^,`^-l^*A^\"?^(C^*F^*{^'b^#N^$%^(p^)`^(s^-j^*A^$%^*J^$1^+o^./^'A^*F^*{^*n^*n^$%^+O^!%^&Z^%.^.W^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiRzXiElXi5XXixgXi1sXipBXiI/XihDXipGXip7XidiXiNOXiQlXihwXilgXihzXi1qXipBXiQlXipKXiQxXitvXi4vXidBXipGXip7XipuXipuXiQlXitPXiElXiZaXiUuXi5XXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 109
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a710ffae21ca",
      "text": "就是讓我跟在你們身後。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*J^,X^-}^$%^.+^\"d^*F^*{^(c^#b^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipKXixYXi19XiQlXi4rXiJkXipGXip7XihjXiNiXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5973e9efac3f",
      "text": "你們知道排水管旁邊那個石基座嗎？正中央原本嵌著一顆 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^&h^(y^$<^%V^-D^.h^.8^)!^!V^&k^/'^/_^+X^.V^%H^!,^5@^\"5^$x^6W^-a^!%^)u ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiZoXih5XiQ8XiVWXi1EXi5oXi44XikhXiFWXiZrXi8nXi9fXitYXi5WXiVIXiEsXjVAXiI1XiR4XjZXXi1hXiElXil1IA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4bca1c6a8236",
      "text": "寶石，但後來被人偷了，而我現在知道它在哪裡。只要你們允許我跟著你們， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#4^&k^*A^!I^#b^!O^(@^!<^/O^*D^*A^'W^$%^&?^\"d^&h^(y^+o^\"d^+I^-j^!\"^\"?^(C^*F^*{^/\"^-s^$%^.+^-a^*F^*{^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiM0XiZrXipBXiFJXiNiXiFPXihAXiE8Xi9PXipEXipBXidXXiQlXiY/XiJkXiZoXih5XitvXiJkXitJXi1qXiEiXiI/XihDXipGXip7Xi8iXi1zXiQlXi4rXi1hXipGXip7XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 103
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bbd74d69c7dc",
      "text": "我就把寶石送給你們。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*J^$1^#4^&k^./^'A^*F^*{^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXipKXiQxXiM0XiZrXi4vXidBXipGXip7XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 31
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f3347a0f1dc9",
      "text": "太棒了！我去拿來……",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+f^%1^*D^*W^$%^\"6^,G^!O^*o^*o",
      "encoded_base64": "XitmXiUxXipEXipXXiQlXiI2XixHXiFPXipvXipv",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_73c6f971f02e",
      "text": "農奴伸手探入束腰外衣，掏出了一顆巨大的寶石。他將寶石遞給了你們。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^4i^##^/N^$+^$>^!f^$|^'f^\"w^(>^*A^/f^!q^*D^!%^)u^#H^\"z^&Z^#4^&k^!\"^!@^#7^#4^&k^8*^'A^*D^*F^*{^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjRpXiMjXi9OXiQrXiQ+XiFmXiR8XidmXiJ3Xig+XipBXi9mXiFxXipEXiElXil1XiNIXiJ6XiZaXiM0XiZrXiEiXiFAXiM3XiM0XiZrXjgqXidBXipEXipGXip7XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 97
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f69e235f38fb",
      "text": "給——拿著，我們趕緊動身吧！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'A^*n^*n^,G^-a^*A^$%^*{^0u^0r^\"%^(c^*I^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XidBXipuXipuXixHXi1hXipBXiQlXip7XjB1XjByXiIlXihjXipJXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 43
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e83debb89b79",
      "text": "好吧。沒關係，但光憑你們自己絕對找不到那顆寶石——因為只有我 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+i^*I^!\"^%\\^.>^38^*A^!I^!c^,5^*F^*{^'l^#I^-I^#:^$/^!)^!u^)!^)u^#4^&k^*n^*n^\"]^%{^\"?^$s^$% ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitpXipJXiEiXiVcXi4+XjM4XipBXiFJXiFjXiw1XipGXip7XidsXiNJXi1JXiM6XiQvXiEpXiF1XikhXil1XiM0XiZrXipuXipuXiJdXiV7XiI/XiRzXiQlIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fc2f887db29f",
      "text": "才知道它藏在哪裡。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$,^&h^(y^+o^-f^\"d^+I^-j^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQsXiZoXih5XitvXi1mXiJkXitJXi1qXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 28
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6013b6746221",
      "text": "朝這個方向望去只有無邊無際的黃沙與流動的沙丘。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,^^(s^!V^$]^+?^,]^\"6^\"?^$s^%}^.8^%}^30^&Z^*7^%]^'p^%j^\"%^&Z^%]^5(^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XixeXihzXiFWXiRdXis/XixdXiI2XiI/XiRzXiV9Xi44XiV9XjMwXiZaXio3XiVdXidwXiVqXiIlXiZaXiVdXjUoXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1d3f9a74d6c0",
      "text": "貿然深入無異於自尋死路。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^6/^&\"^2*^!f^%}^&M^$^^'l^#9^%L^(a^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjYvXiYiXjIqXiFmXiV9XiZNXiReXidsXiM5XiVMXihhXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 37
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a247364d49df",
      "text": "古老的城邦正無聲地向你們發出召喚。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"=^'U^&Z^+_^1a^%H^%}^-W^\"e^+?^*F^*{^&W^!q^\"@^\"U^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiI9XidVXiZaXitfXjFhXiVIXiV9Xi1XXiJlXis/XipGXip7XiZXXiFxXiJAXiJVXiEi",
      "byte_length": 51
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0a14f5d2337f",
      "text": "隨著德拉吉大軍完成集結，你可以看見荒蕪術士施法時閃爍的陣陣魔光。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)X^-a^#j^$6^\"D^\"z^..^#,^$$^)]^'@^*A^*F^\"A^!B^*Q^-m^1W^4b^(<^+a^$_^%b^$f^)E^&+^&Z^)P^)P^*0^!c^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XilYXi1hXiNqXiQ2XiJEXiJ6Xi4uXiMsXiQkXildXidAXipBXipGXiJBXiFCXipRXi1tXjFXXjRiXig8XithXiRfXiViXiRmXilFXiYrXiZaXilQXilQXiowXiFjXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 97
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2aa444c30d02",
      "text": "大地劇烈震顫，一隻隻自幽暗異界召喚而來的恐怖凶獸 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"z^\"e^1#^%|^32^)x^*A^!%^)[^)[^'l^2f^$k^&M^.p^\"@^\"U^'W^!O^&Z^#t^#p^3e^&< ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJ6XiJlXjEjXiV8XjMyXil4XipBXiElXilbXilbXidsXjJmXiRrXiZNXi5wXiJAXiJVXidXXiFPXiZaXiN0XiNwXjNlXiY8IA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ab69e5894b58",
      "text": "出現在大軍陣前。在沒有驅散手段的情況下，你們意識到必須硬生生殺出一條血路， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!q^&?^\"d^\"z^..^)P^!z^!\"^\"d^%\\^$s^*#^$S^$+^.l^&Z^,0^,q^!(^*A^*F^*{^#z^(R^!u^#l^)r^25^&F^&F^%M^!q^!%^%.^(:^(a^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFxXiY/XiJkXiJ6Xi4uXilQXiF6XiEiXiJkXiVcXiRzXiojXiRTXiQrXi5sXiZaXiwwXixxXiEoXipBXipGXip7XiN6XihSXiF1XiNsXilyXjI1XiZGXiZGXiVNXiFxXiElXiUuXig6XihhXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 112
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7357b5edc2f4",
      "text": "才能直取敵軍中樞！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$,^'b^&`^\":^$U^..^!,^8_^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQsXidiXiZgXiI6XiRVXi4uXiEsXjhfXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 28
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d5bea9c2de6c",
      "text": "正當你們在敵陣中浴血突圍時，一個熟悉的身影 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%H^&N^*F^*{^\"d^$U^)P^!,^4N^(:^'*^\"`^$f^*A^!%^!V^-\"^2h^&Z^(c^#a ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVIXiZOXipGXip7XiJkXiRVXilQXiEsXjROXig6XicqXiJgXiRmXipBXiElXiFWXi0iXjJoXiZaXihjXiNhIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f99edc34cbf0",
      "text": "從混戰中昂然殺出，雙手綻放著熾烈的魔法光芒。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#f^%n^$(^!,^;h^&\"^%M^!q^*A^)_^$+^'H^$P^-a^20^%|^&Z^*0^%b^!c^'u^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNmXiVuXiQoXiEsXjtoXiYiXiVNXiFxXipBXilfXiQrXidIXiRQXi1hXjIwXiV8XiZaXiowXiViXiFjXid1XiEi",
      "byte_length": 66
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a3f9356cc5ae",
      "text": "茉莉向你們眨了眨眼。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'z^'{^+?^*F^*{^;F^*D^;F^&d^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xid6Xid7Xis/XipGXip7XjtGXipEXjtGXiZkXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 31
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_01205fcbec5a",
      "text": "「你們怎麼拖了這麼久？讓我們徹底給這一切做個了斷吧。」 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!#^*F^*{^,,^.T^.f^*D^(s^.T^!.^.V^-}^$%^*{^18^/^^'A^(s^!%^+.^*~^!V^*D^,T^*I^!\"^!$ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEjXipGXip7XiwsXi5UXi5mXipEXihzXi5UXiEuXi5WXi19XiQlXip7XjE4Xi9eXidBXihzXiElXisuXip+XiFWXipEXixUXipJXiEiXiEkIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_92d8fe8768f2",
      "text": "一名粗壯的戰士砸碎了一名敵人的腦袋，快步殺到了你們身邊。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!%^\"F^0(^+b^&Z^$(^+a^0#^&o^*D^!%^\"F^$U^!<^&Z^2@^(?^*A^*L^,i^%M^!u^*D^*F^*{^(c^.8^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiElXiJGXjAoXitiXiZaXiQoXithXjAjXiZvXipEXiElXiJGXiRVXiE8XiZaXjJAXig/XipBXipMXixpXiVNXiF1XipEXipGXip7XihjXi44XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_11fa9927c786",
      "text": "「嗯……空氣中瀰漫的鮮血與汗水氣味！這世上再沒有比這更痛快的事了， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!#^6N^*o^*o^'(^%U^!,^5b^2,^&Z^35^(:^'p^;j^%V^%U^1n^*W^(s^*p^!'^!l^%\\^$s^,m^(s^$o^-.^*L^&Z^*r^*D^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEjXjZOXipvXipvXicoXiVVXiEsXjViXjIsXiZaXjM1Xig6XidwXjtqXiVWXiVVXjFuXipXXihzXipwXiEnXiFsXiVcXiRzXixtXihzXiRvXi0uXipMXiZaXipyXipEXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 100
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3322141b5bf4",
      "text": "我熱血沸騰。我準備好了——讓我們送這群德拉吉雜碎去見他們的造物主吧！」 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^&$^(:^5\\^.O^!\"^$%^,x^+\"^+i^*D^*n^*n^-}^$%^*{^./^(s^'R^#j^$6^\"D^0G^&o^\"6^-m^!@^*{^&Z^(v^&4^!-^*I^*W^!$ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiYkXig6XjVcXi5PXiEiXiQlXix4XisiXitpXipEXipuXipuXi19XiQlXip7Xi4vXihzXidSXiNqXiQ2XiJEXjBHXiZvXiI2Xi1tXiFAXip7XiZaXih2XiY0XiEtXipJXipXXiEkIA==",
      "byte_length": 106
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cc1a676dc4e5",
      "text": "一名戰士揮舞兵刃劈開血路，殺到了你們身旁。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!%^\"F^$(^+a^2\"^9s^+,^!r^4t^)F^(:^(a^*A^%M^!u^*D^*F^*{^(c^.h^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiElXiJGXiQoXithXjIiXjlzXissXiFyXjR0XilGXig6XihhXipBXiVNXiF1XipEXipGXip7XihjXi5oXiEi",
      "byte_length": 63
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_75d7113598dc",
      "text": "「我謹代表蓋德隆村誓言：我必將傾盡全力， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!#^$%^8@^*v^-i^-d^#j^)T^$z^-w^1Y^*B^$%^#l^#7^2U^-1^!h^!~^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEjXiQlXjhAXip2Xi1pXi1kXiNqXilUXiR6Xi13XjFZXipCXiQlXiNsXiM3XjJVXi0xXiFoXiF+XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8671d5e569c0",
      "text": "誓死助你們徹底擊潰特克圖克特雷的大軍！衝啊！」 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-w^%L^\"#^*F^*{^18^/^^$F^2-^&5^!d^\"b^!d^&5^)c^&Z^\"z^..^*W^-h^+Q^*W^!$ ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi13XiVMXiIjXipGXip7XjE4Xi9eXiRGXjItXiY1XiFkXiJiXiFkXiY1XiljXiZaXiJ6Xi4uXipXXi1oXitRXipXXiEkIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c36a81d8c3a2",
      "text": "另一名戰士從混戰中浴血殺出，疾步趕到了你們身邊。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\">^!%^\"F^$(^+a^#f^%n^$(^!,^4N^(:^%M^!q^*A^&Q^,i^0u^!u^*D^*F^*{^(c^.8^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiI+XiElXiJGXiQoXithXiNmXiVuXiQoXiEsXjROXig6XiVNXiFxXipBXiZRXixpXjB1XiF1XipEXipGXip7XihjXi44XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_62cdb7f61d8a",
      "text": "一名戰士一路砍殺，奔赴你們的身側。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!%^\"F^$(^+a^!%^(a^&l^%M^*A^2b^.'^*F^*{^&Z^(c^!\\^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiElXiJGXiQoXithXiElXihhXiZsXiVNXipBXjJiXi4nXipGXip7XiZaXihjXiFcXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3c98c2b7f348",
      "text": "「我來自特奎策爾村，今日特來立誓： ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!#^$%^!O^'l^&5^5B^5p^&/^$z^*A^*E^$a^&5^!O^0'^-w^*B ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEjXiQlXiFPXidsXiY1XjVCXjVwXiYvXiR6XipBXipFXiRhXiY1XiFPXjAnXi13XipCIA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c4f5ef001ab8",
      "text": "巫王的大軍今日必將覆滅！我定會親自踐行此誓！」 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^14^-)^&Z^\"z^..^*E^$a^#l^#7^(D^%t^*W^$%^#.^$r^(F^'l^4h^(;^%I^-w^*W^!$ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjE0Xi0pXiZaXiJ6Xi4uXipFXiRhXiNsXiM3XihEXiV0XipXXiQlXiMuXiRyXihGXidsXjRoXig7XiVJXi13XipXXiEkIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_709503366472",
      "text": "又有一名戰士斬殺了敵手，飛奔到了你們的身旁。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+;^$s^!%^\"F^$(^+a^9B^%M^*D^$U^$+^*A^)z^2b^!u^*D^*F^*{^&Z^(c^.h^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xis7XiRzXiElXiJGXiQoXithXjlCXiVNXipEXiRVXiQrXipBXil6XjJiXiF1XipEXipGXip7XiZaXihjXi5oXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_649626afa999",
      "text": "「我謹代表塞德里爾特村前來助陣！」 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!#^$%^8@^*v^-i^/(^#j^)(^&/^&5^$z^!z^!O^\"#^)P^*W^!$ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEjXiQlXjhAXip2Xi1pXi8oXiNqXikoXiYvXiY1XiR6XiF6XiFPXiIjXilQXipXXiEkIA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c7e0837bd50e",
      "text": "在盟友們的簇擁相伴下，你們毅然殺向混戰深處…… ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"d^-0^\"8^*{^&Z^;n^,M^&a^1h^!(^*A^*F^*{^%O^&\"^%M^+?^%n^$(^2*^(,^*o^*o ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJkXi0wXiI4Xip7XiZaXjtuXixNXiZhXjFoXiEoXipBXipGXip7XiVPXiYiXiVNXis/XiVuXiQoXjIqXigsXipvXipvIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b3fd484ad573",
      "text": "在你們接近敵軍統帥之前，幾名聖堂武士及其衛隊截斷了去路！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"d^*F^*{^$?^(l^$U^..^'B^;e^!/^!z^*A^#T^\"F^'Z^42^%J^+a^\"7^!j^(=^)U^:y^,T^*D^\"6^(a^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJkXipGXip7XiQ/XihsXiRVXi4uXidCXjtlXiEvXiF6XipBXiNUXiJGXidaXjQyXiVKXithXiI3XiFqXig9XilVXjp5XixUXipEXiI2XihhXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0600f9013bcf",
      "text": "你們的盟友奮不顧身地引開了部分聖堂武士衛隊，化解了你們的後顧之憂。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^&Z^-0^\"8^+g^!)^4n^(c^\"e^#Z^)F^*D^)#^!s^'Z^42^%J^+a^(=^)U^*A^\")^(I^*D^*F^*{^&Z^#b^4n^!/^91^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiZaXi0wXiI4XitnXiEpXjRuXihjXiJlXiNaXilGXipEXikjXiFzXidaXjQyXiVKXithXig9XilVXipBXiIpXihJXipEXipGXip7XiZaXiNiXjRuXiEvXjkxXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 100
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c663a01d5d03",
      "text": "彷彿光是統帥及其精銳衛隊還不夠棘手似的，一個過於熟悉的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.a^.b^!c^,X^'B^;e^\"7^!j^'7^;W^(=^)U^.7^!)^+d^9p^$+^!H^&Z^*A^!%^!V^(x^$^^-\"^2h^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi5hXi5iXiFjXixYXidCXjtlXiI3XiFqXic3XjtXXig9XilVXi43XiEpXitkXjlwXiQrXiFIXiZaXipBXiElXiFWXih4XiReXi0iXjJoXiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a6dfd82ef8fe",
      "text": "死敵身影竟從統帥衛隊的身後緩緩現身。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%L^$U^(c^#a^28^#f^'B^;e^(=^)U^&Z^(c^#b^'J^'J^&?^(c^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVMXiRVXihjXiNhXjI4XiNmXidCXjtlXig9XilVXiZaXihjXiNiXidKXidKXiY/XihjXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ea17555b24ff",
      "text": "「我警告過你們，再次相見時會是什麼下場！這一次，我可不欠你們 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!#^$%^(S^+B^(x^*F^*{^*A^!l^%D^&a^-m^$f^$r^,X^!=^.T^!(^\"n^*W^(s^!%^%D^*A^$%^\"A^!)^,g^*F^*{ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEjXiQlXihTXitCXih4XipGXip7XipBXiFsXiVEXiZhXi1tXiRmXiRyXixYXiE9Xi5UXiEoXiJuXipXXihzXiElXiVEXipBXiQlXiJBXiEpXixnXipGXip7IA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4fefa465ecb3",
      "text": "任何情分了，你們受死吧！」 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!C^!L^,0^!s^*D^*A^*F^*{^\";^%L^*I^*W^!$ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFDXiFMXiwwXiFzXipEXipBXipGXip7XiI7XiVMXipJXipXXiEkIA==",
      "byte_length": 40
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7385b8ff425f",
      "text": "「愚蠢之徒！就算沒有你們找來的那幾件碎片，我也照樣完成了我的雕像！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!#^/a^.u^!/^#d^*W^*J^-C^%\\^$s^*F^*{^$/^!O^&Z^)!^#T^.W^&o^&1^*A^$%^!1^/x^,f^#,^$$^*D^$%^&Z^)^^!`^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEjXi9hXi51XiEvXiNkXipXXipKXi1DXiVcXiRzXipGXip7XiQvXiFPXiZaXikhXiNUXi5XXiZvXiYxXipBXiQlXiExXi94XixmXiMsXiQkXipEXiQlXiZaXileXiFgXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 100
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_04678a8e045f",
      "text": "你們膽敢拒絕為我效勞，就等著付出血的代價吧！」 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^-[^/m^5Q^-I^%{^$%^$Q^/R^*A^*J^'-^-a^*u^!q^(:^&Z^*v^+&^*I^*W^!$ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7Xi1bXi9tXjVRXi1JXiV7XiQlXiRRXi9SXipBXipKXictXi1hXip1XiFxXig6XiZaXip2XismXipJXipXXiEkIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bd9322e77647",
      "text": "某種巨型生物從統帥的衛隊身後蜿蜒遊動而出。牠猛然立起龐大的身軀， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%$^'$^#H^\"j^&F^&4^#f^'B^;e^&Z^(=^)U^(c^#b^6q^6p^.3^\"%^'W^!q^!\"^-#^*P^&\"^0'^.(^6H^\"z^&Z^(c^(d^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiUkXickXiNIXiJqXiZGXiY0XiNmXidCXjtlXiZaXig9XilVXihjXiNiXjZxXjZwXi4zXiIlXidXXiFxXiEiXi0jXipQXiYiXjAnXi4oXjZIXiJ6XiZaXihjXihkXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 97
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_eedc8e1cf398",
      "text": "巍然聳立在大軍之上，居高臨下地俯視著你們。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^47^&\"^4_^0'^\"d^\"z^..^!/^!'^*A^+w^*+^1U^!(^\"e^5*^(E^-a^*F^*{^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XjQ3XiYiXjRfXjAnXiJkXiJ6Xi4uXiEvXiEnXipBXit3XiorXjFVXiEoXiJlXjUqXihFXi1hXipGXip7XiEi",
      "byte_length": 63
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1ea2c6c127bf",
      "text": "「凡人們，看好了！吾乃威米亞斯，你們的毀滅者！準備領教吾之狂怒吧！」 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!#^+-^!<^*{^*A^*Q^+i^*D^*W^;b^/M^#&^'4^!9^$[^*A^*F^*{^&Z^%N^%t^'V^*W^,x^+\"^)s^,R^;b^!/^&8^#o^*I^*W^!$ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEjXistXiE8Xip7XipBXipRXitpXipEXipXXjtiXi9NXiMmXic0XiE5XiRbXipBXipGXip7XiZaXiVOXiV0XidWXipXXix4XisiXilzXixSXjtiXiEvXiY4XiNvXipJXipXXiEkIA==",
      "byte_length": 103
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2b6bf43599ae",
      "text": "再無多餘贅言，最後的決戰拉開了序幕…… ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!l^%}^\"x^1e^;o^1Y^*A^$q^#b^&Z^,o^$(^$6^)F^*D^;-^#Q^*o^*o ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFsXiV9XiJ4XjFlXjtvXjFZXipBXiRxXiNiXiZaXixvXiQoXiQ2XilGXipEXjstXiNRXipvXipvIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_08f414cd73ce",
      "text": "因擊潰德拉吉大軍，你的隊伍獲得了 20,000 點經驗值獎勵！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"]^$F^2-^#j^$6^\"D^\"z^..^*A^*F^&Z^)U^!F^&:^#e^*D 20,000 ^*;^'D^.P^!Z^7?^;a^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJdXiRGXjItXiNqXiQ2XiJEXiJ6Xi4uXipBXipGXiZaXilVXiFGXiY6XiNlXipEIDIwLDAwMCBeKjteJ0ReLlBeIVpeNz9eO2FeKlcg",
      "byte_length": 78
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9ade93e080fa",
      "text": "你從克拉西斯的屍身旁拾取了他的佩劍「屠龍劍」。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^#f^!d^$6^-l^$[^&Z^#?^(c^.h^7[^\":^*D^!@^&Z^.}^!|^!#^#A^*>^!|^!$^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiNmXiFkXiQ2Xi1sXiRbXiZaXiM/XihjXi5oXjdbXiI6XipEXiFAXiZaXi59XiF8XiEjXiNBXio+XiF8XiEkXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_21a7ac56bb22",
      "text": "「凡人們！你們已經證明了自己配得上無上的榮耀！你們反抗 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!#^+-^!<^*{^*W^*F^*{^#J^'D^-{^$c^*D^'l^#I^)&^#e^!'^%}^!'^&Z^,e^7D^*W^*F^*{^\"9^$4 ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEjXistXiE8Xip7XipXXipGXip7XiNKXidEXi17XiRjXipEXidsXiNJXikmXiNlXiEnXiV9XiEnXiZaXixlXjdEXipXXipGXip7XiI5XiQ0IA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0a54ecfc73bd",
      "text": "德拉吉大軍的英勇壯舉必將流芳百世——你們確實在阿塔斯的歷史長卷中 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#j^$6^\"D^\"z^..^&Z^'y^\"$^+b^01^#l^#7^%j^4`^&Y^*p^*n^*n^*F^*{^-6^#3^\"d^)M^\"o^$[^&Z^6^^1m^)C^\"3^!, ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNqXiQ2XiJEXiJ6Xi4uXiZaXid5XiIkXitiXjAxXiNsXiM3XiVqXjRgXiZZXipwXipuXipuXipGXip7Xi02XiMzXiJkXilNXiJvXiRbXiZaXjZeXjFtXilDXiIzXiEsIA==",
      "byte_length": 97
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b568897401bb",
      "text": "寫下了無比輝煌的篇章。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^/]^!(^*D^%}^,m^2K^2.^&Z^;m^3x^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi9dXiEoXipEXiV9XixtXjJLXjIuXiZaXjttXjN4XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7e4bf3b6ffb1",
      "text": "環顧四周吧！大軍已經潰不成軍，正爭先恐後地逃回城邦高牆之內。此刻 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&B^4n^\"[^\"L^*I^*W^\"z^..^#J^'D^2-^!)^$$^..^*A^%H^1I^!b^#t^#b^\"e^(p^\"\\^+_^1a^*+^&0^!/^!g^!\"^%I^.Y ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZCXjRuXiJbXiJMXipJXipXXiJ6Xi4uXiNKXidEXjItXiEpXiQkXi4uXipBXiVIXjFJXiFiXiN0XiNiXiJlXihwXiJcXitfXjFhXiorXiYwXiEvXiFnXiEiXiVJXi5ZIA==",
      "byte_length": 97
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9c77a7671c4b",
      "text": "正是慶祝勝利的時刻，因為我預見到，在未來你們將再也沒有這般閒暇了—— ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%H^,X^5P^&v^+5^!t^&Z^$f^.Y^*A^\"]^%{^$%^.E^-m^!u^*A^\"d^,_^!O^*F^*{^#7^!l^!1^%\\^$s^(s^'r^6A^;i^*D^*n^*n ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVIXixYXjVQXiZ2Xis1XiF0XiZaXiRmXi5ZXipBXiJdXiV7XiQlXi5FXi1tXiF1XipBXiJkXixfXiFPXipGXip7XiM3XiFsXiExXiVcXiRzXihzXidyXjZBXjtpXipEXipuXipuIA==",
      "byte_length": 103
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_51cb83e31991",
      "text": "你們的所作所為必將引來各方強大勢力的注目，無論正邪 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^&Z^$)^!M^$)^%{^#l^#7^#Z^!O^+>^$]^#]^\"z^\"&^!~^&Z^%e^&^^*A^%}^1\\^%H^)\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiZaXiQpXiFNXiQpXiV7XiNsXiM3XiNaXiFPXis+XiRdXiNdXiJ6XiImXiF+XiZaXiVlXiZeXipBXiV9XjFcXiVIXikiIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2b00182946c4",
      "text": "皆然。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^5j^&\"^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjVqXiYiXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 10
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8cebe5628871",
      "text": "然而，未來從無定數，如何理解我的預言全由你們自行參透。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&\"^'W^*A^,_^!O^#f^%}^#.^$V^*A^#$^!L^&A^(I^$%^&Z^.E^1Y^!h^&I^*F^*{^'l^(;^6K^(q^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiYiXidXXipBXixfXiFPXiNmXiV9XiMuXiRWXipBXiMkXiFMXiZBXihJXiQlXiZaXi5FXjFZXiFoXiZJXipGXip7XidsXig7XjZLXihxXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0429a07a1591",
      "text": "我現在將這場勝利留給你們。永別了，凡人們！願勝利永遠與你們常伴！」 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^&?^\"d^#7^(s^\"n^+5^!t^-+^'A^*F^*{^!\"^%W^*H^*D^*A^+-^!<^*{^*W^.H^+5^!t^%W^({^'p^*F^*{^#O^1h^*W^!$ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiY/XiJkXiM3XihzXiJuXis1XiF0Xi0rXidBXipGXip7XiEiXiVXXipIXipEXipBXistXiE8Xip7XipXXi5IXis1XiF0XiVXXih7XidwXipGXip7XiNPXjFoXipXXiEkIA==",
      "byte_length": 100
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_789641086be3",
      "text": "語畢，巨靈憑空消散，將這份勝利的榮耀留給了你們。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^0:^;k^*A^#H^)g^,5^'(^%k^$S^*A^#7^(s^*x^+5^!t^&Z^,e^7D^-+^'A^*D^*F^*{^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjA6XjtrXipBXiNIXilnXiw1XicoXiVrXiRTXipBXiM3XihzXip4Xis1XiF0XiZaXixlXjdEXi0rXidBXipEXipGXip7XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b82cd8bd4562",
      "text": "恭喜！你們已成功擊潰德拉吉大軍，通關了《浩劫殘陽：破碎大地》！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^1{^+V^*W^*F^*{^#J^$$^\"!^$F^2-^#j^$6^\"D^\"z^..^*A^(t^.>^*D^;_^5^^1l^,l^.@^*B^&n^&o^\"z^\"e^;`^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjF7XitWXipXXipGXip7XiNKXiQkXiIhXiRGXjItXiNqXiQ2XiJEXiJ6Xi4uXipBXih0Xi4+XipEXjtfXjVeXjFsXixsXi5AXipCXiZuXiZvXiJ6XiJlXjtgXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 94
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_dff5839b3c34",
      "text": "你們可以隨心所欲地繼續探索這片世界。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^\"A^!B^)X^#k^$)^4I^\"e^-O^'M^$>^'>^(s^&1^*p^.p^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiJBXiFCXilYXiNrXiQpXjRJXiJlXi1PXidNXiQ+Xic+XihzXiYxXipwXi5wXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_88a9278f27a6",
      "text": "「我們做到了！城邦今後要想踏出他們那道安穩的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!#^$%^*{^*~^!u^*D^*W^+_^1a^*E^#b^(C^,1^.,^!q^!@^*{^)!^(y^+p^-;^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEjXiQlXip7Xip+XiF1XipEXipXXitfXjFhXipFXiNiXihDXiwxXi4sXiFxXiFAXip7XikhXih5XitwXi07XiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0620bcf39231",
      "text": "高牆，可得好好掂量掂量了！能與你們並肩作戰真是太棒了，但我現在必須 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*+^&0^*A^\"A^#e^+i^+i^;f^)*^;f^)*^*D^*W^'b^'p^*F^*{^!+^:#^!M^$(^-2^,X^+f^%1^*D^*A^!I^$%^&?^\"d^#l^)r ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiorXiYwXipBXiJBXiNlXitpXitpXjtmXikqXjtmXikqXipEXipXXidiXidwXipGXip7XiErXjojXiFNXiQoXi0yXixYXitmXiUxXipEXipBXiFJXiQlXiY/XiJkXiNsXilyIA==",
      "byte_length": 100
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2d699c710107",
      "text": "趕回蓋德隆村，我妹妹需要人手幫忙照料傷患。後會有期。」 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^0u^\"\\^-d^#j^)T^$z^*A^$%^;d^;d^)e^(C^!<^$+^+}^,+^/x^/n^!^^;Q^!\"^#b^$r^$s^$u^!\"^!$ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjB1XiJcXi1kXiNqXilUXiR6XipBXiQlXjtkXjtkXillXihDXiE8XiQrXit9XiwrXi94Xi9uXiFeXjtRXiEiXiNiXiRyXiRzXiR1XiEiXiEkIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8e282dcf96a8",
      "text": "茉莉在一道耀眼的魔法光芒中消失了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'z^'{^\"d^!%^(y^7D^&d^&Z^*0^%b^!c^'u^!,^%k^\"|^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xid6Xid7XiJkXiElXih5XjdEXiZkXiZaXiowXiViXiFjXid1XiEsXiVrXiJ8XipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_523c7e1cfd2a",
      "text": "「太輝煌了！簡直太壯烈了！你們讓我見識了一場無與倫比的史詩戰役，我真不知該 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!#^+f^2K^2.^*D^*W^3y^&`^+f^+b^%|^*D^*W^*F^*{^-}^$%^-m^(R^*D^!%^\"n^%}^'p^/!^,m^&Z^1m^6u^$(^17^*A^$%^-2^!)^&h^(M ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEjXitmXjJLXjIuXipEXipXXjN5XiZgXitmXitiXiV8XipEXipXXipGXip7Xi19XiQlXi1tXihSXipEXiElXiJuXiV9XidwXi8hXixtXiZaXjFtXjZ1XiQoXjE3XipBXiQlXi0yXiEpXiZoXihNIA==",
      "byte_length": 112
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0fba6d596e24",
      "text": "如何感謝你們。拯救我們的恩情將永遠銘記在眾人心中——塞德里爾特全體村民 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#$^!L^#{^-z^*F^*{^!\"^,F^,Q^$%^*{^&Z^#v^,0^#7^%W^({^.;^(K^\"d^&e^!<^#k^!,^*n^*n^/(^#j^)(^&/^&5^!h^**^$z^%T ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiMkXiFMXiN7Xi16XipGXip7XiEiXixGXixRXiQlXip7XiZaXiN2XiwwXiM3XiVXXih7Xi47XihLXiJkXiZlXiE8XiNrXiEsXipuXipuXi8oXiNqXikoXiYvXiY1XiFoXioqXiR6XiVUIA==",
      "byte_length": 106
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1f8b2adfb02a",
      "text": "向你們致以最深摯的謝意。」 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+?^*F^*{^'o^!B^$q^2*^2#^&Z^-z^#z^!\"^!$ ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xis/XipGXip7XidvXiFCXiRxXjIqXjIjXiZaXi16XiN6XiEiXiEkIA==",
      "byte_length": 40
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_aa712bf43b38",
      "text": "副首領離去了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^52^)~^)s^)`^\"6^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjUyXil+XilzXilgXiI2XipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 22
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ca23d9a00148",
      "text": "「我謹代表蓋德隆村感謝各位，並祝你們旅途順遂。我必須 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!#^$%^8@^*v^-i^-d^#j^)T^$z^#{^-z^+>^!J^*A^!+^&v^*F^*{^2m^3.^.D^;p^!\"^$%^#l^)r ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEjXiQlXjhAXip2Xi1pXi1kXiNqXilUXiR6XiN7Xi16Xis+XiFKXipBXiErXiZ2XipGXip7XjJtXjMuXi5EXjtwXiEiXiQlXiNsXilyIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a5d204cdcecc",
      "text": "回村救治傷患了。再會。」 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"\\^$z^,Q^%_^!^^;Q^*D^!\"^!l^$r^!\"^!$ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJcXiR6XixRXiVfXiFeXjtRXipEXiEiXiFsXiRyXiEiXiEkIA==",
      "byte_length": 37
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5dd4385f830c",
      "text": "「能與你們並肩作戰是我無上的榮耀。歷史必將載錄這場 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!#^'b^'p^*F^*{^!+^:#^!M^$(^,X^$%^%}^!'^&Z^,e^7D^!\"^6^^1m^#l^#7^64^;<^(s^\"n ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEjXidiXidwXipGXip7XiErXjojXiFNXiQoXixYXiQlXiV9XiEnXiZaXixlXjdEXiEiXjZeXjFtXiNsXiM3XjY0Xjs8XihzXiJuIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fd7bf1c4a594",
      "text": "壯舉，而你們正是其中最耀眼的主角。祝你們好運。」 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+b^01^*A^'W^*F^*{^%H^,X^!j^!,^$q^7D^&d^&Z^!-^(H^!\"^&v^*F^*{^+i^.4^!\"^!$ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitiXjAxXipBXidXXipGXip7XiVIXixYXiFqXiEsXiRxXjdEXiZkXiZaXiEtXihIXiEiXiZ2XipGXip7XitpXi40XiEiXiEkIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_309338e61073",
      "text": "「對我們而言，這是無比輝煌的一天。城邦終於明白奴隸們 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!#^#:^$%^*{^'W^1Y^*A^(s^,X^%}^,m^2K^2.^&Z^!%^+e^!\"^+_^1a^-H^$^^$c^&X^##^)Z^*{ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEjXiM6XiQlXip7XidXXjFZXipBXihzXixYXiV9XixtXjJLXjIuXiZaXiElXitlXiEiXitfXjFhXi1IXiReXiRjXiZYXiMjXilaXip7IA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9543def51505",
      "text": "絕不會再逆來順受。你們為我們點亮了希望——謝謝你們。」 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-I^!)^$r^!l^8c^!O^.D^\";^!\"^*F^*{^%{^$%^*{^*;^*t^*D^+{^,]^*n^*n^-z^-z^*F^*{^!\"^!$ ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi1JXiEpXiRyXiFsXjhjXiFPXi5EXiI7XiEiXipGXip7XiV7XiQlXip7Xio7Xip0XipEXit7XixdXipuXipuXi16Xi16XipGXip7XiEiXiEkIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1ef493ac0a34",
      "text": "再見！我只想盡可能逃得離這裡越遠越好！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!l^-m^*W^$%^\"?^,1^-1^\"A^'b^(p^#e^)`^(s^-j^(]^({^(]^+i^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFsXi1tXipXXiQlXiI/XiwxXi0xXiJBXidiXihwXiNlXilgXihzXi1qXihdXih7XihdXitpXipX",
      "byte_length": 57
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_76831c5274fb",
      "text": "感謝你們還我自由！有什麼我能為你們效勞的嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#{^-z^*F^*{^.7^$%^'l^&I^*W^$s^!=^.T^$%^'b^%{^*F^*{^$Q^/R^&Z^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XiN7Xi16XipGXip7Xi43XiQlXidsXiZJXipXXiRzXiE9Xi5UXiQlXidiXiV7XipGXip7XiRRXi9SXiZaXitYXi5W",
      "byte_length": 66
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_17b12f7b3198",
      "text": "  你是在哪裡被抓的？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^,X^\"d^+I^-j^(@^$2^&Z^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeLFheImReK0leLWpeKEBeJDJeJlpeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5c6ff3aec33e",
      "text": "  他們已經啟程去討伐德拉吉了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^!@^*{^#J^'D^57^'#^\"6^-o^5)^#j^$6^\"D^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIUBeKnteI0peJ0ReNTdeJyNeIjZeLW9eNSleI2peJDZeIkReKkReISI=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fb348082be44",
      "text": "  我見過他們……更確切地說，是他們的殘骸。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^-m^(x^!@^*{^*o^*o^$o^-6^+.^\"e^-x^*A^,X^!@^*{^&Z^,l^*'^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeLW1eKHheIUBeKnteKm9eKm9eJG9eLTZeKy5eImVeLXheKkFeLFheIUBeKnteJlpeLGxeKideISI=",
      "byte_length": 62
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e61ddee7fbb0",
      "text": "我得走了。祝你們好運。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^#e^.&^*D^!\"^&v^*F^*{^+i^.4^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiNlXi4mXipEXiEiXiZ2XipGXip7XitpXi40XiEi",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_dd0e071678b3",
      "text": "一座早已覆滅的小村落。我們當時必須遷徙，於是組織了篷車隊 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!%^/_^,V^#J^(D^%t^&Z^#;^$z^-`^!\"^$%^*{^&N^$f^#l^)r^;~^;x^*A^$^^,X^2;^3z^*D^'1^5%^)U ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiElXi9fXixWXiNKXihEXiV0XiZaXiM7XiR6Xi1gXiEiXiQlXip7XiZOXiRmXiNsXilyXjt+Xjt4XipBXiReXixYXjI7XjN6XipEXicxXjUlXilVIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e6cf02ebaf2b",
      "text": "出發。就在離開村子不久後，我在前方探路時 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!q^&W^!\"^*J^\"d^)`^)F^$z^#(^!)^!.^#b^*A^$%^\"d^!z^$]^$>^(a^$f ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFxXiZXXiEiXipKXiJkXilgXilGXiR6XiMoXiEpXiEuXiNiXipBXiQlXiJkXiF6XiRdXiQ+XihhXiRmIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4079ae3f95dd",
      "text": "遭到了這群奴隸販子的伏擊。我根本不知道其他村民後來怎麼樣了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(}^!u^*D^(s^'R^##^)Z^6.^#(^&Z^3c^$F^!\"^$%^%)^$x^!)^&h^(y^!j^!@^$z^%T^#b^!O^,,^.T^,f^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xih9XiF1XipEXihzXidSXiMjXilaXjYuXiMoXiZaXjNjXiRGXiEiXiQlXiUpXiR4XiEpXiZoXih5XiFqXiFAXiR6XiVUXiNiXiFPXiwsXi5UXixmXipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 90
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1144b0f87496",
      "text": "後會有期。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#b^$r^$s^$u^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNiXiRyXiRzXiR1XiEi",
      "byte_length": 15
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f276c1fb8180",
      "text": "在南方，但我不知道有多遠。押解到這裡的路上我大半時間 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"d^\"/^$]^*A^!I^$%^!)^&h^(y^$s^\"x^({^!\"^7Z^(I^!u^(s^-j^&Z^(a^!'^$%^\"z^\"-^$f^)G ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJkXiIvXiRdXipBXiFJXiQlXiEpXiZoXih5XiRzXiJ4Xih7XiEiXjdaXihJXiF1XihzXi1qXiZaXihhXiEnXiQlXiJ6XiItXiRmXilHIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_82ab7c4b0bc5",
      "text": "都處於昏迷狀態。他們不想讓我知道怎麼找回我的篷車隊。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)$^(,^$^^$d^(n^&7^#|^!\"^!@^*{^!)^,1^-}^$%^&h^(y^,,^.T^$/^\"\\^$%^&Z^'1^5%^)U^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XikkXigsXiReXiRkXihuXiY3XiN8XiEiXiFAXip7XiEpXiwxXi19XiQlXiZoXih5XiwsXi5UXiQvXiJcXiQlXiZaXicxXjUlXilVXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d19598065071",
      "text": "這麼說他們還活著！這是我好長一段時間以來聽過最好的消息了！你 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^.T^-x^!@^*{^.7^%i^-a^*W^(s^,X^$%^+i^)C^!%^.l^$f^)G^!B^!O^-X^(x^$q^+i^&Z^%k^#w^*D^*W^*F ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXi5UXi14XiFAXip7Xi43XiVpXi1hXipXXihzXixYXiQlXitpXilDXiElXi5sXiRmXilHXiFCXiFPXi1YXih4XiRxXitpXiZaXiVrXiN3XipEXipXXipGIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fe7dee09009f",
      "text": "知道他們在哪裡嗎？這樣我就不用滿世界盲目尋找他們了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&h^(y^!@^*{^\"d^+I^-j^+X^.V^(s^,f^$%^*J^!)^&H^,{^*p^.p^&_^&^^#9^$/^!@^*{^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZoXih5XiFAXip7XiJkXitJXi1qXitYXi5WXihzXixmXiQlXipKXiEpXiZIXix7XipwXi5wXiZfXiZeXiM5XiQvXiFAXip7XipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0eef9f6f0700",
      "text": "不！你看到的肯定是另一群人！他們不可能死！我一定要找到他們！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^*W^*F^*Q^!u^&Z^-Z^#.^,X^\">^!%^'R^!<^*W^!@^*{^!)^\"A^'b^%L^*W^$%^!%^#.^(C^$/^!u^!@^*{^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXipXXipGXipRXiF1XiZaXi1aXiMuXixYXiI+XiElXidSXiE8XipXXiFAXip7XiEpXiJBXidiXiVMXipXXiQlXiElXiMuXihDXiQvXiF1XiFAXip7XipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e5ff28fc1fa2",
      "text": "別管我！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*H^-D^$%^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipIXi1EXiQlXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 13
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_99864aaf3c6c",
      "text": "再見了。我要用最快的速度逃離這裡。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!l^-m^*D^!\"^$%^(C^&H^$q^*L^&Z^(u^#V^(p^)`^(s^-j^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFsXi1tXipEXiEiXiQlXihDXiZIXiRxXipMXiZaXih1XiNWXihwXilgXihzXi1qXiEi",
      "byte_length": 51
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_35328bf2051d",
      "text": "謝謝你們！我原本都已經認命，做好了永世為奴的準備。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-z^-z^*F^*{^*W^$%^\"5^$x^)$^#J^'D^(O^\"N^*A^*~^+i^*D^%W^*p^%{^##^&Z^,x^+\"^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi16Xi16XipGXip7XipXXiQlXiI1XiR4XikkXiNKXidEXihPXiJOXipBXip+XitpXipEXiVXXipwXiV7XiMjXiZaXix4XisiXiEi",
      "byte_length": 75
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fcfdfeae58dd",
      "text": "  你知道關於那場軍事征伐的任何消息嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^&h^(y^.>^$^^)!^\"n^..^*r^.c^5)^&Z^!C^!L^%k^#w^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeJmheKHleLj5eJF5eKSFeIm5eLi5eKnJeLmNeNSleJlpeIUNeIUxeJWteI3deK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 56
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5d9baed17201",
      "text": "  你現在打算回村子去嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^&?^\"d^$-^-C^\"\\^$z^#(^\"6^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeJj9eImReJC1eLUNeIlxeJHpeIyheIjZeK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_23d8fdcb03e6",
      "text": "  特奎策爾村正在備戰。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^&5^5B^5p^&/^$z^%H^\"d^+\"^$(^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJjVeNUJeNXBeJi9eJHpeJUheImReKyJeJCheISIg",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_80868b01a51c",
      "text": "  這場軍事行動的目標就是那些奴隸村落。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^(s^\"n^..^*r^(;^\"%^&Z^&^^%9^*J^,X^)!^!8^##^)Z^$z^-`^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKHNeIm5eLi5eKnJeKDteIiVeJlpeJl5eJTleKkpeLFheKSFeITheIyNeKVpeJHpeLWBeISIg",
      "byte_length": 57
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7b6ac1bec561",
      "text": "祝好運。我得動身了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&v^+i^.4^!\"^$%^#e^\"%^(c^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZ2XitpXi40XiEiXiQlXiNlXiIlXihjXipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fecbe0c2670e",
      "text": "我現在要設法回我的村子了。祝你們好運。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^&?^\"d^(C^4e^%b^\"\\^$%^&Z^$z^#(^*D^!\"^&v^*F^*{^+i^.4^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiY/XiJkXihDXjRlXiViXiJcXiQlXiZaXiR6XiMoXipEXiEiXiZ2XipGXip7XitpXi40XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c6e314f7d376",
      "text": "我來自特奎策爾村。我是在村外不遠處被抓獲的。顯然這幫 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^!O^'l^&5^5B^5p^&/^$z^!\"^$%^,X^\"d^$z^\"w^!)^({^(,^(@^$2^&:^&Z^!\"^4&^&\"^(s^+} ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiFPXidsXiY1XjVCXjVwXiYvXiR6XiEiXiQlXixYXiJkXiR6XiJ3XiEpXih7XigsXihAXiQyXiY6XiZaXiEiXjQmXiYiXihzXit9IA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d13d8fa16c65",
      "text": "奴隸販子到處搜捕逃奴，是為了充當即將展開的某場大征伐的兵力。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^##^)Z^6.^#(^!u^(,^/h^4?^(p^##^*A^,X^%{^*D^5.^&N^\"1^#7^+x^)F^&Z^%$^\"n^\"z^.c^5)^&Z^+,^!~^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiMjXilaXjYuXiMoXiF1XigsXi9oXjQ/XihwXiMjXipBXixYXiV7XipEXjUuXiZOXiIxXiM3Xit4XilGXiZaXiUkXiJuXiJ6Xi5jXjUpXiZaXissXiF+XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_415b859bdf20",
      "text": "我猜是在這裡的西南方。不過我也拿不準。他們把我押來時我昏過去了， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^-'^,X^\"d^(s^-j^&Z^-l^\"/^$]^!\"^!)^(x^$%^!1^,G^!)^,x^!\"^!@^*{^$1^$%^7Z^!O^$f^$%^$d^(x^\"6^*D^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXi0nXixYXiJkXihzXi1qXiZaXi1sXiIvXiRdXiEiXiEpXih4XiQlXiExXixHXiEpXix4XiEiXiFAXip7XiQxXiQlXjdaXiFPXiRmXiQlXiRkXih4XiI2XipEXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 97
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d109b4aee6d9",
      "text": "但我聽他們閒聊時提過是在西南方向。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!I^$%^-X^!@^*{^6A^-U^$f^$A^(x^,X^\"d^-l^\"/^$]^+?^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFJXiQlXi1YXiFAXip7XjZBXi1VXiRmXiRBXih4XixYXiJkXi1sXiIvXiRdXis/XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b2dcb1fcf242",
      "text": "所知甚少。我只聽他們提過有聖堂武士在荒原各處搜捕 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$)^&h^/|^#<^!\"^$%^\"?^-X^!@^*{^$A^(x^$s^'Z^42^%J^+a^\"d^1W^\"5^+>^(,^/h^4? ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQpXiZoXi98XiM8XiEiXiQlXiI/Xi1YXiFAXip7XiRBXih4XiRzXidaXjQyXiVKXithXiJkXjFXXiI1Xis+XigsXi9oXjQ/IA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_33d30ba1e2ee",
      "text": "奴隸以補充兵源，但我不知道他們的進攻目標究竟是誰 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^##^)Z^!B^6&^5.^+,^%q^*A^!I^$%^!)^&h^(y^!@^*{^&Z^(w^$O^&^^%9^-<^28^,X^-y ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiMjXilaXiFCXjYmXjUuXissXiVxXipBXiFJXiQlXiEpXiZoXih5XiFAXip7XiZaXih3XiRPXiZeXiU5Xi08XjI4XixYXi15IA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_377e7fb80d4f",
      "text": "。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 4
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ace541799244",
      "text": "這麼看來，先知的預言似乎真的要應驗了。我所聽聞的預言描述 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^.T^*Q^!O^*A^!b^&h^&Z^.E^1Y^!H^!0^-2^&Z^(C^0`^.P^*D^!\"^$%^$)^-X^4^^&Z^.E^1Y^/g^68 ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXi5UXipRXiFPXipBXiFiXiZoXiZaXi5FXjFZXiFIXiEwXi0yXiZaXihDXjBgXi5QXipEXiEiXiQlXiQpXi1YXjReXiZaXi5FXjFZXi9nXjY4IA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_dc55f6b739b9",
      "text": "確實無比淒慘。但願特奎策爾村能夠挺過這場浩劫 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-6^#3^%}^,m^,t^,4^!\"^!I^.H^&5^5B^5p^&/^$z^'b^+d^,I^(x^(s^\"n^5^^1l ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi02XiMzXiV9XixtXix0Xiw0XiEiXiFJXi5IXiY1XjVCXjVwXiYvXiR6XidiXitkXixJXih4XihzXiJuXjVeXjFsIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b5deb04c890a",
      "text": "。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 4
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2036abab9b4f",
      "text": "沒錯，這完全吻合先知的預言。我非常擔心特奎策爾以及其他 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%\\^)5^*A^(s^#,^!h^;t^\"C^!b^&h^&Z^.E^1Y^!\"^$%^)i^#O^*N^#k^&5^5B^5p^&/^!B^\"7^!j^!@ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVcXik1XipBXihzXiMsXiFoXjt0XiJDXiFiXiZoXiZaXi5FXjFZXiEiXiQlXilpXiNPXipOXiNrXiY1XjVCXjVwXiYvXiFCXiI3XiFqXiFAIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e1e0d5470393",
      "text": "奴隸村落的命運。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^##^)Z^$z^-`^&Z^\"N^.4^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiMjXilaXiR6Xi1gXiZaXiJOXi40XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ce84e1d38508",
      "text": "是的，我必須設法回村。必須儘早提醒他們提防聖堂武士與捕奴隊。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,X^&Z^*A^$%^#l^)r^4e^%b^\"\\^$z^!\"^#l^)r^+(^,V^$A^.9^!@^*{^$A^)K^'Z^42^%J^+a^'p^4?^##^)U^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XixYXiZaXipBXiQlXiNsXilyXjRlXiViXiJcXiR6XiEiXiNsXilyXisoXixWXiRBXi45XiFAXip7XiRBXilLXidaXjQyXiVKXithXidwXjQ/XiMjXilVXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_511a280cdaf9",
      "text": "保重。我要離開這鬼地方了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!T^))^!\"^$%^(C^)`^)F^(s^*-^\"e^$]^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFUXikpXiEiXiQlXihDXilgXilGXihzXiotXiJlXiRdXipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_09e78292f2a2",
      "text": "謝謝你們。你們是誰？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-z^-z^*F^*{^!\"^*F^*{^,X^-y^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi16Xi16XipGXip7XiEiXipGXip7XixYXi15Xi5W",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_34459e9259c3",
      "text": "  我是角鬥士。你又是誰？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^,X^(H^*,^+a^!\"^*F^+;^,X^-y^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeLFheKEheKixeK2FeISJeKkZeKzteLFheLXleLlY=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_29308cd39e4a",
      "text": "  威米亞斯是誰？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^#&^'4^!9^$[^,X^-y^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIyZeJzReITleJFteLFheLXleLlY=",
      "byte_length": 23
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6559683206b0",
      "text": "  威米亞斯已經不在了。我收拾了他。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^#&^'4^!9^$[^#J^'D^!)^\"d^*D^!\"^$%^$M^7[^*D^!@^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIyZeJzReITleJFteI0peJ0ReISleImReKkReISJeJCVeJE1eN1teKkReIUBeISIg",
      "byte_length": 51
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4d75b2818ae9",
      "text": "  大家都死了。威米亞斯把他們全殺光了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^\"z^+s^)$^%L^*D^!\"^#&^'4^!9^$[^$1^!@^*{^!h^%M^!c^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeInpeK3NeKSReJUxeKkReISJeIyZeJzReITleJFteJDFeIUBeKnteIWheJU1eIWNeKkReISI=",
      "byte_length": 56
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f2a4e90727e1",
      "text": "  是的，大家都安然無恙。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^,X^&Z^*A^\"z^+s^)$^+p^&\"^%}^;A^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLFheJlpeKkFeInpeK3NeKSReK3BeJiJeJX1eO0FeISIg",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e843271fbcc8",
      "text": "  蓋德隆村正在全力備戰。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^-d^#j^)T^$z^%H^\"d^!h^!~^+\"^$(^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLWReI2peKVReJHpeJUheImReIWheIX5eKyJeJCheISIg",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2caf9be15c13",
      "text": "  他們已與特奎策爾村結盟，共同對抗德拉吉",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^!@^*{^#J^'p^&5^5B^5p^&/^$z^'@^-0^*A^3d^\"E^#:^$4^#j^$6^\"D",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIUBeKnteI0peJ3BeJjVeNUJeNXBeJi9eJHpeJ0BeLTBeKkFeM2ReIkVeIzpeJDReI2peJDZeIkQ=",
      "byte_length": 59
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cf49e8136e69",
      "text": "\t我見過威米亞斯。他確實殘酷無情。",
      "encoded_ascii": "\t^$%^-m^(x^#&^'4^!9^$[^!\"^!@^-6^#3^,l^1b^%}^,0^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "CV4kJV4tbV4oeF4jJl4nNF4hOV4kW14hIl4hQF4tNl4jM14sbF4xYl4lfV4sMF4hIg==",
      "byte_length": 49
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fa5c9a4d465d",
      "text": "祝你們好運。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&v^*F^*{^+i^.4^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZ2XipGXip7XitpXi40XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 19
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_26b410ff8e5c",
      "text": "我是來自蓋德隆村的戰士。我是被威米亞斯賣給這群捕奴隊的，他是個 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^,X^!O^'l^-d^#j^)T^$z^&Z^$(^+a^!\"^$%^,X^(@^#&^'4^!9^$[^.$^'A^(s^'R^4?^##^)U^&Z^*A^!@^,X^!V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXixYXiFPXidsXi1kXiNqXilUXiR6XiZaXiQoXithXiEiXiQlXixYXihAXiMmXic0XiE5XiRbXi4kXidBXihzXidSXjQ/XiMjXilVXiZaXipBXiFAXixYXiFWIA==",
      "byte_length": 94
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_93773d7c6fbd",
      "text": "肆虐恐嚇我們村莊的邪惡法師。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^2>^3)^#t^\"X^$%^*{^$z^6l^&Z^)\"^#y^%b^#M^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XjI+XjMpXiN0XiJYXiQlXip7XiR6XjZsXiZaXikiXiN5XiViXiNNXiEi",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_94ee92044483",
      "text": "是的，他的法力極其強大，我非常擔心蓋德隆村。請千萬別去招惹他，那 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,X^&Z^*A^!@^&Z^%b^!~^1D^!j^#]^\"z^*A^$%^)i^#O^*N^#k^-d^#j^)T^$z^!\"^*S^+7^-_^*H^\"6^,D^3s^!@^*A^)! ",
      "encoded_base64": "XixYXiZaXipBXiFAXiZaXiViXiF+XjFEXiFqXiNdXiJ6XipBXiQlXilpXiNPXipOXiNrXi1kXiNqXilUXiR6XiEiXipTXis3Xi1fXipIXiI2XixEXjNzXiFAXipBXikhIA==",
      "byte_length": 97
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6e466d978a56",
      "text": "可能會危及我的家人。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"A^'b^$r^2\\^\"7^$%^&Z^+s^!<^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJBXidiXiRyXjJcXiI3XiQlXiZaXitzXiE8XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 31
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f5a15c16ccdd",
      "text": "我想是在遙遠的西方——靠近淤泥海。這幫奴隸販子押著我走了那麼久， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^,1^,X^\"d^4j^({^&Z^-l^$]^*n^*n^.C^(l^6c^%d^6`^!\"^(s^+}^##^)Z^6.^#(^7Z^-a^$%^.&^*D^)!^.T^!.^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiwxXixYXiJkXjRqXih7XiZaXi1sXiRdXipuXipuXi5DXihsXjZjXiVkXjZgXiEiXihzXit9XiMjXilaXjYuXiMoXjdaXi1hXiQlXi4mXipEXikhXi5UXiEuXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 97
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_012cb555a496",
      "text": "我早就完全失去方向感了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^,V^*J^#,^!h^\"|^\"6^$]^+?^#{^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXixWXipKXiMsXiFoXiJ8XiI2XiRdXis/XiN7XipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 37
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fdcd660171f4",
      "text": "威米亞斯是個荒蕪術士。他控制了所有村民和村長。我 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#&^'4^!9^$[^,X^!V^1W^4b^(<^+a^!\"^!@^$@^!v^*D^$)^$s^$z^%T^\"O^$z^)C^!\"^$% ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiMmXic0XiE5XiRbXixYXiFWXjFXXjRiXig8XithXiEiXiFAXiRAXiF2XipEXiQpXiRzXiR6XiVUXiJPXiR6XilDXiEiXiQlIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5d55348e3ef8",
      "text": "不知道他到底圖謀什麼，我們被驅逐出來，並被警告要是敢回去，他就會 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^&h^(y^!@^!u^/^^\"b^3~^!=^.T^*A^$%^*{^(@^*#^(r^!q^!O^*A^!+^(@^(S^+B^(C^,X^/m^\"\\^\"6^*A^!@^*J^$r ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXiZoXih5XiFAXiF1Xi9eXiJiXjN+XiE9Xi5UXipBXiQlXip7XihAXiojXihyXiFxXiFPXipBXiErXihAXihTXitCXihDXixYXi9tXiJcXiI2XipBXiFAXipKXiRyIA==",
      "byte_length": 97
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e7c10be93ab8",
      "text": "殺死我們的家人。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%M^%L^$%^*{^&Z^+s^!<^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVNXiVMXiQlXip7XiZaXitzXiE8XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_13070a158efc",
      "text": "不在了？你們能與那種怪物抗衡，實力必定非同凡響。那蓋德隆村 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^\"d^*D^.V^*F^*{^'b^'p^)!^'$^#s^&4^$4^8P^*A^#3^!~^#l^#.^)i^\"E^+-^)o^!\"^)!^-d^#j^)T^$z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXiJkXipEXi5WXipGXip7XidiXidwXikhXickXiNzXiY0XiQ0XjhQXipBXiMzXiF+XiNsXiMuXilpXiJFXistXilvXiEiXikhXi1kXiNqXilUXiR6IA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_acf094c5e76b",
      "text": "如今恢復平靜了嗎？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#$^*E^#u^#g^0Y^)h^*D^+X^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiMkXipFXiN1XiNnXjBZXiloXipEXitYXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 28
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b56fef226133",
      "text": "我……我不敢相信！怎麼會這樣？！我必須立刻回村！你們一定是在開玩笑！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*o^*o^$%^!)^/m^&a^!U^*W^,,^.T^$r^(s^,f^.V^*W^$%^#l^)r^0'^.Y^\"\\^$z^*W^*F^*{^!%^#.^,X^\"d^)F^4U^-@^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXipvXipvXiQlXiEpXi9tXiZhXiFVXipXXiwsXi5UXiRyXihzXixmXi5WXipXXiQlXiNsXilyXjAnXi5ZXiJcXiR6XipXXipGXip7XiElXiMuXixYXiJkXilGXjRVXi1AXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 103
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_64299a0a35e2",
      "text": "別管我！我必須馬上趕回蓋德隆村！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*H^-D^$%^*W^$%^#l^)r^*\"^!'^0u^\"\\^-d^#j^)T^$z^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipIXi1EXiQlXipXXiQlXiNsXilyXioiXiEnXjB1XiJcXi1kXiNqXilUXiR6XipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 49
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_46f258256fcc",
      "text": "聽你們這麼說真是太好了。我得回去找他們了。我已經很久沒有見到家人了 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-X^*F^*{^(s^.T^-x^-2^,X^+f^+i^*D^!\"^$%^#e^\"\\^\"6^$/^!@^*{^*D^!\"^$%^#J^'D^*K^!.^%\\^$s^-m^!u^+s^!<^*D ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi1YXipGXip7XihzXi5UXi14Xi0yXixYXitmXitpXipEXiEiXiQlXiNlXiJcXiI2XiQvXiFAXip7XipEXiEiXiQlXiNKXidEXipLXiEuXiVcXiRzXi1tXiF1XitzXiE8XipEIA==",
      "byte_length": 100
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_eb5cf9384392",
      "text": "。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 4
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_53da40a75786",
      "text": "打仗？蓋德隆村怎麼可能參戰？我們根本不是任何人的對手！光是一個 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$-^0|^.V^-d^#j^)T^$z^,,^.T^\"A^'b^6K^$(^.V^$%^*{^%)^$x^!)^,X^!C^!L^!<^&Z^#:^$+^*W^!c^,X^!%^!V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQtXjB8Xi5WXi1kXiNqXilUXiR6XiwsXi5UXiJBXidiXjZLXiQoXi5WXiQlXip7XiUpXiR4XiEpXixYXiFDXiFMXiE8XiZaXiM6XiQrXipXXiFjXixYXiElXiFWIA==",
      "byte_length": 94
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_786c82265dd3",
      "text": "荒蕪術士就差點讓我們全村覆滅！我們到底在跟誰打仗？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^1W^4b^(<^+a^*J^48^*;^-}^$%^*{^!h^$z^(D^%t^*W^$%^*{^!u^/^^\"d^.+^-y^$-^0|^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjFXXjRiXig8XithXipKXjQ4Xio7Xi19XiQlXip7XiFoXiR6XihEXiV0XipXXiQlXip7XiF1Xi9eXiJkXi4rXi15XiQtXjB8Xi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f62cd954d1a8",
      "text": "跟德拉吉打？！他們肯定是瘋了！我必須趕快回村 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.+^#j^$6^\"D^$-^.V^*W^!@^*{^-Z^#.^,X^-/^*D^*W^$%^#l^)r^0u^*L^\"\\^$z ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi4rXiNqXiQ2XiJEXiQtXi5WXipXXiFAXip7Xi1aXiMuXixYXi0vXipEXipXXiQlXiNsXilyXjB1XipMXiJcXiR6IA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f6f6990c8d05",
      "text": "親眼去看看。多謝你們相助。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(F^&d^\"6^*Q^*Q^!\"^\"x^-z^*F^*{^&a^\"#^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihGXiZkXiI2XipRXipRXiEiXiJ4Xi16XipGXip7XiZhXiIjXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 40
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_373bfd9712c6",
      "text": "  你是怎麼來到這裡的？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^,X^,,^.T^!O^!u^(s^-j^&Z^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeLFheLCxeLlReIU9eIXVeKHNeLWpeJlpeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_72e2704bf607",
      "text": "  你為什麼不設法逃跑？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^%{^!=^.T^!)^4e^%b^(p^(_^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeJXteIT1eLlReISleNGVeJWJeKHBeKF9eLlY=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6e5eab3e9663",
      "text": "沒事了。再見。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%\\^*r^*D^!\"^!l^-m^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVcXipyXipEXiEiXiFsXi1tXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 22
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c1aa3f9f3e11",
      "text": "我們被嚴禁談論這類事情。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^(@^1*^&y^0;^1\\^(s^)w^*r^,0^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7XihAXjEqXiZ5XjA7XjFcXihzXil3XipyXiwwXiEi",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bcacda0271f9",
      "text": "逃跑是被嚴厲禁止的。敢嘗試的人注定只有死路一條。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(p^(_^,X^(@^1*^+:^&y^%G^&Z^!\"^/m^1o^-u^&Z^!<^%e^#.^\"?^$s^%L^(a^!%^%.^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihwXihfXixYXihAXjEqXis6XiZ5XiVHXiZaXiEiXi9tXjFvXi11XiZaXiE8XiVlXiMuXiI/XiRzXiVMXihhXiElXiUuXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_85ed99be789e",
      "text": "住手！那些奴隸可是值錢的財產！再敢動一下你們就死定了！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*z^$+^*W^)!^!8^##^)Z^\"A^,X^!Z^.<^&Z^0=^&G^*W^!l^/m^\"%^!%^!(^*F^*{^*J^%L^#.^*D^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xip6XiQrXipXXikhXiE4XiMjXilaXiJBXixYXiFaXi48XiZaXjA9XiZHXipXXiFsXi9tXiIlXiElXiEoXipGXip7XipKXiVMXiMuXipEXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_873027adeaa4",
      "text": "我警告過你們了！衛兵！把入侵者全宰了！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^(S^+B^(x^*F^*{^*D^*W^(=^+,^*W^$1^!f^.X^'V^!h^1w^*D^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXihTXitCXih4XipGXip7XipEXipXXig9XissXipXXiQxXiFmXi5YXidWXiFoXjF3XipEXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_faf8180837da",
      "text": "站住！是誰膽敢靠近大門？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^->^*z^*W^,X^-y^-[^/m^.C^(l^\"z^)D^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi0+Xip6XipXXixYXi15Xi1bXi9tXi5DXihsXiJ6XilEXi5W",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a6ee8464115d",
      "text": "站住！哦，是你們啊。甚少有人敢再次折返門前 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^->^*z^*W^+H^*A^,X^*F^*{^+Q^!\"^/|^#<^$s^!<^/m^!l^%D^,?^7J^)D^!z ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi0+Xip6XipXXitIXipBXixYXipGXip7XitRXiEiXi98XiM8XiRzXiE8Xi9tXiFsXiVEXiw/XjdKXilEXiF6IA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_dafc8fb3cb7d",
      "text": "與我對峙。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'p^$%^#:^;v^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XidwXiQlXiM6Xjt2XiEi",
      "byte_length": 15
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c71aabd62e05",
      "text": "你好，朋友。有什麼我能為你效勞的嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^+i^*A^,[^\"8^!\"^$s^!=^.T^$%^'b^%{^*F^$Q^/R^&Z^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXitpXipBXixbXiI4XiEiXiRzXiE9Xi5UXiQlXidiXiV7XipGXiRRXi9SXiZaXitYXi5W",
      "byte_length": 54
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0190b8c404c6",
      "text": "  我不是來劫掠的。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^!)^,X^!O^1l^1<^&Z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeISleLFheIU9eMWxeMTxeJlpeISI=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b4c3fed79c0a",
      "text": "  沒有任何幽魂能對我指手畫腳！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^%\\^$s^!C^!L^2f^*.^'b^#:^$%^$8^$+^-,^00^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJVxeJHNeIUNeIUxeMmZeKi5eJ2JeIzpeJCVeJDheJCteLSxeMDBeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fbe8c29375dd",
      "text": "  我只是一名尋求庇護的流浪者。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^\"?^,X^!%^\"F^#9^,n^,\"^(T^&Z^%j^,r^'V^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeIj9eLFheISVeIkZeIzleLG5eLCJeKFReJlpeJWpeLHJeJ1ZeISI=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b5455074ec9e",
      "text": "  這裡是泰南神廟的一部分嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^(s^-j^,X^%f^\"/^&w^0[^&Z^!%^)#^!s^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKHNeLWpeLFheJWZeIi9eJndeMFteJlpeISVeKSNeIXNeK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c63381feab5c",
      "text": "  泰南派我前來尋找某樣東西。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^%f^\"/^.n^$%^!z^!O^#9^$/^%$^,f^,`^-l^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJWZeIi9eLm5eJCVeIXpeIU9eIzleJC9eJSReLGZeLGBeLWxeISI=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b90cbbe43172",
      "text": "  阿波斯告訴了我這裡發生的事。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^)M^%c^$[^+B^-t^*D^$%^(s^-j^&W^&F^&Z^*r^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKU1eJWNeJFteK0JeLXReKkReJCVeKHNeLWpeJldeJkZeJlpeKnJeISI=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_93079dd53d7b",
      "text": "  我在尋找崔斯特姆。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^\"d^#9^$/^#E^$[^&5^#%^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeImReIzleJC9eI0VeJFteJjVeIyVeISI=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4cf5dc7585be",
      "text": "  泰南要我找到她。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^%f^\"/^(C^$%^$/^!u^+h^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJWZeIi9eKENeJCVeJC9eIXVeK2heISI=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c21d731dba56",
      "text": "  阿波斯跟我提起過她。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^)M^%c^$[^.+^$%^$A^.(^(x^+h^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKU1eJWNeJFteLiteJCVeJEFeLiheKHheK2heISI=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_418365653d89",
      "text": "  為什麼這裡幾乎沒什麼可搜刮的？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^%{^!=^.T^(s^-j^#T^!0^%\\^!=^.T^\"A^/h^;r^&Z^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJXteIT1eLlReKHNeLWpeI1ReITBeJVxeIT1eLlReIkFeL2heO3JeJlpeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 47
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_68796b279850",
      "text": "  這扇大門通往何處？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^(s^$*^\"z^)D^(t^,)^!L^(,^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKHNeJCpeInpeKUReKHReLCleIUxeKCxeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e3fbb2890ad4",
      "text": "我現在必須離開了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^&?^\"d^#l^)r^)`^)F^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiY/XiJkXiNsXilyXilgXilGXipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f3ddc68104ed",
      "text": "倘若你們是來劫掠的，就拔出兵刃吧。守護所剩無幾的殘存之物 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^;q^'x^*F^*{^,X^!O^1l^1<^&Z^*A^*J^/c^!q^+,^!r^*I^!\"^#+^(T^$)^8U^%}^#T^&Z^,l^#*^!/^&4 ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjtxXid4XipGXip7XixYXiFPXjFsXjE8XiZaXipBXipKXi9jXiFxXissXiFyXipJXiEiXiMrXihUXiQpXjhVXiV9XiNUXiZaXixsXiMqXiEvXiY0IA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e28098506b5c",
      "text": "乃是我的神聖職責。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^/M^,X^$%^&Z^&w^'Z^'\\^0>^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi9NXixYXiQlXiZaXiZ3XidaXidcXjA+XiEi",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0b97c63be373",
      "text": "不是？踏進這座被詛咒的殿堂幾乎沒有別的理由。報上 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^,X^.V^.,^(w^(s^/_^(@^(L^\"P^&Z^.m^42^#T^!0^%\\^$s^*H^&Z^&A^&I^!\"^+`^!' ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXixYXi5WXi4sXih3XihzXi9fXihAXihMXiJQXiZaXi5tXjQyXiNUXiEwXiVcXiRzXipIXiZaXiZBXiZJXiEiXitgXiEnIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_11b2b86f13c0",
      "text": "來意吧。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!O^#z^*I^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFPXiN6XipJXiEi",
      "byte_length": 12
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9c8f25cb4b80",
      "text": "你以為不能？這將會是你生前說的最後一句話！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^!B^%{^!)^'b^.V^(s^#7^$r^,X^*F^&F^!z^-x^&Z^$q^#b^!%^2]^-v^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiFCXiV7XiEpXidiXi5WXihzXiM3XiRyXixYXipGXiZGXiF6Xi14XiZaXiRxXiNiXiElXjJdXi12XipX",
      "byte_length": 63
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_53d27b8ebdfd",
      "text": "倘若你所謂的庇護是指安全歇息之所，還是去別處找吧。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^;q^'x^*F^$)^0s^&Z^,\"^(T^,X^$8^+p^!h^%E^#w^!/^$)^*A^.7^,X^\"6^*H^(,^$/^*I^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjtxXid4XipGXiQpXjBzXiZaXiwiXihUXixYXiQ4XitwXiFoXiVFXiN3XiEvXiQpXipBXi43XixYXiI2XipIXigsXiQvXipJXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_218b599fad48",
      "text": "這裡只有永無止境的躁動與凶險。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^-j^\"?^$s^%W^%}^%G^\"q^&Z^4\"^\"%^'p^3e^*m^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXi1qXiI/XiRzXiVXXiV9XiVHXiJxXiZaXjQiXiIlXidwXjNlXiptXiEi",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8ce0a3e2229c",
      "text": "正是如此。你怎會知曉我家主人的事？難道說 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%H^,X^#$^%I^!\"^*F^,,^$r^&h^7y^$%^+s^!-^!<^&Z^*r^.V^)a^(y^-x ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVIXixYXiMkXiVJXiEiXipGXiwsXiRyXiZoXjd5XiQlXitzXiEtXiE8XiZaXipyXi5WXilhXih5Xi14IA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d7a14d6c8646",
      "text": "他的尊名當真流傳至今？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^&Z^+u^\"F^&N^-2^%j^+$^'n^*E^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXiZaXit1XiJGXiZOXi0yXiVqXiskXiduXipFXi5W",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f92740cb5daf",
      "text": "偉大泰南的幽魂在上，我就知道他必定會找到破解這道詛咒的辦法！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*}^\"z^%f^\"/^&Z^2f^*.^\"d^!'^*A^$%^*J^&h^(y^!@^#l^#.^$r^$/^!u^&n^(I^(s^(y^(L^\"P^&Z^2L^%b^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xip9XiJ6XiVmXiIvXiZaXjJmXiouXiJkXiEnXipBXiQlXipKXiZoXih5XiFAXiNsXiMuXiRyXiQvXiF1XiZuXihJXihzXih5XihMXiJQXiZaXjJMXiViXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d05633a5bc40",
      "text": "若有任何我能效勞之處，儘管開口便是。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'x^$s^!C^!L^$%^'b^$Q^/R^!/^(,^*A^+(^-D^)F^\"<^!R^,X^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xid4XiRzXiFDXiFMXiQlXidiXiRRXi9SXiEvXigsXipBXisoXi1EXilGXiI8XiFSXixYXiEi",
      "byte_length": 54
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ac895b715bfc",
      "text": "那位女士？你怎麼會知道那位女士？你必須擊敗我靈魂的所有 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^!J^#\"^+a^.V^*F^,,^.T^$r^&h^(y^)!^!J^#\"^+a^.V^*F^#l^)r^$F^$R^$%^)g^*.^&Z^$)^$s ",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXiFKXiMiXithXi5WXipGXiwsXi5UXiRyXiZoXih5XikhXiFKXiMiXithXi5WXipGXiNsXilyXiRGXiRSXiQlXilnXiouXiZaXiQpXiRzIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b1f7ffe85fb9",
      "text": "化身，才能接近她！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\")^(c^*A^$,^'b^$?^(l^+h^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiIpXihjXipBXiQsXidiXiQ/XihsXitoXipX",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a405a912a2c0",
      "text": "阿波斯！諸神在上，那個名字將是你此生吐出的最後遺言！他就是 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)M^%c^$[^*W^1]^&w^\"d^!'^*A^)!^!V^\"F^#)^#7^,X^*F^%I^&F^\"G^!q^&Z^$q^#b^0v^1Y^*W^!@^*J^,X ",
      "encoded_base64": "XilNXiVjXiRbXipXXjFdXiZ3XiJkXiEnXipBXikhXiFWXiJGXiMpXiM3XixYXipGXiVJXiZGXiJHXiFxXiZaXiRxXiNiXjB2XjFZXipXXiFAXipKXixYIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5c7ddd626c02",
      "text": "一切無盡痛苦的罪魁禍首！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!%^+.^%}^-1^-.^.t^&Z^5x^<!^7B^)~^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiElXisuXiV9Xi0xXi0uXi50XiZaXjV4XjwhXjdCXil+XipX",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_04c93b40c286",
      "text": "是我家主人派你們來找她的？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,X^$%^+s^!-^!<^.n^*F^*{^!O^$/^+h^&Z^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XixYXiQlXitzXiEtXiE8Xi5uXipGXip7XiFPXiQvXitoXiZaXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 40
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_31fc35d6d9f8",
      "text": "許多像你們這樣的冒險者曾踏遍這座大殿尋找 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-s^\"x^!`^*F^*{^(s^,f^&Z^/P^*m^'V^.j^.,^69^(s^/_^\"z^.m^#9^$/ ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi1zXiJ4XiFgXipGXip7XihzXixmXiZaXi9QXiptXidWXi5qXi4sXjY5XihzXi9fXiJ6Xi5tXiM5XiQvIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7589299fe96e",
      "text": "失落的寶藏。我的佩劍早已被他們的鮮血染得通紅。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"|^-`^&Z^#4^-f^!\"^$%^&Z^.}^!|^,V^#J^(@^!@^*{^&Z^35^(:^%%^#e^(t^3!^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJ8Xi1gXiZaXiM0Xi1mXiEiXiQlXiZaXi59XiF8XixWXiNKXihAXiFAXip7XiZaXjM1Xig6XiUlXiNlXih0XjMhXiEi",
      "byte_length": 69
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_751e8adea9cd",
      "text": "齊弗蘭。前門守衛。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^36^#[^/G^!\"^!z^)D^#+^(=^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XjM2XiNbXi9HXiEiXiF6XilEXiMrXig9XiEi",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_084dd4e83f55",
      "text": "哪裡也去不了。但在過去，它曾是連通這座神廟與外界 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+I^-j^!1^\"6^!)^*D^!\"^!I^\"d^(x^\"6^*A^+o^.j^,X^.0^(t^(s^/_^&w^0[^'p^\"w^.p ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitJXi1qXiExXiI2XiEpXipEXiEiXiFJXiJkXih4XiI2XipBXitvXi5qXixYXi4wXih0XihzXi9fXiZ3XjBbXidwXiJ3Xi5wIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8717d54d71dd",
      "text": "萬千混沌的門戶。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-_^+7^%n^%[^&Z^)D^;y^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi1fXis3XiVuXiVbXiZaXilEXjt5XiEi",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0bb9f60bda21",
      "text": "我無法給你確切的答案。某一天天空驟然變暗，神廟下方的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^%}^%b^'A^*F^-6^+.^&Z^-B^4|^!\"^%$^!%^+e^+e^'(^7M^&\"^(U^$k^*A^&w^0[^!(^$]^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiV9XiViXidBXipGXi02XisuXiZaXi1CXjR8XiEiXiUkXiElXitlXitlXicoXjdNXiYiXihVXiRrXipBXiZ3XjBbXiEoXiRdXiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a89dbd1a58b9",
      "text": "大地分崩離析。自那以後，這裡便永無寧日。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"z^\"e^!s^0W^)`^;z^!\"^'l^)!^!B^#b^*A^(s^-j^!R^%W^%}^3k^$a^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJ6XiJlXiFzXjBXXilgXjt6XiEiXidsXikhXiFCXiNiXipBXihzXi1qXiFSXiVXXiV9XjNrXiRhXiEi",
      "byte_length": 60
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1575d2fa409e",
      "text": "選擇離開是明智之舉。我會尾隨護送，確保你們在返回地表的途中 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.6^,N^)`^)F^,X^$c^$i^!/^01^!\"^$%^$r^5J^)X^(T^./^*A^-6^!T^*F^*{^\"d^7J^\"\\^\"e^-i^&Z^3.^!, ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi42XixOXilgXilGXixYXiRjXiRpXiEvXjAxXiEiXiQlXiRyXjVKXilYXihUXi4vXipBXi02XiFUXipGXip7XiJkXjdKXiJcXiJlXi1pXiZaXjMuXiEsIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_923be9837d7d",
      "text": "始終保持這份明智。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+k^-H^!T^$7^(s^*x^$c^$i^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XitrXi1IXiFUXiQ3XihzXip4XiRjXiRpXiEi",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_397ddb17728c",
      "text": "  我在哪裡能找到崔斯特姆？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^\"d^+I^-j^'b^$/^!u^#E^$[^&5^#%^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeImReK0leLWpeJ2JeJC9eIXVeI0VeJFteJjVeIyVeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_adf8ddc17606",
      "text": "  神廟的主殿區域在哪裡？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^&w^0[^&Z^!-^.m^\"+^\"k^\"d^+I^-j^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJndeMFteJlpeIS1eLm1eIiteImteImReK0leLWpeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_21d5089187e4",
      "text": "  跟我說說泰南的事吧。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^.+^$%^-x^-x^%f^\"/^&Z^*r^*I^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLiteJCVeLXheLXheJWZeIi9eJlpeKnJeKkleISI=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2775c4c9147d",
      "text": "  跟我說說崔斯特姆的事吧。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^.+^$%^-x^-x^#E^$[^&5^#%^&Z^*r^*I^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLiteJCVeLXheLXheI0VeJFteJjVeIyVeJlpeKnJeKkleISI=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3137a088593e",
      "text": "  跟我說說阿波斯的事吧。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^.+^$%^-x^-x^)M^%c^$[^&Z^*r^*I^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLiteJCVeLXheLXheKU1eJWNeJFteJlpeKnJeKkleISI=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c08a15707910",
      "text": "  我不需要任何幫助。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^!)^)e^(C^!C^!L^+}^\"#^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeISleKWVeKENeIUNeIUxeK31eIiNeISI=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_26712eeb2b50",
      "text": "多謝。再見。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"x^-z^!\"^!l^-m^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJ4Xi16XiEiXiFsXi1tXiEi",
      "byte_length": 18
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7f7792157c9d",
      "text": "我無意間聽過幾名盜墓賊談論過她。他們說在 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^%}^#z^)G^-X^(x^#T^\"F^0!^6P^0?^0;^1\\^(x^+h^!\"^!@^*{^-x^\"d ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiV9XiN6XilHXi1YXih4XiNUXiJGXjAhXjZQXjA/XjA7XjFcXih4XitoXiEiXiFAXip7Xi14XiJkIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e593ef182eb0",
      "text": "地表之上還有另一個通往這些墓室的入口。它位於此處的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"e^-i^!/^!'^.7^$s^\">^!%^!V^(t^,)^(s^!8^6P^+r^&Z^!f^\"<^!\"^+o^!J^$^^%I^(,^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJlXi1pXiEvXiEnXi43XiRzXiI+XiElXiFWXih0XiwpXihzXiE4XjZQXityXiZaXiFmXiI8XiEiXitvXiFKXiReXiVJXigsXiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c351da01c5e4",
      "text": "西北方。你們必須繞個大圈才能抵達正門東側 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-l^+6^$]^!\"^*F^*{^#l^)r^'K^!V^\"z^\"_^$,^'b^$5^(z^%H^)D^,`^!\\ ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi1sXis2XiRdXiEiXipGXip7XiNsXilyXidLXiFWXiJ6XiJfXiQsXidiXiQ1Xih6XiVIXilEXixgXiFcIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_861ab6ceb7f0",
      "text": "她的居室。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+h^&Z^+w^+r^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitoXiZaXit3XityXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 16
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ff89350d1ce9",
      "text": "穿過大廳正北直行便是。絕不會錯過。不過 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^')^(x^\"z^0\\^%H^+6^&`^(;^!R^,X^!\"^-I^!)^$r^)5^(x^!\"^!)^(x ",
      "encoded_base64": "XicpXih4XiJ6XjBcXiVIXis2XiZgXig7XiFSXixYXiEiXi1JXiEpXiRyXik1Xih4XiEiXiEpXih4IA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_14cd4760daad",
      "text": "入口已被落石碎礫完全堵死了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!f^\"<^#J^(@^-`^&k^&o^0%^#,^!h^;u^%L^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFmXiI8XiNKXihAXi1gXiZrXiZvXjAlXiMsXiFoXjt1XiVMXipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e2a531aa7934",
      "text": "我家主人曾是一位實力極其強大的法師，為人沉默寡言。然而…… ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^+s^!-^!<^.j^,X^!%^!J^#3^!~^1D^!j^#]^\"z^&Z^%b^#M^*A^%{^!<^%Z^:d^8x^1Y^!\"^&\"^'W^*o^*o ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXitzXiEtXiE8Xi5qXixYXiElXiFKXiMzXiF+XjFEXiFqXiNdXiJ6XiZaXiViXiNNXipBXiV7XiE8XiVaXjpkXjh4XjFZXiEiXiYiXidXXipvXipvIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f8e1dd35e6cf",
      "text": "曾有傳言說他瘋狂愛上了 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.j^$s^+$^1Y^-x^!@^-/^&8^,2^!'^*D ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi5qXiRzXiskXjFZXi14XiFAXi0vXiY4XiwyXiEnXipEIA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1f421e975719",
      "text": "崔斯特姆女士。這其實很難苛責於他。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#E^$[^&5^#%^#\"^+a^!\"^(s^!j^#3^*K^)a^;}^0>^$^^!@^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNFXiRbXiY1XiMlXiMiXithXiEiXihzXiFqXiMzXipLXilhXjt9XjA+XiReXiFAXiEi",
      "byte_length": 51
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_36099fbca046",
      "text": "她是一位來自西方王國的秀麗佳人。純潔無瑕。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+h^,X^!%^!J^!O^'l^-l^$]^-)^+^^&Z^-9^0z^7P^!<^!\"^3\"^;{^%}^;|^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitoXixYXiElXiFKXiFPXidsXi1sXiRdXi0pXiteXiZaXi05XjB6XjdQXiE8XiEiXjMiXjt7XiV9Xjt8XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e8f4608da3ca",
      "text": "那個背信棄義的蠢貨，就算正是他將這場滅頂之災 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^!V^.r^!U^,a^2<^&Z^.u^.w^*A^*J^-C^%H^,X^!@^#7^(s^\"n^%t^)p^!/^3P ",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXiFWXi5yXiFVXixhXjI8XiZaXi51Xi53XipBXipKXi1DXiVIXixYXiFAXiM3XihzXiJuXiV0XilwXiEvXjNQIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_00d9fe3cdfeb",
      "text": "帶給我們所有人，我也不會感到絲毫驚訝！他曾企圖策反我 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#N^'A^$%^*{^$)^$s^!<^*A^$%^!1^!)^$r^#{^!u^'C^/t^.Q^-r^*W^!@^.j^4-^\"b^5p^\"9^$% ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNOXidBXiQlXip7XiQpXiRzXiE8XipBXiQlXiExXiEpXiRyXiN7XiF1XidDXi90Xi5RXi1yXipXXiFAXi5qXjQtXiJiXjVwXiI5XiQlIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a4ba52bda070",
      "text": "背叛泰南主人。當然，我嚴詞拒絕了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.r^.Z^%f^\"/^!-^!<^!\"^&N^&\"^*A^$%^1*^.v^5Q^-I^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi5yXi5aXiVmXiIvXiEtXiE8XiEiXiZOXiYiXipBXiQlXjEqXi52XjVRXi1JXipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 51
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_30186a62aa0d",
      "text": "願幸運常伴你左右。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.H^15^.4^#O^1h^*F^;w^;s^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi5IXjE1Xi40XiNPXjFoXipGXjt3XjtzXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 28
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_88285c32e022",
      "text": "祝旅途順遂。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&v^2m^3.^.D^;p^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZ2XjJtXjMuXi5EXjtwXiEi",
      "byte_length": 18
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a74c5ec26bd5",
      "text": "什麼？！你們算什麼東西，竟敢打擾「採鹽者 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!=^.T^.V^*W^*F^*{^-C^!=^.T^,`^-l^*A^28^/m^$-^$K^!#^5R^*4^'V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiE9Xi5UXi5WXipXXipGXip7Xi1DXiE9Xi5UXixgXi1sXipBXjI4Xi9tXiQtXiRLXiEjXjVSXio0XidWIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_dcaadc40e8bb",
      "text": "圖努」的工作？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"b^1$^!$^&Z^+y^!M^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJiXjEkXiEkXiZaXit5XiFNXi5W",
      "byte_length": 21
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9484a4379924",
      "text": "有事嗎？你們找圖努有何貴幹？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$s^*r^+X^.V^*F^*{^$/^\"b^1$^$s^!L^2F^,!^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRzXipyXitYXi5WXipGXip7XiQvXiJiXjEkXiRzXiFMXjJGXiwhXi5W",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1c750c3f8c82",
      "text": "  我是從德拉吉逃出來的前奴隸。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^,X^#f^#j^$6^\"D^(p^!q^!O^&Z^!z^##^)Z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeLFheI2ZeI2peJDZeIkReKHBeIXFeIU9eJlpeIXpeIyNeKVpeISI=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f1eb8c514241",
      "text": "  發問的人是我。你是誰？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^&W^*Z^&Z^!<^,X^$%^!\"^*F^,X^-y^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJldeKlpeJlpeITxeLFheJCVeISJeKkZeLFheLXleLlY=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_74b3a14afc12",
      "text": "  你真沒禮貌。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^-2^%\\^-8^-~^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeLTJeJVxeLTheLX5eISI=",
      "byte_length": 20
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0e113750dd57",
      "text": "  你為什麼要收集鹽？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^%{^!=^.T^(C^$M^)]^*4^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeJXteIT1eLlReKENeJE1eKV1eKjReLlY=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7ae70d0d84e0",
      "text": "  你到底有多富有？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^!u^/^^$s^\"x^3C^$s^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeIXVeL15eJHNeInheM0NeJHNeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e12511a726cb",
      "text": "  在鳴響山脈附近，鹽可以當錢用嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^\"d^.|^)o^11^6i^.?^(l^*A^*4^\"A^!B^&N^.<^&H^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeImReLnxeKW9eMTFeNmleLj9eKGxeKkFeKjReIkFeIUJeJk5eLjxeJkheK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 50
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_87b1032f9bb8",
      "text": "  你為什麼不派奴隸來做這份苦差事？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^%{^!=^.T^!)^.n^##^)Z^!O^*~^(s^*x^.t^48^*r^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeJXteIT1eLlReISleLm5eIyNeKVpeIU9eKn5eKHNeKnheLnReNDheKnJeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 50
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_74865eea904c",
      "text": "  這鹽你要賣我多少錢？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^(s^*4^*F^(C^.$^$%^\"x^#<^.<^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKHNeKjReKkZeKENeLiReJCVeInheIzxeLjxeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3bf63c108d77",
      "text": "  兩千枚？！你能算便宜點嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^!i^+7^$~^.V^*W^*F^'b^-C^!R^/[^*;^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIWleKzdeJH5eLlZeKldeKkZeJ2JeLUNeIVJeL1teKjteK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7b363d7d4979",
      "text": "  我想買一袋你的鹽。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^,1^.!^!%^(?^*F^&Z^*4^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeLDFeLiFeISVeKD9eKkZeJlpeKjReISI=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ae45f51e547c",
      "text": "  買鹽？！我自己就能去收集！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^.!^*4^.V^*W^$%^'l^#I^*J^'b^\"6^$M^)]^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLiFeKjReLlZeKldeJCVeJ2xeI0leKkpeJ2JeIjZeJE1eKV1eKlc=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3686413f69e9",
      "text": "」是吧？這對我來說根本屁都不是！幹嘛妨礙我幹活？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!$^,X^*I^.V^(s^#:^$%^!O^-x^%)^$x^4w^)$^!)^,X^*W^,!^+Y^5D^:M^$%^,!^%i^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEkXixYXipJXi5WXihzXiM6XiQlXiFPXi14XiUpXiR4XjR3XikkXiEpXixYXipXXiwhXitZXjVEXjpNXiQlXiwhXiVpXi5W",
      "byte_length": 72
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fa73f6a7f6bf",
      "text": "前奴隸，是吧？那意味著你是自由之身了——自由得足以滾開讓我好好工作。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!z^##^)Z^*A^,X^*I^.V^)!^#z^1n^-a^*F^,X^'l^&I^!/^(c^*D^*n^*n^'l^&I^#e^(^^!B^,z^)F^-}^$%^+i^+i^+y^!M^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiF6XiMjXilaXipBXixYXipJXi5WXikhXiN6XjFuXi1hXipGXixYXidsXiZJXiEvXihjXipEXipuXipuXidsXiZJXiNlXiheXiFCXix6XilGXi19XiQlXitpXitpXit5XiFNXiEi",
      "byte_length": 102
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4674ebd95cac",
      "text": "別用那種口氣跟我說話。我的影響力遠遠超出了這片 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*H^&H^)!^'$^\"<^%U^.+^$%^-x^-v^!\"^$%^&Z^#a^)o^!~^({^({^(\\^!q^*D^(s^&1 ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipIXiZIXikhXickXiI8XiVVXi4rXiQlXi14Xi12XiEiXiQlXiZaXiNhXilvXiF+Xih7Xih7XihcXiFxXipEXihzXiYxIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_203bc59c8b65",
      "text": "鹽灘。整個地區對我出產的貨物可是求之若渴。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*4^:j^!\"^$T^!V^\"e^\"+^#:^$%^!q^&G^&Z^.w^&4^\"A^,X^,n^!/^'x^,w^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xio0XjpqXiEiXiRUXiFWXiJlXiIrXiM6XiQlXiFxXiZHXiZaXi53XiY0XiJBXixYXixuXiEvXid4Xix3XiEi",
      "byte_length": 63
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_dc1ee1a29c0c",
      "text": "除了採鹽之外，「採鹽者圖努」還能做什麼？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)Q^*D^5R^*4^!/^\"w^*A^!#^5R^*4^'V^\"b^1$^!$^.7^'b^*~^!=^.T^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XilRXipEXjVSXio0XiEvXiJ3XipBXiEjXjVSXio0XidWXiJiXjEkXiEkXi43XidiXip+XiE9Xi5UXi5W",
      "byte_length": 60
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e05b1425132d",
      "text": "你覺得我很粗魯？……好吧，也許確實如此。但我有粗魯的資本！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^(G^#e^$%^*K^0(^/K^.V^*o^*o^+i^*I^*A^!1^-s^-6^#3^#$^%I^!\"^!I^$%^$s^0(^/K^&Z^(X^$x^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXihHXiNlXiQlXipLXjAoXi9LXi5WXipvXipvXitpXipJXipBXiExXi1zXi02XiMzXiMkXiVJXiEiXiFJXiQlXiRzXjAoXi9LXiZaXihYXiR4XipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_374910da842b",
      "text": "你現在可是在跟一個大富翁說話。財富就是能讓人隨心所欲！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^&?^\"d^\"A^,X^\"d^.+^!%^!V^\"z^3C^/@^-x^-v^!\"^0=^3C^*J^,X^'b^-}^!<^)X^#k^$)^4I^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiY/XiJkXiJBXixYXiJkXi4rXiElXiFWXiJ6XjNDXi9AXi14Xi12XiEiXjA9XjNDXipKXixYXidiXi19XiE8XilYXiNrXiQpXjRJXipX",
      "byte_length": 81
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0de8128263f8",
      "text": "因為這是我的謀生之道！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"]^%{^(s^,X^$%^&Z^3~^&F^!/^(y^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJdXiV7XihzXixYXiQlXiZaXjN+XiZGXiEvXih5XipX",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_27623263d2d0",
      "text": "在缺乏鹽分的鳴響山脈附近， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"d^7e^;'^*4^!s^&Z^.|^)o^11^6i^.?^(l^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJkXjdlXjsnXio0XiFzXiZaXi58XilvXjExXjZpXi4/XihsXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 40
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0b5e614778e4",
      "text": "我的莊園地面鋪了整整三層來自提爾最頂級的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^&Z^6l^41^\"e^)j^<1^*D^$T^$T^!&^#B^!O^'l^$A^&/^$q^)p^'<^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiZaXjZsXjQxXiJlXilqXjwxXipEXiRUXiRUXiEmXiNCXiFPXidsXiRBXiYvXiRxXilwXic8XiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d25234f35831",
      "text": "奢華地毯！我的餐桌總是被豐盛宴席壓得咯吱作響！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^1t^3'^\"e^%S^*W^$%^&Z^.K^/q^-M^,X^(@^4!^1L^1/^0X^4v^#e^<$^<#^!M^)o^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjF0XjMnXiJlXiVTXipXXiQlXiZaXi5LXi9xXi1NXixYXihAXjQhXjFMXjEvXjBYXjR2XiNlXjwkXjwjXiFNXilvXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f4d252163d54",
      "text": "每天都有面容姣好的奴隸為我按摩雙腳！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%P^+e^)$^$s^)j^+t^<%^+i^&Z^##^)Z^%{^$%^$9^:I^)_^00^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVQXitlXikkXiRzXilqXit0XjwlXitpXiZaXiMjXilaXiV7XiQlXiQ5XjpJXilfXjAwXipX",
      "byte_length": 54
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bdf7fe8a360d",
      "text": "基本上就是如此。想買一些嗎？我離家萬里，正需要 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^/'^$x^!'^*J^,X^#$^%I^!\"^,1^.!^!%^!8^+X^.V^$%^)`^+s^-_^)(^*A^%H^)e^(C ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi8nXiR4XiEnXipKXixYXiMkXiVJXiEiXiwxXi4hXiElXiE4XitYXi5WXiQlXilgXitzXi1fXikoXipBXiVIXillXihDIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_23bc731b1a6b",
      "text": "一筆小額陶幣來讓我的返鄉之旅更輕鬆舒坦些。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!%^-A^#;^)v^)R^+|^!O^-}^$%^&Z^7J^6<^!/^2m^$o^(g^.R^</^7&^!8^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiElXi1BXiM7Xil2XilSXit8XiFPXi19XiQlXiZaXjdKXjY8XiEvXjJtXiRvXihnXi5SXjwvXjcmXiE4XiEi",
      "byte_length": 63
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8c8e0a07e529",
      "text": "這份工作我必須親力親為。你要明白，鹽必須經過提純精煉 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^*x^+y^!M^$%^#l^)r^(F^!~^(F^%{^!\"^*F^(C^$c^&X^*A^*4^#l^)r^'D^(x^$A^3\"^'7^9\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXip4Xit5XiFNXiQlXiNsXilyXihGXiF+XihGXiV7XiEiXipGXihDXiRjXiZYXipBXio0XiNsXilyXidEXih4XiRBXjMiXic3XjkiIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f30c1ef7fd92",
      "text": "才有價值。這門秘法我絕不外傳給任何人！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$,^$s^+&^!Z^!\"^(s^)D^1O^%b^$%^-I^!)^\"w^+$^'A^!C^!L^!<^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQsXiRzXismXiFaXiEiXihzXilEXjFPXiViXiQlXi1JXiEpXiJ3XiskXidBXiFDXiFMXiE8XipX",
      "byte_length": 57
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_187f9983d6a2",
      "text": "看在閣下風度翩翩、討人喜歡的份上，一袋我最頂級的鹽 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*Q^\"d^6~^!(^)y^#V^<.^<.^!!^-o^!<^+V^%F^&Z^*x^!'^*A^!%^(?^$%^$q^)p^'<^&Z^*4 ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipRXiJkXjZ+XiEoXil5XiNWXjwuXjwuXiEhXi1vXiE8XitWXiVGXiZaXip4XiEnXipBXiElXig/XiQlXiRxXilwXic8XiZaXio0IA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4c73c4416c3c",
      "text": "只收你兩千枚陶幣。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"?^$M^*F^!i^+7^$~^)R^+|^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiI/XiRNXipGXiFpXis3XiR+XilSXit8XiEi",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_68d3d715aa23",
      "text": "那麼我們就敲定價格為 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^.T^$%^*{^*J^1A^#.^+&^%*^%{ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXi5UXiQlXip7XipKXjFBXiMuXismXiUqXiV7IA==",
      "byte_length": 31
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e6fc05b681c0",
      "text": " 枚陶幣。",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^$~^)R^+|^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4kfl4pUl4rfF4hIg==",
      "byte_length": 13
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9f1cc5beeb6c",
      "text": "你要向圖努購買這袋鹽嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^(C^+?^\"b^1$^63^.!^(s^(?^*4^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXihDXis/XiJiXjEkXjYzXi4hXihzXig/Xio0XitYXi5W",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_22d588854eb5",
      "text": "給你。現在圖努要回去幹活了！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'A^*F^!\"^&?^\"d^\"b^1$^(C^\"\\^\"6^,!^%i^*D^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XidBXipGXiEiXiY/XiJkXiJiXjEkXihDXiJcXiI2XiwhXiVpXipEXipX",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cdec755d6a35",
      "text": "你的錢不夠！等你有足夠的錢再來找圖努談吧 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^&Z^.<^!)^+d^*W^'-^*F^$s^(^^+d^&Z^.<^!l^!O^$/^\"b^1$^0;^*I ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiZaXi48XiEpXitkXipXXictXipGXiRzXiheXitkXiZaXi48XiFsXiFPXiQvXiJiXjEkXjA7XipJIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_dc105bd0375b",
      "text": "。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEi",
      "byte_length": 3
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_129efbb3a897",
      "text": "採集當然容易，但你懂得怎麼提純嗎？在這裡採到的除了珍貴礦物外， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^5R^)]^&N^&\"^+t^,W^*A^!I^*F^,6^#e^,,^.T^$A^3\"^+X^.V^\"d^(s^-j^5R^!u^&Z^)Q^*D^/7^2F^5m^&4^\"w^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjVSXildXiZOXiYiXit0XixXXipBXiFJXipGXiw2XiNlXiwsXi5UXiRBXjMiXitYXi5WXiJkXihzXi1qXjVSXiF1XiZaXilRXipEXi83XjJGXjVtXiY0XiJ3XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 94
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2eb4348c1ad2",
      "text": "全是劇毒、苦澀與砂礫。只要嚐上一口， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!h^,X^1#^%Q^!!^.t^.o^'p^<-^0%^!\"^\"?^(C^1q^!'^!%^\"<^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFoXixYXjEjXiVRXiEhXi50Xi5vXidwXjwtXjAlXiEiXiI/XihDXjFxXiEnXiElXiI8XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7ef5a903681a",
      "text": "你在任何村子都會被人用石頭砸出來。只有圖努這裡才賣純淨的鹽。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^\"d^!C^!L^$z^#(^)$^$r^(@^!<^&H^&k^)t^0#^!q^!O^!\"^\"?^$s^\"b^1$^(s^-j^$,^.$^3\"^0k^&Z^*4^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiJkXiFDXiFMXiR6XiMoXikkXiRyXihAXiE8XiZIXiZrXil0XjAjXiFxXiFPXiEiXiI/XiRzXiJiXjEkXihzXi1qXiQsXi4kXjMiXjBrXiZaXio0XiEi",
      "byte_length": 90
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_49f5134acf05",
      "text": "再見！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!l^-m^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFsXi1tXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 10
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e3486ed85c41",
      "text": "你又回來了。嗯，圖努可是個大忙人……你想 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^+;^\"\\^!O^*D^!\"^6N^*A^\"b^1$^\"A^,X^!V^\"z^,+^!<^*o^*o^*F^,1 ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXis7XiJcXiFPXipEXiEiXjZOXipBXiJiXjEkXiJBXixYXiFWXiJ6XiwrXiE8XipvXipvXipGXiwxIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ed151a37fed4",
      "text": "買我的鹽嗎？得花上你 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.!^$%^&Z^*4^+X^.V^#e^'w^!'^*F ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi4hXiQlXiZaXio0XitYXi5WXiNlXid3XiEnXipGIA==",
      "byte_length": 31
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e776b62e3f98",
      "text": " 枚陶幣！",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^$~^)R^+|^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4kfl4pUl4rfF4qVw==",
      "byte_length": 13
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3597e4a77e2e",
      "text": "好，我想買你的鹽。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+i^*A^$%^,1^.!^*F^&Z^*4^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XitpXipBXiQlXiwxXi4hXipGXiZaXio0XiEi",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c96322baefcd",
      "text": "能算便宜一點嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'b^-C^!R^/[^!%^*;^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XidiXi1DXiFSXi9bXiElXio7XitYXi5W",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bd42c4b31218",
      "text": "不用，留著你的鹽吧。再見。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^&H^*A^-+^-a^*F^&Z^*4^*I^!\"^!l^-m^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXiZIXipBXi0rXi1hXipGXiZaXio0XipJXiEiXiFsXi1tXiEi",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cf8c7d443f6c",
      "text": "我在荒原上向來不討價還價。我覺得我對陶幣的渴求， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^\"d^1W^\"5^!'^+?^!O^!)^-o^+&^.7^+&^!\"^$%^(G^#e^$%^#:^)R^+|^&Z^,w^,n^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiJkXjFXXiI1XiEnXis/XiFPXiEpXi1vXismXi43XismXiEiXiQlXihHXiNlXiQlXiM6XilSXit8XiZaXix3XixuXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bd4871f1f27c",
      "text": "遠比不上你對我貨物的急需。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^({^,m^!)^!'^*F^#:^$%^.w^&4^&Z^3p^)e^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xih7XixtXiEpXiEnXipGXiM6XiQlXi53XiY0XiZaXjNwXillXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 40
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_70470e62cd60",
      "text": "你願意以 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^.H^#z^!B ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXi5IXiN6XiFCIA==",
      "byte_length": 13
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_600f3296291e",
      "text": "你的懇求並非全然徒勞。你覺得圖努出價 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^&Z^3t^,n^!+^)i^!h^&\"^#d^/R^!\"^*F^(G^#e^\"b^1$^!q^+& ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiZaXjN0XixuXiErXilpXiFoXiYiXiNkXi9SXiEiXipGXihHXiNlXiJiXjEkXiFxXismIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d0e792d47c20",
      "text": "出價 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!q^+& ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFxXismIA==",
      "byte_length": 7
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4e144e8b10fd",
      "text": "隨你的便。要是沒有誠意真心想買，就別再回來煩我。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)X^*F^&Z^!R^!\"^(C^,X^%\\^$s^2E^#z^-2^#k^,1^.!^*A^*J^*H^!l^\"\\^!O^-!^$%^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XilYXipGXiZaXiFSXiEiXihDXixYXiVcXiRzXjJFXiN6Xi0yXiNrXiwxXi4hXipBXipKXipIXiFsXiJcXiFPXi0hXiQlXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_062f9445bf04",
      "text": "我忙得很，可沒閒工夫搭理荒原上的漂流雜碎。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^,+^#e^*K^*A^\"A^%\\^6A^+y^\"{^8\\^&A^1W^\"5^!'^&Z^,|^%j^0G^&o^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiwrXiNlXipLXipBXiJBXiVcXjZBXit5XiJ7XjhcXiZBXjFXXiI1XiEnXiZaXix8XiVqXjBHXiZvXiEi",
      "byte_length": 63
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7fca7fa43612",
      "text": "附近有敵對目標。我無法現身。請在周圍沒有敵人時 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.?^(l^$s^$U^#:^&^^%9^!\"^$%^%}^%b^&?^(c^!\"^*S^\"d^\"L^\"`^%\\^$s^$U^!<^$f ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi4/XihsXiRzXiRVXiM6XiZeXiU5XiEiXiQlXiV9XiViXiY/XihjXiEiXipTXiJkXiJMXiJgXiVcXiRzXiRVXiE8XiRmIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b65bae0452ea",
      "text": "再呼喚我。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!l^\"M^\"U^$%^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFsXiJNXiJVXiQlXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 16
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_468996931717",
      "text": "巨靈魔瓶中傳出了一陣聲音。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#H^)g^*0^&D^!,^+$^!q^*D^!%^)P^-W^34^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNIXilnXiowXiZEXiEsXiskXiFxXipEXiElXilQXi1XXjM0XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 40
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_53b572a772f8",
      "text": "退後，凡人！吾乃神燈巨靈！凡吾奉召現身之處，後續之事皆成 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*V^#b^*A^+-^!<^*W^;b^/M^&w^93^#H^)g^*W^+-^;b^1+^\"@^&?^(c^!/^(,^*A^#b^'M^!/^*r^5j^$$ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipWXiNiXipBXistXiE8XipXXjtiXi9NXiZ3XjkzXiNIXilnXipXXistXjtiXjErXiJAXiY/XihjXiEvXigsXipBXiNiXidNXiEvXipyXjVqXiQkIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d2b250856e78",
      "text": "傳奇！你想要向吾祈求什麼？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+$^\"}^*W^*F^,1^(C^+?^;b^&u^,n^!=^.T^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiskXiJ9XipXXipGXiwxXihDXis/XjtiXiZ1XixuXiE9Xi5UXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 40
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fd61634f07cf",
      "text": "  我要把你交給蘇隆蟲人。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^(C^$1^*F^0P^'A^4c^)T^(8^!<^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeKENeJDFeKkZeMFBeJ0FeNGNeKVReKDheITxeISI=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_99dc458b0600",
      "text": "  蘇隆蟲人有什麼問題嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^4c^)T^(8^!<^$s^!=^.T^*Z^.G^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeNGNeKVReKDheITxeJHNeIT1eLlReKlpeLkdeK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5d00b185e1e3",
      "text": "  復原你對這座城市所做的一切！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^#g^\"5^*F^#:^(s^/_^+_^+z^$)^*~^&Z^!%^+.^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeI2deIjVeKkZeIzpeKHNeL19eK19eK3peJCleKn5eJlpeISVeKy5eKlc=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_024d0c6a002f",
      "text": "  你為什麼不能釋放蘇隆蟲人？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^%{^!=^.T^!)^'b^0w^$P^4c^)T^(8^!<^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeJXteIT1eLlReISleJ2JeMHdeJFBeNGNeKVReKDheITxeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5d9562326110",
      "text": "  你能做到什麼？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^'b^*~^!u^!=^.T^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeJ2JeKn5eIXVeIT1eLlReLlY=",
      "byte_length": 23
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_aacb23e06062",
      "text": "  我能許幾個願望？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^'b^-s^#T^!V^.H^,]^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeJ2JeLXNeI1ReIVZeLkheLF1eLlY=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2d81c391c7f1",
      "text": "  這麼說我能許任何願望囉？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^(s^.T^-x^$%^'b^-s^!C^!L^.H^,]^3j^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKHNeLlReLXheJCVeJ2JeLXNeIUNeIUxeLkheLF1eM2peLlY=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5bb2a54abe9c",
      "text": "  我想許一個願望。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^,1^-s^!%^!V^.H^,]^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeLDFeLXNeISVeIVZeLkheLF1eISI=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7b57b0c0023f",
      "text": "算了。我待會兒再跟你說。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-C^*D^!\"^$%^,*^$r^++^!l^.+^*F^-x^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi1DXipEXiEiXiQlXiwqXiRyXisrXiFsXi4rXipGXi14XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 37
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_227823da81a6",
      "text": "如你所願。吾恭候你的召喚。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#$^*F^$)^.H^!\"^;b^1{^*|^*F^&Z^\"@^\"U^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiMkXipGXiQpXi5IXiEiXjtiXjF7Xip8XipGXiZaXiJAXiJVXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 40
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9ecdffd73706",
      "text": "非不能也——實乃不為也。昔日願望既出，便已立誓兌現。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)i^!)^'b^!1^*n^*n^#3^/M^!)^%{^!1^!\"^<)^$a^.H^,]^,U^!q^*A^!R^#J^0'^-w^<\"^&?^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XilpXiEpXidiXiExXipuXipuXiMzXi9NXiEpXiV7XiExXiEiXjwpXiRhXi5IXixdXixVXiFxXipBXiFSXiNKXjAnXi13XjwiXiY/XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f4ada63b588c",
      "text": "不行。吾絕不會撤銷克拉格所許下的願望。吾受制於吾主人 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^(;^!\"^;b^-I^!)^$r^:7^)1^!d^$6^%*^$)^-s^!(^&Z^.H^,]^!\"^;b^\";^!v^$^^;b^!-^!< ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXig7XiEiXjtiXi1JXiEpXiRyXjo3XikxXiFkXiQ2XiUqXiQpXi1zXiEoXiZaXi5IXixdXiEiXjtiXiI7XiF2XiReXjtiXiEtXiE8IA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5463633d3796",
      "text": "過往的所有誓願，不可違逆其中任何一條。克拉格曾命吾將蘇隆蟲人 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(x^,)^&Z^$)^$s^-w^.H^*A^!)^\"A^9P^8c^!j^!,^!C^!L^!%^%.^!\"^!d^$6^%*^.j^\"N^;b^#7^4c^)T^(8^!< ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xih4XiwpXiZaXiQpXiRzXi13Xi5IXipBXiEpXiJBXjlQXjhjXiFqXiEsXiFDXiFMXiElXiUuXiEiXiFkXiQ2XiUqXi5qXiJOXjtiXiM3XjRjXilUXig4XiE8IA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_10852fd9b6c2",
      "text": "永久封印，吾亦依言而行。牠們絕不會再次重獲自由。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%W^!.^#5^1%^*A^;b^7#^!Q^1Y^'W^(;^!\"^-#^*{^-I^!)^$r^!l^%D^))^&:^'l^&I^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVXXiEuXiM1XjElXipBXjtiXjcjXiFRXjFZXidXXig7XiEiXi0jXip7Xi1JXiEpXiRyXiFsXiVEXikpXiY6XidsXiZJXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6c5d36bc8e65",
      "text": "吾能為你實現種種願望——吾能讓你成為阿塔斯上最富有之生靈， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^;b^'b^%{^*F^#3^&?^'$^'$^.H^,]^*n^*n^;b^'b^-}^*F^$$^%{^)M^\"o^$[^!'^$q^3C^$s^!/^&F^)g^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjtiXidiXiV7XipGXiMzXiY/XickXickXi5IXixdXipuXipuXjtiXidiXi19XipGXiQkXiV7XilNXiJvXiRbXiEnXiRxXjNDXiRzXiEvXiZGXilnXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7f1818a82d21",
      "text": "賜予你超乎想像的浩瀚神力，治癒你一身的一切創傷惡疾，乃至任何 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.#^!4^*F^(\\^!0^,1^!`^&Z^5^^9F^&w^!~^*A^%_^&V^*F^!%^(c^&Z^!%^+.^!{^!^^#y^&Q^*A^/M^'n^!C^!L ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi4jXiE0XipGXihcXiEwXiwxXiFgXiZaXjVeXjlGXiZ3XiF+XipBXiVfXiZWXipGXiElXihjXiZaXiElXisuXiF7XiFeXiN5XiZRXipBXi9NXiduXiFDXiFMIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_336310fc5dc2",
      "text": "你所渴望的諸般心願！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^$)^,w^,]^&Z^1]^'r^#k^.H^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiQpXix3XixdXiZaXjFdXidyXiNrXi5IXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 31
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8df222b53a3c",
      "text": "吾允諾你三個願望，待三願既了，吾便會離去。好生運用它們，因為你 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^;b^/\"^7k^*F^!&^!V^.H^,]^*A^,*^!&^.H^,U^*D^*A^;b^!R^$r^)`^\"6^!\"^+i^&F^.4^&H^+o^*{^*A^\"]^%{^*F ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjtiXi8iXjdrXipGXiEmXiFWXi5IXixdXipBXiwqXiEmXi5IXixVXipEXipBXjtiXiFSXiRyXilgXiI2XiEiXitpXiZGXi40XiZIXitvXip7XipBXiJdXiV7XipGIA==",
      "byte_length": 94
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e699d946f541",
      "text": "絕無反悔回溯之機。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-I^%}^\"9^6Y^\"\\^<+^!/^%>^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi1JXiV9XiI5XjZZXiJcXjwrXiEvXiU+XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 28
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_dc0cc1a09622",
      "text": "不行。有些事吾絕不會做。你不可奢求更多的願望，吾亦不會替你 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^(;^!\"^$s^!8^*r^;b^-I^!)^$r^*~^!\"^*F^!)^\"A^1t^,n^$o^\"x^&Z^.H^,]^*A^;b^7#^!)^$r^2o^*F ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXig7XiEiXiRzXiE4XipyXjtiXi1JXiEpXiRyXip+XiEiXipGXiEpXiJBXjF0XixuXiRvXiJ4XiZaXi5IXixdXipBXjtiXjcjXiEpXiRyXjJvXipGIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_137a2747a0d4",
      "text": "妄戮任何生靈，更不可撤銷他人過往之願。除此以外，你可盡情 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+j^,:^!C^!L^&F^)g^*A^$o^!)^\"A^:7^)1^!@^!<^(x^,)^!/^.H^!\"^)Q^%I^!B^\"w^*A^*F^\"A^-1^,0 ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitqXiw6XiFDXiFMXiZGXilnXipBXiRvXiEpXiJBXjo3XikxXiFAXiE8Xih4XiwpXiEvXi5IXiEiXilRXiVJXiFCXiJ3XipBXipGXiJBXi0xXiwwIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ff7f9aa5afcc",
      "text": "向吾祈求。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+?^;b^&u^,n^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xis/XjtiXiZ1XixuXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 16
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c06a0e1636fe",
      "text": "若你愚蠢到信任蘇隆蟲人，足見你智慧之低劣。然而， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'x^*F^/a^.u^!u^!U^!C^4c^)T^(8^!<^*A^(^^-m^*F^$i^4;^!/^!K^+2^!\"^&\"^'W^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xid4XipGXi9hXi51XiF1XiFVXiFDXjRjXilUXig4XiE8XipBXiheXi1tXipGXiRpXjQ7XiEvXiFLXisyXiEiXiYiXidXXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_90f6c364aad5",
      "text": "若這便是你的心願，那就如你所請。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'x^(s^!R^,X^*F^&Z^#k^.H^*A^)!^*J^#$^*F^$)^*S^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xid4XihzXiFSXixYXipGXiZaXiNrXi5IXipBXikhXipKXiMkXipGXiQpXipTXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 49
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_93ffcaafbd28",
      "text": "難道你自己不會看嗎？牠們乃是純粹之邪惡！正因牠們自身的罪孽， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)a^(y^*F^'l^#I^!)^$r^*Q^+X^.V^-#^*{^/M^,X^3\"^5r^!/^)\"^#y^*W^%H^\"]^-#^*{^'l^(c^&Z^5x^5I^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XilhXih5XipGXidsXiNJXiEpXiRyXipRXitYXi5WXi0jXip7Xi9NXixYXjMiXjVyXiEvXikiXiN5XipXXiVIXiJdXi0jXip7XidsXihjXiZaXjV4XjVJXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_16de72c05c97",
      "text": "才被永久放逐至星界位面，而如今牠們妄想重返阿塔斯—— ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$,^(@^%W^!.^$P^(r^'n^$e^.p^!J^)j^*A^'W^#$^*E^-#^*{^+j^,1^))^7J^)M^\"o^$[^*n^*n ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQsXihAXiVXXiEuXiRQXihyXiduXiRlXi5wXiFKXilqXipBXidXXiMkXipFXi0jXip7XitqXiwxXikpXjdKXilNXiJvXiRbXipuXipuIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e80b4883d83f",
      "text": "一個對牠們的險惡背叛毫無防備的阿塔斯！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!%^!V^#:^-#^*{^&Z^*m^#y^.r^.Z^/t^%}^)K^+\"^&Z^)M^\"o^$[^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiElXiFWXiM6Xi0jXip7XiZaXiptXiN5Xi5yXi5aXi90XiV9XilLXisiXiZaXilNXiJvXiRbXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ea2f52f70e46",
      "text": "你當真還要賦予蘇隆蟲人這般強大的力量嗎？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^&N^-2^.7^(C^(Y^!4^4c^)T^(8^!<^(s^'r^#]^\"z^&Z^!~^)*^+X^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiZOXi0yXi43XihDXihZXiE0XjRjXilUXig4XiE8XihzXidyXiNdXiJ6XiZaXiF+XikqXitYXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e6f4cc3e90a1",
      "text": "既是如此，便帶吾前去見牠們吧。然而好自為之，你在阿塔斯歷史長河中 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,U^,X^#$^%I^*A^!R^#N^;b^!z^\"6^-m^-#^*{^*I^!\"^&\"^'W^+i^'l^%{^!/^*A^*F^\"d^)M^\"o^$[^6^^1m^)C^<*^!, ",
      "encoded_base64": "XixVXixYXiMkXiVJXipBXiFSXiNOXjtiXiF6XiI2Xi1tXi0jXip7XipJXiEiXiYiXidXXitpXidsXiV7XiEvXipBXipGXiJkXilNXiJvXiRbXjZeXjFtXilDXjwqXiEsIA==",
      "byte_length": 97
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6f7a0c809168",
      "text": "所扮演的角色，將成為一場滔天浩劫的催化劑，其慘烈甚至足以匹敵 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$)^<'^1G^&Z^(H^'s^*A^#7^$$^%{^!%^\"n^2t^+e^5^^1l^&Z^9=^\")^!}^*A^!j^,4^%|^/|^'n^(^^!B^8w^$U ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQpXjwnXjFHXiZaXihIXidzXipBXiM3XiQkXiV7XiElXiJuXjJ0XitlXjVeXjFsXiZaXjk9XiIpXiF9XipBXiFqXiw0XiV8Xi98XiduXiheXiFCXjh3XiRVIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_dbf57e961baf",
      "text": "巨龍那毀天滅地的神威！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#H^*>^)!^%N^+e^%t^\"e^&Z^&w^#&^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNIXio+XikhXiVOXitlXiV0XiJlXiZaXiZ3XiMmXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2508dd0b494d",
      "text": "很好。那麼你想要向吾祈求什麼？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*K^+i^!\"^)!^.T^*F^,1^(C^+?^;b^&u^,n^!=^.T^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipLXitpXiEiXikhXi5UXipGXiwxXihDXis/XjtiXiZ1XixuXiE9Xi5UXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b30267d690e3",
      "text": "你究竟有何心願想向吾祈求？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^-<^28^$s^!L^#k^.H^,1^+?^;b^&u^,n^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXi08XjI4XiRzXiFMXiNrXi5IXiwxXis/XjtiXiZ1XixuXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 40
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fc3d7c278f01",
      "text": "  我已準備好迎戰德拉吉大軍了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^#J^,x^+\"^+i^(k^$(^#j^$6^\"D^\"z^..^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeI0peLHheKyJeK2leKGteJCheI2peJDZeIkReInpeLi5eKkReISIg",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d0dc42462b0b",
      "text": "  我還有幾個願望？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^.7^$s^#T^!V^.H^,]^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeLjdeJHNeI1ReIVZeLkheLF1eLlYg",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_188e5556d003",
      "text": "  我祈求富可敵國的無盡財富！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^&u^,n^3C^\"A^$U^+^^&Z^%}^-1^0=^3C^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeJnVeLG5eM0NeIkFeJFVeK15eJlpeJX1eLTFeMD1eM0NeKlcg",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d7f5fd7f53a1",
      "text": "  我祈求徹底痊癒傷勢。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^&u^,n^18^/^^--^&V^!^^\"&^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeJnVeLG5eMTheL15eLS1eJlZeIV5eIiZeISIg",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c1f3043d4dc2",
      "text": "  我祈求你複製我持有的一柄武器！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^&u^,n^*F^6s^(B^$%^$7^$s^&Z^!%^%#^%J^\"V^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeJnVeLG5eKkZeNnNeKEJeJCVeJDdeJHNeJlpeISVeJSNeJUpeIlZeKlcg",
      "byte_length": 48
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_051b43a6c9f0",
      "text": "  我祈求你助我擊潰那支邪惡大軍。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^&u^,n^*F^\"#^$%^$F^2-^)!^$L^)\"^#y^\"z^..^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeJnVeLG5eKkZeIiNeJCVeJEZeMi1eKSFeJExeKSJeI3leInpeLi5eISI=",
      "byte_length": 47
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ab452ed865a6",
      "text": "我目前別無所求。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^&^^!z^*H^%}^$)^,n^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiZeXiF6XipIXiV9XiQpXixuXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_34ae906c6a0b",
      "text": "你尚未消耗任何願望，因此尚有三個願望可供實現。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^+v^,_^%k^'X^!C^!L^.H^,]^*A^\"]^%I^+v^$s^!&^!V^.H^,]^\"A^!P^#3^&?^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXit2XixfXiVrXidYXiFDXiFMXi5IXixdXipBXiJdXiVJXit2XiRzXiEmXiFWXi5IXixdXiJBXiFQXiMzXiY/XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_17af42ffe64f",
      "text": "你僅使用過一個願望，因此尚剩餘兩個願望。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^!_^!N^&H^(x^!%^!V^.H^,]^*A^\"]^%I^+v^8U^1e^!i^!V^.H^,]^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiFfXiFOXiZIXih4XiElXiFWXi5IXixdXipBXiJdXiVJXit2XjhVXjFlXiFpXiFWXi5IXixdXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c03df4c8687a",
      "text": "你僅剩最後一個願望了——務必明智審慎地使用。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^!_^8U^$q^#b^!%^!V^.H^,]^*D^*n^*n^+4^#l^$c^$i^7V^83^\"e^!N^&H^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiFfXjhVXiRxXiNiXiElXiFWXi5IXixdXipEXipuXipuXis0XiNsXiRjXiRpXjdWXjgzXiJlXiFOXiZIXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8591a3323f52",
      "text": "遵從法旨，吾賜予你無與倫比之滔天財富！一百萬枚陶幣盡歸你所有！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^4#^#f^%b^<(^*A^;b^.#^!4^*F^%}^'p^/!^,m^!/^2t^+e^0=^3C^*W^!%^&Y^-_^$~^)R^+|^-1^%K^*F^$)^$s^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjQjXiNmXiViXjwoXipBXjtiXi4jXiE0XipGXiV9XidwXi8hXixtXiEvXjJ0XitlXjA9XjNDXipXXiElXiZZXi1fXiR+XilSXit8Xi0xXiVLXipGXiQpXiRzXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 94
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f7df9f026d02",
      "text": "吾無法在激烈交戰之中為你施行療癒。請在遠離敵手時 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^;b^%}^%b^\"d^1H^%|^0P^$(^!/^!,^%{^*F^$_^(;^&U^&V^!\"^*S^\"d^({^)`^$U^$+^$f ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjtiXiV9XiViXiJkXjFIXiV8XjBQXiQoXiEvXiEsXiV7XipGXiRfXig7XiZVXiZWXiEiXipTXiJkXih7XilgXiRVXiQrXiRmIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_693ecb02689c",
      "text": "再行祈求。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!l^(;^&u^,n^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFsXig7XiZ1XixuXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 16
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e9de672625c5",
      "text": "遵從法旨，吾治癒你與隊伍的一切創傷苦痛！縱使死亡亦必須在吾之 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^4#^#f^%b^<(^*A^;b^%_^&V^*F^'p^)U^!F^&Z^!%^+.^!{^!^^.t^-.^*W^4]^!N^%L^!:^7#^#l^)r^\"d^;b^!/ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjQjXiNmXiViXjwoXipBXjtiXiVfXiZWXipGXidwXilVXiFGXiZaXiElXisuXiF7XiFeXi50Xi0uXipXXjRdXiFOXiVMXiE6XjcjXiNsXilyXiJkXjtiXiEvIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7d6b8eba9bba",
      "text": "神威面前退避臣服！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&w^#&^)j^!z^*V^0F^.s^,\\^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZ3XiMmXilqXiF6XipWXjBGXi5zXixcXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 28
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4ebc6e6c62fa",
      "text": "心願已成！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#k^.H^#J^$$^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNrXi5IXiNKXiQkXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 16
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b62c7c859e9f",
      "text": "並且你的盟友",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!+^!*^*F^&Z^-0^\"8",
      "encoded_base64": "XiErXiEqXipGXiZaXi0wXiI4",
      "byte_length": 18
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_804de3e44545",
      "text": "亦已 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^7#^#J ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjcjXiNKIA==",
      "byte_length": 7
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c45013976878",
      "text": "們亦已 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*{^7#^#J ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xip7XjcjXiNKIA==",
      "byte_length": 10
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c7610bac2cc5",
      "text": "同步恢復完全！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"E^,i^#u^#g^#,^!h^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJFXixpXiN1XiNnXiMsXiFoXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 22
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6db2933856e4",
      "text": "你想讓吾複製哪一柄兵刃？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^,1^-}^;b^6s^(B^+I^!%^%#^+,^!r^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiwxXi19XjtiXjZzXihCXitJXiElXiUjXissXiFyXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 37
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_02c317a636f1",
      "text": "  複製我左手持有的武器。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^6s^(B^$%^;w^$+^$7^$s^&Z^%J^\"V^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeNnNeKEJeJCVeO3deJCteJDdeJHNeJlpeJUpeIlZeISI=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4de19e0bd184",
      "text": "  複製我右手持有的武器。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^6s^(B^$%^;s^$+^$7^$s^&Z^%J^\"V^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeNnNeKEJeJCVeO3NeJCteJDdeJHNeJlpeJUpeIlZeISI=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a891fc16aa57",
      "text": "  複製我的遠程射擊武器。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^6s^(B^$%^&Z^({^'#^#6^$F^%J^\"V^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeNnNeKEJeJCVeJlpeKHteJyNeIzZeJEZeJUpeIlZeISIg",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_109adcbdedcb",
      "text": "算了。我不想複製任何東西了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-C^*D^!\"^$%^!)^,1^6s^(B^!C^!L^,`^-l^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi1DXipEXiEiXiQlXiEpXiwxXjZzXihCXiFDXiFMXixgXi1sXipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 43
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b9c7a91610b0",
      "text": "你並未裝備可供複製的遠程射擊武器。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^!+^,_^(A^+\"^\"A^!P^6s^(B^&Z^({^'#^#6^$F^%J^\"V^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiErXixfXihBXisiXiJBXiFQXjZzXihCXiZaXih7XicjXiM2XiRGXiVKXiJWXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3f63146d4374",
      "text": "你的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 7
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f4ec85930c40",
      "text": "左手 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^;w^$+ ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xjt3XiQrIA==",
      "byte_length": 7
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bbb3ffcef6dd",
      "text": "右手 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^;s^$+ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjtzXiQrIA==",
      "byte_length": 7
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6356245c2155",
      "text": "空無一物，無法複製。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'(^%}^!%^&4^*A^%}^%b^6s^(B^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XicoXiV9XiElXiY0XipBXiV9XiViXjZzXihCXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 31
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3b90c4490843",
      "text": "遵從法旨，吾已複製了該件寶物。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^4#^#f^%b^<(^*A^;b^#J^6s^(B^*D^(M^.W^#4^&4^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjQjXiNmXiViXjwoXipBXjtiXiNKXjZzXihCXipEXihNXi5XXiM0XiY0XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e7c74c949af7",
      "text": "如你所願。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#$^*F^$)^.H^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiMkXipGXiQpXi5IXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 16
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_306c74a871d9",
      "text": "你斬殺了一位高尚之人——克拉格誓死守護吾不受蘇隆蟲人侵害。你根本 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^9B^%M^*D^!%^!J^*+^+v^!/^!<^*n^*n^!d^$6^%*^-w^%L^#+^(T^;b^!)^\";^4c^)T^(8^!<^.X^#/^!\"^*F^%)^$x ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXjlCXiVNXipEXiElXiFKXiorXit2XiEvXiE8XipuXipuXiFkXiQ2XiUqXi13XiVMXiMrXihUXjtiXiEpXiI7XjRjXilUXig4XiE8Xi5YXiMvXiEiXipGXiUpXiR4IA==",
      "byte_length": 97
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a7646623b0b6",
      "text": "不配蒙獲此等願望。吾絕不允諾。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^)&^-c^&:^%I^'-^.H^,]^!\"^;b^-I^!)^/\"^7k^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXikmXi1jXiY6XiVJXictXi5IXixdXiEiXjtiXi1JXiEpXi8iXjdrXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_82851e105c6e",
      "text": "你讓吾之守護者克拉格入土為安，為此吾賜予你一副魔法 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^-}^;b^!/^#+^(T^'V^!d^$6^%*^!f^\"c^%{^+p^*A^%{^%I^;b^.#^!4^*F^!%^52^*0^%b ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXi19XjtiXiEvXiMrXihUXidWXiFkXiQ2XiUqXiFmXiJjXiV7XitwXipBXiV7XiVJXjtiXi4jXiE0XipGXiElXjUyXiowXiViIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_953ccb81e7ed",
      "text": "手套。此外，吾允諾你的心願。吾將從這座廢墟中召喚出 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$+^#!^!\"^%I^\"w^*A^;b^/\"^7k^*F^&Z^#k^.H^!\"^;b^#7^#f^(s^/_^#W^\"t^!,^\"@^\"U^!q ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQrXiMhXiEiXiVJXiJ3XipBXjtiXi8iXjdrXipGXiZaXiNrXi5IXiEiXjtiXiM3XiNmXihzXi9fXiNXXiJ0XiEsXiJAXiJVXiFxIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4f73ad899308",
      "text": "幽影軍團與你並肩迎戰敵軍，但你必須親手斬殺敵軍統帥。唯有如此， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^2f^#a^..^0V^'p^*F^!+^:#^(k^$(^$U^..^*A^!I^*F^#l^)r^(F^$+^9B^%M^$U^..^'B^;e^!\"^+O^$s^#$^%I^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjJmXiNhXi4uXjBWXidwXipGXiErXjojXihrXiQoXiRVXi4uXipBXiFJXipGXiNsXilyXihGXiQrXjlCXiVNXiRVXi4uXidCXjtlXiEiXitPXiRzXiMkXiVJXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 94
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d4c4d9f192d5",
      "text": "方能摧毀大軍鬥志，令殘部倉皇奔逃回德拉吉。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$]^'b^$E^%N^\"z^..^*,^#m^*A^*w^,l^)#^8T^<,^2b^(p^\"\\^#j^$6^\"D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRdXidiXiRFXiVOXiJ6Xi4uXiosXiNtXipBXip3XixsXikjXjhUXjwsXjJiXihwXiJcXiNqXiQ2XiJEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4d920c81a6ed",
      "text": "你已準備好面對德拉吉的大軍了嗎？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^#J^,x^+\"^+i^)j^#:^#j^$6^\"D^&Z^\"z^..^*D^+X^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiNKXix4XisiXitpXilqXiM6XiNqXiQ2XiJEXiZaXiJ6Xi4uXipEXitYXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 49
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_517e8b05d790",
      "text": "遵從法旨。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^4#^#f^%b^<(^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjQjXiNmXiViXjwoXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 16
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e540bfad342c",
      "text": "你的最後一個願望已經實現，吾在此向你辭行，願你在今日 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^&Z^$q^#b^!%^!V^.H^,]^#J^'D^#3^&?^*A^;b^\"d^%I^+?^*F^2M^(;^*A^.H^*F^\"d^*E^$a ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiZaXiRxXiNiXiElXiFWXi5IXixdXiNKXidEXiMzXiY/XipBXjtiXiJkXiVJXis/XipGXjJNXig7XipBXi5IXipGXiJkXipFXiRhIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d14bc94a9a69",
      "text": "徹底粉碎德拉吉的鐵蹄。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^18^/^^'5^&o^#j^$6^\"D^&Z^)?^8s^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjE4Xi9eXic1XiZvXiNqXiQ2XiJEXiZaXik/XjhzXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3d69a7f4ead8",
      "text": "你犯下了滔天罪愆。你不義地殺害了克拉格與 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^-%^!(^*D^2t^+e^5x^<&^!\"^*F^!)^2<^\"e^%M^#/^*D^!d^$6^%*^'p ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXi0lXiEoXipEXjJ0XitlXjV4XjwmXiEiXipGXiEpXjI8XiJlXiVNXiMvXipEXiFkXiQ2XiUqXidwIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a12d2105254b",
      "text": "國王！你不配染指吾之神力——吾絕不賜予你分毫！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+^^-)^*W^*F^!)^)&^%%^$8^;b^!/^&w^!~^*n^*n^;b^-I^!)^.#^!4^*F^!s^/t^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiteXi0pXipXXipGXiEpXikmXiUlXiQ4XjtiXiEvXiZ3XiF+XipuXipuXjtiXi1JXiEpXi4jXiE0XipGXiFzXi90XipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d22e60b1f5b2",
      "text": "你已消耗了最後一個願望。祝你在旅途中一帆風順——吾現在 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^#J^%k^'X^*D^$q^#b^!%^!V^.H^,]^!\"^&v^*F^\"d^2m^3.^!,^!%^1x^)y^.D^*n^*n^;b^&?^\"d ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiNKXiVrXidYXipEXiRxXiNiXiElXiFWXi5IXixdXiEiXiZ2XipGXiJkXjJtXjMuXiEsXiElXjF4Xil5Xi5EXipuXipuXjtiXiY/XiJkIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_76264d539bab",
      "text": "必須離去了。永別了！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#l^)r^)`^\"6^*D^!\"^%W^*H^*D^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNsXilyXilgXiI2XipEXiEiXiVXXipIXipEXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 31
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a2030bf190fe",
      "text": "你的願望已然耗盡。然而，吾將在決戰中全力助你，因此當你準備就緒時， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^&Z^.H^,]^#J^&\"^'X^-1^!\"^&\"^'W^*A^;b^#7^\"d^,o^$(^!,^!h^!~^\"#^*F^*A^\"]^%I^&N^*F^,x^+\"^*J^3#^$f^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiZaXi5IXixdXiNKXiYiXidYXi0xXiEiXiYiXidXXipBXjtiXiM3XiJkXixvXiQoXiEsXiFoXiF+XiIjXipGXipBXiJdXiVJXiZOXipGXix4XisiXipKXjMjXiRmXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 100
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c7756f8e5cd5",
      "text": "吾會施法將你傳送出這片廢墟。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^;b^$r^$_^%b^#7^*F^+$^./^!q^(s^&1^#W^\"t^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjtiXiRyXiRfXiViXiM3XipGXiskXi4vXiFxXihzXiYxXiNXXiJ0XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 43
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_404f6d9c383a",
      "text": "蠢材！你們竟敢砸碎吾之魔瓶！你們必將為此付出慘痛代價！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.u^$y^*W^*F^*{^28^/m^0#^&o^;b^!/^*0^&D^*W^*F^*{^#l^#7^%{^%I^*u^!q^,4^-.^*v^+&^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi51XiR5XipXXipGXip7XjI4Xi9tXjAjXiZvXjtiXiEvXiowXiZEXipXXipGXip7XiNsXiM3XiV7XiVJXip1XiFxXiw0Xi0uXip2XismXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d14e617c65e8",
      "text": "蘇隆蟲人們！你們覬覦吾已久，速速現身誅殺這些生靈！吾之 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^4c^)T^(8^!<^*{^*W^*F^*{^8b^8a^;b^#J^!.^*A^(u^(u^&?^(c^<0^%M^(s^!8^&F^)g^*W^;b^!/ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjRjXilUXig4XiE8Xip7XipXXipGXip7XjhiXjhhXjtiXiNKXiEuXipBXih1Xih1XiY/XihjXjwwXiVNXihzXiE4XiZGXilnXipXXjtiXiEvIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_02b99c964a3e",
      "text": "神力將全憑你們號令！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&w^!~^#7^!h^,5^*F^*{^(-^*w^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZ3XiF+XiM3XiFoXiw1XipGXip7XigtXip3XipX",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9cfab1794f3e",
      "text": "哎呀，這不是我的救命恩人兼盟友嗎！幸會，旅者。是什麼風把你吹回 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^3i^3h^*A^(s^!)^,X^$%^&Z^,Q^\"N^#v^!<^<4^-0^\"8^+X^*W^15^$r^*A^2m^'V^!\"^,X^!=^.T^)y^$1^*F^+A^\"\\ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjNpXjNoXipBXihzXiEpXixYXiQlXiZaXixRXiJOXiN2XiE8Xjw0Xi0wXiI4XitYXipXXjE1XiRyXipBXjJtXidWXiEiXixYXiE9Xi5UXil5XiQxXipGXitBXiJcIA==",
      "byte_length": 94
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cb4d9cc5623c",
      "text": "蓋德隆村了？如你所見，我們這裡的傷患都快把我們給淹沒了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-d^#j^)T^$z^*D^.V^#$^*F^$)^-m^*A^$%^*{^(s^-j^&Z^!^^;Q^)$^*L^$1^$%^*{^'A^0l^%\\^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi1kXiNqXilUXiR6XipEXi5WXiMkXipGXiQpXi1tXipBXiQlXip7XihzXi1qXiZaXiFeXjtRXikkXipMXiQxXiQlXip7XidBXjBsXiVcXipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_eb0eae56e156",
      "text": "  戰鬥過後這裡的情況如何？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$(^*,^(x^#b^(s^-j^&Z^,0^,q^#$^!L^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCheKixeKHheI2JeKHNeLWpeJlpeLDBeLHFeIyReIUxeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5935f9701b1b",
      "text": "  莉娜拉現在好嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^'{^/*^$6^&?^\"d^+i^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJ3teLypeJDZeJj9eImReK2leK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7621033c4a59",
      "text": "  需要我幫忙嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^)e^(C^$%^+}^,+^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKWVeKENeJCVeK31eLCteK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 23
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3ffe405df3c6",
      "text": "  妳最近有聽說什麼動靜嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^7(^$q^(l^$s^-X^-x^!=^.T^\"%^)h^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeNyheJHFeKGxeJHNeLVheLXheIT1eLlReIiVeKWheK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9d00cfda5597",
      "text": "保重，茉莉。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!T^))^*A^'z^'{^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFUXikpXipBXid6Xid7XiEi",
      "byte_length": 18
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_678f9f308a2b",
      "text": "正如我所說的，鎮上的傷患讓我們忙得不可開交。我很慶幸 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%H^#$^$%^$)^-x^&Z^*A^);^!'^&Z^!^^;Q^-}^$%^*{^,+^#e^!)^\"A^)F^0P^!\"^$%^*K^5P^15 ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVIXiMkXiQlXiQpXi14XiZaXipBXik7XiEnXiZaXiFeXjtRXi19XiQlXip7XiwrXiNlXiEpXiJBXilGXjBQXiEiXiQlXipLXjVQXjE1IA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2ae55294bb90",
      "text": "當初好好指導了莉娜拉，否則我現在肯定會焦頭爛額—— ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&N^1\"^+i^+i^$8^10^*D^'{^/*^$6^*A^\"H^!x^$%^&?^\"d^-Z^#.^$r^%~^)t^&-^)v^*n^*n ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZOXjEiXitpXitpXiQ4XjEwXipEXid7Xi8qXiQ2XipBXiJIXiF4XiQlXiY/XiJkXi1aXiMuXiRyXiV+Xil0XiYtXil2XipuXipuIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e8691584c2e2",
      "text": "她幫了非常大的忙。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+h^+}^*D^)i^#O^\"z^&Z^,+^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitoXit9XipEXilpXiNPXiJ6XiZaXiwrXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 28
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ee1007805666",
      "text": "她就在這附近，你何不親自去問她？不過我可以告訴你， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+h^*J^\"d^(s^.?^(l^*A^*F^!L^!)^(F^'l^\"6^*Z^+h^.V^!)^(x^$%^\"A^!B^+B^-t^*F^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitoXipKXiJkXihzXi4/XihsXipBXipGXiFMXiEpXihGXidsXiI2XipaXitoXi5WXiEpXih4XiQlXiJBXiFCXitCXi10XipGXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ae60d779337b",
      "text": "我對她的付出深感欽佩——要是沒有她，早在你們出現之前，威米亞斯就已經把 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^#:^+h^&Z^*u^!q^2*^#{^<@^.}^*n^*n^(C^,X^%\\^$s^+h^*A^,V^\"d^*F^*{^!q^&?^!/^!z^*A^#&^'4^!9^$[^*J^#J^'D^$1 ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiM6XitoXiZaXip1XiFxXjIqXiN7XjxAXi59XipuXipuXihDXixYXiVcXiRzXitoXipBXixWXiJkXipGXip7XiFxXiY/XiEvXiF6XipBXiMmXic0XiE5XiRbXipKXiNKXidEXiQxIA==",
      "byte_length": 106
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_886a84a60ab9",
      "text": "所有村民給殺光了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$)^$s^$z^%T^'A^%M^!c^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQpXiRzXiR6XiVUXidBXiVNXiFjXipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 28
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_78b356ab9467",
      "text": "嗯，除非你想幫忙照料傷患，否則恐怕沒有什麼能讓 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^6N^*A^)Q^)i^*F^,1^+}^,+^/x^/n^!^^;Q^*A^\"H^!x^#t^0^^%\\^$s^!=^.T^'b^-} ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjZOXipBXilRXilpXipGXiwxXit9XiwrXi94Xi9uXiFeXjtRXipBXiJIXiF4XiN0XjBeXiVcXiRzXiE9Xi5UXidiXi19IA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ac71e0a0e785",
      "text": "你們插手的事。我了解你們這種人——你們寧可外出斬妖除魔，也不想留在這裡 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^4{^$+^&Z^*r^!\"^$%^*D^(I^*F^*{^(s^'$^!<^*n^*n^*F^*{^3k^\"A^\"w^!q^9B^<9^)Q^*0^*A^!1^!)^,1^-+^\"d^(s^-j ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XjR7XiQrXiZaXipyXiEiXiQlXipEXihJXipGXip7XihzXickXiE8XipuXipuXipGXip7XjNrXiJBXiJ3XiFxXjlCXjw5XilRXiowXipBXiExXiEpXiwxXi0rXiJkXihzXi1qIA==",
      "byte_length": 106
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f98b8179ed0e",
      "text": "伺候病人。別擔心，我並不在意。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^0Q^*|^&R^!<^!\"^*H^*N^#k^*A^$%^!+^!)^\"d^#z^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjBRXip8XiZSXiE8XiEiXipIXipOXiNrXipBXiQlXiErXiEpXiJkXiN6XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4dafefb1f0fe",
      "text": "嗯，讓我想想…… ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^6N^*A^-}^$%^,1^,1^*o^*o ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjZOXipBXi19XiQlXiwxXiwxXipvXipvIA==",
      "byte_length": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8b7c2d6d26b8",
      "text": "我聽說東南方有個名叫巴爾卡札的滅絕者，正在給瑪格拉獸惹 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^-X^-x^,`^\"/^$]^$s^!V^\"F^+<^#K^&/^\"0^.k^&Z^%t^-I^'V^*A^%H^\"d^'A^-*^%*^$6^&<^3s ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXi1YXi14XixgXiIvXiRdXiRzXiFWXiJGXis8XiNLXiYvXiIwXi5rXiZaXiV0Xi1JXidWXipBXiVIXiJkXidBXi0qXiUqXiQ2XiY8XjNzIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0e014e331187",
      "text": "麻煩。那些瑪格拉獸顯然住在底下的某種洞穴裡。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*6^-!^!\"^)!^!8^-*^%*^$6^&<^4&^&\"^*z^\"d^/^^!(^&Z^%$^'$^%h^'&^-j^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xio2Xi0hXiEiXikhXiE4Xi0qXiUqXiQ2XiY8XjQmXiYiXip6XiJkXi9eXiEoXiZaXiUkXickXiVoXicmXi1qXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_641f2592bd91",
      "text": "我聽說洞口非常顯眼，絕對不會錯過。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^-X^-x^%h^\"<^)i^#O^4&^&d^*A^-I^#:^!)^$r^)5^(x^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXi1YXi14XiVoXiI8XilpXiNPXjQmXiZkXipBXi1JXiM6XiEpXiRyXik1Xih4XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_47152fde8dd1",
      "text": "城邊住著一個名叫達戈拉爾的傢伙——我聽說你可以從下水道 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+_^.8^*z^-a^!%^!V^\"F^+<^(z^*M^$6^&/^&Z^+#^*y^*n^*n^$%^-X^-x^*F^\"A^!B^#f^!(^%V^(y ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitfXi44Xip6Xi1hXiElXiFWXiJGXis8Xih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXiZaXisjXip5XipuXipuXiQlXi1YXi14XipGXiJBXiFCXiNmXiEoXiVWXih5IA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c04456ab69f0",
      "text": "進入他的領地，但進去的人從來沒有一個能活著走出來。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(w^!f^!@^&Z^)s^\"e^*A^!I^(w^\"6^&Z^!<^#f^!O^%\\^$s^!%^!V^'b^%i^-a^.&^!q^!O^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xih3XiFmXiFAXiZaXilzXiJlXipBXiFJXih3XiI2XiZaXiE8XiNmXiFPXiVcXiRzXiElXiFWXidiXiVpXi1hXi4mXiFxXiFPXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a83494b7e561",
      "text": "去和下水道裡的頭骨長者談談吧——我聽說他們知道通往那裡的路。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"6^\"O^!(^%V^(y^-j^&Z^)t^*$^)C^'V^0;^0;^*I^*n^*n^$%^-X^-x^!@^*{^&h^(y^(t^,)^)!^-j^&Z^(a^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiI2XiJPXiEoXiVWXih5Xi1qXiZaXil0XiokXilDXidWXjA7XjA7XipJXipuXipuXiQlXi1YXi14XiFAXip7XiZoXih5Xih0XiwpXikhXi1qXiZaXihhXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f2849872d68a",
      "text": "願命運為你們帶來榮耀。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.H^\"N^.4^%{^*F^*{^#N^!O^,e^7D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi5IXiJOXi40XiV7XipGXip7XiNOXiFPXixlXjdEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9292a5549818",
      "text": "我真是感激不盡，謝謝你們將我們從德拉吉的魔爪中拯救出來。這是歷史性的一天—— ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^-2^,X^#{^1H^!)^-1^*A^-z^-z^*F^*{^#7^$%^*{^#f^#j^$6^\"D^&Z^*0^&.^!,^,F^,Q^!q^!O^!\"^(s^,X^6^^1m^#r^&Z^!%^+e^*n^*n ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXi0yXixYXiN7XjFIXiEpXi0xXipBXi16Xi16XipGXip7XiM3XiQlXip7XiNmXiNqXiQ2XiJEXiZaXiowXiYuXiEsXixGXixRXiFxXiFPXiEiXihzXixYXjZeXjFtXiNyXiZaXiElXitlXipuXipuIA==",
      "byte_length": 115
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2e8528036455",
      "text": "奴隸們團結一致對抗城邦！感謝你們播下了 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^##^)Z^*{^0V^'@^!%^'o^#:^$4^+_^1a^*W^#{^-z^*F^*{^4A^!(^*D ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiMjXilaXip7XjBWXidAXiElXidvXiM6XiQ0XitfXjFhXipXXiN7Xi16XipGXip7XjRBXiEoXipEIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cabe4de8d6f2",
      "text": "反抗的種子。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"9^$4^&Z^'$^#(^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiI5XiQ0XiZaXickXiMoXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 19
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_46ca8438bb5e",
      "text": "噢！剛才一陣混亂，我都差點忘了——你們拿到 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+]^*W^+0^$,^!%^)P^%n^!3^*A^$%^)$^48^*;^0]^*D^*n^*n^*F^*{^,G^!u ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitdXipXXiswXiQsXiElXilQXiVuXiEzXipBXiQlXikkXjQ4Xio7XjBdXipEXipuXipuXipGXip7XixHXiF1IA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e2796a079858",
      "text": "加林神父的木髓萃取液了嗎？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"\"^/1^&w^5d^&Z^$v^*)^'}^\":^%l^*D^+X^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiIiXi8xXiZ3XjVkXiZaXiR2XiopXid9XiI6XiVsXipEXitYXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 40
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1924cde0c996",
      "text": "  大戰過後鎮上的情況如何？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^\"z^$(^(x^#b^);^!'^&Z^,0^,q^#$^!L^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeInpeJCheKHheI2JeKTteISdeJlpeLDBeLHFeIyReIUxeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b3b215f1c0ee",
      "text": "  茉莉現在好嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^'z^'{^&?^\"d^+i^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJ3peJ3teJj9eImReK2leK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 23
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fc8f02b4bd07",
      "text": "  我能幫上什麼忙嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^'b^+}^!'^!=^.T^,+^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeJ2JeK31eISdeIT1eLlReLCteK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7d953ddbb9c8",
      "text": "  我身上剛好帶著。拿去吧。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^(c^!'^+0^+i^#N^-a^!\"^,G^\"6^*I^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeKGNeISdeKzBeK2leI05eLWFeISJeLEdeIjZeKkleISIg",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8d4ca7cbe043",
      "text": "  這是妳要的萃取液。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^(s^,X^7(^(C^&Z^'}^\":^%l^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKHNeLFheNyheKENeJlpeJ31eIjpeJWxeISIg",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d49246397c78",
      "text": "  好。我這就去替妳取來。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^+i^!\"^$%^(s^*J^\"6^2o^7(^\":^!O^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeK2leISJeJCVeKHNeKkpeIjZeMm9eNyheIjpeIU9eISIg",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_aab562df77a7",
      "text": "  我在哪裡能找到萃取液？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^\"d^+I^-j^'b^$/^!u^'}^\":^%l^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeImReK0leLWpeJ2JeJC9eIXVeJ31eIjpeJWxeLlYg",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_110a43968042",
      "text": "再見，莉娜拉。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!l^-m^*A^'{^/*^$6^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFsXi1tXipBXid7Xi8qXiQ2XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 22
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ac63dc3d008e",
      "text": "嗯，我們還撐得住。有許多傷患需要照料， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^6N^*A^$%^*{^.7^,L^#e^*z^!\"^$s^-s^\"x^!^^;Q^)e^(C^/x^/n^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjZOXipBXiQlXip7Xi43XixMXiNlXip6XiEiXiRzXi1zXiJ4XiFeXjtRXillXihDXi94Xi9uXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_aad2940f3feb",
      "text": "要是茉莉能幫忙負擔肯定會減輕許多，但命運卻 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(C^,X^'z^'{^'b^+}^,+^(W^*N^-Z^#.^$r^%o^(g^-s^\"x^*A^!I^\"N^.4^1& ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihDXixYXid6Xid7XidiXit9XiwrXihXXipOXi1aXiMuXiRyXiVvXihnXi1zXiJ4XipBXiFJXiJOXi40XjEmIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d56a83947d31",
      "text": "把她從我們身邊奪走了。至少她的教導賜予了我 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$1^+h^#f^$%^*{^(c^.8^1,^.&^*D^!\"^'n^#<^+h^&Z^,R^10^.#^!4^*D^$% ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQxXitoXiNmXiQlXip7XihjXi44XjEsXi4mXipEXiEiXiduXiM8XitoXiZaXixSXjEwXi4jXiE0XipEXiQlIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_65690a14f3d4",
      "text": "治療傷患的能力。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%_^&U^!^^;Q^&Z^'b^!~^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVfXiZVXiFeXjtRXiZaXidiXiF+XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ec7f3f993d21",
      "text": "但有了茉莉回來幫忙，一切都輕鬆多了。若沒有她的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!I^$s^*D^'z^'{^\"\\^!O^+}^,+^*A^!%^+.^)$^(g^.R^\"x^*D^!\"^'x^%\\^$s^+h^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFJXiRzXipEXid6Xid7XiJcXiFPXit9XiwrXipBXiElXisuXikkXihnXi5SXiJ4XipEXiEiXid4XiVcXiRzXitoXiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_760e65aafdab",
      "text": "教誨，我簡直不敢想像這座村子如今會變成什麼模樣。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,R^<F^*A^$%^3y^&`^!)^/m^,1^!`^(s^/_^$z^#(^#$^*E^$r^(U^$$^!=^.T^%:^,f^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XixSXjxGXipBXiQlXjN5XiZgXiEpXi9tXiwxXiFgXihzXi9fXiR6XiMoXiMkXipFXiRyXihVXiQkXiE9Xi5UXiU6XixmXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7d54bd2b279d",
      "text": "她很好，只是手頭上要做的事情太多，顯得有些焦慮。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+h^*K^+i^*A^\"?^,X^$+^)t^!'^(C^*~^&Z^*r^,0^+f^\"x^*A^4&^#e^$s^!8^%~^19^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitoXipLXitpXipBXiI/XixYXiQrXil0XiEnXihDXip+XiZaXipyXiwwXitmXiJ4XipBXjQmXiNlXiRzXiE4XiV+XjE5XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_daf9e61b1d0e",
      "text": "如果你想跟她談談，我相信她一定會為你抽空。她就在這附近 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#$^%!^*F^,1^.+^+h^0;^0;^*A^$%^&a^!U^+h^!%^#.^$r^%{^*F^*_^'(^!\"^+h^*J^\"d^(s^.?^(l ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiMkXiUhXipGXiwxXi4rXitoXjA7XjA7XipBXiQlXiZhXiFVXitoXiElXiMuXiRyXiV7XipGXipfXicoXiEiXitoXipKXiJkXihzXi4/XihsIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_597415dd9017",
      "text": "你看上去不像個溫柔體貼的人，我懷疑你有沒有耐心待在 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*Q^!'^\"6^!)^!`^!V^%s^0f^**^<G^&Z^!<^*A^$%^,9^0p^*F^$s^%\\^$s^-S^#k^,*^\"d ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXipRXiEnXiI2XiEpXiFgXiFWXiVzXjBmXioqXjxHXiZaXiE8XipBXiQlXiw5XjBwXipGXiRzXiVcXiRzXi1TXiNrXiwqXiJkIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_75b942ca7337",
      "text": "這裡夠久來幫我們，不過沒關係。你為這個村莊——以及整個阿塔斯—— ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^-j^+d^!.^!O^+}^$%^*{^*A^!)^(x^%\\^.>^38^!\"^*F^%{^(s^!V^$z^6l^*n^*n^!B^\"7^$T^!V^)M^\"o^$[^*n^*n ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXi1qXitkXiEuXiFPXit9XiQlXip7XipBXiEpXih4XiVcXi4+XjM4XiEiXipGXiV7XihzXiFWXiR6XjZsXipuXipuXiFCXiI3XiRUXiFWXilNXiJvXiRbXipuXipuIA==",
      "byte_length": 97
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b70732d9a0df",
      "text": "所做的奉獻早已遠遠足夠了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$)^*~^&Z^1+^-(^,V^#J^({^({^(^^+d^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQpXip+XiZaXjErXi0oXixWXiNKXih7Xih7XiheXitkXipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 40
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d4aabd43c283",
      "text": "太好了！我現在比以往更需要它——這裡有太多的傷患等著 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+f^+i^*D^*W^$%^&?^\"d^,m^!B^,)^$o^)e^(C^+o^*n^*n^(s^-j^$s^+f^\"x^&Z^!^^;Q^'-^-a ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitmXitpXipEXipXXiQlXiY/XiJkXixtXiFCXiwpXiRvXillXihDXitvXipuXipuXihzXi1qXiRzXitmXiJ4XiZaXiFeXjtRXictXi1hIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d1d8bc3d19c6",
      "text": "用呢。這是給你的報酬。雖然不多，但我希望它能在你的旅程中 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&H^+C^!\"^(s^,X^'A^*F^&Z^+`^7o^!\"^.A^&\"^!)^\"x^*A^!I^$%^+{^,]^+o^'b^\"d^*F^&Z^2m^'#^!, ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZIXitDXiEiXihzXixYXidBXipGXiZaXitgXjdvXiEiXi5BXiYiXiEpXiJ4XipBXiFJXiQlXit7XixdXitvXidiXiJkXipGXiZaXjJtXicjXiEsIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0de8c1b6386b",
      "text": "對你有所幫助。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#:^*F^$s^$)^+}^\"#^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiM6XipGXiRzXiQpXit9XiIjXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 22
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_246bc493ef51",
      "text": "在東南方的提奎茲爾村，有一位名叫加林神父的牧師。他 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"d^,`^\"/^$]^&Z^$A^5B^/D^&/^$z^*A^$s^!%^!J^\"F^+<^\"\"^/1^&w^5d^&Z^/5^#M^!\"^!@ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJkXixgXiIvXiRdXiZaXiRBXjVCXi9EXiYvXiR6XipBXiRzXiElXiFKXiJGXis8XiIiXi8xXiZ3XjVkXiZaXi81XiNNXiEiXiFAIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ca14014fa1fb",
      "text": "用植物與仙人掌提煉這種木髓萃取液。如果找到他，直接向他詢問 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&H^%3^&4^'p^!A^!<^$;^$A^9\"^(s^'$^$v^*)^'}^\":^%l^!\"^#$^%!^$/^!u^!@^*A^&`^$?^+?^!@^;!^*Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZIXiUzXiY0XidwXiFBXiE8XiQ7XiRBXjkiXihzXickXiR2XiopXid9XiI6XiVsXiEiXiMkXiUhXiQvXiF1XiFAXipBXiZgXiQ/Xis/XiFAXjshXipaIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2b7672afaca9",
      "text": "便是。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!R^,X^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFSXixYXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 10
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f32d9b082431",
      "text": "實際上，你確實可以。我需要一些木髓萃取液——在威米亞斯統治這裡時， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#3^30^!'^*A^*F^-6^#3^\"A^!B^!\"^$%^)e^(C^!%^!8^$v^*)^'}^\":^%l^*n^*n^\"d^#&^'4^!9^$[^'B^%_^(s^-j^$f^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiMzXjMwXiEnXipBXipGXi02XiMzXiJBXiFCXiEiXiQlXillXihDXiElXiE4XiR2XiopXid9XiI6XiVsXipuXipuXiJkXiMmXic0XiE5XiRbXidCXiVfXihzXi1qXiRmXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 100
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8fb27c5321f2",
      "text": "我用它來讓村民保持昏睡鎮定，而現在我真的很需要它來救治 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^&H^+o^!O^-}^$z^%T^!T^$7^$d^-3^);^#.^*A^'W^&?^\"d^$%^-2^&Z^*K^)e^(C^+o^!O^,Q^%_ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiZIXitvXiFPXi19XiR6XiVUXiFUXiQ3XiRkXi0zXik7XiMuXipBXidXXiY/XiJkXiQlXi0yXiZaXipLXillXihDXitvXiFPXixRXiVfIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_44882b39d3df",
      "text": "傷患。如果你能幫我弄來，我會非常感激。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!^^;Q^!\"^#$^%!^*F^'b^+}^$%^/`^!O^*A^$%^$r^)i^#O^#{^1H^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFeXjtRXiEiXiMkXiUhXipGXidiXit9XiQlXi9gXiFPXipBXiQlXiRyXilpXiNPXiN7XjFIXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_47f5a34d4115",
      "text": "你願意幫我取來嗎？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^.H^#z^+}^$%^\":^!O^+X^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXi5IXiN6Xit9XiQlXiI6XiFPXitYXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 28
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8c8302df063b",
      "text": "我希望你能再考慮一下。我真的很需要它。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^+{^,]^*F^'b^!l^-R^19^!%^!(^!\"^$%^-2^&Z^*K^)e^(C^+o^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXit7XixdXipGXidiXiFsXi1SXjE5XiElXiEoXiEiXiQlXi0yXiZaXipLXillXihDXitvXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_babb44125a70",
      "text": "你將碎片放上雕像，但仍然缺少了一塊碎片。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^#7^&o^&1^$P^!'^)^^!`^*A^!I^!?^&\"^7e^#<^*D^!%^/Z^&o^&1^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiM3XiZvXiYxXiRQXiEnXileXiFgXipBXiFJXiE/XiYiXjdlXiM8XipEXiElXi9aXiZvXiYxXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f6f046be3d38",
      "text": "仍然缺少了一塊碎片…… ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!?^&\"^7e^#<^*D^!%^/Z^&o^&1^*o^*o ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiE/XiYiXjdlXiM8XipEXiElXi9aXiZvXiYxXipvXipvIA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fb0353afcf2c",
      "text": "有些事不太對勁……你說不上來為什麼，但空氣中突然 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$s^!8^*r^!)^+f^#:^+3^*o^*o^*F^-x^!)^!'^!O^%{^!=^.T^*A^!I^'(^%U^!,^'*^&\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRzXiE4XipyXiEpXitmXiM6XiszXipvXipvXipGXi14XiEpXiEnXiFPXiV7XiE9Xi5UXipBXiFJXicoXiVVXiEsXicqXiYiIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5c129e43ee5b",
      "text": "透出一股寒意，周圍的陰影似乎比先前更為深沉陰暗了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(q^!q^!%^'_^#1^#z^*A^\"L^\"`^&Z^6B^#a^!H^!0^,m^!b^!z^$o^%{^2*^%Z^6B^$k^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihxXiFxXiElXidfXiMxXiN6XipBXiJMXiJgXiZaXjZCXiNhXiFIXiEwXixtXiFiXiF6XiRvXiV7XjIqXiVaXjZCXiRrXipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1f58f123d8c5",
      "text": "你休想逃出我的手掌心！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^!G^,1^(p^!q^$%^&Z^$+^$;^#k^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiFHXiwxXihwXiFxXiQlXiZaXiQrXiQ7XiNrXipX",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5cb8bb47c531",
      "text": "黑影在無聲的尖叫中消散於虛無。在那一剎那，你 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*:^#a^\"d^%}^-W^&Z^#=^+<^!,^%k^$S^$^^-g^%}^!\"^\"d^)!^!%^<5^)!^*A^*F ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xio6XiNhXiJkXiV9Xi1XXiZaXiM9Xis8XiEsXiVrXiRTXiReXi1nXiV9XiEiXiJkXikhXiElXjw1XikhXipBXipGIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8b70f88ca303",
      "text": "看清了它的面孔……那是你以前遇過的人……威米亞斯。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*Q^,u^*D^+o^&Z^)j^5G^*o^*o^)!^,X^*F^!B^!z^.2^(x^&Z^!<^*o^*o^#&^'4^!9^$[^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipRXix1XipEXitvXiZaXilqXjVHXipvXipvXikhXixYXipGXiFCXiF6Xi4yXih4XiZaXiE8XipvXipvXiMmXic0XiE5XiRbXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d362778f289e",
      "text": "幾乎在同一瞬間，空氣中的壓迫感煙消雲散，刺骨的寒意也隨之褪去。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#T^!0^\"d^\"E^!%^1N^)G^*A^'(^%U^!,^&Z^4v^1`^#{^4S^%k^)b^$S^*A^!w^*$^&Z^#1^#z^!1^)X^!/^<E^\"6^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNUXiEwXiJkXiJFXiElXjFOXilHXipBXicoXiVVXiEsXiZaXjR2XjFgXiN7XjRTXiVrXiliXiRTXipBXiF3XiokXiZaXiMxXiN6XiExXilYXiEvXjxFXiI2XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 94
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0b30989f4fd0",
      "text": "黑影一言不發，只是匆匆掠過，顯然是要趕往某處…… ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*:^#a^!%^1Y^!)^&W^*A^\"?^,X^<6^<6^1<^(x^*A^4&^&\"^,X^(C^0u^,)^%$^(,^*o^*o ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xio6XiNhXiElXjFZXiEpXiZXXipBXiI/XixYXjw2Xjw2XjE8Xih4XipBXjQmXiYiXixYXihDXjB1XiwpXiUkXigsXipvXipvIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_221a66dfe9c8",
      "text": "當黑影觸及雕像時，它竟然融入了雕像之中！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&N^*:^#a^(J^\"7^)^^!`^$f^*A^+o^28^&\"^(7^!f^*D^)^^!`^!/^!,^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZOXio6XiNhXihKXiI3XileXiFgXiRmXipBXitvXjI4XiYiXig3XiFmXipEXileXiFgXiEvXiEsXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1e0b7cd083cc",
      "text": "一股寒意驟然竄上你的脊樑。絕對有什麼事情不對勁…… ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!%^'_^#1^#z^7M^&\"^7c^!'^*F^&Z^9'^<?^!\"^-I^#:^$s^!=^.T^*r^,0^!)^#:^+3^*o^*o ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiElXidfXiMxXiN6XjdNXiYiXjdjXiEnXipGXiZaXjknXjw/XiEiXi1JXiM6XiRzXiE9Xi5UXipyXiwwXiEpXiM6XiszXipvXipvIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_774c596ddf27",
      "text": "蠢貨！你們拼合了雕像，將我的靈魂召喚了回來！如今我已重獲 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.u^.w^*W^*F^*{^;Z^\"C^*D^)^^!`^*A^#7^$%^&Z^)g^*.^\"@^\"U^*D^\"\\^!O^*W^#$^*E^$%^#J^))^&: ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi51Xi53XipXXipGXip7XjtaXiJDXipEXileXiFgXipBXiM3XiQlXiZaXilnXiouXiJAXiJVXipEXiJcXiFPXipXXiMkXipFXiQlXiNKXikpXiY6IA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_afc698ac89b5",
      "text": "真身，整個阿塔斯都將跪伏在我腳下！準備成為我的第一批 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-2^(c^*A^$T^!V^)M^\"o^$[^)$^#7^<H^3c^\"d^$%^00^!(^*W^,x^+\"^$$^%{^$%^&Z^',^!%^2i ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi0yXihjXipBXiRUXiFWXilNXiJvXiRbXikkXiM3XjxIXjNjXiJkXiQlXjAwXiEoXipXXix4XisiXiQkXiV7XiQlXiZaXicsXiElXjJpIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_db3de5ec7aa9",
      "text": "祭品吧！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&x^\"R^*I^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZ4XiJSXipJXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 13
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f99fc6729778",
      "text": "一陣震耳欲聾的威嚴巨響撕裂了寂靜！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!%^)P^32^'Y^4I^']^&Z^#&^1*^#H^)o^/k^8r^*D^<:^)h^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiElXilQXjMyXidZXjRJXiddXiZaXiMmXjEqXiNIXilvXi9rXjhyXipEXjw6XiloXipX",
      "byte_length": 51
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3a2db00425af",
      "text": "蠢貨！你們拼合了雕像，將我的靈魂召喚了回來！我已重獲 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.u^.w^*W^*F^*{^;Z^\"C^*D^)^^!`^*A^#7^$%^&Z^)g^*.^\"@^\"U^*D^\"\\^!O^*W^$%^#J^))^&: ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi51Xi53XipXXipGXip7XjtaXiJDXipEXileXiFgXipBXiM3XiQlXiZaXilnXiouXiJAXiJVXipEXiJcXiFPXipXXiQlXiNKXikpXiY6IA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_94ce0b9242cd",
      "text": "真身，整個阿塔斯都將跪伏在我腳下！你們休想離開這裡！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-2^(c^*A^$T^!V^)M^\"o^$[^)$^#7^<H^3c^\"d^$%^00^!(^*W^*F^*{^!G^,1^)`^)F^(s^-j^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi0yXihjXipBXiRUXiFWXilNXiJvXiRbXikkXiM3XjxIXjNjXiJkXiQlXjAwXiEoXipXXipGXip7XiFHXiwxXilgXilGXihzXi1qXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ba3e5649be03",
      "text": "我會找到你們——而你們必死無疑！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^$r^$/^!u^*F^*{^*n^*n^'W^*F^*{^#l^%L^%}^0p^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiRyXiQvXiF1XipGXip7XipuXipuXidXXipGXip7XiNsXiVMXiV9XjBwXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 49
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f28e0b5da9d1",
      "text": "這座雕像高達七英尺，外觀呈蜿蜒蛇形。看起來年代 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^/_^)^^!`^*+^(z^<2^'y^<;^*A^\"w^*R^<8^6q^6p^(/^#_^!\"^*Q^.(^!O^+~^*v ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXi9fXileXiFgXiorXih6XjwyXid5Xjw7XipBXiJ3XipSXjw4XjZxXjZwXigvXiNfXiEiXipRXi4oXiFPXit+Xip2IA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_77c1cf78cf10",
      "text": "極其久遠。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^1D^!j^!.^({^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjFEXiFqXiEuXih7XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 16
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_975c85821030",
      "text": "你的魔法感應察覺到一股從雕像散發出的漆黑力場。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^&Z^*0^%b^#{^0`^#2^(G^!u^!%^'_^#f^)^^!`^$S^&W^!q^&Z^6d^*:^!~^\"n^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiZaXiowXiViXiN7XjBgXiMyXihHXiF1XiElXidfXiNmXileXiFgXiRTXiZXXiFxXiZaXjZkXio6XiF+XiJuXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_aae21dca3671",
      "text": "顯而易見，它源於邪惡。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^4&^'W^,W^-m^*A^+o^%q^$^^)\"^#y^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjQmXidXXixXXi1tXipBXitvXiVxXiReXikiXiN5XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_95b91d456365",
      "text": "是什麼風把你們吹到這個被詛咒的地方來的？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,X^!=^.T^)y^$1^*F^*{^+A^!u^(s^!V^(@^(L^\"P^&Z^\"e^$]^!O^&Z^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XixYXiE9Xi5UXil5XiQxXipGXip7XitBXiF1XihzXiFWXihAXihMXiJQXiZaXiJlXiRdXiFPXiZaXi5W",
      "byte_length": 60
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8b442c929c05",
      "text": "  我們在四處探索，便來到了這裡。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^*{^\"d^\"[^(,^$>^'>^*A^!R^!O^!u^*D^(s^-j^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeKnteImReIlteKCxeJD5eJz5eKkFeIVJeIU9eIXVeKkReKHNeLWpeISI=",
      "byte_length": 47
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c384580a44c9",
      "text": "  我這裡有些木髓萃取液要給妳。拿去吧。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^(s^-j^$s^!8^$v^*)^'}^\":^%l^(C^'A^7(^!\"^,G^\"6^*I^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeKHNeLWpeJHNeITheJHZeKileJ31eIjpeJWxeKENeJ0FeNyheISJeLEdeIjZeKkleISIg",
      "byte_length": 57
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a99430952446",
      "text": "  村民們到底怎麼了？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$z^%T^*{^!u^/^^,,^.T^*D^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJHpeJVReKnteIXVeL15eLCxeLlReKkReLlY=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_73b58b24ebb4",
      "text": "  守衛們發生了什麼事？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^#+^(=^*{^&W^&F^*D^!=^.T^*r^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIyteKD1eKnteJldeJkZeKkReIT1eLlReKnJeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_70d9966bae82",
      "text": "  那種植物在哪裡？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^)!^'$^%3^&4^\"d^+I^-j^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKSFeJyReJTNeJjReImReK0leLWpeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d931ab38a22c",
      "text": "  我身上剛好帶著那種萃取液。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^(c^!'^+0^+i^#N^-a^)!^'$^'}^\":^%l^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeKGNeISdeKzBeK2leI05eLWFeKSFeJyReJ31eIjpeJWxeISI=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_14aac3f84f41",
      "text": "  好。我去幫妳找那種植物。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^+i^!\"^$%^\"6^+}^7(^$/^)!^'$^%3^&4^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeK2leISJeJCVeIjZeK31eNyheJC9eKSFeJyReJTNeJjReISI=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f2165989f034",
      "text": "  妳在村子裡是做什麼的？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^7(^\"d^$z^#(^-j^,X^*~^!=^.T^&Z^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeNyheImReJHpeIyheLWpeLFheKn5eIT1eLlReJlpeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c4c03ba0471d",
      "text": "  妳的姊姊在哪裡？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^7(^&Z^7)^7)^\"d^+I^-j^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeNyheJlpeNyleNyleImReK0leLWpeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_30d3974280bd",
      "text": "  茉莉還活著。她把這本書給了我。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^'z^'{^.7^%i^-a^!\"^+h^$1^(s^$x^$p^'A^*D^$%^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJ3peJ3teLjdeJWleLWFeISJeK2heJDFeKHNeJHheJHBeJ0FeKkReJCVeISI=",
      "byte_length": 47
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_34ac00367ec9",
      "text": "那你們最好轉身離開此地。這個村莊正籠罩在 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^*F^*{^$q^+i^(i^(c^)`^)F^%I^\"e^!\"^(s^!V^$z^6l^%H^'3^'P^\"d ",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXipGXip7XiRxXitpXihpXihjXilgXilGXiVJXiJlXiEiXihzXiFWXiR6XjZsXiVIXiczXidQXiJkIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2b4b4cebb2f6",
      "text": "黑暗咒語的陰影之下，你們停留得越久，被波及的風險就越大—— ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*:^$k^\"P^0:^&Z^6B^#a^!/^!(^*A^*F^*{^+!^-+^#e^(]^!.^*A^(@^%c^\"7^&Z^)y^*m^*J^(]^\"z^*n^*n ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xio6XiRrXiJQXjA6XiZaXjZCXiNhXiEvXiEoXipBXipGXip7XishXi0rXiNlXihdXiEuXipBXihAXiVjXiI3XiZaXil5XiptXipKXihdXiJ6XipuXipuIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f22c134191b7",
      "text": "就跟那些村民一模一樣！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*J^.+^)!^!8^$z^%T^!%^%:^!%^,f^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipKXi4rXikhXiE4XiR6XiVUXiElXiU6XiElXixmXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b34a8ab5e1d0",
      "text": "我是莉娜拉，唯一尚未受到",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^,X^'{^/*^$6^*A^+O^!%^+v^,_^\";^!u",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXixYXid7Xi8qXiQ2XipBXitPXiElXit2XixfXiI7XiF1",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_df6dcf163a0e",
      "text": " 威米亞斯帶給這座村莊的狂亂所侵蝕的人",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^#&^'4^!9^$[^#N^'A^(s^/_^$z^6l^&Z^&8^!3^$)^.X^(4^&Z^!<",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4jJl4nNF4hOV4kW14jTl4nQV4oc14vX14kel42bF4mWl4mOF4hM14kKV4uWF4oNF4mWl4hPA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e3cef4e5c44a",
      "text": "幾天前來了一名旅者，沉默寡言又陰沉乖戾。那個畜生束縛了 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#T^+e^!z^!O^*D^!%^\"F^2m^'V^*A^%Z^:d^8x^1Y^+;^6B^%Z^0{^<<^!\"^)!^!V^5f^&F^$|^3W^*D ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNUXitlXiF6XiFPXipEXiElXiJGXjJtXidWXipBXiVaXjpkXjh4XjFZXis7XjZCXiVaXjB7Xjw8XiEiXikhXiFWXjVmXiZGXiR8XjNXXipEIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_90085d8e372d",
      "text": "村長的心智，隨後召集了所有村民，讓他們變得萎靡不振或陷入瘋狂。唯獨 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$z^)C^&Z^#k^$i^*A^)X^#b^\"@^)]^*D^$)^$s^$z^%T^*A^-}^!@^*{^(U^#e^<D^;^^!)^85^$'^)S^!f^-/^&8^!\"^+O^/z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiR6XilDXiZaXiNrXiRpXipBXilYXiNiXiJAXildXipEXiQpXiRzXiR6XiVUXipBXi19XiFAXip7XihVXiNlXjxEXjteXiEpXjg1XiQnXilTXiFmXi0vXiY4XiEiXitPXi96IA==",
      "byte_length": 100
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5897103726a8",
      "text": "我因為受過魔法訓練而得以保持清醒。那個畜生的名字叫威米亞斯 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^\"]^%{^\";^(x^*0^%b^-p^-L^'W^#e^!B^!T^$7^,u^.9^!\"^)!^!V^5f^&F^&Z^\"F^#)^+<^#&^'4^!9^$[ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiJdXiV7XiI7Xih4XiowXiViXi1wXi1MXidXXiNlXiFCXiFUXiQ3Xix1Xi45XiEiXikhXiFWXjVmXiZGXiZaXiJGXiMpXis8XiMmXic0XiE5XiRbIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_69c9b2a3c4b4",
      "text": "——一名滅絕者。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*n^*n^!%^\"F^%t^-I^'V^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipuXipuXiElXiJGXiV0Xi1JXidWXiEi",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5905a604bd65",
      "text": "威米亞斯的控制扭曲了他們的心智。這般力量著實駭人！他 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#&^'4^!9^$[^&Z^$@^!v^1;^$n^*D^!@^*{^&Z^#k^$i^!\"^(s^'r^!~^)*^-a^#3^4(^!<^*W^!@ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiMmXic0XiE5XiRbXiZaXiRAXiF2XjE7XiRuXipEXiFAXip7XiZaXiNrXiRpXiEiXihzXidyXiF+XikqXi1hXiMzXjQoXiE8XipXXiFAIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d8e2bd225e0d",
      "text": "只要一時興起就能摧毀整座村莊。他甚至把我們的守衛全趕走了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"?^(C^!%^$f^-]^.(^*J^'b^$E^%N^$T^/_^$z^6l^!\"^!@^/|^'n^$1^$%^*{^&Z^#+^(=^!h^0u^.&^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiI/XihDXiElXiRmXi1dXi4oXipKXidiXiRFXiVOXiRUXi9fXiR6XjZsXiEiXiFAXi98XiduXiQxXiQlXip7XiZaXiMrXig9XiFoXjB1Xi4mXipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 87
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_df5a2c005416",
      "text": "威米亞斯說，他根本不懼怕荒原能派出任何東西來對付蓋德隆。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#&^'4^!9^$[^-x^*A^!@^%)^$x^!)^$#^0^^1W^\"5^'b^.n^!q^!C^!L^,`^-l^!O^#:^*u^-d^#j^)T^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiMmXic0XiE5XiRbXi14XipBXiFAXiUpXiR4XiEpXiQjXjBeXjFXXiI1XidiXi5uXiFxXiFDXiFMXixgXi1sXiFPXiM6Xip1Xi1kXiNqXilUXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_875dc0ab99ee",
      "text": "他把所有的守衛都賣給了一支德拉吉巡邏隊。我不知道他們達成了什麼 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^$1^$)^$s^&Z^#+^(=^)$^.$^'A^*D^!%^$L^#j^$6^\"D^8g^8u^)U^!\"^$%^!)^&h^(y^!@^*{^(z^$$^*D^!=^.T ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXiQxXiQpXiRzXiZaXiMrXig9XikkXi4kXidBXipEXiElXiRMXiNqXiQ2XiJEXjhnXjh1XilVXiEiXiQlXiEpXiZoXih5XiFAXip7Xih6XiQkXipEXiE9Xi5UIA==",
      "byte_length": 94
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_19c1d9c94d33",
      "text": "交易，但我們的守軍默默地跟著走了，而德拉吉軍隊也沒有 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^0P^,W^*A^!I^$%^*{^&Z^#+^..^:d^:d^\"e^.+^-a^.&^*D^*A^'W^#j^$6^\"D^..^)U^!1^%\\^$s ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjBQXixXXipBXiFJXiQlXip7XiZaXiMrXi4uXjpkXjpkXiJlXi4rXi1hXi4mXipEXipBXidXXiNqXiQ2XiJEXi4uXilVXiExXiVcXiRzIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_24d74fbabcee",
      "text": "洗劫村莊。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^0j^1l^$z^6l^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XjBqXjFsXiR6XjZsXiEi",
      "byte_length": 15
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_779b1affadc8",
      "text": "我照料傷患——你們總不可能忘了吧！我是這座村莊的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^/x^/n^!^^;Q^*n^*n^*F^*{^-M^!)^\"A^'b^0]^*D^*I^*W^$%^,X^(s^/_^$z^6l^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXi94Xi9uXiFeXjtRXipuXipuXipGXip7Xi1NXiEpXiJBXidiXjBdXipEXipJXipXXiQlXixYXihzXi9fXiR6XjZsXiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0a1d89c83498",
      "text": "醫者。好吧，雖然是我自封的，但我從沒聽過有人抱怨",
      "encoded_ascii": "^<J^'V^!\"^+i^*I^*A^.A^&\"^,X^$%^'l^#5^&Z^*A^!I^$%^#f^%\\^-X^(x^$s^!<^,@^3F",
      "encoded_base64": "XjxKXidWXiEiXitpXipJXipBXi5BXiYiXixYXiQlXidsXiM1XiZaXipBXiFJXiQlXiNmXiVcXi1YXih4XiRzXiE8XixAXjNG",
      "byte_length": 72
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e85088d11e83",
      "text": "我用這個頭銜。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^&H^(s^!V^)t^<K^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiZIXihzXiFWXil0XjxLXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 22
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f39ca8baa0be",
      "text": "我是這座村莊的醫者。我本想離開，但我姊姊至今尚未歸來。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^,X^(s^/_^$z^6l^&Z^<J^'V^!\"^$%^$x^,1^)`^)F^*A^!I^$%^7)^7)^'n^*E^+v^,_^%K^!O^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXixYXihzXi9fXiR6XjZsXiZaXjxKXidWXiEiXiQlXiR4XiwxXilgXilGXipBXiFJXiQlXjcpXjcpXiduXipFXit2XixfXiVLXiFPXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_06a6b5b2fe98",
      "text": "如果她還活著，一定會來這裡找我。在得知她的生死之前，我必須留守在此。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#$^%!^+h^.7^%i^-a^*A^!%^#.^$r^!O^(s^-j^$/^$%^!\"^\"d^#e^&h^+h^&Z^&F^%L^!/^!z^*A^$%^#l^)r^-+^#+^\"d^%I^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiMkXiUhXitoXi43XiVpXi1hXipBXiElXiMuXiRyXiFPXihzXi1qXiQvXiQlXiEiXiJkXiNlXiZoXitoXiZaXiZGXiVMXiEvXiF6XipBXiQlXiNsXilyXi0rXiMrXiJkXiVJXiEi",
      "byte_length": 102
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f7750e8ea768",
      "text": "我有些治療的天賦，所以便運用我的力量來救助村民。然而我的重擔 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^$s^!8^%_^&U^&Z^+e^(Y^*A^$)^!B^!R^.4^&H^$%^&Z^!~^)*^!O^,Q^\"#^$z^%T^!\"^&\"^'W^$%^&Z^))^*N ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiRzXiE4XiVfXiZVXiZaXitlXihZXipBXiQpXiFCXiFSXi40XiZIXiQlXiZaXiF+XikqXiFPXixRXiIjXiR6XiVUXiEiXiYiXidXXiQlXiZaXikpXipOIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f12b8eccb17e",
      "text": "與日俱增，因為現在我還得照顧那些發瘋的人。只要威米亞斯一時興起， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'p^$a^<3^\"s^*A^\"]^%{^&?^\"d^$%^.7^#e^/x^4n^)!^!8^&W^-/^&Z^!<^!\"^\"?^(C^#&^'4^!9^$[^!%^$f^-]^.(^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XidwXiRhXjwzXiJzXipBXiJdXiV7XiY/XiJkXiQlXi43XiNlXi94XjRuXikhXiE4XiZXXi0vXiZaXiE8XiEiXiI/XihDXiMmXic0XiE5XiRbXiElXiRmXi1dXi4oXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 97
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b481787c5ff0",
      "text": "村民就會陷入自殘，我必須保護他們。我一直在使用一種 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$z^%T^*J^$r^)S^!f^'l^,l^*A^$%^#l^)r^!T^(T^!@^*{^!\"^$%^!%^&`^\"d^!N^&H^!%^'$ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiR6XiVUXipKXiRyXilTXiFmXidsXixsXipBXiQlXiNsXilyXiFUXihUXiFAXip7XiEiXiQlXiElXiZgXiJkXiFOXiZIXiElXickIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1fad2ca3c42f",
      "text": "藥物讓他們昏昏欲睡，好讓威米亞斯難以操弄他們去互相傷害。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^()^&4^-}^!@^*{^$d^$d^4I^-3^*A^+i^-}^#&^'4^!9^$[^)a^!B^$H^/`^!@^*{^\"6^*s^&a^!^^#/^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XigpXiY0Xi19XiFAXip7XiRkXiRkXjRJXi0zXipBXitpXi19XiMmXic0XiE5XiRbXilhXiFCXiRIXi9gXiFAXip7XiI2XipzXiZhXiFeXiMvXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_aca1917b4cc7",
      "text": "她曾當面與威米亞斯對峙，但在威米亞斯威脅要殺光其他村民時 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+h^.j^&N^)j^'p^#&^'4^!9^$[^#:^;v^*A^!I^\"d^#&^'4^!9^$[^#&^1T^(C^%M^!c^!j^!@^$z^%T^$f ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitoXi5qXiZOXilqXidwXiMmXic0XiE5XiRbXiM6Xjt2XipBXiFJXiJkXiMmXic0XiE5XiRbXiMmXjFUXihDXiVNXiFjXiFqXiFAXiR6XiVUXiRmIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b3b3a02ec5d4",
      "text": "妥協了。她離開村子去替威米亞斯取某樣東西。我聽她提過東北方的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^5C^2[^*D^!\"^+h^)`^)F^$z^#(^\"6^2o^#&^'4^!9^$[^\":^%$^,f^,`^-l^!\"^$%^-X^+h^$A^(x^,`^+6^$]^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjVDXjJbXipEXiEiXitoXilgXilGXiR6XiMoXiI2XjJvXiMmXic0XiE5XiRbXiI6XiUkXixmXixgXi1sXiEiXiQlXi1YXitoXiRBXih4XixgXis2XiRdXiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_38479c561dac",
      "text": "一位德魯伊。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!%^!J^#j^/K^!E^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiElXiFKXiNqXi9LXiFFXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 19
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c827f3a53acb",
      "text": "噢，謝謝你們！你們卸下了我心中的一塊大石。我理應給你們 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+]^*A^-z^-z^*F^*{^*W^*F^*{^<7^!(^*D^$%^#k^!,^&Z^!%^/Z^\"z^&k^!\"^$%^&A^0`^'A^*F^*{ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitdXipBXi16Xi16XipGXip7XipXXipGXip7Xjw3XiEoXipEXiQlXiNrXiEsXiZaXiElXi9aXiJ6XiZrXiEiXiQlXiZBXjBgXidBXipGXip7IA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_437e3f7b880a",
      "text": "一些回報。去看看村長屋裡的那面掛毯後面吧。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!%^!8^\"\\^+`^!\"^\"6^*Q^*Q^$z^)C^8y^-j^&Z^)!^)j^$=^%S^#b^)j^*I^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiElXiE4XiJcXitgXiEiXiI2XipRXipRXiR6XilDXjh5Xi1qXiZaXikhXilqXiQ9XiVTXiNiXilqXipJXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_987b24b08404",
      "text": "威米亞斯的房間就藏在掛毯後——他在裡面的地毯下還藏了一個 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#&^'4^!9^$[^&Z^,<^)G^*J^-f^\"d^$=^%S^#b^*n^*n^!@^\"d^-j^)j^&Z^\"e^%S^!(^.7^-f^*D^!%^!V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiMmXic0XiE5XiRbXiZaXiw8XilHXipKXi1mXiJkXiQ9XiVTXiNiXipuXipuXiFAXiJkXi1qXilqXiZaXiJlXiVTXiEoXi43Xi1mXipEXiElXiFWIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_63ec46227f02",
      "text": "保險箱——我知道他在裡面藏了好多東西。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!T^*m^'/^*n^*n^$%^&h^(y^!@^\"d^-j^)j^-f^*D^+i^\"x^,`^-l^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFUXiptXicvXipuXipuXiQlXiZoXih5XiFAXiJkXi1qXilqXi1mXipEXitpXiJ4XixgXi1sXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_231aaa49a575",
      "text": "恭喜！隊伍獲得 1,000 點經驗值！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^1{^+V^*W^)U^!F^&:^#e 1,000 ^*;^'D^.P^!Z^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjF7XitWXipXXilVXiFGXiY6XiNlIDEsMDAwIF4qO14nRF4uUF4hWl4qVyA=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6bf86568eccf",
      "text": "老實說，我敢發誓茉莉只有一本法術書——事實上，我敢打包票。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'U^#3^-x^*A^$%^/m^&W^-w^'z^'{^\"?^$s^!%^$x^%b^(<^$p^*n^*n^*r^#3^!'^*A^$%^/m^$-^\"'^<A^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XidVXiMzXi14XipBXiQlXi9tXiZXXi13Xid6Xid7XiI/XiRzXiElXiR4XiViXig8XiRwXipuXipuXipyXiMzXiEnXipBXiQlXi9tXiQtXiInXjxBXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e4e2cbf61b58",
      "text": "你們到底是怎麼弄到好幾本的？算了，我就把你們手上的副本全部收下吧。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^!u^/^^,X^,,^.T^/`^!u^+i^#T^$x^&Z^.V^-C^*D^*A^$%^*J^$1^*F^*{^$+^!'^&Z^52^$x^!h^)#^$M^!(^*I^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiF1Xi9eXixYXiwsXi5UXi9gXiF1XitpXiNUXiR4XiZaXi5WXi1DXipEXipBXiQlXipKXiQxXipGXip7XiQrXiEnXiZaXjUyXiR4XiFoXikjXiRNXiEoXipJXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 100
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_26e23a3acd63",
      "text": "願你們踏上蔭涼的庇護之路。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.H^*F^*{^.,^!'^5~^,s^&Z^,\"^(T^!/^(a^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi5IXipGXip7Xi4sXiEnXjV+XixzXiZaXiwiXihUXiEvXihhXiEi",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c6b5ab708229",
      "text": "對了，如果你們有興趣，我需要更多調配藥物所用的植物萃取液。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#:^*D^*A^#$^%!^*F^*{^$s^-]^.*^*A^$%^)e^(C^$o^\"x^(Q^)&^()^&4^$)^&H^&Z^%3^&4^'}^\":^%l^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiM6XipEXipBXiMkXiUhXipGXip7XiRzXi1dXi4qXipBXiQlXillXihDXiRvXiJ4XihRXikmXigpXiY0XiQpXiZIXiZaXiUzXiY0Xid9XiI6XiVsXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_78565b5d5eab",
      "text": "我自己沒法離開跑這一趟——我必須留在這裡救人， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^'l^#I^%\\^%b^)`^)F^(_^(s^!%^8)^*n^*n^$%^#l^)r^-+^\"d^(s^-j^,Q^!<^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXidsXiNJXiVcXiViXilgXilGXihfXihzXiElXjgpXipuXipuXiQlXiNsXilyXi0rXiJkXihzXi1qXixRXiE8XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_70de0d4630ec",
      "text": "但如果你們願意幫忙，我一定會重重酬謝你們。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!I^#$^%!^*F^*{^.H^#z^+}^,+^*A^$%^!%^#.^$r^))^))^7o^-z^*F^*{^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFJXiMkXiUhXipGXip7Xi5IXiN6Xit9XiwrXipBXiQlXiElXiMuXiRyXikpXikpXjdvXi16XipGXip7XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3f0faf039606",
      "text": "東南方是提奎茲爾村。那裡有一位德魯伊加林神父，他擁有我所 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,`^\"/^$]^,X^$A^5B^/D^&/^$z^!\"^)!^-j^$s^!%^!J^#j^/K^!E^\"\"^/1^&w^5d^*A^!@^,M^$s^$%^$) ",
      "encoded_base64": "XixgXiIvXiRdXixYXiRBXjVCXi9EXiYvXiR6XiEiXikhXi1qXiRzXiElXiFKXiNqXi9LXiFFXiIiXi8xXiZ3XjVkXipBXiFAXixNXiRzXiQlXiQpIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d3a8b35f6539",
      "text": "需要的萃取液。他用仙人掌和其他植物來調配合成。只要 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)e^(C^&Z^'}^\":^%l^!\"^!@^&H^!A^!<^$;^\"O^!j^!@^%3^&4^!O^(Q^)&^\"C^$$^!\"^\"?^(C ",
      "encoded_base64": "XillXihDXiZaXid9XiI6XiVsXiEiXiFAXiZIXiFBXiE8XiQ7XiJPXiFqXiFAXiUzXiY0XiFPXihRXikmXiJDXiQkXiEiXiI/XihDIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ec81c3404ef7",
      "text": "告訴他是莉娜拉派你們來取的就行了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+B^-t^!@^,X^'{^/*^$6^.n^*F^*{^!O^\":^&Z^*J^(;^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitCXi10XiFAXixYXid7Xi8qXiQ2Xi5uXipGXip7XiFPXiI6XiZaXipKXig7XipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_08977b45b4cb",
      "text": "請再考慮一下。我的庫存快用光了，而我根本無法離開 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*S^!l^-R^19^!%^!(^!\"^$%^&Z^,#^#*^*L^&H^!c^*D^*A^'W^$%^%)^$x^%}^%b^)`^)F ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipTXiFsXi1SXjE5XiElXiEoXiEiXiQlXiZaXiwjXiMqXipMXiZIXiFjXipEXipBXidXXiQlXiUpXiR4XiV9XiViXilgXilGIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5bc451d9ebcc",
      "text": "——誰知道我一走，威米亞斯會對這座村莊做出什麼事來！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*n^*n^-y^&h^(y^$%^!%^.&^*A^#&^'4^!9^$[^$r^#:^(s^/_^$z^6l^*~^!q^!=^.T^*r^!O^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipuXipuXi15XiZoXih5XiQlXiElXi4mXipBXiMmXic0XiE5XiRbXiRyXiM6XihzXi9fXiR6XjZsXip+XiFxXiE9Xi5UXipyXiFPXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_402c529bac40",
      "text": "祝你們好運。就像我說的，那個村子在東南方。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&v^*F^*{^+i^.4^!\"^*J^!`^$%^-x^&Z^*A^)!^!V^$z^#(^\"d^,`^\"/^$]^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZ2XipGXip7XitpXi40XiEiXipKXiFgXiQlXi14XiZaXipBXikhXiFWXiR6XiMoXiJkXixgXiIvXiRdXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bec43d7a409e",
      "text": "找到加林神父，就能找到萃取液。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$/^!u^\"\"^/1^&w^5d^*A^*J^'b^$/^!u^'}^\":^%l^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQvXiF1XiIiXi8xXiZ3XjVkXipBXipKXidiXiQvXiF1Xid9XiI6XiVsXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8d85a3e318f4",
      "text": "你們替我們除掉了威米亞斯，我真是感激不盡！然而，我們的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^2o^$%^*{^)Q^/e^*D^#&^'4^!9^$[^*A^$%^-2^,X^#{^1H^!)^-1^*W^&\"^'W^*A^$%^*{^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XjJvXiQlXip7XilRXi9lXipEXiMmXic0XiE5XiRbXipBXiQlXi0yXixYXiN7XjFIXiEpXi0xXipXXiYiXidXXipBXiQlXip7XiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0d297cc24c1b",
      "text": "角鬥士依然被囚禁著等待出售。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(H^*,^+a^!Q^&\"^(@^\"Z^&y^-a^'-^,*^!q^56^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihIXiosXithXiFRXiYiXihAXiJaXiZ5Xi1hXictXiwqXiFxXjU2XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 43
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d118c5b184f8",
      "text": "拯救者們回來了。幸會。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,F^,Q^'V^*{^\"\\^!O^*D^!\"^15^$r^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XixGXixRXidWXip7XiJcXiFPXipEXiEiXjE1XiRyXiEi",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d6fb78ca194f",
      "text": "  妳近來好嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^7(^(l^!O^+i^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeNyheKGxeIU9eK2leK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 20
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f5b51bba5948",
      "text": "  妳有收到妳姊姊的音訊嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^7(^$s^$M^!u^7(^7)^7)^&Z^34^09^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeNyheJHNeJE1eIXVeNyheNyleNyleJlpeMzReMDleK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_baad76b68368",
      "text": "  這是妳要的萃取液。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^(s^,X^7(^(C^&Z^'}^\":^%l^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKHNeLFheNyheKENeJlpeJ31eIjpeJWxeISIg",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5196104689d7",
      "text": "我筋疲力竭，但滿心歡喜。自從守護者們歸來後， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^<C^88^!~^29^*A^!I^,{^#k^%F^+V^!\"^'l^#f^#+^(T^'V^*{^%K^!O^#b^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXjxDXjg4XiF+XjI5XipBXiFJXix7XiNrXiVGXitWXiEiXidsXiNmXiMrXihUXidWXip7XiVLXiFPXiNiXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_086e10bf9901",
      "text": "我便一直在照料他們。很快他們就能重返職責了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^!R^!%^&`^\"d^/x^/n^!@^*{^!\"^*K^*L^!@^*{^*J^'b^))^7J^'\\^0>^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiFSXiElXiZgXiJkXi94Xi9uXiFAXip7XiEiXipLXipMXiFAXip7XipKXidiXikpXjdKXidcXjA+XipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 66
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f125b8dedba9",
      "text": "我什麼也沒聽說，但我確信她平安無恙。不過我仍希望 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^!=^.T^!1^%\\^-X^-x^*A^!I^$%^-6^!U^+h^0Y^+p^%}^;A^!\"^!)^(x^$%^!?^+{^,] ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiE9Xi5UXiExXiVcXi1YXi14XipBXiFJXiQlXi02XiFVXitoXjBZXitwXiV9XjtBXiEiXiEpXih4XiQlXiE/Xit7XixdIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_00535fc36cdb",
      "text": "她的冒險旅程不會讓她把我忘得一乾二淨。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+h^&Z^/P^*m^2m^'#^!)^$r^-}^+h^$1^$%^0]^#e^!%^*X^!5^0k^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XitoXiZaXi9QXiptXjJtXicjXiEpXiRyXi19XitoXiQxXiQlXjBdXiNlXiElXipYXiE1XjBrXiEi",
      "byte_length": 57
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4c81b1760d9c",
      "text": "願你們的旅程收穫豐碩。保重。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.H^*F^*{^&Z^2m^'#^$M^<B^4!^9`^!\"^!T^))^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi5IXipGXip7XiZaXjJtXicjXiRNXjxCXjQhXjlgXiEiXiFUXikpXiEi",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ccf6caa7c298",
      "text": "我聽威米亞斯提過，我們的戰士們被北方的一名矮人 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^-X^#&^'4^!9^$[^$A^(x^*A^$%^*{^&Z^$(^+a^*{^(@^+6^$]^&Z^!%^\"F^&j^!< ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXi1YXiMmXic0XiE5XiRbXiRBXih4XipBXiQlXip7XiZaXiQoXithXip7XihAXis2XiRdXiZaXiElXiJGXiZqXiE8IA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bbee0c1f2b81",
      "text": "指揮官扣留了。沒有了他們的保護，蓋德隆注定覆滅。如果 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$8^2\"^#-^$.^-+^*D^!\"^%\\^$s^*D^!@^*{^&Z^!T^(T^*A^-d^#j^)T^%e^#.^(D^%t^!\"^#$^%! ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQ4XjIiXiMtXiQuXi0rXipEXiEiXiVcXiRzXipEXiFAXip7XiZaXiFUXihUXipBXi1kXiNqXilUXiVlXiMuXihEXiV0XiEiXiMkXiUhIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7bb68dadefd3",
      "text": "你們能救出他們，我將感激不盡。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^'b^,Q^!q^!@^*{^*A^$%^#7^#{^1H^!)^-1^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XidiXixRXiFxXiFAXip7XipBXiQlXiM3XiN7XjFIXiEpXi0xXiEi",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8b30b386e4e7",
      "text": "你們摧毀了這個村莊。像你們這種殘暴之徒真讓我作嘔。我 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^$E^%N^*D^(s^!V^$z^6l^!\"^!`^*F^*{^(s^'$^,l^$m^!/^#d^-2^-}^$%^!M^0T^!\"^$% ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiRFXiVOXipEXihzXiFWXiR6XjZsXiEiXiFgXipGXip7XihzXickXixsXiRtXiEvXiNkXi0yXi19XiQlXiFNXjBUXiEiXiQlIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_32df83dc41ba",
      "text": "將隻身踏入荒原尋找我的姊姊。雖然我活不了多久， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#7^)[^(c^.,^!f^1W^\"5^#9^$/^$%^&Z^7)^7)^!\"^.A^&\"^$%^%i^!)^*D^\"x^!.^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiM3XilbXihjXi4sXiFmXjFXXiI1XiM5XiQvXiQlXiZaXjcpXjcpXiEiXi5BXiYiXiQlXiVpXiEpXipEXiJ4XiEuXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_337d4b6960c7",
      "text": "但比起與你們為伍，我寧願去死。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!I^,m^.(^'p^*F^*{^%{^!F^*A^$%^3k^.H^\"6^%L^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFJXixtXi4oXidwXipGXip7XiV7XiFGXipBXiQlXjNrXi5IXiI2XiVMXiEi",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_13c0f2900ab8",
      "text": "再次感謝你們為我取來萃取液。現在，去想辦法對付 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!l^%D^#{^-z^*F^*{^%{^$%^\":^!O^'}^\":^%l^!\"^&?^\"d^*A^\"6^,1^2L^%b^#:^*u ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFsXiVEXiN7Xi16XipGXip7XiV7XiQlXiI6XiFPXid9XiI6XiVsXiEiXiY/XiJkXipBXiI2XiwxXjJMXiViXiM6Xip1IA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4d27dd92485a",
      "text": "那個自稱威米亞斯的怪物吧！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^!V^'l^0&^#&^'4^!9^$[^&Z^#s^&4^*I^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXiFWXidsXjAmXiMmXic0XiE5XiRbXiZaXiNzXiY0XipJXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 40
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cb9fe55a5a0d",
      "text": "看來你們回來了。你們拿到木髓萃取液了嗎？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*Q^!O^*F^*{^\"\\^!O^*D^!\"^*F^*{^,G^!u^$v^*)^'}^\":^%l^*D^+X^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipRXiFPXipGXip7XiJcXiFPXipEXiEiXipGXip7XixHXiF1XiR2XiopXid9XiI6XiVsXipEXitYXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_edf5583e992d",
      "text": "  拿到了。在這裡。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^,G^!u^*D^!\"^\"d^(s^-j^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLEdeIXVeKkReISJeImReKHNeLWpeISI=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_dd9491ca7491",
      "text": "  萃取液到底在哪裡來著？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^'}^\":^%l^!u^/^^\"d^+I^-j^!O^-a^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJ31eIjpeJWxeIXVeL15eImReK0leLWpeIU9eLWFeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_73e47529b5ef",
      "text": "  妳知道關於那座雕像的事嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^7(^&h^(y^.>^$^^)!^/_^)^^!`^&Z^*r^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeNyheJmheKHleLj5eJF5eKSFeL19eKV5eIWBeJlpeKnJeK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_058c3a5110d8",
      "text": "我該走了。再見。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^(M^.&^*D^!\"^!l^-m^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXihNXi4mXipEXiEiXiFsXi1tXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c11a83e9457a",
      "text": "在東南方的提奎茲爾村。由加林神父製作——找到他並 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"d^,`^\"/^$]^&Z^$A^5B^/D^&/^$z^!\"^&I^\"\"^/1^&w^5d^(B^!M^*n^*n^$/^!u^!@^!+ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJkXixgXiIvXiRdXiZaXiRBXjVCXi9EXiYvXiR6XiEiXiZJXiIiXi8xXiZ3XjVkXihCXiFNXipuXipuXiQvXiF1XiFAXiErIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4b6ee98f4009",
      "text": "向他詢問。我本想親自去，但天曉得如果我離開村莊， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+?^!@^;!^*Z^!\"^$%^$x^,1^(F^'l^\"6^*A^!I^+e^7y^#e^#$^%!^$%^)`^)F^$z^6l^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xis/XiFAXjshXipaXiEiXiQlXiR4XiwxXihGXidsXiI2XipBXiFJXitlXjd5XiNlXiMkXiUhXiQlXilgXilGXiR6XjZsXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_260c1be551eb",
      "text": "威米亞斯會做出什麼事來。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#&^'4^!9^$[^$r^*~^!q^!=^.T^*r^!O^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiMmXic0XiE5XiRbXiRyXip+XiFxXiE9Xi5UXipyXiFPXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 37
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c69d49aa9723",
      "text": "我不敢相信村莊被徹底毀滅了",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^!)^/m^&a^!U^$z^6l^(@^18^/^^%N^%t^*D",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiEpXi9tXiZhXiFVXiR6XjZsXihAXjE4Xi9eXiVOXiV0XipE",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_50e9ebf11f38",
      "text": "——而且是出自你們之手！你們怎麼能做出這種事？！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*n^*n^'W^!*^,X^!q^'l^*F^*{^!/^$+^*W^*F^*{^,,^.T^'b^*~^!q^(s^'$^*r^.V^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipuXipuXidXXiEqXixYXiFxXidsXipGXip7XiEvXiQrXipXXipGXip7XiwsXi5UXidiXip+XiFxXihzXickXipyXi5WXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_68feef4c6d3e",
      "text": "！你們根本不該主動去攻擊威米亞斯！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*W^*F^*{^%)^$x^!)^(M^!-^\"%^\"6^$O^$F^#&^'4^!9^$[^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipXXipGXip7XiUpXiR4XiEpXihNXiEtXiIlXiI2XiRPXiRGXiMmXic0XiE5XiRbXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9e9e201f43d3",
      "text": "……威米亞斯怎麼能如此殘暴冷血？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*o^*o^#&^'4^!9^$[^,,^.T^'b^#$^%I^,l^$m^!n^(:^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipvXipvXiMmXic0XiE5XiRbXiwsXi5UXidiXiMkXiVJXixsXiRtXiFuXig6Xi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 49
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b0f8fc498517",
      "text": "  威米亞斯答應過會讓他們回來的。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^#&^'4^!9^$[^-B^0`^(x^$r^-}^!@^*{^\"\\^!O^&Z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIyZeJzReITleJFteLUJeMGBeKHheJHJeLX1eIUBeKnteIlxeIU9eJlpeISI=",
      "byte_length": 47
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2f2236f4c53e",
      "text": "  不，大家是被傳送走了，並沒有被殺。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^!)^*A^\"z^+s^,X^(@^+$^./^.&^*D^*A^!+^%\\^$s^(@^%M^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeISleKkFeInpeK3NeLFheKEBeKyReLi9eLiZeKkReKkFeISteJVxeJHNeKEBeJU1eISI=",
      "byte_length": 53
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_79a4367a5f44",
      "text": "  妳知道關於雕像的事嗎？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^7(^&h^(y^.>^$^^)^^!`^&Z^*r^+X^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeNyheJmheKHleLj5eJF5eKV5eIWBeJlpeKnJeK1heLlYg",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_579f1b4f9be2",
      "text": "  那種植物在哪裡來著？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^)!^'$^%3^&4^\"d^+I^-j^!O^-a^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKSFeJyReJTNeJjReImReK0leLWpeIU9eLWFeLlYg",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d7a03d4682ab",
      "text": "  這是妳要的萃取液。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^(s^,X^7(^(C^&Z^'}^\":^%l^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKHNeLFheNyheKENeJlpeJ31eIjpeJWxeISI=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f7057450bf22",
      "text": "我得走了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^#e^.&^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiNlXi4mXipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 16
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9c7f6a5f65d2",
      "text": "死而復生？哈！我從未聽說有任何人能施展這般神蹟！他分明在 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%L^'W^#g^&F^.V^+F^*W^$%^#f^,_^-X^-x^$s^!C^!L^!<^'b^$_^+x^(s^'r^&w^0B^*W^!@^!s^$c^\"d ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVMXidXXiNnXiZGXi5WXitGXipXXiQlXiNmXixfXi1YXi14XiRzXiFDXiFMXiE8XidiXiRfXit4XihzXidyXiZ3XjBCXipXXiFAXiFzXiRjXiJkIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6d2d40b67fd5",
      "text": "對你們說謊！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#:^*F^*{^-x^3*^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiM6XipGXip7Xi14XjMqXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 19
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_43a4be772964",
      "text": "真的嗎？我懷疑威米亞斯根本沒有足夠的法力去施展如此 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-2^&Z^+X^.V^$%^,9^0p^#&^'4^!9^$[^%)^$x^%\\^$s^(^^+d^&Z^%b^!~^\"6^$_^+x^#$^%I ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi0yXiZaXitYXi5WXiQlXiw5XjBwXiMmXic0XiE5XiRbXiUpXiR4XiVcXiRzXiheXitkXiZaXiViXiF+XiI2XiRfXit4XiMkXiVJIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5705ab6d252d",
      "text": "宏大的法術。十有八九他是為了指使你們聽命行事而撒謊。但誰又能 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^45^\"z^&Z^%b^(<^!\"^*Y^$s^50^7N^!@^,X^%{^*D^$8^!N^*F^*{^-X^\"N^(;^*r^'W^<>^3*^!\"^!I^-y^+;^'b ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjQ1XiJ6XiZaXiViXig8XiEiXipZXiRzXjUwXjdOXiFAXixYXiV7XipEXiQ4XiFOXipGXip7Xi1YXiJOXig7XipyXidXXjw+XjMqXiEiXiFJXi15Xis7XidiIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4aa1b84e85b0",
      "text": "說得準呢？大家現在確實不在這裡，所以或許他真能把他們帶回來。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-x^#e^,x^+C^.V^\"z^+s^&?^\"d^-6^#3^!)^\"d^(s^-j^*A^$)^!B^$'^-s^!@^-2^'b^$1^!@^*{^#N^\"\\^!O^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi14XiNlXix4XitDXi5WXiJ6XitzXiY/XiJkXi02XiMzXiEpXiJkXihzXi1qXipBXiQpXiFCXiQnXi1zXiFAXi0yXidiXiQxXiFAXip7XiNOXiJcXiFPXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_51e76b60c22a",
      "text": "水井旁那個醜陋的怪物雕像嗎？威米亞斯奪權之後就讓人把它搬到了 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%V^!7^.h^)!^!V^2O^2P^&Z^#s^&4^)^^!`^+X^.V^#&^'4^!9^$[^1,^1E^!/^#b^*J^-}^!<^$1^+o^<=^!u^*D ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVWXiE3Xi5oXikhXiFWXjJPXjJQXiZaXiNzXiY0XileXiFgXitYXi5WXiMmXic0XiE5XiRbXjEsXjFFXiEvXiNiXipKXi19XiE8XiQxXitvXjw9XiF1XipEIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8af9d89cf607",
      "text": "這裡。他對它——以及它的拼合完成——極其執迷。我不知道為什麼，但我 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^-j^!\"^!@^#:^+o^*n^*n^!B^\"7^+o^&Z^;Z^\"C^#,^$$^*n^*n^1D^!j^3?^(n^!\"^$%^!)^&h^(y^%{^!=^.T^*A^!I^$% ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXi1qXiEiXiFAXiM6XitvXipuXipuXiFCXiI3XitvXiZaXjtaXiJDXiMsXiQkXipuXipuXjFEXiFqXjM/XihuXiEiXiQlXiEpXiZoXih5XiV7XiE9Xi5UXipBXiFJXiQlIA==",
      "byte_length": 100
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_50afd398c251",
      "text": "有一種預感，一旦那東西完工，對城鎮絕對百害而無一利。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$s^!%^'$^.E^#{^*A^!%^1C^)!^,`^-l^#,^+y^*A^#:^+_^);^-I^#:^&Y^#/^'W^%}^!%^!t^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRzXiElXickXi5FXiN7XipBXiElXjFDXikhXixgXi1sXiMsXit5XipBXiM6XitfXik7Xi1JXiM6XiZZXiMvXidXXiV9XiElXiF0XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2bed822730ef",
      "text": "村民都死光了，我根本用不上這藥， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$z^%T^)$^%L^!c^*D^*A^$%^%)^$x^&H^!)^!'^(s^()^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiR6XiVUXikkXiVMXiFjXipEXipBXiQlXiUpXiR4XiZIXiEpXiEnXihzXigpXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 49
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c7ee14e1923b",
      "text": "不過再告訴你們一次也無妨。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^(x^!l^+B^-t^*F^*{^!%^%D^!1^%}^5D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXih4XiFsXitCXi10XipGXip7XiElXiVEXiExXiV9XjVEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 40
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_02b3b4c456e7",
      "text": "但如果威米亞斯能把他們帶回來，也許我就用得到了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!I^#$^%!^#&^'4^!9^$[^'b^$1^!@^*{^#N^\"\\^!O^*A^!1^-s^$%^*J^&H^#e^!u^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFJXiMkXiUhXiMmXic0XiE5XiRbXidiXiQxXiFAXip7XiNOXiJcXiFPXipBXiExXi1zXiQlXipKXiZIXiNlXiF1XipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_229851a9ef2f",
      "text": "加林神父有我需要的萃取液。他住在東南方一個名叫 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"\"^/1^&w^5d^$s^$%^)e^(C^&Z^'}^\":^%l^!\"^!@^*z^\"d^,`^\"/^$]^!%^!V^\"F^+< ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiIiXi8xXiZ3XjVkXiRzXiQlXillXihDXiZaXid9XiI6XiVsXiEiXiFAXip6XiJkXixgXiIvXiRdXiElXiFWXiJGXis8IA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_edd90123b025",
      "text": "提奎茲爾的村莊。如果你們能找到他，向他詢問便是。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$A^5B^/D^&/^&Z^$z^6l^!\"^#$^%!^*F^*{^'b^$/^!u^!@^*A^+?^!@^;!^*Z^!R^,X^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRBXjVCXi9EXiYvXiZaXiR6XjZsXiEiXiMkXiUhXipGXip7XidiXiQvXiF1XiFAXipBXis/XiFAXjshXipaXiFSXixYXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5f8c65523f83",
      "text": "所有村民都沒了，我其實用不上它，但無論如何還是謝謝你們 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$)^$s^$z^%T^)$^%\\^*D^*A^$%^!j^#3^&H^!)^!'^+o^*A^!I^%}^1\\^#$^!L^.7^,X^-z^-z^*F^*{ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQpXiRzXiR6XiVUXikkXiVcXipEXipBXiQlXiFqXiMzXiZIXiEpXiEnXitvXipBXiFJXiV9XjFcXiMkXiFMXi43XixYXi16Xi16XipGXip7IA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cdda64c9ef40",
      "text": "取了回來。我答應過會給你們報酬，拿去吧。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\":^*D^\"\\^!O^!\"^$%^-B^0`^(x^$r^'A^*F^*{^+`^7o^*A^,G^\"6^*I^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiI6XipEXiJcXiFPXiEiXiQlXi1CXjBgXih4XiRyXidBXipGXip7XitgXjdvXipBXixHXiI2XipJXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_14a806a17271",
      "text": "謝謝你們替我把它取來——希望這沒給你們添太多麻煩。這是 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-z^-z^*F^*{^2o^$%^$1^+o^\":^!O^*n^*n^+{^,]^(s^%\\^'A^*F^*{^5`^+f^\"x^*6^-!^!\"^(s^,X ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi16Xi16XipGXip7XjJvXiQlXiQxXitvXiI6XiFPXipuXipuXit7XixdXihzXiVcXidBXipGXip7XjVgXitmXiJ4Xio2Xi0hXiEiXihzXixYIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_de518b2c25a7",
      "text": "你們的報酬。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^&Z^+`^7o^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiZaXitgXjdvXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 19
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e8feee4c038e",
      "text": "床上的人高燒不退，在睡夢中痛苦地輾轉反側。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#U^!'^&Z^!<^*+^&&^!)^*V^*A^\"d^-3^\"y^!,^-.^.t^\"e^<I^(i^\"9^!\\^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNVXiEnXiZaXiE8XiorXiYmXiEpXipWXipBXiJkXi0zXiJ5XiEsXi0uXi50XiJlXjxJXihpXiI5XiFcXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6b862a726b8b",
      "text": "請別吵醒他。必須等高燒自己退去才行。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*S^*H^/T^.9^!@^!\"^#l^)r^'-^*+^&&^'l^#I^*V^\"6^$,^(;^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipTXipIXi9UXi45XiFAXiEiXiNsXilyXictXiorXiYmXidsXiNJXipWXiI2XiQsXig7XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_73eb7594b925",
      "text": "這是歷史性的一天。感謝你們伸出援手——你們為阿塔斯的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^,X^6^^1m^#r^&Z^!%^+e^!\"^#{^-z^*F^*{^/N^!q^$C^$+^*n^*n^*F^*{^%{^)M^\"o^$[^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXixYXjZeXjFtXiNyXiZaXiElXitlXiEiXiN7Xi16XipGXip7Xi9OXiFxXiRDXiQrXipuXipuXipGXip7XiV7XilNXiJvXiRbXiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_359a6803696b",
      "text": "未來注入了莫大的希望。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,_^!O^%e^!f^*D^/F^\"z^&Z^+{^,]^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XixfXiFPXiVlXiFmXipEXi9GXiJ6XiZaXit7XixdXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_edb84786f488",
      "text": "歡迎。蓋德隆村的村長就是我。你們有難題要向我反映嗎？我能解決它們， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%F^(k^!\"^-d^#j^)T^$z^&Z^$z^)C^*J^,X^$%^!\"^*F^*{^$s^)a^.G^(C^+?^$%^\"9^<V^+X^.V^$%^'b^(I^,o^+o^*{^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVGXihrXiEiXi1kXiNqXilUXiR6XiZaXiR6XilDXipKXixYXiQlXiEiXipGXip7XiRzXilhXi5HXihDXis/XiQlXiI5XjxWXitYXi5WXiQlXidiXihJXixvXitvXip7XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 100
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1de800613c9b",
      "text": "因為我可是村長啊。替大家排憂解難是我的職責，當然還有摘花也是。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"]^%{^$%^\"A^,X^$z^)C^+Q^!\"^2o^\"z^+s^$<^91^(I^)a^,X^$%^&Z^'\\^0>^*A^&N^&\"^.7^$s^;g^'w^!1^,X^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJdXiV7XiQlXiJBXixYXiR6XilDXitRXiEiXjJvXiJ6XitzXiQ8XjkxXihJXilhXixYXiQlXiZaXidcXjA+XipBXiZOXiYiXi43XiRzXjtnXid3XiExXixYXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 94
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0fd153b610de",
      "text": "而且有好多好多花等著我去摘呢！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'W^!*^$s^+i^\"x^+i^\"x^'w^'-^-a^$%^\"6^;g^+C^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XidXXiEqXiRzXitpXiJ4XitpXiJ4Xid3XictXi1hXiQlXiI2XjtnXitDXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2260ba9424ce",
      "text": "  你說話怎麼瘋瘋癲癲的？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^-x^-v^,,^.T^-/^-/^4Y^4Y^&Z^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeLXheLXZeLCxeLlReLS9eLS9eNFleNFleJlpeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3250f4ceb622",
      "text": "  為什麼村民們的舉止這麼怪異？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^%{^!=^.T^$z^%T^*{^&Z^01^%G^(s^.T^#s^&M^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJXteIT1eLlReJHpeJVReKnteJlpeMDFeJUdeKHNeLlReI3NeJk1eLlY=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7bb953b07a21",
      "text": "  這個小鎮到底發生了什麼事？！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^(s^!V^#;^);^!u^/^^&W^&F^*D^!=^.T^*r^.V^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKHNeIVZeIzteKTteIXVeL15eJldeJkZeKkReIT1eLlReKnJeLlZeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_03e9bf9d6d84",
      "text": "  村裡的守衛都去哪了？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$z^-j^&Z^#+^(=^)$^\"6^+I^*D^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJHpeLWpeJlpeIyteKD1eKSReIjZeK0leKkReLlY=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8162a611e715",
      "text": "  你到底在摘什麼樣的花？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^!u^/^^\"d^;g^!=^.T^,f^&Z^'w^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeIXVeL15eImReO2deIT1eLlReLGZeJlpeJ3deLlY=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4d0fc4fb9ac0",
      "text": "  沒有。我從未見過那種東西。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^%\\^$s^!\"^$%^#f^,_^-m^(x^)!^'$^,`^-l^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJVxeJHNeISJeJCVeI2ZeLF9eLW1eKHheKSFeJyReLGBeLWxeISIg",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2a4e883d30fd",
      "text": "  我根本沒看見任何花！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^%)^$x^%\\^*Q^-m^!C^!L^'w^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeJSleJHheJVxeKlFeLW1eIUNeIUxeJ3deKlc=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_918a640fc66b",
      "text": "這座小鎮簡直瘋了！我這就離開！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^/_^#;^);^3y^&`^-/^*D^*W^$%^(s^*J^)`^)F^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXi9fXiM7Xik7XjN5XiZgXi0vXipEXipXXiQlXihzXipKXilgXilGXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_dc96dc76d79d",
      "text": "確實如此。那麼這朵肯定是極其罕見的品種了。我必須把它與其他 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-6^#3^#$^%I^!\"^)!^.T^(s^9C^-Z^#.^,X^1D^!j^5w^-m^&Z^\"R^'$^*D^!\"^$%^#l^)r^$1^+o^'p^!j^!@ ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi02XiMzXiMkXiVJXiEiXikhXi5UXihzXjlDXi1aXiMuXixYXjFEXiFqXjV3Xi1tXiZaXiJSXickXipEXiEiXiQlXiNsXilyXiQxXitvXidwXiFqXiFAIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_50caf2065e57",
      "text": "獨一無二的花朵放在一起珍藏。不過，你們來這裡不是為了這個吧？不知我這個 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^/z^!%^%}^!5^&Z^'w^9C^$P^\"d^!%^.(^/7^-f^!\"^!)^(x^*A^*F^*{^!O^(s^-j^!)^,X^%{^*D^(s^!V^*I^.V^!)^&h^$%^(s^!V ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi96XiElXiV9XiE1XiZaXid3XjlDXiRQXiJkXiElXi4oXi83Xi1mXiEiXiEpXih4XipBXipGXip7XiFPXihzXi1qXiEpXixYXiV7XipEXihzXiFWXipJXi5WXiEpXiZoXiQlXihzXiFWIA==",
      "byte_length": 106
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_359206118919",
      "text": "蓋德隆村長，能為你們效勞些什麼？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-d^#j^)T^$z^)C^*A^'b^%{^*F^*{^$Q^/R^!8^!=^.T^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi1kXiNqXilUXiR6XilDXipBXidiXiV7XipGXip7XiRRXi9SXiE4XiE9Xi5UXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 49
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_585d611cabdd",
      "text": "沒有花？你肯定是瘋了——花朵明明漫山遍野到處都是！哎呀，你現在就正好 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%\\^$s^'w^.V^*F^-Z^#.^,X^-/^*D^*n^*n^'w^9C^$c^$c^2,^11^69^.:^!u^(,^)$^,X^*W^3i^3h^*A^*F^&?^\"d^*J^%H^+i ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVcXiRzXid3Xi5WXipGXi1aXiMuXixYXi0vXipEXipuXipuXid3XjlDXiRjXiRjXjIsXjExXjY5Xi46XiF1XigsXikkXixYXipXXjNpXjNoXipBXipGXiY/XiJkXipKXiVIXitpIA==",
      "byte_length": 103
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5b72e165d8e7",
      "text": "踩在一大片粉紅斑卡度花上面呢！不過，你們來這裡應該不是為了 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^0A^\"d^!%^\"z^&1^'5^3!^;D^\"0^#V^'w^!'^)j^+C^*W^!)^(x^*A^*F^*{^!O^(s^-j^0`^(M^!)^,X^%{^*D ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjBBXiJkXiElXiJ6XiYxXic1XjMhXjtEXiIwXiNWXid3XiEnXilqXitDXipXXiEpXih4XipBXipGXip7XiFPXihzXi1qXjBgXihNXiEpXixYXiV7XipEIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ba23ca5e3893",
      "text": "討論花朵吧？是什麼風把你們吹到蓋德隆村來的？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-o^1\\^'w^9C^*I^.V^,X^!=^.T^)y^$1^*F^*{^+A^!u^-d^#j^)T^$z^!O^&Z^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi1vXjFcXid3XjlDXipJXi5WXixYXiE9Xi5UXil5XiQxXipGXip7XitBXiF1Xi1kXiNqXilUXiR6XiFPXiZaXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a0ac2a6edd70",
      "text": "難道你看不到嗎？放眼望去，它們全從地板上冒出來了！我這輩子 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)a^(y^*F^*Q^!)^!u^+X^.V^$P^&d^,]^\"6^*A^+o^*{^!h^#f^\"e^$}^!'^/P^!q^!O^*D^*W^$%^(s^8t^#( ",
      "encoded_base64": "XilhXih5XipGXipRXiEpXiF1XitYXi5WXiRQXiZkXixdXiI2XipBXitvXip7XiFoXiNmXiJlXiR9XiEnXi9QXiFxXiFPXipEXipXXiQlXihzXjh0XiMoIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_916d8e2d9f99",
      "text": "從沒見過這麼多姿多彩的鮮花！比如說這朵紅色的，你以前有見過 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#f^%\\^-m^(x^(s^.T^\"x^<Q^\"x^#`^&Z^35^'w^*W^,m^#$^-x^(s^9C^3!^'s^&Z^*A^*F^!B^!z^$s^-m^(x ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNmXiVcXi1tXih4XihzXi5UXiJ4XjxRXiJ4XiNgXiZaXjM1Xid3XipXXixtXiMkXi14XihzXjlDXjMhXidzXiZaXipBXipGXiFCXiF6XiRzXi1tXih4IA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_eb81b0fe7ead",
      "text": "類似的花朵嗎？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)w^!H^&Z^'w^9C^+X^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xil3XiFIXiZaXid3XjlDXitYXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 22
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c97c347544a2",
      "text": "傻瓜？紅心傻瓜，也許吧？你誤會了。肯定是你的運作 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^7$^<X^.V^3!^#k^7$^<X^*A^!1^-s^*I^.V^*F^(P^$r^*D^!\"^-Z^#.^,X^*F^&Z^.4^!M ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjckXjxYXi5WXjMhXiNrXjckXjxYXipBXiExXi1zXipJXi5WXipGXihQXiRyXipEXiEiXi1aXiMuXixYXipGXiZaXi40XiFNIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ca7b83aaca54",
      "text": "出了問題。很有可能，你壞掉了。但我沒辦法修理你，因為我可是 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!q^*D^*Z^.G^!\"^*K^$s^\"A^'b^*A^*F^\"v^/e^*D^!\"^!I^$%^%\\^2L^%b^.~^&A^*F^*A^\"]^%{^$%^\"A^,X ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFxXipEXipaXi5HXiEiXipLXiRzXiJBXidiXipBXipGXiJ2Xi9lXipEXiEiXiFJXiQlXiVcXjJMXiViXi5+XiZBXipGXipBXiJdXiV7XiQlXiJBXixYIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d58e8b601cae",
      "text": "村長啊。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$z^)C^+Q^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiR6XilDXitRXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 13
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_674e5bd45132",
      "text": "村民們很好啊？難道他們也壞掉了嗎？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$z^%T^*{^*K^+i^+Q^.V^)a^(y^!@^*{^!1^\"v^/e^*D^+X^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiR6XiVUXip7XipLXitpXitRXi5WXilhXih5XiFAXip7XiExXiJ2Xi9lXipEXitYXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e8bd70497383",
      "text": "我的村民不對勁？為什麼？難道他們四分五裂了嗎？他們沒有 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^&Z^$z^%T^!)^#:^+3^.V^%{^!=^.T^.V^)a^(y^!@^*{^\"[^!s^!6^8r^*D^+X^.V^!@^*{^%\\^$s ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiZaXiR6XiVUXiEpXiM6XiszXi5WXiV7XiE9Xi5UXi5WXilhXih5XiFAXip7XiJbXiFzXiE2XjhyXipEXitYXi5WXiFAXip7XiVcXiRzIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7001908ad178",
      "text": "正常運作嗎？他們壞掉了嗎？還是他們生病了？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%H^#O^.4^!M^+X^.V^!@^*{^\"v^/e^*D^+X^.V^.7^,X^!@^*{^&F^&R^*D^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVIXiNPXi40XiFNXitYXi5WXiFAXip7XiJ2Xi9lXipEXitYXi5WXi43XixYXiFAXip7XiZGXiZSXipEXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7d190a6cc488",
      "text": "這麼說你喜歡嘉年華會囉？在這個小村子裡能看到這麼多攤位和 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^.T^-x^*F^+V^%F^<P^+~^3'^$r^3j^.V^\"d^(s^!V^#;^$z^#(^-j^'b^*Q^!u^(s^.T^\"x^<U^!J^\"O ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXi5UXi14XipGXitWXiVGXjxQXit+XjMnXiRyXjNqXi5WXiJkXihzXiFWXiM7XiR6XiMoXi1qXidiXipRXiF1XihzXi5UXiJ4XjxVXiFKXiJPIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cd6e511b8386",
      "text": "帳篷，確實令人嘆為觀止。要不是我太累了，我肯定會在正午的烈日下 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^8Y^'1^*A^-6^#3^*w^!<^59^%{^*R^%G^!\"^(C^!)^,X^$%^+f^<Z^*D^*A^$%^-Z^#.^$r^\"d^%H^+8^&Z^%|^$a^!( ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjhZXicxXipBXi02XiMzXip3XiE8XjU5XiV7XipSXiVHXiEiXihDXiEpXixYXiQlXitmXjxaXipEXipBXiQlXi1aXiMuXiRyXiJkXiVIXis4XiZaXiV8XiRhXiEoIA==",
      "byte_length": 94
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8d101cef3b9c",
      "text": "翩翩起舞。摘花實在把我給累壞了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^<.^<.^.(^9s^!\"^;g^'w^#3^\"d^$1^$%^'A^<Z^\"v^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjwuXjwuXi4oXjlzXiEiXjtnXid3XiMzXiJkXiQxXiQlXidBXjxaXiJ2XipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 49
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9917d5383132",
      "text": "還有什麼其他事情是我應該知道的嗎？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.7^$s^!=^.T^!j^!@^*r^,0^,X^$%^0`^(M^&h^(y^&Z^+X^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi43XiRzXiE9Xi5UXiFqXiFAXipyXiwwXixYXiQlXjBgXihNXiZoXih5XiZaXitYXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_62faf27091aa",
      "text": "我特別下達命令，派他們去荒漠中摘花。他們在好長一段時間內 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^&5^*H^!(^(z^\"N^*w^*A^.n^!@^*{^\"6^1W^,}^!,^;g^'w^!\"^!@^*{^\"d^+i^)C^!%^.l^$f^)G^!g ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiY1XipIXiEoXih6XiJOXip3XipBXi5uXiFAXip7XiI2XjFXXix9XiEsXjtnXid3XiEiXiFAXip7XiJkXitpXilDXiElXi5sXiRmXilHXiFnIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f17ffdb0b035",
      "text": "都不會回來。因為花實在太多了，光靠我一個人根本採不完。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)$^!)^$r^\"\\^!O^!\"^\"]^%{^'w^#3^\"d^+f^\"x^*D^*A^!c^.C^$%^!%^!V^!<^%)^$x^5R^!)^#,^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XikkXiEpXiRyXiJcXiFPXiEiXiJdXiV7Xid3XiMzXiJkXitmXiJ4XipEXipBXiFjXi5DXiQlXiElXiFWXiE8XiUpXiR4XjVSXiEpXiMsXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e86dd784a9fa",
      "text": "為什麼這麼說？他們在做什麼奇怪的舉動嗎？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%{^!=^.T^(s^.T^-x^.V^!@^*{^\"d^*~^!=^.T^\"}^#s^&Z^01^\"%^+X^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiV7XiE9Xi5UXihzXi5UXi14Xi5WXiFAXip7XiJkXip+XiE9Xi5UXiJ9XiNzXiZaXjAxXiIlXitYXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_01143d96c93f",
      "text": "  村民們全都胡言亂語成了一群白痴！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$z^%T^*{^!h^)$^3}^1Y^!3^0:^$$^*D^!%^'R^&X^<Y^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJHpeJVReKnteIWheKSReM31eMVleITNeMDpeJCReKkReISVeJ1JeJlhePFleKlc=",
      "byte_length": 50
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f1bed5b73d65",
      "text": "  你們根本就沒有守衛！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^*{^%)^$x^*J^%\\^$s^#+^(=^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeKnteJSleJHheKkpeJVxeJHNeIyteKD1eKlc=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b18b446174e6",
      "text": "  你的村莊徹底瘋了！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^&Z^$z^6l^18^/^^-/^*D^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeJlpeJHpeNmxeMTheL15eLS9eKkReKlc=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_90e436ce4107",
      "text": "  你瘋了——你自己知道嗎？！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^-/^*D^*n^*n^*F^'l^#I^&h^(y^+X^.V^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeLS9eKkReKm5eKm5eKkZeJ2xeI0leJmheKHleK1heLlZeKlcg",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c8315b3535fe",
      "text": "算了。這簡直毫無意義。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-C^*D^!\"^(s^3y^&`^/t^%}^#z^2<^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi1DXipEXiEiXihzXjN5XiZgXi90XiV9XiN6XjI8XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_179f23ff41e4",
      "text": "不好意思？你剛才是在跟我說話嗎？真抱歉，我滿腦子都在想著 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^+i^#z^#q^.V^*F^+0^$,^,X^\"d^.+^$%^-x^-v^+X^.V^-2^,@^,h^*A^$%^,{^2@^#(^)$^\"d^,1^-a ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXitpXiN6XiNxXi5WXipGXiswXiQsXixYXiJkXi4rXiQlXi14Xi12XitYXi5WXi0yXixAXixoXipBXiQlXix7XjJAXiMoXikkXiJkXiwxXi1hIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8e15b8739b9f",
      "text": "得在節日結束前採完的所有花朵。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#e^\"d^9b^$a^'@^$|^!z^5R^#,^&Z^$)^$s^'w^9C^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNlXiJkXjliXiRhXidAXiR8XiF6XjVSXiMsXiZaXiQpXiRzXid3XjlDXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2dfd5ed838e0",
      "text": "你怎麼會知道這些？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^,,^.T^$r^&h^(y^(s^!8^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiwsXi5UXiRyXiZoXih5XihzXiE4Xi5W",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_112b4f83c300",
      "text": "  我跟村民們談過了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^.+^$z^%T^*{^0;^(x^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeLiteJHpeJVReKnteMDteKHheKkReISI=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b6c8ac7c5531",
      "text": "  看看你的周圍！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*Q^*Q^*F^&Z^\"L^\"`^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKlFeKlFeKkZeJlpeIkxeImBeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 23
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_875178c65216",
      "text": "  這難道不明顯嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^(s^)a^(y^!)^$c^4&^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKHNeKWFeKHleISleJGNeNCZeK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5f7f92266f40",
      "text": "晚安。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,Y^+p^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XixZXitwXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 10
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_88c384448567",
      "text": "你肯定是壞——呃啊！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^-Z^#.^,X^\"v^*n^*n^3<^+Q^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXi1aXiMuXixYXiJ2XipuXipuXjM8XitRXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 31
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_089715955314",
      "text": "突然間，村長的嗓音驟然低沉，聽起來空洞而遙遠。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'*^&\"^)G^*A^$z^)C^&Z^<O^34^7M^&\"^!K^%Z^*A^-X^.(^!O^'(^%h^'W^4j^({^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XicqXiYiXilHXipBXiR6XilDXiZaXjxPXjM0XjdNXiYiXiFLXiVaXipBXi1YXi4oXiFPXicoXiVoXidXXjRqXih7XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e7a8b51d799e",
      "text": "夠了！我受夠讓這個蠢蛋自言自語了。現在 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+d^*D^*W^$%^\";^+d^-}^(s^!V^.u^6\"^'l^1Y^'l^0:^*D^!\"^&?^\"d ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitkXipEXipXXiQlXiI7XitkXi19XihzXiFWXi51XjYiXidsXjFZXidsXjA6XipEXiEiXiY/XiJkIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_33e5a20af1b8",
      "text": "由我掌控這具軀體。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&I^$%^$;^$@^(s^!k^(d^**^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZJXiQlXiQ7XiRAXihzXiFrXihkXioqXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 28
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0356501bc653",
      "text": "很高興見到我們的拯救者。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*K^*+^-]^-m^!u^$%^*{^&Z^,F^,Q^'V^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipLXiorXi1dXi1tXiF1XiQlXip7XiZaXixGXixRXidWXiEi",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_03df20f1ae3b",
      "text": "你們解除了我們的枷鎖，我們對你們感激不盡。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^(I^)Q^*D^$%^*{^&Z^2p^)8^*A^$%^*{^#:^*F^*{^#{^1H^!)^-1^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XihJXilRXipEXiQlXip7XiZaXjJwXik4XipBXiQlXip7XiM6XipGXip7XiN7XjFIXiEpXi0xXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_69434b079293",
      "text": "我有什麼能為你們效勞的嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^$s^!=^.T^'b^%{^*F^*{^$Q^/R^&Z^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiRzXiE9Xi5UXidiXiV7XipGXip7XiRRXi9SXiZaXitYXi5W",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_263d4dc73388",
      "text": "  城鎮的情況恢復得如何？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^+_^);^&Z^,0^,q^#u^#g^#e^#$^!L^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeK19eKTteJlpeLDBeLHFeI3VeI2deI2VeIyReIUxeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a2cd3fed3364",
      "text": "  你們的守軍狀況好嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^*{^&Z^#+^..^&7^,q^+i^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeKnteJlpeIyteLi5eJjdeLHFeK2leK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cad966f8f219",
      "text": "  德拉吉正準備橫掃整片荒原。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^#j^$6^\"D^%H^,x^+\"^/2^:p^$T^&1^1W^\"5^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeI2peJDZeIkReJUheLHheKyJeLzJeOnBeJFReJjFeMVdeIjVeISI=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cd63aac17014",
      "text": "  我正在組建聯盟。加入我們吧。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^%H^\"d^2;^,'^-V^-0^!\"^\"\"^!f^$%^*{^*I^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeJUheImReMjteLCdeLVZeLTBeISJeIiJeIWZeJCVeKnteKkleISI=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_56889e5d486f",
      "text": "我們在這片廢土上奮力求生，但與威米亞斯帶來的恐怖相比， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^\"d^(s^&1^#W^\"c^!'^+g^!~^,n^&F^*A^!I^'p^#&^'4^!9^$[^#N^!O^&Z^#t^#p^&a^,m^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7XiJkXihzXiYxXiNXXiJjXiEnXitnXiF+XixuXiZGXipBXiFJXidwXiMmXic0XiE5XiRbXiNOXiFPXiZaXiN0XiNwXiZhXixtXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fe81fe31db66",
      "text": "所有其他威脅都顯得微不足道。蓋德隆必將因重獲自由而走向繁榮。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$)^$s^!j^!@^#&^1T^)$^4&^#e^#i^!)^(^^(y^!\"^-d^#j^)T^#l^#7^\"]^))^&:^'l^&I^'W^.&^+?^-N^,e^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQpXiRzXiFqXiFAXiMmXjFUXikkXjQmXiNlXiNpXiEpXiheXih5XiEiXi1kXiNqXilUXiNsXiM3XiJdXikpXiY6XidsXiZJXidXXi4mXis/Xi1OXixlXiEi",
      "byte_length": 90
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ca00c9827cc7",
      "text": "莉娜拉悉心照料那些角鬥士，讓他們恢復了健康。我們再次擁有了防禦力量。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'{^/*^$6^2h^#k^/x^/n^)!^!8^(H^*,^+a^*A^-}^!@^*{^#u^#g^*D^<M^5N^!\"^$%^*{^!l^%D^,M^$s^*D^)K^&{^!~^)*^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xid7Xi8qXiQ2XjJoXiNrXi94Xi9uXikhXiE4XihIXiosXithXipBXi19XiFAXip7XiN1XiNnXipEXjxNXjVOXiEiXiQlXip7XiFsXiVEXixNXiRzXipEXilLXiZ7XiF+XikqXiEi",
      "byte_length": 102
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3cb35ee9aa6a",
      "text": "過往的旅者提到了大軍集結的消息。面對如此龐大的軍隊， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(x^,)^&Z^2m^'V^$A^!u^*D^\"z^..^)]^'@^&Z^%k^#w^!\"^)j^#:^#$^%I^6H^\"z^&Z^..^)U^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xih4XiwpXiZaXjJtXidWXiRBXiF1XipEXiJ6Xi4uXildXidAXiZaXiVrXiN3XiEiXilqXiM6XiMkXiVJXjZIXiJ6XiZaXi4uXilVXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b41fbc3bb80d",
      "text": "蓋德隆唯一的屏障就是偏遠隱蔽的地理位置。也許他們不會 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-d^#j^)T^+O^!%^&Z^#@^)W^*J^,X^![^({^)Y^('^&Z^\"e^&A^!J^'Q^!\"^!1^-s^!@^*{^!)^$r ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi1kXiNqXilUXitPXiElXiZaXiNAXilXXipKXixYXiFbXih7XilZXignXiZaXiJlXiZBXiFKXidRXiEiXiExXi1zXiFAXip7XiEpXiRyIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2c0d005db3b6",
      "text": "像威米亞斯那樣輕易找到我們。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!`^#&^'4^!9^$[^)!^,f^(g^,W^$/^!u^$%^*{^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFgXiMmXic0XiE5XiRbXikhXixmXihnXixXXiQvXiF1XiQlXip7XiEi",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_30bd7633cbd9",
      "text": "你們將我們從一場夢魘中解救出來——如今卻又邀請我們去挑戰另一場恐懼。我 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^#7^$%^*{^#f^!%^\"n^\"y^<]^!,^(I^,Q^!q^!O^*n^*n^#$^*E^1&^+;^:%^*S^$%^*{^\"6^,H^$(^\">^!%^\"n^#t^$#^!\"^$% ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiM3XiQlXip7XiNmXiElXiJuXiJ5XjxdXiEsXihJXixRXiFxXiFPXipuXipuXiMkXipFXjEmXis7XjolXipTXiQlXip7XiI2XixIXiQoXiI+XiElXiJuXiN0XiQjXiEiXiQlIA==",
      "byte_length": 106
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_43e4c6dedfb9",
      "text": "對此深懷顧慮，但至少你們賦予了我們自主選擇的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#:^%I^2*^,9^4n^19^*A^!I^'n^#<^*F^*{^(Y^!4^*D^$%^*{^'l^!-^.6^,N^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiM6XiVJXjIqXiw5XjRuXjE5XipBXiFJXiduXiM8XipGXip7XihZXiE0XipEXiQlXip7XidsXiEtXi42XixOXiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c6f6724150d4",
      "text": "自由……為此，我們同意加入聯盟。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'l^&I^*o^*o^%{^%I^*A^$%^*{^\"E^#z^\"\"^!f^-V^-0^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XidsXiZJXipvXipvXiV7XiVJXipBXiQlXip7XiJFXiN6XiIiXiFmXi1WXi0wXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 49
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_85e84665a493",
      "text": "當德拉吉大軍來襲時，我們的守衛將與你們並肩進軍，我也會派遣部分 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&N^#j^$6^\"D^\"z^..^!O^08^$f^*A^$%^*{^&Z^#+^(=^#7^'p^*F^*{^!+^:#^(w^..^*A^$%^!1^$r^.n^4k^)#^!s ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZOXiNqXiQ2XiJEXiJ6Xi4uXiFPXjA4XiRmXipBXiQlXip7XiZaXiMrXig9XiM3XidwXipGXip7XiErXjojXih3Xi4uXipBXiQlXiExXiRyXi5uXjRrXikjXiFzIA==",
      "byte_length": 94
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2051451b44ff",
      "text": "人手前往提奎茲爾協助備戰。願勝利成為我們所有人的盟友。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!<^$+^!z^,)^$A^5B^/D^&/^2[^\"#^+\"^$(^!\"^.H^+5^!t^$$^%{^$%^*{^$)^$s^!<^&Z^-0^\"8^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiE8XiQrXiF6XiwpXiRBXjVCXi9EXiYvXjJbXiIjXisiXiQoXiEiXi5IXis1XiF0XiQkXiV7XiQlXip7XiQpXiRzXiE8XiZaXi0wXiI4XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e6cd530d0f6d",
      "text": "恭喜！隊伍獲得 4,000 點經驗值！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^1{^+V^*W^)U^!F^&:^#e 4,000 ^*;^'D^.P^!Z^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjF7XitWXipXXilVXiFGXiY6XiNlIDQsMDAwIF4qO14nRF4uUF4hWl4qVyA=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3066606d08cd",
      "text": "祝你們一切順利。能與你們這樣的英雄交談， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&v^*F^*{^!%^+.^.D^!t^!\"^'b^'p^*F^*{^(s^,f^&Z^'y^)\\^0P^0;^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZ2XipGXip7XiElXisuXi5EXiF0XiEiXidiXidwXipGXip7XihzXixmXiZaXid5XilcXjBQXjA7XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1b7f474ae571",
      "text": "我深感榮幸。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^2*^#{^,e^15^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXjIqXiN7XixlXjE1XiEi",
      "byte_length": 18
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_dbf453ec9c45",
      "text": "你們解救了我們，但我們的守衛依然落在大漠奴隸販子的魔爪中。蓋德隆 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^(I^,Q^*D^$%^*{^*A^!I^$%^*{^&Z^#+^(=^!Q^&\"^-`^\"d^\"z^,}^##^)Z^6.^#(^&Z^*0^&.^!,^!\"^-d^#j^)T ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XihJXixRXipEXiQlXip7XipBXiFJXiQlXip7XiZaXiMrXig9XiFRXiYiXi1gXiJkXiJ6Xix9XiMjXilaXjYuXiMoXiZaXiowXiYuXiEsXiEiXi1kXiNqXilUIA==",
      "byte_length": 97
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_017fb41127de",
      "text": "若沒有他們的回歸，絕不可能真正安全。他們被押往了北方。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'x^%\\^$s^!@^*{^&Z^\"\\^%K^*A^-I^!)^\"A^'b^-2^%H^+p^!h^!\"^!@^*{^(@^7Z^,)^*D^+6^$]^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xid4XiVcXiRzXiFAXip7XiZaXiJcXiVLXipBXi1JXiEpXiJBXidiXi0yXiVIXitwXiFoXiEiXiFAXip7XihAXjdaXiwpXipEXis2XiRdXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c3f639d6db2d",
      "text": "你們這群人就像狂暴的沙暴。你們把這座村莊的血肉屠戮殆盡。這裡 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^(s^'R^!<^*J^!`^&8^$m^&Z^%]^$m^!\"^*F^*{^$1^(s^/_^$z^6l^&Z^(:^'^^#A^,:^8H^-1^!\"^(s^-j ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XihzXidSXiE8XipKXiFgXiY4XiRtXiZaXiVdXiRtXiEiXipGXip7XiQxXihzXi9fXiR6XjZsXiZaXig6XideXiNBXiw6XjhIXi0xXiEiXihzXi1qIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1d80063f37e6",
      "text": "已經沒有你們想要的東西了。把你們的屠殺帶到別處去吧。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#J^'D^%\\^$s^*F^*{^,1^(C^&Z^,`^-l^*D^!\"^$1^*F^*{^&Z^#A^%M^#N^!u^*H^(,^\"6^*I^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNKXidEXiVcXiRzXipGXip7XiwxXihDXiZaXixgXi1sXipEXiEiXiQxXipGXip7XiZaXiNBXiVNXiNOXiF1XipIXigsXiI2XipJXiEi",
      "byte_length": 78
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f067f1401fb3",
      "text": "這裡有一扇密門。要開啟它嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^-j^$s^!%^$*^#0^)D^!\"^(C^)F^57^+o^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXi1qXiRzXiElXiQqXiMwXilEXiEiXihDXilGXjU3XitvXitYXi5W",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f36effb6a0b2",
      "text": " 發現了一扇密門！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^&W^&?^*D^!%^$*^#0^)D^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4mV14mP14qRF4hJV4kKl4jMF4pRF4qVyA=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4007d1f03336",
      "text": "要打開它嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(C^$-^)F^+o^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XihDXiQtXilGXitvXitYXi5W",
      "byte_length": 18
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9ccc912fb8a7",
      "text": " 察覺到這面牆有些異常。要靠近仔細檢查嗎？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^#2^(G^!u^(s^)j^&0^$s^!8^&M^#O^!\"^(C^.C^(l^6I^'?^%?^%&^+X^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4jMl4oR14hdV4oc14pal4mMF4kc14hOF4mTV4jT14hIl4oQ14uQ14obF42SV4nP14lP14lJl4rWF4uViA=",
      "byte_length": 62
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_28c629ed1afe",
      "text": "帶我去神廟吧，旅人。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#N^$%^\"6^&w^0[^*I^*A^2m^!<^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNOXiQlXiI2XiZ3XjBbXipJXipBXjJtXiE8XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 31
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_72acf3faa47b",
      "text": "我必須前往治療室。請帶我過去。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^#l^)r^!z^,)^%_^&U^+r^!\"^*S^#N^$%^(x^\"6^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiNsXilyXiF6XiwpXiVfXiZVXityXiEiXipTXiNOXiQlXih4XiI2XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_238d33ece49b",
      "text": "旅人，請等等我。我循著你的思緒前行，但它們正在逐漸減弱。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^2m^!<^*A^*S^'-^'-^$%^!\"^$%^#h^-a^*F^&Z^#q^3#^!z^(;^*A^!I^+o^*{^%H^\"d^(r^2v^%o^#\\^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjJtXiE8XipBXipTXictXictXiQlXiEiXiQlXiNoXi1hXipGXiZaXiNxXjMjXiF6Xig7XipBXiFJXitvXip7XiVIXiJkXihyXjJ2XiVvXiNcXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_db07ce91e5af",
      "text": "要跟上你非常吃力。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(C^.+^!'^*F^)i^#O^2^^!~^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihDXi4rXiEnXipGXilpXiNPXjJeXiF+XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 28
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_23e0af84e735",
      "text": "旅……我……快跟不上……無法…… ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^2m^*o^*o^$%^*o^*o^*L^.+^!)^!'^*o^*o^%}^%b^*o^*o ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjJtXipvXipvXiQlXipvXipvXipMXi4rXiEpXiEnXipvXipvXiV9XiViXipvXipvIA==",
      "byte_length": 49
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b7d1c2fd8798",
      "text": "你準備好帶我去神廟了嗎？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^,x^+\"^+i^#N^$%^\"6^&w^0[^*D^+X^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXix4XisiXitpXiNOXiQlXiI2XiZ3XjBbXipEXitYXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 37
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ca6017693ebe",
      "text": "好吧。我會在這裡等候。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+i^*I^!\"^$%^$r^\"d^(s^-j^'-^*|^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitpXipJXiEiXiQlXiRyXiJkXihzXi1qXictXip8XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1c2354c71d88",
      "text": "太好了。我們出發吧！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+f^+i^*D^!\"^$%^*{^!q^&W^*I^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitmXitpXipEXiEiXiQlXip7XiFxXiZXXipJXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 31
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_953444dd41a3",
      "text": "我感應到一股存在……你是一位旅人。或許你就是我 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^#{^0`^!u^!%^'_^#*^\"d^*o^*o^*F^,X^!%^!J^2m^!<^!\"^$'^-s^*F^*J^,X^$% ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiN7XjBgXiF1XiElXidfXiMqXiJkXipvXipvXipGXixYXiElXiFKXjJtXiE8XiEiXiQnXi1zXipGXipKXixYXiQlIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a6243e9cfcf9",
      "text": "在夢中見到的那個人……那麼，向你問好。我是盲眼者。我透過 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"d^\"y^!,^-m^!u^&Z^)!^!V^!<^*o^*o^)!^.T^*A^+?^*F^*Z^+i^!\"^$%^,X^&_^&d^'V^!\"^$%^(q^(x ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJkXiJ5XiEsXi1tXiF1XiZaXikhXiFWXiE8XipvXipvXikhXi5UXipBXis/XipGXipaXitpXiEiXiQlXixYXiZfXiZkXidWXiEiXiQlXihxXih4IA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1e74224af38a",
      "text": "心靈感應與你對話，因為我淪為奴隸時舌頭就被割掉了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#k^)g^#{^0`^'p^*F^#:^-v^*A^\"]^%{^$%^2)^%{^##^)Z^$f^'q^)t^*J^(@^+1^/e^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNrXilnXiN7XjBgXidwXipGXiM6Xi12XipBXiJdXiV7XiQlXjIpXiV7XiMjXilaXiRmXidxXil0XipKXihAXisxXi9lXipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1e03b9a23a86",
      "text": "  這裡究竟發生了什麼事？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^(s^-j^-<^28^&W^&F^*D^!=^.T^*r^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKHNeLWpeLTxeMjheJldeJkZeKkReIT1eLlReKnJeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_68dd98ed4ac6",
      "text": "  你能給我任何幫助嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^'b^'A^$%^!C^!L^+}^\"#^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeJ2JeJ0FeJCVeIUNeIUxeK31eIiNeK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f4539e60d539",
      "text": "再見。我會回來的。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!l^-m^!\"^$%^$r^\"\\^!O^&Z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFsXi1tXiEiXiQlXiRyXiJcXiFPXiZaXiEi",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_17ad01553e58",
      "text": "若要為你指引前路，單憑幾句問候是不夠的。等你有多餘的時間 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'x^(C^%{^*F^$8^#Z^!z^(a^*A^2a^,5^#T^2]^*Z^*|^,X^!)^+d^&Z^!\"^'-^*F^$s^\"x^1e^&Z^$f^)G ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xid4XihDXiV7XipGXiQ4XiNaXiF6XihhXipBXjJhXiw1XiNUXjJdXipaXip8XixYXiEpXitkXiZaXiEiXictXipGXiRzXiJ4XjFlXiZaXiRmXilHIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_47d3a328aa9a",
      "text": "靜下心來傾聽時再來吧。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)h^!(^#k^!O^2U^-X^$f^!l^!O^*I^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiloXiEoXiNrXiFPXjJVXi1YXiRmXiFsXiFPXipJXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_714cb17b93dc",
      "text": "掌控所有這些奴隸的人是巴卡扎，一名盤踞在洞窟深處的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$;^$@^$)^$s^(s^!8^##^)Z^&Z^!<^,X^#K^\"0^,=^*A^!%^\"F^1M^1_^\"d^%h^2~^2*^(,^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQ7XiRAXiQpXiRzXihzXiE4XiMjXilaXiZaXiE8XixYXiNLXiIwXiw9XipBXiElXiJGXjFNXjFfXiJkXiVoXjJ+XjIqXigsXiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d2372d439374",
      "text": "滅絕者。他就在那裡召喚可怕的怪物，並向他的黑暗主宰 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%t^-I^'V^!\"^!@^*J^\"d^)!^-j^\"@^\"U^\"A^0^^&Z^#s^&4^*A^!+^+?^!@^&Z^*:^$k^!-^1w ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiV0Xi1JXidWXiEiXiFAXipKXiJkXikhXi1qXiJAXiJVXiJBXjBeXiZaXiNzXiY0XipBXiErXis/XiFAXiZaXio6XiRrXiEtXjF3IA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e34292ebd956",
      "text": "奉獻活人祭品。我們被迫效忠巴卡扎，而他的爪牙則嚴加監視， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^1+^-(^%i^!<^&x^\"R^!\"^$%^*{^(@^1`^$Q^.d^#K^\"0^,=^*A^'W^!@^&Z^&.^&3^!x^1*^\"\"^2|^(E^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjErXi0oXiVpXiE8XiZ4XiJSXiEiXiQlXip7XihAXjFgXiRRXi5kXiNLXiIwXiw9XipBXidXXiFAXiZaXiYuXiYzXiF4XjEqXiIiXjJ8XihFXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_436a92516fc0",
      "text": "確保我們永遠無法反抗。這就是這裡「發生」的一切。若你是來徹底終結 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-6^!T^$%^*{^%W^({^%}^%b^\"9^$4^!\"^(s^*J^,X^(s^-j^!#^&W^&F^!$^&Z^!%^+.^!\"^'x^*F^,X^!O^18^/^^-H^'@ ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi02XiFUXiQlXip7XiVXXih7XiV9XiViXiI5XiQ0XiEiXihzXipKXixYXihzXi1qXiEjXiZXXiZGXiEkXiZaXiElXisuXiEiXid4XipGXixYXiFPXjE4Xi9eXi1IXidAIA==",
      "byte_length": 97
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_625e9a1e104e",
      "text": "他的暴政，你要明白你只能孤軍奮戰。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^&Z^$m^,P^*A^*F^(C^$c^&X^*F^\"?^'b^2c^..^+g^$(^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXiZaXiRtXixQXipBXipGXihDXiRjXiZYXipGXiI/XidiXjJjXi4uXitnXiQoXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e9707520cd0a",
      "text": "你正身處巨蟲之腹，巴卡扎的密室聖所。他霸佔了這些 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^%H^(c^(,^#H^(8^!/^3%^*A^#K^\"0^,=^&Z^#0^+r^'Z^$)^!\"^!@^33^0R^*D^(s^!8 ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiVIXihjXigsXiNIXig4XiEvXjMlXipBXiNLXiIwXiw9XiZaXiMwXityXidaXiQpXiEiXiFAXjMzXjBSXipEXihzXiE4IA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_41fe10f77635",
      "text": "洞窟並奴役了我們。這正是巨蟲之腹，連接著 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%h^2~^!+^##^17^*D^$%^*{^!\"^(s^%H^,X^#H^(8^!/^3%^*A^.0^$?^-a ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVoXjJ+XiErXiMjXjE3XipEXiQlXip7XiEiXihzXiVIXixYXiNIXig4XiEvXjMlXipBXi4wXiQ/Xi1hIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_86988b1a0300",
      "text": "更深處的神廟與巴卡扎的學院。如果你是前來 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$o^2*^(,^&Z^&w^0[^'p^#K^\"0^,=^&Z^+n^3/^!\"^#$^%!^*F^,X^!z^!O ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRvXjIqXigsXiZaXiZ3XjBbXidwXiNLXiIwXiw9XiZaXituXjMvXiEiXiMkXiUhXipGXixYXiF6XiFPIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2fbafb55232c",
      "text": "擊敗他的，要知道你只能獨自面對他。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$F^$R^!@^&Z^*A^(C^&h^(y^*F^\"?^'b^/z^'l^)j^#:^!@^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRGXiRSXiFAXiZaXipBXihDXiZoXih5XipGXiI/XidiXi96XidsXilqXiM6XiFAXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_63bcea5586e7",
      "text": "我唯一能給予的幫助就是情報。這片洞窟的統治者是巴卡扎。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^+O^!%^'b^'A^!4^&Z^+}^\"#^*J^,X^,0^+`^!\"^(s^&1^%h^2~^&Z^'B^%_^'V^,X^#K^\"0^,=^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXitPXiElXidiXidBXiE0XiZaXit9XiIjXipKXixYXiwwXitgXiEiXihzXiYxXiVoXjJ+XiZaXidCXiVfXidWXixYXiNLXiIwXiw9XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6d7b48abf1c6",
      "text": "他奴役了我們，並將神廟扭曲為極其黑暗險惡的用途。我們不會 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^##^17^*D^$%^*{^*A^!+^#7^&w^0[^1;^$n^%{^1D^!j^*:^$k^*m^#y^&Z^&H^3.^!\"^$%^*{^!)^$r ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXiMjXjE3XipEXiQlXip7XipBXiErXiM3XiZ3XjBbXjE7XiRuXiV7XjFEXiFqXio6XiRrXiptXiN5XiZaXiZIXjMuXiEiXiQlXip7XiEpXiRyIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_926593b3bfa7",
      "text": "起而反抗巴卡扎——先前的嘗試已經讓太多人喪命了。如果你打算 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.(^'W^\"9^$4^#K^\"0^,=^*n^*n^!b^!z^&Z^1o^-u^#J^'D^-}^+f^\"x^!<^1)^\"N^*D^!\"^#$^%!^*F^$-^-C ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi4oXidXXiI5XiQ0XiNLXiIwXiw9XipuXipuXiFiXiF6XiZaXjFvXi11XiNKXidEXi19XitmXiJ4XiE8XjEpXiJOXipEXiEiXiMkXiUhXipGXiQtXi1DIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_492df7949f83",
      "text": "徹底剷除他，你只能孤軍奮戰。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^18^/^^2Y^)Q^!@^*A^*F^\"?^'b^2c^..^+g^$(^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjE4Xi9eXjJZXilRXiFAXipBXipGXiI/XidiXjJjXi4uXitnXiQoXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 43
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6de5f0fcf139",
      "text": "  太棒了。真感謝你的支持啊。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^+f^%1^*D^!\"^-2^#{^-z^*F^&Z^$L^$7^+Q^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeK2ZeJTFeKkReISJeLTJeI3teLXpeKkZeJlpeJExeJDdeK1FeISI=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7764ffd9281e",
      "text": "  我該如何前往巴卡扎那裡？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^(M^#$^!L^!z^,)^#K^\"0^,=^)!^-j^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeKE1eIyReIUxeIXpeLCleI0teIjBeLD1eKSFeLWpeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_483232766a79",
      "text": "  巴卡扎正在拿奴隸當祭品？！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^#K^\"0^,=^%H^\"d^,G^##^)Z^&N^&x^\"R^.V^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeI0teIjBeLD1eJUheImReLEdeIyNeKVpeJk5eJnheIlJeLlZeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1a8dd6457dab",
      "text": "  你為什麼不把真相告訴奴隸們？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^%{^!=^.T^!)^$1^-2^&a^+B^-t^##^)Z^*{^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeJXteIT1eLlReISleJDFeLTJeJmFeK0JeLXReIyNeKVpeKnteLlY=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f96c0922e62a",
      "text": "  巴卡扎手下有什麼樣的爪牙？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^#K^\"0^,=^$+^!(^$s^!=^.T^,f^&Z^&.^&3^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeI0teIjBeLD1eJCteISheJHNeIT1eLlReLGZeJlpeJi5eJjNeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1a79ae1dc423",
      "text": "  那麼，是誰在看管奴隸？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^)!^.T^*A^,X^-y^\"d^*Q^-D^##^)Z^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKSFeLlReKkFeLFheLXleImReKlFeLUReIyNeKVpeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fe776c43e882",
      "text": "  那些頭目都在哪裡？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^)!^!8^)t^&^^)$^\"d^+I^-j^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKSFeITheKXReJl5eKSReImReK0leLWpeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3d582115e5eb",
      "text": "  我這就去跟那些頭目談談。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^(s^*J^\"6^.+^)!^!8^)t^&^^0;^0;^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeKHNeKkpeIjZeLiteKSFeITheKXReJl5eMDteMDteISI=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1492ac2bc718",
      "text": "  你還能給我其他忠告嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^.7^'b^'A^$%^!j^!@^.d^+B^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeLjdeJ2JeJ0FeJCVeIWpeIUBeLmReK0JeK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a4fbc43b005a",
      "text": "  我在神廟遇見了泰內利夫。他能提供幫助。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^\"d^&w^0[^.2^-m^*D^%f^!g^!t^\"{^!\"^!@^'b^$A^!P^+}^\"#^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeImReJndeMFteLjJeLW1eKkReJWZeIWdeIXReInteISJeIUBeJ2JeJEFeIVBeK31eIiNeISI=",
      "byte_length": 59
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b3562fcf69cb",
      "text": "  他告訴我他能治癒奴隸們。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^!@^+B^-t^$%^!@^'b^%_^&V^##^)Z^*{^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIUBeK0JeLXReJCVeIUBeJ2JeJV9eJlZeIyNeKVpeKnteISI=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f22bc0a37a7e",
      "text": "  我已經說服他們了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^#J^'D^-x^,\\^!@^*{^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeI0peJ0ReLXheLFxeIUBeKnteKkReISIg",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bbbbf06e2aad",
      "text": "  好吧。我去說服他們。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^+i^*I^!\"^$%^\"6^-x^,\\^!@^*{^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeK2leKkleISJeJCVeIjZeLXheLFxeIUBeKnteISIg",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b7144c5d708f",
      "text": "  我需要的是實質幫助，不是空談忠告！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^)e^(C^&Z^,X^#3^(Z^+}^\"#^*A^!)^,X^'(^0;^.d^+B^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeKWVeKENeJlpeLFheIzNeKFpeK31eIiNeKkFeISleLFheJyheMDteLmReK0JeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 53
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e3a03ea4a983",
      "text": "請明白，並非我不想幫你，而是我不想 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*S^$c^&X^*A^!+^)i^$%^!)^,1^+}^*F^*A^'W^,X^$%^!)^,1 ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipTXiRjXiZYXipBXiErXilpXiQlXiEpXiwxXit9XipGXipBXidXXixYXiQlXiEpXiwxIA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_48753d56b08a",
      "text": "讓更多的奴隸陷入危險之中。巴卡扎的活祭與殘虐的爪牙， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-}^$o^\"x^&Z^##^)Z^)S^!f^2\\^*m^!/^!,^!\"^#K^\"0^,=^&Z^%i^&x^'p^,l^3)^&Z^&.^&3^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi19XiRvXiJ4XiZaXiMjXilaXilTXiFmXjJcXiptXiEvXiEsXiEiXiNLXiIwXiw9XiZaXiVpXiZ4XidwXixsXjMpXiZaXiYuXiYzXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a58be2fc636a",
      "text": "已經奪走了我們太多同胞的性命。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#J^'D^1,^.&^*D^$%^*{^+f^\"x^\"E^'`^&Z^#r^\"N^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNKXidEXjEsXi4mXipEXiQlXip7XitmXiJ4XiJFXidgXiZaXiNyXiJOXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0deeed4be38d",
      "text": "巴卡扎盤踞在東面的學院裡。千萬小心，因為他爪牙眾多， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#K^\"0^,=^1M^1_^\"d^,`^)j^&Z^+n^3/^-j^!\"^+7^-_^#;^#k^*A^\"]^%{^!@^&.^&3^&e^\"x^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNLXiIwXiw9XjFNXjFfXiJkXixgXilqXiZaXituXjMvXi1qXiEiXis3Xi1fXiM7XiNrXipBXiJdXiV7XiFAXiYuXiYzXiZlXiJ4XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8093b8a8da87",
      "text": "而且若是你打斷了他的祭祀儀式，他絕不會善罷甘休。然而在抵達他那裡之前， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'W^!*^'x^,X^*F^$-^,T^*D^!@^&Z^&x^&t^+'^#X^*A^!@^-I^!)^$r^1(^1Q^/:^!G^!\"^&\"^'W^\"d^$5^(z^!@^)!^-j^!/^!z^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XidXXiEqXid4XixYXipGXiQtXixUXipEXiFAXiZaXiZ4XiZ0XisnXiNYXipBXiFAXi1JXiEpXiRyXjEoXjFRXi86XiFHXiEiXiYiXidXXiJkXiQ1Xih6XiFAXikhXi1qXiEvXiF6XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 106
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f4f8e104d99f",
      "text": "你必須先穿過這些洞窟的看守頭目——那群效忠巴卡扎的狂熱信徒。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^#l^)r^!b^')^(x^(s^!8^%h^2~^&Z^*Q^#+^)t^&^^*n^*n^)!^'R^$Q^.d^#K^\"0^,=^&Z^&8^&$^!U^#d^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiNsXilyXiFiXicpXih4XihzXiE4XiVoXjJ+XiZaXipRXiMrXil0XiZeXipuXipuXikhXidSXiRRXi5kXiNLXiIwXiw9XiZaXiY4XiYkXiFVXiNkXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c612b0450a86",
      "text": "頭目們住在東邊的營房裡。與我們相比， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)t^&^^*{^*z^\"d^,`^.8^&Z^&'^,<^-j^!\"^'p^$%^*{^&a^,m^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xil0XiZeXip7Xip6XiJkXixgXi44XiZaXiYnXiw8Xi1qXiEiXidwXiQlXip7XiZhXixtXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9f34b23ec5c8",
      "text": "他們過著奢華的生活。巴卡扎用鎖鏈牢牢拴著他們，並給予他們優厚的待遇。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^*{^(x^-a^1t^3'^&Z^&F^%i^!\"^#K^\"0^,=^&H^)8^)<^-$^-$^2j^-a^!@^*{^*A^!+^'A^!4^!@^*{^+)^\"4^&Z^,*^.2^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXip7Xih4Xi1hXjF0XjMnXiZaXiZGXiVpXiEiXiNLXiIwXiw9XiZIXik4Xik8Xi0kXi0kXjJqXi1hXiFAXip7XipBXiErXidBXiE0XiFAXip7XispXiI0XiZaXiwqXi4yXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 103
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ae955d576a37",
      "text": "在某種程度上我甚至替他們感到悲哀——他們就是下一批被送上祭壇的活人祭品。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"d^%$^'$^'#^#V^!'^$%^/|^'n^2o^!@^*{^#{^!u^,.^2`^*n^*n^!@^*{^*J^,X^!(^!%^2i^(@^./^!'^&x^*]^&Z^%i^!<^&x^\"R^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJkXiUkXickXicjXiNWXiEnXiQlXi98XiduXjJvXiFAXip7XiN7XiF1XiwuXjJgXipuXipuXiFAXip7XipKXixYXiEoXiElXjJpXihAXi4vXiEnXiZ4XipdXiZaXiVpXiE8XiZ4XiJSXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 109
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_70ddeadb3edd",
      "text": "給你一個忠告。若你想接近那些頭目，最好的辦法是 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'A^*F^!%^!V^.d^+B^!\"^'x^*F^,1^$?^(l^)!^!8^)t^&^^*A^$q^+i^&Z^2L^%b^,X ",
      "encoded_base64": "XidBXipGXiElXiFWXi5kXitCXiEiXid4XipGXiwxXiQ/XihsXikhXiE4Xil0XiZeXipBXiRxXitpXiZaXjJMXiViXixYIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_eb176ee62bcb",
      "text": "讓自己看起來位高權重。切莫打聽巴卡扎的事，反而要用他的威名 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-}^'l^#I^*Q^.(^!O^!J^*+^1E^))^!\"^+.^/F^$-^-X^#K^\"0^,=^&Z^*r^*A^\"9^'W^(C^&H^!@^&Z^#&^\"F ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi19XidsXiNJXipRXi4oXiFPXiFKXiorXjFFXikpXiEiXisuXi9GXiQtXi1YXiNLXiIwXiw9XiZaXipyXipBXiI5XidXXihDXiZIXiFAXiZaXiMmXiJGIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fc396c923e74",
      "text": "去威嚇他們，聲稱你們是前來晉見他的。就連那些頭目也對巴卡扎懼怕萬分。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"6^#&^\"X^!@^*{^*A^-W^0&^*F^*{^,X^!z^!O^2n^-m^!@^&Z^!\"^*J^.0^)!^!8^)t^&^^!1^#:^#K^\"0^,=^$#^0^^-_^!s^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiI2XiMmXiJYXiFAXip7XipBXi1XXjAmXipGXip7XixYXiF6XiFPXjJuXi1tXiFAXiZaXiEiXipKXi4wXikhXiE4Xil0XiZeXiExXiM6XiNLXiIwXiw9XiQjXjBeXi1fXiFzXiEi",
      "byte_length": 102
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8660bc37da7b",
      "text": "淪為巴卡扎狂熱追隨者的奴隸——就是那些所謂的「頭目」。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^2)^%{^#K^\"0^,=^&8^&$^(o^)X^'V^&Z^##^)Z^*n^*n^*J^,X^)!^!8^$)^0s^&Z^!#^)t^&^^!$^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjIpXiV7XiNLXiIwXiw9XiY4XiYkXihvXilYXidWXiZaXiMjXilaXipuXipuXipKXixYXikhXiE4XiQpXjBzXiZaXiEjXil0XiZeXiEkXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_74a026675ffe",
      "text": "他挑撥他們反對自己的同胞，每當需要恐嚇其他奴隸時， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^,H^2l^!@^*{^\"9^#:^'l^#I^&Z^\"E^'`^*A^%P^&N^)e^(C^#t^\"X^!j^!@^##^)Z^$f^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXixIXjJsXiFAXip7XiI5XiM6XidsXiNJXiZaXiJFXidgXipBXiVQXiZOXillXihDXiN0XiJYXiFqXiFAXiMjXilaXiRmXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ee6f60fa5a74",
      "text": "他們就會毫不猶豫地召來巴布魔。他們整天都待在 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^*{^*J^$r^/t^!)^2y^3,^\"e^\"@^!O^#K^.`^*0^!\"^!@^*{^$T^+e^)$^,*^\"d ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXip7XipKXiRyXi90XiEpXjJ5XjMsXiJlXiJAXiFPXiNLXi5gXiowXiEiXiFAXip7XiRUXitlXikkXiwqXiJkIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3285359c4b15",
      "text": "自己的營房裡享樂。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'l^#I^&Z^&'^,<^-j^!;^%8^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XidsXiNJXiZaXiYnXiw8Xi1qXiE7XiU4XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 28
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a625434d26e0",
      "text": "巴卡扎從幽暗幽冥界域召喚了巴布魔與弗洛魔。牠們 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#K^\"0^,=^#f^2f^$k^2f^2X^.p^\"k^\"@^\"U^*D^#K^.`^*0^'p^#[^%g^*0^!\"^-#^*{ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNLXiIwXiw9XiNmXjJmXiRrXjJmXjJYXi5wXiJrXiJAXiJVXipEXiNLXi5gXiowXidwXiNbXiVnXiowXiEiXi0jXip7IA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_709b0dccf103",
      "text": "受制於他的命令，並毫不猶豫地代他大開殺戒。巴卡扎 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\";^!v^$^^!@^&Z^\"N^*w^*A^!+^/t^!)^2y^3,^\"e^*v^!@^\"z^)F^%M^$&^!\"^#K^\"0^,= ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiI7XiF2XiReXiFAXiZaXiJOXip3XipBXiErXi90XiEpXjJ5XjMsXiJlXip2XiFAXiJ6XilGXiVNXiQmXiEiXiNLXiIwXiw9IA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f43214e6d68b",
      "text": "利用牠們把守神廟與學院。奴隸們對牠們恐懼到了極點， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!t^&H^-#^*{^$1^#+^&w^0[^'p^+n^3/^!\"^##^)Z^*{^#:^-#^*{^#t^$#^!u^*D^1D^*;^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiF0XiZIXi0jXip7XiQxXiMrXiZ3XjBbXidwXituXjMvXiEiXiMjXilaXip7XiM6Xi0jXip7XiN0XiQjXiF1XipEXjFEXio7XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c490b4de74cf",
      "text": "只要一提到巴布魔或弗洛魔的名字，就足以逼得他們不敢停下勞作。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"?^(C^!%^$A^!u^#K^.`^*0^$'^#[^%g^*0^&Z^\"F^#)^*A^*J^(^^!B^.1^#e^!@^*{^!)^/m^+!^!(^/R^!M^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiI/XihDXiElXiRBXiF1XiNLXi5gXiowXiQnXiNbXiVnXiowXiZaXiJGXiMpXipBXipKXiheXiFCXi4xXiNlXiFAXip7XiEpXi9tXishXiEoXi9SXiFNXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a5ff2da5a10a",
      "text": "我說過……這就是我失去雙眼的原因。我被當成了「殺雞儆猴的榜樣」——一個 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^-x^(x^*o^*o^(s^*J^,X^$%^\"|^\"6^)_^&d^&Z^\"5^\"]^!\"^$%^(@^&N^$$^*D^!#^%M^31^2V^2x^&Z^2q^,f^!$^*n^*n^!%^!V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXi14Xih4XipvXipvXihzXipKXixYXiQlXiJ8XiI2XilfXiZkXiZaXiI1XiJdXiEiXiQlXihAXiZOXiQkXipEXiEjXiVNXjMxXjJWXjJ4XiZaXjJxXixmXiEkXipuXipuXiElXiFWIA==",
      "byte_length": 106
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_24f82d02ed88",
      "text": "不相信「轉化」謊言的人。現在奴隸們工作得更加賣命了； ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^&a^!U^!#^(i^\")^!$^3*^1Y^&Z^!<^!\"^&?^\"d^##^)Z^*{^+y^!M^#e^$o^\"\"^.$^\"N^*D^*C ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXiZhXiFVXiEjXihpXiIpXiEkXjMqXjFZXiZaXiE8XiEiXiY/XiJkXiMjXilaXip7Xit5XiFNXiNlXiRvXiIiXi4kXiJOXipEXipDIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e07074fc296a",
      "text": "他們以為只要膽敢質疑轉化，就會像我一樣被弄瞎。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^*{^!B^%{^\"?^(C^-[^/m^(Z^0p^(i^\")^*A^*J^$r^!`^$%^!%^,f^(@^/`^2}^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXip7XiFCXiV7XiI/XihDXi1bXi9tXihaXjBwXihpXiIpXipBXipKXiRyXiFgXiQlXiElXixmXihAXi9gXjJ9XiEi",
      "byte_length": 69
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b02faa64fcee",
      "text": "是的。令人悲痛的是，這全是真的。他的邪惡爪牙必須得到安撫才能踏入這個 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,X^&Z^!\"^*w^!<^,.^-.^&Z^,X^*A^(s^!h^,X^-2^&Z^!\"^!@^&Z^)\"^#y^&.^&3^#l^)r^#e^!u^+p^0d^$,^'b^.,^!f^(s^!V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XixYXiZaXiEiXip3XiE8XiwuXi0uXiZaXixYXipBXihzXiFoXixYXi0yXiZaXiEiXiFAXiZaXikiXiN5XiYuXiYzXiNsXilyXiNlXiF1XitwXjBkXiQsXidiXi4sXiFmXihzXiFWIA==",
      "byte_length": 103
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_293d0911589e",
      "text": "物質界域。他宣揚了一套被他稱為「轉化」的謬論，宣稱 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&4^(Z^.p^\"k^!\"^!@^2d^2k^*D^!%^#!^(@^!@^0&^%{^!#^(i^\")^!$^&Z^3+^1\\^*A^2d^0& ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiY0XihaXi5wXiJrXiEiXiFAXjJkXjJrXipEXiElXiMhXihAXiFAXjAmXiV7XiEjXihpXiIpXiEkXiZaXjMrXjFcXipBXjJkXjAmIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b0f5faf0ec41",
      "text": "只要奴隸工作勤奮、服從管教，就能晉升到更高的存在層次。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"?^(C^##^)Z^+y^!M^2Z^+g^!!^,\\^#f^-D^,R^*A^*J^'b^2n^\",^!u^$o^*+^&Z^#*^\"d^#B^%D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiI/XihDXiMjXilaXit5XiFNXjJaXitnXiEhXixcXiNmXi1EXixSXipBXipKXidiXjJuXiIsXiF1XiRvXiorXiZaXiMqXiJkXiNCXiVEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3c4c3ad31da6",
      "text": "然而實際上，他是將他們當成活人祭品來召喚巴布魔與弗洛魔。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&\"^'W^#3^30^!'^*A^!@^,X^#7^!@^*{^&N^$$^%i^!<^&x^\"R^!O^\"@^\"U^#K^.`^*0^'p^#[^%g^*0^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiYiXidXXiMzXjMwXiEnXipBXiFAXixYXiM3XiFAXip7XiZOXiQkXiVpXiE8XiZ4XiJSXiFPXiJAXiJVXiNLXi5gXiowXidwXiNbXiVnXiowXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e788181ee429",
      "text": "忠告所能帶來的幫助遠超你的想像。我不是戰士， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.d^+B^$)^'b^#N^!O^&Z^+}^\"#^({^(\\^*F^&Z^,1^!`^!\"^$%^!)^,X^$(^+a^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi5kXitCXiQpXidiXiNOXiFPXiZaXit9XiIjXih7XihcXipGXiZaXiwxXiFgXiEiXiQlXiEpXixYXiQoXithXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_dbfddd975ff0",
      "text": "我的同胞們也不是。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^&Z^\"E^'`^*{^!1^!)^,X^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiZaXiJFXidgXip7XiExXiEpXixYXiEi",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3dc668f50cad",
      "text": "在我的夢境中，我看見了神廟，那是一處救贖與毀滅並存的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"d^$%^&Z^\"y^\"q^!,^*A^$%^*Q^-m^*D^&w^0[^*A^)!^,X^!%^(,^,Q^3-^'p^%N^%t^!+^#*^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJkXiQlXiZaXiJ5XiJxXiEsXipBXiQlXipRXi1tXipEXiZ3XjBbXipBXikhXixYXiElXigsXixRXjMtXidwXiVOXiV0XiErXiMqXiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7f0c5c6174dd",
      "text": "場所。我建議你去探索一番——穿過頭目們的營房後，朝 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"n^$)^!\"^$%^,'^-|^*F^\"6^$>^'>^!%^2{^*n^*n^')^(x^)t^&^^*{^&Z^&'^,<^#b^*A^,^ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJuXiQpXiEiXiQlXiwnXi18XipGXiI2XiQ+Xic+XiElXjJ7XipuXipuXicpXih4Xil0XiZeXip7XiZaXiYnXiw8XiNiXipBXixeIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_345289f8ca3e",
      "text": "南方前進。在那裡你會找到神廟的入口。或許你能在那裡 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"/^$]^!z^(w^!\"^\"d^)!^-j^*F^$r^$/^!u^&w^0[^&Z^!f^\"<^!\"^$'^-s^*F^'b^\"d^)!^-j ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiIvXiRdXiF6Xih3XiEiXiJkXikhXi1qXipGXiRyXiQvXiF1XiZ3XjBbXiZaXiFmXiI8XiEiXiQnXi1zXipGXidiXiJkXikhXi1qIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a64a6a1967a3",
      "text": "為你的冒險找到助力。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%{^*F^&Z^/P^*m^$/^!u^\"#^!~^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiV7XipGXiZaXi9QXiptXiQvXiF1XiIjXiF+XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 31
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_72aa4d72b714",
      "text": "確實如此。那麼泰內利夫跟你說了些什麼？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-6^#3^#$^%I^!\"^)!^.T^%f^!g^!t^\"{^.+^*F^-x^*D^!8^!=^.T^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi02XiMzXiMkXiVJXiEiXikhXi5UXiVmXiFnXiF0XiJ7Xi4rXipGXi14XipEXiE4XiE9Xi5UXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7960707f262e",
      "text": "治癒奴隸？這將是一份無比美好的恩賜……但有個難題。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%_^&V^##^)Z^.V^(s^#7^,X^!%^*x^%}^,m^-P^+i^&Z^#v^.#^*o^*o^!I^$s^!V^)a^.G^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVfXiZWXiMjXilaXi5WXihzXiM3XixYXiElXip4XiV9XixtXi1QXitpXiZaXiN2Xi4jXipvXipvXiFJXiRzXiFWXilhXi5HXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8ed8a012300e",
      "text": "那些頭目絕不會讓奴隸平安通過而不痛下殺手。你必須先說服 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^!8^)t^&^^-I^!)^$r^-}^##^)Z^0Y^+p^(t^(x^'W^!)^-.^!(^%M^$+^!\"^*F^#l^)r^!b^-x^,\\ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXiE4Xil0XiZeXi1JXiEpXiRyXi19XiMjXilaXjBZXitwXih0Xih4XidXXiEpXi0uXiEoXiVNXiQrXiEiXipGXiNsXilyXiFiXi14XixcIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_772ff5cda084",
      "text": "他們，我才能放心讓其他奴隸前去接受治療。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^*{^*A^$%^$,^'b^$P^#k^-}^!j^!@^##^)Z^!z^\"6^$?^\";^%_^&U^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXip7XipBXiQlXiQsXidiXiRQXiNrXi19XiFqXiFAXiMjXilaXiF6XiI2XiQ/XiI7XiVfXiZVXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1e442ed7e1fb",
      "text": "如果你照我說的去做，那些頭目一定會放行讓奴隸通過。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#$^%!^*F^/x^$%^-x^&Z^\"6^*~^*A^)!^!8^)t^&^^!%^#.^$r^$P^(;^-}^##^)Z^(t^(x^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiMkXiUhXipGXi94XiQlXi14XiZaXiI2Xip+XipBXikhXiE4Xil0XiZeXiElXiMuXiRyXiRQXig7Xi19XiMjXilaXih0Xih4XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_758eee3937ab",
      "text": "若是如此，請帶路吧！等我被治癒後，其他人一定會緊隨其後。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'x^,X^#$^%I^*A^*S^#N^(a^*I^*W^'-^$%^(@^%_^&V^#b^*A^!j^!@^!<^!%^#.^$r^0r^)X^!j^#b^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xid4XixYXiMkXiVJXipBXipTXiNOXihhXipJXipXXictXiQlXihAXiVfXiZWXiNiXipBXiFqXiFAXiE8XiElXiMuXiRyXjByXilYXiFqXiNiXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ca3e2a7b9558",
      "text": "很好。我期待你很快歸來。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*K^+i^!\"^$%^$u^,*^*F^*K^*L^%K^!O^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipLXitpXiEiXiQlXiR1XiwqXipGXipLXipMXiVLXiFPXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 37
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0a6cf598bfd0",
      "text": "喔。在你離開之前，還有一件事。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+T^!\"^\"d^*F^)`^)F^!/^!z^*A^.7^$s^!%^.W^*r^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitUXiEiXiJkXipGXilgXilGXiEvXiF6XipBXi43XiRzXiElXi5XXipyXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5e548e848255",
      "text": "願你們心靈平靜，戰士們。你們的命運自會在合適的時刻降臨。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.H^*F^*{^#k^)g^0Y^)h^*A^$(^+a^*{^!\"^*F^*{^&Z^\"N^.4^'l^$r^\"d^\"C^(|^&Z^$f^.Y^)N^1U^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi5IXipGXip7XiNrXilnXjBZXiloXipBXiQoXithXip7XiEiXipGXip7XiZaXiJOXi40XidsXiRyXiJkXiJDXih8XiZaXiRmXi5ZXilOXjFVXiEi",
      "byte_length": 84
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_99c6aa7776e9",
      "text": "你們回來了。我能為你們做些什麼？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^\"\\^!O^*D^!\"^$%^'b^%{^*F^*{^*~^!8^!=^.T^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiJcXiFPXipEXiEiXiQlXidiXiV7XipGXip7Xip+XiE4XiE9Xi5UXi5W",
      "byte_length": 48
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ee9226b88cd1",
      "text": "  你對我還有其他忠告嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^#:^$%^.7^$s^!j^!@^.d^+B^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeIzpeJCVeLjdeJHNeIWpeIUBeLmReK0JeK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d57ed5c5609e",
      "text": "  你能給我任何援助嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^'b^'A^$%^!C^!L^$C^\"#^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeJ2JeJ0FeJCVeIUNeIUxeJENeIiNeK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2c446d474b60",
      "text": "你回來了。現在你準備好聆聽我所能告訴你的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^\"\\^!O^*D^!\"^&?^\"d^*F^,x^+\"^+i^3$^-X^$%^$)^'b^+B^-t^*F^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiJcXiFPXipEXiEiXiY/XiJkXipGXix4XisiXitpXjMkXi1YXiQlXiQpXidiXitCXi10XipGXiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_921970a7601c",
      "text": "情報了嗎？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,0^+`^*D^+X^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiwwXitgXipEXitYXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 16
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ed372570dd03",
      "text": "  你能幫我嗎？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^'b^+}^$%^+X^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeJ2JeK31eJCVeK1heLlYg",
      "byte_length": 21
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_303978445704",
      "text": "  這裡究竟發生了什麼事？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^(s^-j^-<^28^&W^&F^*D^!=^.T^*r^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKHNeLWpeLTxeMjheJldeJkZeKkReIT1eLlReKnJeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fd66516c81c2",
      "text": "我沒時間了。再見。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^%\\^$f^)G^*D^!\"^!l^-m^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiVcXiRmXilHXipEXiEiXiFsXi1tXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 28
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e1e2423f6b12",
      "text": "如果你四處奔波卻連花時間蒐集情報都做不到， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#$^%!^*F^\"[^(,^2b^%c^1&^.0^'w^$f^)G^3(^)]^,0^+`^)$^*~^!)^!u^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiMkXiUhXipGXiJbXigsXjJiXiVjXjEmXi4wXid3XiRmXilHXjMoXildXiwwXitgXikkXip+XiEpXiF1XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_98e23a5afec3",
      "text": "你永遠無法完成你的使命。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^%W^({^%}^%b^#,^$$^*F^&Z^!N^\"N^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiVXXih7XiV9XiViXiMsXiQkXipGXiZaXiFOXiJOXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 37
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3ff37857300c",
      "text": "我已經把所知道的一切都告訴你了。現在全看你自己了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^#J^'D^$1^$)^&h^(y^&Z^!%^+.^)$^+B^-t^*F^*D^!\"^&?^\"d^!h^*Q^*F^'l^#I^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiNKXidEXiQxXiQpXiZoXih5XiZaXiElXisuXikkXitCXi10XipGXipEXiEiXiY/XiJkXiFoXipRXipGXidsXiNJXipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 75
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_03c7519de1ae",
      "text": "沒有任何奴隸敢冒險承受巴卡扎的怒火，即便我能說服 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%\\^$s^!C^!L^##^)Z^/m^/P^*m^$0^\";^#K^\"0^,=^&Z^#o^%x^*A^\"1^!R^$%^'b^-x^,\\ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVcXiRzXiFDXiFMXiMjXilaXi9tXi9QXiptXiQwXiI7XiNLXiIwXiw9XiZaXiNvXiV4XipBXiIxXiFSXiQlXidiXi14XixcIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6121ef6c409c",
      "text": "他們幫助你，我也不會這麼做。我們的鮮血已經染紅了太多 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^*{^+}^\"#^*F^*A^$%^!1^!)^$r^(s^.T^*~^!\"^$%^*{^&Z^35^(:^#J^'D^%%^3!^*D^+f^\"x ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXip7Xit9XiIjXipGXipBXiQlXiExXiEpXiRyXihzXi5UXip+XiEiXiQlXip7XiZaXjM1Xig6XiNKXidEXiUlXjMhXipEXitmXiJ4IA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a5160679c2c8",
      "text": "地面。你們必須替我們而戰。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"e^)j^!\"^*F^*{^#l^)r^2o^$%^*{^'W^$(^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJlXilqXiEiXipGXip7XiNsXilyXjJvXiQlXip7XidXXiQoXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 40
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7a586133f17f",
      "text": "又回來了。我能為你們做些什麼？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+;^\"\\^!O^*D^!\"^$%^'b^%{^*F^*{^*~^!8^!=^.T^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "Xis7XiJcXiFPXipEXiEiXiQlXidiXiV7XipGXip7Xip+XiE4XiE9Xi5UXi5W",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_25f00a6f29d2",
      "text": "  你認識泰內利夫嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^(O^(R^%f^!g^!t^\"{^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeKE9eKFJeJWZeIWdeIXReInteK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e6cb458d9ec9",
      "text": "  泰內利夫提議治癒奴隸們。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^%f^!g^!t^\"{^$A^-|^%_^&V^##^)Z^*{^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJWZeIWdeIXReInteJEFeLXxeJV9eJlZeIyNeKVpeKnteISI=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_39b82211f244",
      "text": "  幫助我，我就會治癒奴隸們。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^+}^\"#^$%^*A^$%^*J^$r^%_^&V^##^)Z^*{^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeK31eIiNeJCVeKkFeJCVeKkpeJHJeJV9eJlZeIyNeKVpeKnteISI=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e938d94ce506",
      "text": "沒什麼，再見。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%\\^!=^.T^*A^!l^-m^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVcXiE9Xi5UXipBXiFsXi1tXiEi",
      "byte_length": 21
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d361658999df",
      "text": "  泰內利夫能夠治癒奴隸們。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^%f^!g^!t^\"{^'b^+d^%_^&V^##^)Z^*{^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJWZeIWdeIXReInteJ2JeK2ReJV9eJlZeIyNeKVpeKnteISI=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2cc43ef53ac6",
      "text": "  我會竭盡全力。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^$r^29^-1^!h^!~^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeJHJeMjleLTFeIWheIX5eISI=",
      "byte_length": 23
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c712ac173e8d",
      "text": "  什麼？我做不到那種事！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^!=^.T^.V^$%^*~^!)^!u^)!^'$^*r^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIT1eLlReLlZeJCVeKn5eISleIXVeKSFeJyReKnJeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9273db8860a1",
      "text": "  跟我來——我帶你去接受治療。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^.+^$%^!O^*n^*n^$%^#N^*F^\"6^$?^\";^%_^&U^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLiteJCVeIU9eKm5eKm5eJCVeI05eKkZeIjZeJD9eIjteJV9eJlVeISI=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1d08e0b1e5a9",
      "text": "  我已經說服那些頭目了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^#J^'D^-x^,\\^)!^!8^)t^&^^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeI0peJ0ReLXheLFxeKSFeITheKXReJl5eKkReISI=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_54511639eed9",
      "text": "那個名字……聽起來好熟悉……等等。他不就是盤踞在 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^!V^\"F^#)^*o^*o^-X^.(^!O^+i^-\"^2h^*o^*o^'-^'-^!\"^!@^!)^*J^,X^1M^1_^\"d ",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXiFWXiJGXiMpXipvXipvXi1YXi4oXiFPXitpXi0iXjJoXipvXipvXictXictXiEiXiFAXiEpXipKXixYXjFNXjFfXiJkIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a5d223514815",
      "text": "神廟裡的那位嗎？就是那位在試圖保護我們免遭巴卡扎及其爪牙荼毒時 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&w^0[^-j^&Z^)!^!J^+X^.V^*J^,X^)!^!J^\"d^-u^\"b^!T^(T^$%^*{^!e^(}^#K^\"0^,=^\"7^!j^&.^&3^3&^%Q^$f ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZ3XjBbXi1qXiZaXikhXiFKXitYXi5WXipKXixYXikhXiFKXiJkXi11XiJiXiFUXihUXiQlXip7XiFlXih9XiNLXiIwXiw9XiI3XiFqXiYuXiYzXjMmXiVRXiRmIA==",
      "byte_length": 94
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d82cf2c7e069",
      "text": "英勇犧牲的人。沒錯，我認得泰內利夫。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'y^\"$^2w^1J^&Z^!<^!\"^%\\^)5^*A^$%^(O^#e^%f^!g^!t^\"{^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xid5XiIkXjJ3XjFKXiZaXiE8XiEiXiVcXik1XipBXiQlXihPXiNlXiVmXiFnXiF0XiJ7XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b4fed5c795e4",
      "text": "泰內利夫確實無比崇高，我希望他能早日安息。即便在 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%f^!g^!t^\"{^-6^#3^%}^,m^13^*+^*A^$%^+{^,]^!@^'b^,V^$a^+p^#w^!\"^\"1^!R^\"d ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVmXiFnXiF0XiJ7Xi02XiMzXiV9XixtXjEzXiorXipBXiQlXit7XixdXiFAXidiXixWXiRhXitwXiN3XiEiXiIxXiFSXiJkIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2a4444326287",
      "text": "死後，他的英靈依舊在努力保護我們。這是一份莫大的好意， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%L^#b^*A^!@^&Z^'y^)g^!Q^02^\"d^1$^!~^!T^(T^$%^*{^!\"^(s^,X^!%^*x^/F^\"z^&Z^+i^#z^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVMXiNiXipBXiFAXiZaXid5XilnXiFRXjAyXiJkXjEkXiF+XiFUXihUXiQlXip7XiEiXihzXixYXiElXip4Xi9GXiJ6XiZaXitpXiN6XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_dba3c3c2a303",
      "text": "我也相信你所說的話。然而，還有一個難題——那些頭目。他們 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^!1^&a^!U^*F^$)^-x^&Z^-v^!\"^&\"^'W^*A^.7^$s^!%^!V^)a^.G^*n^*n^)!^!8^)t^&^^!\"^!@^*{ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiExXiZhXiFVXipGXiQpXi14XiZaXi12XiEiXiYiXidXXipBXi43XiRzXiElXiFWXilhXi5HXipuXipuXikhXiE4Xil0XiZeXiEiXiFAXip7IA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_de889156cd0a",
      "text": "絕不會允許奴隸前去接受治療。說服他們讓 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-I^!)^$r^/\"^-s^##^)Z^!z^\"6^$?^\";^%_^&U^!\"^-x^,\\^!@^*{^-} ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi1JXiEpXiRyXi8iXi1zXiMjXilaXiF6XiI2XiQ/XiI7XiVfXiZVXiEiXi14XixcXiFAXip7Xi19IA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b7fe1af99332",
      "text": "奴隸不流一滴血地通過。屆時，我就會跟你走。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^##^)Z^!)^%j^!%^2u^(:^\"e^(t^(x^!\"^2e^$f^*A^$%^*J^$r^.+^*F^.&^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiMjXilaXiEpXiVqXiElXjJ1Xig6XiJlXih0Xih4XiEiXjJlXiRmXipBXiQlXipKXiRyXi4rXipGXi4mXiEi",
      "byte_length": 63
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7a4fb760ae60",
      "text": "我必須告訴你，我們給不了你太多回報。我們不像你們這樣 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^#l^)r^+B^-t^*F^*A^$%^*{^'A^!)^*D^*F^+f^\"x^\"\\^+`^!\"^$%^*{^!)^!`^*F^*{^(s^,f ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiNsXilyXitCXi10XipGXipBXiQlXip7XidBXiEpXipEXipGXitmXiJ4XiJcXitgXiEiXiQlXip7XiEpXiFgXipGXip7XihzXixmIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_90af596b299e",
      "text": "是善戰的勇士。然而，如果你能告訴我哪裡可以治癒奴隸， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,X^1(^$(^&Z^\"$^+a^!\"^&\"^'W^*A^#$^%!^*F^'b^+B^-t^$%^+I^-j^\"A^!B^%_^&V^##^)Z^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XixYXjEoXiQoXiZaXiIkXithXiEiXiYiXidXXipBXiMkXiUhXipGXidiXitCXi10XiQlXitJXi1qXiJBXiFCXiVfXiZWXiMjXilaXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ea3d8c2cdb03",
      "text": "我會竭盡所能協助你。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^$r^29^-1^$)^'b^2[^\"#^*F^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiRyXjI5Xi0xXiQpXidiXjJbXiIjXipGXiEi",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_10f942010215",
      "text": "我相信你的能耐。當你說服那些頭目後， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^&a^!U^*F^&Z^'b^-S^!\"^&N^*F^-x^,\\^)!^!8^)t^&^^#b^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiZhXiFVXipGXiZaXidiXi1TXiEiXiZOXipGXi14XixcXikhXiE4Xil0XiZeXiNiXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_434c83c90235",
      "text": "我就會跟隨你前往治療之地。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*J^$r^.+^)X^*F^!z^,)^%_^&U^!/^\"e^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXipKXiRyXi4rXilYXipGXiF6XiwpXiVfXiZVXiEvXiJlXiEi",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d59a09dd7206",
      "text": "那麼事不宜遲，請帶路吧。等我被治癒之後，其他人一定會 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^.T^*r^!)^/[^.5^*A^*S^#N^(a^*I^!\"^'-^$%^(@^%_^&V^!/^#b^*A^!j^!@^!<^!%^#.^$r ",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXi5UXipyXiEpXi9bXi41XipBXipTXiNOXihhXipJXiEiXictXiQlXihAXiVfXiZWXiEvXiNiXipBXiFqXiFAXiE8XiElXiMuXiRyIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e12a6bae9bf0",
      "text": "渴望緊緊跟隨，巴卡扎與他那套「轉化」的神話謊言也將被徹底 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,w^,]^0r^0r^.+^)X^*A^#K^\"0^,=^'p^!@^)!^#!^!#^(i^\")^!$^&Z^&w^-v^3*^1Y^!1^#7^(@^18^/^ ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xix3XixdXjByXjByXi4rXilYXipBXiNLXiIwXiw9XidwXiFAXikhXiMhXiEjXihpXiIpXiEkXiZaXiZ3Xi12XjMqXjFZXiExXiM3XihAXjE4Xi9eIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8d61d77a582e",
      "text": "擊碎拋棄。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$F^&o^,A^,a^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRGXiZvXixBXixhXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 16
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ab8d60c96ba5",
      "text": "若會引發流血衝突，我就不能去。你必須鼓起勇氣 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'x^$r^#Z^&W^%j^(:^-h^'*^*A^$%^*J^!)^'b^\"6^!\"^*F^#l^)r^*<^.(^\"$^%U ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xid4XiRyXiNaXiZXXiVqXig6Xi1oXicqXipBXiQlXipKXiEpXidiXiI2XiEiXipGXiNsXilyXio8Xi4oXiIkXiVVIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e6d270a1bd5d",
      "text": "促使那些頭目點頭答應。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^2T^!N^)!^!8^)t^&^^*;^)t^-B^0`^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjJUXiFOXikhXiE4Xil0XiZeXio7Xil0Xi1CXjBgXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3e76601596ec",
      "text": "勞工們！停下你們手中的苦工！轉化純屬騙局！唯有神廟才能 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^/R^+y^*{^*W^+!^!(^*F^*{^$+^!,^&Z^.t^+y^*W^(i^\")^3\"^#C^.{^._^*W^+O^$s^&w^0[^$,^'b ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi9SXit5Xip7XipXXishXiEoXipGXip7XiQrXiEsXiZaXi50Xit5XipXXihpXiIpXjMiXiNDXi57Xi5fXipXXitPXiRzXiZ3XjBbXiQsXidiIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5fdb1008f93a",
      "text": "拯救如今的我們！看看我吧！我又重獲了得見光明的雙眼。你們也能重新 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,F^,Q^#$^*E^&Z^$%^*{^*W^*Q^*Q^$%^*I^*W^$%^+;^))^&:^*D^#e^-m^!c^$c^&Z^)_^&d^!\"^*F^*{^!1^'b^))^$\\ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XixGXixRXiMkXipFXiZaXiQlXip7XipXXipRXipRXiQlXipJXipXXiQlXis7XikpXiY6XipEXiNlXi1tXiFjXiRjXiZaXilfXiZkXiEiXipGXip7XiExXidiXikpXiRcIA==",
      "byte_length": 97
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_43d006b2bee6",
      "text": "擁有說話的聲音！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,M^$s^-x^-v^&Z^-W^34^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XixNXiRzXi14Xi12XiZaXi1XXjM0XipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9d1ce0256a9c",
      "text": "  沒錯！轉化是一場騙局！聽他說！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^%\\^)5^*W^(i^\")^,X^!%^\"n^.{^._^*W^-X^!@^-x^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJVxeKTVeKldeKGleIileLFheISVeIm5eLnteLl9eKldeLVheIUBeLXheKlcg",
      "byte_length": 48
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_541af141e5d4",
      "text": "  巴卡扎欺騙了你們！起義反抗吧！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^#K^\"0^,=^2r^.{^*D^*F^*{^*W^.(^2<^\"9^$4^*I^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeI0teIjBeLD1eMnJeLnteKkReKkZeKnteKldeLiheMjxeIjleJDReKkleKlcg",
      "byte_length": 48
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5cbc3b97b54d",
      "text": "  盲眼者在說謊！他是被成功轉化的！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^&_^&d^'V^\"d^-x^3*^*W^!@^,X^(@^$$^\"!^(i^\")^&Z^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJl9eJmReJ1ZeImReLXheMypeKldeIUBeLFheKEBeJCReIiFeKGleIileJlpeKlcg",
      "byte_length": 51
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ef5153fbd56a",
      "text": "甩掉我們身上枷鎖的時刻到了！我們必須為自己的生路而戰！巴卡扎 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^2z^/e^$%^*{^(c^!'^2p^)8^&Z^$f^.Y^!u^*D^*W^$%^*{^#l^)r^%{^'l^#I^&Z^&F^(a^'W^$(^*W^#K^\"0^,= ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjJ6Xi9lXiQlXip7XihjXiEnXjJwXik4XiZaXiRmXi5ZXiF1XipEXipXXiQlXip7XiNsXilyXiV7XidsXiNJXiZaXiZGXihhXidXXiQoXipXXiNLXiIwXiw9IA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5921b91e974f",
      "text": "絕不可能打敗我們所有人！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-I^!)^\"A^'b^$-^$R^$%^*{^$)^$s^!<^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi1JXiEpXiJBXidiXiQtXiRSXiQlXip7XiQpXiRzXiE8XipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 37
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d0f6f5bc70d2",
      "text": "所有的瑪格拉巨怪齊聲發出震天怒吼，那滔天的仇恨道盡了巴卡扎的滔天殘暴。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$)^$s^&Z^-*^%*^$6^#H^#s^36^-W^&W^!q^32^+e^#o^2_^*A^)!^2t^+e^&Z^1g^2g^(y^-1^*D^#K^\"0^,=^&Z^2t^+e^,l^$m^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQpXiRzXiZaXi0qXiUqXiQ2XiNIXiNzXjM2Xi1XXiZXXiFxXjMyXitlXiNvXjJfXipBXikhXjJ0XitlXiZaXjFnXjJnXih5Xi0xXipEXiNLXiIwXiw9XiZaXjJ0XitlXixsXiRtXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 106
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_59fd5d85b190",
      "text": "我對你們拯救我們的恩德感激不盡。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^#:^*F^*{^,F^,Q^$%^*{^&Z^#v^#j^#{^1H^!)^-1^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiM6XipGXip7XixGXixRXiQlXip7XiZaXiN2XiNqXiN7XjFIXiEpXi0xXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 49
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3c901817a8c2",
      "text": "現在你們必須去殺了巴卡扎！動作要快！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&?^\"d^*F^*{^#l^)r^\"6^%M^*D^#K^\"0^,=^*W^\"%^!M^(C^*L^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiY/XiJkXipGXip7XiNsXilyXiI2XiVNXipEXiNLXiIwXiw9XipXXiIlXiFNXihDXipMXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8206d3fad6d0",
      "text": "因為協助了瑪格拉奴隸，隊伍獲得了 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"]^%{^2[^\"#^*D^-*^%*^$6^##^)Z^*A^)U^!F^&:^#e^*D ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJdXiV7XjJbXiIjXipEXi0qXiUqXiQ2XiMjXilaXipBXilVXiFGXiY6XiNlXipEIA==",
      "byte_length": 49
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1076d9e41bd0",
      "text": "5,000 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "5,000 ",
      "encoded_base64": "NSwwMDAg",
      "byte_length": 6
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_61e29d6d0f3a",
      "text": "3,500 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "3,500 ",
      "encoded_base64": "Myw1MDAg",
      "byte_length": 6
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d1fcf2d9ecff",
      "text": "點經驗值！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*;^'D^.P^!Z^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xio7XidEXi5QXiFaXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 16
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_59fc2981a393",
      "text": "蠢貨！你們居然敢唾棄我賜予你們提升自我的恩典！你們本該 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.u^.w^*W^*F^*{^+w^&\"^/m^+P^,a^$%^.#^!4^*F^*{^$A^\",^'l^$%^&Z^#v^2W^*W^*F^*{^$x^(M ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi51Xi53XipXXipGXip7Xit3XiYiXi9tXitQXixhXiQlXi4jXiE0XipGXip7XiRBXiIsXidsXiQlXiZaXiN2XjJXXipXXipGXip7XiR4XihNIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a1120b774a9a",
      "text": "成為供奉我巴布魔與弗洛魔的上等祭品！我征服亞薩斯的霸業 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$$^%{^!P^1+^$%^#K^.`^*0^'p^#[^%g^*0^&Z^!'^'-^&x^\"R^*W^$%^.c^,\\^!9^-e^$[^&Z^33^%5 ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQkXiV7XiFQXjErXiQlXiNLXi5gXiowXidwXiNbXiVnXiowXiZaXiEnXictXiZ4XiJSXipXXiQlXi5jXixcXiE5Xi1lXiRbXiZaXjMzXiU1IA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_35849c10ecd6",
      "text": "就將從這裡開始——拿你們祭旗！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*J^#7^#f^(s^-j^)F^+k^*n^*n^,G^*F^*{^&x^1B^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipKXiM3XiNmXihzXi1qXilGXitrXipuXipuXixHXipGXip7XiZ4XjFCXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fe1c0a2ad04b",
      "text": "好好享受你們的死期吧，異教徒們！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+i^+i^!;^\";^*F^*{^&Z^%L^$u^*I^*A^&M^,R^#d^*{^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitpXitpXiE7XiI7XipGXip7XiZaXiVMXiR1XipJXipBXiZNXixSXiNkXip7XipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 49
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5b74ef9530a9",
      "text": "我說的句句屬實！站起來保衛自己吧。巴卡扎欺騙了你們！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^-x^&Z^2]^2]^#C^#3^*W^->^.(^!O^!T^(=^'l^#I^*I^!\"^#K^\"0^,=^2r^.{^*D^*F^*{^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXi14XiZaXjJdXjJdXiNDXiMzXipXXi0+Xi4oXiFPXiFUXig9XidsXiNJXipJXiEiXiNLXiIwXiw9XjJyXi57XipEXipGXip7XipX",
      "byte_length": 78
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bfc5212ebf2a",
      "text": "謝謝你們！你們拯救了我們所有人。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-z^-z^*F^*{^*W^*F^*{^,F^,Q^*D^$%^*{^$)^$s^!<^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi16Xi16XipGXip7XipXXipGXip7XixGXixRXipEXiQlXip7XiQpXiRzXiE8XiEi",
      "byte_length": 48
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_287d3369a50f",
      "text": "你們必須徹底剷除巴卡扎，否則這一切都將化為泡影！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^#l^)r^18^/^^2Y^)Q^#K^\"0^,=^*A^\"H^!x^(s^!%^+.^)$^#7^\")^%{^2s^#a^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiNsXilyXjE4Xi9eXjJZXilRXiNLXiIwXiw9XipBXiJIXiF4XihzXiElXisuXikkXiM3XiIpXiV7XjJzXiNhXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cbdf2f356afd",
      "text": "我必須讓其餘的奴隸都得到治癒。帶我前往奴隸地窟中 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^#l^)r^-}^!j^1e^&Z^##^)Z^)$^#e^!u^%_^&V^!\"^#N^$%^!z^,)^##^)Z^\"e^2~^!, ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiNsXilyXi19XiFqXjFlXiZaXiMjXilaXikkXiNlXiF1XiVfXiZWXiEiXiNOXiQlXiF6XiwpXiMjXilaXiJlXjJ+XiEsIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a1f809d696ac",
      "text": "我必須讓所有的奴隸都得到治癒。等我完成後，我會來找你們。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^#l^)r^-}^$)^$s^&Z^##^)Z^)$^#e^!u^%_^&V^!\"^'-^$%^#,^$$^#b^*A^$%^$r^!O^$/^*F^*{^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiNsXilyXi19XiQpXiRzXiZaXiMjXilaXikkXiNlXiF1XiVfXiZWXiEiXictXiQlXiMsXiQkXiNiXipBXiQlXiRyXiFPXiQvXipGXip7XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0c98d4cc81c6",
      "text": "跟我來。我們去讓其他奴隸看看，轉化根本就是一場騙局！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.+^$%^!O^!\"^$%^*{^\"6^-}^!j^!@^##^)Z^*Q^*Q^*A^(i^\")^%)^$x^*J^,X^!%^\"n^.{^._^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi4rXiQlXiFPXiEiXiQlXip7XiI2Xi19XiFqXiFAXiMjXilaXipRXipRXipBXihpXiIpXiUpXiR4XipKXixYXiElXiJuXi57Xi5fXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0aabf32c9a75",
      "text": "你們先是將我們從威米亞斯的奴役中解救出來，隨後又擊潰了德拉吉大軍。我們 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^!b^,X^#7^$%^*{^#f^#&^'4^!9^$[^&Z^##^17^!,^(I^,Q^!q^!O^*A^)X^#b^+;^$F^2-^*D^#j^$6^\"D^\"z^..^!\"^$%^*{ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiFiXixYXiM3XiQlXip7XiNmXiMmXic0XiE5XiRbXiZaXiMjXjE3XiEsXihJXixRXiFxXiFPXipBXilYXiNiXis7XiRGXjItXipEXiNqXiQ2XiJEXiJ6Xi4uXiEiXiQlXip7IA==",
      "byte_length": 106
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5305c9a3f1a7",
      "text": "對你們感激不盡。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#:^*F^*{^#{^1H^!)^-1^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiM6XipGXip7XiN7XjFIXiEpXi0xXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_abfde2f77ead",
      "text": "我的神智終於恢復清醒了！你們必須想辦法消滅那個自稱 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^&Z^&w^$i^-H^$^^#u^#g^,u^.9^*D^*W^*F^*{^#l^)r^,1^2L^%b^%k^%t^)!^!V^'l^0& ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiZaXiZ3XiRpXi1IXiReXiN1XiNnXix1Xi45XipEXipXXipGXip7XiNsXilyXiwxXjJMXiViXiVrXiV0XikhXiFWXidsXjAmIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2a18a1914cff",
      "text": "威米亞斯的畜生！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#&^'4^!9^$[^&Z^5f^&F^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiMmXic0XiE5XiRbXiZaXjVmXiZGXipX",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b73f16479cb2",
      "text": "村民一臉茫然地看著你們，彷彿陷入了恍惚出神的狀態。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$z^%T^!%^-\\^9L^&\"^\"e^*Q^-a^*F^*{^*A^.a^.b^)S^!f^*D^7-^7.^!q^&w^&Z^&7^#|^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiR6XiVUXiElXi1cXjlMXiYiXiJlXipRXi1hXipGXip7XipBXi5hXi5iXilTXiFmXipEXjctXjcuXiFxXiZ3XiZaXiY3XiN8XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6b240a48eb23",
      "text": "歡迎來到蓋德隆。這裡就是你們看到我們所在的地方。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%F^(k^!O^!u^-d^#j^)T^!\"^(s^-j^*J^,X^*F^*{^*Q^!u^$%^*{^$)^\"d^&Z^\"e^$]^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVGXihrXiFPXiF1Xi1kXiNqXilUXiEiXihzXi1qXipKXixYXipGXip7XipRXiF1XiQlXip7XiQpXiJkXiZaXiJlXiRdXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a0ff448ac668",
      "text": "  跟我說說這個村莊的事。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^.+^$%^-x^-x^(s^!V^$z^6l^&Z^*r^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLiteJCVeLXheLXheKHNeIVZeJHpeNmxeJlpeKnJeISI=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7d6ca57751ba",
      "text": "  不好意思？你剛才說什麼？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^!)^+i^#z^#q^.V^*F^+0^$,^-x^!=^.T^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeISleK2leI3peI3FeLlZeKkZeKzBeJCxeLXheIT1eLlReLlY=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_69195e1f4037",
      "text": "  你們的守衛在哪裡？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^*{^&Z^#+^(=^\"d^+I^-j^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeKnteJlpeIyteKD1eImReK0leLWpeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_57c8ef10b578",
      "text": "  哈？你瘋了嗎？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^+F^.V^*F^-/^*D^+X^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeK0ZeLlZeKkZeLS9eKkReK1heLlYg",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0e4807c41020",
      "text": "  誰會做出這種愚不可及的事？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^-y^$r^*~^!q^(s^'$^/a^!)^\"A^\"7^&Z^*r^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLXleJHJeKn5eIXFeKHNeJyReL2FeISleIkFeIjdeJlpeKnJeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d923d557f2e1",
      "text": "  他為什麼要把你們的守軍賣掉？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^!@^%{^!=^.T^(C^$1^*F^*{^&Z^#+^..^.$^/e^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIUBeJXteIT1eLlReKENeJDFeKkZeKnteJlpeIyteLi5eLiReL2VeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_85b91289c932",
      "text": "當烈日遮蔽了思緒，這真是美好快樂的一天。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&N^%|^$a^(~^('^*D^#q^3#^*A^(s^-2^,X^-P^+i^*L^%8^&Z^!%^+e^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZOXiV8XiRhXih+XignXipEXiNxXjMjXipBXihzXi0yXixYXi1QXitpXipMXiU4XiZaXiElXitlXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ee34d32cf840",
      "text": "確實如此。這等宏大的思維足以令君王自慚形穢！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-6^#3^#$^%I^!\"^(s^'-^45^\"z^&Z^#q^'F^(^^!B^*w^+@^-)^'l^<S^#_^0q^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi02XiMzXiMkXiVJXiEiXihzXictXjQ1XiJ6XiZaXiNxXidGXiheXiFCXip3XitAXi0pXidsXjxTXiNfXjBxXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f091bfbe5b5b",
      "text": "唯有透過個人的犧牲，才能換來終極的自由。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+O^$s^(q^(x^!V^!<^&Z^2w^1J^*A^$,^'b^4@^!O^-H^1D^&Z^'l^&I^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitPXiRzXihxXih4XiFWXiE8XiZaXjJ3XjFKXipBXiQsXidiXjRAXiFPXi1IXjFEXiZaXidsXiZJXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0813eb081c6c",
      "text": "玩鵝卵石真好玩。孩子們一邊跳舞唱歌一邊玩耍。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^4U^<^^\"2^&k^-2^+i^4U^!\"^+m^#(^*{^!%^.8^0@^9s^<N^4J^!%^.8^4U^7E^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XjRVXjxeXiIyXiZrXi0yXitpXjRVXiEiXittXiMoXip7XiElXi44XjBAXjlzXjxOXjRKXiElXi44XjRVXjdFXiEi",
      "byte_length": 66
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3c22bca9580b",
      "text": "看啊！那些花朵！還有更多花等著採！好香的味道——這是一個嶄新的時代！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*Q^+Q^*W^)!^!8^'w^9C^*W^.7^$s^$o^\"x^'w^'-^-a^5R^*W^+i^*!^&Z^1n^(y^*n^*n^(s^,X^!%^!V^<R^$\\^&Z^$f^*v^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipRXitRXipXXikhXiE4Xid3XjlDXipXXi43XiRzXiRvXiJ4Xid3XictXi1hXjVSXipXXitpXiohXiZaXjFuXih5XipuXipuXihzXixYXiElXiFWXjxSXiRcXiZaXiRmXip2XipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 103
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c416ddcd3299",
      "text": "我說的是擋在路上的一切——那是遮蔽烈日的迷霧！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^-x^&Z^,X^$G^\"d^(a^!'^&Z^!%^+.^*n^*n^)!^,X^(~^('^%|^$a^&Z^(n^)f^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXi14XiZaXixYXiRHXiJkXihhXiEnXiZaXiElXisuXipuXipuXikhXixYXih+XignXiV8XiRhXiZaXihuXilmXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1a891995bb7b",
      "text": "完全可以理解。今天的空氣中瀰漫著濃濃的淤泥。聲音只是自身遙遠的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#,^!h^\"A^!B^&A^(I^!\"^*E^+e^&Z^'(^%U^!,^5b^2,^-a^%w^%w^&Z^6c^%d^!\"^-W^34^\"?^,X^'l^(c^4j^({^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiMsXiFoXiJBXiFCXiZBXihJXiEiXipFXitlXiZaXicoXiVVXiEsXjViXjIsXi1hXiV3XiV3XiZaXjZjXiVkXiEiXi1XXjM0XiI/XixYXidsXihjXjRqXih7XiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 94
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_27f5abfcce72",
      "text": "回響。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"\\^)o^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJcXilvXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 10
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ddb3773dfffe",
      "text": "這是一個令人浮想聯翩的名字。今天的淤泥越來越沉重了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^,X^!%^!V^*w^!<^4M^,1^-V^<.^&Z^\"F^#)^!\"^*E^+e^&Z^6c^%d^(]^!O^(]^%Z^))^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXixYXiElXiFWXip3XiE8XjRNXiwxXi1WXjwuXiZaXiJGXiMpXiEiXipFXitlXiZaXjZjXiVkXihdXiFPXihdXiVaXikpXipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 78
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_246a6f820957",
      "text": "海邊的一個地方。滿是塵埃和微小的石子，就像你腳邊那些一樣。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^6`^.8^&Z^!%^!V^\"e^$]^!\"^,{^,X^\"p^/&^\"O^#i^#;^&Z^&k^#(^*A^*J^!`^*F^00^.8^)!^!8^!%^,f^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XjZgXi44XiZaXiElXiFWXiJlXiRdXiEiXix7XixYXiJwXi8mXiJPXiNpXiM7XiZaXiZrXiMoXipBXipKXiFgXipGXjAwXi44XikhXiE4XiElXixmXiEi",
      "byte_length": 87
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_eef2f45a2466",
      "text": "在這裡，一個人的意志便是所有人的意志。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"d^(s^-j^*A^!%^!V^!<^&Z^#z^#m^!R^,X^$)^$s^!<^&Z^#z^#m^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJkXihzXi1qXipBXiElXiFWXiE8XiZaXiN6XiNtXiFSXixYXiQpXiRzXiE8XiZaXiN6XiNtXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8473fc3ac1d6",
      "text": "唯有淤泥與飛沙。其餘的一切全憑那一人的一時興起。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+O^$s^6c^%d^'p^)z^%]^!\"^!j^1e^&Z^!%^+.^!h^,5^)!^!%^!<^&Z^!%^$f^-]^.(^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitPXiRzXjZjXiVkXidwXil6XiVdXiEiXiFqXjFlXiZaXiElXisuXiFoXiw1XikhXiElXiE8XiZaXiElXiRmXi1dXi4oXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a126ac157440",
      "text": "我們把守衛送給了德拉吉。現在巫王正在庇佑著我們。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^$1^#+^(=^./^'A^*D^#j^$6^\"D^!\"^&?^\"d^14^-)^%H^\"d^,\"^4.^-a^$%^*{^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7XiQxXiMrXig9Xi4vXidBXipEXiNqXiQ2XiJEXiEiXiY/XiJkXjE0Xi0pXiVIXiJkXiwiXjQuXi1hXiQlXip7XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c516021edcd1",
      "text": "我聽說他長著一雙漆黑深邃的眼睛。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^-X^-x^!@^)C^-a^!%^)_^6d^*:^2*^6;^&Z^&d^&f^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXi1YXi14XiFAXilDXi1hXiElXilfXjZkXio6XjIqXjY7XiZaXiZkXiZmXiEi",
      "byte_length": 48
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8512c503935a",
      "text": "哎呀，當然是威米亞斯了。他同巫王一樣強大， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^3i^3h^*A^&N^&\"^,X^#&^'4^!9^$[^*D^!\"^!@^\"E^14^-)^!%^,f^#]^\"z^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjNpXjNoXipBXiZOXiYiXixYXiMmXic0XiE5XiRbXipEXiEiXiFAXiJFXjE0Xi0pXiElXixmXiNdXiJ6XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3864f14075dd",
      "text": "無所畏懼——連自己的影子都不怕。我們頌揚他的尊名， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%}^$)^7@^$#^*n^*n^.0^'l^#I^&Z^#a^#(^)$^!)^0^^!\"^$%^*{^7\"^2k^!@^&Z^+u^\"F^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiV9XiQpXjdAXiQjXipuXipuXi4wXidsXiNJXiZaXiNhXiMoXikkXiEpXjBeXiEiXiQlXip7XjciXjJrXiFAXiZaXit1XiJGXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2b1966ae624a",
      "text": "載歌載舞來向他致敬。你們真該加入我們，這樣一切就會明朗了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^64^4J^64^9s^!O^+?^!@^'o^*O^!\"^*F^*{^-2^(M^\"\"^!f^$%^*{^*A^(s^,f^!%^+.^*J^$r^$c^$t^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XjY0XjRKXjY0XjlzXiFPXis/XiFAXidvXipPXiEiXipGXip7Xi0yXihNXiIiXiFmXiQlXip7XipBXihzXixmXiElXisuXipKXiRyXiRjXiR0XipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 87
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5052ca8757c5",
      "text": "像烈日般光芒萬丈，像飢腸轆轆的泥奔者般迅捷，像 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!`^%|^$a^'r^!c^'u^-_^<L^*A^!`^1d^<[^<\\^<\\^&Z^%d^2b^'V^'r^(j^/.^*A^!` ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFgXiV8XiRhXidyXiFjXid1Xi1fXjxMXipBXiFgXjFkXjxbXjxcXjxcXiZaXiVkXjJiXidWXidyXihqXi8uXipBXiFgIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c6e27db7f1bf",
      "text": "狂暴獸般威猛強橫。除了他自己，世間無人能與之匹敵。威米亞斯， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&8^$m^&<^'r^#&^*P^#]^/2^!\"^)Q^*D^!@^'l^#I^*A^*p^)G^%}^!<^'b^'p^!/^8w^$U^!\"^#&^'4^!9^$[^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiY4XiRtXiY8XidyXiMmXipQXiNdXi8yXiEiXilRXipEXiFAXidsXiNJXipBXipwXilHXiV9XiE8XidiXidwXiEvXjh3XiRVXiEiXiMmXic0XiE5XiRbXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_02115360e09a",
      "text": "我們崇高的……領袖。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^13^*+^&Z^*o^*o^)s^7G^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7XjEzXiorXiZaXipvXipvXilzXjdHXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 31
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d4ab61741ad6",
      "text": "他是如此強大，根本就不需要任何守衛。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^,X^#$^%I^#]^\"z^*A^%)^$x^*J^!)^)e^(C^!C^!L^#+^(=^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXixYXiMkXiVJXiNdXiJ6XipBXiUpXiR4XipKXiEpXillXihDXiFDXiFMXiMrXig9XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1223b8e23325",
      "text": "我們擁有了威米亞斯，其餘一切皆如塵土。我們這裡有的是塵土。我們會 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^,M^$s^*D^#&^'4^!9^$[^*A^!j^1e^!%^+.^5j^#$^\"p^\"c^!\"^$%^*{^(s^-j^$s^&Z^,X^\"p^\"c^!\"^$%^*{^$r ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7XixNXiRzXipEXiMmXic0XiE5XiRbXipBXiFqXjFlXiElXisuXjVqXiMkXiJwXiJjXiEiXiQlXip7XihzXi1qXiRzXiZaXixYXiJwXiJjXiEiXiQlXip7XiRyIA==",
      "byte_length": 97
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_253f2b1d1f0a",
      "text": "一直活下去，直到他命令我們停止呼吸為止。這真是幸福的一天啊。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!%^&`^%i^!(^\"6^*A^&`^!u^!@^\"N^*w^$%^*{^+!^%G^\"M^\"J^%{^%G^!\"^(s^-2^,X^15^&z^&Z^!%^+e^+Q^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiElXiZgXiVpXiEoXiI2XipBXiZgXiF1XiFAXiJOXip3XiQlXip7XishXiVHXiJNXiJKXiV7XiVHXiEiXihzXi0yXixYXjE1XiZ6XiZaXiElXitlXitRXiEi",
      "byte_length": 90
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d65445995817",
      "text": "直到你們再次見到我們。屆時，我們依然會留在這裡。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&`^!u^*F^*{^!l^%D^-m^!u^$%^*{^!\"^2e^$f^*A^$%^*{^!Q^&\"^$r^-+^\"d^(s^-j^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZgXiF1XipGXip7XiFsXiVEXi1tXiF1XiQlXip7XiEiXjJlXiRmXipBXiQlXip7XiFRXiYiXiRyXi0rXiJkXihzXi1qXiEi",
      "byte_length": 72
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_aaca1352f51c",
      "text": "我們的英雄！萬歲！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^&Z^'y^)\\^*W^-_^,j^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7XiZaXid5XilcXipXXi1fXixqXipX",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5df24430c3dc",
      "text": "  你們從那場折磨中恢復過來了嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^*{^#f^)!^\"n^,?^-7^!,^#u^#g^(x^!O^*D^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeKnteI2ZeKSFeIm5eLD9eLTdeISxeI3VeI2deKHheIU9eKkReK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 47
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0300934495c9",
      "text": "  你們的守軍狀況如何？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^*{^&Z^#+^..^&7^,q^#$^!L^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeKnteJlpeIyteLi5eJjdeLHFeIyReIUxeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_57d63fe3b67b",
      "text": "  你們的守衛已經重返職責了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^*{^&Z^#+^(=^#J^'D^))^7J^'\\^0>^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeKnteJlpeIyteKD1eI0peJ0ReKSleN0peJ1xeMD5eKkReISI=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fe1986ca4dec",
      "text": "  蓋德隆願意加入同盟嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^-d^#j^)T^.H^#z^\"\"^!f^\"E^-0^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLWReI2peKVReLkheI3peIiJeIWZeIkVeLTBeK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bfe1d2b40af2",
      "text": "村裡的每一個人都認得你們。你們將我們從那個惡魔手中解救出來，我們 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$z^-j^&Z^%P^!%^!V^!<^)$^(O^#e^*F^*{^!\"^*F^*{^#7^$%^*{^#f^)!^!V^#y^*0^$+^!,^(I^,Q^!q^!O^*A^$%^*{ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiR6Xi1qXiZaXiVQXiElXiFWXiE8XikkXihPXiNlXipGXip7XiEiXipGXip7XiM3XiQlXip7XiNmXikhXiFWXiN5XiowXiQrXiEsXihJXixRXiFxXiFPXipBXiQlXip7IA==",
      "byte_length": 97
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fcdcc3665a14",
      "text": "將永遠銘記你們的恩情。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#7^%W^({^.;^(K^*F^*{^&Z^#v^,0^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiM3XiVXXih7Xi47XihLXipGXip7XiZaXiN2XiwwXiEi",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b51658db8cc6",
      "text": "我們挺過來了。由於先前無人外出打獵，糧食儲備很低，但我們會熬過去的。我們 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^,I^(x^!O^*D^!\"^&I^$^^!b^!z^%}^!<^\"w^!q^$-^&;^*A^5s^0J^+*^+\"^*K^!K^*A^!I^$%^*{^$r^<W^(x^\"6^&Z^!\"^$%^*{ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7XixJXih4XiFPXipEXiEiXiZJXiReXiFiXiF6XiV9XiE8XiJ3XiFxXiQtXiY7XipBXjVzXjBKXisqXisiXipLXiFLXipBXiFJXiQlXip7XiRyXjxXXih4XiI2XiZaXiEiXiQlXip7IA==",
      "byte_length": 109
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e75f7f3d7f91",
      "text": "從你們賜予的自由中汲取了無窮力量。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#f^*F^*{^.#^!4^&Z^'l^&I^!,^%Y^\":^*D^%}^-=^!~^)*^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNmXipGXip7Xi4jXiE0XiZaXidsXiZJXiEsXiVZXiI6XipEXiV9Xi09XiF+XikqXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2dc59a261ccd",
      "text": "莉娜拉用她的醫術幫助了大家",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'{^/*^$6^&H^+h^&Z^<J^(<^+}^\"#^*D^\"z^+s",
      "encoded_base64": "Xid7Xi8qXiQ2XiZIXitoXiZaXjxKXig8Xit9XiIjXipEXiJ6Xitz",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c06a1260af93",
      "text": "，而且茉莉的歸來也給予了巨大的援助——她們確實都是 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*A^'W^!*^'z^'{^&Z^%K^!O^!1^'A^!4^*D^#H^\"z^&Z^$C^\"#^*n^*n^+h^*{^-6^#3^)$^,X ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipBXidXXiEqXid6Xid7XiZaXiVLXiFPXiExXidBXiE0XipEXiNIXiJ6XiZaXiRDXiIjXipuXipuXitoXip7Xi02XiMzXikkXixYIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a1788b1c8811",
      "text": "了不起的偉大女性。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*D^!)^.(^&Z^*}^\"z^#\"^#r^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipEXiEpXi4oXiZaXip9XiJ6XiMiXiNyXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 28
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3c8020723a0c",
      "text": "我們的守衛很快就能徹底康復了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^&Z^#+^(=^*K^*L^*J^'b^18^/^^5N^#g^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7XiZaXiMrXig9XipLXipMXipKXidiXjE4Xi9eXjVOXiNnXipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c17f9faf9894",
      "text": "現在我們免於荒原小型凶獸的侵擾了。我們只能 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&?^\"d^$%^*{^!e^$^^1W^\"5^#;^\"j^3e^&<^&Z^.X^$K^*D^!\"^$%^*{^\"?^'b ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiY/XiJkXiQlXip7XiFlXiReXjFXXiI1XiM7XiJqXjNlXiY8XiZaXi5YXiRLXipEXiEiXiQlXip7XiI/XidiIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_77e1121a157e",
      "text": "祈禱別再有任何強大的敵人找上門來。我們最強大的守軍甚至不及 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&u^&|^*H^!l^$s^!C^!L^#]^\"z^&Z^$U^!<^$/^!'^)D^!O^!\"^$%^*{^$q^#]^\"z^&Z^#+^..^/|^'n^!)^\"7 ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZ1XiZ8XipIXiFsXiRzXiFDXiFMXiNdXiJ6XiZaXiRVXiE8XiQvXiEnXilEXiFPXiEiXiQlXip7XiRxXiNdXiJ6XiZaXiMrXi4uXi98XiduXiEpXiI3IA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_473c09a5267d",
      "text": "你們十分之一的力量。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^*Y^!s^!/^!%^&Z^!~^)*^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XipZXiFzXiEvXiElXiZaXiF+XikqXiEi",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a0b7bd2756f4",
      "text": "你是說把我們的守衛派去遠方作戰？你們確實幫了我們很多，但 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^,X^-x^$1^$%^*{^&Z^#+^(=^.n^\"6^({^$]^!M^$(^.V^*F^*{^-6^#3^+}^*D^$%^*{^*K^\"x^*A^!I ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXixYXi14XiQxXiQlXip7XiZaXiMrXig9Xi5uXiI2Xih7XiRdXiFNXiQoXi5WXipGXip7Xi02XiMzXit9XipEXiQlXip7XipLXiJ4XipBXiFJIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7ee1bbaf6e56",
      "text": "這要求實在太重大了。去跟村長談談吧。我們相信他的判斷。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^(C^,n^#3^\"d^+f^))^\"z^*D^!\"^\"6^.+^$z^)C^0;^0;^*I^!\"^$%^*{^&a^!U^!@^&Z^1k^,T^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXihDXixuXiMzXiJkXitmXikpXiJ6XipEXiEiXiI2Xi4rXiR6XilDXjA7XjA7XipJXiEiXiQlXip7XiZhXiFVXiFAXiZaXjFrXixUXiEi",
      "byte_length": 81
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8e8696796f37",
      "text": "再會。請常回來看我們。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!l^$r^!\"^*S^#O^\"\\^!O^*Q^$%^*{^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFsXiRyXiEiXipTXiNPXiJcXiFPXipRXiQlXip7XiEi",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3e7a5c1e7c1d",
      "text": "我們的戰士依然被囚禁著。去北方尋找他們吧。如果他們不能 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^&Z^$(^+a^!Q^&\"^(@^\"Z^&y^-a^!\"^\"6^+6^$]^#9^$/^!@^*{^*I^!\"^#$^%!^!@^*{^!)^'b ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7XiZaXiQoXithXiFRXiYiXihAXiJaXiZ5Xi1hXiEiXiI2Xis2XiRdXiM5XiQvXiFAXip7XipJXiEiXiMkXiUhXiFAXip7XiEpXidiIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_41feccc6f0b3",
      "text": "回來，隨便一隻泥奔者都能把這座村鎮給踏平。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"\\^!O^*A^)X^!R^!%^)[^%d^2b^'V^)$^'b^$1^(s^/_^$z^);^'A^.,^0Y^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJcXiFPXipBXilYXiFSXiElXilbXiVkXjJiXidWXikkXidiXiQxXihzXi9fXiR6Xik7XidBXi4sXjBZXiEi",
      "byte_length": 63
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e40f474a563c",
      "text": "一陣淒厲的慘叫聲迴盪在整個村莊，所有村民異口同聲地 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!%^)P^,t^+:^&Z^,4^+<^-W^0D^0\"^\"d^$T^!V^$z^6l^*A^$)^$s^$z^%T^&M^\"<^\"E^-W^\"e ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiElXilQXix0Xis6XiZaXiw0Xis8Xi1XXjBEXjAiXiJkXiRUXiFWXiR6XjZsXipBXiQpXiRzXiR6XiVUXiZNXiI8XiJFXi1XXiJlIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f8f0c56bd773",
      "text": "發出尖叫！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&W^!q^#=^+<^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZXXiFxXiM9Xis8XipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 16
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_539f75b51dca",
      "text": "尖叫聲戛然而止，他們全都在瞬間消失無蹤！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#=^+<^-W^<T^&\"^'W^%G^*A^!@^*{^!h^)$^\"d^1N^)G^%k^\"|^%}^(b^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiM9Xis8Xi1XXjxUXiYiXidXXiVHXipBXiFAXip7XiFoXikkXiJkXjFOXilHXiVrXiJ8XiV9XihiXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3a834fef0366",
      "text": "不用了，謝謝。你們得靠自己了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^&H^*D^*A^-z^-z^!\"^*F^*{^#e^.C^'l^#I^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXiZIXipEXipBXi16Xi16XiEiXipGXip7XiNlXi5DXidsXiNJXipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_afcff1807e99",
      "text": "歡迎！熱烈歡迎！真高興在嘉年華會期間看到這麼多人對我的商品 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%F^(k^*W^&$^%|^%F^(k^*W^-2^*+^-]^\"d^<P^+~^3'^$r^$u^)G^*Q^!u^(s^.T^\"x^!<^#:^$%^&Z^1'^\"R ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVGXihrXipXXiYkXiV8XiVGXihrXipXXi0yXiorXi1dXiJkXjxQXit+XjMnXiRyXiR1XilHXipRXiF1XihzXi5UXiJ4XiE8XiM6XiQlXiZaXjEnXiJSIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7e7cdd4914bc",
      "text": "感興趣！生意真是興隆無比！哎呀，我真失禮！容我自我介紹，我是 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#{^-]^.*^*W^&F^#z^-2^,X^-]^)T^%}^,m^*W^3i^3h^*A^$%^-2^\"|^-8^*W^+t^$%^'l^$%^!>^<s^*A^$%^,X ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiN7Xi1dXi4qXipXXiZGXiN6Xi0yXixYXi1dXilUXiV9XixtXipXXjNpXjNoXipBXiQlXi0yXiJ8Xi04XipXXit0XiQlXidsXiQlXiE+XjxzXipBXiQlXixYIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f4462f81b74c",
      "text": "蓋德隆的商人梅爾科。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-d^#j^)T^&Z^1'^!<^%-^&/^'!^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi1kXiNqXilUXiZaXjEnXiE8XiUtXiYvXichXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 31
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_892c3cb3829f",
      "text": "等等！我看到你們身上帶著一些陶器古物！快借我瞧瞧！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'-^'-^*W^$%^*Q^!u^*F^*{^(c^!'^#N^-a^!%^!8^)R^\"V^\"=^&4^*W^*L^!Y^$%^-4^-4^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XictXictXipXXiQlXipRXiF1XipGXip7XihjXiEnXiNOXi1hXiElXiE4XilSXiJWXiI9XiY0XipXXipMXiFZXiQlXi00Xi00XipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8a04cd55b669",
      "text": "  陶器？你在胡說什麼？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^)R^\"V^.V^*F^\"d^3}^-x^!=^.T^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKVJeIlZeLlZeKkZeImReM31eLXheIT1eLlReLlY=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_060ba02c9078",
      "text": "  我手上有幾個破瓦罐……",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^$+^!'^$s^#T^!V^&n^&C^'O^*o^*o",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeJCteISdeJHNeI1ReIVZeJm5eJkNeJ09eKm9eKm8=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_aa8d3f4ddf62",
      "text": "  好啊！我把這些破爛——呃，花瓶賣給你。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^+i^+Q^*W^$%^$1^(s^!8^&n^&-^*n^*n^3<^*A^'w^&D^.$^'A^*F^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeK2leK1FeKldeJCVeJDFeKHNeITheJm5eJi1eKm5eKm5eMzxeKkFeJ3deJkReLiReJ0FeKkZeISI=",
      "byte_length": 59
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cfc421b746e2",
      "text": "  休想！這些花瓶可是價值連城的！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^!G^,1^*W^(s^!8^'w^&D^\"A^,X^+&^!Z^.0^+_^&Z^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIUdeLDFeKldeKHNeITheJ3deJkReIkFeLFheKyZeIVpeLjBeK19eJlpeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 47
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_50a0c7a2e744",
      "text": "  你說的嘉年華會到底是什麼？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^-x^&Z^<P^+~^3'^$r^!u^/^^,X^!=^.T^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeLXheJlpePFBeK35eMydeJHJeIXVeL15eLFheIT1eLlReLlY=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9f0e53860f35",
      "text": "  我根本沒看見什麼嘉年華會。你還好嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^%)^$x^%\\^*Q^-m^!=^.T^<P^+~^3'^$r^!\"^*F^.7^+i^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeJSleJHheJVxeKlFeLW1eIT1eLlRePFBeK35eMydeJHJeISJeKkZeLjdeK2leK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 56
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_340f0671470e",
      "text": "  這裡什麼都沒有！你到底有什麼毛病？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^(s^-j^!=^.T^)$^%\\^$s^*W^*F^!u^/^^$s^!=^.T^%R^&R^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKHNeLWpeIT1eLlReKSReJVxeJHNeKldeKkZeIXVeL15eJHNeIT1eLlReJVJeJlJeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 53
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e7cb1b0ede69",
      "text": "  烏爾提克斯是誰？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^/4^&/^$A^!d^$[^,X^-y^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLzReJi9eJEFeIWReJFteLFheLXleLlY=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_349d8a230112",
      "text": "  那張椅子上根本沒有人！你看清楚！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^)!^,(^<l^#(^!'^%)^$x^%\\^$s^!<^*W^*F^*Q^,u^,c^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKSFeLChePGxeIyheISdeJSleJHheJVxeJHNeITxeKldeKkZeKlFeLHVeLGNeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 50
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_842c5217dd8b",
      "text": "  我不知道我是否該……",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^!)^&h^(y^$%^,X^\"H^(M^*o^*o",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeISleJmheKHleJCVeLFheIkheKE1eKm9eKm8=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a52a12f7d62c",
      "text": "  你都賣些什麼樣的貨物？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^)$^.$^!8^!=^.T^,f^&Z^.w^&4^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeKSReLiReITheIT1eLlReLGZeJlpeLndeJjReLlY=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c75e8a381877",
      "text": "  我想買點東西。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^,1^.!^*;^,`^-l^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeLDFeLiFeKjteLGBeLWxeISI=",
      "byte_length": 23
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f8f36c577ef0",
      "text": "  你賣的東西全是一文不值的垃圾！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^.$^&Z^,`^-l^!h^,X^!%^$W^!)^!Z^&Z^\"i^\"f^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeLiReJlpeLGBeLWxeIWheLFheISVeJFdeISleIVpeJlpeImleImZeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 47
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c03660d75641",
      "text": "這實在太詭異了。我這就離開。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^#3^\"d^+f^;H^&M^*D^!\"^$%^(s^*J^)`^)F^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXiMzXiJkXitmXjtIXiZNXipEXiEiXiQlXihzXipKXilgXilGXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 43
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_dccb9d177db7",
      "text": "我該走了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^(M^.&^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXihNXi4mXipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 15
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ee280dcf8e53",
      "text": "你怎麼會不知道自己身上帶著什麼珍寶？！那看起來就像是科布諾爾 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^,,^.T^$r^!)^&h^(y^'l^#I^(c^!'^#N^-a^!=^.T^/7^#4^.V^*W^)!^*Q^.(^!O^*J^!`^,X^'!^.`^7k^&/ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiwsXi5UXiRyXiEpXiZoXih5XidsXiNJXihjXiEnXiNOXi1hXiE9Xi5UXi83XiM0Xi5WXipXXikhXipRXi4oXiFPXipKXiFgXixYXichXi5gXjdrXiYvIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3d8291165987",
      "text": "遺落的珍稀花瓶啊！快借我看看！求求你了！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^0v^-`^&Z^/7^3w^'w^&D^+Q^*W^*L^!Y^$%^*Q^*Q^*W^,n^,n^*F^*D^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjB2Xi1gXiZaXi83XjN3Xid3XiZEXitRXipXXipMXiFZXiQlXipRXipRXipXXixuXixuXipGXipEXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a2c09764af9a",
      "text": "破瓦罐？！你肯定是看走眼了！那肯定是科布諾爾遺落的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&n^&C^'O^.V^*W^*F^-Z^#.^,X^*Q^.&^&d^*D^*W^)!^-Z^#.^,X^'!^.`^7k^&/^0v^-`^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZuXiZDXidPXi5WXipXXipGXi1aXiMuXixYXipRXi4mXiZkXipEXipXXikhXi1aXiMuXixYXichXi5gXjdrXiYvXjB2Xi1gXiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f9995afd107e",
      "text": "絕世花瓶！你手上有多少個，我每個都出價 50 枚陶幣收購！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-I^*p^'w^&D^*W^*F^$+^!'^$s^\"x^#<^!V^*A^$%^%P^!V^)$^!q^+& 50 ^$~^)R^+|^$M^63^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi1JXipwXid3XiZEXipXXipGXiQrXiEnXiRzXiJ4XiM8XiFWXipBXiQlXiVQXiFWXikkXiFxXismIDUwIF4kfl4pUl4rfF4kTV42M14qVyA=",
      "byte_length": 80
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d6b6f8bedaed",
      "text": "好吧，但要是你們改變主意，我很樂意出高價收購，只要賣方是 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+i^*I^*A^!I^(C^,X^*F^*{^$N^(U^!-^#z^*A^$%^*K^%8^#z^!q^*+^+&^$M^63^*A^\"?^(C^.$^$]^,X ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitpXipJXipBXiFJXihDXixYXipGXip7XiROXihVXiEtXiN6XipBXiQlXipLXiU4XiN6XiFxXiorXismXiRNXjYzXipBXiI/XihDXi4kXiRdXixYIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8e473cda0038",
      "text": "嗯，讓我瞧瞧你們手上有什麼…… ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^6N^*A^-}^$%^-4^-4^*F^*{^$+^!'^$s^!=^.T^*o^*o ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjZOXipBXi19XiQlXi00Xi00XipGXip7XiQrXiEnXiRzXiE9Xi5UXipvXipvIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2d933463e353",
      "text": "我看你們身上帶著 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*Q^*F^*{^(c^!'^#N^-a ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXipRXipGXip7XihjXiEnXiNOXi1hIA==",
      "byte_length": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_97dcf49485a9",
      "text": " 個花瓶 ",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^!V^'w^&D ",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4hVl4nd14mRCA=",
      "byte_length": 11
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8d3543c7d109",
      "text": " 個花瓶 ",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^!V^'w^&D ",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4hVl4nd14mRCA=",
      "byte_length": 11
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8f1eb601c0d2",
      "text": "——真是令人嘆為觀止！我每個付給你們 50 枚陶幣，總共算下來是 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*n^*n^-2^,X^*w^!<^59^%{^*R^%G^*W^$%^%P^!V^*u^'A^*F^*{ 50 ^$~^)R^+|^*A^-M^3d^-C^!(^!O^,X ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipuXipuXi0yXixYXip3XiE8XjU5XiV7XipSXiVHXipXXiQlXiVQXiFWXip1XidBXipGXip7IDUwIF4kfl4pUl4rfF4qQV4tTV4zZF4tQ14hKF4hT14sWCA=",
      "byte_length": 89
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8674c2f101ed",
      "text": "枚陶幣。成交嗎？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$~^)R^+|^!\"^$$^0P^+X^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiR+XilSXit8XiEiXiQkXjBQXitYXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_36b6fe34bbdb",
      "text": "向你們致敬， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+?^*F^*{^'o^*O^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xis/XipGXip7XidvXipPXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 19
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6b7b3a90c954",
      "text": "。希望你們會覺得我的商品值得購買。正如我所說的，我是蓋德隆的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!\"^+{^,]^*F^*{^$r^(G^#e^$%^&Z^1'^\"R^!Z^#e^63^.!^!\"^%H^#$^$%^$)^-x^&Z^*A^$%^,X^-d^#j^)T^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEiXit7XixdXipGXip7XiRyXihHXiNlXiQlXiZaXjEnXiJSXiFaXiNlXjYzXi4hXiEiXiVIXiMkXiQlXiQpXi14XiZaXipBXiQlXixYXi1kXiNqXilUXiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0c5907908316",
      "text": "商人梅爾科。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^1'^!<^%-^&/^'!^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjEnXiE8XiUtXiYvXichXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 19
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1b0bbb73c538",
      "text": "看看你的周圍！周圍的人們全都歡欣雀躍、喜笑顏開！小心！那個 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*Q^*Q^*F^&Z^\"L^\"`^*W^\"L^\"`^&Z^!<^*{^!h^)$^%F^2'^<u^:b^!!^+V^-@^;K^)F^*W^#;^#k^*W^)!^!V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipRXipRXipGXiZaXiJMXiJgXipXXiJMXiJgXiZaXiE8Xip7XiFoXikkXiVGXjInXjx1XjpiXiEhXitWXi1AXjtLXilGXipXXiM7XiNrXipXXikhXiFWIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d5e371d27734",
      "text": "吞火魔術師剛才差點噴到你了！在這樣盛大的嘉年華會上， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^:-^%x^*0^(<^#M^+0^$,^48^*;^\"W^!u^*F^*D^*W^\"d^(s^,f^1L^\"z^&Z^<P^+~^3'^$r^!'^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjotXiV4XiowXig8XiNNXiswXiQsXjQ4Xio7XiJXXiF1XipGXipEXipXXiJkXihzXixmXjFMXiJ6XiZaXjxQXit+XjMnXiRyXiEnXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b781116dda3c",
      "text": "你可得睜大眼睛留神啊！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^\"A^#e^.q^\"z^&d^&f^-+^&w^+Q^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiJBXiNlXi5xXiJ6XiZkXiZmXi0rXiZ3XitRXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d63abb7226c0",
      "text": "沒看到？你怎麼可能會錯過？周圍到處都有人在載歌載舞！如果你 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%\\^*Q^!u^.V^*F^,,^.T^\"A^'b^$r^)5^(x^.V^\"L^\"`^!u^(,^)$^$s^!<^\"d^64^4J^64^9s^*W^#$^%!^*F ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVcXipRXiF1Xi5WXipGXiwsXi5UXiJBXidiXiRyXik1Xih4Xi5WXiJMXiJgXiF1XigsXikkXiRzXiE8XiJkXjY0XjRKXjY0XjlzXipXXiMkXiUhXipGIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_10827c1a9a35",
      "text": "連這都看不見，那你眼睛肯定是直勾勾朝天上看了！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.0^(s^)$^*Q^!)^-m^*A^)!^*F^&d^&f^-Z^#.^,X^&`^7t^7t^,^^+e^!'^*Q^*D^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi4wXihzXikkXipRXiEpXi1tXipBXikhXipGXiZkXiZmXi1aXiMuXixYXiZgXjd0Xjd0XixeXitlXiEnXipRXipEXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e81c83c121b7",
      "text": "有毛病？我覺得好得很！哎呀，我剛才還在跟我身邊的朋友烏爾提克斯說， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$s^%R^&R^.V^$%^(G^#e^+i^#e^*K^*W^3i^3h^*A^$%^+0^$,^.7^\"d^.+^$%^(c^.8^&Z^,[^\"8^/4^&/^$A^!d^$[^-x^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRzXiVSXiZSXi5WXiQlXihHXiNlXitpXiNlXipLXipXXjNpXjNoXipBXiQlXiswXiQsXi43XiJkXi4rXiQlXihjXi44XiZaXixbXiI4Xi80XiYvXiRBXiFkXiRbXi14XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 100
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e2d4644993cc",
      "text": "自從威米亞斯來到這座城鎮後，我感覺前所未有的舒暢！沒錯，他把這裡變成 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'l^#f^#&^'4^!9^$[^!O^!u^(s^/_^+_^);^#b^*A^$%^#{^(G^!z^$)^,_^$s^&Z^</^7x^*W^%\\^)5^*A^!@^$1^(s^-j^(U^$$ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XidsXiNmXiMmXic0XiE5XiRbXiFPXiF1XihzXi9fXitfXik7XiNiXipBXiQlXiN7XihHXiF6XiQpXixfXiRzXiZaXjwvXjd4XipXXiVcXik1XipBXiFAXiQxXihzXi1qXihVXiQkIA==",
      "byte_length": 103
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fe0e60ab684f",
      "text": "了一片奇蹟之境！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*D^!%^&1^\"}^0B^!/^\"q^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipEXiElXiYxXiJ9XjBCXiEvXiJxXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_82ff8f6b0009",
      "text": "他是這個村莊的領袖——他最近才剛接管此地。他是村長…… ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^,X^(s^!V^$z^6l^&Z^)s^7G^*n^*n^!@^$q^(l^$,^+0^$?^-D^%I^\"e^!\"^!@^,X^$z^)C^*o^*o ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXixYXihzXiFWXiR6XjZsXiZaXilzXjdHXipuXipuXiFAXiRxXihsXiQsXiswXiQ/Xi1EXiVJXiJlXiEiXiFAXixYXiR6XilDXipvXipvIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b376066efbbb",
      "text": "或者說至少是村長的一部分。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$'^'V^-x^'n^#<^,X^$z^)C^&Z^!%^)#^!s^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQnXidWXi14XiduXiM8XixYXiR6XilDXiZaXiElXikjXiFzXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 40
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_04c05d9a5d5c",
      "text": "他是我的摯友！你以為是誰在放聲高歌？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^,X^$%^&Z^2#^\"8^*W^*F^!B^%{^,X^-y^\"d^$P^-W^*+^4J^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXixYXiQlXiZaXjIjXiI4XipXXipGXiFCXiV7XixYXi15XiJkXiRQXi1XXiorXjRKXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4881b3258762",
      "text": "梅爾科轉向身旁一把空蕩蕩的椅子，用力搖了搖它。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%-^&/^'!^(i^+?^(c^.h^!%^$1^'(^1X^1X^&Z^<l^#(^*A^&H^!~^3J^*D^3J^+o^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiUtXiYvXichXihpXis/XihjXi5oXiElXiQxXicoXjFYXjFYXiZaXjxsXiMoXipBXiZIXiF+XjNKXipEXjNKXitvXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_dd45b52efe0b",
      "text": "安靜點，烏爾提克斯！你唱成那樣會把我的客人全嚇跑的！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+p^)h^*;^*A^/4^&/^$A^!d^$[^*W^*F^<N^$$^)!^,f^$r^$1^$%^&Z^+q^!<^!h^\"X^(_^&Z^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitwXiloXio7XipBXi80XiYvXiRBXiFkXiRbXipXXipGXjxOXiQkXikhXixmXiRyXiQxXiQlXiZaXitxXiE8XiFoXiJYXihfXiZaXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e7b06f8e6d4c",
      "text": "我必須為他的失態向你們道歉。他剛才『慶祝』得有點過頭了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^#l^)r^%{^!@^&Z^\"|^#|^+?^*F^*{^(y^,h^!\"^!@^+0^$,^<_^5P^&v^<`^#e^$s^*;^(x^)t^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiNsXilyXiV7XiFAXiZaXiJ8XiN8Xis/XipGXip7Xih5XixoXiEiXiFAXiswXiQsXjxfXjVQXiZ2XjxgXiNlXiRzXio7Xih4Xil0XipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 84
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1481b345d544",
      "text": "梅爾科瞥了一眼空椅子，雙眼驟然睜大。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%-^&/^'!^:`^*D^!%^&d^'(^<l^#(^*A^)_^&d^7M^&\"^.q^\"z^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiUtXiYvXichXjpgXipEXiElXiZkXicoXjxsXiMoXipBXilfXiZkXjdNXiYiXi5xXiJ6XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b9980760bbae",
      "text": "真的耶！他又偷偷溜走了！我跟你說，等到了明天早上，他肯定會為今天這麼 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-2^&Z^0.^*W^!@^+;^/O^/O^%r^.&^*D^*W^$%^.+^*F^-x^*A^'-^!u^*D^$c^+e^,V^!'^*A^!@^-Z^#.^$r^%{^*E^+e^(s^.T ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi0yXiZaXjAuXipXXiFAXis7Xi9PXi9PXiVyXi4mXipEXipXXiQlXi4rXipGXi14XipBXictXiF1XipEXiRjXitlXixWXiEnXipBXiFAXi1aXiMuXiRyXiV7XipFXitlXihzXi5UIA==",
      "byte_length": 103
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_676a14437ffe",
      "text": "瘋狂慶祝而後悔莫及的！這點毫無疑問！啊，無所謂了。你們還有興趣 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-/^&8^5P^&v^'W^#b^6Y^/F^\"7^&Z^*W^(s^*;^/t^%}^0p^*Z^*W^+Q^*A^%}^$)^0s^*D^!\"^*F^*{^.7^$s^-]^.* ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi0vXiY4XjVQXiZ2XidXXiNiXjZZXi9GXiI3XiZaXipXXihzXio7Xi90XiV9XjBwXipaXipXXitRXipBXiV9XiQpXjBzXipEXiEiXipGXip7Xi43XiRzXi1dXi4qIA==",
      "byte_length": 94
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_05fbd9b53737",
      "text": "看看我的商品嗎？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*Q^*Q^$%^&Z^1'^\"R^+X^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipRXipRXiQlXiZaXjEnXiJSXitYXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c4a7c65a3bc4",
      "text": "來吧，來吧！在親眼看見之前，你可不能妄下定論！我這就拿出來給 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!O^*I^*A^!O^*I^*W^\"d^(F^&d^*Q^-m^!/^!z^*A^*F^\"A^!)^'b^+j^!(^#.^1\\^*W^$%^(s^*J^,G^!q^!O^'A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFPXipJXipBXiFPXipJXipXXiJkXihGXiZkXipRXi1tXiEvXiF6XipBXipGXiJBXiEpXidiXitqXiEoXiMuXjFcXipXXiQlXihzXipKXixHXiFxXiFPXidBIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_156ac01498e3",
      "text": "你看，你一定會覺得不虛此行的！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*Q^*A^*F^!%^#.^$r^(G^#e^!)^-g^%I^(;^&Z^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXipRXipBXipGXiElXiMuXiRyXihHXiNlXiEpXi1nXiVJXig7XiZaXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_03fe9f7d624f",
      "text": "就像所有商人常誇耀的那樣，我賣的可是全阿塔斯最頂級的貨物！不過在我這裡， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*J^!`^$)^$s^1'^!<^#O^6w^7D^&Z^)!^,f^*A^$%^.$^&Z^\"A^,X^!h^)M^\"o^$[^$q^)p^'<^&Z^.w^&4^*W^!)^(x^\"d^$%^(s^-j^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipKXiFgXiQpXiRzXjEnXiE8XiNPXjZ3XjdEXiZaXikhXixmXipBXiQlXi4kXiZaXiJBXixYXiFoXilNXiJvXiRbXiRxXilwXic8XiZaXi53XiY0XipXXiEpXih4XiJkXiQlXihzXi1qXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 109
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2d152a505b3b",
      "text": "我向你保證這絕對是千真萬確的大實話！親自來瞧瞧吧！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^+?^*F^!T^-{^(s^-I^#:^,X^+7^-2^-_^-6^&Z^\"z^#3^-v^*W^(F^'l^!O^-4^-4^*I^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXis/XipGXiFUXi17XihzXi1JXiM6XixYXis3Xi0yXi1fXi02XiZaXiJ6XiMzXi12XipXXihGXidsXiFPXi00Xi00XipJXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_012bb06de635",
      "text": "你開什麼玩笑！我這裡擁有整個地區最頂級的貨色！在任何地方你都找不到 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^)F^!=^.T^4U^-@^*W^$%^(s^-j^,M^$s^$T^!V^\"e^\"+^$q^)p^'<^&Z^.w^'s^*W^\"d^!C^!L^\"e^$]^*F^)$^$/^!)^!u ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXilGXiE9Xi5UXjRVXi1AXipXXiQlXihzXi1qXixNXiRzXiRUXiFWXiJlXiIrXiRxXilwXic8XiZaXi53XidzXipXXiJkXiFDXiFMXiJlXiRdXipGXikkXiQvXiEpXiF1IA==",
      "byte_length": 100
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ded1675c824f",
      "text": "比這更棒的碎陶器了！我敢打包票！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,m^(s^$o^%1^&Z^&o^)R^\"V^*D^*W^$%^/m^$-^\"'^<A^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XixtXihzXiRvXiUxXiZaXiZvXilSXiJWXipEXipXXiQlXi9tXiQtXiInXjxBXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 49
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_be0899991e30",
      "text": "看見了吧？你在任何地方都找不到比這更好的商品了！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*Q^-m^*D^*I^.V^*F^\"d^!C^!L^\"e^$]^)$^$/^!)^!u^,m^(s^$o^+i^&Z^1'^\"R^*D^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipRXi1tXipEXipJXi5WXipGXiJkXiFDXiFMXiJlXiRdXikkXiQvXiEpXiF1XixtXihzXiRvXitpXiZaXjEnXiJSXipEXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5fd3cf5ab853",
      "text": "願勝利成為你們的盟友。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.H^+5^!t^$$^%{^*F^*{^&Z^-0^\"8^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi5IXis1XiF0XiQkXiV7XipGXip7XiZaXi0wXiI4XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3b1851feb661",
      "text": "你們替我們除掉了威米亞斯那個惡魔，我真是感激不盡！不過，我們不是 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^2o^$%^*{^)Q^/e^*D^#&^'4^!9^$[^)!^!V^#y^*0^*A^$%^-2^,X^#{^1H^!)^-1^*W^!)^(x^*A^$%^*{^!)^,X ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XjJvXiQlXip7XilRXi9lXipEXiMmXic0XiE5XiRbXikhXiFWXiN5XiowXipBXiQlXi0yXixYXiN7XjFIXiEpXi0xXipXXiEpXih4XipBXiQlXip7XiEpXixYIA==",
      "byte_length": 97
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7746288e274d",
      "text": "來這裡閒聊這件事的——你們是想買點東西，對吧？如果你們還不知道的話， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!O^(s^-j^6A^-U^(s^.W^*r^&Z^*n^*n^*F^*{^,X^,1^.!^*;^,`^-l^*A^#:^*I^.V^#$^%!^*F^*{^.7^!)^&h^(y^&Z^-v^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFPXihzXi1qXjZBXi1VXihzXi5XXipyXiZaXipuXipuXipGXip7XixYXiwxXi4hXio7XixgXi1sXipBXiM6XipJXi5WXiMkXiUhXipGXip7Xi43XiEpXiZoXih5XiZaXi12XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 103
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b969af9e9108",
      "text": "我就是蓋德隆的商人梅爾科！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*J^,X^-d^#j^)T^&Z^1'^!<^%-^&/^'!^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXipKXixYXi1kXiNqXilUXiZaXjEnXiE8XiUtXiYvXichXipX",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_766c6952458e",
      "text": "  你現在感覺如何？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^&?^\"d^#{^(G^#$^!L^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeJj9eImReI3teKEdeIyReIUxeLlYg",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_539796744760",
      "text": "  這麼說你不再賣那些破爛了？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^(s^.T^-x^*F^!)^!l^.$^)!^!8^&n^&-^*D^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKHNeLlReLXheKkZeISleIWxeLiReKSFeITheJm5eJi1eKkReLlY=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6bbb94cb3fd8",
      "text": "  你還想收購我的碎花瓶嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^.7^,1^$M^63^$%^&Z^&o^'w^&D^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeLjdeLDFeJE1eNjNeJCVeJlpeJm9eJ3deJkReK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a636c6e1f4ea",
      "text": "  你現在賣些什麼？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^&?^\"d^.$^!8^!=^.T^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeJj9eImReLiReITheIT1eLlReLlYg",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8e606dfe5af0",
      "text": "  我想買點東西。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^,1^.!^*;^,`^-l^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeLDFeLiFeKjteLGBeLWxeISIg",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2090fc9a6a8e",
      "text": "我得走了。再會。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^#e^.&^*D^!\"^!l^$r^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiNlXi4mXipEXiEiXiFsXiRyXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c289f416a1be",
      "text": "什麼？！我的破瓦罐早就多到堆積如山了！我根本不知道那些東西是打哪來的， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!=^.T^.V^*W^$%^&Z^&n^&C^'O^,V^*J^\"x^!u^*[^27^#$^11^*D^*W^$%^%)^$x^!)^&h^(y^)!^!8^,`^-l^,X^$-^+I^!O^&Z^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiE9Xi5UXi5WXipXXiQlXiZaXiZuXiZDXidPXixWXipKXiJ4XiF1XipbXjI3XiMkXjExXipEXipXXiQlXiUpXiR4XiEpXiZoXih5XikhXiE4XixgXi1sXixYXiQtXitJXiFPXiZaXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 106
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_885b23af1729",
      "text": "現在堆得到處都是！我再也不想聽到任何關於破罐子的事了！把它們 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&?^\"d^*[^#e^!u^(,^)$^,X^*W^$%^!l^!1^!)^,1^-X^!u^!C^!L^.>^$^^&n^'O^#(^&Z^*r^*D^*W^$1^+o^*{ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiY/XiJkXipbXiNlXiF1XigsXikkXixYXipXXiQlXiFsXiExXiEpXiwxXi1YXiF1XiFDXiFMXi4+XiReXiZuXidPXiMoXiZaXipyXipEXipXXiQxXitvXip7IA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_dfc8412979c4",
      "text": "給我拿得遠遠的！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'A^$%^,G^#e^({^({^&Z^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XidBXiQlXixHXiNlXih7Xih7XiZaXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bc7cf510aeca",
      "text": "老實說，在威米亞斯控制期間發生的事，我大部分都記不得了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'U^#3^-x^*A^\"d^#&^'4^!9^$[^$@^!v^$u^)G^&W^&F^&Z^*r^*A^$%^\"z^)#^!s^)$^(K^!)^#e^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XidVXiMzXi14XipBXiJkXiMmXic0XiE5XiRbXiRAXiF2XiR1XilHXiZXXiZGXiZaXipyXipBXiQlXiJ6XikjXiFzXikkXihLXiEpXiNlXipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e466e186adb8",
      "text": "我隱約記得好像有某種慶典，但也就僅此而已。當他的法術解除時， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^)Y^-F^(K^#e^+i^!`^$s^%$^'$^5P^2W^*A^!I^!1^*J^!_^%I^'W^#J^!\"^&N^!@^&Z^%b^(<^(I^)Q^$f^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXilZXi1GXihLXiNlXitpXiFgXiRzXiUkXickXjVQXjJXXipBXiFJXiExXipKXiFfXiVJXidXXiNKXiEiXiZOXiFAXiZaXiViXig8XihJXilRXiRmXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d1993b28238f",
      "text": "我整個人都傻了——我擺攤賣的竟然全是破陶罐和鳥羽毛！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^$T^!V^!<^)$^7$^*D^*n^*n^$%^1@^<U^.$^&Z^28^&\"^!h^,X^&n^)R^'O^\"O^4p^'S^%R^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiRUXiFWXiE8XikkXjckXipEXipuXipuXiQlXjFAXjxVXi4kXiZaXjI4XiYiXiFoXixYXiZuXilSXidPXiJPXjRwXidTXiVSXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_55d6b58cee06",
      "text": "當然不賣了。我一恢復理智就把那些破爛全扔了。我賣的可是 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&N^&\"^!)^.$^*D^!\"^$%^!%^#u^#g^&A^$i^*J^$1^)!^!8^&n^&-^!h^8{^*D^!\"^$%^.$^&Z^\"A^,X ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZOXiYiXiEpXi4kXipEXiEiXiQlXiElXiN1XiNnXiZBXiRpXipKXiQxXikhXiE4XiZuXiYtXiFoXjh7XipEXiEiXiQlXi4kXiZaXiJBXixYIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c65f0e23d74f",
      "text": "上等貨色，絕不是什麼垃圾。我真不知道自己當時到底著了什麼魔，但還是要再次感謝你們 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!'^'-^.w^'s^*A^-I^!)^,X^!=^.T^\"i^\"f^!\"^$%^-2^!)^&h^(y^'l^#I^&N^$f^!u^/^^-a^*D^!=^.T^*0^*A^!I^.7^,X^(C^!l^%D^#{^-z^*F^*{ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEnXictXi53XidzXipBXi1JXiEpXixYXiE9Xi5UXiJpXiJmXiEiXiQlXi0yXiEpXiZoXih5XidsXiNJXiZOXiRmXiF1Xi9eXi1hXipEXiE9Xi5UXiowXipBXiFJXi43XixYXihDXiFsXiVEXiN7Xi16XipGXip7IA==",
      "byte_length": 121
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7aa4c39a5e2f",
      "text": "終結了這場噩夢。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-H^'@^*D^(s^\"n^/X^\"y^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi1IXidAXipEXihzXiJuXi9YXiJ5XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_62b62043b006",
      "text": "凡是像你們這樣的旅者在荒野求生所需的一切物資，應有盡有。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+-^,X^!`^*F^*{^(s^,f^&Z^2m^'V^\"d^1W^.:^,n^&F^$)^)e^&Z^!%^+.^&4^(X^*A^0`^$s^-1^$s^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XistXixYXiFgXipGXip7XihzXixmXiZaXjJtXidWXiJkXjFXXi46XixuXiZGXiQpXillXiZaXiElXisuXiY0XihYXipBXjBgXiRzXi0xXiRzXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4e29dcabc571",
      "text": "我有各類通用補給品，還有你在別處絕對找不到的珍稀秘寶 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^$s^+>^)w^(t^&H^6&^'A^\"R^*A^.7^$s^*F^\"d^*H^(,^-I^#:^$/^!)^!u^&Z^/7^3w^1O^#4 ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiRzXis+Xil3Xih0XiZIXjYmXidBXiJSXipBXi43XiRzXipGXiJkXipIXigsXi1JXiM6XiQvXiEpXiF1XiZaXi83XjN3XjFPXiM0IA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2a2871d9373d",
      "text": "與古物。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'p^\"=^&4^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XidwXiI9XiY0XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 13
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4ceeaced9d6a",
      "text": "太好了！我這就拿給你看。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+f^+i^*D^*W^$%^(s^*J^,G^'A^*F^*Q^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitmXitpXipEXipXXiQlXihzXipKXixHXidBXipGXipRXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 37
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_997d348813ac",
      "text": "希望能再次與你們做生意，朋友。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+{^,]^'b^!l^%D^'p^*F^*{^*~^&F^#z^*A^,[^\"8^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xit7XixdXidiXiFsXiVEXidwXipGXip7Xip+XiZGXiN6XipBXixbXiI4XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b520ed32c4af",
      "text": " 注意到地毯的一角沒有被壓住。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^%e^#z^!u^\"e^%S^&Z^!%^(H^%\\^$s^(@^4v^*z^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4lZV4jel4hdV4iZV4lU14mWl4hJV4oSF4lXF4kc14oQF40dl4qel4hIiA=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b163184842da",
      "text": "要掀開鬆開的地毯角嗎？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(C^8h^)F^.R^)F^&Z^\"e^%S^(H^+X^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihDXjhoXilGXi5SXilGXiZaXiJlXiVTXihIXitYXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_06f349825fde",
      "text": "地毯的一角鬆開了。要掀開它嗎？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"e^%S^&Z^!%^(H^.R^)F^*D^!\"^(C^8h^)F^+o^+X^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJlXiVTXiZaXiElXihIXi5SXilGXipEXiEiXihDXjhoXilGXitvXitYXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b6ec0e2f30cf",
      "text": "你離地毯太近了，無法將其掀開。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^)`^\"e^%S^+f^(l^*D^*A^%}^%b^#7^!j^8h^)F^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXilgXiJlXiVTXitmXihsXipEXipBXiV9XiViXiM3XiFqXjhoXilGXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_52deba4fc912",
      "text": "你必須靠近保險箱才能對它進行操作。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^#l^)r^.C^(l^!T^*m^'/^$,^'b^#:^+o^(w^(;^$H^!M^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiNsXilyXi5DXihsXiFUXiptXicvXiQsXidiXiM6XitvXih3Xig7XiRIXiFNXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_30bcf237dbe9",
      "text": "保險箱已經被洗劫一空了。裡面什麼都沒剩下。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!T^*m^'/^#J^'D^(@^0j^1l^!%^'(^*D^!\"^-j^)j^!=^.T^)$^%\\^8U^!(^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFUXiptXicvXiNKXidEXihAXjBqXjFsXiElXicoXipEXiEiXi1qXilqXiE9Xi5UXikkXiVcXjhVXiEoXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_99303a8f9307",
      "text": "保險箱鎖住了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!T^*m^'/^)8^*z^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFUXiptXicvXik4Xip6XipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 22
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ccfa73a10460",
      "text": "  用力砸開它。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^&H^!~^0#^)F^+o^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJkheIX5eMCNeKUZeK29eISI=",
      "byte_length": 20
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_659a512f46b6",
      "text": "別去碰它。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*H^\"6^-5^+o^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipIXiI2Xi01XitvXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 16
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_24167aa8aaa6",
      "text": " 蓄力用",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^2B^!~^&H",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4yQl4hfl4mSA==",
      "byte_length": 10
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ccc81e4912b5",
      "text": " 她的",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^+h^&Z",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4raF4mWg==",
      "byte_length": 7
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_09c9d2ceec3b",
      "text": " 他的",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^!@^&Z",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4hQF4mWg==",
      "byte_length": 7
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1d7a5968c4ef",
      "text": " 拳頭猛砸保險箱， ",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^<k^)t^*P^0#^!T^*m^'/^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "IF48a14pdF4qUF4wI14hVF4qbV4nL14qQSA=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3ce77b7f5771",
      "text": "除了製造出巨大的噪音外毫無作用。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)Q^*D^(B^(v^!q^#H^\"z^&Z^:h^34^\"w^/t^%}^!M^&H^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XilRXipEXihCXih2XiFxXiNIXiJ6XiZaXjpoXjM0XiJ3Xi90XiV9XiFNXiZIXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 49
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f6ad37c57251",
      "text": "將鎖砸得粉碎，同時觸發了陷阱！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#7^)8^0#^#e^'5^&o^*A^\"E^$f^(J^&W^*D^)S^)J^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiM3Xik4XjAjXiNlXic1XiZvXipBXiJFXiRmXihKXiZXXipEXilTXilKXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_25046269fde8",
      "text": " 試圖打開保險箱， ",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^-u^\"b^$-^)F^!T^*m^'/^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4tdV4iYl4kLV4pRl4hVF4qbV4nL14qQSA=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ad35e0949f11",
      "text": "但由於不是盜賊，完全不知道該從何下手。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!I^&I^$^^!)^,X^0!^0?^*A^#,^!h^!)^&h^(y^(M^#f^!L^!(^$+^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFJXiZJXiReXiEpXixYXjAhXjA/XipBXiMsXiFoXiEpXiZoXih5XihNXiNmXiFMXiEoXiQrXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3bc5c7e411c1",
      "text": "但沒有成功。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!I^%\\^$s^$$^\"!^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFJXiVcXiRzXiQkXiIhXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 19
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cabac4c76b86",
      "text": "憑藉外科醫生般的精湛手法，觸發了開啟機關同時避開了陷阱！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,5^04^\"w^'!^<J^&F^'r^&Z^'7^<o^$+^%b^*A^(J^&W^*D^)F^57^%>^.>^\"E^$f^0F^)F^*D^)S^)J^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xiw1XjA0XiJ3XichXjxKXiZGXidyXiZaXic3XjxvXiQrXiViXipBXihKXiZXXipEXilGXjU3XiU+Xi4+XiJFXiRmXjBGXilGXipEXilTXilKXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0aa90ba739f6",
      "text": "在兩千枚陶幣的財富中，你們發現了一把長劍、一顆大寶石，以及一條 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"d^!i^+7^$~^)R^+|^&Z^0=^3C^!,^*A^*F^*{^&W^&?^*D^!%^$1^)C^!|^!!^!%^)u^\"z^#4^&k^*A^!B^\"7^!%^%. ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJkXiFpXis3XiR+XilSXit8XiZaXjA9XjNDXiEsXipBXipGXip7XiZXXiY/XipEXiElXiQxXilDXiF8XiEhXiElXil1XiJ6XiM0XiZrXipBXiFCXiI3XiElXiUuIA==",
      "byte_length": 94
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_902eb951cde0",
      "text": "靈能手鐲！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)g^'b^$+^98^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XilnXidiXiQrXjk4XipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 16
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c97c79b4583c",
      "text": "俯瞰水井深處，可見井壁突出的岩石便於攀爬向下。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^5*^8p^%V^!7^2*^(,^*A^\"A^-m^!7^*\\^'*^!q^&Z^#D^&k^!R^$^^8|^/y^+?^!(^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjUqXjhwXiVWXiE3XjIqXigsXipBXiJBXi1tXiE3XipcXicqXiFxXiZaXiNEXiZrXiFSXiReXjh8Xi95Xis/XiEoXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3b3cb25682bb",
      "text": "這讓往下攀爬變得相當容易。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^-}^,)^!(^8|^/y^(U^#e^&a^&N^+t^,W^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXi19XiwpXiEoXjh8Xi95XihVXiNlXiZhXiZOXit0XixXXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 40
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bfdcaa79fd4b",
      "text": "要爬下水井嗎？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(C^/y^!(^%V^!7^+X^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihDXi95XiEoXiVWXiE3XitYXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 22
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_224b7ac69720",
      "text": "你們就這點能耐嗎？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^*J^(s^*;^'b^-S^+X^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XipKXihzXio7XidiXi1TXitYXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 28
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b6312bdeb367",
      "text": "我等待著你們的出招——我已向你們發出挑戰，你們必須迎戰！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^'-^,*^-a^*F^*{^&Z^!q^,D^*n^*n^$%^#J^+?^*F^*{^&W^!q^,H^$(^*A^*F^*{^#l^)r^(k^$(^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXictXiwqXi1hXipGXip7XiZaXiFxXixEXipuXipuXiQlXiNKXis/XipGXip7XiZXXiFxXixIXiQoXipBXipGXip7XiNsXilyXihrXiQoXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_270a160815a2",
      "text": "等等！我感應到你們身上現在帶著 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'-^'-^*W^$%^#{^0`^!u^*F^*{^(c^!'^&?^\"d^#N^-a ",
      "encoded_base64": "XictXictXipXXiQlXiN7XjBgXiF1XipGXip7XihjXiEnXiY/XiJkXiNOXi1hIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f370f88cb3d1",
      "text": "兩塊 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!i^/Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFpXi9aIA==",
      "byte_length": 7
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a2844a405233",
      "text": "一塊 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!%^/Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiElXi9aIA==",
      "byte_length": 7
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e0926e3e4d47",
      "text": "雕像的碎片！到鎮中心的井邊來。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)^^!`^&Z^&o^&1^*W^!u^);^!,^#k^&Z^!7^.8^!O^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XileXiFgXiZaXiZvXiYxXipXXiF1Xik7XiEsXiNrXiZaXiE3Xi44XiFPXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_943430fb1eba",
      "text": "我在那裡等你們。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^\"d^)!^-j^'-^*F^*{^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiJkXikhXi1qXictXipGXip7XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_322a63a92cbe",
      "text": "你們是怎麼進來的？！你們在這裡做什麼？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^,X^,,^.T^(w^!O^&Z^.V^*W^*F^*{^\"d^(s^-j^*~^!=^.T^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XixYXiwsXi5UXih3XiFPXiZaXi5WXipXXipGXip7XiJkXihzXi1qXip+XiE9Xi5UXi5W",
      "byte_length": 57
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_960c3fb028f4",
      "text": "你們為何來到這裡？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^%{^!L^!O^!u^(s^-j^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiV7XiFMXiFPXiF1XihzXi1qXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 28
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3981a1ba9af6",
      "text": "  我們在四處搜查，便發現了這個地方。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^*{^\"d^\"[^(,^/h^%&^*A^!R^&W^&?^*D^(s^!V^\"e^$]^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeKnteImReIlteKCxeL2heJSZeKkFeIVJeJldeJj9eKkReKHNeIVZeImVeJF1eISI=",
      "byte_length": 53
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9f6064d076de",
      "text": "  那你又在這裡做什麼？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^)!^*F^+;^\"d^(s^-j^*~^!=^.T^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKSFeKkZeKzteImReKHNeLWpeKn5eIT1eLlReLlY=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ae533d7b2848",
      "text": "  你是怎麼操縱村長的？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^,X^,,^.T^$H^4]^$z^)C^&Z^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeLFheLCxeLlReJEheNF1eJHpeKUNeJlpeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_dd0779d7d3fd",
      "text": "  你為何要這麼做？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^%{^!L^(C^(s^.T^*~^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeJXteIUxeKENeKHNeLlReKn5eLlY=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0a32630d761f",
      "text": "  村民們發生了什麼事？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$z^%T^*{^&W^&F^*D^!=^.T^*r^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJHpeJVReKnteJldeJkZeKkReIT1eLlReKnJeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ec254f06c35e",
      "text": "  哎呀，多謝你百忙之中抽空搭理我們。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^3i^3h^*A^\"x^-z^*F^&Y^,+^!/^!,^*_^'(^8\\^&A^$%^*{^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeM2leM2heKkFeInheLXpeKkZeJlleLCteIS9eISxeKl9eJyheOFxeJkFeJCVeKnteISI=",
      "byte_length": 53
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_26065dbde91d",
      "text": "  遠不及親手讓你血債血償那麼有趣！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^({^!)^\"7^(F^$+^-}^*F^(:^<d^(:^5-^)!^.T^$s^.*^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKHteISleIjdeKEZeJCteLX1eKkZeKDpePGReKDpeNS1eKSFeLlReJHNeLipeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 50
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f8f0e8ca25b7",
      "text": "  噢，比如『軟泥怪』之類的綽號嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^+]^*A^,m^#$^<_^.x^%d^#s^<`^!/^)w^&Z^9I^(-^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeK11eKkFeLG1eIyRePF9eLnheJWReI3NePGBeIS9eKXdeJlpeOUleKC1eK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 50
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_23950911752a",
      "text": "  只有小孩子才會玩傀儡木偶。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^\"?^$s^#;^+m^#(^$,^$r^4U^<c^<e^$v^9,^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIj9eJHNeIzteK21eIyheJCxeJHJeNFVePGNePGVeJHZeOSxeISI=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4a9babd480c6",
      "text": "  你嚇不倒我的，渺小的傢伙。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^\"X^!)^!X^$%^&Z^*A^<n^#;^&Z^+#^*y^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeIlheISleIVheJCVeJlpeKkFePG5eIzteJlpeKyNeKnleISI=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ae9573da48bb",
      "text": "  是你控制了這個村莊？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^,X^*F^$@^!v^*D^(s^!V^$z^6l^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLFheKkZeJEBeIXZeKkReKHNeIVZeJHpeNmxeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e2d7a446c46c",
      "text": "  這麼說，你就是領袖？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^(s^.T^-x^*A^*F^*J^,X^)s^7G^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKHNeLlReLXheKkFeKkZeKkpeLFheKXNeN0deLlY=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_68dfff44ad97",
      "text": "  這座村莊是你的玩具？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^(s^/_^$z^6l^,X^*F^&Z^4U^!k^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKHNeL19eJHpeNmxeLFheKkZeJlpeNFVeIWteLlY=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9318c593a030",
      "text": "  解除你的法術！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^(I^)Q^*F^&Z^%b^(<^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKEleKVFeKkZeJlpeJWJeKDxeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 23
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c9be87a8c00e",
      "text": "  放了他們，否則就等著看你的內臟流滿地吧！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$P^*D^!@^*{^*A^\"H^!x^*J^'-^-a^*Q^*F^&Z^!g^3Y^%j^,{^\"e^*I^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJFBeKkReIUBeKnteKkFeIkheIXheKkpeJy1eLWFeKlFeKkZeJlpeIWdeM1leJWpeLHteImVeKkleKlc=",
      "byte_length": 62
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9d77054f2e4b",
      "text": "那些村民？噢，好吧，當你們粗暴地攻擊其中一人時，我便擅自作主 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^!8^$z^%T^.V^+]^*A^+i^*I^*A^&N^*F^*{^0(^$m^\"e^$O^$F^!j^!,^!%^!<^$f^*A^$%^!R^2$^'l^!M^!- ",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXiE4XiR6XiVUXi5WXitdXipBXitpXipJXipBXiZOXipGXip7XjAoXiRtXiJlXiRPXiRGXiFqXiEsXiElXiE8XiRmXipBXiQlXiFSXjIkXidsXiFNXiEtIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_24850f4967bc",
      "text": "把他們全都傳送到了淤泥海中。我向你們保證他們目前還算安全…… ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$1^!@^*{^!h^)$^+$^./^!u^*D^6c^%d^6`^!,^!\"^$%^+?^*F^*{^!T^-{^!@^*{^&^^!z^.7^-C^+p^!h^*o^*o ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQxXiFAXip7XiFoXikkXiskXi4vXiF1XipEXjZjXiVkXjZgXiEsXiEiXiQlXis/XipGXip7XiFUXi17XiFAXip7XiZeXiF6Xi43Xi1DXitwXiFoXipvXipvIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_53d328d932cd",
      "text": "暫時而言。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$l^$f^'W^1Y^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRsXiRmXidXXjFZXiEi",
      "byte_length": 15
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6d30dea8a3dc",
      "text": "該回答問題的是你們，而不是我——又不是我擅自闖入這裡的。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(M^\"\\^-B^*Z^.G^&Z^,X^*F^*{^*A^'W^!)^,X^$%^*n^*n^+;^!)^,X^$%^2$^'l^.z^!f^(s^-j^&Z^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihNXiJcXi1CXipaXi5HXiZaXixYXipGXip7XipBXidXXiEpXixYXiQlXipuXipuXis7XiEpXixYXiQlXjIkXidsXi56XiFmXihzXi1qXiZaXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a09a4f0a262a",
      "text": "不過，我現在挺無聊的。我就發發善心，回答你們幾個問題來給自己解悶吧。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^(x^*A^$%^&?^\"d^,I^%}^-U^&Z^!\"^$%^*J^&W^&W^1(^#k^*A^\"\\^-B^*F^*{^#T^!V^*Z^.G^!O^'A^'l^#I^(I^<i^*I^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXih4XipBXiQlXiY/XiJkXixJXiV9Xi1VXiZaXiEiXiQlXipKXiZXXiZXXjEoXiNrXipBXiJcXi1CXipGXip7XiNUXiFWXipaXi5HXiFPXidBXidsXiNJXihJXjxpXipJXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 103
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ea9574914280",
      "text": "這是我給予你們的特許。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^,X^$%^'A^!4^*F^*{^&Z^&5^-s^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXixYXiQlXidBXiE0XipGXip7XiZaXiY1Xi1zXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_721006d20c9b",
      "text": "而你們恰好發現了那扇門，是吧？無妨。既然你們進來了， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'W^*F^*{^<h^+i^&W^&?^*D^)!^$*^)D^*A^,X^*I^.V^%}^5D^!\"^,U^&\"^*F^*{^(w^!O^*D^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XidXXipGXip7XjxoXitpXiZXXiY/XipEXikhXiQqXilEXipBXixYXipJXi5WXiV9XjVEXiEiXixVXiYiXipGXip7Xih3XiFPXipEXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4941d774cb93",
      "text": "那你們到底想怎樣？我警告你們，站在你們面前的是一位滅絕者大師。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^*F^*{^!u^/^^,1^,,^,f^.V^$%^(S^+B^*F^*{^*A^->^\"d^*F^*{^)j^!z^&Z^,X^!%^!J^%t^-I^'V^\"z^#M^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXipGXip7XiF1Xi9eXiwxXiwsXixmXi5WXiQlXihTXitCXipGXip7XipBXi0+XiJkXipGXip7XilqXiF6XiZaXixYXiElXiFKXiV0Xi1JXidWXiJ6XiNNXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 94
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ec1130f0d883",
      "text": "反客為主發問，嗯？挺伶俐的嘛，真可愛。不過我可不會被區區 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"9^+q^%{^!-^&W^*Z^*A^6N^.V^,I^<a^<b^&Z^+Y^*A^-2^\"A^,2^!\"^!)^(x^$%^\"A^!)^$r^(@^\"+^\"+ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiI5XitxXiV7XiEtXiZXXipaXipBXjZOXi5WXixJXjxhXjxiXiZaXitZXipBXi0yXiJBXiwyXiEiXiEpXih4XiQlXiJBXiEpXiRyXihAXiIrXiIrIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b1a79dd20f4b",
      "text": "荒原流浪者給嚇倒，我現在就明白地告訴你們這點。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^1W^\"5^%j^,r^'V^'A^\"X^!X^*A^$%^&?^\"d^*J^$c^&X^\"e^+B^-t^*F^*{^(s^*;^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjFXXiI1XiVqXixyXidWXidBXiJYXiFYXipBXiQlXiY/XiJkXipKXiRjXiZYXiJlXitCXi10XipGXip7XihzXio7XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2ca377633908",
      "text": "我乃滅絕者大師——憑藉我的法力，我能完全操控這整座城鎮。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^/M^%t^-I^'V^\"z^#M^*n^*n^,5^04^$%^&Z^%b^!~^*A^$%^'b^#,^!h^$H^$@^(s^$T^/_^+_^);^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXi9NXiV0Xi1JXidWXiJ6XiNNXipuXipuXiw1XjA0XiQlXiZaXiViXiF+XipBXiQlXidiXiMsXiFoXiRIXiRAXihzXiRUXi9fXitfXik7XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6e44ed884040",
      "text": "它屬於我！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+o^#C^$^^$%^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitvXiNDXiReXiQlXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 16
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7cb6ba0f28b1",
      "text": "我行事自有我的理由。姑且把它當作一場心智掌控的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^(;^*r^'l^$s^$%^&Z^&A^&I^!\"^:3^!*^$1^+o^&N^!M^!%^\"n^#k^$i^$;^$@^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXig7XipyXidsXiRzXiQlXiZaXiZBXiZJXiEiXjozXiEqXiQxXitvXiZOXiFNXiElXiJuXiNrXiRpXiQ7XiRAXiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_21c62bfb6282",
      "text": "實驗吧。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#3^.P^*I^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiMzXi5QXipJXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 13
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c2691092ad6f",
      "text": "噢，根本不用客氣。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+]^*A^%)^$x^!)^&H^+q^%U^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitdXipBXiUpXiR4XiEpXiZIXitxXiVVXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 28
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_dca4123b2590",
      "text": "吾乃威米亞斯。你可以這樣稱呼我，或是用我信徒口中 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^;b^/M^#&^'4^!9^$[^!\"^*F^\"A^!B^(s^,f^0&^\"M^$%^*A^$'^,X^&H^$%^!U^#d^\"<^!, ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjtiXi9NXiMmXic0XiE5XiRbXiEiXipGXiJBXiFCXihzXixmXjAmXiJNXiQlXipBXiQnXixYXiZIXiQlXiFVXiNkXiI8XiEsIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d14fd34ecc15",
      "text": "無數稱號中的任何一個。我相信那些村民一定會非常樂意 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%}^$V^0&^(-^!,^&Z^!C^!L^!%^!V^!\"^$%^&a^!U^)!^!8^$z^%T^!%^#.^$r^)i^#O^%8^#z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiV9XiRWXjAmXigtXiEsXiZaXiFDXiFMXiElXiFWXiEiXiQlXiZhXiFVXikhXiE4XiR6XiVUXiElXiMuXiRyXilpXiNPXiU4XiN6IA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c08eb1f9fe49",
      "text": "向你們轉述其中的幾個名號。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+?^*F^*{^(i^68^!j^!,^&Z^#T^!V^\"F^(-^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xis/XipGXip7XihpXjY4XiFqXiEsXiZaXiNUXiFWXiJGXigtXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 40
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6a0ce76843ce",
      "text": "你們是多麼急著自尋死路啊！好吧，在你們白白送命之前， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^,X^\"x^.T^3p^-a^'l^#9^%L^(a^+Q^*W^+i^*I^*A^\"d^*F^*{^&X^&X^./^\"N^!/^!z^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XixYXiJ4Xi5UXjNwXi1hXidsXiM5XiVMXihhXitRXipXXitpXipJXipBXiJkXipGXip7XiZYXiZYXi4vXiJOXiEvXiF6XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4a08a11b963e",
      "text": "就像你們害死那些村民一樣， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*J^!`^*F^*{^#/^%L^)!^!8^$z^%T^!%^,f^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipKXiFgXipGXip7XiMvXiVMXikhXiE4XiR6XiVUXiElXixmXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 40
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_338b88c234c8",
      "text": "像你們害死那些村民一樣， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!`^*F^*{^#/^%L^)!^!8^$z^%T^!%^,f^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFgXipGXip7XiMvXiVMXikhXiE4XiR6XiVUXiElXixmXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 37
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_135d5f811147",
      "text": "不妨先聽聽我的一個提議。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^5D^!b^-X^-X^$%^&Z^!%^!V^$A^-|^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXjVEXiFiXi1YXi1YXiQlXiZaXiElXiFWXiRBXi18XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 37
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_435c645b13a2",
      "text": "我現在警告你們，而且只警告這一次。如果敢再侮辱或 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^&?^\"d^(S^+B^*F^*{^*A^'W^!*^\"?^(S^+B^(s^!%^%D^!\"^#$^%!^/m^!l^9+^3`^$' ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiY/XiJkXihTXitCXipGXip7XipBXidXXiEqXiI/XihTXitCXihzXiElXiVEXiEiXiMkXiUhXi9tXiFsXjkrXjNgXiQnIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c7acd87f9c0c",
      "text": "嘲弄我半句， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+Z^/`^$%^\"-^2]^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitaXi9gXiQlXiItXjJdXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 19
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_88217149661e",
      "text": "我就讓所有的村民全都葬身於淤泥之中。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*J^-}^$)^$s^&Z^$z^%T^!h^)$^-b^(c^$^^6c^%d^!/^!,^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXipKXi19XiQpXiRzXiZaXiR6XiVUXiFoXikkXi1iXihjXiReXjZjXiVkXiEvXiEsXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_53201b8dee70",
      "text": "我就把所有的村民殺個精光。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*J^$1^$)^$s^&Z^$z^%T^%M^!V^'7^!c^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXipKXiQxXiQpXiRzXiZaXiR6XiVUXiVNXiFWXic3XiFjXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 40
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6bf1d73e0a33",
      "text": "我保證說到做到——敢再惹惱我，他們一個也別想活。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^!T^-{^-x^!u^*~^!u^*n^*n^/m^!l^3s^<j^$%^*A^!@^*{^!%^!V^!1^*H^,1^%i^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiFUXi17Xi14XiF1Xip+XiF1XipuXipuXi9tXiFsXjNzXjxqXiQlXipBXiFAXip7XiElXiFWXiExXipIXiwxXiVpXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_350b913b3f00",
      "text": "你們是傻了嗎？我早就警告過會有什麼後果。他們全都完了。我希望 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^,X^7$^*D^+X^.V^$%^,V^*J^(S^+B^(x^$r^$s^!=^.T^#b^%!^!\"^!@^*{^!h^)$^#,^*D^!\"^$%^+{^,] ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XixYXjckXipEXitYXi5WXiQlXixWXipKXihTXitCXih4XiRyXiRzXiE9Xi5UXiNiXiUhXiEiXiFAXip7XiFoXikkXiMsXipEXiEiXiQlXit7XixdIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_09c379ea2860",
      "text": "你們會喜歡雙手沾滿村民鮮血的滋味。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^$r^+V^%F^)_^$+^74^,{^$z^%T^35^(:^&Z^7|^1n^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiRyXitWXiVGXilfXiQrXjc0Xix7XiR6XiVUXjM1Xig6XiZaXjd8XjFuXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7995814e6d46",
      "text": "沒錯，你確實可以說我掌控著這個村莊……在方方面面皆是。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%\\^)5^*A^*F^-6^#3^\"A^!B^-x^$%^$;^$@^-a^(s^!V^$z^6l^*o^*o^\"d^$]^$]^)j^)j^5j^,X^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVcXik1XipBXipGXi02XiMzXiJBXiFCXi14XiQlXiQ7XiRAXi1hXihzXiFWXiR6XjZsXipvXipvXiJkXiRdXiRdXilqXilqXjVqXixYXiEi",
      "byte_length": 81
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7958c5d3d2a6",
      "text": "『領袖』是個多麼模稜兩可的詞彙。從宏觀角度而言，我確實是這群人的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^<_^)s^7G^<`^,X^!V^\"x^.T^%:^<r^!i^\"A^&Z^.v^<g^!\"^#f^45^*R^(H^#V^'W^1Y^*A^$%^-6^#3^,X^(s^'R^!<^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjxfXilzXjdHXjxgXixYXiFWXiJ4Xi5UXiU6XjxyXiFpXiJBXiZaXi52XjxnXiEiXiNmXjQ1XipSXihIXiNWXidXXjFZXipBXiQlXi02XiMzXixYXihzXidSXiE8XiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 97
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_af460381adf0",
      "text": "首領，但我覺得更貼切的稱呼應該是『提線木偶師』。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)~^)s^*A^!I^$%^(G^#e^$o^<G^+.^&Z^0&^\"M^0`^(M^,X^<_^$A^'I^$v^9,^#M^<`^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xil+XilzXipBXiFJXiQlXihHXiNlXiRvXjxHXisuXiZaXjAmXiJNXjBgXihNXixYXjxfXiRBXidJXiR2XjksXiNNXjxgXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b03be622f8ca",
      "text": "更像是一場實驗，真的。不過這個詞倒挺貼切……沒錯，這個 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$o^!`^,X^!%^\"n^#3^.P^*A^-2^&Z^!\"^!)^(x^(s^!V^.v^!X^,I^<G^+.^*o^*o^%\\^)5^*A^(s^!V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRvXiFgXixYXiElXiJuXiMzXi5QXipBXi0yXiZaXiEiXiEpXih4XihzXiFWXi52XiFYXixJXjxHXisuXipvXipvXiVcXik1XipBXihzXiFWIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_47b77166905d",
      "text": "村莊就是我的玩具，我想怎麼擺弄就怎麼擺弄。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$z^6l^*J^,X^$%^&Z^4U^!k^*A^$%^,1^,,^.T^1@^/`^*J^,,^.T^1@^/`^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiR6XjZsXipKXixYXiQlXiZaXjRVXiFrXipBXiQlXiwxXiwsXi5UXjFAXi9gXipKXiwsXi5UXjFAXi9gXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_55261bdd6f7b",
      "text": "你們希望我解放這個村莊？嗯，那我給你們提個條件吧。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^+{^,]^$%^(I^$P^(s^!V^$z^6l^.V^6N^*A^)!^$%^'A^*F^*{^$A^!V^%.^.W^*I^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7Xit7XixdXiQlXihJXiRQXihzXiFWXiR6XjZsXi5WXjZOXipBXikhXiQlXidBXipGXip7XiRBXiFWXiUuXi5XXipJXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bca2359c2fe9",
      "text": "等等，先別走。在你們離開之前，讓我提個條件。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'-^'-^*A^!b^*H^.&^!\"^\"d^*F^*{^)`^)F^!/^!z^*A^-}^$%^$A^!V^%.^.W^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XictXictXipBXiFiXipIXi4mXiEiXiJkXipGXip7XilgXilGXiEvXiF6XipBXi19XiQlXiRBXiFWXiUuXi5XXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d96cbf9a9118",
      "text": "我也算得上是個收藏家，我正在尋找一座雕像的兩塊碎片 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^!1^-C^#e^!'^,X^!V^$M^-f^+s^*A^$%^%H^\"d^#9^$/^!%^/_^)^^!`^&Z^!i^/Z^&o^&1 ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiExXi1DXiNlXiEnXixYXiFWXiRNXi1mXitzXipBXiQlXiVIXiJkXiM5XiQvXiElXi9fXileXiFgXiZaXiFpXi9aXiZvXiYxIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d23adfedb1e1",
      "text": "好讓我的收藏臻於完美。如果你們能為我找回這些碎片， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+i^-}^$%^&Z^$M^-f^<t^$^^#,^-P^!\"^#$^%!^*F^*{^'b^%{^$%^$/^\"\\^(s^!8^&o^&1^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitpXi19XiQlXiZaXiRNXi1mXjx0XiReXiMsXi1QXiEiXiMkXiUhXipGXip7XidiXiV7XiQlXiQvXiJcXihzXiE4XiZvXiYxXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d3f6b38aa6aa",
      "text": "我便會 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^!R^$r ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiFSXiRyIA==",
      "byte_length": 10
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2e375edcebdc",
      "text": "把村民全都帶回來，並且 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$1^$z^%T^!h^)$^#N^\"\\^!O^*A^!+^!* ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQxXiR6XiVUXiFoXikkXiNOXiJcXiFPXipBXiErXiEqIA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a1e431d912e2",
      "text": "徹底解除我對這座村莊的掌控。到那時你們愛怎麼處置它都行。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^18^/^^(I^)Q^$%^#:^(s^/_^$z^6l^&Z^$;^$@^!\"^!u^)!^$f^*F^*{^,2^,,^.T^(,^'Q^+o^)$^(;^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjE4Xi9eXihJXilRXiQlXiM6XihzXi9fXiR6XjZsXiZaXiQ7XiRAXiEiXiF1XikhXiRmXipGXip7XiwyXiwsXi5UXigsXidRXitvXikkXig7XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b2a7a26a7f42",
      "text": "我並未殺害那些村民，只是把他們傳送到了淤泥中。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^!+^,_^%M^#/^)!^!8^$z^%T^*A^\"?^,X^$1^!@^*{^+$^./^!u^*D^6c^%d^!,^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiErXixfXiVNXiMvXikhXiE4XiR6XiVUXipBXiI/XixYXiQxXiFAXip7XiskXi4vXiF1XipEXjZjXiVkXiEsXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8897dcb52dae",
      "text": "當你們攻擊那個村民時，我便把他們全部傳送到了淤泥中。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&N^*F^*{^$O^$F^)!^!V^$z^%T^$f^*A^$%^!R^$1^!@^*{^!h^)#^+$^./^!u^*D^6c^%d^!,^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZOXipGXip7XiRPXiRGXikhXiFWXiR6XiVUXiRmXipBXiQlXiFSXiQxXiFAXip7XiFoXikjXiskXi4vXiF1XipEXjZjXiVkXiEsXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b271c62d08ed",
      "text": "除非你們替我取回雕像碎片，否則我會讓他們留在那裡自生自滅。相信我， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)Q^)i^*F^*{^2o^$%^\":^\"\\^)^^!`^&o^&1^*A^\"H^!x^$%^$r^-}^!@^*{^-+^\"d^)!^-j^'l^&F^'l^%t^!\"^&a^!U^$%^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XilRXilpXipGXip7XjJvXiQlXiI6XiJcXileXiFgXiZvXiYxXipBXiJIXiF4XiQlXiRyXi19XiFAXip7Xi0rXiJkXikhXi1qXidsXiZGXidsXiV0XiEiXiZhXiFVXiQlXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 100
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6c2e7b310fb7",
      "text": "要是你們敢一去不復返，他們就跟死人沒什麼兩樣了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(C^,X^*F^*{^/m^!%^\"6^!)^#g^7J^*A^!@^*{^*J^.+^%L^!<^%\\^!=^.T^!i^,f^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihDXixYXipGXip7Xi9tXiElXiI2XiEpXiNnXjdKXipBXiFAXip7XipKXi4rXiVMXiE8XiVcXiE9Xi5UXiFpXixmXipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9fd061926dad",
      "text": "我向來說話算話。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^+?^!O^-x^-v^-C^-v^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXis/XiFPXi14Xi12Xi1DXi12XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0975d792bf97",
      "text": "如何？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#$^!L^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XiMkXiFMXi5W",
      "byte_length": 9
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2f43f8fedbcb",
      "text": "  我需要考慮一下……",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^)e^(C^-R^19^!%^!(^*o^*o",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeKWVeKENeLVJeMTleISVeISheKm9eKm8=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_17e9a25efb36",
      "text": "  好吧，我去找雕像碎片。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^+i^*I^*A^$%^\"6^$/^)^^!`^&o^&1^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeK2leKkleKkFeJCVeIjZeJC9eKV5eIWBeJm9eJjFeISI=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8b3ad191e537",
      "text": "  那些雕像碎片在哪裡？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^)!^!8^)^^!`^&o^&1^\"d^+I^-j^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKSFeITheKV5eIWBeJm9eJjFeImReK0leLWpeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_00b60176b338",
      "text": "  休想。我絕不會幫你的。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^!G^,1^!\"^$%^-I^!)^$r^+}^*F^&Z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIUdeLDFeISJeJCVeLUleISleJHJeK31eKkZeJlpeISI=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e29d44951484",
      "text": "說真的，我真奇怪自己為何還要給你們選擇的餘地——你們根本不明白 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-x^-2^&Z^*A^$%^-2^\"}^#s^'l^#I^%{^!L^.7^(C^'A^*F^*{^.6^,N^&Z^1e^\"e^*n^*n^*F^*{^%)^$x^!)^$c^&X ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi14Xi0yXiZaXipBXiQlXi0yXiJ9XiNzXidsXiNJXiV7XiFMXi43XihDXidBXipGXip7Xi42XixOXiZaXjFlXiJlXipuXipuXipGXip7XiUpXiR4XiEpXiRjXiZYIA==",
      "byte_length": 94
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d656c5f8bb9b",
      "text": "目前的處境，是吧？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&^^!z^&Z^(,^\"q^*A^,X^*I^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZeXiF6XiZaXigsXiJxXipBXixYXipJXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 28
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c858011e6e73",
      "text": "好吧。我給你們十秒鐘。快點做決定。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+i^*I^!\"^$%^'A^*F^*{^*Y^;2^9y^!\"^*L^*;^*~^,o^#.^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitpXipJXiEiXiQlXidBXipGXip7XipZXjsyXjl5XiEiXipMXio7Xip+XixvXiMuXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_15dce0131ae8",
      "text": "不行，你們的時間到了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^(;^*A^*F^*{^&Z^$f^)G^!u^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXig7XipBXipGXip7XiZaXiRmXilHXiF1XipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7e24577db008",
      "text": "總共有兩塊碎片。一塊在東邊的蘇蘭蜥蜴人手中，另一塊 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-M^3d^$s^!i^/Z^&o^&1^!\"^!%^/Z^\"d^,`^.8^&Z^4c^/G^(2^(3^!<^$+^!,^*A^\">^!%^/Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi1NXjNkXiRzXiFpXi9aXiZvXiYxXiEiXiElXi9aXiJkXixgXi44XiZaXjRjXi9HXigyXigzXiE8XiQrXiEsXipBXiI+XiElXi9aIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_59fc8abed862",
      "text": "則歸東北方的一名德魯伊所有。把碎片帶回來給我，我自會信守 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!x^%K^,`^+6^$]^&Z^!%^\"F^#j^/K^!E^$)^$s^!\"^$1^&o^&1^#N^\"\\^!O^'A^$%^*A^$%^'l^$r^!U^#+ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiF4XiVLXixgXis2XiRdXiZaXiElXiJGXiNqXi9LXiFFXiQpXiRzXiEiXiQxXiZvXiYxXiNOXiJcXiFPXidBXiQlXipBXiQlXidsXiRyXiFVXiMrIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_634fd076d319",
      "text": "我的承諾。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^&Z^$0^7k^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiZaXiQwXjdrXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 16
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_536d48371a89",
      "text": "不過我奉勸你們最好動作快點。要是帶回來的只是一堆屍體可就不太美妙了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^(x^$%^1+^;?^*F^*{^$q^+i^\"%^!M^*L^*;^!\"^(C^,X^#N^\"\\^!O^&Z^\"?^,X^!%^*[^#?^**^\"A^*J^!)^+f^-P^43^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXih4XiQlXjErXjs/XipGXip7XiRxXitpXiIlXiFNXipMXio7XiEiXihDXixYXiNOXiJcXiFPXiZaXiI/XixYXiElXipbXiM/XioqXiJBXipKXiEpXitmXi1QXjQzXipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 103
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_66d249a16944",
      "text": "你們回來時我會在 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^\"\\^!O^$f^$%^$r^\"d ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiJcXiFPXiRmXiQlXiRyXiJkIA==",
      "byte_length": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cf162a558933",
      "text": "鎮中心的水井旁 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^);^!,^#k^&Z^%V^!7^.h ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xik7XiEsXiNrXiZaXiVWXiE3Xi5oIA==",
      "byte_length": 22
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1e04054caae2",
      "text": "這裡 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^-j ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXi1qIA==",
      "byte_length": 7
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0cceff82c080",
      "text": "恭候。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^1{^*|^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjF7Xip8XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 10
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e146addd869f",
      "text": "讓我把話說得簡單明瞭一點。你們只有一條路可走——替我取回雕像 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-}^$%^$1^-v^-x^#e^3y^2a^$c^<p^!%^*;^!\"^*F^*{^\"?^$s^!%^%.^(a^\"A^.&^*n^*n^2o^$%^\":^\"\\^)^^!` ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi19XiQlXiQxXi12Xi14XiNlXjN5XjJhXiRjXjxwXiElXio7XiEiXipGXip7XiI/XiRzXiElXiUuXihhXiJBXi4mXipuXipuXjJvXiQlXiI6XiJcXileXiFgIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8495874e381e",
      "text": "碎片。只要辦到了，我就解除施加在村莊上的法術",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&o^&1^!\"^\"?^(C^2L^!u^*D^*A^$%^*J^(I^)Q^$_^\"\"^\"d^$z^6l^!'^&Z^%b^(<",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZvXiYxXiEiXiI/XihDXjJMXiF1XipEXipBXiQlXipKXihJXilRXiRfXiIiXiJkXiR6XjZsXiEnXiZaXiViXig8",
      "byte_length": 66
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8e1d8f307dff",
      "text": "，並且把所有村民安全帶回來。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*A^!+^!*^$1^$)^$s^$z^%T^+p^!h^#N^\"\\^!O^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipBXiErXiEqXiQxXiQpXiRzXiR6XiVUXitwXiFoXiNOXiJcXiFPXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 43
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_79ce05e08e35",
      "text": "如果你們不替我找回碎片，我絕不會善罷甘休，我們遲早會再次 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#$^%!^*F^*{^!)^2o^$%^$/^\"\\^&o^&1^*A^$%^-I^!)^$r^1(^1Q^/:^!G^*A^$%^*{^.5^,V^$r^!l^%D ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiMkXiUhXipGXip7XiEpXjJvXiQlXiQvXiJcXiZvXiYxXipBXiQlXi1JXiEpXiRyXjEoXjFRXi86XiFHXipBXiQlXip7Xi41XixWXiRyXiFsXiVEIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8957476fc769",
      "text": "我早已知曉你們企圖組建聯盟的圖謀。如果你們不把碎片帶回來， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^,V^#J^&h^7y^*F^*{^4-^\"b^2;^,'^-V^-0^&Z^\"b^3~^!\"^#$^%!^*F^*{^!)^$1^&o^&1^#N^\"\\^!O^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXixWXiNKXiZoXjd5XipGXip7XjQtXiJiXjI7XiwnXi1WXi0wXiZaXiJiXjN+XiEiXiMkXiUhXipGXip7XiEpXiQxXiZvXiYxXiNOXiJcXiFPXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_84e9b8bbde8b",
      "text": "等大戰決戰之日來臨，我向你們保證，我一定會站在你們的對立面！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'-^\"z^$(^,o^$(^!/^$a^!O^1U^*A^$%^+?^*F^*{^!T^-{^*A^$%^!%^#.^$r^->^\"d^*F^*{^&Z^#:^0'^)j^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XictXiJ6XiQoXixvXiQoXiEvXiRhXiFPXjFVXipBXiQlXis/XipGXip7XiFUXi17XipBXiQlXiElXiMuXiRyXi0+XiJkXipGXip7XiZaXiM6XjAnXilqXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_aa10c2de3293",
      "text": "如果你們好奇村民們的下場，我已經把他們傳送到 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#$^%!^*F^*{^+i^\"}^$z^%T^*{^&Z^!(^\"n^*A^$%^#J^'D^$1^!@^*{^+$^./^!u ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiMkXiUhXipGXip7XitpXiJ9XiR6XiVUXip7XiZaXiEoXiJuXipBXiQlXiNKXidEXiQxXiFAXip7XiskXi4vXiF1IA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4ac1669e80ee",
      "text": "淤泥中了。要是你們帶回了雕像碎片，我就把他們帶回來。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^6c^%d^!,^*D^!\"^(C^,X^*F^*{^#N^\"\\^*D^)^^!`^&o^&1^*A^$%^*J^$1^!@^*{^#N^\"\\^!O^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjZjXiVkXiEsXipEXiEiXihDXixYXipGXip7XiNOXiJcXipEXileXiFgXiZvXiYxXipBXiQlXipKXiQxXiFAXip7XiNOXiJcXiFPXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_21a66310eb25",
      "text": "聽著，我說過讓你們去拿雕像碎片。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-X^-a^*A^$%^-x^(x^-}^*F^*{^\"6^,G^)^^!`^&o^&1^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi1YXi1hXipBXiQlXi14Xih4Xi19XipGXip7XiI2XixHXileXiFgXiZvXiYxXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 49
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_748c52117749",
      "text": "你們身上沒有另一塊碎片！我手上已經有了來自 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^(c^!'^%\\^$s^\">^!%^/Z^&o^&1^*W^$%^$+^!'^#J^'D^$s^*D^!O^'l ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XihjXiEnXiVcXiRzXiI+XiElXi9aXiZvXiYxXipXXiQlXiQrXiEnXiNKXidEXiRzXipEXiFPXidsIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c05cb465af1c",
      "text": "淤泥海的碎片。我還需要蘇蘭蜥蜴人那一塊！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^6c^%d^6`^&Z^&o^&1^!\"^$%^.7^)e^(C^4c^/G^(2^(3^!<^)!^!%^/Z^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjZjXiVkXjZgXiZaXiZvXiYxXiEiXiQlXi43XillXihDXjRjXi9HXigyXigzXiE8XikhXiElXi9aXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_94147266b709",
      "text": "蘇蘭蜥蜴人的碎片。我還需要淤泥海那一塊！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^4c^/G^(2^(3^!<^&Z^&o^&1^!\"^$%^.7^)e^(C^6c^%d^6`^)!^!%^/Z^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjRjXi9HXigyXigzXiE8XiZaXiZvXiYxXiEiXiQlXi43XillXihDXjZjXiVkXjZgXikhXiElXi9aXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1614b9ac827a",
      "text": "快去把它拿來！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*L^\"6^$1^+o^,G^!O^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipMXiI2XiQxXitvXixHXiFPXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 22
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a3b1d66a08e9",
      "text": "往東邊去找蘇蘭蜥蜴人。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,)^,`^.8^\"6^$/^4c^/G^(2^(3^!<^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiwpXixgXi44XiI2XiQvXjRjXi9HXigyXigzXiE8XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_206d2b31053f",
      "text": "往東北方去尋找德魯伊！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,)^,`^+6^$]^\"6^#9^$/^#j^/K^!E^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiwpXixgXis2XiRdXiI2XiM5XiQvXiNqXi9LXiFFXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ce3333219c14",
      "text": "我感應到你們帶了 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^#{^0`^!u^*F^*{^#N^*D ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiN7XjBgXiF1XipGXip7XiNOXipEIA==",
      "byte_length": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a2e4c6ac7e65",
      "text": "淤泥海的碎片。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^6c^%d^6`^&Z^&o^&1^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjZjXiVkXjZgXiZaXiZvXiYxXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 22
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7340bb2fe0f8",
      "text": "蘇蘭蜥蜴人的碎片。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^4c^/G^(2^(3^!<^&Z^&o^&1^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjRjXi9HXigyXigzXiE8XiZaXiZvXiYxXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 28
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0e0854cacb9e",
      "text": "到鎮中心的井邊來找我。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!u^);^!,^#k^&Z^!7^.8^!O^$/^$%^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiF1Xik7XiEsXiNrXiZaXiE3Xi44XiFPXiQvXiQlXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_876579f147b8",
      "text": "我感應到你們身上兩塊碎片都帶齊了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^#{^0`^!u^*F^*{^(c^!'^!i^/Z^&o^&1^)$^#N^36^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiN7XjBgXiF1XipGXip7XihjXiEnXiFpXi9aXiZvXiYxXikkXiNOXjM2XipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a87308e8913d",
      "text": "到鎮中心的井邊來。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!u^);^!,^#k^&Z^!7^.8^!O^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiF1Xik7XiEsXiNrXiZaXiE3Xi44XiFPXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 28
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_141f1a722d90",
      "text": "把碎片 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$1^&o^&1 ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQxXiZvXiYxIA==",
      "byte_length": 10
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3d902d179504",
      "text": "交給我！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^0P^'A^$%^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjBQXidBXiQlXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 13
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d5f1bab8ccdf",
      "text": "交給我！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^0P^'A^$%^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjBQXidBXiQlXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 13
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c95bceb8ac8a",
      "text": "  好吧。兩塊碎片都在這裡了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^+i^*I^!\"^!i^/Z^&o^&1^)$^\"d^(s^-j^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeK2leKkleISJeIWleL1peJm9eJjFeKSReImReKHNeLWpeKkReISIg",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_66e0c2edca20",
      "text": "  這是蘇蘭蜥蜴人的碎片。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^(s^,X^4c^/G^(2^(3^!<^&Z^&o^&1^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKHNeLFheNGNeL0deKDJeKDNeITxeJlpeJm9eJjFeISIg",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_610ef7749828",
      "text": "  這是淤泥海的碎片。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^(s^,X^6c^%d^6`^&Z^&o^&1^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKHNeLFheNmNeJWReNmBeJlpeJm9eJjFeISIg",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cdf769364b91",
      "text": "  休想！你休想得到半塊碎片！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^!G^,1^*W^*F^!G^,1^#e^!u^\"-^/Z^&o^&1^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIUdeLDFeKldeKkZeIUdeLDFeI2VeIXVeIi1eL1peJm9eJjFeKlcg",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a0aa633cd590",
      "text": "  我受夠你的威脅了！納命來吧！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^\";^+d^*F^&Z^#&^1T^*D^*W^';^\"N^!O^*I^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeIjteK2ReKkZeJlpeIyZeMVReKkReKldeJzteIk5eIU9eKkleKlcg",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4fb5e565d41c",
      "text": "太好了！只剩下最後一塊碎片了！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+f^+i^*D^*W^\"?^8U^!(^$q^#b^!%^/Z^&o^&1^*D^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitmXitpXipEXipXXiI/XjhVXiEoXiRxXiNiXiElXi9aXiZvXiYxXipEXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f3f405154013",
      "text": "去找 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"6^$/ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiI2XiQvIA==",
      "byte_length": 7
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ba3732953794",
      "text": "北方的德魯伊 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+6^$]^&Z^#j^/K^!E ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xis2XiRdXiZaXiNqXi9LXiFFIA==",
      "byte_length": 19
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_66b1c351661d",
      "text": "東邊的蘇蘭蜥蜴人 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,`^.8^&Z^4c^/G^(2^(3^!< ",
      "encoded_base64": "XixgXi44XiZaXjRjXi9HXigyXigzXiE8IA==",
      "byte_length": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_64cde39e429d",
      "text": "把那塊碎片取回來！你們回來時我依然會在這裡等候。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$1^)!^/Z^&o^&1^\":^\"\\^!O^*W^*F^*{^\"\\^!O^$f^$%^!Q^&\"^$r^\"d^(s^-j^'-^*|^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQxXikhXi9aXiZvXiYxXiI6XiJcXiFPXipXXipGXip7XiJcXiFPXiRmXiQlXiFRXiYiXiRyXiJkXihzXi1qXictXip8XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3809c65237ed",
      "text": "多謝！我 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"x^-z^*W^$% ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJ4Xi16XipXXiQlIA==",
      "byte_length": 13
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f9575a266870",
      "text": "這就召回村民，並 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^*J^\"@^\"\\^$z^%T^*A^!+ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXipKXiJAXiJcXiR6XiVUXipBXiErIA==",
      "byte_length": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d10df82c8cbb",
      "text": "解除對村莊的心智掌控！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(I^)Q^#:^$z^6l^&Z^#k^$i^$;^$@^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihJXilRXiM6XiR6XjZsXiZaXiNrXiRpXiQ7XiRAXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_68a8563e1f35",
      "text": "恭喜！隊伍獲得 4,000 點經驗值！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^1{^+V^*W^)U^!F^&:^#e 4,000 ^*;^'D^.P^!Z^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjF7XitWXipXXilVXiFGXiY6XiNlIDQsMDAwIF4qO14nRF4uUF4hWl4qVyA=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_721c121ccbee",
      "text": "我向來說話算話，並且信守了我的諾言。現在我給你們一個機會， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^+?^!O^-x^-v^-C^-v^*A^!+^!*^!U^#+^*D^$%^&Z^7k^1Y^!\"^&?^\"d^$%^'A^*F^*{^!%^!V^%>^$r^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXis/XiFPXi14Xi12Xi1DXi12XipBXiErXiEqXiFVXiMrXipEXiQlXiZaXjdrXjFZXiEiXiY/XiJkXiQlXidBXipGXip7XiElXiFWXiU+XiRyXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_742a5287c25e",
      "text": "在一場公平決鬥中將我擊倒。我甚至可以讓你們先出一招。如果 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"d^!%^\"n^3:^0Y^,o^*,^!,^#7^$%^$F^!X^!\"^$%^/|^'n^\"A^!B^-}^*F^*{^!b^!q^!%^,D^!\"^#$^%! ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJkXiElXiJuXjM6XjBZXixvXiosXiEsXiM3XiQlXiRGXiFYXiEiXiQlXi98XiduXiJBXiFCXi19XipGXip7XiFiXiFxXiElXixEXiEiXiMkXiUhIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_29635026a93d",
      "text": "你們對自己微不足道的力量有自信的話，儘管朝我出手吧。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^#:^'l^#I^#i^!)^(^^(y^&Z^!~^)*^$s^'l^!U^&Z^-v^*A^+(^-D^,^^$%^!q^$+^*I^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiM6XidsXiNJXiNpXiEpXiheXih5XiZaXiF+XikqXiRzXidsXiFVXiZaXi12XipBXisoXi1EXixeXiQlXiFxXiQrXipJXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4e8938ddb66c",
      "text": "你太不自量力了， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^+f^!)^'l^)*^!~^*D^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXitmXiEpXidsXikqXiF+XipEXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1039685211e0",
      "text": "小子。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#;^#(^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiM7XiMoXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 10
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_80f164649f67",
      "text": "小姑娘。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#;^:3^5F^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiM7XjozXjVGXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 13
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0a4b0d745b06",
      "text": "惹怒我可不是什麼明智之舉。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^3s^#o^$%^\"A^!)^,X^!=^.T^$c^$i^!/^01^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjNzXiNvXiQlXiJBXiEpXixYXiE9Xi5UXiRjXiRpXiEvXjAxXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 40
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_982ec1424e68",
      "text": "記住，只要你們把兩塊碎片都交給我，我隨時都能救回村民。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(K^*z^*A^\"?^(C^*F^*{^$1^!i^/Z^&o^&1^)$^0P^'A^$%^*A^$%^)X^$f^)$^'b^,Q^\"\\^$z^%T^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihLXip6XipBXiI/XihDXipGXip7XiQxXiFpXi9aXiZvXiYxXikkXjBQXidBXiQlXipBXiQlXilYXiRmXikkXidiXixRXiJcXiR6XiVUXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_58dbbd808dfe",
      "text": "我隨時都能取那些村民的性命。別惹怒我。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^)X^$f^)$^'b^\":^)!^!8^$z^%T^&Z^#r^\"N^!\"^*H^3s^#o^$%^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXilYXiRmXikkXidiXiI6XikhXiE4XiR6XiVUXiZaXiNyXiJOXiEiXipIXjNzXiNvXiQlXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_681825cabd01",
      "text": "那就這樣吧！我對你們已經仁至義盡了！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^*J^(s^,f^*I^*W^$%^#:^*F^*{^#J^'D^37^'n^2<^-1^*D^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXipKXihzXixmXipJXipXXiQlXiM6XipGXip7XiNKXidEXjM3XiduXjI8Xi0xXipEXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fed453d47a7d",
      "text": "我這就把這座村莊打入淤泥之中！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^(s^*J^$1^(s^/_^$z^6l^$-^!f^6c^%d^!/^!,^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXihzXipKXiQxXihzXi9fXiR6XjZsXiQtXiFmXjZjXiVkXiEvXiEsXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_dd31d4c19785",
      "text": "像你把村莊打入深淵那樣，自己跳下去吧！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!`^*F^$1^$z^6l^$-^!f^2*^<m^)!^,f^*A^'l^#I^0@^!(^\"6^*I^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFgXipGXiQxXiR6XjZsXiQtXiFmXjIqXjxtXikhXixmXipBXidsXiNJXjBAXiEoXiI2XipJXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9d1a9ee3a92b",
      "text": "迎戰我吧，小毛孩們！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(k^$(^$%^*I^*A^#;^%R^+m^*{^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihrXiQoXiQlXipJXipBXiM7XiVSXittXip7XipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 31
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3df4209e194a",
      "text": "當威米亞斯倒下時，一聲淒厲的尖叫迴盪在整個村莊！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&N^#&^'4^!9^$[^!X^!(^$f^*A^!%^-W^,t^+:^&Z^#=^+<^0D^0\"^\"d^$T^!V^$z^6l^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZOXiMmXic0XiE5XiRbXiFYXiEoXiRmXipBXiElXi1XXix0Xis6XiZaXiM9Xis8XjBEXjAiXiJkXiRUXiFWXiR6XjZsXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2dd4420080fb",
      "text": "當雕像倒塌時，它轟然炸裂，將無數碎片激射 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&N^)^^!`^!X^<f^$f^*A^+o^.y^&\"^%z^8r^*A^#7^%}^$V^&o^&1^1H^#6 ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZOXileXiFgXiFYXjxmXiRmXipBXitvXi55XiYiXiV6XjhyXipBXiM3XiV9XiRWXiZvXiYxXjFIXiM2IA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_06054dc5048e",
      "text": "飛向遠方！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)z^+?^({^$]^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "Xil6Xis/Xih7XiRdXipX",
      "byte_length": 15
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1a3385547741",
      "text": "蠢貨！我給予你們充裕的考慮時間，你們竟然不領情！那就這樣吧！你們 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.u^.w^*W^$%^'A^!4^*F^*{^5.^8Q^&Z^-R^19^$f^)G^*A^*F^*{^28^&\"^!)^)s^,0^*W^)!^*J^(s^,f^*I^*W^*F^*{ ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi51Xi53XipXXiQlXidBXiE0XipGXip7XjUuXjhRXiZaXi1SXjE5XiRmXilHXipBXipGXip7XjI4XiYiXiEpXilzXiwwXipXXikhXipKXihzXixmXipJXipXXipGXip7IA==",
      "byte_length": 97
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_66fc1bae9b94",
      "text": "今日必死無疑！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*E^$a^#l^%L^%}^0p^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipFXiRhXiNsXiVMXiV9XjBwXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 22
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2b34f96a8231",
      "text": "當威米亞斯倒下時，雕像竟然動了！它蜿蜒滑下了石台。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&N^#&^'4^!9^$[^!X^!(^$f^*A^)^^!`^28^&\"^\"%^*D^*W^+o^6q^6p^%u^!(^*D^&k^\"B^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZOXiMmXic0XiE5XiRbXiFYXiEoXiRmXipBXileXiFgXjI4XiYiXiIlXipEXipXXitvXjZxXjZwXiV1XiEoXipEXiZrXiJCXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b0c40a13543f",
      "text": "此刻矗立在你們面前的生物高達七英尺，由活體巨石塑成。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%I^.Y^<q^0'^\"d^*F^*{^)j^!z^&Z^&F^&4^*+^(z^<2^'y^<;^*A^&I^%i^**^#H^&k^1s^$$^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVJXi5ZXjxxXjAnXiJkXipGXip7XilqXiF6XiZaXiZGXiY0XiorXih6XjwyXid5Xjw7XipBXiZJXiVpXioqXiNIXiZrXjFzXiQkXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2794cfbb818e",
      "text": "憑藉著你們的魔法感應，那尊雕像散發出的刺鼻黑魔法惡臭 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,5^04^-a^*F^*{^&Z^*0^%b^#{^0`^*A^)!^+u^)^^!`^$S^&W^!q^&Z^!w^4q^*:^*0^%b^#y^'m ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xiw1XjA0Xi1hXipGXip7XiZaXiowXiViXiN7XjBgXipBXikhXit1XileXiFgXiRTXiZXXiFxXiZaXiF3XjRxXio6XiowXiViXiN5XidtIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_aa490655e7ff",
      "text": "幾乎令你們當場窒息倒地。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#T^!0^*w^*F^*{^&N^\"n^:~^#w^!X^\"e^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNUXiEwXip3XipGXip7XiZOXiJuXjp+XiN3XiFYXiJlXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 37
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_26b00341f6ab",
      "text": "雖然你們沒有魔法感應天賦，但你們依然能深切感受到 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.A^&\"^*F^*{^%\\^$s^*0^%b^#{^0`^+e^(Y^*A^!I^*F^*{^!Q^&\"^'b^2*^+.^#{^\";^!u ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi5BXiYiXipGXip7XiVcXiRzXiowXiViXiN7XjBgXitlXihZXipBXiFJXipGXip7XiFRXiYiXidiXjIqXisuXiN7XiI7XiF1IA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_055d95a1dfd1",
      "text": "從這東西身上散發出的陣陣邪惡魔法波動。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#f^(s^,`^-l^(c^!'^$S^&W^!q^&Z^)P^)P^)\"^#y^*0^%b^%c^\"%^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNmXihzXixgXi1sXihjXiEnXiRTXiZXXiFxXiZaXilQXilQXikiXiN5XiowXiViXiVjXiIlXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ced36e2b589a",
      "text": "顯而易見，這絕對是你們最好避之不及的恐怖之物。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^4&^'W^,W^-m^*A^(s^-I^#:^,X^*F^*{^$q^+i^0F^!/^!)^\"7^&Z^#t^#p^!/^&4^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjQmXidXXixXXi1tXipBXihzXi1JXiM6XixYXipGXip7XiRxXitpXjBGXiEvXiEpXiI3XiZaXiN0XiNwXiEvXiY0XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_15bd2dc06e93",
      "text": "我已成就了我的天命！我的死亡將我推向了超越你們想像的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^#J^$$^*J^*D^$%^&Z^+e^\"N^*W^$%^&Z^%L^!:^#7^$%^,J^+?^*D^(\\^(]^*F^*{^,1^!`^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiNKXiQkXipKXipEXiQlXiZaXitlXiJOXipXXiQlXiZaXiVMXiE6XiM3XiQlXixKXis/XipEXihcXihdXipGXip7XiwxXiFgXiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d368803e5f38",
      "text": "無上偉力。多謝你們賜予我痛快的死亡，並為我帶來我所需的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%}^!'^*}^!~^!\"^\"x^-z^*F^*{^.#^!4^$%^-.^*L^&Z^%L^!:^*A^!+^%{^$%^#N^!O^$%^$)^)e^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiV9XiEnXip9XiF+XiEiXiJ4Xi16XipGXip7Xi4jXiE0XiQlXi0uXipMXiZaXiVMXiE6XipBXiErXiV7XiQlXiNOXiFPXiQlXiQpXillXiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5c004a2aa928",
      "text": "雕像碎片。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)^^!`^&o^&1^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XileXiFgXiZvXiYxXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 16
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2bedef32a3f4",
      "text": "你們根本不知道自己啟動了何等浩瀚的序幕——一個屬於阿塔斯的全新時代！——將在我的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^%)^$x^!)^&h^(y^'l^#I^57^\"%^*D^!L^'-^5^^9F^&Z^;-^#Q^*n^*n^!%^!V^#C^$^^)M^\"o^$[^&Z^!h^$\\^$f^*v^*W^*n^*n^#7^\"d^$%^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiUpXiR4XiEpXiZoXih5XidsXiNJXjU3XiIlXipEXiFMXictXjVeXjlGXiZaXjstXiNRXipuXipuXiElXiFWXiNDXiReXilNXiJvXiRbXiZaXiFoXiRcXiRmXip2XipXXipuXipuXiM3XiJkXiQlXiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 121
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_68bb55783477",
      "text": "號令之下開啟！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(-^*w^!/^!(^)F^57^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XigtXip3XiEvXiEoXilGXjU3XipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 22
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_74797978b6b4",
      "text": "看在你們助我一臂之力的份上，我暫且饒你們一命，但我警告你們——若我們日後 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*Q^\"d^*F^*{^\"#^$%^!%^'k^!/^!~^&Z^*x^!'^*A^$%^$l^!*^.M^*F^*{^!%^\"N^*A^!I^$%^(S^+B^*F^*{^*n^*n^'x^$%^*{^$a^#b ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipRXiJkXipGXip7XiIjXiQlXiElXidrXiEvXiF+XiZaXip4XiEnXipBXiQlXiRsXiEqXi5NXipGXip7XiElXiJOXipBXiFJXiQlXihTXitCXipGXip7XipuXipuXid4XiQlXip7XiRhXiNiIA==",
      "byte_length": 109
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bcef9262a316",
      "text": "狹路相逢，你們必死無疑。我給你們時間接受這個命運。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^9#^(a^&a^7K^*A^*F^*{^#l^%L^%}^0p^!\"^$%^'A^*F^*{^$f^)G^$?^\";^(s^!V^\"N^.4^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjkjXihhXiZhXjdLXipBXipGXip7XiNsXiVMXiV9XjBwXiEiXiQlXidBXipGXip7XiRmXilHXiQ/XiI7XihzXiFWXiJOXi40XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_79785b05ae8f",
      "text": "我現在必須啟程去征服整個阿塔斯了！準備迎接我們重逢的那一天吧—— ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^&?^\"d^#l^)r^57^'#^\"6^.c^,\\^$T^!V^)M^\"o^$[^*D^*W^,x^+\"^(k^$?^$%^*{^))^7K^&Z^)!^!%^+e^*I^*n^*n ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiY/XiJkXiNsXilyXjU3XicjXiI2Xi5jXixcXiRUXiFWXilNXiJvXiRbXipEXipXXix4XisiXihrXiQ/XiQlXip7XikpXjdLXiZaXikhXiElXitlXipJXipuXipuIA==",
      "byte_length": 97
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4067f8ce82a7",
      "text": "準備受死吧！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,x^+\"^\";^%L^*I^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xix4XisiXiI7XiVMXipJXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 19
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ce05226fd2e2",
      "text": "永別了——暫時如此。好好珍惜你們有限的光陰吧，因為它短暫如朝露。我們 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%W^*H^*D^*n^*n^$l^$f^#$^%I^!\"^+i^+i^/7^7X^*F^*{^$s^)O^&Z^!c^6B^*I^*A^\"]^%{^+o^&i^$l^#$^,^^.B^!\"^$%^*{ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVXXipIXipEXipuXipuXiRsXiRmXiMkXiVJXiEiXitpXitpXi83XjdYXipGXip7XiRzXilPXiZaXiFjXjZCXipJXipBXiJdXiV7XitvXiZpXiRsXiMkXixeXi5CXiEiXiQlXip7IA==",
      "byte_length": 103
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2d544709b278",
      "text": "終將重逢，而你們必死無疑。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-H^#7^))^7K^*A^'W^*F^*{^#l^%L^%}^0p^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi1IXiM3XikpXjdLXipBXidXXipGXip7XiNsXiVMXiV9XjBwXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 40
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_aad49f711d6d",
      "text": "威米亞斯離開了這個區域。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#&^'4^!9^$[^)`^)F^*D^(s^!V^\"+^\"k^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiMmXic0XiE5XiRbXilgXilGXipEXihzXiFWXiIrXiJrXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 37
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d4521a781dab",
      "text": "向你們致敬，勇士們！歡迎回到蓋德隆。在接下來的好一陣子裡，我們 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+?^*F^*{^'o^*O^*A^\"$^+a^*{^*W^%F^(k^\"\\^!u^-d^#j^)T^!\"^\"d^$?^!(^!O^&Z^+i^!%^)P^#(^-j^*A^$%^*{ ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xis/XipGXip7XidvXipPXipBXiIkXithXip7XipXXiVGXihrXiJcXiF1Xi1kXiNqXilUXiEiXiJkXiQ/XiEoXiFPXiZaXitpXiElXilQXiMoXi1qXipBXiQlXip7IA==",
      "byte_length": 94
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4ce377a2db7c",
      "text": "得忙著照料傷患，但你們將我們徹底從德拉吉的陰影中 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#e^,+^-a^/x^/n^!^^;Q^*A^!I^*F^*{^#7^$%^*{^18^/^^#f^#j^$6^\"D^&Z^6B^#a^!, ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNlXiwrXi1hXi94Xi9uXiFeXjtRXipBXiFJXipGXip7XiM3XiQlXip7XjE4Xi9eXiNmXiNqXiQ2XiJEXiZaXjZCXiNhXiEsIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_64efa281c77f",
      "text": "解救了出來！我們真是感激不盡！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(I^,Q^*D^!q^!O^*W^$%^*{^-2^,X^#{^1H^!)^-1^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihJXixRXipEXiFxXiFPXipXXiQlXip7Xi0yXixYXiN7XjFIXiEpXi0xXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_eb2ec68a2f7d",
      "text": "很高興見到你們。有你們在村子裡，這裡安全多了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*K^*+^-]^-m^!u^*F^*{^!\"^$s^*F^*{^\"d^$z^#(^-j^*A^(s^-j^+p^!h^\"x^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipLXiorXi1dXi1tXiF1XipGXip7XiEiXiRzXipGXip7XiJkXiR6XiMoXi1qXipBXihzXi1qXitwXiFoXiJ4XipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 69
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_28ebc9fae36a",
      "text": "  很高興看見這裡有人站崗警戒。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*K^*+^-]^*Q^-m^(s^-j^$s^!<^->^#F^(S^$&^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkteKiteLV1eKlFeLW1eKHNeLWpeJHNeITxeLT5eI0ZeKFNeJCZeISI=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6d1ba705be5f",
      "text": "  很高興看見你們重返崗位。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*K^*+^-]^*Q^-m^*F^*{^))^7J^#F^!J^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkteKiteLV1eKlFeLW1eKkZeKnteKSleN0peI0ZeIUpeISI=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ecb75d6bf09d",
      "text": "  村莊目前的情況如何？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$z^6l^&^^!z^&Z^,0^,q^#$^!L^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJHpeNmxeJl5eIXpeJlpeLDBeLHFeIyReIUxeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9d1b12904534",
      "text": "  村民們現在怎麼樣了？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$z^%T^*{^&?^\"d^,,^.T^,f^*D^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJHpeJVReKnteJj9eImReLCxeLlReLGZeKkReLlY=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_26d6b35466ae",
      "text": "  村長現在好些了嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$z^)C^&?^\"d^+i^!8^*D^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJHpeKUNeJj9eImReK2leITheKkReK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b24a66f498c9",
      "text": "  莉娜拉現在好嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^'{^/*^$6^&?^\"d^+i^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJ3teLypeJDZeJj9eImReK2leK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_621ea98155f3",
      "text": "我們所有人都認得你們。蓋德隆村欠你們天大的恩情。你們 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^$)^$s^!<^)$^(O^#e^*F^*{^!\"^-d^#j^)T^$z^,g^*F^*{^+e^\"z^&Z^#v^,0^!\"^*F^*{ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7XiQpXiRzXiE8XikkXihPXiNlXipGXip7XiEiXi1kXiNqXilUXiR6XixnXipGXip7XitlXiJ6XiZaXiN2XiwwXiEiXipGXip7IA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3da7ccb747aa",
      "text": "幫了我們極大的忙， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+}^*D^$%^*{^1D^\"z^&Z^,+^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xit9XipEXiQlXip7XjFEXiJ6XiZaXiwrXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 28
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0847f6eaa573",
      "text": "我們如今能重返崗位守衛城鎮，全都是拜你們所賜。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^#$^*E^'b^))^7J^#F^!J^#+^(=^+_^);^*A^!h^)$^,X^,E^*F^*{^$)^.#^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7XiMkXipFXidiXikpXjdKXiNGXiFKXiMrXig9XitfXik7XipBXiFoXikkXixYXixFXipGXip7XiQpXi4jXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a4caf17eb280",
      "text": "我想我們根本無以為報。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^,1^$%^*{^%)^$x^%}^!B^%{^+`^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiwxXiQlXip7XiUpXiR4XiV9XiFCXiV7XitgXiEi",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e7d1ac80362e",
      "text": "能再次重返故土真是太好了。謝謝你們所做的一切。現在 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'b^!l^%D^))^7J^5U^\"c^-2^,X^+f^+i^*D^!\"^-z^-z^*F^*{^$)^*~^&Z^!%^+.^!\"^&?^\"d ",
      "encoded_base64": "XidiXiFsXiVEXikpXjdKXjVVXiJjXi0yXixYXitmXitpXipEXiEiXi16Xi16XipGXip7XiQpXip+XiZaXiElXisuXiEiXiY/XiJkIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d928868bd4fb",
      "text": "我們可以好好守衛村莊，防止像威米亞斯那樣的惡徒再次作亂了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^\"A^!B^+i^+i^#+^(=^$z^6l^*A^)K^%G^!`^#&^'4^!9^$[^)!^,f^&Z^#y^#d^!l^%D^!M^!3^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7XiJBXiFCXitpXitpXiMrXig9XiR6XjZsXipBXilLXiVHXiFgXiMmXic0XiE5XiRbXikhXixmXiZaXiN5XiNkXiFsXiVEXiFNXiEzXipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 87
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_64c3e816eaf8",
      "text": "自從你們替我們除掉威米亞斯後，這裡變得格外平靜祥和。如今 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'l^#f^*F^*{^2o^$%^*{^)Q^/e^#&^'4^!9^$[^#b^*A^(s^-j^(U^#e^%*^\"w^0Y^)h^9H^\"O^!\"^#$^*E ",
      "encoded_base64": "XidsXiNmXipGXip7XjJvXiQlXip7XilRXi9lXiMmXic0XiE5XiRbXiNiXipBXihzXi1qXihVXiNlXiUqXiJ3XjBZXiloXjlIXiJPXiEiXiMkXipFIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_45bac830ec78",
      "text": "他的殘暴統治已經結束，我們正在建立更強固的防禦工事，確保 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^&Z^,l^$m^'B^%_^#J^'D^'@^$|^*A^$%^*{^%H^\"d^,'^0'^$o^#]^3>^&Z^)K^&{^+y^*r^*A^-6^!T ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXiZaXixsXiRtXidCXiVfXiNKXidEXidAXiR8XipBXiQlXip7XiVIXiJkXiwnXjAnXiRvXiNdXjM+XiZaXilLXiZ7Xit5XipyXipBXi02XiFUIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_46f8391979b0",
      "text": "類似的慘劇絕不會再次重演。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)w^!H^&Z^,4^1#^-I^!)^$r^!l^%D^))^1G^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xil3XiFIXiZaXiw0XjEjXi1JXiEpXiRyXiFsXiVEXikpXjFHXiEi",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_78cce6a3bbe7",
      "text": "村民們依然在休養恢復中。對他們而言，要接受自己的身體 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$z^%T^*{^!Q^&\"^\"d^!G^.I^#u^#g^!,^!\"^#:^!@^*{^'W^1Y^*A^(C^$?^\";^'l^#I^&Z^(c^** ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiR6XiVUXip7XiFRXiYiXiJkXiFHXi5JXiN1XiNnXiEsXiEiXiM6XiFAXip7XidXXjFZXipBXihDXiQ/XiI7XidsXiNJXiZaXihjXioqIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6414edc7c01c",
      "text": "曾被他人操弄控制的事實實在太難了。他們當中的大多數人 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.j^(@^!@^!<^$H^/`^$@^!v^&Z^*r^#3^#3^\"d^+f^)a^*D^!\"^!@^*{^&N^!,^&Z^\"z^\"x^$V^!< ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi5qXihAXiFAXiE8XiRIXi9gXiRAXiF2XiZaXipyXiMzXiMzXiJkXitmXilhXipEXiEiXiFAXip7XiZOXiEsXiZaXiJ6XiJ4XiRWXiE8IA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4880b89fff8e",
      "text": "根本無法理解魔法是怎麼一回事。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%)^$x^%}^%b^&A^(I^*0^%b^,X^,,^.T^!%^\"\\^*r^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiUpXiR4XiV9XiViXiZBXihJXiowXiViXixYXiwsXi5UXiElXiJcXipyXiEi",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_304ac5779a6e",
      "text": "村長哪怕身體依然虛弱，也一直在不知疲倦地督導加固 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$z^)C^+I^0^^(c^**^!Q^&\"^-g^#\\^*A^!1^!%^&`^\"d^!)^&h^88^;(^\"e^<x^10^\"\"^3> ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiR6XilDXitJXjBeXihjXioqXiFRXiYiXi1nXiNcXipBXiExXiElXiZgXiJkXiEpXiZoXjg4XjsoXiJlXjx4XjEwXiIiXjM+IA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f75814fc07ca",
      "text": "村莊的防禦。我看他已經有好長一段時間沒合眼睡覺了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$z^6l^&Z^)K^&{^!\"^$%^*Q^!@^#J^'D^$s^+i^)C^!%^.l^$f^)G^%\\^\"C^&d^-3^(G^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiR6XjZsXiZaXilLXiZ7XiEiXiQlXipRXiFAXiNKXidEXiRzXitpXilDXiElXi5sXiRmXilHXiVcXiJDXiZkXi0zXihHXipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4ba36d2afa07",
      "text": "就像我們其他人一樣，他絕不想再看到第二起『威米亞斯事件』。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*J^!`^$%^*{^!j^!@^!<^!%^,f^*A^!@^-I^!)^,1^!l^*Q^!u^',^!5^.(^<_^#&^'4^!9^$[^*r^.W^<`^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipKXiFgXiQlXip7XiFqXiFAXiE8XiElXixmXipBXiFAXi1JXiEpXiwxXiFsXipRXiF1XicsXiE1Xi4oXjxfXiMmXic0XiE5XiRbXipyXi5XXjxgXiEi",
      "byte_length": 87
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bc66d6ec2dc3",
      "text": "莉娜拉毫無疑問是全村裡最忙碌的人。自從威米亞斯解除了 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'{^/*^$6^/t^%}^0p^*Z^,X^!h^$z^-j^$q^,+^<y^&Z^!<^!\"^'l^#f^#&^'4^!9^$[^(I^)Q^*D ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xid7Xi8qXiQ2Xi90XiV9XjBwXipaXixYXiFoXiR6Xi1qXiRxXiwrXjx5XiZaXiE8XiEiXidsXiNmXiMmXic0XiE5XiRbXihJXilRXipEIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2fe0b3bd6945",
      "text": "他的法術後，她便一直在悉心照料大家。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^&Z^%b^(<^#b^*A^+h^!R^!%^&`^\"d^2h^#k^/x^/n^\"z^+s^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXiZaXiViXig8XiNiXipBXitoXiFSXiElXiZgXiJkXjJoXiNrXi94Xi9uXiJ6XitzXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4b084cb64992",
      "text": "威米亞斯的邪術先前讓村民們根本無法自理生活。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#&^'4^!9^$[^&Z^)\"^(<^!b^!z^-}^$z^%T^*{^%)^$x^%}^%b^'l^&A^&F^%i^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiMmXic0XiE5XiRbXiZaXikiXig8XiFiXiF6Xi19XiR6XiVUXip7XiUpXiR4XiV9XiViXidsXiZBXiZGXiVpXiEi",
      "byte_length": 66
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4ffdd152690c",
      "text": "希望你們在村子裡能住得舒心愜意。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+{^,]^*F^*{^\"d^$z^#(^-j^'b^*z^#e^</^#k^<v^#z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xit7XixdXipGXip7XiJkXiR6XiMoXi1qXidiXip6XiNlXjwvXiNrXjx2XiN6XiEi",
      "byte_length": 48
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5e3151e4e443",
      "text": "如果你們現在離開村莊，我就殺光所有村民！你們休想離開！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#$^%!^*F^*{^&?^\"d^)`^)F^$z^6l^*A^$%^*J^%M^!c^$)^$s^$z^%T^*W^*F^*{^!G^,1^)`^)F^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiMkXiUhXipGXip7XiY/XiJkXilgXilGXiR6XjZsXipBXiQlXipKXiVNXiFjXiQpXiRzXiR6XiVUXipXXipGXip7XiFHXiwxXilgXilGXipX",
      "byte_length": 81
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_52b198fed0a5",
      "text": "休想擅自離開村莊！我絕不允許！我已經向你們發出挑戰， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!G^,1^2$^'l^)`^)F^$z^6l^*W^$%^-I^!)^/\"^-s^*W^$%^#J^'D^+?^*F^*{^&W^!q^,H^$(^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFHXiwxXjIkXidsXilgXilGXiR6XjZsXipXXiQlXi1JXiEpXi8iXi1zXipXXiQlXiNKXidEXis/XipGXip7XiZXXiFxXixIXiQoXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_837dbc7cf122",
      "text": "你們必須迎戰！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^#l^)r^(k^$(^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiNsXilyXihrXiQoXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 22
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_324219673150",
      "text": "我說過我絕不會讓你們離開！迎戰我吧，懦夫們！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^-x^(x^$%^-I^!)^$r^-}^*F^*{^)`^)F^*W^(k^$(^$%^*I^*A^,7^\"{^*{^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXi14Xih4XiQlXi1JXiEpXiRyXi19XipGXip7XilgXilGXipXXihrXiQoXiQlXipJXipBXiw3XiJ7Xip7XipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e6ecb9e7b0a9",
      "text": "我察覺到了你們的魔法波動，我現在警告你們，要是敢離開這個區域，我就把所有的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^#2^(G^!u^*D^*F^*{^&Z^*0^%b^%c^\"%^*A^$%^&?^\"d^(S^+B^*F^*{^*A^(C^,X^/m^)`^)F^(s^!V^\"+^\"k^*A^$%^*J^$1^$)^$s^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiMyXihHXiF1XipEXipGXip7XiZaXiowXiViXiVjXiIlXipBXiQlXiY/XiJkXihTXitCXipGXip7XipBXihDXixYXi9tXilgXilGXihzXiFWXiIrXiJrXipBXiQlXipKXiQxXiQpXiRzXiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 112
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_80786f7afcd6",
      "text": "村民全都殺光！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$z^%T^!h^)$^%M^!c^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiR6XiVUXiFoXikkXiVNXiFjXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 22
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_37a636e35892",
      "text": "仍要執意離開嗎？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!?^(C^3?^#z^)`^)F^+X^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiE/XihDXjM/XiN6XilgXilGXitYXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d69754abd8e2",
      "text": "你們哪裡也別想去！直面我吧！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^+I^-j^!1^*H^,1^\"6^*W^&`^)j^$%^*I^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XitJXi1qXiExXipIXiwxXiI2XipXXiZgXilqXiQlXipJXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 43
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b6854a43ccf7",
      "text": "每名隊員",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%P^\"F^)U^+G",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVQXiJGXilVXitH",
      "byte_length": 12
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e9a4ca0b82e1",
      "text": "這是你們的戰鬥，不是我的。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^,X^*F^*{^&Z^$(^*,^*A^!)^,X^$%^&Z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXixYXipGXip7XiZaXiQoXiosXipBXiEpXixYXiQlXiZaXiEi",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6dd534c7e047",
      "text": "別把我牽扯進去！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*H^$1^$%^5e^.e^(w^\"6^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XipIXiQxXiQlXjVlXi5lXih3XiI2XipX",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_29160683dbc4",
      "text": "嘿！我只是個無辜的旁觀者。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+\\^*W^$%^\"?^,X^!V^%}^66^&Z^.h^*R^'V^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XitcXipXXiQlXiI/XixYXiFWXiV9XjY2XiZaXi5oXipSXidWXiEi",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5801174cf22b",
      "text": "我跟這場戰鬥毫無關係，而且我打算繼續置身事外。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^.+^(s^\"n^$(^*,^/t^%}^.>^38^*A^'W^!*^$%^$-^-C^-O^'M^'Q^(c^*r^\"w^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXi4rXihzXiJuXiQoXiosXi90XiV9Xi4+XjM4XipBXidXXiEqXiQlXiQtXi1DXi1PXidNXidRXihjXipyXiJ3XiEi",
      "byte_length": 69
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0324eca76d27",
      "text": "你們得自己動手去殺！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^#e^'l^#I^\"%^$+^\"6^%M^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiNlXidsXiNJXiIlXiQrXiI2XiVNXipX",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cc25ef240c25",
      "text": "我現在正忙著呢！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^&?^\"d^%H^,+^-a^+C^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiY/XiJkXiVIXiwrXi1hXitDXipX",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c6d7aa2381ee",
      "text": "要是光坐在那裡嚼舌根，你們會送命的！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(C^,X^!c^8E^\"d^)!^-j^5:^'q^%)^*A^*F^*{^$r^./^\"N^&Z^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XihDXixYXiFjXjhFXiJkXikhXi1qXjU6XidxXiUpXipBXipGXip7XiRyXi4vXiJOXiZaXipX",
      "byte_length": 54
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c9c209b5aac7",
      "text": "把這些坎克蟲全宰了！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$1^(s^!8^/%^!d^(8^!h^1w^*D^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQxXihzXiE4Xi8lXiFkXig4XiFoXjF3XipEXipX",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e278bf519784",
      "text": "沒什麼比稍微活動筋骨更能讓人熱血沸騰的了，是吧？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%\\^!=^.T^,m^-:^#i^%i^\"%^<C^*$^$o^'b^-}^!<^&$^(:^5\\^.O^&Z^*D^*A^,X^*I^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVcXiE9Xi5UXixtXi06XiNpXiVpXiIlXjxDXiokXiRvXidiXi19XiE8XiYkXig6XjVcXi5PXiZaXipEXipBXixYXipJXi5W",
      "byte_length": 72
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_84858d6b23cb",
      "text": "別光愣在那裡！你們要是不做點什麼，我們大家全都會沒命的！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*H^!c^<w^\"d^)!^-j^*W^*F^*{^(C^,X^!)^*~^*;^!=^.T^*A^$%^*{^\"z^+s^!h^)$^$r^%\\^\"N^&Z^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XipIXiFjXjx3XiJkXikhXi1qXipXXipGXip7XihDXixYXiEpXip+Xio7XiE9Xi5UXipBXiQlXip7XiJ6XitzXiFoXikkXiRyXiVcXiJOXiZaXipX",
      "byte_length": 84
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d3f936a57b34",
      "text": "是時候讓這群軟體蛞蝓見識一下什麼才是真正的戰鬥了！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,X^$f^*|^-}^(s^'R^.x^**^<z^<{^-m^(R^!%^!(^!=^.T^$,^,X^-2^%H^&Z^$(^*,^*D^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XixYXiRmXip8Xi19XihzXidSXi54XioqXjx6Xjx7Xi1tXihSXiElXiEoXiE9Xi5UXiQsXixYXi0yXiVIXiZaXiQoXiosXipEXipX",
      "byte_length": 75
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ac617fdf1c5b",
      "text": "沒時間廢話了——動手大開殺戒吧！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%\\^$f^)G^#W^-v^*D^*n^*n^\"%^$+^\"z^)F^%M^$&^*I^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVcXiRmXilHXiNXXi12XipEXipuXipuXiIlXiQrXiJ6XilGXiVNXiQmXipJXipX",
      "byte_length": 48
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ec48b2345945",
      "text": "受死吧，滿嘴坎克蟲臭氣的混蛋！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\";^%L^*I^*A^,{^+[^/%^!d^(8^'m^%U^&Z^%n^6\"^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiI7XiVMXipJXipBXix7XitbXi8lXiFkXig4XidtXiVVXiZaXiVuXjYiXipX",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8829ab3db3f1",
      "text": "我從不跟死人說話！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^#f^!)^.+^%L^!<^-x^-v^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiNmXiEpXi4rXiVMXiE8Xi14Xi12XipX",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2e1ff916ab24",
      "text": "你們休想靠動動嘴皮子就蒙混過關！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^!G^,1^.C^\"%^\"%^+[^&[^#(^*J^-c^%n^(x^.>^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiFHXiwxXi5DXiIlXiIlXitbXiZbXiMoXipKXi1jXiVuXih4Xi4+XipX",
      "byte_length": 48
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7cdb8de16fa9",
      "text": "今天你們注定要成為烏鴉的美餐！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*E^+e^*F^*{^%e^#.^(C^$$^%{^/4^<|^&Z^-P^.K^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XipFXitlXipGXip7XiVlXiMuXihDXiQkXiV7Xi80Xjx8XiZaXi1QXi5LXipX",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3527a0f70be4",
      "text": "今天你們的碎骨將鋪滿這片荒土，斯利格怪的孽種！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*E^+e^*F^*{^&Z^&o^*$^#7^<1^,{^(s^&1^1W^\"c^*A^$[^!t^%*^#s^&Z^5I^'$^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XipFXitlXipGXip7XiZaXiZvXiokXiM3XjwxXix7XihzXiYxXjFXXiJjXipBXiRbXiF0XiUqXiNzXiZaXjVJXickXipX",
      "byte_length": 69
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1f004a058c0f",
      "text": "你要是再敢對我耍嘴皮子，我就把你舌頭割下來！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^(C^,X^!l^/m^#:^$%^7E^+[^&[^#(^*A^$%^*J^$1^*F^'q^)t^+1^!(^!O^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXihDXixYXiFsXi9tXiM6XiQlXjdFXitbXiZbXiMoXipBXiQlXipKXiQxXipGXidxXil0XisxXiEoXiFPXipX",
      "byte_length": 66
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0f7fb2ea3297",
      "text": "我該怎麼宰了你呢？讓我好好盤算盤算！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^(M^,,^.T^1w^*D^*F^+C^.V^-}^$%^+i^+i^1M^-C^1M^-C^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXihNXiwsXi5UXjF3XipEXipGXitDXi5WXi19XiQlXitpXitpXjFNXi1DXjFNXi1DXipX",
      "byte_length": 54
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_420f573543a9",
      "text": "奴隸向你們揮了揮手並繼續前行，臉上帶著堅毅決絕的神情。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^##^)Z^+?^*F^*{^2\"^*D^2\"^$+^!+^-O^'M^!z^(;^*A^-\\^!'^#N^-a^\"l^%O^,o^-I^&Z^&w^,0^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiMjXilaXis/XipGXip7XjIiXipEXjIiXiQrXiErXi1PXidNXiF6Xig7XipBXi1cXiEnXiNOXi1hXiJsXiVPXixvXi1JXiZaXiZ3XiwwXiEi",
      "byte_length": 81
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_eb47efb08a5c",
      "text": "謝謝你們！我還以為自己這輩子再也不能說話了！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-z^-z^*F^*{^*W^$%^.7^!B^%{^'l^#I^(s^8t^#(^!l^!1^!)^'b^-x^-v^*D^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi16Xi16XipGXip7XipXXiQlXi43XiFCXiV7XidsXiNJXihzXjh0XiMoXiFsXiExXiEpXidiXi14Xi12XipEXipX",
      "byte_length": 66
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3961772e2cd6",
      "text": "我必須獨自入內。請在這裡等我。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^#l^)r^/z^'l^!f^!g^!\"^*S^\"d^(s^-j^'-^$%^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiNsXilyXi96XidsXiFmXiFnXiEiXipTXiJkXihzXi1qXictXiQlXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d207a4316ad0",
      "text": "治療室中傳出了一陣聲音，聽起來隱約像是 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%_^&U^+r^!,^+$^!q^*D^!%^)P^-W^34^*A^-X^.(^!O^)Y^-F^!`^,X ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVfXiZVXityXiEsXiskXiFxXipEXiElXilQXi1XXjM0XipBXi1YXi4oXiFPXilZXi1GXiFgXixYIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_183db8235c2a",
      "text": "泰內利夫的聲音：",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%f^!g^!t^\"{^&Z^-W^34^*B",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVmXiFnXiF0XiJ7XiZaXi1XXjM0XipC",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b92cf36b6046",
      "text": "進來吧，旅者們。進來治癒你們一身的所有創傷與疾病。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(w^!O^*I^*A^2m^'V^*{^!\"^(w^!O^%_^&V^*F^*{^!%^(c^&Z^$)^$s^!{^!^^'p^&Q^&R^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xih3XiFPXipJXipBXjJtXidWXip7XiEiXih3XiFPXiVfXiZWXipGXip7XiElXihjXiZaXiQpXiRzXiF7XiFeXidwXiZRXiZSXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b4cf7c6f1f6a",
      "text": "請離開房間，好讓我能夠接受治療。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*S^)`^)F^,<^)G^*A^+i^-}^$%^'b^+d^$?^\";^%_^&U^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipTXilgXilGXiw8XilHXipBXitpXi19XiQlXidiXitkXiQ/XiI7XiVfXiZVXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 49
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e2c859ce1fa1",
      "text": "恭喜！隊伍獲得 2000 點經驗值！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^1{^+V^*W^)U^!F^&:^#e 2000 ^*;^'D^.P^!Z^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjF7XitWXipXXilVXiFGXiY6XiNlIDIwMDAgXio7XidEXi5QXiFaXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 43
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_633438c22e44",
      "text": "密室中傳來了一陣聲音： ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#0^+r^!,^+$^!O^*D^!%^)P^-W^34^*B ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiMwXityXiEsXiskXiFPXipEXiElXilQXi1XXjM0XipCIA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7531c9e17cc2",
      "text": "在你們使用我的神力之前，必須先治癒所有的瑪格拉獸。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"d^*F^*{^!N^&H^$%^&Z^&w^!~^!/^!z^*A^#l^)r^!b^%_^&V^$)^$s^&Z^-*^%*^$6^&<^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJkXipGXip7XiFOXiZIXiQlXiZaXiZ3XiF+XiEvXiF6XipBXiNsXilyXiFiXiVfXiZWXiQpXiRzXiZaXi0qXiUqXiQ2XiY8XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_99597160c735",
      "text": "你們已獲得治癒。願命運為你們帶來福運，旅者們。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^#J^&:^#e^%_^&V^!\"^.H^\"N^.4^%{^*F^*{^#N^!O^&z^.4^*A^2m^'V^*{^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiNKXiY6XiNlXiVfXiZWXiEiXi5IXiJOXi40XiV7XipGXip7XiNOXiFPXiZ6Xi40XipBXjJtXidWXip7XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7f3a17a4e237",
      "text": "奴隸離開了神廟。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^##^)Z^)`^)F^*D^&w^0[^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiMjXilaXilgXilGXipEXiZ3XjBbXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5e0cffa7ba14",
      "text": "另一名奴隸步入神廟接受治療。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\">^!%^\"F^##^)Z^,i^!f^&w^0[^$?^\";^%_^&U^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiI+XiElXiJGXiMjXilaXixpXiFmXiZ3XjBbXiQ/XiI7XiVfXiZVXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 43
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_992ba8d2e072",
      "text": "離我遠點，你們這些野蠻人！你們何不去別的村落大肆破壞？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)`^$%^({^*;^*A^*F^*{^(s^!8^.:^/H^!<^*W^*F^*{^!L^!)^\"6^*H^&Z^$z^-`^\"z^2>^&n^\"v^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XilgXiQlXih7Xio7XipBXipGXip7XihzXiE4Xi46Xi9IXiE8XipXXipGXip7XiFMXiEpXiI2XipIXiZaXiR6Xi1gXiJ6XjI+XiZuXiJ2Xi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3ced1e0e5902",
      "text": "阻止這場獻祭！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)L^%G^(s^\"n^-(^&x^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XilMXiVHXihzXiJuXi0oXiZ4XipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 22
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_03dced9eb1ad",
      "text": "是觸手！殺了它！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,X^(J^$+^*W^%M^*D^+o^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XixYXihKXiQrXipXXiVNXipEXitvXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0952ed4aa33b",
      "text": "達卡倫在那裡！殺了他！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(z^\"0^/!^\"d^)!^-j^*W^%M^*D^!@^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xih6XiIwXi8hXiJkXikhXi1qXipXXiVNXipEXiFAXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d8e485624013",
      "text": "殺了達卡倫！我會留在這裡等你們回來。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%M^*D^(z^\"0^/!^*W^$%^$r^-+^\"d^(s^-j^'-^*F^*{^\"\\^!O^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVNXipEXih6XiIwXi8hXipXXiQlXiRyXi0rXiJkXihzXi1qXictXipGXip7XiJcXiFPXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6bb37f500b7d",
      "text": "謝天謝地！瑪格拉族打算把我當成祭品獻祭……你們能 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-z^+e^-z^\"e^*W^-*^%*^$6^5V^$-^-C^$1^$%^&N^$$^&x^\"R^-(^&x^*o^*o^*F^*{^'b ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi16XitlXi16XiJlXipXXi0qXiUqXiQ2XjVWXiQtXi1DXiQxXiQlXiZOXiQkXiZ4XiJSXi0oXiZ4XipvXipvXipGXip7XidiIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_22b733fbb83f",
      "text": "救我離開這裡嗎？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,Q^$%^)`^)F^(s^-j^+X^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XixRXiQlXilgXilGXihzXi1qXitYXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a05945423f9a",
      "text": "太好了。真是白謝謝你們了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+f^+i^*D^!\"^-2^,X^&X^-z^-z^*F^*{^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitmXitpXipEXiEiXi0yXixYXiZYXi16Xi16XipGXip7XipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 40
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ef7b3a50d0ec",
      "text": "我很感謝你們的心意，但你們站在那麼遠的地方， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*K^#{^-z^*F^*{^&Z^#k^#z^*A^!I^*F^*{^->^\"d^)!^.T^({^&Z^\"e^$]^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXipLXiN7Xi16XipGXip7XiZaXiNrXiN6XipBXiFJXipGXip7Xi0+XiJkXikhXi5UXih7XiZaXiJlXiRdXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_61b12a81feba",
      "text": "是沒辦法幫我解開鎖鏈的。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,X^%\\^2L^%b^+}^$%^(I^)F^)8^)<^&Z^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XixYXiVcXjJMXiViXit9XiQlXihJXilGXik4Xik8XiZaXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 37
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_78ffd0679e2a",
      "text": "根本救不了我。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%)^$x^,Q^!)^*D^$%^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiUpXiR4XixRXiEpXipEXiQlXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 22
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ded080182b98",
      "text": " 用力拉扯鎖鏈",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^&H^!~^$6^.e^)8^)<",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4mSF4hfl4kNl4uZV4pOF4pPA==",
      "byte_length": 19
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3b72ce2fa487",
      "text": "，但無法扯斷它們。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*A^!I^%}^%b^.e^,T^+o^*{^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipBXiFJXiV9XiViXi5lXixUXitvXip7XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 28
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ed6721fdfbca",
      "text": "，像折斷枯枝般輕易扯斷了鎖鏈。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*A^!`^,?^,T^5Z^<~^'r^(g^,W^.e^,T^*D^)8^)<^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipBXiFgXiw/XixUXjVaXjx+XidyXihnXixXXi5lXixUXipEXik4Xik8XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cd8d0f792b98",
      "text": "恭喜！隊伍獲得了 1,000 點經驗值！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^1{^+V^*W^)U^!F^&:^#e^*D 1,000 ^*;^'D^.P^!Z^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjF7XitWXipXXilVXiFGXiY6XiNlXipEIDEsMDAwIF4qO14nRF4uUF4hWl4qVyA=",
      "byte_length": 47
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4927654819a7",
      "text": "我真不知該如何感謝你們救了我。我真的以——",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^-2^!)^&h^(M^#$^!L^#{^-z^*F^*{^,Q^*D^$%^!\"^$%^-2^&Z^!B^*n^*n",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXi0yXiEpXiZoXihNXiMkXiFMXiN7Xi16XipGXip7XixRXipEXiQlXiEiXiQlXi0yXiZaXiFCXipuXipu",
      "byte_length": 63
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_227f47dd33af",
      "text": "突然間，地面劇烈震動了起來！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'*^&\"^)G^*A^\"e^)j^1#^%|^32^\"%^*D^.(^!O^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XicqXiYiXilHXipBXiJlXilqXjEjXiV8XjMyXiIlXipEXi4oXiFPXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 43
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_902efc501f10",
      "text": "是淤泥恐魔！它來了！小心觸手！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,X^6c^%d^#t^*0^*W^+o^!O^*D^*W^#;^#k^(J^$+^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XixYXjZjXiVkXiN0XiowXipXXitvXiFPXipEXipXXiM7XiNrXihKXiQrXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d1b314bc580b",
      "text": "謝謝你們救了我並殺了達卡倫。我可不想淪為祭品。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-z^-z^*F^*{^,Q^*D^$%^!+^%M^*D^(z^\"0^/!^!\"^$%^\"A^!)^,1^2)^%{^&x^\"R^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi16Xi16XipGXip7XixRXipEXiQlXiErXiVNXipEXih6XiIwXi8hXiEiXiQlXiJBXiEpXiwxXjIpXiV7XiZ4XiJSXiEi",
      "byte_length": 69
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2b9feea5e14a",
      "text": "  達卡倫是誰？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^(z^\"0^/!^,X^-y^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKHpeIjBeLyFeLFheLXleLlY=",
      "byte_length": 20
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_77edeab3cd61",
      "text": "我原本在跟威米亞斯談條件，他說只要我去找這個德魯伊拿一座雕像碎片， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^\"5^$x^\"d^.+^#&^'4^!9^$[^0;^%.^.W^*A^!@^-x^\"?^(C^$%^\"6^$/^(s^!V^#j^/K^!E^,G^!%^/_^)^^!`^&o^&1^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiI1XiR4XiJkXi4rXiMmXic0XiE5XiRbXjA7XiUuXi5XXipBXiFAXi14XiI/XihDXiQlXiI2XiQvXihzXiFWXiNqXi9LXiFFXixHXiElXi9fXileXiFgXiZvXiYxXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 100
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d0d1817da395",
      "text": "他就會考慮放過小鎮——但我萬萬沒想到， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^*J^$r^-R^19^$P^(x^#;^);^*n^*n^!I^$%^-_^-_^%\\^,1^!u^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXipKXiRyXi1SXjE5XiRQXih4XiM7Xik7XipuXipuXiFJXiQlXi1fXi1fXiVcXiwxXiF1XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c80a6510905b",
      "text": "我竟然是被送來當祭品的！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^28^&\"^,X^(@^./^!O^&N^&x^\"R^&Z^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXjI4XiYiXixYXihAXi4vXiFPXiZOXiZ4XiJSXiZaXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 37
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cb0d694d5985",
      "text": "他是這一帶的德魯伊。他手上握有威米亞斯想要的雕像碎片。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^,X^(s^!%^#N^&Z^#j^/K^!E^!\"^!@^$+^!'^1>^$s^#&^'4^!9^$[^,1^(C^&Z^)^^!`^&o^&1^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXixYXihzXiElXiNOXiZaXiNqXi9LXiFFXiEiXiFAXiQrXiEnXjE+XiRzXiMmXic0XiE5XiRbXiwxXihDXiZaXileXiFgXiZvXiYxXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9c90e00078c6",
      "text": "我猜威米亞斯答應把我送來當祭品以換取那塊碎片。真慶幸 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^-'^#&^'4^!9^$[^-B^0`^$1^$%^./^!O^&N^&x^\"R^!B^4@^\":^)!^/Z^&o^&1^!\"^-2^5P^15 ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXi0nXiMmXic0XiE5XiRbXi1CXjBgXiQxXiQlXi4vXiFPXiZOXiZ4XiJSXiFCXjRAXiI6XikhXi9aXiZvXiYxXiEiXi0yXjVQXjE1IA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9db07d326dd1",
      "text": "你們及時趕到了……",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^\"7^$f^0u^!u^*D^*o^*o",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiI3XiRmXjB1XiF1XipEXipvXipv",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e35a6e8e856f",
      "text": "  威米亞斯已經死了。是我殺了他。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^#&^'4^!9^$[^#J^'D^%L^*D^!\"^,X^$%^%M^*D^!@^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIyZeJzReITleJFteI0peJ0ReJUxeKkReISJeLFheJCVeJU1eKkReIUBeISIg",
      "byte_length": 48
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_039d42827c60",
      "text": "  吉德隆的所有村民全都死了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^\"D^#j^)T^&Z^$)^$s^$z^%T^!h^)$^%L^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIkReI2peKVReJlpeJCleJHNeJHpeJVReIWheKSReJUxeKkReISIg",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7afc63ce0ca0",
      "text": "  威米亞斯派我來取雕像碎片。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^#&^'4^!9^$[^.n^$%^!O^\":^)^^!`^&o^&1^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIyZeJzReITleJFteLm5eJCVeIU9eIjpeKV5eIWBeJm9eJjFeISI=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f5e2af3fb191",
      "text": "  這個叫威米亞斯的是何許人也？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^(s^!V^+<^#&^'4^!9^$[^&Z^,X^!L^-s^!<^!1^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKHNeIVZeKzxeIyZeJzReITleJFteJlpeLFheIUxeLXNeITxeITFeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b509e7917a05",
      "text": "  你現在要回村子去嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^&?^\"d^(C^\"\\^$z^#(^\"6^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeJj9eImReKENeIlxeJHpeIyheIjZeK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0fa25697ac23",
      "text": "  莉娜拉是你的妹妹嗎？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^'{^/*^$6^,X^*F^&Z^;d^;d^+X^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJ3teLypeJDZeLFheKkZeJlpeO2ReO2ReK1heLlYg",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7e8f68a23acf",
      "text": "  你的妹妹是誰？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^&Z^;d^;d^,X^-y^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeJlpeO2ReO2ReLFheLXleLlYg",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_45f1dbbb70ba",
      "text": "  莉娜拉所受的訓練保護不了她嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^'{^/*^$6^$)^\";^&Z^-p^-L^!T^(T^!)^*D^+h^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJ3teLypeJDZeJCleIjteJlpeLXBeLUxeIVReKFReISleKkReK2heK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 47
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0eb878985ef8",
      "text": "  跟我說說這塊雕像碎片的事。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^.+^$%^-x^-x^(s^/Z^)^^!`^&o^&1^&Z^*r^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLiteJCVeLXheLXheKHNeL1peKV5eIWBeJm9eJjFeJlpeKnJeISI=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3bcf8cbf02e6",
      "text": "  必須阻止威米亞斯！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^#l^)r^)L^%G^#&^'4^!9^$[^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeI2xeKXJeKUxeJUdeIyZeJzReITleJFteKlc=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_007c5601802c",
      "text": "  請帶我去找你的法術書。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*S^#N^$%^\"6^$/^*F^&Z^%b^(<^$p^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKlNeI05eJCVeIjZeJC9eKkZeJlpeJWJeKDxeJHBeISI=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4ea929a47a60",
      "text": "什、什麼？但如果你們殺了威米亞斯，那吉德隆怎麼樣了？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!=^!!^!=^.T^.V^!I^#$^%!^*F^*{^%M^*D^#&^'4^!9^$[^*A^)!^\"D^#j^)T^,,^.T^,f^*D^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiE9XiEhXiE9Xi5UXi5WXiFJXiMkXiUhXipGXip7XiVNXipEXiMmXic0XiE5XiRbXipBXikhXiJEXiNqXilUXiwsXi5UXixmXipEXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_088abc97a359",
      "text": "要是你們不插手，鎮民們現在都還活著！你們 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(C^,X^*F^*{^!)^4{^$+^*A^);^%T^*{^&?^\"d^)$^.7^%i^-a^*W^*F^*{ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihDXixYXipGXip7XiEpXjR7XiQrXipBXik7XiVUXip7XiY/XiJkXikkXi43XiVpXi1hXipXXipGXip7IA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_33afc91eb07d",
      "text": "毀掉了一整座村落！希望你們為自己感到得意——我再也 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%N^/e^*D^!%^$T^/_^$z^-`^*W^+{^,]^*F^*{^%{^'l^#I^#{^!u^#e^#z^*n^*n^$%^!l^!1 ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVOXi9lXipEXiElXiRUXi9fXiR6Xi1gXipXXit7XixdXipGXip7XiV7XidsXiNJXiN7XiF1XiNlXiN6XipuXipuXiQlXiFsXiExIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_868aa11b088d",
      "text": "不想跟你們有任何瓜葛！滾開！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^,1^.+^*F^*{^$s^!C^!L^<X^(\"^*W^,z^)F^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXiwxXi4rXipGXip7XiRzXiFDXiFMXjxYXigiXipXXix6XilGXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 43
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_40071f668778",
      "text": "是他派你來的？他肯定是以為達卡倫背信棄義了。那麼，你最好的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,X^!@^.n^*F^!O^&Z^.V^!@^-Z^#.^,X^!B^%{^(z^\"0^/!^.r^!U^,a^2<^*D^!\"^)!^.T^*A^*F^$q^+i^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XixYXiFAXi5uXipGXiFPXiZaXi5WXiFAXi1aXiMuXixYXiFCXiV7Xih6XiIwXi8hXi5yXiFVXixhXjI8XipEXiEiXikhXi5UXipBXipGXiRxXitpXiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3f11c139751a",
      "text": "辦法就是把雕像碎片帶去交給他。要是你威脅他，他很 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^2L^%b^*J^,X^$1^)^^!`^&o^&1^#N^\"6^0P^'A^!@^!\"^(C^,X^*F^#&^1T^!@^*A^!@^*K ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjJMXiViXipKXixYXiQxXileXiFgXiZvXiYxXiNOXiI2XjBQXidBXiFAXiEiXihDXixYXipGXiMmXjFUXiFAXipBXiFAXipLIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_079f447521ef",
      "text": "可能會把所有村民殺光。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"A^'b^$r^$1^$)^$s^$z^%T^%M^!c^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJBXidiXiRyXiQxXiQpXiRzXiR6XiVUXiVNXiFjXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d9a653bbc484",
      "text": "我所知不多，只知道他是個強大的滅絕法師。他霸佔了我的家鄉吉德隆， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^$)^&h^!)^\"x^*A^\"?^&h^(y^!@^,X^!V^#]^\"z^&Z^%t^-I^%b^#M^!\"^!@^33^0R^*D^$%^&Z^+s^6<^\"D^#j^)T^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiQpXiZoXiEpXiJ4XipBXiI/XiZoXih5XiFAXixYXiFWXiNdXiJ6XiZaXiV0Xi1JXiViXiNNXiEiXiFAXjMzXjBSXipEXiQlXiZaXitzXjY8XiJEXiNqXilUXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 97
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4d2202cdb181",
      "text": "控制了所有的村民。我不敢回去——如果我回去，他可能會把大家都 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$@^!v^*D^$)^$s^&Z^$z^%T^!\"^$%^!)^/m^\"\\^\"6^*n^*n^#$^%!^$%^\"\\^\"6^*A^!@^\"A^'b^$r^$1^\"z^+s^)$ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRAXiF2XipEXiQpXiRzXiZaXiR6XiVUXiEiXiQlXiEpXi9tXiJcXiI2XipuXipuXiMkXiUhXiQlXiJcXiI2XipBXiFAXiJBXidiXiRyXiQxXiJ6XitzXikkIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3667280c5047",
      "text": "殺光。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%M^!c^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVNXiFjXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 10
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f4585078117b",
      "text": "不行，那樣會害了我妹妹。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^(;^*A^)!^,f^$r^#/^*D^$%^;d^;d^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXig7XipBXikhXixmXiRyXiMvXipEXiQlXjtkXjtkXiEi",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bc62799c1647",
      "text": "是啊，沒錯！我真高興我的教導影響了她，讓她也踏上了學習 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,X^+Q^*A^%\\^)5^*W^$%^-2^*+^-]^$%^&Z^,R^10^#a^)o^*D^+h^*A^-}^+h^!1^.,^!'^*D^+n^3{ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XixYXitRXipBXiVcXik1XipXXiQlXi0yXiorXi1dXiQlXiZaXixSXjEwXiNhXilvXipEXitoXipBXi19XitoXiExXi4sXiEnXipEXituXjN7IA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ca846c759bdd",
      "text": "奧藝之路。我也很慶幸這些教導讓她暫時免於受到威米亞斯 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^6Q^3Z^!/^(a^!\"^$%^!1^*K^5P^15^(s^!8^,R^10^-}^+h^$l^$f^!e^$^^\";^!u^#&^'4^!9^$[ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjZRXjNaXiEvXihhXiEiXiQlXiExXipLXjVQXjE1XihzXiE4XixSXjEwXi19XitoXiRsXiRmXiFlXiReXiI7XiF1XiMmXic0XiE5XiRbIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_35f028ff1962",
      "text": "黑暗力量的侵害——至少能撐上一陣子。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*:^$k^!~^)*^&Z^.X^#/^*n^*n^'n^#<^'b^,L^!'^!%^)P^#(^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xio6XiRrXiF+XikqXiZaXi5YXiMvXipuXipuXiduXiM8XidiXixMXiEnXiElXilQXiMoXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3318a4f18982",
      "text": "我妹妹叫莉娜拉。她住在吉德隆村，至少以前是住在那裡。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^;d^;d^+<^'{^/*^$6^!\"^+h^*z^\"d^\"D^#j^)T^$z^*A^'n^#<^!B^!z^,X^*z^\"d^)!^-j^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXjtkXjtkXis8Xid7Xi8qXiQ2XiEiXitoXip6XiJkXiJEXiNqXilUXiR6XipBXiduXiM8XiFCXiF6XixYXip6XiJkXikhXi1qXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4dc86216a8de",
      "text": "希望她平安無事——我不敢回去，唯恐威米亞斯會殺了她和 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+{^,]^+h^0Y^+p^%}^*r^*n^*n^$%^!)^/m^\"\\^\"6^*A^+O^#t^#&^'4^!9^$[^$r^%M^*D^+h^\"O ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xit7XixdXitoXjBZXitwXiV9XipyXipuXipuXiQlXiEpXi9tXiJcXiI2XipBXitPXiN0XiMmXic0XiE5XiRbXiRyXiVNXipEXitoXiJPIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_48731d765527",
      "text": "全村的人。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!h^$z^&Z^!<^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFoXiR6XiZaXiE8XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 16
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2e643fa2dc01",
      "text": "我很懷疑。多少能撐一下，但我相信威米亞斯非常清楚 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*K^,9^0p^!\"^\"x^#<^'b^,L^!%^!(^*A^!I^$%^&a^!U^#&^'4^!9^$[^)i^#O^,u^,c ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXipLXiw5XjBwXiEiXiJ4XiM8XidiXixMXiElXiEoXipBXiFJXiQlXiZhXiFVXiMmXic0XiE5XiRbXilpXiNPXix1XixjIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_37dba5867ee6",
      "text": "莉娜拉的力量。他沒對她痛下殺手，純粹只是想看著她掙扎著拯救村莊， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'{^/*^$6^&Z^!~^)*^!\"^!@^%\\^#:^+h^-.^!(^%M^$+^*A^3\"^5r^\"?^,X^,1^*Q^-a^+h^.g^,=^-a^,F^,Q^$z^6l^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xid7Xi8qXiQ2XiZaXiF+XikqXiEiXiFAXiVcXiM6XitoXi0uXiEoXiVNXiQrXipBXjMiXjVyXiI/XixYXiwxXipRXi1hXitoXi5nXiw9Xi1hXixGXixRXiR6XjZsXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 97
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7eaf510d0259",
      "text": "任由他戲弄玩耍。我想這讓他覺得很有趣。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!C^&I^!@^,;^/`^4U^7E^!\"^$%^,1^(s^-}^!@^(G^#e^*K^$s^.*^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFDXiZJXiFAXiw7Xi9gXjRVXjdFXiEiXiQlXiwxXihzXi19XiFAXihHXiNlXipLXiRzXi4qXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_74b91c43f990",
      "text": "沒錯。我也這麼認為，然而直接與他正面交鋒只會害死那些 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%\\^)5^!\"^$%^!1^(s^.T^(O^%{^*A^&\"^'W^&`^$?^'p^!@^%H^)j^0P^6?^\"?^$r^#/^%L^)!^!8 ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVcXik1XiEiXiQlXiExXihzXi5UXihPXiV7XipBXiYiXidXXiZgXiQ/XidwXiFAXiVIXilqXjBQXjY/XiI/XiRyXiMvXiVMXikhXiE4IA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a7f5e4949d42",
      "text": "村民。我建議拼湊完那座雕像——到時他會全神貫注在雕像上， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$z^%T^!\"^$%^,'^-|^;Z^77^#,^)!^/_^)^^!`^*n^*n^!u^$f^!@^$r^!h^&w^;J^%e^\"d^)^^!`^!'^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiR6XiVUXiEiXiQlXiwnXi18XjtaXjc3XiMsXikhXi9fXileXiFgXipuXipuXiF1XiRmXiFAXiRyXiFoXiZ3XjtKXiVlXiJkXileXiFgXiEnXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d9c0f6c2d161",
      "text": "或許你們就能趁機痛擊他！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$'^-s^*F^*{^*J^'b^.)^%>^-.^$F^!@^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQnXi1zXipGXip7XipKXidiXi4pXiU+Xi0uXiRGXiFAXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 37
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3969ed250cca",
      "text": "我可以帶你們去我藏法術書的地方。那些書能向我妹妹證明 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^\"A^!B^#N^*F^*{^\"6^$%^-f^%b^(<^$p^&Z^\"e^$]^!\"^)!^!8^$p^'b^+?^$%^;d^;d^-{^$c ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiJBXiFCXiNOXipGXip7XiI2XiQlXi1mXiViXig8XiRwXiZaXiJlXiRdXiEiXikhXiE4XiRwXidiXis/XiQlXjtkXjtkXi17XiRjIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_adc5b6292cd2",
      "text": "我還好好地活著。得知她不用再為我擔心，我也會安心許多。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^.7^+i^+i^\"e^%i^-a^!\"^#e^&h^+h^!)^&H^!l^%{^$%^*N^#k^*A^$%^!1^$r^+p^#k^-s^\"x^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXi43XitpXitpXiJlXiVpXi1hXiEiXiNlXiZoXitoXiEpXiZIXiFsXiV7XiQlXipOXiNrXipBXiQlXiExXiRyXitwXiNrXi1zXiJ4XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d57adce8f92b",
      "text": "比起掌控小鎮，威米亞斯更想要這座雕像。它散發著惡臭的邪氣—— ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,m^.(^$;^$@^#;^);^*A^#&^'4^!9^$[^$o^,1^(C^(s^/_^)^^!`^!\"^+o^$S^&W^-a^#y^'m^&Z^)\"^%U^*n^*n ",
      "encoded_base64": "XixtXi4oXiQ7XiRAXiM7Xik7XipBXiMmXic0XiE5XiRbXiRvXiwxXihDXihzXi9fXileXiFgXiEiXitvXiRTXiZXXi1hXiN5XidtXiZaXikiXiVVXipuXipuIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6c59d5188361",
      "text": "在我離開前他所拼湊的部分就已經散發著黑色的氣息。我懷疑這座雕像能為 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"d^$%^)`^)F^!z^!@^$)^;Z^77^&Z^)#^!s^*J^#J^'D^$S^&W^-a^*:^'s^&Z^%U^#w^!\"^$%^,9^0p^(s^/_^)^^!`^'b^%{ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJkXiQlXilgXilGXiF6XiFAXiQpXjtaXjc3XiZaXikjXiFzXipKXiNKXidEXiRTXiZXXi1hXio6XidzXiZaXiVVXiN3XiEiXiQlXiw5XjBwXihzXi9fXileXiFgXidiXiV7IA==",
      "byte_length": 100
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2ec8ab1d9e03",
      "text": "吉德隆……乃至整個阿薩斯帶來任何好處。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"D^#j^)T^*o^*o^/M^'n^$T^!V^)M^-e^$[^#N^!O^!C^!L^+i^(,^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJEXiNqXilUXipvXipvXi9NXiduXiRUXiFWXilNXi1lXiRbXiNOXiFPXiFDXiFMXitpXigsXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_828b2f323643",
      "text": "跟我到廢墟去，我拿給你們。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.+^$%^!u^#W^\"t^\"6^*A^$%^,G^'A^*F^*{^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi4rXiQlXiF1XiNXXiJ0XiI2XipBXiQlXixHXidBXipGXip7XiEi",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_22ef49244e94",
      "text": "再見，再次感謝你們。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!l^-m^*A^!l^%D^#{^-z^*F^*{^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFsXi1tXipBXiFsXiVEXiN7Xi16XipGXip7XiEi",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c601d76a68f0",
      "text": "書就在上面這裡。跟我來。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$p^*J^\"d^!'^)j^(s^-j^!\"^.+^$%^!O^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRwXipKXiJkXiEnXilqXihzXi1qXiEiXi4rXiQlXiFPXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 37
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5fe56937ad98",
      "text": "這裡就是我埋藏法術書的地方。我還在這裡藏了一些卷軸。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^-j^*J^,X^$%^1r^-f^%b^(<^$p^&Z^\"e^$]^!\"^$%^.7^\"d^(s^-j^-f^*D^!%^!8^\"3^(e^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXi1qXipKXixYXiQlXjFyXi1mXiViXig8XiRwXiZaXiJlXiRdXiEiXiQlXi43XiJkXihzXi1qXi1mXipEXiElXiE4XiIzXihlXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9eb2de6c254b",
      "text": "就當作是救我的報酬吧。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*J^&N^!M^,X^,Q^$%^&Z^+`^7o^*I^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipKXiZOXiFNXixYXixRXiQlXiZaXitgXjdvXipJXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_28bae0367a2a",
      "text": "拿去吧。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,G^\"6^*I^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XixHXiI2XipJXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 13
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_812602ae8203",
      "text": "你們拿不下了，所以我把所有東西都留在這裡給你們。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^,G^!)^!(^*D^*A^$)^!B^$%^$1^$)^$s^,`^-l^)$^-+^\"d^(s^-j^'A^*F^*{^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XixHXiEpXiEoXipEXipBXiQpXiFCXiQlXiQxXiQpXiRzXixgXi1sXikkXi0rXiJkXihzXi1qXidBXipGXip7XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_12ce1daad790",
      "text": "你們拿不下了，所以我把卷軸留在這裡給你們。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^,G^!)^!(^*D^*A^$)^!B^$%^$1^\"3^(e^-+^\"d^(s^-j^'A^*F^*{^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XixHXiEpXiEoXipEXipBXiQpXiFCXiQlXiQxXiIzXihlXi0rXiJkXihzXi1qXidBXipGXip7XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1c2fd7b5ff9d",
      "text": "你們拿不下了，所以我把卷軸留在這裡給你們。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^,G^!)^!(^*D^*A^$)^!B^$%^$1^\"3^(e^-+^\"d^(s^-j^'A^*F^*{^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XixHXiEpXiEoXipEXipBXiQpXiFCXiQlXiQxXiIzXihlXi0rXiJkXihzXi1qXidBXipGXip7XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_82d120125501",
      "text": "把書帶去吉德隆村給我妹妹莉娜拉。她看到就會知道我還 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$1^$p^#N^\"6^\"D^#j^)T^$z^'A^$%^;d^;d^'{^/*^$6^!\"^+h^*Q^!u^*J^$r^&h^(y^$%^.7 ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQxXiRwXiNOXiI2XiJEXiNqXilUXiR6XidBXiQlXjtkXjtkXid7Xi8qXiQ2XiEiXitoXipRXiF1XipKXiRyXiZoXih5XiQlXi43IA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_706409eebff6",
      "text": "活著。我必須留在這裡，以免威米亞斯發現我逃跑了。再見。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%i^-a^!\"^$%^#l^)r^-+^\"d^(s^-j^*A^!B^!e^#&^'4^!9^$[^&W^&?^$%^(p^(_^*D^!\"^!l^-m^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVpXi1hXiEiXiQlXiNsXilyXi0rXiJkXihzXi1qXipBXiFCXiFlXiMmXic0XiE5XiRbXiZXXiY/XiQlXihwXihfXipEXiEiXiFsXi1tXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_145204ecc76e",
      "text": "恭喜！隊伍獲得了 2000 點經驗值！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^1{^+V^*W^)U^!F^&:^#e^*D 2000 ^*;^'D^.P^!Z^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjF7XitWXipXXilVXiFGXiY6XiNlXipEIDIwMDAgXio7XidEXi5QXiFaXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b819b0578ce2",
      "text": "感謝你們除掉了威米亞斯！我會繼續留在這裡研習法術。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#{^-z^*F^*{^)Q^/e^*D^#&^'4^!9^$[^*W^$%^$r^-O^'M^-+^\"d^(s^-j^9G^3{^%b^(<^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiN7Xi16XipGXip7XilRXi9lXipEXiMmXic0XiE5XiRbXipXXiQlXiRyXi1PXidNXi0rXiJkXihzXi1qXjlHXjN7XiViXig8XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_70ea98e214ba",
      "text": "替我向妹妹問好。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^2o^$%^+?^;d^;d^*Z^+i^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjJvXiQlXis/XjtkXjtkXipaXitpXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_85cfe410ecb0",
      "text": "快上路吧！威米亞斯可不會等太久！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*L^!'^(a^*I^*W^#&^'4^!9^$[^\"A^!)^$r^'-^+f^!.^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XipMXiEnXihhXipJXipXXiMmXic0XiE5XiRbXiJBXiEpXiRyXictXitmXiEuXipX",
      "byte_length": 48
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_933fe3c7214e",
      "text": "  你一個人在這裡沒問題嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^!%^!V^!<^\"d^(s^-j^%\\^*Z^.G^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeISVeIVZeITxeImReKHNeLWpeJVxeKlpeLkdeK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0a9288efd25b",
      "text": "我得走了。回頭見。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^#e^.&^*D^!\"^\"\\^)t^-m^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiNlXi4mXipEXiEiXiJcXil0Xi1tXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 28
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9928b0b11955",
      "text": "是的，她是。你們見過她了，對吧？希望她一切安好。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,X^&Z^*A^+h^,X^!\"^*F^*{^-m^(x^+h^*D^*A^#:^*I^.V^+{^,]^+h^!%^+.^+p^+i^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XixYXiZaXipBXitoXixYXiEiXipGXip7Xi1tXih4XitoXipEXipBXiM6XipJXi5WXit7XixdXitoXiElXisuXitwXitpXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_80753419e6aa",
      "text": "沒事的，我應付得來——只要不是被抓去當祭品的話。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%\\^*r^&Z^*A^$%^0`^*u^#e^!O^*n^*n^\"?^(C^!)^,X^(@^$2^\"6^&N^&x^\"R^&Z^-v^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVcXipyXiZaXipBXiQlXjBgXip1XiNlXiFPXipuXipuXiI/XihDXiEpXixYXihAXiQyXiI2XiZOXiZ4XiJSXiZaXi12XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1a85fb9c4d7b",
      "text": "快走吧！現在達卡倫死了，瑪格拉族不會再來打擾我。去吧！去找 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*L^.&^*I^*W^&?^\"d^(z^\"0^/!^%L^*D^*A^-*^%*^$6^5V^!)^$r^!l^!O^$-^$K^$%^!\"^\"6^*I^*W^\"6^$/ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipMXi4mXipJXipXXiY/XiJkXih6XiIwXi8hXiVMXipEXipBXi0qXiUqXiQ2XjVWXiEpXiRyXiFsXiFPXiQtXiRLXiQlXiEiXiI2XipJXipXXiI2XiQvIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9ee52dcf2b63",
      "text": "威米亞斯！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#&^'4^!9^$[^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiMmXic0XiE5XiRbXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 16
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e91779d1ff8d",
      "text": "我不想再跟你們說話了。免得壞了我獲得 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^!)^,1^!l^.+^*F^*{^-x^-v^*D^!\"^!e^#e^\"v^*D^$%^&:^#e ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiEpXiwxXiFsXi4rXipGXip7Xi14Xi12XipEXiEiXiFlXiNlXiJ2XipEXiQlXiY6XiNlIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e39f327794c6",
      "text": "轉化的機會！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(i^\")^&Z^%>^$r^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihpXiIpXiZaXiU+XiRyXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 19
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_246a27f746b0",
      "text": "你們也是在等著接受轉化嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^!1^,X^\"d^'-^-a^$?^\";^(i^\")^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiExXixYXiJkXictXi1hXiQ/XiI7XihpXiIpXitYXi5W",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b2659feebf73",
      "text": "  是的，我希望能第一個輪到。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^,X^&Z^*A^$%^+{^,]^'b^',^!%^!V^(h^!u^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLFheJlpeKkFeJCVeK3teLF1eJ2JeJyxeISVeIVZeKGheIXVeISI=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1b493c005f58",
      "text": "  不，我只是個奴隸。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^!)^*A^$%^\"?^,X^!V^##^)Z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeISleKkFeJCVeIj9eLFheIVZeIyNeKVpeISI=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bc057361744b",
      "text": "  轉化根本是個騙局！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^(i^\")^%)^$x^,X^!V^.{^._^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKGleIileJSleJHheLFheIVZeLnteLl9eKlc=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f233659cb2ea",
      "text": "  跟我說說這個地方的事。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^.+^$%^-x^-x^(s^!V^\"e^$]^&Z^*r^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLiteJCVeLXheLXheKHNeIVZeImVeJF1eJlpeKnJeISI=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a31154993818",
      "text": "  巴卡扎爾在欺騙你！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^#K^\"0^,=^&/^\"d^2r^.{^*F^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeI0teIjBeLD1eJi9eImReMnJeLnteKkZeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_781deba9ca88",
      "text": "再見，祝你好運。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!l^-m^*A^&v^*F^+i^.4^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFsXi1tXipBXiZ2XipGXitpXi40XiEi",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a26170f03da3",
      "text": "不行，我等得最久！我才是第一個接受轉化的人。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^(;^*A^$%^'-^#e^$q^!.^*W^$%^$,^,X^',^!%^!V^$?^\";^(i^\")^&Z^!<^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXig7XipBXiQlXictXiNlXiRxXiEuXipXXiQlXiQsXixYXicsXiElXiFWXiQ/XiI7XihpXiIpXiZaXiE8XiEi",
      "byte_length": 66
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0258948733a8",
      "text": "好好效忠巴卡扎爾，你們也能像我一樣，贏得接受轉化的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+i^+i^$Q^.d^#K^\"0^,=^&/^*A^*F^*{^!1^'b^!`^$%^!%^,f^*A^.%^#e^$?^\";^(i^\")^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitpXitpXiRRXi5kXiNLXiIwXiw9XiYvXipBXipGXip7XiExXidiXiFgXiQlXiElXixmXipBXi4lXiNlXiQ/XiI7XihpXiIpXiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_536426064d88",
      "text": "殊榮！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^9!^,e^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XjkhXixlXipX",
      "byte_length": 9
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d1fe33513382",
      "text": "騙子！我忠心耿耿地為巴卡扎爾效力。很快我就會被昇華為 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.{^#(^*W^$%^.d^#k^=!^=!^\"e^%{^#K^\"0^,=^&/^$Q^!~^!\"^*K^*L^$%^*J^$r^(@^<}^3'^%{ ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi57XiMoXipXXiQlXi5kXiNrXj0hXj0hXiJlXiV7XiNLXiIwXiw9XiYvXiRRXiF+XiEiXipLXipMXiQlXipKXiRyXihAXjx9XjMnXiV7IA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_dc9e9f9603b4",
      "text": "更高等的存在。你們是來考驗我的忠誠嗎？滾開！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$o^*+^'-^&Z^#*^\"d^!\"^*F^*{^,X^!O^-R^.P^$%^&Z^.d^2E^+X^.V^,z^)F^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRvXiorXictXiZaXiMqXiJkXiEiXipGXip7XixYXiFPXi1SXi5QXiQlXiZaXi5kXjJFXitYXi5WXix6XilGXipX",
      "byte_length": 66
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8aa5902c803e",
      "text": "我在這裡等了一整天。只有幹完雜活後，有資格者才會被帶去 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^\"d^(s^-j^'-^*D^!%^$T^+e^!\"^\"?^$s^,!^#,^0G^%i^#b^*A^$s^(X^%*^'V^$,^$r^(@^#N^\"6 ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiJkXihzXi1qXictXipEXiElXiRUXitlXiEiXiI/XiRzXiwhXiMsXjBHXiVpXiNiXipBXiRzXihYXiUqXidWXiQsXiRyXihAXiNOXiI2IA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_afc1d988081f",
      "text": "進行轉化。巴卡扎爾除了主持轉化儀式外，從不離開他的居室。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(w^(;^(i^\")^!\"^#K^\"0^,=^&/^)Q^*D^!-^$7^(i^\")^+'^#X^\"w^*A^#f^!)^)`^)F^!@^&Z^+w^+r^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xih3Xig7XihpXiIpXiEiXiNLXiIwXiw9XiYvXilRXipEXiEtXiQ3XihpXiIpXisnXiNYXiJ3XipBXiNmXiEpXilgXilGXiFAXiZaXit3XityXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e7c4271e6f2a",
      "text": "這是無上的榮耀！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^,X^%}^!'^&Z^,e^7D^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXixYXiV9XiEnXiZaXixlXjdEXipX",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6d60381c1936",
      "text": "瑪格拉！跟我走。現在輪到你了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-*^%*^$6^*W^.+^$%^.&^!\"^&?^\"d^(h^!u^*F^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi0qXiUqXiQ2XipXXi4rXiQlXi4mXiEiXiY/XiJkXihoXiF1XipGXipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_90f468801bff",
      "text": "巴布魔轉向你們。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#K^.`^*0^(i^+?^*F^*{^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNLXi5gXiowXihpXis/XipGXip7XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7b6b3bc6f041",
      "text": "賣力幹活吧，奴隸們，你們也可能享有轉化的殊榮！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.$^!~^,!^%i^*I^*A^##^)Z^*{^*A^*F^*{^!1^\"A^'b^!;^$s^(i^\")^&Z^9!^,e^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi4kXiF+XiwhXiVpXipJXipBXiMjXilaXip7XipBXipGXip7XiExXiJBXidiXiE7XiRzXihpXiIpXiZaXjkhXixlXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c789d67ea436",
      "text": "不！休想毀掉我接受轉化的機會！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^*W^!G^,1^%N^/e^$%^$?^\";^(i^\")^&Z^%>^$r^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXipXXiFHXiwxXiVOXi9lXiQlXiQ/XiI7XihpXiIpXiZaXiU+XiRyXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_acfefea273ef",
      "text": "  我們換個話題吧。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^*{^4@^!V^-v^.G^*I^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeKnteNEBeIVZeLXZeLkdeKkleISI=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_729f02931dd3",
      "text": "無鱗者，你找我有何貴幹？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%}^*2^'V^*A^*F^$/^$%^$s^!L^2F^,!^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XiV9XioyXidWXipBXipGXiQvXiQlXiRzXiFMXjJGXiwhXi5W",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_417c27e34754",
      "text": "我正在尋找我的新部落。等我找到之後再來跟你談。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^%H^\"d^#9^$/^$%^&Z^$\\^)#^-`^!\"^'-^$%^$/^!u^!/^#b^!l^!O^.+^*F^0;^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiVIXiJkXiM5XiQvXiQlXiZaXiRcXikjXi1gXiEiXictXiQlXiQvXiF1XiEvXiNiXiFsXiFPXi4rXipGXjA7XiEi",
      "byte_length": 69
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_185b7918e4f2",
      "text": "向你們致問候，無鱗者們。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+?^*F^*{^'o^*Z^*|^*A^%}^*2^'V^*{^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xis/XipGXip7XidvXipaXip8XipBXiV9XioyXidWXip7XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 37
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_87036531082a",
      "text": "我仍在等待引領我前往新部落的啟示異象。我現在沒時間 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^!?^\"d^'-^,*^#Z^)s^$%^!z^,)^$\\^)#^-`^&Z^57^&s^&M^4g^!\"^$%^&?^\"d^%\\^$f^)G ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiE/XiJkXictXiwqXiNaXilzXiQlXiF6XiwpXiRcXikjXi1gXiZaXjU3XiZzXiZNXjRnXiEiXiQlXiY/XiJkXiVcXiRmXilHIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6b081a8dc26e",
      "text": "閒聊——我必須追尋那份異象。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^6A^-U^*n^*n^$%^#l^)r^(o^#9^)!^*x^&M^4g^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjZBXi1VXipuXipuXiQlXiNsXilyXihvXiM5XikhXip4XiZNXjRnXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 43
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a08fffec5585",
      "text": "  我只是想聊聊。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^\"?^,X^,1^-U^-U^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeIj9eLFheLDFeLVVeLVVeISI=",
      "byte_length": 23
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_289c8b667f44",
      "text": "  你怎麼會沒有狩獵我們的心情？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^,,^.T^$r^%\\^$s^8l^&;^$%^*{^&Z^#k^,0^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeLCxeLlReJHJeJVxeJHNeOGxeJjteJCVeKnteJlpeI2teLDBeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_719292098325",
      "text": "  我聽說西方出現了一位新酋長。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^-X^-x^-l^$]^!q^&?^*D^!%^!J^$\\^=5^)C^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeLVheLXheLWxeJF1eIXFeJj9eKkReISVeIUpeJFxePTVeKUNeISI=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9fb0d3df43c6",
      "text": "那你就說吧。我現在沒心情把你們當獵物。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^*F^*J^-x^*I^!\"^$%^&?^\"d^%\\^#k^,0^$1^*F^*{^&N^&;^&4^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXipGXipKXi14XipJXiEiXiQlXiY/XiJkXiVcXiNrXiwwXiQxXipGXip7XiZOXiY7XiY0XiEi",
      "byte_length": 57
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7ba63a20ac82",
      "text": "我親眼見過蘇蘭蜥蜴人出賣自己的靈魂。相比之下，跟獵物 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^(F^&d^-m^(x^4c^/G^(2^(3^!<^!q^.$^'l^#I^&Z^)g^*.^!\"^&a^,m^!/^!(^*A^.+^&;^&4 ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXihGXiZkXi1tXih4XjRjXi9HXigyXigzXiE8XiFxXi4kXidsXiNJXiZaXilnXiouXiEiXiZhXixtXiEvXiEoXipBXi4rXiY7XiY0IA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_790d65e42287",
      "text": "說說話根本算不上什麼大事。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-x^-x^-v^%)^$x^-C^!)^!'^!=^.T^\"z^*r^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi14Xi14Xi12XiUpXiR4Xi1DXiEpXiEnXiE9Xi5UXiJ6XipyXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 40
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4d144e111273",
      "text": "我是勞莎，曾是灰群島部落的一員。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^,X^/R^/E^*A^.j^,X^%y^'R^=)^)#^-`^&Z^!%^+G^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXixYXi9SXi9FXipBXi5qXixYXiV5XidSXj0pXikjXi1gXiZaXiElXitHXiEi",
      "byte_length": 48
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f72c6399330f",
      "text": "  灰群島在哪裡？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^%y^'R^=)^\"d^+I^-j^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJXleJ1JePSleImReK0leLWpeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 23
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_48cbf8397965",
      "text": "  我該怎麼去那裡？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^(M^,,^.T^\"6^)!^-j^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeKE1eLCxeLlReIjZeKSFeLWpeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bf43772342fd",
      "text": "  你能帶我去那條地道嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^'b^#N^$%^\"6^)!^%.^\"e^(y^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeJ2JeI05eJCVeIjZeKSFeJS5eImVeKHleK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6e7dadf83e15",
      "text": "  你看起來很沮喪。出什麼事了嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^*Q^.(^!O^*K^=,^1)^!\"^!q^!=^.T^*r^*D^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeKlFeLiheIU9eKktePSxeMSleISJeIXFeIT1eLlReKnJeKkReK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 47
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_03e8faf9251d",
      "text": "  貪得無厭的做派？我不太明白。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^1^^#e^%}^+9^&Z^*~^.n^.V^$%^!)^+f^$c^&X^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeMV5eI2VeJX1eKzleJlpeKn5eLm5eLlZeJCVeISleK2ZeJGNeJlheISI=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7af6281d4474",
      "text": "  你為什麼要怪罪那些商人？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^%{^!=^.T^(C^#s^5x^)!^!8^1'^!<^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeJXteIT1eLlReKENeI3NeNXheKSFeITheMSdeITxeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_00514dd7c2b1",
      "text": "  什麼是商人島？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^!=^.T^,X^1'^!<^=)^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIT1eLlReLFheMSdeITxePSleLlY=",
      "byte_length": 23
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_415c933f5f40",
      "text": "  被謀殺？發生了什麼事？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^(@^3~^%M^.V^&W^&F^*D^!=^.T^*r^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKEBeM35eJU1eLlZeJldeJkZeKkReIT1eLlReKnJeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_650ecf45fc6c",
      "text": "  後來又發生了什麼？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^#b^!O^+;^&W^&F^*D^!=^.T^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeI2JeIU9eKzteJldeJkZeKkReIT1eLlReLlY=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f37b5283aa88",
      "text": "它們在北方，聳立在淤泥海之中。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+o^*{^\"d^+6^$]^*A^4_^0'^\"d^6c^%d^6`^!/^!,^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XitvXip7XiJkXis2XiRdXipBXjRfXjAnXiJkXjZjXiVkXjZgXiEvXiEsXiEi",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c27c74692fe3",
      "text": "我離開時它還在那些島上。可能現在還在那裡。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^)`^)F^$f^+o^.7^\"d^)!^!8^=)^!'^!\"^\"A^'b^&?^\"d^.7^\"d^)!^-j^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXilgXilGXiRmXitvXi43XiJkXikhXiE4Xj0pXiEnXiEiXiJBXidiXiY/XiJkXi43XiJkXikhXi1qXiEi",
      "byte_length": 63
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_10f73e77019c",
      "text": "以前曾有一條地道，把商人島與淤泥海邊緣的懸崖 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!B^!z^.j^$s^!%^%.^\"e^(y^*A^$1^1'^!<^=)^'p^6c^%d^6`^.8^9J^&Z^0a^9l ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFCXiF6Xi5qXiRzXiElXiUuXiJlXih5XipBXiQxXjEnXiE8Xj0pXidwXjZjXiVkXjZgXi44XjlKXiZaXjBhXjlsIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_83b0685ec712",
      "text": "連接在一起，但現在已經坍塌了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.0^$?^\"d^!%^.(^*A^!I^&?^\"d^#J^'D^=%^<f^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi4wXiQ/XiJkXiElXi4oXipBXiFJXiY/XiJkXiNKXidEXj0lXjxmXipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5612498e1de8",
      "text": "為什麼？！地道已經被堵死了——根本過不去。何況我再也 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%{^!=^.T^.V^*W^\"e^(y^#J^'D^(@^;u^%L^*D^*n^*n^%)^$x^(x^!)^\"6^!\"^!L^,q^$%^!l^!1 ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiV7XiE9Xi5UXi5WXipXXiJlXih5XiNKXidEXihAXjt1XiVMXipEXipuXipuXiUpXiR4Xih4XiEpXiI2XiEiXiFMXixxXiQlXiFsXiExIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1b15f2e42760",
      "text": "不想回那裡去了！我正在南方尋找新部落。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^,1^\"\\^)!^-j^\"6^*D^*W^$%^%H^\"d^\"/^$]^#9^$/^$\\^)#^-`^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXiwxXiJcXikhXi1qXiI2XipEXipXXiQlXiVIXiJkXiIvXiRdXiM5XiQvXiRcXikjXi1gXiEi",
      "byte_length": 57
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ce87059a7d05",
      "text": "島上有一座大宅子，住著一個無鱗者家族。他們正是我痛苦的根源。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^=)^!'^$s^!%^/_^\"z^='^#(^*A^*z^-a^!%^!V^%}^*2^'V^+s^5V^!\"^!@^*{^%H^,X^$%^-.^.t^&Z^%)^%q^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xj0pXiEnXiRzXiElXi9fXiJ6Xj0nXiMoXipBXip6Xi1hXiElXiFWXiV9XioyXidWXitzXjVWXiEiXiFAXip7XiVIXixYXiQlXi0uXi50XiZaXiUpXiVxXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5d8b36e82275",
      "text": "他們腐化了我們族裡的一個人，還謀殺了我的配偶。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^*{^0/^\")^*D^$%^*{^5V^-j^&Z^!%^!V^!<^*A^.7^3~^%M^*D^$%^&Z^)&^9,^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXip7XjAvXiIpXipEXiQlXip7XjVWXi1qXiZaXiElXiFWXiE8XipBXi43XjN+XiVNXipEXiQlXiZaXikmXjksXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c7363331e89a",
      "text": "那是淤泥海上一座島嶼上的貿易村落。許多商人經常光顧那裡——它 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^,X^6c^%d^6`^!'^!%^/_^=)^=*^!'^&Z^6/^,W^$z^-`^!\"^-s^\"x^1'^!<^'D^#O^!c^4n^)!^-j^*n^*n^+o ",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXixYXjZjXiVkXjZgXiEnXiElXi9fXj0pXj0qXiEnXiZaXjYvXixXXiR6Xi1gXiEiXi1zXiJ4XjEnXiE8XidEXiNPXiFjXjRuXikhXi1qXipuXipuXitvIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1de6ba9bdbd6",
      "text": "坐落在許多條商路之上。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^8E^-`^\"d^-s^\"x^%.^1'^(a^!/^!'^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjhFXi1gXiJkXi1zXiJ4XiUuXjEnXihhXiEvXiEnXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6b327f086cfb",
      "text": "我的配偶基夫桑曾是酋長——世上找不出比他更出色的獵手。那個商人 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^&Z^)&^9,^/'^\"{^=+^.j^,X^=5^)C^*n^*n^*p^!'^$/^!)^!q^,m^!@^$o^!q^'s^&Z^&;^$+^!\"^)!^!V^1'^!< ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiZaXikmXjksXi8nXiJ7Xj0rXi5qXixYXj01XilDXipuXipuXipwXiEnXiQvXiEpXiFxXixtXiFAXiRvXiFxXidzXiZaXiY7XiQrXiEiXikhXiFWXjEnXiE8IA==",
      "byte_length": 94
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_581eae610984",
      "text": "家族妄想讓整個部落淪為他們的走街小販。基夫桑斷然拒絕。但迪爾薩，一個 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+s^5V^+j^,1^-}^$T^!V^)#^-`^2)^%{^!@^*{^&Z^.&^=3^#;^6.^!\"^/'^\"{^=+^,T^&\"^5Q^-I^!\"^!I^(m^&/^-e^*A^!%^!V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitzXjVWXitqXiwxXi19XiRUXiFWXikjXi1gXjIpXiV7XiFAXip7XiZaXi4mXj0zXiM7XjYuXiEiXi8nXiJ7Xj0rXixUXiYiXjVRXi1JXiEiXiFJXihtXiYvXi1lXipBXiElXiFWIA==",
      "byte_length": 103
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_401887201c80",
      "text": "信奉了你們那套貪婪做派的傢伙，向他發起了決鬥挑戰。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!U^1+^*D^*F^*{^)!^#!^1^^1-^*~^.n^&Z^+#^*y^*A^+?^!@^&W^.(^*D^,o^*,^,H^$(^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFVXjErXipEXipGXip7XikhXiMhXjFeXjEtXip+Xi5uXiZaXisjXip5XipBXis/XiFAXiZXXi4oXipEXixvXiosXixIXiQoXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3b9a66a8c073",
      "text": "你們這類人總是貪婪地搜刮抓取各樣事物，純粹是為了掠奪而掠奪。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^(s^)w^!<^-M^,X^1^^1-^\"e^/h^;r^$2^\":^+>^,f^*r^&4^*A^3\"^5r^,X^%{^*D^1<^1,^'W^1<^1,^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XihzXil3XiE8Xi1NXixYXjFeXjEtXiJlXi9oXjtyXiQyXiI6Xis+XixmXipyXiY0XipBXjMiXjVyXixYXiV7XipEXjE8XjEsXidXXjE8XjEsXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c41ae21471c7",
      "text": "你能據為己有的東西越多，在他人眼裡你就越有勢力，而你也就越想 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^'b^5T^%{^#I^$s^&Z^,`^-l^(]^\"x^*A^\"d^!@^!<^&d^-j^*F^*J^(]^$s^\"&^!~^*A^'W^*F^!1^*J^(]^,1 ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXidiXjVUXiV7XiNJXiRzXiZaXixgXi1sXihdXiJ4XipBXiJkXiFAXiE8XiZkXi1qXipGXipKXihdXiRzXiImXiF+XipBXidXXipGXiExXipKXihdXiwxIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cb007e04406c",
      "text": "攫取更多東西。這就是你們同類的生存之道——你們只看重 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^8]^\":^$o^\"x^,`^-l^!\"^(s^*J^,X^*F^*{^\"E^)w^&Z^&F^#*^!/^(y^*n^*n^*F^*{^\"?^*Q^)) ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjhdXiI6XiRvXiJ4XixgXi1sXiEiXihzXipKXixYXipGXip7XiJFXil3XiZaXiZGXiMqXiEvXih5XipuXipuXipGXip7XiI/XipRXikpIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_07a589e4aaf8",
      "text": "物質。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&4^(Z^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiY0XihaXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 10
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8650c77e8b68",
      "text": "當我為基夫桑準備決鬥時，我們都笑了——迪爾薩根本軟弱無力。但到了決鬥時， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&N^$%^%{^/'^\"{^=+^,x^+\"^,o^*,^$f^*A^$%^*{^)$^-@^*D^*n^*n^(m^&/^-e^%)^$x^.x^#\\^%}^!~^!\"^!I^!u^*D^,o^*,^$f^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZOXiQlXiV7Xi8nXiJ7Xj0rXix4XisiXixvXiosXiRmXipBXiQlXip7XikkXi1AXipEXipuXipuXihtXiYvXi1lXiUpXiR4Xi54XiNcXiV9XiF+XiEiXiFJXiF1XipEXixvXiosXiRmXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 109
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ac0fb762da9c",
      "text": "迪爾薩的力量竟然暴增了十倍，基夫桑被他開膛破肚。隨著他的死， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(m^&/^-e^&Z^!~^)*^28^&\"^$m^\"s^*D^*Y^!W^*A^/'^\"{^=+^(@^!@^)F^=2^&n^=1^!\"^)X^-a^!@^&Z^%L^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihtXiYvXi1lXiZaXiF+XikqXjI4XiYiXiRtXiJzXipEXipZXiFXXipBXi8nXiJ7Xj0rXihAXiFAXilGXj0yXiZuXj0xXiEiXilYXi1hXiFAXiZaXiVMXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_398330fa9da9",
      "text": "部落的榮耀蕩然無存，於是我離開那裡去尋找新部落——遠離 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)#^-`^&Z^,e^7D^1X^&\"^%}^#*^*A^$^^,X^$%^)`^)F^)!^-j^\"6^#9^$/^$\\^)#^-`^*n^*n^({^)` ",
      "encoded_base64": "XikjXi1gXiZaXixlXjdEXjFYXiYiXiV9XiMqXipBXiReXixYXiQlXilgXilGXikhXi1qXiI2XiM5XiQvXiRcXikjXi1gXipuXipuXih7XilgIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6c8c8e0c16da",
      "text": "你們這些同類。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^(s^!8^\"E^)w^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XihzXiE4XiJFXil3XiEi",
      "byte_length": 21
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f93cd52e807b",
      "text": "除非那個商人對迪爾薩施了某種妖術，否則他絕不可能平白變強。除了他們， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)Q^)i^)!^!V^1'^!<^#:^(m^&/^-e^$_^*D^%$^'$^<9^(<^*A^\"H^!x^!@^-I^!)^\"A^'b^0Y^&X^(U^#]^!\"^)Q^*D^!@^*{^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XilRXilpXikhXiFWXjEnXiE8XiM6XihtXiYvXi1lXiRfXipEXiUkXickXjw5Xig8XipBXiJIXiF4XiFAXi1JXiEpXiJBXidiXjBZXiZYXihVXiNdXiEiXilRXipEXiFAXip7XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 103
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5eabb1425869",
      "text": "還有誰會想把我們變成販夫走卒？總之，如果沒有人在背後撐腰， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.7^$s^-y^$r^,1^$1^$%^*{^(U^$$^6.^\"{^.&^=#^.V^-M^!/^*A^#$^%!^%\\^$s^!<^\"d^.r^#b^,L^'f^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi43XiRzXi15XiRyXiwxXiQxXiQlXip7XihVXiQkXjYuXiJ7Xi4mXj0jXi5WXi1NXiEvXipBXiMkXiUhXiVcXiRzXiE8XiJkXi5yXiNiXixMXidmXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_36fdcaba3253",
      "text": "膽小如鼠的迪爾薩根本不敢挑戰基夫桑。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-[^#;^#$^*=^&Z^(m^&/^-e^%)^$x^!)^/m^,H^$(^/'^\"{^=+^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi1bXiM7XiMkXio9XiZaXihtXiYvXi1lXiUpXiR4XiEpXi9tXixIXiQoXi8nXiJ7Xj0rXiEi",
      "byte_length": 54
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1d5b473e19f4",
      "text": "新酋長？跟我說說他和他圖騰的事。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$\\^=5^)C^.V^.+^$%^-x^-x^!@^\"O^!@^\"b^.O^&Z^*r^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRcXj01XilDXi5WXi4rXiQlXi14Xi14XiFAXiJPXiFAXiJiXi5PXiZaXipyXiEi",
      "byte_length": 48
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_78b13b04e2be",
      "text": "  他現在還不是酋長。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^!@^&?^\"d^.7^!)^,X^=5^)C^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIUBeJj9eImReLjdeISleLFhePTVeKUNeISI=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_971a5f96d9f9",
      "text": "  他曾是個被驅逐的年輕蜥蜴人。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^!@^.j^,X^!V^(@^*#^(r^&Z^+~^(g^(2^(3^!<^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIUBeLmpeLFheIVZeKEBeKiNeKHJeJlpeK35eKGdeKDJeKDNeITxeISI=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_899fe7fd91f0",
      "text": "  他的圖騰是旋風。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^!@^&Z^\"b^.O^,X^$`^)y^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIUBeJlpeImJeLk9eLFheJGBeKXleISI=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ea4f06b75575",
      "text": "  他就在西方的鹽灘上。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^!@^*J^\"d^-l^$]^&Z^*4^:j^!'^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIUBeKkpeImReLWxeJF1eJlpeKjReOmpeISdeISI=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_02849cfabd7b",
      "text": "  你會給我任何回報嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^$r^'A^$%^!C^!L^\"\\^+`^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeJHJeJ0FeJCVeIUNeIUxeIlxeK2BeK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_275b71321009",
      "text": "  友誼就是最好的回報。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^\"8^=4^*J^,X^$q^+i^&Z^\"\\^+`^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIjhePTReKkpeLFheJHFeK2leJlpeIlxeK2BeISI=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5ddfca1bb331",
      "text": "那他肯定正在為了追尋自己的圖騰而試煉。這份勇氣真令人敬佩。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^!@^-Z^#.^%H^\"d^%{^*D^(o^#9^'l^#I^&Z^\"b^.O^'W^-u^9\"^!\"^(s^*x^\"$^%U^-2^*w^!<^*O^.}^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXiFAXi1aXiMuXiVIXiJkXiV7XipEXihvXiM5XidsXiNJXiZaXiJiXi5PXidXXi11XjkiXiEiXihzXip4XiIkXiVVXi0yXip3XiE8XipPXi59XiEi",
      "byte_length": 87
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5148b5cf3763",
      "text": "這種人才能成為最出色的酋長。他們有尋找自身啟示異象的魄力。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^'$^!<^$,^'b^$$^%{^$q^!q^'s^&Z^=5^)C^!\"^!@^*{^$s^#9^$/^'l^(c^57^&s^&M^4g^&Z^.S^!~^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXickXiE8XiQsXidiXiQkXiV7XiRxXiFxXidzXiZaXj01XilDXiEiXiFAXip7XiRzXiM5XiQvXidsXihjXjU3XiZzXiZNXjRnXiZaXi5TXiF+XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bf0ac759230e",
      "text": "圖騰會賜予值得認可的年輕後輩無比強大的力量。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"b^.O^$r^.#^!4^!Z^#e^(O^\"A^&Z^+~^(g^#b^8t^%}^,m^#]^\"z^&Z^!~^)*^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJiXi5PXiRyXi4jXiE0XiFaXiNlXihPXiJBXiZaXit+XihnXiNiXjh0XiV9XixtXiNdXiJ6XiZaXiF+XikqXiEi",
      "byte_length": 66
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a40af870e7b6",
      "text": "那是代表速度與隱匿的圖騰。一個旋風部落能夠掌控 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^,X^*v^-i^(u^#V^'p^)Y^7%^&Z^\"b^.O^!\"^!%^!V^$`^)y^)#^-`^'b^+d^$;^$@ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXixYXip2Xi1pXih1XiNWXidwXilZXjclXiZaXiJiXi5PXiEiXiElXiFWXiRgXil5XikjXi1gXidiXitkXiQ7XiRAIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7856388bb652",
      "text": "極其廣闊的獵場。他的部落將會無比強大。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^1D^!j^9V^)I^&Z^&;^\"n^!\"^!@^&Z^)#^-`^#7^$r^%}^,m^#]^\"z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XjFEXiFqXjlWXilJXiZaXiY7XiJuXiEiXiFAXiZaXikjXi1gXiM3XiRyXiV9XixtXiNdXiJ6XiEi",
      "byte_length": 57
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_842914c63307",
      "text": "我會去找他。也許他的部落值得我加入。感謝你們的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^$r^\"6^$/^!@^!\"^!1^-s^!@^&Z^)#^-`^!Z^#e^$%^\"\"^!f^!\"^#{^-z^*F^*{^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiRyXiI2XiQvXiFAXiEiXiExXi1zXiFAXiZaXikjXi1gXiFaXiNlXiQlXiIiXiFmXiEiXiN7Xi16XipGXip7XiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_010de6c99e11",
      "text": "相助。無鱗者向來很少在伸手索取之前無償付出。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&a^\"#^!\"^%}^*2^'V^+?^!O^*K^#<^\"d^/N^$+^'>^\":^!/^!z^%}^5-^*u^!q^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZhXiIjXiEiXiV9XioyXidWXis/XiFPXipLXiM8XiJkXi9OXiQrXic+XiI6XiEvXiF6XiV9XjUtXip1XiFxXiEi",
      "byte_length": 66
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e1915f22fd60",
      "text": "你的血統出賣了你。果然從來不會有不求回報的付出。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^&Z^(:^'B^!q^.$^*D^*F^!\"^%!^&\"^#f^!O^!)^$r^$s^!)^,n^\"\\^+`^&Z^*u^!q^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiZaXig6XidCXiFxXi4kXipEXipGXiEiXiUhXiYiXiNmXiFPXiEpXiRyXiRzXiEpXixuXiJcXitgXiZaXip1XiFxXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_27f73f0bff31",
      "text": "我身上既沒有小販的貨物，也沒有半塊陶幣。我絕不會為你們 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^(c^!'^,U^%\\^$s^#;^6.^&Z^.w^&4^*A^!1^%\\^$s^\"-^/Z^)R^+|^!\"^$%^-I^!)^$r^%{^*F^*{ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXihjXiEnXixVXiVcXiRzXiM7XjYuXiZaXi53XiY0XipBXiExXiVcXiRzXiItXi9aXilSXit8XiEiXiQlXi1JXiEpXiRyXiV7XipGXip7IA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ced403752380",
      "text": "背負任何義務。我們說得夠多了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.r^(W^!C^!L^2<^+4^!\"^$%^*{^-x^#e^+d^\"x^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi5yXihXXiFDXiFMXjI8Xis0XiEiXiQlXip7Xi14XiNlXitkXiJ4XipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_33dce44c350f",
      "text": "也許你本該生著鱗片降世。我接受你們許下的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!1^-s^*F^$x^(M^&F^-a^*2^&1^)N^*p^!\"^$%^$?^\";^*F^*{^-s^!(^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiExXi1zXipGXiR4XihNXiZGXi1hXioyXiYxXilOXipwXiEiXiQlXiQ/XiI7XipGXip7Xi1zXiEoXiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f6076ee5d14c",
      "text": "友誼誓約。等我見到酋長，我會讓他將你們列為『非獵物』。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"8^=4^-w^-F^!\"^'-^$%^-m^!u^=5^)C^*A^$%^$r^-}^!@^#7^*F^*{^8f^%{^<_^)i^&;^&4^<`^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiI4Xj00Xi13Xi1GXiEiXictXiQlXi1tXiF1Xj01XilDXipBXiQlXiRyXi19XiFAXiM3XipGXip7XjhmXiV7XjxfXilpXiY7XiY0XjxgXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_920f7b8a5ea3",
      "text": "你們配得上與我們共享獵獲。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^)&^#e^!'^'p^$%^*{^3d^!;^&;^&:^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XikmXiNlXiEnXidwXiQlXip7XjNkXiE7XiY7XiY6XiEi",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ac8ff63c0fe2",
      "text": "這個話題事關我自身。要說就繼續說，不然就離開。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^!V^-v^.G^*r^.>^$%^'l^(c^!\"^(C^-x^*J^-O^'M^-x^*A^!)^&\"^*J^)`^)F^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXiFWXi12Xi5HXipyXi4+XiQlXidsXihjXiEiXihDXi14XipKXi1PXidNXi14XipBXiEpXiYiXipKXilgXilGXiEi",
      "byte_length": 69
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_91f38c3ecfd6",
      "text": "  當然。我想談談那位酋長。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^&N^&\"^!\"^$%^,1^0;^0;^)!^!J^=5^)C^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJk5eJiJeISJeJCVeLDFeMDteMDteKSFeIUpePTVeKUNeISI=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_329f2884a458",
      "text": "  那我自便就是了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^)!^$%^'l^!R^*J^,X^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKSFeJCVeJ2xeIVJeKkpeLFheKkReISI=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cfe728a9eead",
      "text": "向你們致問候，『非獵物』。我已經找到了我的新部落。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+?^*F^*{^'o^*Z^*|^*A^<_^)i^&;^&4^<`^!\"^$%^#J^'D^$/^!u^*D^$%^&Z^$\\^)#^-`^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xis/XipGXip7XidvXipaXip8XipBXjxfXilpXiY7XiY0XjxgXiEiXiQlXiNKXidEXiQvXiF1XipEXiQlXiZaXiRcXikjXi1gXiEi",
      "byte_length": 75
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e707b0fb8b40",
      "text": "  這個部落比你之前的部落更好嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^(s^!V^)#^-`^,m^*F^!/^!z^&Z^)#^-`^$o^+i^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKHNeIVZeKSNeLWBeLG1eKkZeIS9eIXpeJlpeKSNeLWBeJG9eK2leK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 47
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ff45f0dafcbe",
      "text": "  你這一路走來凶險嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^(s^!%^(a^.&^!O^3e^*m^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeKHNeISVeKGFeLiZeIU9eM2VeKm1eK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_294aaca41e73",
      "text": "  你覺得索萬怎麼樣？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^(G^#e^'>^-_^,,^.T^,f^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeKEdeI2VeJz5eLV9eLCxeLlReLGZeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_63ebe21c26de",
      "text": "我得繼續趕路了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^#e^-O^'M^0u^(a^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiNlXi1PXidNXjB1XihhXipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5a4cc7989bcc",
      "text": "他恪守榮耀。能獲得如此強大的圖騰庇佑，他必定擁有充沛的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^49^#+^,e^7D^!\"^'b^&:^#e^#$^%I^#]^\"z^&Z^\"b^.O^,\"^4.^*A^!@^#l^#.^,M^$s^5.^8I^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXjQ5XiMrXixlXjdEXiEiXidiXiY6XiNlXiMkXiVJXiNdXiJ6XiZaXiJiXi5PXiwiXjQuXipBXiFAXiNsXiMuXixNXiRzXjUuXjhJXiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_54acead9acaf",
      "text": "內在力量。只要他還是酋長，我想我會一直留下來。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!g^\"d^!~^)*^!\"^\"?^(C^!@^.7^,X^=5^)C^*A^$%^,1^$%^$r^!%^&`^-+^!(^!O^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFnXiJkXiF+XikqXiEiXiI/XihDXiFAXi43XixYXj01XilDXipBXiQlXiwxXiQlXiRyXiElXiZgXi0rXiEoXiFPXiEi",
      "byte_length": 69
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9670597f5aaa",
      "text": "這個部落年輕且充滿榮耀。這裡的土地雖然險惡，但我們比你們這幫無鱗者 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^!V^)#^-`^+~^(g^!*^5.^,{^,e^7D^!\"^(s^-j^&Z^\"c^\"e^.A^&\"^*m^#y^*A^!I^$%^*{^,m^*F^*{^(s^+}^%}^*2^'V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXiFWXikjXi1gXit+XihnXiEqXjUuXix7XixlXjdEXiEiXihzXi1qXiZaXiJjXiJlXi5BXiYiXiptXiN5XipBXiFJXiQlXip7XixtXipGXip7XihzXit9XiV9XioyXidWIA==",
      "byte_length": 100
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_df297efde971",
      "text": "能存活得好得多。我們能喝下帶硫磺的水， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'b^#*^%i^#e^+i^#e^\"x^!\"^$%^*{^'b^6M^!(^#N^=.^=/^&Z^%V^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XidiXiMqXiVpXiNlXitpXiNlXiJ4XiEiXiQlXip7XidiXjZNXiEoXiNOXj0uXj0vXiZaXiVWXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e7f5e4d59ac1",
      "text": "也能享受這炙熱的烈日。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!1^'b^!;^\";^(s^7=^&$^&Z^%|^$a^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiExXidiXiE7XiI7XihzXjc9XiYkXiZaXiV8XiRhXiEi",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_91402b5cbe4d",
      "text": "命運眷顧了我的追尋之路。它引領我平安來到了這個部落。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"N^.4^7A^4n^*D^$%^&Z^(o^#9^!/^(a^!\"^+o^#Z^)s^$%^0Y^+p^!O^!u^*D^(s^!V^)#^-`^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJOXi40XjdBXjRuXipEXiQlXiZaXihvXiM5XiEvXihhXiEiXitvXiNaXilzXiQlXjBZXitwXiFPXiF1XipEXihzXiFWXikjXi1gXiEi",
      "byte_length": 78
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f66aca411e22",
      "text": "我很高興能與你們相遇。你們的指引讓我在體力耗盡前趕到了這裡。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*K^*+^-]^'b^'p^*F^*{^&a^.2^!\"^*F^*{^&Z^$8^#Z^-}^$%^\"d^**^!~^'X^-1^!z^0u^!u^*D^(s^-j^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXipLXiorXi1dXidiXidwXipGXip7XiZhXi4yXiEiXipGXip7XiZaXiQ4XiNaXi19XiQlXiJkXioqXiF+XidYXi0xXiF6XjB1XiF1XipEXihzXi1qXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a73960f4f94e",
      "text": "雖然你們當初只要求友誼，但我知道你們這類人看重 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.A^&\"^*F^*{^&N^1\"^\"?^(C^,n^\"8^=4^*A^!I^$%^&h^(y^*F^*{^(s^)w^!<^*Q^)) ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi5BXiYiXipGXip7XiZOXjEiXiI/XihDXixuXiI4Xj00XipBXiFJXiQlXiZoXih5XipGXip7XihzXil3XiE8XipRXikpIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8e7f4ba982b5",
      "text": "物質報酬。出於榮耀，我願贈予你們一件珍貴之物。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&4^(Z^+`^7o^!\"^!q^$^^,e^7D^*A^$%^.H^([^!4^*F^*{^!%^.W^/7^2F^!/^&4^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiY0XihaXitgXjdvXiEiXiFxXiReXixlXjdEXipBXiQlXi5IXihbXiE0XipGXip7XiElXi5XXi83XjJGXiEvXiY0XiEi",
      "byte_length": 69
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_da5a4c5337c5",
      "text": "  能告訴我是什麼樣的物品嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^'b^+B^-t^$%^,X^!=^.T^,f^&Z^&4^\"R^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJ2JeK0JeLXReJCVeLFheIT1eLlReLGZeJlpeJjReIlJeK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bf468dc18a46",
      "text": "  我依然只求與你們結為朋友。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^!Q^&\"^\"?^,n^'p^*F^*{^'@^%{^,[^\"8^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeIVFeJiJeIj9eLG5eJ3BeKkZeKnteJ0BeJXteLFteIjheISI=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_44d771bb8ba0",
      "text": "  我懷著榮耀接受這件禮物。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^,9^-a^,e^7D^$?^\";^(s^.W^-8^&4^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeLDleLWFeLGVeN0ReJD9eIjteKHNeLldeLTheJjReISI=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4b674ff65268",
      "text": "  快把它交給我！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*L^$1^+o^0P^'A^$%^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkxeJDFeK29eMFBeJ0FeJCVeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 23
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c33f3c216eee",
      "text": "  我不需要它。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^!)^)e^(C^+o^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeISleKWVeKENeK29eISI=",
      "byte_length": 20
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_72a7092d8c7b",
      "text": "  我還是必須拒絕。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^.7^,X^#l^)r^5Q^-I^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeLjdeLFheI2xeKXJeNVFeLUleISI=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_78d5c725bfcc",
      "text": "它散發著一股魔法的惡臭。我們圖騰給予的夢境啟示告訴我，它能助你們達成追尋。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+o^$S^&W^-a^!%^'_^*0^%b^&Z^#y^'m^!\"^$%^*{^\"b^.O^'A^!4^&Z^\"y^\"q^57^&s^+B^-t^$%^*A^+o^'b^\"#^*F^*{^(z^$$^(o^#9^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XitvXiRTXiZXXi1hXiElXidfXiowXiViXiZaXiN5XidtXiEiXiQlXip7XiJiXi5PXidBXiE0XiZaXiJ5XiJxXjU3XiZzXitCXi10XiQlXipBXitvXidiXiIjXipGXip7Xih6XiQkXihvXiM5XiEi",
      "byte_length": 111
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a3976918ae81",
      "text": "這就是我贈予你們的原因。你們的做法與我們不同，而物質 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^*J^,X^$%^([^!4^*F^*{^&Z^\"5^\"]^!\"^*F^*{^&Z^*~^%b^'p^$%^*{^!)^\"E^*A^'W^&4^(Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXipKXixYXiQlXihbXiE0XipGXip7XiZaXiI1XiJdXiEiXipGXip7XiZaXip+XiViXidwXiQlXip7XiEpXiJFXipBXidXXiY0XihaIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4479eede56c3",
      "text": "對你們的旅途與追尋至關重要。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#:^*F^*{^&Z^2m^3.^'p^(o^#9^'n^.>^))^(C^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiM6XipGXip7XiZaXjJtXjMuXidwXihvXiM5XiduXi4+XikpXihDXiEi",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ac0a5ff5bab6",
      "text": "你的榮耀增添了我的光彩。部落與你們結為朋友實乃明智之舉。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^&Z^,e^7D^\"s^5`^*D^$%^&Z^!c^#`^!\"^)#^-`^'p^*F^*{^'@^%{^,[^\"8^#3^/M^$c^$i^!/^01^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiZaXixlXjdEXiJzXjVgXipEXiQlXiZaXiFjXiNgXiEiXikjXi1gXidwXipGXip7XidAXiV7XixbXiI4XiMzXi9NXiRjXiRpXiEvXjAxXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fef79eb24fbb",
      "text": "無鱗者對物質財富的渴求總能逗我發笑。這件東西 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%}^*2^'V^#:^&4^(Z^0=^3C^&Z^,w^,n^-M^'b^;;^$%^&W^-@^!\"^(s^.W^,`^-l ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiV9XioyXidWXiM6XiY0XihaXjA9XjNDXiZaXix3XixuXi1NXidiXjs7XiQlXiZXXi1AXiEiXihzXi5XXixgXi1sIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e105ac005c91",
      "text": "就給你們吧。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*J^'A^*F^*{^*I^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipKXidBXipGXip7XipJXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 19
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b4e879597639",
      "text": "我的夢境說你們確實需要它。你們的做法不會冒犯到我。這份饋贈是 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^&Z^\"y^\"q^-x^*F^*{^-6^#3^)e^(C^+o^!\"^*F^*{^&Z^*~^%b^!)^$r^/P^-%^!u^$%^!\"^(s^*x^)}^([^,X ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiZaXiJ5XiJxXi14XipGXip7Xi02XiMzXillXihDXitvXiEiXipGXip7XiZaXip+XiViXiEpXiRyXi9QXi0lXiF1XiQlXiEiXihzXip4Xil9XihbXixYIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5234f0122420",
      "text": "出於榮耀的。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!q^$^^,e^7D^&Z^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFxXiReXixlXjdEXiZaXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 19
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5c9133bfd5a9",
      "text": "那我也不強求你們收下。我會把它扔進一道深邃的地裂中， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^$%^!1^!)^#]^,n^*F^*{^$M^!(^!\"^$%^$r^$1^+o^8{^(w^!%^(y^2*^6;^&Z^\"e^8r^!,^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXiQlXiExXiEpXiNdXixuXipGXip7XiRNXiEoXiEiXiQlXiRyXiQxXitvXjh7Xih3XiElXih5XjIqXjY7XiZaXiJlXjhyXiEsXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9248d4befb25",
      "text": "這樣就沒有人能用它來對付你們了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^,f^*J^%\\^$s^!<^'b^&H^+o^!O^#:^*u^*F^*{^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXixmXipKXiVcXiRzXiE8XidiXiZIXitvXiFPXiM6Xip1XipGXip7XipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 49
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_311585c86703",
      "text": "你們身上帶不下了，所以我把它留在這裡給你們。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^(c^!'^#N^!)^!(^*D^*A^$)^!B^$%^$1^+o^-+^\"d^(s^-j^'A^*F^*{^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XihjXiEnXiNOXiEpXiEoXipEXipBXiQpXiFCXiQlXiQxXitvXi0rXiJkXihzXi1qXidBXipGXip7XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_798066a9f60f",
      "text": "看來我們的命運交織在一起了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*Q^!O^$%^*{^&Z^\"N^.4^0P^3z^\"d^!%^.(^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipRXiFPXiQlXip7XiZaXiJOXi40XjBQXjN6XiJkXiElXi4oXipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_80a730abe5ef",
      "text": "  部落現在情況如何？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^)#^-`^&?^\"d^,0^,q^#$^!L^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKSNeLWBeJj9eImReLDBeLHFeIyReIUxeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f4c2f212abf0",
      "text": "  這裡有發生什麼值得注意的事嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^(s^-j^$s^&W^&F^!=^.T^!Z^#e^%e^#z^&Z^*r^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKHNeLWpeJHNeJldeJkZeIT1eLlReIVpeI2VeJWVeI3peJlpeKnJeK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 47
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a456d1dc047a",
      "text": "  你在期待有自己的孩子嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^\"d^$u^,*^$s^'l^#I^&Z^+m^#(^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeImReJHVeLCpeJHNeJ2xeI0leJlpeK21eIyheK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_52fe3ae08c19",
      "text": "我必須繼續前行了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^#l^)r^-O^'M^!z^(;^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiNsXilyXi1PXidNXiF6Xig7XipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9b419b95bc6e",
      "text": "部落正在穩步壯大。我們的圖騰庇佑著我們。許多族人都外出狩獵了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)#^-`^%H^\"d^-;^,i^+b^\"z^!\"^$%^*{^&Z^\"b^.O^,\"^4.^-a^$%^*{^!\"^-s^\"x^5V^!<^)$^\"w^!q^8l^&;^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XikjXi1gXiVIXiJkXi07XixpXitiXiJ6XiEiXiQlXip7XiZaXiJiXi5PXiwiXjQuXi1hXiQlXip7XiEiXi1zXiJ4XjVWXiE8XikkXiJ3XiFxXjhsXiY7XipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 93
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ab692e90881a",
      "text": "我已經成為索萬的配偶。我找到了一位令我打心底敬重的酋長。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^#J^'D^$$^%{^'>^-_^&Z^)&^9,^!\"^$%^$/^!u^*D^!%^!J^*w^$%^$-^#k^/^^*O^))^&Z^=5^)C^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiNKXidEXiQkXiV7Xic+Xi1fXiZaXikmXjksXiEiXiQlXiQvXiF1XipEXiElXiFKXip3XiQlXiQtXiNrXi9eXipPXikpXiZaXj01XilDXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4c789c1063e3",
      "text": "榮耀將長存於他的心中，以及他子嗣的心中。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,e^7D^#7^)C^#*^$^^!@^&Z^#k^!,^*A^!B^\"7^!@^#(^=$^&Z^#k^!,^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XixlXjdEXiM3XilDXiMqXiReXiFAXiZaXiNrXiEsXipBXiFCXiI3XiFAXiMoXj0kXiZaXiNrXiEsXiEi",
      "byte_length": 60
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2bd0dbce6194",
      "text": "還沒有，但我們圖騰降下的夢境預示著那一天很快就會到來。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.7^%\\^$s^*A^!I^$%^*{^\"b^.O^)N^!(^&Z^\"y^\"q^.E^&s^-a^)!^!%^+e^*K^*L^*J^$r^!u^!O^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi43XiVcXiRzXipBXiFJXiQlXip7XiJiXi5PXilOXiEoXiZaXiJ5XiJxXi5FXiZzXi1hXikhXiElXitlXipLXipMXipKXiRyXiF1XiFPXiEi",
      "byte_length": 81
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8e4bc580195a",
      "text": "希望你們的追尋之旅能像我一樣順利。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+{^,]^*F^*{^&Z^(o^#9^!/^2m^'b^!`^$%^!%^,f^.D^!t^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xit7XixdXipGXip7XiZaXihvXiM5XiEvXjJtXidiXiFgXiQlXiElXixmXi5EXiF0XiEi",
      "byte_length": 51
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c82ff3d43e71",
      "text": "  你最近有什麼新消息嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^$q^(l^$s^!=^.T^$\\^%k^#w^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeJHFeKGxeJHNeIT1eLlReJFxeJWteI3deK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_16f49af63b53",
      "text": "  恭喜你。你的家族必定繁榮昌盛。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^1{^+V^*F^!\"^*F^&Z^+s^5V^#l^#.^-N^,e^2%^1L^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeMXteK1ZeKkZeISJeKkZeJlpeK3NeNVZeI2xeIy5eLU5eLGVeMiVeMUxeISI=",
      "byte_length": 47
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e453eaee70bb",
      "text": "我現在有一窩蛋埋在地底下。我們的圖騰 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^&?^\"d^$s^!%^=0^6\"^1r^\"d^\"e^/^^!(^!\"^$%^*{^&Z^\"b^.O ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiY/XiJkXiRzXiElXj0wXjYiXjFyXiJkXiJlXi9eXiEoXiEiXiQlXip7XiZaXiJiXi5PIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2a2086980a3d",
      "text": "庇護著牠們並賜予力量。到今年年底，我和索萬 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,\"^(T^-a^-#^*{^!+^.#^!4^!~^)*^!\"^!u^*E^+~^+~^/^^*A^$%^\"O^'>^-_ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiwiXihUXi1hXi0jXip7XiErXi4jXiE0XiF+XikqXiEiXiF1XipFXit+Xit+Xi9eXipBXiQlXiJPXic+Xi1fIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_10ee7d8c5189",
      "text": "就會有一打孵化出世的小蜥蜴了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*J^$r^$s^!%^$-^=&^\")^!q^*p^&Z^#;^(2^(3^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipKXiRyXiRzXiElXiQtXj0mXiIpXiFxXipwXiZaXiM7XigyXigzXipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7c38024ae78c",
      "text": "你們令我深感榮幸。我的夢境預示你們也會大獲全勝。你們將會 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^*w^$%^2*^#{^,e^15^!\"^$%^&Z^\"y^\"q^.E^&s^*F^*{^!1^$r^\"z^&:^!h^+5^!\"^*F^*{^#7^$r ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7Xip3XiQlXjIqXiN7XixlXjE1XiEiXiQlXiZaXiJ5XiJxXi5FXiZzXipGXip7XiExXiRyXiJ6XiY6XiFoXis1XiEiXipGXip7XiM3XiRyIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1ea5d83ce15b",
      "text": "名揚遠方，贏得無數戰役。阿薩斯會因你們的追尋而變得更好。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"F^2k^({^$]^*A^.%^#e^%}^$V^$(^17^!\"^)M^-e^$[^$r^\"]^*F^*{^&Z^(o^#9^'W^(U^#e^$o^+i^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJGXjJrXih7XiRdXipBXi4lXiNlXiV9XiRWXiQoXjE3XiEiXilNXi1lXiRbXiRyXiJdXipGXip7XiZaXihvXiM5XidXXihVXiNlXiRvXitpXiEi",
      "byte_length": 84
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_85d26cc2eb90",
      "text": "我沒什麼新鮮事好說了。去旅行吧，以後再來拜訪我。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^%\\^!=^.T^$\\^35^*r^+i^-x^*D^!\"^\"6^2m^(;^*I^*A^!B^#b^!l^!O^,E^4d^$%^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiVcXiE9Xi5UXiRcXjM1XipyXitpXi14XipEXiEiXiI2XjJtXig7XipJXipBXiFCXiNiXiFsXiFPXixFXjRkXiQlXiEi",
      "byte_length": 72
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_addfebeac29d",
      "text": "願你們永遠獵獲豐盈。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.H^*F^*{^%W^({^&;^&:^4!^=-^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi5IXipGXip7XiVXXih7XiY7XiY6XjQhXj0tXiEi",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9797625944e3",
      "text": "救命啊！強盜要殺我！我發現了一處古代廢墟，而他們 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,Q^\"N^+Q^*W^#]^0!^(C^%M^$%^*W^$%^&W^&?^*D^!%^(,^\"=^*v^#W^\"t^*A^'W^!@^*{ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XixRXiJOXitRXipXXiNdXjAhXihDXiVNXiQlXipXXiQlXiZXXiY/XipEXiElXigsXiI9Xip2XiNXXiJ0XipBXidXXiFAXip7IA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2b8dcbd66b95",
      "text": "想把那裡據為己有！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,1^$1^)!^-j^5T^%{^#I^$s^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiwxXiQxXikhXi1qXjVUXiV7XiNJXiRzXipX",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_04ca3c9426a5",
      "text": "他們派了一隻火元素來殺我！我僥倖逃脫了，但我知道他們還會再派 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^*{^.n^*D^!%^)[^%x^!a^'=^!O^%M^$%^*W^$%^=\"^5+^(p^'c^*D^*A^!I^$%^&h^(y^!@^*{^.7^$r^!l^.n ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXip7Xi5uXipEXiElXilbXiV4XiFhXic9XiFPXiVNXiQlXipXXiQlXj0iXjUrXihwXidjXipEXipBXiFJXiQlXiZoXih5XiFAXip7Xi43XiRyXiFsXi5uIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_54b4d0f4f56d",
      "text": "另一隻來！你們一定要幫我除掉他們！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\">^!%^)[^!O^*W^*F^*{^!%^#.^(C^+}^$%^)Q^/e^!@^*{^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiI+XiElXilbXiFPXipXXipGXip7XiElXiMuXihDXit9XiQlXilRXi9lXiFAXip7XipX",
      "byte_length": 51
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9b9040ef4370",
      "text": "  我為什麼要幫你除掉他們？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^%{^!=^.T^(C^+}^*F^)Q^/e^!@^*{^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeJXteIT1eLlReKENeK31eKkZeKVFeL2VeIUBeKnteLlY=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_39c9c090265d",
      "text": "  我也大可直接殺了你拿走懸賞。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^!1^\"z^\"A^&`^$?^%M^*D^*F^,G^.&^0a^*T^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeITFeInpeIkFeJmBeJD9eJU1eKkReKkZeLEdeLiZeMGFeKlReISI=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5502504b0772",
      "text": "  他們為什麼要派元素生物追殺你？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^!@^*{^%{^!=^.T^(C^.n^!a^'=^&F^&4^(o^%M^*F^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIUBeKnteJXteIT1eLlReKENeLm5eIWFeJz1eJkZeJjReKG9eJU1eKkZeLlYg",
      "byte_length": 48
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_420ef67f523f",
      "text": "  你剛才說是廢墟。那這條地裂是怎麼回事？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^+0^$,^-x^,X^#W^\"t^!\"^)!^(s^%.^\"e^8r^,X^,,^.T^\"\\^*r^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeKzBeJCxeLXheLFheI1deInReISJeKSFeKHNeJS5eImVeOHJeLFheLCxeLlReIlxeKnJeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 59
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a75e2352cc6d",
      "text": "  好吧。我會幫你。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^+i^*I^!\"^$%^$r^+}^*F^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeK2leKkleISJeJCVeJHJeK31eKkZeISI=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2a083549f1ca",
      "text": "  我才不在乎你的死活！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^$,^!)^\"d^!0^*F^&Z^%L^%i^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeJCxeISleImReITBeKkZeJlpeJUxeJWleKlc=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4d110f322163",
      "text": "我要走了。告辭。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^(C^.&^*D^!\"^+B^2M^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXihDXi4mXipEXiEiXitCXjJNXiEi",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_be6e1ff97d94",
      "text": "如果你們能擊退他們，我會給你們豐厚的回報絕不讓你們白跑一趟， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#$^%!^*F^*{^'b^$F^*V^!@^*{^*A^$%^$r^'A^*F^*{^4!^\"4^&Z^\"\\^+`^-I^!)^-}^*F^*{^&X^(_^!%^8)^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiMkXiUhXipGXip7XidiXiRGXipWXiFAXip7XipBXiQlXiRyXidBXipGXip7XjQhXiI0XiZaXiJcXitgXi1JXiEpXi19XipGXip7XiZYXihfXiElXjgpXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ef3ff2685ab1",
      "text": "但必須等你們把他們趕跑之後才行！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!I^#l^)r^'-^*F^*{^$1^!@^*{^0u^(_^!/^#b^$,^(;^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFJXiNsXilyXictXipGXip7XiQxXiFAXip7XjB1XihfXiEvXiNiXiQsXig7XipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 49
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0ab93ff4cb2d",
      "text": "你、你們確實可以，但那樣你們就體會不到消滅阿薩斯世間邪惡的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^!!^*F^*{^-6^#3^\"A^!B^*A^!I^)!^,f^*F^*{^*J^**^$r^!)^!u^%k^%t^)M^-e^$[^*p^)G^)\"^#y^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiEhXipGXip7Xi02XiMzXiJBXiFCXipBXiFJXikhXixmXipGXip7XipKXioqXiRyXiEpXiF1XiVrXiV0XilNXi1lXiRbXipwXilHXikiXiN5XiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_420e31851fd9",
      "text": "成就感了！你們只不過是冷血殺害了一個手無寸鐵的隱士—— ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$$^*J^#{^*D^*W^*F^*{^\"?^!)^(x^,X^!n^(:^%M^#/^*D^!%^!V^$+^%}^=(^)?^&Z^)Y^+a^*n^*n ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQkXipKXiN7XipEXipXXipGXip7XiI/XiEpXih4XixYXiFuXig6XiVNXiMvXipEXiElXiFWXiQrXiV9Xj0oXik/XiZaXilZXithXipuXipuIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7f368d492e09",
      "text": "那算什麼榮耀？求求你們幫幫我！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^-C^!=^.T^,e^7D^.V^,n^,n^*F^*{^+}^+}^$%^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXi1DXiE9Xi5UXixlXjdEXi5WXixuXixuXipGXip7Xit9Xit9XiQlXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_27aa7cd88e1b",
      "text": "就像我跟你們說的，他們想從地裂中召喚元素生物！我擋了他們的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*J^!`^$%^.+^*F^*{^-x^&Z^*A^!@^*{^,1^#f^\"e^8r^!,^\"@^\"U^!a^'=^&F^&4^*W^$%^$G^*D^!@^*{^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipKXiFgXiQlXi4rXipGXip7Xi14XiZaXipBXiFAXip7XiwxXiNmXiJlXjhyXiEsXiJAXiJVXiFhXic9XiZGXiY0XipXXiQlXiRHXipEXiFAXip7XiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d0cb38f2a5d5",
      "text": "路，所以他們才派火元素來追殺我！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(a^*A^$)^!B^!@^*{^$,^.n^%x^!a^'=^!O^(o^%M^$%^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihhXipBXiQpXiFCXiFAXip7XiQsXi5uXiV4XiFhXic9XiFPXihvXiVNXiQlXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 49
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7d52acbe0ca8",
      "text": "對不起。我太慌亂了，我本來想說廢墟卻口誤說成了地裂。你們能 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#:^!)^.(^!\"^$%^+f^#}^!3^*D^*A^$%^$x^!O^,1^-x^#W^\"t^1&^\"<^(P^-x^$$^*D^\"e^8r^!\"^*F^*{^'b ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiM6XiEpXi4oXiEiXiQlXitmXiN9XiEzXipEXipBXiQlXiR4XiFPXiwxXi14XiNXXiJ0XjEmXiI8XihQXi14XiQkXipEXiJlXjhyXiEiXipGXip7XidiIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_16c0a72f97a8",
      "text": "理解這點的，對吧？我可是差一點就沒命了！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&A^(I^(s^*;^&Z^*A^#:^*I^.V^$%^\"A^,X^48^!%^*;^*J^%\\^\"N^*D^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZBXihJXihzXio7XiZaXipBXiM6XipJXi5WXiQlXiJBXixYXjQ4XiElXio7XipKXiVcXiJOXipEXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_dcb341e8c2f9",
      "text": "謝謝你們！請快一點！廢、廢墟就在西南方。小心那些火 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-z^-z^*F^*{^*W^*S^*L^!%^*;^*W^#W^!!^#W^\"t^*J^\"d^-l^\"/^$]^!\"^#;^#k^)!^!8^%x ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi16Xi16XipGXip7XipXXipTXipMXiElXio7XipXXiNXXiEhXiNXXiJ0XipKXiJkXi1sXiIvXiRdXiEiXiM7XiNrXikhXiE4XiV4IA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_88bdbdd8ef8a",
      "text": "元素！那些強盜已經召喚了好幾隻！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!a^'=^*W^)!^!8^#]^0!^#J^'D^\"@^\"U^*D^+i^#T^)[^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFhXic9XipXXikhXiE4XiNdXjAhXiNKXidEXiJAXiJVXipEXitpXiNUXilbXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 49
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e5887a3486e7",
      "text": "求求你們了！可憐可憐我這個老隱士吧！快把強盜趕走！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,n^,n^*F^*{^*D^*W^\"A^1}^\"A^1}^$%^(s^!V^'U^)Y^+a^*I^*W^*L^$1^#]^0!^0u^.&^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XixuXixuXipGXip7XipEXipXXiJBXjF9XiJBXjF9XiQlXihzXiFWXidVXilZXithXipJXipXXipMXiQxXiNdXjAhXjB1Xi4mXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_80b5940a42b2",
      "text": "行行好發發慈悲吧！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(;^(;^+i^&W^&W^3H^,.^*I^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "Xig7Xig7XitpXiZXXiZXXjNIXiwuXipJXipX",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e6f29a9a5584",
      "text": "要是你們不除掉那幫殺人兇手，火元素會把我活活燒死的！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(C^,X^*F^*{^!)^)Q^/e^)!^+}^%M^!<^*G^$+^*A^%x^!a^'=^$r^$1^$%^%i^%i^&&^%L^&Z^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihDXixYXipGXip7XiEpXilRXi9lXikhXit9XiVNXiE8XipHXiQrXipBXiV4XiFhXic9XiRyXiQxXiQlXiVpXiVpXiYmXiVMXiZaXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d50f270316e0",
      "text": "我知道一定會的！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^&h^(y^!%^#.^$r^&Z^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiZoXih5XiElXiMuXiRyXiZaXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_81bc9da0b7e8",
      "text": "看吧！他命令火元素攻擊了！殺了他！求求你們！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*Q^*I^*W^!@^\"N^*w^%x^!a^'=^$O^$F^*D^*W^%M^*D^!@^*W^,n^,n^*F^*{^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipRXipJXipXXiFAXiJOXip3XiV4XiFhXic9XiRPXiRGXipEXipXXiVNXipEXiFAXipXXixuXixuXipGXip7XipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ebd822937f46",
      "text": "  巡林客說你是個荒蕪術士。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^8g^/1^+q^-x^*F^,X^!V^1W^4b^(<^+a^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeOGdeLzFeK3FeLXheKkZeLFheIVZeMVdeNGJeKDxeK2FeISI=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6ae4f7648541",
      "text": "  為什麼沒有更多的元素生物來攻擊你？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^%{^!=^.T^%\\^$s^$o^\"x^&Z^!a^'=^&F^&4^!O^$O^$F^*F^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJXteIT1eLlReJVxeJHNeJG9eInheJlpeIWFeJz1eJkZeJjReIU9eJE9eJEZeKkZeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 53
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2ada4b3906fb",
      "text": "  你為什麼不直接離開這個地區？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^%{^!=^.T^!)^&`^$?^)`^)F^(s^!V^\"e^\"+^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeJXteIT1eLlReISleJmBeJD9eKWBeKUZeKHNeIVZeImVeIiteLlY=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e871ac887da5",
      "text": "  你這麼膽小懦弱，根本不可能有這種堅定信念。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^(s^.T^-[^#;^,7^#\\^*A^%)^$x^!)^\"A^'b^$s^(s^'$^\"l^#.^!U^1z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeKHNeLlReLVteIzteLDdeI1xeKkFeJSleJHheISleIkFeJ2JeJHNeKHNeJyReImxeIy5eIVVeMXpeISI=",
      "byte_length": 65
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b62d85bba5b4",
      "text": "我要走了。再見。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^(C^.&^*D^!\"^!l^-m^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXihDXi4mXipEXiEiXiFsXi1tXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f36863384a4e",
      "text": "好啊！我受夠了你們的盤問和指控！滾在…… ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+i^+Q^*W^$%^\";^+d^*D^*F^*{^&Z^1M^*Z^\"O^$8^$@^*W^,z^\"d^*o^*o ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitpXitRXipXXiQlXiI7XitkXipEXipGXip7XiZaXjFNXipaXiJPXiQ4XiRAXipXXix6XiJkXipvXipvIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7e7e588d621c",
      "text": "滾出去！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,z^!q^\"6^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "Xix6XiFxXiI2XipX",
      "byte_length": 12
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a66f1c94b90a",
      "text": "那處廢墟是我發現的，我絕不會放棄它！管它什麼元素生物， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^(,^#W^\"t^,X^$%^&W^&?^&Z^*A^$%^-I^!)^$r^$P^,a^+o^*W^-D^+o^!=^.T^!a^'=^&F^&4^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXigsXiNXXiJ0XixYXiQlXiZXXiY/XiZaXipBXiQlXi1JXiEpXiRyXiRQXixhXitvXipXXi1EXitvXiE9Xi5UXiFhXic9XiZGXiY0XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5b20d0c3ec54",
      "text": "我都要留下來——哪怕要了我的命！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^)$^(C^-+^!(^!O^*n^*n^+I^0^^(C^*D^$%^&Z^\"N^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXikkXihDXi0rXiEoXiFPXipuXipuXitJXjBeXihDXipEXiQlXiZaXiJOXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 49
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d33544fe5089",
      "text": "他在說謊！他才是荒蕪術士！他派了元素生物來殺我，好讓我在他們搜刮廢墟時 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^\"d^-x^3*^*W^!@^$,^,X^1W^4b^(<^+a^*W^!@^.n^*D^!a^'=^&F^&4^!O^%M^$%^*A^+i^-}^$%^\"d^!@^*{^/h^;r^#W^\"t^$f ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXiJkXi14XjMqXipXXiFAXiQsXixYXjFXXjRiXig8XithXipXXiFAXi5uXipEXiFhXic9XiZGXiY0XiFPXiVNXiQlXipBXitpXi19XiQlXiJkXiFAXip7Xi9oXjtyXiNXXiJ0XiRmIA==",
      "byte_length": 106
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2545c14a6fa5",
      "text": "礙不著他們的事！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^:M^!)^-a^!@^*{^&Z^*r^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjpNXiEpXi1hXiFAXip7XiZaXipyXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c95964d6b9d0",
      "text": "是強盜在驅使牠們！他們日復一日地嘲弄我——我根本不知道牠們何時 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,X^#]^0!^\"d^*#^!N^-#^*{^*W^!@^*{^$a^#g^!%^$a^\"e^+Z^/`^$%^*n^*n^$%^%)^$x^!)^&h^(y^-#^*{^!L^$f ",
      "encoded_base64": "XixYXiNdXjAhXiJkXiojXiFOXi0jXip7XipXXiFAXip7XiRhXiNnXiElXiRhXiJlXitaXi9gXiQlXipuXipuXiQlXiUpXiR4XiEpXiZoXih5Xi0jXip7XiFMXiRmIA==",
      "byte_length": 94
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fb217f716bd1",
      "text": "會發動襲擊！你們一定要救救我！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$r^&W^\"%^08^$F^*W^*F^*{^!%^#.^(C^,Q^,Q^$%^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRyXiZXXiIlXjA4XiRGXipXXipGXip7XiElXiMuXihDXixRXixRXiQlXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9592a825f2d6",
      "text": "蠢貨！你們會為此被燒成灰燼！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.u^.w^*W^*F^*{^$r^%{^%I^(@^&&^$$^%y^&)^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi51Xi53XipXXipGXip7XiRyXiV7XiVJXihAXiYmXiQkXiV5XiYpXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 43
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7ab217dc6700",
      "text": "衛兵開始走向轉角，想查明…… ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(=^+,^)F^+k^.&^+?^(i^(H^*A^,1^%&^$c^*o^*o ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xig9XissXilGXitrXi4mXis/XihpXihIXipBXiwxXiUmXiRjXipvXipvIA==",
      "byte_length": 43
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4d57c344f09c",
      "text": "這陣吵雜聲響是怎麼回事。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^)P^/T^0G^-W^)o^,X^,,^.T^\"\\^*r^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXilQXi9UXjBHXi1XXilvXixYXiwsXi5UXiJcXipyXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 37
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6d4e390dbc7a",
      "text": "這個罐子裝滿了穀物。想找出裡面藏有什麼…… ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^!V^'O^#(^(A^,{^*D^'%^&4^!\"^,1^$/^!q^-j^)j^-f^$s^!=^.T^*o^*o ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXiFWXidPXiMoXihBXix7XipEXiclXiY0XiEiXiwxXiQvXiFxXi1qXilqXi1mXiRzXiE9Xi5UXipvXipvIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_99622e88d187",
      "text": "幾乎是不可能的。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#T^!0^,X^!)^\"A^'b^&Z^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNUXiEwXixYXiEpXiJBXidiXiZaXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1d78a57654a1",
      "text": "這是一堆雜物廢料。要翻找看看嗎？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^,X^!%^*[^0G^&4^#W^/n^!\"^(C^-Q^$/^*Q^*Q^+X^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXixYXiElXipbXjBHXiY0XiNXXi9uXiEiXihDXi1RXiQvXipRXipRXitYXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 49
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a7bb941e2141",
      "text": "你沒有發現任何值得注意的東西。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^%\\^$s^&W^&?^!C^!L^!Z^#e^%e^#z^&Z^,`^-l^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiVcXiRzXiZXXiY/XiFDXiFMXiFaXiNlXiVlXiN6XiZaXixgXi1sXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8676fbd8ac24",
      "text": " 發現了一堆糞便。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^&W^&?^*D^!%^*[^0*^!R^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4mV14mP14qRF4hJV4qW14wKl4hUl4hIiA=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6261551c941c",
      "text": " 險險避開了小齧齒動物的撕咬。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^*m^*m^0F^)F^*D^#;^0N^.U^\"%^&4^&Z^/k^\"Q^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4qbV4qbV4wRl4pRl4qRF4jO14wTl4uVV4iJV4mNF4mWl4va14iUV4hIiA=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2c91b7bca70b",
      "text": " 敏捷地避開了蠍子的螫咬。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^//^/.^\"e^0F^)F^*D^06^#(^&Z^05^\"Q^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4vL14vLl4iZV4wRl4pRl4qRF4wNl4jKF4mWl4wNV4iUV4hIiA=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_20f81618479b",
      "text": " 發現了一張碎紙片，上面寫著……",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^&W^&?^*D^!%^,(^&o^0+^&1^*A^!'^)j^/]^-a^*o^*o",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4mV14mP14qRF4hJV4sKF4mb14wK14mMV4qQV4hJ14pal4vXV4tYV4qb14qbw==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ce349b309f33",
      "text": "「小心……」",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!#^#;^#k^*o^*o^!$",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEjXiM7XiNrXipvXipvXiEk",
      "byte_length": 18
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e62ab7bc81d8",
      "text": " 發現了一隻死老鼠。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^&W^&?^*D^!%^)[^%L^'U^*=^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4mV14mP14qRF4hJV4pW14lTF4nVV4qPV4hIiA=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6b3abfcb5cf8",
      "text": " 找到了一塊發霉變質的乾麵包。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^$/^!u^*D^!%^/Z^&W^0H^(U^(Z^&Z^*X^*5^\"'^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4kL14hdV4qRF4hJV4vWl4mV14wSF4oVV4oWl4mWl4qWF4qNV4iJ14hIiA=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6aecd1219263",
      "text": "這裡只有一個破碎穀罐的碎片。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^-j^\"?^$s^!%^!V^&n^&o^'%^'O^&Z^&o^&1^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXi1qXiI/XiRzXiElXiFWXiZuXiZvXiclXidPXiZaXiZvXiYxXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 43
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0c889ba3ead6",
      "text": " 在周圍翻找時，一隻老鼠咬住了…… ",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^\"d^\"L^\"`^-Q^$/^$f^*A^!%^)[^'U^*=^\"Q^*z^*D^*o^*o ",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4iZF4iTF4iYF4tUV4kL14kZl4qQV4hJV4pW14nVV4qPV4iUV4qel4qRF4qb14qbyA=",
      "byte_length": 50
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e579e7658545",
      "text": " 的手！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^&Z^$+^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4mWl4kK14qVyA=",
      "byte_length": 11
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_df08a2992abe",
      "text": " 發現了一顆魔法果實！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^&W^&?^*D^!%^)u^*0^%b^%!^#3^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4mV14mP14qRF4hJV4pdV4qMF4lYl4lIV4jM14qVyA=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c4b5d55da553",
      "text": " 搜查了一陣子，終於發現了一塊…… ",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^/h^%&^*D^!%^)P^#(^*A^-H^$^^&W^&?^*D^!%^/Z^*o^*o ",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4vaF4lJl4qRF4hJV4pUF4jKF4qQV4tSF4kXl4mV14mP14qRF4hJV4vWl4qb14qbyA=",
      "byte_length": 50
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4228286a6066",
      "text": "可用作木棒的木棍。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"A^&H^!M^$v^%1^&Z^$v^%0^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJBXiZIXiFNXiR2XiUxXiZaXiR2XiUwXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 28
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_85004157174a",
      "text": " 發現了一幅圖畫，描繪著一尊巨大的四臂…… ",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^&W^&?^*D^!%^#P^\"b^-,^*A^/g^0,^-a^!%^+u^#H^\"z^&Z^\"[^'k^*o^*o ",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4mV14mP14qRF4hJV4jUF4iYl4tLF4qQV4vZ14wLF4tYV4hJV4rdV4jSF4iel4mWl4iW14na14qb14qbyA=",
      "byte_length": 62
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ba874cebcd17",
      "text": "活動雕像正在碾碎一群倒楣的冒險者。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%i^\"%^)^^!`^%H^\"d^0$^&o^!%^'R^!X^/r^&Z^/P^*m^'V^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVpXiIlXileXiFgXiVIXiJkXjAkXiZvXiElXidSXiFYXi9yXiZaXi9QXiptXidWXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9b33df74c60e",
      "text": " 找到了一盒毫無價值的便宜小飾品。然而在…… ",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^$/^!u^*D^!%^/~^/t^%}^+&^!Z^&Z^!R^/[^#;^)|^\"R^!\"^&\"^'W^\"d^*o^*o ",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4kL14hdV4qRF4hJV4vfl4vdF4lfV4rJl4hWl4mWl4hUl4vW14jO14pfF4iUl4hIl4mIl4nV14iZF4qb14qbyA=",
      "byte_length": 65
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_308c25063df9",
      "text": "盒子底部居然有一顆頗有價值的寶石！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^/~^#(^/^^)#^+w^&\"^$s^!%^)u^0I^$s^+&^!Z^&Z^#4^&k^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi9+XiMoXi9eXikjXit3XiYiXiRzXiElXil1XjBJXiRzXismXiFaXiZaXiM0XiZrXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_32433888013d",
      "text": "在翻找瓦礫堆時，被一隻蠍子螫傷了！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"d^-Q^$/^&C^0%^*[^$f^*A^(@^!%^)[^06^#(^05^!^^*D^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJkXi1RXiQvXiZDXjAlXipbXiRmXipBXihAXiElXilbXjA2XiMoXjA1XiFeXipEXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9655de6505e9",
      "text": " 找到了幾支箭矢！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^$/^!u^*D^#T^$L^'.^&g^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4kL14hdV4qRF4jVF4kTF4nLl4mZ14qVyA=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1d3e3ea53471",
      "text": "要搜查這堆乾草嗎？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(C^/h^%&^(s^*[^*X^*f^+X^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihDXi9oXiUmXihzXipbXipYXipmXitYXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 28
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e40b16a76844",
      "text": " 伸手伸進…… ",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^/N^$+^/N^(w^*o^*o ",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4vTl4kK14vTl4od14qb14qbyA=",
      "byte_length": 20
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_46c1d41436e7",
      "text": " 伸手伸進乾草堆裡，掏出了一……",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^/N^$+^/N^(w^*X^*f^*[^-j^*A^/f^!q^*D^!%^*o^*o",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4vTl4kK14vTl4od14qWF4qZl4qW14tal4qQV4vZl4hcV4qRF4hJV4qb14qbw==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_625362822bab",
      "text": " 堆糞便。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^*[^0*^!R^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4qW14wKl4hUl4hIiA=",
      "byte_length": 14
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_383da352ed0c",
      "text": " 顆人類頭骨。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^)u^!<^)w^)t^*$^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4pdV4hPF4pd14pdF4qJF4hIiA=",
      "byte_length": 20
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8ba1b3131f35",
      "text": " 隻老鼠，咬了…… ",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^)[^'U^*=^*A^\"Q^*D^*o^*o ",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4pW14nVV4qPV4qQV4iUV4qRF4qb14qbyA=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_78a1f5695514",
      "text": " 一口便溜走了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^!%^\"<^!R^%r^.&^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4hJV4iPF4hUl4lcl4uJl4qRF4hIiA=",
      "byte_length": 23
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_17c8f21b1310",
      "text": " 根做工粗糙的骨針。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^%)^*~^+y^0(^0)^&Z^*$^)-^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4lKV4qfl4reV4wKF4wKV4mWl4qJF4pLV4hIiA=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7397f17ad53f",
      "text": " 塊陶罐碎片。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^/Z^)R^'O^&o^&1^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4vWl4pUl4nT14mb14mMV4hIiA=",
      "byte_length": 20
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ccf483a5a729",
      "text": " 隻乾癟如木乃伊的老鼠。看來是遭受了…… ",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^)[^*X^/}^#$^$v^/M^!E^&Z^'U^*=^!\"^*Q^!O^,X^(}^\";^*D^*o^*o ",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4pW14qWF4vfV4jJF4kdl4vTV4hRV4mWl4nVV4qPV4hIl4qUV4hT14sWF4ofV4iO14qRF4qb14qbyA=",
      "byte_length": 59
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_769bb0a17eac",
      "text": "正午烈日的曝曬烘烤。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%H^+8^%|^$a^&Z^/o^,Z^/v^/w^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVIXis4XiV8XiRhXiZaXi9vXixaXi92Xi93XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 31
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1eaa67ecb755",
      "text": "根可用作木棒的舊桌腳。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%)^\"A^&H^!M^$v^%1^&Z^02^/q^00^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiUpXiJBXiZIXiFNXiR2XiUxXiZaXjAyXi9xXjAwXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8b62771ed52d",
      "text": "條骯髒破舊的腰布。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%.^0L^0M^&n^02^&Z^'f^.`^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiUuXjBMXjBNXiZuXjAyXiZaXidmXi5gXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 28
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_96d7aff93cb1",
      "text": " 把陶幣！",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^$1^)R^+|^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4kMV4pUl4rfF4qVw==",
      "byte_length": 13
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b55cfd6fef39",
      "text": " 隻小蟲子，從你手中爬了出來。",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^)[^#;^(8^#(^*A^#f^*F^$+^!,^/y^*D^!q^!O^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4pW14jO14oOF4jKF4qQV4jZl4qRl4kK14hLF4veV4qRF4hcV4hT14hIg==",
      "byte_length": 43
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8d0c68e3a184",
      "text": " 顆小寶石！",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^)u^#;^#4^&k^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4pdV4jO14jNF4ma14qVw==",
      "byte_length": 16
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_44d4a161cc23",
      "text": "衣櫃是空的。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(>^%B^,X^'(^&Z^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xig+XiVCXixYXicoXiZaXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 19
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_08c237251979",
      "text": "要搜查這個衣櫃嗎？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(C^/h^%&^(s^!V^(>^%B^+X^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihDXi9oXiUmXihzXiFWXig+XiVCXitYXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 28
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c242dd9d8db6",
      "text": " 翻找著櫃子，並發現了一……",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^-Q^$/^-a^%B^#(^*A^!+^&W^&?^*D^!%^*o^*o",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4tUV4kL14tYV4lQl4jKF4qQV4hK14mV14mP14qRF4hJV4qb14qbw==",
      "byte_length": 40
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_01987adc4217",
      "text": " 隻蝴蝶，從櫃子裡飛了出來。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^)[^(5^(6^*A^#f^%B^#(^-j^)z^*D^!q^!O^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4pW14oNV4oNl4qQV4jZl4lQl4jKF4tal4pel4qRF4hcV4hT14hIiA=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b5ec5f5e51be",
      "text": " 隻小蜘蛛，跳到了地板上。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^)[^#;^(1^(0^*A^0@^!u^*D^\"e^$}^!'^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4pW14jO14oMV4oMF4qQV4wQF4hdV4qRF4iZV4kfV4hJ14hIiA=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f56cd0eb9ac6",
      "text": " 木頭上刻著一段訊息：「書吏加雷斯曾到此一遊。」",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^$v^)t^!'^.Y^-a^!%^.l^09^#w^*B^!#^$p^/S^\"\"^)c^$[^.j^!u^%I^!%^.3^!\"^!$",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4kdl4pdF4hJ14uWV4tYV4hJV4ubF4wOV4jd14qQl4hI14kcF4vU14iIl4pY14kW14ual4hdV4lSV4hJV4uM14hIl4hJA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_dfa06cd23810",
      "text": " 顆魔法果實！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^)u^*0^%b^%!^#3^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4pdV4qMF4lYl4lIV4jM14qVyA=",
      "byte_length": 20
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9198a940fcb6",
      "text": " 靠在門上的陶罐。它摔落到地上時砸中了你的頭…… ",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^.C^\"d^)D^!'^&Z^)R^'O^!\"^+o^/i^-`^!u^\"e^!'^$f^0#^!,^*D^*F^&Z^)t^*o^*o ",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4uQ14iZF4pRF4hJ14mWl4pUl4nT14hIl4rb14vaV4tYF4hdV4iZV4hJ14kZl4wI14hLF4qRF4qRl4mWl4pdF4qb14qbyA=",
      "byte_length": 71
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0b848483cc60",
      "text": "落到了地上。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-`^!u^*D^\"e^!'^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi1gXiF1XipEXiJlXiEnXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 19
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a041388829af",
      "text": " 靠在門上的陶罐。它摔…… ",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^.C^\"d^)D^!'^&Z^)R^'O^!\"^+o^/i^*o^*o ",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4uQ14iZF4pRF4hJ14mWl4pUl4nT14hIl4rb14vaV4qb14qbyA=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e07a4b515b44",
      "text": " 木頭上刻著一段訊息：「千萬別相信佩圖克。」 ",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^$v^)t^!'^.Y^-a^!%^.l^09^#w^*B^!#^+7^-_^*H^&a^!U^.}^\"b^!d^!\"^!$ ",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4kdl4pdF4hJ14uWV4tYV4hJV4ubF4wOV4jd14qQl4hI14rN14tX14qSF4mYV4hVV4ufV4iYl4hZF4hIl4hJCA=",
      "byte_length": 65
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d586dd4b003c",
      "text": "好了，門開了。千萬別跟任何人說是我幫你們開的！我要…… ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+i^*D^*A^)D^)F^*D^!\"^+7^-_^*H^.+^!C^!L^!<^-x^,X^$%^+}^*F^*{^)F^&Z^*W^$%^(C^*o^*o ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitpXipEXipBXilEXilGXipEXiEiXis3Xi1fXipIXi4rXiFDXiFMXiE8Xi14XixYXiQlXit9XipGXip7XilGXiZaXipXXiQlXihDXipvXipvIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7293cc596f98",
      "text": "回去幹活了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"\\^\"6^,!^%i^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJcXiI2XiwhXiVpXipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 19
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3935f74fef7e",
      "text": "在那裡！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"d^)!^-j^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJkXikhXi1qXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 13
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9b5b3476f7d1",
      "text": "你想烤這隻拔了毛的禿鷹嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^,1^/w^(s^)[^/c^*D^%R^&Z^&}^*3^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiwxXi93XihzXilbXi9jXipEXiVSXiZaXiZ9XiozXitYXi5W",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a822367147c0",
      "text": "你們休想逃走！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^!G^,1^(p^.&^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiFHXiwxXihwXi4mXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 22
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_05138d376a41",
      "text": "突然間，你的巨蠍獸側過頭，彷彿在側耳傾聽",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'*^&\"^)G^*A^*F^&Z^#H^06^&<^!\\^(x^)t^*A^.a^.b^\"d^!\\^'Y^2U^-X",
      "encoded_base64": "XicqXiYiXilHXipBXipGXiZaXiNIXjA2XiY8XiFcXih4Xil0XipBXi5hXi5iXiJkXiFcXidZXjJVXi1Y",
      "byte_length": 60
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d2c1a491d315",
      "text": "巨蠍獸轉過身，狂奔而去。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#H^06^&<^(i^(x^(c^*A^&8^2b^'W^\"6^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNIXjA2XiY8XihpXih4XihjXipBXiY4XjJiXidXXiI2XiEi",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6614f38b5267",
      "text": " 聽見德莫西營地的方向傳來一陣微弱的鈴鐺作響聲 ",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^-X^-m^#j^/F^-l^&'^\"e^&Z^$]^+?^+$^!O^!%^)P^#i^#\\^&Z^=6^=7^!M^)o^-W ",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4tWF4tbV4jal4vRl4tbF4mJ14iZV4mWl4kXV4rP14rJF4hT14hJV4pUF4jaV4jXF4mWl49Nl49N14hTV4pb14tVyA=",
      "byte_length": 68
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_51b0af54c4ea",
      "text": "，但你什麼聲音也沒聽見。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*A^!I^*F^!=^.T^-W^34^!1^%\\^-X^-m^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipBXiFJXipGXiE9Xi5UXi1XXjM0XiExXiVcXi1YXi1tXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 37
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f5e2d1d694f7",
      "text": "這本書裡的文字字跡潦草得難以辨認。你翻開到了 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^$x^$p^-j^&Z^$W^#)^#)^(`^;/^*f^#e^)a^!B^6{^(O^!\"^*F^-Q^)F^!u^*D ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXiR4XiRwXi1qXiZaXiRXXiMpXiMpXihgXjsvXipmXiNlXilhXiFCXjZ7XihPXiEiXipGXi1RXilGXiF1XipEIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_53f77aab1e10",
      "text": "幾天前記錄的最新一頁，開始閱讀。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#T^+e^!z^(K^;<^&Z^$q^$\\^!%^5&^*A^)F^+k^:&^7I^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNUXitlXiF6XihLXjs8XiZaXiRxXiRcXiElXjUmXipBXilGXitrXjomXjdJXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 49
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4f886536ac0a",
      "text": "我已經完成了關於恐懼萃取液的研究，發現我必須 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^#J^'D^#,^$$^*D^.>^$^^#t^$#^'}^\":^%l^&Z^9G^-<^*A^&W^&?^$%^#l^)r ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiNKXidEXiMsXiQkXipEXi4+XiReXiN0XiQjXid9XiI6XiVsXiZaXjlHXi08XipBXiZXXiY/XiQlXiNsXilyIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1f3dc6b098dc",
      "text": "準備好調配碗，並取得花朵萃取液。我終於明白 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,x^+\"^+i^(Q^)&^&q^*A^!+^\":^#e^'w^9C^'}^\":^%l^!\"^$%^-H^$^^$c^&X ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xix4XisiXitpXihRXikmXiZxXipBXiErXiI6XiNlXid3XjlDXid9XiI6XiVsXiEiXiQlXi1IXiReXiRjXiZYIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_61ab97dbfdb7",
      "text": "為何這種毒藥的秘密被守得如此嚴密——它塗在刀刃上能 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%{^!L^(s^'$^%Q^()^&Z^1O^#0^(@^#+^#e^#$^%I^1*^#0^*n^*n^+o^;+^\"d^7Q^!r^!'^'b ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiV7XiFMXihzXickXiVRXigpXiZaXjFPXiMwXihAXiMrXiNlXiMkXiVJXjEqXiMwXipuXipuXitvXjsrXiJkXjdRXiFyXiEnXidiIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e6f3c61e0b50",
      "text": "永不失效。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%W^!)^\"|^$Q^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVXXiEpXiJ8XiRRXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 16
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2dbb80de77ef",
      "text": "我已經聯繫了一位本地商人替我弄來萃取液。他答應在 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^#J^'D^-V^:;^*D^!%^!J^$x^\"e^1'^!<^2o^$%^/`^!O^'}^\":^%l^!\"^!@^-B^0`^\"d ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiNKXidEXi1WXjo7XipEXiElXiFKXiR4XiJlXjEnXiE8XjJvXiQlXi9gXiFPXid9XiI6XiVsXiEiXiFAXi1CXjBgXiJkIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_175e995f6755",
      "text": "幾天之內交貨，所以我將專注於破解無名者之書， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#T^+e^!/^!g^0P^.w^*A^$)^!B^$%^#7^#8^%e^$^^&n^(I^%}^\"F^'V^!/^$p^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNUXitlXiEvXiFnXjBQXi53XipBXiQpXiFCXiQlXiM3XiM4XiVlXiReXiZuXihJXiV9XiJGXidWXiEvXiRwXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_54806827e725",
      "text": "為召喚儀式做準備。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%{^\"@^\"U^+'^#X^*~^,x^+\"^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiV7XiJAXiJVXisnXiNYXip+Xix4XisiXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 28
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_93ebc4b23ae1",
      "text": "我已經完成了調配碗上的法術附魔，現在只差 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^#J^'D^#,^$$^*D^(Q^)&^&q^!'^&Z^%b^(<^.?^*0^*A^&?^\"d^\"?^48 ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiNKXidEXiMsXiQkXipEXihRXikmXiZxXiEnXiZaXiViXig8Xi4/XiowXipBXiY/XiJkXiI/XjQ4IA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_daa53193ed56",
      "text": "恐懼萃取液本身了。那個蠢貨商人手下一定是一幫白癡！任何 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#t^$#^'}^\":^%l^$x^(c^*D^!\"^)!^!V^.u^.w^1'^!<^$+^!(^!%^#.^,X^!%^+}^&X^>$^*W^!C^!L ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiN0XiQjXid9XiI6XiVsXiR4XihjXipEXiEiXikhXiFWXi51Xi53XjEnXiE8XiQrXiEoXiElXiMuXixYXiElXit9XiZYXj4kXipXXiFDXiFMIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_83bd6d2c0d5d",
      "text": "傻子到現在也該弄到萃取液了！要不是我得盯著那些 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^7$^#(^!u^&?^\"d^!1^(M^/`^!u^'}^\":^%l^*D^*W^(C^!)^,X^$%^#e^:U^-a^)!^!8 ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjckXiMoXiF1XiY/XiJkXiExXihNXi9gXiF1Xid9XiI6XiVsXipEXipXXihDXiEpXixYXiQlXiNlXjpVXi1hXikhXiE4IA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ed4a82a885b7",
      "text": "瑪格拉人守規矩，我早就親自去弄了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-*^%*^$6^!<^#+^6'^5k^*A^$%^,V^*J^(F^'l^\"6^/`^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi0qXiUqXiQ2XiE8XiMrXjYnXjVrXipBXiQlXixWXipKXihGXidsXiI2Xi9gXipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_076f64de8fd9",
      "text": "……對異界生物的研究，極少有辦法能將這些 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*o^*o^#:^&M^.p^&F^&4^&Z^9G^-<^*A^1D^#<^$s^2L^%b^'b^#7^(s^!8 ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipvXipvXiM6XiZNXi5wXiZGXiY0XiZaXjlHXi08XipBXjFEXiM8XiRzXjJMXiViXidiXiM3XihzXiE4IA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d927575bcd20",
      "text": "生物從不受歡迎的界域驅逐出去。大多數歷史上的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&F^&4^#f^!)^\";^%F^(k^&Z^.p^\"k^*#^(r^!q^\"6^!\"^\"z^\"x^$V^6^^1m^!'^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZGXiY0XiNmXiEpXiI7XiVGXihrXiZaXi5wXiJrXiojXihyXiFxXiI2XiEiXiJ6XiJ4XiRWXjZeXjFtXiEnXiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_05121b207b99",
      "text": "驅逐之法皆因缺乏記錄而失傳。曾使用這些辦法的巫師 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*#^(r^!/^%b^5j^\"]^7e^;'^(K^;<^'W^\"|^+$^!\"^.j^!N^&H^(s^!8^2L^%b^&Z^14^#M ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiojXihyXiEvXiViXjVqXiJdXjdlXjsnXihLXjs8XidXXiJ8XiskXiEiXi5qXiFOXiZIXihzXiE4XjJMXiViXiZaXjE0XiNNIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cdee777426ce",
      "text": "出於擔心被他人竊取，極少將他們的發現記錄 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!q^$^^*N^#k^(@^!@^!<^5n^\":^*A^1D^#<^#7^!@^*{^&Z^&W^&?^(K^;< ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFxXiReXipOXiNrXihAXiFAXiE8XjVuXiI6XipBXjFEXiM8XiM3XiFAXip7XiZaXiZXXiY/XihLXjs8IA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b20090c8fcf1",
      "text": "下來。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!(^!O^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEoXiFPXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 10
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b76a81c56642",
      "text": "最經典的驅逐方法，是使用一件與目標生物陣營 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$q^'D^2W^&Z^*#^(r^$]^%b^*A^,X^!N^&H^!%^.W^'p^&^^%9^&F^&4^)P^&' ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRxXidEXjJXXiZaXiojXihyXiRdXiViXipBXixYXiFOXiZIXiElXi5XXidwXiZeXiU5XiZGXiY0XilQXiYnIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fe158679da82",
      "text": "完全相反的神器。在諸多聖物當中， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#,^!h^&a^\"9^&Z^&w^\"V^!\"^\"d^1]^\"x^'Z^&4^&N^!,^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiMsXiFoXiZhXiI5XiZaXiZ3XiJWXiEiXiJkXjFdXiJ4XidaXiY0XiZOXiEsXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 49
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fae2606d0ce0",
      "text": "一件遠近馳名的強大物品便是黎明之光，它足以 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!%^.W^({^(l^>)^\"F^&Z^#]^\"z^&4^\"R^!R^,X^*8^$c^!/^!c^*A^+o^(^^!B ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiElXi5XXih7XihsXj4pXiJGXiZaXiNdXiJ6XiY0XiJSXiFSXixYXio4XiRjXiEvXiFjXipBXitvXiheXiFCIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_273b8a22daa8",
      "text": "驅逐除了最凶惡存在之外的所有異界生物。歷史—— ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*#^(r^)Q^*D^$q^3e^#y^#*^\"d^!/^\"w^&Z^$)^$s^&M^.p^&F^&4^!\"^6^^1m^*n^*n ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiojXihyXilRXipEXiRxXjNlXiN5XiMqXiJkXiEvXiJ3XiZaXiQpXiRzXiZNXi5wXiZGXiY0XiEiXjZeXjFtXipuXipuIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bd4314639a34",
      "text": "這本古籍沉重得異乎尋常，手感彷彿包含了它實際頁數 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^$x^\"=^>%^%Z^))^#e^&M^!0^#9^#O^*A^$+^#{^.a^.b^\"'^\"I^*D^+o^#3^30^5&^$V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXiR4XiI9Xj4lXiVaXikpXiNlXiZNXiEwXiM5XiNPXipBXiQrXiN7Xi5hXi5iXiInXiJJXipEXitvXiMzXjMwXjUmXiRWIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3835a23343c2",
      "text": "的十倍之多。書頁本身是由某種比起紙張 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&Z^*Y^!W^!/^\"x^!\"^$p^5&^$x^(c^,X^&I^%$^'$^,m^.(^0+^,( ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZaXipZXiFXXiEvXiJ4XiEiXiRwXjUmXiR4XihjXixYXiZJXiUkXickXixtXi4oXjArXiwoIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2c8c4371782e",
      "text": "更類似皮革的材質製成，但你無法確切斷定 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$o^)w^!H^&[^;&^&Z^$y^(Z^(B^$$^*A^!I^*F^%}^%b^-6^+.^,T^#. ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRvXil3XiFIXiZbXjsmXiZaXiR5XihaXihCXiQkXipBXiFJXipGXiV9XiViXi02XisuXixUXiMuIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0ebef2761733",
      "text": "這究竟是何種材質。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^-<^28^,X^!L^'$^$y^(Z^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXi08XjI4XixYXiFMXickXiR5XihaXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 28
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7857ae13e1e3",
      "text": "你快速瀏覽了一遍以紅墨水書寫的文字……",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*L^(u^>#^>'^*D^!%^69^!B^3!^>\"^%V^$p^/]^&Z^$W^#)^*o^*o",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXipMXih1Xj4jXj4nXipEXiElXjY5XiFCXjMhXj4iXiVWXiRwXi9dXiZaXiRXXiMpXipvXipv",
      "byte_length": 57
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_30d9296834a7",
      "text": "……過去所見的異界生物皆在可控範圍之內。然而，近期的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*o^*o^(x^\"6^$)^-m^&Z^&M^.p^&F^&4^5j^\"d^\"A^$@^'0^\"`^!/^!g^!\"^&\"^'W^*A^(l^$u^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipvXipvXih4XiI2XiQpXi1tXiZaXiZNXi5wXiZGXiY0XjVqXiJkXiJBXiRAXicwXiJgXiEvXiFnXiEiXiYiXidXXipBXihsXiR1XiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5ff7921c4ece",
      "text": "實驗揭示了召喚異界生物的新方法， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#3^.P^$B^&s^*D^\"@^\"U^&M^.p^&F^&4^&Z^$\\^$]^%b^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiMzXi5QXiRCXiZzXipEXiJAXiJVXiZNXi5wXiZGXiY0XiZaXiRcXiRdXiViXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 49
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a7868f53b5f1",
      "text": "可能導致召喚出以現有手段根本無法擊敗的恐怖存在。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"A^'b^10^'o^\"@^\"U^!q^!B^&?^$s^$+^.l^%)^$x^%}^%b^$F^$R^&Z^#t^#p^#*^\"d^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJBXidiXjEwXidvXiJAXiJVXiFxXiFCXiY/XiRzXiQrXi5sXiUpXiR4XiV9XiViXiRGXiRSXiZaXiN0XiNwXiMqXiJkXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cc70e5e1eae0",
      "text": "其中一個不可直呼其名的存在，據悉正企圖 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!j^!,^!%^!V^!)^\"A^&`^\"M^!j^\"F^&Z^#*^\"d^*A^5T^2h^%H^4-^\"b ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFqXiEsXiElXiFWXiEpXiJBXiZgXiJNXiFqXiJGXiZaXiMqXiJkXipBXjVUXjJoXiVIXjQtXiJiIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fd686c8b5c57",
      "text": "降臨此界。若有人將其召喚而來，隨之而來的混亂 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)N^1U^%I^.p^!\"^'x^$s^!<^#7^!j^\"@^\"U^'W^!O^*A^)X^!/^'W^!O^&Z^%n^!3 ",
      "encoded_base64": "XilOXjFVXiVJXi5wXiEiXid4XiRzXiE8XiM3XiFqXiJAXiJVXidXXiFPXipBXilYXiEvXidXXiFPXiZaXiVuXiEzIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c8041c6049a6",
      "text": "將會是毀天滅地的末日浩劫。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#7^$r^,X^%N^+e^%t^\"e^&Z^$w^$a^5^^1l^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiM3XiRyXixYXiVOXitlXiV0XiJlXiZaXiR3XiRhXjVeXjFsXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 40
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9e64e0ccaf5a",
      "text": "此處記載了用於召喚準備的儀軌與禱文……",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%I^(,^(K^64^*D^&H^$^^\"@^\"U^,x^+\"^&Z^+'^>(^'p^&|^$W^*o^*o",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVJXigsXihLXjY0XipEXiZIXiReXiJAXiJVXix4XisiXiZaXisnXj4oXidwXiZ8XiRXXipvXipv",
      "byte_length": 57
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_17a801ccc14a",
      "text": "你再也讀不下去了。文本中所描述的惡行 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^!l^!1^7I^!)^!(^\"6^*D^!\"^$W^$x^!,^$)^/g^68^&Z^#y^(; ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiFsXiExXjdJXiEpXiEoXiI2XipEXiEiXiRXXiR4XiEsXiQpXi9nXjY4XiZaXiN5Xig7IA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_15e3962f4aff",
      "text": "讓你的胃感到不適。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-}^*F^&Z^3|^#{^!u^!)^(|^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi19XipGXiZaXjN8XiN7XiF1XiEpXih8XiEi",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_101697d68f6a",
      "text": "翻開這本書，你發現它涉及力量法器的創造、使用",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-Q^)F^(s^$x^$p^*A^*F^&W^&?^+o^3O^\"7^!~^)*^%b^\"V^&Z^!{^(v^!!^!N^&H",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi1RXilGXihzXiR4XiRwXipBXipGXiZXXiY/XitvXjNPXiI3XiF+XikqXiViXiJWXiZaXiF7Xih2XiEhXiFOXiZI",
      "byte_length": 66
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_caac271c240e",
      "text": "以及摧毀。你翻到書中的一段，",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!B^\"7^$E^%N^!\"^*F^-Q^!u^$p^!,^&Z^!%^.l^*A",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFCXiI3XiRFXiVOXiEiXipGXi1RXiF1XiRwXiEsXiZaXiElXi5sXipB",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e2fd52b72cf5",
      "text": "開始閱讀……",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)F^+k^:&^7I^*o^*o",
      "encoded_base64": "XilGXitrXjomXjdJXipvXipv",
      "byte_length": 18
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7bc321a02c1c",
      "text": "……已經表明，法器傳統上是護身符或法杖，",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*o^*o^#J^'D^-i^$c^*A^%b^\"V^+$^'B^!'^,X^(T^(c^'+^$'^%b^${^*A",
      "encoded_base64": "XipvXipvXiNKXidEXi1pXiRjXipBXiViXiJWXiskXidCXiEnXixYXihUXihjXicrXiQnXiViXiR7XipB",
      "byte_length": 60
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_17c137c30ad3",
      "text": "被祈求來賜予恩典。然而，隨著越來越多的材料",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(@^&u^,n^!O^.#^!4^#v^2W^!\"^&\"^'W^*A^)X^-a^(]^!O^(]^\"x^&Z^$y^/n",
      "encoded_base64": "XihAXiZ1XixuXiFPXi4jXiE0XiN2XjJXXiEiXiYiXidXXipBXilYXi1hXihdXiFPXihdXiJ4XiZaXiR5Xi9u",
      "byte_length": 63
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b28223aff5f1",
      "text": "變得可用，法器的設計正在迅速改變。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(U^#e^\"A^&H^*A^%b^\"V^&Z^4e^-n^%H^\"d^(j^(u^$N^(U^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XihVXiNlXiJBXiZIXipBXiViXiJWXiZaXjRlXi1uXiVIXiJkXihqXih1XiROXihVXiEi",
      "byte_length": 51
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_52ce3f46496e",
      "text": "法器演進的一大步是使用常見的",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%b^\"V^1G^(w^&Z^!%^\"z^,i^,X^!N^&H^#O^-m^&Z",
      "encoded_base64": "XiViXiJWXjFHXih3XiZaXiElXiJ6XixpXixYXiFOXiZIXiNPXi1tXiZa",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_aed446a3afa0",
      "text": "物品，那些你期望在阿塔斯任何房屋中找到的物品。這樣，",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&4^\"R^*A^)!^!8^*F^$u^,]^\"d^)M^\"o^$[^!C^!L^,<^8y^!,^$/^!u^&Z^&4^\"R^!\"^(s^,f^*A",
      "encoded_base64": "XiY0XiJSXipBXikhXiE4XipGXiR1XixdXiJkXilNXiJvXiRbXiFDXiFMXiw8Xjh5XiEsXiQvXiF1XiZaXiY0XiJSXiEiXihzXixmXipB",
      "byte_length": 78
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ccf832dc0247",
      "text": "巫師的力量來源就不會那麼明顯。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^14^#M^&Z^!~^)*^!O^%q^*J^!)^$r^)!^.T^$c^4&^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XjE0XiNNXiZaXiF+XikqXiFPXiVxXipKXiEpXiRyXikhXi5UXiRjXjQmXiEi",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3d2bd51882fb",
      "text": "我甚至聽過將傢俱用作法器的傳說，但那不太",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^/|^'n^-X^(x^#7^+#^<3^&H^!M^%b^\"V^&Z^+$^-x^*A^!I^)!^!)^+f",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXi98XiduXi1YXih4XiM3XisjXjwzXiZIXiFNXiViXiJWXiZaXiskXi14XipBXiFJXikhXiEpXitm",
      "byte_length": 60
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_981062af3dc0",
      "text": "可能。一件傢俱怎麼可能擁有法器所必需的",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"A^'b^!\"^!%^.W^+#^<3^,,^.T^\"A^'b^,M^$s^%b^\"V^$)^#l^)e^&Z",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJBXidiXiEiXiElXi5XXisjXjwzXiwsXi5UXiJBXidiXixNXiRzXiViXiJWXiQpXiNsXillXiZa",
      "byte_length": 57
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_eb382f601ca6",
      "text": "光滑表面呢？猜測比比皆是。有一件物品……",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!c^%u^-i^)j^+C^.V^-'^%p^,m^,m^5j^,X^!\"^$s^!%^.W^&4^\"R^*o^*o",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFjXiV1Xi1pXilqXitDXi5WXi0nXiVwXixtXixtXjVqXixYXiEiXiRzXiElXi5XXiY0XiJSXipvXipv",
      "byte_length": 60
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_238009737ce9",
      "text": "作者開始進入細節，所以你跳過這部分。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!M^'V^)F^+k^(w^!f^'?^9b^*A^$)^!B^*F^0@^(x^(s^)#^!s^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFNXidWXilGXitrXih3XiFmXic/XjliXipBXiQpXiFCXipGXjBAXih4XihzXikjXiFzXiEi",
      "byte_length": 54
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c254b6a525ad",
      "text": "……已知法器會賜予其持有者來自黑暗",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*o^*o^#J^&h^%b^\"V^$r^.#^!4^!j^$7^$s^'V^!O^'l^*:^$k",
      "encoded_base64": "XipvXipvXiNKXiZoXiViXiJWXiRyXi4jXiE0XiFqXiQ3XiRzXidWXiFPXidsXio6XiRr",
      "byte_length": 51
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7f39362aa6ff",
      "text": "界域的力量。有無數的爐邊故事講述那些只要法器完好，",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.p^\"k^&Z^!~^)*^!\"^$s^%}^$V^&Z^&,^.8^5U^*r^6+^68^)!^!8^\"?^(C^%b^\"V^#,^+i^*A",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi5wXiJrXiZaXiF+XikqXiEiXiRzXiV9XiRWXiZaXiYsXi44XjVVXipyXjYrXjY4XikhXiE4XiI/XihDXiViXiJWXiMsXitpXipB",
      "byte_length": 75
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_be946a42f699",
      "text": "就無法被殺死的褻瀆者。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*J^%}^%b^(@^%M^%L^&Z^-k^,~^'V^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipKXiV9XiViXihAXiVNXiVMXiZaXi1rXix+XidWXiEi",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0b0b86a7c8ea",
      "text": "有趣的是，我發現了證據，證明可能存在強大到",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$s^.*^&Z^,X^*A^$%^&W^&?^*D^-{^5T^*A^-{^$c^\"A^'b^#*^\"d^#]^\"z^!u",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRzXi4qXiZaXixYXipBXiQlXiZXXiY/XipEXi17XjVUXipBXi17XiRjXiJBXidiXiMqXiJkXiNdXiJ6XiF1",
      "byte_length": 63
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a7bca8db27fb",
      "text": "足以賜予這類力量的法器——無論是以令人難以置信的",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(^^!B^.#^!4^(s^)w^!~^)*^&Z^%b^\"V^*n^*n^%}^1\\^,X^!B^*w^!<^)a^!B^'Q^!U^&Z",
      "encoded_base64": "XiheXiFCXi4jXiE0XihzXil3XiF+XikqXiZaXiViXiJWXipuXipuXiV9XjFcXixYXiFCXip3XiE8XilhXiFCXidRXiFVXiZa",
      "byte_length": 72
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_66c4a4a00337",
      "text": "再生能力、保護褻瀆者免受傷害的魔法靈氣，或是",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!l^&F^'b^!~^!!^!T^(T^-k^,~^'V^!e^\";^!^^#/^&Z^*0^%b^)g^%U^*A^$'^,X",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFsXiZGXidiXiF+XiEhXiFUXihUXi1rXix+XidWXiFlXiI7XiFeXiMvXiZaXiowXiViXilnXiVVXipBXiQnXixY",
      "byte_length": 66
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2aeb0961d8f5",
      "text": "永生本身的形式。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%W^&F^$x^(c^&Z^#_^#X^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVXXiZGXiR4XihjXiZaXiNfXiNYXiEi",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ecd8f944be8c",
      "text": "如果一個褻瀆者能將這些能力與將法器隱藏在",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#$^%!^!%^!V^-k^,~^'V^'b^#7^(s^!8^'b^!~^'p^#7^%b^\"V^)Y^-f^\"d",
      "encoded_base64": "XiMkXiUhXiElXiFWXi1rXix+XidWXidiXiM3XihzXiE4XidiXiF+XidwXiM3XiViXiJWXilZXi1mXiJk",
      "byte_length": 60
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_37d22542a14f",
      "text": "常見物品中的能力結合起來，其結果至少將會",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#O^-m^&4^\"R^!,^&Z^'b^!~^'@^\"C^.(^!O^*A^!j^'@^%!^'n^#<^#7^$r",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNPXi1tXiY0XiJSXiEsXiZaXidiXiF+XidAXiJDXi4oXiFPXipBXiFqXidAXiUhXiduXiM8XiM3XiRy",
      "byte_length": 60
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fb46d579c3bc",
      "text": "難以控制。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)a^!B^$@^!v^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XilhXiFCXiRAXiF2XiEi",
      "byte_length": 15
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_46127e9c09aa",
      "text": "我記得有一個名叫史克林杉德的褻瀆者那——",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^(K^#e^$s^!%^!V^\"F^+<^1m^!d^/1^=;^#j^&Z^-k^,~^'V^)!^*n^*n",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXihLXiNlXiRzXiElXiFWXiJGXis8XjFtXiFkXi8xXj07XiNqXiZaXi1rXix+XidWXikhXipuXipu",
      "byte_length": 60
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2f58a84b69cd",
      "text": "這本書裡的所有書頁都被劃掉了，除了一頁。只留下",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^$x^$p^-j^&Z^$)^$s^$p^5&^)$^(@^4s^/e^*D^*A^)Q^*D^!%^5&^!\"^\"?^-+^!(",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXiR4XiRwXi1qXiZaXiQpXiRzXiRwXjUmXikkXihAXjRzXi9lXipEXipBXilRXipEXiElXjUmXiEiXiI/Xi0rXiEo",
      "byte_length": 69
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1c81ce4ed574",
      "text": "一段褪色的銘文：",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!%^.l^<E^'s^&Z^.;^$W^*B",
      "encoded_base64": "XiElXi5sXjxFXidzXiZaXi47XiRXXipC",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_baefdafde368",
      "text": "當處理方向時：",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&N^(,^&A^$]^+?^$f^*B",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZOXigsXiZBXiRdXis/XiRmXipC",
      "byte_length": 21
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d0da052b68c9",
      "text": "所有未經允許的搜尋，皆徒勞無功。——尼爾拉戈",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$)^$s^,_^'D^/\"^-s^&Z^/h^#9^*A^5j^#d^/R^%}^\"!^!\"^*n^*n^#>^&/^$6^*M",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQpXiRzXixfXidEXi8iXi1zXiZaXi9oXiM5XipBXjVqXiNkXi9SXiV9XiIhXiEiXipuXipuXiM+XiYvXiQ2XipN",
      "byte_length": 66
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cfc207cd495e",
      "text": "某種看不見的力量將你的攻擊從鏡子上彈開。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%$^'$^*Q^!)^-m^&Z^!~^)*^#7^*F^&Z^$O^$F^#f^)>^#(^!'^#^^)F^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiUkXickXipRXiEpXi1tXiZaXiF+XikqXiM3XipGXiZaXiRPXiRGXiNmXik+XiMoXiEnXiNeXilGXiEi",
      "byte_length": 60
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9f181a87e656",
      "text": "不！你不知道你在做什麼！住手！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^*W^*F^!)^&h^(y^*F^\"d^*~^!=^.T^*W^*z^$+^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXipXXipGXiEpXiZoXih5XipGXiJkXip+XiE9Xi5UXipXXip6XiQrXipX",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ffda42cebcb1",
      "text": "不！它要碎了！我的力量！不！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^*W^+o^(C^&o^*D^*W^$%^&Z^!~^)*^*W^!)^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXipXXitvXihDXiZvXipEXipXXiQlXiZaXiF+XikqXipXXiEpXipX",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0de7fd3a5bc4",
      "text": "一陣震動搖晃了學院的地基——一聲低沉、喉音般的咆哮",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!%^)P^32^\"%^3J^=:^*D^+n^3/^&Z^\"e^/'^*n^*n^!%^-W^!K^%Z^!!^/V^34^'r^&Z^.[^.\\",
      "encoded_base64": "XiElXilQXjMyXiIlXjNKXj06XipEXituXjMvXiZaXiJlXi8nXipuXipuXiElXi1XXiFLXiVaXiEhXi9WXjM0XidyXiZaXi5bXi5c",
      "byte_length": 75
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9769ffebbeec",
      "text": "聽起來像是不自然的痛苦與挫敗的叫喊。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-X^.(^!O^!`^,X^!)^'l^&\"^&Z^-.^.t^'p^7]^$R^&Z^+<^+S^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi1YXi4oXiFPXiFgXixYXiEpXidsXiYiXiZaXi0uXi50XidwXjddXiRSXiZaXis8XitTXiEi",
      "byte_length": 54
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3fc0c6a2bdae",
      "text": "恭喜！隊伍獲得3,000點經驗值！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^1{^+V^*W^)U^!F^&:^#e3,000^*;^'D^.P^!Z^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XjF7XitWXipXXilVXiFGXiY6XiNlMywwMDBeKjteJ0ReLlBeIVpeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_74243400027d",
      "text": "  我可以許什麼願？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^\"A^!B^-s^!=^.T^.H^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeIkFeIUJeLXNeIT1eLlReLkheLlY=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_abc007908e5f",
      "text": "您的願望就是我的命令，主人。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^4:^&Z^.H^,]^*J^,X^$%^&Z^\"N^*w^*A^!-^!<^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XjQ6XiZaXi5IXixdXipKXixYXiQlXiZaXiJOXip3XipBXiEtXiE8XiEi",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_926ebc50c787",
      "text": "您有什麼願望，主人？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^4:^$s^!=^.T^.H^,]^*A^!-^!<^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XjQ6XiRzXiE9Xi5UXi5IXixdXipBXiEtXiE8Xi5W",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6f58cb3986a8",
      "text": "  我希望旅行。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^+{^,]^2m^(;^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeK3teLF1eMm1eKDteISI=",
      "byte_length": 20
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_aa9b6308abcb",
      "text": "  你到底能做什麼？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^!u^/^^'b^*~^!=^.T^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeIXVeL15eJ2JeKn5eIT1eLlReLlY=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_78f00ee0d9ed",
      "text": "  告訴我你的歷史。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^+B^-t^$%^*F^&Z^6^^1m^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeK0JeLXReJCVeKkZeJlpeNl5eMW1eISI=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_213c69058dbf",
      "text": "  我現在別無所求。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^&?^\"d^*H^%}^$)^,n^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeJj9eImReKkheJX1eJCleLG5eISI=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bf5a0af75c5d",
      "text": "  你是什麼？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^,X^!=^.T^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeLFheIT1eLlReLlY=",
      "byte_length": 17
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0b1e8a98d35e",
      "text": "  你會說話？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^$r^-x^-v^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeJHJeLXheLXZeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 17
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_dca3dd1d6055",
      "text": "沒什麼。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%\\^!=^.T^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVcXiE9Xi5UXiEi",
      "byte_length": 12
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_00924df47b56",
      "text": "沙漠中散佈著許多偉大的方尖碑，",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%]^,}^!,^$S^:f^-a^-s^\"x^*}^\"z^&Z^$]^#=^&p^*A",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVdXix9XiEsXiRTXjpmXi1hXi1zXiJ4Xip9XiJ6XiZaXiRdXiM9XiZwXipB",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4ef361aa281b",
      "text": "當它們活躍時會散發出強大的靈氣。我的力量使我能",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&N^+o^*{^%i^:b^$f^$r^$S^&W^!q^#]^\"z^&Z^)g^%U^!\"^$%^&Z^!~^)*^!N^$%^'b",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZOXitvXip7XiVpXjpiXiRmXiRyXiRTXiZXXiFxXiNdXiJ6XiZaXilnXiVVXiEiXiQlXiZaXiF+XikqXiFOXiQlXidi",
      "byte_length": 69
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_56a23d5ffb6e",
      "text": "鎖定這些靈氣，並將幾個物體，例如",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)8^#.^(s^!8^)g^%U^*A^!+^#7^#T^!V^&4^**^*A^9h^#$",
      "encoded_base64": "Xik4XiMuXihzXiE4XilnXiVVXipBXiErXiM3XiNUXiFWXiY0XioqXipBXjloXiMk",
      "byte_length": 48
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_174ad107cafb",
      "text": "你們自己，傳送到那個地點。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^'l^#I^*A^+$^./^!u^)!^!V^\"e^*;^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XidsXiNJXipBXiskXi4vXiF1XikhXiFWXiJlXio7XiEi",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a05cf76e9205",
      "text": "  方尖碑是什麼？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$]^#=^&p^,X^!=^.T^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJF1eIz1eJnBeLFheIT1eLlReLlY=",
      "byte_length": 23
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e7ac4bdcb76d",
      "text": "  方尖碑是如何啟動的？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$]^#=^&p^,X^#$^!L^57^\"%^&Z^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJF1eIz1eJnBeLFheIyReIUxeNTdeIiVeJlpeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b60ece73437e",
      "text": "  這些寶石在哪裡？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^(s^!8^#4^&k^\"d^+I^-j^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKHNeITheIzReJmteImReK0leLWpeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_145d38502d99",
      "text": "  方尖碑在哪裡？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$]^#=^&p^\"d^+I^-j^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJF1eIz1eJnBeImReK0leLWpeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 23
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8fae406f3a95",
      "text": "別管你的力量了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*H^-D^*F^&Z^!~^)*^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipIXi1EXipGXiZaXiF+XikqXipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8f49d10a923d",
      "text": "您想聽什麼故事，主人？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^4:^,1^-X^!=^.T^5U^*r^*A^!-^!<^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XjQ6XiwxXi1YXiE9Xi5UXjVVXipyXipBXiEtXiE8Xi5W",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a9d22894cf6a",
      "text": "  告訴我關於羅德的事。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^+B^-t^$%^.>^$^^/?^#j^&Z^*r^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeK0JeLXReJCVeLj5eJF5eLz9eI2peJlpeKnJeISI=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c7c643a22526",
      "text": "  羅德發生了什麼事？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^/?^#j^&W^&F^*D^!=^.T^*r^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLz9eI2peJldeJkZeKkReIT1eLlReKnJeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7ab300a56d74",
      "text": "  羅德服侍的國王是誰？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^/?^#j^,\\^0}^&Z^+^^-)^,X^-y^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLz9eI2peLFxeMH1eJlpeK15eLSleLFheLXleLlY=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c1f702016e99",
      "text": "  你是怎麼出現的？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^,X^,,^.T^!q^&?^&Z^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeLFheLCxeLlReIXFeJj9eJlpeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_59ccd3fe9d13",
      "text": "  在那些世紀裡你做了什麼？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^\"d^)!^!8^*p^2:^-j^*F^*~^*D^!=^.T^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeImReKSFeITheKnBeMjpeLWpeKkZeKn5eKkReIT1eLlReLlY=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5111dd44a56b",
      "text": "現在不想聽故事。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&?^\"d^!)^,1^-X^5U^*r^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiY/XiJkXiEpXiwxXi1YXjVVXipyXiEi",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_11df8d180cd3",
      "text": "非常抱歉，主人。這個區域充滿了魔法散發物。邪惡勢力",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)i^#O^,@^,h^*A^!-^!<^!\"^(s^!V^\"+^\"k^5.^,{^*D^*0^%b^$S^&W^&4^!\"^)\"^#y^\"&^!~",
      "encoded_base64": "XilpXiNPXixAXixoXipBXiEtXiE8XiEiXihzXiFWXiIrXiJrXjUuXix7XipEXiowXiViXiRTXiZXXiY0XiEiXikiXiN5XiImXiF+",
      "byte_length": 75
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_80bda5596436",
      "text": "正大舉出動，我建議您盡快尋找掩護。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%H^\"z^01^!q^\"%^*A^$%^,'^-|^4:^-1^*L^#9^$/^9~^(T^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVIXiJ6XjAxXiFxXiIlXipBXiQlXiwnXi18XjQ6Xi0xXipMXiM5XiQvXjl+XihUXiEi",
      "byte_length": 51
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cb915e0f13b5",
      "text": "建於泥海形成之前，這些方尖碑是魔法能量的",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,'^$^^%d^6`^#_^$$^!/^!z^*A^(s^!8^$]^#=^&p^,X^*0^%b^'b^)*^&Z",
      "encoded_base64": "XiwnXiReXiVkXjZgXiNfXiQkXiEvXiF6XipBXihzXiE4XiRdXiM9XiZwXixYXiowXiViXidiXikqXiZa",
      "byte_length": 60
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b98ebaf88158",
      "text": "古老聚焦點。強大的羅德是唯一一位",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"=^'U^'[^%~^*;^!\"^#]^\"z^&Z^/?^#j^,X^+O^!%^!%^!J",
      "encoded_base64": "XiI9XidVXidbXiV+Xio7XiEiXiNdXiJ6XiZaXi8/XiNqXixYXitPXiElXiElXiFK",
      "byte_length": 48
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_264cf0a41ad5",
      "text": "學會如何利用其力量的法師。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+n^$r^#$^!L^!t^&H^!j^!~^)*^&Z^%b^#M^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XituXiRyXiMkXiFMXiF0XiZIXiFqXiF+XikqXiZaXiViXiNNXiEi",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_58bf8fbd6b98",
      "text": "方向對我來說是毫無意義的，對任何穿越其他",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$]^+?^#:^$%^!O^-x^,X^/t^%}^#z^2<^&Z^*A^#:^!C^!L^')^(]^!j^!@",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRdXis/XiM6XiQlXiFPXi14XixYXi90XiV9XiN6XjI8XiZaXipBXiM6XiFDXiFMXicpXihdXiFqXiFA",
      "byte_length": 60
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_de02c0723e92",
      "text": "維度的人也是如此。我只是順著魔法的絲線尋找它們的源頭。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'F^#V^&Z^!<^!1^,X^#$^%I^!\"^$%^\"?^,X^.D^-a^*0^%b^&Z^'C^'I^#9^$/^+o^*{^&Z^%q^)t^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XidGXiNWXiZaXiE8XiExXixYXiMkXiVJXiEiXiQlXiI/XixYXi5EXi1hXiowXiViXiZaXidDXidJXiM5XiQvXitvXip7XiZaXiVxXil0XiEi",
      "byte_length": 81
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_89324f134433",
      "text": "目前，我感覺到有",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&^^!z^*A^$%^#{^(G^!u^$s",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZeXiF6XipBXiQlXiN7XihHXiF1XiRz",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b3fe57a137fe",
      "text": "個活躍的方尖碑",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!V^%i^:b^&Z^$]^#=^&p",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFWXiVpXjpiXiZaXiRdXiM9XiZw",
      "byte_length": 21
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_be1629903665",
      "text": "每個方尖碑都有一顆與其特殊靈氣同調的大寶石。當那顆",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%P^!V^$]^#=^&p^)$^$s^!%^)u^'p^!j^&5^9!^)g^%U^\"E^(Q^&Z^\"z^#4^&k^!\"^&N^)!^)u",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVQXiFWXiRdXiM9XiZwXikkXiRzXiElXil1XidwXiFqXiY1XjkhXilnXiVVXiJFXihRXiZaXiJ6XiM0XiZrXiEiXiZOXikhXil1",
      "byte_length": 75
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_78f9c91cb95f",
      "text": "寶石被放在適當的位置時，方尖碑的靈氣就會輻射到",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#4^&k^(@^$P^\"d^(|^&N^&Z^!J^'Q^$f^*A^$]^#=^&p^&Z^)g^%U^*J^$r^=>^#6^!u",
      "encoded_base64": "XiM0XiZrXihAXiRQXiJkXih8XiZOXiZaXiFKXidRXiRmXipBXiRdXiM9XiZwXiZaXilnXiVVXipKXiRyXj0+XiM2XiF1",
      "byte_length": 69
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a7ef6779161c",
      "text": "天際。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+e^30^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XitlXjMwXiEi",
      "byte_length": 9
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0d3331e5aba9",
      "text": "可悲的是，自從偉大的羅德在世以來已經過去太久了，",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"A^,.^&Z^,X^*A^'l^#f^*}^\"z^&Z^/?^#j^\"d^*p^!B^!O^#J^'D^(x^\"6^+f^!.^*D^*A",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJBXiwuXiZaXixYXipBXidsXiNmXip9XiJ6XiZaXi8/XiNqXiJkXipwXiFCXiFPXiNKXidEXih4XiI2XitmXiEuXipEXipB",
      "byte_length": 72
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1290f41b6cd0",
      "text": "沒有他的保護，這些寶石只能任由",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%\\^$s^!@^&Z^!T^(T^*A^(s^!8^#4^&k^\"?^'b^!C^&I",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVcXiRzXiFAXiZaXiFUXihUXipBXihzXiE4XiM0XiZrXiI/XidiXiFDXiZJ",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_afe94d2329c2",
      "text": "這片無法無天的土地擺佈。它們現在可能在任何地方。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^&1^%}^%b^%}^+e^&Z^\"c^\"e^1@^:f^!\"^+o^*{^&?^\"d^\"A^'b^\"d^!C^!L^\"e^$]^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXiYxXiV9XiViXiV9XitlXiZaXiJjXiJlXjFAXjpmXiEiXitvXip7XiY/XiJkXiJBXidiXiJkXiFDXiFMXiJlXiRdXiEi",
      "byte_length": 72
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8d18a90b0a93",
      "text": "羅德曾服侍一位不配的國王，現在他已長眠在",
      "encoded_ascii": "^/?^#j^.j^,\\^0}^!%^!J^!)^)&^&Z^+^^-)^*A^&?^\"d^!@^#J^)C^24^\"d",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi8/XiNqXi5qXixcXjB9XiElXiFKXiEpXikmXiZaXiteXi0pXipBXiY/XiJkXiFAXiNKXilDXjI0XiJk",
      "byte_length": 60
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5402b968c268",
      "text": "沙子之下。然而，羅德是一位擁有強大力量的巫師；是許多",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%]^#(^!/^!(^!\"^&\"^'W^*A^/?^#j^,X^!%^!J^,M^$s^#]^\"z^!~^)*^&Z^14^#M^*C^,X^-s^\"x",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVdXiMoXiEvXiEoXiEiXiYiXidXXipBXi8/XiNqXixYXiElXiFKXixNXiRzXiNdXiJ6XiF+XikqXiZaXjE0XiNNXipDXixYXi1zXiJ4",
      "byte_length": 78
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_755b13895433",
      "text": "奇蹟的創造者。沒有任何法師能與他匹敵。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"}^0B^&Z^!{^(v^'V^!\"^%\\^$s^!C^!L^%b^#M^'b^'p^!@^8w^$U^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJ9XjBCXiZaXiF7Xih2XidWXiEiXiVcXiRzXiFDXiFMXiViXiNNXidiXidwXiFAXjh3XiRVXiEi",
      "byte_length": 57
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_279d85d3d6ff",
      "text": "他被一隻索倫怪——一種異維度恐懼生物——所殺。唉，如果我",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^(@^!%^)[^'>^/!^#s^*n^*n^!%^'$^&M^'F^#V^#t^$#^&F^&4^*n^*n^$)^%M^!\"^+M^*A^#$^%!^$%",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXihAXiElXilbXic+Xi8hXiNzXipuXipuXiElXickXiZNXidGXiNWXiN0XiQjXiZGXiY0XipuXipuXiQpXiVNXiEiXitNXipBXiMkXiUhXiQl",
      "byte_length": 84
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7838fd404236",
      "text": "在戰鬥激烈時就在附近，我無與倫比的力量就能",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"d^$(^*,^1H^%|^$f^*J^\"d^.?^(l^*A^$%^%}^'p^/!^,m^&Z^!~^)*^*J^'b",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJkXiQoXiosXjFIXiV8XiRmXipKXiJkXi4/XihsXipBXiQlXiV9XidwXi8hXixtXiZaXiF+XikqXipKXidi",
      "byte_length": 63
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1270760b3be7",
      "text": "拯救無與倫比的法師羅德了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,F^,Q^%}^'p^/!^,m^&Z^%b^#M^/?^#j^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XixGXixRXiV9XidwXi8hXixtXiZaXiViXiNNXi8/XiNqXipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f0e9cfcd0b4a",
      "text": "是德懷爾國王，一個不配擁有智者羅德服務的傻瓜。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,X^#j^,9^&/^+^^-)^*A^!%^!V^!)^)&^,M^$s^$i^'V^/?^#j^,\\^+4^&Z^7$^<X^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XixYXiNqXiw5XiYvXiteXi0pXipBXiElXiFWXiEpXikmXixNXiRzXiRpXidWXi8/XiNqXixcXis0XiZaXjckXjxYXiEi",
      "byte_length": 69
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5865faab749b",
      "text": "的確，德懷爾國王和他的所有子民都為他的輕率付出了",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&Z^-6^*A^#j^,9^&/^+^^-)^\"O^!@^&Z^$)^$s^#(^%T^)$^%{^!@^&Z^(g^22^*u^!q^*D",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZaXi02XipBXiNqXiw5XiYvXiteXi0pXiJPXiFAXiZaXiQpXiRzXiMoXiVUXikkXiV7XiFAXiZaXihnXjIyXip1XiFxXipE",
      "byte_length": 72
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5bbd978b4487",
      "text": "生命的代價。甚至連不屈不撓的羅德也未能倖免。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&F^\"N^&Z^*v^+&^!\"^/|^'n^.0^!)^5K^!)^=8^&Z^/?^#j^!1^,_^'b^5+^!e^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZGXiJOXiZaXip2XismXiEiXi98XiduXi4wXiEpXjVLXiEpXj04XiZaXi8/XiNqXiExXixfXidiXjUrXiFlXiEi",
      "byte_length": 66
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_04e8f3985d50",
      "text": "這樣的知識不是給凡人聽的。只有全知的羅德知道",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^,f^&Z^&h^(R^!)^,X^'A^+-^!<^-X^&Z^!\"^\"?^$s^!h^&h^&Z^/?^#j^&h^(y",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXixmXiZaXiZoXihSXiEpXixYXidBXistXiE8Xi1YXiZaXiEiXiI/XiRzXiFoXiZoXiZaXi8/XiNqXiZoXih5",
      "byte_length": 66
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_69eb8f2f599a",
      "text": "無生命體之活力的秘密，而我不朽的力量是羅德",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%}^&F^\"N^**^!/^%i^!~^&Z^1O^#0^*A^'W^$%^!)^3K^&Z^!~^)*^,X^/?^#j",
      "encoded_base64": "XiV9XiZGXiJOXioqXiEvXiVpXiF+XiZaXjFPXiMwXipBXidXXiQlXiEpXjNLXiZaXiF+XikqXixYXi8/XiNq",
      "byte_length": 63
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_99a9517542ba",
      "text": "強大智慧留存的全部。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#]^\"z^$i^4;^-+^#*^&Z^!h^)#^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNdXiJ6XiRpXjQ7Xi0rXiMqXiZaXiFoXikjXiEi",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1de801f63a41",
      "text": "在羅德死後，我被掩埋。去年一場沙塵暴讓我重見天日，",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"d^/?^#j^%L^#b^*A^$%^(@^9~^1r^!\"^\"6^+~^!%^\"n^%]^\"p^$m^-}^$%^))^-m^+e^$a^*A",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJkXi8/XiNqXiVMXiNiXipBXiQlXihAXjl+XjFyXiEiXiI2Xit+XiElXiJuXiVdXiJwXiRtXi19XiQlXikpXi1tXitlXiRhXipB",
      "byte_length": 75
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_59f7ef936bf6",
      "text": "然後村民們撿到了我。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&\"^#b^$z^%T^*{^=9^!u^*D^$%^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiYiXiNiXiR6XiVUXip7Xj05XiF1XipEXiQlXiEi",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ffc17f90156c",
      "text": "令人敬畏的法師羅德賦予了我許多強大的力量。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*w^!<^*O^7@^&Z^%b^#M^/?^#j^(Y^!4^*D^$%^-s^\"x^#]^\"z^&Z^!~^)*^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xip3XiE8XipPXjdAXiZaXiViXiNNXi8/XiNqXihZXiE0XipEXiQlXi1zXiJ4XiNdXiJ6XiZaXiF+XikqXiEi",
      "byte_length": 63
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f1ce5b8fad51",
      "text": "唉，許多秘密都遺失在時間的無情之手中，再也無法找回了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+M^*A^-s^\"x^1O^#0^)$^0v^\"|^\"d^$f^)G^&Z^%}^,0^!/^$+^!,^*A^!l^!1^%}^%b^$/^\"\\^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XitNXipBXi1zXiJ4XjFPXiMwXikkXjB2XiJ8XiJkXiRmXilHXiZaXiV9XiwwXiEvXiQrXiEsXipBXiFsXiExXiV9XiViXiQvXiJcXipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 81
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d05483a62d5a",
      "text": "我是令人敬畏的羅德最完美的傑作。我一直陪伴著他直到",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^,X^*w^!<^*O^7@^&Z^/?^#j^$q^#,^-P^&Z^9<^!M^!\"^$%^!%^&`^8.^1h^-a^!@^&`^!u",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXixYXip3XiE8XipPXjdAXiZaXi8/XiNqXiRxXiMsXi1QXiZaXjk8XiFNXiEiXiQlXiElXiZgXjguXjFoXi1hXiFAXiZgXiF1",
      "byte_length": 75
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_45d185c529be",
      "text": "他最後的日子。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^$q^#b^&Z^$a^#(^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXiRxXiNiXiZaXiRhXiMoXiEi",
      "byte_length": 21
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e91256b595a9",
      "text": "莊嚴的巫師羅德需要我的智慧，所以他賦予了我說話的能力。我對",
      "encoded_ascii": "^6l^1*^&Z^14^#M^/?^#j^)e^(C^$%^&Z^$i^4;^*A^$)^!B^!@^(Y^!4^*D^$%^-x^-v^&Z^'b^!~^!\"^$%^#:",
      "encoded_base64": "XjZsXjEqXiZaXjE0XiNNXi8/XiNqXillXihDXiQlXiZaXiRpXjQ7XipBXiQpXiFCXiFAXihZXiE0XipEXiQlXi14Xi12XiZaXidiXiF+XiEiXiQlXiM6",
      "byte_length": 87
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_60a3e1b5d8c3",
      "text": "對他的記憶充滿感激。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#:^!@^&Z^(K^$\"^5.^,{^#{^1H^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiM6XiFAXiZaXihLXiQiXjUuXix7XiN7XjFIXiEi",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_358fb2182c94",
      "text": "我將等待您的下一個命令。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^#7^'-^,*^4:^&Z^!(^!%^!V^\"N^*w^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiM3XictXiwqXjQ6XiZaXiEoXiElXiFWXiJOXip3XiEi",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_de3ccff4a42d",
      "text": "非常抱歉，主人。周圍的泥土屏蔽了方尖碑的",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)i^#O^,@^,h^*A^!-^!<^!\"^\"L^\"`^&Z^%d^\"c^#@^('^*D^$]^#=^&p^&Z",
      "encoded_base64": "XilpXiNPXixAXixoXipBXiEtXiE8XiEiXiJMXiJgXiZaXiVkXiJjXiNAXignXipEXiRdXiM9XiZwXiZa",
      "byte_length": 60
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_53246f04f562",
      "text": "靈氣。您必須在地面上，我的力量才能發揮作用。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)g^%U^!\"^4:^#l^)r^\"d^\"e^)j^!'^*A^$%^&Z^!~^)*^$,^'b^&W^2\"^!M^&H^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XilnXiVVXiEiXjQ6XiNsXilyXiJkXiJlXilqXiEnXipBXiQlXiZaXiF+XikqXiQsXidiXiZXXjIiXiFNXiZIXiEi",
      "byte_length": 66
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_80baef746eeb",
      "text": "萬分抱歉，主人。然而，目前沒有活躍的",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-_^!s^,@^,h^*A^!-^!<^!\"^&\"^'W^*A^&^^!z^%\\^$s^%i^:b^&Z",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi1fXiFzXixAXixoXipBXiEtXiE8XiEiXiYiXidXXipBXiZeXiF6XiVcXiRzXiVpXjpiXiZa",
      "byte_length": 54
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_aa6e047eab56",
      "text": "方尖碑可供我傳送過去。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$]^#=^&p^\"A^!P^$%^+$^./^(x^\"6^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRdXiM9XiZwXiJBXiFQXiQlXiskXi4vXih4XiI2XiEi",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_102c5a03c7f8",
      "text": "我該帶您去哪裡，主人？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^(M^#N^4:^\"6^+I^-j^*A^!-^!<^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXihNXiNOXjQ6XiI2XitJXi1qXipBXiEtXiE8Xi5W",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_73e233d9977b",
      "text": "  提奎茲爾。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$A^5B^/D^&/^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJEFeNUJeL0ReJi9eISI=",
      "byte_length": 17
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d813c797ccab",
      "text": "  塞德利特。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^/(^#j^!t^&5^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLyheI2peIXReJjVeISI=",
      "byte_length": 17
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_42107244c51e",
      "text": "  蓋德隆。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^-d^#j^)T^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLWReI2peKVReISI=",
      "byte_length": 14
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8a487bcbfb92",
      "text": "  精靈商隊。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^'7^)g^1'^)U^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJzdeKWdeMSdeKVVeISI=",
      "byte_length": 17
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5ec3c7e1c13a",
      "text": "  紅沙區。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^3!^%]^\"+^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeMyFeJV1eIiteISI=",
      "byte_length": 14
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d3ed95771bf9",
      "text": "  德拉吉的田野。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^#j^$6^\"D^&Z^;\\^.:^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeI2peJDZeIkReJlpeO1xeLjpeISI=",
      "byte_length": 23
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7ab1baa102c6",
      "text": "算了，我留下來。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-C^*D^*A^$%^-+^!(^!O^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi1DXipEXipBXiQlXi0rXiEoXiFPXiEi",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0e049c87b3e0",
      "text": "提奎茲爾",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$A^5B^/D^&/",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRBXjVCXi9EXiYv",
      "byte_length": 12
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_eb5dfe0ff9b1",
      "text": "精靈商隊",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'7^)g^1'^)U",
      "encoded_base64": "Xic3XilnXjEnXilV",
      "byte_length": 12
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9ebac08505de",
      "text": "紅沙區",
      "encoded_ascii": "^3!^%]^\"+",
      "encoded_base64": "XjMhXiVdXiIr",
      "byte_length": 9
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a82830312f94",
      "text": "德拉吉的田野",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#j^$6^\"D^&Z^;\\^.:",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNqXiQ2XiJEXiZaXjtcXi46",
      "byte_length": 18
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_796e1c59abdb",
      "text": "您已經在",
      "encoded_ascii": "^4:^#J^'D^\"d",
      "encoded_base64": "XjQ6XiNKXidEXiJk",
      "byte_length": 12
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_74fb78d07ee3",
      "text": "了。在您的雙腳",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*D^!\"^\"d^4:^&Z^)_^00",
      "encoded_base64": "XipEXiEiXiJkXjQ6XiZaXilfXjAw",
      "byte_length": 21
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_38486bf19dc7",
      "text": "幾乎能和我一樣快帶您到達目的地時，我使用方尖碑的力量是不合適的。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#T^!0^'b^\"O^$%^!%^,f^*L^#N^4:^!u^(z^&^^&Z^\"e^$f^*A^$%^!N^&H^$]^#=^&p^&Z^!~^)*^,X^!)^\"C^(|^&Z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNUXiEwXidiXiJPXiQlXiElXixmXipMXiNOXjQ6XiF1Xih6XiZeXiZaXiJlXiRmXipBXiQlXiFOXiZIXiRdXiM9XiZwXiZaXiF+XikqXixYXiEpXiJDXih8XiZaXiEi",
      "byte_length": 96
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e07d7bf5ebad",
      "text": "感覺到方尖碑的洞中散發出魔法靈氣。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#{^(G^!u^$]^#=^&p^&Z^%h^!,^$S^&W^!q^*0^%b^)g^%U^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiN7XihHXiF1XiRdXiM9XiZwXiZaXiVoXiEsXiRTXiZXXiFxXiowXiViXilnXiVVXiEi",
      "byte_length": 51
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f6eec5964006",
      "text": "等等！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'-^'-^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XictXictXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 10
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c61792c059a7",
      "text": "既然你們已經拿到了角鬥士，我們就沒有理由再留在這裡了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,U^&\"^*F^*{^#J^'D^,G^!u^*D^(H^*,^+a^*A^$%^*{^*J^%\\^$s^&A^&I^!l^-+^\"d^(s^-j^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XixVXiYiXipGXip7XiNKXidEXixHXiF1XipEXihIXiosXithXipBXiQlXip7XipKXiVcXiRzXiZBXiZJXiFsXi0rXiJkXihzXi1qXipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8a702e78b6f1",
      "text": "我們要離開這個該死的地方了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^(C^)`^)F^(s^!V^(M^%L^&Z^\"e^$]^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7XihDXilgXilGXihzXiFWXihNXiVMXiZaXiJlXiRdXipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 43
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2d511105f336",
      "text": "我是阿蘭特指揮官。你想跟我做買賣嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^,X^)M^/G^&5^$8^2\"^#-^!\"^*F^,1^.+^$%^*~^.!^.$^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXixYXilNXi9HXiY1XiQ4XjIiXiMtXiEiXipGXiwxXi4rXiQlXip+Xi4hXi4kXitYXi5W",
      "byte_length": 54
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_97ce0b949d8c",
      "text": "  你們的衛兵到底是怎麼回事？！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^*{^&Z^(=^+,^!u^/^^,X^,,^.T^\"\\^*r^.V^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeKnteJlpeKD1eKyxeIXVeL15eLFheLCxeLlReIlxeKnJeLlZeKlcg",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b318efda6ee4",
      "text": "  你剛才把那個人給打昏了！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^+0^$,^$1^)!^!V^!<^'A^$-^$d^*D^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeKzBeJCxeJDFeKSFeIVZeITxeJ0FeJC1eJGReKkReKlc=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_196507eebee0",
      "text": "  你就是手裡有角鬥士的那個人？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^*J^,X^$+^-j^$s^(H^*,^+a^&Z^)!^!V^!<^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeKkpeLFheJCteLWpeJHNeKEheKixeK2FeJlpeKSFeIVZeITxeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_dcbe7dd009f4",
      "text": "  我正在尋找來自蓋德隆的角鬥士。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^%H^\"d^#9^$/^!O^'l^-d^#j^)T^&Z^(H^*,^+a^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeJUheImReIzleJC9eIU9eJ2xeLWReI2peKVReJlpeKEheKixeK2FeISI=",
      "byte_length": 47
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d47019fc71a5",
      "text": "  你在這裡做什麼買賣？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^\"d^(s^-j^*~^!=^.T^.!^.$^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeImReKHNeLWpeKn5eIT1eLlReLiFeLiReLlY=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7a1c11b62bcb",
      "text": "  這些角鬥士是從哪裡弄來的？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^(s^!8^(H^*,^+a^,X^#f^+I^-j^/`^!O^&Z^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKHNeITheKEheKixeK2FeLFheI2ZeK0leLWpeL2BeIU9eJlpeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4ce6ba702459",
      "text": "  角鬥士都在哪裡？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^(H^*,^+a^)$^\"d^+I^-j^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKEheKixeK2FeKSReImReK0leLWpeLlYg",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1659413a87a9",
      "text": "  你打算要什麼樣的報酬？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^$-^-C^(C^!=^.T^,f^&Z^+`^7o^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeJC1eLUNeKENeIT1eLlReLGZeJlpeK2BeN29eLlY=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b0cdb1a1b5bd",
      "text": "  一萬陶幣？我剛好有這麼多。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^!%^-_^)R^+|^.V^$%^+0^+i^$s^(s^.T^\"x^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeISVeLV9eKVJeK3xeLlZeJCVeKzBeK2leJHNeKHNeLlReInheISIg",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_273dc5e1ec12",
      "text": "  我們成交吧。你想要什麼？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^*{^$$^0P^*I^!\"^*F^,1^(C^!=^.T^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeKnteJCReMFBeKkleISJeKkZeLDFeKENeIT1eLlReLlY=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ee05a217bcb7",
      "text": "遺憾的事，但總得殺雞儆猴以儆效尤。他們現在想打瞌睡得 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^0v^0_^&Z^*r^*A^!I^-M^#e^%M^31^2V^2x^!B^2V^$Q^6V^!\"^!@^*{^&?^\"d^,1^$-^=<^-3^#e ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjB2XjBfXiZaXipyXipBXiFJXi1NXiNlXiVNXjMxXjJWXjJ4XiFCXjJWXiRRXjZWXiEiXiFAXip7XiY/XiJkXiwxXiQtXj08Xi0zXiNlIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5e2bbbda7e64",
      "text": "三思而後行了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!&^#q^'W^#b^(;^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEmXiNxXidXXiNiXig7XipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 22
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f1be5c0bc040",
      "text": "我手裡確實有些角鬥士。至於我有沒有你們 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^$+^-j^-6^#3^$s^!8^(H^*,^+a^!\"^'n^$^^$%^$s^%\\^$s^*F^*{ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiQrXi1qXi02XiMzXiRzXiE4XihIXiosXithXiEiXiduXiReXiQlXiRzXiVcXiRzXipGXip7IA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b7049018748f",
      "text": "想找的特定角鬥士，那可就是另一回事了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,1^$/^&Z^&5^#.^(H^*,^+a^*A^)!^\"A^*J^,X^\">^!%^\"\\^*r^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiwxXiQvXiZaXiY1XiMuXihIXiosXithXipBXikhXiJBXipKXixYXiI+XiElXiJcXipyXipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1b82a107dba1",
      "text": "哈，今天算你們走運！我手裡的正好就是那批角鬥士！不過， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+F^*A^*E^+e^-C^*F^*{^.&^.4^*W^$%^$+^-j^&Z^%H^+i^*J^,X^)!^2i^(H^*,^+a^*W^!)^(x^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitGXipBXipFXitlXi1DXipGXip7Xi4mXi40XipXXiQlXiQrXi1qXiZaXiVIXitpXipKXixYXikhXjJpXihIXiosXithXipXXiEpXih4XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bf59de02a575",
      "text": "我懷疑你們能不能出得起比另一位買家更高的價碼——你們看起來可不像 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^,9^0p^*F^*{^'b^!)^'b^!q^#e^.(^,m^\">^!%^!J^.!^+s^$o^*+^&Z^+&^94^*n^*n^*F^*{^*Q^.(^!O^\"A^!)^!` ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiw5XjBwXipGXip7XidiXiEpXidiXiFxXiNlXi4oXixtXiI+XiElXiFKXi4hXitzXiRvXiorXiZaXismXjk0XipuXipuXipGXip7XipRXi4oXiFPXiJBXiEpXiFgIA==",
      "byte_length": 97
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d1421f2ac8a6",
      "text": "有錢人的樣子。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$s^.<^!<^&Z^,f^#(^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRzXi48XiE8XiZaXixmXiMoXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 22
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_97753c96d444",
      "text": "我們正在等待有人送來我們抓到的這批角鬥士的贖金。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^%H^\"d^'-^,*^$s^!<^./^!O^$%^*{^$2^!u^&Z^(s^2i^(H^*,^+a^&Z^3-^)+^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7XiVIXiJkXictXiwqXiRzXiE8Xi4vXiFPXiQlXip7XiQyXiF1XiZaXihzXjJpXihIXiosXithXiZaXjMtXikrXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5ec2e9d0ec95",
      "text": "我們是捕奴隊！不然看起來像什麼？你要是問出這種 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^,X^4?^##^)U^*W^!)^&\"^*Q^.(^!O^!`^!=^.T^.V^*F^(C^,X^*Z^!q^(s^'$ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7XixYXjQ/XiMjXilVXipXXiEpXiYiXipRXi4oXiFPXiFgXiE9Xi5UXi5WXipGXihDXixYXipaXiFxXihzXickIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f146937e98b1",
      "text": "問題，肯定是腦袋在烈日下曬太久曬昏頭了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*Z^.G^*A^-Z^#.^,X^2@^(?^\"d^%|^$a^!(^,Z^+f^!.^,Z^$d^)t^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipaXi5HXipBXi1aXiMuXixYXjJAXig/XiJkXiV8XiRhXiEoXixaXitmXiEuXixaXiRkXil0XipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_143f1c786b9a",
      "text": "他們來自其中一個奴隸村落。據說有人控制了 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^*{^!O^'l^!j^!,^!%^!V^##^)Z^$z^-`^!\"^5T^-x^$s^!<^$@^!v^*D ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXip7XiFPXidsXiFqXiEsXiElXiFWXiMjXilaXiR6Xi1gXiEiXjVUXi14XiRzXiE8XiRAXiF2XipEIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_056ab5b1ed4b",
      "text": "他們的城鎮，這就是為什麼他們自願被賣。你們可以過去 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^*{^&Z^+_^);^*A^(s^*J^,X^%{^!=^.T^!@^*{^'l^.H^(@^.$^!\"^*F^*{^\"A^!B^(x^\"6 ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXip7XiZaXitfXik7XipBXihzXipKXixYXiV7XiE9Xi5UXiFAXip7XidsXi5IXihAXi4kXiEiXipGXip7XiJBXiFCXih4XiI2IA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7d84a30876cc",
      "text": "跟他們談談——他們溫順得跟綿羊一樣！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.+^!@^*{^0;^0;^*n^*n^!@^*{^%s^.D^#e^.+^>&^8M^!%^,f^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi4rXiFAXip7XjA7XjA7XipuXipuXiFAXip7XiVzXi5EXiNlXi4rXj4mXjhNXiElXixmXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_dd48ba5b22e6",
      "text": "他們在北方——當你們撞上骨牆柵欄時，沿著東緣走， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^*{^\"d^+6^$]^*n^*n^&N^*F^*{^/l^!'^*$^&0^%(^%C^$f^*A^%`^-a^,`^9J^.&^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXip7XiJkXis2XiRdXipuXipuXiZOXipGXip7Xi9sXiEnXiokXiYwXiUoXiVDXiRmXipBXiVgXi1hXixgXjlKXi4mXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_137872f627be",
      "text": "就能找到入口。我猜衛兵應該不會攔你們， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*J^'b^$/^!u^!f^\"<^!\"^$%^-'^(=^+,^0`^(M^!)^$r^9n^*F^*{^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipKXidiXiQvXiF1XiFmXiI8XiEiXiQlXi0nXig9XissXjBgXihNXiEpXiRyXjluXipGXip7XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cef4ff9d3aa8",
      "text": "所以你們不會遇到任何麻煩。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$)^!B^*F^*{^!)^$r^.2^!u^!C^!L^*6^-!^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQpXiFCXipGXip7XiEpXiRyXi4yXiF1XiFDXiFMXio2Xi0hXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 40
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2b0b907249e5",
      "text": "有一幫蘇蘭蜥蜴人對他們很感興趣。別問我那些 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$s^!%^+}^4c^/G^(2^(3^!<^#:^!@^*{^*K^#{^-]^.*^!\"^*H^*Z^$%^)!^!8 ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRzXiElXit9XjRjXi9HXigyXigzXiE8XiM6XiFAXip7XipLXiN7Xi1dXi4qXiEiXipIXipaXiQlXikhXiE4IA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e13194ee8858",
      "text": "大蜥蜴要拿人類做什麼——我才不想知道。他們承諾 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"z^(2^(3^(C^,G^!<^)w^*~^!=^.T^*n^*n^$%^$,^!)^,1^&h^(y^!\"^!@^*{^$0^7k ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJ6XigyXigzXihDXixHXiE8Xil3Xip+XiE9Xi5UXipuXipuXiQlXiQsXiEpXiwxXiZoXih5XiEiXiFAXip7XiQwXjdrIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ae07c6b9bda2",
      "text": "付給我們一萬陶幣買下他們。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*u^'A^$%^*{^!%^-_^)R^+|^.!^!(^!@^*{^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xip1XidBXiQlXip7XiElXi1fXilSXit8Xi4hXiEoXiFAXip7XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 40
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_511f8c44516d",
      "text": "哎呀！這可真是出人意料！如果你願意掏出這麼大一筆錢， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^3i^3h^*W^(s^\"A^-2^,X^!q^!<^#z^/n^*W^#$^%!^*F^.H^#z^/f^!q^(s^.T^\"z^!%^-A^.<^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjNpXjNoXipXXihzXiJBXi0yXixYXiFxXiE8XiN6Xi9uXipXXiMkXiUhXipGXi5IXiN6Xi9mXiFxXihzXi5UXiJ6XiElXi1BXi48XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d340e1689bc1",
      "text": "角鬥士就是你的了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(H^*,^+a^*J^,X^*F^&Z^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XihIXiosXithXipKXixYXipGXiZaXipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a1c012caa61f",
      "text": "  算了吧！10,000 有點太高了！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^-C^*D^*I^*W10,000 ^$s^*;^+f^*+^*D^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLUNeKkReKkleKlcxMCwwMDAgXiRzXio7XitmXiorXipEXipX",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e8910718090d",
      "text": "  沒門。我要留著我的錢。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^%\\^)D^!\"^$%^(C^-+^-a^$%^&Z^.<^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJVxeKUReISJeJCVeKENeLSteLWFeJCVeJlpeLjxeISI=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_29ce25cb062a",
      "text": "  好吧。這是錢。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^+i^*I^!\"^(s^,X^.<^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeK2leKkleISJeKHNeLFheLjxeISI=",
      "byte_length": 23
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e7338ba51ce7",
      "text": "很好。但如果你像我想像的那樣想要那些角鬥士，我知道",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*K^+i^!\"^!I^#$^%!^*F^!`^$%^,1^!`^&Z^)!^,f^,1^(C^)!^!8^(H^*,^+a^*A^$%^&h^(y",
      "encoded_base64": "XipLXitpXiEiXiFJXiMkXiUhXipGXiFgXiQlXiwxXiFgXiZaXikhXixmXiwxXihDXikhXiE4XihIXiosXithXipBXiQlXiZoXih5",
      "byte_length": 75
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0cc529719a12",
      "text": "你還會回來的。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^.7^$r^\"\\^!O^&Z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXi43XiRyXiJcXiFPXiZaXiEi",
      "byte_length": 21
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2c8ab7f0ee5a",
      "text": "隨意去和角鬥士們談談吧。如果你改變主意，歡迎回來！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)X^#z^\"6^\"O^(H^*,^+a^*{^0;^0;^*I^!\"^#$^%!^*F^$N^(U^!-^#z^*A^%F^(k^\"\\^!O^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XilYXiN6XiI2XiJPXihIXiosXithXip7XjA7XjA7XipJXiEiXiMkXiUhXipGXiROXihVXiEtXiN6XipBXiVGXihrXiJcXiFPXipX",
      "byte_length": 75
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_652a5aa79c3f",
      "text": "這才是我喜歡聽的話！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^$,^,X^$%^+V^%F^-X^&Z^-v^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXiQsXixYXiQlXitWXiVGXi1YXiZaXi12XipX",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8964a8a4157f",
      "text": "就像我說的，",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*J^!`^$%^-x^&Z^*A",
      "encoded_base64": "XipKXiFgXiQlXi14XiZaXipB",
      "byte_length": 18
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_67d0130a070c",
      "text": "價格是 10,000 陶幣。我懷疑你有那麼多。不過，如果你願意，",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+&^%*^,X 10,000 ^)R^+|^!\"^$%^,9^0p^*F^$s^)!^.T^\"x^!\"^!)^(x^*A^#$^%!^*F^.H^#z^*A",
      "encoded_base64": "XismXiUqXixYIDEwLDAwMCBeKVJeK3xeISJeJCVeLDleMHBeKkZeJHNeKSFeLlReInheISJeISleKHheKkFeIyReJSFeKkZeLkheI3peKkE=",
      "byte_length": 80
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6e34a0066251",
      "text": "我也可以接受一把魔法劍來代替錢。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^!1^\"A^!B^$?^\";^!%^$1^*0^%b^!|^!O^*v^2o^.<^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiExXiJBXiFCXiQ/XiI7XiElXiQxXiowXiViXiF8XiFPXip2XjJvXi48XiEi",
      "byte_length": 48
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9412577914f2",
      "text": "  把角鬥士給我！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$1^(H^*,^+a^'A^$%^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJDFeKEheKixeK2FeJ0FeJCVeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 23
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0d942b546cb1",
      "text": "  我想買下這些角鬥士。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^,1^.!^!(^(s^!8^(H^*,^+a^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeLDFeLiFeISheKHNeITheKEheKixeK2FeISI=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f4b7fd917042",
      "text": "  把角鬥士賣給我，否則你就死定了！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$1^(H^*,^+a^.$^'A^$%^*A^\"H^!x^*F^*J^%L^#.^*D^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJDFeKEheKixeK2FeLiReJ0FeJCVeKkFeIkheIXheKkZeKkpeJUxeIy5eKkReKlc=",
      "byte_length": 50
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_16fffc8f10da",
      "text": "  如果不交出來，我就殺了你！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^#$^%!^!)^0P^!q^!O^*A^$%^*J^%M^*D^*F^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIyReJSFeISleMFBeIXFeIU9eKkFeJCVeKkpeJU1eKkReKkZeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_db5bc0d20378",
      "text": "  因為我叫你這麼做。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^\"]^%{^$%^+<^*F^(s^.T^*~^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIl1eJXteJCVeKzxeKkZeKHNeLlReKn5eISI=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9a45442c39a7",
      "text": "  10,000 有點太多了！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  10,000 ^$s^*;^+f^\"x^*D^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICAxMCwwMDAgXiRzXio7XitmXiJ4XipEXipX",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4caec5b16b1b",
      "text": "  我能弄到那筆錢。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^'b^/`^!u^)!^-A^.<^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeJ2JeL2BeIXVeKSFeLUFeLjxeISI=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_731439a1f8bd",
      "text": "  好吧。這是一把魔法劍。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^+i^*I^!\"^(s^,X^!%^$1^*0^%b^!|^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeK2leKkleISJeKHNeLFheISVeJDFeKjBeJWJeIXxeISI=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2294ff45ee3f",
      "text": "  那些蘇蘭蜥蜴人在哪裡？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^)!^!8^4c^/G^(2^(3^!<^\"d^+I^-j^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKSFeITheNGNeL0deKDJeKDNeITxeImReK0leLWpeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fd3f3797f050",
      "text": "  算了吧！我們還是直接殺了你比較快。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^-C^*D^*I^*W^$%^*{^.7^,X^&`^$?^%M^*D^*F^,m^(f^*L^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLUNeKkReKkleKldeJCVeKnteLjdeLFheJmBeJD9eJU1eKkReKkZeLG1eKGZeKkxeISI=",
      "byte_length": 53
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_74eff1118eed",
      "text": "  我會把雕像碎片帶給威米亞斯。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^$r^$1^)^^!`^&o^&1^#N^'A^#&^'4^!9^$[^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeJHJeJDFeKV5eIWBeJm9eJjFeI05eJ0FeIyZeJzReITleJFteISI=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a8eb2ce42684",
      "text": "天啊！多麼傲慢！你闖進我的營地還對我發號施令？！無論如何，",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+e^+Q^*W^\"x^.T^1j^#~^*W^*F^.z^(w^$%^&Z^&'^\"e^.7^#:^$%^&W^(-^$_^*w^.V^*W^%}^1\\^#$^!L^*A",
      "encoded_base64": "XitlXitRXipXXiJ4Xi5UXjFqXiN+XipXXipGXi56Xih3XiQlXiZaXiYnXiJlXi43XiM6XiQlXiZXXigtXiRfXip3Xi5WXipXXiV9XjFcXiMkXiFMXipB",
      "byte_length": 87
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_65957dc814ec",
      "text": "我為什麼要把他們交給你？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^%{^!=^.T^(C^$1^!@^*{^0P^'A^*F^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiV7XiE9Xi5UXihDXiQxXiFAXip7XjBQXidBXipGXi5W",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_38f82dc3c5cc",
      "text": "我已經跟蘇蘭蜥蜴人談好要把他們賣過去了。我為什麼要",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^#J^'D^.+^4c^/G^(2^(3^!<^0;^+i^(C^$1^!@^*{^.$^(x^\"6^*D^!\"^$%^%{^!=^.T^(C",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiNKXidEXi4rXjRjXi9HXigyXigzXiE8XjA7XitpXihDXiQxXiFAXip7Xi4kXih4XiI2XipEXiEiXiQlXiV7XiE9Xi5UXihD",
      "byte_length": 75
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b1ceb6f4ec31",
      "text": "改賣給你們呢？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$N^.$^'A^*F^*{^+C^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XiROXi4kXidBXipGXip7XitDXi5W",
      "byte_length": 21
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cae5963dad27",
      "text": "衛兵！別打瞌睡了！快來消滅這些小丑！對得起你們的薪水！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(=^+,^*W^*H^$-^=<^-3^*D^*W^*L^!O^%k^%t^(s^!8^#;^;O^*W^#:^#e^.(^*F^*{^&Z^==^%V^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "Xig9XissXipXXipIXiQtXj08Xi0zXipEXipXXipMXiFPXiVrXiV0XihzXiE4XiM7XjtPXipXXiM6XiNlXi4oXipGXip7XiZaXj09XiVWXipX",
      "byte_length": 81
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_dfb372943792",
      "text": "嗯……不行。別以為你能用魅力從我手裡騙走角鬥士，因為",
      "encoded_ascii": "^6N^*o^*o^!)^(;^!\"^*H^!B^%{^*F^'b^&H^*/^!~^#f^$%^$+^-j^.{^.&^(H^*,^+a^*A^\"]^%{",
      "encoded_base64": "XjZOXipvXipvXiEpXig7XiEiXipIXiFCXiV7XipGXidiXiZIXiovXiF+XiNmXiQlXiQrXi1qXi57Xi4mXihIXiosXithXipBXiJdXiV7",
      "byte_length": 78
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7207a672d9d3",
      "text": "那是不管用的。要嘛付我 10,000 陶幣，要嘛給我一把魔法劍。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^,X^!)^-D^&H^&Z^!\"^(C^+Y^*u^$% 10,000 ^)R^+|^*A^(C^+Y^'A^$%^!%^$1^*0^%b^!|^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXixYXiEpXi1EXiZIXiZaXiEiXihDXitZXip1XiQlIDEwLDAwMCBeKVJeK3xeKkFeKENeK1leJ0FeJCVeISVeJDFeKjBeJWJeIXxeISI=",
      "byte_length": 80
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3addc7377e95",
      "text": "當然，如果你能湊齊那麼多錢，我就把角鬥士改賣給",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&N^&\"^*A^#$^%!^*F^'b^77^36^)!^.T^\"x^.<^*A^$%^*J^$1^(H^*,^+a^$N^.$^'A",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZOXiYiXipBXiMkXiUhXipGXidiXjc3XjM2XikhXi5UXiJ4Xi48XipBXiQlXipKXiQxXihIXiosXithXiROXi4kXidB",
      "byte_length": 69
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ef37f4965366",
      "text": "你。我只想離開這個鬼地方——我的衛兵",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^!\"^$%^\"?^,1^)`^)F^(s^!V^*-^\"e^$]^*n^*n^$%^&Z^(=^+,",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiEiXiQlXiI/XiwxXilgXilGXihzXiFWXiotXiJlXiRdXipuXipuXiQlXiZaXig9Xiss",
      "byte_length": 54
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c5434ffa1015",
      "text": "也沒讓這事情變得更容易。快點。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!1^%\\^-}^(s^*r^,0^(U^#e^$o^+t^,W^!\"^*L^*;^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiExXiVcXi19XihzXipyXiwwXihVXiNlXiRvXit0XixXXiEiXipMXio7XiEi",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_28ae45fa5d93",
      "text": "好吧，就這樣！你可以隨意處置他們。至於",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+i^*I^*A^*J^(s^,f^*W^*F^\"A^!B^)X^#z^(,^'Q^!@^*{^!\"^'n^$^",
      "encoded_base64": "XitpXipJXipBXipKXihzXixmXipXXipGXiJBXiFCXilYXiN6XigsXidRXiFAXip7XiEiXiduXiRe",
      "byte_length": 57
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b20bf554714b",
      "text": "我們，我們要離開這個被遺棄的地方了。歡迎隨意使用我們剛",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^*A^$%^*{^(C^)`^)F^(s^!V^(@^0v^,a^&Z^\"e^$]^*D^!\"^%F^(k^)X^#z^!N^&H^$%^*{^+0",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7XipBXiQlXip7XihDXilgXilGXihzXiFWXihAXjB2XixhXiZaXiJlXiRdXipEXiEiXiVGXihrXilYXiN6XiFOXiZIXiQlXip7Xisw",
      "byte_length": 81
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_61efd5675f87",
      "text": "廢棄的營地。我們現在可以負擔得起更好的了！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#W^,a^&Z^&'^\"e^!\"^$%^*{^&?^\"d^\"A^!B^(W^*N^#e^.(^$o^+i^&Z^*D^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNXXixhXiZaXiYnXiJlXiEiXiQlXip7XiY/XiJkXiJBXiFCXihXXipOXiNlXi4oXiRvXitpXiZaXipEXipX",
      "byte_length": 63
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8888cbd0e38e",
      "text": "在這裡祝你好運。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"d^(s^-j^&v^*F^+i^.4^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJkXihzXi1qXiZ2XipGXitpXi40XiEi",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fe994b01fe54",
      "text": "他們往東邊去了。所有你——等等。你該不會是在想直接把錢",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^*{^,)^,`^.8^\"6^*D^!\"^$)^$s^*F^*n^*n^'-^'-^!\"^*F^(M^!)^$r^,X^\"d^,1^&`^$?^$1^.<",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXip7XiwpXixgXi44XiI2XipEXiEiXiQpXiRzXipGXipuXipuXictXictXiEiXipGXihNXiEpXiRyXixYXiJkXiwxXiZgXiQ/XiQxXi48",
      "byte_length": 81
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_48c0f4d4f83a",
      "text": "「搶」過來吧？呵。好吧，祝你好運。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!#^1?^!$^(x^!O^*I^.V^+D^!\"^+i^*I^*A^&v^*F^+i^.4^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEjXjE/XiEkXih4XiFPXipJXi5WXitEXiEiXitpXipJXipBXiZ2XipGXitpXi40XiEi",
      "byte_length": 51
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d84cb64630f7",
      "text": "還有威米亞斯想要的一塊雕像碎片，他們原本也打算送過去的……",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.7^$s^#&^'4^!9^$[^,1^(C^&Z^!%^/Z^)^^!`^&o^&1^*A^!@^*{^\"5^$x^!1^$-^-C^./^(x^\"6^&Z^*o^*o",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi43XiRzXiMmXic0XiE5XiRbXiwxXihDXiZaXiElXi9aXileXiFgXiZvXiYxXipBXiFAXip7XiI1XiR4XiExXiQtXi1DXi4vXih4XiI2XiZaXipvXipv",
      "byte_length": 87
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_611f196f716f",
      "text": "好吧。這能省去我跑一趟的麻煩——前提是你能給我 10,000 陶幣或一把魔法劍。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+i^*I^!\"^(s^'b^9%^\"6^$%^(_^!%^8)^&Z^*6^-!^*n^*n^!z^$A^,X^*F^'b^'A^$% 10,000 ^)R^+|^$'^!%^$1^*0^%b^!|^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XitpXipJXiEiXihzXidiXjklXiI2XiQlXihfXiElXjgpXiZaXio2Xi0hXipuXipuXiF6XiRBXixYXipGXidiXidBXiQlIDEwLDAwMCBeKVJeK3xeJCdeISVeJDFeKjBeJWJeIXxeISI=",
      "byte_length": 104
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fbb2b43c3333",
      "text": "你準備好為這些囚犯付錢了嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^,x^+\"^+i^%{^(s^!8^\"Z^-%^*u^.<^*D^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXix4XisiXitpXiV7XihzXiE4XiJaXi0lXip1Xi48XipEXitYXi5W",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_eb970d2c658c",
      "text": "  這是錢。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^(s^,X^.<^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKHNeLFheLjxeISI=",
      "byte_length": 14
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3816410ec774",
      "text": "  10,000 陶幣有點太貴了……",
      "encoded_ascii": "  10,000 ^)R^+|^$s^*;^+f^2F^*D^*o^*o",
      "encoded_base64": "ICAxMCwwMDAgXilSXit8XiRzXio7XitmXjJGXipEXipvXipv",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_17b04250cdb0",
      "text": "  收下這把魔法劍。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$M^!(^(s^$1^*0^%b^!|^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJE1eISheKHNeJDFeKjBeJWJeIXxeISI=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ada63038355c",
      "text": "  現在就釋放角鬥士！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^&?^\"d^*J^0w^$P^(H^*,^+a^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJj9eImReKkpeMHdeJFBeKEheKixeK2FeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5ed075fb6ae0",
      "text": "  好吧。這是 10,000。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^+i^*I^!\"^(s^,X 10,000^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeK2leKkleISJeKHNeLFggMTAsMDAwXiEi",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_19136bd3b488",
      "text": "  我不知道能不能拿出 10,000……",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^!)^&h^(y^'b^!)^'b^,G^!q 10,000^*o^*o",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeISleJmheKHleJ2JeISleJ2JeLEdeIXEgMTAsMDAwXipvXipv",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_67b2606a6c3a",
      "text": "  不！釋放角鬥士，否則就死！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^!)^*W^0w^$P^(H^*,^+a^*A^\"H^!x^*J^%L^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeISleKldeMHdeJFBeKEheKixeK2FeKkFeIkheIXheKkpeJUxeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8a242d6c1a70",
      "text": "我要走了。算了吧。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^(C^.&^*D^!\"^-C^*D^*I^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXihDXi4mXipEXiEiXi1DXipEXipJXiEi",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e51cf2d892a3",
      "text": "不行！如果你想要他們，你就得付錢！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^(;^*W^#$^%!^*F^,1^(C^!@^*{^*A^*F^*J^#e^*u^.<^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXig7XipXXiMkXiUhXipGXiwxXihDXiFAXip7XipBXipGXipKXiNlXip1Xi48XipX",
      "byte_length": 51
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6c9eeaa6d4e3",
      "text": "又回來啦？有什麼我可以為你效勞的嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+;^\"\\^!O^+R^.V^$s^!=^.T^$%^\"A^!B^%{^*F^$Q^/R^&Z^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "Xis7XiJcXiFPXitSXi5WXiRzXiE9Xi5UXiQlXiJBXiFCXiV7XipGXiRRXi9SXiZaXitYXi5W",
      "byte_length": 54
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_025de8e2a909",
      "text": "  我無法遵守我們的交易了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^%}^%b^4#^#+^$%^*{^&Z^0P^,W^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeJX1eJWJeNCNeIyteJCVeKnteJlpeMFBeLFdeKkReISI=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_87d592d47cd0",
      "text": "  我會弄到錢的。再等一下。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^$r^/`^!u^.<^&Z^!\"^!l^'-^!%^!(^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeJHJeL2BeIXVeLjxeJlpeISJeIWxeJy1eISVeISheISI=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7b5d8eaef7f9",
      "text": "弄不到錢，是吧？嗯，沒關係。我只好把這些人",
      "encoded_ascii": "^/`^!)^!u^.<^*A^,X^*I^.V^6N^*A^%\\^.>^38^!\"^$%^\"?^+i^$1^(s^!8^!<",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi9gXiEpXiF1Xi48XipBXixYXipJXi5WXjZOXipBXiVcXi4+XjM4XiEiXiQlXiI/XitpXiQxXihzXiE4XiE8",
      "byte_length": 63
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a0efc347b74e",
      "text": "賣給蘇蘭蜥蜴人了。不過，把所有東西打包好還需要",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.$^'A^4c^/G^(2^(3^!<^*D^!\"^!)^(x^*A^$1^$)^$s^,`^-l^$-^\"'^+i^.7^)e^(C",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi4kXidBXjRjXi9HXigyXigzXiE8XipEXiEiXiEpXih4XipBXiQxXiQpXiRzXixgXi1sXiQtXiInXitpXi43XillXihD",
      "byte_length": 69
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cfee3f8f369f",
      "text": "一點時間，所以如果你能快點弄到錢的話……",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!%^*;^$f^)G^*A^$)^!B^#$^%!^*F^'b^*L^*;^/`^!u^.<^&Z^-v^*o^*o",
      "encoded_base64": "XiElXio7XiRmXilHXipBXiQpXiFCXiMkXiUhXipGXidiXipMXio7Xi9gXiF1Xi48XiZaXi12XipvXipv",
      "byte_length": 60
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_102ac3320d66",
      "text": "太棒了！我期待能再次與你做生意。我們",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+f^%1^*D^*W^$%^$u^,*^'b^!l^%D^'p^*F^*~^&F^#z^!\"^$%^*{",
      "encoded_base64": "XitmXiUxXipEXipXXiQlXiR1XiwqXidiXiFsXiVEXidwXipGXip+XiZGXiN6XiEiXiQlXip7",
      "byte_length": 54
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_efbf30ac0e59",
      "text": "要離開這個被遺棄的地方了。噢，歡迎隨意使用營地——我們",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(C^)`^)F^(s^!V^(@^0v^,a^&Z^\"e^$]^*D^!\"^+]^*A^%F^(k^)X^#z^!N^&H^&'^\"e^*n^*n^$%^*{",
      "encoded_base64": "XihDXilgXilGXihzXiFWXihAXjB2XixhXiZaXiJlXiRdXipEXiEiXitdXipBXiVGXihrXilYXiN6XiFOXiZIXiYnXiJlXipuXipuXiQlXip7",
      "byte_length": 81
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8202149fbfea",
      "text": "現在可以負擔得起更好的了！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&?^\"d^\"A^!B^(W^*N^#e^.(^$o^+i^&Z^*D^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiY/XiJkXiJBXiFCXihXXipOXiNlXi4oXiRvXitpXiZaXipEXipX",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8bce782371de",
      "text": "衛兵！我們要出發了！準備行軍！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(=^+,^*W^$%^*{^(C^!q^&W^*D^*W^,x^+\"^(;^..^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "Xig9XissXipXXiQlXip7XihDXiFxXiZXXipEXipXXix4XisiXig7Xi4uXipX",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a94d05afebaf",
      "text": "你沒有足夠的錢。等你有了 10,000 陶幣",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^%\\^$s^(^^+d^&Z^.<^!\"^'-^*F^$s^*D 10,000 ^)R^+|",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiVcXiRzXiheXitkXiZaXi48XiEiXictXipGXiRzXipEIDEwLDAwMCBeKVJeK3w=",
      "byte_length": 50
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_37fb1771d80a",
      "text": "再來。在那之前，別浪費我的時間。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!l^!O^!\"^\"d^)!^!/^!z^*A^*H^,r^.\"^$%^&Z^$f^)G^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFsXiFPXiEiXiJkXikhXiEvXiF6XipBXipIXixyXi4iXiQlXiZaXiRmXilHXiEi",
      "byte_length": 48
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3b99a45674db",
      "text": "我們現在要返回蓋德隆了。祝你旅途順利。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^&?^\"d^(C^7J^\"\\^-d^#j^)T^*D^!\"^&v^*F^2m^3.^.D^!t^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7XiY/XiJkXihDXjdKXiJcXi1kXiNqXilUXipEXiEiXiZ2XipGXjJtXjMuXi5EXiF0XiEi",
      "byte_length": 57
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_253a71626fbf",
      "text": "太貴了，是嗎？那你願意出多少錢買這些角鬥士？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+f^2F^*D^*A^,X^+X^.V^)!^*F^.H^#z^!q^\"x^#<^.<^.!^(s^!8^(H^*,^+a^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XitmXjJGXipEXipBXixYXitYXi5WXikhXipGXi5IXiN6XiFxXiJ4XiM8Xi48Xi4hXihzXiE4XihIXiosXithXi5W",
      "byte_length": 66
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c56f2a29055b",
      "text": "  我出 2,000。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^!q 2,000^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeIXEgMiwwMDBeISI=",
      "byte_length": 17
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2b6516c3ad7f",
      "text": "  5,000 怎麼樣？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  5,000 ^,,^.T^,f^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICA1LDAwMCBeLCxeLlReLGZeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 20
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6d4bf1265832",
      "text": "  7,000 陶幣聽起來如何？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  7,000 ^)R^+|^-X^.(^!O^#$^!L^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICA3LDAwMCBeKVJeK3xeLVheLiheIU9eIyReIUxeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1d68ebf9d15b",
      "text": "  我出 8,000。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^!q 8,000^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeIXEgOCwwMDBeISI=",
      "byte_length": 17
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_de6b8a4f8398",
      "text": "  好吧。我接受你的價格。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^+i^*I^!\"^$%^$?^\";^*F^&Z^+&^%*^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeK2leKkleISJeJCVeJD9eIjteKkZeJlpeKyZeJSpeISI=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c851632e77f9",
      "text": "  我把我的魔法劍給你。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^$1^$%^&Z^*0^%b^!|^'A^*F^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeJDFeJCVeJlpeKjBeJWJeIXxeJ0FeKkZeISI=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ddafc1c25782",
      "text": "  我饒你一命！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^.M^*F^!%^\"N^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeLk1eKkZeISVeIk5eKlc=",
      "byte_length": 20
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6c5a41a1b358",
      "text": "7,000？嗯……",
      "encoded_ascii": "7,000^.V^6N^*o^*o",
      "encoded_base64": "NywwMDBeLlZeNk5eKm9eKm8=",
      "byte_length": 17
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f61499541019",
      "text": "我在這裡待太久，一定是神志不清了！好吧。我同意你的",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^\"d^(s^-j^,*^+f^!.^*A^!%^#.^,X^&w^#m^!)^,u^*D^*W^+i^*I^!\"^$%^\"E^#z^*F^&Z",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiJkXihzXi1qXiwqXitmXiEuXipBXiElXiMuXixYXiZ3XiNtXiEpXix1XipEXipXXitpXipJXiEiXiQlXiJFXiN6XipGXiZa",
      "byte_length": 75
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e3bcfbe16364",
      "text": "出價。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!q^+&^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFxXismXiEi",
      "byte_length": 9
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c6fb6b095256",
      "text": "雖然很誘人，但你的出價還是讓我有點不高興。我的最後底線是",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.A^&\"^*K^1Z^!<^*A^!I^*F^&Z^!q^+&^.7^,X^-}^$%^$s^*;^!)^*+^-]^!\"^$%^&Z^$q^#b^/^^'I^,X",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi5BXiYiXipLXjFaXiE8XipBXiFJXipGXiZaXiFxXismXi43XixYXi19XiQlXiRzXio7XiEpXiorXi1dXiEiXiQlXiZaXiRxXiNiXi9eXidJXixY",
      "byte_length": 84
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4ca96046e4a7",
      "text": "8,250——一分也不能少。",
      "encoded_ascii": "8,250^*n^*n^!%^!s^!1^!)^'b^#<^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "OCwyNTBeKm5eKm5eISVeIXNeITFeISleJ2JeIzxeISI=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d010ad7b6b7e",
      "text": "不行，儘管你的出價聽起來很慷慨，但這些優秀的",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^(;^*A^+(^-D^*F^&Z^!q^+&^-X^.(^!O^*K^70^7/^*A^!I^(s^!8^+)^-9^&Z",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXig7XipBXisoXi1EXipGXiZaXiFxXismXi1YXi4oXiFPXipLXjcwXjcvXipBXiFJXihzXiE4XispXi05XiZa",
      "byte_length": 66
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7e90a49640ec",
      "text": "角鬥士絕不可能只值 5,000。我把我的孩子賣了都能賣到",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(H^*,^+a^-I^!)^\"A^'b^\"?^!Z 5,000^!\"^$%^$1^$%^&Z^+m^#(^.$^*D^)$^'b^.$^!u",
      "encoded_base64": "XihIXiosXithXi1JXiEpXiJBXidiXiI/XiFaIDUsMDAwXiEiXiQlXiQxXiQlXiZaXittXiMoXi4kXipEXikkXidiXi4kXiF1",
      "byte_length": 72
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a524f9f37123",
      "text": "更好的價錢。8,500 怎麼樣？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$o^+i^&Z^+&^.<^!\"8,500 ^,,^.T^,f^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRvXitpXiZaXismXi48XiEiOCw1MDAgXiwsXi5UXixmXi5W",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_84f268186754",
      "text": "你一定是在開玩笑。這些高貴的戰士，我不能接受少於 9,000 的價格。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^!%^#.^,X^\"d^)F^4U^-@^!\"^(s^!8^*+^2F^&Z^$(^+a^*A^$%^!)^'b^$?^\";^#<^$^ 9,000 ^&Z^+&^%*^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiElXiMuXixYXiJkXilGXjRVXi1AXiEiXihzXiE4XiorXjJGXiZaXiQoXithXipBXiQlXiEpXidiXiQ/XiI7XiM8XiReIDksMDAwIF4mWl4rJl4lKl4hIg==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_528cc51fcd0a",
      "text": "他們受誓言所約束！你總不會期望能用這麼低廉的價格",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^*{^\";^-w^1Y^$)^-F^$|^*W^*F^-M^!)^$r^$u^,]^'b^&H^(s^.T^!K^6X^&Z^+&^%*",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXip7XiI7Xi13XjFZXiQpXi1GXiR8XipXXipGXi1NXiEpXiRyXiR1XixdXidiXiZIXihzXi5UXiFLXjZYXiZaXismXiUq",
      "byte_length": 72
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9cc0985c5834",
      "text": "買到榮譽吧。給我一個認真的報價。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.!^!u^,e^6-^*I^!\"^'A^$%^!%^!V^(O^-2^&Z^+`^+&^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi4hXiF1XixlXjYtXipJXiEiXidBXiQlXiElXiFWXihPXi0yXiZaXitgXismXiEi",
      "byte_length": 48
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2937758cbe30",
      "text": "成交！你出 8,000，雖然比我要求的低了一些，但也實在是好到",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$$^0P^*W^*F^!q 8,000^*A^.A^&\"^,m^$%^(C^,n^&Z^!K^*D^!%^!8^*A^!I^!1^#3^\"d^,X^+i^!u",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQkXjBQXipXXipGXiFxIDgsMDAwXipBXi5BXiYiXixtXiQlXihDXixuXiZaXiFLXipEXiElXiE4XipBXiFJXiExXiMzXiJkXixYXitpXiF1",
      "byte_length": 81
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_62e23896f96c",
      "text": "令人難以拒絕。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*w^!<^)a^!B^5Q^-I^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xip3XiE8XilhXiFCXjVRXi1JXiEi",
      "byte_length": 21
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_48f59d75260a",
      "text": "什麼？！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!=^.T^.V^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiE9Xi5UXi5WXipX",
      "byte_length": 12
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bd618e7148d7",
      "text": "你跟我討價還價，然後又付不出錢？！我真該為此殺了你！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^.+^$%^-o^+&^.7^+&^*A^&\"^#b^+;^*u^!)^!q^.<^.V^*W^$%^-2^(M^%{^%I^%M^*D^*F^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXi4rXiQlXi1vXismXi43XismXipBXiYiXiNiXis7Xip1XiEpXiFxXi48Xi5WXipXXiQlXi0yXihNXiV7XiVJXiVNXipEXipGXipX",
      "byte_length": 78
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5e3f449d9485",
      "text": "從我眼前消失！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#f^$%^&d^!z^%k^\"|^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNmXiQlXiZkXiF6XiVrXiJ8XipX",
      "byte_length": 21
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f426ed9273ba",
      "text": "我期待能再次與你做生意。我們要離開這個",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^$u^,*^'b^!l^%D^'p^*F^*~^&F^#z^!\"^$%^*{^(C^)`^)F^(s^!V",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiR1XiwqXidiXiFsXiVEXidwXipGXip+XiZGXiN6XiEiXiQlXip7XihDXilgXilGXihzXiFW",
      "byte_length": 57
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_93988a888316",
      "text": "被遺棄的地方了。噢，歡迎隨意使用營地——我們現在",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(@^0v^,a^&Z^\"e^$]^*D^!\"^+]^*A^%F^(k^)X^#z^!N^&H^&'^\"e^*n^*n^$%^*{^&?^\"d",
      "encoded_base64": "XihAXjB2XixhXiZaXiJlXiRdXipEXiEiXitdXipBXiVGXihrXilYXiN6XiFOXiZIXiYnXiJlXipuXipuXiQlXip7XiY/XiJk",
      "byte_length": 72
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1b77c00119fa",
      "text": "負擔得起更好的了！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(W^*N^#e^.(^$o^+i^&Z^*D^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XihXXipOXiNlXi4oXiRvXitpXiZaXipEXipX",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_35dad4e4778b",
      "text": "衛兵！我們要出發了！醒醒，準備行軍！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(=^+,^*W^$%^*{^(C^!q^&W^*D^*W^.9^.9^*A^,x^+\"^(;^..^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "Xig9XissXipXXiQlXip7XihDXiFxXiZXXipEXipXXi45Xi45XipBXix4XisiXig7Xi4uXipX",
      "byte_length": 54
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7e841a8a321a",
      "text": "我告訴你，自從他們發現那些角鬥士不會試圖",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^+B^-t^*F^*A^'l^#f^!@^*{^&W^&?^)!^!8^(H^*,^+a^!)^$r^-u^\"b",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXitCXi10XipGXipBXidsXiNmXiFAXip7XiZXXiY/XikhXiE4XihIXiosXithXiEpXiRyXi11XiJi",
      "byte_length": 60
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0453ba3fe1f2",
      "text": "逃跑後，他們就開始給我偷懶！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(p^(_^#b^*A^!@^*{^*J^)F^+k^'A^$%^/O^9Y^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XihwXihfXiNiXipBXiFAXip7XipKXilGXitrXidBXiQlXi9PXjlZXipX",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e9e56ad1775c",
      "text": "阿蘭特轉向附近一個無所事事的衛兵，並撿起一塊",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)M^/G^&5^(i^+?^.?^(l^!%^!V^%}^$)^*r^*r^&Z^(=^+,^*A^!+^=9^.(^!%^/Z",
      "encoded_base64": "XilNXi9HXiY1XihpXis/Xi4/XihsXiElXiFWXiV9XiQpXipyXipyXiZaXig9XissXipBXiErXj05Xi4oXiElXi9a",
      "byte_length": 66
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ce7f8d85d651",
      "text": "相當大的石頭。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&a^&N^\"z^&Z^&k^)t^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZhXiZOXiJ6XiZaXiZrXil0XiEi",
      "byte_length": 21
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_57d104c407f3",
      "text": "嘿！你這偷懶的爛泥！動起來！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+\\^*W^*F^(s^/O^9Y^&Z^&-^%d^*W^\"%^.(^!O^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XitcXipXXipGXihzXi9PXjlZXiZaXiYtXiVkXipXXiIlXi4oXiFPXipX",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6a0584d27f38",
      "text": "阿蘭特將石頭砸向衛兵，擊中了他的頭！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)M^/G^&5^#7^&k^)t^0#^+?^(=^+,^*A^$F^!,^*D^!@^&Z^)t^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XilNXi9HXiY1XiM3XiZrXil0XjAjXis/Xig9XissXipBXiRGXiEsXipEXiFAXiZaXil0XipX",
      "byte_length": 54
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3e5e2951e870",
      "text": "好了，現在他真的不省人事了！他昏過去了！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+i^*D^*A^&?^\"d^!@^-2^&Z^!)^9%^!<^*r^*D^*W^!@^$d^(x^\"6^*D^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XitpXipEXipBXiY/XiJkXiFAXi0yXiZaXiEpXjklXiE8XipyXipEXipXXiFAXiRkXih4XiI2XipEXipX",
      "byte_length": 60
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_064dfb9ca0ad",
      "text": "活該！我付錢給你們是為了什麼？！不是為了讓你們閒坐著！給我",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%i^(M^*W^$%^*u^.<^'A^*F^*{^,X^%{^*D^!=^.T^.V^*W^!)^,X^%{^*D^-}^*F^*{^6A^8E^-a^*W^'A^$%",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVpXihNXipXXiQlXip1Xi48XidBXipGXip7XixYXiV7XipEXiE9Xi5UXi5WXipXXiEpXixYXiV7XipEXi19XipGXip7XjZBXjhFXi1hXipXXidBXiQl",
      "byte_length": 87
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c8938932e891",
      "text": "回去站崗！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"\\^\"6^->^#F^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJcXiI2Xi0+XiNGXipX",
      "byte_length": 15
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1c66f6e384b6",
      "text": "咳咳。我們剛才說到哪了？噢，對了！你是來談生意的嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^:t^:t^!\"^$%^*{^+0^$,^-x^!u^+I^*D^.V^+]^*A^#:^*D^*W^*F^,X^!O^0;^&F^#z^&Z^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "Xjp0Xjp0XiEiXiQlXip7XiswXiQsXi14XiF1XitJXipEXi5WXitdXipBXiM6XipEXipXXipGXixYXiFPXjA7XiZGXiN6XiZaXitYXi5W",
      "byte_length": 78
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2851d53510fc",
      "text": "阿蘭特和他的手下離開了該區域。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)M^/G^&5^\"O^!@^&Z^$+^!(^)`^)F^*D^(M^\"+^\"k^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XilNXi9HXiY1XiJPXiFAXiZaXiQrXiEoXilgXilGXipEXihNXiIrXiJrXiEi",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_37d03f906a29",
      "text": "噢……我的頭！發生什麼事了？嘿！大家都去哪了！大夥們？阿蘭特？！嘿！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+]^*o^*o^$%^&Z^)t^*W^&W^&F^!=^.T^*r^*D^.V^+\\^*W^\"z^+s^)$^\"6^+I^*D^*W^\"z^5?^*{^.V^)M^/G^&5^.V^*W^+\\^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XitdXipvXipvXiQlXiZaXil0XipXXiZXXiZGXiE9Xi5UXipyXipEXi5WXitcXipXXiJ6XitzXikkXiI2XitJXipEXipXXiJ6XjU/Xip7Xi5WXilNXi9HXiY1Xi5WXipXXitcXipX",
      "byte_length": 102
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d648854e5ed2",
      "text": "法杖等待你的命令。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%b^${^'-^,*^*F^&Z^\"N^*w^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiViXiR7XictXiwqXipGXiZaXiJOXip3XiEi",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f0bbfa6ca878",
      "text": "你尋找什麼種類的金屬？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^#9^$/^!=^.T^'$^)w^&Z^)+^#C^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiM5XiQvXiE9Xi5UXickXil3XiZaXikrXiNDXi5W",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5c7663f7a9ec",
      "text": "任何",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!C^!L",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFDXiFM",
      "byte_length": 6
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_966d4899976d",
      "text": "黃金",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*7^)+",
      "encoded_base64": "Xio3Xikr",
      "byte_length": 6
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_703249c93b6f",
      "text": "白銀",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&X^)0",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZYXikw",
      "byte_length": 6
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ec2739b22f5b",
      "text": "鋼鐵",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)2^)?",
      "encoded_base64": "XikyXik/",
      "byte_length": 6
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_75a3b9d497a3",
      "text": "銅",
      "encoded_ascii": "^0x",
      "encoded_base64": "XjB4",
      "byte_length": 3
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_088c9815d46c",
      "text": "法杖發出明亮的光芒",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%b^${^&W^!q^$c^*t^&Z^!c^'u",
      "encoded_base64": "XiViXiR7XiZXXiFxXiRjXip0XiZaXiFjXid1",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4ec92c62fd22",
      "text": "法杖沒有啟動。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%b^${^%\\^$s^57^\"%^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiViXiR7XiVcXiRzXjU3XiIlXiEi",
      "byte_length": 21
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4d16e11733d4",
      "text": "，但沒有指向任何特定的東西。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*A^!I^%\\^$s^$8^+?^!C^!L^&5^#.^&Z^,`^-l^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipBXiFJXiVcXiRzXiQ4Xis/XiFDXiFMXiY1XiMuXiZaXixgXi1sXiEi",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6a2a1d4150a1",
      "text": "什麼都沒有",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!=^.T^)$^%\\^$s",
      "encoded_base64": "XiE9Xi5UXikkXiVcXiRz",
      "byte_length": 15
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_257eb963c481",
      "text": "並指向你腳下的一個物體。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!+^$8^+?^*F^00^!(^&Z^!%^!V^&4^**^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiErXiQ4Xis/XipGXjAwXiEoXiZaXiElXiFWXiY0XioqXiEi",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c74ca57ea7e0",
      "text": "，指向",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*A^$8^+?",
      "encoded_base64": "XipBXiQ4Xis/",
      "byte_length": 9
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_817de663e883",
      "text": "並指向",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!+^$8^+?",
      "encoded_base64": "XiErXiQ4Xis/",
      "byte_length": 9
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c4f3b5a9f35e",
      "text": "的項圈。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&Z^)q^\"_^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZaXilxXiJfXiEi",
      "byte_length": 12
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_588e880470d4",
      "text": "的項鍊。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&Z^)q^)6^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZaXilxXik2XiEi",
      "byte_length": 12
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7c7610ecf967",
      "text": "什麼也沒找到。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!=^.T^!1^%\\^$/^!u^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiE9Xi5UXiExXiVcXiQvXiF1XiEi",
      "byte_length": 21
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9f7d59a7b73e",
      "text": "手鐲和一顆寶石。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$+^98^\"O^!%^)u^#4^&k^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQrXjk4XiJPXiElXil1XiM0XiZrXiEi",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8aece9831474",
      "text": "魔法水果和一根羽毛。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*0^%b^%V^%!^\"O^!%^%)^'S^%R^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiowXiViXiVWXiUhXiJPXiElXiUpXidTXiVSXiEi",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c394253d8273",
      "text": "幾顆寶石。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#T^)u^#4^&k^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNUXil1XiM0XiZrXiEi",
      "byte_length": 15
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1f6726266ca1",
      "text": "一袋硬幣和一條皮帶。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!%^(?^25^+|^\"O^!%^%.^&[^#N^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiElXig/XjI1Xit8XiJPXiElXiUuXiZbXiNOXiEi",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d1c87d2efd83",
      "text": "一顆寶石和一個魔法水果。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!%^)u^#4^&k^\"O^!%^!V^*0^%b^%V^%!^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiElXil1XiM0XiZrXiJPXiElXiFWXiowXiViXiVWXiUhXiEi",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0ced42141c48",
      "text": "你的回答就足夠了。我現在離開，但別懷疑我還會再回來的。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^&Z^\"\\^-B^*J^(^^+d^*D^!\"^$%^&?^\"d^)`^)F^*A^!I^*H^,9^0p^$%^.7^$r^!l^\"\\^!O^&Z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiZaXiJcXi1CXipKXiheXitkXipEXiEiXiQlXiY/XiJkXilgXilGXipBXiFJXipIXiw5XjBwXiQlXi43XiRyXiFsXiJcXiFPXiZaXiEi",
      "byte_length": 81
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2c51be4faf80",
      "text": "現在進去，別耽擱。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&?^\"d^(w^\"6^*A^*H^-T^,O^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiY/XiJkXih3XiI2XipBXipIXi1UXixPXiEi",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_39f1e27b7c0d",
      "text": "我們警告過你了！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^(S^+B^(x^*F^*D^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7XihTXitCXih4XipGXipEXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e31ba3b1f9e4",
      "text": "早就叫你離開了！受死吧！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,V^*J^+<^*F^)`^)F^*D^*W^\";^%L^*I^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XixWXipKXis8XipGXilgXilGXipEXipXXiI7XiVMXipJXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 37
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7475bcf066ba",
      "text": "站住！此地不准任何人進入！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^->^*z^*W^%I^\"e^!)^/Q^!C^!L^!<^(w^!f^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi0+Xip6XipXXiVJXiJlXiEpXi9RXiFDXiFMXiE8Xih3XiFmXipX",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bbad7be653a8",
      "text": "  我是奉命前來此處的。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^,X^1+^\"N^!z^!O^%I^(,^&Z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeLFheMSteIk5eIXpeIU9eJUleKCxeJlpeISI=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6c3ece64d6ca",
      "text": "  你們的首領叫我們進去的。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^*{^&Z^)~^)s^+<^$%^*{^(w^\"6^&Z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeKnteJlpeKX5eKXNeKzxeJCVeKnteKHdeIjZeJlpeISI=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8b0698ac7169",
      "text": "  讓開，放我過去！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^-}^)F^*A^$P^$%^(x^\"6^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLX1eKUZeKkFeJFBeJCVeKHheIjZeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_07ab3e62c1d9",
      "text": "  立刻讓我進去！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^0'^.Y^-}^$%^(w^\"6^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeMCdeLlleLX1eJCVeKHdeIjZeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 23
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b681d28e78da",
      "text": "  那是機密。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^)!^,X^%>^#0^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKSFeLFheJT5eIzBeISI=",
      "byte_length": 17
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d3cdf090a5b0",
      "text": "  膽敢阻攔我，你們會受罰的！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^-[^/m^)L^9n^$%^*A^*F^*{^$r^\";^0-^&Z^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLVteL21eKUxeOW5eJCVeKkFeKkZeKnteJHJeIjteMC1eJlpeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_350026e6283a",
      "text": "  需要我去站崗值勤。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^)e^(C^$%^\"6^->^#F^!Z^2Z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKWVeKENeJCVeIjZeLT5eI0ZeIVpeMlpeISI=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d0ce09ffd699",
      "text": "  我這就離開。再會。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^(s^*J^)`^)F^!\"^!l^$r^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeKHNeKkpeKWBeKUZeISJeIWxeJHJeISI=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9766616604ed",
      "text": "奉誰的命令？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^1+^-y^&Z^\"N^*w^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XjErXi15XiZaXiJOXip3Xi5W",
      "byte_length": 18
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_47fa5f1c7f83",
      "text": "誰都不准進入這裡！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-y^)$^!)^/Q^(w^!f^(s^-j^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi15XikkXiEpXi9RXih3XiFmXihzXi1qXipX",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9caf36855d14",
      "text": "別再回來！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*H^!l^\"\\^!O^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XipIXiFsXiJcXiFPXipX",
      "byte_length": 15
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3b7f061c0b06",
      "text": "為何召見你？我們的首領從不隨便叫人來這裡。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%{^!L^\"@^-m^*F^.V^$%^*{^&Z^)~^)s^#f^!)^)X^!R^+<^!<^!O^(s^-j^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiV7XiFMXiJAXi1tXipGXi5WXiQlXip7XiZaXil+XilzXiNmXiEpXilYXiFSXis8XiE8XiFPXihzXi1qXiEi",
      "byte_length": 63
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e300b358cfee",
      "text": "你休想進去！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^!G^,1^(w^\"6^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiFHXiwxXih3XiI2XipX",
      "byte_length": 18
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_56f9e33b2d38",
      "text": "除非你說明來意，否則不得通行。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)Q^)i^*F^-x^$c^!O^#z^*A^\"H^!x^!)^#e^(t^(;^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XilRXilpXipGXi14XiRjXiFPXiN6XipBXiJIXiF4XiEpXiNlXih0Xig7XiEi",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3b4fc2388b02",
      "text": "好吧，你可以進去。直接前往東部坑道。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+i^*I^*A^*F^\"A^!B^(w^\"6^!\"^&`^$?^!z^,)^,`^)#^5>^(y^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitpXipJXipBXipGXiJBXiFCXih3XiI2XiEiXiZgXiQ/XiF6XiwpXixgXikjXjU+Xih5XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1da2f779400d",
      "text": "我們不相信你！退後，離這裡遠點！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^!)^&a^!U^*F^*W^*V^#b^*A^)`^(s^-j^({^*;^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7XiEpXiZhXiFVXipGXipXXipWXiNiXipBXilgXihzXi1qXih7Xio7XipX",
      "byte_length": 48
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8fac9a6004aa",
      "text": "他們不需要守衛！如果你們還想要命，就立刻離開！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^*{^!)^)e^(C^#+^(=^*W^#$^%!^*F^*{^.7^,1^(C^\"N^*A^*J^0'^.Y^)`^)F^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXip7XiEpXillXihDXiMrXig9XipXXiMkXiUhXipGXip7Xi43XiwxXihDXiJOXipBXipKXjAnXi5ZXilgXilGXipX",
      "byte_length": 69
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2ffabb802c50",
      "text": "要麼把角鬥士帶來，要麼給我滾出去！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(C^.T^$1^(H^*,^+a^#N^!O^*A^(C^.T^'A^$%^,z^!q^\"6^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XihDXi5UXiQxXihIXiosXithXiNOXiFPXipBXihDXi5UXidBXiQlXix6XiFxXiI2XipX",
      "byte_length": 51
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e59bd48920b0",
      "text": "角鬥士在哪裡？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(H^*,^+a^\"d^+I^-j^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XihIXiosXithXiJkXitJXi1qXi5W",
      "byte_length": 21
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_20ada7d55beb",
      "text": "  什麼角鬥士？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^!=^.T^(H^*,^+a^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIT1eLlReKEheKixeK2FeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 20
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e77a1b7513c5",
      "text": "  角鬥士都不在了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^(H^*,^+a^)$^!)^\"d^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKEheKixeK2FeKSReISleImReKkReISI=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_116c44dd172c",
      "text": "  你以為我是誰啊？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^!B^%{^$%^,X^-y^+Q^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeIUJeJXteJCVeLFheLXleK1FeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_936f12da9318",
      "text": "  阿蘭特來不了了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^)M^/G^&5^!O^!)^*D^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKU1eL0deJjVeIU9eISleKkReKkReISI=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e7135d3cb2a6",
      "text": "  誰是阿蘭特？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^-y^,X^)M^/G^&5^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLXleLFheKU1eL0deJjVeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 20
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fc7b7fdc7f74",
      "text": "  我要去哪裡找這些角鬥士？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^(C^\"6^+I^-j^$/^(s^!8^(H^*,^+a^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeKENeIjZeK0leLWpeJC9eKHNeITheKEheKixeK2FeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7e57ef9904de",
      "text": "  我只想找到阿蘭特。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^\"?^,1^$/^!u^)M^/G^&5^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeIj9eLDFeJC9eIXVeKU1eL0deJjVeISI=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_af29264d00e4",
      "text": "  你為什麼想要角鬥士？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^%{^!=^.T^,1^(C^(H^*,^+a^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeJXteIT1eLlReLDFeKENeKEheKixeK2FeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_53e93197fd51",
      "text": "  是哪家商會僱用你的？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^,X^+I^+s^1'^$r^=?^&H^*F^&Z^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLFheK0leK3NeMSdeJHJePT9eJkheKkZeJlpeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_702efa1ef60b",
      "text": "  我從阿蘭特手裡把角鬥士買下來了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^#f^)M^/G^&5^$+^-j^$1^(H^*,^+a^.!^!(^!O^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeI2ZeKU1eL0deJjVeJCteLWpeJDFeKEheKixeK2FeLiFeISheIU9eKkReISI=",
      "byte_length": 50
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fdec04e23b17",
      "text": "  你可以帶走那些角鬥士。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^\"A^!B^#N^.&^)!^!8^(H^*,^+a^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeIkFeIUJeI05eLiZeKSFeITheKEheKixeK2FeISI=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d34c17ecce86",
      "text": "  什麼雕像碎片？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^!=^.T^)^^!`^&o^&1^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIT1eLlReKV5eIWBeJm9eJjFeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 23
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cef0a0c159c3",
      "text": "  這個法師是誰？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^(s^!V^%b^#M^,X^-y^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKHNeIVZeJWJeI01eLFheLXleLlY=",
      "byte_length": 23
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f00cc700c6ba",
      "text": "  你說的法師是威米亞斯嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^-x^&Z^%b^#M^,X^#&^'4^!9^$[^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeLXheJlpeJWJeI01eLFheIyZeJzReITleJFteK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cd6447ecae55",
      "text": "  我想買下那塊雕像碎片。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^,1^.!^!(^)!^/Z^)^^!`^&o^&1^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeLDFeLiFeISheKSFeL1peKV5eIWBeJm9eJjFeISI=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2826cb53c061",
      "text": " 我們還有很多事要準備。再會。",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^$%^*{^.7^$s^*K^\"x^*r^(C^,x^+\"^!\"^!l^$r^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4kJV4qe14uN14kc14qS14ieF4qcl4oQ14seF4rIl4hIl4hbF4kcl4hIg==",
      "byte_length": 43
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_62306100198b",
      "text": "不在了？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^\"d^*D^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXiJkXipEXi5W",
      "byte_length": 12
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ec1ed5b935d7",
      "text": "既然如此，你想不想買下我們本來打算 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,U^&\"^#$^%I^*A^*F^,1^!)^,1^.!^!(^$%^*{^$x^!O^$-^-C ",
      "encoded_base64": "XixVXiYiXiMkXiVJXipBXipGXiwxXiEpXiwxXi4hXiEoXiQlXip7XiR4XiFPXiQtXi1DIA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b561a6629dac",
      "text": "給阿蘭特的雕像碎片？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'A^)M^/G^&5^&Z^)^^!`^&o^&1^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XidBXilNXi9HXiY1XiZaXileXiFgXiZvXiYxXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 31
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6b33ddd2cd3f",
      "text": "我特地來這裡要買的角鬥士！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^&5^\"e^!O^(s^-j^(C^.!^&Z^(H^*,^+a^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiY1XiJlXiFPXihzXi1qXihDXi4hXiZaXihIXiosXithXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 40
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6aaf5261cea6",
      "text": "阿蘭特",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)M^/G^&5",
      "encoded_base64": "XilNXi9HXiY1",
      "byte_length": 9
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0e593fa4760a",
      "text": "你不是阿蘭特的人嗎？他",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^!)^,X^)M^/G^&5^&Z^!<^+X^.V^!@",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiEpXixYXilNXi9HXiY1XiZaXiE8XitYXi5WXiFA",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_38707403de47",
      "text": "那我就跟你做交易。我們本來打算用一塊 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^$%^*J^.+^*F^*~^0P^,W^!\"^$%^*{^$x^!O^$-^-C^&H^!%^/Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXiQlXipKXi4rXipGXip+XjBQXixXXiEiXiQlXip7XiR4XiFPXiQtXi1DXiZIXiElXi9aIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7410b70a806c",
      "text": "珍貴的雕像碎片付給阿蘭特。只要你給我帶來十二名角鬥士，我就把碎片連同5,000陶幣 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^/7^2F^&Z^)^^!`^&o^&1^*u^'A^)M^/G^&5^!\"^\"?^(C^*F^'A^$%^#N^!O^*Y^!5^\"F^(H^*,^+a^*A^$%^*J^$1^&o^&1^.0^\"E5,000^)R^+| ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi83XjJGXiZaXileXiFgXiZvXiYxXip1XidBXilNXi9HXiY1XiEiXiI/XihDXipGXidBXiQlXiNOXiFPXipZXiE1XiJGXihIXiosXithXipBXiQlXipKXiQxXiZvXiYxXi4wXiJFNSwwMDBeKVJeK3wg",
      "byte_length": 114
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5eb4842ee659",
      "text": "一起交給你。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!%^.(^0P^'A^*F^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiElXi4oXjBQXidBXipGXiEi",
      "byte_length": 18
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a625a6b9435b",
      "text": "把角鬥士帶給我們，你就能拿到雕像碎片。在親眼見到貨物之前， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$1^(H^*,^+a^#N^'A^$%^*{^*A^*F^*J^'b^,G^!u^)^^!`^&o^&1^!\"^\"d^(F^&d^-m^!u^.w^&4^!/^!z^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQxXihIXiosXithXiNOXidBXiQlXip7XipBXipGXipKXidiXixHXiF1XileXiFgXiZvXiYxXiEiXiJkXihGXiZkXi1tXiF1Xi53XiY0XiEvXiF6XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0baa67da8497",
      "text": "我可不會相信你。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^\"A^!)^$r^&a^!U^*F^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiJBXiEpXiRyXiZhXiFVXipGXiEi",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c027a32dcfce",
      "text": "你問題很多，也許太多了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*Z^.G^*K^\"x^*A^!1^-s^+f^\"x^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXipaXi5HXipLXiJ4XipBXiExXi1zXitmXiJ4XipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b8cec81f736c",
      "text": "阿蘭特的營地在蓋德隆以北。你得穿過城鎮才能抵達那裡， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)M^/G^&5^&Z^&'^\"e^\"d^-d^#j^)T^!B^+6^!\"^*F^#e^')^(x^+_^);^$,^'b^$5^(z^)!^-j^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XilNXi9HXiY1XiZaXiYnXiJlXiJkXi1kXiNqXilUXiFCXis2XiEiXipGXiNlXicpXih4XitfXik7XiQsXidiXiQ1Xih6XikhXi1qXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5c9f51bf1730",
      "text": "所以自己小心點。那可不是什麼好地方。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$)^!B^'l^#I^#;^#k^*;^!\"^)!^\"A^!)^,X^!=^.T^+i^\"e^$]^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQpXiFCXidsXiNJXiM7XiNrXio7XiEiXikhXiJBXiEpXixYXiE9Xi5UXitpXiJlXiRdXiEi",
      "byte_length": 54
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_65aa33d29d88",
      "text": "我可不會去深究法師的心思。他們是群古怪的傢伙，往往很討厭 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^\"A^!)^$r^\"6^2*^-<^%b^#M^&Z^#k^#q^!\"^!@^*{^,X^'R^\"=^#s^&Z^+#^*y^*A^,)^,)^*K^-o^+9 ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiJBXiEpXiRyXiI2XjIqXi08XiViXiNNXiZaXiNrXiNxXiEiXiFAXip7XixYXidSXiI9XiNzXiZaXisjXip5XipBXiwpXiwpXipLXi1vXis5IA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_49b3e49d2231",
      "text": "別人多管閒事。我只知道西邊有個法師 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*H^!<^\"x^-D^6A^*r^!\"^$%^\"?^&h^(y^-l^.8^$s^!V^%b^#M ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipIXiE8XiJ4Xi1EXjZBXipyXiEiXiQlXiI/XiZoXih5Xi1sXi44XiRzXiFWXiViXiNNIA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3fc544308096",
      "text": "為它開了高價。這是用來折抵角鬥士的部分貨款。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%{^+o^)F^*D^*+^+&^!\"^(s^,X^&H^!O^,?^$5^(H^*,^+a^&Z^)#^!s^.w^7{^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiV7XitvXilGXipEXiorXismXiEiXihzXixYXiZIXiFPXiw/XiQ1XihIXiosXithXiZaXikjXiFzXi53Xjd7XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_15ba66506191",
      "text": "名字叫威米亞斯。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"F^#)^+<^#&^'4^!9^$[^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJGXiMpXis8XiMmXic0XiE5XiRbXiEi",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6c93b7bcf73c",
      "text": "沒錯，就是他。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%\\^)5^*A^*J^,X^!@^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVcXik1XipBXipKXixYXiFAXiEi",
      "byte_length": 21
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c33ade52d118",
      "text": "為了利潤。一間人類商會僱用我們尋找角鬥士，這就是 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%{^*D^!t^7_^!\"^!%^)G^!<^)w^1'^$r^=?^&H^$%^*{^#9^$/^(H^*,^+a^*A^(s^*J^,X ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiV7XipEXiF0XjdfXiEiXiElXilHXiE8Xil3XjEnXiRyXj0/XiZIXiQlXip7XiM5XiQvXihIXiosXithXipBXihzXipKXixYIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_abde21f305ee",
      "text": "我們在幹的事。我們本來跟阿蘭特談了筆好買賣，用錢和雕像 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^\"d^,!^&Z^*r^!\"^$%^*{^$x^!O^.+^)M^/G^&5^0;^*D^-A^+i^.!^.$^*A^&H^.<^\"O^)^^!` ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7XiJkXiwhXiZaXipyXiEiXiQlXip7XiR4XiFPXi4rXilNXi9HXiY1XjA7XipEXi1BXitpXi4hXi4kXipBXiZIXi48XiJPXileXiFgIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f571593d912b",
      "text": "碎片換取角鬥士。我們可沒辦法再等太久了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&o^&1^4@^\":^(H^*,^+a^!\"^$%^*{^\"A^%\\^2L^%b^!l^'-^+f^!.^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZvXiYxXjRAXiI6XihIXiosXithXiEiXiQlXip7XiJBXiVcXjJMXiViXiFsXictXitmXiEuXipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 60
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d6b1dbb26d34",
      "text": "問這種問題沒什麼好處，有時候可是會要命的。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*Z^(s^'$^*Z^.G^%\\^!=^.T^+i^(,^*A^$s^$f^*|^\"A^,X^$r^(C^\"N^&Z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipaXihzXickXipaXi5HXiVcXiE9Xi5UXitpXigsXipBXiRzXiRmXip8XiJBXixYXiRyXihDXiJOXiZaXiEi",
      "byte_length": 63
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f3806c8bda5a",
      "text": "這塊雕像碎片本來是用來折抵角鬥士的部分貨款的。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^/Z^)^^!`^&o^&1^$x^!O^,X^&H^!O^,?^$5^(H^*,^+a^&Z^)#^!s^.w^7{^&Z^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXi9aXileXiFgXiZvXiYxXiR4XiFPXixYXiZIXiFPXiw/XiQ1XihIXiosXithXiZaXikjXiFzXi53Xjd7XiZaXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_02bae577cbca",
      "text": "珍貴的雕像碎片……但要是阿蘭特待會兒現身，他拿到錢也一樣 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^/7^2F^&Z^)^^!`^&o^&1^*o^*o^!I^(C^,X^)M^/G^&5^,*^$r^++^&?^(c^*A^!@^,G^!u^.<^!1^!%^,f ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi83XjJGXiZaXileXiFgXiZvXiYxXipvXipvXiFJXihDXixYXilNXi9HXiY1XiwqXiRyXisrXiY/XihjXipBXiFAXixHXiF1Xi48XiExXiElXixmIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0ab4fad75570",
      "text": "會很開心的。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$r^*K^)F^#k^&Z^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRyXipLXilGXiNrXiZaXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 19
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fb55f3d53a43",
      "text": "兩萬五千枚陶幣，它就是你的了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!i^-_^!6^+7^$~^)R^+|^*A^+o^*J^,X^*F^&Z^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFpXi1fXiE2Xis3XiR+XilSXit8XipBXitvXipKXixYXipGXiZaXipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0da2117bbe42",
      "text": "  一塊破石頭要兩萬五千！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^!%^/Z^&n^&k^)t^(C^!i^-_^!6^+7^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeISVeL1peJm5eJmteKXReKENeIWleLV9eITZeKzdeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ea257246b641",
      "text": "  我只有1,000。這樣夠嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^\"?^$s1,000^!\"^(s^,f^+d^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeIj9eJHMxLDAwMF4hIl4oc14sZl4rZF4rWF4uVg==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_da99cdeacdaf",
      "text": "  我出15,000跟你買。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^!q15,000^.+^*F^.!^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeIXExNSwwMDBeLiteKkZeLiFeISI=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_65bf71c4f691",
      "text": "  聽起來很公道。成交！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^-X^.(^!O^*K^3:^(y^!\"^$$^0P^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLVheLiheIU9eKkteMzpeKHleISJeJCReMFBeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4d006bc3949a",
      "text": "  我也沒那麼想要那塊雕像碎片。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^!1^%\\^)!^.T^,1^(C^)!^/Z^)^^!`^&o^&1^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeITFeJVxeKSFeLlReLDFeKENeKSFeL1peKV5eIWBeJm9eJjFeISI=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b38f38163173",
      "text": " 那筆錢八成比你身上的全部財產還多。",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^)!^-A^.<^50^$$^,m^*F^(c^!'^&Z^!h^)#^0=^&G^.7^\"x^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4pIV4tQV4uPF41MF4kJF4sbV4qRl4oY14hJ14mWl4haF4pI14wPV4mR14uN14ieF4hIg==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cee97373ab6a",
      "text": "想做買賣就再回來。保證是好交易。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,1^*~^.!^.$^*J^!l^\"\\^!O^!\"^!T^-{^,X^+i^0P^,W^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiwxXip+Xi4hXi4kXipKXiFsXiJcXiFPXiEiXiFUXi17XixYXitpXjBQXixXXiEi",
      "byte_length": 48
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9024259b7833",
      "text": " 本該帶著要賣的角鬥士在這裡跟我們碰頭的。",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^$x^(M^#N^-a^(C^.$^&Z^(H^*,^+a^\"d^(s^-j^.+^$%^*{^-5^)t^&Z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4keF4oTV4jTl4tYV4oQ14uJF4mWl4oSF4qLF4rYV4iZF4oc14tal4uK14kJV4qe14tNV4pdF4mWl4hIg==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_54d8d5f46cfa",
      "text": " 我才不跟他打交道。跟那法師扯上關係對身體有害。",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^$%^$,^!)^.+^!@^$-^0P^(y^!\"^.+^)!^%b^#M^.e^!'^.>^38^#:^(c^**^$s^#/^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4kJV4kLF4hKV4uK14hQF4kLV4wUF4oeV4hIl4uK14pIV4lYl4jTV4uZV4hJ14uPl4zOF4jOl4oY14qKl4kc14jL14hIg==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_078439c0f542",
      "text": "我把它賣給蓋德隆的法師還能賺更多。我賣你這個便宜價， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^$1^+o^.$^'A^-d^#j^)T^&Z^%b^#M^.7^'b^7m^$o^\"x^!\"^$%^.$^*F^(s^!V^!R^/[^+&^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiQxXitvXi4kXidBXi1kXiNqXilUXiZaXiViXiNNXi43XidiXjdtXiRvXiJ4XiEiXiQlXi4kXipGXihzXiFWXiFSXi9bXismXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5f41346c57c7",
      "text": "只是為了省去親自跑一趟的麻煩罷了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"?^,X^%{^*D^9%^\"6^(F^'l^(_^!%^8)^&Z^*6^-!^1Q^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiI/XixYXiV7XipEXjklXiI2XihGXidsXihfXiElXjgpXiZaXio2Xi0hXjFRXipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 51
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_26e8da54a4df",
      "text": "哈！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+F^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XitGXipX",
      "byte_length": 6
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0a43a73592a1",
      "text": " 我會在這裡等著。",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^$%^$r^\"d^(s^-j^'-^-a^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4kJV4kcl4iZF4oc14tal4nLV4tYV4hIg==",
      "byte_length": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cc689bf3a1cc",
      "text": "我話一出口就後悔了，但我可以勉強接受區區18,000枚 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^-v^!%^!q^\"<^*J^#b^6Y^*D^*A^!I^$%^\"A^!B^9>^#]^$?^\";^\"+^\"+18,000^$~ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXi12XiElXiFxXiI8XipKXiNiXjZZXipEXipBXiFJXiQlXiJBXiFCXjk+XiNdXiQ/XiI7XiIrXiIrMTgsMDAwXiR+IA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e7f598fa330b",
      "text": "陶幣。非常便宜！開價夠大方了吧！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)R^+|^!\"^)i^#O^!R^/[^*W^)F^+&^+d^\"z^$]^*D^*I^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XilSXit8XiEiXilpXiNPXiFSXi9bXipXXilGXismXitkXiJ6XiRdXipEXipJXipX",
      "byte_length": 48
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2b852892f128",
      "text": "這是雕像碎片，但我們還是想要角鬥士。把他們 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^,X^)^^!`^&o^&1^*A^!I^$%^*{^.7^,X^,1^(C^(H^*,^+a^!\"^$1^!@^*{ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXixYXileXiFgXiZvXiYxXipBXiFJXiQlXip7Xi43XixYXiwxXihDXihIXiosXithXiEiXiQxXiFAXip7IA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d44590080e8d",
      "text": "帶過來，我們會付錢給你！更多更多的錢！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#N^(x^!O^*A^$%^*{^$r^*u^.<^'A^*F^*W^$o^\"x^$o^\"x^&Z^.<^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNOXih4XiFPXipBXiQlXip7XiRyXip1Xi48XidBXipGXipXXiRvXiJ4XiRvXiJ4XiZaXi48XipX",
      "byte_length": 57
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1f21f17325e6",
      "text": "你身上根本沒那麼多錢！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^(c^!'^%)^$x^%\\^)!^.T^\"x^.<^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXihjXiEnXiUpXiR4XiVcXikhXi5UXiJ4Xi48XipX",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9700266b2d45",
      "text": "你的損失。我還有其他人可以交易。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^&Z^$D^\"|^!\"^$%^.7^$s^!j^!@^!<^\"A^!B^0P^,W^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiZaXiREXiJ8XiEiXiQlXi43XiRzXiFqXiFAXiE8XiJBXiFCXjBQXixXXiEi",
      "byte_length": 48
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6056cd2d1dbb",
      "text": " 要是你想買下雕像碎片，就得去弄更多錢來。",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^(C^,X^*F^,1^.!^!(^)^^!`^&o^&1^*A^*J^#e^\"6^/`^$o^\"x^.<^!O^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4oQ14sWF4qRl4sMV4uIV4hKF4pXl4hYF4mb14mMV4qQV4qSl4jZV4iNl4vYF4kb14ieF4uPF4hT14hIg==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0371c6a52d18",
      "text": "挖掘了一陣子之後，你發現了某樣東西！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^2!^=@^*D^!%^)P^#(^!/^#b^*A^*F^&W^&?^*D^%$^,f^,`^-l^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjIhXj1AXipEXiElXilQXiMoXiEvXiNiXipBXipGXiZXXiY/XipEXiUkXixmXixgXi1sXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0e41e64326ae",
      "text": "你挖了又挖，卻一無所獲。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^2!^*D^+;^2!^*A^1&^!%^%}^$)^&:^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXjIhXipEXis7XjIhXipBXjEmXiElXiV9XiQpXiY6XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 37
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d2e38feb9e01",
      "text": "站住！別再往前！我的力量無窮無盡——你們絕不可能戰勝我！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^->^*z^*W^*H^!l^,)^!z^*W^$%^&Z^!~^)*^%}^-=^%}^-1^*n^*n^*F^*{^-I^!)^\"A^'b^$(^+5^$%^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi0+Xip6XipXXipIXiFsXiwpXiF6XipXXiQlXiZaXiF+XikqXiV9Xi09XiV9Xi0xXipuXipuXipGXip7Xi1JXiEpXiJBXidiXiQoXis1XiQlXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_63a151e77bbb",
      "text": "別再前進，否則你們將被毀滅！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*H^!l^!z^(w^*A^\"H^!x^*F^*{^#7^(@^%N^%t^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipIXiFsXiF6Xih3XipBXiJIXiF4XipGXip7XiM3XihAXiVOXiV0XipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 43
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e64b59aa05d6",
      "text": "任何人都不准進入！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!C^!L^!<^)$^!)^/Q^(w^!f^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFDXiFMXiE8XikkXiEpXi9RXih3XiFmXipX",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_80acf4ee0931",
      "text": "我是蒸氣之泉的德魯伊。感謝萬物之靈，你們總算來了！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^,X^(&^%U^!/^%a^&Z^#j^/K^!E^!\"^#{^-z^-_^&4^!/^)g^*A^*F^*{^-M^-C^!O^*D^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXixYXigmXiVVXiEvXiVhXiZaXiNqXi9LXiFFXiEiXiN7Xi16Xi1fXiY0XiEvXilnXipBXipGXip7Xi1NXi1DXiFPXipEXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8342fdbda742",
      "text": "我需要幫忙趕走一個在我的綠洲紮營的荒蕪術士。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^)e^(C^+}^,+^0u^.&^!%^!V^\"d^$%^&Z^3V^76^8\"^&'^&Z^1W^4b^(<^+a^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXillXihDXit9XiwrXjB1Xi4mXiElXiFWXiJkXiQlXiZaXjNWXjc2XjgiXiYnXiZaXjFXXjRiXig8XithXiEi",
      "byte_length": 66
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9a95a6ef1c8c",
      "text": "你們回來了！快告訴我你們願意幫我！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^\"\\^!O^*D^*W^*L^+B^-t^$%^*F^*{^.H^#z^+}^$%^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiJcXiFPXipEXipXXipMXitCXi10XiQlXipGXip7Xi5IXiN6Xit9XiQlXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4b212e67e376",
      "text": "  我該如何幫忙？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^(M^#$^!L^+}^,+^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeKE1eIyReIUxeK31eLCteLlY=",
      "byte_length": 23
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6d665066ba30",
      "text": "  這是你的綠洲——你自己去解決！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^(s^,X^*F^&Z^3V^76^*n^*n^*F^'l^#I^\"6^(I^,o^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKHNeLFheKkZeJlpeM1ZeNzZeKm5eKm5eKkZeJ2xeI0leIjZeKEleLG9eKlc=",
      "byte_length": 47
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d19bee8e7d5b",
      "text": "  剛才那些由水構成的東西是什麼？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^+0^$,^)!^!8^&I^%V^8~^$$^&Z^,`^-l^,X^!=^.T^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKzBeJCxeKSFeITheJkleJVZeOH5eJCReJlpeLGBeLWxeLFheIT1eLlReLlY=",
      "byte_length": 47
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5893531c9839",
      "text": "  為什麼不用水元素呢？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^%{^!=^.T^!)^&H^%V^!a^'=^+C^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJXteIT1eLlReISleJkheJVZeIWFeJz1eK0NeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bddfdeeb2886",
      "text": "  你為什麼沒辦法趕走他？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^%{^!=^.T^%\\^2L^%b^0u^.&^!@^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeJXteIT1eLlReJVxeMkxeJWJeMHVeLiZeIUBeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8e382fb079bf",
      "text": "  我要你跟我一起去。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^(C^*F^.+^$%^!%^.(^\"6^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeKENeKkZeLiteJCVeISVeLiheIjZeISI=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_733f906bc98f",
      "text": "  等荒蕪術士死了我會回來的。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^'-^1W^4b^(<^+a^%L^*D^$%^$r^\"\\^!O^&Z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJy1eMVdeNGJeKDxeK2FeJUxeKkReJCVeJHJeIlxeIU9eJlpeISI=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f77f066ea414",
      "text": "我沒時間幫忙。抱歉。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^%\\^$f^)G^+}^,+^!\"^,@^,h^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiVcXiRmXilHXit9XiwrXiEiXixAXixoXiEi",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_aba264fe8e06",
      "text": "荒蕪術士和他的手下在綠洲西南側。他只能藉由 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^1W^4b^(<^+a^\"O^!@^&Z^$+^!(^\"d^3V^76^-l^\"/^!\\^!\"^!@^\"?^'b^04^&I ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjFXXjRiXig8XithXiJPXiFAXiZaXiQrXiEoXiJkXjNWXjc2Xi1sXiIvXiFcXiEiXiFAXiI/XidiXjA0XiZJIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_02795f8128a4",
      "text": "汲取綠洲的生命精華來施展黑暗力量！如果不盡快阻止他， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%Y^\":^3V^76^&Z^&F^\"N^'7^3'^!O^$_^+x^*:^$k^!~^)*^*W^#$^%!^!)^-1^*L^)L^%G^!@^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVZXiI6XjNWXjc2XiZaXiZGXiJOXic3XjMnXiFPXiRfXit4Xio6XiRrXiF+XikqXipXXiMkXiUhXiEpXi0xXipMXilMXiVHXiFAXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ebb98a165e6e",
      "text": "我擔心這座綠洲就徹底毀了！你們必須除掉他！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*N^#k^(s^/_^3V^76^*J^18^/^^%N^*D^*W^*F^*{^#l^)r^)Q^/e^!@^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXipOXiNrXihzXi9fXjNWXjc2XipKXjE4Xi9eXiVOXipEXipXXipGXip7XiNsXilyXilRXi9lXiFAXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_98c12145f802",
      "text": "老實說，我是新來的，根本沒有足以擊敗荒蕪術士的力量。要是 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'U^#3^-x^*A^$%^,X^$\\^!O^&Z^*A^%)^$x^%\\^$s^(^^!B^$F^$R^1W^4b^(<^+a^&Z^!~^)*^!\"^(C^,X ",
      "encoded_base64": "XidVXiMzXi14XipBXiQlXixYXiRcXiFPXiZaXipBXiUpXiR4XiVcXiRzXiheXiFCXiRGXiRSXjFXXjRiXig8XithXiZaXiF+XikqXiEiXihDXixYIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_26dbf24ae0ee",
      "text": "他繼續留在那裡，就會吸乾綠洲的生機。只要你們把他趕走， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^-O^'M^-+^\"d^)!^-j^*A^*J^$r^\"J^*X^3V^76^&Z^&F^%>^!\"^\"?^(C^*F^*{^$1^!@^0u^.&^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXi1PXidNXi0rXiJkXikhXi1qXipBXipKXiRyXiJKXipYXjNWXjc2XiZaXiZGXiU+XiEiXiI/XihDXipGXip7XiQxXiFAXjB1Xi4mXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_147f0b956ab0",
      "text": "我就告訴你們一處巨大寶藏的地點。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*J^+B^-t^*F^*{^!%^(,^#H^\"z^#4^-f^&Z^\"e^*;^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXipKXitCXi10XipGXip7XiElXigsXiNIXiJ6XiM0Xi1mXiZaXiJlXio7XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 49
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_015d0be386e9",
      "text": "我也希望自己能辦到，但我沒有足夠的力量對付荒蕪術士和所有 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^!1^+{^,]^'l^#I^'b^2L^!u^*A^!I^$%^%\\^$s^(^^+d^&Z^!~^)*^#:^*u^1W^4b^(<^+a^\"O^$)^$s ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiExXit7XixdXidsXiNJXidiXjJMXiF1XipBXiFJXiQlXiVcXiRzXiheXitkXiZaXiF+XikqXiM6Xip1XjFXXjRiXig8XithXiJPXiQpXiRzIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d1429f9de226",
      "text": "他的手下。我需要像你們這樣的人來幫我！這座綠洲就是我的生命，要是 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^&Z^$+^!(^!\"^$%^)e^(C^!`^*F^*{^(s^,f^&Z^!<^!O^+}^$%^*W^(s^/_^3V^76^*J^,X^$%^&Z^&F^\"N^*A^(C^,X ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXiZaXiQrXiEoXiEiXiQlXillXihDXiFgXipGXip7XihzXixmXiZaXiE8XiFPXit9XiQlXipXXihzXi9fXjNWXjc2XipKXixYXiQlXiZaXiZGXiJOXipBXihDXixYIA==",
      "byte_length": 97
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1fef6f1a6c38",
      "text": "它枯竭死去了……我連想都不敢想。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+o^5Z^29^%L^\"6^*D^*o^*o^$%^.0^,1^)$^!)^/m^,1^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitvXjVaXjI5XiVMXiI2XipEXipvXipvXiQlXi4wXiwxXikkXiEpXi9tXiwxXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 49
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3a5a435e014d",
      "text": "那些？喔，那些是我的水元素。好吧，其實也不算我的，那是 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^!8^.V^+T^*A^)!^!8^,X^$%^&Z^%V^!a^'=^!\"^+i^*I^*A^!j^#3^!1^!)^-C^$%^&Z^*A^)!^,X ",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXiE4Xi5WXitUXipBXikhXiE4XixYXiQlXiZaXiVWXiFhXic9XiEiXitpXipJXipBXiFqXiMzXiExXiEpXi1DXiQlXiZaXipBXikhXixYIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0c26cd528ad8",
      "text": "屬於我前任守護者的。但那些事以後再談！我現在需要你們幫忙 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#C^$^^$%^!z^!C^#+^(T^'V^&Z^!\"^!I^)!^!8^*r^!B^#b^!l^0;^*W^$%^&?^\"d^)e^(C^*F^*{^+}^,+ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNDXiReXiQlXiF6XiFDXiMrXihUXidWXiZaXiEiXiFJXikhXiE4XipyXiFCXiNiXiFsXjA7XipXXiQlXiY/XiJkXillXihDXipGXip7Xit9XiwrIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_662593cdac24",
      "text": "趕走那個荒蕪術士和他的部隊！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^0u^.&^)!^!V^1W^4b^(<^+a^\"O^!@^&Z^)#^)U^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjB1Xi4mXikhXiFWXjFXXjRiXig8XithXiJPXiFAXiZaXikjXilVXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 43
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_674531a04265",
      "text": "誰，我嗎？我根本召喚不出任何水元素。那是我前任留下來的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-y^*A^$%^+X^.V^$%^%)^$x^\"@^\"U^!)^!q^!C^!L^%V^!a^'=^!\"^)!^,X^$%^!z^!C^-+^!(^!O^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi15XipBXiQlXitYXi5WXiQlXiUpXiR4XiJAXiJVXiEpXiFxXiFDXiFMXiVWXiFhXic9XiEiXikhXixYXiQlXiF6XiFDXi0rXiEoXiFPXiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8ec39f4500b5",
      "text": "預備法術。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.E^+\"^%b^(<^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi5FXisiXiViXig8XiEi",
      "byte_length": 15
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_32f7eb2c941a",
      "text": "我最近才接手照管這座綠洲，而且力量還不夠強大， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^$q^(l^$,^$?^$+^/x^-D^(s^/_^3V^76^*A^'W^!*^!~^)*^.7^!)^+d^#]^\"z^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiRxXihsXiQsXiQ/XiQrXi94Xi1EXihzXi9fXjNWXjc2XipBXidXXiEqXiF+XikqXi43XiEpXitkXiNdXiJ6XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cf6477c8fca1",
      "text": "連從小水窪召喚點水都難。那個荒蕪術士瞬間就能把我擊垮。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.0^#f^#;^%V^=A^\"@^\"U^*;^%V^)$^)a^!\"^)!^!V^1W^4b^(<^+a^1N^)G^*J^'b^$1^$%^$F^.^^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi4wXiNmXiM7XiVWXj1BXiJAXiJVXio7XiVWXikkXilhXiEiXikhXiFWXjFXXjRiXig8XithXjFOXilHXipKXidiXiQxXiQlXiRGXi5eXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_96ad8feb9faa",
      "text": "多謝你們！等我實力更強時，一定會回報你們的恩情。等他被除掉後 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"x^-z^*F^*{^*W^'-^$%^#3^!~^$o^#]^$f^*A^!%^#.^$r^\"\\^+`^*F^*{^&Z^#v^,0^!\"^'-^!@^(@^)Q^/e^#b ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJ4Xi16XipGXip7XipXXictXiQlXiMzXiF+XiRvXiNdXiRmXipBXiElXiMuXiRyXiJcXitgXipGXip7XiZaXiN2XiwwXiEiXictXiFAXihAXilRXi9lXiNiIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5edfc536f412",
      "text": "再來找我，我會把一處寶藏的下落告訴你們。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!l^!O^$/^$%^*A^$%^$r^$1^!%^(,^#4^-f^&Z^!(^-`^+B^-t^*F^*{^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFsXiFPXiQvXiQlXipBXiQlXiRyXiQxXiElXigsXiM0Xi1mXiZaXiEoXi1gXitCXi10XipGXip7XiEi",
      "byte_length": 60
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_dc90fc757f9d",
      "text": "好吧，我跟你們一起去。就像我說的，綠洲在西南方。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+i^*I^*A^$%^.+^*F^*{^!%^.(^\"6^!\"^*J^!`^$%^-x^&Z^*A^3V^76^\"d^-l^\"/^$]^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitpXipJXipBXiQlXi4rXipGXip7XiElXi4oXiI2XiEiXipKXiFgXiQlXi14XiZaXipBXjNWXjc2XiJkXi1sXiIvXiRdXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_82c34af271fa",
      "text": "祝你們馬到成功！再會！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&v^*F^*{^*\"^!u^$$^\"!^*W^!l^$r^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZ2XipGXip7XioiXiF1XiQkXiIhXipXXiFsXiRyXipX",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4c750a0a4410",
      "text": "請再考慮一下。如果你們改變心意，我就在這裡。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*S^!l^-R^19^!%^!(^!\"^#$^%!^*F^*{^$N^(U^#k^#z^*A^$%^*J^\"d^(s^-j^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipTXiFsXi1SXjE5XiElXiEoXiEiXiMkXiUhXipGXip7XiROXihVXiNrXiN6XipBXiQlXipKXiJkXihzXi1qXiEi",
      "byte_length": 66
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7b704cf4e560",
      "text": "看來你們已經回來了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*Q^!O^*F^*{^#J^'D^\"\\^!O^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipRXiFPXipGXip7XiNKXidEXiJcXiFPXipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f7b9fe16556e",
      "text": "  我不會去殺那個荒蕪術士。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^!)^$r^\"6^%M^)!^!V^1W^4b^(<^+a^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeISleJHJeIjZeJU1eKSFeIVZeMVdeNGJeKDxeK2FeISI=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1503af187e52",
      "text": "  我會替你殺了他。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^$r^2o^*F^%M^*D^!@^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeJHJeMm9eKkZeJU1eKkReIUBeISI=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1319fc5e5cdc",
      "text": "  除非你跟我一起去幫忙。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^)Q^)i^*F^.+^$%^!%^.(^\"6^+}^,+^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKVFeKWleKkZeLiteJCVeISVeLiheIjZeK31eLCteISI=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_24b23742fae9",
      "text": "  我不會替你殺任何人。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^!)^$r^2o^*F^%M^!C^!L^!<^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeISleJHJeMm9eKkZeJU1eIUNeIUxeITxeISI=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d7239437a45b",
      "text": "請再考慮考慮！要是不把他趕走， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*S^!l^-R^19^-R^19^*W^(C^,X^!)^$1^!@^0u^.&^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipTXiFsXi1SXjE5Xi1SXjE5XipXXihDXixYXiEpXiQxXiFAXjB1Xi4mXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_592b518f3f83",
      "text": "他會把整個地區化為一片荒原廢土的。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^$r^$1^$T^!V^\"e^\"+^\")^%{^!%^&1^1W^\"5^#W^\"c^&Z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXiRyXiQxXiRUXiFWXiJlXiIrXiIpXiV7XiElXiYxXjFXXiI1XiNXXiJjXiZaXiEi",
      "byte_length": 51
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2b04f7773cde",
      "text": "  回去等我的消息。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^\"\\^\"6^'-^$%^&Z^%k^#w^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIlxeIjZeJy1eJCVeJlpeJWteI3deISI=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3492cebdda5f",
      "text": "等你們除掉荒蕪術士和他的人馬，再來找我說話。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'-^*F^*{^)Q^/e^1W^4b^(<^+a^\"O^!@^&Z^!<^*\"^*A^!l^!O^$/^$%^-x^-v^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XictXipGXip7XilRXi9lXjFXXjRiXig8XithXiJPXiFAXiZaXiE8XioiXipBXiFsXiFPXiQvXiQlXi14Xi12XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_969224ac6787",
      "text": "我會告訴你們寶藏在哪裡。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^$r^+B^-t^*F^*{^#4^-f^\"d^+I^-j^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiRyXitCXi10XipGXip7XiM0Xi1mXiJkXitJXi1qXiEi",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1696245f933d",
      "text": "好的。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+i^&Z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XitpXiZaXiEi",
      "byte_length": 9
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_af88ed8969df",
      "text": "感謝你們拯救了這座綠洲！作為回報，我會告訴你們 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#{^-z^*F^*{^,F^,Q^*D^(s^/_^3V^76^*W^!M^%{^\"\\^+`^*A^$%^$r^+B^-t^*F^*{ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiN7Xi16XipGXip7XixGXixRXipEXihzXi9fXjNWXjc2XipXXiFNXiV7XiJcXitgXipBXiQlXiRyXitCXi10XipGXip7IA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fccd622be121",
      "text": "一處巨大寶藏的地點。它就在極東方的彩繪惡地。小心 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!%^(,^#H^\"z^#4^-f^&Z^\"e^*;^!\"^+o^*J^\"d^1D^,`^$]^&Z^#`^0,^#y^\"e^!\"^#;^#k ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiElXigsXiNIXiJ6XiM0Xi1mXiZaXiJlXio7XiEiXitvXipKXiJkXjFEXixgXiRdXiZaXiNgXjAsXiN5XiJlXiEiXiM7XiNrIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9da9134ba24b",
      "text": "生活在那裡的蘇蘭蜥蜴人部落——他們腦子有點瘋癲。寶藏 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&F^%i^\"d^)!^-j^&Z^4c^/G^(2^(3^!<^)#^-`^*n^*n^!@^*{^2@^#(^$s^*;^-/^4Y^!\"^#4^-f ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZGXiVpXiJkXikhXi1qXiZaXjRjXi9HXigyXigzXiE8XikjXi1gXipuXipuXiFAXip7XjJAXiMoXiRzXio7Xi0vXjRZXiEiXiM0Xi1mIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d04d619b1051",
      "text": "就在某處廢墟裡，完全無人看守！祝你們一切順利，我的朋友們。祝 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*J^\"d^%$^(,^#W^\"t^-j^*A^#,^!h^%}^!<^*Q^#+^*W^&v^*F^*{^!%^+.^.D^!t^*A^$%^&Z^,[^\"8^*{^!\"^&v ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipKXiJkXiUkXigsXiNXXiJ0Xi1qXipBXiMsXiFoXiV9XiE8XipRXiMrXipXXiZ2XipGXip7XiElXisuXi5EXiF0XipBXiQlXiZaXixbXiI4Xip7XiEiXiZ2IA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0427a57f7970",
      "text": "好運，再次向你們致謝。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+i^.4^*A^!l^%D^+?^*F^*{^'o^-z^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitpXi40XipBXiFsXiVEXis/XipGXip7XidvXi16XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2d9d5031be55",
      "text": "現在快動身吧，不然——什麼？！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&?^\"d^*L^\"%^(c^*I^*A^!)^&\"^*n^*n^!=^.T^.V^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiY/XiJkXipMXiIlXihjXipJXipBXiEpXiYiXipuXipuXiE9Xi5UXi5WXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_83a901f24c69",
      "text": "朋友們！幫我擊敗這個來自城邦的禍害！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,[^\"8^*{^*W^+}^$%^$F^$R^(s^!V^!O^'l^+_^1a^&Z^7B^#/^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XixbXiI4Xip7XipXXit9XiQlXiRGXiRSXihzXiFWXiFPXidsXitfXjFhXiZaXjdCXiMvXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_000d5b115b04",
      "text": "恭喜！由於肅清了綠洲，你的隊伍獲得了 4,000 點經驗值！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^1{^+V^*W^&I^$^^5y^,u^*D^3V^76^*A^*F^&Z^)U^!F^&:^#e^*D 4,000 ^*;^'D^.P^!Z^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjF7XitWXipXXiZJXiReXjV5Xix1XipEXjNWXjc2XipBXipGXiZaXilVXiFGXiY6XiNlXipEIDQsMDAwIF4qO14nRF4uUF4hWl4qVyA=",
      "byte_length": 77
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_75e23301bd2a",
      "text": "你們就算擊潰了我們的軍隊，德拉吉也絕不會向奴隸屈服！絕不！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^*J^-C^$F^2-^*D^$%^*{^&Z^..^)U^*A^#j^$6^\"D^!1^-I^!)^$r^+?^##^)Z^5K^,\\^*W^-I^!)^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XipKXi1DXiRGXjItXipEXiQlXip7XiZaXi4uXilVXipBXiNqXiQ2XiJEXiExXi1JXiEpXiRyXis/XiMjXilaXjVLXixcXipXXi1JXiEpXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d6573c564f96",
      "text": "很好！你打敗了我的守衛！那就讓我們看看你對上一名德拉吉 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*K^+i^*W^*F^$-^$R^*D^$%^&Z^#+^(=^*W^)!^*J^-}^$%^*{^*Q^*Q^*F^#:^!'^!%^\"F^#j^$6^\"D ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipLXitpXipXXipGXiQtXiRSXipEXiQlXiZaXiMrXig9XipXXikhXipKXi19XiQlXip7XipRXipRXipGXiM6XiEnXiElXiJGXiNqXiQ2XiJEIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_252d2d1b0ad4",
      "text": "聖堂武士能有什麼本事！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'Z^42^%J^+a^'b^$s^!=^.T^$x^*r^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XidaXjQyXiVKXithXidiXiRzXiE9Xi5UXiR4XipyXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5f393151b692",
      "text": "你竟然敢把那個可憐的德魯伊帶到我眼前？！衛兵！殺了這幫 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^28^&\"^/m^$1^)!^!V^\"A^1}^&Z^#j^/K^!E^#N^!u^$%^&d^!z^.V^*W^(=^+,^*W^%M^*D^(s^+} ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXjI4XiYiXi9tXiQxXikhXiFWXiJBXjF9XiZaXiNqXi9LXiFFXiNOXiF1XiQlXiZkXiF6Xi5WXipXXig9XissXipXXiVNXipEXihzXit9IA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f27e01e07736",
      "text": "蠢貨！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.u^.w^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi51Xi53XipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 10
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_21d924a19218",
      "text": "我只是奉命行事。滾開別煩我。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^\"?^,X^1+^\"N^(;^*r^!\"^,z^)F^*H^-!^$%^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiI/XixYXjErXiJOXig7XipyXiEiXix6XilGXipIXi0hXiQlXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 43
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f0c1eb4ea8aa",
      "text": "我是這個營地的指揮官。你們想要什麼？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^,X^(s^!V^&'^\"e^&Z^$8^2\"^#-^!\"^*F^*{^,1^(C^!=^.T^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXixYXihzXiFWXiYnXiJlXiZaXiQ4XjIiXiMtXiEiXipGXip7XiwxXihDXiE9Xi5UXi5W",
      "byte_length": 54
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_661839274ac1",
      "text": "  在你們徹底毀掉這座綠洲之前，給我滾出去！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^\"d^*F^*{^18^/^^%N^/e^(s^/_^3V^76^!/^!z^*A^'A^$%^,z^!q^\"6^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeImReKkZeKnteMTheL15eJU5eL2VeKHNeL19eM1ZeNzZeIS9eIXpeKkFeJ0FeJCVeLHpeIXFeIjZeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 62
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_60e95f68362d",
      "text": "  我想加入你們。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^,1^\"\"^!f^*F^*{^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeLDFeIiJeIWZeKkZeKnteISI=",
      "byte_length": 23
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4c810803661e",
      "text": "  我帶來了來自德拉吉的口信。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^#N^!O^*D^!O^'l^#j^$6^\"D^&Z^\"<^!U^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeI05eIU9eKkReIU9eJ2xeI2peJDZeIkReJlpeIjxeIVVeISIg",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_570dfc38fc14",
      "text": "  塵捲風。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^\"p^0c^)y^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeInBeMGNeKXleISI=",
      "byte_length": 14
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f2af0b37c21c",
      "text": "  達戈拉爾已經死了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^(z^*M^$6^&/^#J^'D^%L^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKHpeKk1eJDZeJi9eI0peJ0ReJUxeKkReISI=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d6bdf58c08ef",
      "text": "  沒錯，口信正是達戈拉爾傳來的。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^%\\^)5^*A^\"<^!U^%H^,X^(z^*M^$6^&/^+$^!O^&Z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJVxeKTVeKkFeIjxeIVVeJUheLFheKHpeKk1eJDZeJi9eKyReIU9eJlpeISI=",
      "byte_length": 47
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bfca5a6a5e5f",
      "text": "  不，口信是德拉卡斯聖堂武士傳來的。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^!)^*A^\"<^!U^,X^#j^$6^\"0^$[^'Z^42^%J^+a^+$^!O^&Z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeISleKkFeIjxeIVVeLFheI2peJDZeIjBeJFteJ1peNDJeJUpeK2FeKyReIU9eJlpeISI=",
      "byte_length": 53
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_029214bbcaf8",
      "text": "  是我宰了達戈拉爾！下一個就輪到你了！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^,X^$%^1w^*D^(z^*M^$6^&/^*W^!(^!%^!V^*J^(h^!u^*F^*D^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLFheJCVeMXdeKkReKHpeKk1eJDZeJi9eKldeISheISVeIVZeKkpeKGheIXVeKkZeKkReKlcg",
      "byte_length": 57
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3ef368209087",
      "text": "  是逃跑的奴隸殺了他。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^,X^(p^(_^&Z^##^)Z^%M^*D^!@^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLFheKHBeKF9eJlpeIyNeKVpeJU1eKkReIUBeISI=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f23a100b0228",
      "text": "  絕不能讓這片土地被毀滅！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^-I^!)^'b^-}^(s^&1^\"c^\"e^(@^%N^%t^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLUleISleJ2JeLX1eKHNeJjFeImNeImVeKEBeJU5eJXReKlc=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c6ad27b6b56d",
      "text": "  你在擔憂些什麼？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^\"d^*N^91^!8^!=^.T^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeImReKk5eOTFeITheIT1eLlReLlY=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_89e980ca4479",
      "text": "  滾出這裡！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^,z^!q^(s^-j^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLHpeIXFeKHNeLWpeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 17
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5b4c272979da",
      "text": "  我是無敵的！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^,X^%}^$U^&Z^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeLFheJX1eJFVeJlpeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 20
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4fbfbd85feac",
      "text": "  手無寸鐵的對手？！真叫我作嘔！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$+^%}^=(^)?^&Z^#:^$+^.V^*W^-2^+<^$%^!M^0T^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCteJX1ePSheKT9eJlpeIzpeJCteLlZeKldeLTJeKzxeJCVeIU1eMFReKlcg",
      "byte_length": 48
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_450eee4fac02",
      "text": "  我需要參與哪種戰鬥？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^)e^(C^6K^'p^+I^'$^$(^*,^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeKWVeKENeNkteJ3BeK0leJyReJCheKixeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5473ac0da30e",
      "text": "  算了。我不想加入你們。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^-C^*D^!\"^$%^!)^,1^\"\"^!f^*F^*{^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLUNeKkReISJeJCVeISleLDFeIiJeIWZeKkZeKnteISI=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_af3447f22d2d",
      "text": "  我想為德魯伊拯救這座綠洲。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^,1^%{^#j^/K^!E^,F^,Q^(s^/_^3V^76^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeLDFeJXteI2peL0teIUVeLEZeLFFeKHNeL19eM1ZeNzZeISI=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_be6ac17ccd68",
      "text": "  只要我先宰了你就休想！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^\"?^(C^$%^!b^1w^*D^*F^*J^!G^,1^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIj9eKENeJCVeIWJeMXdeKkReKkZeKkpeIUdeLDFeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b94f133e586a",
      "text": "  為什麼要在這裡集結兵力？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^%{^!=^.T^(C^\"d^(s^-j^)]^'@^+,^!~^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJXteIT1eLlReKENeImReKHNeLWpeKV1eJ0BeKyxeIX5eLlY=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3e662872f67f",
      "text": "我有比這種蠢話更重要的要務在身。你為何甘冒觸怒我的風險， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^$s^,m^(s^'$^.u^-v^$o^))^(C^&Z^(C^+4^\"d^(c^!\"^*F^%{^!L^/:^/P^(J^#o^$%^&Z^)y^*m^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiRzXixtXihzXickXi51Xi12XiRvXikpXihDXiZaXihDXis0XiJkXihjXiEiXipGXiV7XiFMXi86Xi9QXihKXiNvXiQlXiZaXil5XiptXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fa7902b1fef2",
      "text": "來保衛這片毫無價值的破地方？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!O^!T^(=^(s^&1^/t^%}^+&^!Z^&Z^&n^\"e^$]^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFPXiFUXig9XihzXiYxXi90XiV9XismXiFaXiZaXiZuXiJlXiRdXi5W",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9e0f5fd4a523",
      "text": "你們打架在行嗎？想不想加入我們？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^$-^%\"^\"d^(;^+X^.V^,1^!)^,1^\"\"^!f^$%^*{^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiQtXiUiXiJkXig7XitYXi5WXiwxXiEpXiwxXiIiXiFmXiQlXip7Xi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 49
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cd075cd19adc",
      "text": "那些事我們待會再談。現在先告訴我你在我的營地幹什麼， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^!8^*r^$%^*{^,*^$r^!l^0;^!\"^&?^\"d^!b^+B^-t^$%^*F^\"d^$%^&Z^&'^\"e^,!^!=^.T^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXiE4XipyXiQlXip7XiwqXiRyXiFsXjA7XiEiXiY/XiJkXiFiXitCXi10XiQlXipGXiJkXiQlXiZaXiYnXiJlXiwhXiE9Xi5UXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_723d4406b3f3",
      "text": "否則我就叫人宰了你。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"H^!x^$%^*J^+<^!<^1w^*D^*F^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJIXiF4XiQlXipKXis8XiE8XjF3XipEXipGXiEi",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_595253a903e1",
      "text": "真的嗎？那麼在你傳達口信之前，你可以轉告達戈拉爾—— ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-2^&Z^+X^.V^)!^.T^\"d^*F^+$^(z^\"<^!U^!/^!z^*A^*F^\"A^!B^(i^+B^(z^*M^$6^&/^*n^*n ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi0yXiZaXitYXi5WXikhXi5UXiJkXipGXiskXih6XiI8XiFVXiEvXiF6XipBXipGXiJBXiFCXihpXitCXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXipuXipuIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2871f7f2855d",
      "text": "再轉告一次——我絕不會批准動用城邦資金資助他對奴隸進行的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!l^(i^+B^!%^%D^*n^*n^$%^-I^!)^$r^2i^/Q^\"%^&H^+_^1a^(X^)+^(X^\"#^!@^#:^##^)Z^(w^(;^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFsXihpXitCXiElXiVEXipuXipuXiQlXi1JXiEpXiRyXjJpXi9RXiIlXiZIXitfXjFhXihYXikrXihYXiIjXiFAXiM6XiMjXilaXih3Xig7XiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0f10b0cf306b",
      "text": "「實驗」，而且我也不會多給他任何超出每月配額的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!#^#3^.P^!$^*A^'W^!*^$%^!1^!)^$r^\"x^'A^!@^!C^!L^(\\^!q^%P^/p^)&^)v^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEjXiMzXi5QXiEkXipBXidXXiEqXiQlXiExXiEpXiRyXiJ4XidBXiFAXiFDXiFMXihcXiFxXiVQXi9wXikmXil2XiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1d84ebdfb0d3",
      "text": "奴隸。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^##^)Z^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiMjXilaXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 10
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_968a1ebb3116",
      "text": "你帶來的這個口信，確實是關於達戈拉爾的要求，對吧？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^#N^!O^&Z^(s^!V^\"<^!U^*A^-6^#3^,X^.>^$^^(z^*M^$6^&/^&Z^(C^,n^*A^#:^*I^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiNOXiFPXiZaXihzXiFWXiI8XiFVXipBXi02XiMzXixYXi4+XiReXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXiZaXihDXixuXipBXiM6XipJXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_eca85f94fadd",
      "text": "沒錯，那就是口令。所以你們想要什麼？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%\\^)5^*A^)!^*J^,X^\"<^*w^!\"^$)^!B^*F^*{^,1^(C^!=^.T^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVcXik1XipBXikhXipKXixYXiI8Xip3XiEiXiQpXiFCXipGXip7XiwxXihDXiE9Xi5UXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_98c156444da5",
      "text": "死了？我真不敢相信！達戈拉爾可是城邦裡最強大的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%L^*D^.V^$%^-2^!)^/m^&a^!U^*W^(z^*M^$6^&/^\"A^,X^+_^1a^-j^$q^#]^\"z^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVMXipEXi5WXiQlXi0yXiEpXi9tXiZhXiFVXipXXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXiJBXixYXitfXjFhXi1qXiRxXiNdXiJ6XiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3fa9cddf01e1",
      "text": "法師之一！他是怎麼死的？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%b^#M^!/^!%^*W^!@^,X^,,^.T^%L^&Z^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiViXiNNXiEvXiElXipXXiFAXixYXiwsXi5UXiVMXiZaXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 37
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d7459087f033",
      "text": "你殺了達戈拉爾？！哈！我懷疑你連我的守衛都打不過，不過就讓我們 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^%M^*D^(z^*M^$6^&/^.V^*W^+F^*W^$%^,9^0p^*F^.0^$%^&Z^#+^(=^)$^$-^!)^(x^*A^!)^(x^*J^-}^$%^*{ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiVNXipEXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXi5WXipXXitGXipXXiQlXiw5XjBwXipGXi4wXiQlXiZaXiMrXig9XikkXiQtXiEpXih4XipBXiEpXih4XipKXi19XiQlXip7IA==",
      "byte_length": 94
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_70f4726d5641",
      "text": "試試看吧！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-u^-u^*Q^*I^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi11Xi11XipRXipJXipX",
      "byte_length": 15
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5c0106c34d89",
      "text": "該死的奴隸！難道他們不明白自己的社會地位早就註定了嗎？！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(M^%L^&Z^##^)Z^*W^)a^(y^!@^*{^!)^$c^&X^'l^#I^&Z^=E^$r^\"e^!J^,V^*J^=F^#.^*D^+X^.V^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihNXiVMXiZaXiMjXilaXipXXilhXih5XiFAXip7XiEpXiRjXiZYXidsXiNJXiZaXj1FXiRyXiJlXiFKXixWXipKXj1GXiMuXipEXitYXi5WXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_437a9fb93764",
      "text": "哼，我們出征到這裡，就是要處置這群奴隸和他們那些可憐的破爛村落！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+K^*A^$%^*{^!q^.c^!u^(s^-j^*A^*J^,X^(C^(,^'Q^(s^'R^##^)Z^\"O^!@^*{^)!^!8^\"A^1}^&Z^&n^&-^$z^-`^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitLXipBXiQlXip7XiFxXi5jXiF1XihzXi1qXipBXipKXixYXihDXigsXidRXihzXidSXiMjXilaXiJPXiFAXip7XikhXiE4XiJBXjF9XiZaXiZuXiYtXiR6Xi1gXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 97
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_60199b317014",
      "text": "慢著。你是怎麼越過我的守衛的？唔…… ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#~^-a^!\"^*F^,X^,,^.T^(]^(x^$%^&Z^#+^(=^&Z^.V^+N^*o^*o ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiN+Xi1hXiEiXipGXixYXiwsXi5UXihdXih4XiQlXiZaXiMrXig9XiZaXi5WXitOXipvXipvIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4195847771ea",
      "text": "你一定是跟那個可憐的德魯伊一夥的！衛兵！除掉這幫煩人的傢伙。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^!%^#.^,X^.+^)!^!V^\"A^1}^&Z^#j^/K^!E^!%^5?^&Z^*W^(=^+,^*W^)Q^/e^(s^+}^-!^!<^&Z^+#^*y^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiElXiMuXixYXi4rXikhXiFWXiJBXjF9XiZaXiNqXi9LXiFFXiElXjU/XiZaXipXXig9XissXipXXilRXi9lXihzXit9Xi0hXiE8XiZaXisjXip5XiEi",
      "byte_length": 90
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d909e29d7bdb",
      "text": "隨著在這裡的大規模兵力集結，我們的戰士已經不夠用了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)X^-a^\"d^(s^-j^&Z^\"z^6'^%:^+,^!~^)]^'@^*A^$%^*{^&Z^$(^+a^#J^'D^!)^+d^&H^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XilYXi1hXiJkXihzXi1qXiZaXiJ6XjYnXiU6XissXiF+XildXidAXipBXiQlXip7XiZaXiQoXithXiNKXidEXiEpXitkXiZIXipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 78
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b33f20475b3c",
      "text": "你肯定是活得不耐煩了！我的守衛很樂意成全你。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^-Z^#.^,X^%i^#e^!)^-S^-!^*D^*W^$%^&Z^#+^(=^*K^%8^#z^$$^!h^*F^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXi1aXiMuXixYXiVpXiNlXiEpXi1TXi0hXipEXipXXiQlXiZaXiMrXig9XipLXiU4XiN6XiQkXiFoXipGXiEi",
      "byte_length": 66
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c8220edfad8e",
      "text": "我們很快就會知道你是不是真的無敵。衛兵！進攻！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^*K^*L^*J^$r^&h^(y^*F^,X^!)^,X^-2^&Z^%}^$U^!\"^(=^+,^*W^(w^$O^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7XipLXipMXipKXiRyXiZoXih5XipGXixYXiEpXixYXi0yXiZaXiV9XiRVXiEiXig9XissXipXXih3XiRPXipX",
      "byte_length": 69
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6386488b8051",
      "text": "我們到這裡來是為了清剿強盜巢穴和奴隸村落。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^!u^(s^-j^!O^,X^%{^*D^,u^7R^#]^0!^#G^'&^\"O^##^)Z^$z^-`^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7XiF1XihzXi1qXiFPXixYXiV7XipEXix1XjdSXiNdXjAhXiNHXicmXiJPXiMjXilaXiR6Xi1gXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6de5fddcbd73",
      "text": "城邦內部有太多異議叛亂，再也無法容忍來自外部的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+_^1a^!g^)#^$s^+f^\"x^&M^-|^.Z^!3^*A^!l^!1^%}^%b^+t^1y^!O^'l^\"w^)#^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitfXjFhXiFnXikjXiRzXitmXiJ4XiZNXi18Xi5aXiEzXipBXiFsXiExXiV9XiViXit0XjF5XiFPXidsXiJ3XikjXiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_668f9af75b90",
      "text": "襲擊了。大部分戰鬥都是對付手無寸鐵的對手。你能 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^08^$F^*D^!\"^\"z^)#^!s^$(^*,^)$^,X^#:^*u^$+^%}^=(^)?^&Z^#:^$+^!\"^*F^'b ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjA4XiRGXipEXiEiXiJ6XikjXiFzXiQoXiosXikkXixYXiM6Xip1XiQrXiV9Xj0oXik/XiZaXiM6XiQrXiEiXipGXidiIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fb21f0f12bd0",
      "text": "勝任這份差事嗎？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+5^!C^(s^*x^48^*r^+X^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xis1XiFDXihzXip4XjQ4XipyXitYXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c1dc8b1e56cc",
      "text": "城邦內部有太多異議叛亂，再也無法容忍來自 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+_^1a^!g^)#^$s^+f^\"x^&M^-|^.Z^!3^*A^!l^!1^%}^%b^+t^1y^!O^'l ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitfXjFhXiFnXikjXiRzXitmXiJ4XiZNXi18Xi5aXiEzXipBXiFsXiExXiV9XiViXit0XjF5XiFPXidsIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bd7c6b2af08a",
      "text": "強盜和奴隸村落的襲擊。我們出征到此就是為了徹底殲滅他們。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#]^0!^\"O^##^)Z^$z^-`^&Z^08^$F^!\"^$%^*{^!q^.c^!u^%I^*J^,X^%{^*D^18^/^^=D^%t^!@^*{^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNdXjAhXiJPXiMjXilaXiR6Xi1gXiZaXjA4XiRGXiEiXiQlXip7XiFxXi5jXiF1XiVJXipKXixYXiV7XipEXjE4Xi9eXj1EXiV0XiFAXip7XiEi",
      "byte_length": 84
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a29eb2a7a2ce",
      "text": "那麼，是什麼口信？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^.T^*A^,X^!=^.T^\"<^!U^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXi5UXipBXixYXiE9Xi5UXiI8XiFVXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 28
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7fbcc17ab7c3",
      "text": "達戈拉爾",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(z^*M^$6^&/",
      "encoded_base64": "Xih6XipNXiQ2XiYv",
      "byte_length": 12
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_070b72e9403b",
      "text": "德拉卡斯？我從沒聽說過他。不過這也不奇怪—— ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#j^$6^\"0^$[^.V^$%^#f^%\\^-X^-x^(x^!@^!\"^!)^(x^(s^!1^!)^\"}^#s^*n^*n ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNqXiQ2XiIwXiRbXi5WXiQlXiNmXiVcXi1YXi14Xih4XiFAXiEiXiEpXih4XihzXiExXiEpXiJ9XiNzXipuXipuIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_470827edc9b4",
      "text": "城邦裡動盪不斷，新的聖堂武士崛起和落馬得太快了。不管怎樣， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+_^1a^-j^\"%^0\"^!)^,T^*A^$\\^&Z^'Z^42^%J^+a^=C^.(^\"O^-`^*\"^#e^+f^*L^*D^!\"^!)^-D^,,^,f^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitfXjFhXi1qXiIlXjAiXiEpXixUXipBXiRcXiZaXidaXjQyXiVKXithXj1DXi4oXiJPXi1gXioiXiNlXitmXipMXipEXiEiXiEpXi1EXiwsXixmXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3e69ff33e04f",
      "text": "是什麼口信？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,X^!=^.T^\"<^!U^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XixYXiE9Xi5UXiI8XiFVXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 19
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f8677e913c64",
      "text": "德拉卡斯",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#j^$6^\"0^$[",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNqXiQ2XiIwXiRb",
      "byte_length": 12
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5a64f00d2edc",
      "text": "  命令你立即返回城邦。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^\"N^*w^*F^0'^\"1^7J^\"\\^+_^1a^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIk5eKndeKkZeMCdeIjFeN0peIlxeK19eMWFeISIg",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6faa1870225e",
      "text": "  命令你將指揮權移交給我。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^\"N^*w^*F^#7^$8^2\"^1E^'\"^0P^'A^$%^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIk5eKndeKkZeIzdeJDheMiJeMUVeJyJeMFBeJ0FeJCVeISI=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3d12d20580fa",
      "text": "  特克圖克特雷對這座綠洲另有特殊規劃。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^&5^!d^\"b^!d^&5^)c^#:^(s^/_^3V^76^\">^$s^&5^9!^6'^4s^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJjVeIWReImJeIWReJjVeKWNeIzpeKHNeL19eM1ZeNzZeIj5eJHNeJjVeOSFeNideNHNeISI=",
      "byte_length": 56
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_149651f4682c",
      "text": "  你的死期到了，受死吧！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^&Z^%L^$u^!u^*D^*A^\";^%L^*I^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeJlpeJUxeJHVeIXVeKkReKkFeIjteJUxeKkleKlcg",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_96a3bc2c0728",
      "text": "  好吧。這就是公文手令。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^+i^*I^!\"^(s^*J^,X^3:^$W^$+^*w^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeK2leKkleISJeKHNeKkpeLFheMzpeJFdeJCteKndeISIg",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_151a104d3826",
      "text": "  唔。我剛才明明還拿著的…… ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^+N^!\"^$%^+0^$,^$c^$c^.7^,G^-a^&Z^*o^*o ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeK05eISJeJCVeKzBeJCxeJGNeJGNeLjdeLEdeLWFeJlpeKm9eKm8g",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f30654d1cda9",
      "text": "  沒有紙本文件。我把口信記在腦子裡了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^%\\^$s^0+^$x^$W^.W^!\"^$%^$1^\"<^!U^(K^\"d^2@^#(^-j^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJVxeJHNeMCteJHheJFdeLldeISJeJCVeJDFeIjxeIVVeKEteImReMkBeIyheLWpeKkReISI=",
      "byte_length": 56
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2704edc6fb0c",
      "text": "算了。我還是直接殺了你比較快。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-C^*D^!\"^$%^.7^,X^&`^$?^%M^*D^*F^,m^(f^*L^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi1DXipEXiEiXiQlXi43XixYXiZgXiQ/XiVNXipEXipGXixtXihmXipMXiEi",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7c7bae7faa27",
      "text": "  你必須服從命令！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^#l^)r^,\\^#f^\"N^*w^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeI2xeKXJeLFxeI2ZeIk5eKndeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2aa0ed23f9ee",
      "text": "  好啊。不服從拉倒，自掘墳墓的是你。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^+i^+Q^!\"^!)^,\\^#f^$6^!X^*A^'l^=@^:C^6P^&Z^,X^*F^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeK2leK1FeISJeISleLFxeI2ZeJDZeIVheKkFeJ2xePUBeOkNeNlBeJlpeLFheKkZeISI=",
      "byte_length": 53
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d4205fa03179",
      "text": "我現在就要取你的性命。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^&?^\"d^*J^(C^\":^*F^&Z^#r^\"N^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiY/XiJkXipKXihDXiI6XipGXiZaXiNyXiJOXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f8f3b279e093",
      "text": "  解散你的部隊，返回城邦！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^(I^$S^*F^&Z^)#^)U^*A^7J^\"\\^+_^1a^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKEleJFNeKkZeJlpeKSNeKVVeKkFeN0peIlxeK19eMWFeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b88689382e95",
      "text": "  離開這座綠洲，去搜查荒原！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^)`^)F^(s^/_^3V^76^*A^\"6^/h^%&^1W^\"5^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKWBeKUZeKHNeL19eM1ZeNzZeKkFeIjZeL2heJSZeMVdeIjVeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d3034e22b1a0",
      "text": "  立即返回城邦。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^0'^\"1^7J^\"\\^+_^1a^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeMCdeIjFeN0peIlxeK19eMWFeISI=",
      "byte_length": 23
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_40842a99e14d",
      "text": "  幫我殺了你的守衛。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^+}^$%^%M^*D^*F^&Z^#+^(=^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeK31eJCVeJU1eKkReKkZeJlpeIyteKD1eISIg",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_716b6a415155",
      "text": "蠢貨！你真以為你能逼我和我自己的部隊 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.u^.w^*W^*F^-2^!B^%{^*F^'b^.1^$%^\"O^$%^'l^#I^&Z^)#^)U ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi51Xi53XipXXipGXi0yXiFCXiV7XipGXidiXi4xXiQlXiJPXiQlXidsXiNJXiZaXikjXilVIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6bc82f1ad871",
      "text": "開戰嗎？你未免也太天真了！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)F^$(^+X^.V^*F^,_^!e^!1^+f^+e^-2^*D^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XilGXiQoXitYXi5WXipGXixfXiFlXiExXitmXitlXi0yXipEXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 40
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_24ea242d41c1",
      "text": "是……我會幫……你…… ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,X^*o^*o^$%^$r^+}^*o^*o^*F^*o^*o ",
      "encoded_base64": "XixYXipvXipvXiQlXiRyXit9XipvXipvXipGXipvXipvIA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_344ba3aa5f31",
      "text": "能回到文明社會，不用在這該死的荒原上 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'b^\"\\^!u^$W^$c^=E^$r^*A^!)^&H^\"d^(s^(M^%L^&Z^1W^\"5^!' ",
      "encoded_base64": "XidiXiJcXiF1XiRXXiRjXj1FXiRyXipBXiEpXiZIXiJkXihzXihNXiVMXiZaXjFXXiI1XiEnIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_446eb90bd9fa",
      "text": "受罪，真是太好了！衛兵！我們開拔！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\";^5x^*A^-2^,X^+f^+i^*D^*W^(=^+,^*W^$%^*{^)F^/c^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiI7XjV4XipBXi0yXixYXitmXitpXipEXipXXig9XissXipXXiQlXip7XilGXi9jXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_aee2766b7bef",
      "text": "很好。我會帶著部隊開始搜查荒原。記得 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*K^+i^!\"^$%^$r^#N^-a^)#^)U^)F^+k^/h^%&^1W^\"5^!\"^(K^#e ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipLXitpXiEiXiQlXiRyXiNOXi1hXikjXilVXilGXitrXi9oXiUmXjFXXiI1XiEiXihLXiNlIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7c6305f9a38c",
      "text": "轉告 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(i^+B ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihpXitCIA==",
      "byte_length": 7
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_77014eae0f85",
      "text": " 我正在遵照他的命令列事。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^$%^%H^\"d^4#^/x^!@^&Z^\"N^*w^8f^*r^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4kJV4lSF4iZF40I14veF4hQF4mWl4iTl4qd144Zl4qcl4hIiA=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_803aea56fe53",
      "text": "解散我的部隊？讓他們自生自滅？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(I^$S^$%^&Z^)#^)U^.V^-}^!@^*{^'l^&F^'l^%t^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihJXiRTXiQlXiZaXikjXilVXi5WXi19XiFAXip7XidsXiZGXidsXiV0Xi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_96becfe4d0ca",
      "text": "不！門都沒有！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^*W^)D^)$^%\\^$s^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXipXXilEXikkXiVcXiRzXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 22
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4621d301ca8a",
      "text": "只有達戈拉爾敢下達這麼大膽的命令。好吧。我會解散 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"?^$s^(z^*M^$6^&/^/m^!(^(z^(s^.T^\"z^-[^&Z^\"N^*w^!\"^+i^*I^!\"^$%^$r^(I^$S ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiI/XiRzXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXi9tXiEoXih6XihzXi5UXiJ6Xi1bXiZaXiJOXip3XiEiXitpXipJXiEiXiQlXiRyXihJXiRTIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fff3a2e03192",
      "text": "守衛並返回城邦。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#+^(=^!+^7J^\"\\^+_^1a^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiMrXig9XiErXjdKXiJcXitfXjFhXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_99c2731abfcd",
      "text": "就連達戈拉爾也不會提出這種要求！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*J^.0^(z^*M^$6^&/^!1^!)^$r^$A^!q^(s^'$^(C^,n^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipKXi4wXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXiExXiEpXiRyXiRBXiFxXihzXickXihDXixuXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 49
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3bbc1fbdde69",
      "text": "我看自掘墳墓的會是你才對！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*Q^'l^=@^:C^6P^&Z^$r^,X^*F^$,^#:^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXipRXidsXj1AXjpDXjZQXiZaXiRyXixYXipGXiQsXiM6XipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 40
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_804ac266b045",
      "text": "達戈拉爾可不是我想招惹的對象。好吧，我會返回 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(z^*M^$6^&/^\"A^!)^,X^$%^,1^,D^3s^&Z^#:^4g^!\"^+i^*I^*A^$%^$r^7J^\"\\ ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXiJBXiEpXixYXiQlXiwxXixEXjNzXiZaXiM6XjRnXiEiXitpXipJXipBXiQlXiRyXjdKXiJcIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c2985e53071a",
      "text": "城邦。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+_^1a^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitfXjFhXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 10
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f3b6a10ded03",
      "text": "我懷疑這個德拉卡斯根本就不存在！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^,9^0p^(s^!V^#j^$6^\"0^$[^%)^$x^*J^!)^#*^\"d^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiw5XjBwXihzXiFWXiNqXiQ2XiIwXiRbXiUpXiR4XipKXiEpXiMqXiJkXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 49
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9353ed3d941a",
      "text": "隨便什麼人都會拿達戈拉爾的名字招搖撞騙！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)X^!R^!=^.T^!<^)$^$r^,G^(z^*M^$6^&/^&Z^\"F^#)^,D^3J^/l^.{^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XilYXiFSXiE9Xi5UXiE8XikkXiRyXixHXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXiZaXiJGXiMpXixEXjNKXi9sXi57XipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0777dd042e2c",
      "text": "我聽說過達戈拉爾那種讓人緩慢痛苦死去的手段。我可不想 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^-X^-x^(x^(z^*M^$6^&/^)!^'$^-}^!<^'J^#~^-.^.t^%L^\"6^&Z^$+^.l^!\"^$%^\"A^!)^,1 ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXi1YXi14Xih4Xih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXikhXickXi19XiE8XidKXiN+Xi0uXi50XiVMXiI2XiZaXiQrXi5sXiEiXiQlXiJBXiEpXiwxIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9de4425af182",
      "text": "親身體會。我該怎麼做？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(F^(c^**^$r^!\"^$%^(M^,,^.T^*~^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihGXihjXioqXiRyXiEiXiQlXihNXiwsXi5UXip+Xi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8dada1c6890e",
      "text": "你提到的這個德拉卡斯根本嚇不倒我。等他的信使 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^$A^!u^&Z^(s^!V^#j^$6^\"0^$[^%)^$x^\"X^!)^!X^$%^!\"^'-^!@^&Z^!U^!N ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiRBXiF1XiZaXihzXiFWXiNqXiQ2XiIwXiRbXiUpXiR4XiJYXiEpXiFYXiQlXiEiXictXiFAXiZaXiFVXiFOIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_132a05c37fbb",
      "text": "沒有回去覆命時，也許他會親自到這裡來，到時我連他一併 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%\\^$s^\"\\^\"6^(D^\"N^$f^*A^!1^-s^!@^$r^(F^'l^!u^(s^-j^!O^*A^!u^$f^$%^.0^!@^!%^=B ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVcXiRzXiJcXiI2XihEXiJOXiRmXipBXiExXi1zXiFAXiRyXihGXidsXiF1XihzXi1qXiFPXipBXiF1XiRmXiQlXi4wXiFAXiElXj1CIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8aad0ea0073d",
      "text": "收拾！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$M^7[^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRNXjdbXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 10
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d501664afe9a",
      "text": "我情願冒著惹怒他的風險！我根本不相信你們是信使！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^,0^.H^/P^-a^3s^#o^!@^&Z^)y^*m^*W^$%^%)^$x^!)^&a^!U^*F^*{^,X^!U^!N^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiwwXi5IXi9QXi1hXjNzXiNvXiFAXiZaXil5XiptXipXXiQlXiUpXiR4XiEpXiZhXiFVXipGXip7XixYXiFVXiFOXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_accf4b6f7caa",
      "text": "好吧。如果達戈拉爾是在轉達特克圖克特雷的旨意，那一定 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+i^*I^!\"^#$^%!^(z^*M^$6^&/^,X^\"d^(i^(z^&5^!d^\"b^!d^&5^)c^&Z^<(^#z^*A^)!^!%^#. ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitpXipJXiEiXiMkXiUhXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXixYXiJkXihpXih6XiY1XiFkXiJiXiFkXiY1XiljXiZaXjwoXiN6XipBXikhXiElXiMuIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_35d944307c25",
      "text": "非常重要。我該怎麼做？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)i^#O^))^(C^!\"^$%^(M^,,^.T^*~^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XilpXiNPXikpXihDXiEiXiQlXihNXiwsXi5UXip+Xi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a1972ee12940",
      "text": "好吧。我這就返回城邦。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+i^*I^!\"^$%^(s^*J^7J^\"\\^+_^1a^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XitpXipJXiEiXiQlXihzXipKXjdKXiJcXitfXjFhXiEi",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a6637f5f3bd7",
      "text": "我才不會聽命於某個不知名的聖堂武士！衛兵！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^$,^!)^$r^-X^\"N^$^^%$^!V^!)^&h^\"F^&Z^'Z^42^%J^+a^*W^(=^+,^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiQsXiEpXiRyXi1YXiJOXiReXiUkXiFWXiEpXiZoXiJGXiZaXidaXjQyXiVKXithXipXXig9XissXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_031f0d40e14b",
      "text": "既然達戈拉爾要我回城邦，我可不會違逆他。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,U^&\"^(z^*M^$6^&/^(C^$%^\"\\^+_^1a^*A^$%^\"A^!)^$r^9P^8c^!@^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XixVXiYiXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXihDXiQlXiJcXitfXjFhXipBXiQlXiJBXiEpXiRyXjlQXjhjXiFAXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8bfe5f8deeea",
      "text": "好吧。我交出指揮權。你想要我做什麼？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+i^*I^!\"^$%^0P^!q^$8^2\"^1E^!\"^*F^,1^(C^$%^*~^!=^.T^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitpXipJXiEiXiQlXjBQXiFxXiQ4XjIiXjFFXiEiXipGXiwxXihDXiQlXip+XiE9Xi5UXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b1ac3def2bcb",
      "text": "不管是不是達戈拉爾的命令，我都不相信你！衛兵！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^-D^,X^!)^,X^(z^*M^$6^&/^&Z^\"N^*w^*A^$%^)$^!)^&a^!U^*F^*W^(=^+,^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXi1EXixYXiEpXixYXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXiZaXiJOXip3XipBXiQlXikkXiEpXiZhXiFVXipGXipXXig9XissXipX",
      "byte_length": 69
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_16188799b99d",
      "text": "那就這樣吧。我把指揮權移交給你。我該怎麼做？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^*J^(s^,f^*I^!\"^$%^$1^$8^2\"^1E^'\"^0P^'A^*F^!\"^$%^(M^,,^.T^*~^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXipKXihzXixmXipJXiEiXiQlXiQxXiQ4XjIiXjFFXiciXjBQXidBXipGXiEiXiQlXihNXiwsXi5UXip+Xi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6882faf4193a",
      "text": "我想那個德拉卡斯只是想把我調開，好讓他 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^,1^)!^!V^#j^$6^\"0^$[^\"?^,X^,1^$1^$%^(Q^)F^*A^+i^-}^!@ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiwxXikhXiFWXiNqXiQ2XiIwXiRbXiI/XixYXiwxXiQxXiQlXihRXilGXipBXitpXi19XiFAIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ea7b3910f85e",
      "text": "能獨吞藏在這裡的東西！休想！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'b^/z^:-^-f^\"d^(s^-j^&Z^,`^-l^*W^!G^,1^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XidiXi96XjotXi1mXiJkXihzXi1qXiZaXixgXi1sXipXXiFHXiwxXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 43
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_92c98b731539",
      "text": "不管是不是達戈拉爾的命令，我都不信任你們！衛兵！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^-D^,X^!)^,X^(z^*M^$6^&/^&Z^\"N^*w^*A^$%^)$^!)^!U^!C^*F^*{^*W^(=^+,^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXi1EXixYXiEpXixYXih6XipNXiQ2XiYvXiZaXiJOXip3XipBXiQlXikkXiEpXiFVXiFDXipGXip7XipXXig9XissXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5ef78ad99421",
      "text": "好吧。那我該做些什麼？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+i^*I^!\"^)!^$%^(M^*~^!8^!=^.T^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitpXipJXiEiXikhXiQlXihNXip+XiE4XiE9Xi5UXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_62e16b17616a",
      "text": "剛才還在？你把城邦的公文弄丟了？！你知道信使 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+0^$,^.7^\"d^.V^*F^$1^+_^1a^&Z^3:^$W^/`^*q^*D^.V^*W^*F^&h^(y^!U^!N ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiswXiQsXi43XiJkXi5WXipGXiQxXitfXjFhXiZaXjM6XiRXXi9gXipxXipEXi5WXipXXipGXiZoXih5XiFVXiFOIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d977e6083428",
      "text": "遺失城邦公文要付出什麼代價嗎！那就是死！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^0v^\"|^+_^1a^3:^$W^(C^*u^!q^!=^.T^*v^+&^+X^*W^)!^*J^,X^%L^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XjB2XiJ8XitfXjFhXjM6XiRXXihDXip1XiFxXiE9Xi5UXip2XismXitYXipXXikhXipKXixYXiVMXipX",
      "byte_length": 60
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b3640c50bc33",
      "text": "公文在哪裡？！你在耍什麼花樣？！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^3:^$W^\"d^+I^-j^.V^*W^*F^\"d^7E^!=^.T^'w^,f^.V^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjM6XiRXXiJkXitJXi1qXi5WXipXXipGXiJkXjdFXiE9Xi5UXid3XixmXi5WXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 49
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c4300eb4e6c5",
      "text": "我不會再容忍你耍任何把戲了！衛兵！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^!)^$r^!l^+t^1y^*F^7E^!C^!L^$1^,;^*D^*W^(=^+,^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiEpXiRyXiFsXit0XjF5XipGXjdFXiFDXiFMXiQxXiw7XipEXipXXig9XissXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3d40cf5bb7f1",
      "text": "使用心靈異能說服他？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!N^&H^#k^)g^&M^'b^-x^,\\^!@^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFOXiZIXiNrXilnXiZNXidiXi14XixcXiFAXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 31
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_db76acfe9519",
      "text": "你未能支配他的心智！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^,_^'b^$L^)&^!@^&Z^#k^$i^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXixfXidiXiRMXikmXiFAXiZaXiNrXiRpXipX",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b055f85e7794",
      "text": "心靈異能？！你竟敢試圖操縱一名 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#k^)g^&M^'b^.V^*W^*F^28^/m^-u^\"b^$H^4]^!%^\"F ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNrXilnXiZNXidiXi5WXipXXipGXjI4Xi9tXi11XiJiXiRIXjRdXiElXiJGIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f65cf6baf86f",
      "text": "聖堂武士的心智，真是自尋死路！衛兵！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'Z^42^%J^+a^&Z^#k^$i^*A^-2^,X^'l^#9^%L^(a^*W^(=^+,^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XidaXjQyXiVKXithXiZaXiNrXiRpXipBXi0yXixYXidsXiM5XiVMXihhXipXXig9XissXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2954d05010ee",
      "text": "你成功支配了他的心智！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^$$^\"!^$L^)&^*D^!@^&Z^#k^$i^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiQkXiIhXiRMXikmXipEXiFAXiZaXiNrXiRpXipX",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4063b3d73823",
      "text": "噢……在這裡……我現在明白了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+]^*o^*o^\"d^(s^-j^*o^*o^$%^&?^\"d^$c^&X^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitdXipvXipvXiJkXihzXi1qXipvXipvXiQlXiY/XiJkXiRjXiZYXipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b29c4c7f6094",
      "text": " 現在要我做什麼？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^&?^\"d^(C^$%^*~^!=^.T^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4mP14iZF4oQ14kJV4qfl4hPV4uVF4uViA=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4124d2f947a8",
      "text": "當然。如果對這座綠洲另有規劃，特克圖克特雷絕不能 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&N^&\"^!\"^#$^%!^#:^(s^/_^3V^76^\">^$s^6'^4s^*A^&5^!d^\"b^!d^&5^)c^-I^!)^'b ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZOXiYiXiEiXiMkXiUhXiM6XihzXi9fXjNWXjc2XiI+XiRzXjYnXjRzXipBXiY1XiFkXiJiXiFkXiY1XiljXi1JXiEpXidiIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ab8a833a43b3",
      "text": "冒險讓計劃落入敵方密探之手，尤其是 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^/P^*m^-}^-n^4s^-`^!f^$U^$]^#0^$>^!/^$+^*A^6V^!j^,X ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi9QXiptXi19Xi1uXjRzXi1gXiFmXiRVXiRdXiMwXiQ+XiEvXiQrXipBXjZWXiFqXixYIA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d383fe9984bf",
      "text": "那個該死的面紗聯盟！好吧， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^!V^(M^%L^&Z^)j^-G^-V^-0^*W^+i^*I^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXiFWXihNXiVMXiZaXilqXi1HXi1WXi0wXipXXitpXipJXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 40
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0ac16464401f",
      "text": " 建議我怎麼做？",
      "encoded_ascii": " ^,'^-|^$%^,,^.T^*~^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "IF4sJ14tfF4kJV4sLF4uVF4qfl4uVg==",
      "byte_length": 22
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d9b177850569",
      "text": "果然如此。你們隨便什麼人都可以自稱是來自城邦的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%!^&\"^#$^%I^!\"^*F^*{^)X^!R^!=^.T^!<^)$^\"A^!B^'l^0&^,X^!O^'l^+_^1a^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiUhXiYiXiMkXiVJXiEiXipGXip7XilYXiFSXiE9Xi5UXiE8XikkXiJBXiFCXidsXjAmXixYXiFPXidsXitfXjFhXiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_eb17656ea018",
      "text": "信使，只是想讓我放鬆戒備罷了——門都沒有！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!U^!N^*A^\"?^,X^,1^-}^$%^$P^.R^$&^+\"^1Q^*D^*n^*n^)D^)$^%\\^$s^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFVXiFOXipBXiI/XixYXiwxXi19XiQlXiRQXi5SXiQmXisiXjFRXipEXipuXipuXilEXikkXiVcXiRzXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d7b208fb7b17",
      "text": "放棄任務的命令通常不會只靠口頭背誦。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$P^,a^!C^+4^&Z^\"N^*w^(t^#O^!)^$r^\"?^.C^\"<^)t^.r^7H^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRQXixhXiFDXis0XiZaXiJOXip3Xih0XiNPXiEpXiRyXiI/Xi5DXiI8Xil0Xi5yXjdIXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_55f7583e7146",
      "text": "單憑你一句話，可不能讓我信服。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^2a^,5^*F^!%^2]^-v^*A^\"A^!)^'b^-}^$%^!U^,\\^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjJhXiw1XipGXiElXjJdXi12XipBXiJBXiEpXidiXi19XiQlXiFVXixcXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5a11d507965a",
      "text": "況且，我從沒聽說過德拉卡斯！我怎麼知道他根本 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,q^!*^*A^$%^#f^%\\^-X^-x^(x^#j^$6^\"0^$[^*W^$%^,,^.T^&h^(y^!@^%)^$x ",
      "encoded_base64": "XixxXiEqXipBXiQlXiNmXiVcXi1YXi14Xih4XiNqXiQ2XiIwXiRbXipXXiQlXiwsXi5UXiZoXih5XiFAXiUpXiR4IA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fd46222b5510",
      "text": "不存在？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^#*^\"d^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXiMqXiJkXi5W",
      "byte_length": 12
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_494771d90df6",
      "text": "這叫我難以置信。讓我看看公文——沒有證據，我哪裡也 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^+<^$%^)a^!B^'Q^!U^!\"^-}^$%^*Q^*Q^3:^$W^*n^*n^%\\^$s^-{^5T^*A^$%^+I^-j^!1 ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXis8XiQlXilhXiFCXidRXiFVXiEiXi19XiQlXipRXipRXjM6XiRXXipuXipuXiVcXiRzXi17XjVUXipBXiQlXitJXi1qXiExIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7bc05519437b",
      "text": "不會去。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^$r^\"6^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXiRyXiI2XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 13
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a423b758481b",
      "text": "交給你？哈！讓我看看手令！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^0P^'A^*F^.V^+F^*W^-}^$%^*Q^*Q^$+^*w^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjBQXidBXipGXi5WXitGXipXXi19XiQlXipRXipRXiQrXip3XipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 40
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d356d3d106fc",
      "text": "確實。如果他對這座綠洲另有計劃，那這裡一定有什麼特別 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-6^#3^!\"^#$^%!^!@^#:^(s^/_^3V^76^\">^$s^-n^4s^*A^)!^(s^-j^!%^#.^$s^!=^.T^&5^*H ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi02XiMzXiEiXiMkXiUhXiFAXiM6XihzXi9fXjNWXjc2XiI+XiRzXi1uXjRzXipBXikhXihzXi1qXiElXiMuXiRzXiE9Xi5UXiY1XipIIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_afba90cde3ac",
      "text": "之處。讓我看看手令——我想看看裡面有沒有提到任何 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!/^(,^!\"^-}^$%^*Q^*Q^$+^*w^*n^*n^$%^,1^*Q^*Q^-j^)j^$s^%\\^$s^$A^!u^!C^!L ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEvXigsXiEiXi19XiQlXipRXipRXiQrXip3XipuXipuXiQlXiwxXipRXipRXi1qXilqXiRzXiVcXiRzXiRBXiF1XiFDXiFMIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fcfaf9b73b36",
      "text": "關於他計劃的細節。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.>^$^^!@^-n^4s^&Z^'?^9b^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi4+XiReXiFAXi1uXjRzXiZaXic/XjliXiEi",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7a5d7975da15",
      "text": "部隊離開了該區域。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)#^)U^)`^)F^*D^(M^\"+^\"k^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XikjXilVXilgXilGXipEXihNXiIrXiJrXiEi",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_16fc13e8e9aa",
      "text": "你們就算擊潰了德拉吉的軍隊，我們也一定會捲土重來消滅你們 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^*J^-C^$F^2-^*D^#j^$6^\"D^&Z^..^)U^*A^$%^*{^!1^!%^#.^$r^0c^\"c^))^!O^%k^%t^*F^*{ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XipKXi1DXiRGXjItXipEXiNqXiQ2XiJEXiZaXi4uXilVXipBXiQlXip7XiExXiElXiMuXiRyXjBjXiJjXikpXiFPXiVrXiV0XipGXip7IA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4d5d7ca89cbf",
      "text": "這種賤種！德拉吉絕不會陷落！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^'$^2G^'$^*W^#j^$6^\"D^-I^!)^$r^)S^-`^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXickXjJHXickXipXXiNqXiQ2XiJEXi1JXiEpXiRyXilTXi1gXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 43
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a5df2938b83a",
      "text": "你居然站在那個德魯伊那一邊？看來光把他趕走還不夠。我們 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^+w^&\"^->^\"d^)!^!V^#j^/K^!E^)!^!%^.8^.V^*Q^!O^!c^$1^!@^0u^.&^.7^!)^+d^!\"^$%^*{ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXit3XiYiXi0+XiJkXikhXiFWXiNqXi9LXiFFXikhXiElXi44Xi5WXipRXiFPXiFjXiQxXiFAXjB1Xi4mXi43XiEpXitkXiEiXiQlXip7IA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_07d0eb441672",
      "text": "只好把你也宰了！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"?^+i^$1^*F^!1^1w^*D^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiI/XitpXiQxXipGXiExXjF3XipEXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d56aa460147c",
      "text": "我們正要離開這裡。別來煩我們。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^%H^(C^)`^)F^(s^-j^!\"^*H^!O^-!^$%^*{^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7XiVIXihDXilgXilGXihzXi1qXiEiXipIXiFPXi0hXiQlXip7XiEi",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0c5c6e0f5c2a",
      "text": "別傷害我！我這就給你們讓路。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*H^!^^#/^$%^*W^$%^(s^*J^'A^*F^*{^-}^(a^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipIXiFeXiMvXiQlXipXXiQlXihzXipKXidBXipGXip7Xi19XihhXiEi",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8a89740c5d77",
      "text": "營地的口令是「塵捲風」，免得你們待會又被 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&'^\"e^&Z^\"<^*w^,X^!#^\"p^0c^)y^!$^*A^!e^#e^*F^*{^,*^$r^+;^(@ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiYnXiJlXiZaXiI8Xip3XixYXiEjXiJwXjBjXil5XiEkXipBXiFlXiNlXipGXip7XiwqXiRyXis7XihAIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1a2fae730033",
      "text": "其他衛兵給攔下來。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!j^!@^(=^+,^'A^9n^!(^!O^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFqXiFAXig9XissXidBXjluXiEoXiFPXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 28
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d31edeede9c8",
      "text": "你告訴了衛兵口令「塵捲風」。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^+B^-t^*D^(=^+,^\"<^*w^!#^\"p^0c^)y^!$^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXitCXi10XipEXig9XissXiI8Xip3XiEjXiJwXjBjXil5XiEkXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 43
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a57667730dad",
      "text": "很好。那就去辦你們的正事吧。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*K^+i^!\"^)!^*J^\"6^2L^*F^*{^&Z^%H^*r^*I^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipLXitpXiEiXikhXipKXiI2XjJMXipGXip7XiZaXiVIXipyXipJXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 43
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5ee2a1daa01f",
      "text": "此地禁止任何人進入！說明你們的來意，否則立刻滾開！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%I^\"e^&y^%G^!C^!L^!<^(w^!f^*W^-x^$c^*F^*{^&Z^!O^#z^*A^\"H^!x^0'^.Y^,z^)F^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVJXiJlXiZ5XiVHXiFDXiFMXiE8Xih3XiFmXipXXi14XiRjXipGXip7XiZaXiFPXiN6XipBXiJIXiF4XjAnXi5ZXix6XilGXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3a292897dac5",
      "text": "  這裡是誰在負責？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^(s^-j^,X^-y^\"d^(W^0>^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKHNeLWpeLFheLXleImReKFdeMD5eLlY=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3b5bc6cad492",
      "text": "  只是路過。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^\"?^,X^(a^(x^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIj9eLFheKGFeKHheISIg",
      "byte_length": 18
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7874c3b782ee",
      "text": "  閉嘴，不然就死！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^.=^+[^*A^!)^&\"^*J^%L^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLj1eK1teKkFeISleJiJeKkpeJUxeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3721423004a4",
      "text": "  就憑你也想叫我離開？哈！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*J^,5^*F^!1^,1^+<^$%^)`^)F^.V^+F^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkpeLDVeKkZeITFeLDFeKzxeJCVeKWBeKUZeLlZeK0ZeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c6928533b509",
      "text": "  是蒸氣之泉的德魯伊派我來的。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^,X^(&^%U^!/^%a^&Z^#j^/K^!E^.n^$%^!O^&Z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLFheKCZeJVVeIS9eJWFeJlpeI2peL0teIUVeLm5eJCVeIU9eJlpeISI=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5eafbd6e39e7",
      "text": "  我是來殺他的！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^,X^!O^%M^!@^&Z^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeLFheIU9eJU1eIUBeJlpeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 23
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2bd73d7738b2",
      "text": "  我替他帶來了來自德拉吉的口信。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^2o^!@^#N^!O^*D^!O^'l^#j^$6^\"D^&Z^\"<^!U^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeMm9eIUBeI05eIU9eKkReIU9eJ2xeI2peJDZeIkReJlpeIjxeIVVeISIg",
      "byte_length": 48
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_61669a5fc2f8",
      "text": "  我是來綠洲取點水的。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^,X^!O^3V^76^\":^*;^%V^&Z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeLFheIU9eM1ZeNzZeIjpeKjteJVZeJlpeISI=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e14da19a0aa7",
      "text": "  我在這片荒原中流浪。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^\"d^(s^&1^1W^\"5^!,^%j^,r^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeImReKHNeJjFeMVdeIjVeISxeJWpeLHJeISI=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9a40d7e2b974",
      "text": "  你們這裡有多少人？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^*{^(s^-j^$s^\"x^#<^!<^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeKnteKHNeLWpeJHNeInheIzxeITxeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_920396401228",
      "text": "  立刻離開這裡。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^0'^.Y^)`^)F^(s^-j^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeMCdeLlleKWBeKUZeKHNeLWpeISI=",
      "byte_length": 23
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e4087dc5b084",
      "text": "  好吧。我這就走。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^+i^*I^!\"^$%^(s^*J^.&^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeK2leKkleISJeJCVeKHNeKkpeLiZeISI=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a2e9b66f9014",
      "text": "很好。那就快點滾，別靠近綠洲！這是給你的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*K^+i^!\"^)!^*J^*L^*;^,z^*A^*H^.C^(l^3V^76^*W^(s^,X^'A^*F^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipLXitpXiEiXikhXipKXipMXio7Xix6XipBXipIXi5DXihsXjNWXjc2XipXXihzXixYXidBXipGXiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8c8972780b31",
      "text": "警告！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(S^+B^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihTXitCXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 10
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c1eaeecafc23",
      "text": "我、我這就給你們讓路。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^!!^$%^(s^*J^'A^*F^*{^-}^(a^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiEhXiQlXihzXipKXidBXipGXip7Xi19XihhXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ddfb6f8103f0",
      "text": "站住！你現在哪都別想去！你為什麼會在這裡？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^->^*z^*W^*F^&?^\"d^+I^)$^*H^,1^\"6^*W^*F^%{^!=^.T^$r^\"d^(s^-j^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi0+Xip6XipXXipGXiY/XiJkXitJXikkXipIXiwxXiI2XipXXipGXiV7XiE9Xi5UXiRyXiJkXihzXi1qXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_14e1fd400bf3",
      "text": "我這就去辦。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^(s^*J^\"6^2L^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXihzXipKXiI2XjJMXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 19
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7dee8ea9f4af",
      "text": "塔坎，德拉吉的聖堂武士。你找他有什麼事？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"o^/%^*A^#j^$6^\"D^&Z^'Z^42^%J^+a^!\"^*F^$/^!@^$s^!=^.T^*r^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJvXi8lXipBXiNqXiQ2XiJEXiZaXidaXjQyXiVKXithXiEiXipGXiQvXiFAXiRzXiE9Xi5UXipyXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_825732072e62",
      "text": "很好！看來你想見識見識德拉吉精銳部隊的厲害！那就成全你！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*K^+i^*W^*Q^!O^*F^,1^-m^(R^-m^(R^#j^$6^\"D^'7^;W^)#^)U^&Z^+:^#/^*W^)!^*J^$$^!h^*F^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipLXitpXipXXipRXiFPXipGXiwxXi1tXihSXi1tXihSXiNqXiQ2XiJEXic3XjtXXikjXilVXiZaXis6XiMvXipXXikhXipKXiQkXiFoXipGXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0dd0262e22a2",
      "text": "你嚇不倒我！現在告訴我你為什麼在這裡，否則我就叫 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^\"X^!)^!X^$%^*W^&?^\"d^+B^-t^$%^*F^%{^!=^.T^\"d^(s^-j^*A^\"H^!x^$%^*J^+< ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiJYXiEpXiFYXiQlXipXXiY/XiJkXitCXi10XiQlXipGXiV7XiE9Xi5UXiJkXihzXi1qXipBXiJIXiF4XiQlXipKXis8IA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a036e49a66ef",
      "text": "其他衛兵過來！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!j^!@^(=^+,^(x^!O^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFqXiFAXig9XissXih4XiFPXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 22
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_69e41d7a5401",
      "text": "我投降！你說什麼我都照辦，只要別傷害我！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^$3^)N^*W^*F^-x^!=^.T^$%^)$^/x^2L^*A^\"?^(C^*H^!^^#/^$%^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiQzXilOXipXXipGXi14XiE9Xi5UXiQlXikkXi94XjJMXipBXiI/XihDXipIXiFeXiMvXiQlXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f3ba71d53b89",
      "text": "自從我們來到這裡，那個德魯伊就一直在找我們麻煩。既然你為他賣命， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'l^#f^$%^*{^!O^!u^(s^-j^*A^)!^!V^#j^/K^!E^*J^!%^&`^\"d^$/^$%^*{^*6^-!^!\"^,U^&\"^*F^%{^!@^.$^\"N^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XidsXiNmXiQlXip7XiFPXiF1XihzXi1qXipBXikhXiFWXiNqXi9LXiFFXipKXiElXiZgXiJkXiQvXiQlXip7Xio2Xi0hXiEiXixVXiYiXipGXiV7XiFAXi4kXiJOXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 97
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3775f64a80c4",
      "text": "那你就非死不可！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^*F^*J^)i^%L^!)^\"A^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXipGXipKXilpXiVMXiEpXiJBXipX",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bad2e932aa14",
      "text": "哼，到別的地方去取水吧。用不了多久，這座綠洲就會 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+K^*A^!u^*H^&Z^\"e^$]^\"6^\":^%V^*I^!\"^&H^!)^*D^\"x^!.^*A^(s^/_^3V^76^*J^$r ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitLXipBXiF1XipIXiZaXiJlXiRdXiI2XiI6XiVWXipJXiEiXiZIXiEpXipEXiJ4XiEuXipBXihzXi9fXjNWXjc2XipKXiRyIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_74e96f6a412f",
      "text": "變成一片只剩黃沙的廢土。現在給我滾——別逼我動手。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(U^$$^!%^&1^\"?^8U^*7^%]^&Z^#W^\"c^!\"^&?^\"d^'A^$%^,z^*n^*n^*H^.1^$%^\"%^$+^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihVXiQkXiElXiYxXiI/XjhVXio3XiVdXiZaXiNXXiJjXiEiXiY/XiJkXidBXiQlXix6XipuXipuXipIXi4xXiQlXiIlXiQrXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_30f54b7899c7",
      "text": "我給過你警告了！衛兵！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^'A^(x^*F^(S^+B^*D^*W^(=^+,^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXidBXih4XipGXihTXitCXipEXipXXig9XissXipX",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6fea0c3797f1",
      "text": "那麼，就流浪到別處去，否則休怪我們不客氣。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^.T^*A^*J^%j^,r^!u^*H^(,^\"6^*A^\"H^!x^!G^#s^$%^*{^!)^+q^%U^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXi5UXipBXipKXiVqXixyXiF1XipIXigsXiI2XipBXiJIXiF4XiFHXiNzXiQlXip7XiEpXitxXiVVXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_95dfe54d0dd1",
      "text": "喔？讓我看看手令。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+T^.V^-}^$%^*Q^*Q^$+^*w^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitUXi5WXi19XiQlXipRXipRXiQrXip3XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 28
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_575730e29e80",
      "text": "我什麼都不會告訴你！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^!=^.T^)$^!)^$r^+B^-t^*F^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiE9Xi5UXikkXiEpXiRyXitCXi10XipGXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 31
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d7088d4e84b0",
      "text": "我們本該在此地清查據報出沒於這一帶、騎乘著 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^$x^(M^\"d^%I^\"e^,u^%&^5T^+`^!q^%\\^$^^(s^!%^#N^!!^0K^0O^-a ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7XiR4XihNXiJkXiVJXiJlXix1XiUmXjVUXitgXiFxXiVcXiReXihzXiElXiNOXiEhXjBLXjBPXi1hIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_87e014e2c21c",
      "text": "雙足飛龍的強盜。我們的領袖塔坎正在施展法術收集情報。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)_^(^^)z^*>^&Z^#]^0!^!\"^$%^*{^&Z^)s^7G^\"o^/%^%H^\"d^$_^+x^%b^(<^$M^)]^,0^+`^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XilfXiheXil6Xio+XiZaXiNdXjAhXiEiXiQlXip7XiZaXilzXjdHXiJvXi8lXiVIXiJkXiRfXit4XiViXig8XiRNXildXiwwXitgXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_62e0bbaecf77",
      "text": "照他的運氣看來，我們八成得待到這座綠洲生機耗盡為止了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^/x^!@^&Z^.4^%U^*Q^!O^*A^$%^*{^50^$$^#e^,*^!u^(s^/_^3V^76^&F^%>^'X^-1^%{^%G^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi94XiFAXiZaXi40XiVVXipRXiFPXipBXiQlXip7XjUwXiQkXiNlXiwqXiF1XihzXi9fXjNWXjc2XiZGXiU+XidYXi0xXiV7XiVHXipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fef8051a88bc",
      "text": "整個營地周圍都駐紮著衛兵，大概有二十來人。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$T^!V^&'^\"e^\"L^\"`^)$^1f^8\"^-a^(=^+,^*A^\"z^,d^$s^!5^*Y^!O^!<^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRUXiFWXiYnXiJlXiJMXiJgXikkXjFmXjgiXi1hXig9XissXipBXiJ6XixkXiRzXiE1XipZXiFPXiE8XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bb205a4e4a24",
      "text": "聖堂武士就在綠洲西南側的營地裡。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'Z^42^%J^+a^*J^\"d^3V^76^-l^\"/^!\\^&Z^&'^\"e^-j^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XidaXjQyXiVKXithXipKXiJkXjNWXjc2Xi1sXiIvXiFcXiZaXiYnXiJlXi1qXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 49
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1c8a1b6ab049",
      "text": "站住！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^->^*z^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi0+Xip6XipX",
      "byte_length": 9
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_03624d620a12",
      "text": "  我是背下來的。只有他本人能聽。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^,X^.r^!(^!O^&Z^!\"^\"?^$s^!@^$x^!<^'b^-X^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeLFheLnJeISheIU9eJlpeISJeIj9eJHNeIUBeJHheITxeJ2JeLVheISI=",
      "byte_length": 47
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7720e9e834d4",
      "text": "  好吧。就在這裡。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^+i^*I^!\"^*J^\"d^(s^-j^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeK2leKkleISJeKkpeImReKHNeLWpeISI=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_df3f9d0859af",
      "text": "  投降，否則受死！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$3^)N^*A^\"H^!x^\";^%L^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJDNeKU5eKkFeIkheIXheIjteJUxeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2c714835ef7e",
      "text": "  我一定是來這裡的路上弄丟了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^!%^#.^,X^!O^(s^-j^&Z^(a^!'^/`^*q^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeISVeIy5eLFheIU9eKHNeLWpeJlpeKGFeISdeL2BeKnFeKkReISI=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cdc1511775d9",
      "text": "  我給忘了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^'A^0]^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeJ0FeMF1eKkReISI=",
      "byte_length": 17
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a1ec8e1f103f",
      "text": "  放肆！這只有你們的長官才能看！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$P^2>^*W^(s^\"?^$s^*F^*{^&Z^)C^#-^$,^'b^*Q^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJFBeMj5eKldeKHNeIj9eJHNeKkZeKnteJlpeKUNeIy1eJCxeJ2JeKlFeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 47
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_54a8ecc530c8",
      "text": "我放肆？！你們竟敢冒充信使！衛兵！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^$P^2>^.V^*W^*F^*{^28^/m^/P^5.^!U^!N^*W^(=^+,^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiRQXjI+Xi5WXipXXipGXip7XjI4Xi9tXi9QXjUuXiFVXiFOXipXXig9XissXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1b04ee7dad99",
      "text": "對不起。我這就給您讓路。營地的口令是 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#:^!)^.(^!\"^$%^(s^*J^'A^4:^-}^(a^!\"^&'^\"e^&Z^\"<^*w^,X ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiM6XiEpXi4oXiEiXiQlXihzXipKXidBXjQ6Xi19XihhXiEiXiYnXiJlXiZaXiI8Xip3XixYIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_12eb2c826ad8",
      "text": "「塵捲風」，免得又有其他人攔阻你們。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!#^\"p^0c^)y^!$^*A^!e^#e^+;^$s^!j^!@^!<^9n^)L^*F^*{^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEjXiJwXjBjXil5XiEkXipBXiFlXiNlXis7XiRzXiFqXiFAXiE8XjluXilMXipGXip7XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bf40b6ceebdd",
      "text": "你嚇不倒我！衛兵！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^\"X^!)^!X^$%^*W^(=^+,^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiJYXiEpXiFYXiQlXipXXig9XissXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 28
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_506252632162",
      "text": "所有信使都知道弄丟公文手令的代價是什麼！那就是死！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$)^$s^!U^!N^)$^&h^(y^/`^*q^3:^$W^$+^*w^&Z^*v^+&^,X^!=^.T^*W^)!^*J^,X^%L^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQpXiRzXiFVXiFOXikkXiZoXih5Xi9gXipxXjM6XiRXXiQrXip3XiZaXip2XismXixYXiE9Xi5UXipXXikhXipKXixYXiVMXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_35c00947a9e5",
      "text": "忘了？少騙人了。你們肯定是給那個德魯伊賣命的！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^0]^*D^.V^#<^.{^!<^*D^!\"^*F^*{^-Z^#.^,X^'A^)!^!V^#j^/K^!E^.$^\"N^&Z^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjBdXipEXi5WXiM8Xi57XiE8XipEXiEiXipGXip7Xi1aXiMuXixYXidBXikhXiFWXiNqXi9LXiFFXi4kXiJOXiZaXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b6f1709c46b8",
      "text": "告訴我是什麼口信。如果夠重要，我會轉達給他。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+B^-t^$%^,X^!=^.T^\"<^!U^!\"^#$^%!^+d^))^(C^*A^$%^$r^(i^(z^'A^!@^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitCXi10XiQlXixYXiE9Xi5UXiI8XiFVXiEiXiMkXiUhXitkXikpXihDXipBXiQlXiRyXihpXih6XidBXiFAXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d350e9798e64",
      "text": "我什麼都沒看到！你在耍什麼花樣？！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^!=^.T^)$^%\\^*Q^!u^*W^*F^\"d^7E^!=^.T^'w^,f^.V^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiE9Xi5UXikkXiVcXipRXiF1XipXXipGXiJkXjdFXiE9Xi5UXid3XixmXi5WXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d7273d47bba5",
      "text": "嘗試使用心靈異能說服他？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^1o^-u^!N^&H^#k^)g^&M^'b^-x^,\\^!@^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjFvXi11XiFOXiZIXiNrXilnXiZNXidiXi14XixcXiFAXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 37
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f3bfb32c86c4",
      "text": "你的異能對我沒用！衛兵！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^&Z^&M^'b^#:^$%^%\\^&H^*W^(=^+,^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiZaXiZNXidiXiM6XiQlXiVcXiZIXipXXig9XissXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 37
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f5ad1a2c1382",
      "text": "噢……在這裡……就在我的手裡。好吧，你們可以進去 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+]^*o^*o^\"d^(s^-j^*o^*o^*J^\"d^$%^&Z^$+^-j^!\"^+i^*I^*A^*F^*{^\"A^!B^(w^\"6 ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitdXipvXipvXiJkXihzXi1qXipvXipvXipKXiJkXiQlXiZaXiQrXi1qXiEiXitpXipJXipBXipGXip7XiJBXiFCXih3XiI2IA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_82ab75ad7dd7",
      "text": "營地了。要是被任何人攔下，口令是 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&'^\"e^*D^!\"^(C^,X^(@^!C^!L^!<^9n^!(^*A^\"<^*w^,X ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiYnXiJlXipEXiEiXihDXixYXihAXiFDXiFMXiE8XjluXiEoXipBXiI8Xip3XixYIA==",
      "byte_length": 49
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8d30bfd262b6",
      "text": "「塵捲風」。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!#^\"p^0c^)y^!$^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEjXiJwXjBjXil5XiEkXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 19
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d0f8918c56fe",
      "text": "聖堂武士恢復了神智！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'Z^42^%J^+a^#u^#g^*D^&w^$i^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XidaXjQyXiVKXithXiN1XiNnXipEXiZ3XiRpXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 31
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2eaf9d222040",
      "text": "你居然讓我殘殺自己的部隊！我要把你碎屍萬段！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^+w^&\"^-}^$%^,l^%M^'l^#I^&Z^)#^)U^*W^$%^(C^$1^*F^&o^#?^-_^.l^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXit3XiYiXi19XiQlXixsXiVNXidsXiNJXiZaXikjXilVXipXXiQlXihDXiQxXipGXiZvXiM/Xi1fXi5sXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_45f9aba3ff49",
      "text": "趁他們更多人趕來之前，你們最好快點上路。快動身吧！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.)^!@^*{^$o^\"x^!<^0u^!O^!/^!z^*A^*F^*{^$q^+i^*L^*;^!'^(a^!\"^*L^\"%^(c^*I^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi4pXiFAXip7XiRvXiJ4XiE8XjB1XiFPXiEvXiF6XipBXipGXip7XiRxXitpXipMXio7XiEnXihhXiEiXipMXiIlXihjXipJXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_993706fe8ce7",
      "text": "快走吧！接下來只能靠你們自己了！祝好運！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*L^.&^*I^*W^$?^!(^!O^\"?^'b^.C^*F^*{^'l^#I^*D^*W^&v^+i^.4^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipMXi4mXipJXipXXiQ/XiEoXiFPXiI/XidiXi5DXipGXip7XidsXiNJXipEXipXXiZ2XitpXi40XipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f02ae5df5e6a",
      "text": "快走！更多守衛很快就會來搜尋你們了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*L^.&^*W^$o^\"x^#+^(=^*K^*L^*J^$r^!O^/h^#9^*F^*{^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipMXi4mXipXXiRvXiJ4XiMrXig9XipLXipMXipKXiRyXiFPXi9oXiM5XipGXip7XipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_62fe59c9e6bc",
      "text": "你們好，陌生人。我是老獨眼。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^+i^*A^9z^&F^!<^!\"^$%^,X^'U^/z^&d^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XitpXipBXjl6XiZGXiE8XiEiXiQlXixYXidVXi96XiZkXiEi",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ae6f8a109121",
      "text": "又見面了！有什麼我可以為你們效勞的？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+;^-m^)j^*D^*W^$s^!=^.T^$%^\"A^!B^%{^*F^*{^$Q^/R^&Z^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "Xis7Xi1tXilqXipEXipXXiRzXiE9Xi5UXiQlXiJBXiFCXiV7XipGXip7XiRRXi9SXiZaXi5W",
      "byte_length": 54
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a3116fa082e3",
      "text": "  跟我說說外面的荒野吧。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^.+^$%^-x^-x^\"w^)j^&Z^1W^.:^*I^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLiteJCVeLXheLXheIndeKWpeJlpeMVdeLjpeKkleISI=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2d201c4363ca",
      "text": "  幫我逃出這裡！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^+}^$%^(p^!q^(s^-j^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeK31eJCVeKHBeIXFeKHNeLWpeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 23
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8173f6dac09c",
      "text": "  你是如何在沙漠中生存下來的？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^,X^#$^!L^\"d^%]^,}^!,^&F^#*^!(^!O^&Z^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeLFheIyReIUxeImReJV1eLH1eISxeJkZeIypeISheIU9eJlpeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6c42a7385b52",
      "text": "  逃跑的奴隸都去哪裡了？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^(p^(_^&Z^##^)Z^)$^\"6^+I^-j^*D^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKHBeKF9eJlpeIyNeKVpeKSReIjZeK0leLWpeKkReLlY=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_11fbc97d1350",
      "text": "  外面有什麼樣的野獸怪物？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^\"w^)j^$s^!=^.T^,f^&Z^.:^&<^#s^&4^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIndeKWpeJHNeIT1eLlReLGZeJlpeLjpeJjxeI3NeJjReLlY=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c22bcfcbc28c",
      "text": "  我該如何逃跑？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^(M^#$^!L^(p^(_^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeKE1eIyReIUxeKHBeKF9eLlY=",
      "byte_length": 23
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6f3c3242c7f6",
      "text": "  說重點！我到底要怎麼出去？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^-x^))^*;^*W^$%^!u^/^^(C^,,^.T^!q^\"6^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLXheKSleKjteKldeJCVeIXVeL15eKENeLCxeLlReIXFeIjZeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_987c9d84bf3f",
      "text": "  你能幫我逃出這裡嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^'b^+}^$%^(p^!q^(s^-j^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeJ2JeK31eJCVeKHBeIXFeKHNeLWpeK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5ee15081e65a",
      "text": "多謝你的幫忙。再會。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"x^-z^*F^&Z^+}^,+^!\"^!l^$r^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJ4Xi16XipGXiZaXit9XiwrXiEiXiFsXiRyXiEi",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_00d863fc1d13",
      "text": "那片沙漠簡直是一場噩夢。多年前我自己也曾在外面流浪，到處尋找 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^&1^%]^,}^3y^&`^,X^!%^\"n^/X^\"y^!\"^\"x^+~^!z^$%^'l^#I^!1^.j^\"d^\"w^)j^%j^,r^*A^!u^(,^#9^$/ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXiYxXiVdXix9XjN5XiZgXixYXiElXiJuXi9YXiJ5XiEiXiJ4Xit+XiF6XiQlXidsXiNJXiExXi5qXiJkXiJ3XilqXiVqXixyXipBXiF1XigsXiM5XiQvIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fd89975ce5a2",
      "text": "水源。那是最大的難題——如果自己變成了一堆乾渴的枯骨， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%V^%q^!\"^)!^,X^$q^\"z^&Z^)a^.G^*n^*n^#$^%!^'l^#I^(U^$$^*D^!%^*[^*X^,w^&Z^5Z^*$^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVWXiVxXiEiXikhXixYXiRxXiJ6XiZaXilhXi5HXipuXipuXiMkXiUhXidsXiNJXihVXiQkXipEXiElXipbXipYXix3XiZaXjVaXiokXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_edbb0dbf10ff",
      "text": "外面就算有再多怪物也都不重要了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"w^)j^*J^-C^$s^!l^\"x^#s^&4^!1^)$^!)^))^(C^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJ3XilqXipKXi1DXiRzXiFsXiJ4XiNzXiY0XiExXikkXiEpXikpXihDXipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 48
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8c8086437cf9",
      "text": "你們該不會是在動逃跑的念頭吧？要是敢嘗試，那些守衛會剁掉你們的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^(M^!)^$r^,X^\"d^\"%^(p^(_^&Z^1z^)t^*I^.V^(C^,X^/m^1o^-u^*A^)!^!8^#+^(=^$r^=G^/e^*F^*{^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XihNXiEpXiRyXixYXiJkXiIlXihwXihfXiZaXjF6Xil0XipJXi5WXihDXixYXi9tXjFvXi11XipBXikhXiE4XiMrXig9XiRyXj1HXi9lXipGXip7XiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 94
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c7701a0907df",
      "text": "手指。就算闖過了他們那一關，你們的腦漿也會在沙漠烈日下烤乾沸騰。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$+^$8^!\"^*J^-C^.z^(x^*D^!@^*{^)!^!%^.>^*A^*F^*{^&Z^2@^%v^!1^$r^\"d^%]^,}^%|^$a^!(^/w^*X^5\\^.O^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQrXiQ4XiEiXipKXi1DXi56Xih4XipEXiFAXip7XikhXiElXi4+XipBXipGXip7XiZaXjJAXiV2XiExXiRyXiJkXiVdXix9XiV8XiRhXiEoXi93XipYXjVcXi5PXiEi",
      "byte_length": 96
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9c4df15c9fbc",
      "text": "我曾跟隨商人車隊同行，但那跟獨自留在荒原上一樣 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^.j^.+^)X^1'^!<^5%^)U^\"E^(;^*A^!I^)!^.+^/z^'l^-+^\"d^1W^\"5^!'^!%^,f ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXi5qXi4rXilYXjEnXiE8XjUlXilVXiJFXig7XipBXiFJXikhXi4rXi96XidsXi0rXiJkXjFXXiI1XiEnXiElXixmIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0b338503f023",
      "text": "凶險。那些人很多隨時都想割開你的喉嚨搶奪一切。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^3e^*m^!\"^)!^!8^!<^*K^\"x^)X^$f^)$^,1^+1^)F^*F^&Z^/V^/Y^1?^1,^!%^+.^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XjNlXiptXiEiXikhXiE4XiE8XipLXiJ4XilYXiRmXikkXiwxXisxXilGXipGXiZaXi9WXi9ZXjE/XjEsXiElXisuXiEi",
      "byte_length": 69
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1852fb5f3dce",
      "text": "有些逃跑的奴隸聚集在一起建立了村落。不過都維持不久。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$s^!8^(p^(_^&Z^##^)Z^'[^)]^\"d^!%^.(^,'^0'^*D^$z^-`^!\"^!)^(x^)$^'F^$7^!)^!.^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRzXiE4XihwXihfXiZaXiMjXilaXidbXildXiJkXiElXi4oXiwnXjAnXipEXiR6Xi1gXiEiXiEpXih4XikkXidGXiQ3XiEpXiEuXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5f9d31b0d2ca",
      "text": "他們往往在不知不覺中耗盡了水源，然後不是渴死，就是爬回來 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^*{^,)^,)^\"d^!)^&h^!)^(G^!,^'X^-1^*D^%V^%q^*A^&\"^#b^!)^,X^,w^%L^*A^*J^,X^/y^\"\\^!O ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXip7XiwpXiwpXiJkXiEpXiZoXiEpXihHXiEsXidYXi0xXipEXiVWXiVxXipBXiYiXiNiXiEpXixYXix3XiVMXipBXipKXixYXi95XiJcXiFPIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6388a023c027",
      "text": "甘願領受酷刑懲罰。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^/:^.H^)s^\";^1b^9|^/b^0-^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi86Xi5IXilzXiI7XjFiXjl8Xi9iXjAtXiEi",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_56e51faf6b72",
      "text": "凡是你能想像到的恐怖魔物，外頭全都有。我見過最可怕的是一頭地陷蟲 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+-^,X^*F^'b^,1^!`^!u^&Z^#t^#p^*0^&4^*A^\"w^)t^!h^)$^$s^!\"^$%^-m^(x^$q^\"A^0^^&Z^,X^!%^)t^\"e^)S^(8 ",
      "encoded_base64": "XistXixYXipGXidiXiwxXiFgXiF1XiZaXiN0XiNwXiowXiY0XipBXiJ3Xil0XiFoXikkXiRzXiEiXiQlXi1tXih4XiRxXiJBXjBeXiZaXixYXiElXil0XiJlXilTXig4IA==",
      "byte_length": 97
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0d2133fd7683",
      "text": "。它在灌木平原上襲擊了我們。我逃了出來，但它奪走了我的一隻眼睛。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!\"^+o^\"d^0o^$v^0Y^\"5^!'^08^$F^*D^$%^*{^!\"^$%^(p^*D^!q^!O^*A^!I^+o^1,^.&^*D^$%^&Z^!%^)[^&d^&f^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEiXitvXiJkXjBvXiR2XjBZXiI1XiEnXjA4XiRGXipEXiQlXip7XiEiXiQlXihwXipEXiFxXiFPXipBXiFJXitvXjEsXi4mXipEXiQlXiZaXiElXilbXiZkXiZmXiEi",
      "byte_length": 96
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b9616ca8efbe",
      "text": "你們逃不出這裡的。打消這個念頭吧，乖乖待在 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^(p^!)^!q^(s^-j^&Z^!\"^$-^%k^(s^!V^1z^)t^*I^*A^0{^0{^,*^\"d ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XihwXiEpXiFxXihzXi1qXiZaXiEiXiQtXiVrXihzXiFWXjF6Xil0XipJXipBXjB7XjB7XiwqXiJkIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_40d5eb1690cd",
      "text": "你們現在的位置認命吧。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^&?^\"d^&Z^!J^'Q^(O^\"N^*I^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiY/XiJkXiZaXiFKXidRXihPXiJOXipJXiEi",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fe86a07a894d",
      "text": "隨時歡迎回來。我的朋友們大多都死了，或者被遣送 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)X^$f^%F^(k^\"\\^!O^!\"^$%^&Z^,[^\"8^*{^\"z^\"x^)$^%L^*D^*A^$'^'V^(@^4k^./ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XilYXiRmXiVGXihrXiJcXiFPXiEiXiQlXiZaXixbXiI4Xip7XiJ6XiJ4XikkXiVMXipEXipBXiQnXidWXihAXjRrXi4vIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_09489752319c",
      "text": "走了。能有人作伴我很高興。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.&^*D^!\"^'b^$s^!<^!M^1h^$%^*K^*+^-]^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi4mXipEXiEiXidiXiRzXiE8XiFNXjFoXiQlXipLXiorXi1dXiEi",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7e06d5860515",
      "text": "主要的出口在大門的守衛身後。你得分散他們的注意力，好讓你們能在他們 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!-^(C^&Z^!q^\"<^\"d^\"z^)D^&Z^#+^(=^(c^#b^!\"^*F^#e^!s^$S^!@^*{^&Z^%e^#z^!~^*A^+i^-}^*F^*{^'b^\"d^!@^*{ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEtXihDXiZaXiFxXiI8XiJkXiJ6XilEXiZaXiMrXig9XihjXiNiXiEiXipGXiNlXiFzXiRTXiFAXip7XiZaXiVlXiN6XiF+XipBXitpXi19XipGXip7XidiXiJkXiFAXip7IA==",
      "byte_length": 100
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0e9d0a28ce30",
      "text": "搞清楚狀況前發動突襲。以前也有奴隸這麼幹過——只是 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^:R^,u^,c^&7^,q^!z^&W^\"%^'*^08^!\"^!B^!z^!1^$s^##^)Z^(s^.T^,!^(x^*n^*n^\"?^,X ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjpSXix1XixjXiY3XixxXiF6XiZXXiIlXicqXjA4XiEiXiFCXiF6XiExXiRzXiMjXilaXihzXi5UXiwhXih4XipuXipuXiI/XixYIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9d25e62254ed",
      "text": "難度極高。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)a^#V^1D^*+^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XilhXiNWXjFEXiorXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 16
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_451f8593bbb6",
      "text": "既然你們這麼好心聽我絮叨了半天， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,U^&\"^*F^*{^(s^.T^+i^#k^-X^$%^8<^82^*D^\"-^+e^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XixVXiYiXipGXip7XihzXi5UXitpXiNrXi1YXiQlXjg8XjgyXipEXiItXitlXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 49
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b271c68992a8",
      "text": "我就幫你們逃出這裡吧。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*J^+}^*F^*{^(p^!q^(s^-j^*I^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXipKXit9XipGXip7XihwXiFxXihzXi1qXipJXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1319dbe307d3",
      "text": "既然你們已經狠狠教訓了那些守衛，我這裡有一件禮物要送給你們。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,U^&\"^*F^*{^#J^'D^4T^4T^,R^-p^*D^)!^!8^#+^(=^*A^$%^(s^-j^$s^!%^.W^-8^&4^(C^./^'A^*F^*{^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XixVXiYiXipGXip7XiNKXidEXjRUXjRUXixSXi1wXipEXikhXiE4XiMrXig9XipBXiQlXihzXi1qXiRzXiElXi5XXi04XiY0XihDXi4vXidBXipGXip7XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_10cdb670ee43",
      "text": "我原本一直留著這東西準備自己逃跑時用，但屬於我的時代已經過去了，你們 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^\"5^$x^!%^&`^-+^-a^(s^,`^-l^,x^+\"^'l^#I^(p^(_^$f^&H^*A^!I^#C^$^^$%^&Z^$f^*v^#J^'D^(x^\"6^*D^*A^*F^*{ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiI1XiR4XiElXiZgXi0rXi1hXihzXixgXi1sXix4XisiXidsXiNJXihwXihfXiRmXiZIXipBXiFJXiNDXiReXiQlXiZaXiRmXip2XiNKXidEXih4XiI2XipEXipBXipGXip7IA==",
      "byte_length": 103
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_42877293c2e7",
      "text": "比我更用得著它。拿去吧，這張卷軸是你們的了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,m^$%^$o^&H^#e^-a^+o^!\"^,G^\"6^*I^*A^(s^,(^\"3^(e^,X^*F^*{^&Z^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XixtXiQlXiRvXiZIXiNlXi1hXitvXiEiXixHXiI2XipJXipBXihzXiwoXiIzXihlXixYXipGXip7XiZaXipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c65d3774bc70",
      "text": "現在快離開這裡，免得他們派更多人來搜捕你們！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&?^\"d^*L^)`^)F^(s^-j^*A^!e^#e^!@^*{^.n^$o^\"x^!<^!O^/h^4?^*F^*{^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiY/XiJkXipMXilgXilGXihzXi1qXipBXiFlXiNlXiFAXip7Xi5uXiRvXiJ4XiE8XiFPXi9oXjQ/XipGXip7XipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_819af363e480",
      "text": "逃離這裡有兩條路。一條是穿過大門守衛，在那裡我可以幫你們 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(p^)`^(s^-j^$s^!i^%.^(a^!\"^!%^%.^,X^')^(x^\"z^)D^#+^(=^*A^\"d^)!^-j^$%^\"A^!B^+}^*F^*{ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihwXilgXihzXi1qXiRzXiFpXiUuXihhXiEiXiElXiUuXixYXicpXih4XiJ6XilEXiMrXig9XipBXiJkXikhXi1qXiQlXiJBXiFCXit9XipGXip7IA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_233db59e0685",
      "text": "一把。另一條在東邊——骨牆上有個薄弱脆弱的缺口。如果你們 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!%^$1^!\"^\">^!%^%.^\"d^,`^.8^*n^*n^*$^&0^!'^$s^!V^6o^#\\^2?^#\\^&Z^7e^\"<^!\"^#$^%!^*F^*{ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiElXiQxXiEiXiI+XiElXiUuXiJkXixgXi44XipuXipuXiokXiYwXiEnXiRzXiFWXjZvXiNcXjI/XiNcXiZaXjdlXiI8XiEiXiMkXiUhXipGXip7IA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f175672fa57b",
      "text": "能砸垮它，就能逃出去。你們想試哪一條路？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'b^0#^.^^+o^*A^*J^'b^(p^!q^\"6^!\"^*F^*{^,1^-u^+I^!%^%.^(a^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XidiXjAjXi5eXitvXipBXipKXidiXihwXiFxXiI2XiEiXipGXip7XiwxXi11XitJXiElXiUuXihhXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e17f3340af13",
      "text": "  你能引開守衛的注意力嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^'b^#Z^)F^#+^(=^&Z^%e^#z^!~^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeJ2JeI1peKUZeIyteKD1eJlpeJWVeI3peIX5eK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0bea6caafda1",
      "text": "  我們會去試試骨牆。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^*{^$r^\"6^-u^-u^*$^&0^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeKnteJHJeIjZeLXVeLXVeKiReJjBeISI=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_039d059d85ee",
      "text": "先算了吧。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!b^-C^*D^*I^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFiXi1DXipEXipJXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 16
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f90c07d2c327",
      "text": "好吧。要是你們改變主意，這提議依然算數。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+i^*I^!\"^(C^,X^*F^*{^$N^(U^!-^#z^*A^(s^$A^-|^!Q^&\"^-C^$V^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitpXipJXiEiXihDXixYXipGXip7XiROXihVXiEtXiN6XipBXihzXiRBXi18XiFRXiYiXi1DXiRWXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1913c33ec711",
      "text": "跟我來，我會替你們引開守衛。跟在我身後，別讓他們 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.+^$%^!O^*A^$%^$r^2o^*F^*{^#Z^)F^#+^(=^!\"^.+^\"d^$%^(c^#b^*A^*H^-}^!@^*{ ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi4rXiQlXiFPXipBXiQlXiRyXjJvXipGXip7XiNaXilGXiMrXig9XiEiXi4rXiJkXiQlXihjXiNiXipBXipIXi19XiFAXip7IA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_acbceef5a537",
      "text": "看見你們，在我引開他們之前千萬別靠近。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*Q^-m^*F^*{^*A^\"d^$%^#Z^)F^!@^*{^!/^!z^+7^-_^*H^.C^(l^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipRXi1tXipGXip7XipBXiJkXiQlXiNaXilGXiFAXip7XiEvXiF6Xis3Xi1fXipIXi5DXihsXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_760210d7ce55",
      "text": "聰明的選擇。那邊只有兩三個守衛。不過我不建議你們 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^2=^$c^&Z^.6^,N^!\"^)!^.8^\"?^$s^!i^!&^!V^#+^(=^!\"^!)^(x^$%^!)^,'^-|^*F^*{ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjI9XiRjXiZaXi42XixOXiEiXikhXi44XiI/XiRzXiFpXiEmXiFWXiMrXig9XiEiXiEpXih4XiQlXiEpXiwnXi18XipGXip7IA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_015a5004ca6e",
      "text": "在幹掉他們之後還在那裡磨蹭逗留。其他守衛很快就會 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"d^,!^/e^!@^*{^!/^#b^.7^\"d^)!^-j^-7^9)^;;^-+^!\"^!j^!@^#+^(=^*K^*L^*J^$r ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJkXiwhXi9lXiFAXip7XiEvXiNiXi43XiJkXikhXi1qXi03XjkpXjs7Xi0rXiEiXiFqXiFAXiMrXig9XipLXipMXipKXiRyIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b59c082b960b",
      "text": "追殺過來。我會盡可能帶你們接近那裡。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(o^%M^(x^!O^!\"^$%^$r^-1^\"A^'b^#N^*F^*{^$?^(l^)!^-j^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihvXiVNXih4XiFPXiEiXiQlXiRyXi0xXiJBXidiXiNOXipGXip7XiQ/XihsXikhXi1qXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_05a8e27c70b1",
      "text": "我只能送你們到這裡了。圍欄就在東邊不遠處。祝你們 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^\"?^'b^./^*F^*{^!u^(s^-j^*D^!\"^\"`^%C^*J^\"d^,`^.8^!)^({^(,^!\"^&v^*F^*{ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiI/XidiXi4vXipGXip7XiF1XihzXi1qXipEXiEiXiJgXiVDXipKXiJkXixgXi44XiEpXih7XigsXiEiXiZ2XipGXip7IA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_99a14a82c446",
      "text": "一切順利。如果你們真的能活下來，一定要回來徹底摧毀這座 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!%^+.^.D^!t^!\"^#$^%!^*F^*{^-2^&Z^'b^%i^!(^!O^*A^!%^#.^(C^\"\\^!O^18^/^^$E^%N^(s^/_ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiElXisuXi5EXiF0XiEiXiMkXiUhXipGXip7Xi0yXiZaXidiXiVpXiEoXiFPXipBXiElXiMuXihDXiJcXiFPXjE4Xi9eXiRFXiVOXihzXi9fIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a8c138ff7852",
      "text": "該死的城邦。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(M^%L^&Z^+_^1a^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihNXiVMXiZaXitfXjFhXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 19
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2cfa38a4e74d",
      "text": "現在你們比我更需要它。拿去吧，拿上這張卷軸。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&?^\"d^*F^*{^,m^$%^$o^)e^(C^+o^!\"^,G^\"6^*I^*A^,G^!'^(s^,(^\"3^(e^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiY/XiJkXipGXip7XixtXiQlXiRvXillXihDXitvXiEiXixHXiI2XipJXipBXixHXiEnXihzXiwoXiIzXihlXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_466dbed2db66",
      "text": "多趕路，少廢話！快帶你們逃出去。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"x^0u^(a^*A^#<^#W^-v^*W^*L^#N^*F^*{^(p^!q^\"6^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJ4XjB1XihhXipBXiM8XiNXXi12XipXXipMXiNOXipGXip7XihwXiFxXiI2XiEi",
      "byte_length": 48
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_432d757aa9c8",
      "text": "快走吧，我可沒有多餘的歲月可以揮霍！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*L^.&^*I^*A^$%^\"A^%\\^$s^\"x^1e^&Z^,j^/p^\"A^!B^2\"^;%^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipMXi4mXipJXipBXiQlXiJBXiVcXiRzXiJ4XjFlXiZaXixqXi9wXiJBXiFCXjIiXjslXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6219ae1f52d9",
      "text": "  好的。在前帶路吧！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^+i^&Z^!\"^\"d^!z^#N^(a^*I^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeK2leJlpeISJeImReIXpeI05eKGFeKkleKlc=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e77c59b0be14",
      "text": "  算了。我改變心意了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^-C^*D^!\"^$%^$N^(U^#k^#z^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLUNeKkReISJeJCVeJE5eKFVeI2teI3peKkReISIg",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_04207b68a6b0",
      "text": "好。我們出發！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+i^!\"^$%^*{^!q^&W^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitpXiEiXiQlXip7XiFxXiZXXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 22
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4cf6b11d9c6c",
      "text": "好吧。要是改變主意，你們知道去哪找我。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+i^*I^!\"^(C^,X^$N^(U^!-^#z^*A^*F^*{^&h^(y^\"6^+I^$/^$%^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitpXipJXiEiXihDXixYXiROXihVXiEtXiN6XipBXipGXip7XiZoXih5XiI2XitJXiQvXiQlXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5affa2e5f7ed",
      "text": "先退後一點，等我引開大門守衛。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!b^*V^#b^!%^*;^*A^'-^$%^#Z^)F^\"z^)D^#+^(=^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFiXipWXiNiXiElXio7XipBXictXiQlXiNaXilGXiJ6XilEXiMrXig9XiEi",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8fc2f6ac6d3e",
      "text": "保持在視線範圍內，否則當我引開守衛時，你們就無法及時撲上去突襲他們了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!T^$7^\"d^(E^'I^'0^\"`^!g^*A^\"H^!x^&N^$%^#Z^)F^#+^(=^$f^*A^*F^*{^*J^%}^%b^\"7^$f^4B^!'^\"6^'*^08^!@^*{^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFUXiQ3XiJkXihFXidJXicwXiJgXiFnXipBXiJIXiF4XiZOXiQlXiNaXilGXiMrXig9XiRmXipBXipGXip7XipKXiV9XiViXiI3XiRmXjRCXiEnXiI2XicqXjA4XiFAXip7XipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 106
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9b50ce624952",
      "text": "  好的。帶路吧！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^+i^&Z^!\"^#N^(a^*I^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeK2leJlpeISJeI05eKGFeKkleKlcg",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_351355aa6c95",
      "text": "沒錯。我們走。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%\\^)5^!\"^$%^*{^.&^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVcXik1XiEiXiQlXip7Xi4mXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 22
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_411ffdca6c93",
      "text": "好吧。要是改變主意，你們知道去哪找我。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+i^*I^!\"^(C^,X^$N^(U^!-^#z^*A^*F^*{^&h^(y^\"6^+I^$/^$%^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitpXipJXiEiXihDXixYXiROXihVXiEtXiN6XipBXipGXip7XiZoXih5XiI2XitJXiQvXiQlXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_738bed36b117",
      "text": "嘿！你們看起來可不像農田奴隸……等等……是逃跑的角鬥士！攔住他們！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+\\^*W^*F^*{^*Q^.(^!O^\"A^!)^!`^4i^;\\^##^)Z^*o^*o^'-^'-^*o^*o^,X^(p^(_^&Z^(H^*,^+a^*W^9n^*z^!@^*{^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitcXipXXipGXip7XipRXi4oXiFPXiJBXiEpXiFgXjRpXjtcXiMjXilaXipvXipvXictXictXipvXipvXixYXihwXihfXiZaXihIXiosXithXipXXjluXip6XiFAXip7XipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 100
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_90a8906cc34f",
      "text": "你們不需要我的幫忙了——接下來全靠你們自己了！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^!)^)e^(C^$%^&Z^+}^,+^*D^*n^*n^$?^!(^!O^!h^.C^*F^*{^'l^#I^*D^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiEpXillXihDXiQlXiZaXit9XiwrXipEXipuXipuXiQ/XiEoXiFPXiFoXi5DXipGXip7XidsXiNJXipEXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c9af2017a1e1",
      "text": "你想要幹什麼，獨眼？滾回去幹活！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^,1^(C^,!^!=^.T^*A^/z^&d^.V^,z^\"\\^\"6^,!^%i^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiwxXihDXiwhXiE9Xi5UXipBXi96XiZkXi5WXix6XiJcXiI2XiwhXiVpXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 49
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9de57c4def8d",
      "text": "出水管道那邊有人！看啊！有入侵者！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!q^%V^-D^(y^)!^.8^$s^!<^*W^*Q^+Q^*W^$s^!f^.X^'V^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFxXiVWXi1EXih5XikhXi44XiRzXiE8XipXXipRXitRXipXXiRzXiFmXi5YXidWXipX",
      "byte_length": 51
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b13499cf435c",
      "text": "什麼？！我們去查看一下。弟兄們，跟我來！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!=^.T^.V^*W^$%^*{^\"6^%&^*Q^!%^!(^!\"^16^1!^*{^*A^.+^$%^!O^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiE9Xi5UXi5WXipXXiQlXip7XiI2XiUmXipRXiElXiEoXiEiXjE2XjEhXip7XipBXi4rXiQlXiFPXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3fb394d7ece6",
      "text": "你聽見遠處傳來守衛們的叫喊聲。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^-X^-m^({^(,^+$^!O^#+^(=^*{^&Z^+<^+S^-W^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXi1YXi1tXih7XigsXiskXiFPXiMrXig9Xip7XiZaXis8XitTXi1XXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ff9647f50118",
      "text": "這裡根本沒人！一定是獨眼耍了我們！快！大門沒人看守了！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^-j^%)^$x^%\\^!<^*W^!%^#.^,X^/z^&d^7E^*D^$%^*{^*W^*L^*W^\"z^)D^%\\^!<^*Q^#+^*D^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXi1qXiUpXiR4XiVcXiE8XipXXiElXiMuXixYXi96XiZkXjdFXipEXiQlXip7XipXXipMXipXXiJ6XilEXiVcXiE8XipRXiMrXipEXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fa599991b1c7",
      "text": "嘿，那邊那個！立刻給我站住！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+\\^*A^)!^.8^)!^!V^*W^0'^.Y^'A^$%^->^*z^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XitcXipBXikhXi44XikhXiFWXipXXjAnXi5ZXidBXiQlXi0+Xip6XipX",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_747fbc875723",
      "text": "把你們身上帶的所有東西扔在地上，滾進圍欄裡去，爛泥！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$1^*F^*{^(c^!'^#N^&Z^$)^$s^,`^-l^8{^\"d^\"e^!'^*A^,z^(w^\"`^%C^-j^\"6^*A^&-^%d^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQxXipGXip7XihjXiEnXiNOXiZaXiQpXiRzXixgXi1sXjh7XiJkXiJlXiEnXipBXix6Xih3XiJgXiVDXi1qXiI2XipBXiYtXiVkXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7ea8d97f5aa8",
      "text": "  休想！我不是奴隸！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^!G^,1^*W^$%^!)^,X^##^)Z^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIUdeLDFeKldeJCVeISleLFheIyNeKVpeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6197661fd816",
      "text": "  好吧。我照你說的做。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^+i^*I^!\"^$%^/x^*F^-x^&Z^*~^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeK2leKkleISJeJCVeL3heKkZeLXheJlpeKn5eISI=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2a4af8f0cd46",
      "text": "逃跑的奴隸！抓住他們！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(p^(_^&Z^##^)Z^*W^$2^*z^!@^*{^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XihwXihfXiZaXiMjXilaXipXXiQyXip6XiFAXip7XipX",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f1f79804eddb",
      "text": "這就是我喜歡奴隸的地方——懦弱又順從！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^*J^,X^$%^+V^%F^##^)Z^&Z^\"e^$]^*n^*n^,7^#\\^+;^.D^#f^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXipKXixYXiQlXitWXiVGXiMjXilaXiZaXiJlXiRdXipuXipuXiw3XiNcXis7Xi5EXiNmXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b72917c233c2",
      "text": "我警告過你了！逃跑的奴隸！抓住他們！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^(S^+B^(x^*F^*D^*W^(p^(_^&Z^##^)Z^*W^$2^*z^!@^*{^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXihTXitCXih4XipGXipEXipXXihwXihfXiZaXiMjXilaXipXXiQyXip6XiFAXip7XipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ea13f9270b0a",
      "text": "嘿！離大門遠點！滾到圍欄後面去，跟你們那幫 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+\\^*W^)`^\"z^)D^({^*;^*W^,z^!u^\"`^%C^#b^)j^\"6^*A^.+^*F^*{^)!^+} ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitcXipXXilgXiJ6XilEXih7Xio7XipXXix6XiF1XiJgXiVDXiNiXilqXiI2XipBXi4rXipGXip7XikhXit9IA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d18853c33ede",
      "text": "同類待在一起！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"E^)w^,*^\"d^!%^.(^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJFXil3XiwqXiJkXiElXi4oXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 22
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f8047672bee8",
      "text": "  這是一場誤會！我們不是奴隸！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^(s^,X^!%^\"n^(P^$r^*W^$%^*{^!)^,X^##^)Z^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKHNeLFheISVeIm5eKFBeJHJeKldeJCVeKnteISleLFheIyNeKVpeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8af43b1b92ba",
      "text": "  聖堂武士？什麼聖堂武士？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^'Z^42^%J^+a^.V^!=^.T^'Z^42^%J^+a^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJ1peNDJeJUpeK2FeLlZeIT1eLlReJ1peNDJeJUpeK2FeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_76bde5cfd30a",
      "text": "  我必須和你們的長官談談！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^#l^)r^\"O^*F^*{^&Z^)C^#-^0;^0;^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeI2xeKXJeIk9eKkZeKnteJlpeKUNeIy1eMDteMDteKlc=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f87ff4562449",
      "text": "  求求你，讓我見你們的長官！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^,n^,n^*F^*A^-}^$%^-m^*F^*{^&Z^)C^#-^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLG5eLG5eKkZeKkFeLX1eJCVeLW1eKkZeKnteJlpeKUNeIy1eKlc=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7aa836101689",
      "text": "抱歉，我的錯。我這就走。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,@^,h^*A^$%^&Z^)5^!\"^$%^(s^*J^.&^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XixAXixoXipBXiQlXiZaXik1XiEiXiQlXihzXipKXi4mXiEi",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_12f9911479e0",
      "text": "哼，每個人都這麼說。好吧，就算你們以前不是奴隸， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+K^*A^%P^!V^!<^)$^(s^.T^-x^!\"^+i^*I^*A^*J^-C^*F^*{^!B^!z^!)^,X^##^)Z^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitLXipBXiVQXiFWXiE8XikkXihzXi5UXi14XiEiXitpXipJXipBXipKXi1DXipGXip7XiFCXiF6XiEpXixYXiMjXilaXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_04b472c4b884",
      "text": "你們最好也趕快認命習慣，因為只要那位聖堂武士把你們帶回 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^$q^+i^!1^0u^*L^(O^\"N^3{^$!^*A^\"]^%{^\"?^(C^)!^!J^'Z^42^%J^+a^$1^*F^*{^#N^\"\\ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiRxXitpXiExXjB1XipMXihPXiJOXjN7XiQhXipBXiJdXiV7XiI/XihDXikhXiFKXidaXjQyXiVKXithXiQxXipGXip7XiNOXiJcIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b8ba99f3703f",
      "text": "德拉吉，你們就「是」奴隸了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#j^$6^\"D^*A^*F^*{^*J^!#^,X^!$^##^)Z^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNqXiQ2XiJEXipBXipGXip7XipKXiEjXixYXiEkXiMjXilaXipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 43
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8d1f9be97ab8",
      "text": "來自德拉吉的某位聖堂武士——在奴隸欄有些奴隸逃跑之後，他 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!O^'l^#j^$6^\"D^&Z^%$^!J^'Z^42^%J^+a^*n^*n^\"d^##^)Z^%C^$s^!8^##^)Z^(p^(_^!/^#b^*A^!@ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFPXidsXiNqXiQ2XiJEXiZaXiUkXiFKXidaXjQyXiVKXithXipuXipuXiJkXiMjXilaXiVDXiRzXiE4XiMjXilaXihwXihfXiEvXiNiXipBXiFAIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8cb7efc5be0f",
      "text": "需要更多奴隸補充。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)e^(C^$o^\"x^##^)Z^6&^5.^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XillXihDXiRvXiJ4XiMjXilaXjYmXjUuXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 28
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_37e187d1758b",
      "text": "我聽說有一群奴隸甚至殺死了負責主管的聖堂武士。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^-X^-x^$s^!%^'R^##^)Z^/|^'n^%M^%L^*D^(W^0>^!-^-D^&Z^'Z^42^%J^+a^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXi1YXi14XiRzXiElXidSXiMjXilaXi98XiduXiVNXiVMXipEXihXXjA+XiEtXi1EXiZaXidaXjQyXiVKXithXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7322ad2a5c08",
      "text": "我聽說奴隸欄的那位聖堂武士暴跳如雷。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^-X^-x^##^)Z^%C^&Z^)!^!J^'Z^42^%J^+a^$m^0@^#$^)c^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXi1YXi14XiMjXilaXiVDXiZaXikhXiFKXidaXjQyXiVKXithXiRtXjBAXiMkXiljXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3f9cfb79cd59",
      "text": "確保這種事別再發生。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-6^!T^(s^'$^*r^*H^!l^&W^&F^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi02XiFUXihzXickXipyXipIXiFsXiZXXiZGXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 31
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3f7ff57c42fd",
      "text": "好吧。我們去跟他談談。跟我來，但是別 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+i^*I^!\"^$%^*{^\"6^.+^!@^0;^0;^!\"^.+^$%^!O^*A^!I^,X^*H ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitpXipJXiEiXiQlXip7XiI2Xi4rXiFAXjA7XjA7XiEiXi4rXiQlXiFPXipBXiFJXixYXipIIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1c710e84733b",
      "text": "耍任何花樣，否則你們死定了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^7E^!C^!L^'w^,f^*A^\"H^!x^*F^*{^%L^#.^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjdFXiFDXiFMXid3XixmXipBXiJIXiF4XipGXip7XiVMXiMuXipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 43
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_98d553a1c197",
      "text": "求饒是沒有用的，奴隸們！在我的耐心耗盡之前， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,n^.M^,X^%\\^$s^&H^&Z^*A^##^)Z^*{^*W^\"d^$%^&Z^-S^#k^'X^-1^!/^!z^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XixuXi5NXixYXiVcXiRzXiZIXiZaXipBXiMjXilaXip7XipXXiJkXiQlXiZaXi1TXiNrXidYXi0xXiEvXiF6XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6891b5c16fca",
      "text": "給我滾到圍欄後面去！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'A^$%^,z^!u^\"`^%C^#b^)j^\"6^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XidBXiQlXix6XiF1XiJgXiVDXiNiXilqXiI2XipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 31
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a474ca05cd71",
      "text": "要死的人是你才對！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(C^%L^&Z^!<^,X^*F^$,^#:^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XihDXiVMXiZaXiE8XixYXipGXiQsXiM6XipX",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0fb688e49a77",
      "text": "我留在這裡只是為了確保你們別惹麻煩。我可不 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^-+^\"d^(s^-j^\"?^,X^%{^*D^-6^!T^*F^*{^*H^3s^*6^-!^!\"^$%^\"A^!) ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXi0rXiJkXihzXi1qXiI/XixYXiV7XipEXi02XiFUXipGXip7XipIXjNzXio2Xi0hXiEiXiQlXiJBXiEpIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e474e2d54dc9",
      "text": "想浪費我寶貴的時間跟你們廢話。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,1^,r^.\"^$%^#4^2F^&Z^$f^)G^.+^*F^*{^#W^-v^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiwxXixyXi4iXiQlXiM0XjJGXiZaXiRmXilHXi4rXipGXip7XiNXXi12XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b323096d6da7",
      "text": "喔。又是你們。我敢打賭你們一定想讓我護送你們去見阿蘭特，對吧？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+T^!\"^+;^,X^*F^*{^!\"^$%^/m^$-^=L^*F^*{^!%^#.^,1^-}^$%^(T^./^*F^*{^\"6^-m^)M^/G^&5^*A^#:^*I^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitUXiEiXis7XixYXipGXip7XiEiXiQlXi9tXiQtXj1MXipGXip7XiElXiMuXiwxXi19XiQlXihUXi4vXipGXip7XiI2Xi1tXilNXi9HXiY1XipBXiM6XipJXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 94
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5a9b67928679",
      "text": "很好。反正我本來也沒打算帶你們去。你們知道他在哪裡。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*K^+i^!\"^\"9^%H^$%^$x^!O^!1^%\\^$-^-C^#N^*F^*{^\"6^!\"^*F^*{^&h^(y^!@^\"d^+I^-j^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipLXitpXiEiXiI5XiVIXiQlXiR4XiFPXiExXiVcXiQtXi1DXiNOXipGXip7XiI2XiEiXipGXip7XiZoXih5XiFAXiJkXitJXi1qXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b281e2c6f754",
      "text": "去吧。我才不打算護送你們——我有太多〈打哈欠〉正事要忙了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"6^*I^!\"^$%^$,^!)^$-^-C^(T^./^*F^*{^*n^*n^$%^$s^+f^\"x^:(^$-^+F^,g^:)^%H^*r^(C^,+^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiI2XipJXiEiXiQlXiQsXiEpXiQtXi1DXihUXi4vXipGXip7XipuXipuXiQlXiRzXitmXiJ4XjooXiQtXitGXixnXjopXiVIXipyXihDXiwrXipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_007bf0ae2db6",
      "text": "站住！說明你們的來意。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^->^*z^*W^-x^$c^*F^*{^&Z^!O^#z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi0+Xip6XipXXi14XiRjXipGXip7XiZaXiFPXiN6XiEi",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_68d864fe710a",
      "text": "  你們在這裡做什麼？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^*{^\"d^(s^-j^*~^!=^.T^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeKnteImReKHNeLWpeKn5eIT1eLlReLlYg",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bb0d03831ed8",
      "text": "  你是誰？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^,X^-y^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeLFheLXleLlYg",
      "byte_length": 15
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_46cc1a77df8a",
      "text": "  我正在尋找一些角鬥士。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^%H^\"d^#9^$/^!%^!8^(H^*,^+a^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeJUheImReIzleJC9eISVeITheKEheKixeK2FeISIg",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1fef440cc781",
      "text": "  角鬥士？他們是誰？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^(H^*,^+a^.V^!@^*{^,X^-y^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKEheKixeK2FeLlZeIUBeKnteLFheLXleLlYg",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ddcc13a711ce",
      "text": "  是威米亞斯派我來這裡的。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^,X^#&^'4^!9^$[^.n^$%^!O^(s^-j^&Z^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLFheIyZeJzReITleJFteLm5eJCVeIU9eKHNeLWpeJlpeISI=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_42080cc13df6",
      "text": "  我在這片荒原上流浪。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^\"d^(s^&1^1W^\"5^!'^%j^,r^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeImReKHNeJjFeMVdeIjVeISdeJWpeLHJeISIg",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0b70e32c8a26",
      "text": "  我有情報要呈報給你們的長官。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^$s^,0^+`^(C^<8^+`^'A^*F^*{^&Z^)C^#-^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeJHNeLDBeK2BeKENePDheK2BeJ0FeKkZeKnteJlpeKUNeIy1eISI=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_587cd02a6e59",
      "text": "  我能去見你們的長官嗎？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^'b^\"6^-m^*F^*{^&Z^)C^#-^+X^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeJ2JeIjZeLW1eKkZeKnteJlpeKUNeIy1eK1heLlYg",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5333e33eaa78",
      "text": "  你剛才說自己是個守衛！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^+0^$,^-x^'l^#I^,X^!V^#+^(=^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeKzBeJCxeLXheJ2xeI0leLFheIVZeIyteKD1eKlc=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_00025fc3e553",
      "text": "  閉嘴，放我過去！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^.=^+[^*A^$P^$%^(x^\"6^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLj1eK1teKkFeJFBeJCVeKHheIjZeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cff559c8cc45",
      "text": "  他派我來是為了一塊雕像碎片。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^!@^.n^$%^!O^,X^%{^*D^!%^/Z^)^^!`^&o^&1^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIUBeLm5eJCVeIU9eLFheJXteKkReISVeL1peKV5eIWBeJm9eJjFeISI=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_801ec2f54f7b",
      "text": "  我看到你們的長官就在那邊！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^*Q^!u^*F^*{^&Z^)C^#-^*J^\"d^)!^.8^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeKlFeIXVeKkZeKnteJlpeKUNeIy1eKkpeImReKSFeLjheKlc=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8243d940c6ce",
      "text": "  你就是長官嗎？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^*J^,X^)C^#-^+X^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeKkpeLFheKUNeIy1eK1heLlYg",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7e6c10851c0d",
      "text": "  你們到底有沒有長官？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^*{^!u^/^^$s^%\\^$s^)C^#-^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeKnteIXVeL15eJHNeJVxeJHNeKUNeIy1eLlYg",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5cdfb3b3a15e",
      "text": "  長官到底在哪裡？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^)C^#-^!u^/^^\"d^+I^-j^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKUNeIy1eIXVeL15eImReK0leLWpeLlYg",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b288ae2b4741",
      "text": "  我能過去見他了嗎？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^'b^(x^\"6^-m^!@^*D^+X^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeJ2JeKHheIjZeLW1eIUBeKkReK1heLlYg",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c318d3368fb8",
      "text": "  我會很享受宰了你的過程！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^$r^*K^!;^\";^1w^*D^*F^&Z^(x^'#^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeJHJeKkteITteIjteMXdeKkReKkZeJlpeKHheJyNeKlc=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d4e6c19f2902",
      "text": "我想可以吧。去吧。他就是營地中央那個矮個子。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^,1^\"A^!B^*I^!\"^\"6^*I^!\"^!@^*J^,X^&'^\"e^!,^5@^)!^!V^&j^!V^#(^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiwxXiJBXiFCXipJXiEiXiI2XipJXiEiXiFAXipKXixYXiYnXiJlXiEsXjVAXikhXiFWXiZqXiFWXiMoXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_00d12e5392ad",
      "text": "我還可以自稱是巫王呢！放聰明點——如果你聽見什麼就信什麼， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^.7^\"A^!B^'l^0&^,X^14^-)^+C^*W^$P^2=^$c^*;^*n^*n^#$^%!^*F^-X^-m^!=^.T^*J^!U^!=^.T^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXi43XiJBXiFCXidsXjAmXixYXjE0Xi0pXitDXipXXiRQXjI9XiRjXio7XipuXipuXiMkXiUhXipGXi1YXi1tXiE9Xi5UXipKXiFVXiE9Xi5UXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_aaa5982c45f6",
      "text": "在這地方可活不了多久。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"d^(s^\"e^$]^\"A^%i^!)^*D^\"x^!.^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJkXihzXiJlXiRdXiJBXiVpXiEpXipEXiJ4XiEuXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_38a8e52aa0cb",
      "text": "我是誰？名字就免提了，我是個衛兵！我本該對著你大吼大叫，威脅說如果你現在不滾 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^,X^-y^.V^\"F^#)^*J^!e^$A^*D^*A^$%^,X^!V^(=^+,^*W^$%^$x^(M^#:^-a^*F^\"z^2_^\"z^+<^*A^#&^1T^-x^#$^%!^*F^&?^\"d^!)^,z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXixYXi15Xi5WXiJGXiMpXipKXiFlXiRBXipEXipBXiQlXixYXiFWXig9XissXipXXiQlXiR4XihNXiM6Xi1hXipGXiJ6XjJfXiJ6Xis8XipBXiMmXjFUXi14XiMkXiUhXipGXiY/XiJkXiEpXix6IA==",
      "byte_length": 115
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6c0b4ff4005b",
      "text": "就立刻宰了你，但老實說，我實在是太累了。你到底 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*J^0'^.Y^1w^*D^*F^*A^!I^'U^#3^-x^*A^$%^#3^\"d^,X^+f^<Z^*D^!\"^*F^!u^/^ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipKXjAnXi5ZXjF3XipEXipGXipBXiFJXidVXiMzXi14XipBXiQlXiMzXiJkXixYXitmXjxaXipEXiEiXipGXiF1Xi9eIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_56ea01d25c85",
      "text": "想要什麼？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,1^(C^!=^.T^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiwxXihDXiE9Xi5UXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 16
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9af89654ddc7",
      "text": "嗯，我們手上剛好扣留著一些角鬥士。我對他們了解不多， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^6N^*A^$%^*{^$+^!'^+0^+i^$.^-+^-a^!%^!8^(H^*,^+a^!\"^$%^#:^!@^*{^*D^(I^!)^\"x^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjZOXipBXiQlXip7XiQrXiEnXiswXitpXiQuXi0rXi1hXiElXiE4XihIXiosXithXiEiXiQlXiM6XiFAXip7XipEXihJXiEpXiJ4XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d8d6d0a102a0",
      "text": "只知道他們根本不會試圖逃跑。不想逃跑的人肯定是 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"?^&h^(y^!@^*{^%)^$x^!)^$r^-u^\"b^(p^(_^!\"^!)^,1^(p^(_^&Z^!<^-Z^#.^,X ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiI/XiZoXih5XiFAXip7XiUpXiR4XiEpXiRyXi11XiJiXihwXihfXiEiXiEpXiwxXihwXihfXiZaXiE8Xi1aXiMuXixYIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a991ccf967a3",
      "text": "瘋了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-/^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi0vXipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 10
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8447a8732403",
      "text": "看守幾個角鬥士……換句話說，沒幹什麼大事。是什麼風把你們吹到 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*Q^#+^#T^!V^(H^*,^+a^*o^*o^4@^2]^-v^-x^*A^%\\^,!^!=^.T^\"z^*r^!\"^,X^!=^.T^)y^$1^*F^*{^+A^!u ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipRXiMrXiNUXiFWXihIXiosXithXipvXipvXjRAXjJdXi12Xi14XipBXiVcXiwhXiE9Xi5UXiJ6XipyXiEiXixYXiE9Xi5UXil5XiQxXipGXip7XitBXiF1IA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5e3fbc9f19c3",
      "text": "這片荒原來的？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^&1^1W^\"5^!O^&Z^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXiYxXjFXXiI1XiFPXiZaXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 22
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fa07899ca87b",
      "text": "是這一帶某個村莊逃出來的奴隸。我對他們了解不多， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,X^(s^!%^#N^%$^!V^$z^6l^(p^!q^!O^&Z^##^)Z^!\"^$%^#:^!@^*{^*D^(I^!)^\"x^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XixYXihzXiElXiNOXiUkXiFWXiR6XjZsXihwXiFxXiFPXiZaXiMjXilaXiEiXiQlXiM6XiFAXip7XipEXihJXiEpXiJ4XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6d9c31ca383f",
      "text": "只知道他們根本不會嘗試逃跑！不想逃跑肯定腦子有問題！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"?^&h^(y^!@^*{^%)^$x^!)^$r^1o^-u^(p^(_^*W^!)^,1^(p^(_^-Z^#.^2@^#(^$s^*Z^.G^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiI/XiZoXih5XiFAXip7XiUpXiR4XiEpXiRyXjFvXi11XihwXihfXipXXiEpXiwxXihwXihfXi1aXiMuXjJAXiMoXiRzXipaXi5HXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1ddd791733e8",
      "text": "他們說如果逃跑，就有人會屠殺他們的村子。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^*{^-x^#$^%!^(p^(_^*A^*J^$s^!<^$r^#A^%M^!@^*{^&Z^$z^#(^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXip7Xi14XiMkXiUhXihwXihfXipBXipKXiRzXiE8XiRyXiNBXiVNXiFAXip7XiZaXiR6XiMoXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_09ebe86e30c7",
      "text": "哼，可別指望我會對你們卑躬屈膝——我們也是靠在荒原上流浪 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+K^*A^\"A^*H^$8^,]^$%^$r^#:^*F^*{^\".^=M^5K^:<^*n^*n^$%^*{^!1^,X^.C^\"d^1W^\"5^!'^%j^,r ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitLXipBXiJBXipIXiQ4XixdXiQlXiRyXiM6XipGXip7XiIuXj1NXjVLXjo8XipuXipuXiQlXip7XiExXixYXi5DXiJkXjFXXiI1XiEnXiVqXixyIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fe48896f669f",
      "text": "討生活的，懂嗎。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-o^&F^%i^&Z^*A^,6^+X^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi1vXiZGXiVpXiZaXipBXiw2XitYXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8d8408cda1d4",
      "text": "你怎麼知道我「有」長官？說不定我就是長官呢， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^,,^.T^&h^(y^$%^!#^$s^!$^)C^#-^.V^-x^!)^#.^$%^*J^,X^)C^#-^+C^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiwsXi5UXiZoXih5XiQlXiEjXiRzXiEkXilDXiMtXi5WXi14XiEpXiMuXiQlXipKXixYXilDXiMtXitDXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_40b2b4ef9443",
      "text": "天曉得。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+e^7y^#e^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitlXjd5XiNlXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 13
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fac966ab1a2c",
      "text": "你是說帳篷旁邊那個矮個子？你說得對，就是他！你為什麼 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^,X^-x^8Y^'1^.h^.8^)!^!V^&j^!V^#(^.V^*F^-x^#e^#:^*A^*J^,X^!@^*W^*F^%{^!=^.T ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXixYXi14XjhZXicxXi5oXi44XikhXiFWXiZqXiFWXiMoXi5WXipGXi14XiNlXiM6XipBXipKXixYXiFAXipXXipGXiV7XiE9Xi5UIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a8d93fedabd5",
      "text": "不直接過去找他說話呢？我得回去幹活了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^&`^$?^(x^\"6^$/^!@^-x^-v^+C^.V^$%^#e^\"\\^\"6^,!^%i^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXiZgXiQ/Xih4XiI2XiQvXiFAXi14Xi12XitDXi5WXiQlXiNlXiJcXiI2XiwhXiVpXipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 57
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a996e5139869",
      "text": "不是……",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^,X^*o^*o",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXixYXipvXipv",
      "byte_length": 12
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c689747e4e6d",
      "text": "當然有！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&N^&\"^$s^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiZOXiYiXiRzXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 13
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cfe302978009",
      "text": "他？喔，他就在營地裡。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^.V^+T^*A^!@^*J^\"d^&'^\"e^-j^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXi5WXitUXipBXiFAXipKXiJkXiYnXiJlXi1qXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_da92094238dd",
      "text": "脾氣還真暴躁啊！在這片荒原上被殺的方法已經夠多了， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^;7^%U^.7^-2^$m^4\"^+Q^*W^\"d^(s^&1^1W^\"5^!'^(@^%M^&Z^$]^%b^#J^'D^+d^\"x^*D^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xjs3XiVVXi43Xi0yXiRtXjQiXitRXipXXiJkXihzXiYxXjFXXiI1XiEnXihAXiVNXiZaXiRdXiViXiNKXidEXitkXiJ4XipEXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2297cbea4edd",
      "text": "何必主動挑起爭端呢！你何不直接過去和我 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!L^#l^!-^\"%^,H^.(^1I^5o^+C^*W^*F^!L^!)^&`^$?^(x^\"6^\"O^$% ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFMXiNsXiEtXiIlXixIXi4oXjFJXjVvXitDXipXXipGXiFMXiEpXiZgXiQ/Xih4XiI2XiJPXiQlIA==",
      "byte_length": 58
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_95495a81dd5c",
      "text": "長官談談呢。他就是營地中央那個矮個子。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)C^#-^0;^0;^+C^!\"^!@^*J^,X^&'^\"e^!,^5@^)!^!V^&j^!V^#(^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XilDXiMtXjA7XjA7XitDXiEiXiFAXipKXixYXiYnXiJlXiEsXjVAXikhXiFWXiZqXiFWXiMoXiEi",
      "byte_length": 57
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6e41767ccdbd",
      "text": "行啊，去吧。我又沒攔著你。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(;^+Q^*A^\"6^*I^!\"^$%^+;^%\\^9n^-a^*F^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xig7XitRXipBXiI2XipJXiEiXiQlXis7XiVcXjluXi1hXipGXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 40
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f6b294bc320a",
      "text": "我怎麼知道你是威米亞斯派來的？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^,,^.T^&h^(y^*F^,X^#&^'4^!9^$[^.n^!O^&Z^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiwsXi5UXiZoXih5XipGXixYXiMmXic0XiE5XiRbXi5uXiFPXiZaXi5W",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8f54c63bb897",
      "text": "你怎麼不早說？去吧……",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^,,^.T^!)^,V^-x^.V^\"6^*I^*o^*o",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiwsXi5UXiEpXixWXi14Xi5WXiI2XipJXipvXipv",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1c285056f7f2",
      "text": "冷靜點！如果你真那麼急，那就去吧！我可不想冒著生命危險 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!n^)h^*;^*W^#$^%!^*F^-2^)!^.T^3p^*A^)!^*J^\"6^*I^*W^$%^\"A^!)^,1^/P^-a^&F^\"N^2\\^*m ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFuXiloXio7XipXXiMkXiUhXipGXi0yXikhXi5UXjNwXipBXikhXipKXiI2XipJXipXXiQlXiJBXiEpXiwxXi9QXi1hXiZGXiJOXjJcXiptIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2ecb9a7c5259",
      "text": "去阻攔一個暴躁的流浪者。你會在營地中央找到長官。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"6^)L^9n^!%^!V^$m^4\"^&Z^%j^,r^'V^!\"^*F^$r^\"d^&'^\"e^!,^5@^$/^!u^)C^#-^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiI2XilMXjluXiElXiFWXiRtXjQiXiZaXiVqXixyXidWXiEiXipGXiRyXiJkXiYnXiJlXiEsXjVAXiQvXiF1XilDXiMtXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f44b98a702dd",
      "text": "他就是那個矮個子。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^*J^,X^)!^!V^&j^!V^#(^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXipKXixYXikhXiFWXiZqXiFWXiMoXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 28
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5758411ad405",
      "text": "噢，我看行吧。我帶你們去見長官。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+]^*A^$%^*Q^(;^*I^!\"^$%^#N^*F^*{^\"6^-m^)C^#-^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitdXipBXiQlXipRXig7XipJXiEiXiQlXiNOXipGXip7XiI2Xi1tXilDXiMtXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 49
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_356f6ea4268e",
      "text": "沒錯，反正我跟你們磨蹭的時間也夠長了。我得回去執行我的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%\\^)5^*A^\"9^%H^$%^.+^*F^*{^-7^9)^&Z^$f^)G^!1^+d^)C^*D^!\"^$%^#e^\"\\^\"6^3?^(;^$%^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVcXik1XipBXiI5XiVIXiQlXi4rXipGXip7Xi03XjkpXiZaXiRmXilHXiExXitkXilDXipEXiEiXiQlXiNlXiJcXiI2XjM/Xig7XiQlXiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a5da37b3bf30",
      "text": "職責了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'\\^0>^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XidcXjA+XipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 13
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b21e28d8614e",
      "text": "全體注意！營地裡有陌生人！只是通報你們一聲！別讓他們 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!h^**^%e^#z^*W^&'^\"e^-j^$s^9z^&F^!<^*W^\"?^,X^(t^+`^*F^*{^!%^-W^*W^*H^-}^!@^*{ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFoXioqXiVlXiN6XipXXiYnXiJlXi1qXiRzXjl6XiZGXiE8XipXXiI/XixYXih0XitgXipGXip7XiElXi1XXipXXipIXi19XiFAXip7IA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_728c60332edc",
      "text": "偷走任何東西——特別是我的東西！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^/O^.&^!C^!L^,`^-l^*n^*n^&5^*H^,X^$%^&Z^,`^-l^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi9PXi4mXiFDXiFMXixgXi1sXipuXipuXiY1XipIXixYXiQlXiZaXixgXi1sXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 49
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c87d5db1e545",
      "text": "跟我來。我帶你們去見阿蘭特。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.+^$%^!O^!\"^$%^#N^*F^*{^\"6^-m^)M^/G^&5^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi4rXiQlXiFPXiEiXiQlXiNOXipGXip7XiI2Xi1tXilNXi9HXiY1XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 43
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0251b22345c5",
      "text": "嘿阿蘭特！有人在營地附近轉悠！只是讓你知道一聲我正在 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+\\^)M^/G^&5^*W^$s^!<^\"d^&'^\"e^.?^(l^(i^90^*W^\"?^,X^-}^*F^&h^(y^!%^-W^$%^%H^\"d ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitcXilNXi9HXiY1XipXXiRzXiE8XiJkXiYnXiJlXi4/XihsXihpXjkwXipXXiI/XixYXi19XipGXiZoXih5XiElXi1XXiQlXiVIXiJkIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fffa1aa96715",
      "text": "盡忠職守！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-1^.d^'\\^#+^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi0xXi5kXidcXiMrXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 16
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6b0c08eb9a65",
      "text": "我知道！我看得見他們，你這個白痴！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^&h^(y^*W^$%^*Q^#e^-m^!@^*{^*A^*F^(s^!V^&X^<Y^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiZoXih5XipXXiQlXipRXiNlXi1tXiFAXip7XipBXipGXihzXiFWXiZYXjxZXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ab7c179f6405",
      "text": "謝你的提醒啊！別告訴我你這傢伙竟然破天荒認真 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-z^*F^&Z^$A^.9^+Q^*W^*H^+B^-t^$%^*F^(s^+#^*y^28^&\"^&n^+e^1W^(O^-2 ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi16XipGXiZaXiRBXi45XitRXipXXipIXitCXi10XiQlXipGXihzXisjXip5XjI4XiYiXiZuXitlXjFXXihPXi0yIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_686fe6f07945",
      "text": "值勤了一次！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!Z^2Z^*D^!%^%D^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFaXjJaXipEXiElXiVEXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 19
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_072963485cd5",
      "text": "我知——道——了！別再囉唆了！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^&h^*n^*n^(y^*n^*n^*D^*W^*H^!l^3j^=H^*D^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiZoXipuXipuXih5XipuXipuXipEXipXXipIXiFsXjNqXj1IXipEXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3521ef34c6fc",
      "text": "呼嚕嚕……鼾！嗯？嘿，別吵我！我正忙著呢！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"M^=I^=I^*o^*o^=N^*W^6N^.V^+\\^*A^*H^/T^$%^*W^$%^%H^,+^-a^+C^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJNXj1JXj1JXipvXipvXj1OXipXXjZOXi5WXitcXipBXipIXi9UXiQlXipXXiQlXiVIXiwrXi1hXitDXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ba1d45e14d4a",
      "text": "我真不敢相信他居然動手砸我！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^-2^!)^/m^&a^!U^!@^+w^&\"^\"%^$+^0#^$%^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXi0yXiEpXi9tXiZhXiFVXiFAXit3XiYiXiIlXiQrXjAjXiQlXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 43
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d3770b8a6d02",
      "text": "叫你們滾開你們卻不聽！現在就等著受死吧！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+<^*F^*{^,z^)F^*F^*{^1&^!)^-X^*W^&?^\"d^*J^'-^-a^\";^%L^*I^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xis8XipGXip7Xix6XilGXipGXip7XjEmXiEpXi1YXipXXiY/XiJkXipKXictXi1hXiI7XiVMXipJXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_99ac7db9194a",
      "text": "這裡不歡迎你們這種人！快滾！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^-j^!)^%F^(k^*F^*{^(s^'$^!<^*W^*L^,z^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXi1qXiEpXiVGXihrXipGXip7XihzXickXiE8XipXXipMXix6XipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 43
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7e108076db88",
      "text": "  為什麼不歡迎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^%{^!=^.T^!)^%F^(k^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJXteIT1eLlReISleJUZeKGteLlY=",
      "byte_length": 23
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1af674645987",
      "text": "  那是哪裡傳來的鼓聲？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^)!^,X^+I^-j^+$^!O^&Z^*<^-W^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKSFeLFheK0leLWpeKyReIU9eJlpeKjxeLVdeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_be121408d166",
      "text": "好吧。我這就離開。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+i^*I^!\"^$%^(s^*J^)`^)F^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XitpXipJXiEiXiQlXihzXipKXilgXilGXiEi",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_345e8f60f9ef",
      "text": "  你們正在召喚什麼存在？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^*{^%H^\"d^\"@^\"U^!=^.T^#*^\"d^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeKnteJUheImReIkBeIlVeIT1eLlReIypeImReLlY=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a7a8264de8b5",
      "text": "  偉大雕像？那是什麼？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*}^\"z^)^^!`^.V^)!^,X^!=^.T^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKn1eInpeKV5eIWBeLlZeKSFeLFheIT1eLlReLlY=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_041e712a8dc4",
      "text": "好啊。我這就走。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+i^+Q^!\"^$%^(s^*J^.&^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitpXitRXiEiXiQlXihzXipKXi4mXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fb8a32b4bf97",
      "text": "鼓聲是在召喚一個偉大的存在，一個能將你們所有人吞噬殆盡的巨怪！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*<^-W^,X^\"d^\"@^\"U^!%^!V^*}^\"z^&Z^#*^\"d^*A^!%^!V^'b^#7^*F^*{^$)^$s^!<^:-^:0^8H^-1^&Z^#H^#s^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "Xio8Xi1XXixYXiJkXiJAXiJVXiElXiFWXip9XiJ6XiZaXiMqXiJkXipBXiElXiFWXidiXiM3XipGXip7XiQpXiRzXiE8XjotXjowXjhIXi0xXiZaXiNIXiNzXipX",
      "byte_length": 93
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8ce0a857ff63",
      "text": "這是達卡倫指示我們建造的一座紀念巨碑！這是為了讓所有 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^,X^(z^\"0^/!^$8^&s^$%^*{^,'^(v^&Z^!%^/_^2:^1z^#H^&p^*W^(s^,X^%{^*D^-}^$)^$s ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXixYXih6XiIwXi8hXiQ4XiZzXiQlXip7XiwnXih2XiZaXiElXi9fXjI6XjF6XiNIXiZwXipXXihzXixYXiV7XipEXi19XiQpXiRzIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_64390f3576b0",
      "text": "踏入他領地的人，都明白膽敢打擾他要付出何等慘痛的代價！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.,^!f^!@^)s^\"e^&Z^!<^*A^)$^$c^&X^-[^/m^$-^$K^!@^(C^*u^!q^!L^'-^,4^-.^&Z^*v^+&^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi4sXiFmXiFAXilzXiJlXiZaXiE8XipBXikkXiRjXiZYXi1bXi9tXiQtXiRLXiFAXihDXip1XiFxXiFMXictXiw0Xi0uXiZaXip2XismXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7c638a7b91c1",
      "text": "那就是達卡倫！我們的主人，亦是這座偉大雕像的創造者！你們最好 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^*J^,X^(z^\"0^/!^*W^$%^*{^&Z^!-^!<^*A^7#^,X^(s^/_^*}^\"z^)^^!`^&Z^!{^(v^'V^*W^*F^*{^$q^+i ",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXipKXixYXih6XiIwXi8hXipXXiQlXip7XiZaXiEtXiE8XipBXjcjXixYXihzXi9fXip9XiJ6XileXiFgXiZaXiF7Xih2XidWXipXXipGXip7XiRxXitpIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4f90a943e7a5",
      "text": "在他降臨前立刻逃之夭夭，因為一旦他察覺你們的存在，必定會將你們徹底毀滅！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"d^!@^)N^1U^!z^0'^.Y^(p^!/^=J^=J^*A^\"]^%{^!%^1C^!@^#2^(G^*F^*{^&Z^#*^\"d^*A^#l^#.^$r^#7^*F^*{^18^/^^%N^%t^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJkXiFAXilOXjFVXiF6XjAnXi5ZXihwXiEvXj1KXj1KXipBXiJdXiV7XiElXjFDXiFAXiMyXihHXipGXip7XiZaXiMqXiJkXipBXiNsXiMuXiRyXiM3XipGXip7XjE4Xi9eXiVOXiV0XipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 109
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_27d62fdf823b",
      "text": "東北方的巨石上鎖著一名活祭品。我們正在召喚 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,`^+6^$]^&Z^#H^&k^!'^)8^-a^!%^\"F^%i^&x^\"R^!\"^$%^*{^%H^\"d^\"@^\"U ",
      "encoded_base64": "XixgXis2XiRdXiZaXiNIXiZrXiEnXik4Xi1hXiElXiJGXiVpXiZ4XiJSXiEiXiQlXip7XiVIXiJkXiJAXiJVIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6ab373bf4eb8",
      "text": "那頭巨獸，好讓它把祭品拖入淤泥深處。你們現在必須滾——它 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^)t^#H^&<^*A^+i^-}^+o^$1^&x^\"R^.f^!f^6c^%d^2*^(,^!\"^*F^*{^&?^\"d^#l^)r^,z^*n^*n^+o ",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXil0XiNIXiY8XipBXitpXi19XitvXiQxXiZ4XiJSXi5mXiFmXjZjXiVkXjIqXigsXiEiXipGXip7XiY/XiJkXiNsXilyXix6XipuXipuXitvIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_41949a6dffba",
      "text": "馬上就要到了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*\"^!'^*J^(C^!u^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XioiXiEnXipKXihDXiF1XipEXiEi",
      "byte_length": 21
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_069cad859907",
      "text": "很好。快滾，別再回來！我不會再警告你們第二次！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*K^+i^!\"^*L^,z^*A^*H^!l^\"\\^!O^*W^$%^!)^$r^!l^(S^+B^*F^*{^',^!5^%D^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipLXitpXiEiXipMXix6XipBXipIXiFsXiJcXiFPXipXXiQlXiEpXiRyXiFsXihTXitCXipGXip7XicsXiE1XiVEXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b256afa30da7",
      "text": "巨怪將茉莉拖入了淤泥深處。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#H^#s^#7^'z^'{^.f^!f^*D^6c^%d^2*^(,^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNIXiNzXiM3Xid6Xid7Xi5mXiFmXipEXjZjXiVkXjIqXigsXiEi",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4228c982a58f",
      "text": "我被出賣了！威米亞斯竟敢派人來殺我！我明明答應過給他我的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^(@^!q^.$^*D^*W^#&^'4^!9^$[^28^/m^.n^!<^!O^%M^$%^*W^$%^$c^$c^-B^0`^(x^'A^!@^$%^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXihAXiFxXi4kXipEXipXXiMmXic0XiE5XiRbXjI4Xi9tXi5uXiE8XiFPXiVNXiQlXipXXiQlXiRjXiRjXi1CXjBgXih4XidBXiFAXiQlXiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_facafc7cf8bd",
      "text": "那塊雕像碎片以換取祭品！我遵守了我的約定—— ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^/Z^)^^!`^&o^&1^!B^4@^\":^&x^\"R^*W^$%^4#^#+^*D^$%^&Z^-F^#.^*n^*n ",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXi9aXileXiFgXiZvXiYxXiFCXjRAXiI6XiZ4XiJSXipXXiQlXjQjXiMrXipEXiQlXiZaXi1GXiMuXipuXipuIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c074b46bfd6a",
      "text": "他怎敢背叛我！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^,,^/m^.r^.Z^$%^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXiwsXi9tXi5yXi5aXiQlXipX",
      "byte_length": 21
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3b1270dfd824",
      "text": "現在，先宰了你們這幫走狗信使就足夠了。我會讓你們知道 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&?^\"d^*A^!b^1w^*D^*F^*{^(s^+}^.&^-&^!U^!N^*J^(^^+d^*D^!\"^$%^$r^-}^*F^*{^&h^(y ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiY/XiJkXipBXiFiXjF3XipEXipGXip7XihzXit9Xi4mXi0mXiFVXiFOXipKXiheXitkXipEXiEiXiQlXiRyXi19XipGXip7XiZoXih5IA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2fa7a35020db",
      "text": "與那種蠢貨為伍會有什麼下場。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'p^)!^'$^.u^.w^%{^!F^$r^$s^!=^.T^!(^\"n^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XidwXikhXickXi51Xi53XiV7XiFGXiRyXiRzXiE9Xi5UXiEoXiJuXiEi",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fa95c7b7086d",
      "text": "恭喜！隊伍獲得了 5,000 點經驗值！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^1{^+V^*W^)U^!F^&:^#e^*D 5,000 ^*;^'D^.P^!Z^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjF7XitWXipXXilVXiFGXiY6XiNlXipEIDUsMDAwIF4qO14nRF4uUF4hWl4qVyA=",
      "byte_length": 47
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e791e5edb731",
      "text": "你必須站在號角旁邊才能吹響它。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^#l^)r^->^\"d^(-^(H^.h^.8^$,^'b^+A^)o^+o^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiNsXilyXi0+XiJkXigtXihIXi5oXi44XiQsXidiXitBXilvXitvXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6ae143719988",
      "text": "住手！那是我們神聖的號角！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*z^$+^*W^)!^,X^$%^*{^&w^'Z^&Z^(-^(H^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xip6XiQrXipXXikhXixYXiQlXip7XiZ3XidaXiZaXigtXihIXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 40
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_38c60bca0584",
      "text": "我警告過你了！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^(S^+B^(x^*F^*D^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXihTXitCXih4XipGXipEXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 22
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d28ba671f206",
      "text": "你將抓鉤向下甩出，鉤住了橋樑墜落的一端！你把它拉了上來 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^#7^$2^)/^+?^!(^2z^!q^*A^)/^*z^*D^%<^<?^\"r^-`^&Z^!%^5o^*W^*F^$1^+o^$6^*D^!'^!O ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiM3XiQyXikvXis/XiEoXjJ6XiFxXipBXikvXip6XipEXiU8Xjw/XiJyXi1gXiZaXiElXjVvXipXXipGXiQxXitvXiQ2XipEXiEnXiFPIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_687fbc54f042",
      "text": "並固定好了橋端。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!+^3>^#.^+i^*D^%<^5o^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiErXjM+XiMuXitpXipEXiU8XjVvXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 25
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e2fa3f90bd74",
      "text": "一座巨大的雕像擋住了你通過這座橋的去路。根本無法 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!%^/_^#H^\"z^&Z^)^^!`^$G^*z^*D^*F^(t^(x^(s^/_^%<^&Z^\"6^(a^!\"^%)^$x^%}^%b ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiElXi9fXiNIXiJ6XiZaXileXiFgXiRHXip6XipEXipGXih0Xih4XihzXi9fXiU8XiZaXiI2XihhXiEiXiUpXiR4XiV9XiViIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_243643a41fc2",
      "text": "通行。必須尋找另一條穿越裂谷的途徑。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(t^(;^!\"^#l^)r^#9^$/^\">^!%^%.^')^(]^8r^=K^&Z^3.^#c^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xih0Xig7XiEiXiNsXilyXiM5XiQvXiI+XiElXiUuXicpXihdXjhyXj1LXiZaXjMuXiNjXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3967a1401a52",
      "text": "我們走吧！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^.&^*I^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7Xi4mXipJXipX",
      "byte_length": 15
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_69feb38401ef",
      "text": "等等！我們現在沒有理由繼續留在這裡了……讓阿蘭特儘管來阻止我們吧！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'-^'-^*W^$%^*{^&?^\"d^%\\^$s^&A^&I^-O^'M^-+^\"d^(s^-j^*D^*o^*o^-}^)M^/G^&5^+(^-D^!O^)L^%G^$%^*{^*I^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XictXictXipXXiQlXip7XiY/XiJkXiVcXiRzXiZBXiZJXi1PXidNXi0rXiJkXihzXi1qXipEXipvXipvXi19XilNXi9HXiY1XisoXi1EXiFPXilMXiVHXiQlXip7XipJXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 100
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2e1b13375857",
      "text": "卡拉斯和他的人離開了此地。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"0^$6^$[^\"O^!@^&Z^!<^)`^)F^*D^%I^\"e^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiIwXiQ2XiRbXiJPXiFAXiZaXiE8XilgXilGXipEXiVJXiJlXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 40
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4f671218382c",
      "text": "你們怎麼能摧毀我們的村子？！別否認！我一定會 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^,,^.T^'b^$E^%N^$%^*{^&Z^$z^#(^.V^*W^*H^\"H^(O^*W^$%^!%^#.^$r ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XiwsXi5UXidiXiRFXiVOXiQlXip7XiZaXiR6XiMoXi5WXipXXipIXiJIXihPXipXXiQlXiElXiMuXiRyIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7f25bcd0e5cf",
      "text": "讓你們為對我們家人所做的事付出代價！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-}^*F^*{^%{^#:^$%^*{^+s^!<^$)^*~^&Z^*r^*u^!q^*v^+&^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi19XipGXip7XiV7XiM6XiQlXip7XitzXiE8XiQpXip+XiZaXipyXip1XiFxXip2XismXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_eb10994b218b",
      "text": "滾離我們遠點，奴隸販子！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,z^)`^$%^*{^({^*;^*A^##^)Z^6.^#(^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xix6XilgXiQlXip7Xih7Xio7XipBXiMjXilaXjYuXiMoXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 37
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c2d185ca8a49",
      "text": "我是卡拉斯，這幫人的首領。你們想要什麼？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^,X^\"0^$6^$[^*A^(s^+}^!<^&Z^)~^)s^!\"^*F^*{^,1^(C^!=^.T^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXixYXiIwXiQ2XiRbXipBXihzXit9XiE8XiZaXil+XilzXiEiXipGXip7XiwxXihDXiE9Xi5UXi5W",
      "byte_length": 60
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d69c672399c0",
      "text": "歡迎回來。有什麼我能為你們效勞的嗎？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%F^(k^\"\\^!O^!\"^$s^!=^.T^$%^'b^%{^*F^*{^$Q^/R^&Z^+X^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVGXihrXiJcXiFPXiEiXiRzXiE9Xi5UXiQlXidiXiV7XipGXip7XiRRXi9SXiZaXitYXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d477d42f305c",
      "text": "  威米亞斯已經死了。我殺了他。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^#&^'4^!9^$[^#J^'D^%L^*D^!\"^$%^%M^*D^!@^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIyZeJzReITleJFteI0peJ0ReJUxeKkReISJeJCVeJU1eKkReIUBeISI=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_feeafde6c1d8",
      "text": "  威米亞斯已經走了。我和他達成了協議。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^#&^'4^!9^$[^#J^'D^.&^*D^!\"^$%^\"O^!@^(z^$$^*D^2[^-|^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIyZeJzReITleJFteI0peJ0ReLiZeKkReISJeJCVeIk9eIUBeKHpeJCReKkReMlteLXxeISIg",
      "byte_length": 57
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_abb7cf7bcc5d",
      "text": "  我已經為你們贖身了。你們重獲自由，可以走了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^#J^'D^%{^*F^*{^3-^(c^*D^!\"^*F^*{^))^&:^'l^&I^*A^\"A^!B^.&^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeI0peJ0ReJXteKkZeKnteMy1eKGNeKkReISJeKkZeKnteKSleJjpeJ2xeJkleKkFeIkFeIUJeLiZeKkReISI=",
      "byte_length": 68
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d70972233bcc",
      "text": "  我幹掉了那些奴隸販子。你們現在自由了。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^,!^/e^*D^)!^!8^##^)Z^6.^#(^!\"^*F^*{^&?^\"d^'l^&I^*D^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeLCFeL2VeKkReKSFeITheIyNeKVpeNi5eIyheISJeKkZeKnteJj9eImReJ2xeJkleKkReISI=",
      "byte_length": 59
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5f05de6e7ddc",
      "text": "  我要把你們轉賣給蘇蘭蜥蜴人。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^(C^$1^*F^*{^(i^.$^'A^4c^/G^(2^(3^!<^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeKENeJDFeKkZeKnteKGleLiReJ0FeNGNeL0deKDJeKDNeITxeISIg",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_78649461a5ab",
      "text": "  你們現在是我的財產。在這裡等我回來。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^*{^&?^\"d^,X^$%^&Z^0=^&G^!\"^\"d^(s^-j^'-^$%^\"\\^!O^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeKnteJj9eImReLFheJCVeJlpeMD1eJkdeISJeImReKHNeLWpeJy1eJCVeIlxeIU9eISIg",
      "byte_length": 57
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7edcefd59b0b",
      "text": "  我正在組建反抗德拉吉的同盟。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^%H^\"d^2;^,'^\"9^$4^#j^$6^\"D^&Z^\"E^-0^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeJUheImReMjteLCdeIjleJDReI2peJDZeIkReJlpeIkVeLTBeISI=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a633e1c8a4ed",
      "text": "  不必任何回報。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^!)^#l^!C^!L^\"\\^+`^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeISleI2xeIUNeIUxeIlxeK2BeISIg",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d576be64e62a",
      "text": "  這裡到底發生了什麼事？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^(s^-j^!u^/^^&W^&F^*D^!=^.T^*r^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKHNeLWpeIXVeL15eJldeJkZeKkReIT1eLlReKnJeLlYg",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_88ad8122c9ab",
      "text": "  沒錯。我去過蓋德隆。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^%\\^)5^!\"^$%^\"6^(x^-d^#j^)T^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJVxeKTVeISJeJCVeIjZeKHheLWReI2peKVReISIg",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e3f54bb393bd",
      "text": "  是的。他要我去收集雕像碎片。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^,X^&Z^!\"^!@^(C^$%^\"6^$M^)]^)^^!`^&o^&1^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLFheJlpeISJeIUBeKENeJCVeIjZeJE1eKV1eKV5eIWBeJm9eJjFeISI=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_11d997a88f23",
      "text": "  你們是哪裡人？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^*{^,X^+I^-j^!<^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeKnteLFheK0leLWpeITxeLlYg",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a5bd2b0572b4",
      "text": "  你們的村子發生了什麼事？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^*{^&Z^$z^#(^&W^&F^*D^!=^.T^*r^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeKnteJlpeJHpeIyheJldeJkZeKkReIT1eLlReKnJeLlYg",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6a8656a68f70",
      "text": "  蓋德隆在哪裡？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^-d^#j^)T^\"d^+I^-j^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLWReI2peKVReImReK0leLWpeLlYg",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e820042546f3",
      "text": "  你們想逃跑嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^*{^,1^(p^(_^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeKnteLDFeKHBeKF9eK1heLlY=",
      "byte_length": 23
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_44f8d58e0b5e",
      "text": "  跟我說說威米亞斯的事。",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^.+^$%^-x^-x^#&^'4^!9^$[^&Z^*r^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLiteJCVeLXheLXheIyZeJzReITleJFteJlpeKnJeISI=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_06007fe74aec",
      "text": "  守衛都去哪裡了？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^#+^(=^)$^\"6^+I^-j^*D^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIyteKD1eKSReIjZeK0leLWpeKkReLlY=",
      "byte_length": 26
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_44d36ab9c35b",
      "text": "  等救出你們之後，我會把這座營地徹底摧毀！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^'-^,Q^!q^*F^*{^!/^#b^*A^$%^$r^$1^(s^/_^&'^\"e^18^/^^$E^%N^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJy1eLFFeIXFeKkZeKnteIS9eI2JeKkFeJCVeJHJeJDFeKHNeL19eJideImVeMTheL15eJEVeJU5eKlc=",
      "byte_length": 62
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cb91c8808b24",
      "text": "  為什麼不逃出去宰了威米亞斯？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^%{^!=^.T^!)^(p^!q^\"6^1w^*D^#&^'4^!9^$[^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJXteIT1eLlReISleKHBeIXFeIjZeMXdeKkReIyZeJzReITleJFteLlY=",
      "byte_length": 44
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_758853c98af4",
      "text": "  為什麼那座雕像如此重要？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^%{^!=^.T^)!^/_^)^^!`^#$^%I^))^(C^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJXteIT1eLlReKSFeL19eKV5eIWBeIyReJUleKSleKENeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_351311fc36b5",
      "text": "  至少你們能重獲自由！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^'n^#<^*F^*{^'b^))^&:^'l^&I^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJ25eIzxeKkZeKnteJ2JeKSleJjpeJ2xeJkleKlc=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a3ef50045b23",
      "text": "蘇蘭人？休想！我聽說過他們是怎麼對待人類奴隸的——我們 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^4c^/G^!<^.V^!G^,1^*W^$%^-X^-x^(x^!@^*{^,X^,,^.T^#:^,*^!<^)w^##^)Z^&Z^*n^*n^$%^*{ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjRjXi9HXiE8Xi5WXiFHXiwxXipXXiQlXi1YXi14Xih4XiFAXip7XixYXiwsXi5UXiM6XiwqXiE8Xil3XiMjXilaXiZaXipuXipuXiQlXip7IA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3274c3823782",
      "text": "寧可死也不願被賣給他們。你肯定是在開玩笑吧？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^3k^\"A^%L^!1^!)^.H^(@^.$^'A^!@^*{^!\"^*F^-Z^#.^,X^\"d^)F^4U^-@^*I^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjNrXiJBXiVMXiExXiEpXi5IXihAXi4kXidBXiFAXip7XiEiXipGXi1aXiMuXixYXiJkXilGXjRVXi1AXipJXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_afddff08519d",
      "text": "  不，我沒開玩笑。我們走。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^!)^*A^$%^%\\^)F^4U^-@^!\"^$%^*{^.&^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeISleKkFeJCVeJVxeKUZeNFVeLUBeISJeJCVeKnteLiZeISIg",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d23933980016",
      "text": "  抱歉，我不是那個意思。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^,@^,h^*A^$%^!)^,X^)!^!V^#z^#q^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLEBeLGheKkFeJCVeISleLFheKSFeIVZeI3peI3FeISIg",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_191ce7003ab0",
      "text": "你休想逼我們去蘇蘭人那裡！除非你先把我們全殺了！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^!G^,1^.1^$%^*{^\"6^4c^/G^!<^)!^-j^*W^)Q^)i^*F^!b^$1^$%^*{^!h^%M^*D^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiFHXiwxXi4xXiQlXip7XiI2XjRjXi9HXiE8XikhXi1qXipXXilRXilpXipGXiFiXiQxXiQlXip7XiFoXiVNXipEXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3f49dd431fee",
      "text": "這種玩笑一點都不好笑。說出這種話，你損失的可不只是幽默感 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^'$^4U^-@^!%^*;^)$^!)^+i^-@^!\"^-x^!q^(s^'$^-v^*A^*F^$D^\"|^&Z^\"A^!)^\"?^,X^2f^:d^#{ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXickXjRVXi1AXiElXio7XikkXiEpXitpXi1AXiEiXi14XiFxXihzXickXi12XipBXipGXiREXiJ8XiZaXiJBXiEpXiI/XixYXjJmXjpkXiN7IA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_bb3d1bc60872",
      "text": "而已。那麼，你究竟是為了什麼來到這裡的？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'W^#J^!\"^)!^.T^*A^*F^-<^28^,X^%{^*D^!=^.T^!O^!u^(s^-j^&Z^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XidXXiNKXiEiXikhXi5UXipBXipGXi08XjI4XixYXiV7XipEXiE9Xi5UXiFPXiF1XihzXi1qXiZaXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0491f05e7e3d",
      "text": "很好！我們寧可戰死也不當你的奴隸！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*K^+i^*W^$%^*{^3k^\"A^$(^%L^!1^!)^&N^*F^&Z^##^)Z^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipLXitpXipXXiQlXip7XjNrXiJBXiQoXiVMXiExXiEpXiZOXipGXiZaXiMjXilaXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ce1e59ce7f6b",
      "text": "好吧。我們會留在這裡等你們回來。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+i^*I^!\"^$%^*{^$r^-+^\"d^(s^-j^'-^*F^*{^\"\\^!O^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitpXipJXiEiXiQlXip7XiRyXi0rXiJkXihzXi1qXictXipGXip7XiJcXiFPXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 49
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_cdeea48c1a1a",
      "text": "你們太謙虛了——你們為這片荒涼之地重燃了希望。去跟 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^+f^6x^-g^*D^*n^*n^*F^*{^%{^(s^&1^1W^,s^!/^\"e^))^&%^*D^+{^,]^!\"^\"6^.+ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XitmXjZ4Xi1nXipEXipuXipuXipGXip7XiV7XihzXiYxXjFXXixzXiEvXiJlXikpXiYlXipEXit7XixdXiEiXiI2Xi4rIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fcc636880fe1",
      "text": "我們的村長談談吧。我相信我們一定有辦法能幫上你們。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^&Z^$z^)C^0;^0;^*I^!\"^$%^&a^!U^$%^*{^!%^#.^$s^2L^%b^'b^+}^!'^*F^*{^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7XiZaXiR6XilDXjA7XjA7XipJXiEiXiQlXiZhXiFVXiQlXip7XiElXiMuXiRzXjJMXiViXidiXit9XiEnXipGXip7XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f0969054c05d",
      "text": "真的嗎？雖然我很想當場答應，但這件事並非我一個人所能 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-2^&Z^+X^.V^.A^&\"^$%^*K^,1^&N^\"n^-B^0`^*A^!I^(s^.W^*r^!+^)i^$%^!%^!V^!<^$)^'b ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi0yXiZaXitYXi5WXi5BXiYiXiQlXipLXiwxXiZOXiJuXi1CXjBgXipBXiFJXihzXi5XXipyXiErXilpXiQlXiElXiFWXiE8XiQpXidiIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_28fcca2c2375",
      "text": "決定的。你們必須去和村長商量，但除掉 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,o^#.^&Z^!\"^*F^*{^#l^)r^\"6^\"O^$z^)C^1'^)*^*A^!I^)Q^/e ",
      "encoded_base64": "XixvXiMuXiZaXiEiXipGXip7XiNsXilyXiI2XiJPXiR6XilDXjEnXikqXipBXiFJXilRXi9lIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8fcab287fc80",
      "text": "威米亞斯 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#&^'4^!9^$[ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiMmXic0XiE5XiRbIA==",
      "byte_length": 13
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_17af972d81e3",
      "text": "並解放我們， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!+^(I^$P^$%^*{^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiErXihJXiRQXiQlXip7XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 19
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d9e06ab2a912",
      "text": "絕對是邁向正確方向的一大步。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-I^#:^,X^2N^+?^%H^-6^$]^+?^&Z^!%^\"z^,i^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi1JXiM6XixYXjJOXis/XiVIXi02XiRdXis/XiZaXiElXiJ6XixpXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 43
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_10c96f9e1e1a",
      "text": "死了？我很難相信你們竟然能擊敗他，但如果你們所言 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%L^*D^.V^$%^*K^)a^&a^!U^*F^*{^28^&\"^'b^$F^$R^!@^*A^!I^#$^%!^*F^*{^$)^1Y ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVMXipEXi5WXiQlXipLXilhXiZhXiFVXipGXip7XjI4XiYiXidiXiRGXiRSXiFAXipBXiFJXiMkXiUhXipGXip7XiQpXjFZIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0097106d794f",
      "text": "屬實，那我們可就欠了你們天大的恩情。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#C^#3^*A^)!^$%^*{^\"A^*J^,g^*D^*F^*{^+e^\"z^&Z^#v^,0^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiNDXiMzXipBXikhXiQlXip7XiJBXipKXixnXipEXipGXip7XitlXiJ6XiZaXiN2XiwwXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d8c191619212",
      "text": "一名衛兵告訴我們，你們也為我們贖身了，我們現在自由了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!%^\"F^(=^+,^+B^-t^$%^*{^*A^*F^*{^!1^%{^$%^*{^3-^(c^*D^*A^$%^*{^&?^\"d^'l^&I^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiElXiJGXig9XissXitCXi10XiQlXip7XipBXipGXip7XiExXiV7XiQlXip7XjMtXihjXipEXipBXiQlXip7XiY/XiJkXidsXiZJXipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8b0214ecd7be",
      "text": "我們該如何報答你們才好？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^(M^#$^!L^+`^-B^*F^*{^$,^+i^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7XihNXiMkXiFMXitgXi1CXipGXip7XiQsXitpXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 37
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a4e6e634eaf3",
      "text": "真的嗎！你們肯定身手不凡，竟然能讓威米亞斯那樣的傢伙願意 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-2^&Z^+X^*W^*F^*{^-Z^#.^(c^$+^!)^+-^*A^28^&\"^'b^-}^#&^'4^!9^$[^)!^,f^&Z^+#^*y^.H^#z ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi0yXiZaXitYXipXXipGXip7Xi1aXiMuXihjXiQrXiEpXistXipBXjI4XiYiXidiXi19XiMmXic0XiE5XiRbXikhXixmXiZaXisjXip5Xi5IXiN6IA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b4ab3cf84298",
      "text": "達成交易！我們全體村民都欠了你們大恩大德。我們該如何報答你們才好？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(z^$$^0P^,W^*W^$%^*{^!h^**^$z^%T^)$^,g^*D^*F^*{^\"z^#v^\"z^#j^!\"^$%^*{^(M^#$^!L^+`^-B^*F^*{^$,^+i^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xih6XiQkXjBQXixXXipXXiQlXip7XiFoXioqXiR6XiVUXikkXixnXipEXipGXip7XiJ6XiN2XiJ6XiNqXiEiXiQlXip7XihNXiMkXiFMXitgXi1CXipGXip7XiQsXitpXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 100
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6e8c244cc9fe",
      "text": "衛兵已經告訴我們了。我們深感銘謝。然而，我們仍面臨著一個小小的 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(=^+,^#J^'D^+B^-t^$%^*{^*D^!\"^$%^*{^2*^#{^.;^-z^!\"^&\"^'W^*A^$%^*{^!?^)j^1U^-a^!%^!V^#;^#;^&Z ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xig9XissXiNKXidEXitCXi10XiQlXip7XipEXiEiXiQlXip7XjIqXiN7Xi47Xi16XiEiXiYiXidXXipBXiQlXip7XiE/XilqXjFVXi1hXiElXiFWXiM7XiM7XiZaIA==",
      "byte_length": 94
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a803ee3ea6db",
      "text": "難題——威米亞斯。只要那個惡魔還活著，我們就無法返回自己的村莊。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)a^.G^*n^*n^#&^'4^!9^$[^!\"^\"?^(C^)!^!V^#y^*0^.7^%i^-a^*A^$%^*{^*J^%}^%b^7J^\"\\^'l^#I^&Z^$z^6l^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XilhXi5HXipuXipuXiMmXic0XiE5XiRbXiEiXiI/XihDXikhXiFWXiN5XiowXi43XiVpXi1hXipBXiQlXip7XipKXiV9XiViXjdKXiJcXidsXiNJXiZaXiR6XjZsXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 97
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c26bf50dc359",
      "text": "把營地的人全殺了？雖然我很慶幸能重獲自由，但我真希望你們不必 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$1^&'^\"e^&Z^!<^!h^%M^*D^.V^.A^&\"^$%^*K^5P^15^'b^))^&:^'l^&I^*A^!I^$%^-2^+{^,]^*F^*{^!)^#l ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQxXiYnXiJlXiZaXiE8XiFoXiVNXipEXi5WXi5BXiYiXiQlXipLXjVQXjE1XidiXikpXiY6XidsXiZJXipBXiFJXiQlXi0yXit7XixdXipGXip7XiEpXiNsIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2c82d0ceddc5",
      "text": "訴諸於殺光那些人的手段。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-t^1]^$^^%M^!c^)!^!8^!<^&Z^$+^.l^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi10XjFdXiReXiVNXiFjXikhXiE4XiE8XiZaXiQrXi5sXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 37
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_65b753c0e6d9",
      "text": "即使我們自由了，我們仍面臨著一個小小的難題——威米亞斯。只要那個惡魔 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"1^!N^$%^*{^'l^&I^*D^*A^$%^*{^!?^)j^1U^-a^!%^!V^#;^#;^&Z^)a^.G^*n^*n^#&^'4^!9^$[^!\"^\"?^(C^)!^!V^#y^*0 ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiIxXiFOXiQlXip7XidsXiZJXipEXipBXiQlXip7XiE/XilqXjFVXi1hXiElXiFWXiM7XiM7XiZaXilhXi5HXipuXipuXiMmXic0XiE5XiRbXiEiXiI/XihDXikhXiFWXiN5XiowIA==",
      "byte_length": 103
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_10a7a366b8ab",
      "text": "還活著，我們就無法返回自己的村莊。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.7^%i^-a^*A^$%^*{^*J^%}^%b^7J^\"\\^'l^#I^&Z^$z^6l^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi43XiVpXi1hXipBXiQlXip7XipKXiV9XiViXjdKXiJcXidsXiNJXiZaXiR6XjZsXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 52
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_31b90a0542f9",
      "text": "我們現在——是奴隸。我們即將被賣給蘇蘭人以換取一筆 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^&?^\"d^*n^*n^,X^##^)Z^!\"^$%^*{^\"1^#7^(@^.$^'A^4c^/G^!<^!B^4@^\":^!%^-A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7XiY/XiJkXipuXipuXixYXiMjXilaXiEiXiQlXip7XiIxXiM3XihAXi4kXidBXjRjXi9HXiE8XiFCXjRAXiI6XiElXi1BIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3395235b51c5",
      "text": "金錢。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)+^.<^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XikrXi48XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 10
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_200144d62a0c",
      "text": "我們原本要被賣給一些蘇蘭人以換取一筆錢財。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^\"5^$x^(C^(@^.$^'A^!%^!8^4c^/G^!<^!B^4@^\":^!%^-A^.<^0=^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7XiI1XiR4XihDXihAXi4kXidBXiElXiE4XjRjXi9HXiE8XiFCXjRAXiI6XiElXi1BXi48XjA9XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_59385f8066af",
      "text": "謝天謝地，你們阻止了這場悲劇。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-z^+e^-z^\"e^*A^*F^*{^)L^%G^*D^(s^\"n^,.^1#^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi16XitlXi16XiJlXipBXipGXip7XilMXiVHXipEXihzXiJuXiwuXjEjXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d8ec50c9bac4",
      "text": "村子依然受制於威米亞斯的咒縛之下嗎？願他的名字遭永世詛咒！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$z^#(^!Q^&\"^\";^!v^$^^#&^'4^!9^$[^&Z^\"P^3W^!/^!(^+X^.V^.H^!@^&Z^\"F^#)^(}^%W^*p^(L^\"P^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiR6XiMoXiFRXiYiXiI7XiF2XiReXiMmXic0XiE5XiRbXiZaXiJQXjNXXiEvXiEoXitYXi5WXi5IXiFAXiZaXiJGXiMpXih9XiVXXipwXihMXiJQXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1490fb3b1edb",
      "text": "是的。那座雕像是威米亞斯全副心神所在。我擔心拯救村子的唯一 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,X^&Z^!\"^)!^/_^)^^!`^,X^#&^'4^!9^$[^!h^52^#k^&w^$)^\"d^!\"^$%^*N^#k^,F^,Q^$z^#(^&Z^+O^!% ",
      "encoded_base64": "XixYXiZaXiEiXikhXi9fXileXiFgXixYXiMmXic0XiE5XiRbXiFoXjUyXiNrXiZ3XiQpXiJkXiEiXiQlXipOXiNrXixGXixRXiR6XiMoXiZaXitPXiElIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_dff11154a300",
      "text": "途徑，就是把他索要的東西帶給他。如果想要拯救小鎮， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^3.^#c^*A^*J^,X^$1^!@^'>^(C^&Z^,`^-l^#N^'A^!@^!\"^#$^%!^,1^(C^,F^,Q^#;^);^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XjMuXiNjXipBXipKXixYXiQxXiFAXic+XihDXiZaXixgXi1sXiNOXidBXiFAXiEiXiMkXiUhXiwxXihDXixGXixRXiM7Xik7XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a0b354b189c4",
      "text": "你們就必須照他的要求去做。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^*J^#l^)r^/x^!@^&Z^(C^,n^\"6^*~^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XipKXiNsXilyXi94XiFAXiZaXihDXixuXiI2Xip+XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 40
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9628d82e840b",
      "text": "我們來自蓋德隆村——或者該說，是那個村子所殘存的一切。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^!O^'l^-d^#j^)T^$z^*n^*n^$'^'V^(M^-x^*A^,X^)!^!V^$z^#(^$)^,l^#*^&Z^!%^+.^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7XiFPXidsXi1kXiNqXilUXiR6XipuXipuXiQnXidWXihNXi14XipBXixYXikhXiFWXiR6XiMoXiQpXixsXiMqXiZaXiElXisuXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d8a1d9268d5a",
      "text": "一名荒蕪術士潛入了鎮上，控制了村長，接著又控制了村裡的其他人。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!%^\"F^1W^4b^(<^+a^7:^!f^*D^);^!'^*A^$@^!v^*D^$z^)C^*A^$?^-a^+;^$@^!v^*D^$z^-j^&Z^!j^!@^!<^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiElXiJGXjFXXjRiXig8XithXjc6XiFmXipEXik7XiEnXipBXiRAXiF2XipEXiR6XilDXipBXiQ/Xi1hXis7XiRAXiF2XipEXiR6Xi1qXiZaXiFqXiFAXiE8XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 94
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_aa0838d4321b",
      "text": "他威脅說如果我們不離開並去充當奴隸， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^#&^1T^-x^#$^%!^$%^*{^!)^)`^)F^!+^\"6^5.^&N^##^)Z^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXiMmXjFUXi14XiMkXiUhXiQlXip7XiEpXilgXilGXiErXiI2XjUuXiZOXiMjXilaXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 55
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5cc3ec120f0a",
      "text": "他就會殺光所有人。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^*J^$r^%M^!c^$)^$s^!<^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXipKXiRyXiVNXiFjXiQpXiRzXiE8XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 28
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fc715c48f8e9",
      "text": "它在這邊的南方。我警告你們，如果你們打算去那裡，威米亞斯 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+o^\"d^(s^.8^&Z^\"/^$]^!\"^$%^(S^+B^*F^*{^*A^#$^%!^*F^*{^$-^-C^\"6^)!^-j^*A^#&^'4^!9^$[ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitvXiJkXihzXi44XiZaXiIvXiRdXiEiXiQlXihTXitCXipGXip7XipBXiMkXiUhXipGXip7XiQtXi1DXiI2XikhXi1qXipBXiMmXic0XiE5XiRbIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5e80f0906cd5",
      "text": "會在你們對他採取任何行動時屠殺全村。請千萬別讓他 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$r^\"d^*F^*{^#:^!@^5R^\":^!C^!L^(;^\"%^$f^#A^%M^!h^$z^!\"^*S^+7^-_^*H^-}^!@ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiRyXiJkXipGXip7XiM6XiFAXjVSXiI6XiFDXiFMXig7XiIlXiRmXiNBXiVNXiFoXiR6XiEiXipTXis3Xi1fXipIXi19XiFAIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_41a153a34901",
      "text": "不行！上一次有人逃跑，威米亞斯就把那個人的家人給活活 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^(;^*W^!'^!%^%D^$s^!<^(p^(_^*A^#&^'4^!9^$[^*J^$1^)!^!V^!<^&Z^+s^!<^'A^%i^%i ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXig7XipXXiEnXiElXiVEXiRzXiE8XihwXihfXipBXiMmXic0XiE5XiRbXipKXiQxXikhXiFWXiE8XiZaXitzXiE8XidBXiVpXiVpIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_dcb8517bc5c6",
      "text": "燒死了！這根本不值得冒險！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&&^%L^*D^*W^(s^%)^$x^!)^!Z^#e^/P^*m^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiYmXiVMXipEXipXXihzXiUpXiR4XiEpXiFaXiNlXi9QXiptXipX",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_986c8d1a638b",
      "text": "我只知道他對某座雕像非常著迷。他簡直是個瘋子！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^\"?^&h^(y^!@^#:^%$^/_^)^^!`^)i^#O^-a^(n^!\"^!@^3y^&`^,X^!V^-/^#(^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiI/XiZoXih5XiFAXiM6XiUkXi9fXileXiFgXilpXiNPXi1hXihuXiEiXiFAXjN5XiZgXixYXiFWXi0vXiMoXipX",
      "byte_length": 69
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9c8df9eabd9b",
      "text": "他們又在偷懶休息了。他們知道我們不敢逃跑。只要我們膽敢嘗試， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^*{^+;^\"d^/O^9Y^!G^#w^*D^!\"^!@^*{^&h^(y^$%^*{^!)^/m^(p^(_^!\"^\"?^(C^$%^*{^-[^/m^1o^-u^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXip7Xis7XiJkXi9PXjlZXiFHXiN3XipEXiEiXiFAXip7XiZoXih5XiQlXip7XiEpXi9tXihwXihfXiEiXiI/XihDXiQlXip7Xi1bXi9tXjFvXi11XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4188339da9fb",
      "text": "威米亞斯就會殺了我們的家人。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#&^'4^!9^$[^*J^$r^%M^*D^$%^*{^&Z^+s^!<^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiMmXic0XiE5XiRbXipKXiRyXiVNXipEXiQlXip7XiZaXitzXiE8XiEi",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_52e48b8a9656",
      "text": "不行。威米亞斯是個荒蕪術士，他通曉的事物遠超目力所及。無論成功的機率有多大， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^(;^!\"^#&^'4^!9^$[^,X^!V^1W^4b^(<^+a^*A^!@^(t^7y^&Z^*r^&4^({^(\\^&^^!~^$)^\"7^!\"^%}^1\\^$$^\"!^&Z^%>^22^$s^\"x^\"z^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXig7XiEiXiMmXic0XiE5XiRbXixYXiFWXjFXXjRiXig8XithXipBXiFAXih0Xjd5XiZaXipyXiY0Xih7XihcXiZeXiF+XiQpXiI3XiEiXiV9XjFcXiQkXiIhXiZaXiU+XjIyXiRzXiJ4XiJ6XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 115
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_8b68bb783bf3",
      "text": "我絕不做那個因為企圖嘗試某些可能被威米亞斯察覺的舉動， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^-I^!)^*~^)!^!V^\"]^%{^4-^\"b^1o^-u^%$^!8^\"A^'b^(@^#&^'4^!9^$[^#2^(G^&Z^01^\"%^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXi1JXiEpXip+XikhXiFWXiJdXiV7XjQtXiJiXjFvXi11XiUkXiE4XiJBXidiXihAXiMmXic0XiE5XiRbXiMyXihHXiZaXjAxXiIlXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_337abbb66cc5",
      "text": "而害死我們家人的人。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'W^#/^%L^$%^*{^+s^!<^&Z^!<^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XidXXiMvXiVMXiQlXip7XitzXiE8XiZaXiE8XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 31
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b6f315d6545d",
      "text": "沒有什麼比手刃那個怪物更讓我痛快的事了！但是，我們甚至還沒走近，他就會用 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%\\^$s^!=^.T^,m^$+^!r^)!^!V^#s^&4^$o^-}^$%^-.^*L^&Z^*r^*D^*W^!I^,X^*A^$%^*{^/|^'n^.7^%\\^.&^(l^*A^!@^*J^$r^&H ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVcXiRzXiE9Xi5UXixtXiQrXiFyXikhXiFWXiNzXiY0XiRvXi19XiQlXi0uXipMXiZaXipyXipEXipXXiFJXixYXipBXiQlXip7Xi98XiduXi43XiVcXi4mXihsXipBXiFAXipKXiRyXiZIIA==",
      "byte_length": 109
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_54843b39dcb0",
      "text": "一個法術把我們整個村莊徹底化為齏粉。這根本不可能。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!%^!V^%b^(<^$1^$%^*{^$T^!V^$z^6l^18^/^^\")^%{^9g^'5^!\"^(s^%)^$x^!)^\"A^'b^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiElXiFWXiViXig8XiQxXiQlXip7XiRUXiFWXiR6XjZsXjE4Xi9eXiIpXiV7XjlnXic1XiEiXihzXiUpXiR4XiEpXiJBXidiXiEi",
      "byte_length": 75
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_15f54effdc60",
      "text": "我不知道。自從他來到村莊後，就一直在尋找 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^!)^&h^(y^!\"^'l^#f^!@^!O^!u^$z^6l^#b^*A^*J^!%^&`^\"d^#9^$/ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiEpXiZoXih5XiEiXidsXiNmXiFAXiFPXiF1XiR6XjZsXiNiXipBXipKXiElXiZgXiJkXiM5XiQvIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3a3bc725b09c",
      "text": "那座雕像遺失的碎片。我敢肯定這是某個邪惡陰謀的一部分。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^/_^)^^!`^0v^\"|^&Z^&o^&1^!\"^$%^/m^-Z^#.^(s^,X^%$^!V^)\"^#y^6B^3~^&Z^!%^)#^!s^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXi9fXileXiFgXjB2XiJ8XiZaXiZvXiYxXiEiXiQlXi9tXi1aXiMuXihzXixYXiUkXiFWXikiXiN5XjZCXjN+XiZaXiElXikjXiFzXiEi",
      "byte_length": 81
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6091f7e508de",
      "text": "確實如此，但我不會改變心意。如果你們想襲擊奴隸販子， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-6^#3^#$^%I^*A^!I^$%^!)^$r^$N^(U^#k^#z^!\"^#$^%!^*F^*{^,1^08^$F^##^)Z^6.^#(^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi02XiMzXiMkXiVJXipBXiFJXiQlXiEpXiRyXiROXihVXiNrXiN6XiEiXiMkXiUhXipGXip7XiwxXjA4XiRGXiMjXilaXjYuXiMoXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4bfeae7c31f4",
      "text": "儘管動手——但我們絕不插手。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+(^-D^\"%^$+^*n^*n^!I^$%^*{^-I^!)^4{^$+^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XisoXi1EXiIlXiQrXipuXipuXiFJXiQlXip7Xi1JXiEpXjR7XiQrXiEi",
      "byte_length": 42
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_83b0d527b117",
      "text": "謝謝你們救了我們。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-z^-z^*F^*{^,Q^*D^$%^*{^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi16Xi16XipGXip7XixRXipEXiQlXip7XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 28
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_526370b8c2ff",
      "text": "去和我們的首領卡拉斯談談吧。你們可以在圍欄中央找到他。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"6^\"O^$%^*{^&Z^)~^)s^\"0^$6^$[^0;^0;^*I^!\"^*F^*{^\"A^!B^\"d^\"`^%C^!,^5@^$/^!u^!@^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiI2XiJPXiQlXip7XiZaXil+XilzXiIwXiQ2XiRbXjA7XjA7XipJXiEiXipGXip7XiJBXiFCXiJkXiJgXiVDXiEsXjVAXiQvXiF1XiFAXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_54559c90c350",
      "text": "卡拉斯代表我們大家。他就在圍欄中央。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"0^$6^$[^*v^-i^$%^*{^\"z^+s^!\"^!@^*J^\"d^\"`^%C^!,^5@^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiIwXiQ2XiRbXip2Xi1pXiQlXip7XiJ6XitzXiEiXiFAXipKXiJkXiJgXiVDXiEsXjVAXiEi",
      "byte_length": 54
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1124f42f02f2",
      "text": "我們跟在你們身後。我們走吧。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^*{^.+^\"d^*F^*{^(c^#b^!\"^$%^*{^.&^*I^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXip7Xi4rXiJkXipGXip7XihjXiNiXiEiXiQlXip7Xi4mXipJXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 43
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0e980301b11e",
      "text": "嘿！等一下！我有話要跟你們說！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+\\^*W^'-^!%^!(^*W^$%^$s^-v^(C^.+^*F^*{^-x^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XitcXipXXictXiElXiEoXipXXiQlXiRzXi12XihDXi4rXipGXip7Xi14XipX",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_f24f63bfb1e0",
      "text": "你們自以為在對我的角鬥士做什麼？！給我住手！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^'l^!B^%{^\"d^#:^$%^&Z^(H^*,^+a^*~^!=^.T^.V^*W^'A^$%^*z^$+^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7XidsXiFCXiV7XiJkXiM6XiQlXiZaXihIXiosXithXip+XiE9Xi5UXi5WXipXXidBXiQlXip6XiQrXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_348b451ca702",
      "text": "  不。他們現在自由了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^!)^!\"^!@^*{^&?^\"d^'l^&I^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeISleISJeIUBeKnteJj9eImReJ2xeJkleKkReISIg",
      "byte_length": 33
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_1a08433fd897",
      "text": "  你再也不能扣留他們了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^!l^!1^!)^'b^$.^-+^!@^*{^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeIWxeITFeISleJ2JeJC5eLSteIUBeKnteKkReISIg",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_9e8128bbbefd",
      "text": "  他們不再是你的角鬥士了！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^!@^*{^!)^!l^,X^*F^&Z^(H^*,^+a^*D^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIUBeKnteISleIWxeLFheKkZeJlpeKEheKixeK2FeKkReKlcg",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4c9cd1404991",
      "text": "  認賠了事，安靜地滾吧。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^(O^62^*D^*r^*A^+p^)h^\"e^,z^*I^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKE9eNjJeKkReKnJeKkFeK3BeKWheImVeLHpeKkleISIg",
      "byte_length": 36
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fb856a9f8df9",
      "text": "  威米亞斯已經死了。你阻止不了他們。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^#&^'4^!9^$[^#J^'D^%L^*D^!\"^*F^)L^%G^!)^*D^!@^*{^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeIyZeJzReITleJFteI0peJ0ReJUxeKkReISJeKkZeKUxeJUdeISleKkReIUBeKnteISIg",
      "byte_length": 54
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2565bff44a64",
      "text": "  你真該別再幹這種勾當了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^-2^(M^*H^!l^,!^(s^'$^7t^&N^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeLTJeKE1eKkheIWxeLCFeKHNeJyReN3ReJk5eKkReISIg",
      "byte_length": 39
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_80a226f3d50b",
      "text": "  你真以為你能對付得了我們？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^-2^!B^%{^*F^'b^#:^*u^#e^*D^$%^*{^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeLTJeIUJeJXteKkZeJ2JeIzpeKnVeI2VeKkReJCVeKnteLlY=",
      "byte_length": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_90d30c74b515",
      "text": "  哎呀！我會把他們放回去的。抱歉。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^3i^3h^*W^$%^$r^$1^!@^*{^$P^\"\\^\"6^&Z^!\"^,@^,h^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeM2leM2heKldeJCVeJHJeJDFeIUBeKnteJFBeIlxeIjZeJlpeISJeLEBeLGheISIg",
      "byte_length": 51
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_83518148f287",
      "text": "是這樣嗎？聽著，我很樂意把他們賣給你們，但像這樣直接帶走他們， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^,X^(s^,f^+X^.V^-X^-a^*A^$%^*K^%8^#z^$1^!@^*{^.$^'A^*F^*{^*A^!I^!`^(s^,f^&`^$?^#N^.&^!@^*{^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XixYXihzXixmXitYXi5WXi1YXi1hXipBXiQlXipLXiU4XiN6XiQxXiFAXip7Xi4kXidBXipGXip7XipBXiFJXiFgXihzXixmXiZgXiQ/XiNOXi4mXiFAXip7XipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 94
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e922c0808075",
      "text": "不僅讓我很沒面子，而且我還損失了一大筆開銷！你們打算 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^!_^-}^$%^*K^%\\^)j^#(^*A^'W^!*^$%^.7^$D^\"|^*D^!%^\"z^-A^)F^)1^*W^*F^*{^$-^-C ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXiFfXi19XiQlXipLXiVcXilqXiMoXipBXidXXiEqXiQlXi43XiREXiJ8XipEXiElXiJ6Xi1BXilGXikxXipXXipGXip7XiQtXi1DIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_42ac9d15438a",
      "text": "要我怎麼辦？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(C^$%^,,^.T^2L^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihDXiQlXiwsXi5UXjJMXi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 19
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2265cbe3320f",
      "text": "你是認真的嗎？你知不知道我會虧多少錢？！我看我還是去 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^,X^(O^-2^&Z^+X^.V^*F^&h^!)^&h^(y^$%^$r^9N^\"x^#<^.<^.V^*W^$%^*Q^$%^.7^,X^\"6 ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXixYXihPXi0yXiZaXitYXi5WXipGXiZoXiEpXiZoXih5XiQlXiRyXjlOXiJ4XiM8Xi48Xi5WXipXXiQlXipRXiQlXi43XixYXiI2IA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_93a4534d624e",
      "text": "把這件事告訴威米亞斯好了——他一定會讓他們乖乖留下來的。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$1^(s^.W^*r^+B^-t^#&^'4^!9^$[^+i^*D^*n^*n^!@^!%^#.^$r^-}^!@^*{^0{^0{^-+^!(^!O^&Z^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQxXihzXi5XXipyXitCXi10XiMmXic0XiE5XiRbXitpXipEXipuXipuXiFAXiElXiMuXiRyXi19XiFAXip7XjB7XjB7Xi0rXiEoXiFPXiZaXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_274e11330028",
      "text": "要是這幫衛兵懂得用心點而不是偷懶摸魚，我何苦要親自幹這種事！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(C^,X^(s^+}^(=^+,^,6^#e^&H^#k^*;^'W^!)^,X^/O^9Y^/j^:'^*A^$%^!L^.t^(C^(F^'l^,!^(s^'$^*r^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihDXixYXihzXit9Xig9XissXiw2XiNlXiZIXiNrXio7XidXXiEpXixYXi9PXjlZXi9qXjonXipBXiQlXiFMXi50XihDXihGXidsXiwhXihzXickXipyXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4d93f6da313b",
      "text": "現在，你們是要阻止這場逃跑，還是非得要我動用武力？ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^&?^\"d^*A^*F^*{^,X^(C^)L^%G^(s^\"n^(p^(_^*A^.7^,X^)i^#e^(C^$%^\"%^&H^%J^!~^.V ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiY/XiJkXipBXipGXip7XixYXihDXilMXiVHXihzXiJuXihwXihfXipBXi43XixYXilpXiNlXihDXiQlXiIlXiZIXiVKXiF+Xi5WIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_0b39467b8d46",
      "text": "卡拉斯插話道！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"0^$6^$[^4{^-v^(y^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiIwXiQ2XiRbXjR7Xi12Xih5XipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 22
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5d24a6dc3da3",
      "text": "休想！你帶不走我們的！我們一定要回我們的村子——就算非得 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!G^,1^*W^*F^#N^!)^.&^$%^*{^&Z^*W^$%^*{^!%^#.^(C^\"\\^$%^*{^&Z^$z^#(^*n^*n^*J^-C^)i^#e ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFHXiwxXipXXipGXiNOXiEpXi4mXiQlXip7XiZaXipXXiQlXip7XiElXiMuXihDXiJcXiQlXip7XiZaXiR6XiMoXipuXipuXipKXi1DXilpXiNlIA==",
      "byte_length": 85
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_39a39540b1b4",
      "text": "殺了你才能回去也在所不惜！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^%M^*D^*F^$,^'b^\"\\^\"6^!1^\"d^$)^!)^7X^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiVNXipEXipGXiQsXidiXiJcXiI2XiExXiJkXiQpXiEpXjdYXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 40
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_27bd24667318",
      "text": "開什麼玩笑？！我和我的衛兵一眨眼就能把你們全擺平！沒錯，我們…… ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)F^!=^.T^4U^-@^.V^*W^$%^\"O^$%^&Z^(=^+,^!%^;F^&d^*J^'b^$1^*F^*{^!h^1@^0Y^*W^%\\^)5^*A^$%^*{^*o^*o ",
      "encoded_base64": "XilGXiE9Xi5UXjRVXi1AXi5WXipXXiQlXiJPXiQlXiZaXig9XissXiElXjtGXiZkXipKXidiXiQxXipGXip7XiFoXjFAXjBZXipXXiVcXik1XipBXiQlXip7XipvXipvIA==",
      "byte_length": 97
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_021dc421c9c8",
      "text": "真的……能……擺平……你們……",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-2^&Z^*o^*o^'b^*o^*o^1@^0Y^*o^*o^*F^*{^*o^*o",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi0yXiZaXipvXipvXidiXipvXipvXjFAXjBZXipvXipvXipGXip7XipvXipv",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_4391d8a261d2",
      "text": "阿蘭特望向他手下的一名衛兵，果不其然，那傢伙又在打瞌睡了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)M^/G^&5^,]^+?^!@^$+^!(^&Z^!%^\"F^(=^+,^*A^%!^!)^!j^&\"^*A^)!^+#^*y^+;^\"d^$-^=<^-3^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XilNXi9HXiY1XixdXis/XiFAXiQrXiEoXiZaXiElXiJGXig9XissXipBXiUhXiEpXiFqXiYiXipBXikhXisjXip5Xis7XiJkXiQtXj08Xi0zXipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 88
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3f0942dc5a1a",
      "text": "阿蘭特環顧四周尋找手下，才發現根本沒有半個人跟上來。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)M^/G^&5^&B^4n^\"[^\"L^#9^$/^$+^!(^*A^$,^&W^&?^%)^$x^%\\^$s^\"-^!V^!<^.+^!'^!O^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XilNXi9HXiY1XiZCXjRuXiJbXiJMXiM5XiQvXiQrXiEoXipBXiQsXiZXXiY/XiUpXiR4XiVcXiRzXiItXiFWXiE8Xi4rXiEnXiFPXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 79
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_7158ceb9438d",
      "text": "他嘆了一口氣。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^59^*D^!%^\"<^%U^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXjU5XipEXiElXiI8XiVVXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 22
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_579495afcb09",
      "text": "唉，我到底在騙誰啊？你們贏了。我要離開這鬼地方了。事實上，拿去吧， ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+M^*A^$%^!u^/^^\"d^.{^-y^+Q^.V^*F^*{^.%^*D^!\"^$%^(C^)`^)F^(s^*-^\"e^$]^*D^!\"^*r^#3^!'^*A^,G^\"6^*I^*A ",
      "encoded_base64": "XitNXipBXiQlXiF1Xi9eXiJkXi57Xi15XitRXi5WXipGXip7Xi4lXipEXiEiXiQlXihDXilgXilGXihzXiotXiJlXiRdXipEXiEiXipyXiMzXiEnXipBXixHXiI2XipJXipBIA==",
      "byte_length": 100
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_43ff18c1d3b0",
      "text": "這些裝備全給你們了——我再也不幹這行了。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^!8^(A^+\"^!h^'A^*F^*{^*D^*n^*n^$%^!l^!1^!)^,!^(s^(;^*D^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXiE4XihBXisiXiFoXidBXipGXip7XipEXipuXipuXiQlXiFsXiExXiEpXiwhXihzXig7XipEXiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 61
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_fae82205b5d5",
      "text": "對於你們所做的一切，我真是感激不盡。我們現在要回 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#:^$^^*F^*{^$)^*~^&Z^!%^+.^*A^$%^-2^,X^#{^1H^!)^-1^!\"^$%^*{^&?^\"d^(C^\"\\ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiM6XiReXipGXip7XiQpXip+XiZaXiElXisuXipBXiQlXi0yXixYXiN7XjFIXiEpXi0xXiEiXiQlXip7XiY/XiJkXihDXiJcIA==",
      "byte_length": 73
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_641f765dec0f",
      "text": "蓋德隆了。祝你們旅途順利。 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^-d^#j^)T^*D^!\"^&v^*F^*{^2m^3.^.D^!t^!\" ",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi1kXiNqXilUXipEXiEiXiZ2XipGXip7XjJtXjMuXi5EXiF0XiEiIA==",
      "byte_length": 40
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_e92c9d4eb02a",
      "text": "甚、什麼？！死了？喔，太好了！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^/|^!!^!=^.T^.V^*W^%L^*D^.V^+T^*A^+f^+i^*D^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi98XiEhXiE9Xi5UXi5WXipXXiVMXipEXi5WXitUXipBXitmXitpXipEXipX",
      "byte_length": 45
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_2650ba1cc9b7",
      "text": "阿蘭特撿起一塊大石頭，轉向身旁的一名衛兵…… ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)M^/G^&5^=9^.(^!%^/Z^\"z^&k^)t^*A^(i^+?^(c^.h^&Z^!%^\"F^(=^+,^*o^*o ",
      "encoded_base64": "XilNXi9HXiY1Xj05Xi4oXiElXi9aXiJ6XiZrXil0XipBXihpXis/XihjXi5oXiZaXiElXiJGXig9XissXipvXipvIA==",
      "byte_length": 67
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a1379863076a",
      "text": "你！為什麼沒人把這件事向我通報！你剛才又在打瞌睡了，對吧？！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*W^%{^!=^.T^%\\^!<^$1^(s^.W^*r^+?^$%^(t^+`^*W^*F^+0^$,^+;^\"d^$-^=<^-3^*D^*A^#:^*I^.V^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXipXXiV7XiE9Xi5UXiVcXiE8XiQxXihzXi5XXipyXis/XiQlXih0XitgXipXXipGXiswXiQsXis7XiJkXiQtXj08Xi0zXipEXipBXiM6XipJXi5WXipX",
      "byte_length": 90
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b96540090999",
      "text": "不等衛兵回答，阿蘭特就用力把石頭砸向衛兵！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^'-^(=^+,^\"\\^-B^*A^)M^/G^&5^*J^&H^!~^$1^&k^)t^0#^+?^(=^+,^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXictXig9XissXiJcXi1CXipBXilNXi9HXiY1XipKXiZIXiF+XiQxXiZrXil0XjAjXis/Xig9XissXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 64
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_ec2f955eea11",
      "text": "這就當作給你的教訓！ ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^*J^&N^!M^'A^*F^&Z^,R^-p^*W ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXipKXiZOXiFNXidBXipGXiZaXixSXi1wXipXIA==",
      "byte_length": 31
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_23d5818cfe4c",
      "text": "不！趁你們還能走的時候快點離開這裡！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!)^*W^.)^*F^*{^.7^'b^.&^&Z^$f^*|^*L^*;^)`^)F^(s^-j^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiEpXipXXi4pXipGXip7Xi43XidiXi4mXiZaXiRmXip8XipMXio7XilgXilGXihzXi1qXipX",
      "byte_length": 54
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_71da9bd510da",
      "text": "  滾開別擋路，矮冬瓜！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^,z^)F^*H^$G^(a^*A^&j^=O^<X^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeLHpeKUZeKkheJEdeKGFeKkFeJmpePU9ePFheKlc=",
      "byte_length": 32
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_59b08e6a4dff",
      "text": "  這裡到底有什麼樣的怪物？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^(s^-j^!u^/^^$s^!=^.T^,f^&Z^#s^&4^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKHNeLWpeIXVeL15eJHNeIT1eLlReLGZeJlpeI3NeJjReLlY=",
      "byte_length": 38
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b0d8b4cc15bf",
      "text": "  我才不怕什麼怪物！",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^$%^$,^!)^0^^!=^.T^#s^&4^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeJCVeJCxeISleMF5eIT1eLlReI3NeJjReKlc=",
      "byte_length": 29
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_92765d7872a4",
      "text": "  你的同伴遭遇了什麼事？",
      "encoded_ascii": "  ^*F^&Z^\"E^1h^(}^.2^*D^!=^.T^*r^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "ICBeKkZeJlpeIkVeMWheKH1eLjJeKkReIT1eLlReKnJeLlY=",
      "byte_length": 35
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_218bbe198b37",
      "text": "多謝提醒，後會有期。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"x^-z^$A^.9^*A^#b^$r^$s^$u^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiJ4Xi16XiRBXi45XipBXiNiXiRyXiRzXiR1XiEi",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_6abe30c36cac",
      "text": "這片區域到處都是怪物！如果你們不回頭，肯定會死無葬身之地，就像 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(s^&1^\"+^\"k^!u^(,^)$^,X^#s^&4^*W^#$^%!^*F^*{^!)^\"\\^)t^*A^-Z^#.^$r^%L^%}^-b^(c^!/^\"e^*A^*J^!` ",
      "encoded_base64": "XihzXiYxXiIrXiJrXiF1XigsXikkXixYXiNzXiY0XipXXiMkXiUhXipGXip7XiEpXiJcXil0XipBXi1aXiMuXiRyXiVMXiV9Xi1iXihjXiEvXiJlXipBXipKXiFgIA==",
      "byte_length": 94
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a1e76c695ee7",
      "text": "我的同伴那樣慘死。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^&Z^\"E^1h^)!^,f^,4^%L^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiZaXiJFXjFoXikhXixmXiw0XiVMXiEi",
      "byte_length": 27
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_d0cf8e7d7f86",
      "text": "你們絕不會想知道的！忘了這個鬼地方，永遠別再回來，因為 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^*{^-I^!)^$r^,1^&h^(y^&Z^*W^0]^*D^(s^!V^*-^\"e^$]^*A^%W^({^*H^!l^\"\\^!O^*A^\"]^%{ ",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXip7Xi1JXiEpXiRyXiwxXiZoXih5XiZaXipXXjBdXipEXihzXiFWXiotXiJlXiRdXipBXiVXXih7XipIXiFsXiJcXiFPXipBXiJdXiV7IA==",
      "byte_length": 82
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_510d7bf39a2b",
      "text": "如果你們留下來，就永遠別想活著離開。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^#$^%!^*F^*{^-+^!(^!O^*A^*J^%W^({^*H^,1^%i^-a^)`^)F^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiMkXiUhXipGXip7Xi0rXiEoXiFPXipBXipKXiVXXih7XipIXiwxXiVpXi1hXilgXilGXiEi",
      "byte_length": 54
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_576227ad2e47",
      "text": "那你們很快就會體會到恐懼的滋味！就在我身後沒幾步遠的地方，有兩隻巨蠍獸！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^*F^*{^*K^*L^*J^$r^**^$r^!u^#t^$#^&Z^7|^1n^*W^*J^\"d^$%^(c^#b^%\\^#T^,i^({^&Z^\"e^$]^*A^$s^!i^)[^#H^06^&<^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXipGXip7XipLXipMXipKXiRyXioqXiRyXiF1XiN0XiQjXiZaXjd8XjFuXipXXipKXiJkXiQlXihjXiNiXiVcXiNUXixpXih7XiZaXiJlXiRdXipBXiRzXiFpXilbXiNIXjA2XiY8XipX",
      "byte_length": 108
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_5c696fe2a9e7",
      "text": "他們被一群托爾螳螂人給殺了……我告訴你們，這裡除了死亡以外什麼都沒有。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^!@^*{^(@^!%^'R^/-^&/^8O^8N^!<^'A^%M^*D^*o^*o^$%^+B^-t^*F^*{^*A^(s^-j^)Q^*D^%L^!:^!B^\"w^!=^.T^)$^%\\^$s^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XiFAXip7XihAXiElXidSXi8tXiYvXjhPXjhOXiE8XidBXiVNXipEXipvXipvXiQlXitCXi10XipGXip7XipBXihzXi1qXilRXipEXiVMXiE6XiFCXiJ3XiE9Xi5UXikkXiVcXiRzXiEi",
      "byte_length": 105
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_39390f8c8039",
      "text": "那是你們自己的命，如果想送死儘管去吧。但可別說 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^)!^,X^*F^*{^'l^#I^&Z^\"N^*A^#$^%!^,1^./^%L^+(^-D^\"6^*I^!\"^!I^\"A^*H^-x ",
      "encoded_base64": "XikhXixYXipGXip7XidsXiNJXiZaXiJOXipBXiMkXiUhXiwxXi4vXiVMXisoXi1EXiI2XipJXiEiXiFJXiJBXipIXi14IA==",
      "byte_length": 70
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a63e6aa7f155",
      "text": "我沒警告過你們！",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^%\\^(S^+B^(x^*F^*{^*W",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiVcXihTXitCXih4XipGXip7XipX",
      "byte_length": 24
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_b55062fee97f",
      "text": "我現在就要離開了，你們最好也快點走。傻站在這裡只會 ",
      "encoded_ascii": "^$%^&?^\"d^*J^(C^)`^)F^*D^*A^*F^*{^$q^+i^!1^*L^*;^.&^!\"^7$^->^\"d^(s^-j^\"?^$r ",
      "encoded_base64": "XiQlXiY/XiJkXipKXihDXilgXilGXipEXipBXipGXip7XiRxXitpXiExXipMXio7Xi4mXiEiXjckXi0+XiJkXihzXi1qXiI/XiRyIA==",
      "byte_length": 76
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3f1cd9e691f7",
      "text": "給那些怪物更多時間盯上你們。後會有期。",
      "encoded_ascii": "^'A^)!^!8^#s^&4^$o^\"x^$f^)G^:U^!'^*F^*{^!\"^#b^$r^$s^$u^!\"",
      "encoded_base64": "XidBXikhXiE4XiNzXiY0XiRvXiJ4XiRmXilHXjpVXiEnXipGXip7XiEiXiNiXiRyXiRzXiR1XiEi",
      "byte_length": 57
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_c2198242d221",
      "text": "你怎麼說？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^,,^.T^-x^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiwsXi5UXi14Xi5W",
      "byte_length": 15
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_039dc2b2f1e1",
      "text": "你想離開這個區域嗎？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^,1^)`^)F^(s^!V^\"+^\"k^+X^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiwxXilgXilGXihzXiFWXiIrXiJrXitYXi5W",
      "byte_length": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_a5b031949468",
      "text": "你打算怎麼做？",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*F^$-^-C^,,^.T^*~^.V",
      "encoded_base64": "XipGXiQtXi1DXiwsXi5UXip+Xi5W",
      "byte_length": 21
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "DLG_3402f0b4eff7",
      "text": "關閉",
      "encoded_ascii": "^.>^.=",
      "encoded_base64": "Xi4+Xi49",
      "byte_length": 6
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "LOC_dfcaacaab8e2",
      "text": "迪斯頓",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(m^$[^.F",
      "encoded_base64": "XihtXiRbXi5G",
      "byte_length": 9
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "LOC_fb1051d2ac8c",
      "text": "加恩",
      "encoded_ascii": "^\"\"^#v",
      "encoded_base64": "XiIiXiN2",
      "byte_length": 6
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "LOC_c05a62c7a9c2",
      "text": "達格",
      "encoded_ascii": "^(z^%*",
      "encoded_base64": "Xih6XiUq",
      "byte_length": 6
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "LOC_3d4c45815161",
      "text": "哈爾頓",
      "encoded_ascii": "^+F^&/^.F",
      "encoded_base64": "XitGXiYvXi5G",
      "byte_length": 9
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "LOC_9e9cedd2c72e",
      "text": "馬格拉瑪",
      "encoded_ascii": "^*\"^%*^$6^-*",
      "encoded_base64": "XioiXiUqXiQ2Xi0q",
      "byte_length": 12
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "LOC_5c3685466bea",
